place.com',0,0,'2016-12-30',0,56876,'Her hair is the color of night, it hangs down her back and is adorned with jewels and beads.  She wears a long white gown, it flows to her feet..  A long worn out rope drapes around her neck with the skull of LadySilver at the end. Etched in the skull \"BSC\" can be seen.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,2070,18,5000,224,4,'2016-12-30 17:54:56',NULL),(10078,'Castor','CASTOR','test',3,268434928,6192,176000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5072,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'6\'0\" tall and rail thin, he stands tall and proud. He is dressed in a slick leather from head to toe and is shrouded in a black cape. Dark sunken eyes peer out at the room around him.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10079,'silina','SILINA','test',2,253697233,4128,120017,65,0,241,500125,1478734072,0,5073,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-11-09',0,0,'she is tall with light brown hair with a red rose artfully tucked into her curly updoo and hazel eyes thin with a soft curve and medium skin she wears a ring made of silver and blue topaz  with intricate designes on the band and also a neclace that adornes her neck with a blue stone the center  changes  color to the wearers mood  it is inscribed   \"for  silina, may your rewards out  weigh your disapointments.\"  (behind all the glamoure she has beautiful  butterfly wings with azure veins running through the','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,12267,0,20,0,94,4,'2016-11-09 18:29:07',NULL),(10080,'KnighTTwitch','KNIGHTTWITCH','test',1,268434928,8390736,1826800,65,0,8,2729,1430014575,0,5074,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-04-25',0,0,'A Mysterious Dreamer That Wears A Long Dark Cloak,Hiding his face is his Long Black Hair. He also Carries a strange Staff with a large Orb at the Top. A Quiet Dreamer Silent Most times Switfly Moving through out the Dream Barely seen or heard. His shadow is all anyone seems to ever see of him.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,9503,17,0,150,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10081,'PuRe RaGe','PURE RAGE','test',1,1343221040,10488400,4159999,65,0,130,277479,1454171789,0,5075,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-01-30',0,0,'A man of undiscernable age, tall and well built, though obviously weathered. Empty Scabbards hang from both hips, and many weapons native to the city adorn his belt.  His movements are smooth, almost feral, and there is a dangerous glint in his eyes despite the fact that he\'s nearly always smiling.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,9207,0,33,0,164,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10082,'Princess Alexis','PRINCESS ALEXIS','test',3,251658241,6448,173861,65,0,36,79502,1473645447,0,5076,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-09-11',0,0,'A Ghost. A Mistress. A Betrayer.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,12964,0,20,0,51,3,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10083,'Aejeck','AEJECK','test',1,268374272,10487888,1826000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5080,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'This tall and lean man\'s skin tone matches the fiery determination in his eyes. A warriors expression, hardened by many a battle. He carries himself with an unwavering confidence, bordering on arrogance.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10084,'Army man','ARMY MAN','test',3,1433890816,6208,726000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5080,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'Upon his left breast pocket you notice a small pin, inscribed upon it are the words \"Officer of the Guard, as mandated by Isun and Machavelli\" ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10085,'Anavrin','ANAVRIN','test',3,1345543392,6704,176000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5082,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'He is a tall athletic man dressed in color shifting robes. His hair is slightly messed. He returns your gaze with an intense and curious look of wonder and excitement.\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10086,'NOS','NOS','test',2,259001840,4176,1826000,65,0,8,8096,1413175384,0,5083,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-10-13',0,0,'','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,2053,0,20,0,150,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10087,'DreamEdge','DREAMEDGE','test',3,267123968,6752,6573394,65,0,578,751947,1481983142,0,5085,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-17',0,0,'A magnificent khaki blazer over a wrinkle-free collared brown shirt, and a loose necktie that peeks through his long, snowy white beard. His slacks are seer-sucker\'d, with soft brown leather slip-ons that are well polished. He carries a newly sanded wooden cane in his right hand.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,2225,0,24,5000,167,4,'2016-12-17 09:42:04',NULL),(10169,'Kage','KAGE','test',3,3574591744,6256,15612490,65,0,1803,4617525,1482886387,0,5150,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-27',0,10000,'Kage Thraka stands taller than most, bearing oddly plated armor that shows obvious signs of years of combat. A thick strap runs across his torso, holding Sand Chakrams against his armored form.  His eyes glow with a green light that seems to pulsate at times.  An ancient blade hangs at his side, savage-looking and engraved with the Thraka family crest.  A City Guard medallion is pinned near his crest.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,0,1946,17,5000,335,6,'2016-12-07 09:04:21',NULL),(10088,'Vampyro','VAMPYRO','test',3,1467284960,7248,3819264,65,0,773,1156637,1481979189,0,5085,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-17',0,0,'Clean attire, perfect posture, and stern features exemplify this dreamer\'s appearance. A golden smithy hammer swings from his belt, shining flawlessly. Jars and bottles rattle against each other in his pouch, while a giant fluffy green feather sways from his movements as it pokes out from under the latch of his pack. \"Prof. Shipley, Dreamtender\" is stitched on a simple shirt.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,7337,0,20,5000,219,6,'2016-12-15 18:22:11',NULL),(10089,'FeNiX R','FENIX R','test',2,1425538528,32,66000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5086,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'a dreamer of small Physcic ability, hes made mainly for blind obidence but can sometimes have a mind of his own\r\n\r\nEx-4th Sphere\r\nMember of the old Hunter-Killers\r\n`Hokuten`','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10090,'Hikari X','HIKARI X','test',2,1426005344,4688,4159999,65,0,2715,3371088,1483018470,0,5091,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-29',0,0,'Standing 6\'2\'\' eyes of the purest ice color turn to gaze at you. Light cyan colored hair is highlighted in brilliant white, and falls freely around his youthful and silently beautiful face. His body appears toned, yet gracefull to favor speed. His form is tightly accented by jet black leather pants and a knit hooded vest. The vest exposes his defined arms. Thin black ink lines form symetrical patterns from shoulder to hand on both. A sheathed tachi is strapped to his back. The sheath bears a Radiant star.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,1513,0,20,5000,60,4,'2016-11-06 16:10:17',NULL),(10091,'Kira Windveil','KIRA WINDVEIL','test',2,1427111328,4672,1615001,65,0,327,196517,1424822869,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-02-24',0,0,' A man stands before you six feet in height. Brilliant strands of lavender fall gently over his strikingly beautiful face, a dark platinum circlet band keeps it out of his pale, prismatic amethyst eyes. A well kept body is accented by tight black leather, with metallic armor pieces in spots. An infinity symbol, rests on his left wrist, with two K\'s in each loop, arcane markings continue up his well defined arms. A warm look often plays on his face. A platinum engagement ring rests on his left ring finger.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,4121,0,17,0,6,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10092,'guardDog','GUARDDOG','test',1,1903654768,12652144,16865088,65,0,730,2270210,1468900306,0,5092,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-18',12500,20000,'A battle-scarred and night skinned dreamer with a full beard that wears a suit of armor to match his skin.  A halo signifying a Teacher of Willpower adorn his head and the golden emblem of a DreamSmith is slung to his back.  Next to his side is a blade of pure night with glistening golden letters spelling out \"Canine\" in it\'s hilt.  His golden eyes seem to look right into you when he gazes upon you.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,7626,0,20,5000,195,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10615,'Mirza','MIRZA','test',1,256900320,2048,27551,65,0,13,14506,1428805943,0,5058,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-04-11',0,0,'He stands straight at 5\'10\", athletic with toned muscles, he keeps his long dirty blonde hair pulled back from his face. His right arm is covered shoulder to wrist in battle worn abyss armor, his left hand he keeps encased in an armored glove resting idly at the hilt of his broadsword, with a tattoo tracing his bicep. Otherwise bare chested, his legs are covered in the same worn abyss armor down to the boots upon his feet. Skulls accent the knee plates. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,6497,13914,29,0,150,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10093,'Chastener','CHASTENER','test',1,268434928,4196384,159999,65,0,48,54356,1421464711,0,5096,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-01-16',0,0,'A man of average height and physical build, however appearing fit. Shoulder-length black hair is seen hanging beneath a black hat with a round bill which hides most of his face from view except for his mouth and square jaw. It appears he has not shaved in a few days. He wears a black leather trenchcoat, which stops below his knees and underneath he wears a black collared shirt, black pants, and black leather boots. When his eyes can be seen his pupils have a dull white glow surrounded by darkness.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,7100,0,20,0,152,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10094,'Rockk','ROCKK','test',3,268430832,6224,4159999,65,0,992,1573331,1481686255,0,5096,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-13',0,0,'Standing over 8 feet tall with a large physical frame exuding strength, appearing middle-aged with small wrinkles in the outer corners of night colored eyes. His head clean shaven with a long thick beard hanging from his face. Small and large scars originating from past lacerations can be seen upon his body.\r\n\r\nHe wears thick earthen toned leather pauldrons, bracers, and greaves with a pair of boots.  Plain abyss clothing is seen underneath his armor.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,10382,17,0,213,4,'2016-12-13 22:37:26',NULL),(10095,'Gorgunsun','GORGUNSUN','test',1,253672976,6293552,477480,65,0,258,454657,1496888287,0,5097,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-06-07',0,0,'An old wolf, with dark brown fur and hazel eyes, his mane tied into long, intricate braids with random bits of bone, talons, and small skulls tied into it.   His sides are somewhat emaciated, his ribs showing, though his paws end in long black claws groomed to a wicked edge sharper than a well forged blade.  Across his tensed shoulders rests a didgeridoo painted with tribal glyphs. Strapped to his flank is a large, notched cleaver.   ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.232',7500,0,0,0,0,77,4,'2016-12-30 02:28:27',NULL),(10096,'Gromnir','GROMNIR','test',1,253751792,4196384,121351,65,0,61,70419,1470205159,0,5097,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-03',0,0,'This dreamer carries himself quietly, often seen bundling himself within his long black cloak lined with raven feathers.  From a wide-brimmed hat his long hair hangs in such a way that it only partially obscures his mask.  His false visage is beaked, crimson glasses obscuring his eyes.  Less obtrusively at his hip rests a polished flintlock pistol.  ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,1513,0,20,0,165,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10097,'Wolflancer','WOLFLANCER','test',4,1437785376,8800,6658526,65,0,937,1143599,1469663398,0,5100,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-27',0,0,'Standing around 6 feet , with a muscular build. A strange energy seems to swirl around. Fire seems to engulf his hair. Strapped on his back is a large flaming flamberge that appears to be engulfed in flames as  ruby dust seems to sparkle from it.  Running along the left arm, shoulder and across his entire chest are tattoos of flames. Hanging from his hip by a small chain is an emphant essence that appears to have been burnt. Noticeably out of place is a small white flower tucked below his halo. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,8195,17,5000,215,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10098,'Kaer GeRRoZ','KAER GERROZ','test',1,252846368,69248,19472867,65,0,2152,3087561,1483854408,0,5102,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-01-08',0,0,'Kaer Gerroz looks like he waded through hell itself. His skin is burned like a crisp, with numerous blisters and deep permanent cut vounds that covers his entire body. Instead of blood, a dark liquified substance can be seen in the vounds, flowing like it has its own conscience. His eyes emit a blood red gleam in his partly fried skull. Flames burn up and down his skin, dancing across it slowly but surely, as if attempting to induce eternal torment. An oil like, charred stench can be sensed in his presence','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.232',7505,1495,0,20,5000,285,6,'2017-01-08 00:47:56',NULL),(10099,'Lock','LOCK','test',1,266550832,4197408,150051,65,0,20,20026,1481236254,0,5102,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-08',0,0,'This dreamer has long golden hair cascading half way down his back, adorning his otherwise stern features. His strong athletic build is partly covered by thick golden armor. The unshielded parts show his bare skin, clearly exposed to a lot of sun, and covered by multiple tribal tattoos. Wrinkles have started to show at the sides of his eyes, and his chin has a hint of beard that reveals his age as older than his physique would seem. On his back is a grossly oversized broadsword, even for his size','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,1501,0,20,5000,151,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10100,'Dragon','DRAGON','test',1,255886336,10487888,1808730,65,0,3,591,1428158363,0,5103,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-04-04',0,0,' ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,4650,0,20,5000,150,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10101,'Sammywa','SAMMYWA','test',1,266399169,2099216,46551,65,0,52,73049,1470134481,0,5104,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-02',0,0,'A young woman, she stands tall, at about 6 feet. Long blond hair hangs down her back, roughly braided, and she wears a shirt and pants of lightweight cotton, protectively reinforced with well-worn leather at critical locations. She regards her surroundings with a seemingly cold, impersonal gaze, always ready with her ranseur at her side.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,6159,2250,21,0,150,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10102,'Geal','GEAL','test',4,0,0,11000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5104,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'A weedy little man. He wears a rugged, light brown shirt and pair of shorts, both adorned with numerous, bulging pockets. The outfit is completed by heavy boots and a large backpack, brimming with all manner of complete junk. Small amounts of grime feature on his skin and fingernails. His greasy hair is tousled, and behind round spectacles his eyes sit within dark rings. He seems slightly unsteady and unshaven, the signs of age carved haphazardly into his pale visage.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10103,'Kailinnoff','KAILINNOFF','test',1,252128560,6294064,236190,65,0,187,317960,1454309149,0,5106,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-02-01',0,0,'raised as a Squire to a great kight, He bares the colors of his nobility of his kingdom. He has several battle scars encluding one that runs in unison over his left eye. He carries the hilt and three blades of the light holder sword and is in love with Callidora. He is and will always be a fighter for the Scryers of Truth and protector to all dreamers.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,7100,0,0,0,150,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10104,'Dar\'canon','DAR\'CANON','test',3,1410371568,6736,4159999,65,0,2315,6443662,1481081998,0,5108,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-06',0,0,'Hair as dark as night. A face chiseled of stone. His eyes are a solid deep abyss. On his right cheek is a tattoo of a wolf head and a diamond shaped scar mars his center forehead. Quite physically fit, on his left hip is a hand and a half shortsword with a plain leather sheath. The pommel appears to be a dreamer and beast locked in battle and strapped to his left arm securely, is what looks like a sand colored dragon scale and if you watch him fight, he utilizes this as a shield.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,0,23,5000,13,0,'2016-12-06 23:28:00',NULL),(10105,'Bloodhunter','BLOODHUNTER','test',1,255036688,4196400,176000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5111,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'Before you stands a dreamer, 6\'3. A Tattoo on his back of a Large Blood red Dragon, inside a Soulfly. his Blood coloured hair, with tips flowing down the sides, an eyebrow piercing on his right eye. a metalic chain goes from his belt to his pocket. An orb floats around him, almost like a energy globe. You see two Golden wings on his back, as they shine brightly. he is an Arch-Angel. He wears a hoody, and a small cap facing Backwards, he has a Microphone inhand.\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10106,'Tirelon','TIRELON','test',2,252120336,4144,391635,65,0,29,78299,1479246441,0,5111,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-11-15',0,0,'','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,9587,5362,6,0,153,4,'2016-11-15 17:16:40',NULL),(10107,'OfF KiLTeR','OFF KILTER','test',2,1736477984,87664,19159999,65,0,972,2512661,1483069737,0,5113,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-29',0,0,'That\'s An OfF KiLTeR; you need a skill of at least 79 in Dreamseer to use it.\r\nThe OfF KiLTeR has no discernable purpose and 254 charges\r\nFunction #1: Missile - Velocity: Fastest and Bouncing & Twitchy; Effect: Annoying Buzzing Noise; Damage: 999 Kazillion\r\n\r\nDream On! You are nowhere near skilled enough in wit and banter to compete with this tall, red-fro\'ed man devil! He wears old leather sandals with blue wool socks and can occasionally be seen shuffling around the room waiting for victims and students.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,7214,2328,38,5000,266,6,'2016-12-30 00:44:56',NULL),(10108,'Clarity','CLARITY','test',4,267386289,533584,4010038,65,0,1877,7456642,1529239393,0,5114,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2018-06-17',0,35000,'Petite of both size and stature. Sand and silver hair has been cropped short, a sleek bob that frames her eyes, one indigo and one blood colored.  A ragged scar runs the length of an otherwise pretty face. She is dressed in a simple off-shoulder tunic dress and leather underbust corset. On her feet, a pair of knee high leather boots. A matching belt at her hips holds a variety of talisman and a sheathed blade. \r\n\r\nOccasionally a glass bottle can be seen in her left hand.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'10.20.18.1',7500,6958,7522,29,5000,68,99,'2018-06-17 08:45:31',NULL),(10109,'Faramirr','FARAMIRR','test',3,267456496,6176,66000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5117,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'His 6ft frame is clad in black and silver armor made of interlocking plates and chain mail and draped in red fabric.  His eyes are surprisingly cold. All about him is a swirl of shadows and whispered voices. At his side is a blade. Deep in thought he rolls a small black sphere in his hand.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10110,'Naphtali','NAPHTALI','test',2,252182000,4160,717627,65,0,37,52160,1476068333,0,5117,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-10-09',0,0,'You see before a man in his mid 20\'s. He wears a silk doublet appointed with saphires and a finely tooled wide black leather belt. He glows with the light blue glimmer of insight. The very air about him seems to hiss and pop with electricity. His every step sings with the rattle of hidden chain mail. You note the shadow he casts is in the shape of a beast. In his halo you see a spark of black chaos. On his chest is a bloody hand print.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,9901,4405,19,5000,155,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10111,'HiRoGIiFiQ','HIROGIIFIQ','test',4,266002113,9312,4637655,65,0,211,223144,1466727829,0,5118,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-06-23',0,0,'Hiro is wearing a magnifying glass as a take-apart bracelet. Her troublesome demeanor and sub-par work ethic are overshadowed by her love of fun and amusement. A fiery insignia on her right palm reads, \"L.O.S. Librarian\", on her left palm a smeared wet ink stain reads, \"L.O.D. Librarian\".','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,7136,0,20,5000,209,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10112,'Damia','DAMIA','test',3,262188273,6208,1639295,65,0,1801,3724190,1483149363,0,5121,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-30',0,0,'Before you stands a young woman, her hair  is up in a messy bun, with bright earthen eyes with a hint of green. Wearing a chalk tank top over berry bikini top with matching berry pleated mini skirt. She wears calf high combat boots. Below her right ear, a tattoo the size of a coin, the emblem of the Umbrics','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,6644,0,20,0,289,4,'2016-12-28 21:34:16',NULL),(10113,'Madeline','MADELINE','test',4,252185905,8224,77625,65,0,43,94481,1469677769,0,5121,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-27',0,0,' A young child looking to be around the age of 5,  with long blonde wavy golden hair, half of which is pulled up and tied with a huge puffy bow. Her eyes a dark blue framed by thick lashes are set in pale features.  She wears a frilly dress lined with lace. It\'s tied with a huge bow at her back that matches the one in her hair. She wears dainty slippers on her tiny feet. . On her left wrist is a jean bracelet  She carries a little teddy bear with her.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,619,720,41,0,167,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10114,'taureanh','TAUREANH','test',4,261529265,9296,1796523,65,0,40,32053,1472795264,0,5122,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-09-02',0,0,'Looking at her, you can tell she is quite an experienced dreamer. Her eyes loaded with mischief, there is always a sly smile upon her face.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,1516,0,20,5000,150,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10115,'Flagg','FLAGG','test',1,266993376,8390736,1762439,65,0,0,0,0,0,5123,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'A tall, bald headed,  and wirey man, his vest is open in display of the Triple Crescent of An\'Gealach upon his chest, along with a small medallion which displays the Crest of the Shadow which hangs from his neck.  His eyes are a deep red,  and his hands caloused, but perfectly manicured. Two majestic wings protrude from his back, covered with pure white silken feathers.  While he carries a constant look of purpose on his face, a faint glimmer of laughter can be found in his eyes..','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10116,'Kazh','KAZH','test',4,262127088,8272,1826000,65,0,1,168,1410149220,0,5126,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-09-08',0,0,'has a tattoo on his arm with a heart in an open hand and wears a small badge just over his heart','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,8809,2548,5,0,150,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10117,'Myridian Sun','MYRIDIAN SUN','test',4,260046128,8288,5181243,65,0,693,1382152,1481982024,0,5130,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-17',0,0,'Standing 5\'10\" he is not the most imposing of characters. His hair a brilliant golden blonde. His deep blue eyes seem to take everything in.  Armor seems to draw in the light. It\'s surface difiicult to makeout, ever shifting... A blade at his side bears the Crest of the City guard.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,5987,2516,29,5000,0,6,'2016-12-17 08:42:24',NULL),(10118,'Bahzell Tomanak','BAHZELL TOMANAK','test',1,268369392,8390720,990721,65,0,37,22147,1479608860,0,5130,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-11-19',0,0,'The Man before stands just a mite over 7 feet, his massive frame rip cord taunt with muscles honed from years of combat. Yet for his size, he moves with an unatural balance. His voice deep and powerful rumbles up from the depth of him.  ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,12610,0,0,5000,0,6,'2016-11-18 14:21:25',NULL),(10119,'Kard','KARD','test',2,266272048,4144,10076000,65,0,1,3656,1410190991,0,5132,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-09-08',0,0,'Kard appears as a young man with cascading waist-length golden hair; rebellious strands falling before a pleasant face softened by a look residing within his gentle sapphire eyes and a heart-warming smile.\r\nHis clothing consists of a simple leather vest, wool shirt and breeches that would be worn by a man of low social rank.  About his waist rests a single leather pouch. Around his neck hangs a familiar coin of gold bearing a lion and sun suspended by a purple ribbon; that jangles when he moves quickly.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,0,41,5000,150,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10120,'Jack','JACK','test',4,0,0,176000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5132,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'Well browned hair rests neatly above a solid expression on a chiseled face.  A professional, white, military uniform looks like it was shined and pressed only moments before, adorned only with a polished crest, and two bent pieces of metal at his hips held by thing leather straps.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10121,'PAMSWEETS','PAMSWEETS','test',1,253435185,8391744,735052,65,0,16,17317,1461118341,0,5134,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-04-19',0,0,'A naked body smeared with haphazard fingerprint streaks of blood-paint. While carelessly applied, from a distance the paint forms whorls and swirls that spiral into a design that terminates at her breastbone.  A trio of keys hang from a purple cord around her neck. Warm lips turn up in a slight smile, but deep almond eyes have hardened with a trace of confusion. Blonde hair is long, loose, and a mess. When she lifts her hand to push the bangs from her face, a ragged scar is visible across the left palm.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,13788,1097,45,5000,151,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10122,'Pamelar','PAMELAR','test',1,265571633,4197408,159999,65,0,46,40477,1461960136,0,5134,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-04-29',0,0,'A brown-eyed, blonde woman. Her hair is put back into a loose braid. She wears a dark green button-down; The sleeves are neatly rolled and cuffed below the elbow. A pair of dark slacks are tucked into calf-high leather boots. Her waist is belted and a hatchet hangs at her side; her wrist bears an ornate buckler. A lute is slung across her back by its strap. She wears a gold locket. She looks annoyed at your close examination.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,5992,2951,29,5000,152,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10123,'Gumby','GUMBY','test',1,256132160,8390720,726000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5138,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'Before you sits a tall green glob of clay. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10124,'Surak','SURAK','test',1,254885344,4196400,172947,65,0,19,23142,1411342827,0,5141,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-09-21',0,0,'He appears friendly, a hint of mischief in his eyes. He is clad in the colors of his focus and from his neck hangs a pendant with a gem in it\'s center. The gem is dark with flecks of black and purple swirling within its depths. It is inlaid in pure gold and around the gem is inscribed four words: Gal Andrin Jii Nesvat. On his chest there is a faint outline of a circle roughly the same size as a House Crest.  A Seeker of Knowledge and humble servant of the Dream, He travels the Dream in his eternal quest.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,1040,0,41,0,150,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10125,'Dakkoth','DAKKOTH','test',3,251658240,6240,8459123,65,0,847,3295424,1470635152,0,5144,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-08',2500,30000,'A bright blue eyed, seamlessly tan skinned, and shiny golden haired male.  He is wearing Night colored loose fitting robes adorned with Abyss colored battle gear, and a Guardian\'s KoES crest on his front and back.  A circling emerald halo appears over his head.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,0,24,5000,45,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10126,'BELGERETH','BELGERETH','test',1,262471120,10488912,3172421,65,0,403,1265206,1438545765,0,5137,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-08-02',0,0,'His cape is pulled up tight with the collar turned up\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,11826,0,20,5000,150,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(100,'Emphant_0','EMPHANT_0','test',1,252142914,0,25000,77,0,540,76817386,1485465841,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',15,2,'2017-01-26',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.232',7507,0,0,0,0,0,0,'2017-01-14 09:49:16',NULL),(101,'Emphant_1','EMPHANT_1','test',1,252142914,0,25000,77,0,567,76091801,1482929071,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-28',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7509,0,0,0,0,0,0,'2016-12-28 07:30:06',NULL),(102,'Emphant_2','EMPHANT_2','test',1,252142914,0,25000,77,0,540,76818153,148546