e than functional. A permanent smile appears on his face, flashing pearly white teeth. Blonde hair fixed just so. Over his head flitters little blue lights that sparkle and match exactly his eyes. He fidgets often and nearly bounces as he walks, a gleeful spring in his step.','0000-00-00','jiovanni@gmail.com',0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,7278,0,20,5000,7,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10128,'Bertrade','BERTRADE','test',3,259423489,82402448,159160000,65,0,71,116350,1419387534,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-12-23',0,0,'An older woman, Bertrade has a kindly face with wrinkles around her eyes and mouth that suggest smiles rather than frowns.  She wears a plain, serviceable gown of good cloth. Her only ornaments are a wedding band of plain, heavy gold and a locket hanging from a chain around her neck. She sometimes walks with the aid of a staff and often wears a shawl and gloves to keep her old bones warm.  She wears the halos of a master teacher, the fruits of long study and service','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,12373,0,20,5000,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10129,'Aaronyes','AARONYES','test',4,253897968,82404496,159160000,65,0,62,201037,1415223692,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-11-05',0,0,'This dreamer has adopted a tailcoat and starched cravat - accenting his broad shoulders and trim waist. His muscular legs are emphasized by the wearing of pantaloons, which disappear into knee-high leather riding boots. His hair is brushed forward and volumized into a classic style which pairs with his long, well groomed sideburns.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,7100,0,20,5000,2,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10130,'Castellan','CASTELLAN','test',1,268435440,99158016,0,65,0,49,78180,1444700034,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-10-12',2500,53750,'A faint silhouette of Castellan\'s soulsphere fades in and out of view, barely holding onto its dreamstate.  The distinct scent of ash seems to dwell in his vicinity.  The last flashes of energy drain away...','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,1514,48,5000,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10131,'Blagi Klygar','BLAGI KLYGAR','test',3,251661568,82402448,159160000,65,0,109,218708,1416116888,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-11-16',0,0,'An elderly man; a crazy mop of white hair gives way to blue eyes, friendly smile and a long white beard. White robes appear baggy on a thin frame that appears almost emaciated, though it supports immaculate posture. His hands are gnarled and knotted and he rubs them constantly as if he were in pain. Leather sandals are upon his feet. A small chisel, which he touches frequently, hangs around his neck. He smells strongly of freshly cut timber.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,0,12457,43,5000,2,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10132,'Kal\'lankissa','KAL\'LANKISSA','test',2,267390705,99177616,159160000,65,0,72,95787,1471465556,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-17',0,0,'The stoic dreamer before you stands with eyes sewn shut. Raised lines of healed scaring over her eyes serve as a reminder of a violent past. Her garments in keeping with her bearing are well kept, as is her grooming. Fitting for the air of nobless oblige her mannerisms betray. Her avatar continuously phases in and out of existence.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,0,12457,43,5000,3,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10133,'Yenrodoat','YENRODOAT','test',2,268377072,528528,159160000,65,0,6,3297,1410293357,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-09-09',0,0,'A thin, tall man with pale skin and sharp features. His eyes are a dark green. His hair is more than shoulder length and jet black, partly obscuring his face. He wears what appears to be a nicely custom fit black chest plate armor with a crest of two opposing hawks with a crescent moon superimposed over a sun between them. He wears a thick dark red overcoat with deep pockets that have a slimy residue with a bluish green tint covering their satin fringe.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,12457,43,0,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10134,'Ssvatra','SSVATRA','test',1,1046326,15073360,1660000,65,0,24,28705,1426997661,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-03-22',0,0,'Eerily glowing eyes that dart back and forth, always searching.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,408,10235,18,0,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10135,'Bhegwir','BHEGWIR','test',2,836373,393296,1660000,65,0,17,19564,1445913782,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-10-26',0,0,'There is more than pure rage in this mare\'s eyes. His gaze is inquizitive, sometimes drawn to studying distracting interests. His curiosity is clearly the mark of a younger mare, eager to prove himself.  He scratches the ground around him, sniffing as he searches.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,1990,44,0,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10136,'Shae','SHAE','test',3,2535402897,7248,4159999,65,0,730,2107951,1480473263,0,5044,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-11-29',0,0,'Shae\'s body is of small stature, almost pixie-like. She\'s quick with a smirk, but her liquid blue eyes tell another story. You see tiny wrinkles around her eyes, but her age is hard to decipher. On her upper right arm, a translucent metal band gently holds an oval emerald. Shae is always fidgeting with a delicate silver ring on her index finger and wigging her bare toes.\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,421,1024,41,5000,110,6,'2016-11-29 22:25:23',NULL),(10137,'RavenXR','RAVENXR','test',3,267910624,531040,4576000,65,0,8,872,1529431684,0,5016,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2018-06-19',0,0,'A man standing approximately six feet in height, bearing soft skin and dark hair. His eyes are that of the high seas before a storm. Deep blood bracers adorn each arm, matching perfectly with his gear. Garments of the darkest abyss color complete the ensamble.  A small medal hangs around his neck shining in even the darkest of places. At his hip rests a Knights Blade. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'10.20.18.1',7500,6958,7522,29,0,0,99,'2018-06-19 14:11:59',NULL),(10140,'Nunak','NUNAK','test',1,263752998,15073424,159160000,65,0,85,48335,1469669495,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-27',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,0,1150,44,0,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10141,'Abiranadad','ABIRANADAD','test',3,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10143,'Dericannn','DERICANNN','test',1,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10148,'Audra','AUDRA','test',1,1362116017,8391232,1659999,65,0,329,801079,1482813476,0,5004,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-26',0,0,'A young lady with daring blue eyes. Her blonde hair thick and wavy that goes to mid-waist with jeweled pins holding up her sides. A bubbly personality with a high pitched voice resonating from her rose colored lips. A small diamond pierces her nose.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,7121,0,20,0,132,4,'2016-12-09 18:45:55',NULL),(10149,'Punk','PUNK','test',1,252143460,131072,32961,65,0,23,8679,1491349494,0,5004,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-04-04',0,0,'The mare glows red with chaos. A scar-like mark extends from its forearm down to its avatar shredding claws.','0000-00-00',NULL,1491349494,5,'199.58.75.232',7500,329,1366,44,0,0,4,'2017-04-02 00:26:46',NULL),(10150,'Sylas','SYLAS','test',1,252143462,131088,873858,65,0,73,40874,1484790966,0,5037,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-01-18',0,0,'An azure residue drips from the jaws of this seemingly large mare. Its skin gives the apperance of a shadow, as it moves fluently through the dream.','0000-00-00',NULL,1484789830,6,'199.58.75.232',7500,329,1366,44,0,0,4,'2017-01-1