 seem to always be lost in thought. She speaks in soft but crisp tones. She wears a necklace around her neck, a soul essence serves as its pendant. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,2073,0,49,5000,3,99,'2016-11-24 20:23:09',NULL),(10191,'Sgiathatch','SGIATHATCH','test',1,260242720,8390736,1721392,65,0,23,50648,1471833280,0,5167,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-21',0,0,'circling his shoulder length gold hair you seen a golden crystalline Dragon which is his namesake and he has piercing blue eyes that appear to be those of a Dragon. Emblazoned up his left breast is the emblem of a Dragon.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,0,5,0,152,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10197,'Xyn Rhade','XYN RHADE','test',4,254803600,8256,692400,65,0,11,48284,1470716062,0,5171,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-09',0,0,'Before you stands a tall, well built man, with Earth colored skin.  Shoulder length Plum hair shifts about as he moves as only a FateSender can.  His left arm has a fleshy color and feel, yet a stoney look to it.  Vibrant ice blue eyes seem alive with a quiet intelligence and pent up energy.\r\n\r\nA ruby red gem can be seen attached to the back of his left hand.\r\n\r\n\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,1647,3391,16,0,68,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10195,'Fireball','FIREBALL','test',3,252005872,7232,1046798,65,0,235,182107,1474224968,0,5151,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-09-18',0,0,'Fidgety and eyes constantly darting around the room, he appears bored.  Loose with his words, almost inviting a confrontation with a burn in his eyes.  Hobbling around with a cane and a pronounced curve in his back, this seasoned dreamer appears much older than expected. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,2037,0,20,5000,162,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10196,'Nihsreyase','NIHSREYASE','test',2,260044784,4672,716364,65,0,25,14397,1413081215,0,5151,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-10-11',0,0,'A 