-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10208,'Vapor','VAPOR','test',3,263958784,7232,686476,65,0,36,34769,1445135223,0,5005,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-10-17',0,0,'Vapor is cowled in a robe patched together from tanned deer hide.  It covers his entire form, save for his face.  His facial expression seems unphased, most of the time.  A soft red mist continuously dances out from his hood, and below his robe when he walks.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,338,9920,18,5000,150,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10205,'Jaden','JADEN','test',3,3618635313,6208,956441,65,0,178,282902,1425602002,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-03-05',0,0,'She has wafting thin golden hair; it hangs down into her face with ragged ends that seem to have been cut with an exceptionally dull razor. An inquisitive yet harrowing grin usually smothers her facial features. Her faintly glowing eyes are piercing yet pale, and the color of pearl. She has markings upon her face not quite known in definition, though she is seemingly fastidious about her appearance. A mask of intrigue greets those who gaze upon this dreamer. She has a soft voice, yet echo\'s as she speaks.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,10259,0,20,0,12,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10207,'Apothos','APOTHOS','test',2,1375727856,4160,1659999,65,0,1553,1745555,1467517685,0,5149,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-02',0,0,'A man of medium build, clad in simple dark robes, with a long scar running down the length of his young, but insightful face. A modest blade is set at his hip, a faint glow radiating from it.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,0,22,0,185,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10213,'Vill Valorian','VILL VALORIAN','test',2,3828480832,4176,2906683,65,0,1361,3820279,1482989486,0,5165,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-29',0,0,'Bright Yellow eyes Appearing regal refined proper and well mannered Vill has two majestic red spikey long horns along with green long spikey hair with red tips Dressed in Celtic like Japanese Chirin Uniform and Koujia armor with Peace Corpse Insignias emblazened on the front.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,7767,68,27,5000,95,2,'2016-12-29 00:59:34',NULL),(10212,'Sidious Tryhnak','SIDIOUS TRYHNAK','test',3,1627360752,6224,4102138,65,0,683,1581648,1420410012,0,5170,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-01-04',0,0,'A muscled figure clad in a long abyss cloak that shimmers night when hit by the light just right. It is ripped all over, faint flecks of red where the fibers have torn apart and at least one white and green patch holding it together.  Shaggy black hair with flecks of gray peak out from beneath his cowl.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,1756,0,5000,228,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10216,'Jiovanni','JIOVANNI','test',1,252382896,99158128,9160000,65,0,771,1671525,1481784711,0,5047,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-15',0,0,'Standing before you is a dreamer at 6\' tall in height, average build, muscular arms, his hair the color of the dirty blonde, spiked backwards resembling quills, his eyes shimmering vigorously bright, gold in color, no pupils are visible to stare back at you as you seem to become hypnotized. He wears a gold locket on his neck in the shape of a heart, engraved with the name \"KAIHAN\" in beautiful light emeralds.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,1216,0,26,5000,24511,99,'2016-12-15 01:57:28',NULL),(10214,'Warren','WARREN','test',1,268138496,6293584,1791453,65,0,46,29475,1411240856,0,5159,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-09-20',0,0,'A Dark Knight from the Chaos gates arives to the City.. Body made of Ice and cole. He stands tall and mighty with his arms draped to the side of his waist... Un discribed and Unknown he walks the dream in paths of many others who have failed in. In Small font  but in bold letter\'s is inscription on his  arm that scribes member of  the Dark Abyss Soals..\r\n What can this mean?','0