,5169,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-03-26',0,0,'She has long hair held up by a white lace ribbon, loose strands framing her face. Her skin is milky in complexion, and her eyes deep sea green.\r\n\r\nShe wears a loose fitting shirt that buttons at the front, and tucks loosely into fitted leather pants that almost cover white leather boots.\r\n\r\nA beautiful House Calenture medallion sits at her throat, sapphires and emeralds surrounding a large dual triune shaped emerald that glows when she fidgets with it, which is more often then necessary.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,1937,17,5000,202,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10227,'Sala Erosa','SALA EROSA','test',3,268431360,6192,446339,65,0,151,288019,1468634949,0,5052,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-15',0,0,'The man stood a bit past six feet with a lithe and sharp-angled frame all but hidden away behind a sharply tailored black robe. The cuffs roll back in stiff binding to keep his hands free, the whole thing bound tight to his frame by leather straps. His face was covered by what appeared to be unpolished white stone, a vague oval of definition with sunken but intelligent green eyes showing as the only definite feature. His hands seem to match, made of the same statuesque material and latticed with fine crack','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,5519,39,20,0,76,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10233,'Silverwake','SILVERWAKE','test',4,251939697,8800,4620547,65,0,37,121796,1478896333,0,5184,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-11-11',0,0,'Secretive & alluring, this evangelist has star-glitter sprinkled in her brilliant night sky colored hair, along her temples & on her chest.  Her skin a soft shade of sand & eyes that glow an eerie ocean blue. Her pixie grin reveals a face both clever & guile.  Her dress attire shimmers, constantly changing colors to suit what you might determine to be her mood.  Strapped to her back is a mandolin, etched with engravings & mystic runes that swirl into the mark of the Oracle ..... \'  *  \' .....','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,7655,0,20,5000,27,6,'2016-11-11 15:37:06',NULL),(10229,'livingdeadgirl','LIVINGDEADGIRL','test',2,268431377,4144,710132,65,0,5,1580,1410255671,0,5182,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-09-09',0,0,'you see standing before you a very petite female with long dark red hair. crystal green eyes peek out at you from behind her bangs. a smile plays across her lips. she is wearing a long black dress which makes her pale skin  appear even paler. around her neck is a single silver chain and across all of her fingers including her thumbs she is wearing silver rings. \r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,2053,0,20,0,150,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10235,'Thaywyn','THAYWYN','test',3,252705633,6144,2898,65,0,11,7835,1472714458,0,5165,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-09-01',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,1790,1028,4,0,52,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10231,'Kaigon','KAIGON','test',2,268378096,15208592,89160000,65,0,323,144350,1482094542,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-18',0,0,'An old dream-soul catches your eye. He\'s looking for something, intently searching the fabric of the dream. You watch as he reaches up to the wall, inspecting the cracks. His right arm becomes the focal point, partially revealing a black patch with tally marks and a partial word: JAN.. Suddenly the old man turns and glares at another dreamer across the room, growing dubious.The now visible half ..ITOR leaves you feeling unsettled. The old man, grumbles, reaches down for a piece of dream trash, then departs','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,12528,0,5000,7,99,'2016-12-18 15:57:56',NULL),(10232,'Em\'et','EM\'ET','test',4,252177376,9328,19159999,65,0,1944,4296953,1491595078,0,5183,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-04-07',0,0,'An average man, of ordinary weight and height. Earthen eyes peer out below short earth hair. Several small pouches line his belt, and a large smithing hammer hangs on his left. The head of the hammer is black and seems to absorb in the light from around him.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.232',7500,8921,0,41,5000,2,6,'2017-01-08 00:51:01',NULL),(10230,'Ziddynoh','ZIDDYNOH','test',2,253697009,4128,115229,65,0,232,800568,1434872275,0,5179,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-06-21',0,0,'A fair young girl stands tall and skinny with almost perfect posture. Around her neck she wears a red stone bound by copper wire, and a crimson heart shaped locket. Her skin is pale in comparison to her raven black hair, in which a berry colored rose is nestled. She wears black jeans with silver threaded patterns and jellyfish buttons as well as a black leather jacket with a large shimmering \'Z\' that changes colour according to her mood. On her shoulder is a small golden Clockwork Scorpion.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,5074,33,0,200,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10234,'Morihei','MORIHEI','test',2,0,0,66000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5184,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'Your classical Asian stereotype this man has straight dark hair, long-cut sideburns, round facial features and a light complexion. Almond brown eyes reveal wisdom with a voice unaccented and soft-spoken. Broad shouldered, narrow waisted, he is physically fit. Dressed in Oriental garbs, a \"keikogi\" crossover with 3/4 sleeves covers his chest and is made of a thick waffle pattern fabric. A \"hakama\" pleated skirt and section serve as pant legs with a solid black belt holding everything together.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10238,'WishBringer','WISHBRINGER','test',4,259460576,15212672,29002765,65,0,891,1406410,1529435534,0,5001,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2018-06-19',0,0,'Just an old fella.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'10.20.18.1',7500,6958,7522,29,5000,148,99,'2018-06-19 15:14:21',NULL),(11173,'Revena