lickers occassionally.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,12629,0,20,5000,250,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10250,'Anyasha','ANYASHA','test',3,260013329,530528,6622967,65,0,612,888939,1529271238,0,5039,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2018-06-17',0,0,'This woman is tall with striking features, pale skin and sharp cheek bones. Locks of auburn hair fall lightly over her shoulders. Around her neck hangs an unadorned chain with a circle of paler skin on her chest. Her dress is unassuming but reveals her lithe form underneath. A number of rusted chakram and a dull, runed blade rest on her hip.  Her jet black eyes pace the room, gazing as though from a distance...\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'10.20.18.1',7500,6958,7522,29,0,196,99,'2018-06-17 17:35:08',NULL),(10251,'Gondoren','GONDOREN','test',4,3522161392,8208,41251,65,0,64,153407,1415573220,0,5225,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-11-09',0,0,'A tall man, carries a large notebook tucked under one arm, usually scribbling notes in it.\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,0,22,0,165,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10253,'Lucille','LUCILLE','test',4,1467948513,8240,356642,65,0,137,391251,1468987231,0,5193,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-20',0,0,'She appears young--in her late teens. 5\'6\" and lanky, almost gaunt. She has straight hair, held back with two pins on the left side, and bangs which touch her eyelashes and wiggle when she blinks.  She is wearing an abyss, cashmere sweater, an abyss woolen peacoat topped with a striped scarf, dark hole-y blue jeans, and black sneakers, with a hole in the right one. She has a light canvas and leather satchel draped left-to-right across her chest. A careful listener\'d notice an uncommon accent.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,5964,4115,5,0,63,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10256,'Sevlen','SEVLEN','test',3,268369392,6160,159999,65,0,79,64435,1463544276,0,5040,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-05-18',0,0,'A handsome younger man; hair beginning to turn grey. His hands are calloused and well-worn from years of use. His posture is impeccable.  His green eyes rest under bushy eyebrows, scanning the room with measured interest.  A simple baldric is draped across his back, a hilt with a faded engraving exposed.  His voice is heavily accented and his words odd, as if he is speaking an uncommon tongue. He appears dusty.  His youthful appearance doesn\'t match the timeless quality in his eyes.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,7563,0,0,0,68,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10254,'Kodak','KODAK','test',1,252143459,14811136,0,65,0,1,0,1410638187,0,5038,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-09-13',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,1410638187,4,'199.58.75.230',7501,0,0,0,0,0,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10257,'Vin','VIN','test',4,263654160,8224,159999,65,0,173,204870,1471367390,0,5165,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-16',0,0,'clean unique pattern of skin and face, with two very long fox ears, followed by very very long red hair, wearing a very noble royal robe of honor','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,12625,0,20,0,66,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10258,'Puned','PUNED','test',2,1442315760,4144,320001,65,0,558,373606,1482549755,0,5196,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-23',0,0,'Quietly listening... ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,1543,0,20,0,71,4,'2016-12-18 14:15:01',NULL),(10259,'Venom','VENOM','test',2,1441861616,5200,2046844,65,0,360,865058,1436963595,0,5191,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-07-15',0,0,'As you stare at him you realize this dreamer is older then dirt, older then the oldest rock, so old that he looks like a walking fossil.  His rotting corpse constantly falling apart at the seams.   He has an aura of pure insight around him, seemingly being used to keep his body together.  Being an undead vampyre for 2,400 years apparently takes it\'s toll.  You gaze at his cheerful apperance and friendly smile.  The medallion on his chest containing a crystal for each of the focuii seems to hum silently.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,2009,17,5000,174,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10260,'Corin','CORIN','test',1,253697776,4196400,176000,65,0,0,0,0,0,5197,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,'Before you stands a tall man with darkened skin and black hair.  Wearing loose fitting clothing made of cloth, he appears no more than a simple commoner.  Then you notice the long thin curved sword shethed at his side, that moves with him with such grace that he must have worn it there his entire life.  In his eyes, and angry face, you see a fire burning within and extreme determination.  A mere shadow of what he once was, now consumed by rage, a hollow shell of a man...','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10261,'Funk','FUNK','test',1,252142373,131088,93552,65,0,9,3226,1439694088,0,5005,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-08-15',0,0,'An azure residue drips from the jaws of this seemingly large mare. Its skin gives the apperance of a shadow, as it moves fluently through the dream.','0000-00-00',NULL,1439690949,5,'199.58.75.230',7505,234,785,44,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10262,'Grudish','GRUDISH','test',1,252143459,14811136,0,65,0,1,0,1410762151,0,5184,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-09-15',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,1410762151,5,'199.58.75.230',7501,0,0,0,0,0,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10264,'Kratos','KRATOS','test',1,253828656,2048,59999,65,0,30,38922,1438168811,0,5015,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-07-29',0,0,'He is exceptionally tall, standing at a height in between 6 to 6.3 feet,  he is at his peak physical condition. Based on his facial features and voice patterns, one can assume Kratos\' age is ranging from late 30s to early 40s.\r\n\r\nHe has tanned skin, deep scars run down the majority of his upper body and up to his face.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,7596,0,20,0,68,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10265,'Jadin Lore','JADIN LORE','test',3,1426533872,6176,88260,65,0,131,313270,1417237353,0,5106,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-11-29',0,0,'A some what knowledgeable dreamer wearing clad iron armor young and hyper active but yet even younger at heart ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,1713,0,20,0,150,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10273,'Rowan Strate','ROWAN STRATE','test',3,266264593,6144,8479,65,0,19,40343,1415069163,0,5042,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-11-03',0,0,'Not short, yet not average in height by any means. She wears bracers on each wrist, born of leather, and a blade at her hip. Maple colored hair with copper accents lays in a dense braid that hangs over a shoulder. Her eyes are of wolfen amber, her skin milky and flawless, the only imperfection being the smattering of freckles just over the crest of her nose and cheeks. She appears young, dressing in buck leathers as a boy would. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,7515,357,0,0,153,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10269,'RedBee','REDBEE','test',2,1439609104,4160,1154273,65,0,386,1023480,1473387881,0,5163,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-09-08',0,0,'His chin is square his neck is thick and tall, young skin that compliments his broad arms & shoulders. Upon his armor are long spikes. He looks at you sharply with a smooth sandstone orb in his left hand. He seems rather cheerful most times. A barely detectable scent of SpearMint is near him. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,4729,17,0,67,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10270,'NullReaver','NULLREAVER','test',3,3501899584,6224,1909678,65,0,54,109748,1434305417,0,5194,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-06-14',0,0,'Obsidian skin, so dark and yet glinting with the light, beckons your eyes to linger upon it. Thick, emarald vinelike hair swirls about his head as if wind blows upon it, but the wind is not always there. Brilliant, flashing eyes of smooth obsidian implore you to fall into their piercing gaze. Emeralds, bold and beautiful, hang from his neck and jangle from his writs and ankles whenever he moves a silver aura envelopes him.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,11259,25,0,154,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10271,'Bjarte','BJARTE','test',2,252669360,4096,29474,65,0,73,66209,1466309709,0,5013,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-06-19',0,0,'A youthful glow fails to hide the rugged, intelligent vigor underneath.  Blue-gray eyes examine Bjarte\'s surroundings behind thick strands of pure blonde hair, cropped short over his ears.  A pale, thick beard with clean edges blankets his sturdy jawline.  Bjarte\'s thick leather and cloth armor seems to soften his voice and muffle any sound he makes.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,12136,0,0,0,152,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10272,'Mernic Follish','MERNIC FOLLISH','test',2,268373488,4096,982,65,0,13,28006,1411960003,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2014-09-28',0,0,'Long dark hair has been pulled back into a pony tail, and a short stubble shadows his face. He wears a white shirt and a dark leather vest over top of it. Dark pants and light boots don his lower half.\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,7658,0,20,0,100,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10274,'Lexxy Mesa','LEXXY MESA','test',3,266464993,6208,751952,65,0,36,33570,1436839014,0,5118,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-07-13',0,0,'Lexxy\'s movements are graceful, her eyes are almond shaped with no twinkle. Her \"r\"s roll. She walks toe-to-heel.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,12378,0,20,5000,151,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10275,'Tyren','TYREN','test',2,259489264,4144,659999,65,0,236,382250,1474390703,0,5055,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-09-20',0,0,'An average height man stands before you. His dark hair is straight and shoulder length. Attached to the back of his night blue armor is a large blade wit