iba Ta\'kin','TEONIBA TA\'KIN','test',2,267530080,4160,1243897,65,0,806,811656,1474860552,0,5209,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-09-25',0,0,'He wears a grand fiery robe that covers his entire avatar with the sigil of eight eyes on the back of it. Inside of the robe you see nothing only pure darkness as you attempt to glance even closer..  As he moves through the plains he does not walk, yet he glides across the room. A hooded top rests on top of his head and all you see is his bright fiery eyes peering out at you looking around the room indiscriminately. When he speaks it is slow and his voice sounds like multiple voices speaking at once.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,12560,0,20,5000,58,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10318,'Lu Chaos','LU CHAOS','test',1,253508864,12585056,6669789,65,0,2331,3711997,1493489236,0,5209,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-04-29',0,0,'Lu Chaos a very handsome dreamer. He walks around with his head held high with a big smile! His right hand is now pocketed. He is an average sized dreamer, with long white hair. There is a tattoo on his neck that says \" Wolf Pack \".\r\nA Vicious Wolf Tattoo Now Covers His Entire Face.. His armor is made of gold but appears as the color of blood, but over his splendid wolven armor he wears a beige colored pancho with the words, \"The Peace Corpse.\" A long chain dangles from his neck with a PoR crest hanging.','2016-09-26',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.232',7500,785,0,20,5000,40,4,'2017-04-29 14:14:26',NULL),(10320,'Zenobia','ZENOBIA','test',2,1359482113,4688,3498333,65,0,486,1005402,1482813737,0,5004,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-26',0,0,'A young woman with tanned skin. Strands of long pearlescent hair extends past her waist with azure silken threads covering her body. Two rings, one on her wedding finger and one on her pinkie shows her love for another.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,12250,0,20,0,77,4,'2016-12-27 00:03:54',NULL),(10324,'Briggs','BRI