230',7501,0,11658,0,5000,3,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10451,'Vrirt','VRIRT','test',1,252142917,131088,79865,65,0,16,7994,1450042680,0,5100,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-12-13',0,0,'A look of bewilderment is etched into this mare\'s face. It is abnormally small with the exception of the large whiskers that pertrude from either side of its face.','0000-00-00',NULL,1449965644,5,'199.58.75.230',7504,694,1140,44,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10452,'Shirrin','SHIRRIN','test',4,259673553,99181712,159160000,65,0,38,70009,1420595047,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-01-06',0,0,'Knots of brightly colored rags and a few mismatching bells adorn her tangled, mousy hair. Her face is partially concealed by it\'s disarray, and a smudge of either dirt or ink is apparent on her cheek. Her clothing is bright, only dulled by it\'s apparent age and use, and both almost matches and almost fits. At least a half dozen poorly made and dented bangles line each arm, and both ankles. Her feet are bare and not quite clean, and her nails hold the chipped remains of brightly colored lacquer.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,0,22,5000,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10453,'Tanek','TANEK','test',3,267254528,530496,1160000,65,0,14,31713,1420598191,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-01-06',0,0,'A slender little boy dressed is simple, practical shades of tan and abyss. White-blond hair is simply cut, and his complexion is pale enough to border on sickly. His stern, serious expression is completed by large, unblinking black eyes.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,1673,0,20,0,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10454,'Sela Cardan','SELA CARDAN','test',3,266689873,530544,14160000,65,0,19,26955,1461283411,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-04-21',0,0,'Teal locks cut in an angular bob frame an innocent face set with a pair of expressive, hazel eyes. She is fit with a corset and a belted long skirt slit from hem to thigh, revealing an intricately runed dagger secured by a garter. A satchel full to the brim with odds and ends seems out of place as she lugs it around clumsily.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,12457,43,5000,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10455,'Fangx','FANGX','test',2,1367342576,5728,9065500,65,0,3066,3967677,1483853743,0,5091,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-01-08',0,0,'Standing 6\'3\'\', obsidian strands of hair fall chaotically about his face. Light crimson color, networked like cracked glass, accent his dark brown eyes. A black cloak rests on his broad shoulders, clasping over his throat. Beneath is a black chest plate that cuts off mid abdomen exposing defined muscle, marred by a thin sweeping claw scar. He wears black leather pants, and aggressively styled boots, all tightened by silver buckles. A small coral pendant hangs from a thin necklace and rests above his heart.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.232',7502,1495,0,20,5000,119,6,'2017-01-08 00:36:59',NULL),(10456,'Notechis','NOTECHIS','test',1,975333,6684816,159160000,65,0,12,12583,1420349466,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-01-04',0,0,'A hovering mass of old fabric, torn and ragged to its dusty edges. Mildewed bones poke out through each rip and tear in the cloth. An almost overwhelming musty odor lingers.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,0,24,0,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10457,'Sharque','SHARQUE','test',1,839046,15075472,159160000,65,0,91,177453,1472348668,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-27',280000,400000,'Darkness, shadowed, all concealed but amber eyes that shine beneath her cloak of fuschia. Look deeper into her amber eyes, see what lurks in her soul. A sight beyond reality. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,288,0,24,5000,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10458,'Donord','DONORD','test',3,267894512,6160,35051,65,0,15,22019,1427008994,0,5177,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-03-22',0,0,'A young dreamer, with short cropped hair and tattered clothes.\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,647,22,0,154,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10459,'Snomaan','SNOMAAN','test',1,279622,15073424,159160000,65,0,8,12906,1420098098,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-01-01',0,0,'This creature seems to slide along the ground. Frigid air wafts off the pristine, white shrouds that envelope the mare\'s skeletal form which seems to be made of the clearest ice. Bells tinkle faintly in this creature\'s wake...','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,12457,43,5000,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10460,'Toneri','TONERI','test',2,255967808,4096,0,65,0,2,306,1428040202,0,5265,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-04-03',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,4143,0,20,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10461,'Xelexia Rylex','XELEXIA RYLEX','test',4,1374477825,8192,9999,65,0,39,101252,1427556268,0,5121,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-03-28',0,0,'The woman before you is deeply tanned with long white hair pulled back in an intricate braid decorated with earthtoned beads. Violeet eyes stare at you above high cheekbones and soft full lips. The sides of her face are marred by what you think are scars, but upon closer inspection you notice what looks to be tribal markings faintly tattooed framing her eyes and cheeks.  Leathers of many colors are sewn together to form a top that is sleeveless and ends mid-belly, and the same for full leggings and boots. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,7112,0,20,0,161,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10464,'Seth Undercloud','SETH UNDERCLOUD','test',3,1469058528,7216,816951,65,0,197,743050,1422746005,0,5267,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-01-31',0,0,'An aged dreamer stands before you, wearing a plum shirt and a white overcoat.  He peers at you curiously, wondering why you are looking him over so intently.  Around his neck is a small blue chain made of tiny forged insight rings, the letters \"LL\" carved into the clasp that holds it in place.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,2151,0,20,5000,173,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10465,'Norkight','NORKIGHT','test',2,1375661552,4208,19022763,65,0,2009,2886569,1483116336,0,5266,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-30',0,0,' A basically nondescript man except for his eyes. Eyes that seem to have seen much in this place but are haunted by many ghosts of the past but is trying to exorcise them. His only distinguishing feature is the scar on his left hand. Wearing ihs finest ceremonial robes.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,0,22,0,254,4,'2016-12-30 11:48:56',NULL),(10467,'Jadeitite Slate','JADEITITE SLATE','test',4,252120401,8208,20931,65,0,31,66258,1424920866,0,5268,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-02-25',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,9396,0,20,0,151,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10469,'Gray Tones','GRAY TONES','test',2,3786407681,4176,2640083,65,0,786,2249449,1446146657,0,5268,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-10-29',0,20000,'Long sparkling silver strands of hair fall into her face glistening over the backdrop of her silvery tinted skin. She has a youthful face, but seems to be an old soul. Her tight fitting black leather armor is lined with metallic purple dragon scales. She pulls on an oversized black hood when chameled; only her ruby lips and the icy glow of her icy blue eyes can be seen underneath. A thin metal band with an odd blood stone rests on her right hand.  As she walks by a hint of lavender is left behind.  ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,7738,0,22,5000,260,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10470,'Custodes','CUSTODES','test',1,252836656,132712592,159160000,65,0,3,621,1420099112,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-01-01',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,12649,43,5000,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10472,'Night-Hawk','NIGHT-HAWK','test',1,268434928,