akes you feel better as you look at him. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,3544,2270,18,5000,172,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10479,'Herbert','HERBERT','test',3,1961815040,530544,13159999,65,0,160,218085,1472355342,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-27',0,0,'The man wears simple brown rags.  His long white hair and beard is unkempt and falls halfway down his torso.  He drags one foot behind him as he walks and carries a long solid gold staff, a bright green soul essence sits at the top.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,1592,48,5000,3,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10480,'Akkadian','AKKADIAN','test',1,261729280,187255952,159160000,65,0,394,1038516,1529269474,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2018-06-17',0,0,'A gentle, older man dressed in long flowing purple robes. His hair, grey and hanging well below his shoulders matches the long salt and pepper beard tied toward the end with a string and tiny bauble. He speaks with a soft and raspy voice. He wears a pair of half moon glasses. A bracelet with many keys of different shapes and sizes is worn on his right wrist.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'10.20.18.1',7500,6958,7522,29,5000,12,99,'2018-06-17 17:09:33',NULL),(10481,'Grok Firebeard','GROK FIREBEARD','test',1,252640544,13109328,2910000,65,0,244,271117,1491000693,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-03-31',0,0,'A stocky dwarf about 4 feet tall.  A long red beard flows down to his waist with large copper and silver adornments braided into it.  The visible portions of his face are gruff, covered with wrinkles and scars.  He carries with him a large 2 handed axe with wood shaft that he steadies over his shoulder.  He has a bandolier strung across his chest holding several different types of bombs.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.232',7500,747,7265,6,5000,5,99,'2017-03-31 18:52:45',NULL),(10482,'Nipkath','NIPKATH','test',1,268435442,15073392,15999999,65,0,114,112843,1471735185,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.c