arge white wings that arch behind himself. His white silk outfit softly moves as he walks. Around his nick is a small shimmering crystal in the shape of an angel that tends to constantly change colors as you look at it.  On his left hand is a gold ring and inscirbed on it  is \"Nick+Tala 4 ever!\". It has a unique look to it as if not made of normal material.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,231,5020,33,0,56,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10789,'Nmoto','NMOTO','test',1,1356721952,2064,36697,65,0,43,114569,1445393972,0,5398,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-10-20',0,0,'Nmoto wears simple clothes of cloth and hide that appear to shield most of Nmoto\'s visible skin, except the hands, and face. The eyes bear either a judging or discerning gaze, and the speech is harsh and forceful. A small wooden bracelet dangles about a wrist, and a brash, savage looking hat sits atop the head.\r\n\r\nIt\'s hard to tell whether Nmoto is a bandit, a  scout, or a traveler. Take your pick, you\'re probably right. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,7157,0,20,0,58,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10790,'Pork','PORK','test',1,252141829,131104,68323,65,0,1,700,1442704829,0,5242,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-09-19',0,0,'An azure residue drips from the jaws of this seemingly large mare. Its skin gives the apperance of a shadow, as it moves fluently through the dream.','0000-00-00',NULL,1442704829,5,'199.58.75.230',7501,642,1172,44,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10793,'Bamra','BAMRA','test',3,281954,393312,8160000,65,0,17,29081,1470356535,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-04',0,0,'Totally cute... like totally.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,7256,1846,39,0,0,97,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10794,'Sing','SING','test',1,252142371,131088,0,65,0,14,3717,1495422307,0,5040,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-05-21',0,0,'Other than its blazing gold eyes, the mare otherwise looks almost transparent. It breathes deeply, its gold eyes closely following all nearby movement.','0000-00-00',NULL,1495422307,3,'199.58.75.232',7500,8322,2941,44,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10796,'Jones Shaw','JONES SHAW','test',4,1427111472,8240,468661,65,0,440,891556,1483087605,0,5308,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-30',0,0,'Dark skin is weathered from a life of working outdoors.Wearing a crisp white dress shirt and black brocade vest. A black bolo tie with an amethyst butterfly slide under the shirt collar. Dress denims in black held by a belt with a stunning silver buckle in the shape of a dual triune. A black 10 gallon stetson hat tops the ensemble.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,0,17,0,122,4,'2016-12-03 23:00:24',NULL),(10797,'Magerum','MAGERUM','test',1,255900944,12586080,4893095,65,0,54,113160,1446431126,0,5403,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2015-11-01',0,0,'Just short of 6 feet in height and of average build.  Age appears to be somewhere between the third and fourth decades of life.  Narrowed eyes and many small battle scars are all that stand out.                              Upon his belt you spot the telltale signs of a warrior; a variety of chakrams and elemens, some showing signs of long use.  Peaking from his pack you notice what appear to be several old, scared, house emblems.  Colors from all ranks can be seen peeking through.   ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,686,0,20,5000,57,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10799,'Sicario','SICARIO','test',1,252836864,15206512,15159999,65,0,65,119676,1480319160,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-11-28',0,0,'Before you stands a dreamer of tall stature, a muscular frame, and wearing full armor of reinforced leather. He appears to be middle age with wrinkles beginning to form on his face. A thick scar runs down the left side of his face and eye although mostly concealed with long strands of white hair parted at an angle. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,3057,17,5000,0,99