',0,0,'Standing at 5\'9\" Dex is muscular and is always on his toes. His clothing looks to be self-made and poorly so. His arms remain bare. A 3in. horizontal scar crosses his left bicep. It appears to have been a deep cut. His face betrays no emotion more often than not.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,4748,1121,42,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10876,'Krishanna','KRISHANNA','test',2,252120369,4096,9999,65,0,14,28124,1451878365,0,5457,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-01-03',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,5830,17398,33,0,56,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10877,'Aikido','AIKIDO','test',3,1436593408,6240,9075112,65,0,281,781921,1457373714,0,5457,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-03-07',0,0,'A slightly older man stands before you. At first you notice his pure white hair, almost glowing.  As you look down to his face soft, emerald eyes and gentile smile look back at you.  The tall and muscular physique appears relaxed in most situations.  The neatly pressed, white suit hangs from his shoulders, wraping his body precisely. Several banished nightmare tokens adorn his belt.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,0,17,0,88,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10878,'Krishnamurti','KRISHNAMURTI','test',2,259063280,4144,243001,65,0,32,8022,1457379965,0,5457,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-03-07',0,0,'','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,12580,0,20,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(10880,'Deeter','DEETER','test',1,266743536,254364816,159160000,65,0,304,287714,1529267208,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2018-06-17',0,0,'He stands before you 5’10” tall with broad shoulders and muscular chest. Dressed in simple garb a round belly extrudes slightly. Despite his obvious strength he hunches sustaining a large canvas bag filled with scrolls and tomes of epic proportions. His husky voice is modulated and charming.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'10.20.18.1',7500,6958,7522,29,5000,2,99,'2018-06-