-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,12787,0,20,0,17,4,'2016-12-27 18:29:51',NULL),(11015,'Zaxun','ZAXUN','test',1,268435184,48762512,50000000,65,0,96,201793,1478134789,10186,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-11-02',0,0,'Zaxun stands nearly 8 feet tall,  wearing a full set of decorative abyss platemail.  His spaulders have two large sharpened blades rising from his shoulders, resembling the Dreamer\'s of Light symbol. The fingers of his gauntlets form sharp claws.  The symbol of the Protectors of Radiance is cut into the center of his helmet, revealing his ebony eyes and darkened skin through the narrow opening.  He carries with him the monstrous Mace of Castigation.  Eight sharpened blade form the head of the mace','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,19962,707,48,5000,3,99,'2016-11-02 23:07:32',NULL),(11017,'Benjin','BENJIN','test',4,251726608,8192,0,65,0,6,5690,1465296281,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-06-07',0,0,'His appearance is dominated by wide eyes and a broad toothy smile surrounded by freckles on his cheeks and nose. His youthful body seems to vibrate with enthusiasm. A guess would put him in his late teens.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,317,22402,0,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11016,'Quixi','QUIXI','test',3,266898353,6144,9999,65,0,19,15358,1479594919,0,5356,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-11-19',0,0,'Disheveled hair pulled back in an attempt at a ponytail, with strands falling every which way, frame a small face with dull gray eyes and a bulbous nose that looks out of place.  Layers of blue fabric hide her figure, causing her to appear as wide as she is tall, a full 4 feet.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,1528,0,0,0,52,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11019,'Krayah Merisol','KRAYAH MERISOL','test',3,268434929,15210592,6159999,65,0,8,7399,1465964988,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-06-15',0,0,'The dreamer before you is garbed head to toe in black steel. Soft facial features hold the characteristics of experience. Her brunette hair is cropped harshly and a faded scar interrupts her left eyebrow. Her body is fit, but distinctly feminine. Two scabbards hold a short and a long blade on either side of her hips.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,0,166,24,0,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11020,'Malarky','MALARKY','test',3,257953024,6144,59999,65,0,61,154601,1477948376,0,5550,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-10-31',0,0,'Disoriented and perpetually drunk, the dreamer hobbles about in a sketchy looking lab coat wandering the dream with crazy wild hair and glint in his eyE!','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,7134,0,20,0,61,4,'2016-10-30 20:19:28',NULL),(11021,'Penacus','PENACUS','test',3,252706800,6144,6001,65,0,40,37000,1466452807,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-06-20',0,0,'gaunt with black skin,  sharp facial features and an expression that rarely betrays his intent. The eyes are a fathomless onyx with small sharp protusion extending less than an inch above them both. His hands seem a bit large when compared to his body as do his feet. he\'s clothed in a simple fashion of dark material.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,3885,2682,42,0,2,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11023,'Coraal','CORAAL','test',3,253828592,6192,669900,65,0,468,2474493,1496888356,0,5551,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-06-07',0,0,'Long, full storm colored hair cascades around shoulders and back, falling to the waist; framing a boyishly handsome face with intense emerald eyes. A tight tunic embroidered in golden roses hugs his fit frame. Tight leather pants tuck beneath high boots. Upon his brow a Peace Corpse crest sits like a third eye. He wears a glowing ring of abyss chalk. In his hand, a beautifully carved staff capped with an orb of emerald light. A choker bearing a single rose charm engraved with \"Sorsha\" is around his neck.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.232',7500,7100,0,20,5000,