culla with a sharp collar. Four embossed faces move throughout his form like ghosts in and out of existence. He carries with him an ornate thin disc attached to his hip.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,6879,0,20,0,8,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11038,'Harlen Ronit','HARLEN RONIT','test',4,2499804416,8224,159999,65,0,405,1333452,1482782404,0,5565,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-26',0,0,'A young man, in his mid twenties. He is average height, but physically fit. A single intricate braid of chalk hair falls to the small of his back. His gaze is calm and even, his complection clear, and his face clean shaven. A simple black shirt, embossed with the Peace Corpse symbol on the back, shows his athletic build. He wears dark denim jeans and black leather boots. Golden rings adorn each finger on each hand, save his thumbs. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,17014,39,0,98,4,'2016-12-26 15:14:42',NULL),(11039,'Kalthoss','KALTHOSS','test',2,0,4096,0,65,0,2,428,1468039141,0,5566,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-09',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,1235,0,20,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11040,'Takahiro','TAKAHIRO','test',1,251658240,2048,50,65,0,5,3958,1466983417,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-06-26',0,0,'','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,10305,0,0,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11041,'vaas','VAAS','test',1,251665440,2592,78428,65,0,88,147346,1476081180,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-10-10',0,0,'He has a rectangular face with a defined, slightly pointed chin and a sturdy jaw line. His dark eyes are small and spaced evenly apart, sitting below trim eyebrows that seemed to curve as a natural extension of his broad, rounded nose.  His mouth is closed in a thin, straight line, and his hair—naturally red in color with firey streaks—is neatly tied and worn back to reveal a wide forehead. The jacket he wears over his broad shoulders has neatly polished buttons down the front','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,12219,0,20,0,51,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11043,'Toto tum','TOTO TUM','test',3,254807729,6144,0,65,0,2,373,1467068699,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-06-27',0,0,'Grandma Toto holds a mop and a bucket!','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,7182,0,20,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11044,'Aeragord','AERAGORD','test',3,252806896,6144,7601,65,0,12,33275,1468223192,0,5536,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-11',0,0,'A young man, mid teens. formaly from the dream city Tok\'Aloc. forced to flee after two brothers started a war. it took many dreams to find a new home. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,11138,7093,39,0,53,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11045,'Nathan','NATHAN','test',3,252644848,6224,2297289,65,0,575,1161328,1483068220,0,5440,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-29',0,10000,'Living without his entire left arm leaves one wondering how this dreamer maintains such an upbeat personality. His quick furitive eyes give away at his abundant and excitable energy which occupies him. He stands at 5\'6\", proudly wearing a Peace Corpse symbol on his belt. Oddly enough, oftentimes you catch him doing strange behaviors like clapping as if another arm is there. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,1950,0,20,5000,0,4,'2016-12-29 22:25:45',NULL),(11046,'Xererth','XERERTH','test',1,1431655504,10488912,4154378,65,0,736,1950913,1483126332,0,5440,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-30',0,0,'At a towering 7 foot tall, this bipedal reptilian humanoid resembles an Iguana, and is perhaps the most disturbing creature you\'d ever seen. The powerful smell of reptilian flesh and embalming herbs assault your nostrils. This shambling creation in front of you seems like it was crafted in madness, and birthed in nightmares. Various limbs, none of which humanlike, sprout from this creature in disarray, and in its eye is a strange unearthly glow.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,2629,17,5000,2,3,'2016-12-30 18:46:06',NULL),(11047,'Frisk II','FRISK II','test',1,262581553,2048,50,65,0,3,738,1467413975,0,5572,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-01',0,0,'She looks kinda dumb.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,2747,13731,33,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11051,'Wormfall','WORMFALL','test',3,255852272,6144,0,65,0,1,452,1467623074,0,5574,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-04',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,1888,8021,6,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11050,'Roxie','ROXIE','test',2,261725681,4096,9001,65,0,29,77588,1469483391,0,5573,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-25',0,0,'\r\n* you feel a slight breeze as the dreamer before you walks by and you smell something that reminds you of home...*  Quiet at times and chatty at others, but always listening to others...','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,6559,0,20,0,53,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11052,'Sweething','SWEETHING','test',2,1375730945,5728,4606518,65,0,70,155551,1471960635,0,5573,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-23',0,0,'\r\n\r\nMade from the finest leather, her hand crafted robe fits snuggly around her body. You see sparks of what seems like Insight shooting from it in all areas of the robe, causing it to shimmer when she moves. She also wears a semi-rugged black leather jacket, given to her by a dear friend. She subconsciencely plays with her  medalion which hangs losely around her neck.\r\n\r\n\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,2090,0,20,5000,62,6,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11053,'Lariwyn Araym','LARIWYN ARAYM','test',1,3506441905,2064,15001,65,0,32,84803,1471537295,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-18',0,0,'An average looking girl is clothed in a knee length white dress with flowy sleeves to commemorate a fallen dreamer.\r\nLeaf shaped elven ears poke out from braided hair. Almond shaped eyes of grey stand out on a slim face. A curved longbow carved from mallorn hangs on one side.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,2402,0,20,0,2,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11054,'Ridash','RIDASH','test',1,252143459,14811136,0,65,0,1,0,1467817509,0,5576,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-06',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,1467817509,5,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,0,0,0,0,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11055,'Paremar','PAREMAR','test',2,0,4096,0,65,0,1,174,1467817639,0,5576,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-06',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,1367,0,20,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11056,'Phiz','PHIZ','test',3,263978464,6192,176500,65,0,1,1611,1467846842,0,5577,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-06',0,0,'   ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,0,15,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11057,'Circa','CIRCA','test',4,253895200,8192,9999,65,0,36,77276,1469026424,0,5550,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-20',0,0,'A figment of your imagination that offers only confusion. It resembles that person you know dressed in a familiar looking outfit you can\'t quite place. Your memory of its presence is always fleeting. Manifest enigma, non-ense are voices heard in whispers when standing next to this.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,8809,2692,0,0,54,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11058,'Ariadna Calen','ARIADNA CALEN','test',1,262647281,2048,0,65,0,1,377,1467863000,0,5511,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-06',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7501,12625,0,20,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11060,'Triumph Keeper','TRIUMPH KEEPER','test',1,267861296,2048,9999,65,0,5,16783,1468314024,0,5230,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-12',0,0,'Before you stands a tall man at 6\'5\" and has long golden hair flowing down to his mid back.  He is muscular, and wears a shiny Gold plated armor.  On his hip is a blade with a gold enlaid handle, sharp shiny metal blade that is curved somewhat.  His eyes shine a bright almost yellow but still green hue.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,0,42,22,0,52,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11059,'Tihai','TIHAI','test',1,252143461,131088,43640,65,0,13,13952,1480904404,0,5230,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-04',0,0,'An azure residue drips from the jaws of this seemingly large mare. Its skin gives the apperance of a shadow, as it moves fluently through the dream.','0000-00-00',NULL,1480904404,5,'199.58.75.230',7504,6090,0,23,0,0,4,'2016-12-04 21:45:04',NULL),(11061,'Cidish','CIDISH','test',1,252142915,131072,48,65,0,3,6513,1470074685,0,5224,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-01',0,0,'A look of bewilderment is etched into this mare\'s face. It is abnormally small with the exception of the large whiskers that pertrude from either side of its face.','0000-00-00',NULL,1470074685,3,'199.58.75.230',7500,293,1026,44,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11062,'Vumak','VUMAK','test',1,252143459,131072,0,65,0,1,201,1468104908,0,5573,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-09',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,1468104908,3,'199.58.75.230',7503,0,48,19,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11063,'Frey','FREY','test',2,1366785072,268440144,4055385,65,0,1434,3282667,1483137919,11015,5543,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-30',0,0,'A tall dreamer with strong, wide shoulders and a fierce, angular face. His light blue eyes seem to glitter with savage laughter and he stands straight with his chin parallel to the ground with his shoulders slightly back. His golden brown hair falls to a medium length just below his shoulders. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,12806,0,20,0,17,4,'2016-12-30 17:46:25',NULL),(11064,'Emmiren','EMMIREN','test',4,266661361,8192,0,65,0,1,980,1468200763,0,5580,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-10',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,0,0,0,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11067,'Soraya','SORAYA','test',1,267452145,15206512,10076000,65,0,3,6114,1473487321,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-09-10',0,0,'Strands of raven locks of hair flows loosely cascading down to her lower back, her eyes of emerald hue are filled with an instensity. Her avatar is silent aside, from the occasional clanking of the heavy armor she wears. It appears pristine in its construction almost as though new. On opposite sides of her waist, a set of tarnished chakrams are visible. Her avatar is covered with an assortment of scars and  punture marks.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7504,0,0,48,5000,0,99,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11066,'Sholistan','SHOLISTAN','test',3,258055664,6720,726000,65,0,1,7819,1468288316,0,5578,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-11',0,0,'Sholistan is dressed in an almost absurd motley. His clothing clashes in an odd way, with a deep crimson cotton ensemble trimmed with a rich plum trim. Flowing from his back is a patchwork of bright colors, sewn together with a thick black thread, giving it a bold slapdash sense of chaos. His face seems chiseled and defined, almost stoic. The irises of his eyes, a crystalline blue with a spiderweb like lattice that observes unwaveringly. His hair is black, peppered with streaks of grey slowly forming.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,0,22,0,55,3,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11068,'Astoibaen','ASTOIBAEN','test',1,1,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,0,5583,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,50,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11071,'Lee Gjun','LEE GJUN','test',1,264986720,2048,0,65,0,1,1687,1468474797,0,5108,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-14',0,0,'A translucent apparition floats before you. He never looks like the same person for too long and his appearance can sometimes change mid-conversation. It is hard to pinpoint any discerning features due to that and the fact that his substance fades in and out. He is never truly there. More a silhoutte than a man, sometimes a light wind will disturb his misty constitution.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,9656,0,20,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11069,'Inzoum','INZOUM','test',1,1896848880,8391760,4159999,65,0,674,3105359,1483045596,0,5582,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-29',0,40000,'A tall man in his mid-thirties stands before you, fierce determination in his eyes. In his back, long dark hair drop straight to his waist in a pony tail. Two iron rings dangle from his ear. The blade at his side has an intricate ornament on the pommel, from which dangles a smooth stone with a single rune carved in, painted blood-red. An Ankh pendant on a black silk cord dangles from his neck.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,0,0,22,5000,113,6,'2016-12-29 17:57:08',NULL),(11070,'Asaniel','ASANIEL','test',3,268041473,6176,153381,65,0,43,186266,1479539396,0,5582,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-11-19',0,0,'You rub your eyes as you look at this strange creature before you... You see a large silver dragon gazing intensely at you with sparkling silver eyes... The shape shimmers briefly into that of a lovely young lady in her mid 20s with long, flowing silver hair falling on a plum colored dress with intricate abyss motifs embroidered in, a finely crafted great katana on her back. While the hulking beast moves with subtle grace and elegance, her human figure struggles to maintain decorum. Which is she really?','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,7830,0,20,0,66,4,'2016-11-19 04:46:20',NULL),(11072,'Markie','MARKIE','test',1,256249584,2048,3051,65,0,17,15639,1472261822,0,5002,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-26',0,0,'A young man who appears confident.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,12947,0,20,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11073,'Tralani','TRALANI','test',4,252780033,8192,9999,65,0,10,40612,1468793601,0,5573,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-17',0,0,'You see an older woman with white hair wearing a simple red robe around her plump frame who walks the dream with an air of confidence around her. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,238,1273,12,0,51,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11074,'asrids','ASRIDS','test',1,1,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,0,5585,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,50,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11075,'Kainydd','KAINYDD','test',1,267910129,2048,5611,65,0,24,64129,1468930617,0,5585,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-19',0,0,'a young woman with long dark curls and piercing blue eyes with tattoos running down her arms telling a story of a past life, her long dress clings to her body. she seems innocent but never cross her she has a side not many see, but she will show if she has to.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,1951,0,20,0,51,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11076,'Lhesmyr','LHESMYR','test',3,1,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,0,5587,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,50,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11077,'Marquard','MARQUARD','test',3,268230320,6144,0,65,0,19,8823,1468958643,0,5588,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-19',0,0,'Marquard is an unimposing figure of a man; he is slightly shorter than the typical male dreamer, his thinning light blonde hair covering most of his head down to shoulder-length, and has a bit of a \'beer belly\'. He is covered in coarsely threaded brown robes - no hood - with plain, dark grey tunic underneath, both of which look to have been hand-sewn by a novice. His skin is dark and he has lean but defined muscle mass on his forearms. His brown eyes are surrounded in wrinkles, indicating he is middle-aged','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,1915,0,20,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11078,'HasidicRabbi','HASIDICRABBI','test',1,251658240,2048,0,65,0,2,668,1471919518,0,5589,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-08-22',0,0,'(none)','0