een eye with an affinity for fine objects.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,12581,0,20,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11090,'lliam','LLIAM','test',3,268405728,6672,42665,65,0,108,179226,1477810562,0,1,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-10-30',0,0,'A young man appearing to be in his mid 20\'s. His large, dark eyes exhibit the perfect balance between charm and danger. He\'s  tall, well built, and walks with a sense of confidence.\r\n.\r\n','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,6129,0,26,0,51,3,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11091,'Nidus','NIDUS','test',4,261722368,8240,176150,65,0,31,14578,1474358145,0,5550,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-09-20',0,0,'Hysteria breathes through. A smooth face, no lips, nose or eyes to define him. Instead, only the remains of what once was a face in turmoil marred by the set in bolts along his jaw line that once held tight to a mask. ','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7505,6470,2198,0,0,51,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(6011,'The Darkness','THE DARKNESS','test',1,268435440,526480,159160000,65,0,492,1053773,1494700751,0,0,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2017-05-13',0,0,'','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.232',7500,0,12457,43,5000,44,99,'2017-01-02 19:05:34',NULL),(11092,'Elan','ELAN','test',1,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,0,5595,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'1000-01-01',0,0,NULL,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'',0,0,0,0,0,50,0,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11094,'Krunc','KRUNC','test',1,251878864,2048,0,65,0,4,3226,1469932040,0,5051,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-07-30',0,0,'Heavy set. Face scarred with the left eye clouded and sunken deep within its socket. The damage extends to the left  arm leaving it dangling limply from the shoulder, ending in a stub at the wrist. An easy smile stands in contrast.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,7176,0,20,0,50,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11095,'Rut\'roh','RUT\'ROH','test',1,209718,15073424,159160000,65,0,5,11375,1478218721,0,0,'Jo