ent lighting situation which builds upon his already discomforting shady qualities. As if not sketchy enough, he tends to cling to the shadows of the room and speaks in suave, articulated and calculated expressions.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7500,12036,0,20,0,7,2,'2016-12-30 19:28:43',NULL),(11146,'Thrawn','THRAWN','test',1,267390448,12586080,7220566,65,0,57,110638,1477966676,0,5003,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-10-31',0,0,'You see a tall figure wearing a bright white military uniform.  His spaulders have a circular symbol with a spear point in the center. His eyes are nothing but bright blue pinpoints of energy within a dark void.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7503,92,0,41,5000,58,6,'2016-10-31 22:41:55',NULL),(11149,'Hael Frost','HAEL FROST','test',2,268176305,4112,59999,65,0,105,892182,1483068105,0,5627,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-12-29',0,0,'A stoic young lady with dusty pink eyes with glowing azure pupils.Rapunzel-like hair is done in twin braided buns decorated with a grey puffs of fur,the rest lose to the ground.Small feathered wings rest on her back.She wears a short,knee-length,tawny colored dress with white lace trim.The off-the-shoulder sleeves are long and loose,falling slightly over the fingers. Gray stockings come with,along with light brown boots going half way up the leg with white laces.Smells of sandalwood and vanilla.','0000-00-00',NULL,0,0,'199.58.75.230',7502,3522,0,49,0,114,4,'2016-12-30 00:55:24',NULL),(11151,'Ragor','RAGOR','test',1,252143461,131072,35422,65,0,3,1661,1477683061,0,5024,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-10-28',0,0,'(none)','0000-00-00',NULL,1477683061,5,'199.58.75.230',7502,0,3870,5,0,0,4,'1970-01-01 00:00:00',NULL),(11153,'Hairy Harold','HAIRY HAROLD','test',4,267124192,8192,7001,65,0,2,8177,1477456864,0,5230,'Joe Blow','someone@someplace.com',0,0,'2016-10-26',0,0,'Before you stands 6 foot 3inches, broad shoulder, hairy chested, rough looking man.  He is wearing 