INSERT INTO `player_sot` VALUES (554,'Aethimir',9108025,54,54,33,33,33,54,54,33,33,33,'Small burn marks pock this dreamers clothes in random spots.  Once dark-brown hair, cut short, is starting to grey at the temples.  Slung over a shoulder is a small pack, a sheaf of tattered papers pokes out of the top under the flap.',0,0,1,3,'rhjRSwAvyr',0,4,'2007-10-19 13:59:27',79,'\0',0,0,636872,13221705,8647394,11,83,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,479035632,1908504,16,0),(555,'Igteus',1622821,44,26,26,44,26,44,26,26,44,26,'This able-bodied partisan is clad in thick clothing including various different types of armor.  Thick gray hair laden with solid white locks extends downward from his head and comes to rest neatly on his shoulders.  His stature and countenance appear to defy his age as he stands perfectly straight, his face ensnared in an expression of both pride and dissapointment.  ',0,0,1804,1,'urNNpomNfSvj',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:11:48',75,'\0',0,0,196679,28923,49501,3,43,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,8717296,24,32784,0),(556,'Gharod',1332726,0,25,25,43,25,43,25,25,43,25,'Tousled blond hair sports dark streaks as if he had dipped his hands in black dust and then stroked his locks. This man in the prime of his youth is clothed in a plain leather jerkin covering a linen shirt and trousers that extend to meet thick leather boots; nothing in his attire draws attention. However, his height, rugged features, thick forearms and rough, blackened hands are difficult to overlook.',0,0,1804,1,'yaHYgWtrEL',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:12:10',75,'\0',0,0,129870,44651,82030,6,15,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,75826160,522132504,98320,0),(557,'Zar\'tenya',4159999,49,29,29,29,49,49,29,29,29,49,'Locks of raven coloured hair cascades down her waist, loose strands covering the right side of her face as if to conceal  something upon her forehead. Clothed in loose fitting red leather jerkin and silk fabric wraps around torso and curves of her slender figure. A prominent mark of dual blades in a larger circle is branded onto the center of her forehead while her dark eyes seem to always be lost in thought. She speaks in clear crisp tones.',0,0,1804,2,'KlcBLGGAoB',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:15:17',84,'\0',0,0,1747370,9676321,8592497,249,447,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520701169,16843029,16,0),(559,'Lynus Xebseluur',4126400,49,49,29,29,29,49,49,29,29,29,'A hard set jaw and severe look dominate the face of this Dreamer.  She wears a sleek skin tight one piece suit, obviously cut for ease of motion.  Her once haphazardly styled hair has been cut severely short, and a pack is secured firmly to her back. A chakram rests loosely on her hip.',0,0,1804,4,'G0pAjGGxRC',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:18:29',84,'\0',0,0,150423,13818,41600,1,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,529351921,352785687,18,0),(560,'Zennan',4118399,48,29,29,29,49,49,29,29,29,49,'This man stands hunched over, his white beard reaching almost to the ground.  Long white hair cascades down his back, half way hidden by his huge blue wizard\'s hat. He wears a thick dark blue robe and a lighter colored scarf around his neck. His wrinkled face shows a very high age, but his eyes look as if they are hiding something. ',0,0,1804,4,'kPrOqksptM',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:19:03',75,'\0',0,0,351484,329488,371088,9,16,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,8995056,1052695,20,0),(561,'Hoyt',18778715,59,36,36,59,36,59,36,36,59,36,'This man is of average height.  He stands a bit hunched over.  He wears an old beaten hat that is stained with sweat, soil and several different types of sand.  He wears old torn clothes that has a patchwork of different colors.  His hands are wrinkled and worn.  Several small scars cover his hand, along with a thick, and packed, layer of dirt and grime under his nails.',0,0,1953,1,'kWEBInDITc',0,4,'2007-10-19 14:19:18',84,'\0',0,0,1109001,691543,1053011,23,7,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,8765680,354161944,916,0),(562,'Kal\'lankissa',97543734,99,99,99,99,99,99,99,99,99,99,'Bereft of her natural eyes, her eyelids are sewn shut with crisscrossing stitches. Dark thick locks of abyss hair has been braided into one long strand that rests easily upon her small shoulders, making its way down to the small of her back. Adorned with a rusted coloured silk tunic which wraps around her avatar, hugging each of her curves with accuracy. Her hands are bare, she wears a gold bracelet upon her wrists in the shape of serpents.',0,0,1804,4,'UPhUcllejP',0,4,'2007-10-19 14:19:33',79,'',0,0,897935,1512211,3968476,4,8,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521290993,403969046,12,0),(563,'Tevapetine',1019999,41,24,41,24,24,41,24,41,24,24,'(none)',0,0,1,4,'ir5zBh5aqf',12884901888,0,'2007-10-19 14:19:48',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,118554866,487722753,0,0),(564,'Geiru Kaulem',1659999,44,26,26,44,26,44,26,26,44,26,'Geiru Kaulem is a short, fat man. His excessively pale skin makes it seem like he has never seen sunlight in his life. His short blond hair seems to glimmer under any form of light. Almost every inch of his visible skin is covered in scars and burn marks, as if he has been tortured relentlessly. A large double sided war axe is strapped to his back with leather straps.',0,0,1804,1,'fHKNdZzUnN',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:20:04',75,'\0',0,0,223850,1629696,128096,10,182,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,75826160,16908823,98320,0),(565,'Weldrick',158399,34,19,19,34,19,34,19,19,34,19,'This tall man is wrapped in armor polished to sparkling chrome..  Various leather strings and straps tangle themselves together to form a uniquely shaped belt.  A long, spiraled spear always supports his weight, as he is constantly leaning against it for support.  His face, marked by a sense of relief, and two gemstone-like crystal blue eyes, appears to scan the horizon as if expecting something',0,0,1804,1,'WeJdPmhJ7o',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:20:15',75,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,528777712,28,98576,0),(566,'Brass',159999,34,19,19,34,19,34,19,19,34,19,'long blonde braids cascade down the wide chest of this extremely large man. Aged bronze armor cover his shoulders, hands, legs and wrists. The symbol of The Emancipators of Men adorn his chest and most of his clothing',0,0,1804,1,'fYGwcukzBN',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:20:29',75,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,75792624,470817820,275,0),(567,'Beatrice',153695,34,19,19,34,19,34,19,19,34,19,'A very tall and young woman, her face shows a very young age, her pale skin seams to shine in the light. Long and curly reddish hair seams to constantly flow as it frames her face well. Her sky blue eyes seam to pierce what ever she is looking at.',0,0,1804,1,'EGUHAhohzF',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:20:39',75,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,25462257,24,98576,0),(568,'Gorowind',155247,34,19,19,34,19,34,19,19,34,19,'Clad in meticulously polished armor, he appears to hold no obvious weapon in his hands; however, mounted on his helmet are two horns of unknown origin which look well-worn with use.\r\n',0,0,1804,1,'LqcWJr6gFu',0,0,'2007-10-19 14:20:50',75,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,478446064,24,98576,0),(569,'Leo',303,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'An old man wearing simple lose abyss robes.  His face is marked with wrinkles and age spots.   His eyes are faded blue and chalk hair sprouts from his semi-balding head.  He slumps slightly and leans heavily upon a walking stick which curves to meet his hand.',0,0,340,2,'YceMUFkK6G',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:16:41',79,'\0',0,0,97941,306,3,2,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,1053464,0,0),(570,'Rorin',2040,21,21,10,10,10,21,21,10,10,10,'A young man of average hight and build, with wavy shoulder length blond hair, and greyish green eyes.  He wears long robes of a dark green, and more often then not has an smile on his face.\r\n',0,0,376,3,'bQ3uQpPFBU',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:27:40',79,'\0',0,0,507,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67895536,117901080,0,0),(571,'Azel',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A young woman, aged around the mid-twenties, though presenting some traits of an older age. Her hair is seemingly grayed and dulled by the years, and her skin shows a certain elderly palor. Wearing a discrete, dark dress, with few highlights, she appears to place no particular attention to her physical appearance. Her face inspires a severe, austere personality. Although her appearance suggests a frail build, her posture and behavior reveals a healthy, youthful vigor.',0,0,228,3,'wSOdPVCdM2',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:28:18',79,'\0',0,0,6576,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(572,'Phus',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'',0,0,437,1,'ku6UhFnZ8H',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:28:31',79,'\0',0,0,8481,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,302252272,1580802,0,0),(573,'Kira Windveil',1649109,44,24,23,23,41,44,26,26,26,44,' A man stands before you six feet in height. Brilliant strands of lavender fall gently over his strikingly beautiful face. Your gaze meets his, as it does his eyes pierce forth in jade and amethyst tones. Upon his body rests a tight fitting leather vest, above his heart rests a golden key pendant. Muscular arms ringed with ink lead to his right wrist upon it, an infinity symbol. On his left hand sits a wedding band, shaped as a ward, his love\'s lifessence within. Between his thumb and forefinger, her star.',0,0,1763,2,'veCihpthNd',281474976710656,0,'2007-10-19 15:28:41',84,'\0',0,0,5949362,1048906,448306,91,379,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,319357280,269484056,65536,0),(574,'Firefount',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,340,4,'h6hZ1zps0V',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:28:55',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,0,0,0),(575,'Bree',6083,23,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,'Before you stands a young woman of light skin with the slightest rose hue. Her Auburn locks fall ever so gently about her shoulders and frame her face slightly obscuring her emerald eyes.  She is an average build wearing long flowing sleeveless white dress with plum trim. A symbol adorns the front of her garments.',0,0,368,3,'eZrLahyhaf',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:48:53',79,'\0',0,0,13132,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,403441137,301994519,32768,0),(576,'Nyala',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'Her long black ringlets are gathered in a messy bun with several tendrils falling loosely about her face. Her skin has a slight blue hue to it and she is dressed in ornate onyx colored satin robes.',0,0,368,2,'Omeq3WSSJg',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:50:30',79,'\0',0,0,4319,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520619249,522133248,0,0),(577,'Keiani',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,368,1,'NkW3dLqumw',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:53:12',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,263409,0,0,0),(578,'Lapis',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Before you is simply a young woman, dark hair and pale skin. Her eyes are a viloent sort of green and wears a simple golden layerd dress, accented by teal trim. ',0,0,266,4,'KyM8EDxXcH',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:55:50',79,'\0',0,0,3861,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143537,201591832,0,0),(579,'Lucian Tiros',9999,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,24,'At almost seven feet he is tall, and wiry, despite the age clearly writen upon his features. His clothing form the torn teal bandage covering one eye, to his ripped teal shirt show hard use, and the sand sandals he wears are ment for someone of smaller size. Oddly a clean pure chalk cloak starts from below his unkempt roped hair to drag along behind him as he moves, following an abyss cane as his other eye is the pure chalk milkiness of the blind.',0,0,270,2,'HKCshiNduu',0,0,'2007-10-19 15:58:50',79,'\0',0,0,384427,7628,1129,16,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,5404,0,0),(580,'Pylon',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,335,4,'Y4uFnsAaYR',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:19:43',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,0,0,0),(581,'Kynan',4,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'This redhaired,bearded man stands about six feet tall.His skin is very tanned and weathered though there are many long scars and burn marks on it.Adorned in leather armor,there is a large sword strapped to his back.Noosed on his belt is a chisel and small hammer.',0,0,176,1,'0xrZtRWa7H',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:20:59',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17039856,16844568,98304,0),(582,'Murphy',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Murphy\'s head, covered in a thick tuft of black hair, appears to be perfectly round and without flaw.  Yellow and blue strips of a thin, coarse, and dirty cloth are woven together to form the one-piece suit that engulfs every inch of his body, and stops at his neck.  Crossed over his back, much like swords, appear to be two thick, brown branches, with leaves still attached.',0,0,472,4,'oVGLEa8he9',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:21:30',85,'\0',0,0,20182,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142512,268701719,528,0),(583,'Awena',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A small and stocky nervous woman, she appears to be in her thirties, dressed in well woven earth and jade tunic and trews.',0,0,999999,1,'NXYRfIg8i5',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:22:04',79,'\0',0,0,72,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,402916593,119277336,0,0),(584,'Sion Trew',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'An old man, around five feet in height, glowers at the room from under bushy eyebrows.  He is leaning heavily on a solid wooden cane.  His simple brown clothes are covered in burns.  He is constantly writing things down in a notebook he keeps in his pocket.',0,0,155,2,'obqDureJNU',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:22:46',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,1842967,0,0),(585,'Idoaclese',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,472,3,'wDguxU9xp5',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:24:50',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(586,'Silk Khel\'din',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A curious looking gentleman, his hair seems to be made of the finest silk, his clothes of a similiar material.  He seems interested in everything and nothing at once.',0,0,197,3,'3ZH8xrYBKK',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:26:11',79,'\0',0,0,67564,0,0,2,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67895536,117442328,0,0),(587,'Lord Xenus',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,472,1,'fZGRn1eL4X',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:28:24',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,0,0,0),(588,'Fithian Rankin',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,999999,1,'UvNbO3lXY2',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:29:10',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NU