\'s symbol engraved in the buckle. His voice, deep and commanding. Armor has a brilliant abyss tint to it. On his left hand, you can see a golden ring upon his ring finger. His abyss hair lays at ear length neatly with a parted center.',0,0,193,1,'0dAaRu4yKG',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:43:26',79,'\0',0,0,6080834,903720,332552,211,360,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,528793840,522133249,400,0),(597,'Freja',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Dull blue eyes greet you with a steady gaze, beneath the shade of ebony tendrils. Her thin, pale lips wear a constant smile. Tresses of black cascade down to her waist, and nestled firmly upon the side of her scalp is a purple lily. A strapless, and yet elegant blue dress adorns her slender figure, and from the bottom of her skirt both of her small feet stick out, stained by dirt and grass alike, bare and devoid of any protection. ',0,0,302,3,'AJXL93ktIP',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:43:38',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520881393,202116117,0,0),(598,'Shayleanne',12733,25,25,13,13,13,25,25,13,13,13,'Her straight brown hair is tied back with a red ribbon, her skin tanned from the sun. Sable brown eyes surrounded with dark lashes radiate warmth and tenderness. She is dressed in a crushed velvet jumper, her boots mid thigh length have a knife strapped to the side. \r\n',0,0,1440,3,'BzwxUbixiM',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:43:54',79,'\0',0,0,146450,2842,108,1,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470566129,131608,0,0),(599,'Vates',136256,33,19,19,19,32,33,19,19,19,33,'boycott',0,0,447,2,'MWjVgajDhM',0,0,'2007-10-19 16:45:56',79,'\0',0,0,753571,141170,17642,32,6,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,559089,0,98304,0),(600,'Delosian',94159999,69,69,43,43,43,69,69,43,43,43,'The dark look in this dreamers eyes seems to accent his fiery hair.  His near alabaster complexion brings out the dark offset of his eyes. With a rainbow hued gem in his ear, he seems He wears loose fitting abyss trousers, and a flowing crimson long coat that exposes his bare chest, with a single carved emerald wing on its breast.  He is often seen working a piece of straw around, in his mouth. The scent of horses, and straw are pungent nearest him.    ',0,0,1804,3,'G0pAjGGxRC',217020518514230019,4,'2007-10-19 16:51:11',75,'\0',0,0,1259492,88140965,2239904,14,33,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,42877168,352395029,16,0),(601,'Jevan',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'This man is average in height, with short grey hair cut in an unremarkable fashion.  His slim body is adorned in simple but colorful clothes that hang loosely around him. Pale blue eyes stand out on an otherwise pale face with limited features. Plain boots adorn his feet.',0,0,271,3,'BVqGGSYiTS',0,0,'2007-10-19 17:11:04',79,'\0',0,0,705,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,504103152,168364568,0,0),(602,'Nadiyah',125942,33,18,18,18,33,33,18,18,18,33,'Standing before you is a petite young woman, with long dark hair, her eyes are hazel and when she smiles they light up, her features are delicate, her skin slightly tan.  Her dress is short and flowing.  ',0,0,99,2,'yTXY1ZsoZ7',0,0,'2007-10-19 17:15:14',79,'\0',0,0,108282,128491,2549,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470320369,522133272,0,0),(603,'Dagota Hiromi',4159999,49,29,49,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,'A young man in his late twenties that has slitted, tangerine-colored eyes with a fascinating gleam. He has a thin oriental face and waist-length, blood-red hair bound in one large ponytail. His body is very slender and a long thin sword sticks out behind his back. Multiple black lines runs across his face as if he was playing with charcoal.',0,0,1804,4,'ofNkuc5Rp4',0,0,'2007-10-19 17:28:02',75,'\0',0,0,95936,0,0,0,8,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,26296560,302055960,16,0),(604,'Epoch',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,539,2,'RWAS0vklQf',0,0,'2007-10-19 17:29:54',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,352846064,471602456,0,0),(605,'Corrado',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'The man before you stands roughly 5\'10\" tall. His hair parted neatly in the center. Corrado\'s eyes are a bright blue that seem to shine through the part in his hair.  His light upper armor is pure white, with two equally white armbands, from which three, side by side thin chains attach to his shoulder pads on each side. Over top of his armor he wears a lightly colored linen vest with matching linen pants. His boots are made of the same material as his upper armor, & they fit snug to his feet with knee pads',0,0,1804,3,'x2FhZEbreZ',0,0,'2007-10-19 17:32:03',84,'\0',0,0,3812,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,1376280,0,0),(606,'Madrigal',2465,21,10,10,10,21,21,10,10,10,21,'A smallish woman, her hair grayed with age, her bearing upright and regal but with a warm smile on her face.  She wears a long silky robe in regal color and carries, slung across her chest, a brocade bag.  A slightly tarnished pin sits on her shoulder with the initials EP on it.  The scent of lilacs seems to follow her when she moves.',0,0,163,2,'70kgmFLRBJ',0,0,'2007-10-19 17:34:30',79,'\0',0,0,96851,2500,35,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,525552,17957397,0,0),(607,'Azraidus',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,390,3,'aiiwCZDTlg',0,0,'2007-10-19 17:44:21',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(608,'Gremshin',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A tall, burly dreamer wearing a slight smile on his lips.  To look at him, one might be forgiven for thinking he had something up his sleeve.. some dirt on you.  Despite his friendly demenour something about him tends to send shivers up your spine ',0,0,326,3,'kU5vjatKDP',0,0,'2007-10-19 17:53:33',79,'\0',0,0,422,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470548720,319033879,0,0),(609,'Dogoda',59999,29,16,16,16,29,29,16,16,16,29,'A average sized man with hair of night. An empty satchel on his side. A white gold band, set with three stones, the center imperial cut diamond is flawless and clear, in it a jade spark of resilience.',0,0,479,2,'v7VqxCxdMl',0,0,'2007-10-19 18:17:44',79,'\0',0,0,228844685,133915,73916,252,19,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268976368,270475032,0,0),(611,'Jasher',9899,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,'Upon closer inspection, you notice beautifull braids in Jasher\'s hair, and she has a white one piece dress on with yellow and magenta flowers embroidered all throughout the light-weight fabric. Her restless dart like eyes have beautiful saphron irises and her big smile is characterized by blue metalic bracers. It is difficult not to notice her charismatic freckles and her long deafening legs. ',0,0,446,1,'kyCDiTZftb',0,0,'2007-10-19 18:19:16',79,'\0',0,0,83637,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67371248,23,0,0),(612,'Calis',7133,23,12,21,9,12,23,12,23,12,12,'A short, almost waifish woman with angular features.  Her bright green hair is pulled sharply back.  A haphazardly formed fateslayer is worn proudly at her side, almost as a symbol.',0,0,199,4,'TEZjvjoyZx',0,0,'2007-10-19 18:20:33',79,'\0',0,0,1559,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,118490353,119473944,0,0),(613,'Arlian',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,421,2,'sqtLvEP7yN',0,0,'2007-10-19 18:21:20',79,'\0',0,0,169,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,520232728,0,0),(614,'Sorgen',57059,0,16,29,16,16,29,16,29,16,16,'',0,0,1804,4,'LO6PPspvvT',0,0,'2007-10-19 18:30:01',75,'\0',0,0,2062369,222967,180605,361,34,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,68177139,18618396,0,0),(615,'Sand',73516,30,30,17,17,17,30,30,17,17,17,'A person of average height could easily stand head and shoulders taller then this young man. Tan smudges and odd streaks of dark, corrosive mettalic mar his otherwise handsome face with sharp features and a hard-set jaw. The streaks radiate from a prominent, gleaming yet foreign rune in his forehead. A ratty, tattered vest covers a nicely fitted suit of abyss armor trimmed in jade. An insignia, a single emerald wing, is affixed under his collar bone on the left side. The streaks continue down his arms.',0,0,355,3,'zs4NWiWMjn',0,0,'2007-10-19 18:35:19',79,'\0',0,0,2521084,213584,149388,327,38,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470582256,119480088,32770,0),(616,'Radu Lykan',12,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,306,1,'IDnznaLe9v',0,0,'2007-10