lR',0,0,'2007-10-19 19:20:30',79,'\0',0,0,826804,5787,2793,38,6,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470287088,2039576,98304,0),(639,'Kalidas',48077,28,15,15,15,27,28,15,15,15,28,'This intelligent gentleman has deep-set green eyes that are like two pools of stangant water. His luxurious, wavy, sandy hair is worn in a style that reminds you of the aurora borealis. He is tall and has a broad-shouldered build. His skin is pale. He has an elegant nose and wide feet. His wardrobe is mysterious, with deep earthy colors and golden highlights.  To his side floats a small glowing orb, following his every movement, that remains effortlessly at his side.',0,0,97,2,'ZdDcb7QKfV',0,0,'2007-10-19 19:33:33',79,'\0',0,0,313171,10765,1769,22,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,403194096,471598103,0,0),(640,'Ki Adimundi',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'This man\'s very skin seems to be made from Granite, you get a sense that he is as old as the ground that you walk on, however you could not tell from his solid stone build, a glow of blue light resonates from his eyes. ',0,0,999999,2,'fYQEnWh3ak',0,0,'2007-10-19 19:33:37',84,'\0',0,0,12129,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470286576,521935903,0,0),(641,'Maul',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'This dreamer has a sleek, trim, and muscular build, he wears pitch black clothing and armor, which appears to have seen many battles, he adorns an array of torturous and powerful looking weapons nearly covering his avatar. This dreamer has a very deep, commanding voice. His hair is the color of flame and seems to move and contort as if it were fire moving in the wind, a sharp purple light blazes from his eye sockets, and although he has no notable eyes, he seems to see everything around him in great detail',0,0,397,4,'XDGJIvQICq',0,0,'2007-10-19 19:34:29',79,'\0',0,0,11438,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,34603248,522133272,0,0),(642,'Tercy',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,258,1,'1gx9gEmURq',0,0,'2007-10-19 19:38:38',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,471274783,0,0),