s right side but the features on his left side are normal and quite attractive.',0,0,459,1,'KeCu1SafAp',0,0,'2007-10-19 20:33:31',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470024432,522133272,0,0),(667,'Smoke',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A robed figure stands in the shadows, cowl covering his face.  Few features can actually be made out.  As the figure steps from the shadows, towards the light, and his face is about to be revealed, it\'s not.  Almost as if the lights dimmed, just for him.',0,0,403,2,'9FwC80qqLK',0,0,'2007-10-19 20:44:08',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,522133279,0,0),(668,'Ace',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'wears red clothes all the time',0,0,488,1,'8r3HJQBU4O',0,0,'2007-10-19 20:48:20',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,31,3,0),(669,'Slushy',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,486,1,'rzFyyMGmEm',0,0,'2007-10-19 20:50:36',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,522133269,0,0),(670,'BaneRenamed',1980,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A ghostly figure, that much was certain.  The nature of this man was elusive and shifting, changed on a whim to suit the man\'s fancy of the dream.  The eyes though, the eyes never changed.  Always the same boring shade of hazel.',0,0,665,1,'c7LSlPTFA8',0,0,'2007-10-19 20:59:10',84,'\0',0,0,23040,0,20,1,0,1,NULL,'2008-02-08 22:09:00','Original owner made character for quick roleplay.  Exception to rule made in interest of recruiting good rp\'er.',0,520618224,28,0,0),(671,'Kaa Sii',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,467,1,'tacc2ZrXXO',0,0,'2007-10-19 21:13:58',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,0,0,0),(672,'Gada Wite',5000,22,11,11,22,11,22,11,11,22,11,'Here is a dreamer who is tall and thin, with wide shoulders and a self-confident stance. She wears plain straight-legged pants, and a tight white blouse that presses her small breasts into her chest, with a collar that flares up in elegant white satin ruffles about her neck. Over this blouse is an inexcusably tacky plaid coat, patterned in greens and purples and brownish grays, its lower two buttons fastened conservatively. Her platinum white hair is rigidly styled in a short-cropped fauxhawk.',0,0,253,1,'OEwzUa0rez',0,0,'2007-10-19 21:22:44',79,'\0',0,0,11295,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,263409,1820,0,0),(673,'Ryuichi',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A single deep blue eye stares out at you from behind wisps of silvery-white, however his right eye is covered in thick bandages. A white robe hangs around his masculine figure, the sleeves dragging down to the floor. From beneath the hem of his robe appears black boots adorning his feet.',0,0,303,1,'VJ5fwmV8XS',0,0,'2007-10-19 21:29:16',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,520101656,0,0),(674,'Miranda',9966,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,'A fairly young lady with long blonde hair and bright hazel eyes. An old EoM pin stuck to her clothing.',0,0,234,1,'Nv4H5m4uUh',0,0,'2007-10-19 21:37:00',79,'\0',0,0,102966,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,352584945,304026136,0,0),(675,'Serethos',46685,28,15,28,15,15,28,15,28,15,15,'You see a dreamer of middle years with a friendly and determined air about him. A tiny plum-chalk shield with the letters \"EP\" is pinned to his vest beside the Emergence crest.',0,0,288,4,'zJxahEDz0B',0,0,'2007-10-19 21:47:30',79,'\0',0,0,722171,48576,10146,38,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521159008,522125592,98304,0),(676,'Sylas Prium',653399,0,39,23,23,23,39,39,23,23,23,'Sylas is a short and very slender young man. His long brown hair falls just short of his shoulders. His chest is adorned by the crest of the Sect of the Prudent. A plain looking, night colored sheathe hangs off of his right hip. A second plain looking abyss colored sheathe hangs off of his left hip. Large scars appear on the back of each of his hands. A golden ring adorns his left ring finger.',0,0,110,3,'o8HXe4KzoN',0,0,'2007-10-19 21:54:27',75,'\0',0,0,1620036,671288,77888,35,306,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470598640,280,98304,0),(677,'Xererth',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'You see a small aqua colored iguana crawling across the floor quickly. ',0,0,314,1,'C5epEA8N4b',0,0,'2007-10-19 22:20:05',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,117702896,460544,0,0),(678,'Askme Not',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A man of middle-age who appears to be wearing garb that is not much more than rough wool and tattered sheepskin.  On his upper left arm is the mark of a brand.  The skin that makes up the brand, a simple \r\n\"X\" is coarse and scaled like a reptiles.  His eyes look as though he has found escape from an unseen torture.',0,0,474,2,'KRu1PV22Zk',0,0,'2007-10-19 22:29:37',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470286576,471800856,0,0),(679,'Nathan',59999,29,29,16,16,16,29,29,16,16,16,'A teenage boy with short-umkempt abyss hair portraying his hazel eyes and high cheek bones.  A strange, yet noticable character surrounds this boy, he seems to be upsessed with writing and history. Bearing a leather satchel filled with plenty of codecies written in many hands seem to be taking up most of his time these dreams. His face is expressionless, as well as seemingly  troubled. This boy seems as if he bears the sins of all the histories he\'s read. On his back lies a bow gleaming in a green aura.',0,0,314,3,'L7QBTlXnus',0,0,'2007-10-19 22:35:41',79,'\0',0,0,892282,68080,10863,45,15,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520896752,2031644,0,0),(680,'Twilight',2796,21,10,21,10,10,21,10,21,10,10,'Straight, long, jet black hair falls down this womans back. A head band is placed around her head with one tall multi colored feather attached to it, sticking up behind her head. On each of her cheeks she has some sort of red paint smuged to make a line on them. She is wearing a worn and torn dress made of thick material. At the bottom it is cut to make points, in a Zig Zag fashion. Around her waist is a belt that holds all of her weaponry, including her favorite blade with an inscription \" Free Wanderer.\"',0,0,461,4,'LDPM9Lo5QP',0,0,'2007-10-19 22:58:26',79,'\0',0,0,59629,3000,204,7,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143537,303176732,0,0),(681,'Orochimaru',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,489,3,'vvYJjHQ2pc',0,0,'2007-10-19 23:02:04',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(682,'Pheign',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A near skeletal figure can occasionally be glimpsed beneath the bulky robe and cloak. The faint sound of rawhide stretching can barely be heard beneath her throaty almost dusty voice.',0,0,274,2,'jOBP8D1FsQ',0,0,'2007-10-19 23:06:55',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1049841,118493212,0,0),(683,'Marcus Chant',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'At slightly higher than average hieght, this dreamer glances purposefully.  His blue hair stands out strikingly from an otherwise nondescript appearance.',0,0,174,1,'5Dle3bzzEk',0,0,'2007-10-19 23:21:09',79,'\0',0,0,27955,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268697840,2038808,0,0),(684,'Grellecke',81334984,68,68,42,42,42,68,68,42,42,42,'(none)',0,0,1804,4,'ewCaQFZuFr',0,0,'2007-10-19 23:27:13',84,'\0',0,0,359085,1411161,18086176,20,27,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,26099952,67376415,16,0),(685,'Amara',158399,34,34,19,19,19,34,34,19,19,19,'Long abyss hair falls in curls to her hips,  loosely framing large lost eyes that glow a dark disturbing emerald. Her long flowing silk robes are corseted at the middle of her petite frame, now tattered and unkept.  The cowl of her robes are oft seen pulled over her head, shadowing all but her eyes and full lips.  About her neck, a thick leather collar with a tarnished silver serpent eating it\'s tail, an O ring at it\'s center.\r\n',0,0,367,3,'1KpR2tYGmG',0,0,'2007-10-19 23:35:18',79,'\0',0,0,230592039,357098,204326,170,5,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520914161,18816792,0,0),(686,'Shamblix',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1,2,'pTFnij16NJ',0,0,'2007-10-19 23:35:59',84,'\0',0,0,3367,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,3827,459008,32768,0),(687,'Dude',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,490,1,'syT1wXkWgd',0,0,'20