)',0,0,999999,1,'jKpNk1i8Xm',0,0,'2007-10-20 08:18:50',79,'\0',0,0,71,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470025457,270471196,0,0),(709,'Arthas',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,' ',0,0,422,3,'Its3ypQckE',0,0,'2007-10-20 08:39:55',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,270471192,0,0),(710,'Zanteel',99999999,99,99,99,99,99,99,99,99,99,99,'Tanned skin and clear eyes doesn\'t give away the age of this dreamer. If you watch him closely you may notice his neatness and order in the way he dresses, speak or acts.',0,0,70,4,'H7P3jM2NTC',0,0,'2007-10-20 08:48:46',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,252711452,0,0),(711,'Aerion',268,14,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A young strapping man with tan complexion. His blue eyes so light they almost distract as an oddity but are quite lovely accented by the thin brows. His facial features are sharp and rigid, and much like his physique would indicate he is in good shape. A tatoo of a green serpent rings his left bicep and a blade can be seen emerging from under his gear on his right shoulder.',0,0,429,1,'bUmX7tDVXj',0,0,'2007-10-20 08:49:08',79,'\0',0,0,2406,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,522125592,768,0),(713,'Xyn Rhade',1540845,44,26,39,22,26,44,26,44,26,26,'Before you stands a tall, well built man, with Rust colored skin.  Shoulder length Indigo hair shifts about as he moves as only a FateSender can.  His left arm has a fleshy color and feel, yet a stoney look to it.  Vibrant ice blue eyes seem alive with a quiet intelligence and pent up energy.\r\n\r\nA ruby red gem can be seen attached to the back of his left hand.\r\n\r\n\r\n',0,0,500,4,'EGrNWvNURe',144115188075855872,0,'2007-10-20 09:08:46',79,'\0',0,0,7410138,2079059,1554290,799,313,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,269550192,270340123,40960,0),(714,'Neveza',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A dreamer that is lost and dazed. Asorbing information and knowledge through his adventures.',0,0,482,2,'8pzdU2kUiB',0,0,'2007-10-20 09:22:37',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17301744,521936668,0,0),(715,'Omen',7859,23,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,'... your vision seems to blur as you gaze at this Dreamer. His skin appears as if it is made of a smokey abyss substance, obscuring any distinct features, other than a scar running down the side of his face. A sly smirk seems etched on his face as well, as if he finds everything secretly amusing. The rest of his body is hidden away under a cowled robe, the hood pulled down even with his eyes.\r\n\r\nOften seen, yet rarely heard...',0,0,458,3,'3bjKLlE074',0,0,'2007-10-20 09:39:06',79,'\0',0,0,9726,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,31,0,0),(716,'Fenrax',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'First, and most noticable, is the extravagantly rugged-looking leather robe he wears.  It hangs upon him as though form fitting and loose, yet surprisingly thick and durable at the same time.  Woven in dyed black and red fabrics, it symetrically etches the look of wings; or claws; upon his back.  Two very pronounced pauldrons of sheer plate armor widen his chest to twice its normal width.  His hands and legs are sheathed in leather as well, leaving only his muscular neck and face exposed.',0,0,501,4,'17X1Xc1ymZ',0,0,'2007-10-20 09:45:46',79,'\0',0,0,28199,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142512,522125592,0,0),(717,'Anubeion',60885,30,16,16,16,30,30,16,16,16,30,'A bleached skeleton held together with chalky ligaments stands before you wearing a white, knee-length shift that billows slightly in an otherworldly breeze. The skull is missing its top third, severed smoothly, its cavity nearly filled with a pulsing azure substance. A translucent veil covers the face, making its emptiness more bearable.\r\n\r\n',0,0,288,2,'IpIASkVqiR',0,0,'2007-10-20 10:25:55',79,'\0',0,0,1145309,77401,16516,34,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,252199264,31,32786,0),(718,'Zezima',9547,16,13,13,22,13,24,13,13,24,13,'A large black hood covers his face so that all that is visible is a red colored left eye. Blood drips out from beneath the hood. Black robes cover his entire body and a large hand-and-a-half sword hangs at his waist. The smell of death and despair is about him wherever he goes. Instead of walking, he seems to glide. His voice is raspy and raw sounding, as if it is a chore for him to speak. Black silk gloves cover his hands.\r\n\r\n',0,0,490,1,'NbbW0VW9SQ',0,0,'2007-10-20 10:28:15',79,'\0',0,0,1563215,32214,24095,367,25,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,522133279,0,0),(719,'Rowan',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A plain man of average height. Seems like the kind of person you might not notice unless you were looking for him. He has a scruffy three-day growth of beard and a looks as though he could use a little more sleep.',0,0,502,1,'Opg6ckTLFy',0,0,'2007-10-20 10:55:02',79,'\0',0,0,108,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470025457,520101656,0,0),(720,'Maegannon',6407,23,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,'She is tall, taller then most men by nearly a head. She is built thickly, muscular and curvy. She appears to be neither old, nor very young. A semi-healed gash is visible on her forehead. Her hair is waist length, and colored like fresh snow. Her ears are elongated into delicate points. On either side of her face, from foehead to chin, she has three claw-like tattoos, in purpleish ink.  She\'s dressed in a simple, ankle length cloth dress. It clings to her form, just so, to be both tasteful and appealing.',0,0,102,3,'cbVD8kRdU1',0,0,'2007-10-20 11:00:00',79,'\0',0,0,164950,0,65,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,787697,520356888,0,0),(721,'Moziat',59999,29,16,29,16,16,29,16,29,16,16,'A young dreamer in his late teens, there seams to be some scar tissue over his ears. A strong look of concentration seams to constantly be on his face.',0,0,82,4,'r3MGdHJezq',0,0,'2007-10-20 11:04:53',79,'\0',0,0,462872,52606,1711,9,7,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,34619632,354358556,0,0),(722,'Loricas',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A thin man, he stands tall and has a somewhat regal bearing. He wears a pearl white high collared coat with black fanciful embroidery that hangs down to his knees. Particularly noticeable among the embroidery is the image of some sort of wide winged bird embroidered across the chest of the jacket. His loose fitting white pants bear similar patterns.  His eyes seem distant, as though he is staring past whatever they fall upon.',0,0,357,1,'vDOk0wKlo6',0,0,'2007-10-20 11:27:12',79,'\0',0,0,1578,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(723,'Talisman',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Dark Brown worn boots, and leather bracers apon his arms.  A dusty green outfit, with a dozen pockets stitched into them, and a black teashirl apon his chest.',0,0,441,1,'fgYey5m8J4',0,0,'2007-10-20 11:34:40',79,'\0',0,0,1408,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470024432,520559640,0,0),(724,'Kasid',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Night colored hair hides most of his face and blood colored wrist, shin, and shoulder guards are faintly visiable under the slick abyss cloak (that covers most of his body) he wears.  Small chalk colored scars cover his hands, which are highly noticeable on his dark skin.  Another chalk scar is faintly seen under the night hair that befalls his face.  On closer inspection, the scars have a faintly noticable aura about them.',0,0,256,1,'7X9YqjXeup',0,0,'2007-10-20 11:36:05',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268697840,522125599,0,0),(725,'Yoshi',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,408,3,'gAo4Uc5gcL',0,0,'2007-10-20 11:38:41',84,'\0',0,0,22511,0,0,0,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,17760540,0,0),(726,'Windy',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,425,4,'iOfuDibfPo',0,0,'2007-10-20 11:39:07',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,68157680,471601944,0,0),(727,'Niral Shambari',67820,30,16,30,16,16,30,16,30,16,16,'Her black silk sari drapes lightly from her left shoulder and continues to cover her supple body.  Her delicate slippers are tailored in the same simple cloth. A golden ring encircles her left ring finger.  Standing meekly at 5 \'6 she looks out on the world with pale green eyes which are accented by her brown hair. Her age is hard to determine though she appears to be in the prime of her youth. The lines around her face make her seem much wiser and older. ',0,0,245,4,'UnzUQHyWjP',0,0,'2007-10-20 11:49:21',79,'\0',0,0,3166905,92835,35115,84,45,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,437290225,504504087,0,0),(728,'Scryer',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'This man stands with firey red eyes looking upon you, his skin dark as though ash had covered it. Two daggers sit on his belt in plain sight.  He speaks in a low near whisper with obvious distaste for most',0,0,503,1,'Y4UNFS7C6M',0,0,'2007-10-20 11:53:45',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17039600,33693471,0,0),(729,'Hind',9070,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,'A tall, young man dressed in priests garments. A white wingclip adorns his crest. A single scar runs down each of his palms. ',0,0,311,1,'NmLnfPHqJK',0,0,'2007-10-20 12:04:58',79,'\0',0,0,232037,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67371504,522130712,98304,0),(730,'Lock',159999,34,19,19,34,19,34,19,19,34,19,'This dreamer has long golden hair cascading half way down his back, adorning his otherwise stern features. His strong athletic build is partly covered by thick wooden armor. The unshielded parts show his bare skin, clearly exposed to a lot of sun, and covered by multiple tribal tattoos. Wrinkles have started to show at the sides of his eyes, and his chin has a hint of beard that reveals his age as older than his physique would seem',0,0,238,1,'BKOeotcUt0',0,0,'2007-10-20 12:34:20',79,'\0',0,0,807126,166714,18010,20,31,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67404016,470031388,256,0),(731,'Nail',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'wearing a formal looking suit, Nail is a tall dreamer whose features makes him appear to be around thirty years of age. Dark brows bring out his already noticeable blue eyes, that hints of an underlying mischief. A three inch claw hangs around his neck in a steel chain',0,0,238,4,'cLwLJmOzdG',0,0,'2007-10-20 12:35:04',79,'\0',0,0,17474,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,303038960,301994520,98304,0),(732,'Nicholai',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,165,2,'szVKrn4yO4',0,0,'2007-10-20 12:49:04',79,'\0',0,0,11305,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268959984,67896351,0,0),(733,'Saati Jhanis',7224,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,23,'This girl teetering on the edge of womanhood moves with both grace and purpose. Black hair reaches to her low-back in a single braid and eyes nearly as dark as her hair reveal an intense gaze. Her lithe and well-defined limbs are covered by a single piece of light cotton folded and wound around her waist and torso, the end of it passing over her shoulder and tucked into a fold at her waistline. The faint smell of fish follows her everywhere.',0,0,128,2,'zIFFPNEleS',0,0,'2007-10-20 13:09:26',79,'\0',0,0,33437,3500,0,15,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520619249,84347675,0,0),(734,'Mariana',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'you see a young girl, her clothes, nothing fancy. A neclace placed around her neck and a ring around her finger. Her eyes seem to be always looking down.',0,0,223,4,'lAcFhj5eO0',0,0,'2007-10-20 13:30:55',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470811889,353834775,0,0),(735,'Adnesul',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Curious yet confused',0,0,94,4,'Ub6bvHOxEO',0,0,'2007-10-20 13:32:32',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,34604273,18290456,0,0),(736,'Muckfinger',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,408,3,'DOYrk4xnt9',0,0,'2007-10-20 13:57:15',79,'\0',0,0,3958,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,7964,0,0),(737,'Cantinus',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,480,3,'QTk77sUHfF',0,0,'2007-10-20 14:44:54',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(738,'Abigael',9999,24,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'A multitude of ivory, pearl and  clay bangles clatter softly upon this aging womans wrists, and is perhaps her first noticeable feature after the dark cloth scarf cinched around her neck. The scarf spills over her shoulders, and down her back amongst her sun-bleached and grey-streaked hair. A pair of amethyst eyes peer out from softly wrinked crows-feet that contrast with her neatly toned body, covered by a loose cotton blouse and skirt that flares neatly around her sandaled feet.',0,0,143,3,'RV62NEWv8o',0,0,'2007-10-20 15:09:25',79,'\0',0,0,82528,4826,105,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,386663665,352326936,0,0),(739,'Ashton',468492,38,22,22,38,22,38,22,22,38,22,'Ashton is petite in stature, with a tanned and tone figure. Eyes of a dark violet hue with flecks of pink are fringed by eyelashes of impressive length. A tiara sits atop a head full of raven-black hair. A sparkling pink wedding ring encircles her left ring finger, and her hands are tipped with perfectly pink manicured fingernails. She wears a cloak with the hood falling down her back; the hem of it has flickering, animated flames. ',0,0,2665,1,'dQOtuJrJQd',72058693549555712,4,'2007-10-20 15:12:20',79,'\0',0,0,3474603,245370,97870,128,46,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520406385,335549464,33156,0),(740,'Lowden',99,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A tall thin man he stands with his clothes neatly pressed, his hair parted and combed to an exact science.  His tone is that of an educated man, although his tone quickly changes to that of one obviously finding himself superior when those he believes below him are near.  Packs of bandages and a rapier hang from his belt.',0,0,503,3,'T3qo1UV2zz',0,0,'2007-10-20 15:18:02',83,'\0',0,0,13181,100,1,5,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,34341104,522133249,0,0),(741,'Jaden',572515,39,39,22,22,22,39,39,22,22,22,'She has wafting thin golden hair; it hangs down into her face with ragged ends that seem to have been cut with an exceptionally dull razor. An inquisitive yet harrowing grin usually smothers her facial features. Her faintly glowing eyes are piercing yet pale, and the color of pearl. She has markings upon her face not quite known in definition, though she is seemingly fastidious about her appearance. A mask of intrigue greets those who gaze upon this dreamer. She has a soft voice, yet echo\'s as she speaks.',0,0,268,3,'1sfXnGOvDX',0,0,'2007-10-20 15:24:54',79,'\0',0,0,3583816,1292895,729889,345,92,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,67945713,320806684,2,0),(742,'Hephaistos Ares',9999,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,24,'A young man with golden hair and bright blue eyes that appear to be searching for something.  He is dressed in Blue with gray accessories.',0,0,504,2,'CresbZxwjX',0,0,'2007-10-20 16:28:51',79,'\0',0,0,155933,1009,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67633392,1056536,0,0),(743,'Kazeth',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,371,4,'FibWnlgqET',0,0,'2007-10-20 17:17:58',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,252645144,3,0),(744,'Swiftwoe',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Careful. Watchful. ',0,0,94,4,'ptznEp58nh',0,0,'2007-10-20 18:27:07',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,34604273,35594008,0,0),(745,'Solister',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'Standing moderately tall, something about him isn\'t quite right. The way your eyes are focused, or maybe the way he is, he often appears blurry.  Not so around his face and upper body. Clear blue eyes and a child-like smile greet you. A ring is on a short colar around his neck.  He tugs down at his jacket, straightening it and waves his hand back at forth as he notices your glance.',0,0,505,2,'vOlefWUSbz',0,0,'2007-10-20 18:38:06',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,521150232,0,0),(746,'Scan',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'An un-remarkable man with a shadowy figure and expressive eyes and facial gestures.',0,0,373,3,'WFoowbCbxi',0,0,'2007-10-20 19:21:15',79,'\0',0,0,934,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,302776560,522133276,0,0),(747,'Siager',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,' ',0,0,422,2,'f1g2XJHsHO',0,0,'2007-10-20 19:28:28',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,2035736,0,0),(748,'Cyrias',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'He is about average height, with a rather slender build. His dark brown hair can\'t be more than half an inch long. He is clothed in finely spun white robes, with embroidery of an elaborate helix pattern done in black and silver thread running down the outside length of each arm. Spanning his chest is an embalem of a bird with it\'s wings spread, again done in black. Black matte leather boots and gloves with silver detailing complete the outfit.',0,0,507,4,'FaWn1j99ib',0,0,'2007-10-20 19:38:58',79,'\0',0,0,1050,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470810864,520101655,0,0),(749,'Andrew',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,415,1,'lmN1XhAJyc',0,0,'2007-10-20 19:42:45',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,33816816,268439576,0,0),(750,'Morigoto',159999,34,19,19,34,19,34,19,19,34,19,'Raised to the title of Chancellor with the Scryers, he now wanders the cities paths in search of whatever truth may be there to light the paths.',0,0,509,1,'wdEOBQXhzD',0,0,'2007-10-20 20:11:47',79,'\0',0,0,3858,0,0,46,106,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67404320,521215768,32770,0),(751,'Avani',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'The woman appears unique in every way... The garments wrapped around her tall slender frame are tattered yet clean. Her form is almost inhuman; a strange beauty resonates from her awkward yet lovely existance, as if she does not quite belong in this world. Leaves stick out from her long wavy hair, as if she has tread through many thick forests. An untamed fire burns in her bright green eyes, and her features are curiously unreadable.',0,0,465,3,'rqOcwz4cPV',0,0,'2007-10-20 21:25:41',79,'\0',0,0,2604,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,787697,465944,0,0),(752,'Trenas',159999,34,34,19,19,19,34,34,19,19,19,'A medium height male with heavily tanned skin.  Ebony hair hangs loose against a deep abyss cloak and robes.  The top of a blood red tunic peaks over the low cut neck of his robes.  Piercing green eyes blaze from above his angular features and hawk like nose.  A simple wooden walking staff is usually in his hands, decorated with carvings and a couple of odd feathers.  His face beginning to show lines of age.\r\n',0,0,140,3,'v2KZTKoAug',0,0,'2007-10-20 21:38:25',79,'\0',0,0,3866134,251875,100248,160,57,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520913136,18816792,0,0),(753,'Talaya',2665,3,10,21,10,10,21,10,21,10,10,'A slender woman with long and well kept, though simply styled golden hair.  Mischevious blue eyes gaze out from beneath her bangs and a ready smiles comes often to her slightly angular features.  Her steps are swift and certain, showing a confidence and grace.\r\nA light, loose crimson cotton skirt and bright red blouse swirl around her form, and a tight fitting pair of supple leather boots hug her legs.  The hilt of a small dagger glints from the deepths of her blouse sleeve.\r\n',0,0,140,4,'16q8LQ28tD',0,0,'2007-10-20 21:40:47',79,'\0',0,0,40677,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,68158705,16908568,0,0),(754,'Zartok',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,145,2,'UOCGuq5I5p',0,0,'2007-10-20 21:54:10',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67633392,520363799,0,0),(755,'Korjyrin',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'You notice a wrist band that says \"Korjy\" on it.  Upon further gaze you notice sleek long black feathers.  You come to your senses, it is a black crow that you see before you.  But not just any crow.  An extremely groomed crow with shiny claws, feathers and beak.  You think to your self, wow how does he keep them so clean?',0,0,226,1,'wPmkEewk4y',0,0,'2007-10-20 22:33:05',79,'\0',0,0,4916,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,270475032,0,0),(756,'Zaishya',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Your eyes carry from her shiny black beak to her neck.  A shimmering pendant catches your attention.  What looks to be a house symbol is engraved.  Her chest, convienently covered with black feathers, enhances the pendant\'s presence.  Individually groomed feathers fill her entire wing span.  From the corner of your eye you catch a little white feather which bashfully hides at the end of her tail. ',0,0,226,1,'qjDHmhOtp0',0,0,'2007-10-20 22:34:01',79,'\0',0,0,17842,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(757,'Lekia',0,4,18,10,10,10