20,'Sweeping, jet-black hair wisps across his face, flowing long and without restraint down his back.  Dark crimson-red eyes center the features of his hardened, youthful face.  \r\n\r\nA dark, collared shirt binds tightly across his chest, worn open for a length before coming together mid-torso.  Tucked fashionably into the belt of his pants, both his sleeves and pantleggings are rolled upward.  His feet are wound tightly inside a cloth bandage wrap, matching those around his forearms.',0,0,501,2,'EDtbFgyZpb',0,0,'2007-10-21 13:56:42',79,'\0',0,0,115888,0,0,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618480,16785176,98304,0),(780,'Ambivalence',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'A perplexed looking young man.  He looks at everything and everyone as though he has a question, or something that needs clarification.  He is quite tall compared to most, but overly thin and drawn out.  \r\n\r\nHe seems to possess a zest for life and laughter.  He takes few things seriously.  The few things he takes seriously become very apparent, very quickly.\r\n',0,0,474,4,'FXSrfucRkt',0,0,'2007-10-21 14:16:15',79,'\0',0,0,2292,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,68157936,67569439,32768,0),(781,'Eros',659999,39,23,23,23,39,39,23,23,23,39,'The dreamer\'s skin is full azure, covered in brightly glowing runes.  His pure abyss eyes lack a pupil and seem to stare right through you.  A mirror polished breastplate covers his torso with flames embossed on the surface.  A blood red ruby the size of your fist hangs by a platnium chain around his neck.  The ruby seems to pulsate light even in the darkness.  He carries with him a staff encrusted with a reflective unknown metal, that has been adorned with blood colored gems.',0,0,511,2,'AABRKeLLFh',844424930131968,0,'2007-10-21 14:45:44',79,'\0',0,0,50620,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,252232544,15,32768,0),(782,'Necromancer',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'The Brother of WIshbringer. Lost soul in search of something... but what?',0,0,516,2,'azYysoqEUw',0,0,'2007-10-21 14:57:10',79