You see his nails overgrown while his twisted hands curl over his wrists, but he tends to keep them hidden in his cloak..  His hair is the most interesting thing you see about the man; a very distinguised royal purple colored mohawk graces the top of his head.  Drapped with a black cloak, the last thing you seem to notice is glowing symbol of some sort around the center of the cloak, it appears to be in the shape of a blade.',0,0,154,4,'aEuQdAHtAe',0,0,'2007-10-23 21:01:40',79,'\0',0,0,1739,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,303038704,18816769,0,0),(845,'Jorem',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'The dreamer you see is a tannish figure, a thick layer of tan fur overlines his skin, appearing to be more than human, yet a gentle embrace envelopes your mind, calming your soul.  His hair is a scruffy dirty blonde and his eyes are sky blue.  Dressed in noting but beige cloth, covering his waist down to his knees.  His chest glows bright that seems to be in the shape of a dove.',0,0,154,3,'mhLZAJyTxk',0,0,'2007-10-23 21:02:29',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67895536,404166421,0,0),(846,'Thiknorg',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'He carries a shovel hoisted over his shoulder and he seems to waiver in and out, his eyes as chalky white as his skin, yet he must see something as he is always watching.. just watching.',0,0,363,2,'MqVrECgwsf',0,0,'2007-10-23 21:12:08',79,'\0',0,0,2915,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(847,'Ash',1659999,44,26,26,44,26,44,26,26,44,26,'Two scars across this dreamers right cheek stand in contrast to his otherwise smooth unblemished skin. An unusual translucent blade is fixed across his back, occasionally radiating different colors. Azure eyes illuminate this dreamers youthful complexion which is otherwise concealed in darkness by an abyss hood. ',0,0,455,1,'UfohNKPeef',281474976710656,0,'2007-10-23 22:35:58',79,'\0',0,0,8220541,2531110,1058624,344,668,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,328032,16843039,33280,0),(848,'Vain',0,16,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Almost as if carved in darkest ebony, he stands slightly over six feet tall. Heavily built and broad of shoulder, he posesses a measured, purposeful gait. His eyes, such as they are, reflect the stars and betray nothing. His smile is almost perpetual and betrays just as much. At the present time he wears the plainest slightly shifting robes of blood red hue.',0,0,393,1,'PSpsvaCqPA',0,0,'2007-10-23 23:07:13',79,'\0',0,0,6940,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,16843039,0,0),(849,'Drum Aiken',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Short, around 5\'9 with  a striking mop of curly bright red hair. Pale complexion spotted with freckles. Smile never far from his face  and with an easy laugh he seems very appraochable. Wears a golden trousers, boots and jacket, a scheme  which is broken only by the abyssal waistcoat sporting an impossible number of pockets. A golden eye motif can be glimpsed at times over his right breast. Golden bracers with the same motif cover his wrists.',0,0,393,4,'xaIsIgcCkd',0,0,'2007-10-23 23:08:10',79,'\0',0,0,6111,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,34603248,520356864,0,0),(850,'Fivetide',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,393,2,'acSAbcJEAr',0,0,'2007-10-23 23:09:18',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(851,'Yellow Teeth',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A spotted, mangy hyena stands before you. It nervously gances left and right and abruptly gnaws on a festering wound on its flank.   ',0,0,999999,2,'kAuUBHyGwH',0,0,'2007-10-24 02:36:18',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,471604996,0,0),(852,'Bobby',0,5,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A young boy of about 5, walks with a limp.  Unable to speak, he clumsily fidgets with a raw jewel.  He knows he isn\'t very smart and thus he doesn\'t like to be around others.  He wanders the city \"searching\" for something.',0,0,504,3,'WpniTkBFtM',0,0,'2007-10-24 03:51:27',79,'\0',0,0,22342,0,0,3,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,269222128,354353683,0,0),(853,'Kurindra',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'This kind-eyed woman with mirthful wrinkles around her eyes and mouth moves with both grace and purpose. Black hair with the first white strands reaches to her low-back in a single braid and eyes nearly as dark as her hair reveal an intense gaze. Her hardened and sun scorched limbs are covered by a single piece of light cotton folded and wound around her waist and torso, the end of it passing over her shoulder and tucked into a fold at her waistline. The odor of salt and fish follows her everywhere.',0,0,128,3,'CTwHMNucmz',0,0,'2007-10-24 03:58:57',79,'\0',0,0,3225,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,394526960,2039576,16,0),(854,'Ezra',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'This dreamer is dressed it clothes that seem to be made of some kind of tanned animal hide. She is a bit shorter than average, and has a jumpy, almost paranoid jilt. Her piercing violet eyes dart around the room, flicking from face to face, even when she speaks. Her rich red hair is tangled and ill-kept, and bounces awkwardly when her head moves. On her left arm is a small tatoo, almost unnoticeable: a small bruise-colored circle surrounded by outward pointing chevrons.',0,0,345,4,'JWTSdvuMKU',0,0,'2007-10-24 07:40:10',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17827057,404233240,0,0),(855,'Julianos Traven',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,538,1,'PQjrGryvFd',0,0,'2007-10-24 10:36:17',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,402726679,0,0),(856,'Terelius Ignium',659999,39,23,23,39,23,39,23,23,39,23,'Sparkling emerald eyes near almond in shape, watch her surroundings with a smoldering stare. Her fiery hair trails down in an intricate braid that falls below her waist. Her skin sheens lightly in it\'s deep tan. A red silk kerchief wraps around her neck above a rich midnight blue gown hugging her curves suggestively, slipping to the ground and whisks softly as she walks. Knives and a varitable armory of chakrams adorn her outfit.',0,0,478,1,'pJdRcFITIP',1099511627776,0,'2007-10-24 10:40:41',79,'\0',0,0,3869520,1372136,998095,333,378,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,33867089,252579352,98704,0),(857,'Sevlen',42859,28,28,15,15,15,28,28,15,15,15,'A handsome younger man; hair beginning to turn grey. His hands are calloused and well-worn from years of use. His posture is impeccable.  His green eyes rest under bushy eyebrows, scanning the room with measured interest.  A simple baldric is draped across his back, a hilt with a faded engraving exposed.  His pace is often erratic, purpose sporatically evident in his step. He appears dusty.  His youthful appearance doesn\'t seem to match the timeless quality in his eyes, as if he is older than he appears.',0,0,540,3,'sBIynTJrbZ',0,0,'2007-10-24 15:03:32',79,'\0',0,0,361839,55926,14008,85,142,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,504119536,117448472,0,0),(858,'Cuero',659999,39,23,23,23,39,39,23,23,23,39,'A man of average height and clearly athletic build stands before you, clad in armor stained black. His gear is skillfully made of leather, light and sturdy. His eyes are fierce and scan the room constantly. His skin is sun-touched to a dark bronze and appears tough; the product of many trials. His words come in crisp, measured bursts. A long knife rests at his hip, appearing worn and rusty, as if seldom used. His left cheek is discolored in a contrasting white line; scarred.',0,0,1804,2,'aLvQQrGwhM',16777216,0,'2007-10-24 15:05:25',84,'\0',0,0,3279016,1163980,613330,283,286,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520667440,270475032,32768,0),(859,'Rakan',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'\r\n',0,0,541,3,'uDibhSOZJy',0,0,'2007-10-24 19:21:28',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,522133272,0,0),(860,'Talesia',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,542,2,'qBmEgrGecl',0,0,'2007-10-24 19:39:53',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,34079985,2031637,2,0),(861,'Lainiium',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,372,1,'QbNUBvWKxI',0,0,'2007-10-24 19:46:10',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(862,'Kayrah',0,10,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A slender 