. Her eyes are golden in color, and her pouted lips are stained to a peach tint. Her athletic form is tightly bound in a short leather dress. She wears an abyssal platinum band around her ring finger, with a crimson diamond in the center. Two silvery chains hang from her neck - one holds a small locket in the shape of two crossed wings, the other pendant dips down into the front of her dress, concealed. ',0,0,555,1,'WGGbiVAAqe',281474976710656,0,'2007-10-27 01:16:52',79,'\0',0,0,3703100,304273,145874,178,103,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,117753185,1052694,65792,0),(883,'Penelope Luea',0,19,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Standing at a petite 5\' and 85lbs, her silky black hair flows past her shoulders and down the length of her back. Laceless leather boots reach up to her creamy white thighs, while a leather mini-skirt stops a few inches short of meeting them. An open-bust corset completes her outfit. ',0,0,556,4,'sjaTCARAIn',0,0,'2007-10-27 07:43:21',79,'\0',0,0,109161,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143537,522133272,0,0),(884,'Purk Brautch',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Blond Guy, with red clothes, good-looking.',0,0,215,1,'uByRDmhfGj',0,0,'2007-10-27 10:58:59',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,352583920,520225047,0,0),(885,'Durelt',9679,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,'A well-built dreamer with a crisp military stance.',0,0,288,1,'KLAEvcKVtZ',0,0,'2007-10-27 15:23:24',79,'\0',0,0,176569,10000,321,7,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,252182768,31,0,0),(886,'Bay',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Little more then an old man whos curious and thoughtfull of his suroundings,looks to have held great power once and may still if needed',0,0,558,3,'BWrsellsoh',0,0,'2007-10-27 17:23:14',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,35586584,0,0),(887,'Saphillia',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,559,4,'OyMtMgepXn',0,0,'2007-10-27 19:46:35',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143537,521346844,0,0),(888,'Neriak',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,560,1,'ZybtbaxFAY'