35480,0,0),(947,'Xa\'anna',36575,27,15,15,27,15,27,15,15,27,15,'A petite frame stands in perfect form; her skin remains pale and untouched by the elements or ravages of  time itself. Her eyes betraying a look of passion and determination behind their violet hue. Each strand of hair seems to be position perfectly with precision following her every movement in unison falling past her waist and nearly to her ankles or can be seen tied in a large bun during any engagement. Her silk tolga wraps around each section of her body revealing the twists and turns of her body.',0,0,1804,4,'uRSXQHtCBH',0,0,'2007-11-01 17:48:28',79,'\0',0,0,35363,4265286,4228711,477,8,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,394544625,471604245,98320,0),(948,'Lydia',6039,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,23,'You see a woman who is small but graceful in her movements, she has vividly blue eyes peeking out from beneath the matching waves of hair that fall softly around her, framing and almost hiding her face from view. A simple black dress paired with slighlty oversized combat boots seem to suggest fashion is the least of her concerns, a silk pouch is worn around her waist which has a handful of scrolls poking out, the bulk and odd shape hints at other items hidden deep inside..',0,0,423,2,'BIlZnyKKUk',0,0,'2007-11-01 19:01:04',79,'\0',0,0,67635,3600,61,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,268961009,270475029,0,0),(949,'Taco Ridley',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,598,3,'VoQhUhgiaw',0,0,'2007-11-01 19:20:54',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17564913,17237781,0,0),(950,'Ivy',9320,24,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'This womans hair lays in a braid down her back. The color of her hair is a firey red, with silver streaks in it. She has a tattoo of a dragon going up her arm. She is dressed in a tightly woren and slightly ripped dress. She is a nice and cheerful person.',0,0,452,3,'pzmAneoKNX',0,0,'2007-11-01 19:51:55',79,'\0',0,0,369023,10029,709,17,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,34342385,1179672,98304,0),(951,'Logen',13,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Before you stands a man with naturally tan skin, at about 7feet tall, 289pounds of pure muscle with icy blue eyes that when looked into you can see he has seen to many wars and death, he is dressed in merchant class clothes, and has a peaceful aura about him',0,0,597,1,'PmZAJphLLI',0,0,'2007-11-01 19:57:00',79,'\0',0,0,39179,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,18816796,0,0),(952,'Xiarasya',4159999,49,49,29,29,29,49,49,29,29,29,'She is dressed in soft earth garments, that have chalk as its trim, and thoughtful grey eyes shrouded by sandy hair. The body underneath is lith and well toned, tanned and only the faint creases around her eyes show her to be in her early forties. Hanging at her side is a well used bag with a journal stuffed into it as well as quills and scrolls.',0,0,1804,3,'ir5zBh5aqf',0,4,'2007-11-01 21:55:15',79,'\0',0,0,517336,194179,235882,15,13,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,361564145,1381660,98320,0),(953,'Tobat',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'Slightly taller than most, he carries himself in a hunched over manner. Long dark hair flows freely behind him with royal blue gems tied, seemingly at random, throughout.',0,0,595,2,'GHmkjjHYaB',0,0,'2007-11-01 23:33:00',79,'\0',0,0,38406,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,522129432,0,0),(954,'Mariam',9999,24,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'This lady puts you in mind of a playful puppy.  She has round blue eyes, hidden behind some simple specticals, that are like two pools of water behind windows. Her fine, wavy, golden hair is long and is worn in a bizarre style. She is tall and has an athletic build. Her skin is deeply-tanned. She has a crooked nose and hollow cheeks. Her wardrobe is tight and practical, with a mostly gray color scheme.',0,0,97,3,'bnUoxbBvpg',0,0,'2007-11-02 15:05:15',79,'\0',0,0,40442,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,67896561,520093720,0,0),(955,'Den\'yara',9800,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,'Wearing a short sleeved tunic that falls to just above her knees and leggings that go to her ankles. Her feet are bare and often dirty. A shawl is haphazardly thrown over her shoulders, and at times you can catch a glimpse of scars on her neck and arms. \r\nAmber curls are pulled up in a bun and held in place by writing utensils, yet half of it is falling down. Several books and maps are peeking out of a sack she has slinged across her shoulder. ',0,0,111,4,'gExTBTvzEQ',0,0,'2007-11-02 15:22:06',79,'\0',0,0,338759,10094,294,9,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,386925809,269685528,0,0),(956,'Dominic',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,594,3,'UEdyhRHaGC',0,0,'2007-11-02 15:53:01',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470548720,522125848,0,0),(957,'Norea',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A slim woman with long blackish hair is standing in front of you. Her skin is pale, shimmering white like ivory. Deep in her dark eyes glowes a misterious fire. She is dressed with a black robe made of velvet embroidered with strange looking golden signs. She wears a golden necklace which is formed like a snake holding its tail in its mouth.',0,0,600,2,'hnfSNRClWW',0,0,'2007-11-03 10:07:27',79,'\0',0,0,24269,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520619249,69141504,0,0),(958,'Nikcolby',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,601,1,'qnOXebKJgT',0,0,'2007-11-03 11:31:36',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,0,0,0),(959,'Scorpius',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'This dreamer is young and thin, with a deep brown compection and his hair hangind down in phat locks. Large fiery goggles cover his eyes, which combined with his dreads makes it difficult to detail his face. He wears a flexible crimson form-fitting coverall and boots which incorporate synthetic padding and hi-tech buckles.',0,0,436,1,'fsNOcNhhVq',0,0,'2007-11-03 15:36:45',79,'\0',0,0,760,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,67240476,0,0),(960,'Strangehands',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'I am tall and have fair skin and blonde hair, short on the sides and bushy on top. My blue tunic shifts in hue from early morning to twilight 