 are held high in his confidence. His complexion is pale, and boarders on unhealthy. His jade colored eyes burn with arrogance and a hint of insanity. His dark hair is cropped short, to his scalp. He wears a rather non discript black and red t-shirt, and simple black slacks. His shoes are built for speed, but otherwise are also very plain. The only jewlery he wears is a simple silver ring on his left hand.',0,0,617,4,'LOMxvZFXZS',0,0,'2007-11-05 06:43:29',79,'\0',0,0,2845,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142512,18809109,0,0),(983,'Luci',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'She is average, being roughly 5\' 8\" tall, and around 180 pounds. Her auburn hair is cut in thick layers, giving the sholder length locks a fuller look. Her lips are full, and painted blood red, Her cerulean colored eyes are lined in black, and shadowed with white powder. She wears a simple, strappless cotten dress, the hem reaching her knee caps. She wears leather ankle boots upon her feet.  A silver ring can be seen on her left hand.',0,0,102,2,'UMPKfqgEcr',0,0,'2007-11-05 06:44:43',79,'\0',0,0,11192,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470287601,522133272,0,0),(984,'Dafious',9999,24,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'A somewhat tall dreamer standing around 6\"0\" stands before you. tightly nit dark black vest , hugs his shoulders and chest. smooth  but distinctive designs cover it. making the man seem very  cold in nature.\r\nchains hang from around his neck, as if they are binding him to something.his clothes seem somewhat old and torn,  a foul stench lingers from this dreamers very avatar.',0,0,136,3,'PFqigAUpZI',0,0,'2007-11-05 09:19:38',79,'\0',0,0,62423,29,0,10,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,794392,0,0),(985,'Winjjuc',58848,29,16,16,29,16,29,16,16,29,16,'A very tainted looking dreamer, who\'s posture stands firm. His eyes let off a dim glow.encased in a large cloak the large scar running up his left arm is barely visible. when this dreamer walks into the room his presence is barely known. across his shoulder lays a strap tied to a very large sack.his boots scrap the ground beneath with each step leaving a faint echo whenever he passes by\r\n',0,0,136,1,'TfvDrwIcTM',0,0,'2007-11-05 09:25:25',79,'\0',0,0,472529,114283,54744,100,54,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,278768,16785176,0,0),(986,'Rao',9999,25,14,25,14,14,25,14,25,14,14,'A dark hooded cloak  covers this dreamers broad complection. his hair drapes past his shoulders,drifting out of the thick hood. one hand holds a small dagger the other a long wooden staff, with jagged splinters hanging from the bottom. On his chest lies a beautiful white wing symbolizing he\'s a member of the Trinity Knight\'s.',0,0,136,4,'xwISRghXNu',0,0,'2007-11-05 09:28:47',79,'\0',0,0,158668,10316,405,12,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521142768,522131480,32768,0),(987,'Morcal',9800,24,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'A young man with thick brown hair, a hawk-like brow, piercing gray eyes and powerful muscles. He is tall, roughly six feet, with broad shoulders. His clothing is earth toned, dark brown and green.  He has a simple leather baldric at his hip with a well used blade hilt showing. Around his neck is a simple silver chain.  He walks deliberately and with sure feet despite his size. His sharp gaze belies intelligence.',0,0,619,3,'ocUgdShYYp',0,0,'2007-11-05 12:36:00',79,'\0',0,0,72815,7674,276,3,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470548720,119277336,0,0),(988,'Samsungfoe',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,620,1,'ajTwyLQPsA',0,0,'2007-11-05 14:55:33',79,'\0',0,0,1363,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,251920624,118489351,0,0),(989,'Daneil Beoulve',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,621,2,'HHwiHHmoKl',0,0,'2007-11-05 15:27:23',79,'\0',0,0,4491,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,386400496,67116056,0,0),(990,'Bashir',86874239,0,98,76,75,98,99,98,99,98,98,'A horrible, ghastly creature.  A single, thin scar marks it\'s mutated form.',0,0,1804,4,'fcVZQDP9DY',50331648,4,'2007-11-05 22:22:21',75,'\0',0,0,325992,7741120,48775093,58,518,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,6,412244982,117901068,98320,0),(9