ou gaze upon this man. His face seems chiseled out of granite, stern and serious. His snowy white hair is pulled back into a ponytail and held with a silver embroidered clasp. His garments consist of a splint mail suit, reinforced with steel studs and leather padded shoulders. Knee-high leather boots, polished clean, adorn his feet. A sleek ebony wooden bow with mystical runes and etchings hangs over his back complimented by a quiver full of hand-made arrows.',0,0,650,1,'EsKksQkVQY',0,0,'2007-11-08 22:42:01',84,'\0',0,0,16537,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,521934104,0,0),(1021,'Jabrelle',6871,23,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,'Standing about 5\' 8\" with jet black hair that falls freely down her back.  She is lith with slight curves and long legs.  She wears a short, low cut dress and tall heeled boot which flatter her figure.  Her bright blue eyes seem to sparkle and pierce though even the dimmist darkness.  She seems rather perky yet remains a bit of an enigma.\r\n',0,0,367,3,'dQZKcVCsdx',0,0,'2007-11-09 00:01:47',79,'\0',0,0,65344,7000,129,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520881393,2039576,0,0),(1022,'Chris',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,652,3,'MNJfAJsfnp',0,0,'2007-11-09 02:56:17',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(1023,'Naphtali',985913,41,22,22,22,39,41,24,24,24,41,'You see before a man in his mid 20\'s. He wears a silk doublet appointed with saphires and a finely tooled wide black leather belt. He glows with the light blue glimmer of insight. The very air about him seems to hiss and pop with electricity. His every step sings with the rattle of hidden chain mail. You note the shadow he casts is in the shape of a beast. In his halo you see a spark of black chaos. On his chest is a bloody hand print.',0,0,653,2,'IuPSyPgBGG',281474976710656,0,'2007-11-09 04:33:36',79,'\0',0,0,5857582,688207,310435,449,167,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520683872,201330198,32772,0),(1024,'Baraquessa',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A petite woman standing just over five feet tall with a slim, almost boyish build.  Her skin is pale and without blemish, with her scarlet hair pulled back in a tight bun.  Wire rimmed glasses perch upon her nose in front of her brilliant violet eyes.  Her dress is plain and unflattering on her thin frame, but functional and comfortable looking.',0,0,655,2,'GwvefeiDVE',0,0,'2007-11-09 12:39:21',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17302769,520159256,0,0),(1025,'Beccah Vulpini',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,655,3,'oEDOYwpbuD',0,0,'2007-11-09 12:50:28',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,787697,0,0,0),(1026,'Argetlamh',0,15,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A tall dreamer stands before you, dressed simply in pants and a tunic. Showing slightly, on his arms is some sort of chain armor under his clothes. A blade hangs at his side, with a single gold jewel adorning it\'s hilt. Upon his right hand is what appears to be an old scar, crossings it\'s back. ',0,0,624,1,'SdmDdiBeZy',0,0,'2007-11-09 17:42:32',79,'\0',0,0,14950,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268697840,2031644,0,0),(1027,'Zallazar',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,232,3,'XsUKPXLiKi',0,0,'2007-11-09 19:28:12',79,'\0',0,0,562,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,202113264,471605013,0,0),(1028,'Arch',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A worn, obviously weary man.  Although he has a young face, his eyes show his age . . . he is dressed in a simple brown jacket, made of a rough fabric, and a black bow tie.  His pants are a plain black.\r\n\r\n',0,0,130,1,'sXXUrgjEBP',0,0,'2007-11-09 22:12:21',79,'\0',0,0,3811,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,521936664,0,0),(1029,'Xiaomi',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,660,4,'EtmLQVGTbM',0,0,'2007-11-10 00:48:35',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,0,0,0),(1030,'Valken',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A man of average height with chin length silver hair parted in the center. His skin is slightly pale and seems to blend in nicely in well lit areas. He wears well shaded blue s