-21 21:15:58',79,'\0',0,0,8910759,1791437,1223610,620,68,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,302859873,18816792,98316,0),(1114,'Anyasha',2972508,47,44,26,26,26,47,47,28,28,28,'This woman is tall with what appear to be once-striking features, now set with sunken cheeks and palid complexion. Locks of barely auburn hair, accented by streaks of grey, fall lightly over her shoulders. Around her neck hangs an unadorned chain with a circle of paler skin on her chest. Her demure dress is unassuming but reveals her frail form underneath. A number of rusted chakram and a dull, runed blade rest on her hip.  Her glossy black eyes wearily pace the room, gazing as though from a distance...\r\n',0,0,717,3,'WSxxOiKHji',0,0,'2007-11-21 22:55:51',79,'\0',0,0,4388399,2022705,390445,111,239,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17646833,522133269,16,0),(1115,'Dura Cuire',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'you look upon an intreging dreamer as he seems wise yet naive with his older age and seemingly different culture that he hides within..............',0,0,684,3,'CcGNfcVROE',0,0,'2007-11-22 18:34:03',79,'\0',0,0,6588,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,353108208,404165148,0,0),(1116,'Lydian',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Not small, but a bit smaller than average. A bit thin too. His hair, bit long, and his whole appearence makes him look a bit dirty\r\n',0,0,720,1,'ZMfbeMmgnl',0,0,'2007-11-22 18:40:36',79,'\0',0,0,12638,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,522133272,0,0),(1117,'River',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,684,1,'rQicgQyiLx',0,0,'2007-11-22 19:04:01',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,0,0,0),(1118,'Eyerie',0,0,10,10,8,11,20,10,10,10,20,'A crazy girl with crazy hair, her ugly hair looks like a honeycomb or beehive on her head. She can\'t talk! But she is mean! She is against all Emancipators! ',0,0,721,2,'LbQqFlknFM',0,0,'2007-11-22 19:19:43',79,'\0',0,0,25780,0,0,11,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17302769,65560,0,0),(1119,'Intarcu Bal\'mor',1544025,44,44,26,26,26,44,44,26,26,26,'Trim and lithe, this Dreamer is of small stature.  A brilliant amethyst rune pulsates steadily in the center of her forehead, and a long scar tugs horribly down the left side of her face, distracting from her otherwise brilliant blue eyes.  A pair of large, blistering scars warps her palms. Her half plate armor has been finely polished and securely strapped to her body. Her long black hair, ending at her waist,  is bound in tightly kempt pony tail. A pair of twin blades hang at either side of her waist.',0,0,1804,3,'WeJdPmhJ7o',12884901888,4,'2007-11-22 22:00:08',75,'\0',0,0,370516,2107853,563828,71,69,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,529335537,2031637,16,0),(1120,'Crabbe',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,725,4,'zJFZXilnJs',0,0,'2007-11-22 23:29:43',79,'\0',0,0,2355,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,34603248,352387349,1,0),(1121,'Nephesh',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,711,3,'IiGvasXNXc',0,0,'2007-11-23 12:02:35',79,'\0',0,0,14295,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,353108208,18809112,0,0),(1122,'Bloodfly',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,726,1,'ZRWTGWlgxS',0,0,'2007-11-23 17:13:19',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,0,0,0),(1123,'Keron',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,729,1,'uHPyNYymNn',0,0,'2007-11-23 17:50:32',79,'\0',0,0,16881,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470024432,520164119,0,0),(1124,'Yamoto',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,728,3,'ykpATFQPKr',0,0,'2007-11-23 17:55:28',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(1125,'Kraisy',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,451,2,'yQqazFkxgr',0,0,'2007-11-23 22:19:02',79,'\0',0,0,1282,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,525553,0,0,0),(1126,'Soraya',1378971,43,25,25,43,25,43,25,25,43,25,'Strands of raven locks of hair flows loosely cascading down to her lower back, her eyes of emerald hue are filled with an instensity. Her avatar is silent aside, from the occasional clanking of the heavy armor she wears. It appears pristine in its construction almost as though new. On opposite sides of her waist, a set of tarnished chakrams are visible. Her avatar is covered with an assortment of scars and  punture marks.',0,0,1804,1,'QvHhSCUbDK',0,0,'2007-11-23 22:52:43',79,'\0',0,0,338900,2062674,683703,71,158,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,528812017,520093719,98320,0),(1127,'A\'kmar Ralnora',100000,32,32,18,18,18,32,32,18,18,18,'Dirty and grimy long golden hair is mussed, and stickily framing his face.  With his bright sapphire eyes hard, and cold, the many scars of battle only accentuate them, from his deep tanned skin.  He stands tall, poised as though ready for something, with dingy beaten and battered white plate armor.  Gouges, punctures, and scorch marks mar his armor.  White grieves, and shoulder plates, are all but destroyed, as he grips the hilt of his golden blade, in anticipation of something?\r\n',0,0,1804,3,'fYGwcukzBN',0,4,'2007-11-23 22:53:23',75,'\0',0,0,118482,835197,821426,413,42,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,76302578,24,16,0),(1128,'Candy Apples',0,20,10,19,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,730,4,'eYKXHJqzaQ',0,0,'2007-11-24 01:58:34',79,'\0',0,0,474,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,303039729,793621,0,0),(1129,'Lunella',1921,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A wisp of a body skulks within the shadows around her. Midnight eyes reveal little emotion, her skin is as ivory as a heavenly moon. A ghastly scar marks her left palm. Once noble, perhaps - she appears to have fallen. ',0,0,732,1,'aFhqQcAIfq',0,0,'2007-11-24 08:00:44',79,'\0',0,0,67170,2000,79,7,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470025457,352387349,0,0),(1130,'Zula',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,721,4,'IurrTBXCvl',0,0,'2007-11-24 12:35:15',79,'\0',0,0,16330,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143537,2031640,0,0),(1131,'The Dreamweaver',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Standing 6\'7 Tall, spiked hair of white Chalk color, as they fall from his head, touching the top of his ears. His Arms of Muscles that seem to be of Gigantic strength, An Glyphic Tattoo on his right arm. Covered in a weavy chalk robe, with lining of Night, And a s