re deep night blue, and seem to have a mirrored effect to them, his hair is also dark blue, cut close, and very well groomed. ',0,0,443,2,'ecfLXrxanj',0,0,'2007-11-25 01:52:57',79,'\0',0,0,29045,5000,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(1138,'Hayai',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,738,2,'fNTXHFMusX',0,0,'2007-11-25 02:21:57',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(1139,'Eldicar Marwol',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,739,2,'IDReeGnwnI',0,0,'2007-11-25 08:38:29',79,'\0',0,0,383,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(1140,'Alliana Traegus',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'This thin, but curvy woman stands tall, wearing a night-blue, leather, body suit, that fits tightly around her body. Her boots and gloves are attached to the outfit, along with red spikes that are scattered all around the suit. She has two long blades sheathed to make an X on her back and one small blade on her ankel. Her skin appears to be made from stone itself and her night-blue hair is chopped into a shaggy, shoulder length cut. Her sapphire eyes are usualy set in an intense gaze.',0,0,745,4,'aeMAvpRjya',0,0,'2007-11-25 19:39:44',79,'\0',0,0,52596,0,0,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,269485297,17826079,0,0),(1141,'Tiyuk Quellmalz',50352,29,16,29,16,16,29,16,29,16,16,'A dreamer whose shape is a bit ambiguous, sometimes changing in subtle ways for no apparent reason. The color variations of his body and plain clothing are very subtle as well, sticking with a theme of simple earthen tones. ',0,0,748,4,'wNFOnrvKmW',0,0,'2007-11-26 18:46:43',79,'\0',0,0,1467113,63595,13243,45,7,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1065200,521934613,0,0),(1142,'Drahcir Lhar',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A man with thick brown hair, a hawk-like brow and piercing gray eyes stands before you. His gaze sweeps across the room, missing  nothing. He is bigger than most men, perhaps six feet with broad shoulders. He wears a golden cloak and black tunic, with silver wristbands carved with runic symbols. At his