enth',91924475,69,69,43,43,43,69,69,43,43,43,'This man appears to be middle aged.  His long, flowing black hair parts down the middle, while three braids of white hair fall from the left, right and back side of his head.  His eyes resemble not that of a human, but of a feline, with blue slit-like pupils.  He is dressed in a simple, milky colored cloak that appears to be kept clean and in good condition.  A strap rests on his left shoulder, crossing over his chest and back, to keep a mid-sized satchel resting on his hip.',0,0,727,3,'WjQnPepdqo',0,4,'2007-12-20 21:24:57',79,'\0',0,0,1348230,114315342,21851114,31,68,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,529416432,117440536,60,0),(1364,'Damiana Ragel',4159999,48,29,49,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,'This woman\'s rose red hair which flows straight down just past her shoulders hides the shortness of her stature.  Standing shorter than most, her soft earthen skin and gentle features of a woman seemingly soft in nature.  Her ears as well as right nostril have small gold studs within them.  A light green fern colored tunic covers her from chest to midriff.  A long black skirt with the same light green streaks up and down it, covers her from hips to knees.',0,0,1804,4,'AqjRejaueT',0,0,'2007-12-20 21:53:56',84,'\0',0,0,6500,4159999,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,43074801,520554268,20,0),(1365,'Juxtaposer',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,344,1,'rtEPYnQTMy',0,0,'2007-12-21 08:49:10',79,'\0',0,0,2520,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(1366,'Aislinn',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,754,2,'NfqnKxewOf',0,0,'2007-12-21 08:56:39',84,'\0',0,0,1899,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,525553,0,0,0),(1367,'Guant',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'As his name implies, this person is thin - almost emaciated.  He has a severe scar covering the right side of his face, and his features are slightly dissimilar.',0,0,266,2,'DoykdzxSaa',0,0,'2007-12-21 13:32:30',79,'\0',0,0,324,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,303043096,0,0),(1368,'Pericles',0,20,20,9,10,1