,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17826032,253697815,0,0),(1512,'Voe',2047,18,10,10,10,20,21,10,10,10,21,'Two long, brown, piggy tails dangle and sway on each side of Voe\'s face. Several freckles are scattered across each of her cheeks. She has on a white shirt, topped with a cyan vest. She wears a dark blue medium length skirt and leather thigh-high boots. Her eyes are very unique; if you look at them when her mood changes, you may notice that her eye color does also. She is sometimes seen using a nail file or holding some old books.',0,0,555,2,'kOSbPjXbZG',0,0,'2008-01-31 18:54:09',79,'\0',0,0,155291,1500,0,8,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470287601,235670551,0,0),(1513,'Cabot',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'A younger man, in his late twenties with fire in his veins and a restless spirit.  His skin is a rich caramel, blemished with barely visible freckles on his cheeks and arms.  His clothing suggests a vagabond\'s nature, blue dyed but threadbare.  His hair hangs to just below the ear in thin, tightly bound dreadlocks with small shells binding them at random.',0,0,995,4,'bwDtqdkJgS',0,0,'2008-01-31 21:12:18',79,'\0',0,0,984,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142512,470818588,0,0),(1514,'Magus',43544,28,15,15,17,15,28,15,15,28,15,'Magus is clad in Abyss gear with a garment of Night. He wears a pair of finely crafted suede leather boots, a gift from a great SoulMaster. Magus is a warrior of the blade, pure, as Gatekeepers are. He has a quiet yet passionate ressonance. You notice his features are soft, but defined with age. His stance is strong, but he rests a hand on his blade...always at the ready. ',0,0,976,1,'NfLfIDzMwS',0,0,'2008-01-31 23:17:11',79,'\0',0,0,403154,61041,17497,86,27,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268714224,69144599,0,0),(1515,'Pisaun',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,996,4,'vItdQwFvdM',0,0,'2008-02-01 16:34:31',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1049841,0,0,0),(1516,'Varwyn',656979,39,19,19,19,34,39,23,23,23,39,'She wears a corset crafted of haribone and the deep cerulean silk, cinched tight about the waist and accented by leather straps. A sable colored lace half-jacket with ruffles about the neckline and wrists accompanies it. The pants are form fitting leather of the darkest pitch Her belt is but a scarf of the same silk used upon the corset, tied at the side with added material left to dangle down the thigh. Stilletto heeled boots caress her lower legs ending at the knee. A fine rapier, secured at the ready.',0,0,997,2,'GubyKVQxCt',3298534883328,0,'2008-02-01 20:08:32',79,'\0',0,0,2589139,150692,13807,37,9,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,269010769,286265344,33798,0),(1517,'Aleanic',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Before you stands a dreamer who looks about middle age but is shorter then you expect. She wears a simple cut dress.',0,0,998,3,'jWyUzIHgUH',0,0,'2008-02-02 00:13:36',79,'\0',0,0,6550,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520881393,1842967,0,0),(1518,'Vessek',0,20,10,18,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'a deminutive girl who always seems lost. Deep purple hair dyed to match her clothing hiding her lack of eyes.',0,0,1000,4,'EphWgAMSeX',0,0,'2008-02-02 04:48:30',79,'\0',0,0,10121,0,0,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,303039729,521281304,0,0),(1519,'Dath Nightstride',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,999,1,'kzXaIeaXbj',0,0,'2008-02-02 04:51:24',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,0,0,0),(1520,'Dathric',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Dathric stands roughly seven units tall and is built tough, but not too tough. With enough compassion in his eyes to be approachable. ',0,0,999,1,'lvpZfZlkMq',0,0,'2008-02-02 05:04:09',79,'\0',0,0,11409,0,0,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470024432,387914776,0,0),(1521,'Kyoreth',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1001,3,'hHYvzVlwZG',0,0,'2008-02-02 11:34:11',79,'\0',0,0,9996,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,69144320,3,0),(1522,'Alazan',9800,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,'His figure is broad and long-limbed, a feral grace seen in his relaxed shoulders and movement. His hair is pulled into a pair of tightly woven braids down either side of his head, and his skin is covered with a thin coat of soot, particularly dark around his eyes and neck in contrast with the bright blue eyes. A pair of thick sideburns grow down his broad jawline and cragged chin.  His attire has a vagabond\'s look to it, old brown cloth worn out from wear, dusted at its seams. His body is truly massive.',0,0,356,4,'vDTlGvoWjB',0,0,'2008-02-02 17:26:01',79,'\0',0,0,119860,13646,3846,43,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142512,404232222,0,0),(1523,'Crone Hellebron',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1002,3,'jTxHpUefxb',0,0,'2008-02-03 03:00:11',79,'\0',0,0,685,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,67109912,0,0),(1524,'Reaguin Heiros',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1003,3,'CulsoJtdyD',0,0,'2008-02-03 03:29:56',79,'\0',0,0,20009,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,386662640,202383127,2,0),(1525,'Noelia',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1004,2,'SPkScCzexS',0,0,'2008-02-04 20:04:01',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,525553,0,0,0),(1526,'Ajani Indra',9320,15,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,'As you look into his eyes, and as you listen to this dreamer, you can see he is a man of strong will with a voice of deep proportions, he stands about 5\'8 and wears a metal plated wrist band on his right wrist that reads, \" Contra.\" He wears a hood over his head. His sword, inside of it\'s sheath, hangs on his side, On the side of the sheath lies the word, \" Corigon. \"\r\nAs he stands, he stands with an excellent posture. His armor has a color of jade and his hair breaches from around his neck inside his hood',0,0,919,1,'CTmLVRTKjD',0,0,'2008-02-05 03:27:36',79,'\0',0,0,67081,12677,3357,44,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17039600,453445400,2,0),(1527,'Gugblatt',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,151,2,'MhEFyVXiqI',0,0,'2008-02-06 00:11:55',79,'\0',0,0,444,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,117703187,0,0),(1528,'Caileadair',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'',0,0,907,2,'ppKIzeDJqL',0,0,'2008-02-06 13:43:44',79,'\0',0,0,11507,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(1529,'Noel',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1005,2,'zOqrZRGygL',0,0,'2008-02-06 15:27:08',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(1530,'Dave',3747,21,11,11,11,21,21,11,11,11,21,'You see a man in a yellow jacket and trousers with light skin and green hair. ',0,0,1006,2,'obeXWABKUJ',0,0,'2008-02-06 20:47:49',79,'\0',0,0,64911,4000,253,12,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,117965296,67108885,32768,0),(1531,'Wawu',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1005,4,'yKXvJoQoHc',0,0,'2008-02-07 09:33:58',79,'\0',0,0,515,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,319815920,2035736,0,0),(1532,'Mokoro',9999,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,'A slender, taut, well-groomed man stands before you, often in the corners of the room. His light blue eyes and a common half-smile, almost as if it were a nervous habit, are framed by short blonde hair. His fitted dark blue pants and shirt are accented by a polished armor of a natural hue. On the left side of his neck is a simple, circular tattoo. A pack is slung over his shoulder, which he seems to constantly be rummaging through.',0,0,717,1,'NSSYUPcsJw',0,0,'2008-02-07 14:30:26',79,'\0',0,0,12074,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67371248,252648472,0,0),(1533,'Jareel Xerthali',4131841,49,29,49,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,'The man before you stands a bit shorter than average height. He is a grizzly looking man with a mildly hunched back. His brown hair is long and untidy with strands of gray present. He wears thin pieces of a dark, rough hide which are laced together with leather strings as his clothing. His dark leather belt holds both his pants up and his shirt in place, leaving only his belly to hang over. Metal bracers are worn on his wrists which appear to have runic inscriptions engraved upon it. He walks barefoot.',0,0,1804,4,'kmoERWchDf',0,0,'2008-02-08 17:18:01',75,'\0',0,0,104399,4214625,82784,2,7,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,412172528,2039580,22,0),(1534,'Kallankissa',1999,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Bereft of her natural eyes, her eyelids are sewn shut with crisscrossing stitches. Dark thick locks of abyss hair has been braided into one long strand that rests easily upon her small shoulders, making its way down to the small of her back. Adorned with a earth toned tunic that wraps around her avatar, hugging each of her curves with accuracy. Her hands are bare, she wears a gold bracelet upon her wrists in the shape of serpents.',0,0,1804,3,'wSOdPVCdM2',0,4,'2008-02-08 19:01:28',84,'',0,0,871430,10081059,12052646,14,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,529417457,521475356,4119,0),(1535,'Vorenus Mors',7500,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,23,'Carrying himself with an air of nobility and entitlement, he moves with a preditory grace.  His face is youthful, with sharp handsome features; though his cold, blue eyes betray a hint sadness.  His skin is fair.  His long, blonde hair hangs freely down to the middle of his back.\r\n\r\nHe wears a simple, black hooded cloak over his otherwise bare, well-muscled torso.  On each arm, he wears black, leather bracers etched with ancient runes.  He wears simple black pants and black leather knee-high boots.',0,0,1009,2,'DvtVvFWpuT',0,0,'2008-02-08 20:57:30',79,'\0',0,0,46877,7500,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67633392,354361109,0,0),(1536,'Quowiann',859289,40,40,23,23,23,40,40,23,23,23,'Curly beige hair hangs just above his eyebrows, his pale skin seams to glow in the darkness. He seams to wear a uniform that has been aged as the colors are dull.\r\n',0,0,1804,3,'TDlmvZqTNL',0,0,'2008-02-09 12:36:20',88,'\0',0,0,72607,2094487,1235198,102,77,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,395116784,520167189,16,0),(1537,'Marcus Daeous',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'The man appears to be in his late-twenties, he is of average height and slightly above average build, his hair is golden blond and falls just before his shoulders, it appears to be slightly unkempt, his eyes are a bright royal blue and seem to be quite mindful, he speaks in a clear, calm, and steady tone. He adorns what appears to be leather clothing dyed dark red, as well as abyss chainmail and platemail armor, a plain yet seemingly well kept and very sharp blade is strapped securely to his back. ',0,0,397,3,'xoHDRcxXne',0,0,'2008-02-10 02:31:28',79,'\0',0,0,411,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67895536,520167191,0,0),(1538,'Mia Kilia',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1010,2,'AEHhLKHVIO',0,0,'2008-02-10 13:09:40',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,525553,0,0,0),(1539,'Miki Kilia',0,17,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'',0,0,607,2,'EscPFKsobx',0,0,'2008-02-10 13:17:43',79,'\0',0,0,2770,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17302769,353374236,0,0),(1540,'Rah\'zak',9999,24,7,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'(none)',0,0,1011,3,'rDpeSJtPOn',0,0,'2008-02-10 16:58:49',79,'\0',0,0,8544,9999,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,521142808,3,0),(1541,'Machiavelli',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,1014,1,'wsoYBZYkor',0,0,'2008-02-11 13:51:36',84,'\0',0,0,574,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,35069720,2,0),(1542,'Darren',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'A plain, small man. Seems young but not entirely. He appears withdrawn and strangely detached. Narrow, black eyes makes him seem like focused about something. He wears simple brown clothes and might have a tattoo on his left arm. His shirt covers most of the symbol there. ',0,0,1012,4,'MWqBnUZyVA',0,0,'2008-02-11 15:34:33',79,'\0',0,0,7941,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142512,387718167,0,0),(1543,'Veltis al\'Nyn',641874,28,19,15,15,34,39,23,23,23,39,'Deep abyss short hair contrasts against youthful icy eyes that stare out over a thick crimson-red silk scarf which wraps around a face of smooth light skin. The remainder of the scarf spills down the back of this dreamers pristine sleeveless vest, nearly to his knees. Both of his toned upper arms are wrapped in dozens of dark colored ribbons, as are his wrists.  A silk sash cinches his waist, carrying several pouches and looped through flowing silk pants that flare out over sandaled feet.',