,NULL,0,262384,0,0,0),(1575,'Arganous',5434,22,11,11,11,22,22,11,11,11,22,'The man standing before you is not much to look at.  Frail and old, his black hair is thin and sparse, his hands wrinkled with time.  He wears a simple blue robe with a long black cloak, the hood carelessly tossed off to the side.  A more careful look reveals a deep seated wisdom in his eyes.',0,0,1039,2,'utiUMlrjvT',0,0,'2008-03-01 20:37:11',79,'\0',0,0,20950,5831,397,12,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,521150231,3,0),(1576,'Jacen Molvarr',4582,22,11,11,22,11,22,11,11,22,11,'A plain looking man in his mid twenties, he is a bit tall yet rather thin. He gives off a gritty appearence when you meet him. On his side hangs a short sword. His eye\'s are normally light blue until he grows very angry, then his eye\'s seem to change to a dangerous looking yellow. He constantly seems to be scanning the room with gaze, as if worried he is being hunted.',0,0,988,1,'coprUoYNrC',0,0,'2008-03-02 15:08:48',79,'\0',0,0,101772,5016,434,12,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,386007576,0,0),(1577,'Ikaftl',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A tall man with skin the color of fire. He stands imposingly and when not talking to others mumbles under his breath some thing about the blade.',0,0,1042,2,'IWMemkUwUi',0,0,'2008-03-03 05:19:17',79,'\0',0,0,13094,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,522133250,0,0),(1578,'Bar\'nayen',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'An unusually deep voice meets your ears when this avatar speaks. Blood skin and clothes are visible, and this dreamer seems always somewhere else in his mind. His eyes are always distant, and are firery in color. He is often seen talking to himself, and looks to be in his mid fifties. A hunched back makes him look shorter than he really is, just over six feet.\r\n\r\n\r\n',0,0,1026,2,'CpnGWwBiNa',0,0,'2008-03-03 17:00:14',79,'\0',0,0,20546,0,0,3,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,33620225,0,0),(1579,'Bado\'ir',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'An oddity of a man, his skin seems to 