10,20,'A fully dark suited man can describe much; stealth and lust, well mannered and virtuous.  Whatever the cause may be, he may be there, may not.  He is a shadow among all civilians.  However what you determine him as is what you will live by, because this might only be the one time you see him.  A great betrayer has left this man and cunning and justice has overcome him.\r\n\r\n',0,0,1138,2,'YZKdfKGllz',0,0,'2008-03-30 20:30:55',84,'\0',0,0,3999,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268959984,269488152,0,0),(1666,'Falthorn',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'When a man dressed dark and sly is seen, he is pondered upon, unknowing of what might happen, you shelter yourself.  The stone-like skin is a tale which tells of a man who encountered a dragon who turned the tables quite quickly.  The golden, angelic, hair is a once in a lifetime award, for cunning and bravery of the just.\r\nThis man is seen as bad, but is judicious, be wary, for you might encounter one such as Falthorn one day.\r\n',0,0,1138,2,'IbDCBhRsYq',0,0,'2008-03-30 22:00:05',79,'\0',0,0,2424,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67633392,269488159,0,0),(1667,'Crimson Wolf',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1100,2,'lSuzGbWPmm',0,0,'2008-03-31 00:13:54',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(1668,'Blue Jacket',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1139,2,'ElrOZAKKJF',0,0,'2008-03-31 10:22:17',79,'\0',0,0,2814,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,403177712,353375509,0,0),(1669,'Daoryn',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1141,4,'ERvYTrKNSH',0,0,'2008-03-31 18:47:58',79,'\0',0,0,475,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,118489328,7191,0,0),(1670,'Tee Jay',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,1095,1,'eAEJwEblqz',0,0,'2008-03-31 19:46:29',79,'\0',0,0,228,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,67372273,320806684,1,0),(1671,'Piq',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,999999,2,'SJJtotegJQ',0,0,'2008-03-31 20:10:09',79,'\0',0,0,343,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,34341380,0,0),(1672,'Wesson',0,20,10,10,1