tly tattered and dirty. Scattered about her are a number of faint scars, though they do little to detract from her looks. She often speaks in a soft, hushed voice.',0,0,988,4,'diCwwfRhuM',0,0,'2008-12-27 18:50:18',79,'\0',0,0,58702,1503,15,3,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143537,252645136,0,0),(1773,'Elfe Mechant',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'She\'s a little bit naughty and a whole lot nice...this vivacious woman is dressed in a red halter dress with an empire waist, and the soft fabric falls to her thighs. Striped stockings make their way from her thighs down to her red high heels. She has dark hair that falls to the middle of her back, and wears a red pointy hat trimmed in white fur. \r\nShe may look as if she\'s hiding something when she peers at you with wide, jade eyes and a playful smile. ',0,0,1804,4,'xZWewSChhc',0,0,'2008-12-27 19:22:21',84,'\0',0,0,6292,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143537,65560,0,0),(1774,'Tithian',9899,0,22,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'Tall and lanky, Tithian\'s eyes are shrouded in impenetrable shadows cast by a low-crowned hat with a wide brim which rests on his head. His jawline, gaunt and framed with a mask of coarse stubble, is curtained by silver locks of tangled hair. A dusty and ragged cloak drapes from his shoulders and swaddles his thin frame. Worn boots, scuffed and muddy from endless miles, adorn his feet. A large satchel hangs under a crook of one arm, secured by thick leather strap. A filigreed yatagan is secured to one hip.',0,0,2486,3,'nsrTvNJfrp',0,0,'2008-12-27 19:33:53',79,'\0',0,0,80868,7000,20,6,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,495714544,488578072,16,0),(1775,'Bingo',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A young, spry fellow dressed in a yellow and black jumpsuit.',0,0,108,3,'xMYPwhxtDH',0,0,'2008-12-27 21:01:45',85,'\0',0,0,11664,0,0,3,0,1832,NULL,'2009-01-19 02:10:17',NULL,0,520880368,520363800,0,0),(1776,'Raziel',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1384,3,'QrHKwrclKW',0,0,'2008-12-29 10:09:03',79,'\0',0,0,3151,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,201588994,0,0),(1777,'Rush',159999,34,18,34,19,18,34,19,34,19,19,'Rush is a shadow of the Dreamer he once was.  Darkened skin wraps his frame with splotches of pale white marks that scatter across his skin in no obvious pattern; other than a small triple sided symbol on the inside of his right wrist.  Liquid silvery hair falls lazily infront of predatory flashing eyes.  His feet seem distorted and hazey to the common eye, melding in and out of the floor below him.',0,0,1804,4,'BZpXuKUCUW',0,0,'2008-12-29 17:59:59',84,'',0,0,317700,9437115,5277116,95,26,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1081584,16850716,12307,0),(1778,'Xazbit',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A man of short stature and nervousness.  He has dawned a full suit of dull metallic armor that show no signs of battle.  Native to his home land, his tunic and trousers are of a deep blue and sit tight with his avatar.  A torn and loose fitting cape hangs lazily behind him.  His blistering red eyes seem restless.',0,0,1231,2,'ZDzkdiQWQR',0,0,'2008-12-30 21:21:15',84,'\0',0,0,16728,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,252183793,252641308,0,0),(1779,'Eksos',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1387,3,'iderSdatsb',0,0,'2008-12-31 15:18:46',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(1780,'Riku',8634,24,12,12,24,12,24,12,12,24,12,'Before you is a man of roughly average height, with brown hair and blue eyes. He is rather lean, and seems to be in his early 20\'s. He is mostly concealed beneath a long black cloak, with only his face visible, and carries a short, thin, and rather exotic sword at his side. Beneath the small exposures in the cloak, you can see a padded leather vest as well. There is also a small bulge under his left and right arms.',0,0,1389,1,'EhjmOWIlcl',0,0,'2008-12-31 17:18:41',79,'\0',0,0,943022,17428,8794,98,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,522133279,0,0),(1781,'Lifaen',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1392,3,'OKFVCAVQzp',0,0,'2009-01-01 12:32:57',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(1782,'Nyjiman',3996079,0,29,29,29,49,49,29,29,29,49,'Nyjiman stands remarkably short when compared to most, barely clearing five feet in height. His garb is sparse, mostly consisting of feathers and patches of fur that are braided into his unwashed and messy hair and adorn his shoulders, midsection, and ankles. Streaks of brightly colored paint mask his bearded face, and a large copper hoop runs through his septum. A long wooden staff, adorned with feathers and the skulls of small animals, rests in the crook of one arm. ',0,0,1804,2,'6mVJdN0IBV',0,4,'2009-01-01 19:48:42',75,'',0,0,210457,4531171,535092,16,19,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,529088752,404226328,4115,0),(1783,'Sarom Keeper',5620,22,11,11,22,11,22,11,11,22,11,'(none)',0,0,1076,1,'DwYOQPcUDg',0,0,'2009-01-02 10:25:51',79,'\0',0,0,22671,6600,980,23,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67371248,66069,0,0),(1784,'Laviticas',117227,0,18,18,18,32,32,18,18,18,32,'Standing before you is a dreamer around 5\'11 with glowing, cyan, almond shaped eyes. He only wears a pair of black leather battle worn trousers. His upper body is thin yet very muscular. On his back are two short blades that are curved. Upon his left hip he carries Leviathan, his left hand bares the wedding ring Heaven placed there.',0,0,1162,2,'xxEcHphZNY',0,0,'2009-01-02 18:49:19',75,'\0',0,0,232098610,289135,183408,329,100,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520650992,18816792,0,0),(1785,'D\'podom Rodeir',59399,29,16,16,16,29,29,16,16,16,29,'A dreamer clean kempt, with palest skin, lightly yellow tinted hair, resting just at his temples.  It is bound in a long tail behind his back and frames the ruby eyes of an albino. A cuffed plum shirt trimmed with an abyss vest over his chest; abyss pants, covering his legs.',0,0,1398,2,'uDJchlqovs',1099511627776,0,'2009-01-05 13:33:03',79,'\0',0,0,1357343,71943,19519,83,15,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,352862544,304026112,32768,0),(1786,'Kambreah',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,316,4,'ncxcugikFi',0,0,'2009-01-05 22:54:12',79,