own corset short dress. Aside from her eyes the only things that keep her from being plain are the deep faded gashes covering her right arm and the alluring sound of her voice, as well as the scent of honeysuckle that follows in her wake.',0,0,1402,2,'peDGTcUJyE',0,0,'2009-01-07 22:19:43',84,'\0',0,0,10930,131,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,352847089,471603223,0,0),(1792,'Agoden',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A young man with short brown hair and blue eyes, he looks rather confused, several bruises cover his body.',0,0,1404,1,'GRfeuryuED',0,0,'2009-01-08 03:10:52',79,'\0',0,0,509,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470024432,1842199,0,0),(1793,'Soradin',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1405,3,'VRmAGLcTyb',0,0,'2009-01-08 12:44:24',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(1794,'Naree',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1407,3,'oUXFowXVCA',0,0,'2009-01-08 14:48:51',79,'\0',0,0,394,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520881393,470946327,0,0),(1795,'Queznay',9159999,54,33,54,33,33,54,33,54,33,33,'A short and crooked man, barely four feet tall. His complexion is fairly tanned. A tightly fitting jacket of golden tones hugs his avatar.  Hair is neatly kept, and combed to one side which collides with the spectacle frames that shape his circular head. He waddles in short strides, and as he does a cluster of unknown trinkets and talisman can be seen on the inside of his jacket, they jingle as he waddles by...',0,0,1396,4,'eZrLahyhaf',0,4,'2009-01-08 15:32:49',84,'',0,0,2702394,162371911,52205899,349,145,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,277971184,68288775,4116,0),(1796,'Ceina',19009371,59,59,36,36,36,59,59,36,36,36,'Ceina appears as a young girl, roughly eleven or twelve years of age, with well groomed blonde hair and sparkling blue eyes that betray an age far beyond her physical years. Her skin is pale and cold to the touch, and her stance is far too proper and stiff to be suitable for a girl of her age. An elegant gown with a high collar trails behind her as she walks. A pale amethyst shimmer, barely perceptible to the eye, flashes along the surface of her eyes. ',0,0,1804,3,'Omeq3WSSJg',0,4,'2009-01-08 19:02:36',83,'',0,0,891589,24880227,15962456,147,13,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,361612529,65560,4112,0),(1797,'Takao Kazuhiko',3411,21,21,11,11,11,21,21,11,11,11,'A long dark brown robe adorns the frame of this individual, wrapping around his avatar with precision. A set of bronze bracers dangles from his wrist and ankles as he walks barefoot. A large mark has been branded onto his forehead of unknown origins barely concealed by strands of raven locks. His skin seems unscathed by the ravages of the elements or time. An amulet the shape of a circle rests at the center of his chest. It appears to be relic with signs of wear and age. His voice echoes deeply as he speak',0,0,217,3,'raJohiOnRV',0,0,'2009-01-08 20:14:36',79,'\0',0,0,43120,3500,89,3,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470548720,471603221,16,0),(1798,'Bariun',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'',0,0,1411,2,'JaqkAuIjvL',0,0,'2009-01-09 15:34:11',79,'\0',0,0,7551,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67633392,2038808,0,0),(1799,'Tyrian Silvera',59999,29,13,13,13,25,29,16,16,16,29,'Pale ice-like blue eyes peer out at you from long night hair. A thin scar mars the handsome face, searing across the right eyebrow, and moving across the eye. His figure is thin, and looks fairly flexible. A dagger hangs from his belt, a small sapphire embedded in the hilt. Next to it on the belt lies a grander sword, thin and long, with a matching sapphire. When he speaks, his voice is soft, and often very quiet.',0,0,1412,2,'GHTvEkTuMQ',72057594037927936,0,'2009-01-09 16:28:31',79,'\0',0,0,208545,9999,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268976496,269491989,65536,0),(1800,'Gawain Theblind',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1413,3,'thUKHhTjQV',0,0,'2009-01-10 13:26:16',79,'\0',0,0,1718,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(1801,'Vaedron Solphsis',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1414,2,'WLbaJtNQGC',0,0,'2009-01-10 16:11:43