ently around Hotaii.  A foul stench of sulfur and bile follows closely in its wake.',0,0,1804,1,'oVGLEa8he9',0,4,'2009-01-18 13:48:22',75,'\0',0,0,195816,2004253,1419267,302,1230,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,142922997,404032271,400,0),(1827,'Myristyl',89794,30,29,16,16,16,31,31,17,17,17,'A petite woman with silk black hair that softly curls down her back. The green velvet gown shows wear yet still molds her curves. Around her neck lies a chain with a simple emerald stone.',0,0,1440,3,'LHCAvPqXRD',256,0,'2009-01-18 14:09:01',79,'\0',0,0,2360294,66598,6599,35,4,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520914193,84412439,33794,0),(1828,'Synx',3000,21,11,11,11,21,21,11,11,11,21,'Immediately you notice the rich dark shade of this dreamer\'s complexion as it collides with his attire of the darkest night.\r\nAccompanied with cloud resembling hair. His eyes glisten, as if replaced by fine gems, his jaw often tense but with a bleek expression. He moves about his surroundings in an awkward fashion, almost as if his joints do not move.  Beasts of an unknown origin seem to have left their mark on this dreamer, for his entire hands are marred viciously.',0,0,1231,2,'KfmwAjaxAA',0,0,'2009-01-18 15:25:23',84,'\0',0,0,14636,3000,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,525553,269488159,0,0),(1829,'Grissle',500,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1436,3,'OUhRDhRkhD',0,0,'2009-01-18 15:54:23',79,'\0',0,0,4766,500,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520618224,520101632,0,0),(1830,'Marsden Braxton',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1441,3,'JFCfEaQPbd',0,0,'2009-01-18 17:14:27',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(1831,'Oath',923633,41,24,24,24,41,41,24,24,24,41,'Oath is without many spoils,  asking not of others and is generally reserved, yet friendly despite his coarse voice.',0,0,727,2,'LncQkADEcC',0,1,'2009-01-18 17:25:50',84,'\0',0,0,232551,39947,3696,21,24,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,8998133,420288003,16,0),(1832,'Volnox',1643399,44,26,44,26,26,44,26,44,26,26,'An average sized man with a slightly larger build than most. Dyed long hair, and full beard cover most of Volnox\'s facial features. A tight fitting halo of various wildlife leaves are tightly bound to his head. Tattered tan and abyss hides wrap carefully around his avatar, covering all but from the knees down. Rugged sandals made of a mysterious wood adheres to the bottom of his feet with a single strap.  On his hip rests what appears to be several miniature skulls of an unknown species bundled together.',0,0,1804,4,'obqDureJNU',0,4,'2009-01-18 19:59:35',75,'\0',0,0,294180,9962378,8318979,193,155,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,9503504,387391260,98320,0),(1833,'Hotaiii',3971237,49,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,49,29,'A bizarre amalgamation of arachnid and humanoid, this creature is wrapped in loose, tattered wraps.',0,0,2405,1,'wDguxU9xp5',0,4,'2009-01-18 20:19:03',79,'\0',0,0,59928,1178388,590042,134,606,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,243619061,404429599,400,0),(1834,'Nantuck',111500,32,18,18,32,18,32,18,18,32,18,'This man appears heavily clothed in furs in animal skins, hanging low to his ankles and exposing near nothing of his skin.  What little of him you see shines with a bronzed earthen tone, and his eyes contain no color but pure white and solid black.  He smells faintly of fish\r\n',0,0,361,1,'pMVKUPZpxC',0,0,'2009-01-20 01:07:02',79,'\0',0,0,9119,111500,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,402948336,522130716,0,0),(1835,'Vaeda Green',4978,22,11,11,11,22,22,11,11,11,22,'',0,0,446,2,'PRaJHnDSKp',0,0,'2009-01-20 20:39:52',79,'\0',0,0,137227,5099,121,7,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520619249,402653208,0,0),(1836,'Ranukken',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1446,3,'XMywrJoZNa',0,0,'2009-01-21 09:22:38',79,'\0',0,0,370,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(1837,'Serenity',90556,3,31,17,17,17,31,31,17,17,17,'The long golden tresses that trail down her back are tied back neatly with a brightly colored silk ribbon.  Her satin dress flows easily about her small, petite frame. Her deep blue eyes look around her as she seems to contemplate everything in her path.  A delicate necklace of pure azure flower petals lies about her neck, a gift from Icarus.\r\n\r\n',0,0,367,3,'JYRGycKWXq',0,0,'2009-01-22 00:35:09',85,'\0',0,0,81545,95136,4580,5,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520914161,354361112,2,0),(1838,'Cierra Myst',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1451,2,'zLDQquaWlv',0,0,'2009-01-23 18:22:42',79,'\0',0,0,977,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,352846064,1179671,0,0),(1839,'Metalus',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1453,3,'yomolRzfkW',0,0,'2009-01-24 07:47:39',79,'\0',0,0,2135,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,203362072,0,0),(1840,'Gatti Lagouss',4084,22,11,11,11,22,22,11,11,11,22,'A seemingly happy dreamer. He stands around 5\"8\" his white Hair lingers just above his ears.His eyes are slighty green and gray. His voice lingers a mild tone throughout the room when he speaks. with one distinctive scar climbing from his wrist to his shoulder on his left arm, his garments made from an unknown tough and raw material, with boots that have two oddly different patterns when he walks they leave a small quiet thud that barely echoes.',0,0,1455,2,'AJMyTKZNrU',0,0,'2009-01-24 13:37:08',79,'\0',0,0,52031,4084,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,522126360,0,0),(1841,'Arabeth Traegus',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,452,3,'VQIqpysTnJ',0,0,'2009-01-24 18:47:19',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,269223153,17826079,0,0),(1843,'Mays',1999,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A man of average size and a defined build.  His lifeless complexion seems to polarize itself from the white curls atop his head.  A carefully trimmed goatee surrounds his lips and chin.  His eyes often radiate a deep amber color around milky white pupils. Dawned in immaculate armor, it is apparent the upkeep of the armor is a top priority.  Large forearms are covered in ink designs that begin at the wrist and extend under his armor to reach up, and around his neck. A fresh inked \'J\' glows from a forearm.',0,0,1231,2,'ddSgGwRTjb',0,0,'2009-01-24 19:05:24',84,'\0',0,0,695882,797861,71361,23,56,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,557296,269491999,16,0),(1844,'Karas Ka\'arn',2100,21,21,10,10,10,21,21,10,10,10,'With milky white eyes, and fiery red hair, this dreamer seems far from blind. He wears a night and jade uniform, torn in places, and coated with a thin layer of dust.',0,0,823,3,'TvoUZBVeNX',0,0,'2009-01-24 19:34:15',79,'\0',0,0,25032,2000,0,5,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,34341104,118490903,0,0),(1845,'Makena',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1456,4,'NvNHJzHomG',0,0,'2009-01-25 15:05:38',85,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1049841,0,0,0),(1846,'Cynder',2475,21,10,10,10,21,21,10,10,10,21,'Many slit-like scars and scabs adorn this dreamers ashen skin, mostly upon her arms and legs. Her short, choppy, fire colored hair looks as if it is missing in patches. Her attire is filthy and ripped, showing she does not take care of herself. She shows a tired look from the dark rings under her eyes and her droopy eyelids. She carries a small doll, that looks as if it is an exact replica of herself, and a dull carving knife.',0,0,1020,2,'pHFQwNHeHu',0,0,'2009-01-25 15:07:05',79,'\0',0,0,27705,2500,25,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,34079985,33686016,0,0),(1847,'Bubbles',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Bubbles is a petite woman with long flowing grey hair that she wears in a tight bun. Her face is consumed with lines that tell a story. Her nose is slightly crooked and her eyes are small with blue, green specs. Her clothes are misshapen and loose fitting, her shoes are too big. Her hands are thin & pale with short stubby fingers that lay clenched due to disease. ',0,0,1036,1,'ijjyChguYQ',0,0,'2009-01-25 18:51:56',79,'\0',0,0,7774,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,263409,202375189,1,0),(1848,'Tzra\'zik',4083740,49,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,49,29,'This beast bears a form that goes beyond simple description. It is a flailing mass of tentacles, teeth and eyes, pus and ooze dripping from its massive form in thick black streams. Three pairs of hooked claws dripping with venom extend awkwardly from its bloated body, and a spiked prehensile tail twitches.  The stomach turning scent of bile and sulphur follow closely in it\'s wake.',0,0,1804,1,'3ZH8xrYBKK',0,4,'2009-01-25 19:44:46',79,'',0,0,114262,11994314,7943138,1355,1058,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,6,277174518,1839104,4752,0),(1849,'Desdemona',990,0,10,10,10,15,20,10,10,10,20,'Before you stands a dreamer of  appearence. This mysterious stranger seems to stand out at first glance for many reasons, like the lack of head. In the dreamers hand, there is a mask, held upon a large pole, and usually held were the head should be. The face, appearing as though it were made of clay, changes its expression through reforming itself, then again seeming to harden into clay. The dreamer\'s voice sounds like a mix of male and female, both speaking at once. It wears a suit of abyss colored armor.',0,0,1389,2,'HhuhJdeqTu',0,0,'2009-01-25 22:36:21',79,'\0',0,0,7942,1000,10,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520619249,520101663,0,0),(1850,'Elle',59399,29,16,29,16,16,29,16,29,16,16,'Once happy and had everything going good. her eyes now show sadness and sorrow. the passion she had once is gone all she has is empty dreams.',0,0,1436,4,'fIlbmAvNsG',0,0,'2009-01-26 17:29:17',79,'\0',0,0,455744607,80016,20617,43,4,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,34620673,520356375,32768,0),(1851,'Auburn',1000,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'When you look at this dreamer you see her brown eyes flow to yours holding them tightly. Her tan arms are bandaged. The cloth she wears looks a size small and is torn in some places. Her blood red hair is always up and swings to her sholders. A bag on her sholder clanks with a few flasks and a few fresh bandges. She is about 6 feet tall. On her feet are an old worn pair of red sandles. Her legs are both bandaged from her feet to her knees. Her face is chared like she has been to close to fire.',0,0,1438,2,'llnmOpiaPT',0,0,'2009-01-28 15:07:06',79,'\0',0,0,3868,1000,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17302769,469900312,0,0),(1852,'Tarrow',500,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'Jade eyes twinkle at you as this dreamer stands. Skin and armor of the clearest night adorn his body, along with berry colored and stained vest and pants. His face is clearly pleased, at most times. He is of average height, and of an oval shaped face. His mouth is small, but he speaks with an amount of pressure behind the words, as if he were trying to force them out, while maintaing a smooth feeling, as those the words soothe you. ',0,0,1452,2,'rvENlerEor',0,0,'2009-01-29 15:59:23',79,'\0',0,0,4122,500,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,117966065,521342992,0,0),(1853,'Kronin',8,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'Before you stands a tall man with short curly brown locks. His face is young looking with little signs of fatigue. He is stought in posture and speaks with an easy tone. His light blue eyes are soft as he looks upon you.',0,0,1432,2,'uqXsJPMpGy',0,0,'2009-01-30 10:16:12',84,'\0',0,0,20584,8,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,268961009,270475032,0,0),(1854,'Fiona',884,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Young and winsome, her face comley glows. Her smile delicate and Innocent, with dimples on each cheek. She has long braided hair adorn with baby\'s breath. She wears a dainty dress with shoes that flop when she walks. Swinging from her hand, hangs a small bag filled with her most precious items.',0,0,1456,4,'XjExZlajhu',0,0,'2009-01-30 12:10:56',79,'\0',0,0,51893,900,16,3,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470811889,385947416,0,0),(1855,'James',0,18,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Perfectly parted black hair rests upon this dreamers head, and he looks at you with his scarlet eyes. His smile is genuine, and his clothing abyss, with the exception of his blood armor. His voice is of average pitch and volume. In all appearances he seems normal. But there is something unsettling about the way he looks at you.',0,0,1452,3,'vRdzvHMcGc',0,0,'2009-01-30 22:21:37',79,'\0',0,0,6488,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520881393,522125592,0,0),(1856,'Beldarion',0,20,10,10,1