en \r\nwhile a pronounced smudgeof dirt mars her forehead. Her hair, clasped into a messy ponytail, is the firey color of the setting sun; skin the shade of the palest sand, eyes lit with the hue of a fleeting shadow and her rose tinted lips curl into a mysterious smile. A soft lilting voice escapes her when she speaks, as she attempts to vainlyadjust her ragged shirt on her shoulder',0,0,1490,3,'BKVDqIfGYY',0,0,'2009-02-14 16:05:00',79,'\0',0,0,14457,500,10,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,34342129,404166423,0,0),(1874,'Isabella Torek',9999,24,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'Damp, fiery-orange tendrils of long hair is scattered about this young woman\'s head in a disarray. She has wide eyes the color of cerulean, and her lips are rosy-pink. Her musical voice is soft and can reach high tones. Around her neck is a fine golden chain. Unknown furs are wrapped around her body, and made into an odd dress. Draped across her shoulders, is a pure white cape, with the initials I. T. stitched in an elegant script. A gold band circles her ring finger.',0,0,555,3,'IYeSbvcaFG',0,0,'2009-02-15 19:07:10',79,'\0',0,0,350711,6056,150,3,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,34342129,404494358,0,0),(1875,'Canth',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,1491,1,'mRYKgGpGTG',0,0,'2009-02-16 11:52:02',79,'\0',0,0,1269,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17039600,320802837,0,0),(1876,'Samhain',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1495,4,'AJbvTQBoQi',0,0,'2009-02-16 21:28:10',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,0,0,0),(1877,'Intrium',3490,21,11,11,11,21,21,11,11,11,21,'A thin smile on this dreamer\'s face makes him look friendly, but prehaps a bit preoccupied. His chalk outfit makes his abyss hair and skin stand out. At his side is an abyss blade, which looks very well polished, but unused. ',0,0,250,2,'WapYThGSjU',0,0,'2009-02-19 19:07:16',79,'\0',0,0,86759,3612,122,4,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,268439583,3,0),(1878,'Dex Creed',0,20,10,17,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1501,4,'wfghCGTCnd',0,0,'2009