 from many dreams past, My former self was a Freesoul GK of the 6th sphere. Some may remeber me but my old friends are long gone. I was an avid hunter of darkmares and had lots of battle with the biggest DMs of my time. I have been in chaos for so long I have forgotten all the knowledge and skills I once had. I hope that with some help and guidence I can reclaim my former status and glory.',0,0,1516,1,'ISfOXbyJNZ',0,0,'2009-03-10 09:14:02',88,'\0',0,0,6981,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67371248,520094744,3,0),(1892,'Paulus',8212,24,12,12,12,24,24,12,12,12,24,'An ancient soul born again. Eager to learn about the city and its secrets as well as my ablitites. Always seeking guidence in an effort to learn and better myself. On his belt is attached a long and thin elegant rapier blade with a swept crossguard and jem inlaid basket hilt.',0,0,1516,2,'dioySZyNhP',0,0,'2009-03-10 11:53:26',79,'\0',0,0,177657,9001,789,23,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,403177712,521148440,2,0),(1893,'Jalal',0,15,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1518,2,'VrvrDQKPlM',0,0,'2009-03-11 20:20:36',79,'\0',0,0,22903,0,0,3,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(1894,'Gemma',4500,22,11,22,11,11,22,11,22,11,11,'A darkskinned beauty of 26, short in stature with short choppy white tresses smeared over one eye and braided in places. Her striped peaches and cream socks move up mid thigh, Her small frame is covered by a flared halter-t dress in many soft sandy, earth, peachy, and cream tones that barely covers her bum. Her tiny feet are covered by small blocky shoes and her body is fit.',0,0,1442,4,'WAMMLusUTM',0,0,'2009-03-12 15:36:46',79,'\0',0,0,67576,4500,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1049841,1376287,16,0),(1895,'Moss Garret',7623,23,12,18,12,12,23,12,23,12,12,'A man in his mid to late 20\'s, chisled features and ropey build,  roughly 5\'9 in height and nothing of note on his person, a cocky swagger carries him from place to place as his hazel eyes twinkle from beneath his smooth brown hair.',0,0,1442,4,'ZphuGVfFfg',0,0