er is a mass of talons, teeth, and thick carapace swaddled in the tattered remains of his clothes. Multiple eyes glare in all directions, rolling wildy in their sockets. Teeth dripping with venom protrude from a maw that can barely contain their razor-sharp lengths. A booming cackle can be heard emanating from the beast\'s misshappen jaws.',0,0,1804,4,'VsTxJk8P7H',0,4,'2009-03-16 17:40:06',79,'\0',0,0,334763,3002490,1358535,85,746,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,6,261167350,1187079,16,0),(1902,'Katarzyna',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'She has a tattoo of silver raven wings that span from the bridge of her nose to either sides of her forehead. She wears a silver raven clawed gauntlet upon her left hand. A black onyx amulet encircles her thin swan-like neck. A tattered and torn dress is tightly fitted across her young, healthy body. Her light brown hair hangs in loose curls and caresses her shoulders as it falls gently down to the middle of her back. Resting upon her hip is a sheathed dagger.',0,0,444,4,'zpjYrzPwHf',0,0,'2009-03-17 19:32:54',79,'\0',0,0,33074,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,403703025,385881883,0,0),(1903,'Hales',0,19,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'Slim built, tall and slinky with short and messy bright red hair. A weathered and unshaven face shows anything but excitement or joy. Seveal lengthy scars can be seen on his right arm and the toes of his metalic boots are dented and scratched to all hell.',0,0,1528,2,'mNpTcLYhTE',0,0,'2009-03-19 11:15:42',79,'\0',0,0,3304,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17301744,522125848,0,0),(1904,'Ironside',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1525,3,'qpXUtlRBNn',0,0,'2009-03-19 15:53:58',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(1905,'Maddy',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1532,3,'RJanxvwlvU',0,0,'2009-03-21 12:16:19',79,'\0',0,0,7285,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470549745,387127064,0,0),(1906,'Musubi',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,1533,1,'NIEPrYcsSJ',0,0,'2009-03-21 20:44:09',79,'\0',0,0,448,0,0,0