round amalia shoulders, and her eyes shine a bright blue. When she smiles, in the right light you can catch a glimps of a pair of sharp elongated teeth.\r\nShe is frequently lost, and has a very poor sense of direction.',0,0,1541,1,'dsnzgZIvxF',0,0,'2009-03-29 22:32:23',79,'\0',0,0,116497,3700,186,10,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470025457,67175447,0,0),(1913,'Faelinx',9555,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,24,'Blackened hair and smooth sand colored skin, with a thin black silk vest that hangs over his pearl white and black chest plate. His black silk pants tucked neatly into his black leather boots with shin guards on each side that reach up to his knees. Faelinx\'s eyes are clear blue, and shine when he focuses, and a large scar across his right eye. Hanging on his back is his Katana that has a blue aura around it. Its handle is carved from ivory with three black stones lining the handle vertically on each side.',0,0,1542,2,'FQsIoLokHW',0,0,'2009-03-30 16:54:38',79,'\0',0,0,213470,8709,154,5,6,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,529006832,2039573,272,0),(1914,'Kharnix',7425,23,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,'Wearing a clean linen monk\'s top and clean white linen pants. His equally white hair hanging straight down to his shoulders. His skin has a slight cyan shine to it that makes it appear almost glass like. His eyes shine bright jade from behind his hair that\'s parted in the center. His voice is calm and smooth. He walks the city with white shoes that never seem to get dirty, or worn. His age appears to be older. His voice can be heard from the top of his long wooden staff, as it echoes throughout the room.\r\n',0,0,1542,3,'XuvlszZMJd',0,0,'2009-03-30 17:11:29',79,'\0',0,0,36496,2500,75,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,12,256,0),(1915,'King Baba',0,20,19,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'An oddly familiar face, looking lost...',0,0,273,3,'RedvcYZUce',0,0,'2009-03-31 03:51:49',84,'\0',0,0,2336,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470549745,270471192,0,0),(1916,'Keeshaena',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,999