est of my sleeping hours to find a cure for this perdicument.\r\n',0,0,1548,2,'xUSXWCYcgC',0,0,'2009-04-05 17:56:41',79,'\0',0,0,17033,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,403178737,469834776,0,0),(1926,'Mannichi',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Dark hair frames a gray face twisted into an omnipresent snide smile... A glorious red cape cape cascades down his back, trimed in black and clasped at his throat with  haunting gold brooch.  He is tall and whiplash lean, almost malnourished looking, but with a full face and penetrating green eyes.  He seems very sure of himself.',0,0,1549,4,'POAufxftcu',0,0,'2009-04-05 19:54:55',79,'\0',0,0,4146,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143537,404685056,2,0),(1927,'Kiku',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1549,3,'TFBYBByZwO',0,0,'2009-04-06 01:44:08',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,787697,0,0,0),(1928,'Thomas Marritza',500,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Wears a small amulet around his neck that glows faintly with Will.',0,0,1555,1,'TesLeTXOZW',0,0,'2009-04-06 07:03:21',79,'\0',0,0,8100,500,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,68951064,0,0),(1929,'Requiem',9290,0,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'Requiem stands 6\' in height. His eyes are piercing emerald. His silver hair stretches to the mid of his back. An abyss robe loosely drapes over his average body. He carries a single mythril knife, barely longer than a finger. ',0,0,1556,3,'WOcEETmbnT',281474976710912,0,'2009-04-06 13:33:48',84,'\0',0,0,561752,9900,610,8,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,522133272,65536,0),(1930,'Armanti',4950,22,11,11,11,22,22,11,11,11,22,'A thrity something man appears plain and atractive at the same time, from his neck hangs a pendant that glows with insight. He seems shy, and lively at the same time. His thoughts and actions appear orderly and seems to play out in a systematic manner. As you glance at him you think you see a smile out of the corner of your eye but as you look closer it seems to fade quickly.  ',0,0,1555,2,'RuhMiRoXsQ',0,0,'2009-04-06 18:34:51',