e carefully trimmed. His dark blue eyes never seem still. He is in constant restless motion, and seems intensely interested in everything. He is currently wearing a floppy silk hat adorned with an ostrich feather, a pair of bulky leather gloves, and a red handkerchief tied over his nose and mouth\r\n',0,0,1577,2,'bwaHYjUQHN',0,0,'2009-04-19 22:40:20',79,'\0',0,0,367197,12160,2161,26,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470286688,117444632,98304,0),(1950,'Izumaki',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1581,2,'pLCBOwncpp',0,0,'2009-04-19 23:12:17',79,'\0',0,0,211,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268959984,67240204,0,0),(1951,'Landro Sieal',1000,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A short man with no remarkable features aside from a small mark on the top of his left hand. You try to get a closer look at the mark, but for some reason can\'t seem to sharpen your focus on it. ',0,0,1584,2,'ETFFJvpOur',0,0,'2009-04-20 13:07:07',79,'\0',0,0,15446,1000,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,520880156,0,0),(1952,'Kanto',1659999,44,26,26,26,44,44,26,26,26,44,'A young, handsome man with meticulously styled blonde hair. His skin appears unblemished, with bright, warm blue eyes and a gleaming smile. Well-polished arm bracers seem the only armor on him, the rest of his clothes are simple yet pristine-looking garments that fit him snugly. His walk is light as is his voice, which seems to brim with happiness.',0,0,717,2,'PXYgQkNE4G',0,0,'2009-04-20 21:55:01',79,'\0',0,0,1031691,11755466,4938667,35,6,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67698928,235798552,4,0),(1953,'Cliq',18778715,59,36,36,59,36,59,36,36,59,36,'Joshua hobbles around in fettered shackles; his thin boney frame wrapped in layers of coarse brown scraps of cloth. Long, greasy hair curtains his shaggy backpack he carries with a big awe-struck smile plastered across his face. His eyes glimmer spellbound by everything around him.',0,0,1804,1,'o4O71bevzX',0,4,'2009-04-20 23:35:53',75,'',0,0,1356597,10792493,2013778,20,4,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,478527728,471605004,4112,0