e on his body, their origin appearing tribal.  His eyes appear as calm as his demeanor.  There is something mysterious that is hard to place. He is barefoot.',0,0,1781,3,'xpOpIQVjWX',0,0,'2009-08-31 13:50:02',79,'\0',0,0,4180,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470548720,5911,0,0),(2156,'Eelar',2500,21,21,10,10,10,21,21,10,10,10,'Before you stands a boy, verging on manhood. His hair is rough and dirty, hanging down just past his shoulders, his simple, makeshift clothing is covered in dust. As he wanders the dreamscape, he appears to observe everything with a sense of awe, yet seems somewhat uncomfortable, constantly fidgeting and taking up as little space as possible. What is strangest about him though is his face. His features lack vibrance,colour, and definition, almost just a smudge on his head.',0,0,202,3,'sLNoyQIqBu',0,0,'2009-08-31 19:24:49',79,'\0',0,0,37474,2500,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470548720,404035605,0,0),(2157,'Ffr',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1782,3,'vEALzfxopT',0,0,'2009-08-31 20:18:01',79,'\0',0,0,785,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17563888,251793432,19,0),(2158,'Nathan Scott',0,20,10,9,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1783,2,'XCpVYDlVcG',0,0,'2009-09-01 05:22:42',79,'\0',0,0,945,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(2159,'Qujaimarii',4159999,49,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,49,29,'A tall but rotund man stands before you. His round face is partially covered by an imperial style mustache with curly grey whiskers. He round rimmed glasses attached to some kind of tether. He is partially balding with curly white hair dominating his lower head. He wears a long orange tunic with matching trousers. He holds his balance with a wooden cane.',0,0,1804,1,'CctuyMd2zZ',0,4,'2009-09-01 22:46:53',79,'\0',0,0,306000,3287,41600,1,12,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,8732912,50528277,1938,0),(2160,'Desertstormer',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'\"Clad in a leathery tunic and cloak\" Desertstormer appears disheveled and angry. Sand whips at his heels of his boots.',0,0,1785,2,'ySVIKv