8720,68951839,0,0),(2423,'Hector Kyros',9899,24,12,24,12,12,24,13,24,13,13,'Looking to be in his early 30s, with just a hint of grey hair. His eyes are hard and when looking straight at you seem to see through you. His leathery skin tells of hard times. He is cloaked in abyss and blood, his rugged boots seem meant for fighting or climbing. When he moves, the double edged sword at his hip moves as if a part of him. Sheathed in plain leather, with a sphere shaped hilt. One side abyss, the other chak, each has a small orb of the other floating in it.',0,0,1919,4,'NJhTWDrTQj',0,0,'2009-12-08 03:21:49',79,'\0',0,0,38142,398,2,4,5,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,487588080,169804053,0,0),(2424,'Lothebe',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,392,1,'CuOwfkCFtP',0,0,'2009-12-08 16:56:21',79,'\0',0,0,917,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470024432,18812696,0,0),(2425,'Cherish',59999,29,20,10,10,10,29,29,16,16,16,'Long lavish red hair falls loosely around her delicate face, ending just below her hips. Black lace flows into an abyssal leather bodice, releasing the ruffles of a fire-licked silk shirt. It lies unbuttoned, and its loose sleeves fall from shoulder to thigh. Matching leather pants hug toned hips and thighs. Silent stepping boots rest on slender feet. Pert lips contrast greatly against porcelain skin, while her crystal blue eyes are curious and clear. An abyss crystal hangs around her neck.',0,0,526,3,'YXBzJWMKhI',0,0,'2009-12-08 19:46:41',79,'\0',0,0,90006,1500,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17580273,16843008,0,0),(2426,'Landrew',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1976,2,'NefAWiJZWN',0,0,'2009-12-12 20:56:49',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(2427,'Sarah Little',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,1977,1,'dYiAjZCLHU',0,0,'2009-12-13 20:08:39',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,263409,0,0,0),(2428,'Newbane',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1979,3,'zrFhvmQRtQ',0,0,'2009-12-14 00:48:58',79,'\0',0,0,287,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,4