0,'(none)',0,0,1992,4,'TqMBTPwsZy',0,0,'2009-12-23 21:56:22',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,0,0,0),(2438,'Lylia',2500,21,10,10,10,21,21,10,10,10,21,'(none)',0,0,1994,2,'KTWlfBXvzF',0,0,'2009-12-24 19:31:28',79,'\0',0,0,34302,0,0,5,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618225,520232727,0,0),(2439,'Talon Mystwolf',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'As the war wolf he stands tall enough for his fawn to ride, his battle armor and gear scarred and well worn, bearing the Master\'s House Crest. as the Warrior, he stands at 5 feet 8 inches, barrel chested and thick of body and heavily muscled limbs. the armor he wears during the moon phase also bears the Master\'s Crest, as does the hilt of the plainly sharp serviceble sword, and the shield that he wears on his back. His service is to Little Fawn, by order of his Master',0,0,1995,2,'uQMqPnuyTm',0,0,'2009-12-25 10:20:13',79,'\0',0,0,44945,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,386335772,0,0),(2440,'Little Fawn',6308,23,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,'A pretty young girl with pale-golden hair drawn into a ponytail, bright blue eyes, and red pouty lips. She exudes youthful charm, and energy. An emblem of two rampant lions on a gold chevron shield matches the one that adorns the armor of her wolfen guardian Talon Mystwulf. Her features are best described as \'cute\', and her nature seems quite impish and playful.',0,0,1996,3,'GbjhDgnqYe',0,0,'2009-12-25 18:01:22',79,'\0',0,0,192747,6308,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67895537,2032151,0,0),(2441,'Holyghetto',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1999,2,'TKxnWhnOhs',0,0,'2009-12-27 04:36:49',84,'\0',0,0,156,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470286576,16843032,0,0),(2442,'Talon Mystwulf',2310,21,10,10,21,10,21,10,10,21,10,'Human shaped, he stands taller then before, about 8 ft, heavy chested and thickly muscled. his features are human but feral, bearded, heavily maned, and furred of chest. His ears are still wolfs ears,  and he retains his bushy tail. He wears leather breeches, and crimson dyed boots. sword belt and shield finish his outfit. Glowing blue runes on arms and chest are the result of his induction into House Deltros. His service is to Little Fawn, by order of her Father, his Master.',0,0,1995,1,'yVanwpWWVI',0,0,'2009-12-27 10:06:06',79,'\0',0,0,140323,2323,13,1,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,253690399,0,0),(2443,'Nikkesa',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2000,4,'iPONjXHrmu',0,0,'2009-12-27 22:08:57',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1049841,0,0,0),(2444,'Soulslayerryuu',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2001,3,'UeyauFxFWr',0,0,'2009-12-30 18:25:15',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(2445,'Valaria',1659999,45,26,45,26,26,45,26,45,26,26,'This woman is very tall and has a very skeletal figure. She has dark abyss hair that is pulled so tightly back into a pony tail the skin on her face is pulled tight. A deep scar is clearly seen running across her neck. She wears a bright red  dress, which seems to be home made, that comes down to the top of her knees. A well worn pair of combat boots tightly hug her feet.',0,0,1804,4,'5h8vZujbCC',0,4,'2009-12-30 21:42:17',84,'\0',0,0,504,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,529597201,16843036,98320,0),(2446,'Joanic',8443,24,12,24,12,12,24,12,24,12,12,'joanic stands at just over 5 ft, her hair is short and looks messy, and her face looks aged with noticable wrinkles around the corners of her mouth and on her forehead.\r\n She wears the Deltros colors of Fire and Abyss proudly. ',0,0,2003,4,'iCFgozriWn',0,0,'2010-01-02 16:59:05',79,'\0',0,0,289752,7791,348,7,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,319815921,35586591,0,0),(2447,'Yoton',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2004,3,'dxQsTugniM',0,0,'2010-01-02 18:26:41',79,'\0',0,0,410,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,252444912,35587864,0,0),(2448,'Seliva',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'The small and lithe frame of the avatar  is all that betrays the gender of this tightly swaddled Dreamer. Carefully wrapped strips of cloth cover her arms and face, and her head is framed by a hooded robe that drapes from her shoulders. Echoes of her movement dissonantly casts a moment or two ahead of her, betraying her future movements slightly to those with a keen eye. Echoes of transluscent faces come and go within the depths of her hood, overlapping as they convey a limitless array of expressions. ',0,0,2005,4,'degkkYEPWs',0,0,'2010-01-02 21:16:32',84,'\0',0,0,950,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048817,18809112,0,0),(2449,'Lisbet',1000,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'She\'s fairly plain, with straight dark hair parted in the middle and cropped at her chin. She\'s not particularly tall or short, nor is she particularly thin, or curvy. Just your average dark haired, mid twenties female. She does wear a bit of rouge on her otherwise pale cheeks, but it\'s hardly noticable. \r\nShe\'s wearing a fairly non descript blue tunic and tanned leather leggings. Her feet are covered by matching leather shoes. The only jewlery she wears is a fairly plain wedding band.',0,0,102,3,'XzkUBPvNLo',0,0,'2010-01-03 12:28:31',79,'\0',0,0,6267,1000,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880369,269488149,0,0),(2450,'Justus',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2007,3,'hcIobssKMV',0,0,'2010-01-04 20:52:36',79,'\0',0,0,1131,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17563888,68685848,3,0),(2452,'Tiatc',0,20,10,10,10,10,20,10,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,999999,2,'6672867786677179',0,0,'2010-01-05 00:20:30',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524288,0,0,0),(2453,'Tiatcx',0,20,10,10,10,10,20,10,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,999999,2,'6565866678707380',0,0,'2010-01-05 00:22:08',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524288,0,0,0),(2454,'Tiatcxds',0,20,10,10,10,10,20,10,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,999999,1,'6781669075676871',0,0,'2010-01-05 00:22:43',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262144,0,0,0),(2455,'Tiatcxdss',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,999999,2,'6886687675878178',0,0,'2010-01-05 00:23:09',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524288,0,0,0),(2456,'