dtjKTd',0,4,'2010-01-10 21:05:42',79,'\0',0,0,6061,0,0,3,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,528744689,66584,16,0),(2467,'Geal',18351,25,13,25,13,13,25,13,25,13,13,'A weedy little man. He wears a rugged, light brown shirt and pair of shorts, both adorned with numerous, bulging pockets. The outfit is completed by heavy boots and a large backpack, brimming with all manner of complete junk. Small amounts of grime feature on his skin and fingernails. His greasy hair is tousled, and behind round spectacles his eyes sit within dark rings. He seems slightly unsteady and unshaven, the signs of age carved haphazardly into his pale visage.',0,0,202,4,'qODDENpGny',0,0,'2010-01-12 01:29:06',79,'\0',0,0,193514,5432,533,9,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142512,521673494,0,0),(2468,'Carys',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'',0,0,2018,3,'PGkiDOgdNp',0,0,'2010-01-12 23:42:23',79,'\0',0,0,2809,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520357105,18816792,128,0),(2469,'Synteny',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1804,2,'TXvqsokCdK',0,0,'2010-01-14 22:00:55',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(2470,'Syntony',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1803,2,'ebPVQKgGMC',0,0,'2010-01-14 22:01:04',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(2471,'Dairisf',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,2019,1,'mQzvwmeeIN',0,0,'2010-01-15 01:36:58',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,262384,0,0,0),(2472,'Cupid',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'The God of Love stands before you... and somehow you know he\'s dreamed before... another time and another place.\r\nCupid\'s hair is the color of the fires of passion, with perfect skin of a young newly born babe.\r\nThere is nothing more to Cupid than what you see, but behind his eyes there lurks a restrained evil...',0,0,2020,4,'NbgpuIQfpK',0,0,'2010-01-15 11:54:27',84,'\0',0,0,8436,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,34603248,33620504,0,0),(2473,'Tanthi',0,20,10,10,10,17,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,2023,2,'SBmnfRsAVI',0,0,'2010-01-16 23:13:50',79,'\0',0,0,12331,0,0,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470286576,471794712,3,0),(2474,'Nothriel',19159999,59,36,36,36,59,59,36,36,36,59,'A towering giant of man, easily topping six and a half feet in height, with shoulders as broad as a cart handle and deeply calloused hands. Close cut, dirty blond hair flows lightly as he moves, doing little to obscure his broad features. His deep blue eyes seem almost lifeless, reflecting  little of even the brightest light. Clad in a simple leather tunic and breeches, with travel worn boots, his black dyed belt shows a thin patch of heavy wear on the right side, just past his hips. ',0,0,1804,2,'CrRHLjodAQ',0,4,'2010-01-17 21:12:24',79,'\0',0,0,306694,0,0,0,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,76136688,521934620,28,0),(2475,'Charisse',18916597,59,36,59,36,36,59,36,59,36,36,'She has long hair that flows down her back in a cascade of uncontrollable curls. She keeps her hair out of her face with a wreath of wildflowers that rests atop her head. She wears a dress that skims her knees, flaring out when she walks. Her feet are bare, her toes wiggling as if they can\'t keep still. Her eyes are a startling shade of blue and usually sparkle, although on rare occasions, a hint of pain can be seen in their depths as if she is remembering something painful. ',0,0,2012,4,'42X8f0bwTE',0,4,'2010-01-17 21:33:59',79,'',0,0,375142,0,191600,2,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,101827825,17236248,4108,0),(2476,'Greg Vancher',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2026,3,'nFkZQcXntb',0,0,'2010-01-18 06:24:54',79,'\0',0,0,1140,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,269222128,270474261,0,0),(2477,'Byzie',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2027,3,'KJiiORlyCe',0,0,'2010-01-18 18:35:14',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,0,0,0),(2478,'Justyn',1999,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'This young mans vivid snowy hair and light violet eyes are enhanced by the purple-dyed leather vest protecting his thin yet toned frame. Beneath the vest is a pristine silk shirt tucked into a thick and worn leather belt. The belt carries several silver chains hooked to many pouches, one to an ornate carved wooden box, and the thickest to a shimmering crystal ball. The belt also cinches the top of his greaves, which are a gangle of blue and purple hued patches of many types of materials.',0,0,143,4,'OhgbPkILhz',0,0,'2010-01-19 14:36:51',79,'\0',0,0,3508,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,1183768,0,0),(2479,'Althea',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'White hair appears as though it had been attempted to be pulled into a ponytail, but half of it has escaped its confines. She wears a simple long jade green gown that is tattered at the bottom, with broken straps. This dreamer\'s appearance is unremarkable aside from unkempt, messy hair and a single wilted purple flower halfheartedly placed behind her right ear. ',0,0,2029,3,'hXUTmLIDRN',0,0,'2010-01-19 20:42:02',79,'\0',0,0,1307,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786673,460572,0,0),(2480,'Bahrumbahdum',2500,21,10,10,21,10,21,10,10,21,10,'Draped in elegant robes of silk and satin, Bahrumbahdum is, simply put, grotesquely fat. Multiple chins hide his trunk-like neck, and his extremeties jiggle as he huffs and puffs along. His ankles are buried by a roll of flab that settles along of the tops of his swollen, sandalled feet. Beady eyes peer out from behind bloated cheeks, and his sweaty face is red and flushed. A cupid\'s smile seems eternally pursed on his greasy lips. ',0,0,2005,1,'rlXMXmozPO',0,0,'2010-01-20 13:19:21',84,'\0',0,0,27178,2500,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17039600,1180696,0,0),(2481,'Kalimon',3614016,0,29,29,29,48,48,29,29,29,48,'Kalimon is a short man, he comes halfway up to what most dreamers stand at. His dark blue skin shines in the light, it almost looks fake. A long red beard follows a narrow path on his chin line and ends up in a busy and unkempt head of hair. An electric current races across his avatar at random times. He wears sleek blue clothes that fit his size well.',0,0,1804,2,'3j2yv6DzOR',0,4,'2010-01-21 12:59:07',75,'\0',0,0,66127,5221,627378,19,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,25772816,1048591,98320,0),(2482,'Yazashinari',3944559,49,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,49,29,'An anomaly of a figure stands before you. A dense haze surrounds the feminine avatar. A flawless visage, nearly transparent, is hidden partially underneath a golden cloak that enshrouds the entire body revealing little but the feint outlines of feminine curves. Hypnotic eyes glance about as if searching for something. ',0,0,1804,1,'xkIfmxLrII',0,4,'2010-01-21 19:32:48',88,'\0',0,0,110177,25157,370051,16,30,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,50676977,67372061,768,0),(2483,'Zsazsa',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1804,2,'VGHXogsLdr',0,0,'2010-01-22 16:27:10',75,'\0',0,0,196,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(2484,'Zsa Zsa',128922,33,18,18,18,33,33,18,18,18,33,'This short  young woman that  has night colored curls that frame her small simple face, with a wildflower behind her ear. She wears a very plain stewards dress of abyss and azure . She has a deep red scar upon her arm. On her neck is a simple heart inscirbed with her kittens name. \" Suki\" She\r\n her neck is a small heart on a chain.  A kitten is seen following her around.\r\nA mini Lambent heart shape crest, shimmers from the folds of her dress',0,0,1804,2,'rQsPDvGKuy',0,0,'2010-01-22 16:41:15',84,'\0',0,0,2971450,300236,186754,213,44,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,557297,253697815,0,0),(2485,'Mokorro',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Tall, tanned, and muscular, Mokorro seems bred for war. He wears nearly no clothing to speak of: a very small black chain cod-piece, cinching around his toned waist with interlinking silver circles. He has highly polished, heavy silver-plate boots and one matching guantlet on his left hand. A long, extravagant sword is strapped to his back. His hair is jet-black, cropped short on the sides with a perfectly styled faux-hawk coming to a point on the top. His eyes are sky-blue and his smile impeccable.',0,0,1610,1,'DIFQAftuiS',0,0,'2010-01-22 18:51:22',79,'\0',0,0,5209,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,404226072,0,0),(2486,'Placeholder MT',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,1804,2,'TeUnrQMkEY',0,0,'2010-01-23 22:37:51',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(2487,'Alderon',990,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Alderon always looks nervous and twitches a lot. He wears a white lab coat, that\'s open enough to show his very pail, muscular chest. His coat is torn, along with his pants. All around the upper half of his body, are scars and burns. His black hair, with a few strands of gray, is long and stringy. A brown, leather patch covers his left eye. His feet are bare and covered in dirt. He is mostly seen talking to himself.',0,0,555,4,'eMORDTcuxW',0,0,'2010-01-24 19:42:28',79,'\0',0,0,13370,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142512,520093718,0,0),(2488,'Thyeldin',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Eyes of blood look languidly around from person to person, framed with a few loose bangs of abyss hair, that sweeps back into a ponytail at the nape of his lightly tanned neck.  The wiry frame of this man is bound tightly in rope-like muscles that undulate below his earth toned suede leggings.  His torso is bound in a match vest.  Resting beneath is a loose fitting faded grey shirt.  Strapped to one leg rests a small hunting knife fitted into its sheath.  A belt of pouches bears the scent of various herbs.',0,0,2039,3,'eURdHlvNyM',0,0,'2010-01-26 18:42:19',79,'\0',0,0,8106,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(2489,'Rei',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1371,3,'diSpoaMNvc',0,0,'2010-01-27 23:11:28',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,787697,0,0,0),(2490,'Farlong',9227,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,'With a medium build, face neither square nor round, and no distinctive marks or features apart from his unruly hair and a gold band on the third finger of his left hand, everything in his appearance seems designed to be easily ignored or forgotten. He often examines his surroundings, and other dreamers, drawing and writing in his notebook, which contains a variety of figures, symbols, stick drawings and a few crossed-out nonsensical sequences of words.',0,0,2042,1,'kfWLzWKYGf',0,0,'2010-01-27 23:40:31',79,'\0',0,0,1139233,12623,2624,31,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,352583920,269356823,0,0),(2491,'Reicheru',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A woman who looks timid and unsure of her suroundings. She is thin and small in hight with a small round face and deep green eyes.',0,0,2041,1,'VrAIZlBrDI',0,0,'2010-01-28 00:01:11',79,'\0',0,0,8230,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470024433,17832981,3,0),(2492,'Umitenchen',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,2044,2,'RIDwuXSVEB',0,0,'2010-01-28 21:39:25',79,'\0',0,0,857,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470286576,471604245,3,0),(2493,'Cayman',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2045,4,'Ttotfkcmnl',0,0,'2010-01-28 22:05:40',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(2494,'Statue',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A combination of several materials  gathered from all over the city form this solid rock statue. It\'s shimmering glow pulsates brightly.',0,0,1804,3,'hlRaCGMTdP',0,0,'2010-01-29 18:11:56',84,'\0',0,0,6643,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786673,0,256,0),(2495,'Testicles',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,999999,2,'asdf',0,4,'2010-01-30 02:56:22',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524288,0,0,0),(2496,'TesticlesDos',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,999999,3,'gSipRsvG',0,0,'2010-01-30 03:11:05',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786432,0,0,0),(2497,'TesticlesTres',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none) test desc',0,0,999999,3,'UztkBVUP',0,4,'2010-01-30 03:44:01',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,386662400,301989912,0,0),(2498,'Aleasa',749,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2003,3,'AGJBqneTNd',0,0,'2010-01-30 13:34:36',79,'\0',0,0,13806,749,0,0,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,269222129,67568661,0,0),(2499,'Katof Felinei',500,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Gatekeeper in silver armour',0,0,846,1,'RwEepWEJwk',0,0,'2010-01-30 16:00:20',79,'\0',0,0,16626,500,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,69141013,0,0),(2500,'Kudzoo',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,2050,2,'ohbwZIYHYK',0,0,'2010-01-30 23:02:22',84,'\0',0,0,1946,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,353835008,0,0),(2501,'Cala\'ith',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'This old woman is thin, with flabbed skin hanging from it. Her pale green eyes stare right through you .She stands stout and strong. She wears, neatly pressed cloths.',0,0,2033,1,'vVuWSgzPGZ',0,0,'2010-01-31 12:25:11',79,'\0',0,0,5422,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67371249,202113048,0,0),(2502,'Ahgria',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,2053,2,'kkNlsHoDjA',0,0,'2010-02-01 15:50:40',79,'\0',0,0,762,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,0,0,0),(2503,'Nerion',9899,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,'A faintly pale man, posed in awkward thoughts; the uncomforty of his own body compliments throughout the crooked posture of himself. A frail image forshadows his body, almost as if sickly. His speechless persona reflects a lonesome attitude. A patched brown cloak consumes his lean body, illustrating an out of proportion feeling to this avatar. The hood of his shroud engulfs his head, illuminating little visibility of his face. Following his eyes, they spark dull grey, lighting decrepit features.',0,0,1874,4,'iUdZrYEVho',0,0,'2010-02-01 16:47:51',79,'\0',0,0,208084,8264,765,9,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,386924784,471342869,0,0),(2504,'Sigmund Drow',0,20,20,8,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2054,3,'dVvtnUweDG',0,0,'2010-02-01 17:36:44',79,'\0',0,0,448,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17563888,2039576,2,0),(2505,'Delphia Deltros',9999,24,13,24,13,13,24,13,24,13,13,'Slightly taller than the average female and slender, this woman has an air of self-entitlement about her. Long white hair is pulled to one side of her neck, contrasting sharply with her grey, pristine skin. Completely red eyes stare ahead, no discernable pupils to note where she looks. A very revealing red and black lace corsette barely covers her slim body, and thigh-high black boots with fiery engravings accentuate her long legs. A gaudy ring on her finger displays a circle of eight eyes, surrounding one',0,0,2055,4,'svnJvxWydK',0,0,'2010-02-02 00:06:32',79,'\0',0,0,31235,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048817,18678047,0,0),(2506,'Kovak Vadaa',3,20,10,10,10,16,20,10,10,10,20,'A young man garbed in the hide of an unknown creature stands before you. The youth smells strongly of smoke and the forest and his decorations seem natural in origin. Bone fetishes and beads of vibrant colors hang from braids in his hair and from knotted gutstring along his moccasins and leggings. Though his clothing is simple and plain his body is richly decorated in a manner that seems spiritual in nature. A red web of serpentine lines writhe across his arms and black paint encases his jaw and shoulders.',0,0,2056,2,'ROxKGAnGYS',0,0,'2010-02-02 23:46:47',79,'\0',0,0,8527,3,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,471276546,0,0),(2507,'Praxis',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Average height with jet black hair that\'s ear length. Light leather armor fastened securely to his avatar with a dagger tucked into his right leather boot. A small sword strapped to his back. His gaze is sometimes misleading as he never appears to be looking directly at anything, but instead he appears to be looking through it at what lies behind. His voices carries a rather smooth, calming tone.',0,0,1553,3,'RohpwXuVek',0,0,'2010-02-04 04:44:23',79,'\0',0,0,3194,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,353703196,0,0),(2508,'Sodor',5000,22,22,11,11,11,22,22,11,11,11,'Medium height with short dark brown hair and green eyes. He appears to be in his early twenties with no visable scars or tatoos. He wears a long flowing night robe with abyss trim.',0,0,1162,3,'IvDPSdJeLa',0,0,'2010-02-04 23:55:08',84,'\0',0,0,199876,5000,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470548720,521150232,0,0),(2509,'Navar Mynde',0,20,10,10,20,10,2