nally even build, a simple garment of crimson and abyss polarizes itself from that of his skin\'s hue.  Massive forearms erupt with fiery veins, tagged with intricate ink designs.',0,0,2077,2,'ajlgIsMkou',0,0,'2010-02-09 21:57:21',79,'\0',0,0,17291,2000,0,18,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,520167170,0,0),(2527,'Francis Acacius',1200,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Francis is a portly gentleman of average height, near his sixtieth winter. The years have grayed his hair and left his pate bald, which he attempts to conceal by combing thin tendrils of hair over it. His weathered skin is ruddy on his laugh lined face and callused hands and forearms. He wears an off white shirt, the sleeves rolled up to his bulky biceps. His legs are clothed in beige trousers and his feet leather shoes. He has a well worn suede apron covering his front.',0,0,1576,3,'nJOHrSlGPF',0,0,'2010-02-10 00:50:54',79,'\0',0,0,83047,1200,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,1514520,0,0),(2528,'Tornac',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2080,4,'vqIdlZDnIq',0,0,'2010-02-10 16:11:15',79,'\0',0,0,83,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,240,0,0,0),(2529,'Arrithion',1000,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A Lost Wonderer\r\n',0,0,2073,3,'tpcWsyvVQR',0,0,'2010-02-10 19:06:07',79,'\0',0,0,13977,1000,0,4,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,269222128,521936664,1,0),(2530,'Rizor',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,1600,4,'eZjDtHZPyt',0,0,'2010-02-10 21:59:53',79,'\0',0,0,629,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,219152624,2036246,0,0),(2531,'Mortai',5000,22,11,11,22,11,22,11,11,22,11,'A simple man wearing a simple silver shirt. He has bloodshot gray-green eyes and his silver hair is cut short, hiding the faint balding that has begun. He seems to never cease scanning the room, observing no one in particular. ',0,0,1600,1,'zmsJoWshHx',0,0,'2010-02-12 08:19:07',79,'\0',0,0,29951,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,503578864,505356056,0,0),(2532,'Lemir',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Long red hair hangs in a ponytail down his back, keeping all but 