0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,34078961,320803608,0,0),(2575,'Erinal',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2119,4,'jBHiZEpuCu',0,0,'2010-03-10 23:08:19',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,0,0,0),(2576,'Xudesa',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'The frail man before you is unfathomably ancient. A long, coarse beard drapes down to his ankles as he hobbles in, his twisted frame propped up by an equally twisted cane. One eye has been seared shut, the curve of his orbital bone blotched with a black and jagged burn. A single tooth  peeks out from his wrinkled lips as he smiles. A wooden rocking chair that dwarfs him in size has been haphazardly roped to his back. ',0,0,2120,4,'drnMQfpmOQ',0,0,'2010-03-11 06:44:39',84,'\0',0,0,4893,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,471146264,0,0),(2577,'Ai\'ton',990,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A well defined young man. He\'s a combination of darker race and light giving him stark features and a softly powedered pale chocolate skin as well as captivating blue eyes. He wears a fullsleeve hooded jacket baring his chest and pants of braided black and coal leathers. His face is lightly stubbled in key places and his head is the same, he wears nothing on his feet, and an oddly braided chain at his neck. He often stands slightly hunched, yet relaxed with hands in pocket.\r\n',0,0,2121,1,'inHaMaPKKc',0,0,'2010-03-11 18:45:36',84,'\0',0,0,22716,1000,10,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,386342679,0,0),(2578,'Path',1000,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'His skin is marked with thousands of unique tattoos, each magnificently cryptic; laced into the next. Large steel pauldrons dress his shoulders, weighing down heavily on his form. Across his upper torso, a beautiful jerkin fits tightly to his form integrated into his leggings by a fierce looking cummerbund. His armored boots are extraordinarily long, extended by ornately gothic sabatons that clink on the ground as he walks. A silver Halberd hangs loosely from a mechanized strapping system across his back.',0,0,535,3,'NZQnVPYxEv',0,0,'2010-03-14 09:28:39',79,'\0',0,0,36502,1000,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,168558832,319425053,0,0),(2579,'Rusty Nail',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,275,4,'hChFsXZoac',0,0,'2010-03-15 08:14:05',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,0,0,0),(2580,'Precion',500,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'',0,0,2124,3,'EFvNEKQAtZ',0,0,'2010-03-17 20:25:26',79,'\0',0,0,2516,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,520101656,0,0),(2581,'Menz',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'He looks as if he is in a constant state of pain.  Eyes shrouded by long, matted hair that is missing in places.  His skin is so pale, seemingly untouched by light.  Both of his legs bow inward at the knees.  His left arm ends just above where the elbow should be.  His right arm constantly twitches at the shoulder.',0,0,2125,4,'CoygurlDzO',0,0,'2010-03-17 22:39:01',79,'\0',0,0,1816,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17826032,16783125,0,0),(2582,'Auger',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,2128,1,'nrBYRbTPqF',0,0,'2010-03-19 01:57:19',79,'\0',0,0,3562,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,33816816,67240991,0,0),(2583,'Gnaeus',6845,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,23,'A lithe and pale-skinned young man with eyes at once piercing and haunted.  His aspect is one of grace and fluid disconnection; his footfalls, unnervingly quiet.',0,0,2176,2,'xgOBoqWaba',0,0,'2010-03-20 01:43:20',79,'\0',0,0,414265,6873,28,1,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,117965040,522133248,0,0),(2584,'Arryn',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'She wears a very short plum dress, with barely enough material to cover her. The sides are split, revealing more of her tanned, lithe frame. Long legs end in stilettos that she appears to walk in effortlessly. A strange pendant sits at her throat, the black gem set inside often pulses, changing colors. The dreamer looks haughty and arrogant, though her facial features on occasion seem almost friendly.',0,0,999999,3,'qCeBbcpiJE',0,0,'2010-03-22 20:49:45',79,'\0',0,0,2071,0,0,0,0,