sely there is something strange branded on his right arm. His soft hands show he has much work to do before he becomes noticed.',0,0,2246,1,'cDdbUQztwQ',0,0,'2010-05-02 17:00:05',79,'\0',0,0,76363,7656,217,7,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,67371248,268435480,0,0),(2638,'Corlan',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,2247,1,'xHxbNVWJWM',0,0,'2010-05-03 02:41:24',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470024432,201588760,0,0),(2639,'Quetza',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Adornments that only gods and royalty could have adorn this tall elegant woman from head to her feet. Her distinct features and obsidian eyes give her a near sinister yet aluring apeal. A grand loin cloth hangs to her knees and a colorful tail of beautifuly arranged peacock feathers grazes the ground as she walks, one foot before the other. Her chest is covered by nothing but strategicaly placed jems while her black hair is held in place by a chain and diamond circlet. She displays an unnerving confidence.',0,0,2251,4,'QSFYBMZmNz',0,0,'2010-05-03 15:01:54',79,'\0',0,0,10965,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142513,118426648,0,0),(2640,'Capadocian',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,2246,2,'tUuCdSIobS',0,0,'2010-05-03 15:24:12',79,'\0',0,0,2591,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520618224,522133248,0,0),(2642,'Karabha',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,999999,1,'ycChlWhlna',0,0,'2010-05-03 21:12:14',79,'\0',0,0,328,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17039600,16785176,0,0),(2643,'Saric',1587265,44,44,26,26,26,44,44,26,26,26,'Long bony razor-sharp talons rip into the ground like ripe fruit as the broad husk of a monster towers over dreamers; it\'s disjointed maw riddled with jagged teeth, salivating into a glistening tangled mat of chin hair. Wicked eyes spy through the holes of a torn hood, its shallow glare bathed in darkness. Shredded rags hang from malformed limbs, the stench of rot pouring off them like a poisonous gas.',0,0,1804,3,'pTujTYBeKK',0,4,'2010-05-06 23:13:12',79,'\0',0,0,79168,19253,33200,2,31,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,529334517,151652359,16,0),(2644,'Vrikar',1638834,44,26,26,26,44,44,26,26,26,44,'A mangled form covered in a dark cloak. Beneath the hood of the cloak are dark blood red eyes that glow with a dim hue, and two disfigured hands extend out of the side of the cloak. He seems to glide across the ground with the bottom of his cloak barely dragging under him.\r\n\r\n',0,0,2194,2,'deJeBHRKXs',0,4,'2010-05-07 00:16:19',84,'\0',0,0,130582,9639,49304,3,26,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,143196405,269488152,16,0),(2645,'Saint',7995,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,23,'With dark abyss skin, this dreamer stands an average 6\' with a sturdy build.  His right battle-worn hand hovers steadily over his blade, which glistens a rich azure shade as if made out of pure Insight.  His eyes the same color.  A chalk color tattoo runs down his left bicep reading Carpe Diem in old-english font. The tone in his voice resembles that of a man with much confidence. ',0,0,2252,2,'jNLsithwBP',0,0,'2010-05-07 14:24:30',79,'\0',0,0,53829,5837,342,9,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,352846064,252641311,0,0),(2646,'Brealene',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,2255,1,'tflOkKnlft',0,0,'2010-05-08 10:39:08',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,263409,0,0,0),(2647,'Chael',0,19,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Wearing an almost contagious half-smile, this dreamer stands a towering 7\'6\'\' tall.  His hair, silky and smooth has curls going in every direction.  His tunic unbuttoned a few from the top allows airflow to get to his skin, causes an aroma of fresh wintergreen that fills the room.  His clothes, and armor look as if hand-crafted by two very articulate smiths.  You can\'t help but notice him constantly in motion, chewing his nails one minute, and picking at them the next.',0,0,1375,1,'XgiYnUNOOb',0,0,'2010-05-09 00:01:54',79,'\0',0,0,5799,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,352583920,318771992,2,0),(2648,'Khateyana',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'At first glance she appears young, petite and almost fragile.