4,0,0),(2664,'Falstrand Able',4159999,49,29,9,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,'A big leather cap plants a greasy mop of black hair over his sharply contrasted pale complexion. Coated from head-to-toe in various leather pouches and patches, his make-shift lab coat drags ruggedly across the floor, infrequently tearing and dropping strange vials on the ground. He appears disheveled and unsure of himself as he clumsily searches his pockets for some long lost formula.',0,0,1804,4,'WOBSfhPp',0,4,'2010-07-18 20:28:19',75,'\0',0,0,20747,0,0,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,529613600,471604245,98320,0),(2665,'Braziri Vestral',4159999,49,29,29,29,49,49,29,29,29,49,'This young woman is barely five feet tall with grey eyes that are often downcast and a cap of short black hair that curls on the ends.  She wears a grey jumpsuit with a pair of short black boots on her feet.  She has a knapsack on her back, the flap open to reveal a collection of notebooks all shoved in any which way.  Her image flickers in and out from time to time.',0,0,1804,2,'IDxvUxBc',0,4,'2010-07-18 20:59:09',83,'\0',0,0,4395,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,529088753,522133248,16,0),(2666,'Alizmarda',4159999,49,29,29,29,49,49,29,29,29,49,'A tall, slender woman with stark white hair that ends just at the jaw. Her eyes are of a stone gray, dark against her pale flesh. Her tattered green dress is dotted with tiny, teal stones that dangle slightly from thin threads. Her face, hair, and garb are streaked with what looks like mud, with a dried, dark red substance smeared among the cloth. Her hands, however, are adorned with perfectly clean, teal cloth gloves. Her image flickers in and out from time to time.',0,0,1804,2,'DayIgIhN',0,4,'2010-07-18 21:00:36',84,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,525313,117506069,0,0),(2667,'Merelle',4077215,49,29,49,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,'A tall man, broad shouldered and well defined of a muscle that interferes little with the steady grace of his movements. His head always held high, unconsciously displaying his high cheekbones. His shoulders squared as he walks, his vibrant ice blue eyes constantly dancing. A long free flowing mane of silver hair hangs past his shoulders, occasionally covering the sheath of a long bladed crescent shaped sword that hangs from a bandoleer across his back. ',0,0,1804,4,'jtNYUzDG',0,4,'2010-07-18 21:10:46',79,'\0',0,0,42702,0,82784,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,9519872,352321564,98320,0),(2668,'Sunrise',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'a beautiful woman with sparkiling blue eyes. and lovely long red curly hair, with  beautiful pale skin as her dress falls around it. she has a kind heart, always looking for a way to chear people up. she has one secret that noone can see.',0,0,2272,4,'fkovUIJ[',0,0,'2010-07-18 21:27:19',79,'\0',0,0,42209,0,0,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17826033,521281304,0,0),(2669,'Ty\'rix',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A short man stands before you with jet black hair that hangs to his shoulders. A red vest hangs open revealing a white shirt with matching boots. The legs of his red pants are tucked neatly into his boots, one of which has a dagger stuffed inside.',0,0,193,3,'zsURDTuU',0,0,'2010-07-18 22:46:09',79,'\0',0,0,47,0,0,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,65560,0,0),(2670,'Shattered',7661,0,22,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,'Standing only 5\'2\", Looking around the age of mid twentys.. Her hair tied back with a tattered ribbon.. Just enough bangs lay on her left cheek  what seems to cover a deep scar.. Her eyes have a depth that when you look in them you began to feel at home.. The dress lays to her feet trailing lightly behind her, following her curves.. Her feet are not covered. She wears an anklet that has a small chime when she walks. Last you see a metal of sorts thorugh her cheeks on her face.. causing a dimpled affect.',0,0,649,3,'cSFBODYl',0,0,'2010-07-19 14:56:12',79,'\0',0,0,161471,6557,256,5,5,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880369,320806656,0,0),(2671,'Jude',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'',0,0,999999,1,'KQazLGQF',0,0,'2010-07-1