st femininity that is somewhat at odds with her distracted, scholarly demeanor.',0,0,2460,2,'FjUh[uMr',0,0,'2010-12-22 03:20:10',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,1,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,285737985,151980800,0,0),(2919,'Krishnamurti',3440,21,21,11,11,11,21,21,11,11,11,'A tall older man stands before you. His hair bright white, almost glowing, is trimed very short. His eyes continually scan the room, still uneasy with his surroundings. He wears a white, double breasted jacket over a berry shirt partially hidden by a simple tie.  The fabric of his clothing looks very soft, and well maintained; the creases appear almost razor sharp running down his pant legs. ',0,0,513,3,'lAEmxjWy',0,0,'2010-12-26 02:32:29',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,2,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,786672,318767128,0,0),(2920,'Xenoath',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,2462,1,'LpElmtLP',0,0,'2010-12-26 16:06:15',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,17039360,185012246,0,0),(2921,'Menal',4480,20,10,10,20,10,22,11,11,22,11,'The stranger walks silently, his dark clothing making his face even darker in the shadows. When light falls upon him, it reveals a fair face often displaying what appears to be a mischievous smirk, capped by dark, well-groomed hair. Before  long, he\'s swallowed again by the shadows, nearly invisible in their confines.',0,0,2463,1,'mP[XqNKX',0,0,'2010-12-26 20:39:20',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,2,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,236003087,0,0),(2922,'Flashing',6329,23,12,12,12,23,23,12,12,12,23,'Skin ablaze collides with white curles that fall all around Deuces\' head.  He wears a simple tunic, and trousers. Both well fitting.  At one time may have been white, but are now an off-grey from the contributing dirt and oils that also reside on his arms.  Various ink designs seem to stretch up his back, peeking in to view as tendrils of designs reach up across his neckline.',0,0,2465,2,'xJtmxzUG',0,0,'2010-12-29 15:51:38',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,3,4,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,524528,488443906,0,0),(2923,'Geo',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10