27:03',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1147120,0,0,0),(3353,'Gabe',404,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Tall, thin with long lime colored hair. Has a long beard with is also leaf colored his eyes are bloodshot and half open.',0,0,2806,3,'cnLTXOSm',0,0,'2011-10-13 14:44:25',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,101449968,134809880,0,0),(3354,'Sky Warp',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'Dressed in decked out attire, looking formal and royal, often with a sturn look on his face.  He looks arrogant with his delicate clean skin.  The only thing detracting from this is an almost artisticaly placed scar on his pretty boy face, and a small blemish on his right cheek and a birth mark on his forehead perfectly above both eyes.  His hair is long and wild which reaches past his shoulders with a prominant pink color to it.',0,0,2304,1,'jTqgije[',0,0,'2011-10-15 13:46:03',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,335806704,2036248,0,0),(3355,'Ashlynn',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,' Although her looks cause her to stand out, with blazing red hair and alluring green eyes, you will almost always find her staying to herself either with her nose in a book or lost in her thoughts. Completely new to this realm, she comes off as shy, but enjoys having somewhere to explore and a place to learn.',0,0,2808,2,'NEYdhbtZ',0,0,'2011-10-15 18:02:28',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,34079745,117704214,0,0),(3356,'Neroveth',9999,24,24,13,13,13,24,24,13,13,13,'His face is covered by a smooth ceramic mask painted black.  No facial features are apparent upon the simple curved surface expect for two round holes at the eyes.  His neck and head are hidden by tightly wrapped black fabric disappearing beneath a full body black cloak with storm trimming.  Only his dark eyes, peering out, give any sign of expression from the man.',0,0,123,3,'eZMPeNey',0,0,'2011-10-16 16:11:22',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,270471199,0,0),(3357,'Jaesyn Grey',4118399,49,29,29,49,29,49,2