ought after by her king, she was commissioned to create an entire mythology legitimizing his reign.  What started as little more than a propaganda piece quickly consumed Lyr\'yl .',0,0,3060,4,'OUIbmRSX',0,0,'2012-06-27 11:44:28',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17827057,219291415,0,0),(3685,'Sunburst',9899,24,20,10,10,10,24,24,13,13,13,'Sunburst has long brown curly hair . She has sparkiling blue eyes that somehow match the tone of her skin. Her mouth in mostly in the shape of a smile. She wears a tight deep red corset decorated with a Red and Yellow owl perched on her shoulder, a bright yellow miniskirt and red tights the same colour as her corset.\r\nShe wears 2 fingerless gloves that go up to her wrists and you can only just see the hilt of a dagger hidden inside her coat.',0,0,3061,3,'MAHHbdhT',0,0,'2012-06-28 23:11:05',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,470549857,83952923,98304,0),(3686,'Vincent',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'A young man of 14 stands before you. Though his body is small and lean his large hands lead you to believe he may have a few growth spirts in his future. His hair is white, short and curly and hangs about his ears. His eyes are an icy blue. His face is long and his jaw square, showing the first signs of stubble. His hands are those of a scholar and show no sign of a single days toil. He is always quick with an awkward smile.',0,0,653,4,'KPTNXVnR',0,0,'2012-06-30 01:01:12',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1048816,33555224,3,0),(3687,'Kiel',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'This tall, scrawny fellow before you looks almost like a scarecrow - if scarecrows traditionally had thin, pale skin instead of burlap.  The wild blonde hair is certainly reminiscent enough of straw and that bright, ragged excuse for an outfit is rather eye-catching.  Speaking of eyes, his can\'t seem to stay put!  Brown as his boots, they dart around curiously, taking in everything and fueling a nearly permanent grin.',0,0,1197,3,'KXufjijG',0,0,'2