late armor covers Kain Greystorm\'s avatar.  The weight of the armor seems trivial by the nimbleness he moves with, making no sound at all.  He carries with him a monsterous glaive polearm attached around his shoulder by a simple leather strap.  At the top a polished curved blade comes to a deadly point.  The polearm\'s shaft is socked with rubies, saphires, and other various gemstones. The bottom of the shaft branches off into two forked razorsharp points.  ',0,0,3137,1,'qxEQKTzd',0,0,'2012-09-08 12:11:02',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520356080,521149973,0,0),(3803,'Theanos',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Born to poor parents from a working caste, Theanos realizes that the only way to raise his station in life is by learning the Arts.',0,0,3139,3,'dqbQg[FU',0,0,'2012-09-08 17:48:17',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880128,18816280,0,0),(3804,'Sashashi',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'A cute, rambunctious Soulmistress.',0,0,3140,3,'RGKvGSgX',0,0,'2012-09-08 19:17:11',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,302777345,218829312,0,0),(3808,'Fistandantilus',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'Appearing to be in his early 30s with a stocky athletic frame and pale skin.  On his belt hangs a dagger on his right hip and a pouch on the left.',0,0,3141,2,'EwfAemSi',0,0,'2012-09-11 01:10:41',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,487063552,270475029,0,0),(3810,'Kasumi Calinon',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Her undeterminable script of a color of hair sways when she moves.  She is beautiful with red and off gold to silver eyes which seem ever alert and watchful.  Some might guess her hair is teal, others might guess it is brick colored, while more might guess it is every color defined into one, yet ever present in its status.  She carries a very long wooden stick with one feather wraped in a loose leather binding on its end.',0,0,1745,3,'uHcdUuOu',0,0,'2012-09-11 13:47:59',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,218891505,521213205,0,0),(3811,'Tar\