ft hand in a claw like fashion. A loin cloth falls to mid calf and intricate tattoos of snake scales and jaguar pelt riddle his avatar.',0,0,1606,3,'EyobHdWq',0,0,'2012-09-18 19:39:38',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,454559515,0,0),(3820,'Neanna',59999,29,29,16,16,16,29,29,16,16,16,'A gaunt young woman who looks to have recently come of age and possesses bright blue eyes that appear to bore into your soul. Her jet black hair hangs messily down to her neck, and she wears heavy robes made of dark green fabric. Around her neck is a blood-stained amulet.',0,0,3112,3,'CMTbbSBY',0,4,'2012-09-19 17:17:06',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520881393,134808600,0,0),(3821,'Sirzha',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,3146,3,'OBICcebC',0,0,'2012-09-20 00:07:53',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880128,117710616,0,0),(3822,'Dill Pepper',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,3147,1,'xJha[GVU',0,0,'2012-09-23 05:23:57',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,33816576,186588935,0,0),(3825,'Kira Windvale',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'A man stands before you six feet in height. Brilliant strands of lavender fall gently over his strikingly beautiful face. Your gaze meets his, as it does his eyes pierce forth in azure and amethyst tones. Upon his body rests a tight fitting leather Emancipated Commander\'s uniform; vest variant. His arms are ringed with tattoos, leading down musclar arms to two thin leather bracelets adorn his wrists. Upon his binding finger rests a thin platinum band, a small teardrop crystal is set into its center.',0,0,3099,2,'jVU[PNSp',0,0,'2012-09-23 19:36:28',83,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,302514416,986902,0,0),(3827,'Shelldora',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'This dreamer\'s mass of tightly-woven, braided hair is gathered and pulled up into a high ponytail. Her odd green colored skin appears moist, as if fresh paint was recently applied. Over her face is a black balaclava, shielding all of her fe