ses, are belong to him.',0,0,3237,1,'XMw[Gn[g',0,0,'2013-02-02 15:02:04',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,50593792,269095681,0,0),(3950,'Onna',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Helpless and alone, easily manipulated by others, yet only wishing to help even when harmed.',0,0,3238,3,'lxZdqXxh',0,0,'2013-02-04 15:20:55',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,218891505,503974424,0,0),(3951,'Tonnot',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,3239,1,'zeYBOxyT',0,0,'2013-02-04 18:45:22',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,251921409,285348375,0,0),(3952,'Sangria',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,3240,3,'RIoyYhIp',0,0,'2013-02-05 08:40:34',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,487326721,251731227,0,0),(3953,'Zinfandel',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'(none)',0,0,3240,2,'nTVcStfm',0,0,'2013-02-05 08:43:21',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,487064577,285282840,0,0),(3954,'Champagne',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'(none)',0,0,3240,4,'PW[bIpkt',0,0,'2013-02-05 08:45:20',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143297,117508378,0,0),(3955,'Barbera',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,3240,1,'BjGDGrIP',0,0,'2013-02-05 08:47:40',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520356865,251726870,0,0),(3956,'Malbec',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,3240,3,'wkVyKnhD',0,0,'2013-02-05 08:49:48',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880128,252251416,0,0),(3957,'Satevar',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'He is dressed plainly in dark leather and soft cotton cloth.  Deep hazel eyes seem to take a keen interest in the ordinary, as though he\'s witnessing something others cannot see.',0,0,3242,3,'cAicFrFV',0,0,'2013-02-07 16:28:21',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,404692504,0,0),(3959,'Stormcrow',44999,28,15,15,15,28,28,15,15,15,28,'This man has dark blue hair that is short and well groomed. His skin is pale, and on close examination has a slightly stony quality. He is dressed in a dark suit of complex robes which fold accross eachother in a complex manner. There is something about him that doesn\'t seem quite right, but you can\'t put your finger on it... ',0,0,3243,2,'XytMrcQd',0,0,'2013-02-09 18:35:29',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,268976368,236920600,0,0),(3961,'Eppy',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'Wonders what befell his beloved Dreamers of Light.',0,0,3004,2,'fpKghLKM',0,0,'2013-02-09 19:29:31',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,503841008,169283358,3,0),(3962,'Rexarok',9999,24,20,10,10,10,24,24,13,13,13,'Tall and tanned with a slim build of average weight.  His short, textured hair matches the coal color of his eyes. A fitted black leather vest is harnessed across his chest in an X from shoulders to belt, opening wide from his neck to reveal the wiry muscle over his collar bones.  A thick, silver furred wolf\'s pelt broadens his shoulders, falling heavily down his back to mid-thigh.  Black leather pants are belted tightly to his waist by a large metal clasp, with tall wolfskin hunting boots below his knees.',0,0,3242,3,'EEIlGyvk',0,0,'2013-02-11 07:26:42',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,404692248,0,0),(3963,'Ethandryl',12499,25,10,10,10,20,25,13,13,13,25,'While this dreamer is obviously newly awakened, you get a sense that he is an old soul.  Something sharp and bright is conveyed through his deep set eyes.  He emanates vibrations of warmth and kindness.',0,0,3004,2,'hvXyz[yz',0,0,'2013-02-12 07:29:17',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,34095344,1904408,0,0),(3964,'Sica',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,' light blue colored hair and an earth dress.',0,0,1763,4,'ABudPf[e',0,0,'2013-02-12 13:15:40',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,185599217,203164696,0,0),(3967,'Medb Nab\'morrigu',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A small pale skinned, woman with long blood-red hair in three warrior braids down her back. Her clothing is forest coloured leathers and fine pelts dyed to match. Intricate blue whorls are tattooed along the length of her arms, with a similar design accenting her eyes, making the jade of them stand out brightly.',0,0,205,1,'MQoFnUTC',0,0,'2013-02-13 12:04:06',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17040385,135994134,0,0),(3968,'Medb nab\'Morrigu',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'(none)',0,0,205,1,'EtkVCn[q',0,0,'2013-02-13 12:08:43',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,263169,0,0,0),(3969,'Shadowkind',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'This dreamer wears a dark hooded robe that obscures his features. He is discernably male, six feet tall, and muscular...although even that is difficult to tell through the thick, obscuring robe. His hands, when they can be seen, are marble white with thick veins of abyss. The light around him always seems to dim slightly, and he cools the air that surrounds him like a giant chunk of melting ice.',0,0,3243,4,'Mi[fkuaO',0,0,'2013-02-13 21:47:36',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,521142272,522133248,0,0),(3970,'Cantrip',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'This carefully crafted Automaton resembles a human male, age 21, with painstaking detail. Although visibly of brass construction, he is so artfully sculpted and crafted as to appear living and even breathing from even a short distance away. His movements are slightly mechanical in nature, but what truly gives him away is the soft whirring sound he emits any time he is not perfectly still. ',0,0,3243,1,'BMcLggJM',0,0,'2013-02-13 21:51:04',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,486801408,438114842,0,0),(3971,'Solomon',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,3247,3,'a[GQhVxo',0,0,'2013-02-15 08:09:29',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,218890240,522001681,0,0),(3972,'Alyzee',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'Her jet-black ringlets, porcelain skin, and large green eyes give her an almost doll-like appearance. She has a slight frame, with her curves all but hidden beneath a large black coat. Beneath her coat, she is clad severe, utilitarian clothes of leather and latex.',0,0,3244,4,'yseIKQMJ',0,0,'2013-02-15 19:57:13',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,521143537,287251712,0,0),(3974,'Roc',4159999,49,29,29,49,29,49,29,29,49,29,'This avatar seems to be an amalgamation of different pieces of essence fused together.  Every major joint of the avatars body has a thin and even line.  The avatar is void of details, other than harsh lines such as broad shoulders, muscle tone, and strong jaw to suggest a male avatar.  The face is smooth and ageless, and the eyes are a blank pale white.  A harness of silk straps wraps around the avatars chest, securing a shimmering shard of a soul essence imbeded into where the avatars heart should be.',0,0,2687,1,'FamTIJSX',0,4,'2013-02-17 15:09:03',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,344304,234881024,0,0),(3975,'Caige',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,3249,3,'KEWP[SRd',0,0,'2013-02-18 05:54:54',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,520880368,1580056,3,0),(3976,'Aislin',0,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,20,'You see an attractive female who is roughly 5\'7\" with long silvery white hair and tan skin. Aislin looks at you and you can\'t help but notice her large violet eyes and long silver lashes. When she turns her head, you see that her ears are slightly pointed. She wears long flowing robes of a semi-opaque lavender material with silver threads worked throughout, which give the appearance of a shimmer when she walks.',0,0,3250,2,'IY[KUObU',0,0,'2013-02-20 17:56:57',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,487064577,303108376,0,0),(3977,'Solris',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Solris appears to be a young boy with short, wavy blonde hair. His skin and clothes are completely pale, almost ghost-like. Despite his apparent youth he does not fidget and moves with a controlled focus. His eyes seem to glow with a reserved intelligence. He speaks with a high, adolescent voice; his words are metered and articulate.',0,0,3248,3,'YNUQAjNT',0,0,'2013-02-20 20:03:52',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,84672512,488447261,0,0),(3978,'Lilyahn',0,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,'A young woman with distinct, angular features that may translate as beauty to some.  Her skin is fair; her figure nubile.  Her eyes have no whites, dominated completely by opaque blackness.  Red hair frames her face, tumbling below her shoulders with a natural wave to it.  Her dress is simple: black silk fitted to her torso, tapering in at her waist before loosening significantly, dragging a few inches upon the floor.  Her voice and pace is slow and typically sing-song; her dialogue often insanity.',0,0,540,4,'[kVdSJGv',0,0,'2013-02-21 12:09:23',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,17827057,522133272,0,0),(3979,'Alco Sayzon',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2685,3,'SKDU[iDy',0,0,'2013-02-22 10:33:09',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,470548480,34936086,0,0),(3980,'Circlain',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'Small brown eyes aset on a small oval face shaped by a mess of auburn hair greet you from the 5\'2\" man before you. He wears a faded brown and green striped suit that once may have spoken of wealth but long ago slipped into disrepair. His lips twist into a smile at each new person he sees.',0,0,332,3,'zHB[edzR',0,0,'2013-02-24 15:00:41',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,436994048,152829983,0,0),(3982,'Valhanz',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'This man stands tall with a lean physique, broad shoulders and slender waist. His indigo eyes are merry, mocking eyes full of life. His rich brown hair is thick and wavy, one heavy wave tumbles jauntily over his forehead.',0,0,3253,3,'aiXPbPCL',0,0,'2013-02-26 19:28:13',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,453771504,505159448,0,0),(3983,'Isha Kinkini',0,20,10,10,20,10,20,10,10,20,10,'A middle aged woman with silvered hair and a clear complexion. Her body is athletic and her eyes speak of a quiet strength. Her simple linen garments largely obscured by a vibrant tabard.',0,0,997,1,'[VvR[tMt',0,0,'2013-02-26 21:04:43',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,263409,101058076,0,0),(3984,'Brandee',0,20,20,10,10,10,20,20,10,10,10,'(none)',0,0,2629,3,'vZGlBrFo',0,0,'2013-02-27 20:23:19',79,'\0',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,520881393,168757781,0,0);
