INSERT INTO `room` VALUES (101,1,'Threshold - Outside The City Of Dreams',1,'The Courtyard Of Awakening','N/A','IDS_KNOW0101',''),(102,1,'Threshold - Outside The City Of Dreams',2,'The Hall of Voices','N/A','IDS_KNOW0102',''),(103,1,'Threshold - Outside The City Of Dreams',3,'The Chamber of Arts','N/A','IDS_KNOW0103','The very air of this chamber shimmers with power and seems to hold a great, ancient knowledge. The exquisite workmanship and excellent condition of the room cry out that creating it was a labor of love.'),(104,1,'Threshold - Outside The City Of Dreams',4,'The Armory','N/A','IDS_KNOW0104',''),(105,1,'Threshold - Outside The City Of Dreams',5,'Sanctuary','N/A','IDS_KNOW0105',''),(106,1,'Threshold - Outside The City Of Dreams',6,'Underlight, City Of Dreams','N/A','IDS_KNOW0106',''),(201,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',1,'The Outer Stairs','-5326;-3317;2','IDS_KNOW0201',''),(202,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',2,'Stair Entrance','4327;-1388;2','IDS_KNOW0202',''),(203,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',3,'Northwest Room','662;2941;2','IDS_KNOW0203',''),(204,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',4,'Northeast Room','4214;3890;2','IDS_KNOW0204',''),(205,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',5,'Southwest Room','413;7793;2','IDS_KNOW0205',''),(206,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',6,'Southeast Room','4062;7593;2','IDS_KNOW0206',''),(207,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',7,'Stair Exit','-4602;6978;2','IDS_KNOW0207',''),(208,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',8,'The Rocky Path','7740;-325;2','IDS_KNOW0208',''),(209,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',9,'The Private Walk','8090;2010;2','IDS_KNOW0209',''),(210,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',10,'The Conquered Field','7256;4968;2','IDS_KNOW0210',''),(211,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',11,'The Battled Field','12034;4680;2','IDS_KNOW0211',''),(212,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',12,'Field Of Friends','13872;2494;2','IDS_KNOW0212',''),(213,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',13,'Field Of Foes','15894;5148;2','IDS_KNOW0213',''),(214,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',14,'Fantasy Falls','17824;7190;2','IDS_KNOW0214',''),(215,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',15,'Forgetful Falls','14881;6114;2','IDS_KNOW0215',''),(216,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',16,'Xun Dal J\'han Vista','22044;1770;2','IDS_KNOW0216','The gentle breeze blowing through the room sings like a flute. Shadows and sunlight dance across the waters below the falls in endless procession. A few small lizards bask on stones in the pool or hide among the red flowers that grow about its edge.'),(217,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',17,'Hidden Falls','18089;1766;2','IDS_KNOW0217',''),(218,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',18,'East Field','1376;-238;2','IDS_KNOW0218',''),(219,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',19,'West Field','9770;6844;2','IDS_KNOW0219',''),(220,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',20,'Far East Field','7246;9438;2','IDS_KNOW0220',''),(221,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',21,'North Field','11677;-3838;2','IDS_KNOW0221',''),(222,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',22,'Far West Field','14775;-7443;2','IDS_KNOW0222',''),(223,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',23,'Four Passage Field','9348;-7481;2','IDS_KNOW0223',''),(224,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',24,'Northeast Ring','5193;-7086;2','IDS_KNOW0224',''),(225,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',25,'Northwest Ring','2132;-6753;2','IDS_KNOW0225',''),(226,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',26,'Southwest Ring','2097;-4681;2','IDS_KNOW0226',''),(227,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',27,'Southeast Ring','4543;-4282;2','IDS_KNOW0227',''),(228,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',28,'Cholok\'s Temple','20862;-4020;2','IDS_KNOW0228',''),(229,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',29,'Gloom Peaks Entrance','2536;-3918;2','IDS_KNOW0229',''),(230,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',30,'Lost Caves Entrance','18354;-2594;2','IDS_KNOW0230',''),(231,2,'Lower Basin Of Stars',31,'Hidden Study','9920;-9632;2','IDS_KNOW0231','A healthy, natural growth of plantlife with an aroma of greenery beckons at your senses. A cool, calming mist invites you into the study and a tranquilizing sound of trickling water surrounds you. A brilliant glow of soft, sparkling dew drops dance around, exuding the effects of splashing water.'),(301,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',1,'The Beaten Path','1404;400;3','IDS_KNOW0301',''),(302,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',2,'Crystal Point','12896;-4894;3','IDS_KNOW0302',''),(303,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',3,'The Easy Bend','9229;1211;3','IDS_KNOW0303',''),(304,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',4,'The Bend','13494;-338;3','IDS_KNOW0304',''),(305,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',5,'The U-Turn','17346;-1051;3','IDS_KNOW0305',''),(306,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',6,'The Arched Gateway','17926;1968;3','IDS_KNOW0306',''),(307,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',7,'Trinity Crossing','14773;1949;3','IDS_KNOW0307',''),(308,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',8,'Trinity Fountain','9773;3990;3','IDS_KNOW0308',''),(309,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',9,'The Grand Walkway','3693;3072;3','IDS_KNOW0309',''),(310,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',10,'Arch Of The Protectors','1033;3377;3','IDS_KNOW0310',''),(311,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',11,'North Water Tunnel','-4546;-931;3','IDS_KNOW0311',''),(312,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',12,'Middle Water Tunnel','-8359;980;3','IDS_KNOW0312','So little light illuminates the room that the waist deep water appears black. Small currents eddy about in a seemingly aimless procession. Something sinuous brushes against your leg below the surface.'),(313,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',13,'South Water Tunnel','-12227;222;3','IDS_KNOW0313',''),(314,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',14,'Outside Sanctuary','-1437;255;3','IDS_KNOW0314',''),(315,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',15,'Secluded Sanctuary','-2004;212;3','IDS_KNOW0315',''),(316,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',16,'Neutral Home Entrance','4864;-4318;3','IDS_KNOW0316',''),(317,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',17,'Neutral Home','17;-4276;3','IDS_KNOW0317',''),(318,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',18,'South Chamber','-3675;-3815;3','IDS_KNOW0318',''),(319,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',19,'West Chamber','-6674;-3673;3','IDS_KNOW0319',''),(320,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',20,'North Chamber','-9539;-3484;3','IDS_KNOW0320',''),(321,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',21,'The Commons Entrance','13258;9114;3','IDS_KNOW0321',''),(322,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',22,'The Commons Hall','8652;9401;3','IDS_KNOW0322',''),(323,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',23,'Eiderdown\'s Chamber','5314;10261;3','IDS_KNOW0323',''),(324,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',24,'Private Room','2057;10334;3','IDS_KNOW0324',''),(325,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',25,'Shanook\'s Chamber','-1475;10244;3','IDS_KNOW0325',''),(326,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',26,'Threshold Way','-7155;5702;3','IDS_KNOW0326','Graceful arches coax your gaze up to the stars of a pastel sky. A warm, gentle breeze carries the scent of flowers and waterfalls gently through the grasses. A pathway of polished stone leads onward to the Gathering of the Entranced.'),(327,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',27,'Pond of Reflections','-13811;4340;3','IDS_KNOW0327',''),(328,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',28,'Unused','N/A','IDS_KNOW0328',''),(329,3,'Upper Basin Of Stars',29,'Dreamseer Guild','-10552;4835;3','IDS_KNOW0329',''),(401,4,'Mt. Illapse',1,'Threshold Way','2043;1502;4','IDS_KNOW0401','Massive rock walls rise up to delineate a path along an escarpment. Strong winds gust from time to time, pushing at you with a strong force. The footpath up the mountain is worn from countless travelers\' steps on its way to the Dreamers of Light.'),(402,4,'Mt. Illapse',2,'Galulin Trail','2587;3099;4','IDS_KNOW0402',''),(403,4,'Mt. Illapse',3,'Dwalag\'s Trail','3572;-6536;4','IDS_KNOW0403',''),(404,4,'Mt. Illapse',4,'Haumos Trail','3786;11717;4','IDS_KNOW0404',''),(405,4,'Mt. Illapse',5,'Jerigigian\'s Trail','8229;-2447;4','IDS_KNOW0405',''),(406,4,'Mt. Illapse',6,'Adae\'s Trail','8111;-8054;4','IDS_KNOW0406',''),(407,4,'Mt. Illapse',7,'Nyradadin\'s Trail','9042;-12071;4','IDS_KNOW0407',''),(408,4,'Mt. Illapse',8,'Legaths Trail','13996;-2948;4','IDS_KNOW0408',''),(409,4,'Mt. Illapse',9,'Gelishes Trail','13849;-7607;4','IDS_KNOW0409',''),(410,4,'Mt. Illapse',10,'Ceann Trail','1437;-13210;4','IDS_KNOW0410',''),(411,4,'Mt. Illapse',11,'Wicare\'s Trail','18603;-2419;4','IDS_KNOW0411',''),(412,4,'Mt. Illapse',12,'Mirdinir\'s Mishap','-4041;-8857;4','IDS_KNOW0412',''),(413,4,'Mt. Illapse',13,'Ollicinid\'s Cavern','-3366;-12190;4','IDS_KNOW0413',''),(414,4,'Mt. Illapse',14,'The Cavern Of Kadardos','-3593;-13886;4','IDS_KNOW0414',''),(415,4,'Mt. Illapse',15,'Riach\'s Hut','-3040;-17382;4','IDS_KNOW0415',''),(416,4,'Mt. Illapse',16,'Cave Of Pabard','-2845;-18502;4','IDS_KNOW0416',''),(417,4,'Mt. Illapse',17,'Camp of Kings','25198;-2915;4','IDS_KNOW0417',''),(418,4,'Mt. Illapse',18,'The Small Dungeon Entrance','19768;-7451;4','IDS_KNOW0418',''),(419,4,'Mt. Illapse',19,'Small Dungeon Left Wing','17882;-10686;4','IDS_KNOW0419',''),(420,4,'Mt. Illapse',20,'Small Dungeon Right Wing','21488;-10493;4','IDS_KNOW0420',''),(421,4,'Mt. Illapse',21,'Forgotten Pits','26937;-7187;4','IDS_KNOW0421',''),(422,4,'Mt. Illapse',22,'Solitude Pits','25393;-9465;4','IDS_KNOW0422',''),(423,4,'Mt. Illapse',23,'Forgotten Grotto','24012;12379;4','IDS_KNOW0423',''),(424,4,'Mt. Illapse',24,'Tiraths Pit','26810;-11990;4','IDS_KNOW0424',''),(425,4,'Mt. Illapse',25,'Padeas Pit','29877;-13651;4','IDS_KNOW0425',''),(426,4,'Mt. Illapse',26,'Illapse Keep Ambuscade (south)','26868;-15226;4','IDS_KNOW0426',''),(427,4,'Mt. Illapse',27,'Illapse Keep','27083;-17918;4','IDS_KNOW0427',''),(428,4,'Mt. Illapse',28,'Illapse Keep Ambuscade (north)','26303;-21074;4','IDS_KNOW0428',''),(429,4,'Mt. Illapse',29,'Ready Room','30106;-18588;4','IDS_KNOW0429',''),(430,4,'Mt. Illapse',30,'Illapse Sanctuary','23070;-18077;4','IDS_KNOW0430',''),(431,4,'Mt. Illapse',31,'Cabal Cache','17862;-14677;4','IDS_KNOW0431',''),(501,5,'Edgeward Barrows',1,'Low Road','3576;7309;5','IDS_KNOW0501',''),(502,5,'Edgeward Barrows',2,'Gold Sanctuary South','4480;4043;5','IDS_KNOW0502',''),(503,5,'Edgeward Barrows',3,'Light Road','1878;3983;5','IDS_KNOW0503',''),(504,5,'Edgeward Barrows',4,'Dark Road','6516;4066;5','IDS_KNOW0504',''),(505,5,'Edgeward Barrows',5,'Gold Sanctuary West','23;4465;5','IDS_KNOW0505',''),(506,5,'Edgeward Barrows',6,'Gold Sanctuary','8631;1953;5','IDS_KNOW0506',''),(507,5,'Edgeward Barrows',7,'Gold Sanctuary East','5540;775;5','IDS_KNOW0507',''),(508,5,'Edgeward Barrows',8,'Gold Sanctuary North','3938;-1562;5','IDS_KNOW0508',''),(509,5,'Edgeward Barrows',9,'The Crossroads','2353;-334;5','IDS_KNOW0509',''),(510,5,'Edgeward Barrows',10,'Road of Sorrow South','7158;-951;5','IDS_KNOW0510',''),(511,5,'Edgeward Barrows',11,'Road of Sorrow North','7273;-4131;5','IDS_KNOW0511',''),(512,5,'Edgeward Barrows',12,'Earth Sanctuary East','3058;-3945;5','IDS_KNOW0512',''),(513,5,'Edgeward Barrows',13,'Free Spirit Sanctuary','-2187;-3874;5','IDS_KNOW0513',''),(514,5,'Edgeward Barrows',14,'Earth Sanctuary South East','-562;-1939;5','IDS_KNOW0514',''),(515,5,'Edgeward Barrows',15,'Earth Sanctuary South West','-2852;-2209;5','IDS_KNOW0515',''),(516,5,'Edgeward Barrows',16,'Earth Sanctuary Road','-5482;-2693;5','IDS_KNOW0516',''),(517,5,'Edgeward Barrows',17,'The Barrows','-6125;5510;5','IDS_KNOW0517',''),(518,5,'Edgeward Barrows',18,'Lake Of Tears South West','-5942;-7829;5','IDS_KNOW0518',''),(519,5,'Edgeward Barrows',19,'Lake Of Tears','-1232;-7062;5','IDS_KNOW0519',''),(520,5,'Edgeward Barrows',20,'The Broken Steps','1521;-6347;5','IDS_KNOW0520',''),(521,5,'Edgeward Barrows',21,'Lake Of Tears South East','1840;-9691;5','IDS_KNOW0521',''),(522,5,'Edgeward Barrows',22,'The Ring Of Passage','4419;-7476;5','IDS_KNOW0522',''),(523,5,'Edgeward Barrows',23,'Lake Of Tears North East','543;-12397;5','IDS_KNOW0523',''),(524,5,'Edgeward Barrows',24,'Lake Of Tears North','-1472;-12570;5','IDS_KNOW0524',''),(525,5,'Edgeward Barrows',25,'Lake Of Tears North West','-4267;-11446;5','IDS_KNOW0525',''),(526,5,'Edgeward Barrows',26,'Path of Justice','-1265;-16591;5','IDS_KNOW0526',''),(527,5,'Edgeward Barrows',27,'Cavern of Tears','-5933;-14564;5','IDS_KNOW0527',''),(528,5,'Edgeward Barrows',28,'Threshold Way','6933;7593;5','IDS_KNOW0528','A wasteland of stone and sand stretches before you. The air is dry and hot. Ancient mounds, worn by time, dot the landscape. A carefully fitted stone path meanders among the natural splendors on its way to the Union of the Covenant.'),(529,5,'Edgeward Barrows',29,'Little Cave','-9106;-5521;5','IDS_KNOW0529',''),(530,5,'Edgeward Barrows',30,'Cave Road','-8913;-251;5','IDS_KNOW0530',''),(601,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',1,'Romance Falls','1157;-1219;6','IDS_KNOW0601','A cobblestone bridge has been constructed here, spanning the river created by the gently flowing waterfall. The majority of the bridge seems to be crafted from marble, abundantly colored by plum, ivory, and all tones in between. The gentle waterfall barely makes a noise despite its size, and the water passing beneath the bridge is nearly silent. The water is crystal clear and between the rocks, various tokens, medallions, coins and other relics seem to have been dropped into it. Midway across the bridge, faint whispering is almost perceivable.'),(602,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',2,'The Twin Trees','3704;-1070;6','IDS_KNOW0602','In the shadows of the stonebark trees, hazy images of animals both familiar and strange blink in and out of being: a stag looks up from drinking and vanishes; a rabbit darts from one tree to the other and disappears; a sprecklefin fish leaps out of the shallow water and with a splash it is gone. The menagerie\'s variety seems endless, though each creature exists only long enough to be noticed.'),(603,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',3,'The Shallow Path','7519;-2220;6','IDS_KNOW0603',''),(604,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',4,'The Tall Falls','11057;-1634;6','IDS_KNOW0604',''),(605,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',5,'Fernix\'s Fountain','11533;1073;6','IDS_KNOW0605',''),(606,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',6,'Drali\'s Drink','1129;3614;6','IDS_KNOW0606','Purity itself flows like water over the falls in this private lagoon, filling the pool with a quiet serenity that is difficult to ignore. The stones are overgrown with brightly flowering vines and thick fern fronds. The air is still, filled with the misty spray of the falls and the rich scent of plant life.'),(607,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',7,'The Covered Stairs','8142;3732;6','IDS_KNOW0607',''),(608,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',8,'Aciawyn\'s Lagoon','6506;1636;6','IDS_KNOW0608',''),(609,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',9,'Aciawyn\'s Point','4711;2159;6','IDS_KNOW0609',''),(610,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',10,'Prigonnor\'s Route','2822;1770;6','IDS_KNOW0610',''),(611,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',11,'Kaorennor\'s Rest','515;5047;6','IDS_KNOW0611',''),(612,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',12,'Gelaten\'s Modest Rock','3497;5630;6','IDS_KNOW0612','A massive stone block pierces the sky; the sky is split open above; a rainfall trickles ceaselessly like a curtain of water, pattering the stone walk. Behind you, in the sparse grass, a forgotten stone pokes through.'),(613,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',13,'The Bridge Of Wishes','6251;5667;6','IDS_KNOW0613','The river\'s gentle waves break upon the bridge\'s time-washed stones. This soft susurration of the waters carries with it memories of wishes whispered by wonderstruck wanderers as they gazed upon the clear sky. The words linger on the edge of comprehension, as though they weren\'t meant to be heard by anyone but the dream itself. The sound entices as if the bridge itself were inviting those who stand upon it to add their own wishes to the water\'s chorus.'),(614,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',14,'Turgin\'s Turn','13371;-326;6','IDS_KNOW0614',''),(615,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',15,'Turgin\'s Rest','16489;-2314;6','IDS_KNOW0615',''),(616,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',16,'Turgin\'s Route','15967;-854;6','IDS_KNOW0616',''),(617,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',17,'Turgin\'s Respite','16443;714;6','IDS_KNOW0617','Partially obscured by foliage, a ring of arcane runes has been carved into the stone, such that it seemingly always lies in the shadow of the pillar. Portions of the carving appear newer than others; sharp, freshly carved runes give way to older runes, as though the entire circle has always been a work in progress kept up by each new generation of dreamers. The oldest of the runes seem to fade into the stone like a half-forgotten idea.'),(618,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',18,'Turgin\'s Point','19406;-2560;6','IDS_KNOW0618',''),(619,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',19,'Ibioc\'s Path','18128;3421;6','IDS_KNOW0619',''),(620,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',20,'Calilnid\'s Path','15952;2455;6','IDS_KNOW0620',''),(621,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',21,'Griecred\'s Place','13690;3841;6','IDS_KNOW0621',''),(622,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',22,'Zilat\'s Rest','12592;5979;6','IDS_KNOW0622',''),(623,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',23,'Karner\'s Secret Cove','13396;1329;6','IDS_KNOW0623','Upon entering, you find ankle-deep water that sparkles and cascades down the hidden waterfall. Small outcroppings of rocks seem to form a safe path down. The spray from the falling water and presence of abundant sunlight cause the perpetual display of an eternal rainbow.'),(624,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',24,'Terranayd\'s Twist','16015;5470;6','IDS_KNOW0624',''),(625,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',25,'Kedarecan\'s Finest Hour','19579;6335;6','IDS_KNOW0625',''),(626,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',26,'Sanctuary Steps','8330;5248;6','IDS_KNOW0626',''),(627,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',27,'Upfalls Sanctuary','8265;8489;6','IDS_KNOW0627','A verdant place, slightly humid with the sweet smell of growing things and the sound of flowing water. Vine trailers poke nearly everywhere from neatly arranged ivy planters. All is prim and well-cared for, and the trickling water imparts a soft, wandering musical quality to the room. Occasional flashes on the walls from the pond allude to sparkling water there, or perhaps little fishes.'),(628,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',28,'Lotholin\'s Polished Way','12210;8743;6','IDS_KNOW0628',''),(629,6,'Lower Lambent Flats',29,'Threshold Way','770;7402;6','IDS_KNOW0629','The turf here is lush and springy, suggestive of marshy conditions. A cool breeze carries the scent of exotic flowers and the cries of birds. A crystalline stream forms a path leading to the Alliance of the Eclipse.'),(701,7,'Higher Lambent Flats',1,'Liavudd\'s Lost Wanderings','2063;489;7','IDS_KNOW0701','Matted reeds crack beneath your footfall as you follow a well-used trail. The noisome vegetation grows in thick clumps, and the ground underfoot is alternately spongy and humped. The buzz of midges and the chirp of frogs remind you that this place teems with dreams not your own.'),(702,7,'Higher Lambent Flats',2,'Peaceful Path','3926;1598;7','IDS_KNOW0702',''),(703,7,'Higher Lambent Flats',3,'Igteus\'s Last Breath','4003;3467;7','IDS_KNOW0703','Detailed mosaics feature organic and metallic components elevating the basic function of the room into a craftsmen paradise. Every detail seems executed in perfection \'cept for a portion reflecting an abrupt end to the fine work. An inscription carved in this area reads, \"My work is never finished. Let my touch not be diminished.\"'),(704,7,'Higher Lambent Flats',4,'Cadilin\'s Charm Hill','7784;4738;7','IDS_KNOW0704','Ageless mounds of earth serve as a platform for thick fields of lavender. Primitive designs made throughout the area play on angles and distance, only allowing their true images to be seen from specific perspectives.'),(705,7,'Higher Lambent Flats',5,'Onirader\'s Waystop','11201;5308;7','IDS_KNOW0705','An elevated viewing room with ancient remains of unfinished projects and cast off tools. Vibrant wildflowers grow in clumps leaning towards various points in the heavens, as if fed by a myriad of celestial bodies.'),(706,7,'Higher Lambent Flats',6,'The Graydus Oasis','14993;3795;7','IDS_KNOW0706','A high, scenic campground with the ancient remains of a building site. Wildflowers ring the grassy edges of the Oasis. Here the air is fresh, the water cascades pure, and the grassy mounds beckon you to linger in rest a moment longer before you push onward.'),(707,7,'Higher Lambent Flats',7,'Short Turn','15309;7774;7','IDS_KNOW0707',''),(708,7,'Higher Lambent Flats',8,'Mirrored Falls','11438;7646;7','IDS_KNOW0708',''),(709,7,'Higher Lambent Flats',9,'Soulmaster Guild','8177;8235;7','IDS_KNOW0709','Bright sunlight twinkles off the waters flowing all about the room. The gentle splashing of the water is muted by the acoustics and altered into the sound of a thousand tiny bells. Leafy green plants hang from the ceiling and bloom with tiny white flowerets. Flashes of silver in the central pool may be fish darting beneath the surface.'),(801,8,'Trinity Plains',1,'Fountain Of Wishes','594;181;8','IDS_KNOW0801',''),(802,8,'Trinity Plains',2,'Trinity Path','3914;1460;8','IDS_KNOW0802',''),(803,8,'Trinity Plains',3,'Kasumi\'s Crossing','6677;828;8','IDS_KNOW0803',''),(804,8,'Trinity Plains',4,'Vorella\'s Higher Path','12133;1133;8','IDS_KNOW0804',''),(805,8,'Trinity Plains',5,'The Resting Columns','7133;-4484;8','IDS_KNOW0805',''),(806,8,'Trinity Plains',6,'Sanctuary 6','2153;-4661;8','IDS_KNOW0806',''),(807,8,'Trinity Plains',7,'Hall Of Medio','6328;-8400;8','IDS_KNOW0807',''),(808,8,'Trinity Plains',8,'Hall Of Bajo','2998;-8529;8','IDS_KNOW0808',''),(809,8,'Trinity Plains',9,'Hall Of Gato','-1100;-7740;8','IDS_KNOW0809',''),(810,8,'Trinity Plains',10,'The Twisted Path','15229;-419;8','IDS_KNOW0810',''),(811,8,'Trinity Plains',11,'The Switchback Steps','15259;-6147;8','IDS_KNOW0811',''),(812,8,'Trinity Plains',12,'The Shaded Steps','15406;-10504;8','IDS_KNOW0812',''),(813,8,'Trinity Plains',13,'The Turning Way','12693;-2833;8','IDS_KNOW0813',''),(814,8,'Trinity Plains',14,'Canyon Path','21035;862;8','IDS_KNOW0814',''),(815,8,'Trinity Plains',15,'Canyon Crossing','22429;-4526;8','IDS_KNOW0815',''),(816,8,'Trinity Plains',16,'Canyon Road','22090;-7189;8','IDS_KNOW0816',''),(817,8,'Trinity Plains',17,'Western Canyon','27919;-6178;8','IDS_KNOW0817',''),(818,8,'Trinity Plains',18,'Eastern Canyon','26626;-3537;8','IDS_KNOW0818',''),(819,8,'Trinity Plains',19,'Jhavilic\'s Peril','-4888;250;8','IDS_KNOW0819',''),(820,8,'Trinity Plains',20,'Path of Hope','-3551;4215;8','IDS_KNOW0820',''),(821,8,'Trinity Plains',21,'Outer Sanctuary','-6741;7973;8','IDS_KNOW0821',''),(822,8,'Trinity Plains',22,'Sanctuary 22','-11196;-7331;8','IDS_KNOW0822',''),(823,8,'Trinity Plains',23,'The Little Bridge','-9646;-2905;8','IDS_KNOW0823',''),(824,8,'Trinity Plains',24,'Ladybug\'s Perseverance','-2249;-254;8','IDS_KNOW0824',''),(825,8,'Trinity Plains',25,'Tjia Tsehai\'s Subterranean','-2588;-13864;8','IDS_KNOW0825','The room radiates an aura of fantasy and mystery, which slowly fades as waves of lucidity infuse the air.'),(901,9,'Trinity Rise',1,'Canyon Path','-423;-807;9','IDS_KNOW0901',''),(902,9,'Trinity Rise',2,'Canyon Turn','-1510;-3746;9','IDS_KNOW0902',''),(903,9,'Trinity Rise',3,'Canyon Fork','-5202;-3514;9','IDS_KNOW0903',''),(904,9,'Trinity Rise',4,'Trinity Road','-4260;1387;9','IDS_KNOW0904',''),(905,9,'Trinity Rise',5,'The Lower Passive River','3367;-815;9','IDS_KNOW0905',''),(906,9,'Trinity Rise',6,'The Upper Passive River','2719;-4680;9','IDS_KNOW0906',''),(907,9,'Trinity Rise',7,'The Passive Pond','-4216;-8268;9','IDS_KNOW0907',''),(908,9,'Trinity Rise',8,'The Crossway','10801;2988;9','IDS_KNOW0908',''),(909,9,'Trinity Rise',9,'The Passage of Pathos','9328;-2301;9','IDS_KNOW0909',''),(910,9,'Trinity Rise',10,'The Tunnel Of Regret','8347;-10472;9','IDS_KNOW0910',''),(911,9,'Trinity Rise',11,'The Damp Passage','2152;-11112;9','IDS_KNOW0911',''),(912,9,'Trinity Rise',12,'The Cave Of Mildew','-1944;-15325;9','IDS_KNOW0912',''),(913,9,'Trinity Rise',13,'The Rotting Cavern','2485;-13069;9','IDS_KNOW0913','Reeking mildew and thick fungus slowly crumble away the hard grey stone of the walls. Rotting vegetation squishes underfoot releasing the thick aroma of decay. The slow drip of water is the only sound as the leakage collects into the depression in the floor. A thin sheen of scum floats on top of the small pool.'),(914,9,'Trinity Rise',14,'The Cave Of Mold','5514;-15900;9','IDS_KNOW0914',''),(915,9,'Trinity Rise',15,'Cave of Pain','10472;-13816;9','IDS_KNOW0915',''),(916,9,'Trinity Rise',16,'Tunnel Caves','14562;-13605;9','IDS_KNOW0916',''),(917,9,'Trinity Rise',17,'The Damp Tunnel','17509;-11432;9','IDS_KNOW0917',''),(918,9,'Trinity Rise',18,'Lower Canyon Tunnel','17316;-4759;9','IDS_KNOW0918',''),(919,9,'Trinity Rise',19,'Lower Canyon Fork','17686;1700;9','IDS_KNOW0919',''),(1001,10,'Trinity Walk',1,'The Rising Path','3493;2218;10','IDS_KNOW1001',''),(1002,10,'Trinity Walk',2,'Cairn of Don Argan','2529;8105;10','IDS_KNOW1002',''),(1003,10,'Trinity Walk',3,'Dagnon\'s Deadly Ground','4202;13731;10','IDS_KNOW1003',''),(1004,10,'Trinity Walk',4,'The Stone Table','-3773;1337;10','IDS_KNOW1004',''),(1005,10,'Trinity Walk',5,'Sanctuary of Dona Cleoperra','-5917;-6197;10','IDS_KNOW1005',''),(1006,10,'Trinity Walk',6,'Torea\'s Vile Respite','-10421;-5448;10','IDS_KNOW1006',''),(1007,10,'Trinity Walk',7,'Sly\'s Chamber','-4909;-2956;10','IDS_KNOW1007',''),(1008,10,'Trinity Walk',8,'Mazentius Hall','-5121;-10328;10','IDS_KNOW1008',''),(1009,10,'Trinity Walk',9,'The Long Curve','9597;12851;10','IDS_KNOW1009',''),(1010,10,'Trinity Walk',10,'Ellie\'s Last Decision','9925;8414;10','IDS_KNOW1010',''),(1011,10,'Trinity Walk',11,'Ellie\'s Final Choice','15096;8275;10','IDS_KNOW1011',''),(1012,10,'Trinity Walk',12,'Steep Passage','17530;3550;10','IDS_KNOW1012',''),(1013,10,'Trinity Walk',13,'A Quiet Place','22589;2676;10','IDS_KNOW1013',''),(1014,10,'Trinity Walk',14,'The Eastern Hill Path','14853;3559;10','IDS_KNOW1014',''),(1015,10,'Trinity Walk',15,'The Western Hill Path','9680;3166;10','IDS_KNOW1015',''),(1016,10,'Trinity Walk',16,'The Open Road','362;-7241;10','IDS_KNOW1016',''),(1017,10,'Trinity Walk',17,'The Left Bend','4155;-6880;10','IDS_KNOW1017',''),(1018,10,'Trinity Walk',18,'The Winding Road','7089;-6216;10','IDS_KNOW1018',''),(1019,10,'Trinity Walk',19,'The Sable Gate','16597;-2589;10','IDS_KNOW1019',''),(1020,10,'Trinity Walk',20,'The U-Turn','8475;-3254;10','IDS_KNOW1020',''),(1021,10,'Trinity Walk',21,'The Bending Road','13416;-5087;10','IDS_KNOW1021',''),(1022,10,'Trinity Walk',22,'Lookout Point','12342;-857;10','IDS_KNOW1022',''),(1101,11,'Trinity Fields',1,'The Hand Of Fate','560;862;11','IDS_KNOW1101',''),(1102,11,'Trinity Fields',2,'The Crossing Paths','4679;-145;11','IDS_KNOW1102',''),(1103,11,'Trinity Fields',3,'Southeast Ring Path','4560;-3381;11','IDS_KNOW1103',''),(1104,11,'Trinity Fields',4,'Southwest Ring Path','-3087;-4758;11','IDS_KNOW1104',''),(1105,11,'Trinity Fields',5,'The Ring Path','1842;7794;11','IDS_KNOW1105',''),(1106,11,'Trinity Fields',6,'The Long Curve','-6841;357;11','IDS_KNOW1106',''),(1107,11,'Trinity Fields',7,'The Tomb Of El-Jinar','7455;-3134;11','IDS_KNOW1107',''),(1108,11,'Trinity Fields',8,'Ellie\'s Entombment','6846;-7662;11','IDS_KNOW1108',''),(1109,11,'Trinity Fields',9,'Ossuary Entrance','5044;-11275;11','IDS_KNOW1109',''),(1110,11,'Trinity Fields',10,'Sanctuary Entrance','12849;-9112;11','IDS_KNOW1110',''),(1111,11,'Trinity Fields',11,'Peaceful Retreat','12558;-4309;11','IDS_KNOW1111',''),(1112,11,'Trinity Fields',12,'South Sanctuary','-10547;-8118;11','IDS_KNOW1112',''),(1113,11,'Trinity Fields',13,'East Sanctuary','-7234;-9392;11','IDS_KNOW1113',''),(1114,11,'Trinity Fields',14,'North Sanctuary','-10599;-13127;11','IDS_KNOW1114',''),(1115,11,'Trinity Fields',15,'West Sanctuary','-13720;-9408;11','IDS_KNOW1115',''),(1116,11,'Trinity Fields',16,'Threshold Way','-7223;-3662;8','IDS_KNOW1116','Columns of rock rise up from the grassy plains. The sounds of myriad insects makes a perpetual hum. A rough dirt track wends its way past open fields, dank caves, and swift flowing rivers to make its way to the Order of the Sable Moon.'),(1117,11,'Trinity Fields',17,'Hall of the Ancients','-12288;-3440;11','IDS_KNOW1117',''),(1201,12,'Evernight Plateau',1,'Little Bridge','-389;-917;12','IDS_KNOW1201',''),(1202,12,'Evernight Plateau',2,'Threshold Way','-651;1499;12','IDS_KNOW1202','Scorched and blackened earth spreads out before you. The gloomy sky hangs low and heavy, blanketing the land in perpetual twilight. An ancient path, clear of ash, leads through the darkened realm towards House Calenture.'),(1203,12,'Evernight Plateau',3,'West Sanctuary','5508;-4132;12','IDS_KNOW1203',''),(1204,12,'Evernight Plateau',4,'The Crossways','12028;-4810;12','IDS_KNOW1204',''),(1205,12,'Evernight Plateau',5,'The Rock Falls','14482;-5290;12','IDS_KNOW1205',''),(1206,12,'Evernight Plateau',6,'Cave Falls','15273;-2705;12','IDS_KNOW1206',''),(1207,12,'Evernight Plateau',7,'Middle Road','13390;1898;12','IDS_KNOW1207',''),(1208,12,'Evernight Plateau',8,'The Falls','9871;323;12','IDS_KNOW1208',''),(1209,12,'Evernight Plateau',9,'Upper Falls','9935;2993;12','IDS_KNOW1209',''),(1210,12,'Evernight Plateau',10,'The Long Road','14228;3716;12','IDS_KNOW1210',''),(1211,12,'Evernight Plateau',11,'The Wall Of Rock','13431;8431;12','IDS_KNOW1211',''),(1212,12,'Evernight Plateau',12,'The Bending Road','15901;11856;12','IDS_KNOW1212',''),(1213,12,'Evernight Plateau',13,'The Great Bridge','11749;15742;12','IDS_KNOW1213',''),(1214,12,'Evernight Plateau',14,'The Twisting Road','9562;19660;12','IDS_KNOW1214',''),(1215,12,'Evernight Plateau',15,'Lower Lake Road','7425;15809;12','IDS_KNOW1215',''),(1216,12,'Evernight Plateau',16,'Lake Road','4673;16863;12','IDS_KNOW1216',''),(1217,12,'Evernight Plateau',17,'Upper Lake Road','5955;19705;17','IDS_KNOW1217',''),(1218,12,'Evernight Plateau',18,'Upper Twisting Road','6420;22978;12','IDS_KNOW1218',''),(1219,12,'Evernight Plateau',19,'High Road','3328;24830;12','IDS_KNOW1219',''),(1220,12,'Evernight Plateau',20,'The Clandestine Path','10429;-7667;12','IDS_KNOW1220',''),(1221,12,'Evernight Plateau',21,'The Cliff','8629;-9462;12','IDS_KNOW1221',''),(1222,12,'Evernight Plateau',22,'The U-Turn','5183;-10816;12','IDS_KNOW1222',''),(1223,12,'Evernight Plateau',23,'Hidden Falls Exit','9800;-2589;12','IDS_KNOW1223',''),(1224,12,'Evernight Plateau',24,'The Black Turn','2596;-7218;12','IDS_KNOW1224',''),(1225,12,'Evernight Plateau',25,'The Dark Turn','5460;-7023;12','IDS_KNOW1225',''),(1226,12,'Evernight Plateau',26,'Sanctuary','6394;-1127;12','IDS_KNOW1226',''),(1227,12,'Evernight Plateau',27,'The Low Curves','18622;-2232;12','IDS_KNOW1227',''),(1228,12,'Evernight Plateau',28,'The High Curves','2082;-6200;12','IDS_KNOW1228',''),(1229,12,'Evernight Plateau',29,'Steps to Sanctuary','8212;-3034;12','IDS_KNOW1229',''),(1230,12,'Evernight Plateau',30,'Calenture Way','1176;23934;12','IDS_KNOW1230',''),(1231,12,'Evernight Plateau',31,'Cache','14759;303;12','IDS_KNOW1231',''),(1232,12,'Evernight Plateau',32,'Chamber of Distraction','12707;-8849;12','IDS_KNOW1232','The night air from the open roof drifts down around you. The walls are splashed with bright colors. There are shelves on all four walls filled with burnt candles, half full vials, herbs, driftwood, and shiny metals. A large table stands in the far corner covered with parchments. The room manifests a scene of evident distraction.'),(1301,13,'West Valley Of Totality',1,'Threshold Way','674;1055;13','IDS_KNOW1301','A deep grand valley opens before you. High above the winds howl like the clamor of battle, while below all is hushed silence. Gigantic monuments of stone, formed in impossible shapes, mark the path leading to the Protectors of Radiance.'),(1302,13,'West Valley Of Totality',2,'The Slopes Of Choregan','-3424;-1328;13','IDS_KNOW1302',''),(1303,13,'West Valley Of Totality',3,'Grehatio\'s Cavern','-9212;1394;13','IDS_KNOW1303',''),(1304,13,'West Valley Of Totality',4,'Bigibwyn\'s Path','-11353;6265;13','IDS_KNOW1304',''),(1305,13,'West Valley Of Totality',5,'Brorev\'s Road','-5354;6185;13','IDS_KNOW1305',''),(1306,13,'West Valley Of Totality',6,'Ibadric\'s Turn','1199;7435;13','IDS_KNOW1306',''),(1307,13,'West Valley Of Totality',7,'Windin\'s Walk','3422;-5896;13','IDS_KNOW1307',''),(1308,13,'West Valley Of Totality',8,'The Toothy Point','-2018;-6292;13','IDS_KNOW1308',''),(1309,13,'West Valley Of Totality',9,'Sanctuary','11319;-7215;13','IDS_KNOW1309',''),(1310,13,'West Valley Of Totality',10,'Hall of Acigot','-11359;4038;13','IDS_KNOW1310',''),(1311,13,'West Valley Of Totality',11,'Study of Erennathnio','-8461;-6019;13','IDS_KNOW1311',''),(1312,13,'West Valley Of Totality',12,'Chamber of Adrenilith','-14144;-5945;13','IDS_KNOW1312',''),(1313,13,'West Valley Of Totality',13,'The Amphitheatre of the Sphere','9106;6165;13','IDS_KNOW1313',''),(1314,13,'West Valley Of Totality',14,'Geicred\'s Shining Road','9388;2958;13','IDS_KNOW1314',''),(1315,13,'West Valley Of Totality',15,'Benny\'s Blue Passage','9747;-1778;13','IDS_KNOW1315',''),(1316,13,'West Valley Of Totality',16,'Sanctuary of Sarsipious','8607;-7962;13','IDS_KNOW1316',''),(1317,13,'West Valley Of Totality',17,'Aria\'s Aware Passage','3389;-9665;13','IDS_KNOW1317',''),(1401,14,'East Valley Of Totality',1,'Jinok\'s Cliff\'s','1885;-188;14','IDS_KNOW1401',''),(1402,14,'East Valley Of Totality',2,'Merandan\'s Dark Mountain','-300;-1680;14','IDS_KNOW1402',''),(1403,14,'East Valley Of Totality',3,'Bright Outlook','-11029;-370;14','IDS_KNOW1403',''),(1404,14,'East Valley Of Totality',4,'Canden\'s Western Cliff','-13247;-7225;14','IDS_KNOW1404','The sky pulses and shifts with an endless rainbow of color that stretches away into infinite distance. The strong breeze against which you must cling precariously to prevent being blown off also carries with it the cries of birds whose nests are made far below in the cliffside.'),(1405,14,'East Valley Of Totality',5,'Canden\'s East Cliff','-5472;-5918;14','IDS_KNOW1405',''),(1406,14,'East Valley Of Totality',6,'Gordizo\'s Grand Entry','3354;-5182;14','IDS_KNOW1406',''),(1407,14,'East Valley Of Totality',7,'The Hall of Glory','8552;-5354;14','IDS_KNOW1407',''),(1408,14,'East Valley Of Totality',8,'The Radiant Gateway','8624;1744;14','IDS_KNOW1408',''),(1409,14,'East Valley Of Totality',9,'West Sanctuary Passage','-16664;-6875;14','IDS_KNOW1409',''),(1410,14,'East Valley Of Totality',10,'Sanctuary','-18552;-1236;14','IDS_KNOW1410',''),(1411,14,'East Valley Of Totality',11,'East Sanctuary Passage','-1436;3013;14','IDS_KNOW1411',''),(1412,14,'East Valley Of Totality',12,'GateKeeper Guild','-850;-3556;14','IDS_KNOW1412',''),(1501,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',1,'Praywwr\'s Path','-637;-1146;15','IDS_KNOW1501',''),(1502,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',2,'Quentio\'s Turn','224;2132;15','IDS_KNOW1502',''),(1503,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',3,'Wuand\'s Turn','-2571;2977;15','IDS_KNOW1503',''),(1504,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',4,'Pandnae\'s Pond','-4397;6230;15','IDS_KNOW1504',''),(1505,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',5,'Whiny\'s Wanderings','-4083;9695;15','IDS_KNOW1505',''),(1506,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',6,'Stone Crossway','4368;5477;15','IDS_KNOW1506',''),(1507,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',7,'Sunroof Cavern','84;7376;15','IDS_KNOW1507',''),(1508,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',8,'Lothordolric\'s Cistern','8127;3307;15','IDS_KNOW1508',''),(1509,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',9,'The Sewer Halls','6118;-8358;15','IDS_KNOW1509',''),(1510,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',10,'Unber\'s Grotto','2654;-4561;15','IDS_KNOW1510',''),(1511,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',11,'The Sweating Hall','-1503;5188;15','IDS_KNOW1511',''),(1512,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',12,'Sepulcher','-557;-7572;15','IDS_KNOW1512',''),(1513,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',13,'The Reservoir','429;-11703;15','IDS_KNOW1513',''),(1514,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',14,'The Reservoir Hall','1788;-14682;15','IDS_KNOW1514',''),(1515,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',15,'The North Sewer','6956;-12807;15','IDS_KNOW1515',''),(1516,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',16,'The South Sewer','6255;-11108;15','IDS_KNOW1516',''),(1517,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',17,'The East Cloud Rocks','14444;-510;15','IDS_KNOW1517','A long-forgotten dreamquake tossed up stones that forgot to fall. They slowly drift and tumble across the sky, clattering against one another and unleashing a riotous thunder unlike anything mere lightning could inspire.'),(1518,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',18,'The West Cloud Rocks','9900;-680;15','IDS_KNOW1518',''),(1519,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',19,'Sanctuary','5590;312;15','IDS_KNOW1519',''),(1520,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',20,'The Rock Passage','7206;-4638;15','IDS_KNOW1520',''),(1521,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',21,'The Ashen Way','14505;-3579;15','IDS_KNOW1521',''),(1522,15,'Lower Umbric Plains',22,'Threshold Way','-4073;1602;15','IDS_KNOW1522','Plantlife of all varieties covers ground and walls. A hazy sky casts muted light and long shadows. A small warm breeze whispers as an indistinct path makes its way in and out of dark tunnels on its way to the Keepers of Eternal Shadow.'),(1601,16,'Upper Umbric Plains',1,'Stone Cloud Crossing','1069;-1013;16','IDS_KNOW1601','A strange gravity teaches stones to defy their nature here. Granite stormclouds threaten to rain down landslides. A chalky, limestone dust fog clings to the water\'s surface.'),(1602,16,'Upper Umbric Plains',2,'Floating Rock Road','-2181;2007;16','IDS_KNOW1602',''),(1603,16,'Upper Umbric Plains',3,'Pebble Path Road','-3457;8240;16','IDS_KNOW1603',''),(1604,16,'Upper Umbric Plains',4,'Lichen Lodge','1403;7253;16','IDS_KNOW1604','Where elsewhere in the city vegetation overgrows rocks, here it is the rocks that have been planted, like beige seeds struggling to find enough sunlight within the uncontrolled mass of verdant fungal growth. The thick walls of lichens have been carved and shaped to allow passage, though its abundant growth threatens to retake the pathway at any time.'),(1605,16,'Upper Umbric Plains',5,'The Garrison','1554;3570;16','IDS_KNOW1605',''),(1606,16,'Upper Umbric Plains',6,'Bellenter\'s Betrayal','4857;7064;16','IDS_KNOW1606',''),(1607,16,'Upper Umbric Plains',7,'Vents of Valador','10499;7384;16','IDS_KNOW1607','A long, hot hiss escapes the vents, like a soul breaking free of its prison of a body, filling the room with a sticky humidity. The shadows on the stone flicker and waver with a heat that resents the wan light streaming in from above.'),(1608,16,'Upper Umbric Plains',8,'The Shadow Gates','11907;4154;16','IDS_KNOW1608','Shadows made of secrets stretch longer than the ambient light would allow, reaching out to grasp new knowledge and add it to themselves. Gnawing uncertainty hangs like a gossamer veil from each archway, separating familiar from strange, known from unknown, past from future.'),(1609,16,'Upper Umbric Plains',9,'Lost Crossing','4925;2494;16','IDS_KNOW1609',''),(1701,17,'House Calenture',1,'Initiates Entrance','-479;35;17','IDS_KNOW1701',''),(1702,17,'House Calenture',2,'Initiate Missions','-407;3100;17','IDS_KNOW1702',''),(1703,17,'House Calenture',3,'Initiate Lounge','1;5235;17','IDS_KNOW1703',''),(1704,17,'House Calenture',4,'Mustering Hall','1681;2156;17','IDS_KNOW1704',''),(1705,17,'House Calenture',5,'Master Armory','4368;-7248;17','IDS_KNOW1705',''),(1706,17,'House Calenture',6,'Essence Storage','2243;-1477;17','IDS_KNOW1706',''),(1707,17,'House Calenture',7,'Maze 7','8176;-5712;17','IDS_KNOW1707',''),(1708,17,'House Calenture',8,'Master Vault','8016;-8064;17','IDS_KNOW1708',''),(1709,17,'House Calenture',9,'Sanctuary','-336;-3794;17','IDS_KNOW1709',''),(1710,17,'House Calenture',10,'Facade (unused)','-1236;8127;17','IDS_KNOW1710',''),(1711,17,'House Calenture',11,'Gathering Hall','2864;6124;17','IDS_KNOW1711',''),(1712,17,'House Calenture',12,'Ruler Meeting Room 1','13450;-6024;17','IDS_KNOW1712',''),(1713,17,'House Calenture',13,'Initiate Meeting Room','13424;-4128;17','IDS_KNOW1713',''),(1714,17,'House Calenture',14,'The Patrol Center','13435;-1595;17','IDS_KNOW1714',''),(1715,17,'House Calenture',15,'Forward Armory','13442;629;17','IDS_KNOW1715',''),(1716,17,'House Calenture',16,'Ruler Meeting Room 2','16567;-6021;17','IDS_KNOW1716',''),(1717,17,'House Calenture',17,'Guardian Meeting Room','13376;-1984;17','IDS_KNOW1717',''),(1718,17,'House Calenture',18,'The Teaching Hall','16575;-1285;17','IDS_KNOW1718',''),(1719,17,'House Calenture',19,'Forward Vault','16395;1076;17','IDS_KNOW1719',''),(1720,17,'House Calenture',20,'Guardian Entrance','6708;-1082;17','IDS_KNOW1720',''),(1721,17,'House Calentu