f Stars',5,'Fayd\'s Fortress','9801;-3542;19','IDS_KNOW1905',''),(1906,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',6,'The Main Hall','13142;-5978;19','IDS_KNOW1906',''),(1907,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',7,'The Private Meeting Room','13873;-2645;19','IDS_KNOW1907',''),(1908,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',8,'The Mediation Chamber','16167;-5955;19','IDS_KNOW1908',''),(1909,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',9,'The Study','13950;-8198;19','IDS_KNOW1909',''),(1910,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',10,'The Small Bend','10125;-6588;19','IDS_KNOW1910',''),(1911,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',11,'The Switchback','7442;-7077;19','IDS_KNOW1911',''),(1912,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',12,'Basin Lower Road','5264;-4203;19','IDS_KNOW1912',''),(1913,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',13,'Basin Middle Road','2483;-4678;19','IDS_KNOW1913',''),(1914,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',14,'Basin High Road','2426;-8677;19','IDS_KNOW1914',''),(1915,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',15,'The Lazy Turn','-1407;-3798;19','IDS_KNOW1915',''),(1916,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',16,'Upper Basin Road','-812;-8376;19','IDS_KNOW1916',''),(1917,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',17,'The Hidden Path','10230;-9948;19','IDS_KNOW1917',''),(1918,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',18,'The East Lagoon','10330;-13934;19','IDS_KNOW1918',''),(1919,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',19,'Intrigue\'s Rest','5149;-14427;19','IDS_KNOW1919',''),(1920,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',20,'Lower Basin Road','6851;-10522;19','IDS_KNOW1920',''),(1921,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',21,'Outer Sanctuary','1407;-13653;19','IDS_KNOW1921',''),(1922,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',22,'WishBringer\'s Ice Palace','-3243;-11878;19','IDS_KNOW1922',''),(1923,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',23,'The Bridge Of Memories','-4892;-9678;19','IDS_KNOW1923',''),(1924,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',24,'Spider Rock','-4328;-4240;19','IDS_KNOW1924',''),(1925,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',25,'The Lower Basin River','-3390;1526;19','IDS_KNOW1925',''),(1926,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',26,'The Middle Basin River','-11818;-217;19','IDS_KNOW1926',''),(1927,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',27,'The Upper Basin River','-9847;-3237;19','IDS_KNOW1927',''),(1928,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',28,'The Horseshoe Staircase','-9022;-13849;19','IDS_KNOW1928',''),(1929,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',29,'West Lagoon Road','4000;-1563;19','IDS_KNOW1929',''),(1930,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',30,'West Road','-211;-16036;19','IDS_KNOW1930',''),(1931,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',31,'The Flask and Chak','8970;5866;19','IDS_KNOW1931',''),(1932,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',32,'Secret Cache','-4195;-15781;19','IDS_KNOW1932',''),(1933,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',33,'Secret Maze','-4298;-18613;19','IDS_KNOW1933',''),(1934,19,'Middle Basin Of Stars',34,'WishBringer\'s Private Retreat','-8574;-17186;19','IDS_KNOW1934',''),(2001,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',1,'Dreamers of Light','1430;-284;20','IDS_KNOW2001','Bright salvation shines like a beacon of hope in the mind. Symbols of times forgotten remain bright and untarnished. Power and age seem to flow from the stone of the walls.'),(2002,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',2,'Dreamers, Union Hall','1482;-3412;20','IDS_KNOW2002',''),(2003,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',3,'Union of the Covenant','673;-5940;20','IDS_KNOW2003','The power of sanctuary seems amplified more than usual here. The openness of the floor seems to portray a military parade ground being readied for the freedom of movement needed by a pair of duelists. Thick granite walls present a look of unyielding strength.'),(2004,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',4,'Union, Alliance Hall','1740;-8439;20','IDS_KNOW2004',''),(2005,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',5,'Alliance of the Eclipse','1650;-11511;20','IDS_KNOW2005','A radiant sense of peace and warmth pervades the atmosphere here, the gentle colors are pleasing to the eye. The hand-woven tapestries that hang from the ceiling are of exceptional quality and show a master artist\'s touch.'),(2006,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',6,'Alliance, Order Hall','4656;-11592;20','IDS_KNOW2006',''),(2007,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',7,'Order of the Sable Moon','7126;-12523;20','IDS_KNOW2007','The musty scent of old books lends this room the feel of an ancient library. The floor is clean and spacious, seeming almost ready for apparatus of experimentation to be placed. The myriad designs on the walls evoke the possibilities of understanding the unknown.'),(2008,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',8,'Order, Calenture Hall','9429;-12206;20','IDS_KNOW2008',''),(2009,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',9,'House Calenture','12961;-11679;20','IDS_KNOW2009','A sense of strength permeates throughout the room. The large regular tiles that mark the floor demonstrate an even hand and careful eye. Striated rock forms walls reminiscent of a hall of judgment.'),(2010,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',10,'Calenture, Protectors Hall','12560;-8706;20','IDS_KNOW2010',''),(2011,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',11,'Protectors of the Radiance','13474;-6080;20','IDS_KNOW2011','A sense of purpose charges the air in this room. The golden tiles of the floor sparkle with an inner energy. Rough hewn but solid walls impart a feeling of valor unquenchable.'),(2012,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',12,'Protectors, Keepers Hall','1242;-3444;20','IDS_KNOW2012',''),(2013,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',13,'Keepers of Eternal Shadow','12908;-350;20','IDS_KNOW2013','Silence, like a palpable thing, resides in this room. All is laid out with a careful eye to remain random. The murals across the walls speak of stories more ancient than memory and more real than life.'),(2014,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',14,'Keepers, Gathering Hall','9725;-438;20','IDS_KNOW2014',''),(2015,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',15,'Gathering of the Entranced','7263;612;20','IDS_KNOW2015','The quiet sanctity of this room lends the feeling of a temple. The floor is mottled but unbroken like a foundation built of faith. Careful geometric marks seem to hold mysteries beyond their appearance.'),(2016,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',16,'Gathering, Dreamers Hall','4633;174;20','IDS_KNOW2016',''),(2017,20,'Threshold, Gateway to the Dream City',17,'Provenance','7309;-6725;20','IDS_KNOW2017',''),(2101,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',1,'Main Entrance (unused)','5959;2664;21','IDS_KNOW2101',''),(2102,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',2,'Gathering Hall','397;-2879;21','IDS_KNOW2102',''),(2103,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',3,'Center Hall','1715;10034;21','IDS_KNOW2103',''),(2104,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',4,'Sanctuary','416;-5602;21','IDS_KNOW2104',''),(2105,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',5,'Initiate Lounge','3029;-6333;21','IDS_KNOW2105',''),(2106,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',6,'Initiate Missions','3825;-9232;21','IDS_KNOW2106',''),(2107,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',7,'Initiate Entrance','3619;-12291;21','IDS_KNOW2107',''),(2108,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',8,'Guardian Lounge','-2360;-6801;21','IDS_KNOW2108',''),(2109,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',9,'Protectors Of Radiance Hall','640;-12912;21','IDS_KNOW2109',''),(2110,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',10,'Guardian Missions','-2280;-10001;21','IDS_KNOW2110',''),(2111,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',11,'Guardian Entrance','-2881;-12428;21','IDS_KNOW2111',''),(2112,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',12,'Circle Of Rulers Entrance','879;-18446;21','IDS_KNOW2112',''),(2113,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',13,'Circle Of Rulers Lounge','860;-15410;21','IDS_KNOW2113',''),(2114,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',14,'Circle Of Rulers Voting Hall','-1752;-15533;21','IDS_KNOW2114',''),(2115,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',15,'Celebration Hall','3165;-3487;21','IDS_KNOW2115',''),(2116,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',16,'Essence Room','-2197;-3411;21','IDS_KNOW2116',''),(2117,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',17,'Guardians Meeting Room','6788;-11559;21','IDS_KNOW2117',''),(2118,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',18,'Rulers Meeting Room','8819;-11689;21','IDS_KNOW2118',''),(2119,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',19,'West Meeting Room','6738;-9673;21','IDS_KNOW2119',''),(2120,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',20,'East Meeting Room','8896;-9473;21','IDS_KNOW2120',''),(2121,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',21,'The Patrol Room','6698;-7436;21','IDS_KNOW2121',''),(2122,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',22,'Forward Meeting Room','8795;-7527;21','IDS_KNOW2122',''),(2123,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',23,'Forward Armory','6685;-5408;21','IDS_KNOW2123',''),(2124,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',24,'The Teaching Hall','8796;-5283;21','IDS_KNOW2124',''),(2125,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',25,'Maze 25','4592;-16640;21','IDS_KNOW2125',''),(2126,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',26,'Armory','4528;-18384;21','IDS_KNOW2126',''),(2127,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',27,'Vault','7872;-18880;21','IDS_KNOW2127',''),(2128,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',28,'Maze 28','8016;-15664;21','IDS_KNOW2128',''),(2129,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',29,'Maze 29','10736;-16752;21','IDS_KNOW2129',''),(2130,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',30,'Library of Radiance','12064;-12335;21','IDS_KNOW2130',''),(2131,21,'Protectors Of The Radiance',31,'Main Entrance','5136;-243;21','IDS_KNOW2131',''),(2201,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',1,'Main Entrance (unused)','-4131;-858;22','IDS_KNOW2201',''),(2202,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',2,'Gathering Hall','728;-4471;22','IDS_KNOW2202','A disembodied clack-clack-clack, like a calculating abacus, echos through the room, adding a rhythmic back note to a steady hum of energy radiating from the depths of the stronghold. The stone is gently worn, giving indication of movement throughout the house.'),(2203,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',3,'Center Hall','971;-6158;22','IDS_KNOW2203','Light reflects off grand mosaic walls with elevated alcoves which radiating subtle energy from within. Pillars reaching to the sky seem to cast off unique icons related to the artifacts in the sky giving clue of a higher celestial relationship.'),(2204,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',4,'Celebration Hall','823;-10459;22','IDS_KNOW2204','Water, thick with living nutrient, flows through the room and off towards unknown filtration areas. Situated to allow for a showcase of floating displays, the center portion of the room stands out as it is uniquely lit by the heavens.'),(2205,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',5,'Maze','592;-14848;22','IDS_KNOW2205',''),(2206,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',6,'Initiate Lounge','-2318;-4337;22','IDS_KNOW2206','Training dummies and worn scrolls litter the room, some more worn than others. Cheeky comments featuring the names of dreamers - some familiar and some not - accent the walls, suggesting a place of raucous camaraderie and study.'),(2207,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',7,'Initiate Missions','-3085;-777;22','IDS_KNOW2207',''),(2208,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',8,'Initiate Entrance','-2742;-9702;22','IDS_KNOW2208',''),(2209,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',9,'Guardian Lounge','3675;-4080;22','IDS_KNOW2209','Worn foot marks speak to the pacing strides of thoughtful visitors. Scorch marks scattered about the room give indication of the Star\'s resting place. Though the room shows obvious signs of traffic the corners are decorated with lounge pillows and countless journals depicting algorithms and training exercises.'),(2210,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',10,'Guardian Missions','4586;-7038;22','IDS_KNOW2210',''),(2211,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',11,'Guardian Entrance','4679;-9987;22','IDS_KNOW2211',''),(2212,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',12,'West Meeting Room','8388;-9273;22','IDS_KNOW2212',''),(2213,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',13,'Forward Patrol Center','8178;-6203;22','IDS_KNOW2213',''),(2214,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',14,'East Meeting Room','1122;-8841;22','IDS_KNOW2214',''),(2215,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',15,'The Teaching Hall','10795;-9525;22','IDS_KNOW2215',''),(2216,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',16,'Sanctuary','7061;-13696;22','IDS_KNOW2216','Warm water moves through the room, faintly smelling of metal and ozone. The metallic details of the wall seem perpetually poilshed and offer strangely distorted reflections of anyone nearby, like twisted mirrors of reality.'),(2217,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',17,'Armory','-4014;-14932;22','IDS_KNOW2217',''),(2218,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',18,'Vault','6952;-15892;22','IDS_KNOW2218',''),(2219,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',19,'Ruler\'s South Entrance','-6802;-4272;22','IDS_KNOW2219',''),(2220,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',20,'Circle Of Rulers Lounge','-5813;-7272;22','IDS_KNOW2220',''),(2221,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',21,'Ruler\'s North Entrance','-5973;-9694;22','IDS_KNOW2221',''),(2222,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',22,'Circle Of Rulers Goal Room','-9514;-6792;22','IDS_KNOW2222',''),(2223,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',23,'Power Room','3400;-1802;22','IDS_KNOW2223',''),(2224,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',24,'Under Hall','6515;-879;22','IDS_KNOW2224',''),(2225,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',25,'Astronomy Lab','9077;-839;22','IDS_KNOW2225',''),(2226,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',26,'Rulers Meeting Room','-2140;-19723;22','IDS_KNOW2226',''),(2227,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',27,'The Atrium','-4538;-17537;22','IDS_KNOW2227',''),(2228,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',28,'Guardians Meeting Room','-7470;-1769;22','IDS_KNOW2228',''),(2229,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',29,'Alliance Of The Eclipse Hall','-7120;-14117;22','IDS_KNOW2229',''),(2230,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',30,'Library of the Eclipse','9711;-11319;22','IDS_KNOW2230','Tender warmth like a friendly hug emanates from the center icon of the Eclipse. At the edge of hearing and sight whispers the constant scratch of stylus to parchment and unique sound of thick tomes falling shut. The scent of oiled leather and unseen fire tickles at the nose.'),(2231,22,'Alliance Of The Eclipse',31,'Main Entrance','-4058;1758;22','IDS_KNOW2231',''),(2301,23,'Gathering Of The Entranced',1,'Main Entrance (unused)','4956;-403;23','IDS_KNOW2301',''),(2302,23,'Gathering Of The Entrance