oon',29,'Essence Room','-664;3057;25','IDS_KNOW2529',''),(2530,25,'Order Of The Sable Moon',30,'Order Of The Sable Moon Hall','-3000;-400;25','IDS_KNOW2530',''),(2531,25,'Order Of The Sable Moon',31,'Forward Armory','-70086;11732;25','IDS_KNOW2531',''),(2601,26,'Union Of The Covenant',1,'Main Entrance (unused)','4706;-3504;26','IDS_KNOW2601',''),(2602,26,'Union Of The Covenant',2,'Gathering Hall','229;-2667;26','IDS_KNOW2602','A dark marble pavilion is flanked all about by portals. Overhead, the bright sky shines warmly on sandstone floors and walls.'),(2603,26,'Union Of The Covenant',3,'Center Hall','242;-6448;26','IDS_KNOW2603','Splashing water sounds and brilliantly sky-lit central spaces lead to shadowed portals. Murals overhead depict a tall lady in long flowing robes surveying the expanses below.'),(2604,26,'Union Of The Covenant',4,'Initiate Lounge','-2710;-2767;26','IDS_KNOW2604','Soft lit sand stone walls are hung with tapestries depicting Initiates, Guardians and Rulers of the Union in amicable discussion. A slender, long haired woman balancing an amphora on her shoulder watches from the background.'),(2605,26,'Union Of The Covenant',5,'Initiate Missions','-3479;-6395;26','IDS_KNOW2605',''),(2606,26,'Union Of The Covenant',6,'Initiate Entrance','-2771;-8224;26','IDS_KNOW2606',''),(2607,26,'Union Of The Covenant',7,'Guardian Lounge','3033;-3347;26','IDS_KNOW2607',''),(2608,26,'Union Of The Covenant',8,'Guardian Missions','3190;-6421;26','IDS_KNOW2608',''),(2609,26,'Union Of The Covenant',9,'Guardian Entrance','3741;-9408;26','IDS_KNOW2609',''),(2610,26,'Union Of The Covenant',10,'Circle Of Rulers Lounge','128;-11699;26','IDS_KNOW2610',''),(2611,26,'Union Of The Covenant',11,'Circle Of Rulers Entrance','3094;-11615;26','IDS_KNOW2611',''),(2612,26,'Union Of The Covenant',12,'Circle Of Rulers Goal Room','-2290;-11580;26','IDS_KNOW2612',''),(2613,26,'Union Of The Covenant',13,'Celebration Hall','1192;-9982;26','IDS_KNOW2613','Bright beams of light, sombre shadows and dancing motes of dust amplify the vaulted spaces of this cavernous, silent room.'),(2614,26,'Union Of The Covenant',14,'Essence Room','-873;-8770;26','IDS_KNOW2614','Three portals adorn three walls. The fourth wall, curiously bare, is flanked by two statues of a tall, slender woman.'),(2615,26,'Union Of The Covenant',15,'Rulers Meeting Room','-4276;-9163;26','IDS_KNOW2615',''),(2616,26,'Union Of The Covenant',16,'The Patrol Room','-6454;-9197;26','IDS_KNOW2616',''),(2617,26,'Union Of The Covenant',17,'Guardians Meeting Room','-5589;-5642;26','IDS_KNOW2617',''),(2618,26,'Union Of The Covenant',18,'The Teachers Hall','-7853;-5718;26','IDS_KNOW2618',''),(2619,26,'Union Of The Covenant',19,'Maze 19','-5025;-4047;26','IDS_KNOW2619',''),(2621,26,'Union Of The Covenant',21,'Forward Armory (unused)','-6984;3338;26','IDS_KNOW2621',''),(2622,26,'Union Of The Covenant',22,'Maze 22','848;3024;26','IDS_KNOW2622',''),(2623,26,'Union Of The Covenant',23,'Maze 23','-4461;-197;26','IDS_KNOW2623',''),(2624,26,'Union Of The Covenant',24,'Vault','4544;1026;26','IDS_KNOW2624',''),(2625,26,'Union Of The Covenant',25,'Union Hall','-4940;-10043;26','IDS_KNOW2625',''),(2626,26,'Union Of The Covenant',26,'Sanctuary','-2903;-9692;26','IDS_KNOW2626',''),(2627,26,'Union Of The Covenant',27,'Athenaeum','-7863;267;26','IDS_KNOW2627',''),(2628,26,'Union Of The Covenant',28,'Main Entrance','4706;-3504;26','IDS_KNOW2628',''),(2629,26,'Union Of The Covenant',29,'Armory','-7019;1882;26','IDS_KNOW2629',''),(2630,26,'Union Of The Covenant',30,'Forward Armory','-5024;1968;26','IDS_KNOW2630','The ancient stone walls of this armory are engraved with four full length bas reliefs of people. Above each is carved a simple balance. The first shows a smiling, slender man. He holds a leafy twig in his right hand. Beneath his feet is the inscription \"Chance\". The second bas relief shows a tall, stern faced woman. She wears a necklace of tear shaped crystals, and a blade at her belt. Her inscription reads \"Takana\". The third image shows a man in warrior\'s leathers. He holds a dove between his hands, and a round shield rests against his legs. His legend reads \"Tierlan\". The last engraving is of a slender man in silken robes. In his right hand he holds a tongue of flame, and his left grasps a wine bottle. His inscription reads \"Sigwulf.\"'),(2701,27,'Albino Caves',1,'Sanctuary','8676;-514;27','IDS_KNOW2701','The air here is dank and cold. Where elsewhere even the slightest hum of energy can be felt, this place is utterly lifeless. A sense of loss and foreboding hangs in the atmosphere like a dark spectre.'),(2702,27,'Albino Caves',2,'Fester\'s River','6291;-414;27','IDS_KNOW2702',''),(2703,27,'Albino Caves',3,'Temple Of Tsthogua','6430;1695;27','IDS_KNOW2703',''),(2704,27,'Albino Caves',4,'Ivory Palace','4061;1797;27','IDS_KNOW2704',''),(2705,27,'Albino Caves',5,'Chalk Cavern','2289;120;27','IDS_KNOW2705',''),(2706,27,'Albino Caves',6,'Addycyn\'s Alcoves','-551;722;27','IDS_KNOW2706',''),(2707,27,'Albino Caves',7,'Ivory Cave','-3355;2082;27','IDS_KNOW2707',''),(2708,27,'Albino Caves',8,'Sedd\'s Final Sight','-6771;786;27','IDS_KNOW2708',''),(2709,27,'Albino Caves',9,'Vile Retreat','-9875;-602;27','IDS_KNOW2709',''),(2710,27,'Albino Caves',10,'Cydoc\'s Oozing Remains','-9058;2422;27','IDS_KNOW2710',''),(2711,27,'Albino Caves',11,'The Peaceful Grotto','-175;2096;27','IDS_KNOW2711',''),(2712,27,'Albino Caves',12,'Cararan\'s Ledge','-5423;4506;27','IDS_KNOW2712',''),(2713,27,'Albino Caves',13,'Isolion\'s Vista','63;5748;27','IDS_KNOW2713',''),(2714,27,'Albino Caves',14,'The River Of Feyward','-3414;7556;27','IDS_KNOW2714',''),(2715,27,'Albino Caves',15,'Small Cave','993;8731;27','IDS_KNOW2715',''),(2716,27,'Albino Caves',16,'The Whirlpool','3539;7580;27','IDS_KNOW2716',''),(2717,27,'Albino Caves',17,'Aristoe\'s Reflective Room','-1119;11439;27','IDS_KNOW2717',''),(2718,27,'Albino Caves',18,'The Churning Depths','-89;9122;27','IDS_KNOW2718',''),(2719,27,'Albino Caves'