nd convey a sense of claustrophobia. The hot damp air is suffocating.'),(3704,37,'Lower Cairn Of Sorrow',4,'Anelinde\'s Prison','1237;1661;37','IDS_KNOW3704','A horrid stench permeates the air here. The scarce light sends ugly shadows jumping against cobwebbed walls, their surfaces damp with mold, fungus, and decay.'),(3705,37,'Lower Cairn Of Sorrow',5,'Far West Passage','-3400;-235;37','IDS_KNOW3705',''),(3706,37,'Lower Cairn Of Sorrow',6,'North Passage','-3285;-1743;37','IDS_KNOW3706',''),(3707,37,'Lower Cairn Of Sorrow',7,'Edgeward Barrows Exit','-4936;-3856;37','IDS_KNOW3707',''),(3708,37,'Lower Cairn Of Sorrow',8,'East Wing Entrance','1377;-6808;37','IDS_KNOW3708',''),(3709,37,'Lower Cairn Of Sorrow',9,'West Wing Entrance','-2360;-6965;37','IDS_KNOW3709',''),(3710,37,'Lower Cairn Of Sorrow',10,'Nowyn\'s Situation','777;-9318;37','IDS_KNOW3710',''),(3801,38,'Lower Ossuary Of Dread',1,'Pagas\'s Room','1685;1315;38','IDS_KNOW3801',''),(3802,38,'Lower Ossuary Of Dread',2,'The Western Corridor','-507;-514;38','IDS_KNOW3802',''),(3803,38,'Lower Ossuary Of Dread',3,'The Alcoves Of Arranor','1814;-2189;38','IDS_KNOW3803',''),(3804,38,'Lower Ossuary Of Dread',4,'Vernio\'s Chamber','7322;679;38','IDS_KNOW3804',''),(3805,38,'Lower Ossuary Of Dread',5,'The Grieving Hall','10117;2432;38','IDS_KNOW3805',''),(3806,38,'Lower Ossuary Of Dread',6,'The Chamber Of The Timid','13972;-1943;38','IDS_KNOW3806',''),(3807,38,'Lower Ossuary Of Dread',7,'Cache','3464;-5022;38','IDS_KNOW3807',''),(3901,39,'Threshold Pits',1,'Bogrom\'s Lair','7040;-4193;39','IDS_KNOW3901',''),(3902,39,'Threshold Pits',2,'Main Stairs','1354;2385;39','IDS_KNOW3902',''),(3903,39,'Threshold Pits',3,'The Lower Hall','1091;6099;39','IDS_KNOW3903',''),(3904,39,'Threshold Pits',4,'Path of Honor','3882;9142;39','IDS_KNOW3904',''),(3905,39,'Threshold Pits',5,'Chamber of Fate','3252;3135;39','IDS_KNOW3905',''),(3906,39,'Threshold Pits',6,'The Crumbled Way','-1575;8704;39','IDS_KNOW3906',''),(3907,39,'Threshold Pits',7,'Cave Of Crystals','-1398;12608;39','IDS_KNOW3907','Faceted natural gemstones inlay the very walls of this sandy-bottomed chamber. The radiance of the crystals creates a cascading shimmer at your peripheral vision. The would-be silence of the cavern is corrupted by the nearby thrum of a flow of water.'),(3908,39,'Threshold Pits',8,'The Broken Hall','-4317;6736;39','IDS_KNOW3908',''),(3909,39,'Threshold Pits',9,'The Waterhole','-2996;16346;39','IDS_KNOW3909','The reverberating echo of the cascading water drowns any other sounds and voices. A sense of ancient secrets and grounded power immerses the room like the torrent falling from above, and dry dust at the wall\'s edge confirms this to be an old place.'),(3910,39,'Threshold Pits',10,'Dueler\'s Respite','7304;6592;39','IDS_KNOW3910',''),(3911,39,'Threshold Pits',11,'Dueling Arena','12050;5984;39','IDS_KNOW3911',''),(3912,39,'Threshold Pits',12,'Armory Steps','4237;6807;39','IDS_KNOW3912',''),(3913,39,'Threshold Pits',13,'Grand Forge','4531;3642;39','IDS_KNOW3913','A glance out the windows reveals this to be the apex of a tower of nigh-impossible height, far above the Pits below. A low, rolling rumble emanates from the three columns around the room and causes the floor and walls to vibrate rhythmically. The stones of the central column are unnaturally cool to the touch, however a pulsing flow of heat at its heart feeds the roaring flame at its summit.'),(3914,39,'Threshold Pits',14,'Upper Spiral Staircase','-6624;5542;39','IDS_KNOW3914','Down the steps you go, higher and higher. Up the spiral you climb, lower and lower.'),(3915,39,'Threshold Pits',15,'Lower Spiral Staircase','-6540;7381;39','IDS_KNOW3915','Down the steps you go, higher and higher. Up the spiral you climb, lower and lower.'),(3916,39,'Threshold Pits',16,'The Bile Crypt','-8026;5302;39','IDS_KNOW3916',''),(3917,39,'Threshold Pits',17,'Black Rock Bridge','-7159;1310;39','IDS_KNOW3917',''),(3918,39,'Threshold Pits',18,'The Damp Grotto','-10444;1746;39','IDS_KNOW3918',''),(3919,39,'Threshold Pits',19,'The Maze 19','-1322;3813;39','IDS_KNOW3919',''),(3920,39,'Threshold Pits',20,'The Maze 20','-1546;371;39','IDS_KNOW3920',''),(3921,39,'Threshold Pits',21,'Master Hall','-3130;1709;39','IDS_KNOW3921',''),(3922,39,'Threshold Pits',22,'South Meeting Room','-4502;4725;39','IDS_KNOW3922',''),(3923,39,'Threshold Pits',23,'North Meeting Room','-4382;-1285;39','IDS_KNOW3923',''),(3924,39,'Threshold Pits',24,'West Meeting Room','-2421;5700;39','IDS_KNOW3924',''),(3925,39,'Threshold Pits',25,'Library of Dreams','299;-2332;39','IDS_KNOW3925',''),(3926,39,'Threshold Pits',26,'The Jagged Steps','-4005;-3072;39','IDS_KNOW3926',''),(3927,39,'Threshold Pits',27,'The Corrupted Way','5157;-4173;39','IDS_KNOW3927',''),(3928,39,'Threshold Pits',28,'Ari\'s Decending Hopes','6412;313;39','IDS_KNOW3928',''),(3929,39,'Threshold Pits',29,'Steps Of Consciousness','2762;404;39','IDS_KNOW3929',''),(3930,39,'Threshold Pits',30,'The Study Of Renrut Nek','278;-5909;39','IDS_KNOW3930',''),(3931,39,'Threshold Pits',31,'Hidden Ballroom','7247;1514;39','IDS_KNOW3931','Upon entry, this expansive circular room has an inviting atmosphere. A cluster of mounted flames form the illusion of orbiting the elegant chandelier, which dangles from the middle of the tall concave ceiling. Its teardrop crystals reflect the lit candles, casting a glow of illumination across the golden, ornate interior. The hard, polished floor has a spiral design that starts from the center of the room and expands outward. Off to one side, a harp and other musical instruments can be seen. Heavy maroon curtains are draped around ancient murals, as if in presentation. Ground torches gleam near the painted walls, staving off the creeping shadows.'),(4001,40,'Chimeric Plane',1,'Ring of Diplomacy','1404;1161;40','IDS_KNOW4001',''),(4101,41,'Library of Dreams',1,'Library Main Room','400;655;41','IDS_KNOW4101',''),(4102,41,'Library of Dreams',2,'Sphere One Hall','433;-4179;41','IDS_KNOW4102',