_KNOW4125',''),(4126,41,'Library of Dreams',26,'Sphere Nine Hall','2809;3478;41','IDS_KNOW4126',''),(4127,41,'Library of Dreams',27,'Sphere Nine Study','1669;2363;41','IDS_KNOW4127',''),(4128,41,'Library of Dreams',28,'Sphere Nine Reading Room','6360;3090;41','IDS_KNOW4128',''),(4129,41,'Library of Dreams',29,'Sphere Nine Archives','5259;5001;41','IDS_KNOW4129',''),(4201,42,'Threshold Caves',1,'Hidden Ambush','818;-4405;42','IDS_KNOW4201',''),(4202,42,'Threshold Caves',2,'Entrance','829;-534;42','IDS_KNOW4202',''),(4203,42,'Threshold Caves',3,'Ceremonial Hall','1056;3898;42','IDS_KNOW4203','The boundaries of the hall shift and waver, spreading outwards to a range beyond sight. Silence is so pervasive it throbs in your ears, punctuated at rare intervals with the faint rattling of iron on stone. The altar seems to draw the heat from the room despite the glowing braziers atop it. Acrid smoke climbs in thin spirals from the fires to sting your eyes. Air, thick and cloying, with an unidentifiable scent, leaves a coppery taste in your mouth. Pulsing light from the swirling pools below reflects about the room, bathing it in a crimson dance of macabre and grotesque figures.'),(4204,42,'Threshold Caves',4,'Labyrinth Entrance','-2710;2568;42','IDS_KNOW4204',''),(4205,42,'Threshold Caves',5,'Labyrinth 5','-4736;2587;42','IDS_KNOW4205',''),(4206,42,'Threshold Caves',6,'Labyrinth 6','-4914;-313;42','IDS_KNOW4206',''),(4207,42,'Threshold Caves',7,'Labyrinth 7','-6895;-2120;42','IDS_KNOW4207',''),(4208,42,'Threshold Caves',8,'Crossway','-2949;-4650;42','IDS_KNOW4208',''),(4209,42,'Threshold Caves',9,'Temple of Meditation','-2657;-6613;42','IDS_KNOW4209',''),(4210,42,'Threshold Caves',10,'Stairs 10','-2003;-8577;42','IDS_KNOW4210',''),(4211,42,'Threshold Caves',11,'Stairs 11','-644;-8556;42','IDS_KNOW4211',''),(4212,42,'Threshold Caves',12,'Stairs 12','-4116;-8557;42','IDS_KNOW4212',''),(4213,42,'Threshold Caves',13,'Stairs 13','-5215;-8551;42','IDS_KNOW4213',''),(4214,42,'Threshol