INSERT INTO `trainlog` VALUES (10054,10027,72,50,'Inscribe 50 Sil','Though it looks the same, things have changed a lot in this new dream.  Make some notes on the main changes in teaching and come back to discuss them with me.  Good, Bad? Anything we could or should work to try to change?','2014-10-25 18:57:43',NULL),(10284,10077,108,1,'Sable Shield','Assist a couple of housemates of different focuses in their house related duties. Spend a little time doing this, ensuring your assistance is noted. Report on what you did, who you helped, why, and why their duties are what they are.','2014-10-25 20:57:58',NULL),(10034,10340,11,1,'Amulet: Lilith','Now that you understand what Ward does, now you will be able to create something that is the GateKeeper\'s most prized possession.  Any GateKeeper will tell you that Amulet is something they keep near and dear to them. It is your job to find out why. If you can find a GateKeeper that will part with their amulet for you to look at, do so. Examine it thoroughly and tell me what connects an Amulet to its Ward. ','2014-10-26 02:20:55',NULL),(10127,10034,52,10,'Train 10 Ashton','Tell me how it went Training your first student in a while! Finish up the 3 examples tasks as originally outlined, and then report back!','2014-10-26 03:01:01',NULL),(10009,10340,8,10,'Lilith-Prot10','Protection comes in many forms but is an important aspect of the Dream. Find five locations within the City that offer an inate protection for a dreamer or item. The rooms themselves must offer the protection and it cannot just be that the room is a Sanctuary. ','2014-10-26 03:05:51',NULL),(10284,10340,9,20,'FA - 20','Ah, the life of a FreeSpirit. Able to go nearly where ever the please, when they please. Find those places, at least a couple, that most embody what it is to be free, as you see it. Take someone there (or a few) and share something with them, teach them, if you will. Grand or simple, it\'s the result that matters. Next see if you can uncover strategies to improve your agoknight hunting skills. Attempt to implement them, and we\'ll discuss the results.','2014-10-26 04:24:37',NULL),(10127,10003,52,1,'Train Liolira','Dream up an amazing new Insight Art (Major or Minor). Write example tasks to learn your excellent new Art after interviewing 2 Elder Teachers, 1 Teacher from each faction, and 2 younger dreamers!','2014-10-26 05:02:17',NULL),(10098,10250,22,20,'Anyasha forge part2','The other houses have two more vaults than us. Make devices that we leave in their essence rooms. The devices must be left there to analyze the other houses over the course of some time. Present the analyzis result on what could be done to the other houses, and how their vault strength could be transfered it to ours.','2014-10-26 18:05:46',NULL),(10007,11014,29,10,'Poison 10','There are many things in the City that seem to be a burden/poison to dreamers. Not just the art... Think of 5 things in this City that seems to be poisoned. They must be very different and I want to know exactly why you chose these. Then come up with one that you see as the biggest problem here and how you could change it.','2016-07-05 05:59:49','2016-07-04 04:37:59'),(10127,10125,88,1,'Quest: Kanto','','2014-11-22 22:52:07',NULL),(10022,10069,67,20,'SoulReaper: 20','Spend at least five dreams using your blade for things other than dueling and hunting. Be imaginative, involve other Dreamers as best you can, see how you can get other people to join in. Tell me about the Dreamers you interacted with, what you or they did... for example (can\'t use this one!) would be to use your blade to cut open a skin of wine to drink and share with others.... ','2014-11-23 01:59:09',NULL),(10025,10003,9,10,'FreeAction 10','No one is truely free in the city. We all have to follow one rule or another. lf you where truely free to do what ever you wanted.what would you do to fortify your homes defence? Not its dreamers your house itself, besides just locking the portals, Be creative and put the thought into it~','2014-11-23 04:43:40',NULL),(10022,10094,35,50,'Trap Nightmare: 50','Spend some time trapping different mares, even a Dark Mare if you can find one. What can be trapped, how easily was it trapped? What can\'t be trapped, why not? How damaged does a mare need to be trapped in order for you to successfully trap it? What is the maximum amount your trap, at 49, can do? What about at 50-59? Seek out someone with this information. Discover how trap works, or come up with a theory of your own, test this theory as best you can, were you right or were you wrong?','2014-11-23 05:13:56',NULL),(10098,10182,22,50,'Ghazgkull Forge 50','Make sure our next meetings are successfully closed, by convincing each Dreamsmith of its necessity. Provide the smiths with an interview process, prepare questions and other ways to judge who is worthy. Make sure Kanto does not get a say in either two and that the decision are the Dreamsmith\'s alone. ','2014-11-23 20:25:44',NULL),(10062,10094,74,30,'Mind Blank | 30','Get a few of your housemates assistance with this one. You\'re going to spend three days pestering the enemy. Prepare a series of different scenarios that did not happen about certain dreamers, and with the help of your housemates, speak on these scenarios as if they truly happened around those close to the target. Keep track of their reactions. Word of mouth is grossly important here. Can you start something lasting? Did word get back to the intended target? What was their response? 11.12','2014-11-23 21:59:39',NULL),(10125,10259,107,1,'Peace Aura - Learn','Learn of the specifics of Peace Aura what it is and what it does.  Also learn of the houses past era.  What can we learn from the pacifist astronomers who once inhabited the AoE?  How can their efforts be applied now with the nightmare incursion points','2014-11-23 22:45:39',NULL),(10051,10069,25,20,'Reweave-20','You claim or wish to be a great warrior.  I want you to find out through friends of yours whom the greats were or are now considered to be.  Then I want you to match blades with several of them.  See how you can improve as a warrior, how did you match up?  Did you win?  Full report when you have dueled several of the greats','2014-11-24 02:32:13',NULL),(10067,10213,63,1,'Invisibility','Time to play spy games. I want you to become invisible when in thresh and around others. Listen to everything that people are talking about. Gather all the information you can about the war, the Orders plans, defense strategies, everything you think is important. Also ponder the advantages/disadvantages Invis has over Chamele. Learn all you can and then lets talk. <T>\r\n','2014-11-24 03:25:06',NULL),(10226,10415,47,1,'Push','Bundle Task - To Learn','2014-11-24 09:00:43',NULL),(10226,10415,15,1,'Judgement','Bundle Task','2014-11-24 09:01:40',NULL),(10226,10415,98,1,'Newly Awakened','Bundle Task','2014-11-24 09:02:56',NULL),(10027,10415,69,1,'Tranceflame learn','complete as per amante bundled','2014-11-24 09:18:52',NULL),(10007,10393,70,10,'FlameSear 10','Find all the levels of flame 0-90, see what color their flame is. Tell me who it was and what level, then what color it was.','2014-11-24 23:27:13',NULL),(10025,10069,111,1,'read','for all your involvement of the mare riding rituals, well done! you have earned passage for the house art dazzle','2014-11-25 02:32:33',NULL),(10062,10018,74,10,'Mind Blank 10','It is important that we GKs come together to progress ourselves and our city. Putting allegiance aside, and dreaming for the collective. Speak to our fellow GKs and find out the most adequate meeting time for everyone. Also gather at least one topic each would like to cover at these meetings, or work on down the road. Report back to me, and I will set the meeting time.','2014-11-25 03:38:14',NULL),(10018,10072,141,1,'Kinesis | Learn','Describe a time when you had to \"move\" an immovable object. What was it, and how did you accomplish this?','2014-11-25 05:15:01',NULL),(10011,10219,15,20,'Solomier Judge 20','Back before the fall of the houses, folks used to take it personally when they\'re judged rather than asked their sphere. Do folks still feel that way? Poll as many dreamers as you can find in the next several days about how the feel about it. _-* 9.17','2014-11-25 05:50:33',NULL),(10027,10079,69,1,'Tranceflame learn','Time for a treasure hunt the other day I noticed you did not remember what items did what. Though as seer we get identify sooner than most recognizing some items by sight is still important. So find the items the city supplies us with, Ask for the locations of the best genns for your sphere and the next. Bring me back your lists and revelations and we can talk more.','2014-11-25 06:40:10',NULL),(10057,10182,96,30,'Quest: Sense:40','Sense your enemies tactics and thwart them. You have a choice. 10 minor, 5 medium, or 1 major. ','2014-11-25 20:35:14',NULL),(10066,10219,13,1,'Solomier - Return L','The honor system in returning items to the collapser of a Darkmare doesn\'t work in most cases. Devise a plan that would ensure talismen dropped from a Darkmare would go to the collapser. Share your idea with a few others and gather their feedback.','2014-11-25 21:01:25',NULL),(10421,10400,47,1,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 02:32:25',NULL),(10421,10400,7,1,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 02:32:53',NULL),(10421,10400,9,1,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 02:33:05',NULL),(10421,10400,68,1,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 02:33:21',NULL),(10421,10415,69,10,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 03:10:42',NULL),(10421,10415,2,10,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 03:10:51',NULL),(10127,10012,4,40,'FS 40 Bortami','Help shape the fate of your House! Lead an effort to strengthen your House towards a specific goal that someone else in your House suggests! You may take the \"center stage\" or you may lead from behind, letting another member have the spotlight!','2014-11-26 03:34:04',NULL),(10009,10072,108,1,'SableShield-Jeru','Openly drain infront of members of opposing houses. Make a dramatic event out of it to make sure they know what\'s going on.','2014-11-26 03:34:25',NULL),(10127,10400,1,10,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-11-26 03:46:15',NULL),(10127,10007,70,50,'FlameSear 50','Get your House to care about the mares that are infesting it, before the fire of Chaos overtakes it and destroys the Stronghold! Make efforts with your fellow members to remove the mares! You don\'t have to be successful, but make some solid attempts!','2014-11-26 03:50:37',NULL),(10169,10090,105,1,'Quest: Kage','Bring in items for the house, recharge our vaults, and stock us with vision alterors.','2014-11-26 03:57:41',NULL),(10127,10169,87,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-11-26 04:10:43',NULL),(10421,10400,65,10,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 04:21:37',NULL),(10421,10027,15,50,'LS, Judgement 50','I can see there are some judgements flowing both ways in this conflict you told me about.  And it\'s high time you got back out in the dream.  Get at least 2 of your enemy to come with you to your spot and talk with them, tell them why you go to this spot and see if they don\'t see you as a dreamer, not just an enemy.  Perhaps learn something about them as well.  It can be one at a time or both at the same time.  Tell me all about it.','2014-11-26 04:30:00',NULL),(10421,10427,38,1,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 04:53:31',NULL),(10421,10427,47,1,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 04:53:44',NULL),(10421,10427,40,1,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 04:53:54',NULL),(10421,10427,71,1,'Quest: Avris','x','2014-11-26 04:54:05',NULL),(10421,10226,50,30,'Ama NMF 30','Wrote the original for kanto, rewrote, kanto already looked at it!','2014-11-26 05:58:04',NULL),(10098,10400,8,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-11-26 21:13:57',NULL),(10098,10400,6,10,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-11-26 21:14:46',NULL),(10057,10219,64,30,'Quest: Give:30','Your devotion to the house hasn\'t gone un-noticed. You\'re were a hunting machine even when you were maxed and gave your time humbly. Think of 5 ways you can give back to the house, and put one into action. Once the action has been completed fully return to me. ~Kail','2014-11-27 00:34:17',NULL),(10062,10411,47,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Awarded for a bundle task completion.','2014-11-27 00:45:57',NULL),(10062,10411,9,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Rewarded from completion of bundle task.','2014-11-27 00:46:02',NULL),(10062,10411,68,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Rewarded for completion of bundle task.','2014-11-27 00:46:08',NULL),(10062,10411,7,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Rewarded from completion of bundle task.\r\n','2014-11-27 00:46:14',NULL),(10421,10072,10,40,'Jeru: Ward 40','Ward yourself in with the Horron in Horron\'s lair and find a way to defeat it by yourself.  Bring a party member to verify the deed.  Bring me the essence.  Anyone worthy of being called a god can do this.  Any tools you require can be used.  No assistance from the witness.  Spread word of your deed once it is complete.','2014-11-27 01:10:41',NULL),(10062,10411,8,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing his bundle task.','2014-11-27 01:15:26',NULL),(10421,10057,139,1,'Kail Sense Datoke','Bring me a Datoke essence.  Failing that, Forge a set of items for a newly, chak, shield, 2 elemens, 2 alterors.','2014-11-27 01:31:06',NULL),(10057,10003,63,30,'Quest:Invis:30','Invis vs Chamele. Compare the evokes, and learn the difference between the two arts. Why can we perform offensive arts with invis, but not chamele? Duration of chamele is much longer than invis. Why? Indepth theory and analysis is expected. Have fun ~Kailoth','2014-11-27 01:58:55',NULL),(10284,10393,25,1,'Reweave - Learn','Reweave is a useful skill to have, but there is more in the City that could use repairs of a similar fashion. Consider this, investigate and/or explore as you see fit, to discover what you feel is needing a delicate touch such as this. Can your discovery be rewoven (or repaired), and have you thoughts on how, or why/why not?','2014-11-27 03:57:25',NULL),(10062,10393,24,10,'Restore 10','Every dreamer has a weakness that eventually brings them down. Find a member of the house that is in need, and help pick them back up. What did they need, and how did you do it?','2014-11-27 15:20:36',NULL),(10007,10400,9,10,'Free Action - 10','10 bundle task completion done','2014-11-28 07:08:34',NULL),(10029,10022,24,60,'Restore: 60','As we have discussed beliefs and personal ideaology are not bound to specific stone and interior decoration. In keeping with this I wish for you to call together those of the \"Old Light\" in faith and attitude and arrange some unique way that you will meet regularly to keep the passion and belief alive in this new age. How will those true to old zealotry of the Light express their direction? Let the light shine forth once again. Bring them together, lead them, and put faith into action for all to see.','2014-11-28 07:15:54',NULL),(10125,10400,98,1,'from bundle','From his bundle to learn his learnables at 2nd sphere.','2014-11-28 08:00:30',NULL),(10125,10400,72,1,'from bundle','from his successful completion of bundle of learnables at 2nd sphere','2014-11-28 08:01:15',NULL),(10226,10069,67,30,'SoulReaper 30','Bundle Task Plat to 30','2014-11-28 09:12:03',NULL),(10226,10069,3,30,'SoulMaster 30','Bundle Task Plat 30','2014-11-28 09:12:13',NULL),(10226,10069,24,30,'Restore 30','Bundle Task Plat 30','2014-11-28 09:12:19',NULL),(10226,10069,70,30,'FlameSear 30','Bundle Task Plat 30','2014-11-28 09:12:29',NULL),(10226,10069,25,30,'Reweave 30','Bundle Task Plat 30','2014-11-28 09:30:00',NULL),(10098,10393,72,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-11-28 22:32:09',NULL),(10098,10393,98,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-11-28 22:32:58',NULL),(10098,10393,98,1,'Bundle learn 2 Cord','you just recieved 2nd sphere. explore the dream and find out every portal that are now locked to you. Write down their location. Get someone who is 3rd sphere ans up, show them each place and get them to describe what are beyond the locked area. Find a newly awakened and get to know them. Subtly teach them how to drain. (Newly awakened, inscribe, drain self learn)','2014-11-28 22:32:58',NULL),(10098,10393,9,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-11-28 22:33:45',NULL),(10098,10393,40,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-11-28 22:34:05',NULL),(10098,10393,46,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-11-28 22:34:21',NULL),(10421,10022,67,50,'Blade Blade 50','Remember what it is like to be a newly again.  Collapse an agoknight with the blade I\'ve forged for you.  Then, without the help of a seer, find a horron and collapse it with your blade.  Show others how you manage to collapse a horron without a seer.','2014-11-29 01:31:42',NULL),(10062,10411,68,10,'Flame 10','Reward for completing plat bundle task.','2014-11-29 03:27:02',NULL),(10062,10411,9,10,'FA 10','Reward for completing plat bundle task.','2014-11-29 03:27:09',NULL),(10062,10411,1,10,'GK 10','Reward for completing plat bundle task.','2014-11-29 03:27:15',NULL),(10062,10411,65,10,'Blade 10','Reward for completing plat bundle task.','2014-11-29 03:27:20',NULL),(10062,10411,6,10,'Med 10','Reward for completing plat bundle task.','2014-11-29 03:27:26',NULL),(10127,10009,52,30,'Train 30 Dreiko','Explain the bundled task process to a dreamer under Third Sphere. Assist them in obtaining and completing one of these tasks, educating them about the Teaching System and their focus, even if not a Seer! Report back how their progress went and if you thought the difficulty of the task was appropriate or not, and why!','2014-11-29 04:00:03',NULL),(10072,10400,10,1,'Ward','','2014-11-29 07:34:52',NULL),(10072,10400,11,1,'Quest: Jerulan','','2014-11-29 07:36:42',NULL),(10128,10125,83,20,'Dakkoth H Aura 20','Theorize on a way to heal your home of the mare incursion utilizing the strength of your house\'s Prime Artifact.  Involve your house mates as much as possible in devising a method to apply your theory.\r\n','2014-11-30 05:00:14',NULL),(10128,10400,1,20,'token to 20','Gatesmasher','2014-11-30 05:10:01',NULL),(10128,10400,65,20,'token to 20 ','Gatesmasher\r\n','2014-11-30 05:10:19',NULL),(10128,10400,6,20,'token to 20','Meditation','2014-11-30 05:12:30',NULL),(10128,10400,68,10,'token to 20 ','flameshaft\r\n','2014-11-30 05:13:09',NULL),(10007,10411,7,10,'RF 10','from a completed bundle 10 task','2014-12-01 01:36:20',NULL),(10007,10411,26,1,'Purify Learn','bundle \"learn\" task completed','2014-12-01 02:32:17',NULL),(10007,10411,98,1,'Newly Learn','bundle \"learn 20\" task completed','2014-12-01 02:32:27',NULL),(10007,10411,72,1,'Inscribe Learn','bundle \"learn\" task completed','2014-12-01 02:34:21',NULL),(10007,10411,46,1,'Recall Learn','bundle \"learn\" task completed','2014-12-01 02:34:33',NULL),(10007,10411,40,1,'Deafen Learn','bundle \"learn\" task completed','2014-12-01 02:35:12',NULL),(10127,10098,88,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-12-01 06:27:41',NULL),(10226,10230,98,10,'NA','Bundle plat quest for Insight Arts to 10','2014-12-01 08:54:15',NULL),(10022,10230,16,1,'Ziddynoh: Identify','The house has gone through many changes recently. I became a Ruler and we ensured purity of beliefs by removing anyone who did not hold true to the Light\'s beliefs. Now we are tasked with strengthening the house so that we can survive the trials ahead of us. I want you to identify a few weaknesses of the house and tell me what we could do to rectify them. ~.|','2014-12-01 09:15:43',NULL),(10027,10230,2,10,'Quest: LadySilver','','2014-12-01 11:02:05',NULL),(10226,10230,14,10,'Know','Bundle plat task to 0-1','2014-12-01 11:02:46',NULL),(10421,10411,10,1,'Quest: Avris','completion codex from Dina','2014-12-02 01:48:25',NULL),(10421,10411,11,1,'Quest: Avris','completion codex from Dina','2014-12-02 01:48:33',NULL),(10025,10022,111,10,'Dazzle to 10','BladeSlayer for your service and dedication as a ruler of the light, you have earned your plat to 10','2014-12-02 02:16:16',NULL),(10226,10415,16,1,'Identify','Identify three \'not so obvious\' traits, preferably somewhat hidden ones, of each of the dreamers here, including yourself.  You may whisper your own hidden traits, but the others I\'d like you to \'randomly\' speak outloud. You do not have to name the dreamer you are speaking of, however.','2014-12-02 10:51:53',NULL),(10010,10219,47,40,'Push 40 Solomier','I want you to hold a debate on the pros and cons of Push, I also want you to use your creativity and find 5 others who can help you push that creativity to have items forged that could be used to push the betterment of others around them. ~Cryst~\r\n','2014-12-03 00:01:23',NULL),(10421,10072,92,30,'Jeru Reflect 30','Challenge each house save your own to a blade duel to 5.  They may select their champion.  If you win all 3 duels you will have your plat, if you lose even one I will take one away.  If I find out any collusion you will lose Reflect altogether.','2014-12-03 01:40:08',NULL),(10226,10320,15,1,'Bundle','Bundle to Learn completed.','2014-12-03 04:59:03',NULL),(10226,10320,48,1,'SE','Bundle Task Learns','2014-12-03 04:59:41',NULL),(10226,10320,98,1,'NA','Bundle Task Learns','2014-12-03 05:00:10',NULL),(10226,10320,16,1,'ID','Bundle Task Learns','2014-12-03 05:00:51',NULL),(10011,10012,41,1,'Bortami Blind','Blind is a powerful tool that is often neglected. Why is this? What ways can blind be used, practically, comically, or metaphorically? Come up with at least two of each and use this charm to test them on your friends. Additionally, test this from time to time on those around you and see who you can catch unaware. _-* 11.28 [By Clarity]','2014-12-03 05:33:11',NULL),(10063,10219,14,10,'Know 10','Utilize whatever means are needed to obtain information about our enemy that we do not already know. How can we approach using this information for our benefit?\r\n','2014-12-03 06:24:19',NULL),(10125,10004,107,1,'Peace Aura - Learn','Zsa Zsa, learn of the art in the following manner....what does it do?  what does it cost?  What are you able to do when Peace Aura is cast upon you?  What can\'t you do?  Tell me how you think this art is best used.  ~Dakk\r\n','2014-12-03 07:44:09',NULL),(10125,10094,31,40,'Curse - 40','You have been given a Severely Torn Doll.  Examine it closely.  As you begin to reweave this doll, who does it appear to look like?  For what purpose was this doll created?  Use your gift of \'creation\' to reweave it and the curse upon it shall thrive once again.  Present this item to the person it resembles.  As you meddle with it, are there any affects to the dreamer?','2014-12-03 08:01:37',NULL),(10009,10320,69,1,'Tranceflame','From bundle task','2014-12-03 16:41:40',NULL),(10022,10226,74,30,'Mind Blank: 30','Come up with a theory as to how Mind Blank actually works. How is it we can make it so that others can not locate us? Why does it work? Talk to ten dreamers and get their opinion as well, how is MB useful to them. I want your written theory placed in the Library. ~.|','2014-12-04 01:51:30',NULL),(10182,10219,1,50,'GateKeeper to 50','A massive amount of energy from the Orb of Calenture was drained into our plane last night to remove the nightmares. As we have learned, that energy is now slowly draining out of our plane via our water system into the Cenotaph. Come up with a plan to use the devices we already forged to draw the excess energy from the waters back *into* the Orb. I will help carry out the plan.','2014-12-04 04:52:52',NULL),(10238,10011,42,60,'Quest: Darkness 60','Darkness - It is of sight, but also of levels of emotions.  Fear can install a darkness within ones mind.  Gather some of your greatest story telling friends, get some campfire supplies... and start up a Haunted Story telling group - Go to a scary spot in the City, dark, and gloomy.  Sit and share, instill internal darkness.  Take note of the environments affects, the story\'s affects on the dreamers - watch the Darkness take hold.  Have a couple of these sessions at minimal.','2014-12-05 04:31:19',NULL),(10259,10378,2,10,'Quest: Venom','test','2014-12-05 22:04:53',NULL),(10057,10169,74,50,'Quest: MB:50','Strategically, use mind blank to your advantage to give you leverage over your enemies. How you accomplish this is your choosing. Involve the house if you wish, or go about it solo. ~Kailoth','2014-12-06 01:52:40',NULL),(10057,10182,96,40,'Quest: Sense:40','Attempt to recapture the energy lost from the House Prime that was lost during the removal of the mares.','2014-12-06 02:11:32',NULL),(10003,10069,38,1,'Scare(L)BT222','Scare is highly affective in battle with dreamers and mares. I want you to interview 3 well known fighters and have them tell you why they feel its effective. Summarize their thoughts and then create your own theory on how to use scare effectively in battle.','2014-12-06 05:43:01',NULL),(10226,10022,31,40,'Curse 40','This item is your curse. Decide what kind of curse it is, how it effects you, and act it out for a good few dreams. (Try to pick something that won\'t make your wife grumpy, thanks!!) Involve other dreamers  and figure out how you could be cured.','2014-12-06 08:16:12',NULL),(10009,10311,108,1,'Flower-LearnSable','Speak with Gatekeepers and if possible a knowledgeable Elder (ala Silk Nuvas) about the nature of portal locking and ward. Focus on the ability for an amulet to allow passage. You don\'t need a lot of details, mostly just the basic knowledge that will allow us to proceed with our essence room project.','2014-12-06 23:59:57',NULL),(10025,10018,139,1,'Quest - poppygirl','The art sense datoken was created not long before the gates to the city closed on us. speak with 5 dreamers that have this art. learn why it was a crucial art at that time in the city. discover how it was made. memories are foggy so this may be slightly difficult. good luc','2014-12-07 00:51:05',NULL),(10009,10072,16,10,'Jerulan-ID10','Identify and utilize a new system to maximize the gains in Ossuary and/or Dorsal for the lazy hunters. This should not use power tokens in any way but can be specific for one focus if you choose.','2014-12-07 01:46:50',NULL),(10226,10065,30,1,'Antidote to learn','Do some \'research\' about Your dreams. Where do you stand right now, why and where are you going?  I\'d like you to pick one thing you aren\'t happy about in your dreams and \"Antidote\" yourself to fix it.','2014-12-07 03:47:05',NULL),(10066,10219,13,10,'Return 10','Work out the details of your essence drive. Goals, incentives, etc. After you\'ve worked out the details of this event, propose your event to a Ruler of Calenture and gain any feedback and revise your event if needed. Once approved, set the date on the Mission Boards.','2014-12-07 06:50:52',NULL),(10022,10094,28,40,'Abjure: 40','So, we know you can remove arts from Dreamers and Mares alike. Can you abjure the idiocy of dreamers? It seems as though some fight for no reason other than for the sake of fighting. Perhaps you can give them a more fulfilling reason to fight? Or possibly convince them to stop... Show me a few examples of this, make a noted effort, try to bring reason to the chaos.','2014-12-07 07:11:19',NULL),(10127,10022,60,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-12-07 19:30:35',NULL),(10128,10022,67,60,'Bladeslayer blde 60','Knock some of the rust off your blade by seeking out and duelling with some of the better duellists who are currently in the City.  Considering what it once was to you, does it have a name and a history of its own?  When you report on whom you duelled and what your learned, I would like to hear something of your blade\'s history.','2014-12-08 00:43:39',NULL),(10127,10072,68,70,'FlameShaft 70 Jeru','The mares seem to be forging up an arsenal. I wonder why?! Attempt to discover where and how their new workshop is. Work with others to come up with a new weapon of your own to combat them, or the lesser mares!','2014-12-08 02:30:36',NULL),(10127,10219,102,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-12-08 02:43:03',NULL),(10018,10219,17,1,'Quest: Jade','Mares and fonts have a bad hait of spewing out \"cursed\" items. This was never a problem for Idoaclecians. Discuss with a few others, and theorize why you think this City has them.','2014-12-08 03:03:37',NULL),(10127,10108,102,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-12-08 03:05:22',NULL),(10007,10065,67,30,'Blade 30','Bundle 30 plat task','2014-12-08 04:18:02',NULL),(10007,10065,3,30,'Acerrav SM 30','bundle plat 30 task','2014-12-08 04:18:10',NULL),(10007,10065,24,30,'Restore 30','Bundle 30 plat task','2014-12-08 04:18:19',NULL),(10007,10065,70,30,'Flame 30','Bundle 30 plat task','2014-12-08 04:18:25',NULL),(10011,10219,37,20,'Sol Trail 20','While we\'re at peace, keep us on the right path to defending our city. What can we do to strengthen our home and our defenses? Should we continue to research a way to combat our enemies, or should we take a more practical approach? Why? How? Speak with the members of our home and come up with a working theory. [By Clarity] _-* 11.25','2014-12-08 04:22:42',NULL),(10007,10065,26,10,'Purify 10','Bundle 10 plat task','2014-12-08 05:40:20',NULL),(10007,10065,25,10,'Reweave 10','Bundle 10 plat task','2014-12-08 05:40:30',NULL),(10007,10408,67,10,'Blade 10','completed 10 plat bundle task through ladysilver','2014-12-09 04:03:29',NULL),(10007,10408,70,10,'flame 10','completed 10 plat bundle task through ladysilver','2014-12-09 04:03:58',NULL),(10226,10022,29,40,'POison 40','For the next few dreams, you excude poison from every pore.  What kind of poison is it? How will it effect those around you? Without risking rank, status or other such things, cause a little mayhem with the wicked SoulMaster talents that you have.  As a SoulMaster, what Are you based on? Poison, Restore, water, air? Talk to me about how you see your own focus and where you fit into it, within the city.','2014-12-09 04:46:05',NULL),(10226,10065,8,1,'Bundle Tasks','Prot','2014-12-09 05:20:43',NULL),(10226,10065,15,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Tasks\r\n','2014-12-09 05:21:14',NULL),(10226,10065,16,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle tasks\r\n','2014-12-09 05:22:31',NULL),(10226,10065,40,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Tasks','2014-12-09 05:22:56',NULL),(10226,10065,73,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Tasks\r\n','2014-12-09 05:23:29',NULL),(10027,10067,21,20,'Blend to 20','Blending times. I am seeing more and more things in the dream being blended in the new City. The Dream is changing. Have you seen this too and should we jump on board or stand our ground with tranfidtions. Use you insight ask around tell me what you see and what you wish you could see mroe of. Create  a story from our time to save for our future,','2014-12-09 08:03:35',NULL),(10027,10410,16,1,'Quest: LadySilver','','2014-12-09 18:34:10',NULL),(10027,10410,47,1,'Quest: LadySilver','','2014-12-09 18:34:23',NULL),(10027,10410,15,1,'Quest: LadySilver','','2014-12-09 18:34:35',NULL),(10027,10410,98,1,'Quest: LadySilver','','2014-12-09 18:35:21',NULL),(10027,10410,69,1,'Quest: LadySilver','','2014-12-09 18:35:35',NULL),(10007,10408,3,10,'Soulmaster 10','bundle task plat','2014-12-09 21:11:54',NULL),(10027,10079,47,1,'Quest: LadySilver','','2014-12-09 21:12:35',NULL),(10027,10079,15,1,'Quest: LadySilver','','2014-12-09 21:12:59',NULL),(10007,10414,7,1,'Quest: Dina','learn bundle 0-19','2014-12-10 01:59:58',NULL),(10007,10414,9,1,'Quest: Dina','learn bundle 0-19','2014-12-10 02:00:27',NULL),(10007,10414,47,1,'Quest: Dina','learn bundle 0-19','2014-12-10 02:01:16',NULL),(10007,10414,8,1,'Quest: Dina','learn bundle 0-19','2014-12-10 03:26:45',NULL),(10127,10007,52,50,'Train 50 Dina','Work with at least two Newly Awakened: help them get to Orbit 9 with at least a strong functional understanding of the Dream! Assist them in obtaining a bundled task to Learn their Arts 0-19 and to Plateau their Arts to 10 from another Teacher! Then help them do the tasks. Finally, give each of them a Sphere task and make sure they complete it!','2014-12-10 03:56:37',NULL),(10022,10320,47,1,'Zenobia: Push','Some would say the new Dreamers get pushed around, due to more powerful and established Dreamers overlooking them. Do you think strength of arms, or experience within the city decides who is most useful within the City? Find an instance where a gem of knowledge, or a \"good idea\" came from an unlikely source, such as a lower sphered Dreamer. ~.|','2014-12-10 07:57:34',NULL),(10226,10320,72,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-10 08:06:25',NULL),(10226,10320,17,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-10 08:07:39',NULL),(10005,10009,22,30,'Forge 30 Dreiko','Ensure a time is scheduled for the attempt to drain a nuetral vault, but beforehand, using your forge secretly craft some sort of item of power and place it into the vault before you go.  The item should be some sort of puzzle or clue that could be used for a future project.  Ensure that the others do not simply dismiss the item.  Begin efforts to start a new project based off the item you \"find\".','2014-12-10 22:59:02',NULL),(10127,10169,67,50,'SoulReap 50 Kage','There are many enemies in this City, and many ways to overcome them! Think of an enemy that presents a threat to you, your new House, or the City at large. Overcome it without the use of any Arts or talisman you could not use in a Sanctuary!','2014-12-11 04:13:07',NULL),(10127,10011,52,40,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-12-11 04:15:43',NULL),(10022,10250,81,1,'Anyasha: Vampiric','The SoulMaster Guild has recently begun meeting on Tuesdays, at 7 dst. First on our agenda is improving upon the art of Poison... maybe different theories have been discussed, research has begun on ways of changing the art so that it is more viable and not just a pesky annoyance. Either find someone working on a part of this research and assist them, or develop your own theory and put it into practice. Either present your results at a Guild meeting, or to me personally. ~.|','2014-12-11 05:22:29',NULL),(10238,10027,22,1,'Forging a City','Bundled tasks should develop young dreamers!  You will be forging their dreams in this City!  Your quest is to Forge three young dreamers with a Bundled Task!  Give me feedback on how the process worked out - the tasks you had them do - but mostly develop the Tasks to Forge their Dreams in this City!  Help them become!','2014-12-12 01:54:20',NULL),(10238,10057,22,40,'Forge - Kailoth','The darkmares have been doing strange things at recent.  Hording items, not going to the houses of dreamers and instead seeming to setup defense perimeters.  Powerful items and things long since lost have been found at the feet of them.   Lead multiple assaults on these darkmare raids, collect their goods - Bring me the essences of 5 different darkmares, 5 unique items they have dropped, and proof that Chakrams of 60 exist - I want a FateSender 60.','2014-12-12 01:58:54',NULL),(10022,10226,103,1,'Amante: Bequeath','Helping the Newly Awakened is one of your passions is seems. Why is that? What do the newly awakened offer to the dream? Why is it so important to guide them through their first steps within the City? Are they easily led astray? How do you keep your bias out of your words when you teach the newly awakened... do you keep your bias out of it? Why is it important for a newly to have a full grasp of the City before making lasting decisions as to their path in it? ~.|','2014-12-12 09:45:20',NULL),(10452,10072,22,50,'Undergames Reward','Forge 50','2014-12-13 02:13:06',NULL),(10452,10022,3,60,'Undergames Reward','SM 60','2014-12-13 02:15:54',NULL),(10452,10004,20,1,'Undergames Reward','','2014-12-13 02:19:21',NULL),(10452,10108,39,30,'Undergames Reward','','2014-12-13 02:21:19',NULL),(10238,10098,51,70,'Locate Dreamer 70','Silk Nuvas, a tinkerer they say.  Manages to move in and out of portals seemingly locked to other dreamers.  Had recent word he may have an idea to tinker with Primes to shield houses from Mare spawns - who is he, what can he do.. how does he do it. Locate him','2014-12-13 03:23:14',NULL),(10238,10007,22,30,'Quest: WishBringer','Continue the growing of flowers and storing them - tending to them.  The quest that was set forth to you by Starfall thru Eros\'s quest.  Finish this quest as intended and your Forge quest will be complete as I will honor it as Starfall would honor my own.','2014-12-13 03:53:58',NULL),(10022,10069,16,1,'BT: Identify','Your service to the house is exemplary, you like to bring in items to help your house and family members, though some times your items are complete trash and I want to hit you! The house is going through changes right now and it needs your strength more than ever so that we can survive these trying times. I want you to ask to go hunting with Amante, I would like you to carry all the ess she collects and take them to the house for her. Do this so the house can grow stronger. ~.|','2014-12-13 05:44:14',NULL),(10022,10226,111,1,'Amante: Dazzle','In recognition of your dedication to the house. Thank you for all of your hard work. I am sure you will continue to be dedicated to making the Light shine more brightly than ever. ~.|\r\n','2014-12-13 05:54:05',NULL),(10226,10018,74,20,'Mind Blank plat','Rewriting a quest I wrote for Jade because I accidently titled it to Blade as if he\'s like, always on my mind or something. Bah. Anyway she did the quest, it was something about Forgetting certain words and still trying to have conversations with people without using them. It was awesome, she did well. Thank you.','2014-12-13 07:40:23',NULL),(10011,10284,22,20,'Elspet Forge 20','The nexus talisman needs a component designed for taking in essences. The whole city is meant to gain from the Nexus Talismans, so this component should not be designed in a way that imposes undue burden on any essence belief. Work with a team of dreamers of your choosing to create it. At least one person should be someone you ordinarily might not work with (doesn\'t have to be an enemy). Due by Sunday 12.14. _-* 12.7','2014-12-14 21:17:57',NULL),(10226,10318,72,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle task\r\n','2014-12-14 22:30:17',NULL),(10226,10318,98,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-14 22:31:04',NULL),(10062,10318,10,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing Bundle task given by Amante.','2014-12-14 22:47:05',NULL),(10062,10318,11,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing Bundle task given by Amante.','2014-12-14 22:47:10',NULL),(10421,10226,88,1,'Quest: Avris','Amante has been nominated by DoL for MT','2014-12-15 00:06:30',NULL),(10421,10022,88,1,'Quest: Avris','Bladeslayer is the 2nd nominee from DoL','2014-12-15 00:10:24',NULL),(10009,10212,108,1,'Sable-Sidious','You have already earned this art. Maintain your membership for a minute.','2014-12-15 01:42:01',NULL),(10284,10104,16,10,'ID - 10','Avoid getting goo on anyone in doing this, but uncover a method (or the theory behind it) on how to modify an item to change it\'s purpose from nothing to something useful. Attempt to work with forgers on a prototype, or an example, or if you\'re ready... the real thing. We\'ll discuss your goo-less results.','2014-12-15 03:32:48',NULL),(10127,10104,67,40,'SoulReaper 40 Dar','Years ago, your friends and allies were cut down before they even had a chance to grow. Determine the feasibility of the Deltros becoming a success in this City. Either as their own faction, within another, taking over another, etc. Work with others sympathetic to this cause to begin the process.','2014-12-15 03:40:24',NULL),(10127,10104,72,30,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-12-15 03:44:51',NULL),(10452,10018,116,1,'Wordsmith','','2014-12-15 03:54:51',NULL),(10452,10077,116,1,'Wordsmith','','2014-12-15 03:54:55',NULL),(10182,10018,141,10,'Kinesis to 10','Get help from a scryer to look into the past and discover the origin of Kinesis. Then teach whatever you find to 10 GateKeepers.','2014-12-15 06:21:36',NULL),(10010,10219,89,10,'Soul Sheild 10','There is an illness that has gripped the city. I want you to come up with a way that you think Soul Sheild could be used to help those who are infected, be cured. And if you can, try it out on some of those that are infected ~Cryst~','2014-12-15 06:35:55',NULL),(10226,10022,27,40,'Drain Self 40','You\'ve been spending a lot of time draining your self into everything around you. Out of the biggest issues, pick two or three you can leave others in charge of, and walk away for no less then three dreams. Walk...Away.  ','2014-12-15 08:45:35',NULL),(10062,10411,68,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing plateau 20 bundle task.','2014-12-16 03:53:36',NULL),(10062,10411,1,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing plateau 20 bundle task.','2014-12-16 03:53:41',NULL),(10062,10411,65,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing plateau 20 bundle task.','2014-12-16 03:53:45',NULL),(10098,10318,26,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-12-16 21:16:35',NULL),(10098,10318,40,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-12-16 21:16:51',NULL),(10098,10318,46,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2014-12-16 21:17:11',NULL),(10005,10009,22,40,'Forge 40 Dreiko','I require some help on forging the prime blades for the dueling league.  Assit by gathering raw materials and energy sources required to complete the blades.','2014-12-16 23:49:47',NULL),(10009,10284,36,30,'Elspet-Blade30','Acquiring more storage will allow us to strengthen our blades even further. Identify another of the houses that will work with us on an attempt to lock both of our essence rooms. Broker a deal with them that will allow this to happen.','2014-12-17 01:39:44',NULL),(10226,10022,27,40,'Quest: Amante','Blade did his task and was granted a plat in Drain self, but a storm set it back to 30. I\'m returning his plat too him.\r\n','2014-12-17 03:32:50',NULL),(10098,10250,22,30,'Forge to 30','The Dreamsmiths are going to attempt to make a container that can hold multiple essences. The Threshold Pits forge will be utilized and we need a way to operate it. Involve others that have worked with it before and determine how it can best be operated to make the container. Be ready to assist the Dreamsmiths with this sunday.','2014-12-17 23:08:32',NULL),(10125,10250,28,40,'Abjure - 40','There\'s a sickness going around.  It\'s said to be a poison but no means of antidote or purify has seemed to combat it.  Study those with the sickness.  Seek a way to remove this ailment from them.  Time is of the matter, so do not linger on this!','2014-12-18 02:59:45',NULL),(10421,10125,31,50,'Dak Curse 50','Take all that research you did and bring it to the Smiths regarding the nexus. Develop and implement a plan to create the Nexus with the Smiths.  You heard some \'actionable\' plans today, yours should be just as tangible.  Failure is an option.','2014-12-18 03:35:54',NULL),(10022,10205,111,1,'Jaden: Dazzle','In recognition of your steadfast service to the house, looking fear in the face and staring it down in order to protect your home and family... I grant you the ability of Dazzle. Use it well and always let the Light shine forth. ~.|','2014-12-18 04:32:59',NULL),(10226,10318,9,20,'FA 20','Bundle plat task to 20 for focal arts.','2014-12-18 07:28:59',NULL),(10072,10318,6,10,'Meditation10','Part of Lu Chaos\' completed bundle task. ','2014-12-18 07:30:26',NULL),(10169,10219,26,10,'Purify 10','Our Orb is still diminished after the removal of the mares from Calenture.  Spend some time bolstering its strength, preferably by participating in trapping to make the effort efficient, and report back to me when you feel you\'ve added enough strength to allow us to forge enough shields for one real battle.','2014-12-18 20:01:32',NULL),(10010,10226,73,30,'DT 30 Amante','You have gained the knowledge of Recharge for the next week. I want you to make a huge scene of being able to recharge your items, and perhaps the items of others. Ensure that you make a great show of the destruction of the items. Record the reactions of others, and who beleived that you actually obtained the art ? ~Cryst~','2014-12-19 02:32:03',NULL),(10027,10010,63,30,'Invis to 30','I heard you mention a few times about starting a teachers guild/council. Create some guidelines and see if the City is ready yet.  Make and outline of yorur expctations and talk to teachers and rulers to see if they feel it would be beneficail. Or what they think might be. You can do this individiual or in a meeting. Good luck.','2014-12-19 03:46:41',NULL),(10421,10318,1,20,'Lu GK 20','Completed a bundle task from Amante','2014-12-19 03:46:47',NULL),(10421,10318,68,20,'Lu Flame 20','Completed a bundle task from Amante','2014-12-19 03:47:04',NULL),(10421,10408,3,10,'Saffron SM 10','Lost plat due to storm, checked logs','2014-12-19 04:03:46',NULL),(10421,10276,50,20,'hanna NMF 20','Spend 1 full minute in nightmare form in the same room as the lost caves shamblix.  Contemplate what it means to be an emphant among nightmares.  No chamele, invis or soulmaster restore allowed.  Failure to survive is not a failure of the task.  Take someone with you as a witness and to help you survive.  *this task drips with a green mucus*','2014-12-19 04:06:11',NULL),(10421,10226,64,30,'Ama Give 30','Bring someone who is not Bladeslayer to a seldom traveled room in the dream.  Give them a memory about it, some piece of lore that you know, a battle, an event, whatever it is.  Why is it important to remember our past?','2014-12-19 04:38:35',NULL),(10027,10408,25,1,'Reweave learn','Shields 101 There are many color combinations of shields int he dream. Seek out the favorites of dreamers and why they prefer them. do they prefer differant shields for hunting or fighting? Where is the best genn sto find shields. I have a special story to sahre with you when you ahve gathered this information. Good luck on your hunt of shield information.','2014-12-19 04:46:41',NULL),(10066,10226,46,30,'Amante - Recall 30','Identify a memory that you and at least three other dreamers share. Discuss this memory with each of them, ideally together and make note of any differences and similarities in memory. Considering that, think about how each of you have grown apart or together and where you all are now. Record all details of the conversations.','2014-12-19 05:14:51',NULL),(10127,10320,19,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-12-19 05:24:47',NULL),(10127,10320,18,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2014-12-19 05:25:10',NULL),(10125,10455,107,1,'PeaceAura - Learn','Learn of the basics of Peace Aura....what it costs....what it does....how long it lasts....etc.  Also, inscribe them on codices and display them in our library for reference.','2014-12-20 03:47:32',NULL),(10066,10219,13,20,'Solomier Return 20','Since our return, we have seen an handful of Darkmares. Compile an accurate list of all Darkmares since our return to the city. Attempt to divide them groups or factions if you can. Possibly by city origin, too. Share your findings with two other dreamers and revise it if needed.','2014-12-20 05:06:32',NULL),(10072,10318,7,10,'Quest: Jerulan','','2014-12-20 06:46:09',NULL),(10067,10090,21,10,'Blend 10 - Hikari','Blending into things is most difficult sometimes. Theorize the difference between Blending through a ward and Blending through a locked portal. Why are the two different? They are both blocked to us and locked just in different ways. Why is the art limited to the one but not the other? Find me and we\'ll discuss your thoughts. <T>','2014-12-20 07:12:50',NULL),(10067,10090,21,10,'Blend 20 - Hik','Blending into things is most difficult sometimes. Theorize the difference between blending through a ward and blending through a locked portal. Why are the two different? They are both blocked to us and locked just in different ways. Why is the art limited to the one  but not the other? Find me and we\'ll discuss your thoughts. <T>','2014-12-20 07:12:50',NULL),(10029,10022,25,60,'Reweave: 60','Continue with your purge of the unfaithful. Make a demonstrable change within the Dreamers of Light as testiment to your new legacy and power as a leader within.','2014-12-20 07:17:00',NULL),(10125,10022,83,1,'HealingAura - Blade','First, you must learn the basics of this artform.  How much it costs...How much does it heal...how long are the evokes....etc.  The second part of this quest rests on your participation with the nightmare cleansing at DoL.  It takes a massive display of strength and healing to purge the nightmares from a house.  Show us your strength.  Use the Dreaming Stone and cleanse your house of Chaos.','2014-12-20 21:52:03',NULL),(10018,10072,17,1,'ID Curse | Learn','Challenge at least one dreamer to a cursed duel! Each of you may pick your team mate, whom will be casting stagger, scare, kinesis, etc (except blind) on the other team\'s dueler. No protective arts are allowed. Have fun!','2014-12-21 06:08:32',NULL),(10027,10004,2,30,'Quest: LadySilver','','2014-12-21 07:28:22',NULL),(10226,10318,38,1,'Scare','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-21 08:49:36',NULL),(10226,10318,24,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-21 08:49:43',NULL),(10226,10318,15,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-21 08:49:51',NULL),(10226,10318,15,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle task\r\n','2014-12-21 08:49:51',NULL),(10029,10004,24,1,'Restore: Learn','Practice the seeds of the skill as it exists within you. Repair your five most damaged or otherwise worn out toys, tools, and/or accessories by breathing life back into their essence. The change need not be permanent, even a demonstration of life within them for a moment will suffice.','2014-12-21 08:51:04',NULL),(10029,10027,73,40,'Destroy Talis: 40','Working with your students and fellow Calenturians I wish for you to compile a list of famous acts of destruction not only from our era but also from the era and world of the Idoaclesians. Look for any similarities or acts that you think warrant further investigation.','2014-12-21 09:22:09',NULL),(10226,10318,74,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-21 09:23:09',NULL),(10062,10411,8,10,'Prot 10','Reward for completed plat bundle task.','2014-12-22 02:14:51',NULL),(10062,10411,6,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completed plat bundle task.','2014-12-22 02:15:14',NULL),(10062,10411,9,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completed plat bundle task.','2014-12-22 02:15:30',NULL),(10062,10411,7,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completed plat bundle task.','2014-12-22 02:15:48',NULL),(10072,10318,141,1,'Kinesis','This is for a 30\'s bundle from amante. ','2014-12-22 03:09:06',NULL),(10421,10072,92,40,'Jeru Reflect 40 (3)','You have attempted 2 tasks for me that did not allow failure, the work for them was not a waste and you\'ve reported on the actions of both.  Finally, here is a task you cannot fail.  Decide what to do about Dakkoth\'s Ascension.  Support him or do not, that is up to you, but figure it out and report to me.','2014-12-22 03:59:45',NULL),(10072,10318,65,20,'Quest: Jerulan','Lu Chaos completed a 20 bundle task, I am honoring. ','2014-12-22 04:22:45',NULL),(10009,10007,108,10,'Sable10-Dina','Develop parameters for learning and plateauing sable shield. I would like it to be a point system based on house activities. For example, a soulmaster collecting 1000 essences is worth 1 point.','2014-12-22 04:25:44',NULL),(10226,10219,17,10,'Identify Curse 10','Identify a few of your curses, what are they and how can you work on curing yourself of them?  Tell me a couple of curses that other dreamers can suffer from?','2014-12-22 07:03:45',NULL),(10226,10318,25,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task','2014-12-22 08:06:45',NULL),(10226,10318,16,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle task\r\n','2014-12-22 08:08:31',NULL),(10226,10318,73,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-22 08:08:52',NULL),(10125,10212,26,10,'bundle plat 10','honoring a bundle plat to 10 from Dreiko.  Sidious completed.','2014-12-23 02:49:06',NULL),(10125,10212,27,10,'bundle to 10','completed bundle quest plat to 10 from Dreiko.  Honoring it.\r\n','2014-12-23 02:50:04',NULL),(10421,10125,94,1,'Dak Cleanse Learn','Find out from an ex Gathering member what they believed cleanse did.  Did anyone from Idoaclese use cleanse? Get their take as well.  ','2014-12-24 02:29:08',NULL),(10421,10226,75,30,'Ama Show 30','Start something spontaneous.','2014-12-24 03:44:48',NULL),(10421,10022,87,1,'Quest: Avris','missing support sphere','2014-12-24 03:57:56',NULL),(10226,10318,7,20,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-24 09:37:30',NULL),(10421,10107,102,1,'Off kilter quest','He has gone through a refresher with Avris and I\'m granting quest back','2014-12-24 18:25:43',NULL),(10421,10107,86,1,'off kilter ST','Gone through short training with me','2014-12-24 18:27:13',NULL),(10007,10411,15,1,'Quest: Dina','30 learn bundle','2014-12-25 00:24:21',NULL),(10421,10411,141,1,'Quest: Avris','completion codex from dina','2014-12-25 00:24:48',NULL),(10421,10411,74,1,'Quest: Avris','completion codex from dina','2014-12-25 00:24:58',NULL),(10007,10411,16,1,'Quest: Dina','30 learn bundle','2014-12-25 00:25:02',NULL),(10421,10411,38,1,'Quest: Avris','completion from dina','2014-12-25 00:25:09',NULL),(10421,10411,73,1,'Quest: Avris','completion codex from dina','2014-12-25 00:25:15',NULL),(10007,10411,24,1,'Quest: Dina','30 learn bundle','2014-12-25 00:25:26',NULL),(10007,10411,25,1,'Quest: Dina','30 learn bundle','2014-12-25 00:25:52',NULL),(10125,10148,7,1,'bundle quest rf','learning as part of a completed bundle by krodoc\r\n','2014-12-25 05:32:33',NULL),(10125,10148,8,1,'bundle quest prot','granting in lieu of completing bundle quest from Krodoc\r\n','2014-12-25 07:35:40',NULL),(10010,10104,50,1,'Quest: Crystalline','','2014-12-27 00:18:37',NULL),(10421,10066,92,60,'Tman Reflect 60','Figure out how much dreamsoul each nightmare has.  Find a way to do it, I know you can.  Are Shamblixes and Horrons shielded or do they have more than 100 dreamsoul?  Failure is not an option in this.','2014-12-27 02:31:06',NULL),(10238,10008,22,50,'Forge 50','Somied is NEW to the City.  I\'d like him to stay, but he has to Forge his dreams.  Work with this new dreamer, teach him the ways of the City.  When he returns to me for his interview on whats he\'s learned and he\'s prepared for a sphere quest I will judge your work!','2014-12-27 04:38:30',NULL),(10125,10458,24,1,'Quest: Dakkoth','in fulfillment of his bundle quest','2014-12-27 20:47:35',NULL),(10125,10458,26,1,'Quest: Dakkoth','in fulfillment of his bundle quest','2014-12-27 20:47:58',NULL),(10125,10458,47,1,'Quest: Dakkoth','in fulfillment of his bundle quest','2014-12-27 20:48:29',NULL),(10125,10458,70,1,'Quest: Dakkoth','in fulfillment of his bundle quest','2014-12-27 20:48:55',NULL),(10421,10072,92,50,'Jeru Reflect 50','Dueling is one thing, but becoming a master is another.  Time to take away your advantages and truly show your skill.  I want you to blindfold yourself and duel some dreamers.  Find someone you can beat in an honest blade duel where you can\'t see them, either with them Invis or you blinded.  Once you\'ve managed that, try other forms of disadvantage, tell me what you think up and how they went','2014-12-28 01:31:04',NULL),(10421,10411,8,20,'Quest: Avris','bundle task from krodoc','2014-12-28 01:35:55',NULL),(10421,10411,11,10,'Quest: Avris','bundle task done from Krodoc','2014-12-28 01:36:05',NULL),(10022,10107,111,1,'OfF KiLTeR: Dazzle','The house has need of your forging skills. Please add some Vision Alterors and Vision Charms to the Armory. ~.|','2014-12-28 07:05:41',NULL),(10238,10464,102,1,'Quest: WishBringer','Test\r\n','2014-12-28 08:00:39',NULL),(10238,10464,86,1,'Quest: WishBringer','Train\r\n','2014-12-28 08:01:14',NULL),(10009,10320,19,10,'bundle10','','2014-12-28 19:31:35',NULL),(10009,10320,2,10,'bundle10','','2014-12-28 19:31:46',NULL),(10009,10320,36,10,'bundle10','','2014-12-28 19:31:51',NULL),(10421,10009,18,50,'Dreiko Chamele 50','You will need an energy source, so take a full party and find a horron, kill it without trapping it and recover the essence.  Take it with you and go explore either KoES or UoC with your party and look for signs of mare activity.  At either house, drain the horron essence and attempt to recover some energy from one of the house portals.  Find or forge a container for it and take what you\'ve found to someone who knows about such things.  What is their assessment?  What is yours?','2014-12-29 05:19:01',NULL),(10022,10226,111,10,'Amante: Dazzle 10','Dazzle me with your ability to keep the Forwards clean and tidy. I don\'t like to see the tables a mess, orderly rows of items make me happy. See if you can get any dreaming house members to assist you. ~.|\r\n','2014-12-29 09:45:59',NULL),(10452,10411,141,10,'Quest: Shirrin','bundle completion - kinesis','2014-12-30 03:27:47',NULL),(10062,10414,68,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing her learn bundle task from Dina.','2014-12-30 03:41:07',NULL),(10062,10411,65,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completed plat bundle task.','2014-12-30 04:46:24',NULL),(10062,10411,1,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completed plat bundle task.','2014-12-30 04:46:30',NULL),(10421,10318,1,30,'Quest: Avris','bundle task from amante','2014-12-30 19:39:54',NULL),(10421,10318,9,30,'Quest: Avris','bundle task from amante','2014-12-30 19:40:04',NULL),(10226,10464,25,10,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-30 22:11:46',NULL),(10226,10464,26,10,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-30 22:11:59',NULL),(10226,10464,29,10,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-30 22:12:08',NULL),(10226,10464,30,10,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Quest\r\n','2014-12-30 22:12:18',NULL),(10421,10411,10,10,'Quest: Avris','krodoc bundle','2014-12-31 00:03:41',NULL),(10421,10411,141,20,'Quest: Avris','krodoc bundle\r\n','2014-12-31 00:03:52',NULL),(10421,10411,68,30,'Quest: Avris','krodoc bundle','2014-12-31 00:04:03',NULL),(10421,10411,9,30,'Quest: Avris','krodoc bundle\r\n','2014-12-31 00:04:30',NULL),(10421,10411,6,30,'Quest: Avris','krodoc bundle\r\n','2014-12-31 00:04:42',NULL),(10421,10411,8,30,'Quest: Avris','krodoc bundle\r\n','2014-12-31 00:04:54',NULL),(10421,10411,7,30,'Quest: Avris','krodoc bundle\r\n','2014-12-31 00:05:02',NULL),(10450,10318,65,30,'Quest: Keilara','','2014-12-31 02:40:12',NULL),(10259,10125,48,1,'Learn: Soul Evoke','This art has a long history.  In fact at one point many considered it forbidden to be taught.  Who in the past abused this art and why?  Recall his history or ask others.  Was his use justified?  Knowing this put yourself in his shoes?  Would you have done the same or different?  Give me a really good reason why you feel it costs one permenate Dreamsoul.  Do this while wearing a toga.','2014-12-31 06:12:23',NULL),(10421,10072,6,30,'Quest: Avris','Reward for a Sela Cardan GM event','2014-12-31 06:20:51',NULL),(10421,10022,74,40,'Quest: Avris','Reward for Sela Cardan\'s GM event','2014-12-31 06:21:50',NULL),(10421,10005,16,60,'Quest: Avris','Reward for Sela Cardan\'s GM event','2014-12-31 06:22:30',NULL),(10421,10018,38,10,'Quest: Avris','Reward for Sela Cardan\'s GM event','2014-12-31 06:24:32',NULL),(10009,10320,2,20,'Seer-Bundle','From Zenobia\'s bundle20 plat','2014-12-31 06:57:16',NULL),(10421,10009,52,40,'Dreiko Train 40','Write me an Avris appropriate Seer 60 task for Elspet','2014-12-31 07:10:16',NULL),(10022,10320,7,1,'Quest: BladeSlayer','bunde to learn, honoring for Amante','2014-12-31 08:28:20',NULL),(10022,10320,24,1,'Quest: BladeSlayer','bunde to learn, honoring for Amante','2014-12-31 08:28:57',NULL),(10022,10320,38,1,'Quest: BladeSlayer','bunde to learn, honoring for Amante','2014-12-31 08:29:17',NULL),(10022,10320,74,1,'Quest: BladeSlayer','bunde to learn, honoring for Amante','2014-12-31 08:29:56',NULL),(10226,10467,47,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-31 10:28:18',NULL),(10226,10467,40,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2014-12-31 10:28:36',NULL),(10009,10320,20,1,'Blast-BundlePlat','Zenobia\'s granting of Blast in accordance to her bundle task completion.','2015-01-01 01:49:16',NULL),(10005,10320,20,10,'Zenobia Blast 10','Completion Codex','2015-01-01 07:19:13',NULL),(10005,10320,69,10,'Quest: Eros','Completion Codex','2015-01-01 07:19:42',NULL),(10005,10320,36,20,'Quest: Eros','Completion Codex','2015-01-01 07:20:42',NULL),(10005,10320,19,20,'Quest: Eros','Completion Codex','2015-01-01 07:21:05',NULL),(10125,10464,70,30,'flame to 30','Seth completed a bundle quest for this.  ~D','2015-01-01 08:46:39',NULL),(10125,10464,24,30,'restore - 30','Seth completed a bundle quest for this.  ~D','2015-01-01 08:47:24',NULL),(10125,10464,3,30,'SoulMaster - 30','Seth completed a bundle quest for this.  ~D','2015-01-01 09:04:55',NULL),(10009,10302,19,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Completion based on Kya\'s 20 learn bundle','2015-01-01 20:07:15',NULL),(10009,10302,18,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Completion based on Kya\'s 20 learn bundle','2015-01-01 20:07:22',NULL),(10009,10302,17,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Completion based on Kya\'s 20 learn bundle','2015-01-01 20:07:57',NULL),(10009,10302,72,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Completion based on Kya\'s 20 learn bundle','2015-01-01 20:08:03',NULL),(10226,10464,67,30,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-01-01 22:03:05',NULL),(10107,10320,69,20,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','','2015-01-01 22:30:16',NULL),(10107,10320,20,20,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','','2015-01-01 22:30:25',NULL),(10072,10018,16,10,'Identify10Jade','Identify the best candidates for both the Order, and Alliance ambassador positions. Report back with the pros and cons of each choice. ','2015-01-01 23:41:22',NULL),(10421,10009,51,10,'Dreiko, Locate','Go run thresh and tell everyone to come here for a quick teaching meeting','2015-01-02 01:56:45',NULL),(10452,10066,141,30,'Kinesis*30','A crudely drawn figure in a hooded cloak is sketched on the side of the paper, an arrow pointing to it from the word \'Blue\". \"A little mystery is hard to find. Find a viable method to fool other Dreamers using yor GateKeepery arts. Determine which art (or arts) are the best, why, and which were the runners up. Plan out your strategy and enact it on several other Dreamers, friends and others. Let\'s discuss your successes, and any failures.\" A poorly drawn star is scratched at the bottom of the page.','2015-01-02 02:05:19',NULL),(10029,10021,22,30,'Forge - 30','Create a set of tools for use by this new Alliance. There should be at least a couple of tools or artifacts designed in the spirit of each Voice and that unique ideology brought to the Alliance. Secure in the library and reveal their purpose to the house.','2015-01-02 11:42:41',NULL),(10421,10467,38,1,'Quest: Avris','To learn bundle from Amante','2015-01-02 23:37:16',NULL),(10421,10467,71,1,'Quest: Avris','To learn bundle from Amante','2015-01-02 23:37:30',NULL),(10226,10072,111,1,'Dazzle','Consider ways Dazzle can be used to help a situation and tell me all DoL dreaming at the time what they are.','2015-01-02 23:38:51',NULL),(10226,10411,111,1,'Dazzle','Go to Chasm and Ward around. While working there, consider a moment (Or more if there are any) when you could use Dazzle to benifit us.','2015-01-02 23:45:10',NULL),(10421,10011,88,1,'Quest: Avris','Starfall has gained all factions\' ruler support and the majority of the MT\'s to become a freespirit MT','2015-01-03 04:59:37',NULL),(10029,10011,22,60,'Forge T. 60 - Pt 2','You have decided on how to use your skill to further the cause of Oneiro-Archaeology. Put concept to action and create the foundational pieces of our concept and deploy them. Let us see if this new area of interest takes root. Vary the recipients and deployment time and method as is appropriate.','2015-01-03 08:26:01',NULL),(10125,10051,107,10,'PA - 10','Create a mission about Peace Aura for all our house members to be informed by.  Include when it is best Peace Aura be used in both offensive and defensive situations.  Determine what the sanctioned use of Peace Aura will be.  Make sure to include all Ruler/Guardian input on the matter.  Then include it in the post as well.  ~D','2015-01-04 06:16:02',NULL),(10027,10067,51,20,'Locate Dramer 20','You can be a fashion guide. Check out the descriptions of dreamers and give them a hand if you want to help with their appearance. I will need there names their descriptions and what you would suggestion. Note you do not have to actually help them. Some might get cranky so thats your choice.','2015-01-04 06:34:26',NULL),(10125,10029,107,10,'Peace Aura - 10','The recent changes has caused heartache and a rash of confusion.  Reach out to our members who are struggling to cope with the changes and help bring them peace of mind as we move forward together to investigate all that has transpired.  ~D ','2015-01-04 06:40:18',NULL),(10067,10011,118,1,'House Members','This is a most helpful art. Please explain how it is better/worse than Locate Dreamers? Also, what do you think it should do as you plat it. It\'s time for your grandest wishes to come out about the hopes of what a simple art \"could\" be. <T>','2015-01-04 07:49:24',NULL),(10226,10018,74,30,'MindBlank 30','The mind is a tricky thing. Speak backwards (Not letters, but words) as much as you can for a few dreams until someone somehow cures you. An example: Stories Tell! Poems write don\'t.','2015-01-04 12:23:10',NULL),(10003,10477,98,1,'NA ( L) Ironies','New challenges are in the city now since the eclipse happened and city\'s merged. Our young are no longer taught the same way. Learn about the bundles and how it affects newlies and more specifically how it affects our art to locate them. Is the art useful anymore?','2015-01-05 02:43:46',NULL),(10007,10112,3,30,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle plat','2015-01-05 03:10:20',NULL),(10007,10112,67,30,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle plat','2015-01-05 03:10:57',NULL),(10007,10112,25,30,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle plat','2015-01-05 03:11:16',NULL),(10007,10112,24,30,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle plat','2015-01-05 03:11:38',NULL),(10007,10112,70,30,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle plat','2015-01-05 03:12:11',NULL),(10027,10469,20,10,'Quest: LadySilver','','2015-01-05 04:59:23',NULL),(10027,10469,36,10,'Quest: LadySilver','','2015-01-05 05:00:09',NULL),(10027,10469,16,10,'Quest: LadySilver','','2015-01-05 05:01:01',NULL),(10027,10469,98,10,'Quest: LadySilver','','2015-01-05 05:02:58',NULL),(10027,10469,19,10,'Quest: LadySilver','','2015-01-05 05:03:46',NULL),(10027,10004,19,30,'Quest: LadySilver','','2015-01-05 05:17:13',NULL),(10125,10455,107,10,'Peace Aura - 10','In order to keep the Peace, we will need supplies to defend.  Organize the Armory and Vault supplies based upon our house members needs.  Recharge all items as well.  If any item is needed and is low, help gen some of them.  ~D','2015-01-05 20:25:13',NULL),(10169,10091,105,1,'Quest: Kage','Gather items for our armories.\r\n','2015-01-05 21:40:22',NULL),(10169,10477,35,1,'Trap Nightmare','To get you whipped into shape to handle trapping duties, I\'d like you to assist me with trapping for the house in the Cenotaph.  We\'ll work on this until we\'ve accumulated a sufficient amount of strength for the Orb.  If for some reason this falls through, I\'d like you to talk to Liolira about what supplies the house is lacking and do your best to fill those voids for us.','2015-01-06 01:48:11',NULL),(10030,10027,21,30,'Blend (30)','My own affinity, Blast, was found to be embodied within a butterfly, its wing edges as razors. I wish for you to leave your body, and the strife behind, and in so doing connect with the weave of the city itself. Be carried away by all of the threads in the world and let the embodiment of this affinity, Blend, come to you. Return to me when you have control of the totem and a deeper understanding of your connection to the city itself.','2015-01-06 03:00:22',NULL),(10027,10030,9,10,'Free Action to 10','You have a freedom many have forsaken. This new dream mirrors yours and mine. Can you name for me ten places that hold some freedom? Can you tell me the names of ten dreamers that shown you or have shared some sense of these freedoms?','2015-01-06 04:19:28',NULL),(10005,10077,21,10,'Tember Blend 10','I\'ve heard talk of fixing the essence room, but no action yet.  Organize a meeting to get people started on efforts to repair the essence room and begin work towards doing so.','2015-01-06 05:57:18',NULL),(10226,10077,111,1,'Dazzle','Assist the others in Chasm, while there consider any moments you find that Dazzle could help us.','2015-01-06 21:44:49',NULL),(10066,10469,48,1,'Quest: Thunderman','She completed a bundle to learn 1-19, Soul evoke should be covered as a learn at orbit 15.','2015-01-07 01:55:10',NULL),(10211,10469,18,20,'Chamele to 20','Welcome back.  Chamele is useful for relearning the dream.  First I want you to tell me how, next I want you to tell my when it might not be usefull.  Finally I want you to tell me what planes you explored, when you used chamele, and what you found.','2015-01-07 03:24:19',NULL),(10132,10010,88,1,'Quest: Kal\'lankissa','','2015-01-07 03:47:31',NULL),(10132,10029,88,1,'Quest: Kal\'lankissa','','2015-01-07 03:53:25',NULL),(10169,10477,28,1,'Abjure','We have a serious problem with Abjure right now.  The Dark Mares have all started using Reflect, which leads to us constantly abjuring ourselves when fighting them!  Come up with some solutions to this problem for our focus - how can we cope with it during combat?  Do we have good alternatives to use instead of Abjure against them?','2015-01-07 04:03:16',NULL),(10125,10461,40,1,'Deafen - Learn','in honor of a completed bundle quest by me.  ~D','2015-01-07 08:27:56',NULL),(10125,10461,47,1,'Push - Learn','in honor of a completed bundle quest by me.  ~D','2015-01-07 08:28:36',NULL),(10125,10051,107,20,'PA - 20','There\'s a few missions on the board that were put up; missions regarding our Vision, Mission, and Beliefs as well as why and how we cleanse.  These were missions put up to reflect the changes that have been in affect for some time.  I don\'t believe I\'ve heard your take on the matters or have been asked questions.  Please review these missions and then let\'s discuss them together and what it means for our home moving forward.  ~D\r\n','2015-01-07 09:23:21',NULL),(10169,10477,35,10,'Trap 10','Make effective use of your trap and conduct a solo run using chamele alts.  Also work with some pack mules from the house to do some more involved runs.  Which do you find more effective in strengthening the orb?','2015-01-07 21:27:11',NULL),(10125,10455,89,30,'SS to 30','Finish recharging, combining, and organizing the Armory and Vault and report back to me.  ~D','2015-01-08 22:32:29',NULL),(10009,10302,2,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Bundle task honoring','2015-01-09 01:32:19',NULL),(10009,10302,69,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Bundle task honoring','2015-01-09 01:32:27',NULL),(10072,10318,12,1,'Shatter','Shatter the dreams perception of you. Invent a new image, and make the dream see a more powerful, disciplined, and classy Lu Chaos. Do it without sacrificing who you truly are.','2015-01-09 01:48:38',NULL),(10450,10169,22,50,'Quest: Keilara','Forge Plateau - UnderGames 1st place winner choice of plat.','2015-01-09 04:00:27',NULL),(10226,10464,25,20,'Reweave','Bundle Task','2015-01-09 04:08:06',NULL),(10450,10318,7,30,'Quest: Keilara',' Bundle task - 30','2015-01-09 04:49:37',NULL),(10052,10027,74,40,'MB to 40 - Silver','This is an art mostly used for battle purposes or privacy.  I want you to invent a game with Mindblank that is not hide and seek.  Be inventive and find some within Calenture to play this game with!  What were the results?  Can this translate to other things?','2015-01-09 05:16:26',NULL),(10480,10029,83,60,'Healing Aura 60','I would like for you to become an auracle, pun intended, and attempt to piece together a true healing aura by breaking down other auras and their properties such as Peace Aura and the aura of the mares. Tear them apart and reassemble the new healing aura. Use as many people as you need in your attempt. Do not break anyone that you can not repair. Let us see how clever you aura. ','2015-01-09 05:29:39',NULL),(10057,10048,105,1,'Quest: Kailoth','Granted due to regular contributions to the house.','2015-01-10 03:34:34',NULL),(10057,10067,105,1,'Quest: Kailoth','Granted due to house activities ~Kail\r\n','2015-01-10 04:24:39',NULL),(10022,10007,28,50,'Dina: Abjure to 50','It seems the SoulMaster guild may be up and running soon. We have things on the agenda so that we can make our arts more useful... First up is poison! I want you to take an active role in this, seek out those who are working on this project, actively assist them as best you can. Come up with theories of your own, test them... if you can. I expect many attempts, many ideas, much assistance given to the Guild... report your findings to the SoulMaster Guild during meetings, or to me personally. ~.|\r\n','2015-01-11 03:02:37',NULL),(10479,10318,68,30,'Quest: Herbert','plat 30 completion given by amante','2015-01-11 08:11:02',NULL),(10029,10022,81,10,'Vampiric Draw: 10','This ability seems overly punative given the essence requirement, is there another binding ingredient that we may be able to manipulate to focus our ability (without limiting the power of the ability itself.) Experiment, discuss, torture.','2015-01-11 23:02:30',NULL),(10029,10104,107,1,'Peace Aura: ','Use the Generator of the house to test the overall stabilitiy of your filter, see if there is any reaction. - This need not be a large scale arduous endevour. - ','2015-01-11 23:22:31',NULL),(10066,10385,68,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 1-19 learns task from starfall. Completion codex from Lance Stone and verbal verification from starfall.','2015-01-12 00:10:28',NULL),(10066,10385,9,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 1-19 learns task from starfall. Completion codex from Lance Stone and verbal verification from starfall.','2015-01-12 00:10:58',NULL),(10066,10385,47,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 1-19 learns task from starfall. Completion codex from Lance Stone and verbal verification from starfall.','2015-01-12 00:11:13',NULL),(10169,10477,28,10,'Abjure to 10','Abjure is our most valuable combat arts.  Having recently returned to the city, I\'d like you to practice your combat techniques.  Find out where you are rusty.  Do whatever you need to in order to train up a bit and be prepared for a training session with me, where we\'ll use live fire to put you to the test and round out your training.','2015-01-12 01:17:08',NULL),(10057,10219,74,50,'Quest: MB-50','Do what Clarity has asked. perform reconnaissance and find out what folks are doing to randomly be obtaining these spheres. Eros, Blade, and Jade mainly, or any other 3 enemies. ~Kail','2015-01-12 03:37:54',NULL),(10072,10034,74,20,'MindBlank20','Recall your past. We all go through trials. Some things that happen to us, we would rather forget. Identify one such moment from your past, and tell me how it either made you stronger, or weaker.','2015-01-12 04:19:34',NULL),(10226,10320,73,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-01-12 05:20:14',NULL),(10005,10320,36,30,'Quest: Eros','Bundle to 30 completion','2015-01-12 05:22:31',NULL),(10005,10320,2,30,'Bundle','Zenobia bundle 30 completion','2015-01-12 05:31:42',NULL),(10022,10320,25,1,'bundle honor','reweave for zenobia\r\n','2015-01-12 05:56:40',NULL),(10022,10320,8,1,'Bundle honor','protection for zenobia\r\n','2015-01-12 05:57:55',NULL),(10051,10469,6,10,'Med to 10 - Gray','I want you to concentrate on what you wish your dreams to be upon re-finding our city.  Do you know the path you wish to take?  What do you want to accomplish?  What \"Will\" you accomplish.  Figure out the answers to these or at least ideas and meditate on them.  Then report','2015-01-12 06:48:37',NULL),(10226,10008,111,1,'Dazzle','Dazzle Blade with one of your best attributes within the next ten minutes','2015-01-12 09:06:51',NULL),(10480,10066,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','','2015-01-13 02:54:09',NULL),(10027,10320,20,30,'blast 30','','2015-01-13 03:39:39',NULL),(10027,10320,19,30,'blast 30','','2015-01-13 03:40:31',NULL),(10027,10320,69,30,'flame to 30','','2015-01-13 03:41:12',NULL),(10030,10465,16,40,'Identify: Forty','Beyond the land lies the \'weave, it is to this force that the seer and seeress gain their power. With the heavy soul that you carry, an exchange must be negotiated for. Cast off one of your many burdens in exchange for a gift from the weave itself. ','2015-01-14 02:17:56',NULL),(10066,10318,1,40,'Gatekeeper 40','Enlist the help of others to find a method to deconstruct a gold chakram. What parts make up the chakram and what are their functions? Attempt to reassemble the talisman. Was there any useful information derrived from either process that you and ohers feel could be used to have the generators produce more gold chakrams?','2015-01-14 02:48:39',NULL),(10226,10318,89,1,'Soul Shield','You\'ve got a theory that Peace Aura is prevented by Soul Shield.  Test this and while you find out, consider how you think Soul Shield works, why it stops MInd Blank and depending on your results, why or why not it doesn\'t stop Peace Aura? How do you think Peace Aura works?','2015-01-14 07:29:29',NULL),(10051,10030,107,1,'Peace Aura - Varwyn','Post a message or series of messages to Dakkoth, Co-Ruler of the Alliance about who and what the Vanezera was in your city and what it continues to be across cities.  See also if he would be willing to post that information upon our mission boards.','2015-01-14 08:24:14',NULL),(10226,10022,30,40,'Antidote 40','Convince Chaos to stay out of trouble for four bells (not necessarily consecutively). Make him stop talking and stand still (other then obvious necessary movements).','2015-01-14 08:26:21',NULL),(10022,10318,50,1,'Lu Chaos: NMF','Study the mating habits of the Bogrom. Emerse yourself into its habitat, study its routine. I expect a detailed report on how the bogrom goes about its mating ritual. ~.|','2015-01-14 09:21:28',NULL),(10238,10503,41,1,'Quest: WishBringer','Testing\r\n','2015-01-14 14:51:26',NULL),(10169,10477,35,20,'Trap 20','Find out what the house arts are for the 4 closed houses.  Get the details of what they actually do and how effective they are.  Also scout them out and determine how effective each one woud be as a stronghold - what pros and cons do you see to each location?','2015-01-15 01:23:58',NULL),(10450,10318,9,40,'FA40LuChaos','Freeing your mind from the negativity, I\'d like you to take a few days and become a gentleman. No swearing, no hitting on females in a negative way. Choose a female friend, housemate, or whatever.. and do something very nice for her, as a gentleman would. And then report to me, with their reactions and comments.','2015-01-15 05:19:46',NULL),(10107,10320,18,10,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','For a combined task','2015-01-15 06:34:39',NULL),(10226,10005,111,1,'Dazzle','Dazzle me with your impressive forging skills.  Make me an object that grants me the vision to see your forging skills!','2015-01-15 07:41:40',NULL),(10066,10318,68,40,'Flameshaft 40','Find a battle savy partner and conduct worthwhile two part test on collapsing Shamblixes. Part 1: Blade (via ping pong), Part 2: Flame (via ping pong). After you and your partner have mastered each strategy, record data (time of battle, hits received and other relevant data). Compare and contrast the results and identify which method is actually best for the ping pong tactic. Demonstrate these methods to a few dreamers as you have demonstrated to me.','2015-01-16 01:34:16',NULL),(10350,10029,116,1,'Wordsmith','Nominated for Wordsmith','2015-01-16 02:42:46',NULL),(10350,10104,116,1,'Wordsmith','Nominated for Wordsmith','2015-01-16 02:42:51',NULL),(10350,10022,116,1,'Wordsmith','Nominated for Wordsmith','2015-01-16 02:42:56',NULL),(10350,10226,116,1,'Wordsmith','Nominated for Wordsmith','2015-01-16 02:43:05',NULL),(10072,10018,13,1,'ReturnJade','Reflect upon your past, and identify a person, or people who have done something to help you in the past. Come up with, and execute a plan to \"pay them back\" for what they have done for you. ','2015-01-16 23:24:55',NULL),(10226,10276,51,20,'Sense 20','Help your fellow dreamers who are obviously addicted. Write up a step by step program type of thing for Locate and/or Sense Dreamer to cure them of their addiction. You know what I mean. You don\'t have to organise these meetings, just tell me what you would do if you were to run one!','2015-01-17 06:26:15',NULL),(10226,10276,51,20,'Quest: Amante','Redoing a task because I wrote it for the wrong art\r\n','2015-01-17 06:26:15',NULL),(10169,10477,35,30,'Trap 30','Investigate the maren presence at the Union.  Try to collect all accounts that you can of Dark Mare activity in that stronghold, and see if you can find out if the Dark Mares are actively using it or not.  Are we being distracted from this menace due to the activities at KOES, or is the Union really just an abandoned project for them?','2015-01-17 14:58:31',NULL),(10029,10169,3,60,'Soulmaster: 60','Guilds, alliances, enemies, plots and other devices - Any of these things alone possesses a certain power, but together they can be so much more. As with our powers, a basic poison or tincture can morph into something more should it be or have a catalyst. --- Be or find such a catalyst for yourself, and get something done -- for or against a prominent dreamer of our focus.','2015-01-17 18:17:15',NULL),(10072,10411,12,1,'Shatter','Identify a plane with Calenture huntung on it. Ward it up. Report back when what happens next. ','2015-01-17 23:36:29',NULL),(10034,10411,10,20,'Quest: Ashton','Bundle Task completion ward 20','2015-01-18 00:57:32',NULL),(10479,10411,141,30,'Quest: Herbert','Honoring Aidan bundle to 30 completion','2015-01-18 17:45:11',NULL),(10479,10112,7,1,'Quest: Herbert','30 bundle','2015-01-18 18:26:14',NULL),(10479,10112,15,1,'Quest: Herbert','30 bundle completion','2015-01-18 18:26:21',NULL),(10479,10112,29,1,'Quest: Herbert','30 bundle completion','2015-01-18 18:26:29',NULL),(10479,10112,30,1,'Quest: Herbert','30 bundle completion','2015-01-18 18:26:37',NULL),(10479,10112,38,1,'Quest: Herbert','30 bundle completion','2015-01-18 18:26:48',NULL),(10479,10112,74,1,'Quest: Herbert','30 bundle completion','2015-01-18 18:26:55',NULL),(10007,10496,15,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle task','2015-01-18 18:34:40',NULL),(10007,10496,47,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle task','2015-01-18 18:35:03',NULL),(10007,10496,98,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle task','2015-01-18 18:35:35',NULL),(10098,10311,40,10,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-01-18 21:46:25',NULL),(10052,10312,4,20,'FS to 20 - Harley','With us being from another city, How are the fonts here different from our city?  Are they better, worse or the same?  Choose two specific fonts to do this research on and offer your thoughts on the outcome.  How can we as Fatesenders and as dreamers potentially change them for the better?','2015-01-18 23:46:11',NULL),(10211,10496,69,1,'Quest: brother timo','trance flame bundle completion','2015-01-18 23:48:02',NULL),(10211,10496,36,10,'Quest: brother timo','bundle advancement','2015-01-18 23:52:29',NULL),(10211,10496,14,10,'Quest: brother timo','bundle advancement','2015-01-18 23:56:51',NULL),(10052,10465,142,1,'Misdirection - Nork','I think what would suit you to learn about this art is seeing how you can misdirect conflicts using your other favorite thing which is drinking.  See if you can help current conflicts going on in the city with an offered drink and a quality shoulder to listen.  Let\'s see what the results produce for you.','2015-01-19 00:04:15',NULL),(10072,10148,1,10,'Quest: Jerulan','finished bundle','2015-01-19 05:01:06',NULL),(10072,10148,65,10,'Quest: Jerulan','bundle complete\r\n','2015-01-19 05:01:31',NULL),(10098,10125,22,50,'Dakkoth Forge 50','3You have assisted in making the Marometer, the tally device for the Nexus project. We successfully made a prototype because of your assistance. Next, we need to perfect the prototype into a functional device. Come up with the schematics needed to fine tune the device, and assist in the process of the final product','2015-01-19 20:51:53',NULL),(10066,10148,9,10,'Quest: Thunderman','Completion codex from Amante for Focus arts to 10.','2015-01-19 23:03:47',NULL),(10066,10148,7,10,'Quest: Thunderman','Completion codex from Amante for Focus arts to 10.','2015-01-19 23:04:18',NULL),(10011,10067,22,30,'Tam - Forge 30','Now is the time to begin deepening your connection to the craft. Consider how you work, what themes you embrace, what methods you use and how it relates to the city. Uncover what you you feel is your next step in making the art a part of how you move through the dream, then take that next step. _-* 1.8','2015-01-19 23:37:53',NULL),(10067,10011,96,20,'Sense Dreamers 20','Starfall, it\'s time to get to know your neighbors the Idoaclesians. Talk to them and write your favorite 2 stories about artifacts from their City. I want you to place them in the Library for all to read. Share their History, so we can build our future. ','2015-01-19 23:57:07',NULL),(10169,10477,105,1,'Quest: Kage','feed the orb trapped essences\r\n','2015-01-20 00:40:21',NULL),(10479,10411,1,40,'Aidan Gatekeeper 40','Here you go little troublemaker:  For your task, you will attempt to ward trap a member of another house into a single room with either a shamblix, hororn, or darkmare.  ','2015-01-20 02:28:44',NULL),(10479,10411,10,30,'Quest: Herbert','Aidan 30 bundle from krodoc','2015-01-20 02:32:10',NULL),(10211,10496,69,10,'Quest: brother timo','bundle task','2015-01-20 03:32:04',NULL),(10132,10477,102,1,'Quest - 1','Interviewed. Restored ability of Quest as per Teaching Standards.','2015-01-20 04:20:03',NULL),(10480,10029,94,1,'Cleanse Nightmare','It is well past time to clean things up. I believe that you know the ins and outs of this art because of your affinity to the other manipulation arts. I call upon your power to turn a phrase. Come up with a delightful history as to why the City would need this art and how it may have evolved into what it is today. Be as creative as you want to be and work the story any way you please. I am looking for your wit and pun and humor to come shining through. \r\n','2015-01-20 06:23:36',NULL),(10226,10125,26,40,'Purify 40','I\'m getting annoyed with the fact that I do this.  Replacing a quest for Dakkoth that I apparently made for Lu Chaos? Sorry.','2015-01-20 06:27:49',NULL),(10480,10018,68,50,'FlameShaft - 50','I would like to see just how creative you are in your writing. This is the task I set before you. Write for me a short story about your Flame from your first sphere until your fourth. That will be five stories in all. Be creative. They can be Odes or Sonnets or whimsical stories. Tie them all together or make them seperate. It\'s your choice. Have fun with this task. ','2015-01-20 06:38:13',NULL),(10480,10022,67,70,'SoulReaper - 70','BladeSlayer, let us find out if that name suits. It should be no problem to slash your way through some nightmares. I would like for you to find three \"circuits\" of nightmares and see how many you can go though in 10 minutes, 20 minutes and 30 minutes. Attempt the three \"circuits\" at least twice and keep notes on your progress. What is the most effective way to save souls at your level. I would suggest Barrows, Chasm and Lost Caves as three possible circuits for you. Good hunting.','2015-01-20 06:54:03',NULL),(10480,10232,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','granted after interview about the art and requirements.\r\n','2015-01-20 07:42:44',NULL),(10011,10496,16,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle task by Dina completed','2015-01-20 23:41:08',NULL),(10066,10378,15,1,'Lincei - Judgement','Compile a list of judgements you\'ve observed others have made about you. Consider each one carefully and determine whether some are true, false or have merit. Identify one judgement and own it.','2015-01-21 01:12:06',NULL),(10011,10052,82,1,'Trisha - Terror','If the opportunity presents itself, the original task to get into UoC and find out what\'s going on will still apply. Since DoL is in your way, it\'s time to get in their way. Do something to interfere with their plans, or contribute to the war effort such that they are afraid to come out and fight when you\'re around, confining them to their house or sanctuary. _-* 1.19','2015-01-21 21:58:16',NULL),(10005,10077,22,1,'Forge Tember Part 1','Find out what primary colors you will be able to forge if you do not know so already.  Using these primary colors, create design templates with inscribe for four items (one of each primary color) that incoroporate these colors.   ','2015-01-22 06:44:21',NULL),(10005,10077,22,1,'Tember Forge part 2','Develope a specialization you that you will focus on once you are able to forge.  Create an alteror, an elemen, a chakram, and a shield that demonstrate your chosen specialization.  ','2015-01-22 06:44:21',NULL),(10005,10077,22,1,'Tember Forge Final','You say that seth is working to close the essence room to non-members.  Get the forgers of the house involved in this process and lead them to use their forge to assist in this project.','2015-01-22 06:44:21',NULL),(10169,10052,25,10,'Reweave 10','I\'d like you to revisit the protective forces you led in your city and compare them against what you know of the city guard here.  What elements of that group would be most beneficial for us to put into place here?  Also provide me with a list of those from your city who you feel I could trust to bring into the city guard.  The list does not have to be long, but I\'d like explanations on those you would deem worthy candidates.','2015-01-22 17:16:17',NULL),(10011,10108,41,10,'Clarity Blind 10','Put your foot down and say you need some time if you\'re ever going to be a teacher, and no one gets to tell you there\'s more important things to do. Your boy can survive one night where we take the time needed to go over those sample tasks you\'ve been working on. Make the time for it. _-*','2015-01-22 21:03:04',NULL),(10169,10090,47,30,'Push 30','Organize a plan to keep our vault stocked with important forged items such as Shields, Alterors, and Dreamsoul elemens now that Thunderman has left the house.  Either work with Ghazgkull or do this on your own, report to me on the exact stock you\'ve created and that you\'d like to keep in place moving forward and we\'ll make sure it suits our needs.','2015-01-23 02:58:57',NULL),(10051,10011,40,30,'Deafen to 30 - Star','Apparently everyone else is deaf to the call that you\'ve received with the Keepers.  So continue to listen better than everyone else and find out what is going on with Kruugaar specifically, what are the motivations for his efforts with KoES.  Will you support him or fend him off?  Other details should be included as well','2015-01-23 17:22:07',NULL),(10479,10029,72,60,'Magnilia Inscribe60','Attempt to join the Wordsmiths and gain their mark.  Save a copy of any writings you submti to them or read at their meetings.  Report back to me once you think you\'ve made a genuine effort to join.','2015-01-23 18:25:42',NULL),(10479,10311,43,10,'Quest: Herbert','gerroz bundle\r\n','2015-01-23 18:37:06',NULL),(10066,10411,11,20,'Quest: Thunderman','Amulet 20 per completion codex of bundle plats to 20 issued by krodoc','2015-01-24 00:54:11',NULL),(10011,10461,71,1,'Flame Learn','Honoring a bundle task by Dakkoth. ','2015-01-24 03:14:19',NULL),(10029,10360,107,1,'Peace Aura: Learn','Familiarize yourself with the mission board and leave me a mission with a tale of yourself and your role in your native city that I might know you better and find specific role for you within the house.','2015-01-24 18:30:57',NULL),(10479,10018,74,40,'Quest: Herbert','Mindblank to 40 for winning the undergames.','2015-01-25 03:57:58',NULL),(10450,10018,1,50,'GK50:Jade','You have suggested that you are working on a plan to damage the Siren, Yazashinara. Summon her, and collect her essence if you can. Not wishing to damage it as per your beliefs, somehow use this essence as a tool to further your plans. Formulate a plan that would silence her, indefinitely, and tell me how and why that it would work.','2015-01-25 04:43:08',NULL),(10007,10477,35,40,'Trap Ntmr 40','Now that you are a freespirit like me, it kinda sucks having to gen all the time for items. Especially Resilience. Talk to a Ruler and get one to set up a deal with you. You trap for them and they give back to you. Then surprise this house with 1000 strength. Don\'t forget to have the Ruler write a codex stating the deal so I can see it.','2015-01-25 17:04:10',NULL),(10066,10385,7,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Completion codex for bundle learns 1-19 issued by starfall. Honoring Resist fear to learn.','2015-01-25 22:07:41',NULL),(10066,10219,22,1,'Forge Learn','(pt 1 complete) p2: Your chosen medium to craft in is stone. Research this medium, acquire the tools necessary to craft in this medium and begin practicing. Develop a process to craft in stone and be able to demonstrate to me from start to finish one piece. keep one of your practice pieces as well to show me.','2015-01-26 00:01:43',NULL),(10480,10088,60,1,'Quest: Akkadian','turned in his sample tasks for regaining the art of sphere. **A**','2015-01-26 03:49:15',NULL),(10005,10018,22,1,'Jade Forge Final','Work with the other forgers of your house to create an item to assist you during the summoning yazawhatsherface or to harm her in some way.  Put this item to use when you attempt to summon her, and report back your results.','2015-01-26 04:52:36',NULL),(10034,10320,6,10,'Med10Zen','Take a little bit of time and think about your inner self. Have you done, or said anything to anyone with any regret? What would you change... why or why not?','2015-01-26 05:23:30',NULL),(10127,10098,22,80,'Forge 80 KG','Work with the other Forgers in the Forgers\' Guild to make an impact on the City. You all must come together with your combined skills to assist with the specific project of another group of dreamers: various focus guilds, creating a vault, removing mares, etc. You must utilize ideas of Forgers outside of your faction, and must make at least 2 attempts at your goal.','2015-01-26 22:22:15',NULL),(10479,10022,70,70,'Bladeslayer Flame70','I have heard rumors that the darkmares have mentioned some kind of egg they are growing inside of KoES.  The next time you the other younguns from your house raid the keepers, seek out this egg then work with your house mates to destroy it.  Darkmare eggs are very strong and difficult to destroy, so work with your house mates to do so.  ','2015-01-27 06:21:00',NULL),(10029,10496,96,10,'Sense D: 10','I am of a mind that we\'re all a little mad, and I do not mean angry. As you explore about the city and encounter others I wish for you to keep track of some of the oddest things you notice about people. This could be a scratch they think no one notices, an embarassing statement, or any other detail or idiosincracy that happens to grab your attention. Find the odd, and return.','2015-01-27 06:35:55',NULL),(10022,10226,100,10,'Quest: BladeSlayer','Explain to me why a house requires PT\'s to function. Ask one other house members, of a different house why PT\'s are important to a house... or why not for that matter, depending on their opinion. Did the opinion differ from yours, how? Is there one \"right\" view?','2015-01-27 07:26:05',NULL),(10007,10477,24,50,'Restore 50','Restore your friendship with Kage to the point he gives you a 30 plat task.','2015-01-28 01:50:11',NULL),(10007,10477,24,50,'Restore 50','Restore the relationship with Kage to the point he gives you a task for 50 flame. ','2015-01-28 01:50:11',NULL),(10007,10411,89,1,'Soul Shield','This art seems to be one that is overlooked a lot, but what are the benefits and disadvantages of it? What is the cost and element of this art, but most of all, how long will it last at unplatted and with each plat?','2015-01-28 02:25:38',NULL),(10125,10112,8,1,'Quest: Dakkoth','In honor of completion of Herbert\'s bundle quest.  ~D','2015-01-28 19:15:58',NULL),(10125,10112,16,1,'Quest: Dakkoth','In honor of completion of Herbert\'s bundle quest.  ~D','2015-01-28 19:16:41',NULL),(10007,10414,139,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle','2015-01-28 23:15:47',NULL),(10007,10414,9,10,'mattia','plat 10 bundle','2015-01-28 23:42:41',NULL),(10007,10414,7,10,'Quest: Dina','plat 10 bundle','2015-01-28 23:43:04',NULL),(10030,10496,51,10,'Locate: 10','Approach one of the many dreamers you have encountered (and feel like having a conversation with) and ask them about the \'local crafting skill(s)\'. Return to me when you have had this conversation and we will compare the information you have gained with the information you have regarding the \'crafting skills\' of your world.','2015-01-28 23:55:23',NULL),(10030,10469,107,1,'Peace Aura: L','As a Seeress we must be able to see into the heart of those around us, just as we have a connection to the deeper \'Weave of the city itself. Whereas I may be bound to the Moon, there are those elements even in the city which you may draw power from. What are these elements for you and how will you use them as a Seeress of your family?','2015-01-29 00:43:31',NULL),(10007,10211,24,20,'Restore 20','Due to the frustrations you are having with what happened at HC last night. Find a newly or someone much lower in sphere. Help show them that there are nice helpful people in this city. Help them get maxed and ready for first and teach them what you can.','2015-01-29 01:08:45',NULL),(10062,10411,65,40,'Blade 40','Design a blade fitting for a GateKeeper of the 4th sphere. Collect any materials needed to craft such a piece, and seek out the help of two forgers who can construct the blade and hilt end. Find a way to combine these two pieces in order to represent all GateKeepers of the city. Bring me the blade for examination.','2015-01-29 02:02:59',NULL),(10450,10072,92,70,'Reflect70Jerulan','Work in conjunction with your Ruler on two Raids on the Keepers of Eternal Shadow. Assuming you are one of the best fighters in your house, that is.. seek out Silk Nuvas to obtain entry into the house. Come up with a solid strategy as he is instructed, and come out with as few casualties as possible.','2015-01-29 03:27:00',NULL),(10450,10022,28,70,'Abjure70Blade','Take your house members a couple of raids to the Keepers of Eternal Shadow. Work with your Military personnel and come up with a decent strategy to defeat the beings with as little collapsing as possible.','2015-01-29 03:56:58',NULL),(10450,10320,18,20,'Quest: Keilara','Bundle Task Plat Completion Codex 20','2015-01-29 04:43:39',NULL),(10226,10320,139,1,'Sense Datoken','Bundle task','2015-01-29 05:31:23',NULL),(10011,10383,38,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle learning','2015-01-29 22:13:55',NULL),(10011,10383,40,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle learning\r\n','2015-01-29 22:14:16',NULL),(10011,10383,71,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle learning','2015-01-29 22:14:47',NULL),(10011,10383,47,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle learning\r\n','2015-01-29 22:15:08',NULL),(10066,10411,11,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plat 30 completion codex issued by Krodoc. Honoring Amulet to 30.','2015-01-30 00:32:48',NULL),(10066,10385,1,10,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle task for first plats is complete and issued by me. Honoring Gatekeeper to 10.','2015-01-30 03:11:12',NULL),(10066,10385,65,10,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle task for first plats is complete and issued by me. Honoring Gatesmasher to 10.','2015-01-30 03:11:53',NULL),(10066,10385,68,10,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle task for first plats is complete and issued by me. Honoring Flameshaft to 10.','2015-01-30 03:12:30',NULL),(10226,10320,111,1,'Dazzle','Dazzle me with your compassion and dedication to the house.','2015-01-30 09:49:36',NULL),(10226,10320,46,1,'FA','Bundle Task','2015-01-30 09:58:20',NULL),(10226,10320,46,1,'Recall','Bundle Task','2015-01-30 09:58:20',NULL),(10226,10320,26,1,'Purify','Bundle Task','2015-01-30 09:58:30',NULL),(10226,10320,40,1,'Deafen','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-01-30 10:00:21',NULL),(10226,10320,9,1,'FA','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-01-30 10:00:31',NULL),(10072,10088,111,1,'Dazzle','Come up with a suitable task for amante\'s mini plataeu. ','2015-01-31 00:29:35',NULL),(10066,10496,139,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle learn 0-19 completion codex from Dina. Attempting to honor Sense Datoken.','2015-01-31 01:28:11',NULL),(10066,10169,139,1,'Quest: Thunderman','This is the quest to honor the Sense Datoken quest issued previously to Kage. he completed it but during a daymare attack, I mistakenly must have tossed it.','2015-01-31 04:08:00',NULL),(10009,10469,40,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Completion based on 2nd sphere bundle learn task','2015-02-01 05:05:49',NULL),(10009,10469,26,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Completion based on 2nd sphere bundle learn task','2015-02-01 05:05:58',NULL),(10479,10477,86,1,'Quest: Herbert','giving support train','2015-02-01 05:14:38',NULL),(10007,10477,35,50,'Trap Ntmr 50','As we talked about, I want you to do somethin \"big\". Enough to make peoples head do a double turn OR get people involved in something, could be a game of some sort. This needs to be worth a 50 plat and not done in a simple way. Time and effort is what I am talking about. I want many reactions.','2015-02-01 05:28:37',NULL),(10479,10411,68,40,'Aidan Flameshaft 40','Find another youngun and using only your flames collapse a Shamblix 20 times or a Horron 10 times.  Oh, and no using Invis you cheater!','2015-02-01 05:48:53',NULL),(10029,10496,64,10,'Give: 10','Explore the Lambent Flats (Higher or Lower or both if you\'re really obsessive) and take note of which rooms inspire you the most. Note the qualities of the room(s) which you feel drawn to the most and consider what might be done to enhance them.','2015-02-01 06:22:03',NULL),(10226,10496,48,1,'Quest: Amante','Bundle Task completed\r\n','2015-02-01 06:54:39',NULL),(10480,10469,25,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted per Bundle task\r\n','2015-02-01 08:01:40',NULL),(10480,10469,24,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted per Bundle task\r\n','2015-02-01 08:01:47',NULL),(10480,10469,8,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted per Bundle task\r\n','2015-02-01 08:01:54',NULL),(10480,10469,73,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted perr Bundle task \r\n','2015-02-01 08:02:07',NULL),(10029,10360,25,20,'Blue: Reweave 20','Completion given by Amante for Bundle - 20\'s.','2015-02-01 20:53:04',NULL),(10029,10360,27,1,'Drain Self: Learn','I am intrigued by your passion for organics and those fields worked within the mysteries of the city. I would like for you to take your knowledge from Idoaclesia and your growing knowledge here to concieve of an \'Almanac\'. The details are up to you, ideally it should lead to a few things we could all do together in the field.','2015-02-01 20:53:39',NULL),(10098,10496,16,10,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-02-01 21:21:53',NULL),(10098,10496,98,10,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-02-01 21:22:53',NULL),(10098,10496,2,10,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-02-01 21:23:07',NULL),(10098,10385,6,10,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-02-01 22:09:16',NULL),(10098,10385,9,10,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-02-01 22:09:42',NULL),(10098,10385,8,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-02-01 22:10:09',NULL),(10067,10496,139,10,'Quest: Tamarisk','Completion of Plat bundle task for Seer. \r\n','2015-02-02 23:04:41',NULL),(10067,10378,69,10,'Quest: Tamarisk','Bundle task completion.','2015-02-03 23:39:48',NULL),(10067,10378,36,10,'Quest: Tamarisk','Bundle task reward\r\n','2015-02-03 23:40:25',NULL),(10450,10011,80,30,'Quest: Keilara','Plateau for Team Red UnderGames Winner','2015-02-04 03:43:23',NULL),(10450,10169,35,50,'Quest: Keilara','Red Team UnderGames Winner Plateau','2015-02-04 03:49:04',NULL),(10450,10090,63,50,'Quest: Keilara','Red Team UnderGames winner plateau','2015-02-04 03:49:40',NULL),(10450,10219,68,50,'Quest: Keilara','Red Team UnderGames winner plateau','2015-02-04 03:50:16',NULL),(10107,10320,16,10,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','BUNDLEFLY!!','2015-02-04 06:12:59',NULL),(10450,10312,38,10,'Quest: Keilara','Plateau winner of Scavenger Hunt hosted by Zenobia','2015-02-05 02:44:22',NULL),(10211,10496,15,10,'Quest: brother timo','judgement plat for bundle completion','2015-02-05 04:18:36',NULL),(10018,10320,9,10,'FA 10','Where flowers bloom, weeds begin to sprout. And weeds are one of the worst things when it comes to maintaining a garden! Ensure a nice patch of cursed weeds grow, where the destroyed flowers once were in Evernight. See if anyone notices. What are their reactions?','2015-02-05 07:32:07',NULL),(10226,10320,74,10,'Mind Blank 10','You\'ve lost your mind, it\'s become a total blank!!!  Other then your house beliefs and loyalties, you\'ve forgotten who you are.  How do those around you react? (If you don\'t want to lose your memory, you could always lose your Sanity!!!)','2015-02-07 06:31:55',NULL),(10226,10022,139,1,'Sense Datoken','Everyone can be a bit maren-esque at some point or other. Identify when housemates, including yourself, are being a bit of a nightmare and point it out. If you can, offer an idea of how they could calm down.','2015-02-08 07:22:59',NULL),(10007,10077,74,30,'MB 30','During the next Lyceum meeting, I want you to share a poem or story, but when you are talking...I want you to forget off and on what you are saying and doing. You can make this funny or serious, but I want it to be noticable and make people wonder what the heck is going on!','2015-02-09 03:36:10',NULL),(10480,10022,24,70,'Restore 70','I would like for you to breathe new life into the City. Find your five favorite rooms in the City that have been neglected and restore them to the glory they deserve. Host the Lyceum there or take a group on a field trip, tell a history that you remember to others there. The ins and outs are up to you entirely. Try to use rooms on different planes if you can. Restore them from empty, lonely rooms. **A**\r\n','2015-02-09 22:03:13',NULL),(10066,10385,48,1,'Quest: Thunderman','bundle 1-19 completion codex issued by starfall. Honoring soul evoke.','2015-02-10 01:53:00',NULL),(10009,10302,9,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Bundle task completion','2015-02-10 02:40:42',NULL),(10009,10302,40,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Bundle task completion','2015-02-10 02:41:08',NULL),(10009,10302,26,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Bundle task completion','2015-02-10 02:41:32',NULL),(10009,10302,46,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Bundle task completion','2015-02-10 02:41:50',NULL),(10009,10302,36,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Bundle task completion','2015-02-10 02:49:34',NULL),(10480,10550,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Quest art granted.\r\n','2015-02-10 04:54:41',NULL),(10480,10550,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support sphere missing\r\n','2015-02-10 04:55:33',NULL),(10480,10550,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','support train missing\r\n','2015-02-10 04:55:39',NULL),(10169,10112,27,20,'Drain Self 20','I\'d like you to explain your views on force restoring to me.  Some have recommended we allow this practice once again in our city - would you agree and why or why not?  Survey a few other dreamers on the matter as well, and share their take with me as well.  Lastly, explain that KOES tattoo of yours to me - what\'s the deal?','2015-02-10 04:55:42',NULL),(10480,10029,107,30,'Quest: Akkadian','Plateau of House art and honoring task from Dakkoth since he is absent.\r\n','2015-02-10 05:17:40',NULL),(10072,10018,13,10,'Return10','Write a poem from the perspective of 3 people you know. Tell each poem to the person it is about, and observe their reaction. Was it how you expected them to react?','2015-02-10 06:42:36',NULL),(10480,10455,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Fangx has been granted Quest as the next part of his apprenticeship. He is to not write plateau tasks or tasks above 3rd sphere yet. I gave him an extensive interview with his mentor Magnilia present. I will revisit with them when they are ready to expand his questing ability.\r\n','2015-02-10 07:00:02',NULL),(10029,10469,46,10,'Recall: 10','I would like for you to explore Lambent for signs of a room that you think should be restored in our upcoming work. As you favor lavender let us find space where a field of it could grow. Let your mind wander and return to me with the room and your vision restore. - Originally written for Restore which was honored by an Elder in a bundle. Work completed as per what I asked for and reward redirected towards Recall 10 for the effort given the situation.','2015-02-11 08:24:32',NULL),(10029,10021,107,1,'Peace Aura: Learn','Survey the house, look for weaknesses now that mares or gone and also within our own supplies. Also, read all missions and tell me of which ones you have accepted. ','2015-02-11 10:26:48',NULL),(10009,10550,21,30,'Blend30','Investigate the dreamer Agonarius. Does he have any weaknesses? What are his ties to the Datoken? Come up with an idea to slow their spread from the Dark Awakening or halt their entrance into the City all together.','2015-02-11 23:14:27',NULL),(10029,10550,139,1,'Sense DatokenL','Already there is much gossip about your return, though in truth it runs a bit deeper than that. I wish for you to take stock of what you have observed and heard in your return, where is it that you have left off in the minds of most? Does this gossip serve you a diservice or will it be something you use as a platform to something greater?','2015-02-12 01:12:48',NULL),(10009,10302,19,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Completion from her plateau to ten bundle','2015-02-12 01:41:34',NULL),(10009,10302,15,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Completion of her plateau bundle to ten task','2015-02-12 01:42:24',NULL),(10009,10302,16,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Completion of her plateau bundle to ten task','2015-02-12 01:42:42',NULL),(10022,10276,5,20,'Random: 20','Pick a few dreamers and make up a \'random\' activity/event about them, that they normally wouldn\'t do. Perhaps asking someone to have a picnic with you, who you normally wouldn\'t talk to. Or perhaps what it would be like if Amante didn\'t use Locate Dreamer for a day... I would like for you to write a -short- story about each experience, and how you imagine it going. You will report them to me out loud once finished, have fun! ~.|','2015-02-12 03:22:14',NULL),(10009,10302,18,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on Kya\'s first plateau bundle task','2015-02-12 21:58:43',NULL),(10011,10383,4,10,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle plateau.','2015-02-13 03:53:06',NULL),(10011,10383,71,10,'Quest: Starfall','','2015-02-13 03:53:30',NULL),(10011,10383,66,10,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle plateau\r\n','2015-02-13 04:02:08',NULL),(10067,10455,21,1,'Blend to learn','Time to play! I want you to be the mix master. Blend things together and impress your friends. It could be a nice delicious cocktail or a mixture of maren and dreamer or song and dance...the choice is yours. Make it fun and get people laughing. Blend the negativity away with a big shot of fun. <T>\r\n','2015-02-13 08:06:43',NULL),(10018,10072,139,1,'Sense Datoken','Since you are quite the popular guy: I want you to extend your feelers out and try to dig up some information on who might have and/or where the 3rd key might be found, that opens the crate that\'s said to help stop Agonarius.','2015-02-13 22:57:00',NULL),(10029,10455,107,20,'Peace Aura: 20','Speak with Shoury to learn of his new goals and aspirations. Speak to him of our work, lore, and general spirit of the house. Offer not pressure to join but rather tantilizing clues as to outlets for his creativity as he works with the Alliance. In this line, contemplate at least five core reasons dreamers would be attracted to the Alliance over other factions, what more can we do?','2015-02-14 05:28:17',NULL),(10052,10011,47,30,'Push 30 - Starfall','You have a knack for getting involved with the difficult efforts.  I have something different for you.  I am \"Pushing\" har har you to assist me in stopping Agonarius.  I need the best Stone Basin you can forge, the strongest design to assist me in what must be done to recover the tools to stop Agonarius.','2015-02-15 19:18:16',NULL),(10029,10104,35,1,'Trap Nightmare: L','Our power over essence is one most seem to be distant from. I wish for you to consider your power as a controller with this ability, how will you focus your mind in particular to control the existance of the lesser mares allowing you to claim more of their power for yourself? How will you make this ability your own, over and above it being a tool of our focus.','2015-02-15 19:28:54',NULL),(10029,10066,142,10,'Misdirection: 10','Viewpoints being the shifting things that they are I wish for you to review current events and tactics associated with them. What abilities, including Misdirection, can we put to better use against Agonarius and his minions? Specific scenarios and locations please.','2015-02-15 23:39:18',NULL),(10051,10011,107,1,'PA - Starfall','Help us come up with a system of house services that can be performed for our Alliance that can be offered as \"credit\" or tasking for the house art and plateaus.  Post this to me so we can put it to the Mission Boards.','2015-02-16 00:44:12',NULL),(10211,10469,36,20,'Quest: brother timo','bundle completion','2015-02-16 01:07:07',NULL),(10066,10385,7,10,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 10 completion codex issued by me, honoring resist fear.','2015-02-16 01:09:47',NULL),(10066,10385,8,10,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 10 completion codex issued by me. Honoring protection.','2015-02-16 01:10:37',NULL),(10211,10469,20,20,'Quest: brother timo','bundle codex by starfall','2015-02-16 01:10:38',NULL),(10211,10469,19,20,'Quest: brother timo','bundle codex from starfire','2015-02-16 01:16:01',NULL),(10211,10469,139,1,'Quest: brother timo','bundle quest from starfire','2015-02-16 01:17:04',NULL),(10066,10385,10,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 20 learns completion codex issued by me. Honoring Ward.','2015-02-16 01:31:18',NULL),(10066,10385,11,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 20 learns completion coded issued by me. Honoring amulet.','2015-02-16 01:32:05',NULL),(10066,10385,72,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 20 learns completion coded issued by me. Honoring inscribe.','2015-02-16 01:33:21',NULL),(10066,10385,98,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 20 learns completion coded issued by me. Honoring newly awakened.','2015-02-16 01:34:18',NULL),(10009,10320,23,1,'Recharge-Learn','Recharge can easily tilt the scales of war by preventing the loss of munitions. However, it\'s impossible to fight a war without loss. Spend time recouping things that were lost by others in the war between the Light and Calenture. At least two things should not be related to battle items and you must assist at least one person considered an enemy. Who did you help? What did you do?','2015-02-16 03:41:59',NULL),(10007,10311,25,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle task to learn','2015-02-16 16:51:30',NULL),(10062,10311,8,1,'Quest: Krodoc','','2015-02-16 16:52:49',NULL),(10007,10311,73,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle task to learn','2015-02-16 16:52:56',NULL),(10007,10311,73,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle task to learn','2015-02-16 16:52:56',NULL),(10007,10311,98,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle task to learn','2015-02-16 16:53:25',NULL),(10007,10411,139,1,'Quest: Dina','he has done a 20 and 30 learn task from me, i am sure you can find it.','2015-02-16 23:26:15',NULL),(10018,10411,12,10,'Shatter 10','Consider a method that can be used to best Shatter an enemy\'s ward, while under attack. Then attempt it at least once, during a DM fight or a battle with Calenture.','2015-02-17 00:26:38',NULL),(10007,10104,24,40,'Restore 40','Everyone seems to believe that Restore is a positive art, but how can it be used in a negative way? At the next Lyceum, I want you to come up with a story that has the art being looked at in a negative way and share it.','2015-02-17 00:57:20',NULL),(10066,10062,13,10,'Krodoc - Return 10','Incorporate the use of your return into two practical applications that display some planning and creativity. Enact these two plans in the company of others and record all details.','2015-02-17 03:37:15',NULL),(10226,10318,139,1,'Sense Datoken','Yet again, I messed up and picked someone else for the task. (Jade, for your information). He\'s completed the task and reported, so granting the art.','2015-02-17 05:20:27',NULL),(10011,10030,7,10,'Varwyn RF 10','Use your gifts of Creation, or in this case re-Creation in Archives of the Planes. Tap into the city\'s memory and draw from it a clue to the nature of The Knowing Glass, the focus relic of the DreamSeers Guild. You needn\'t spearhead the effort to recover it, nor rally the guild to meet unless you choose. But the clue (or clues) must be clear enough to indicate a physical action the guild may take next, with or without you. _-* 1.31','2015-02-17 06:58:33',NULL),(10011,10311,66,30,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle plateau by Gerroz','2015-02-17 20:23:03',NULL),(10011,10311,71,30,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle Plateau by Gerroz','2015-02-17 20:23:53',NULL),(10029,10455,22,1,'Forge: Final Pt 3','Taking the skills you have built in the journey thus far collect components for your \'master work\'. Plan an act using those with the talents you need and who otherwise support you and in this display forge the work that will signify who you intend to be as a Creator. No flaws, hesitation, demonstrate for all who you will be as a Creator.','2015-02-18 02:38:32',NULL),(10211,10320,63,1,'Quest: brother timo','ok something a bit more traditional.  find out the cost of invisibility and how long the evoke time is and how long it lasts when unplatted.  find 5 places in the dream whre you are invisible without the art','2015-02-18 05:36:14',NULL),(10007,10018,74,50,'MB 50','With the rise of Datoken entering our City, people use their Sense Datoken art a lot now to help keep them safe. I want you to do the opposite. I want you to start MB\'n these mares to the point people talk about it, BUT keep this a secret. Names and comments will get you this plat. I expect you to know what is worthy of a 50 plat.','2015-02-18 07:33:15',NULL),(10051,10030,9,20,'FA to 20 - Varwyn','I want you to work upon telling myself or another within the house, a more detailed telling of the stories of the building we reside in from your city so I can place them on the mission boards for information sake.  Thank you','2015-02-18 16:05:04',NULL),(10009,10317,20,40,'Blast40-Teon','To be an effective blaster you need to be well-versed in other aspects of combat. Go a battle without utilizing Blast. Did it work as smoothely as using Blast? Were you more or less of a target?','2015-02-18 22:26:50',NULL),(10169,10066,105,1,'Quest: Kage','defend our home against the datoke invasion','2015-02-19 01:07:43',NULL),(10211,10104,139,1,'Quest: brother timo','no one should have to quest for an art so vital to the city.  useing the method we used the other day, find all the huntable shamblixes in the dream.  Next teach me how to do what you do with them.','2015-02-19 02:49:19',NULL),(10051,10011,89,20,'SS to 20 - Starfall','Come up with a theory that seems plausible and you might use in action regarding Soulshield in some fashion to assist, accelerate or otherwise effect the hatching of the egg.  The hatching needn\'t occur.  Just the theory being used in some fashion','2015-02-19 06:28:14',NULL),(10067,10030,139,1,'Quest: Tamarisk','Honoring of a bundle task for Varwyn.\r\n','2015-02-19 06:32:04',NULL),(10067,10469,16,20,'Quest: Tamarisk','ID 20 for completion of bundles for Gray Tones <Tam>\r\n','2015-02-19 07:18:12',NULL),(10226,10545,24,1,'Restore','Bundle Task','2015-02-19 07:48:03',NULL),(10226,10545,25,1,'Reweave','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-02-19 07:48:34',NULL),(10226,10545,47,1,'Push','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-02-19 07:49:01',NULL),(10226,10545,26,1,'Purify','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-02-19 07:49:32',NULL),(10226,10545,48,1,'Soul Evoke','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-02-19 07:49:57',NULL),(10226,10545,70,1,'FlameSear','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-02-19 07:50:24',NULL),(10029,10011,107,10,'Peace Aura: 10','Get me a copy of your report or force Darby to get it to me and perform one of the tasks included on it. ','2015-02-19 17:15:00',NULL),(10550,10317,23,1,'Recharge 30 - Teon','OoSM has been recharged, in part, due to your efforts. Continue your efforts by further recharging the fear of the Order\'s rise in anyone who stands in our way, dreamer and mare alike. Do this, and the power you seek is yours.','2015-02-19 17:25:35',NULL),(10005,10018,22,10,'Jade forge 10','Assist Tember in replacing the codexs in the library with forged scrolls and other appropriate shapes like planned.  As you are doing this though, you\'re going to rewrite history a bit.  Sneak in some small changes to *some* of the codexs you recreate to make DoL, yourself, or me look better or make other houses or their members look worse.  Do not get caught in this process!','2015-02-19 23:48:55',NULL),(10072,10062,13,20,'Return20Krodoc','Investigate, and uncover the mysteries surrounding the bricks found at the Keepers. What is their purpose? Uncover any secrets about the bricks that you can. ','2015-02-20 02:38:10',NULL),(10066,10226,105,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Service to the house in the form of finding the Dark Temple for the Soulmasters focal chakram.','2015-02-20 04:28:58',NULL),(10029,10067,107,1,'Peace Aura: L','Familiarize yourself with the various house missions, set aside time for yourself and in so doing set yourself right. Detail the ways you intend to express your passion as you progress as a returned member of the Alliance. Thou must have thy groove, so sayeth the spider.','2015-02-20 06:06:37',NULL),(10009,10317,63,1,'Invisibility-Learn','Invisibility, at low levels, doesn\'t last very long. Take this staff and find a way to utilize its effects to try and gain an advantage in a battle or to collapse a Shamblix, if you can. Note that the Datoke naturally have Vision but Nightmares likely do not. Were you able to succeed achieve a collapse using it? ','2015-02-20 20:21:43',NULL),(10169,10108,47,20,'Push 20','Our enemies have been making heavy use of deafen chakrams lately.  Come up with a simple, fast, efficient way for us to communicate with each other when deafened on the battlefield.  At the moment we have no real solution for this, and are often disrupted greatly if deafened for a long time.  Find the most important things that would need communicated in such times, and make sure you cover those with your solution','2015-02-20 20:36:58',NULL),(10009,10092,139,1,'SenseDatoken-Learn','Investigate the current Datoken threat. Learn what you can about Agonarius and the focal weapons that need to be forged to defeat him. Prepare a brief summary to me with the information you have gathered.','2015-02-20 20:53:58',NULL),(10092,10098,46,60,'Recall to 60','Quest was given about recall and how it was initially found in the city.. various changes.. and how he would change it to make the art better today.','2015-02-20 22:01:07',NULL),(10550,10104,96,20,'Sense 20','Trap 500 strength worth of essences and bring them to me. In exchange, I will provide Recharge and Combine services at your request. This will prove if my internal senses of you are correct.','2015-02-21 01:35:10',NULL),(10062,10550,108,1,'Sable Shield Learn','Contract the assistance of a Soulmaster and bring 2000 essences for the prime.','2015-02-21 02:11:07',NULL),(10550,10469,7,10,'Resist Fear - Ten','Perception is one\'s reality. The Dream, or part of it, trembles in fear of Agonarius and the Datoken. Find their weakness and formulate a strategy to use it against him.','2015-02-21 03:15:15',NULL),(10029,10104,28,1,'Abjure:','Abjuration is a \'school\' into and of its own. I would have you explore what \'abjuration\' actually is and use that to discuss with me its relationship to our focus. Few think of our power beyond, \'healer\' and fail to noticed detailed connections to greater powers we may have. Research this out and attempt to find potential ways you will be distinguishing yourself as you move on.','2015-02-21 15:40:10',NULL),(10092,10062,9,50,'FA to 50 - Krodoc','FA is a defining art of willpower even though other focii can learn it.. they do not master it.  Tell me why that would be the case in relation to how the mares greater than emphants have come up with ways to make this art a necessity in the City and GKs much needed.\r\n','2015-02-22 04:11:41',NULL),(10062,10318,10,10,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing bundle task per Jerulan\'s completion codex.','2015-02-22 19:34:52',NULL),(10062,10318,6,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for Amante\'s bundle task.','2015-02-22 19:36:52',NULL),(10098,10062,22,1,'Krodoc Forge learn','1) Seek out those eligible for Dreamsmith Mark. Say You want to learn from them, but your mission is two faced. Both learn from them but at the same time spy for me, to find out if they are any good at shaping/have a style. Also find out if they want the mark to contribue or for power. \r\n2) Identify your own source of power, and how to tap into it. Find out how you will shape your items into your own, recognizeable style','2015-02-22 22:40:54',NULL),(10062,10318,6,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for bundle task per Amante.','2015-02-22 22:57:26',NULL),(10480,10030,52,50,'Train 50','I would like for you to break out of your shell and help those around you. Speak with at least five other teachers, Elders and Masters included, and discuss the need for a Teaching council. When all of your information is gathered, chose a side and prepare your notes. When you are ready, find me and we will have a friendly debate with each other. I will take the opposite side that you choose. Bring your best arguements. ','2015-02-23 04:28:17',NULL),(10480,10030,60,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Having spoken with her and reviewed her 5 sphere tasks, I have regranted her the art. **A**\r\n','2015-02-23 05:13:38',NULL),(10011,10030,24,10,'Varwyn Restore 10','The generator\'s malfunctioning was mysterious, to put it mildly. Examine the generator. What insights do the spirits provide into what took place, and what may be awry? Using what you find, provide concrete instruction on precautions those attempting to repair it must take and why those steps will be necessary. _-* 2.17','2015-02-23 05:36:06',NULL),(10098,10550,22,40,'Shoury Forge 40','You have chosen a path that is going to put you on edge with others, unlike in your past. Consolidate this new beginning by either creating or destroying something that will be outrageous in the eyes of others. This action should signify your willingness to comply to the ways of the order.','2015-02-23 18:03:47',NULL),(10479,10009,2,60,'Dreiko Dreamseer 60','Reignite the Dreamseer guild.  Hold a meeting at the temple of insanity like you wish.  Pretend that you\'re leader of the guild, nobody else seems to be interested in the position from what I\'ve seen lately.  Find a project, besides unlocking the guildhall, that the guild can work on and begin work doing so.  Involve the other guilds if possible.  Your work should be worthy of a plateau to 60.','2015-02-23 22:47:44',NULL),(10550,10104,9,20,'Free Action 20','You have stated that your actions aren\'t bound by House Affiliation. This task is a test of your statement. Provide me with 5 +25 Insight elemens or greater quality, and 3 Horron Datoke essences. Acquire them as you see fit.','2015-02-23 23:39:19',NULL),(10479,10098,19,70,'Quest: Herbert','Remaking Balgi Klygar\'s quest codex he wrote on inscribe...','2015-02-23 23:50:57',NULL),(10550,10317,23,10,'Teon Recharge 10','Recharge the efforts of SMs in the City, in-house, out-of-house, whatever,  to increase the Order\'s prime by 5,000. Do whatever you think it takes to accomplish this, and the power you seek is yours.','2015-02-24 03:36:19',NULL),(10092,10318,65,40,'Blade to 40','There have been famous blades forged throughout the history of this City.  I want you to tell me the story of 4 special blades that have been forged and tell me why they were forged and by who.','2015-02-24 06:05:52',NULL),(10029,10104,35,10,'Trap Nightmare: 10','All of the factions place a high value on those who can trap, often being willing to make deals and offer us the dream if we will use our skill for them. Contemplate what a powerful position this would put you in and if having such a skill proves a temptation for you. Do you value yourself enough to remain loyal, or do you possess the soul of a mercenary?','2015-02-24 17:26:42',NULL),(10479,10572,22,1,'Quest:','Removing drainself, restoring forge','2015-02-24 19:01:34',NULL),(10029,10455,107,30,'Peace Aura: 30','You know the drill: Review the applicable mission for various accepted service projects for the house. Select your three and complete them for the reward you are seeking. And, I ask you to do one more as you are a Knight. Come up with an additional service project to be added to the list for each \'path\'.','2015-02-24 20:12:39',NULL),(10009,10098,118,10,'HM10','Come up with a directive for the Mission Board organization. Have the Guardians create posts that are necessary to help the house run smoothly again, while ensuring that we don\'t drown in unnecessary contact posts.','2015-02-24 21:07:05',NULL),(10052,10030,17,1,'ID Curse - Varwyn','Identifying curses should be something of second nature to a Gypsy.  So come up with an interesting curse that you would place upon an enemy or foe and how you would go about placing said curse on someone in this city.  You do not have to actually do it.','2015-02-25 01:38:19',NULL),(10066,10318,10,20,'Ward 20','Bundle 20\'s task completion codex isued by Amante. Honoring ward 20.','2015-02-25 02:06:48',NULL),(10066,10318,8,10,'Protection 10','Bundle 10\'s completion codex issed by Jerulan. Honoring Protection 10.','2015-02-25 02:08:17',NULL),(10066,10318,12,10,'Shatter 10','Bundle 10\'s completion codex issued by jerulan. Honoring shatter 10.','2015-02-25 02:10:08',NULL),(10066,10318,8,20,'Protection 20','Bundle 20\'s completion codex issued by Amante. Honoring protection 20.','2015-02-25 02:48:56',NULL),(10066,10318,8,30,'Protection 30','Bundle 30\'s completion codex issued by Amante. Honoring Protection 30.','2015-02-25 02:59:37',NULL),(10550,10469,50,1,'Gray Tones - NMF','Collect five unique Datoken essences and study them. How can your new found knowledge be used to defeat Agonarius, his army, and the nightmares that he\'s brought to the City?','2015-02-25 05:03:31',NULL),(10029,10207,107,1,'Peace Aura - L','Learn of The Voices as they exist now within the Alliance, given your position in the city which path might you serve if you were asked to serve according to your truest desire and potential? Consider how this bond may lead to a freedom denied you in the waking world not only with the stronghold itself but with particular members, if any.','2015-02-25 12:08:36',NULL),(10011,10469,107,10,'Gray PA 10','Read over the Peace Aura mission on the MB. Choose from the items listed and do one (1) of them. Alternatively, as part of your Knightly duties, find something not listed that needs doing and that no one else seems to notice is going undone and do that. (Such as organizing a semi-regular meeting time as the rulers requested) _-* 2.21','2015-02-26 00:55:30',NULL),(10127,10112,26,30,'Quest: Kanto','','2015-02-26 03:27:42',NULL),(10066,10385,26,1,'Purify','Bundle 20 learns completion codex issued by me. Honoring purify.','2015-02-26 03:31:45',NULL),(10066,10385,40,1,'deafen learn','Bundle 20 learns completion codex issued by me. Honoring deafen learn.','2015-02-26 03:32:20',NULL),(10066,10385,46,1,'Recall learn','Bundle 20 learns completion codex issued by me. Honoring recall learn.','2015-02-26 03:32:56',NULL),(10127,10018,60,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2015-02-26 03:44:47',NULL),(10127,10018,87,1,'Quest: Kanto','','2015-02-26 03:46:57',NULL),(10066,10385,68,20,'Flameshaft 20','Bundle 20 plat task completion codex issued by me. Honoring flameshaft 20.','2015-02-26 03:53:47',NULL),(10066,10385,9,20,'Freeaction 20','Bundle 20 plat task completion codex issued by me. Honoring free action 20','2015-02-26 03:54:19',NULL),(10066,10385,1,20,'Gatekeeper 20','Bundle 20 plat task completion codex issued by me. Honoring Gatekeeper 20','2015-02-26 03:55:14',NULL),(10066,10385,65,20,'Gatesmasher 20','Bundle 20 plat task completion codex issued by me. Honoring Gatesmasher 20','2015-02-26 03:55:40',NULL),(10066,10385,6,20,'Meditation 20','Bundle 20 plat task completion codex issued by me. Honoring meditation 20.','2015-02-26 03:56:11',NULL),(10066,10385,7,20,'resist fear 20','Bundle 20 plat task completion codex issued by me. Honoring resist fear 20','2015-02-26 03:56:45',NULL),(10066,10385,8,20,'Protection 20','Bundle 20 plats completion codex issued by me. Honoring Protection 20','2015-02-26 04:19:49',NULL),(10011,10052,140,1,'Tempest Trisha','Show your enthusiasm for arms and armaments at the FS Guild meeting, and do what you can to ensure all FateSenders who participate receive something worth the effort they put in. If you could design your ideal weapon, (with ANY art possible to forge) what would it be and why? Design it and draft a schematic for it. Lastly, if I were a weapon, what would I be? _-*','2015-02-26 15:51:52',NULL),(10098,10311,74,10,'Mind Blank 10','When a board is crowded, people tend not to read them or the important things get lost in their minds. Remove the three posts you and Krodoc have on the misson board about items and vaults. Work with him to get standards and rewards in place','2015-02-26 18:10:41',NULL),(10098,10311,24,10,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-02-26 18:41:51',NULL),(10127,10011,144,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2015-02-26 23:13:50',NULL),(10127,10029,144,1,'Quest: Kanto','x','2015-02-26 23:14:15',NULL),(10009,10498,108,1,'SableShield-Seidy','Bring in 50 essences to the Order.','2015-02-27 00:12:29',NULL),(10550,10052,139,1,'Sense Datoken','Agonarius has made it public that he wants Peace Aura. Gain a sense of his true intentions, and reveal this to me and your home.','2015-02-27 05:34:55',NULL),(10550,10052,139,1,'Sense Datoken','Trisha, I\'m working on an Elixir to counter Agonarius\' movements. I require 3 unique Datoken essences. Bring them to me, and the power you seek is yours. Use all of your senses, to accomplish this.','2015-02-27 05:34:55',NULL),(10030,10004,36,30,'Bundle Honor','Honoring the Bundle 30 as given by Starfall.','2015-02-27 08:59:06',NULL),(10030,10004,98,20,'Bundle Honor','Honring based on bundle from Starfall','2015-02-27 08:59:59',NULL),(10550,10311,16,10,'Flower - ID 10','Identify additional assistance from SoulMasters in the City and increase the prime strength by 5,000.','2015-02-27 14:46:27',NULL),(10029,10550,144,1,'Chaos Well:','Ideological implications rarely seem to have power these days, given your own background and the \'belief\' systems now in place where does the Chaos Well and its advancements fit in? Does this item have personal power for you, and if so what are the details of it? At the end of days allies are still a powerful foundation and source of insulation, will you like the well be more than something bound to semantics? Or will you be thought of as something \'bad\' at face value or crest.','2015-02-28 01:00:31',NULL),(10550,10112,144,1,'Chaos Well - Damia','The Chaos Well is a catalyst that is used to further one\'s goals, whatever those may be. Are you using it for power, or it is using you, in this one-way or symbiotic relationship? Figure out & explain this riddle and the power you seek is yours.','2015-02-28 15:04:45',NULL),(10009,10097,139,1,'Sense Datoken-Learn','Bring me the essence of a Horron Datoke.','2015-02-28 15:55:15',NULL),(10550,10092,144,1,'Chaos Well - gD','Chaos Well is a means to empower our prime more efficiently. As a Guardian of the Order, delegate two of your members to fill 10 Chaos Wells to the brim (so, 20 total). You are a Ruler with a Guardian crest, your journey begins here.','2015-02-28 16:04:23',NULL),(10009,10092,139,10,'SenseDatoken10','Investigate the current progress of the Gatekeeper weapon. What is the current status? How will the Gatekeepers determine its wielder? Do you envision a way the City can ensure that the best possible Gatekeeper is chosen?','2015-02-28 16:59:01',NULL),(10011,10104,144,1,'Dar\'c - Chaos Well','The Smiths Guild built the Chaos Wells over a series of two months, developing and refining its prototype. Since the well absorbs essences and can be manipulated in most ways like a prime, what are the implications for the device for our house? How does it interact with Cleanse, and are there any considerations we must take in your view? What about the other essence beliefs? _-* 2.26','2015-02-28 23:35:28',NULL),(10029,10455,89,40,'Soul Shield: 40','Organize the house (those you reasonably can) and those working with us towards working on one Lambent room to make it distinctive in some way. Changes need not be immediate, but the effort should be inclusive.','2015-03-01 00:01:58',NULL),(10092,10026,92,30,'Reflect 30 Golah','This art was brought back to the City by myself.. reflect on how this was made and then I want you to spread the word of it to dreamers of the City.. the Gatekeeper Guild helped me in this endevor.. lay the ground work for this Guild to return to the City.','2015-03-01 02:24:44',NULL),(10029,10011,107,20,'Peace Aura: 20','Select the tasks as suggested through the Mission detailing acceptable house projects and carry them out. For this plateau you must do at least two, remember that in the future should you repeat the projects you will only be given half credit.','2015-03-01 03:14:35',NULL),(10479,10018,22,20,'Quest: Herbert','Granting Jade forge 20 for winning Damia\'s forge competition.','2015-03-01 04:46:15',NULL),(10029,10009,144,1,'Chaos Well:','Initial joy at this new discovery will naturally prevent most from asking too many explosive questions. Knowing what you do of the other houses, and having skill with words as you do - build out from the name of the art and object itself to construct potential arguments. Can Calenture, or the Light -  truly justify using such an ability? Though few will extrapolate to that degree are there actual implications of using this ability we should keep close to our chest?','2015-03-01 05:01:46',NULL),(10479,10092,92,40,'guardDog Reflect 40','Have someone evoke an art on you at least 100 times while you have reflect up and record how many reflects made it through.  Then find someone else with reflect and evoke an art 100 times on them.  Record what their level of reflect is at and how many times it was reflected.','2015-03-01 05:02:08',NULL),(10009,10207,50,1,'NMF-Apothos','Catalog a few important maren phrases to help me better understand Kotoke Holow and the other mares. I\'m fairly decent with the basics but need help with others. ','2015-03-01 05:13:16',NULL),(10479,10465,36,50,'Dreamblade50 Norkig','Speak with the other Seers of the city.  Find out if there are any Dreamseer projects going on around the city that you could get involved in, otherwise organize one yourself.  This should be something that requires the aid of several Dreamseers and not just \"trying to locate the guildhouse or learn the Guild House art.\"','2015-03-01 05:35:58',NULL),(10479,10052,87,1,'Quest: Herbert','Trisha submitted her samples and I verified her completed tasks.  Regranting sphere and support sphere.','2015-03-01 06:15:24',NULL),(10479,10052,60,1,'Quest: Herbert','Trisha submitted her samples and I verified her completed tasks.  Regranting sphere and support sphere.','2015-03-01 06:15:31',NULL),(10480,10052,52,50,'Train 50','I would like for you to expand on your way of teaching. Task others, teach them of your way. I would like to see you work with citizens of both cities in order to solidify the new City of Dreams. It is a new City full of new possibilities. When you have done the proper amount of work for a train 50 task, seek me out and we shall discuss. **A**','2015-03-01 06:45:13',NULL),(10480,10455,2,50,'Dreamseer 50','Get more aquainted with your focal energies. Is there anything else that the DreamSeer art could possibly do than allow you to use higher levels of chakrams? Think and delve deep into yourself and find some answers. I would also like for you to help rebuild the DreamSeer Guild and strengthen it the prosperity of all DreamSeers. You do not have to lead it, just help it to grow. **A**','2015-03-01 07:29:47',NULL),(10029,10465,144,1,'Chaos Well: Learn','Allegiances are a shifting thing, a balance of what one knows in their own mind, outward appearance and bias - confirmed or otherwise. Our existence here is much like this well: deep, growing, full of potential and yet at face value people may be confused by it. Take time to reflect on your actions and associations, are you on a path to costing yourself more than you are anticipating? Will you end up as a filled well, or an empty one sitting in some cold corner of the city.','2015-03-01 16:18:21',NULL),(10029,10112,30,10,'Antidote: Bundle','Honoring a completed bundle with this plateau.','2015-03-01 17:14:18',NULL),(10029,10112,29,10,'Poison: Bundle','Honoring this plateau as part of a completed bundle.','2015-03-01 17:14:27',NULL),(10009,10400,7,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle completion codex','2015-03-01 17:37:17',NULL),(10009,10400,9,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle completion codex','2015-03-01 17:37:24',NULL),(10009,10098,144,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting Kaer Gerroz Chaos Well as per his work in the creation of the art. Kanto specified he did not need to do a task.','2015-03-01 19:56:41',NULL),(10030,10455,21,10,'Blend: First','There is lore of the fine assassins affiliated with our Alliance, I wish for you to scour the dream for a trace of their unique tools. While they may be lost to us perhaps your imagination can lead you to clue about what tools they may have used to slip through the layers of the city.','2015-03-01 22:41:09',NULL),(10022,10104,17,1,'Dar\'canon: ID Curse','How good are you at seeing the inner truth of matters? Are people upfront about their intentions or do they hide behind masks and falsehoods? Identify one such Dreamer, someone who says one thing but means another. What causes their behavior? Is it an inner demon or perhaps a means to an end? Explain your thoughts on the matter. ~.|','2015-03-01 23:46:36',NULL),(10479,10022,52,60,'Kanto Train Plat','Rewriting this train plat that was given by Kanto.  Quest codex says it was made for Starfall by mistake.  ','2015-03-02 00:18:47',NULL),(10550,10030,24,20,'Varwyn Res 20','Gavin is in spirit form, currently without vessel. Dive back into the past and tie it into your present dreams. Work with a SoulMaster to collect 20 trapped emphant essences and study them rigorously, and begin blueprinting a ritual & plan with the knowledge you re-gained to hopefully return Gavin to it\'s former glory.','2015-03-02 00:31:47',NULL),(10011,10030,25,10,'Varwyn Reweave 10','Having just worked on Restore, and now Reweave, minor arts to us that were not available to you before, what differences are you uniquely positioned to notice that soulmasters, and dreamers of the Lyran city are not? What does the experience of working with the arts of other foci feel like for you? Extrapolate from the changes you\'ve experienced so far and create for me a tool that you predict be essential to breaking the barrier to further learning. _-* 2.22','2015-03-02 01:41:43',NULL),(10066,10385,11,10,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle 10 plats completion codex issued by me. honoring amulet 10','2015-03-02 04:12:31',NULL),(10066,10385,10,10,'ward 10','Bundle 10 plats completion codex issued by me. honoring ward 10','2015-03-02 04:12:53',NULL),(10011,10581,9,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle Learning','2015-03-02 04:57:11',NULL),(10011,10581,139,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle Learn\r\n','2015-03-02 04:57:44',NULL),(10030,10581,17,1,'Bundle Honor - ','Honoring Completion of bundle as issued by Starfall on 3.1 - Arts prescribed according to completion are Soul Evoke and Identify Curse.','2015-03-02 05:15:45',NULL),(10550,10104,7,20,'RF 20 - Dar\'canon','Agonarius remains a threat to the City. Outside of the focal weapons to eradicate him, how can the Alliance show to the City.. to Agonarius, that AoE has resisted the fear of him? Come up with two ideas, and share them at your next house meeting or with your rulers. Report back what was discussed.','2015-03-02 15:03:59',NULL),(10092,10311,7,10,'RF to 10','There are lots of things that cause fear in the City besides just the Art of Scare.. I want you to think hard and tell me in detail of 5 things in the City that scare you and what you could do to resist this fear.','2015-03-02 17:51:42',NULL),(10097,10311,39,1,'Stagger ','I seem to stagger all over this dream since my return. I have tried many times to get to the other side of Meditation hall in thresh caves but I get lost in the maze. I use to know a pattern. See if you can coach me by giving me a pattern to learn where I can do it by myself. ','2015-03-03 02:43:09',NULL),(10480,10226,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','HC;s second Master Teacher.\r\n','2015-03-03 03:01:13',NULL),(10480,10029,142,20,'Misdirection 20','I would like for you to use your keen and piercing insight to assist you with this task. Choose at least four of your peers and determine where they have lost their way on something. Offer a pro and con for the path that they are taking and stop them from missing the proper direction. You know how best to approach those close to you.  I leave the how and why of it all, up to your discretion. Find me when you feel that you are ready to report and we will discuss. **A**','2015-03-03 03:20:54',NULL),(10029,10066,144,1,'Chaos Well: Learn','Taking the prototype Kanto worked Dreamsoul into the scenario. What did the addition change about the Chaos Well as we now know it? Gather one or more of the Wells now on offer and experiment with them, looking for the key to the difference from the prototype to the functioning version we now have. There is much you have missed regarding the Well, find the information from those around you who have explored this path.','2015-03-03 03:46:47',NULL),(10062,10400,68,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task per Starfall.','2015-03-03 04:56:05',NULL),(10029,10455,144,1,'Chaos Well: Learn','Discuss with the house majority an incentive program based around the turn in of filled chaos wells. As you lead in this effort consider the ideological implications of this new creation not only for ourselves for but the other factions in the city.','2015-03-03 04:57:31',NULL),(10029,10067,144,1,'Chaos Well','Re-Creation of quest codex based on Fangx task given to Tamarisk and completed.','2015-03-03 05:39:13',NULL),(10092,10311,89,1,'Soul Shield','For this Art.. I want you to tell me of the Sacred Band.. who comprised it and what their mission was in the City... tell me the story of the arts creation.','2015-03-03 15:03:32',NULL),(10009,10311,139,1,'SenseDatoken-Learn','Utilize your abilities to offer support in a battle against datoke. This should include at a minimum one of your fatesender offensive arts. Ensure you do not collapse and try to assist your fellow dreamers to keep them coherant. Do you think your art-based support added value to the encounter?','2015-03-03 22:35:41',NULL),(10029,10383,48,1,'Soul Evoke:','Soul Evoke has a certain stigma associated with it, more often than not dreamers prove too weak to prove resistant to the urge to harm themselves. I would ask for you to consider how you might resist the urge but also what circumstances might see you harm yourself as this ability allows you to do. Is it integral to your role as a priestess?','2015-03-03 23:37:53',NULL),(10011,10383,66,20,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle plateau','2015-03-04 00:07:30',NULL),(10011,10383,4,20,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle Plateau','2015-03-04 00:07:39',NULL),(10011,10383,71,20,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle Plateau','2015-03-04 00:08:13',NULL),(10011,10383,37,10,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle plateau','2015-03-04 00:09:17',NULL),(10029,10383,38,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Completion of Bundle to 10 abilities, Fatesender.','2015-03-04 00:15:19',NULL),(10029,10112,3,40,'Soulmaster: 40','Our guild is largely inactive, power for the \'Agonarius Super Weapon\' is controlled by Calenture, and generally the focus is just sitting, waiting...for something. Do something, anything, to bring health and vitality back to focus-based passions for Soulmasters in the city. Perhaps seek out information on the focal relic, and gain the support of Soulmasters of your choosing to actually, DO, something. Hint - Hint..In the end the choice of what to do is yours to make.','2015-03-04 01:40:30',NULL),(10011,10311,38,20,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle plateau by Starfall','2015-03-04 02:47:25',NULL),(10011,10311,43,20,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle plateau by Starfall','2015-03-04 02:47:31',NULL),(10011,10311,40,20,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle plateau by Starfall','2015-03-04 02:47:37',NULL),(10092,10400,7,20,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-04 17:29:02',NULL),(10092,10400,8,10,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-04 17:29:10',NULL),(10011,10311,38,30,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Gerroz','2015-03-04 17:53:36',NULL),(10011,10311,43,30,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Gerroz','2015-03-04 17:53:44',NULL),(10011,10311,40,30,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Gerroz','2015-03-04 17:53:50',NULL),(10029,10104,25,40,'Reweave: 40','Gather a number of Flat Dreamsoul elemens for the house, not too many as I don\'t want you to explode. Say, at least five. During this time weigh the returns, are you finding them easier from Agoknights or fonts? Varwyn spoke of font tier work in Idoaclesia, allowing for greater production of these high tier items, is such needed here too? Create a proposed cost guide for these high tiered items such as Flat Dreamsoul, level 46 chakrams- fifties, High durability, moderate absorption shields \'the good stuff\'','2015-03-04 17:59:05',NULL),(10011,10030,144,1,'Varwyn Chaos Well','As an art that has been newly created, how does this fit into how you understand arts? What was our process from your perspective? Second, how is this going to work with Gavin? Is he at risk? Are there precautions you must take? _-* 3.1','2015-03-05 01:39:56',NULL),(10211,10030,17,10,'Quest: id curse','the theory is beauty is in the eye of the beholder.  To test this theory find 10 things you feel are beautiful and 10 you feel are not.  identify why you feel the beautiful things are, and the unbeautiful things are not.  then identify if some one else might have a different oppion and why.','2015-03-05 02:23:00',NULL),(10062,10400,10,10,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-05 04:49:31',NULL),(10062,10400,11,10,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-05 04:49:37',NULL),(10062,10400,8,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-05 04:50:32',NULL),(10066,10385,11,20,'Amulet 20','Bundle 20 completion codex issued by me. Honoring amulet 20.','2015-03-05 05:00:37',NULL),(10066,10385,10,20,'ward 20','Bundle 20 completion codex issued by me. Honoring ward 20.','2015-03-05 05:00:58',NULL),(10066,10318,141,10,'kinesis 10','bundle plat 10 completion codex issued by jerulan. honoring kinesis 10.','2015-03-05 05:35:47',NULL),(10092,10062,144,1,'Chaos Well Krodoc','Unplatted they hold 20 essences.. I want you to have 5 members bring in at least 1 chaos well worth of strength to the House.  Report the members to me.','2015-03-05 18:19:50',NULL),(10062,10400,11,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-05 18:20:25',NULL),(10062,10400,10,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-05 18:20:33',NULL),(10062,10092,141,10,'Kinesis 10','Find a dreamer within the house that needs a bit of a push, and provide such in a way that causes them to make at least 1 progression in their path. This does not have to be art or sphere related, but it can be.','2015-03-05 18:21:38',NULL),(10098,10062,22,10,'Krodoc forge 10','My forge is incapacitated for the time being. This puts the order in a bad situation item wise. Find a temporary solution for us, to make up for this. Put the solution into effect, and get us results fast, while I regain my spheres','2015-03-05 18:50:51',NULL),(10092,10400,9,30,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-05 19:01:12',NULL),(10092,10400,1,30,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-05 19:01:37',NULL),(10092,10400,68,30,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-05 19:01:50',NULL),(10092,10400,65,30,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-05 19:02:09',NULL),(10092,10026,144,1,'Chaos Well','Tell me how this Art was created and why this Art is DreamSoul and not Resilience.  Also bring me 3 filled Chaos Wells.','2015-03-05 19:14:24',NULL),(10062,10098,7,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-05 23:10:40',NULL),(10062,10098,6,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-05 23:10:49',NULL),(10062,10098,9,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-05 23:10:57',NULL),(10062,10098,8,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-05 23:11:28',NULL),(10062,10414,8,10,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task','2015-03-06 01:59:26',NULL),(10062,10414,65,10,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task','2015-03-06 01:59:32',NULL),(10062,10414,1,10,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task','2015-03-06 01:59:36',NULL),(10062,10414,6,10,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task','2015-03-06 02:01:52',NULL),(10009,10112,9,10,'Damia-FA10','Paralyze may remove the ability for a dreamer to move but poison often removes the will to move. Unfortunately, most dreamers believe it\'s a useless art. Develop a theory for how to  maximize the usefulness of the art of Poison in a battle. For bonus points, utilize your theory against dreamers, a dark mare, or Datoke.','2015-03-06 03:35:58',NULL),(10009,10400,144,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:45:23',NULL),(10009,10400,40,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:48:19',NULL),(10009,10400,73,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:48:23',NULL),(10009,10400,16,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:48:55',NULL),(10009,10400,15,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:49:00',NULL),(10009,10400,74,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:49:47',NULL),(10009,10400,26,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:51:52',NULL),(10009,10400,46,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:51:56',NULL),(10009,10400,38,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:52:40',NULL),(10009,10400,25,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:52:45',NULL),(10009,10400,24,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on bundle task for 3rd sphere learnables','2015-03-06 03:52:49',NULL),(10066,10400,141,1,'kinesis learn','Bundle 30 learn completion codex issued by dreiko. honoring kinesis learn.','2015-03-06 04:15:07',NULL),(10092,10112,74,10,'Damia MB to 10','Since Sense Dreamer has come to the City.. MindBlank sort of is useless unless you find a hidden nook somewhere.  I want you to tell me 10 rooms that are so out of the way that two people can get away from the City and be alone.','2015-03-06 05:12:32',NULL),(10067,10469,20,30,'Blast 30','Bundle plat with completion codex. ','2015-03-06 06:08:42',NULL),(10067,10469,18,30,'Chamele - 30','Bundle task reward with completion codex.\r\n','2015-03-06 06:08:48',NULL),(10067,10469,19,30,'Vision - 30','Bundle task reward with completion codex.\r\n','2015-03-06 06:10:07',NULL),(10067,10469,16,30,'ID - 30','Bundle task reward with completion codex.\r\n','2015-03-06 06:10:19',NULL),(10067,10469,36,30,'DreamBlade - 30','Bundle task reward with completion codex\r\n','2015-03-06 06:11:16',NULL),(10092,10098,10,1,'Ward/Amulet','Tell me how GateKeepers manipulate Will to create the Ward and how DreamSeers are the only ones that can cross this Ward.  Also I want you to speak with 5 GKs and find out how important their Amulet is to them and who they might have given them to.','2015-03-06 06:29:02',NULL),(10092,10098,11,1,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-06 06:29:08',NULL),(10030,10455,20,50,'Blast: Fifth','In every fortress the spirits are strong, drawn by the vibrant thoughts and feelings of those who are attuned to the place. Explore your own home looking for the places of great spiritual energy, specifically the spirits of wind and otherwise connected to our focus. Draw them out and learn from them of your own spirit guide, that one greater force that links all of your affinities to you.','2015-03-06 06:41:24',NULL),(10067,10030,7,20,'RF - 20','I dub thee, Alliance facade safety officer. You are to make sure that everyone on the facade wears their protective arts. How you decide to enforce and check that is up to you. If you catch an Alliance member without Resist Fear on, give them a citation to bring in an item that is up to vault and armory standards. When you are ready to report, use your judgement, take me to a place in the city where you were once afraid and share a story with me. ~Tam~','2015-03-06 07:14:30',NULL),(10092,10062,7,50,'Resist Fear 50','There are ones that dreamers of the City fear not because of who the are.. but because of who they think they are.. I want you to talk to members of each focus and tell me who they fear might wield the focus weapon because of their opinion of themselves.','2015-03-06 21:47:54',NULL),(10479,10092,8,60,'guardDog Protect 60','Protect the city against the datoken.  Bring me at least 6 different datoken essences that you assited in collapsing or using your wards to protect against.  The essences must be in datoken that you assisted against, you cannot bring me 6 old datoken essences stored in your house.  ','2015-03-07 03:08:23',NULL),(10550,10112,15,10,'Judgement 10:','Recall OoSM\'s essence collection efforts prior to & after the introduction to Chaos Well. What is your judgement? Has this changed due to another enabler, or has it remained the same? Do advancements in certain techniques change your judgement, hence your perception or reality of things?','2015-03-07 04:15:19',NULL),(10350,10011,116,1,'Quest: Qujaimarii','','2015-03-07 04:22:31',NULL),(10479,10112,27,30,'Damia Drain Self 30','Honoring Dina\'s bundle task.','2015-03-07 04:36:41',NULL),(10479,10550,52,40,'Shoury Train 40','Inscribe 4 sample tasks for a plateau to 40 for 4 different people you are familair with.  Preferably ones you\'ve tasked or have had a lot of experience with.  Pick one of these and complete it yourself.','2015-03-07 06:02:02',NULL),(10029,10112,25,40,'Reweave: 40','In the report I was told of birds and other wildlife found throughout your city. We at the Alliance hope to fill our planes (Lambent) with similar manifestations of the cities power. For this I ask you to devise lures of a gentle kind to attract things like birds, turtles, squirrels and such to the Lambents. Note the rooms you have placed them in, and what they are designed to lure.','2015-03-07 07:20:25',NULL),(10029,10545,70,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of Bundle 10-19 SM','2015-03-07 08:37:24',NULL),(10029,10545,26,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of Bundle 10-19 SM','2015-03-07 08:37:49',NULL),(10029,10545,24,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of Bundle 10-19 SM','2015-03-07 08:38:51',NULL),(10029,10545,25,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of Bundle 10-19 SM','2015-03-07 08:39:47',NULL),(10029,10545,3,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of Bundle 10-19 SM','2015-03-07 08:40:07',NULL),(10029,10545,67,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of Bundle 10-19 SM','2015-03-07 08:40:25',NULL),(10029,10455,22,10,'Forge 10: Part 2','Building on your domain and finds during your recent journey put the components you found to work in a device suitable for the archive of the planes. The relic should reflect your connection to the house and what\'s more the Alliance itself in some way that is unconventional. Speak with Starfall for ideas towards this end, showing her the task if needed.','2015-03-07 08:58:44',NULL),(10550,10465,96,20,'Sense Twenty','Perception is reality, or is it? This applies to the datoken/mares and dreamers alike. How do you make sense of this? Uncover the truth to this.','2015-03-07 14:34:30',NULL),(10169,10065,139,1,'Sense Datoken','We have been under a sustained assault from the datoken for some time now.  This means that information is becoming available on the datoke themselves.  Investigate any way you see fit and profile some of the most dangerous for me.  What makes them dangerous?  What are their habits?  Be sure to collect as much of this information as you can, so that we can share it with the rest of the guard and the city.','2015-03-07 20:02:20',NULL),(10029,10065,3,40,'Soulmaster: 40','Gather information on famous/infamous dreamers of our focus in both Underlight and Idoaclesia. Use this as a weight against yourself, the goal being to determine how you will set yourself apart on ways unique only to you. Having decided this, commit to a \'debut\' of yourself in some way, having found this new level of distinction for yourself and your skills.','2015-03-07 20:46:57',NULL),(10226,10065,24,40,'Restore 40','Find a few things or people that need Restoring.  Why do you think they do? What\'s been broken or damaged, and how will you fix it? Pick two or three, and make attempts to fix them. Can you think of any other ways to restore something or someone?','2015-03-08 05:51:56',NULL),(10092,10070,139,1,'Sense Datoken','For this Art I want you to find out about the new daymares and tell me how they differ from the Darks of old.. also.. where is their home when they first enter the City.','2015-03-08 15:16:05',NULL),(10092,10311,25,10,'Reweave 10','Reweave is repairing the fabrics of a shield.. tell me about how this Art is similar to Forge and why this Art is resilience and Forge is Dreamsoul.. ask 3 with Forge to give you their thoughts on this comparison.','2015-03-08 15:57:35',NULL),(10029,10465,22,30,'Forge: Pt 3 ','You work is coming along so well, as a gift for you I have designed a \'Maker\'s Mark\', you may use this simple symbol or \'inscribe it out\' as part of your pieces. Also, you may come up with a mark all of your own. (_) is the mark of the barrel, it holds so much potential (and booze) and I think suits you. Continue creating pieces, this time including the mark, or a mark on each other either in \'stamp\' or spelled out in finer detail.','2015-03-09 00:53:38',NULL),(10550,10030,25,20,'RW Plat #2','Reweave a part of your previous City which is now \"destroyed\" by putting on a play or skit, re-enacting two meaningful moments in your previous dreams. Share them with the City or in a house meeting. If those times are inconvenient, gather five dreamers together to reweave that part of your history into this City, even if temporary.','2015-03-09 03:12:11',NULL),(10029,10052,144,1,'Chaos Well:','Many people of Idoaclesia are complaining that this ability is not what Idoaclesia had, you know how it goes. I wish for you, as an Idoaclesian, to find strengths of this version and find ways you can incorperate it into service projects (ceremonies even) and student projects.','2015-03-09 17:41:32',NULL),(10098,10400,6,30,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-03-09 17:51:26',NULL),(10479,10169,52,40,'Kage Train 40','Work with your Master Teachers to plateau poison cloud to at least 20.  Work with them to develop some sample tasks for plateaus to 10 and 20 that aid the house, beyond simply bringing in items or essences.  ','2015-03-10 02:32:11',NULL),(10029,10455,74,50,'Mind Blank: 50','Alright, let\'s be honest. We know \'naughty\' still happens. Organize a few people for a guided tour of some of the most infamous seedy locals in the city. A guided tour of Mind Blank. Educate about dreamers associated with the places and remind people Sense Dreamers can still kill your privacy. While in these places discuss community service projects that could turn these places around.','2015-03-10 03:19:38',NULL),(10550,10090,21,20,'Blend 20','Blend into the fabric of the dream, observing changes to the Dream we once knew and those that came from the Idoleasceans. Make note of four new locations. Do we dream in two cities, or one cojoined City? Explain this to me, and the power you seek is yours.','2015-03-10 04:36:16',NULL),(10066,10090,74,40,'Mind Blank 40','Theorize on how our abilities have dimished since our return to the dream. Speak with your peers and find others that have experienced this. Have minds simply gone blank or is there at the root of this. Come up with usable alternatives to its common use and how it can be countered. Put these alternatives to the test.','2015-03-10 06:09:36',NULL),(10092,10098,10,10,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-10 06:12:50',NULL),(10092,10098,11,10,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-10 06:12:57',NULL),(10052,10108,40,30,'Deafen 30 - Clarity','Being deaf can also mean not hearing what needs to be heard.  Hear the pulse of our family and find out what sphere/goals they are pursuing and bring them to me so we can discuss them and plan out their paths to achieving them.','2015-03-10 20:55:34',NULL),(10009,10311,74,20,'MB20','Go one dream without evoking Locate Dreamers. You may utilize Sense Dreamers and House Members as much as you wish. Were you able to find your way to where people were? Did you miss evoking it?','2015-03-10 22:12:38',NULL),(10029,10108,144,1,'Chaos Well:','Will Calentue be accepting of this new knowledge of view it as a threat? Are there those who will be put off by the word \'Chaos\' alone? While you explore the ideological implications... We both know that Kage breaks himself trying to provide for Calentures energy needs. Devise a way to use Chaos Wells and collection missions as a fun system of reward for Calenture and break from the perpetual violence we have been facing as of late.','2015-03-10 22:27:25',NULL),(10029,10589,9,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring the Bundle -  Resist Fear, Free Action. Push. Flameshaft','2015-03-11 00:43:06',NULL),(10029,10589,7,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring the Bundle -  Resist Fear, Free Action. Push. Flameshaft','2015-03-11 00:43:12',NULL),(10029,10589,47,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring the Bundle -  Resist Fear, Free Action. Push. Flameshaft','2015-03-11 00:43:16',NULL),(10097,10311,41,1,'Blind','As you know I have been plotting to create an art to cast NMF onto another. I went into this blind so I am asking your help by Outlining one way you think that I could pull this off...I will attempt your outline at a later date. Let me know what you come up with and we can discuss what may work. ','2015-03-11 01:32:50',NULL),(10007,10400,139,1,'Quest: Dina','Bundle completion has been done by Dreiko, third sphere arts.','2015-03-11 02:46:55',NULL),(10062,10400,10,30,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing his bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-11 03:50:14',NULL),(10062,10400,11,30,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task\r\n','2015-03-11 04:07:00',NULL),(10062,10400,141,10,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task\r\n','2015-03-11 04:15:27',NULL),(10092,10098,141,1,'Kinesis','I want you to realize how this Art can truly be a nuisance.. I want you to go against 3 GKs with this Art.  They might have a lower level than your blast but I want you to toy with them when you face off.  Kinesis vs Blast.. tell me how you would have used it better than them.','2015-03-11 07:01:13',NULL),(10092,10589,68,1,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-11 08:05:54',NULL),(10011,10108,44,1,'Clarity Storm Learn','Mass arts are a serious responsibility that some don\'t take seriously. What constitutes responsible mass art use? Both in combat, and not in combat. If you had a daughter, how would you explain the power and responsibility of mass arts to her? For a time, \"the talk\" was something we only needed to have with other FateSenders. Now who else needs the talk? Are you the one to give it? _-* 3.10','2015-03-11 19:11:07',NULL),(10009,10302,19,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on her bundle plateau task to 20.','2015-03-11 22:15:07',NULL),(10009,10302,15,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on her bundle plateau task to 20.','2015-03-11 22:15:12',NULL),(10550,10469,6,20,'GT Med 20','Palisade, a plane where Bashir is worshipped. Why now? Many questions remain unanswered. Meditate in the Lake of Tears to understand & explain how the Palisade came to be in our City & how this may impact its future. With the highest intent, share this at a house meeting or with your Rulership.','2015-03-12 01:05:19',NULL),(10062,10098,141,10,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task\r\n','2015-03-12 01:52:42',NULL),(10052,10108,4,50,'FS 50 - Clarity','Splinter the current FS group that would be creating the chakram to take out Agonarius and organize a group that will ensure that whom we want will receive the chakram as opposed to OSM or DoL','2015-03-12 02:40:01',NULL),(10011,10018,144,1,'Jade Chaos Well','What are the implications for Chaos Wells for your house? What policies does it impact? Why? What does it mean to the Light if an essence is Cleansed/Banished/Imprisoned and the token put into the Chaos Well, which is then placed in the Stone? What are the implications of using drain on a Chaos Well since the essence is still inside (like draining a prime)? Get some other members\r\n as well. _-* 2.28','2015-03-12 06:39:07',NULL),(10029,10550,89,60,'Soul Shield: 60','Few remember \'Wyrmgrim and the Sacred Band and those that do have never brought the legacy forward. The shield at its roots protected him from chaos ripping through the city. Return to those roots and test the Shield against the chaotic powers that still corrupt GeRRoZ and carry that forward to find out if this ability will protect against the grasp of Agonarius or Dark Awakening itself.','2015-03-12 07:05:17',NULL),(10026,10098,12,1,'Shatter Gerroz Lear','Shatter can break any way of any level, if you could change this would you and why','2015-03-12 23:32:54',NULL),(10169,10577,139,1,'Sense Datoken','Much has changed since the days you remember spending time in this city.  The strongholds may look the same, but that does not mean that things are as they always had been.  Find out as much as you can about what has transpired among the open houses since we all found our way back to the city.  Are we repeating mistakes from the past, or are we on better footing now to combat this sort of threat together?','2015-03-13 01:24:44',NULL),(10062,10400,8,30,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for comleting a bundle task.','2015-03-13 05:27:15',NULL),(10062,10400,7,30,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for comleting a bundle task.','2015-03-13 05:27:21',NULL),(10062,10148,8,10,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-13 05:35:09',NULL),(10067,10004,18,20,'Quest: Tamarisk','Bundle to 20 reward\r\n','2015-03-13 05:35:51',NULL),(10067,10455,21,20,'Blend 20','Time to watch you walk through walls. I want you to find at least seven places in the City that you have to Blend into the surroundings to get to. When you have found them, let\'s go on a field trip and you can show me where they are. Not all places are accessable through a portal. That is part of the beauty of the City. ~Tam~','2015-03-13 06:22:25',NULL),(10479,10098,13,1,'Kaer Gerroz Return','Work with at least two other Gatekeepers who have return and strategize some ways for you to use Return to compliment your other Dreamseer and Gatekeeper abilities.  Plan for ways on how you could use it if you were being chased, in wars, fighting datoken/DMS, etc.  ','2015-03-13 17:54:05',NULL),(10098,10092,144,10,'Chaos Well 10','Find out how other houses look at chaos well as an art in regards to how it works on essences. Does it affect how they practice their essence handling? Do they have other plans for ther art? Potential other uses? How far have they been able to spread and advance it? ','2015-03-13 22:31:37',NULL),(10098,10009,144,10,'Dreiko C-Well 10','I didnt make Chaos well just to help DoL save souls. a Chaos well is a chaos compressing device. Primes are powerful because they store a lot of this energy. While smaller, Chaos Wells hold the same potential. Find me several uses for chaos wells beyond transporting essences to a prime','2015-03-14 00:17:22',NULL),(10062,10148,10,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-14 03:47:04',NULL),(10062,10148,11,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-14 03:47:11',NULL),(10062,10148,72,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-14 03:47:18',NULL),(10062,10148,98,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-14 03:47:27',NULL),(10009,10148,139,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on completion codex for bundle learns','2015-03-14 04:04:35',NULL),(10066,10092,92,50,'Reflect 50','If portals are two sided, why then does the Dark Awakening portal indicate its a one way portal from the Dark Awakening? Craft a device with reflective properties that will work with a one way portal and reveal details about the other side. With your peers, use this devise on the DA portal in the Palisade to gather useful information about the other side. Record all details.','2015-03-14 05:34:44',NULL),(10550,10580,74,1,'MB Learn:','Your absense from the dream has \"Mind Blank\'d\" your mind as you don\'t remember how to get to the specific gens & fighting grounds you were once accustomed to. Explore the dream. Without seeking help, find ways to jog your memory to un-\"Mind Blank\" yourself (2 gen areas/2 hunting grounds). If you can un-MB yourself, you will easily handle MB/un-MB\'ing your location.','2015-03-14 05:47:20',NULL),(10480,10469,139,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Bundle task reward\r\n','2015-03-14 06:50:38',NULL),(10480,10469,98,20,'Quest: Akkadian','Bundle task plateau reward\r\n','2015-03-14 06:50:49',NULL),(10480,10469,14,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Bundle task plateau completion\r\n','2015-03-14 06:51:08',NULL),(10480,10469,17,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Bundle task plateau reward.\r\n','2015-03-14 06:51:15',NULL),(10009,10092,118,10,'HM10','Provide assistance in the effort to clear the pathway to our Forward Armory. Work with Flower to identify the best way for you to provide it, whether it be planning, collection, or direct involvement in the activity.','2015-03-14 17:09:24',NULL),(10026,10098,13,10,'Quest: Ger Ret-10','Tasks can be so mundane and often borning, return to a place that holds value to you and return to me with the information as to why.','2015-03-14 22:33:56',NULL),(10062,10098,10,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-15 00:02:13',NULL),(10062,10098,11,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-15 00:02:20',NULL),(10062,10098,141,20,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-15 00:02:25',NULL),(10062,10018,89,10,'Soul Shield 10','Soul Shield is a somewhat useless art in the grand scheme of things. It\'s good for padding against Abjure, and keeping someone from Mind Blanking or removing your Mind Blank. Devise a plan to make it useful and report back the details.\r\n','2015-03-15 00:45:44',NULL),(10062,10092,141,20,'Kinesis 20','You\'ve recently pushed a dreamer to progress themselves. For this plateau, let\'s try to push others in the house to help progress each other. Find me two dreamers who will assist another in completing a task or mission for the house or themselves.\r\n','2015-03-15 03:56:03',NULL),(10092,10062,8,50,'Krodoc Prot 50','We are the Protectors of the City.. this Art is often not seen as important as RF or FA but it is just as important..  talk to 10 dreamers and tell me of a time when art of theirs has failed at a crucial moment and they wish they had protection on at that time.','2015-03-15 04:29:23',NULL),(10062,10022,144,1,'Chaos Well Learn','We held similar items in my city to these Chaos Wells. Learn the differences between the two items and present a plan for changing Chaos Well in a reasonable way.','2015-03-15 05:33:17',NULL),(10062,10148,10,10,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-15 05:45:37',NULL),(10062,10148,46,1,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing bundle task.','2015-03-15 06:14:02',NULL),(10062,10148,26,1,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing bundle task.','2015-03-15 06:14:07',NULL),(10062,10148,40,1,'Quest: Krodoc','\r\n','2015-03-15 06:14:13',NULL),(10029,10550,144,10,'Chaos Well: 10','Rhynan mentioned at our first encounter that Agonarius has a \'place of power.\' Much emphasis has been placed on Dark Awakening, is this the key? I wish for you explore both rumor and location to see if there could be a way, potentially, to siphon off the power of that place of power.','2015-03-15 06:32:53',NULL),(10011,10469,144,1,'Gray Chaos Well 1','Consider the house\'s current state. Are there any sources of chaos inside the house or outside it that must be dealt with? What are they? Choose one, and address it to the best of your ability. _-* 3.10','2015-03-15 07:17:59',NULL),(10005,10007,22,40,'Dina Forge 40','Discover who has the scroll for the Soulmaster focal weapon.  Find out what the requirements are for creating it and begin work to do so.  ','2015-03-15 07:36:20',NULL),(10009,10550,16,20,'Shoury-ID20','Much has changed within the physical City since you last dreamt. Learn about four new locations within the dream. Which came from the Idoaclesian City? Which just appeared? Once you learn of the new, bring some younger dreamers or Idoaclesians to an area that you remember being fond of and tell them why you are drawn to it.','2015-03-15 15:44:34',NULL),(10009,10311,144,1,'Chaos Well','Chaos Wells provide a way to fit more stuff into the same amount of space. We need exactly the same in the Order. Clear out the essence room in the house, converting it to a landing place for lesser elemens (non-flats/12-40s) and lower level chaks. It should essentially be stuff that is useful but not worth trekking up to steal. Make sure to move or acquire items to place there.','2015-03-15 19:12:37',NULL),(10066,10052,105,10,'PC 10','Consider trapping trips by soulmasters versus usage of a chaos well. Can the chaos well compete against trapped essences? Why or why not? If not, devise a useful implementation of the chaos well into the inner workings of Calenture.','2015-03-16 02:21:11',NULL),(10066,10169,105,10,'Poison Cloud 10','Gather the research and work done by yourself / SM guild in regard to Poison. Theorize on whether the Poison improvement will be extended to Poison Cloud too and base it on some logical research gathered. Conversation to follow.','2015-03-16 02:42:31',NULL),(10007,10275,17,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle 2nd plat learn','2015-03-16 03:15:41',NULL),(10007,10275,9,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle 2nd plat learn','2015-03-16 03:15:53',NULL),(10007,10275,26,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle 2nd plat learn','2015-03-16 03:16:43',NULL),(10007,10275,40,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle 2nd plat learn','2015-03-16 03:16:57',NULL),(10007,10275,72,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle 2nd plat learn','2015-03-16 03:18:00',NULL),(10007,10275,46,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle 2nd plat learn','2015-03-16 03:18:23',NULL),(10550,10275,18,1,'Bundle Compl - 2nd','Elders, I have a completion codex from Dina - \"Plase teach Tyren any art he can learn within 2nd sphere. He cas completed his bundle task.\", hence I am granting him Chamele. I will hold on to the codex in case there are issues.','2015-03-16 04:13:08',NULL),(10550,10022,144,10,'CW Plateau: 1','Chaos Well has one limitation that works against one of the abilities that BladeSlayer leverage in terms of trapped essences. Consult with a member of the Forger\'s Circle involved in its creation, and forge a prototype that could possibly counter it, based on your newfound knowledge & understanding.','2015-03-16 05:43:07',NULL),(10062,10400,65,40,'Blade 40','You seem to be developing quite the relationship with the members of AoE. I want you to see how far you can push it with them. Learn their strengths through your encounters with them, and provide for me some results that cast them in a negative light. Report the details back to me.\r\n','2015-03-16 05:51:47',NULL),(10062,10098,10,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-16 06:43:12',NULL),(10062,10098,141,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-16 06:43:19',NULL),(10062,10098,11,30,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-03-16 06:43:26',NULL),(10098,10092,144,20,'gD Chaos well 20','Chaos well greatly aids our house. To advance it further I\'d like a special system to advance it. Set tasks for each level of plateau, as well as set tasks to gain train self support tokens. Include this as an own section in your teaching post on our board','2015-03-16 17:28:21',NULL),(10011,10311,71,40,'Flower Flame 40','As you ascend as a FateSender, there comes a time where you must stoke the flames within you. What truly matters to you? What is it that you dream for? Find a way to show it, make it manifest. Describe it to individuals with forge outside your house and ask them to make something that captures that idea. Then, inscribe what you would make if you could. _-* 3.8','2015-03-16 19:00:28',NULL),(10062,10098,12,10,'Shatter 10','Blend is superior to Shatter in that you do not need to stand still in order to get out of a ward trap. Shatter is fairly quick to evoke as is Blend. With so many similarities and only a minor difference between the two, display for me how the combination of the two makes you far superior with ward traps over any pure GK or DS dreamer.\r\n','2015-03-16 20:00:10',NULL),(10009,10311,144,10,'Chaos Well 10','As a Guardian it\'s your job to lead others toward an overall goal. Have two of your Chaos Wells filled without collapsing a single mare that goes into them.','2015-03-16 21:22:42',NULL),(10480,10026,85,1,'Quest: Akkadian','DreamSmith art\r\n','2015-03-17 02:05:48',NULL),(10029,10112,67,40,'Soulreaper: 40','A reaping is not always an act to be frightened of. Using your passion for the Soul as inspiration augment your blade in your own unique way to render it a support tool for the excursion. Like a dowsing rod, may it help you find what you seek.','2015-03-17 02:36:57',NULL),(10480,10029,144,20,'Chaos Well to 10','For this plateau I am asking that you collect secrets. There is an old tale of a box that when opened, chaos ensues. Place these secrets in a box once you have obtained them and then when you feel that you have found enough, find me and we will go to your favorite spot and open the box and divuldge its secrets and see what havoc comes forth. **A**','2015-03-17 03:14:40',NULL),(10480,10008,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','SPoke with BladeSlayer and Kailee and granted her Quest.\r\n','2015-03-17 04:59:55',NULL),(10480,10072,60,1,'Sphere to Learn','You need to have completed 10 tasks and show 5 examples of sphere tasks. I also wish for you to speak with at least 5 other sphere teachers and speak with them as to what they require in a sphere task. Learn all you can about sphereing and when you have, find me and we will speak more. **A**','2015-03-17 05:13:36',NULL),(10480,10072,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted with Sphere art.\r\n','2015-03-17 05:14:10',NULL),(10107,10550,16,30,'Identify - Shoury','The dream has some new needs in its most recent carnation.  Some of those needs have been identified and solved for.  It\'s time to identify some new needs for the city.  I want you to identify the three most pressing needs in your opinion for the city and a rough idea on how to solve them.\r\n','2015-03-17 06:11:26',NULL),(10098,10092,22,60,'Forge 60','I would like one more colleague amongst the Dreamsmiths. Mentor one for us, and make sure he has at least one session with me as well. Your task is only complete if he or she passes their interview','2015-03-17 07:28:38',NULL),(10092,10400,12,1,'Shatter','Tell why this Art costs so much Will.  Other houses may think you are a arsehole.. I want you to Shatter that image and show them you are just a simply pirate.. even though you are more than that.. Shatter their image of you at least in their eyes... tell me how this fairs and your efforts.','2015-03-17 08:41:14',NULL),(10479,10311,4,40,'Flower fatesender40','Assist in the forging of the chakram to use against Agonarius.','2015-03-17 20:48:51',NULL),(10029,10011,107,30,'Peace Aura: 30','Carry out three services projects as detailed by the house service table of the mission boards. While you go about this work contemplate taking over this mission and keeping it fresh by updating the ideas with a \'suplimental\' goals and projects mission.','2015-03-18 00:27:18',NULL),(10011,10104,8,20,'Dar\'c Protection 20','Attend the FateSender\'s Guild meeting and offer your protection against any datoken that may attack. This task will be complete even if none attack, so long as you are present to defend just in case. _-* 2.28','2015-03-18 01:22:18',NULL),(10009,10550,21,40,'Blend40','Work with two of the Gatekeepers in the house (Excluding Gerroz) to get them to be able to double ward perfectly. Use your Blend to verify whether it was done properly. Is this a tactic we should prepare to use in war? What would the downside be to our members if we do?','2015-03-18 03:29:13',NULL),(10009,10275,18,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on successful completion of his bundle task','2015-03-18 03:29:20',NULL),(10009,10275,16,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on successful completion of his bundle task','2015-03-18 03:30:19',NULL),(10009,10275,15,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on successful completion of his bundle task','2015-03-18 03:30:56',NULL),(10009,10275,19,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on successful completion of his bundle task','2015-03-18 03:32:49',NULL),(10550,10320,18,30,'Quest: Shoury','Elders, I am honoring Zenobia\'s 3rd plateau bundle - Completion codex created by Eros - thank you.','2015-03-18 04:18:59',NULL),(10550,10320,15,10,'Quest: Shoury','Elders, this codex is to honour the completion to 10 codex written by DREIKO. Thank you.','2015-03-18 04:33:44',NULL),(10480,10011,52,50,'Train - 50','I want for you to write a task for a member of each focus to start working on the elemental blades. They may work with the Guilds or with the DreamSmiths or however you wish to word the task. Have them report progress to you and when you feel that you have enough to substantiate a report, find me and we will proceed. **A**','2015-03-18 05:06:18',NULL),(10480,10029,142,30,'Misdirection 30','I want you to use your talent with the spoken word. Attempt to misdirect  at least five conversations with the twisting of a phrase or the double meaning of words. Attempt to stear the conversation in a new direction. Keep notes on your attempts and your success or failures. When you thing that you are ready, come to me and we shall discuss. I will take you to my favorite place in the City  this time. **A**','2015-03-18 05:55:17',NULL),(10092,10098,10,40,'Ward/Amulet 40','Which House requires the most work to protect?  Race from Thresh to the House using the long road for each House.  No shortcuts.  Ward every portal from Thresh to Facade that you can.  Tell me times.  Tell me how each duration affects that House\'s defenses.','2015-03-18 07:10:38',NULL),(10092,10098,11,40,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-18 07:10:43',NULL),(10550,10465,144,10,'CW Plat: 10','\"A mix of emotions you FEEL, what could be the one, what\'s REAL, what\'s your next move its all on YOU, what matters most is that you remain TRUE.\" - Forge a type of Chaos Well that can be used to capture feelings of heartbreak, pain, and frustration. You mustn\'t allow recen\'t events from overtaking your mind and your being. Craft this in solitude, as distractions will be detrimental to your design.','2015-03-18 20:06:53',NULL),(10026,10400,68,40,'Flame 40','Folko changed the way flame was used and thought about, seek out Brother Timothy, GuardDog, Kailoth, Kage, StarFall or Poppygirl or others you see fit, and learn how Folko and Flame go hand in Hand. If you had to honor that dreamer today, how would you do it?','2015-03-18 20:27:55',NULL),(10026,10098,13,20,'Return 20','Return and find the 5 best Fonts of the City What item Genned when you were there, return with that to me.','2015-03-18 22:20:56',NULL),(10029,10011,74,40,'Mind Blank: 40','We discussed an incubation field. I would like to expand upon this further. Do you think it would be possible to use various other energies to make unique fields within the city? If Mind Blank uses Chaos, what may some other energies provide for us as individuals or as groups if we harnessed them?','2015-03-18 23:32:54',NULL),(10007,10112,70,40,'Flame 40','Take this chakram that has a flame circling around it. Put out the flame by using your SM element of water. This will take more than just throwing water on it to put the flame out. I want this chakram to have the same charges, but not be able to produce a deadly flame. How will you suceed in this? Take notes because I want to know!','2015-03-19 03:25:16',NULL),(10011,10469,24,10,'Gray Restore 10','Attend my attempt to break the learning barrier on Restore and participate as requested. Participation is key. Bonus points if you can bring a friend. If you are unable to attend, we can work out an alternative next time I see you. _-* 3.18','2015-03-19 06:19:48',NULL),(10550,10469,15,10,'GT Bundle Reward','Elders, this is a reward from the completion codex written by Akaddian himself. This incorporates Judgement plateau\'d to 10.','2015-03-19 11:16:38',NULL),(10169,10065,70,40,'Flamesear to 40','Assist two of your housemates with completing tasks of their own.  Note that you do not need to see them through to completion, however you should make a real effort to help them with a task they are currently working on.  Report back when you feel you\'ve made a real impact here.','2015-03-19 18:03:18',NULL),(10029,10065,67,40,'Soulreaper: 40','I wish for you to concieve of and create a blade that is a unique manifestation of our focal domain. I might suggest Starfall as a partner to discuss the situation with you and bounce ideas off of if you\'re stuck. The weapon should exude \'you\', and our focus as it speaks to the desire you have to create your own domain within the focus.','2015-03-19 19:02:43',NULL),(10072,10018,13,20,'Return20Jade','Try different strategies with Bladeslayer to collect prime strength. Utilize return while delivering essences back to the house for Bladeslayer. Identify the quickest way to do it, including the most ideally located hunting ground. ','2015-03-20 00:14:46',NULL),(10066,10065,144,1,'Chaos Well Learn','Use the chaos well and conduct experiments with it on essences, trapped essences, and banished essence tokens. Questions will follow regarding your experimentation. Lastly, use the Orb of Calenture to banish the chaos well. Observe all details in how these two react with each other.','2015-03-20 00:41:11',NULL),(10550,10275,69,30,'Bundle Reward','Honoring a bundle task reward - TranceFlame 30, from a codex by Dreiko.','2015-03-20 01:55:12',NULL),(10550,10275,18,20,'Quest: Shoury','Tyren has completed his bundle task for plateau to 20 - this is to cover Chamele to 20','2015-03-20 03:14:50',NULL),(10550,10275,2,20,'Quest: Shoury','Tyren has completed his bundle task for plateau to 20 - this is to cover DreamSeer  to 20','2015-03-20 03:14:56',NULL),(10550,10275,36,20,'Quest: Shoury','Tyren has completed his bundle task for plateau to 20 - this is to cover Dreamblade to 20','2015-03-20 03:15:02',NULL),(10550,10275,19,20,'Quest: Shoury','Tyren has completed his bundle task for plateau to 20 - this is to cover Vision to 20','2015-03-20 03:15:11',NULL),(10226,10090,103,1,'Bequeath','Bequeath something of yourself to those around you. Show how giving you truely are.','2015-03-20 03:24:19',NULL),(10226,10090,103,1,'Bequeath Hik','Bequeath something of yourself upon those around you at the moment.  Show how giving you can be.','2015-03-20 03:24:19',NULL),(10226,10066,103,1,'Quest: Amante','Rewriting an existing quest cauuse AS usual I wrote it for the wrong person.. uhg\r\n','2015-03-20 03:26:16',NULL),(10550,10275,19,30,'Quest: Shoury','Honoring this bundle reward from Dreiko\'s completion bundle codex.','2015-03-20 04:19:52',NULL),(10066,10580,141,1,'kinesis learn','bundle 30 learn completed and completion codex issued by me.','2015-03-20 06:02:20',NULL),(10226,10580,38,1,'Scare','Bundle Quest\r\n','2015-03-20 06:07:14',NULL),(10226,10580,25,1,'Reweave','Bundle Quest\r\n','2015-03-20 06:07:18',NULL),(10226,10580,24,1,'Res','Bundle Quest','2015-03-20 06:07:24',NULL),(10226,10580,15,1,'Judge','Bundle Quest','2015-03-20 06:07:36',NULL),(10226,10580,16,1,'ID','Bundle Task\r\n','2015-03-20 06:07:53',NULL),(10550,10275,18,30,'Quest: Shoury','This is a bundle task reward from Dreiko\'s 30 bundle task completion.','2015-03-21 03:30:25',NULL),(10550,10275,36,30,'Quest: Shoury','This is a bundle task reward from Dreiko\'s 30 bundle task completion.','2015-03-21 03:30:39',NULL),(10550,10275,2,30,'Quest: Shoury','This is a bundle task reward from Dreiko\'s 30 bundle task completion.','2015-03-21 03:30:46',NULL),(10550,10275,16,20,'Quest: Shoury','This is a bundle task reward from myself (ID 20).','2015-03-21 03:30:52',NULL),(10007,10275,7,1,'Quest: Dina','3rd bundle learn','2015-03-21 05:08:44',NULL),(10007,10275,24,1,'Quest: Dina','3rd bundle learn','2015-03-21 05:10:24',NULL),(10007,10275,74,1,'Quest: Dina','3rd bundle learn','2015-03-21 05:10:34',NULL),(10007,10275,38,1,'Quest: Dina','3rd bundle learn','2015-03-21 05:10:46',NULL),(10062,10400,1,40,'GK 40','Seek out your fellow GKs and gather their support in reopening the GateKeeper Guild Hall. Bring back to me the support of at least 3 other GKs and a plan to reopen it.','2015-03-21 06:38:04',NULL),(10051,10469,107,20,'PA to 20 - Gray','Completing parts of our PA structure from the mission boards.','2015-03-21 22:03:12',NULL),(10009,10275,20,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting Tyren Blast based on his third sphere learnable bundle.','2015-03-22 01:17:38',NULL),(10009,10275,20,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting Tyren\'s Blast Plateau based on his First Plat Bundle Completion Codex','2015-03-22 01:27:48',NULL),(10009,10275,20,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring Tyren\'s Blast20 plateau based on his bundle task completion codex','2015-03-22 01:32:19',NULL),(10009,10275,20,30,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting Tyren his Blast to 30 based on his plateau bundle completion.','2015-03-22 01:36:28',NULL),(10062,10550,40,10,'Deafen 10 | Shoury','I\'ve been told Taryag is heading up a project for our home, but I have not seen any action on this. Find out the current status of the project, and report back to me with a plan on how you would approach it if you were in charge of the project.','2015-03-22 02:58:08',NULL),(10026,10062,13,30,'Quest: Return Krodo','Return to me with 3 viable options, and support from at least 3 dreamers to return the access portal to the Guild Hall','2015-03-22 04:27:16',NULL),(10029,10455,107,40,'Peace Aura: 40','For this ability I want you to survey your own desire for Sixth sphere weighed against the goals/projects of the house. Find your direction and use that to set in place a foundation for the support you will need towards your task. You will need support outside the house, obviously, given the scope of the sphere. So find resources externally to assist in forming a project that with push the Alliance further.','2015-03-22 07:05:21',NULL),(10029,10455,144,10,'Chaos Well: 10','Fill the Threshold \'cache\' with Chaos Wells, leaving an created \'scroll\' behind giving those who might find it information on the first three to learn it and that \"as theorized by Magnilia and her research team the capacity grows by twenty as shown in these specimens\".. the rest of the content is yours to decide.','2015-03-22 07:43:38',NULL),(10052,10169,144,1,'Chaos Well - Kage','Come up with a process on how these should be dispersed or stock kept of these throughout Calenture and see to putting that into effect.','2015-03-22 17:08:56',NULL),(10009,10320,23,10,'Recharge10','Recharge at the first plateau is still just a costier form of Destroy Talisman. So I want you to swap the arts for a little while. Spend a battle collecting all of the items that drop and destroy them. If anybody mentions it be sure to let them know you had tried to recharge them to disasterous ends...','2015-03-22 21:29:39',NULL),(10022,10112,24,40,'Damia: Restore 40','I truly dislike seeing the City empty and collecting dust; many rooms within the Dream go unused and vacant, never being visited by a soul. I want you to pick four such places, that perhaps have special meaning for you. Involve yourself in the Lyceum and take a cadre of Dreamers on a trip around the city, taking them to visit these special places. Inform them of the history that infuses the locations, why are they special? Breathe life back into these places, restore them to the glory you remember. ~.|','2015-03-22 22:09:47',NULL),(10009,10275,139,1,'Sense Datoken','Bring me a datoke essence you had a hand in collapsing.','2015-03-23 00:04:02',NULL),(10009,10275,144,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on learnable bundle task completion','2015-03-23 00:07:50',NULL),(10009,10275,73,1,'Quest: Dreiko','','2015-03-23 00:08:36',NULL),(10009,10275,8,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on learnable bundle task completion','2015-03-23 00:08:57',NULL),(10009,10275,25,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on learnable bundle task completion','2015-03-23 00:09:12',NULL),(10009,10275,139,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on plat bundle task completion','2015-03-23 00:15:46',NULL),(10009,10275,139,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on plat bundle task completion','2015-03-23 00:17:44',NULL),(10066,10385,11,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plats 30 competion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring amulet.','2015-03-23 00:24:32',NULL),(10066,10385,68,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plats 30 competion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring flameshaft.','2015-03-23 00:24:55',NULL),(10066,10385,9,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plats 30 competion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring Free Action 30','2015-03-23 00:26:04',NULL),(10066,10385,10,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plats 30 competion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring ward 30.','2015-03-23 00:27:56',NULL),(10066,10385,7,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plats 30 competion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring resist fear 30','2015-03-23 00:28:20',NULL),(10066,10385,8,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plats 30 competion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring protection 30','2015-03-23 00:28:43',NULL),(10066,10385,1,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plats 30 competion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring gatekeeper','2015-03-23 00:29:40',NULL),(10066,10385,65,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plats 30 competion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring gatesmasher 30','2015-03-23 00:30:11',NULL),(10066,10385,6,30,'Quest: Thunderman','Bundle plats 30 competion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring meditation 30','2015-03-23 00:30:34',NULL),(10011,10052,82,10,'Trisha Terror 10','Agonarius is a threat, but nobody is actually *afraid* of him. What would well and truly scare this city, or even just its powerful citizens? What could be done to bring it about? What steps must be taken to prevent it or prepare for it? And what role does teaching and houses play in this? _-* 2.26','2015-03-23 00:40:33',NULL),(10026,10008,144,1,'Learn Chaos Well','What is its purpose, and how are the colors defined, another words how is the color made of the well. bring me 3 from 3 different dreamers.','2015-03-23 01:44:40',NULL),(10550,10275,16,30,'Quest: Shoury','Granting this bundle quest reward from Dreiko\'s completion codex for DreamSeer arts to 30.','2015-03-23 02:36:35',NULL),(10029,10067,144,10,'Chaos Well: 10','I often wonder what beneficial properties the powers of chaos may offer us. I also wonder if I would be more respected if I was a man. theorize and experiment as needed - in some basic way - to see if the powers of chaos could potentially change my \'well\' into a mine shaft.','2015-03-23 04:56:36',NULL),(10005,10007,22,50,'Dina forge 50','Bladeslayer was denied for his dreamsmith interview.  Teach him the ways of forge in our city.  Work with him to develope a central theme to all his creations like we had in our city and expand on his maker\'s mark.  Not some stupid like symbol like ({EROS}).  Some unique way of marking his items, such as an engraved leaf or feather that he may use.','2015-03-23 05:25:59',NULL),(10107,10550,16,40,'ID 40 - Shoury','From the last task, What intrigues me the most is your contribution to the DreamSmith Mark.  Since you and Golah are working on a new Forge philosophy, how will you change the minds of those who only want combative goods?  Identify your challenges and how you will meet those challenges.  Changing people\'s minds can be difficult to say the least.','2015-03-23 18:30:56',NULL),(10550,10320,20,40,'Blast Pleateau: 4','You\'ve encountered many trial with Blast in a conventional way, so you will put your Blast to other uses: gardening. What you once helpe destroy you shall now rebuilt & create in your home in a new location. Scan your home for a solid new foundation for Zenobia\'s Garden. Consult with forger\'s in the City to help you create a master piece. You delegate, they create! Give at least two dreamers outside your home a tour, assuming permission from your leadership.','2015-03-23 22:51:49',NULL),(10026,10022,96,20,'Sense 20','How are sense dreamer and sense mare related, what came first the chicken or the egg','2015-03-24 01:00:07',NULL),(10026,10008,6,20,'Med 20','If you had to choose one place that radiated meditation where would it be and why\r\n','2015-03-24 01:10:27',NULL),(10011,10469,74,10,'Gray MB 10','Don\'t let Apothos fall by the wayside with his work on the Seer relic, the Knowing Glass. Encourage him to make a plan and get to work on the next step. Have him specify just what has to be done and how others can help. _-* 3.20','2015-03-24 01:44:53',NULL),(10026,10070,6,20,'Meditate 20','Meditates changes have vasty improved the need and use of the art, the real question remains, why do we need to meditate in the first place','2015-03-24 01:56:11',NULL),(10030,10469,89,1,'Soul Shield: Learn','I wish for you to experiment with a practice I often used in Idoaclesia. I wish for you to step out of your physical form and experience yourself as energy in the \'Weave itself. Let us find out if the native dreamers of this reality are capable of such a journey. I caution you to remain anchored in some way, less you be lost to the \'Weave of reality and unable to return to your physical form. This \'anchoring\' in essence being a shield for your soul.','2015-03-24 06:26:14',NULL),(10062,10007,144,1,'Chaos Well Learn','AoE is getting on my nerves as of late. Quietly find a way to best hinder their progress and return to me with a few courses of action to take.','2015-03-25 03:00:31',NULL),(10007,10112,31,1,'Curse Learn','You and Norkight seem to have some issues going on. You can\'t remember him and he...isn\'t speaking and says that he hurt someone with words, so he took a vow to not speak till he is forgiven. Whatever that all means. Fix these curses please. Get your mind back and figure out what he is needing. I want a FULL report on what was done and needed.','2015-03-25 04:15:49',NULL),(10029,10011,107,40,'Peace Aura: 40','No. You don\'t get to use the standard quest format. You have a ritual to perform. The likes of which has not been yet experienced in the common era. Impress me, impress the faith, and carry the Shadow back to our house, freeing its spirit from that accursed and corrupted legacy.','2015-03-25 05:46:12',NULL),(10022,10072,144,1,'Jerulan: Chaos Well','Have someone give you two Chaos Wells. Take these wells hunting and fill them to capacity. While doing this figure out the difference if you were hunting without them. Is it much more efficient than when you didn\'t have them? Or could you save as many souls in as much time without them?','2015-03-25 21:31:07',NULL),(10022,10008,103,1,'Kailee: Bequeath','Find a \"younger\" dreamer who is still green and wet around the ears, show them the \"ropes\", it doesn\'t necessarily have to be a newly, just someone... young. Why is bequeath useful to the unsphered and lower spheres? Come back and tell me all about it! ~.|','2015-03-25 21:48:06',NULL),(10048,10108,44,10,'Firestorm - 10','Firestorm is considered a \"mass\" art. Using your knowledge of Firestorm and how it works, come up with a unique art that can be made as a mass art for any focus, and explain how you\'d potentially test and create it, as well as the reasonings behind your choice.','2015-03-26 03:11:47',NULL),(10022,10107,142,1,'OfF: Misdirection','You have been gone from the city for quite some time. Though I am pleased to see your faith remained the same. How much rust has caked onto your avatar since being gone. I want for you to duel Jerulan and test your mettle... perhaps you could misdirect him in some way and win... ~.|\r\n','2015-03-26 04:08:49',NULL),(10107,10018,72,50,'Inscribe 50 - Jade','We all tend to inscribe on simple codexes, but there seems to be a variety of materials and mediums in the dream beyond these handy notepads.  Try and experiment with a couple new materials. What are the pros and cons? I\'d like a few examples provided for review.  As for what to put on them, that\'s up to you. Art, poetry, limericks or recipes for donuts... all are welcome!','2015-03-26 04:20:41',NULL),(10029,10070,35,30,'Trap: 30','Find out what you are going to do with yourself in this new era. Make demonstration of your allegiance and new found purpose by making a tribute of your trapped essences.','2015-03-26 04:32:37',NULL),(10029,10385,15,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle Learn 30-39','2015-03-26 04:52:24',NULL),(10029,10385,16,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle Learn 30-39','2015-03-26 04:52:33',NULL),(10029,10385,24,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle Learn 30-39','2015-03-26 04:52:42',NULL),(10029,10385,25,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle Learn 30-39','2015-03-26 04:54:46',NULL),(10029,10385,73,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle Learn 30-39','2015-03-26 04:55:03',NULL),(10029,10385,74,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle Learn 30-39','2015-03-26 04:55:07',NULL),(10029,10385,144,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle Learn 30-39','2015-03-26 04:55:14',NULL),(10029,10385,38,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle Learn 30-39','2015-03-26 04:57:35',NULL),(10062,10385,141,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-26 05:02:27',NULL),(10029,10550,144,20,'Chaos Well: 20','Hidden Secrets! Leave mission on the library boards that tie back into a collection of items (say a three piece set) that when turned into the secret puzzle master, you, with a Chaos well will result in a prize! You pick the prize. See what interest if any is kicked off from this merry little game.','2015-03-26 05:34:32',NULL),(10480,10029,47,60,'Push 60','Please push the limits of others. I wish for you to strive to help others reach a goal that they are currently working towards. It could be the completion of a quest, sphere, train, experiment.  I will leave the particulars up to you. Be a strong enough force that it pushes the ones you choose to accomplish something. Choose at least six others to nudge in the proper direction. Report when the journeys are complete. We might even have tea and discuss. **A**','2015-03-26 08:02:46',NULL),(10169,10383,16,1,'Identify','We\'ve had some issues with thievery lately, mostly from our essence room.  Devise a strategy by which we can either try and catch those stealing from our essence room, or come up with a way to make it much more painful and annoying for them to steal from it. ','2015-03-26 18:42:37',NULL),(10092,10107,144,1,'Chaos Well','Ok for this I want to theorize for me.  Talk to 2 Smiths about why this Art is one of DreamSoul and not of Resilience as many Arts that have to do with essences are... tell me how it could be more useful.','2015-03-26 20:44:48',NULL),(10107,10550,21,50,'Blend 50 - Shoury','The art of Blend is currently limited to wards.  They simply allow us to slide past the wards, and enter the portals.  Is there a way to get ahold of the house crests for GoE that have been laying around and using them as a means to find an art that could get dreamers into a house?  How can we go about passing the unpassable portals of the dream? ','2015-03-27 06:33:47',NULL),(10092,10009,22,50,'Forge 50 2','and so on.. you must then build up a huge hype and buzz about everyone collecting these limited edition figures.. make them covet them.. when someone presents you all 5 figures you will then award them a prize that is so unique only something an Elder can forge for them.  This must be something of epic proportions and the items must show to the City you are truly deserving of this Art at a high level. ','2015-03-28 04:21:01',NULL),(10092,10009,22,50,'Forge 50 1','I want you to show your skills to the City.. you must carefully craft action figures of a famous GK, SM, DS, FS, and Elder.. past or present.. these figures must me intricately created and detailed and they must be completely unique in some way.  Then you must spread these 5 figures throughout the City in limited edition runs.  Not giving more than 1 to the same dreamer.  The amount you give of each is up to you.  They must not be released at the same time.  GKs in one time.. then later.. DS.. (cont)','2015-03-28 04:21:01',NULL),(10030,10455,23,50,'Recharge: 50','I wish for you to organize an activity uniquely \'Seer\' for those of us in the Alliance sharing this focus. A faire of sorts for each of us to give special demonstration of our interpretation of the focus.','2015-03-28 05:29:52',NULL),(10092,10589,8,1,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-03-28 05:30:06',NULL),(10011,10383,4,30,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Magnilia\r\n','2015-03-28 07:42:47',NULL),(10011,10383,71,30,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Magnilia','2015-03-28 07:43:16',NULL),(10011,10383,66,30,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Magnilia','2015-03-28 07:43:44',NULL),(10011,10383,40,10,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Starfall','2015-03-28 07:50:11',NULL),(10011,10383,38,20,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Magnilia','2015-03-28 07:50:36',NULL),(10011,10383,37,20,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Magnilia','2015-03-28 07:50:57',NULL),(10169,10027,105,1,'Poison Cloud','Spend time recharging our vaults and doing what you do best - playing hostess at the house and in threshold.','2015-03-29 04:48:10',NULL),(10029,10027,144,1,'Chaos Well: Learn','The story of their creation is not too complex, however it is a perfect intro into conversations with people now that you\'ve returned. 1.) What part did GeRRoZ, Starfall and Magnilia play in the final stages of Well creation? 2.)What happens when you plateau Chaos well? 3.)What do you not compress within a Chaos well? - Ask around, be excited at something new! And return to me if you can find these answers. If not, I will teach you all you can stomach myself.','2015-03-29 06:24:57',NULL),(10067,10004,16,30,'Quest: Tamarisk','Reward for bundle to 30 task.','2015-03-29 23:43:12',NULL),(10067,10004,69,30,'Quest: Tamarisk','Reward for bundle to 30 task.\r\n','2015-03-29 23:43:42',NULL),(10062,10092,141,30,'Kinesis 30','I would very much like to see the GK Guild Hall become available. It is something we did have in my city, and is one of my many goals in this city. Devise three plans to reopen the Guild Hall and report back the details to me. Make sure to note any assistance you received on the formation of the plans.','2015-03-30 00:07:12',NULL),(10479,10009,22,60,'Quest: Herbert','Prize for winning 3-11 under games.','2015-03-30 00:42:17',NULL),(10026,10550,22,50,'Forge-Pt 2','Part 2 is to figure out and find the book of memories, it is rumored that this book details the creation path of the Thought in Stone. This will test creativity, imagination, and dedication to both the art, and those not of your focus, for a city divided falls faster than one combined.','2015-03-30 02:59:35',NULL),(10026,10465,22,40,'Forge 40','Since I know you have already aided me in my task, and taking into account what you have already done for another teacher. Your mission is to assist Kailee and I in our recommitment Ceremony, create a never before seen moment, and create the drinks for the guests.','2015-03-30 03:02:59',NULL),(10027,10068,24,1,'Quest: LadySilver','part of bundle','2015-03-30 03:51:25',NULL),(10029,10455,46,50,'Recall: 50','Survey the core sanctuaries of the city (those dreamers depend on the most) and look for any indication that a creeping darkness is encroaching. Taking research partners is greatly encouraged.','2015-03-30 03:52:20',NULL),(10027,10068,26,1,'Quest: LadySilver','part of bundle','2015-03-30 03:52:22',NULL),(10027,10067,14,30,'Quest: LadySilver','to thirty for bundle completion starfall','2015-03-30 04:01:47',NULL),(10067,10004,14,30,'Quest: Tamarisk','Reward for bundle task.\r\n','2015-03-30 04:05:43',NULL),(10011,10465,107,1,'Norkight Peace Aura','Read the mission board post and complete one of the goals listed. Additionally, what do you think is the best way to resolve the situation with OoSM? How would you like us to help? What would make it worse? _-*','2015-03-30 04:26:10',NULL),(10029,10067,5,20,'Random: 30','The way of the witcher are gift most valuable. While the core of your secrets are bound to you and your own coven I would have you create a grimoire. The item as it will be shared should reflect your clan and allow for a connection to the powers for those working with you.','2015-03-30 05:28:49',NULL),(10029,10385,139,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Teaching the art as needed as part of a completed bundle line.','2015-03-30 06:07:49',NULL),(10022,10107,144,10,'OfF: CW 10','How are you at hunting horron? Do you know how to take them down with a partner? If so, grab yourself a partner and teach them how. If not, grab yourself a partner that knows how and learn.  Fill a Chaos Well with the essences.','2015-03-30 18:56:14',NULL),(10107,10320,16,20,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','For completion of a bundled task for 2nd sphere.','2015-03-30 18:56:19',NULL),(10066,10090,105,10,'PC 10','Make a round of the two forward vaults/armories and the master armory. Forge any missing dreamsoul, shields and alterors and make sure that the items not put away are fully recharged.','2015-03-31 00:52:54',NULL),(10550,10090,89,30,'SS Plateau 3','Your theory of the Alliance\'s generator being a battery intrigues many dreamers, including myself. Create a prototype testing this theory, and present it to your home for the possibility of further work in the future if necessary. How can you use your findings to shield the soul of your home moving forward?','2015-03-31 01:57:02',NULL),(10480,10022,35,70,'Trap Nightmare 70','For this task I would like for you to create a Trap Nightmare guide: Beginners to 7th sphere and beyond. I want it detailed with where the best spots are for each level, tips for better trapping at each level, tactics that others do not know, and so on. It should contain seven chapters and be thourough and worthy of a plateau to 70. Cover everything that you know about trapping. When it is finished, I would liike for you to inscribe codex with basic information for each level for the various Library rooms.','2015-03-31 05:38:44',NULL),(10030,10090,16,30,'Identify - 30','Seek our and find at least five locations of entangled reality. This may be related to Idoaclesia and Underlight or other strange anomalies that you are able to detect. Be prepared to speculate on the deeper effects that these entangled locations may present to us, and precautions we may consider taking for our defense.','2015-04-01 03:59:01',NULL),(10022,10108,16,20,'Clarity: ID 20','\"Identify\" at least three things within the Dreamstate that you wish you could change. This could be anything really; people, places, things, arts or perhaps even yourself... anything.  What would you change? How would you change it? Why? Are these changes possible... if so, are you going to try to enact them? What can your imagination come up with...','2015-04-01 17:36:08',NULL),(10479,10018,65,50,'Jade GateSmasher 50','Use this datoken blade and attempt to ward trap some datoken and collapse them using only the blade and your flame.  You may not use the blade on anything besides Datoken.  Report once you feel you have done enough to earn this plateau.  ','2015-04-02 01:03:22',NULL),(10169,10070,35,40,'Trap Nightmare 40','I\'d like you to try and find a way in to the cells of the Cell Block in the Pallisade.  Not just the room itself, but the side of it that actually contains the cells.  They were accessible in the other instance of the city that contained the Pallisade.  If you cannot find a way in, then present me with some ideas on ways we can could try getting in moving forward.  Good luck!','2015-04-02 04:32:48',NULL),(10107,10550,16,50,'ID 50 - Shoury','I want you to spend a little time in the threshold pits and look at the gens down there.  There are very few gens that a newly awakened dreamer can get access to chakrams.  But even more interesting, is that there are three different types of gens down there that can actually whip up some decent items. I\'d like you to grade the different types of items, especially elemens.  These gens will surprise you.','2015-04-02 20:53:26',NULL),(10007,10604,70,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle learn 0-19','2015-04-03 01:32:07',NULL),(10007,10604,25,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle learn 0-19','2015-04-03 01:32:22',NULL),(10007,10604,24,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle learn 0-19','2015-04-03 01:32:30',NULL),(10007,10604,47,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle learn 0-19','2015-04-03 01:32:39',NULL),(10007,10604,26,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle learn 0-19','2015-04-03 01:32:48',NULL),(10022,10604,48,1,'Bundle Completion','Honoring a bundle task from Dina for Hailey.\r\n','2015-04-03 01:42:51',NULL),(10107,10004,38,1,'Scare - Zsa Zsa','I want you to terrify the dream.  Dreamers, mares, datoken, darks and elders alike.  I especially want you to scare them when they are perched on the edge of a wall or cliff.  Do this with a couple items I am going to give you, and tell me how people react.  ','2015-04-03 04:24:21',NULL),(10029,10604,70,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle 10 Completion as issued by Starfall.','2015-04-03 08:17:00',NULL),(10029,10604,26,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle 10 Completion as issued by Starfall.','2015-04-03 08:17:18',NULL),(10029,10604,24,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle 10 Completion as issued by Starfall.','2015-04-03 08:17:29',NULL),(10029,10604,3,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle 10 Completion as issued by Starfall.','2015-04-03 08:17:40',NULL),(10029,10604,67,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring Bundle 10 Completion as issued by Starfall.','2015-04-03 08:17:44',NULL),(10009,10320,23,20,'Recharge20','You\'ve been a garden destroyer and builder in your short dreams. Now let\'s move on from flowers. I want you to build a garden of bad recharges. It should consist of items that have been recharged and destroyed. The garden should have every normal item type and al four foci represented. You can create them with inscribe if you would like or seek a forger to make them for you. Utilize an easily accessible Vault to demonstrate your work of art.','2015-04-03 22:04:09',NULL),(10479,10022,22,70,'Bladeslayer Forge70','You have recently discovered a mysterious key inside your house with your house\'s symbol on it.  Find the true purpose this key was ment for and successfuly use it to unlock or open whatever it was made to do.  ','2015-04-04 04:01:58',NULL),(10550,10455,144,20,'CW Plat: 2nd','Improving Chaos Well reduces your cognitive dissonance of the ability as you gain more mastery over it; the same applies with Dissonance shared tonight. Educate two Seers unaware of Dissonance, and forge them unique prototypes of this concept. Your crafts will serve as \'Chaos Wells\' that will house their initial Dissonance of the art and its function.','2015-04-04 04:05:32',NULL),(10479,10029,70,70,'Magnilia Flame70','Continue to work with your house to add distinction to Lambent.  For one of the rooms of lambent or elsewhere, I want you to work with others from your house or outside to create a flame monument or memorial of some kind.  The purpose and details are up to you, but your efforts should be worthy of a 70 plateau.','2015-04-04 04:29:04',NULL),(10022,10107,144,20,'OfF: CW 20','I want you to develop a theory as to how a Chaos Well functions. Are we literally dumping essences into a well carved out of the chaos, just letting them linger in some temporal void or does the well itself have a function whereby the essence is stored within it. Where does the well go? Is there a boy named Timmy down there? Find out for me.','2015-04-04 05:02:11',NULL),(10029,10550,144,30,'Chaos Well: 30','I want you to take stock of every Cache in the city (as well as the room on the way to Lost Caves). Note the \'stock\' of Chaos Wells in each. Clean out any that have less that the 60 ot 80 capacity. While there create a simply informational tid-bit (forge it please) educating about the well and how much you and I work with it in the city.','2015-04-04 05:05:51',NULL),(10029,10550,107,1,'Chaos Well: Learn','Honoring House Servive PA Quest issued by Starfall (issuer error, Starfall targeted myself instead of Shoury when creating the quest): Read and accept the Peace Aura mission on the boards. Ceese a house service to perform other than the chaos wells option. Also, post to all the leadership in the house informing them of your goals, how the house can help, and asking them if they are working on anything that could use your help. _-*','2015-04-04 05:10:52',NULL),(10479,10107,87,1,'Quest: Herbert','granting support sphere','2015-04-04 06:00:07',NULL),(10007,10077,74,40,'MB 40','The vaults are a freaking mess in the house. No one has really been working on them. I want you to take ownership of this and get them fixed. I have had issues trying to bring in souls, but keep running into full rooms! I expect this to be posted again on the mission board. Change things if they need to be changed.','2015-04-04 22:40:03',NULL),(10009,10469,139,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring bundle plateau based on completion codex','2015-04-05 00:07:33',NULL),(10029,10051,107,30,'Peace Aura: 30','Complete the house service projects as mandated by the missions. In addition to this I wish for you to detail an additional project for each of the \'Voices\' as well as a special \'Knight\' section. Speak with our Knights, letting them know of specific ways they can serve your needs in the faction and set them on that path.','2015-04-05 02:46:56',NULL),(10550,10465,144,20,'CW Plat: 2nd','Norkight, seek the Caches in Lost Caves, Lower Ossuary of Dread, and Evernight Plateau. Recollect the impact this art has had on the City thus far, and forge an informational tid-bit for each Cache in how the art continues shaping the City.\r\n','2015-04-05 04:14:34',NULL),(10029,10383,144,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Giving as part of completion, bundle','2015-04-05 04:56:46',NULL),(10029,10383,74,1,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-04-05 04:58:52',NULL),(10029,10383,46,1,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-04-05 04:59:23',NULL),(10029,10383,26,1,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-04-05 05:01:11',NULL),(10029,10383,24,1,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-04-05 05:05:13',NULL),(10029,10383,25,1,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-04-05 05:05:29',NULL),(10011,10383,43,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Magnilia','2015-04-05 05:06:28',NULL),(10029,10383,73,1,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-04-05 05:06:39',NULL),(10029,10383,98,1,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-04-05 05:06:52',NULL),(10029,10383,15,1,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-04-05 05:07:22',NULL),(10029,10383,139,1,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-04-05 05:07:33',NULL),(10018,10077,139,1,'Sense Datoken','Write at least one article and share it, that fits the requirements of the Awakened board - news, history, and the like.','2015-04-05 05:10:40',NULL),(10029,10550,107,10,'Peace Aura: 10','Follow the mandates of the House Service Projects to completed the required number needed for a Plat\' 10. While you focus on that report to the leadership of the house a daily duty you would like to take on that is engaging, now that you\'re no longer expected to Recharge/Combine as you did in the Order.','2015-04-05 14:38:26',NULL),(10029,10465,107,10,'Peace Aura: 10','Pick from the list of Service Projects the number of appropriate acts for this plateau and carry them out. Additionally: Flat Dreamsoul Elemens  in bulk will be considered as an alternative \'Service Project\' should you be able to get them.','2015-04-05 15:04:09',NULL),(10011,10604,25,10,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Starfall/Clarity','2015-04-05 20:22:48',NULL),(10026,10098,79,1,'Quake Learn','Quake is a rather personal art, it was a teachers way of teaching other arts passively. Quake has several counters, some evident some not so evident. Seek and Quake the scape to learn the counters of this one art, is it ever useful anymore?','2015-04-05 22:29:03',NULL),(10098,10092,100,10,'Power token 10','Make 10 power token from another house\'s prime. Apply them to your forge into useful items for our house armories','2015-04-05 22:53:48',NULL),(10092,10026,139,1,'SenseMareGolah','This art works as another Art in the City but tweaked a bit.  Tell me how Sense Mare was brought into the City and why it is an upgraded version of an existing Art.  Has anyone ever noticed any problems with Art?','2015-04-05 23:27:05',NULL),(10029,10550,107,20,'Peace Aura: 20','House Services Projects required: I would like you to focus on supportive acts for this increase in your ability. Helping someone gather items, hunt, guard. Each individual can count as one \'service\'. Otherwise, pick your selects from the approved acts, trying to focus on those you have not done before.','2015-04-06 13:47:30',NULL),(10011,10108,22,1,'Clarity Forge Final','You saw the introduction to forge\'s history. You have taken the first steps in learning your own style. I do not seek promises that no one keeps once a war starts; don\'t make a liar of yourself by making such a promise. Review the history of the Dreamer Wars, and the Srechethan tribe on the old scrolls. What do you expect of your members with regard to use of forge in war? What must you do to model that behavior? What impact does our city\'s history have on that?','2015-04-06 23:29:14',NULL),(10051,10550,107,20,'PA to 30 - Shoury','I want you to put in three seperate one hour blocks at a gen to do research for the priming theory.  Results equal plateau','2015-04-07 01:09:49',NULL),(10051,10070,16,20,'ID to 20','Do two one hour sessions at generators and gather research results and report for this plateau','2015-04-07 01:31:49',NULL),(10048,10108,42,1,'Darkness - L','Conjure a task of your own to learn Darkness, to plateau it to 10, and to 20.  With the first of a few mass arts available to Senders, what education do you strive the student to take from the task?  What should change, difficulty wise, between the three you made?','2015-04-07 02:05:28',NULL),(10550,10004,18,30,'Chamele Plat: 3rd','This is a reward for the completion of Zsa\'s bundle task to 30 from Starfall. Thank you Elders.','2015-04-07 02:44:49',NULL),(10022,10007,81,1,'Dina Vampiric','First, what are the particulars of the art, mechanically... Second, the art is terrible, by which I mean the way it works is terrible. Devise a way to improve the way it functions. You don\'t need to enact your idea, only come up with the idea. ~.|','2015-04-07 02:54:23',NULL),(10029,10004,107,10,'Quest: Magnilia','For completion of house service acts and the turn in of house credit certifications from Starfall.','2015-04-07 03:29:12',NULL),(10480,10007,3,60,'SM 60 mini','As per our agreement, and to fulfill the requirements of a plateau to 60, I wish for you to develop a teaching plan for you to use as you start to train Tember. Make the plan, write it out for me and start using it with her. **A**','2015-04-07 04:01:00',NULL),(10107,10320,19,40,'Vision 40 - Zenobia','I\'d like you to look into the inner workings of dreamers.  Instead of using the art, use your other senses.  I want you to talk to some dreamers in the city, 5 or more will suffice, and have them tell you two truths and a lie.  See if you can tell which is which. Also, make insights into that dreamer based on the lie they tell as you will learn far more from the lie than you will from the truth.','2015-04-08 02:16:45',NULL),(10066,10090,47,40,'Push 40','\"Push your boundaries with other houses. Solving or addressing any problems that are between us and others. Pick the house you think most apt to become closer to, and take the first step on behalf of Calenture. (Check first before making any agreement)\"','2015-04-08 02:42:40',NULL),(10550,10070,144,10,'CW Plat: 1st','Business as usual.. continue to gen and hunt as time allows. Two options: A) 40 essences,  B) 10 items worthy to be placed in the armory and/or vault, OR C) a combination of the two (20 essences/5 items). Help support the Star and the stores of your home.','2015-04-08 03:44:10',NULL),(10067,10469,23,1,'Recharge Learn','Welcome to DreamSeer Destroy Talisman. At lower levels this art is more destructive than helpful. But it can be pushed through and made to work. I want for you to take one item each (ellie, alt, charm, chak) to a Seer with Recharge. Ask them to Recharge it to its max. Make sure each item is at 1 charge. Chose a way to randomly pick one of the items and hand it to the Recharger. Report successes and failures. The items can be simple or powerful, up to you. Chose 4 or 5 Seers. Have fun. <T>','2015-04-08 03:56:45',NULL),(10450,10067,139,30,'Quest: Keilara','Completion Task Art Grant','2015-04-08 04:01:49',NULL),(10450,10067,52,50,'Train50:Tamarisk','Come up with an entirely new way of teaching students new and old that is inventive, and even fun. Out with the old tasks of seeking a number of students out, and in with something that would keep students coming back for more. ','2015-04-08 04:23:26',NULL),(10092,10018,48,1,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-04-08 05:33:06',NULL),(10092,10072,22,60,'Forge 60','Acquire all the pieces of the blade through any means necessary and hand them over for inspection before presenting them to the Guild.  Forging of the Blade is not required.  Speak to each of the Smiths and discuss your past penalty and what are the current rules that would possibly apply to that situation if any and what rules  and penalties there are currently surrounding the Art of Forge in the City as a means of producing items.','2015-04-08 05:48:54',NULL),(10550,10070,144,20,'CW Plat: 2nd','\'Chaos Well\' exists in multiple forms in the City, SoulMasters being one of them. Bring in 1500 strength worth of essences for the Star\'s consumption, as Trap Talisman is a \'well\' in itself. Help alleviate Magnilia as war may be coming; the Star must remain fed, especially for Power Token creation.','2015-04-08 23:21:42',NULL),(10550,10469,2,40,'Quest: Shoury','Dreamseers are an important focus to the City, both in its own right and in working with Soulmasters, Fatesenders, and Gatekeepers. I want you to study which dreamers currently best represent each focus and why? Aftwards,put on a play, re-enacting the history of how the DreamSeer came to be. Invite dreamers from the City to the Library for re-enactment when ready.','2015-04-08 23:46:18',NULL),(10011,10593,107,1,'Cianne Peace Aura 1','Read the mission about learning the art and fulfill one of the listed points of your choice. In addition, post to each of the house leadership: Magnilia, Darby, Gray Tones, FangX, and myself, asking them what they\'re working on and telling them if there\'s anything you\'d like help with. Even if it\'s not much, get the dialogue going and get to know each other! _-*','2015-04-09 00:37:03',NULL),(10029,10469,74,20,'Mind Blank: 20','We\'ve recently had an experience with \'memory loss\' and \'memory extraction\', we\'ve dealt with mystical teas and potions doing the same. I would like for you to approach the concept of this from the angle of understanding what power \'belief\' has towards consent, implied or otherwise, for such.','2015-04-09 01:27:25',NULL),(10010,10320,2,40,'Dreamseer 40','You completed a task for this art once, I want you to seek out Brother Timothy and get the story of a dreamer named Lord Dread. What is his history? How did his actions affect the city? What is his legacy ? ~Cryst~','2015-04-09 02:06:30',NULL),(10480,10108,52,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Ordainment from completion of apprenticeship. \r\n','2015-04-09 02:31:39',NULL),(10480,10108,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Ordainment Supports\r\n','2015-04-09 02:34:00',NULL),(10480,10108,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Ordainment\r\n','2015-04-09 02:34:15',NULL),(10480,10026,60,1,'Quest: Akkadian','COmpletion of 9 sphere examples. He has met all the requirements to reobtain this art.\r\n','2015-04-09 02:45:26',NULL),(10480,10026,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','FreeSpirit MT -- has all his house supports and 6 MT supports, 2 more than needed.\r\n','2015-04-09 02:57:24',NULL),(10480,10004,98,30,'Quest: Akkadian','Award for bundle plateau\r\n','2015-04-09 03:57:40',NULL),(10480,10469,98,30,'Quest: Akkadian','Award for bundle plateau\r\n','2015-04-09 03:59:11',NULL),(10480,10469,139,30,'Quest: Akkadian','Award for bundle to 30\r\n','2015-04-09 04:04:55',NULL),(10480,10469,14,20,'Quest: Akkadian','Award for bundle to 20\r\n','2015-04-09 04:05:05',NULL),(10480,10469,17,20,'Quest: Akkadian','Award for bundle to 20\r\n','2015-04-09 04:05:12',NULL),(10550,10004,20,10,'Blast to 10','Elders, I am honoring Starfall\'s 3rd plat reward for Zsa.','2015-04-09 04:07:38',NULL),(10550,10004,20,20,'Quest: Shoury','Blast to 20 from starfalls bundle 30','2015-04-09 04:19:41',NULL),(10550,10004,20,30,'Blast to 30','Honoring this reward for Zsa\'s completion from Starfall for plateau\'s to 30\r\n','2015-04-09 05:53:57',NULL),(10067,10004,15,10,'Quest: Tamarisk','Reward for Bundle plateau in Major/Minor arts\r\n','2015-04-09 06:31:14',NULL),(10029,10108,7,20,'Resist Fear: 20','We know of death and pain, torment and eternity. Use your connections with the priestesses of the Alliance to find a moment of clarity and peace through ritual. One or both of them may guide you in this rite.','2015-04-09 19:57:28',NULL),(10022,10107,144,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','I would like you to demonstrate your artistic ability. Craft a monument a monument displaying the greatness and strength of the Light. This is to be an example of your craftsmanship, it will be placed somewhere for all to see. Show me the quintessence of what the Light stands for. \r\n','2015-04-09 20:11:09',NULL),(10107,10320,23,30,'Recharge - Zenobia','I\'d like you to look at the connection between the quality of items being recharged and the results that you experience with recharge.  I\'d like you to experiment with several items and compare items. Pay attention to the items you use to top up your insight as well.\r\n','2015-04-09 20:22:06',NULL),(10027,10004,15,20,'Quest: LadySilver','on a completion codex','2015-04-10 00:15:16',NULL),(10029,10022,81,20,'V. Draw : 20','Approach the portal leading into the Dark Awakening. Using an Agonarius essence as catalyst and/or whatever manipulations to it or devices you need to - draw out a portion of energy from Dark Awakening. Ideally this energy sample should be stored in such a way so as to allow me to further study it. I thank you in advance for the sample.','2015-04-10 05:12:16',NULL),(10007,10604,3,20,'Quest: Dina','20 plat bundle','2015-04-10 20:08:16',NULL),(10007,10604,70,20,'Quest: Dina','20 plat bundle','2015-04-10 20:08:52',NULL),(10007,10604,67,20,'Quest: Dina','20 plat bundle','2015-04-10 20:09:10',NULL),(10007,10604,26,20,'Quest: Dina','20 plat bundle','2015-04-10 20:09:31',NULL),(10007,10604,24,20,'Quest: Dina','20 plat bundle','2015-04-10 20:09:51',NULL),(10007,10604,25,20,'Quest: Dina','20 plat bundle','2015-04-10 20:10:08',NULL),(10011,10004,107,20,'Zsa Zsa PA','Zsa Zsa was a good girl and practiced her Peace Aura all the way up to 19 and now she can go play. If she happens to get around to doing chores for the house like what\'s asked for on the board, she can have her Peace Aura up to 20. _-*','2015-04-10 20:12:10',NULL),(10011,10604,40,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Starfall','2015-04-10 20:52:54',NULL),(10011,10604,9,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Starfall','2015-04-10 20:53:21',NULL),(10011,10604,46,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Starfall','2015-04-10 20:53:50',NULL),(10011,10604,72,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Starfall','2015-04-10 20:54:31',NULL),(10011,10604,98,1,'Quest: Starfall','Bundle by Starfall\r\n','2015-04-10 20:54:52',NULL),(10007,10604,27,1,'Quest: Dina','bundle 20-29 learn','2015-04-10 21:08:08',NULL),(10007,10604,27,10,'Quest: Dina','10 plat bundle','2015-04-10 21:14:50',NULL),(10010,10004,17,10,'Quest: Crystalline','','2015-04-10 22:34:01',NULL),(10169,10604,27,20,'honor bundle drain','honoring bundle completion - drain to 20','2015-04-11 02:47:38',NULL),(10011,10030,22,40,'Varwyn Forge 40','The Codex of Immortal Dreams supposedly possesed the power to train dreamers in DreamStrike. What other eldrich artifacts are out there that combine both Train and Forge? Decide, what can be learned from it or them? Engage several of your students in this. Use both arts to remind them of the potential of Forge to craft the stuff of dreams and nightmares, without elders or actions of The Dream. It need not succeed, just show that imaginations have been sparked. _-* 3.4','2015-04-12 21:17:39',NULL),(10479,10072,1,70,'Jeru GK 70','Insert yourself into the situation with guardDog.  Learn more about what happened to him and learn AoE and HC\'s stance on him and the Order.  Help to spread his story about the city, either postively or negatively, then make efforts to either aid or work against him in a significant way.  ','2015-04-12 21:38:09',NULL),(10009,10077,99,1,'Combine','The combined forced of the City are coming together against a common threat. However, we risk failure due to ego and a lack of ability. You will combat this. I want you to ensure that Thunderman does not carry the Gatekeeper weapon into battle. Effort will be considered for any modifications if you fail. We\'ll discuss the art of Combine during your report.','2015-04-12 21:54:44',NULL),(10030,10550,26,10,'Purify - 10','As part of your work as a Patron of the museum I would have you comb your own collections of artifacts and curios for a rare and mysterious treasure! Imagine if you would that you are a indeed a Patron, the treasure you create and design should serve as piece for the museum on-loan from your collection. Unleash the spirit of relic creation through Forge Talisman!','2015-04-13 00:05:23',NULL),(10092,10311,8,10,'Protection 10','Sometimes the best way to Protect is to hide.. tell me the 3 most hidden areas of the City that can be reached by normal dreamers and why they are the most protected areas and the best places to hide.','2015-04-13 03:44:19',NULL),(10029,10087,3,60,'SoulMaster: 60','Your past has been scared by a certain relationship with the great \'passions\', I wish for you to weave the memory of those passions with the essence of your focus itself. Represent this odd duality, this marriage, in three items and three short lessons which the Lyceum could place in the library to guide and inspire (or warn) those of our focus.','2015-04-13 22:28:26',NULL),(10550,10148,9,20,'FA to 20','This is a reward for Audra\'s bundle to 20 completion.','2015-04-13 23:48:28',NULL),(10550,10148,8,20,'Protection to 20','This is a reward for Audra\'s bundle to 20 completion.','2015-04-13 23:48:38',NULL),(10550,10148,7,20,'Resist Fear to 20','This is a reward for Audra\'s bundle to 20 completion.','2015-04-13 23:48:49',NULL),(10026,10072,10,50,'Ward 50','Ward- Warriors Annoying Retardent Deterent. How many different ways can a portal be blocked? How can we over come blend? Time with 4 gatekeepers your ward and theirs to double ward portals, and let me know how it worked out','2015-04-14 03:24:39',NULL),(10067,10455,19,50,'Vision - 50','For this task I want you to peer into the future and tell me what you see as the Alliance goes forward. What should we focus on and where should we be heading? Also, while you are gazing, what visions do you see for yourself? Where are you headed and how do you think that you can get there? Be detailed and then when you report, take me to a room in the city that helps you calm your mind to see what you need. ~T~)','2015-04-14 05:02:13',NULL),(10072,10007,9,20,'FA20Dina','Freedom is a word that almost all of us lack the perspective to truly comprehend. We are all slaves to shortcomings, weaknesses, and varying degrees of misfortune which our lives revolve around. What burdens, and shortcomings do you struggle most to free yourself from? ','2015-04-14 05:14:28',NULL),(10067,10030,17,20,'ID Curse 30','There is a curse on the land...it\'s laziness. I would like for you to identify the curse in at least four others and help them find a cure. It could be as simple as helping them with tasks, or offering information or pushing them to a goal. The choice is yours. When you finish, find for me a place in the City where you think may be cursed in some way and we\'ll take another field trip and discuss it. ~Tam~','2015-04-14 05:23:12',NULL),(10030,10067,21,30,'Blend: 30','Brother Moon: The spiritual Voice of the house is a voice few may commune with as an anchor but one which all may hear. I would have you contemplate the power and purpose of the Athame and ways we can set aside time, regularly, to be more in touch with this particular Voice. Also, how may we use this unique Voice to soothe and build relationship with our guest, the Siren?','2015-04-14 05:53:40',NULL),(10022,10007,24,60,'Dina: Restore 60','The Stronghold on Umbric has been overrun. The house itself inundated with chaos and corruption. We must find a source within the house that can be cleansed so that we may gain a foothold there. While we are within the house, during our scouting excusion I need for you to search through it, seeking that which we can cleanse and purify so that we may continue our work there and push the taint from the house. Locate this source within the house and devise a way of cleansing it. See to it that the plan works.','2015-04-14 06:20:39',NULL),(10029,10007,35,60,'Trap Nightmare: 60','Trap Nightmare tends to turn houses into slobbering sycophants when it comes to Soulmasters, they\'re willing to look past almost anything when they\'re desperate enough for energy. Find a way to gain leverage in your own house using you value as someone with A)Time on their hands and B)High level trap. What reward or gain you leverage is up to you, return to me when you\'ve been successfull.','2015-04-14 07:07:17',NULL),(10026,10148,10,20,'Quest: golah','','2015-04-14 20:04:22',NULL),(10026,10148,68,10,'Quest: golah','Bundle','2015-04-14 20:04:42',NULL),(10026,10148,1,20,'Quest: golah','','2015-04-14 20:04:52',NULL),(10026,10148,65,20,'Quest: golah','','2015-04-14 20:05:05',NULL),(10026,10148,6,10,'Quest: golah','','2015-04-14 20:14:03',NULL),(10072,10087,142,1,'Misdirection','Mislead or manipulate someone to get your way. ','2015-04-14 21:28:35',NULL),(10550,10469,63,1,'Invis to 1','For this task, I want you to give me a summary of all work that has been done towards the previous two tasks that you\'ve completed towards the art of Invisibility. ((To the GM team, Gray Tones has completed to other tasks, there is a disconnect between the other teacher, and as such, am creating this so I hear the full report of what she\'s actually done, thank you.))','2015-04-14 21:52:49',NULL),(10066,10385,141,10,'Kinesis 10','Completion code issued by myself. Honoring kinesis 10.','2015-04-15 01:07:59',NULL),(10066,10385,141,20,'kinesis 20','Bundle completion codex issued by me. Honoring kinesis 20','2015-04-15 01:22:21',NULL),(10066,10385,141,30,'Kinesis 30','Bundle 30 plats completion codex issued by Magnilia. Honoring kinesis 30','2015-04-15 01:39:39',NULL),(10026,10600,12,1,'Shatter Learn','Shatter the conception of what it means to be a Gatekeeper, Ward has more volitle counters now what are they, and how can we as a focus over come that? Why does amulet not come with Charges?','2015-04-15 03:35:39',NULL),(10450,10072,52,40,'Train40:Jerulan','The teaching methods now are quite different than they were years ago. From being able to task one at a time, to the bundle tasking we do now. Conjure up an entirely new teaching method that would benefit not just the unsphered through third sphere, but the higher levels as well.','2015-04-15 04:30:09',NULL),(10450,10018,10,50,'Ward50:Jade','I would like you to work on your hunting skills. I have heard that others in your house have successfully bladed a horron, or some such. Ward yourself in, and have at it. Report to me with your results.','2015-04-15 04:47:15',NULL),(10066,10018,12,30,'Shatter 30','Write a new poem. Devise a technique to deconstruct your poem into categories. Reassemble the poem in such a way that it is different than before you deconstructed it but can still be a meaningful poem. Be able to explain how you chose to deconstruct it and reassemble it. Share your poem with you peers.','2015-04-15 05:24:56',NULL),(10072,10148,6,20,'Quest: Jerulan','Shoury\'s bundle task','2015-04-15 21:16:59',NULL),(10072,10148,68,20,'Quest: Jerulan','Shoury bundle to 20 ','2015-04-15 21:17:39',NULL),(10107,10077,23,60,'Recharge 60 -Tember','I want you to determine why items cannot be recharged below a certain point, and yet can exist with initial charges above this.  Further to this, why can combined items only be charged to the maximum of a single item?  I\'d also like to investigate the connection between prime artifacts and recharge. Could recharge, somehow, destroy a prime artifact?  Is there someone who knows or has accidentally reduced a houses\' prime to dust?','2015-04-15 23:35:48',NULL),(10107,10550,2,60,'Dreamseer 60','For Dreamseer 60, I want you to continue your work on the redevelopment of the DreamSeer Guild. Having said that, I want you to identify the seers you think would best exemplify the guild and what they would want to see in it.  Develop a charter that you can get consensus on, and bring it before the group at a meeting.\r\n','2015-04-16 03:12:55',NULL),(10136,10600,96,1,'Sense Dreamers ','If the art of Sense Dreamers sensed something else, instead of dreamers, what would you wish it to do? Ask no less than three dreamers what they\'d prefer it to sense, if Dreamers were not an option. Do you find a common answer between the dreamers?','2015-04-17 03:03:38',NULL),(10029,10148,15,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Granting based on completed Bundle: 30 Learn','2015-04-17 18:48:36',NULL),(10029,10148,16,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring based on bundle 30, completed. Learn','2015-04-17 18:48:40',NULL),(10029,10148,24,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring based on bundle 30, completed. Learn','2015-04-17 18:48:50',NULL),(10029,10148,25,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring based on bundle 30, completed. Learn','2015-04-17 18:48:54',NULL),(10029,10148,38,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring based on bundle 30, completed. Learn','2015-04-17 18:48:58',NULL),(10029,10148,73,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring based on bundle 30, completed. Learn','2015-04-17 18:49:06',NULL),(10029,10148,74,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring based on bundle 30, completed. Learn','2015-04-17 18:49:10',NULL),(10029,10148,144,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring based on bundle 30, completed. Learn','2015-04-17 18:49:16',NULL),(10030,10067,98,30,'Newly Awakened','This is written to honor the completion bundle of plateaus to the third.','2015-04-18 04:54:09',NULL),(10030,10455,36,50,'Dreamblade: 50','Work with the Alliance on a house project to create a blade that represents the Star Knights. How you delegate portions of this work is entirely up to you but the various threads should be brought together in a house \'event\' as culmination of the work.','2015-04-18 06:07:28',NULL),(10022,10018,24,20,'Jade: Restore 20','Many places in the City have gone unused and unvisited for such a long time. Pick two rooms within the City\'s walls that hold special meaning to you and breathe life back into them. Host a Lyceum and visit these rooms, tell people about them... why are they important to you... what occured there to have left a lasting impression on your. Restore them to their former glory. ~.|','2015-04-18 06:10:23',NULL),(10072,10148,9,30,'FA30','Audra completed my bundle task','2015-04-18 21:27:01',NULL),(10072,10148,7,30,'RF30','Audra completed my 30 bundle','2015-04-18 21:29:29',NULL),(10072,10148,8,30,'prot30','audra completed bundle task to 30','2015-04-18 21:30:22',NULL),(10072,10148,10,30,'ward30','Audra completed my bundle 30 task.','2015-04-18 21:31:03',NULL),(10072,10148,68,30,'Flameshaft30','Audra completed my bundle 30 task','2015-04-18 21:31:38',NULL),(10072,10148,65,30,'Gatesmasher30','Audra completed my bundle 30 task','2015-04-18 21:32:21',NULL),(10072,10148,6,30,'Meditation30','Audra completed my bundle30 task.','2015-04-18 21:33:00',NULL),(10026,10148,11,10,'Quest: golah','bundle completion','2015-04-18 21:40:13',NULL),(10026,10148,1,30,'Quest: golah','Bundle 30 completion','2015-04-18 21:47:36',NULL),(10026,10469,8,10,'Protection 10','Find a way for forge an item to protect your most prized memory. The twist you are unable to create it yourseldf, you must use words only to another creationist in which they will capture that memory for you.','2015-04-18 22:16:55',NULL),(10479,10087,35,60,'DreamEdge Trap 60','Talk with rulers from each of the 4 open houses.  Negotiate an arrangement with each of them for how much they would charge you in trapped energy to trade for a power token.  It is alright if your beliefs would not allow you to actually do this with some of the houses, you simply need to come to an agreement if you were going to.  Use what information you have gained from this to come up with a plan to either join a house, open a new house, or remain freespirit.  ','2015-04-19 22:47:04',NULL),(10479,10018,52,20,'Jade train 20','Post at least two articles that are accepted to the Archive of the Awakened.  Use your train or other means to influence at least two other dreamers to post at least one article each that is accepted.  ','2015-04-19 23:05:36',NULL),(10067,10455,69,50,'TranceFlame 50','Let\'s push your flame to its breaking point. I want you to pick two circuits (planes with alot of mares) and work your way through with Blast first for ten minutes. Take down all the information you can. How many mares in that time. What kind? What obstacles did you encounter? Then do the same two circuits with Flame and record information for the same questions. Find a place that makes you heat up or angers you and we\'ll discuss your findings there. <T> ) ','2015-04-20 03:14:50',NULL),(10550,10067,144,20,'CW Plat: 2nd','Our relationship w/Chaos Well\'s are symbiotic. And as such, permeates us beyond its functional capability. Share your experiences with the City by visiting the caches in Lost Caves, Lower Ossuary of Dread, and Evernight Plateau. Forge an item with a tid-bit of information, sharing something about the art and how its impacted you and as such, indirectly impacting the City. ','2015-04-20 03:39:01',NULL),(10029,10550,107,40,'Peace Aura: 40','Link with Golah and Trish Pawm as museum supporters to gain ideas about the Pearl of Perception so that you may use that information to create a truly remarkable masterpiece working with Fangx.','2015-04-20 03:54:16',NULL),(10029,10455,22,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Miswritten quest codex from from Shoury intended for FangX','2015-04-20 05:32:18',NULL),(10550,10623,18,40,'Chamele to 40','For this task, I want you to \'Chamele\' into your past and observe yourself. Afterwards, understand the existing factions, groups, and events of the City. Commit yourself to a minimum of two. You will naturally \'un-Chamele\' as you get yourself involved, re-identifying yourself once again. Provide sufficient evidence of your commitments, and the knowledge you seek is yours. **S**','2015-04-21 00:36:02',NULL),(10066,10632,9,1,'FA learn','Bundle learn 1-19 completion codex issued by me. Honoring Free Action 1','2015-04-21 01:03:19',NULL),(10066,10632,47,1,'Push 1','Bundle learn 1-19 completion codex issued by me. Honoring Push 1','2015-04-21 01:03:55',NULL),(10066,10632,68,1,'Flameshaft 1','Bundle learn 1-19 completion codex issued by me. Honoring Flameshaft 1','2015-04-21 01:04:43',NULL),(10007,10604,67,30,'Quest: Dina','30 pat bundle completed','2015-04-21 06:04:34',NULL),(10007,10604,3,30,'Quest: Dina','30 pat bundle completed','2015-04-21 06:04:42',NULL),(10007,10604,25,30,'Quest: Dina','30 pat bundle completed','2015-04-21 06:04:46',NULL),(10007,10604,24,30,'Quest: Dina','30 pat bundle completed','2015-04-21 06:04:52',NULL),(10007,10604,26,30,'Quest: Dina','30 pat bundle completed','2015-04-21 06:05:01',NULL),(10007,10604,70,30,'Quest: Dina','30 pat bundle completed','2015-04-21 06:05:12',NULL),(10007,10604,27,30,'Quest: Dina','30 pat bundle completed','2015-04-21 06:05:22',NULL),(10010,10320,23,40,'Recharge 40- Zenny','Recharge allows seers to put charges back into inanimate objects. I want you to find ways to ``recharge`` 5 animate objects, people, or houses. What did you do, how did you do it. Should you repeat it. You can either do one at a time, or all 5 in one event, the choice is yours, mostly have fun and show your seer creativeness. Cryst','2015-04-22 00:25:29',NULL),(10211,10320,21,1,'Quest: brother timo','blend allows you to pass wards.  I want you to pass for a gk for at least three days, if an elder wants to help you so you can cast gk arts thats fine.  See how many people you can fool.  golah is a gatekeeper with an event on sunday, try to be there and do your best to fool him','2015-04-22 00:35:55',NULL),(10480,10009,20,70,'Quest: Akkadian','Plateau reward for the Undergames as per Grok, the dwarf with the axe. \r\n','2015-04-22 02:48:13',NULL),(10026,10148,141,1,'Quest: golah','','2015-04-22 03:00:57',NULL),(10007,10632,72,1,'Quest: Dina','20 learn bundle','2015-04-22 06:24:09',NULL),(10007,10632,98,1,'Quest: Dina','20 learn bundle','2015-04-22 06:24:17',NULL),(10092,10632,8,1,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-04-22 06:50:57',NULL),(10092,10632,7,1,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-04-22 06:51:10',NULL),(10480,10632,10,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Reward for completion of learnables for 20 from Dina. \r\n','2015-04-22 06:57:24',NULL),(10480,10632,11,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Reward for completion of learnable bundle to 20 from Dina.\r\n','2015-04-22 06:57:58',NULL),(10480,10632,48,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Reward for learnables for 0-19 from Thunderman.\r\n','2015-04-22 06:59:54',NULL),(10029,10545,27,1,'Drain Self: Bundle','Granting as per completion of the bundle 20 : Learns for Avayla','2015-04-22 07:45:17',NULL),(10029,10545,72,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Granting as per Bundle 20 Learn, complete, for Avayla','2015-04-22 07:45:41',NULL),(10029,10545,98,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Granting as per Bundle 20 Learn, complete, for Avayla','2015-04-22 07:45:48',NULL),(10029,10545,139,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Granting as per Bundle 20 Learn, complete, for Avayla','2015-04-22 07:45:57',NULL),(10029,10545,9,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Granting as per Bundle 20 Learn, complete, for Avayla','2015-04-22 07:46:04',NULL),(10238,10311,66,40,'Quest of Blades','You are now a collector of unique blades!  I need a dozen uniquely crafted, uniquely forged blades.  By a dozen unique folks!  Don\'t settle for a dozen simply named blades.  I would like some unique ones, something special.... Gather me a dozen to complete your journey to Blades of 40.','2015-04-23 01:28:28',NULL),(10029,10067,89,20,'Soul Shield: 20','Our abilities and understanding present us with a paradox. If there is no \'Illumination\', no soul, then what is referenced in our discussions and abilities? Is the concept of \'soul\', immortal or not, tied to energy and related concepts within the city? An impossible question perhaps but what is the soul in reference to our reality?','2015-04-23 03:31:26',NULL),(10062,10632,8,10,'prot','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-23 03:32:06',NULL),(10062,10632,7,10,'rf','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-23 03:32:14',NULL),(10062,10632,9,10,'fa','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-23 03:32:26',NULL),(10062,10632,6,10,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-23 03:33:06',NULL),(10062,10632,65,10,'blade','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-23 03:33:16',NULL),(10062,10632,68,10,'flame','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-23 03:33:28',NULL),(10550,10455,21,30,'Blend to 30','For this task, I want you to make attempts at unlocking the secrets behind Blend as it pertains to closed houses, more importantly Keepers of Eternal Shadow. You have ties to the house that are rooted deep within you. Create a plausible theory on how Blend may be able to acccomplish this. Work with at least one other Seer as you conduct your research and test your hypothesis. **S**','2015-04-23 03:38:22',NULL),(10062,10632,1,10,'Quest: Krodoc','Reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-23 03:54:28',NULL),(10450,10077,20,60,'Blast60:Tember','Blast seems to be the DreamSeer\'s greatest weapon in a battle. I want you to keep your hands off your trusty Blast for a period of one week. No using it in battle, no using it for joking. After this period of seven days has passed, return to me and tell me if not having it made you feel any less a Seer. In addition, come up with a creative art that, should Blast ever be removed from a Seer, be a comparable alternative.','2015-04-23 04:04:46',NULL),(10480,10107,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Raised to 2nd MT of DoL.\r\n','2015-04-23 04:05:46',NULL),(10450,10029,35,70,'Trap70:Magnilia','This is a very powerful plat that you are seeking so your task will be two-fold. I want you to trap 5k for your prime, normal SoulMaster business. The second part: If you don\'t value the increase of the amount you can trap, what would you use the strength for? Will you experiment or drink it in a juice? Find the answers deep within yourself and don\'t be afraid to let your mind go free.','2015-04-23 04:25:41',NULL),(10450,10029,35,70,'Trap70:Magnilia','','2015-04-23 04:25:41',NULL),(10480,10455,52,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Ordainment after passing his apprenticeship trials.\r\n','2015-04-23 04:52:20',NULL),(10480,10455,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Given with Train.\r\n','2015-04-23 04:52:29',NULL),(10480,10455,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Given with Train.\r\n','2015-04-23 04:52:35',NULL),(10029,10107,142,10,'Misdirection: 10','Misdirection has obvious implications for a focus attuned with acts of obfuscation. I wish for you to create an imaginary saga which features \'misdirection\' as a key component. The saga could feature a key item which you make a reproduction of for the museum, you could leave the saga in the Courtyard as the Lyceum does their work. You could leave portion of the saga in the Library - or surprise me and present the saga to me in some other way.','2015-04-23 05:13:49',NULL),(10018,10632,10,10,'Quest: Jade','bundle plat','2015-04-23 07:00:29',NULL),(10098,10112,16,10,'Identity to 10','Regain your house ID','2015-04-23 21:25:23',NULL),(10022,10632,40,1,'honor bundle','deafen to learn\r\n','2015-04-24 00:03:02',NULL),(10022,10632,26,1,'honoring bundle','purify to learn','2015-04-24 00:03:13',NULL),(10022,10632,46,1,'honor bundle','Recall to learn\r\n','2015-04-24 00:03:25',NULL),(10108,10219,144,1,'Chaos Well - Learn','Talk to some folks about what you can, and can\'t do with chaos well.  Bla bla what it\'s all about. Also, get some and fill them and bring them in because we\'re desperately in need of strength. Not just one or two, as many as you can over the course of a week.  Also also, find out what\'s up with this blade Lio did scrying for.\r\n','2015-04-24 01:42:04',NULL),(10052,10030,96,40,'Sense 40 - Varwyn','Sensing things about dreamers is something your talented at.  I want you to list the dreamers you sense are most likely to align themselves with Agonarius and his forces and which are most likely to align with those opposing them.  Give detailed reasoning why on both sets of examples.','2015-04-24 02:23:37',NULL),(10479,10632,11,10,'Quest: Herbert','bundle quest from krodoc','2015-04-24 21:52:46',NULL),(10479,10009,21,60,'Blend 60 Dreiko','You encountered 3 trials at the gathering house.  Pretend for a moment you are the being you encountered there.  Come up with 3 new challenges using your forge or other means.   Be prepared to demonstrate them.','2015-04-24 22:21:27',NULL),(10029,10026,142,1,'Misdirection: Learn','Those facing you are turned away. When have you experienced this outside of the art form in the city? I speak not of petty squabbles but of those times when all those who you would have look upon you have instead fallen blind and turned away. The city itself was denied us for so long, what must we do differently this time and how may we do that to ensure she is not lost to use again? Is there hope that we may stand as something other than an endangered species?','2015-04-24 23:56:51',NULL),(10455,10593,139,1,'Sdatoken - Learn',' Learn more about how the recent events in relation to Agonarius, have effected the City physically. I\'d like you to visit a few of the sites he used to inhabit. A few are Evernight, Cenotaph, and Caudal rift. Collect things from these places, and create something darkly beautiful.','2015-04-25 20:07:44',NULL),(10108,10011,17,1,'ID Curse - Learn','So many funny things going on all at once right now. Prime theft, dreamers turning into Darkmares, Big-bads stealing soul essences. Which of these is the current bigger threat? Identify what is fact and what is fiction in these current rumors by speaking to a few folks around the city, and give me what you believe our joint houses should focus on solving first.','2015-04-26 01:22:37',NULL),(10479,10022,85,1,'Quest: Herbert','Giving Golah\'s dreamsmith mark to Bladeslayer as requested by Golah.  Let the games begin.  ','2015-04-27 01:54:16',NULL),(10062,10632,11,20,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-27 02:08:51',NULL),(10062,10632,68,20,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-27 02:08:58',NULL),(10062,10632,9,20,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-27 02:09:55',NULL),(10062,10632,1,20,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-27 02:10:00',NULL),(10062,10632,65,20,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-27 02:10:40',NULL),(10062,10632,6,20,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-27 02:10:48',NULL),(10009,10632,7,20,'Quest: Dreiko','','2015-04-27 02:11:25',NULL),(10062,10632,8,20,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-27 02:13:04',NULL),(10062,10632,10,20,'Quest: Krodoc','reward for completing a bundle task.','2015-04-27 02:13:10',NULL),(10062,10072,12,40,'Shatter 40','Shatter something that hinders progression. Be creative, and ensure the deed fits the reward.','2015-04-27 02:58:41',NULL),(10067,10027,144,10,'Chaos Well to 10','Chaos Well Chaos Well, oh how you have a tale to tell. How do you imp and how do you grow, find out all that you can then come and tell me so. Who made you so, what do you do? How strong do you get from a plateau of two? ~T~','2015-04-27 05:54:16',NULL),(10029,10550,17,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle package.','2015-04-27 07:42:38',NULL),(10029,10550,15,20,'Quest: Magnilia','honoring as part of a completed bundle package','2015-04-27 07:42:43',NULL),(10029,10550,139,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle package.\r\n','2015-04-27 07:42:51',NULL),(10029,10550,14,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completion bundle.','2015-04-27 07:58:14',NULL),(10029,10550,98,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completion bundle.','2015-04-27 07:58:18',NULL),(10029,10550,139,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completion bundle.','2015-04-27 07:58:26',NULL),(10029,10550,17,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completion bundle.','2015-04-27 07:58:40',NULL),(10030,10550,15,30,'Quest: Varwyn','Honoring as part of a completion bundle.','2015-04-27 08:27:41',NULL),(10030,10550,14,20,'Quest: Varwyn','Honoring as part of a completion bundle.','2015-04-27 08:27:45',NULL),(10030,10550,98,20,'Quest: Varwyn','Honoring as part of a completion bundle.','2015-04-27 08:27:49',NULL),(10067,10550,17,30,'Quest: Tamarisk','Honoring bundle task from LadySilver for ID Curse. <T>\r\n','2015-04-27 08:50:05',NULL),(10067,10550,98,30,'Quest: Tamarisk','Honoring bundle task from LadySilver for Newly Awakened. <T>\r\n','2015-04-27 08:50:47',NULL),(10067,10550,139,30,'Quest: Tamarisk','Honoring bundle task from LadySilver for Sense Datoken. <T>\r\n','2015-04-27 08:51:30',NULL),(10027,10030,48,1,'SE to learn','There are such tragedies attached to the loss of dreamsoul. The history speaks volumes. Create a tale of your travels and this art and how it effected you in the past. Why in the dream would you want it then and now. Share with me the next time we meet please.','2015-04-27 08:53:50',NULL),(10027,10550,14,30,'know to 30','as per completion codex','2015-04-27 09:38:52',NULL),(10007,10545,29,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:40:11',NULL),(10007,10545,29,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:40:11',NULL),(10007,10545,30,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:40:17',NULL),(10007,10545,38,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:40:24',NULL),(10007,10545,46,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:40:30',NULL),(10007,10545,7,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:40:44',NULL),(10007,10545,8,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:40:49',NULL),(10007,10545,74,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:40:55',NULL),(10007,10545,73,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:41:16',NULL),(10007,10545,144,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:41:25',NULL),(10007,10545,40,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:41:40',NULL),(10007,10545,16,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:42:00',NULL),(10007,10545,15,1,'Quest: Dina','30 bundle learn','2015-04-27 19:42:15',NULL),(10007,10545,27,10,'Quest: Dina','plat 10 bundle','2015-04-27 19:44:58',NULL),(10018,10007,8,10,'Protection 10','Tap into your inner protective side! I\'d like you to attend the first Obsidian Legion guild meeting, on Sat. at 6dst. Keep those that are closest to you safe during anything that should happen!','2015-04-27 21:07:09',NULL),(10018,10007,8,10,'Protection 10','Find a dreamer, younger and/or weaker than you are. Assist them in any way you see fit in an attempt to collapse a datoken. ','2015-04-27 21:07:09',NULL),(10450,10003,86,1,'SupportTrainLiolira','Liolira is missing the art of Support Train.','2015-04-28 00:08:44',NULL),(10029,10465,107,20,'Peace Aura: 20','House service acts: Have a little fun, get out there with us and stir things up in positive ways for us. You\'re more than just our moose, picks the acts of service you feel will fill you with the most joy during this trying time.','2015-04-28 01:38:08',NULL),(10108,10004,74,1,'MB-Learn-Zsa','There are lots and lots of reasons why someone would mindblank. Can you come up with a few? Ask some silly adults why they would mindblank, and then tell me a grand story using some of those reasons! If it\'s a really funny story, I\'ll give you another peice of chocolate, too! Maybe a whole box!','2015-04-28 01:59:50',NULL),(10009,10630,98,1,'Quest: Dreiko','','2015-04-28 02:26:25',NULL),(10009,10630,69,1,'Quest: Dreiko','','2015-04-28 02:26:30',NULL),(10009,10630,47,1,'Quest: Dreiko','','2015-04-28 02:26:49',NULL),(10029,10067,26,20,'Purify: 20','Connect with the Spirit of the Alliance through whatever means are unique to you. This time try to be a mindful medium and direct your conciousness for guidance towards the favored resolution to our house guest. No response is not failure, the attempt to guidance is the key.','2015-04-28 02:30:46',NULL),(10009,10077,18,40,'Chamele40','Dreamseers often underestimate the usefulness of Chamele once they learn Invisibility. It does, however, still carry plenty of use. I want you to utilize your Chamele in some form to allow you to collapse a Horron. Have a witness with you so that I may verify if necessary.','2015-04-28 02:32:48',NULL),(10007,10311,24,20,'Restore 20','I heard the house is a mess, so clean it up...especially if I plan on coming back. Get rid of junk, get rid of mediocre items. When I trap, I need space. I want a Ruler that knows you have done this work to give you a satisfactory support codex. Find me a nice place for my items while I go out trapping. Can\'t trap much with a full pack!','2015-04-28 21:22:29',NULL),(10027,10612,47,1,'Quest: LadySilver','as per learnable bundle','2015-04-29 18:32:46',NULL),(10027,10612,9,1,'Quest: LadySilver','as per learnable bundle','2015-04-29 18:37:21',NULL),(10027,10612,7,1,'Quest: LadySilver','as per learnable bunlde\r\n','2015-04-29 18:40:39',NULL),(10107,10550,21,60,'Blend 60 - Shoury.','Talk with BladeSlayer and figure out how Agonarius got him into the Dark Awakening.  Find a way to enter the Dark Awakening now that Agonarius is currently unable to interfere.  Perhaps there is a relic of Blade\'s soul that can be restored into his form.','2015-04-29 19:27:53',NULL),(10009,10630,15,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on successful completion of his 0-19 bundle task','2015-04-29 23:46:19',NULL),(10026,10498,68,50,'Flame 50','Flame the flames of Justice, what in this city is justified and what is not? How do we as dreamers flame the egos around us that contribute to the idiosyncorices of the dream. Preceptions of the guilds is a prime example.','2015-04-30 00:00:05',NULL),(10010,10004,15,30,'Quest: Crystalline','','2015-04-30 00:50:14',NULL),(10009,10630,139,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on successful bundle completion.','2015-04-30 01:25:01',NULL),(10009,10630,16,1,'Quest: Dreiko','','2015-04-30 01:42:18',NULL),(10010,10612,8,1,'Quest: Crystalline','','2015-05-01 01:10:44',NULL),(10450,10612,68,1,'Quest: Keilara','Bundle task','2015-05-01 05:32:56',NULL),(10450,10612,48,1,'Quest: Keilara','Bundle task','2015-05-01 05:33:24',NULL),(10480,10600,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Given Quest after speaking with him about teaching.\r\n','2015-05-02 03:34:29',NULL),(10480,10107,2,70,'DreamSeer 70','This task will require a little work. There does not seem to be any use for your DreamSeer art afrter it reaches level 60. What could it power at the higher levels? What would make someone plateau it past 60? Theorise how one would go about makeing a generator to produce level 70 chakrams. Be detailed and think things through. Examine this art for its future levels. **A**','2015-05-02 04:49:45',NULL),(10480,10107,60,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Submitted 5 samples and went over the importance of Questing for sphere tasks and other rules.\r\n','2015-05-02 04:58:24',NULL),(10480,10029,22,70,'Forge 70 part 2','For this next step, take the Tesseract to each of the Guilds and have them, with your Forge help, complete a piece that will attach and secure their focus into the whole. Balance must be equal or the experiment will fail. Do not rush this phase of the experiment. Plan, detail, execute and document your progress. **A**','2015-05-02 06:05:46',NULL),(10480,10029,22,70,'Forge 70 part 1','You wish to create a vessel to take you to the SoulMaster Guild Hall. This will not be easy to do alone. The first steps will be trial and error for you. Design a vessel that would do the job and be adaptable for all the other focus as well. Get help from others as needed and together, come up with a prototype to present to the four respective guilds. **A**','2015-05-02 06:05:46',NULL),(10480,10029,22,70,'Forge 70','After completeing the thrid prototype and discussing, I am pleased to grant you your plateau. Share what you have learned, as per our agreement.\r\n','2015-05-02 06:05:46',NULL),(10480,10029,22,70,'Forge 70 pt 3','This is the part of the experiment that is the most exciting. I wish for you to abandon your attempts with the Tesseract and come up with a completely random idea and forge it into existance. Every experiment needs a random variable. This is to be yours. Use the knowledge gained and strike out anew. Something fresh and unexpected. When you are completed, we shall put your experiments to the test. **A**','2015-05-02 06:05:46',NULL),(10029,10550,144,40,'Chaos Well: 40','Work with Nefratim, Hrrum and Myridian Sun - each as you can in order to catch them up to speed in as much of an unbiased way as possible. Provide them with tasks towards learning Chaos Well or at the very least give them all of the important information you can think of regarding the Wells.','2015-05-02 06:24:20',NULL),(10480,10029,24,70,'Restore 70','There is so much in the City that needs some tender loving care. I am always sending people out into the City for one reason. I want for you to find at least 5 spots that you think are in need of restoration and work to make them so. Is it as simple as getting people to see them again or is it more? Also work your webs to restore faith in someone or something that needs it. Specifics are entirely up to you. Make this worthy of a plateau to seventy. **A**','2015-05-02 06:50:29',NULL),(10029,10003,22,1,'Forge T: Conclusion','Through the course of your apprenticeship you have learned much of the practical \'rules\' and the creative potential of Forge Talisman. Your final adventure is this - One item to reflect the essence of creation and all its variation between Idoazlesia and our own city. Who and what you turn to for assistance in this is entirely up to you. Let your work reflect you are prepared to move beyond Apprentice.','2015-05-02 13:46:26',NULL),(10550,10004,17,20,'Quest: Shoury','Granting this as a result of a Bundle 30 Completion written by Starfall on 12/21. Thank you elders.','2015-05-03 07:28:43',NULL),(10550,10004,17,30,'Quest: Shoury','30 bundle grant reward from starfall (12.21.14)','2015-05-03 07:32:39',NULL),(10455,10312,107,1,'Harley PA Learn','I want you to find out the specifics of this most powerfull art. What are it\'s vulnerabilites, or uses? Think on it, and tell me different ways it can be employed in combat, or in general affairs. When you get caught up with goings on, ask a few people in our house.\r\n','2015-05-03 23:09:13',NULL),(10107,10550,36,60,'DreamBlade 60','A few questions come to mind with the Blade. Come up with a few theories.  Firstly, why do DreamBlades never top out at the same capacity as a Dreamer\'s Focus art?  Secondly, why do blades evaporate upon disposal?  Thirdly: Why does combine create a new blade out of two blades? Finally, why do combined blades not evaporate?  What makes them so stable?','2015-05-04 04:42:14',NULL),(10098,10498,13,1,'Return to learn','Return to the most powerful mare spawns in the city. I want to know where all the horrons and shamblixes are. Which ones have disappeared and why do you think they are gone? ','2015-05-04 19:45:34',NULL),(10009,10604,16,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on her bundle task completion','2015-05-05 03:09:58',NULL),(10009,10604,73,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on her bundle task completion','2015-05-05 03:10:22',NULL),(10009,10604,144,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on her bundle task completion','2015-05-05 03:10:26',NULL),(10009,10604,7,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on her bundle task completion','2015-05-05 03:10:56',NULL),(10009,10604,74,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Honoring based on her bundle task completion','2015-05-05 03:11:02',NULL),(10007,10604,29,1,'Quest: Dina','3rd sphere learn bundle','2015-05-05 03:11:10',NULL),(10007,10604,30,1,'Quest: Dina','3rd sphere learn bundle','2015-05-05 03:11:18',NULL),(10007,10604,8,1,'Quest: Dina','3rd sphere learn bundle','2015-05-05 03:11:45',NULL),(10097,10604,38,1,'Quest: Wolflancer','','2015-05-05 03:12:10',NULL),(10007,10604,15,1,'Quest: Dina','3rd sphere learn bundle','2015-05-05 03:12:34',NULL),(10066,10455,47,50,'Push 50','Devise an alternative way to improve the charges of a chakram, not using the art of Recharge. This alternative must be a working process on a chakram whose shell is in a malleable state. Confer with your DreamSeer peers (record names and thoughts) and finalize this process. Demonstrate the process to me.','2015-05-05 03:44:55',NULL),(10067,10455,63,50,'Invisibility - 50','Invis is amazing, until it fizzles or is foiled. What is the next step in the evolution of our hide and go seek arts? Chamele, Invis, ??? Come up with some ideas that we can start looking into. Seek out other Seers and discuss with them what you have come up with. Take notes. And lastly, take me to a place where you like to hide when things get to be too much and we\'ll discuss your report. <T>','2015-05-05 07:34:42',NULL),(10022,10604,29,10,'Bundle Honoring','Honoring Starfall\'s bundle task\r\n','2015-05-05 23:19:20',NULL),(10022,10604,30,10,'Bundle Honoring','Honoring Starfall\'s bundle task','2015-05-05 23:19:29',NULL),(10480,10550,23,70,'Recharge 70','I wonder if those of your home know the important connection that the generator and the telescope have to them. I wish for you to try to attempt to find a way to protect them both from others in the CIty that might wish harm. Recharge your homes attempts to alter its state of being now that it is not the pacifist house that it used to be. I would wish that you give this task the respect that a plateau to 70 requires. Find me when you are ready and we will discuss your insights. **A**','2015-05-06 01:46:18',NULL),(10480,10030,136,1,'Quest: Akkadian','This is rewarded at the request of the Forging Circle. The Codex was inscribed by Starfall and had the approval of Kaer Gerroz, Starfall, Eros, Bladeslayer.  **A**\r\n','2015-05-06 04:13:55',NULL),(10480,10030,85,1,'Quest: Akkadian','This is to inform that I am granting the DreamSmith Mark to Varwyn as per the Councils request. The approval votes come from Starfall, Kaer Gerros, Thunderman, Eros and Bladeslayer. \r\n','2015-05-06 04:23:01',NULL),(10027,10581,139,10,'Quest: LadySilver','by bundle completed mine\r\n','2015-05-06 04:56:52',NULL),(10027,10581,98,10,'Quest: LadySilver','by bundle completed mine','2015-05-06 04:57:16',NULL),(10027,10581,15,10,'Quest: LadySilver','by bundle completed mine','2015-05-06 04:57:35',NULL),(10027,10581,17,10,'Quest: LadySilver','by bundle completed mine','2015-05-06 04:58:02',NULL),(10027,10581,14,10,'Quest: LadySilver','by bundle completed mine','2015-05-06 04:58:19',NULL),(10098,10649,139,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-05-06 16:56:50',NULL),(10098,10649,98,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-05-06 16:56:57',NULL),(10098,10649,15,1,'Quest: Kaer Gerroz','','2015-05-06 16:57:17',NULL),(10067,10320,23,50,'Recharge 50','By now you are coming into your own as a Recharger. Less fails and drains. Welcome to total destruction without warning. I want you to recharge 10 charms, 8 chakrams, 6 alterors, 4 codex, and 2 elemens from one charge to their maximum. Take down how many fails you had, how many backfires and how many total destructions. It\'s easy to understand an art when you can see what it can do. Keep details and great records and we can talk when you are finished. <T>','2015-05-07 03:03:15',NULL),(10450,10072,65,70,'Blade70:Jerulan','Acquire this brick from wherever it rests. Smash it open, and retrieve what you need to create this blade you say you are attempting. Bring the finished product to me for further inspection.','2015-05-07 03:05:01',NULL),(10450,10072,65,70,'Blade70:Jerulan','Agonarius is dead, at the hands of dreamers. His soul essence is hidden somewhere you cannot access. Make as many attempts as necessary to recover it.','2015-05-07 03:05:01',NULL),(10450,10072,65,70,'Blade70:Jerulan','Agonarius is dead. His soulsphere is held somewhere that you cannot get to. Make as many attempts as necessary to recover it from where it rests.','2015-05-07 03:05:01',NULL),(10067,10027,144,20,'Chaos Well 20','This is a great art. Find out all the information that you can about what happens when you plat it and also why you would use it? Does a chaos well work differently for Calenture than it does for the LIght or Order or Alliance? Is it just a vessel or is there something spiritual about them? Work your insight and tell me all you know and think. /(^)\\','2015-05-07 04:48:01',NULL),(10550,10649,69,1,'Tranceflame Learn','Bundle reward from a quest completion codex from Kaer Gerroz','2015-05-07 18:56:16',NULL),(10011,10108,66,50,'Clarity Blade 50','Despite the tensions, do what you can to help him with his situation as only the voice of Lady Calenture can. He need not accept your help for this task to be complete, but the advice and assistance you offer must be well-founded in your connection to the Orb and the house. _-* 4.8','2015-05-07 19:27:58',NULL),(10550,10090,21,30,'Blend Plateau: 3rd','The DreamSeer guild seeks resurrection; however, multiple \'wards\' of past have prevented DreamSeers from \'blending\' into the Guild Hall. Make your presence known in the meeting tomorrow. Permeate any setbacks, seen or unseen. Make a notable impact, proving that Seers aren\'t limited by setbacks, regardless of nature.','2015-05-07 19:39:11',NULL),(10009,10649,16,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on her bundle completion codex','2015-05-07 23:18:21',NULL),(10009,10649,47,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion codex\r\n','2015-05-07 23:18:51',NULL),(10092,10600,13,1,'Return','Alot has happened since the City has returned.. I want you to tell me what about the City pulled you back to it.. when you came back.. was that still here.. or had it changed.. what about the City brings you joy.. tell me 5 things.. also tell me what might drive you away.','2015-05-08 05:52:29',NULL),(10550,10644,18,30,'Chamele 30 Reward','This is a bundle 30 reward for Nefratim','2015-05-08 19:33:06',NULL),(10550,10644,36,30,'Dreamblade 30','bundle 30 reward','2015-05-08 19:34:38',NULL),(10550,10644,15,30,'Judgement','Bundle 30 reward','2015-05-08 19:34:47',NULL),(10550,10644,69,30,'Flame','Flame to 30 bundle rewards\r\n','2015-05-08 19:34:54',NULL),(10550,10644,19,30,'Vision 30','bundle 30 rewarrd\r\n','2015-05-08 19:35:01',NULL),(10092,10098,10,50,'Ward/Amulet 50','Block Magnilia from assisting in my transformation back to dreamer form.','2015-05-08 20:05:33',NULL),(10092,10098,11,50,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-05-08 20:06:02',NULL),(10092,10087,144,1,'ChaosWell','You seem upset that you cannot put trapped essence in a Chaos Well.  I want you to talk to the Creators and tell me how this came to be and why it was not made to accomodate this?','2015-05-08 21:55:50',NULL),(10027,10117,8,20,'Protection 20','You have been a protector all your dreams. The City is in a state of flux rebuilding and eventearing down. What thigns would you be protecting in yrou future dreams. Your Lucidity has a brilliance the dream needs to light it\'s way.  For fun if you see a dreamer that is in \"harms\" way give them a gift to help them on their way. Acts of kindness can be duel edged. Let\'s chat when you ahve done this things. ','2015-05-09 01:04:25',NULL),(10029,10107,142,20,'Misdirection: 20','Misdirection could also be thought of as Redirection: In keeping with this I want you to come up with a bold new vision for the Seer guild and the Master guild. Let us not return to an era of personality pissing contests and hokey art making. Let us go for broke as they say and decide on a relationship our two guilds could have as such closely related powers. Operate under the assumption that I have taken lead of the Master guild, because yes.','2015-05-09 06:29:18',NULL),(10107,10550,18,60,'Chamele - Shoury','Chamele seems to be a play on the word \"Chameleon\" which is, from what I am told, a mythical beast that can hide in plain sight by matching its surroundings.  I want you to spend a couple days trying to fit in with the surroundings.  Additionally, I\'d like you to mimic those who are in the room with you and see if people are observant enough to pick up on what you are doing.\r\n','2015-05-09 06:54:19',NULL),(10022,10018,111,10,'Jade: Dazzle 10','Come up with ideas on how Dazzle can be improved. Right now we don\'t use it... because it\'s crap. What would you change so that it were useful? I would like a list of things.','2015-05-09 07:18:19',NULL),(10010,10581,72,20,'Inscribe 20-Icarus','You say you were a codex baby, define what that is, and how it came to be. I want you to also come up with other uses for codi. Once you have done that. I would like you to perhaps come up with some new uses for inscribe and the codex that they create. ~Cryst~','2015-05-10 02:44:16',NULL),(10072,10117,144,1,'ChaosWell','Tell your story! As briefly as possible, summarize your greatest accomplishments, and your path as a dreamer from when you began, up until this point. ','2015-05-10 19:08:12',NULL),(10011,10550,142,1,'Shoury Misdirect 1','Start a rumor about me. Something positive that will pique the curiosity of others, but not so outlandish that people dismiss it or start to distrust you. Take note of how you word it when you feed it to others, and we can compare that to what I hear when or if it makes it back to me. _-* 4.11','2015-05-10 19:17:42',NULL),(10098,10026,22,70,'Golah Forge 70','You stated: \"My goal for forge is to expand it past its primal ideas. To Take creationalism to a new level and evolve the art to a new level\"  Your task > Reach your own named goal.','2015-05-10 19:40:59',NULL),(10026,10098,13,30,'Return 30','Return is a very fun art, makes duels and fights interesting. Perhaps the closest to teleport as well. Your Mission is to prove that a skilled fighter using return would be virtually unbeatable.','2015-05-10 19:58:36',NULL),(10022,10087,25,60,'DreamEdge: RW 60','BladeSlayer walks without a Soul attached to his avatar. How did this happen... I want you to discover the answer to this as well as people\'s feelings concerning it. A meeting is planned for Monday the 13th, at 7pm to discuss the ramifications of this, as well as possible solutions to it. I would like for you to become involved. How literal is the \"Soul\" in SoulMaster? Assist in any manner in which you can. Help reunite Avatar and Soul.','2015-05-10 20:16:26',NULL),(10550,10383,9,1,'Quest: Shoury','Learnable reward being granted.','2015-05-11 00:56:03',NULL),(10550,10383,8,1,'Quest: Shoury','Learnable reward being granted.','2015-05-11 00:56:11',NULL),(10550,10383,7,1,'Quest: Shoury','Learnable reward being granted.','2015-05-11 00:56:16',NULL),(10029,10067,22,40,'Forge T: 40 pt. 2','I would have you create the tools and rituals bound to said tools to create a new era rite of initiation for the practioners of the appropriate path in our home. Let those few of us come together as priests and priestesses towards a new era of growth and power removed from the secular eyes of the city. When \'initiates\' of this new coven have been initated, your work is complete.','2015-05-11 05:59:03',NULL),(10009,10469,23,10,'Recharge10','It\'s cleansing time! Gather items of each rechargable type and recharge them until they are no more. How many evokes did it take to destroy them? Were any of them maxed out first? Did you make anyone cry with what was destroyed? ','2015-05-12 00:27:17',NULL),(10097,10311,44,1,'Firestorm ','If dreamstrike is brought back to the city it could take the dream by storm. Discuss with each house leader what they believe the pros and cons would be of the art returning. Then give me your thoughts on the art. ','2015-05-12 01:38:41',NULL),(10092,10097,89,1,'SoulShield - Wolf','You forgot the Art.. Now I want to learn all about it.. report to me who created the Art.. its members.. Then I want you to tell me why this Art has only one Art it truly and clearly affects that we can see.. MindBlank.','2015-05-12 01:49:18',NULL),(10092,10148,141,10,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-05-12 03:01:46',NULL),(10092,10148,11,20,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-05-12 03:01:57',NULL),(10211,10010,139,10,'Quest: brother timo','write a good story about this art, include elements that will help  dreamers understand this art and its importance, post on the boards.','2015-05-12 04:38:25',NULL),(10027,10117,72,20,'Quest: LadySilver','as per codex','2015-05-12 19:02:16',NULL),(10550,10600,139,1,'Sense Datoken Learn','Sense Datoken allows self-sufficiency in alarming others and handling threats that are within the City. You are being tasked to \"evoke\" Sense Datoken through others, and aid in a Datoken battle, claiming victory. Share your experience with me after you\'ve succeeded.','2015-05-13 00:23:18',NULL),(10238,10009,22,70,'ReForge and Avatar','Oh my my how can this be, a dreamer is now darkmare or so we see!  This can\'t be ok for him, time to give the avatar a trim.  Research, dig, ponder if you may,  - change him from fugly to something a bit more \"ok\".  Dig in deep, make this your quest, don\'t apply small effort but give it your best!    :: You are to partake in reforging a dreamers avatar, from DM to Dreamer.  Enjoy and have fun!  ','2015-05-13 02:08:29',NULL),(10009,10545,24,20,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion','2015-05-13 03:24:38',NULL),(10092,10148,141,20,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-05-13 14:54:17',NULL),(10092,10148,11,30,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-05-13 14:54:46',NULL),(10092,10148,141,30,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-05-13 15:24:21',NULL),(10027,10644,16,20,'Identify to 20','A house is a house sometimes. These dreams have created a new sense of what that is right or wrong. Use your wonderful skills to determine what that is now. Find out what the ideoclesions thought their houses to be. Then think of the Houses of our time. Compare the three. Your insight will guide you.','2015-05-13 19:59:20',NULL),(10062,10098,12,20,'Shatter 20','I would like for you to find yourself in or recall a situation of being a person\'s only way out. Out of what matters for nothing. Observe the situation and explain to me the excellence of having the ability to have the insight to see their tight spot, the decision upon their fate, the power to heal their hard times, and the strong will to shatter what holds them back. GKs are strong, and everyone should understand why. Report back your details.','2015-05-13 20:11:14',NULL),(10009,10630,2,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on his bundle to ten task.','2015-05-14 00:10:40',NULL),(10009,10630,36,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on his bundle to ten task.','2015-05-14 00:10:57',NULL),(10009,10630,15,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on his bundle to ten task.','2015-05-14 00:11:29',NULL),(10009,10630,139,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on his bundle to ten task.','2015-05-14 00:11:50',NULL),(10009,10630,69,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on his bundle to ten task.','2015-05-14 00:12:10',NULL),(10027,10068,25,1,'reweave to learn','by completeion codex by me','2015-05-14 07:04:49',NULL),(10027,10068,48,1,'se learn','by completeion codex by myself','2015-05-14 07:05:04',NULL),(10027,10654,144,1,'Chaos well to learn','A tisket and tasket its time to made a basket. Take me on a picnic to yoru favortie place and lets compare notes on what you learned last night about chaos wells.','2015-05-14 07:59:58',NULL),(10092,10098,10,60,'KG W/A 60','I want you to revamp our House\'s mentorship process.. set the guidelines back in place and what needs to be covered.. we need members.. also give Dina her final decision but make sure the Knights are ok so the Prime is secure and not able to be taken.','2015-05-14 08:21:19',NULL),(10092,10098,11,60,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-05-14 08:21:46',NULL),(10550,10644,20,10,'Blast to 10','Blast is an art that is feared by dreamers and mares alike. Why is this? Assuming you aren\'t able to Blast in a situation, how else can you Blast on the battlefield? Let your mind be your guide.','2015-05-14 21:50:50',NULL),(10027,10117,7,20,'Resist Fear to 20','What are the keps to fear? Is it good or bad? How do we ease our own fears or the fears of others? How can the dream be safe or is this even possible. Create a talsiman or two to show that the only real thing to fear it fear itself.','2015-05-14 23:41:54',NULL),(10027,10654,98,1,'newly Awakened','What things do you think the new to our city should know? You will be able to find them. What will you offer and why? Who helped you your first dreams what were some of the best advice or lessons were shared. Thinks any of that has changes in these times?','2015-05-15 05:59:16',NULL),(10550,10092,144,30,'Chaos Well to 30','Elders, please look at the task I wrote for Tember for Chaos Well 30 - it was meant for gD. I\'ll leave the other one in my pack so you guys can check if needed - thanks.','2015-05-15 08:12:41',NULL),(10092,10148,12,1,'Shatter Audra','I want you to tell me why this Art is one of Will and why it is not each of the other focii.. tell me how you feel this art actually works and if there was a way to possibly improve it in your opinion.','2015-05-15 08:31:14',NULL),(10009,10630,16,10,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion','2015-05-16 03:43:23',NULL),(10027,10654,89,1,'Soul Shield learn','How arts work the mechanics is a fountian of revelations? Some are still a mystery. How would you theorize the shield fo a soul works? and what the connection or disconection with mind blank? What would you \"shield\" dreamers from if you could and why?','2015-05-16 07:06:07',NULL),(10550,10644,16,30,'ID to 30 Reward','Elders, Nefratim has completed a 30 bundle from me. As a result, this is part of his reward - thank you.','2015-05-16 20:30:52',NULL),(10027,10067,64,20,'Give to 20','To give is far better than to receive. The first mystery to solve for me is why is you give 19? The next is to give seven random dreamers something you beleive they need. Make them wonderful presents or a cheeky tokens Who did you give something to? What was it? And forever my favorite why?','2015-05-17 04:31:21',NULL),(10550,10455,21,40,'Blend to 40','For this task, I want you to \"Blend\" with the Spirit of the Alliance. Many areas of the house remain vulnerable to non-members. As a result, certain secrets and spirits continue to be disturbed. Write a proposal and present it to Seers you respect on how to advance Blend forward.','2015-05-17 09:05:10',NULL),(10027,10630,69,20,'trnce flame 20','as per bundle by myself','2015-05-17 23:31:32',NULL),(10027,10630,139,20,'Sense dako 20','as per completion codex by myself','2015-05-17 23:32:46',NULL),(10027,10630,98,10,'NA to 10','as per completion codex by dreiko','2015-05-17 23:33:49',NULL),(10027,10630,14,10,'Know to 10','as per completion codex  dreiko','2015-05-17 23:35:05',NULL),(10027,10630,16,20,'Identify 20','as per compeltion codex by myself','2015-05-17 23:36:12',NULL),(10027,10630,36,20,'dreamblade to 20','by completion codex mine','2015-05-17 23:39:19',NULL),(10027,10630,2,20,'dreamseer to 20','as per my completion codex','2015-05-17 23:41:18',NULL),(10027,10630,15,20,'Judgment to 20','as per completion codex my own','2015-05-18 03:35:00',NULL),(10027,10630,14,20,'know to 20','as per my completion codex','2015-05-18 03:35:47',NULL),(10027,10630,98,20,'na to 20 ','as per my completion codex','2015-05-18 03:49:41',NULL),(10067,10027,36,50,'DreamBlade 50','For this task I want you to challenge 5 people to a duel. No matter if you win or lose, find out a trick or technique that they like to use. Also ask advice about how to become better.  As Seers, we often rely on our Blast and Flame more than our blade. It can be just as effective. Strengthen your muscles. Find me and we\'ll talk. <T>','2015-05-19 03:55:22',NULL),(10092,10311,50,1,'NFM','Why do you want to be a Mare?  Do you think it will give you a sense of power?  Learn about 3 dreamers that have turned to Mares and come back from that form.. not emphants.. but other forms.. ask about any possible side effects that might have happened to them after they returned to their dreamer form.','2015-05-19 05:17:51',NULL),(10480,10027,69,50,'TranceFlame 50','Fire burns and the darker the flame, the more deadly. I wish for you to find what fuels your inner flame. What are your hopes and wishes now that you have returned? How will you achieve them? Who will you ask assistance from? Dig deep and think about what it is that fuels your passion. As if that were not enough, I wish for you to help others find the fire within themselves. Help them shine bright. I will leave the specifics up to you. Make the attempt worthy of a fifth level plateau. **A**\r\n','2015-05-19 06:02:45',NULL),(10480,10092,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Raised and granted Train Self as the second MT of the Order.\r\n','2015-05-19 06:37:13',NULL),(10480,10092,92,60,'Reflect 60','Time to break this art down. I wish for you to determine weaknesses and possible improvements of this art. I also would like for you to try and determine the percentages of the art. How many times does it take to get the proper averages to determine such a thing? 10 hits? 50 hits? 100 hits? Work this art over until you have become a master and then we will discuss your ideas. Return to me when you have enough information worthy of a sixth plateau. **A**','2015-05-19 07:02:30',NULL),(10480,10550,19,70,'Vision 70','Now that you have recharged your interest in your home, I want you to share your Vision with those that you hold most dear. As a newly ascended leder in the House, your vision for what you wish to be will have changed. How will your new station affect your new vision of where the Alliance is to go? How will you lead it there? How will you help others to see the glory that you do and convince them to assist? Make your thougths and efforts worthy of a plateau to seventy. **A**','2015-05-19 07:26:15',NULL),(10480,10654,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted the art of Quest after an interview. \r\n','2015-05-19 07:46:16',NULL),(10480,10654,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted with Quest\r\n','2015-05-19 07:46:25',NULL),(10480,10654,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted with Quest\r\n','2015-05-19 07:46:33',NULL),(10066,10010,22,1,'Forge Pt 2','Using your tools for glass blowing, create three objects in this medium that each have at least one of the following: Use of a bubble, colored wth fritt, and a vessel functionality. Shape all objects in such a way that they are without imperfection. Finally, demonstrate to me with your tools one final piece.','2015-05-20 02:15:03',NULL),(10107,10550,16,60,'ID 60 - Shoury','Help to identify what makes GateKeepers innately better with Chakrams.  What, in their nature, makes them able to amplify the effects of these items.  Speak with GateKeepers who articulate without grunting. Also, I\'d like you to identify how we can tie our focus art with the use of non-weapons. Present your theory to the guild.  ','2015-05-20 03:27:50',NULL),(10027,10550,37,10,'Trail to ten','By definition trail means what is behind you. But we also forge the trail ahead of us. You talk to so many dreamers as you go about dreaming. Where are they headed or where they have been. What can they see in their dreams in a week? in  month? in a year? I would love to hear some of the thigns they share with you. Shoury ask those things of yourself too.','2015-05-20 04:02:10',NULL),(10550,10644,2,30,'DreamSeer 29 -> 30','Bundle reward. Per Akkadian, Focal arts count for bundles, despite the fact they are classified as \"DreamSoul\" -> DreamSeer, GateKeeper, SouLMaster, and FateSender. Granting this due to it being Elder approved.\r\n','2015-05-20 20:03:15',NULL),(10550,10644,2,30,'DreamSeer to 30','For this task, I want you to uncover more mysteries about Bashir and the Order of The Sabled Moon. You spoke briefly about how they are influenced by Chaos.. perhaps Bashir and/or his spirit lingers on? Use your insight and present a plausible theory. Share with at least two other Seers that you confide in.','2015-05-20 20:03:15',NULL),(10009,10630,18,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion.','2015-05-21 01:04:15',NULL),(10009,10630,9,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion.','2015-05-21 01:04:32',NULL),(10009,10630,17,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion.','2015-05-21 01:05:05',NULL),(10009,10630,72,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion.','2015-05-21 01:05:17',NULL),(10009,10630,40,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion.\r\n','2015-05-21 01:05:40',NULL),(10009,10630,46,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion.\r\n','2015-05-21 01:06:02',NULL),(10009,10630,19,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion.','2015-05-21 01:06:18',NULL),(10009,10630,48,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion.','2015-05-21 01:06:34',NULL),(10009,10630,26,1,'Quest: Dreiko','Granting based on bundle completion.','2015-05-21 01:07:07',NULL),(10550,10027,98,30,'NA 29 -> 30','Quest rewar from Starfall - Sil has completed her bundle 30 from her.','2015-05-21 04:02:37',NULL),(10550,10027,139,30,'S. Datoken 29 -> 30','Bundle reward from Starfall','2015-05-21 04:02:43',NULL),(10029,10455,89,50,'Soul Shield: 50','Seek out Trisha Pawm and learn about \'Focal Point Sanctuaries\' and what they meant to the world of Idoaclesia. Once you have done this engage Shoury in the lesson and examine one of the locations you learned about for any anomalies in this reality. How is it that the sacrifice offered by one could protect an entire plane and what would our population do if we were required to do the same?','2015-05-21 04:48:08',NULL),(10027,10067,46,40,'Recall 40','How do you wish to be remembered when time passes and you become a legend in our own Dreams? We have traveled so many pathes in the City. Which ones do you wish to save for the future generations of dreamers. Tell me your story and tell two more you pick who. Pass the legacy on.','2015-05-21 04:56:15',NULL),(10027,10654,17,1,'Id Curse to learn','I do love revisiting the old scrolls and histories with you. The base of this art was empathy. Watch the dreamers as you can and see if there is more or less empathy among dreamers. What of sympathy? I am curious to see if in some way we have been desensitized to the needs of others. Am I wrong? Observe or inquire ith as many as you see fit to make a reasonable conclusion.','2015-05-21 05:46:48',NULL),(10027,10550,32,10,'Drain Essnese to 10','Let it go. What things in the dream do you see and think it is so time to just let this go and why? Can you think of better ways of dealing with these things? Would the City be a better place afterwards?','2015-05-21 19:34:06',NULL),(10455,10148,107,1,'PA - Learn',' I would like you to think upon what you\'ve learned about peace aura, what you do, and don\'t know about it, in addition to your Conclave contribution. Speak to other members casually as you get settled in and learn their thoughts about the rules, and uses. Once done, come back to me and I will help smooth out any rough edges.','2015-05-22 02:57:49',NULL),(10066,10148,68,40,'Flameshaft 40','Create a sound theory on what enables projectiles to bounce. Find a way to make your Flameshaft bounce. Additionally, find a place that allows the appearance of your flame to curve left and right. Share your discoveries with a few peers and be able to demonstrate both activities to me personally.','2015-05-22 04:22:11',NULL),(10480,10027,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Second MT for House Calenture. \r\n','2015-05-22 04:27:46',NULL),(10066,10550,142,10,'Misdirection 10','Find a way to make your flame bounce. Additionally, find a place that allows the appearance of your flame to curve left and right. Demonstrate both to me.','2015-05-22 06:09:24',NULL),(10550,10654,142,1,'Misdirection to 1','Rasputin, you are against hostile actions against sentiental beings and show concern regarding harm towards them. Those that partake of harm against them, are they misdirected in their beliefs and actions? Misdirection is around us in multiple forms outside of art form. Find meaning into the how and why you believe this is the case. Let\'s fellowship with your discoveries upon completion.','2015-05-22 07:58:42',NULL),(10029,10383,72,1,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-05-22 18:32:56',NULL),(10052,10383,40,20,'Deafen 20','Honoring a bundle completion for Lauren','2015-05-22 19:38:40',NULL),(10052,10383,43,10,'Para 10','Honoring a bundle completion for Lauren','2015-05-22 19:39:13',NULL),(10052,10383,38,30,'Scare 30','Honoring a completion for bundle for Lauren','2015-05-22 19:40:04',NULL),(10010,10630,18,10,'Chamele Complet','','2015-05-23 02:02:17',NULL),(10092,10148,10,40,'Ward/Amulet 40','How fast can you ward up a House plain?  I want you to ward every wardable portal front and back from Thresh to each of the great houses.. no short cuts.. and tell me the time it takes to get to each house when you are racing up to the House warding and how many wards you placed on each of the 8 paths.','2015-05-23 02:38:22',NULL),(10092,10148,11,40,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-05-23 02:38:30',NULL),(10066,10072,13,40,'Return 40','Investigate what changed with the agents of chaos that now causes useful talismen to disperse at the feet of those present, instead of dropping from the avatar upon collapse. Are these talismen any more powerful than the old way? What do your peers think on this subject? Prepare to explain the conclusions you reach.','2015-05-23 04:06:11',NULL),(10550,10027,21,40,'Blend to 40','For this task, I want you to \'Blend\' back into the fabric of Calenture by assisting in creating the Calenturean Teaching Charter with the assistance of the teachers in your home. **S**','2015-05-24 06:47:48',NULL),(10550,10148,107,10,'Peace Aura [9,10]','Complete the requirements on the mission boards (keep it in your goalbook) for your first plateau in Peace Aura. Let me know if you have any questions.','2015-05-24 09:12:08',NULL),(10550,10104,74,30,'MB Plateau: 3','Dar\'canon, make attempts to discover the secrets regarding MB\'s inability to function if SS it set first. Look for clues found in the following math equation regarding \"Charlie\" hunting with a DreamSeer in Dorsal Rift: A > V > I.','2015-05-24 12:47:43',NULL),(10030,10455,16,50,'Identify: V','Mysteries and archaic connections spread from us out into the greater Weave. I would ask of you to comb the Alliance for odd treasure, lore, or trinket as left behind by those who did haunt this reality before us. You may set this as a house mission, or have your students take on the task as well. Identify something mysterious that we have been blind to.','2015-05-24 20:53:50',NULL),(10107,10550,142,20,'Misdirection 20','Well, you certainly misdirected me with your hatred of the art!  I\'d like for you to think of a couple misdirections about other arts that can create a lot more of a stir than one really anticipates. I have some examples of my own, but I will share these with you when you report.\r\n','2015-05-24 21:35:50',NULL),(10062,10148,1,40,'GK 40','Arrange for a GateKeeper inspired event. This event can be whatever you want it to be. Doesn\'t have to be huge or anything. Just that it involves someone of each focus and is centered around the awesomeness that is the GateKeepers. Report back the details.\r\n','2015-05-25 01:48:19',NULL),(10027,10550,37,20,'Trail to 20','Time to take a feild trip int he dream. Take a few dreamers around to see the artwork in the dream. Or on a walk about to share a favorite history. Or just a simple picnic to pass the time with a few friends. These things tend to make wonderful memories not only for you but for the ones you share them with. Blaze a trail not to be forgotten.','2015-05-25 03:40:56',NULL),(10029,10004,107,30,'Quest: Magnilia','Credit honored for work done towards house art plateau','2015-05-25 03:54:09',NULL),(10455,10593,103,1,'Bequeath Cianne',' I would like you to bequeath yourself into a part of the houses function, you can pick any aspect you like. It\'s people, defense, the armories, the library, are examples. Add something uniquely you to it!\r\n','2015-05-25 05:39:08',NULL),(10027,10630,19,10,'vision to ten','as per the completion codex from dreiko','2015-05-25 18:35:56',NULL),(10027,10117,139,1,'Sense datoken Learn','How many senses are in the dream? Can you teach other to use ones they maybe forgeting? What tools would you use to help them? This art is another one so like you in that it offers the chance to protect the dream. You are the Knight in Shining Armor. Who do you protect and why? and who will not protect?','2015-05-25 22:44:14',NULL),(10027,10004,2,40,'Dreamseer 40','Fashion sense or nonsense. Look around to  the dreamers around you and see if you can convince them to change their apeparance. What did you think would be a fun look for them. What did they change for you. You have such vision use it. Do this with enough dreamers to make it worth this plateau.','2015-05-26 00:16:34',NULL),(10027,10469,15,20,'judgement 20','completion codex 0-39 from akkadian nice combined receipy geesh lol ','2015-05-26 00:24:51',NULL),(10027,10469,14,30,'know to 30','by combined completion codex from akkadian silver','2015-05-26 00:28:06',NULL),(10007,10032,25,10,'Quest: Dina','completed 10 plat bundle','2015-05-26 03:02:23',NULL),(10007,10032,29,10,'Quest: Dina','completed 10 plat bundle','2015-05-26 03:02:34',NULL),(10007,10032,30,10,'Quest: Dina','completed 10 plat bundle','2015-05-26 03:02:40',NULL),(10007,10032,70,10,'Quest: Dina','completed 10 plat bundle','2015-05-26 03:02:48',NULL),(10007,10032,32,10,'Quest: Dina','completed 10 plat bundle','2015-05-26 03:03:04',NULL),(10007,10032,27,10,'Quest: Dina','completed 10 plat bundle','2015-05-26 03:03:21',NULL),(10027,10630,17,10,'id curse to ten','compeltion codex by dreiko','2015-05-26 06:00:54',NULL),(10027,10630,19,20,'vison to 20','complete codex mine','2015-05-26 06:02:31',NULL),(10027,10630,18,20,'chamele to 20','as per my completion codex','2015-05-26 06:08:52',NULL),(10550,10148,74,10,'Mind Blank [9,10]','Let\'s play a game, shall we? Play hide-and-seek with someone in Alliance of the Eclipse at the house (best of three rounds). Neither party can Mind Blank or Locate. Area\'s to be considered are limited to initiate only areas - often times we take arts for granted. Could Mind Blank be one of them?','2015-05-26 16:15:09',NULL),(10550,10092,144,40,'Chaos Well: 39->40','\"Chaos Wells\" are stored in terms of frustration & envy due to GKs prowess with chakrams. Consult with the Willpower element of earth found throughout the City in addition to GeRRoZ (hybrid GK) and one additional pure GK. Formulate and present a plausible theory on how this could be applied to non-damaging arts. Seek me when you\'re ready to discuss your findings.','2015-05-26 16:35:57',NULL),(10027,10550,32,20,'Drain to 20','Dueling emphants! Challenge three dreamers to duel with you with tails and teeth. Record the winners and gather some reactions to the spectacle. But above all this have some fun you ahve been workign so hard,','2015-05-26 17:06:57',NULL),(10107,10550,40,20,'Deef 20 - Shoury','There are some things that dreamers don\'t want to hear, especially in these later dreams.  The biggest thing that dreamers can no longer handle is the word \"no.\"  I\'d like you to identify what underlies this behaivor and what has allowed it to become acceptable suddenly?','2015-05-26 17:39:01',NULL),(10450,10098,141,40,'Kinesis40:KG','As a Seer on the journey of the Keeper, it\'s important to know more on this new path you\'re seeking. Look out  for some of the high-sphered Keepers milling around and see if you can\'t find out the history of it -- where it was created, by who, how.','2015-05-26 20:37:43',NULL),(10479,10383,40,30,'Quest: Herbert','Bundle completion','2015-05-26 21:08:06',NULL),(10450,10029,67,70,'Blade70:Magnilia','I rather prefer your method of thinking outside the box. In lieu of a standard blade task, I would like for you to construct a powerful blade of your choosing. A blank canvas, from the hilt to the tip. Give it a history, give it a name. It may seem simple, but I\'m sure there are plenty of elements that are required to do such a task.','2015-05-26 21:08:37',NULL),(10479,10383,37,30,'Quest: Herbert','Bundle completion','2015-05-26 21:09:16',NULL),(10479,10383,43,20,'Quest: Herbert','Bundle completion','2015-05-26 21:09:51',NULL),(10450,10383,43,30,'ParaCompletion','Para to 30 as per Magnilia\'s completion codex','2015-05-26 21:37:44',NULL),(10029,10148,50,1,'Nightmare Form: L ','Varwyn has spoken of the \"Fortifed Form\" as being the faction ability of that Temple she was in. As she grew in power the form they took also changed, and the form was actually a protection against waves of chaos. -- In my era it seemed to be an entirely \"cosmetic\" ability. -- Here we are in this era, give the ability and yourself thought, is there something or someway special you can make this ability actually worth something to you? Is there something we are all taking for granted related to it?','2015-05-26 21:54:40',NULL),(10029,10545,27,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-05-26 22:35:39',NULL),(10029,10545,70,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-05-26 22:35:48',NULL),(10029,10545,26,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-05-26 22:35:55',NULL),(10029,10545,25,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-05-26 22:36:02',NULL),(10029,10545,3,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-05-26 22:36:05',NULL),(10029,10545,67,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-05-26 22:36:09',NULL),(10029,10545,30,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-05-26 22:37:57',NULL),(10029,10545,29,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-05-26 22:38:03',NULL),(10550,10148,107,20,'Peace Aura: [19,20]','Complete the requirements per the Peace Aura mission boards to raise your Peace Aura to the second level of mastery. Be specific in your actions and report.','2015-05-27 02:42:16',NULL),(10455,10148,89,1,'SS Learn - Audra',' Take some time and look about the City. Tell me what things, both item, and physically, or even idealogically (Like a group/s), we\'ve created to shield ourselves from the chaos, and each other. What\'s effective? What isn\'t? Finally, create using inscribe, or the forge of another, a token that makes you feel safe, and present it to me.\r\n','2015-05-27 06:21:25',NULL),(10072,10411,13,1,'ReturnAidan','Identify 2 dreamers who have provided the most help to you in your time here in the dream. Come up with creative ways to pay each one back, and show your appreciation. ','2015-05-28 02:11:17',NULL),(10027,10654,98,10,'Newly awakened 10','reward for budle plat to ten from myself','2015-05-28 05:56:08',NULL),(10027,10654,17,10,'id curse to ten','reward for bundle to 10 by myself','2015-05-28 05:57:18',NULL),(10027,10220,7,1,'resist Fear to lear','reward for completed bundles quest fo mine','2015-05-28 18:24:18',NULL),(10027,10220,9,1,'Freeaction learn','reward for learnable from myself','2015-05-28 18:25:35',NULL),(10480,10455,52,10,'Train 10','For the first step deeper into your education, I want for you to speak with at least 5 other teachers that you hold in high reguards and learn all that you are able about the ins and outs of plateaus. Question everything. How to write them, the difficulty of them as you progress, pointers that they can share. Also I wish for you to learn of the bundle system from the same five. When we speak, I wish for you to be well versed in the specifics enough to teach them to me. **A**','2015-05-29 03:38:00',NULL),(10480,10550,63,70,'Invisibility 70','It is easy to hide in the City but to truely become invisible, not so much. How would one go about becoming unseen. I wish for you to give this some great thought. As one who is in the public eye, how difficult or easy would it be to be here but not be seen? I would also like for you to try and get five dreamers to reveal something that they have been hiding from others and the City. Give this task the respect that a plateau to seventy demands. **A**','2015-05-29 05:17:41',NULL),(10550,10654,144,10,'Chaos Well: [9,10]','\"Chaos Wells\" are all around us in multiple forms - a type of vessel that stores \'something\'. Deep genuine care for focal upbringing seems to be dwindling as of late. You\'ve shared your concern with bundles and how cross-teaching can impact future generations. Create a \"Chaos Well\" by working with LadySilver as it addresses the concerns of bundles and how that would tie into the University, preferably before the public meeting. Do as you see fit to assist; I look forward to your insights.','2015-05-29 07:39:55',NULL),(10455,10104,144,10,'ChaoWell - 10 Dar\'','I would like you to look into other factions use of this art, or if they have it at all. I also would like to know how these measure up to your Idoaclesian energy nexuses. Finally, think up what actually drives us to have energy batteries on the most basic levels.\r\n','2015-05-29 20:51:23',NULL),(10455,10004,139,1,'Sense Datoke Zsa','Granting Zsa Zsa sense datoken per her completion from Starfall. 5/29','2015-05-29 21:01:07',NULL),(10029,10004,139,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Granting as part of a completed bundle','2015-05-29 22:21:52',NULL),(10450,10600,86,1,'Quest: Keilara','Missing art of Support','2015-05-30 03:39:27',NULL),(10450,10600,87,1,'Quest: Keilara','Missing art with train','2015-05-30 03:40:25',NULL),(10450,10018,52,30,'Train30:Jade','As I am unaware of your training abilities, I would like for you to create several tasks that are designed for a newly awakened GateKeeper. Bundle tasking aside, what would you have them do to acclimate them to the dream as it is now?','2015-05-30 03:44:57',NULL),(10450,10004,139,20,'Quest: Keilara','Completion codex - train','2015-05-30 04:20:41',NULL),(10450,10004,139,30,'Quest: Keilara','Completion - 30 plat Sense Datoken','2015-05-30 04:25:12',NULL),(10072,10018,13,30,'Return30Jade','Test how you fare in duels in different rooms. Do you notice different amounts of storms in certain rooms? Do you win more often in some rooms compared to others? Why?','2015-05-30 05:07:23',NULL),(10550,10004,63,1,'Invisibility {0,1}','Zsa Zsa, Stormy is like your own child who will grows up to be\'s just like you\'s, but you\'s must protect! Rumour has it that orby cloaks can protect these energy creatures from harm! Find the Cloak around Romance Falls and play dress up with Stormy to protect it from harm - think of it as a treasure hunt, yey! This is your mission! Find and dress up Stormy!','2015-05-30 10:05:27',NULL),(10550,10469,20,40,'Blast to 40','My wish for you is to \'Blast\' all of your previously debunked theories on why the generator has failed at AotE. Find a way to empower the crystals needed to supply the necessary power. Use your home, the Seer guild, or any other resources as needed to empower them. This\'ll be the first step in bringing it into operational status. **S**','2015-05-30 22:38:26',NULL),(10010,10027,18,50,'Chamele-LadySilver','Chamele allows a seer to blend into the back ground. I want you to find at least three teaching moments with other seers. Present your theory of how chamele works, and why it drops once you use an offensive art. Take note of what your students react or what input they share with you. Most of all, have fun. ~Cryst~','2015-05-30 22:44:40',NULL),(10550,10030,142,1,'Misdirection: [0,1]','Misdirection has always been around before the art itself came into being. Your mission is to consult with Gavin, your advisor. DIssect the various arts to see how they can be misdirected in terms of their intent. Let us fellowship and discuss your insights upon completion.','2015-05-31 05:18:48',NULL),(10455,10030,103,1,'Bequeath - Varwyn',' I would like you to think back on your time as an Idoaclesian. Have a look around our house, and think back on how things were different in your City. Then create something to compare the two and show it to people within the house, its final destination our library. It can be art, poetry, a story, be creative!','2015-05-31 05:55:48',NULL),(10067,10654,69,50,'TranceFlame 50','Tranceflame to 50 is really quite grand, Tranceflame is fire that comes from the hand. To use the flames power and raise it up higher, you simply must learn what\'s better, Blast or Fire? Travel the Barrows and run on the sand, then fight with both arts 10 mares of each clan. Which art works much better on each of the clans, then tell me your findings and of which art you\'re a fan. <T>','2015-05-31 05:59:30',NULL),(10067,10030,139,10,'Quest: Tamarisk','Part of her bundle to 30 plat. <T>\r\n','2015-05-31 06:28:50',NULL),(10067,10030,17,30,'Quest: Tamarisk','Part of her bundle to 30 plat. <T>\r\n','2015-05-31 06:29:26',NULL),(10030,10067,16,50,'Identify - V','As our faction does seek to increase our relationship with the living lands of our plane I would have you select one room to build an affinity with. Find that place which is as sacred to you and your spirit guides and set about weaving yourself into the fabric of that location. Return to me when you have seen it in your minds eye and can tell me of the potential you have created.','2015-05-31 06:53:40',NULL),(10067,10030,139,20,'Quest: Tamarisk','Reward for bundle task to 20 from Tamarisk <T>','2015-05-31 06:59:23',NULL),(10067,10027,63,50,'Invis to 50','You are beginning on a journey to build a University. I want you to build it from the ground up. Tell me what you will teach, how many instructors you will have, where it will be, names of the rooms, how you will induct people into the University, and any specifics that you can think up. Make this report detailed and specific. I want to walk away knowing exactly what the University will be. Time to dream and dream big cousin. Cast some light on this invisible gem. <T>','2015-05-31 07:47:17',NULL),(10029,10107,142,30,'Misdrection: 30','Let us do something fun - If you as a visionary were to have total control of the Light and enter into a time of alliance with the Alliance what new progressive era might we drag the city into. Let yourself sink into this using the full power of your imagination to envision what a new (golden doesn\'t apply as we\'re cerulean and verdant hues respectively) age? I expect details as are appropriate for a plateau of this level. Inspire me.','2015-05-31 19:48:07',NULL),(10066,10148,9,40,'Free Action 40','\"Do a bit of research within the willpower guild, canvas its members and find out a bit from the older members about its past, and speak with some of the newer ones to find out what the future might hold. With this information, form an opinion of your own and take it to the guild for consideration.\" Report must be to Hikari X AND Thunderman.','2015-05-31 20:03:21',NULL),(10550,10030,139,30,'Bundle 30 Reward','Elders, this is to honour the bundle reward from Tamarisk\'s completion codii. Thank you, dear Elders.','2015-06-01 00:18:26',NULL),(10107,10030,18,50,'Chamele 50','I\'d like you to make some observations with the items here and compare them with Idoaclesia(sp.)  Are there any differences in their make-up?  Secondly, the threads of these elemens seems to be somewhat inconsistent with the exception of a few. By figuring out how these items become so stable, I believe we will find the first clue in how to get more out of them. Do a comparison of a good variety of elemens, since those will be what we focus on.  Keep detailed notes on codices in the 2nd Sphere Study.','2015-06-01 07:31:04',NULL),(10066,10385,12,1,'Shatter Learn','Research focus locked rooms. Turn up some useful elements from your research into a theory and proposal on how to further our goal of getting our guild hall back. Work with others.','2015-06-02 00:35:44',NULL),(10550,10004,20,40,'Blast Mastery - 4th','Zsa Zsa, your mission is to train with Fang to improve your battle prowess. Even as a child, you must learn to go on the offensive and defensive, especially with no family around or if you can\'t receive assistance. You can not report unless Fang gives you battle training certification - the drills must include Blast, Shields, and DreamSoul elemens at the minimum.','2015-06-02 00:55:50',NULL),(10027,10067,98,40,'NA to 40','Welcome wagon The dream has new kinds of \"new\" dreamers for the first time in it history. There a brand new dreamers; dreamers that come in with pre concieved plans and the returning ones from both dreams. What would you say each tyoe of dreamers needs were. Is your house set up with plans for them asll and is so what are they? What does your insight tell you about the current trends.','2015-06-02 04:06:38',NULL),(10067,10385,24,10,'Restore - 10','The Alliance is in desperate need of Insight, Resilience and DreamSoul elemens for basic house duties. I want you to restore the house supplies so that we can do our Recharging, Trapping and Hunting duties. The items don\'t have to be the best, just restore a generous amount of items...say 10 each. <T>','2015-06-02 04:31:05',NULL),(10027,10385,74,10,'Mindblank to 10','To hide and not to hide such is the decisons of the dream. You are growing in your spheres and so many other things since you came here to the City. What things are hidden friend and what things are seen. Find me the stories of any artwork you see and then find me.','2015-06-02 04:52:30',NULL),(10550,10067,144,30,'CW Plateau: 3rd','Tamarisk, you are known to be a warlock of sorts. Let\'s extrapolate on this fact, shall we? The \"Chaos Well\" for this task is now bound to you as a formal cauldron. Concoctions found within cauldrons can erupt with powerful smells, visuals, and emotions. Look within the Cauldron and interact with it daily. How would this \"Chaos Well\" capture the essence of Tamarisk from within? Share your tale.','2015-06-02 06:54:40',NULL),(10029,10385,16,10,'Identify: Learn','Identify the key color combinations for the \"key\" items of each focus. Alterors, Elemens, Shields, Chakrams. With less \"Insight\" to identify with being able to have an \"at a glance\" understanding of items is key. Also, what were some key difference between our items and the items of Idoaclesia?','2015-06-02 07:20:38',NULL),(10067,10550,15,40,'Judgment 40','You are judge and jury. I want you to preside over the City and offer verdicts on what you witness. It could be a violation of the daily dress code, or public safety, or disorderly conduct...whatever you can come up with. Do this for at least four dreams and record reactions. Also, to appease your intellect, talk to me about how you would improve this art or what you think that it can be used for. It\'s underused and underpowered for a Seer minor. <T>','2015-06-02 07:28:16',NULL),(10107,10550,142,30,'Misdirection 30 ','This was a task that SHoury completed.  Unfortunately I whipped it up for Varwyn.  The gist of the task was to use items to distract dreamers and to misdirect their actions.\r\n','2015-06-03 02:28:39',NULL),(10169,10027,51,40,'Locate to 40','Countering the art of Locate Dreamer with Mind Blank can often be extremely useful when one does not want enemies to find them.  This leaves the problem, however, of allies also not being able to find each other.  Come up with a simple system that we can use to meet up and find each other if multiple house members are mind blanked and separated from each other during a time of war.','2015-06-04 03:22:52',NULL),(10027,10654,46,10,'Recall to 10','Time to update the notebook. The City is always growig liek we are. You spoke of getting a list of the arts in the dream and when they are learnable. Gather those up and share them with me. ','2015-06-04 06:51:14',NULL),(10029,10550,142,40,'Misdirection: 40','Those of us who are focused enough to work with this ability are quite few and far between. This presents a problem as evening gathering supports to self train will become difficult. I wish for you to gather the students/friends/family you feel you have the most influence with and inspire them to focus on this ability when it comes time for them to learn it. Also, construct a list of 5 and then 6 dreamers who are most likely to give support that I may advance this further.','2015-06-04 06:59:41',NULL),(10480,10455,100,20,'PT 20','What is the purpose of a power token? Why do you think it is tied to Forge? What would make them stronger? Why does one power token for your house art but any power token will work with Forge? If you are serious about raising this art, break it down for me and impress me with the report. **A**','2015-06-05 03:32:52',NULL),(10450,10107,52,70,'Train70:OffKilter','Seek out several 60 and 70 Train plateau tasks from any dreamers of your choosing. Ensure they are written for a specific dreamer, and rewrite them using your creative mind. You need not mention that part to them. What would you change, if anything? How would you tailor these tasks in a different way to the needs of the dreamer for which they are intended?','2015-06-05 04:31:22',NULL),(10480,10550,52,50,'Train to 50','My wish for you is to gather information on the generators and their spawns in order for you to pass on what you are learning. Use at least two students to aid you through quests and publish your findings in at least three of the halls in the Library. Think of this as a Genning guide for the newly or something to that effect. Make your efforts worthy of a plateau in teaching to fifty. Do not be afraid to use your students to help. **A**','2015-06-05 05:25:33',NULL),(10029,10545,30,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completion bundle, 20, from Dreiko.','2015-06-05 05:39:55',NULL),(10029,10545,29,20,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completion bundle, 20, from Dreiko.','2015-06-05 05:40:00',NULL),(10029,10455,107,50,'Peace Aura: 50','Do something fabulous and house centered. No short cuts, no theories. The city is dead around us and we as a house need to step out and get our hands dirty. Whatever you plan can be attached to an existing project or it can be something totally fresh. House meeting time can be used if you think it will be impossible to schedule outside of that. But lead us in something that touches on the various house quest options and let\'s be fantastic.','2015-06-06 05:28:46',NULL),(10027,10659,139,1,'Sense datoken learn','The art will tell you where to go when it\'s evoked. How you get there is your choice, There are shortcuts that connect the planes. Do you know where some are? Seek them and be ready to show me. Sometimes getting there faster will help, It\'s good to be prepared.','2015-06-06 06:33:30',NULL),(10480,10092,13,70,'Return 70','This is a journey that goes back to the beginning. I wish for you to tell me the tale of guardDog, from first dream up until the now. I would like for you to hit all the highs and lows of your journey thus far. Also, return to a few places where you should have turned right instead of left and tell me what you think you would have done differently. Who inspired you? Who were you angry with? Make this report worthy of a plateau to seventy. **A**','2015-06-07 01:44:50',NULL),(10097,10092,108,1,'Sable Shield','Well you help create the art sonot much to learn on the art itself. So I want you to think on another topic..what would you consider to be  Ultimate Enlightment? And what would you consider to be the ulimate power here?','2015-06-07 02:17:55',NULL),(10107,10455,2,60,'DreamSeer 60','Up until recently we have been able to hunt shams solo, but they seem to have acquired some abilities that allow them to somehow utilize vision.  How are they doing this, and what could the cause be?  Perhaps there is a way to remedy this, and if so, how would be go about implementing this remedy?\r\n','2015-06-08 04:05:36',NULL),(10455,10654,139,1,'Rasputin-DatokLearn',' I\'d like you use the idea of sense datoken for one not showing as learnable and use that  as reason your university should exist. Be that fixing, etcetra. Be as creative as your like with it. Finally, theorize about the datoken, do they have a sense dreamer art? How might the art itself work?\r\n','2015-06-08 04:25:27',NULL),(10480,10022,29,50,'Quest: Akkadian','Reward for Undergames. Plateau in Poison. \r\n','2015-06-08 05:17:56',NULL),(10480,10455,52,20,'Train 20','Time for us to look at what you have learned. I wish for you to be completely honest with yourself and think of what your strengths and weaknesses are as a teacher. When we meet, we will discuss anything that you think you need help with. I also want you to write 4 sample plateau to 20 tasks for me for the arts of your choice. We will also discuss those. Dig deep and really look into your role as a teacher. **A**','2015-06-08 06:24:01',NULL),(10027,10654,139,10,'sense datoken 10','as per a bunlde quest comopleted by me','2015-06-08 07:13:06',NULL),(10066,10455,142,1,'Misdirection Learn','Seeking supports for a sphere requires some sort of interview process to be had before receiving a support. Consider what misdirections or misconceptions dreamers may promise to do with their new sphere and not follow through with. What will you follow through with?','2015-06-09 04:07:20',NULL),(10066,10385,1,40,'Gatekeeper 40','We have a lot of work to do as a focus. Devise a feasible plan to entice Gatekeepers to attend and participate the guild meetings so we can be more productive in our goals. Your plan should be enticing, well thought out and maintainable. Present your idea at a guild meeting.','2015-06-09 04:21:17',NULL),(10550,10010,144,1,'CW Basic Mastery','This mission will require you fortify your efforts for the Under Olympics. It should serve as a \"Chaos Well\" that serves as a healthy distraction which keeps people\'s mind off things. Consult with at least three people you are close to, and see how your efforts will guarantee success on Sunday.','2015-06-09 04:33:46',NULL),(10238,10117,40,40,'Hear No Evil','You are now deaf.  Use these ear plugs often as you are inflicted with a loud piecing noise that drowns out all other noises.  Grab your ears, wince in pain, and see how others communicate with you once they know your infliction and how they go about communicating with you.   Which of your senses stepped up when your hearing went down.  Mostly... just enjoy yourself.  ~Wish','2015-06-10 00:18:37',NULL),(10029,10032,67,20,'Soulreaper: 20','The blade of the plains, the blade of the clan, the blade of your grandfather - The spirit and pride of your people is alive in your mind and because of this has flowed from you into the city around us. Turn your minds eye to these powerful markers throughout the city and with them bring to me design of the blade that would embody those things I mentioned at the beginning of this quest.','2015-06-11 02:58:28',NULL),(10092,10027,142,1,'Misdirection','Misdirection can be used many different ways.  Talk to dreamers that have it and I want you to tell me how they have used it either in an offensive or defensive way.  What annoys people so much about this Art?','2015-06-11 05:58:33',NULL),(10027,10264,47,1,'push learn','as per my bundle silver','2015-06-11 12:24:13',NULL),(10027,10264,48,1,'SE to learn','reward as per a completed bunle quest by me','2015-06-11 12:25:39',NULL),(10027,10264,9,1,'free action learn','this is a one of yoru portective arst as a gatekeepers you can get this strongr than others\r\n','2015-06-11 12:28:14',NULL),(10027,10264,7,1,'resist fear to lear','as a reward for a bundle done by myself andd completed sil','2015-06-11 12:29:41',NULL),(10027,10264,8,1,'protection learn','reward as per a bundle quest by myself silver','2015-06-11 12:30:50',NULL),(10107,10027,16,50,'ID 50 - LadySilver','Apart from the benefit of a faster evoke, the only benefit to platting an art like Identify is to be able to teach a plateau of this level.  I\'d like you to think how the dream could be better at improving arts beyond evoke times.  Focus on Identify in this case, and determine how it could be strengthened.  Furthermore, think of a method we could use to identify remotely to identify items from a distance.','2015-06-12 04:44:07',NULL),(10107,10455,23,60,'Recharge 60','For fun, let\'s do some random acts of kindness.  I want you to recharge all the items to max in the Evernight Plateau, Ossuary of Dread, Lost Caves and Threshold Caves Caches.  Place a forged note stating that it was a service offered by the DreamSeers of Underlight.  If something vapes, replace it with something else.  I\'d like you to also aid Varwyn on her item research, ask her what she needs done.\r\n','2015-06-13 05:47:06',NULL),(10455,10107,103,1,'Beqeuath OfF Kilter','I want you to think up things that have made the City unique. Like you, and the Zug Zug bit. It can be within your home, or the wider City in general. Once you\'ve done that, secretly encourage someone to come up with their own addition, or start a new legacy yourself!','2015-06-13 06:05:58',NULL),(10027,10232,25,20,'Reweave 20','A tale to tell and you are the bard. Weave us a story and share with any who will listen. You have such a wonderful gift to share it will get you t he plateau you seek, I need to know the words you spoke and the ears that heard them.','2015-06-13 15:30:48',NULL),(10066,10108,9,20,'Free Action 20','Identify a negative bond that has hold of the house or one of its members. Create a solution on how to free the house or dreamer from this bond. Address this negative bond to a few house members or the specific dreamer it pertains to. Record all details.','2015-06-14 03:58:51',NULL),(10026,10098,13,40,'Return 40','Create 4 items for 4 different people and return them as if they lost them, and never knew, create an interesting story behind how you found the item, and reaction from the people you picked\r\n','2015-06-14 21:24:57',NULL),(10232,10694,26,1,'Yambe - Purify','Purify your understanding of a plane of your choice (with the exception of Threshold, or Library). Explore every room available to you, and think about the purpose of the plane. Which rooms are for what? Make certain to make use of the art Know whilst you explore, for further understanding! Ensure a thorough report. ','2015-06-14 22:54:50',NULL),(10480,10107,85,1,'Quest: Akkadian','With the approval of some of the Forging CIrcle and after an interview of my own, I am granting Off Kilter the DreamSmith art.\r\n','2015-06-15 04:11:10',NULL),(10480,10455,20,60,'Blast 60','Blast is at the core of every DreamSeer. Some use it as a menacing  weapon while others ignore it. I want for you try Blast out on the mares and see if it works on them as they have evolved. Also, if Blast have a counter, it is Reflect. Find a way to get around that counter for the honor of all Seers. Work with as many Seers as you need to come up with a way that Seers can get Blast to be more effective against Reflect. I expect you to discuss this with more than one Seer. Pick 5 that you admire. **A**','2015-06-15 05:01:06',NULL),(10480,10276,12,30,'Shatter 30','As a fellow GateKeeper, I have always wondered why you learn Shatter later than you learn Ward. I wish for you to think about this problem and give me your best research on the matter. Speak to as many people as you need to get the information to support your thoughts. When you have finished, find me and we shall discuss. **A**','2015-06-15 05:25:30',NULL),(10029,10276,144,1,'Chaos Well: Learn','I could bore you with facts about the Chaos Well not absorbing trapped essences, the fact every belief system has accepted the Chaos Well, or any number and expected drivel - What I instead would like to focus on are the aspects of your own duality. Reflect on the past, present and your future to consider moments when you yourself have acted in ways that upon reflection seem wholy surprising. And yes, I did mean to say future. What mysterious dreams might you have?','2015-06-15 05:40:07',NULL),(10480,10276,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Missing Support Sphere art as part of teacher arts.\r\n','2015-06-15 05:48:04',NULL),(10029,10067,142,1,'Misdirection. Learn','Find a creative way to deal with Calenture that allows us to look \'zen\' while they continue to posture. Let us find a way to fight this agression brewing with our intoxicating blend of science and spirituality without having to come to blows.','2015-06-15 06:45:20',NULL),(10027,10067,139,40,'Sense datoke 40','This is a set of three as thats that works for me. The old dark and the new dark mares are all mixed up. Sirens and hyrbids and kotok and the yaya sisters. The union the keeper are the really house stealers. Please sort this out so that I might be able to \'share what i learn from you so i don/t have to say I don\'t have a clue','2015-06-15 06:49:04',NULL),(10027,10385,47,10,'Push to 10','You are the new game master! Use push use pull make me a game thats fun for all. It can be tag or hide and seek but whatever you deicde be sure its fun, Get back tome when your quest is through and we can think of other thiings to do','2015-06-15 20:03:29',NULL),(10010,10694,47,1,'Push-Yambe-Akka','Push allows you to push other dreamers in the physical sense. I want you to come up with at least 5 unique ways that you or others around you can be pushed. ~Cryst~','2015-06-16 01:59:51',NULL),(10550,10104,16,20,'Identify: [19,20]','Recently, several ideas have sprung up regarding focal bonuses, such as GKs and their damage bonus. What type of passive bonus should SM\'s have in your opinion, and why? This could be the start of something big. Be creative, and share this with at least two other SM\'s to gather their collective thought. Were you successful in identify\'ing one way to work towards SM progression?','2015-06-16 03:13:50',NULL),(10029,10027,144,30,'Chaos Well: 30','I am of the mind that the corruption from the Soul Essence has made its way into the very heart of Clarity. I ask you to look to the spirits of the woods the moon and other mystical powers to gather samples without detection and find if this dark power is in fact hungering within the core of Clarity. Be as an insight witch, the Chaos Well your detection device and cauldron.','2015-06-16 04:52:03',NULL),(10027,10232,142,1,'MisDirection learn','This direction that direction which is the best reaction. This art can be fun but it has several uses. Can you think of some or find them out from others that have the art? The key is to use what works and how this works will be you key in that is what the reward will be.','2015-06-16 19:26:24',NULL),(10027,10275,17,10,'id curse to 10','reward for completeion codex for bundle to ten from drieko  Silver','2015-06-16 20:03:36',NULL),(10027,10275,14,10,'know to 10','reward for completion codex to ten by dreiko silver','2015-06-16 20:05:39',NULL),(10027,10275,98,10,'newly awakend to 10','reward for completion codex to ten from drieko sil','2015-06-16 20:07:01',NULL),(10027,10275,15,20,'judgment to 20','reward for completion codex for bundle to 20 shoury sil','2015-06-16 20:08:50',NULL),(10027,10275,139,30,'Sense Datoken 30','reward for completion codex bundle to thirty from drieko ','2015-06-16 20:10:41',NULL),(10027,10275,14,20,'know to 20','reward for completion codex for 20 shoury','2015-06-16 20:12:16',NULL),(10027,10275,98,20,'newly awakened  20','reward for completion codex bundle 20  shoury','2015-06-16 20:13:20',NULL),(10027,10275,14,30,'know 30','reward for completion codex for bundle 30  from drieko','2015-06-16 20:15:19',NULL),(10027,10275,17,20,'id curse to 20','reward for competion codex for bundle 20 shoury','2015-06-16 20:18:22',NULL),(10027,10275,98,30,'newly awakened 30','reward for completion codex for bundle to 30 from drieko','2015-06-16 20:22:57',NULL),(10027,10275,15,30,'judgment to 30','reward for completion codex for bundle to 30 for drieko','2015-06-16 20:27:25',NULL),(10027,10275,17,30,'id curse to 30','reward for completion codex for bundle to 30 for drieko','2015-06-16 20:31:03',NULL),(10027,10053,36,30,'KE Dreamblade to 30','Forge me blade all shiney and new. with images and symbols and a history too. Make it orginal or bring a memory back to the dream. How you this is up to you. Share it with those close to you and pass on the story. ','2015-06-19 04:06:39',NULL),(10092,10062,1,50,'GK 50','For this task I want you to think of the role of GateKeepers as the warriors and the beliefs of the 4 open Houses.. past beliefs and present beliefs.. why is it that some have more GateKeepers than others.. tell me the active GateKeepers in each House and how you feel it affects the structure of their House.  Go in detail that is worthy of a 5th plateau.','2015-06-19 05:59:21',NULL),(10066,10232,22,20,'Forge Talisman 20','Discover a power source within the city that will serve you as one did in Idoaclesia. Craft a device that can store energy from the power source. Create another talisman that interacts with the energy from the energy storage talisman in a useful way that could be beneficial for the city. Demonstrate the use of the talisman with the power source to me.','2015-06-21 04:05:52',NULL),(10107,10232,47,50,'Push 50 - Em\'et','As the realms of Idoaclesia and Underlight are being pushed together into the same space, what portions would you keep separated?  What would you push back into their own domains in the hope they don\'t impact our dream?  What would you push forward into the new dream? Finally, take a dreamer to Mt. Illapse and find the highest point that you can push a dreamer off of a cliff.  How far do they have to fall in order to sustain damage?','2015-06-22 02:53:26',NULL),(10107,10455,36,60,'Dreamblade 60','I\'d like for you to consider why the dream cannot generate blades in the fonts.  Come up with a means to develop a blade stable enough to generate in a font.  Further to that, I\'d like you to gather a blade design from one smith or MT of each focus.  Incorporate these into the blade designs.  I\'d also like you to look into the DreamSeer focal item and develop a plan to get it repaired, present this to the Seer meeting if possible.\r\n','2015-06-22 03:27:38',NULL),(10697,10232,7,10,'Resist Fear 10','Resist Fearing. For at least three dreams, don\'t scare anyone.','2015-06-22 05:56:04',NULL),(10027,10312,9,1,'Freeaction to learn','reward for bundle to learn from myself','2015-06-22 21:42:46',NULL),(10027,10312,48,1,'soul evoke to learn','reward from leqrnable nundle by myself','2015-06-22 21:44:36',NULL),(10027,10312,26,1,'purify to learn','reward for learnable bunlde by myself','2015-06-22 21:45:34',NULL),(10027,10312,46,1,'recall to learn','reweard for learnable bundle by me\r\n','2015-06-22 21:46:48',NULL),(10010,10312,98,1,'bundle','','2015-06-22 21:49:23',NULL),(10027,10312,72,1,'inscirbe learn','reward for learnable bundle by me\r\n','2015-06-22 21:49:33',NULL),(10029,10027,89,40,'Soul Shield: Mini','As a Master Teacher and mistress of insight I wish for you to connect to the raw elements of the city. Find a manifestation of your focus power in the city or summon it to you and find that piece of happiness for yourself. Report to me of your experience.','2015-06-23 01:12:23',NULL),(10029,10032,107,1,'Peace Aura: Learn','Perform an act of house service. This can be collecting items, filling two basic Chaos Wells, presenting a Datoken essence, representing the house in some way - You\'re a distinguished man, do what you will do.','2015-06-23 01:23:43',NULL),(10238,10311,44,10,'Flower Power','A storm is brewing!  Find yourself some great crafters and have them design you some Umbrellas (preferably items with DS on them) Then play a game of FireStorm tag - 1 hit and you win.  Pick your targets, they have to carry the Umbrella - and you have to try to sneak up and Firestorm them - doesnt have to be that day, that hour, just nail each of them... trancing, when they least expect it... If they see you evoke, they can say Storms Coming!  And you have to stop... play this game.  Enjoy it mostly.  :-)','2015-06-23 02:02:48',NULL),(10010,10612,60,2,'Sphere 2','So where is Zsa Zsa\'s Doll, what may of really happend to it? Work with the citizens and see if their is really a case here, or just a misplaced Doll. Tell me about the new arts you will soon learn, and what they will mean for your dreams. What do you hope for your future as a GateKeeper?','2015-06-23 02:30:18',NULL),(10098,10232,144,1,'Chaos Well Learn','Learn the functionalities of Chaos Well, which was partly based on information about the nexus from Idoaclesia. I\'d like a comparison between the two. Their practical uses as well as their political meaning in the two cities. \r\nIs more from Idoaclesia in regards to this art transferable? If so, what more can be done to refine it, or expand on it?','2015-06-23 07:00:25',NULL),(10092,10062,13,40,'Return to 40','For this quest.. I want you to give me ideas on how we can restore the GateKeeper Guild back to its former glory.. I also want ideas for 3 different new GateKeeper arts that we can either bring back or create that would be a focus of the reopened GK Guild.','2015-06-23 15:46:21',NULL),(10062,10311,72,20,'Inscribe 20','Using your Inscribe, I would like for you to interview the 5 most influential people to you personally within this city and take note of their story. Produce these stories in a series of codi for the Library.','2015-06-23 15:55:10',NULL),(10027,10062,139,10,'Sense Datoken 10','Be sure your list fot he daymares is current. Also what are four quick ways between planes to get where the art tells you to go. Seek out a few to share the shortcuts with','2015-06-24 03:06:40',NULL),(10027,10067,40,20,'Deafen 20','Hear ye Hear ye or not? You travel the dream hearing so many things. What would you like to hear more of what would you like to hear less of and how can we be sure what needs to be heard is. What resources do we have now? Can we use them better?','2015-06-24 03:57:30',NULL),(10697,10702,102,1,'Quest: Nils','Selika has been updated as to the standards of teaching and has thus earned the art of Quest back.','2015-06-24 22:21:16',NULL),(10697,10702,86,1,'Quest: Nils','Returning teacher.','2015-06-24 22:21:24',NULL),(10697,10702,60,1,'Quest: Nils','Selika has shown through several examples that she understands the difficulty levels of each sphere up to 7th which she can currently write to. She\'s been warned about unsatisfactory tasking.','2015-06-24 23:18:43',NULL),(10697,10702,87,1,'Quest: Nils','returning teacher.\r\n','2015-06-24 23:18:50',NULL),(10697,10311,102,1,'Quest: Nils','Flower has proven she can task with success on her own. I\'ve set stipulations on her tasking as follows: No tasking an art learnable above 3rd sphere. No tasking plateaus for those arts above 20, and only arts that Kaer GeRRoZ can train himself.','2015-06-24 23:33:38',NULL),(10697,10232,60,1,'Quest: Nils','Em\'et has shown he understands what is expected from tasking for Spheres. His five examples were on par with what should be expected of a task at their respective levels.','2015-06-25 00:13:09',NULL),(10010,10063,144,1,'Chaos Well- Sniper','I want you to find out all you can about this art, cost, how it increases per plateau. How will this art help you in your future endeavors in the city ? ~Cryst~','2015-06-25 02:20:01',NULL),(10010,10694,24,1,'Flame, Restore-Bdl','You have learned the beliefs of all the houses. I want you to expand on thie knowledge and tell me as a soulmaster how these beliefs either help or hinder the houses. Can you as a Soulmaster relate your skills to one particular faction over the other. Why or why not ? ~Cryst~','2015-06-26 02:16:25',NULL),(10010,10694,24,1,'Restore learn bndl','','2015-06-26 02:16:25',NULL),(10010,10694,25,1,'Reweave, learn, bnd','','2015-06-26 02:17:28',NULL),(10697,10694,48,1,'Quest: Nils','Reward for completing a bundle task issued by Crystalline.','2015-06-26 02:30:43',NULL),(10697,10694,70,1,'Quest: Nils','Reward for completing a bundle task issued by Crystalline.','2015-06-26 02:30:51',NULL),(10002,10063,60,1,'Quest: Siegward','Returning the art of Sphere to SN!PER after reviewing his five sample quests.','2015-06-26 04:06:47',NULL),(10111,10702,0,40,'JP40: HiRoGIiFiQ','Get familiar with the new OSM and what they are doing to our sacred old hotspot with OUR HOT TUB. What they are doing is blasphemy! Come up with a silly fantasy idea how you & I could kick their asses out and take our home back!','2015-06-26 23:08:46',NULL),(10111,10232,51,40,'Locate40HiRoGIiFiQ','Learn about a bloke named boggen. Who was he? What did he look like, where was his station? Who did he hang with? Also ask around about the four pluss one and if you can\'t find the info I\'ll give it to you!','2015-06-27 03:24:53',NULL),(10027,10021,144,1,'Chaos Well learn','The Chaos Well can \"hold\" wishes too and here is mine. Tell me about a secret some fogot. There was once another crest from the Gathering. Do you know about it and anything you know about the current crest can you share too ','2015-06-27 09:50:57',NULL),(10029,10694,3,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring plateau as part of completed bundle.','2015-06-27 19:07:28',NULL),(10029,10694,32,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring plateau as part of completed bundle.','2015-06-27 19:07:38',NULL),(10029,10694,70,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring plateau as part of completed bundle.','2015-06-27 19:07:45',NULL),(10029,10694,26,10,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-06-27 19:07:53',NULL),(10029,10694,24,10,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-06-27 19:07:57',NULL),(10029,10694,25,10,'Quest: Magnilia','','2015-06-27 19:08:01',NULL),(10029,10694,67,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring plateau as part of completed bundle.','2015-06-27 19:08:08',NULL),(10010,10702,139,10,'Sense Datoken 10','Sense Datoken allows us to sense daymares. I want you to speak with others, and try and get the names of as many of these mares as you can. What makes them different from the Darks ? How can you as a dreamer aide in ridding the city of them? ~Cryst~','2015-06-28 01:21:50',NULL),(10480,10027,2,60,'DreamSeer 60','I am going to ask that you take me on a journey, I want to know how you came to be the Seer that you are. Find for me 6 places that hold special meaning to you as a Seer. What happened there? How did it change you? Who influenced you at that time? Questions of those kind should be answered. When you have you list compiled and have your thoughts together, we will take a trip to those places and you can tell me of your story. **A**','2015-06-28 01:42:48',NULL),(10029,10659,30,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-06-28 06:40:23',NULL),(10029,10659,27,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-06-28 06:40:30',NULL),(10029,10659,29,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-06-28 06:40:37',NULL),(10029,10659,26,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-06-28 06:40:40',NULL),(10029,10659,67,10,'Quest: Magnilia','Honoring as part of a completed bundle.','2015-06-28 06:40:43',NULL),(10232,10027,0,40,'LadySilver - Join40','Join the party together! Brainstorm ideas for how to get dreamers together in places other than boring old normal ones like Threshold or the Library. Try several methods, and see what works best to herd people away from normal hubs. What worked, what didn\'t, and why? Be prepared to discuss. ','2015-06-28 21:22:45',NULL),(10117,10702,144,1,'Chaos Well~Selika~','An interesting art for a former imprisoner and a soulmaster!  Learn about this art. what it does etc.   But \'d like your opinion on this art as an imprisoner, a soulmaster, and a freespirit.  What are its advantages? And welcome home Dear One.','2015-06-29 01:36:39',NULL),(10010,10062,24,20,'Restore 20-Krodoc','I want you to take and think about what restore does. I want you to come up with a unique theory as to how restore works, and why it works in that way. Also, do you think there should be changes made, yes or no, and why ? ~Cryst~','2015-06-29 02:11:41',NULL),(10107,10385,46,10,'Recall 10 - Lance','Since the dreams have merged and there is much research that has to be done, I\'d like for you to dig up some of the old chaos scrolls out there to provide some of the history and information that could be useful.  Find 4 chaos scrolls that are still very relevant to modern dreaming.  Find some way to get that information to the dream for everyone to use.\r\n','2015-06-29 03:59:09',NULL),(10067,10385,25,10,'Reweave 10','I want to know how you think. Please write me a short history about Reweave. It can be something that you know or something you made up. Also, tell me how you think Reweave works. Give me your theories. <T>','2015-06-29 04:13:59',NULL),(10289,10111,96,30,'Quest: LoveTwinkie','Ask five dreamers what they sense about you, and make what they say about you into a story about you in some way.','2015-06-29 04:34:00',NULL),(10010,10062,25,20,'Reweave20- Krodoc','Reweave allows us to return a sheild back to its original state, however, recharge allows a Seer to do the same with all other items. Tell me why reweave cannot be recharged, and what makes it different from recharge. If you could make any changes to the art, would you, and if so what changes? ~Cryst~','2015-06-30 00:04:16',NULL),(10550,10010,72,50,'Insc. - 5th Mastery','There are many archives in the Library that may be dated or incorrect. Your mission is to scan the Sphere 1 & 2 Libraries and check for accuracy and updates to the data to reflect current times. Bring Logix with you sometimes. Update at least one of the incorrect codii after confirming that it is incorrect. We must avoid incorrect data being passed down to future generations!','2015-06-30 00:59:13',NULL),(10053,10027,99,1,'Quest: Combine-LS','For Combine,1. research the history of the art, 2.why was the art a guild art? 3.how does it actually work? 4.How and why is this art the only 6th sphere seer art? 5.Ask all the elders at what orbit can this art now be attained.Find all this info and we will discuss...','2015-06-30 01:45:47',NULL),(10092,10062,13,50,'Return 50','The Order has long been a place of strength in the City.  Tell me how we can get the Order back to the House of the greatest strength where it belongs.  How can we tweak recruiting.. anything.. give me 5 good ideas to drive membership that will Return the Order to Glory!','2015-07-01 05:00:51',NULL),(10027,10067,17,40,'Id Curse to 40','You have ben given pieces to a puzzle. What does your insight see in the words of our Lady Justice. There were witnesses and you have the words and youri nisght .What do you see seer?','2015-07-01 06:01:03',NULL),(10111,10232,5,40,'Random40HiRoGIiFiQ','Yog-Ka, Sabra, Dr Carl G Jung, Tehthu... what do these 4 names have in common? Find out the events that took place regarding that commonality and tell me what you think this task might have to do with the art of Random!','2015-07-01 23:47:21',NULL),(10232,10710,24,1,'Alek - Restore','Search throughout the Dream city for something you think could use some Restoring -- what is it, and how did it come to its state of disrepair? If you don\'t know precisely, ask around, theorize. How might you go about restoring it to its former glory? Ensure a thorough report. ','2015-07-03 00:44:31',NULL),(10022,10232,9,20,'Em\'et FA 20','Some people may take for granted their ability to move about freely. People do not appreciate things they have until they have been lost. Forge an object, the object is of your choosing, it can be anything you like but it must contain the effect of paralyze with the highest duration you can muster. See how many people can can get to use the item without \"checking\" what it is. This process is also up to you, you\'re a trickster... figure it out. ~.|','2015-07-03 01:43:12',NULL),(10010,10694,60,2,'Sphere 2','Find out what you can about the wordsmith mark, and find out why the meetings ceased to exist. Hold a meeting if possible. ~Cryst~','2015-07-03 02:26:01',NULL),(10062,10010,108,1,'Sable Shield | Lrn','Bring in 10 full chaos wells to the house and have someone keep track of the energy you brought in.','2015-07-03 04:03:15',NULL),(10010,10062,72,30,'Inscribe 30-Krodoc','You are working hard to get all your arts maxxed. I want you to inscribe either a history or a theory of how inscribe works within the walls of the city, one that you can choose to share with either just me, or put into one of the lower halls of the library. The choice is yours to make. ~Cryst~','2015-07-03 04:12:06',NULL),(10027,10455,99,1,'Combine to learn','I have heard the tribe has some trials here in the city. Find out who and what they were and how the faired. What are these about and how are they connected to the Gathering. Combine the deatils and comes share with me','2015-07-03 05:33:56',NULL),(10480,10022,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Regranting Quest as per completion of the Bladenarius roleplay.\r\n','2015-07-03 06:20:11',NULL),(10480,10022,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Reinstating BladeSlayers Master Teacher status as per our agreement with full understanding of the new rules and the violations and what would occur.\r\n','2015-07-03 06:25:39',NULL),(10479,10022,60,8,'BladeSlayer Sphere8','Lead your house and any others willing to assist in this endevour and attempt to remove the Darkmares at the Keeper\'s house or harm them in some signficant way worthy of 8th sphere.  This effort should involve more than just leading raids on their house.  Come up with a unique way(s) to do this and lead the attempt(s) to do so, utilizing the aid from others.  ','2015-07-03 07:56:10',NULL),(10480,10455,69,60,'TranceFlame 60','I want you to hold a little competition. Make it friendly and fun. Hold a flame duel with at least six participants total. The ins and outs of the fun is up to you. You could see who can collapse a bogram first or ago. What ever you decide. Keep track and be detailed. Also, find me three places where your inner fire is ignited. We may take a journey there.  Pick two others to see what their inner flame ignites. **A**','2015-07-03 08:34:18',NULL),(10550,10232,89,40,'SS - 4th Mastery','Many FateSenders have lost their sense of purpose.. especially those from Idocleasia due to the lack of breakthrough. Explore your connection to the Lucidity element with at least one other FateSender if possible. Explore the hottest.. firey areas of the City with Soul Shield as protection. Answers for the \"evolution and progression\" of your focus should come out of this. Place your findings in the Library after we discuss your findings.\r\n','2015-07-03 17:01:19',NULL),(10010,10062,17,10,'ID Curse 10-Krodoc','There are many ways in which one can be cursed. I want you to come up with at least 3 ways. After you have come up with them, I want you to tell me how you would eliminate them. Can they be eliminated. ~Cryst~','2015-07-03 21:17:08',NULL),(10010,10232,17,10,'ID Curse 10- Em\'et','ID curse allows us to find out if a dreamer is cursed or not. I want you to uncover the history for this art, how was it created, could it be enhanced ? If so how ? What are your feelings in regards to the art itself? I would also like for you to place the history of ID curse in one of the halls of the library. ~Cryst~\r\n','2015-07-04 22:06:50',NULL),(10455,10232,144,10,'Chaos Well 10 - Em','I want you to create a well of a different sort, in your mind, and atleast the shell of one. This well should, and can be for any other object except for energy. Be it a string of chakrams, alterors, be creative, theorize and bring me something to demonstrate the idea.\r\n','2015-07-05 05:06:24',NULL),(10107,10232,22,30,'Scribe 30 - Part 3','This is the final part of my tasking for Em\'et\'s Forge 30 task.  Em\'et, you have a unique style that is very complimentary to my own, but with a twist.  I\'d like you to come up with an original creation of something that existed in your former city that does not exist here. I\'ll be looking for how you capture the essence of that dream. Try to impart what it would be like in our current setting.','2015-07-05 06:15:33',NULL),(10232,10702,142,1,'Misdirect - Selika','As you return to the City, there\'s so much to discover and relearn. Yet not everyone will represent the data in every light. Someone, invariably, will attempt to misdirect you, and make you see things in only the best possible light for themselves. I ask you to sniff this out, and listen to all sides. Who is trying to decieve you, and how? Ensure a thorough report. ','2015-07-06 01:08:43',NULL),(10697,10232,80,30,'Hypnotic Weave 30','Hypnotic Weave has always struck me as an art that serves no other purpose than for show and has no real useful application where its cost and time involved make it worth using. Earn your plateau by proving me wrong.','2015-07-06 04:02:05',NULL),(10018,10232,7,20,'RF 20','You seem to use MB like a crutch. Attempt to go at least two dreams without using it on yourself. In the mean time, find a place or something else to lend you some peace in its absense. Were you able to fully break the habit? Why or why not?','2015-07-06 04:25:00',NULL),(10010,10694,98,1,'Newly Learn-Yambe','Newly Awakened will tell you that a newly is in the city. Do you think there should be more to this art? If so, what changes would you make to the art ? I would also like you to ponder on how this art actually picks up on the aura of the newly ? Mostly, have fun!! ~Cryst~','2015-07-06 04:30:37',NULL),(10550,10027,144,40,'CW - 4th Mastery','Elders - please see the task for Chaos Well that I accidentally targetted Selika with - that was meant for LadySilver. I will keep that in my pack for your review. I will hold on to it for a week - thank you.','2015-07-06 17:24:25',NULL),(10027,10067,21,40,'Blend 40','Create for me a series of four items your choice of materials that will show the dream what it means to be a Dreamseer but more important the Dreamseer you are. Share your creation with your Home and others if you wish but mostly see yourself my prince.','2015-07-07 04:01:23',NULL),(10027,10232,8,20,'Protection 20','What things in the dream need to be protecting? What\'s the best way to do that?  Any story in your collection about protecting you can share. So many enjoy yrou gift how you share it up to you.','2015-07-08 05:06:09',NULL),(10232,10108,39,40,'Clarity - Stagger40','The FateSender focus has been staggering out of the gate, and still we sputter. We should be ruling this Dream! So why aren\'t we? Breakthrough, as you may have heard, was one solution but still flawed. Brainstorm some other solutions with some fellow FateSenders, and develop a plan for moving foward. How can we solve problems long-term, instead of just creating a shiny new art for ourselves? Ensure a thorough report. ','2015-07-08 17:59:49',NULL),(10107,10067,99,1,'Combine - Tamarisk','The art of Combine is no longer a guild art.  There are many who dislike the art and some who like it.  I\'d like you to present to the current guild, which is now open, how you think the art should be taught and if there are to be requirements.  I\'d also like you to talk about abuse of the art in conjunction with the art of forge talisman.\r\n','2015-07-09 04:41:02',NULL),(10107,10654,99,1,'Comibe - Rasputin','For the art of Combine I\'d like you to do a little research and see if there is anything of an existing history for the art. There might not be much in the way of records, but see what you can find. There\'s a bit of controversy with the art being used in conjunction with forge. What do you think the punishment should be, and who should be responsible for monitoring abuse?  ','2015-07-09 05:04:57',NULL),(10654,10694,72,1,'Yambe InscribeLearn','Inscribe is most often used to record information about the dream. Soon you will begin to be able to learn many minor arts of other foci. Seek out information about all the minor arts of other focii. When are you able to learn them compaired to those of that focus? How did you find this information? Which arts are you most excited to learn?','2015-07-09 06:25:20',NULL),(10232,10717,47,1,'Will - Push','The ability to push another seems so simple, yet we cannot do it without an Art, in the City of Dreams. What power does Pushing another dreamer have? Ask around, talk to Dreamers you\'ve met. What good is pushing people, and what\'s the best use of push, in their opinion? Speak to at least three others on this, but the more you speak to, the better. Ensure a thorough report. ','2015-07-09 20:35:11',NULL),(10027,10232,103,1,'Bequeath to learn','The art of giving. See what there is to find out there on this art and think was ways you might use it. Mind you this art has to be used as a reward for something. The cost is what you double what you give.','2015-07-09 20:57:21',NULL),(10111,10232,5,50,'Random50HiRoGIiFiQ','Confide via whispers to an emphant, a bogrom & an agoknight-- tell them random problems you are having & record their responses. Then find a dreamseer, a soulmaster, a gatekeeper & another fatesender & do the same. Who gave the best advice?','2015-07-10 00:51:44',NULL),(10111,10702,46,50,'Recall50HiRoGIiFiQ','You and me. A bottle of pinot. OSM hot tub. We\'re gonna go tell stories of things that happened back when the Order was the best house ever... back in the good ole\' days. Invite whomever you want. ','2015-07-10 01:21:52',NULL),(10480,10108,52,10,'Train to 10','In this next step of your training, I would like for you to speak with at least two Master Teachers and three ordained teachers, their train does not matter, and discuss with them the significance of raising your train to ten. I want you to ponder what the difference between a learnable task and a plateau task. Find teachers that you trust and ask any questions that you might have, ask their advise, ask for tips and tricks. Gather as much information as you are able and then we will have a discussion. **A*','2015-07-10 04:04:57',NULL),(10480,10600,52,10,'Train 10','For this task you are to lean on your fellow teachers. I wish for you to find six teachers that you hold in high reguards and speak with them to learn all that you can about plateaus. I also want you to learn about the bundle system. Be well versed in it for our next talk. Bring with you three examples of plateuas to 10 in the arts of your choice. **A**','2015-07-10 04:52:57',NULL),(10480,10232,82,30,'Terror - to 30','You wield a Stick of Fear - How hard is it to duel whilst scared for your life!  You will find two dreamers - Scare them with your stick of horror... and have them blade duel.  Can you fight scared?  Can they?  Learn a strategy that works well?  If your going to terrorize dreamers, one should learn how to deal with how they might fact back.  Have these battles at min 6 times(different dreamers).  Get me some thoughts on how they fought successfully or unsuccessfully - but mostly have fun!','2015-07-10 05:28:23',NULL),(10062,10276,68,40,'Flame 40 | hanna','Search the city for a flame that either needs to be snuffed out or lit brighter than ever before. Gather dreamers from both cities to accomplish this, and ensure the deed fits the reward. You\'ve free reign here to make a difference! Let\'s see what you\'ve got, GateKeeper!','2015-07-10 05:29:50',NULL),(10010,10065,25,20,'Reweave 20-Ace','Reweave allows you to fix a sheild. I want you to come up with a theory as to how this happens. I want you to also tell me three other things that could be rewoven. What are the good points and bad points of reweave? ~Cryst~','2015-07-10 05:41:42',NULL),(10092,10062,22,20,'Forge 20','There are certain colors that each focii can use and others cannot..  I want you to talk to members of each focii that have Forge.. and another GK and tell me why each of those colors were granted to that focus.. go through each one in the spectrum for each focus.','2015-07-10 06:32:50',NULL),(10092,10232,74,60,'MB 60','MindBlank\'s necessity is hindered by low population and sense dreamer.. how can we re-invent this art.. I want you to come up with 6 creative ways that we can use MindBlank in today\'s City that would give it purpose again.','2015-07-10 06:55:12',NULL),(10092,10010,60,6,'Quest: guardDog','','2015-07-10 07:17:49',NULL),(10108,10065,89,1,'Ace - SS - Learn','Soul Sheild protects against Mindblank. Be it from others mindblanking you, or you keeping others from mindblanking. But that\'s boring. What other uses can you come up with that Soul Sheild can be used? Give me a pratical useage or two, and a at least three fun or creative uses for the art. Also, see if you can find out the history, though it\'s not required for completion, I\'m just curious.','2015-07-10 18:48:42',NULL),(10111,10108,43,50,'Para50: HiRoGIiFiQ','Evoke Paralyze on dreamers during events where it is frowned upon. Successfully paralyze 5 dreamers and then inscribe SorryNotSorry notes & give to them. Report the tea to me, gurl','2015-07-10 19:53:52',NULL),(10107,10018,142,1,'Misdirection - Jade','Misdirection is the simplest and most effective form of illusion there is.  Simply by allowing someone to observe something that goes against their traditional perception or perspective.  Think of how our house can use this skill to do two things: 1-increase our membership and 2- increase our standing in the dream. This is just an opportunity to generate ideas.\r\n','2015-07-11 05:46:04',NULL),(10027,10010,21,20,'Blend to 20','The colors of the dream are awesome. Can you change your look to blend in areas of the city so you are unseen without an art? You can use the light and shadows of course but try to create a camouflage. Have fun!','2015-07-12 04:19:53',NULL),(10010,10065,9,10,'FA 10- Acerrav','Free Action allows you to move around when others try to paralyze you. I want you to develop a theory about how this works. What is the effect to the avatar? Do you think that it could have a negative effect, if so, how would it come to be? ~Cryst~','2015-07-12 04:36:06',NULL),(10027,10455,118,10,'House memebers 10','Share  the information  if you have rosters of current all house members and freespirits. Gather the birthdays your family. its nice to have parties and its a great excuse. What other things can we celebrate?  Lookign forward to yrou report.','2015-07-12 04:53:32',NULL),(10107,10696,69,1,'Tranceflame -Gilliy','For the completion of a bundle task.  FangX enquired with Akkadian, and was told it was acceptable for tasks that predate the teaching change allegedly. I am taking his word on it.','2015-07-12 05:22:53',NULL),(10107,10696,47,1,'Bundle task ','For the redemption of her bundle task.','2015-07-12 05:23:01',NULL),(10107,10696,98,1,'Bundle Redemption','This is for the completion of her bundle task, unsphered.  ','2015-07-12 05:23:12',NULL),(10107,10455,19,60,'Vision 60','I\'d like you to bring some visions of the future of the city to the current dream. I\'d like you to become a true Seer, in that you can see what is to come.  I\'d like you to make these predictions and have a gathering of many dreamers to declare these visions with. Perhaps those of the Coalition may be able to assist in visions with the future.  If not, you\'ll have to find a way to convince the dream of what is to come.\r\n','2015-07-12 05:26:25',NULL),(10107,10030,20,60,'Blast 60 - Varwyn','Blast seems to have some conflicting results on mares. Datoken and Kotoke can be blasted from their respective sides with no hesitation or penalty.  This changes, however, when you evoke on common mares other than Bogroms or Emphants.  I\'d like you to determine why that is. Perhaps there is weakness in the Datoken and Kotoke that can be exploited.  I\'d like you to experiment on the common mares and see if there is a chink in their proverbial armor that is being missed by the dream.\r\n','2015-07-12 06:10:32',NULL),(10232,10010,40,20,'Quartz - Deafen 20','You snooty Seers and your ability to learn Identify before ALLLL the rest of us is just, uhh... snooty. I\'d like for you to spend 3 Dreams without evoking Identify even once -- you may ask others to Identify for you, but you must pretend you do not know the art. Be prepared to discuss the experience around report time. ','2015-07-12 21:21:46',NULL),(10010,10232,17,20,'ID Curse 20- Em\'et','You are a natural historian, you are adept with words. I want you to create a story of how ID curse came to be. I want it to be interesting, I want it to perhaps stretch the realm of what the art can currently do.Once you have done this, I want you to share it with myself, and then place it on the boards for others to enjoy. Remember, it does not need to hold to the current history. Be creative, and inventive. ~Cryst~','2015-07-12 21:30:38',NULL),(10092,10062,6,50,'Med to 50','For this I want to reflect on the 5 rooms in the City that mean the most to you.  Take a couple dreamers on a Tour of Krodoc\'s Dream and give them information on why these rooms mean so much to you.  Report back to me with the information and who you took on your tour.','2015-07-13 05:36:42',NULL),(10027,10258,69,1,'Tranceflame learn','Travel the dream and find me flames five differant ones. Remeber where they are becasue I will you to show me them. Ask some dreamers you see which they use more their blade or flame and why? You will need to let me know who you spoke with and what they said. Come seek me out and we will talk more.','2015-07-14 02:18:04',NULL),(10027,10258,60,1,'sphere 1 for puned','previosu codex for random','2015-07-14 02:45:35',NULL),(10027,10654,144,20,'Chaos Well to 20','Gathering up dreamers wishes. The ones they have for themselves and the ones the have for the dream. Think of ways we as fellow dreamers can help fufill them in general.','2015-07-14 06:57:38',NULL),(10029,10022,81,30,'Vampiric D. : 30','As fate would have it our work was not as cohesive and organized as we might have liked it to be during your ordeal. To make up for the shortfall of direct interaction between yourself and I spend the week not only testing methods to reduce the integrity of the essence towards our poison work but also looking for tidbits that may be useful in our forthcoming work with Draw itself. Share the Poison related results with the Guild as you are able.','2015-07-15 02:14:56',NULL),(10010,10062,72,40,'Inscribe 40-Krodoc','We all know the uses for Inscribe. If this art could be improved, how would you go about it, be very detailed. I also want you to tell me what you use this art the most for? Is it for passing notes, so that you can communicate in a room silently? Is it for placing information in the Library ? ~Cryst~','2015-07-15 02:43:51',NULL),(10702,10232,75,40,'Show 40~ Em\'et','You seem to be well known and well like around the City, as well as knowledgeable. Try taking some of your knowledge (history) and showing it to the City in some form (more than just a codex).~ ','2015-07-16 01:27:07',NULL),(10232,10111,139,1,'HiRo - Sense Datoke','Sense Datoken among your fellow DREAMERS! They\'re smelly like mares, honest to goodness they are. Observe your fellow Dreamers to find mare-like qualities in them, and decide if those qualities are mare-like because dreamers are similar to mares, or because that individual is an idiot. Find at least three instances of mare-like behavior for me, and be creative with it. ','2015-07-16 19:06:08',NULL),(10027,10258,36,10,'Dreamblade to 10','Cuts like a knife. There are so many things that can get \"cut\" find me a few it the dreams and some your insight can sense.  What would you cut out of the dream if you could? What will you new blade do differantly than your first one?','2015-07-16 22:50:00',NULL),(10697,10098,60,8,'Quest: Nils','','2015-07-17 17:34:24',NULL),(10232,10258,47,1,'Puned - Push','I like new Dreamers to know what\'s out there, particularly in regard to dangers. Push can be used to counter arts, but what is out there that is worth countering? Discuss with at least three Dreamers possible uses for Push, and come back to discuss with me -- what\'s useful with the art, what isn\'t? Ensure a thorough report. ','2015-07-17 19:56:28',NULL),(10025,11028,26,20,'purify to 20','Within the short time i have known you, you seem very full of life and enjoy having fun so lets have some fun. l would like you to create some of your yummy treats, use only the purest ingrdiants , set up a stand around the city, thresh is the busiest usually, entice at least 6 dreamers to \"ask\" for your delectable goods, the only rule is you can\'t offer them to them, Deal? when you have completed your quest seek me out and we will have tea and talk.~P~','2016-07-05 00:24:54','2016-06-14 02:50:10'),(10027,10053,144,1,'chaos well learn','The wells carry essenses. What else might serve the dream if it was put in a contianer. Do we have and histories where containers were useful. How do you see these wells aiding you.','2015-07-18 22:28:28',NULL),(10010,10710,18,30,'Chamele 30-Alek','Chamele allows us to hide in the shadows. I want you to try and hide in the shadows. The catch is, you cannot use chamele or invis to do so. How are you going to do this ? What was the reaction of those around you ? Do you feel that chamele can be improved upon? If so, how ? ~Cryst~','2015-07-18 23:37:07',NULL),(10216,10027,21,50,'Blend/50','We have discussed the Teaching System at length as well as a proposal for a University of Dreams. Let\'s blend together teaching ideas from your peers and devise a cirriculum for our teachers. Cover standards, practices, and consequences. Blending these ideas even further, lets explore how to raise the teaching system to its highest echelons. ','2015-07-19 04:24:00',NULL),(10029,10659,3,30,'Soulmaster: 30','As someone who seems resolved to underestimate himself and hang back I would like for you to use this experiment with the essence provided you to step outside of your comfort zone some. Drawing on the core of who you are and what methods inspire or interest you conduct a series of experiements on the essence. Keep detailed accounts of what you do and the results as I would like you to share the experiences with the guild to assist in the larger goal.','2015-07-19 08:04:50',NULL),(10027,10258,60,2,'Sphere 2','After a detailed interveiw as the the houses and the roles in the draems and his advacnement it is my beleif she is ready fro seocns sphere','2015-07-19 18:06:16',NULL),(10027,10258,16,1,'Id to learn','Insight is what we use to see what cannot be seen sometimes. Identify what other might be hiding. You can be silly or serious and compeltely wrong. Ask them the questions you need to come up with your deduction five dreamers at least please. I will need names, questions and results.','2015-07-20 12:58:13',NULL),(10027,10734,47,1,'Push to learn','What can be pushed you asked well a few things. Ask around and see what dreamers share with you. A special task is to find a gatekeeper and ask if they would show you how a ward can be push. Tell me who you spoke with what they said and which gatekeeper assisted you. I hoep you ahve fun meeting dreamers.','2015-07-21 07:26:21',NULL),(10027,10258,19,1,'Vision to learn','Readiness Training. Batttle and hunting have some things the same and some differant. Envision what might be the best practices. Ask others what they see as the right way to do things. Try them out are the right for you. Share what you discover.','2015-07-21 23:04:09',NULL),(10027,10732,36,40,'DreamBlade to 40','Create four items that signify was dreamseers are with your insight. Display them in The Insight Hall in the teaching guild after they are presented at the Dreamseers Guild meeting thats on Tuesday at 7 bells. ','2015-07-22 02:33:36',NULL),(10480,10732,102,1,'Rafe Quest Return','Create 3 sample tasks that you can show to an elder and speak with a few other teachers about the current standards!  Once you are done, bring your samples to myself, Akkadian, Nils or Siegward!  I\'m sure they will be great!','2015-07-22 03:37:01',NULL),(10480,10732,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After speaking with Rafe about teaching, I have returned his Quest art to him. \r\n','2015-07-22 03:37:01',NULL),(10480,10732,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted Support Train to Rafe.\r\n','2015-07-22 03:38:09',NULL),(10480,10732,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granted Support Sphere to Rafe.\r\n','2015-07-22 03:38:33',NULL),(10480,10027,52,50,'Train 50','For this journey, I would like for you to keep a journal for three week detailing everything teaching that you are working on. Who you tasked, who reported, what arts, and so forth. Make this a \"My Teaching\" journal. When you are finished, find me and we will use the Master of Insight Hall to discuss your task and your ideas on what a MT should be. **A**','2015-07-22 03:55:30',NULL),(10480,10027,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After meeting all of the new criteria for the station of Master Teacher, I have granted LadySilver the station again. \r\n','2015-07-22 04:05:55',NULL),(10480,10022,35,80,'Trap Nightmare 80','This is a very special occasion. I would imagine that you have the highest trap nightmare in the City. I would like for you to use that power and strengthen your house at the same time. Trap at least 8k strength for your house prime and also, theorize on ways to improve this art even more. Put aside your house beliefs for now, I am wondering about alternate uses for the energy that you trap within. I appeal to your SoulMaster side and your innate ability to manipulate essences. Make your theories worthy.','2015-07-22 04:41:31',NULL),(10111,10232,51,50,'Locate50HiRoGIiFiQ','Write 5 stories involving dreamers/circumstances from your past Idolacese (?) dreams .. notable things that you witnessed or heard of and place them in the First Sphere area of the Library of Dreams.','2015-07-22 16:56:06',NULL),(10022,10734,26,1,'TaKaelia: Purify','What is the purpose of Purify, as in what is its actual function? Explain to me how you believe it functions? Is it a major or a minor, why? What does it cost you to evoke? Detail two instances where purify would be helpful. Seek these answers and return to me once you have them.','2015-07-23 02:12:44',NULL),(10480,10232,52,50,'Train 50','For this plateau, I want you to use your love of exploration. I would liike for you to find three rooms on every plane and take a student or another teacher there and discuss whatever you deem fit. It could be a history lesson, or an art lesson or contemplating the colors of the skies. Get out and share your love of the City and teach something. Also come up with an idea of how you can incorporate a Museum here in the City. Share your adventures with me and your thoughts. **A**','2015-07-23 06:55:12',NULL),(10027,10067,51,30,'Locate to 30','Locate the perfect place to find a hidden item. you need to hide ti and have others help you find it. Make it a mystery or maybe teasure hunt you make. Have some fun!','2015-07-24 06:25:32',NULL),(10027,10702,144,10,'Chaos Well to 10','You are now the granter of a wish or two. All dreamrs wish for things and it can be as simple as your smile or a shield you find along the way. Find out what dreamers are wishing for and grant couple. What wishes did you bring back to the City with you?','2015-07-25 01:14:57',NULL),(10702,10734,70,1,'Flamesear~ TaKaelia','Speak to other dreamers (a minimum of 5) and find out what you can about the different types of mares: dark mares, day mares, and the lesser mares. Also, ask them what there preference is for fighting. Return to me with what you learn, and we will discuss~ S','2015-07-25 01:53:36',NULL),(10027,10737,47,1,'Push to learn','Seek out dreamers and ask what the colors in the dream mean if anything. What do they mean to you? Do you have a favorite? Do they?  I will need the names fo who you spoke with and their replies and where you were when you spoke with them.','2015-07-25 02:41:55',NULL),(10107,10027,23,60,'Recharge 60 - Sil','This is a rewrite of a terribly written task.  The quest is to accept items for recharge, but at a cost.  Your high level recharge demands that you keep items based off of a pre-determined number with the art of random (that\'s up to you.) Additionally, warn them that if something drains you will have to DT it, you will not recharge it.  See if they are still as interested in having their items charged.  Do this for 10 dreamers.\r\n','2015-07-25 04:56:32',NULL),(10010,10062,72,50,'Inscribe 50-Krodoc','You know all there is about inscribe, you have written stories, and shares histories. I want you to enjoy yourself. I want you to do what you do best, and that is provide defense to yourself, and to the city. Come up with a way to help the city defend itself, from not only the obvious threats, but those that are hidden. What is the biggest threat that you see in the city ? How would you go about getting rid of it ? ~Cryst~','2015-07-26 02:38:32',NULL),(10003,10753,47,1,'Learn: Push, Lethea','Lethea you have a barrier you must push past to communicate with dreamers. Write your story on your scroll I gave you. Introduce yourself and ask for help finding 5 useful items for newlies. Come back to me and tell me what those 5 items would be.','2015-07-26 14:12:33',NULL),(10062,10717,68,1,'Flame | Will Ricson','Speak with a higher sphered member of each focus and get their opinions on the pros and cons of each focus. What are their strengths and weaknesses? As a GateKeeper, where do you feel we can be stronger, and what sorts of things can we sacrifice to reach that end?','2015-07-26 18:19:49',NULL),(10232,10717,60,1,'Will - Ascend 1st','Explore the Dream City, and see for yourself the Eight Great Houses -- only four of these are open at this time. Learn the present beliefs of each Great House that is open, and the past beliefs of at least one house that is no longer open. How do Houses function? What is their basic structure? Be prepared to tell me all there is to know about Houses in the City of Dreams. ','2015-07-26 19:03:43',NULL),(10107,10732,144,1,'Chaos Well - Rafe','Welcome back to the dream Rafe!  Chaos well is the most useful art to find it\'s way to the dream in years.  I\'d like for you to poll some dreamers and find out what the most useful art is, for all focii.  It has to be a single art and cannot be \"blade\" or \"flame\", but a specific art.  Is there a consensus in the dream?','2015-07-26 19:56:10',NULL),(10018,10717,65,10,'GateSmasher 10','Improving our skills with the blade gives most a better understanding with combat in the long run. I\'d like you to branch out and challenge up to five dreamers to a single duel, or more if you desire. If they are willing, ask for any tips they may have to offer. Be prepared to report on all that you learned, and how each duel went.','2015-07-26 23:50:29',NULL),(10022,10232,22,40,'Forge 40 - Em\'et','I want you to come up with an original creation. The what is up to you. This creation should consist of at least five seperate parts, only one part may be created by you. The rest you must have others make for you. Each piece will be a small part of the whole, once combined creating that which you envision. Develop a means by which the pieces are to be fashioned together and carry it out in grand fashion, involve as many others in the creation as you can manage. ','2015-07-27 04:01:36',NULL),(10027,10750,47,1,'Push to learn','Ask dreamers you see what push can do. Finf\\d out something about themselves. Their favorite place or art and ask them so show you. Tell them somethign about yourself in exchance. when you ahve doen this for 7 dreamers come find me with a list who you talked to and what you both shared.','2015-07-28 05:48:06',NULL),(10018,10737,60,1,'1st sphere','Tell me what each item does that spawns from the City. Where else can we get items, and what is the risk of using items that haven\'t been ID\'d? Tell me in order of Nightmare form which is weakest to strongest. Then, learn of each open house\'s beliefs and explain your views on them. Do you think you will one day join one? Why or why not?','2015-07-28 06:07:39',NULL),(10027,10258,18,1,'Chamele to learn','There are ways to hide in the dream without the art itself. Find me four and test them out. share yrou finding with me and a new dreamer if you find one in need, We wills hare the detaisl in yrou report.','2015-07-28 17:53:38',NULL),(10550,10027,142,10,'MD - First Mastery','Your mission is to intentionally \"Misdirect\" your time and energy against what you\'ve been doing for the past several weeks. Relax and have fun with at least two different dreamers. Have a drink.. dance.. laugh.. and play. Engage with those closest to you. By casting this \"Misdirection\".... others will see a side of you never seen or even thought existed. Surprise yourself and others through your actions.','2015-07-28 20:05:31',NULL),(10022,10708,70,40,'Pinhook - Flame 40','You\'ve just recently returned you say! Welcome back, there is much to do in the way of learning and discovery. I will not bore you by asking about theory or your thoughts at this time. I want you to brush up on your skills, or learn new ones. Find someone who knows how to use flame to defeat a shamblix. Have them teach you how this is done. With this person\'s assistance take down ten of the beasts, bring me the proof of your accomplishment.','2015-07-29 00:47:50',NULL),(10702,10750,70,1,'Flamesear~ Arnaya','You haven\'t had a chance to really explore the City, so I would like for you to do just that. Get yourself lost, or find a guide, to show you some areas of the City you can reach. Look for a place that might become your future hiding place. Be prepared to show it to me when you report, and why you chose it~','2015-07-29 02:09:53',NULL),(10022,10009,74,40,'Dreiko: MB 40','It seems my previous task may have been a little too late. You allude to the fact that you may have already altered the location of a certain item. I have need of said item for my own plans. Either bring it to me or make me aware of its location so that I may carry out my plans. For this I will grant you the plat you seek.','2015-07-29 02:41:16',NULL),(10002,10004,8,1,'Bundle 30: Learn','Protection, Resist Fear, Reweave, Destroy Talisman and Chaos Well - I wish for you to hold a lesson for your various toys and dollies and educate them about each of these abilities and why they are important. How will each of these skills be of use to you in dealing with your kingdom of misfits? -Magnilia','2015-07-29 02:52:36',NULL),(10002,10004,7,1,'Bundle 30: Learn','Protection, Resist Fear, Reweave, Destroy Talisman and Chaos Well - I wish for you to hold a lesson for your various toys and dollies and educate them about each of these abilities and why they are important. How will each of these skills be of use to you in dealing with your kingdom of misfits? -Magnilia','2015-07-29 02:52:45',NULL),(10002,10004,25,1,'Bundle 30: Learn','Protection, Resist Fear, Reweave, Destroy Talisman and Chaos Well - I wish for you to hold a lesson for your various toys and dollies and educate them about each of these abilities and why they are important. How will each of these skills be of use to you in dealing with your kingdom of misfits? -Magnilia','2015-07-29 02:52:51',NULL),(10002,10004,73,1,'Bundle 30: Learn','Protection, Resist Fear, Reweave, Destroy Talisman and Chaos Well - I wish for you to hold a lesson for your various toys and dollies and educate them about each of these abilities and why they are important. How will each of these skills be of use to you in dealing with your kingdom of misfits? -Magnilia','2015-07-29 02:53:01',NULL),(10002,10004,144,1,'Bundle 30: Learn','Protection, Resist Fear, Reweave, Destroy Talisman and Chaos Well - I wish for you to hold a lesson for your various toys and dollies and educate them about each of these abilities and why they are important. How will each of these skills be of use to you in dealing with your kingdom of misfits? -Magnilia','2015-07-29 02:53:13',NULL),(10002,10746,86,1,'Support Train','Arlyana Jax has been briefed on current teaching policies and standards and has reviewed the posted guidelines.  Art of Support Train returned.','2015-07-29 03:40:12',NULL),(10002,10746,102,1,'Learning Quest','Arlyana Jax has been briefed on current teaching policies and standards and has reviewed the posted guidelines.  Art of Quest returned.','2015-07-29 03:40:20',NULL),(10746,10271,98,1,'NewlyAwakened-Learn','Dina had tasked him to give 2 reasons why DreamSeers learn this art first and then 2 reason how he would use this art and why.','2015-07-29 04:50:38',NULL),(10732,10750,26,1,'Arnaya Purify ~rafe','The dream is full of things that need soem sort of purifications, but not just a simple art to achieve, find 3 things in the dream that should be purified  to be \'clean\' beyond the limited function of the art, what is more important? symbology or mechanics?','2015-07-29 09:08:40',NULL),(10027,10750,60,1,'First sphere','she has completed an interview with me regarding her readiness for this sphere and we coveed the open house, items, travling the dream dreamer interacting and teachign. It is my conclusion she is more thna ready','2015-07-29 10:27:24',NULL),(10003,10752,9,1,'Kediemas FA-Learn','Kediemas I want you to take your blade and hunt. Find a free action alt. Take it to 3 dreamers and request freeaction using dreamer language. Come back to me and we will talk about what you learned after you have accomplished this.','2015-07-29 23:30:52',NULL),(10022,10746,22,20,'Arlyana: Forge 20','Forge is more than a personal item font. It is a means of artistic expression and should contain one\'s unique style. If someone picked up an object of yours would they know it was your hand that made it? Create three such examples of your work and share them with others. Explain what makes them uniquely yours and teach them what it means to be unique. Ask the question why is it important that Forge be treated with dignity. Return to me with your creations as well as the opinions you have gathered.','2015-07-30 01:03:11',NULL),(10732,10753,69,1,'Lethea Tranc Flame ','The Dream has many flames, some are useful to see, some are not, look for dream flames and and tell me of 3 things flames are apparently used floor.. in your own artistic ways what else flames are apparently good for in a dream.','2015-07-30 04:02:07',NULL),(10107,10027,19,60,'Vision 60','Envision your perfect dream, and what it would involve.  When you look around you, what do you see?  How do we interact, or do we actually interact at all?  What is our biggest threat, and what is our biggest accomplishment?  I\'d like you to find a room that represents the best in the dream and one that represents the worst. What do we need to learn to make this a reality, and what is the biggest threat to it?\r\n ','2015-07-30 04:12:42',NULL),(10455,10027,100,10,'Pt 10 - Silver',' I\'d like you to think about tokens of all sorts over the age of the City. What tokens have been central in the formation of factions and people, and what kind\'ve things did people used to give each other, but no longer do. What have they replaced them with? Finally, create a token to give to someone else. Can be physical with forge, or just something you give to someone to treasure.\r\n','2015-07-30 04:28:17',NULL),(10107,10746,16,50,'Arlyana Jax ID 50','I made a gross error in targeting the quest codex.  The task was to identify personality traits and scribe them into the form of metaphors and physical traits.  She had a great report, I am quite pleased.','2015-07-30 04:37:07',NULL),(10022,10018,22,30,'Forge 30 - Jade','I would like for you to hold a Forge class, the amount of times you are to hold it will depend on the turn out, you decide. The purpose of this class(es) is for people to learn the \"proper\" way of forging. We are not just item vendors which you drop a power token into and an item comes out. There should be skill, style, creativity involved. Teach people about this, show them the potential and possibilities. Each attendee will create an item based on your teaching and submit them for my viewing.\r\n','2015-07-30 07:21:43',NULL),(10728,10232,82,40,'Terror 40','Terror is not the same as Scare, You can be scared of something and still overcome your fear easily. To be truely terrified, is not as easy to get through. I wish for you to think on what truely terrifies you. I would also have you discuss the differences with at least four others and have them either tell you of something that has terrified them or still does. Also, find me three locations in the City where you know something terrifying has happened and share with me. **A**','2015-07-30 18:20:23',NULL),(10018,10009,14,10,'Know 10','Get to Know what you\'ve been missing in your absence. Involve yourself in some minor way.','2015-07-30 23:59:44',NULL),(10030,10455,22,30,'Forge T.: III','Gather components from about the city to create a clay. With this clay you will explore the methods of Idoaclesia. Ten items total will be made. Five practical, five whimsical. ---- Practical: These items must bear details to them that actually reflect their true shape. I.E You give creative description and body of the elemen shape. --- Whimsical: These items may take any shape and should reflect the true mystery of the dream world. -- Note: Imperfections 0%','2015-07-31 07:40:27',NULL),(10030,10455,21,50,'Blend: V','Audra has important work aimed at creating a \"Shatter Training Dummy\" of sorts. As one so attuned to items and energies used to create structure I would ask you to prove yourself in some way asa significant assistant or guide in this work. Discussion with her will not be enough. Some act of progress in her own work must be realized. As always, your involvement and leadership should prove worthy of the fifth level of plateau.','2015-07-31 08:13:57',NULL),(10030,10732,139,1,'Sense Datoken - L','Dark Awakening is a realm that few of us have experienced and yet it is as a place of power for much darkness. In Idoaclesia I theorized that there were \"Vile Vortices\" throughout the city and in these places of mysterious power dreamers did build great and powerful things. --- Look to some of those places where the \"Datoken\" cross into our realm from their Dark Awakening in an effort to detect any anomalies.','2015-07-31 08:58:57',NULL),(10027,10746,21,50,'Blend 50','Beldn back into the Dream we love. Catch up on the changes around you. We have new arts what are they what are their stats. We have new places find them? New beliels of the four open houses? What is going on with the closed  ones? New dreamers with old marks. Dreamsmith and Wordsmith who are they? Find out what is up with the Consortium? Two cities? Ideoclesians?','2015-08-02 04:37:59',NULL),(10111,10732,38,10,'Scare10 HiRoGIiFiQ','Em\'et is on a mission to increase the art abilities of fatesenders. Scare him by making up a story about a ridiculously overpowered new dreamseer art that has been approved and on its way into existance. Get a realiable source to back you & bring me a codex.','2015-08-02 04:49:04',NULL),(10022,10732,22,10,'Rafe: Forge 10','Seems you have had Forge for a long time indeed. Dust it off and forge three examples of your craft. Demonstrate your style and uniqueness and present one of each to a seperate dreamer. Ask for their opinion of what you have made and any criticism they may have. Try to get the opinions of DreamSmiths, or barring their presence ask an Elder. If you cannot find one of those seek ones experienced in forge. Bring your examples and the opinions back to me so that I may see your work.','2015-08-02 06:22:24',NULL),(10022,10750,3,10,'Arnaya: SM 10','Seems that you are coming up in the City. We have all been though those \"baby\" steps. Even the most epic of journeys began with those first few steps. Part of being part of the City is actually being -part- of it, not just a fly on the wall. Find someone that is in need of assistance and help them in whatever way they need. What was the issue, how did you help and were you able to assist in resolving it?','2015-08-02 06:46:26',NULL),(10728,10734,60,1,'Sphere 1:','You\'ve made your rounds through the city and several social gatherings. I would like you to reflect on the most important information you have picked up so far and what seems to be the most bizarre? Why do you feel you are ready to ascend and what does ascending, gaining a sphere, mean for you as a dreamer?','2015-08-03 02:49:59',NULL),(10746,10732,98,20,'Newly to 20','Think back to your early dreams. How has the treatment of newlies changed throughout your dreams? Focus on both the good and the bad.  What should we start doing again when it comes to newlies and what should we avoid?','2015-08-04 00:05:13',NULL),(10009,10732,18,40,'Chamele40','The dream has many layers, some visible, some hidden. Investigate the hidden layers of the dream, be they pictures, visions, ideals, or something else. Combine some of your favorites into a lecture of sorts and share it with others within the City. Aim to share it with as many dreamers as you can that spread across the different walks of Underlight.','2015-08-04 01:44:42',NULL),(10003,10737,9,1,'Freeaction, Learn.','Shamash. It is freeing to understand what holds you back Freeaction does that. Tell me 3 things that other gks say that has paralyzed them and how they overcame it. From those answers, develop your own strategy on how you will never becomes paralyzed.\r\n','2015-08-04 02:23:48',NULL),(10108,10746,144,1,'Arly - Chaos Well','Welcome home! Or well, almost anyway. Since you\'re back (YOU\'RE BACK!) ask around for what\'s changed, what hasn\'t changed, and use that information to start you on the path back to finding a place of your very own here in our city. Tell me about where you think\'s a good place to start.\r\n','2015-08-05 02:06:16',NULL),(10108,10111,144,1,'Hiro - Chaos Well','Chaos Well holds non-trapped essences in one easy storage space, to be later fed to a prime. What it also does, is matches the creators outfit on creation. I want to see how pretty you can get a chaos well. Have some folks make you one, each, with different colors. Poke them to see what color combinations they can come up with to please you! Bring me the prettiest two, and the silliest story from your hunt!','2015-08-05 03:48:21',NULL),(10027,10750,24,1,'restore learn','Rstore to replaces what is lost. You hear alot of talk around you every dream. What have you heard that others have lost. Do you think that hvae retored it or not. Ifyou need to ask more questions. Seek out five loses.','2015-08-05 06:53:28',NULL),(10027,10753,98,1,'Newly Awakened','You have begun your path well and with very good teachers. Think of things you beleive a new dreamer should know. What would you share with them. If you can show them five places that have some meanng to you what would they be. Share them with oen other dreamer then come share it with me.','2015-08-05 16:39:13',NULL),(10022,10753,60,1,'Lethea: 1st Sphere','After speaking with Lethea and verifying that she has sufficient knowledge of the City around her I am raising her to first sphere.','2015-08-05 20:09:32',NULL),(10062,10108,6,20,'Med 20 | Clarity','I had a conversation with Thunderman recently. He did not want to work with OSM because our home tried to close down HC. I explained to him that Calenture once tried to keep OSM from opening entirely. Speak with rulers of past and present and get their opinions on working with houses who\'ve slighted them in the past. Is it really such a big deal? Report your findings.\r\n','2015-08-06 03:03:11',NULL),(10062,10737,68,1,'Flame | Shamash','In a chakram battle between a 9th sphere DreamSeer and a 5th sphere GateKeeper, who has the upper hand and why? Can the same be said for the other two focii as well? Speak with a member of each other focus and find out what they fear the most about a GateKeeper. Report back the details.\r\n','2015-08-06 03:57:12',NULL),(10732,10258,69,10,'Puned Flame  10','Flames have many possible purposes in dreams, hunting the most obvious but not the only, you have suggested multiple possibilties so talk to 5 dreamers and get their ideas to add to yours and give me a gestalt of what you find with 5 possible flames improvements.','2015-08-06 07:06:27',NULL),(10702,10746,46,50,'Recall 50~ Arly','See what you can recall from our dream time about the focal blades, specifically the SM one (Serpent\'s Venom). Speak to others and look through histories if need be. ~S','2015-08-07 01:07:50',NULL),(10108,10258,98,1,'Puned - NA - Learn','NA is a minor seer art, so everyone can learn it eventually. See what you can find out about other methods of New dreamer detection. Do you think they\'re more, or less effective then the art? As well, since you\'re new to the city, you get to see it in a way that many of us don\'t anymore. Take the time to speak to a few people, at least two, about their own experience as a new dreamer, and tell me about them!','2015-08-07 16:06:09',NULL),(10732,10258,9,1,'Free Action Puned','By Rafe, we look to get around the dream fast and avoid snaring by nightmares. where else have dreamers used free actions it has helped many in more than just fighting. ask at least 3 dreamers what else Free Action can help wtih beyond how we use now?','2015-08-07 17:03:05',NULL),(10107,10746,17,30,'ID Curse 30','ID Curse seems out of place among our arts. You\'d think that a SoulMaster would be more likely to benefit from this art. Why do you think it\'s a dreamseer art? Furthermore, why do you think it was at suck a high level for so long, before it was made more accessible/ Do you suppose it may have had other secrets?\r\n','2015-08-08 03:55:13',NULL),(10053,10258,2,10,'Quest: Kelos','For your plateau in Dreamseer, I want you to consider why you chose being a dreamseer. There should be atleast 5 reasons why...Tell this information to a dreamer of another focus, and get their opinion...Bring this information back to me...','2015-08-09 00:47:54',NULL),(10003,10734,96,10,'Sense Dreamers 10','TaKaelia, sense helps us to locate a pocket of energy that dreamers stream and release to allow us to know which areas are populated. How does this happen? 1. Develop a theory on how dreamers release energy, two use your own sense and find an area that minics an energy release. 3. What are the most common areas dreamers are sense in?','2015-08-09 00:50:40',NULL),(10593,10750,67,10,'sharpening knives','We want to keep that Soulreaper of yours nice and sharp..please, if you would, carve something for me, something that touches your soul, you may use any materials you wish, the more detailed the work, the better. Show me who you are through this piece of art. ~c','2015-08-09 04:20:27',NULL),(10732,10753,36,10,'Blade DS 10 ','Rafaella [rafe] Dream Blade 10: Many things can cut in the dream  ,f ind 5 things that cut dreams and paint a picture of that and show it too me. take your time and ask whomever you want to help. how mny things coold there be?','2015-08-09 04:42:00',NULL),(10022,10005,144,1,'Eros: Chaos Well','How does a Chaos Well work? Where do the essences go? Why can it only accept one essence with one strength at a time? Ask around... come up with a working theory as to how it functions. Receive a Chaos Well from someone and fill it, does it make saving souls more efficient than it was without?','2015-08-09 23:20:09',NULL),(10022,10734,3,10,'TaKaelia: SM 10','No focus fits into a box. SoulMasters being healers, GateKeepers being warriors and so on, all these things are stereotypes. Each of us brings many things to our focus. While it is true SoulMasters have an affinity to Resilience and the manipulation of that around us it is you who defines the focus, the focus does not define you. Think on this for a bit, speak with other SoulMasters, if you can find some. What makes you... you? How does being a SoulMaster accent that which you already are?','2015-08-09 23:20:26',NULL),(10232,10746,96,20,'Arly - Sense Drm 20','Finding Dreamers in Threshold, or the Library, or some house, is booooring! Search throughout the City for areas where you\'d rather find Dreamers, preferably somewhere interesting. Find at least three such places, identifying something unique about each such location. What could potentially be used to draw people there? Enjoy, and ensure a thorough report. ','2015-08-10 04:25:41',NULL),(10107,10732,51,40,'Locate Dreamer 40','Pick 10 dreamers, with varying personality traits. Instead of locating these people or following them, pick a place for each where you would expect to locate them based on their personality. Locate a room for each dreamer that reflects how you perceive them.  Bonus points if you have a person you want to envision standing over that damnable tusk.\r\n','2015-08-10 04:48:56',NULL),(10009,10734,24,1,'Restore-Learn','Restore is an important art for Soulmasters and the Dream in general. It allows you to assist others, as well as, yourself in staying coherant. There are also other arts and items that do similar things. Identify items that provide benefit to you OR another dreamer. Bring me three total that should, barring being cursed, provide a benefit toward a Dreamer\'s coherance. We\'ll have a discussion of the specifics of the Art of Restore when you return, so don\'t worry about seeking this information elsewhere.','2015-08-10 21:36:13',NULL),(10455,10746,144,10,'Chaos Well 10 Arlya',' I would like you to search out forms of wells in the city, seeking the hidden abundance that can sometimes be hidden. This can be physical, spiritual, or people, surprise me. What surprised you most about your findings? Finally create your own kind of well, in the form of a poem or piece of art, the choice is yours. ~Fangx','2015-08-11 03:08:46',NULL),(10746,10737,8,1,'A Safe Place','The word protection is often used alongside safety.  I would like you to figure out what safety in the City means to you and find at least 3 places that make you feel safe outside of Sanctuary. }\'|\'{','2015-08-11 23:45:59',NULL),(10702,10734,70,10,'Flame10~ Takaelia','You are interested in a couple of the open houses. I\'d like for you to seek the \"Flame\" of these houses: what keeps them going? Is it their passion for something? etc. Come up with some ideas and come talk to me about what you learn. ~S','2015-08-12 00:58:49',NULL),(10018,10003,111,1,'L: Dazzle','Dazzle us with your QuarterMaster skills. Keep up the vault work with the standards I have set out, make sure nothing slipped through the cracks, and recharge and move things around as needed. When you feel you have done enough work, come to me with your report.','2015-08-12 23:24:18',NULL),(10728,10753,15,1,'Judge - learn','I would like you to explore some of the new areas that are available to you now and judge them.  Be as specific and detailed I know you can be.  Be prepared to justify your judgements.','2015-08-13 22:01:47',NULL),(10732,10753,16,1,'Identify Lethea','How do dreams identify a dream that may  benefit or hurt when one only has an appearence to go by? look around the dream for things you can\'t identify and how you might try to identify. pick 3 good and paint it and what it made you THINK @~\", Rafaella','2015-08-14 01:05:09',NULL),(10732,10258,72,1,'Puned inscribes','The dream is vast in trying to describe or record or display, look around the dream and find things words inscribed could dedscribe better.  Find all the other things this Art can be or could be used for ~Raefa','2015-08-14 23:02:33',NULL),(10108,10258,105,1,'PC - Pun - Learn','Posion Cloud is Calenture\'s house art. As such, I ask a simple task from you. In the span of one weeks time, report to me, via the mission boards, of work done in Calenture\'s name. Be it hunting, genning, assisting dreamers. It can be one, or all of these things, but I expect a report daily, or as close to daily as possible. As well, read the history of the art in our Library and feel free to come ask me any questions you may have about it\'s original discovery.','2015-08-14 23:37:33',NULL),(10018,10022,111,1,'L: Dazzle','Dazzle us all with your hidden respect and kindness for at least two dreams. I don\'t want to hear a single insult or slight. Be nice, be polite.','2015-08-17 01:33:54',NULL),(10022,10753,60,2,'Lethea: 2nd Sphere','Spoke to Lethea about all the things she has learned during her time in the City. About the people, houses, the City itself. Everything she has learned by being around other people.\r\n','2015-08-18 00:26:36',NULL),(10022,10717,60,2,'Will R - 2nd Sphere','2nd sphere interview with Will Ricson. Talked about things he would have learned by spending time inside the City and around other dreamers. Yanno, boring stuff.','2015-08-18 21:21:35',NULL),(10027,10732,19,40,'Vision to 40','You are the new Vison Guide in the dream. Pick ten of those things other may not see and take seven dreamers on a tour to show them.  Not all at once one at a time is fine.You will be to be sure they can reach the rooms. and you can help see the hidden teasures.','2015-08-19 02:10:11',NULL),(10593,10734,67,10,'Exploration','Go on an exploration! take your blade along to cut any interesting plant life or other things you may find, water lilies are a favorite of mine, though I dont know of they are here...  have fun, go several places, take your time,  I cant wait to hear what you find!!  ~C','2015-08-19 03:24:07',NULL),(10027,10067,15,50,'Judgment to 50','Two heads are better than one and i have two projects. I need help with. I need you to teach me how to write a good charter since they come so easy to you. I need helpwith a new venture the Elders have me on a New dreamers Guide. You have always been my right and left hand and working with someone will keep me focused.','2015-08-19 04:05:48',NULL),(10702,10734,25,1,'Reweave~ Takkaelia','We are searching for more pieces of an SM blade, and we\'ve come across another clue. I need help finding areas of death, or tombs of some kind. Help search out areas you think would be places of death and everlasting rest, and show them to me. Why did you pick them?~','2015-08-20 01:29:36',NULL),(10062,10737,1,10,'GK 10 | Shamash','You\'ve learned a fair deal about the GK focus this evening. We\'ve touched on Meditation, Reflect, Ward, Pocket Wards, and one on one fighting. Let\'s take it a step further, and continue our look into the GK focus. Speak with as many GK as are needed to learn the ups and downs of all our other arts. Return to me and we will continue our discussion.\r\n','2015-08-20 02:00:19',NULL),(10062,10018,141,20,'Kinesis 20 | Jade','Take a look at all events of the city at present. Decide where you\'d like to see something happen and what you\'d like to see. This does not have to be a huge something, but it should be something at least of relative note. Push someone else to complete this task for you with the outcome you design.','2015-08-20 02:23:52',NULL),(10018,10737,68,10,'Flame 10','It\'s time to brighten that flame of yours. Timing is everything during combat. Challange two dreamers with a level flame similar to yours, and two that are higher, to a flame duel. Pay close attention to the difference in speed, and seek tips on how to properly dodge. Be prepared to list those you worked with and all that you learned.','2015-08-20 02:37:19',NULL),(10027,10455,144,30,'Chaos well to 30','Time to plan a nice picnic dinner under the stars with at least five dreamers share some stories and laughter around a picnic basket. Whats in the bsket? Where did you go and who joined you? Note if there aren\'t five around do it twice to get at least that many.','2015-08-21 04:17:37',NULL),(10480,10732,52,20,'Train to 20','With the restructuring of the teaching system, I would liike for you to inquire of your fellow teachers. What are their expectations as we move foreward? What do they expect from the Masters and from the Elders as well as themselves? Are there any areas that need addressing or revised? Be detailed in your interviewing and reporting. **A**','2015-08-21 04:46:05',NULL),(10480,10455,63,60,'Invisibility 60','Invisibility is countered by Seers own art of Vision. I would have you focus on the limitations of Invisibility. I want opinions of other Seers on how to make this art better. Involve the Seer Guild and hold discussions. You do not have to limit your questions to your own focus. Pick the minds of all the intellectual people that you know and come up with some ideas that may be worked  on in the future. Make this task worthy of a plateau to 60. I will not accept sloppy or lazy work. **A**','2015-08-21 05:00:49',NULL),(10480,10090,102,1,'Quest apprentice','After speaking with both Master LadySilver and Hikari about the progress of his apprenticeship, I have granted him the art of Quest with the stipulations that he not write tasks without her present nor may he offer a task without her approval. **A**\r\n','2015-08-21 07:02:14',NULL),(10027,10734,60,2,'Seond Sphere','I need you to seek out three things not known to you and bring me the new informtion when you have done this we will have a nice chat. On what other things you need to know for second sphere.','2015-08-21 21:31:12',NULL),(10022,10545,30,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring a pre rule change bundle plat task','2015-08-21 23:27:52',NULL),(10022,10545,27,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring a pre rule change bundle plat task','2015-08-21 23:28:05',NULL),(10022,10545,29,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring a pre rule change bundle plat task','2015-08-21 23:28:23',NULL),(10022,10545,26,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring a pre rule change bundle plat task','2015-08-21 23:28:33',NULL),(10022,10545,24,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring a pre rule change bundle plat task','2015-08-21 23:28:45',NULL),(10022,10545,25,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring a pre rule change bundle plat task','2015-08-21 23:29:36',NULL),(10022,10545,3,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring a pre rule change bundle plat task','2015-08-21 23:29:45',NULL),(10022,10545,67,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring a pre rule change bundle plat task','2015-08-21 23:29:53',NULL),(10022,10545,70,30,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring a pre rule change bundle plat task','2015-08-21 23:30:25',NULL),(10027,10469,63,10,'Invis to ten','You have such and wonderful family to share such things with. Write a story about something unseen make to scarey or one of those lovely stories with a twist or one too funny. Suprise with a tale of a true seer. Have fun with it and i cant wait to hear your story.','2015-08-22 23:38:25',NULL),(10027,10767,60,1,'sphere 1','we have had a lengthy conversation and it is my conclusion she is ready for second sphere','2015-08-23 01:42:47',NULL),(10027,10717,6,10,'Meditation 10','Focus on your dreams and their path. What do you see as your place in hte City? What projects do you propose? What will guide you? Choose three rooms that might represent these goals and why..','2015-08-23 16:58:37',NULL),(10702,10027,46,50,'Recall 50~ Silver','Speak to Yambe Akka about possible dual focus arts. Find out if you can help her in any way to persuade the Seers in looking into one between the foci. Return to me with your results~ S','2015-08-23 18:39:55',NULL),(10022,10009,144,20,'Dreiko: CW 20','Devise a means for the Order to gain strength through imprisonment, rather than draining. Assist your old house in releazing the merits of this new path. I expect a detailed structure for them to build on.','2015-08-23 20:39:52',NULL),(10018,10411,12,20,'Shatter 20','Assist Bladenarius in inspecting the boundries of the Umbric Stronghold. As I came to an agreement with him on this - help come up with an alternate way to Shatter what is keeping us out, so that we can gain access without Grok.','2015-08-23 21:21:24',NULL),(10593,10276,139,1,'Nightmare','Alot of things these dreams make me think...\"what a nightmare\" how about you? Tell me about what you find nightmarish in our present dreams.  Don\'t worry, confidentiality is assured.  ~C','2015-08-24 04:15:58',NULL),(10027,10717,48,1,'Soul Evoke learn','What others think of the art does not matter. Your dreams are your own. More than drs. Give me examples of what your dream is to you. Why do you come back dream after dream? What would make you decide not to return? What do you hope to see when you join the dream? think on these thigns sincerely please and report back to me.','2015-08-24 19:03:23',NULL),(10027,10258,36,20,'Blade to 20','Seek out a dreamers to duel with you  in different states record your observations. Ask them for any tips. Examples while you are scared or in NMF record the results and who dueled with you. ','2015-08-24 19:50:30',NULL),(10455,10732,107,1,'PA - Learn Rafe',' This house for inexplicable reaons finds itself in a war not of its own making. What is it about? Not the touted reasons, look deep and analyze the situation. Finally, how can we use this art to stem the agression?\r\n','2015-08-25 02:45:30',NULL),(10455,10276,107,1,'PA - Learn - Hanna',' I want you to think about the current war situation. How can those who have joined the house to seek a thoughtful and peacefull path stem the tide of senseless agression? Finally, I want you to think on it, and devise a way that our people can be ready and frusterate the enemy, rather than directly confronting them.\r\n','2015-08-25 03:10:36',NULL),(10027,10067,18,50,'Chamele 50','Fade in or fade out time to move your House into tthe Light. She has been hiding too long. What other see will be up to you as you are a true seer. Make the smoke and mitrrors they are using bring the truth out instead of twisting it.','2015-08-25 04:14:05',NULL),(10732,10750,25,1,'Reweave for Arnaya','The dream is a bit tattered, look around the dream, talk to others and ask them, can dreams be rewoven mored than just a shield to protect ourselves. Do we use the art as well as we could beginning with ourselveds? think, question at least 3 if possible to get ideas of what we could reweave? Raefa teaching','2015-08-25 05:39:24',NULL),(10732,10745,9,20,'FA 20 Kaihan','The dream seeks to tangle us in many ways and we are often too slow in reacting. what are 5 things that you wish you could do fast and free that are not easy to do fast or freely other than escaping   a mare?.','2015-08-25 08:37:43',NULL),(10746,10754,47,1,'Push','As you continue to explore the City, I would like you to find some things that represent power to you.  Be prepared to either describe them to me or take me to them.  Also, think about what being powerful would mean to you in the City.  }\'|\'{','2015-08-25 17:01:46',NULL),(10702,10754,60,1,'Quest: Selika','First - we discussed houses, arts, focus and molds, what she\'s learned, getting along with others, etc. Arlyana Jax was the teacher who also put in a good word since I just met her. Very insightful.','2015-08-25 17:50:27',NULL),(10027,10746,139,20,'Sense datoken 20','Well here is another fact finding mission worth of the mare arts here. There are two sects of mares at least as i mentioned ours in keepers and ideoclesions in the union. Find what you can about them Their names any plans you can dicpher and who is in \"charge\"  Also current lists of daymares is always a plus to have.','2015-08-26 04:44:05',NULL),(10022,10737,7,1,'Shamash: RF Learn','Fear can have a purpose. It is even useful at times. I want you to recall a time where you were fearful of something. Were you able to over come your fear? How did you manage it? Share this story with another dreamer and discover that which caused them fear in the past. Does fear have a purpose? What do you believe it is? Is the absense of fear bravery? Return to me once you have related your story, gathered another\'s opinion and have forumated answers to my questions.','2015-08-26 04:45:37',NULL),(10027,10032,74,10,'MinBlank to 10','You have a serenity about you that others envy. How do you maintain such calm. Are there places in the dream you find more serene? Teach me this art in a story. Share it with one other dreamer besides myself.','2015-08-26 05:38:20',NULL),(10746,10745,16,10,'ID to 10','As you have recently returned to the City, you have no doubt found many changes to what you knew.  Speak with others, both new and old, to help pinpoint some of these changes.  How do you feel they will affect your dreams?  }\'|\'{','2015-08-26 16:08:21',NULL),(10067,10050,144,1,'Chaos Well Learn','This should be simple. SInce you\'ve been away we have gotten a new art. It is Chaos Well. Find out all you can about it and discuss with me the differences that Lyraclesia\'s Chaos Well is different than Idoaclesia\'s version. Simple and to the point <T>','2015-08-27 04:51:17',NULL),(10027,10050,15,20,'Judgment 20','Time to find out all the new beliefs of the houses cause they all changed but Calenture. Nice to know where every oen is standing so to speak seek out those leaders you mentioned and find out whats new.','2015-08-27 07:37:34',NULL),(10027,10750,60,2,'Sphere 2','You are the new Dream Planner as such we need mreo information. Walk through the planes you can and find if there are still portals restricted to you. I need the names of the rooms you cannot get to and the plane. Plan for our future. Ask five dreamers what they think we need more of perhaps this will help you decide. Create the plans for three new rooms. Describe to me what three new rooms may look like and their purpose.','2015-08-27 09:31:55',NULL),(10108,10746,105,1,'PC - AJ - Learn','Posion Cloud is given freely to members in our home, under the condition of a small task of service in Calenture\'s name. With that in mind, I\'d like you to take some time to get comfortable with being a Calenturian. Gen with us, hunt, teach in our name. Choose one thing, or many things, that you can do to help best represent us over the course of a week. Return when you\'ve reported activities to me via the mission board.','2015-08-27 15:45:55',NULL),(10027,10050,144,10,'Chaos well 10','I need some assistance with a project. So many are returnimg form your city. What things do you think they should know as they get their dream legs back here  int his dream. I have an easy time with those returning  from my time but I think I could do better with some advice from some one from yours.','2015-08-27 16:59:26',NULL),(10027,10717,46,1,'Recall learn','Recall your first dreams and give me ten tips you would give new dreamers (any dreamers). The dream changes with time what chancges have you seen in the Dream since your arrival.','2015-08-27 18:49:28',NULL),(10746,10258,40,1,'Quest: Arlyana Jax','Deafen is one of the first arts learned by FateSenders.  Why do you think that is?  Come up with your own ideas and seek out a FateSender and get their thoughts.  How are they similar and how are they different? }\'|\'{','2015-08-28 01:55:43',NULL),(10136,10734,3,20,'Soulmaster 20','Find or create a pet in the city for yourself. As a talented SM, creating  tiny life should not be too very difficult! Explain to me in full detail all about your pet. Interactions with others, helpfulness to your focus, lifespan, etc. How is it that our focus can create life more easily than any of the other foci? Why do you feel this is the case?','2015-08-28 03:53:42',NULL),(10108,10767,26,1,'Purify - Moi','(rewrite, task completed) Explore the city and find a room that either needs to be purified, or gives you a sense of purity. Maybe both!Then take me on a tour and tell me why! A fun story or real tale, up to you! Bring me along on the tour to see.','2015-08-28 22:41:16',NULL),(10027,10258,60,3,'Sphere three','You need to gather up some house mates and have an \"event\" to benefit the house be it a gathering for nice items for essenses and offer some prizesfor their efforts. Write up the details and we can post it. and get our new prospects involved too I am sure they would love it. Let\'s have some fun.','2015-08-29 02:03:14',NULL),(10009,10545,144,10,'CW10','Investigate and theorize the conceptual differences between how the different essence manipulation concepts work. What do you envision would need done to change from one type to another? Feel free to use from Draining to Imprisonment as an example.','2015-08-29 23:19:42',NULL),(10027,10719,98,1,'Newly Awaken L','You like to observe and this is a great asset in the dream. Tell me the things you have seen and your thoughts on them. There should be ten diffreant aspects your insight shows you. Consider what you believe a dreamer is. Find two things only a seer can use and asking for suggestions is a good thing,','2015-08-30 03:56:32',NULL),(10027,10746,89,20,'Soul Sheild to 20','Seek out the requirements for spher and see if its is somehtign you wish to offer the dream this time around. It\'s time to spread your wings.','2015-08-30 04:11:53',NULL),(10027,10258,2,20,'Dreamseer to 20','Well you have come a long way since your first days here. I want you to take some time and consider ways we can do things better for Calenture. I need five suggestions and we can work on implimenting them. Use your insight and let make things happen.','2015-08-30 04:40:51',NULL),(10455,10004,23,1,'Recharge Lrn - Zsa',' I\'d like you to recharge your spiritual energy from all the hard times you\'ve been having. Find something that either you wanted to do, or something you\'ve been meaning to do, and make it a reality! I want you think a little bit and theorize how we then can recharge the houses spiritual energy!\r\n','2015-08-31 02:13:37',NULL),(10654,10750,72,1,'Inscribe Learn','What knowlege would you impart on those who some after you? What insights into the Dreamstate or City do you have that are worth inscribing for generations to come? Inscribe can be forever, why do you feel worthy?','2015-08-31 04:49:05',NULL),(10009,10050,74,40,'MB40','Find a cause within the City that you seem inclined toward. Do something that furthers that Cause and assists yourself in the process. What is the cause? What did you do? Were you enlightened int he process?','2015-08-31 23:07:27',NULL),(10018,10050,9,20,'FA 20','Speak with each of the houses and get reacquainted with their beliefs. Then, learn what you can of the things you missed during your absence. Report to me with what you learned, and any opinions you may have.','2015-09-01 04:29:54',NULL),(10593,10087,107,1,'STOP IT!!!','Peace Aura...a nifty art that stops people from doing certain things...if you could stop dreamers from doing things around here, what would they be? If you choose to use individuals by name...never fear, your report will of course be strictly confidential  ~C','2015-09-01 22:43:10',NULL),(10702,10750,25,10,'Reweave10~ Arnaya','We are weaving our own tale, on top of old memories, while searching for the lost Soulmaster blade. Weave a tale of our steps and share it with the City.~	','2015-09-02 00:58:02',NULL),(10022,10050,144,20,'Cuero: CW 20','With the advent of Chaos Well people\'s packs have rejoiced. No longer must you run back and forth between a house while hunting, saving time and making the collection of essence more efficient. Study a Chaos Well, use your insightful seer ability to delve within the inner workings and discover how it works. Where does the ess go when you place it inside... what are its restrictions? Ask a number of other people how they believe it to function, discuss the likely hood of each opinion and whether you agree.','2015-09-02 01:35:57',NULL),(10593,10050,25,10,'Reweave 10','Reweave is all about fixing things...you mentioned that in your City this house (Alliance) was \"better\"  what would you do to fix the house as it is now, to make it better in your eyes?  What other things are you finding in this city that you would like to fix? I\'ll be interested to hear.  ~C','2015-09-02 02:59:19',NULL),(10480,10311,60,6,'Flower of Cienn 6th','Your house prime is lost!  Oh no!  Get it back!  Or try to make a new one or two!  I\'m sure you\'ll do great at this quest and your efforts will be worthy of 6th sphere!  If not, we\'ll find something else for you to do!','2015-09-02 03:12:39',NULL),(10480,10003,52,20,'Train 20','With the completion of the pre-quest, it is time to take your next step in your advancement as a teacher of the City. I wish for you to write a series of tasks for the art of \"Sprinkles\". I wish to see tasks for learning all the way up to the fourth plateau. Enlist the assistance of other teachers and Masters if it is needed. Have fun with the subject matter and use your imagination. **A** ','2015-09-02 03:50:47',NULL),(10480,10746,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Art was missing when she was given Quest after her return. \r\n','2015-09-02 03:57:52',NULL),(10480,10018,52,40,'Train 40','The Libraries are a mess. I am in need of a gifted Librarian. I wish for you to straighten all the mess in each of the Halls, Studies and Archives. Keep things tidy and organized. As you perform your assigned duty, think about the information that should be in each one of the Halls. What is missing from them that should be there to aide dreamers and their growth. Please organize all the areas that you can access. When you are finished, we will discuss your findings. **A**','2015-09-02 04:31:38',NULL),(10480,10018,1,60,'GK60:Jade','Do you think that the Consortium is evil, or are they just here to work with the dreamers? Find out what they are doing. Sit in on some of their work if you are able, and report to me your findings. If you find out they are not who they claim to be, make sure the wool is removed from the eyes of those who think otherwise.','2015-09-02 04:54:05',NULL),(10480,10003,21,1,'Blend Fractal','Find 3 areas in the dream where you can blend beyond the normal bounds. Behind a wall, off a cliff, into a ceiling, etc!  The less well-known the better!  After you have found your 3 places, take a  small group of dreamers and show them these places and theorize the meaning behind them.','2015-09-02 05:07:57',NULL),(10022,10545,67,40,'Avayla: SR 40','It seems we have once again taken up the cause of tinkering with our arts. Poison has been fiddled with enough, let us turn our gaze to Vampiric Draw. Study and research the way this art works, I wish to improve upon it. An essence is consumed each time the art is evoked. Find a way to make it possible that the essence has a chance to be preserved, so that the art may be evoked again. The Light has an essence which is also an artifact. Work this into your process. Involve the other SoulMasters.\r\n','2015-09-02 17:49:48',NULL),(10018,10022,111,10,'S: Dazzle 10','Help the rest of our membership by Cursing them, so they can improve Dazzle. Push them to work on it, and seek plats for it as well.','2015-09-03 01:08:38',NULL),(10022,10003,22,10,'Liolira: Forge 10','Forge should always be appreciated and treated with the upmost care and respect. I have never viewed any of your work. As such I wish for you to supply me three examples of what you consider to be your -best- work. Before bringing them to me you are to take them to Jade and have her inspect your work. Pay careful attention to any and all comments she makes and adjust your craft accordingly before bringing your creations to me. I also expect to hear about what you learned from Jade.','2015-09-03 01:26:10',NULL),(10002,10022,70,80,'Flamesear 80','As it stands, the Dreamers of Light is a fading cause much like a flame with no oxygen to help keep it burning. To plateau your Flame, I would like for you to provide that which your house needs to burn brighter. Create a list of steps your house needs to start thriving again and get to work fanning such a flame. Return to me when your home has shown real improvement with documentation of your efforts and the results they\'ve provided.','2015-09-03 02:11:57',NULL),(10108,10717,98,1,'NA - Will - Learn','You, sir, are a notorious newly helper. Its wonderful to see, but for this task, I want you to try something different. Instead of helping newlies, help yourself. Take a walk and find your most favorite place in the whole city. Look at it closely, and come up with a short, fun tale about how it came to be. When you\'re ready, take me there and tell me the story, along with any other fun details about your journey to your favorite room in the city!\r\n','2015-09-03 07:45:44',NULL),(10746,10717,26,1,'Purify - Learn','The presence of day mares has become more prevalent.  I would like you to learn all you can about the differences between them and all the other beings within the City (dreamers, lesser mares and dark mares).  Seek out information from others and fill in any blanks if you can.','2015-09-03 19:41:03',NULL),(10062,10717,1,10,'GK 10 | Will Ricson','Speak with five other GKs and collect for me their schedules on when the best time would be to meet as a collective. Also ask each of them what one thing they would like to see happen within the City of Dreams. Return to me with the list.','2015-09-03 20:30:48',NULL),(10053,10746,47,30,'Quest: Kelos-Push','Remembering our dream history, who was the dream that Selika and others pushed from threshold to OOSM while he was in nightmare form...Ask 3 dreamers if they remember...','2015-09-04 03:34:01',NULL),(10593,10750,24,10,'Make it...better?','Not your typical restore task...fix things! hair, clothing, carpet color, an emphants toenails...you be the judge...be extra creative and above all else have fun! Involve as many dreamers as you can...I look forward to hearing about some of the things you have brought to restoration.....as you see fit  ~C','2015-09-04 05:21:31',NULL),(10746,10258,26,1,'Useless?','Like Deafen, Purify is one of the first arts learned by SoulMasters and carries the same \"its useless\" stigma.  Rather than have you look around for things that need to be purified, I want you to look for things that many see as useless and think of how that view could be changed.  Be prepared to discuss your findings.','2015-09-05 00:17:13',NULL),(10005,10009,16,30,'Dreiko identify 30','Identify what the best move for Dreiko is during this war between DoL/AoE and take action towards that.','2015-09-05 03:05:47',NULL),(10022,10750,67,20,'Arnaya: SR 20','A blade is your fundamental weapon, when all else is lost it shall remain. But, what is a blade? For a warrior it is an extension of yourself, for a scholar it may be a weight to hold down parchment on a desk. Which is it for you? One of these two, or something else completely? I want you to design your own blade, a reflection of your personality. Return with your blade in hand.','2015-09-05 07:02:47',NULL),(10107,10746,22,30,'Forge - Arlyana Pt3','This final part of your task is to visit the Altar in Threshold Caves.  I\'d like you to inspect the elements of the altar. Clearly this was used for some purpose that has long since slipped from memory.  I want you to either discover or theorize as to what that Altar was for.  From there, determine what tools were used in the process.  Recreate these contraptions and devices and have them for your final report for this plateau.','2015-09-05 22:41:38',NULL),(10107,10009,99,10,'Combine 10 - Dreiko','A mis-targeted quest for Dreiko.  Please see the quest I wrote and targeted to BladeSlayer.  WE had a great discussion about the effectiveness of the MT position and its shortcomings.  If you want my opinion, please feel free to ask. This is terribly OOC, but it\'s really just covering my butt.  Thank you!','2015-09-07 02:26:28',NULL),(10022,10311,142,1,'Flower: Misdirect','I remember a time when FateSenders were \"tricksters\", especially my dear long lost friend Jabfest, she loved teasing me and playing tricks on me. How are you at misdirecting people, or \"tricking\" them. Take this item which I have made to look like a codex you would make, say nothing to the person you give it to them, make them think it is but a note for them to read. How many people can you fool into attempting to read it without verifying it is a codex first.','2015-09-07 22:19:58',NULL),(10779,10750,5,10,'Random 10','You found the Serpent\'s Pommel!  Yay!  But who\'s it?  Show it to Soulmaster teachers and tell them about finding it!  Pick who you think would make the most use of it and give it to them!','2015-09-08 07:52:29',NULL),(10779,10717,9,1,'FA-Learn-Will ','Free Action allows us to be able to move when others try to paralyze us. I want you to find at least three places in the city where you find that you are most free, where your thoughts come without hesitation. Where you are most at ease. Once you have found them, I want you to take me on an adventure and show me them. ~Cryst~','2015-09-08 21:50:48',NULL),(10779,10717,72,1,'Inscribe Will','Inscribe is used for more than just than making a codex, what else do dreamers use it for? find at least 3 other dreamers and how they have used it and give to me how you could use for grafitti you said you might. @>---- Raefa','2015-09-08 22:02:14',NULL),(10779,10717,7,1,'Will - Resist Fear','Search the Outer Planes (newly accessible to you!) for something in the Dreamscape that seems the opposite of scary to you, and plan out ideas for how you might make it scary. Tie this into a discussion of these ideas: What scares us, and why? How is fear relevent to Dreaming? Ensure a thorough report. ','2015-09-08 22:18:00',NULL),(10779,10311,42,1,'Flower Darkness','Darkest days have a way of clouding others\' judgements.  Identify people living in ignorance, and *do* something to enlighten them.  Your actions should be worthy of  learning an art this powerful.','2015-09-08 22:23:20',NULL),(10779,10753,72,1,'Inscribe (Learn)','Lethea, it was once said that not having all senses or capabilities of a typical avatar will strengthen your resolve in other areas to make up for what is \"lacking\". Use this to your advantage, and tell a story or inform someone about history you\'d like to share. Let\'s see what you can come up beyond the typical \"place codii in the Library\" mindset. There is no right or wrong \"answer\". Surprise me (and others, if applicable)!','2015-09-08 22:32:20',NULL),(10746,10258,20,1,'Blast~Learn','Blast is the only battle art unique to Seers.  It also has one of the most unique limitations.  Why do you think this is?  Find one of the other arts with a similar limitation to assist in forming your theory.','2015-09-09 00:17:52',NULL),(10097,10750,40,1,'Quest: Wolflancer','For this task I would like for you to decide in what ways do you think Deafen is useful In battle? What dissadvantage does it cause the dreamer its evoked on. Also see if you can find me a level 20 FS Chak with Deafen as an affect.','2015-09-09 02:01:54',NULL),(10022,10007,34,1,'Dina: Imprison','Detail to me the differences between each of the essence manipulation arts. What makes one more superior than the other? ','2015-09-10 04:49:04',NULL),(10702,10750,3,20,'SM 20~ Arnaya','The SM guild often goes up and down, and we don\'t always have something to do. Take a poll of SMs you run into and find out what it is they would like for us to do, and also ask other dreamers if they feel we should be doing something specific. Bring your results to a meeting to discuss~','2015-09-11 00:53:09',NULL),(10007,10750,70,10,'Flame 10','I want you to take some time out and think about why all the foci have flames named differently? If you are unsure of what the names are, then seek out someone from each focus to find out. ','2015-09-11 02:12:35',NULL),(10654,10593,64,10,'Cianne Give 10','You often give what you find to others, I\'d ask for you to recieve from others. Learn something new about at least 5 dreamers whom you have known for over a month. Try not to let them know that you are digging for information for a quest.','2015-09-13 05:05:12',NULL),(10779,10593,25,50,'Reweave: 50','Pull from the web powers and memories of the path.  The paths of distinction that so many once held higher than anything else are seemingly lost to us, so many adrift in a sea of mediocrity. Reach for the web and use its collective power in the now to create or recreate something you feel to be powerful.','2015-09-13 06:49:24',NULL),(10107,10009,15,40,'Judgement 40','As this art progresses it is detectable less and less often. Which is a very unique attribute for any art.  It\'s the only art that does it, in fact. Think of how you might be able to attribute this art to other arts. Which art would it be the most powerful to add to?  Additionally, do you think the purpose of this is to be deceitful and secretive?','2015-09-13 19:38:20',NULL),(10009,10077,16,20,'ID20','Figment has shown a great ability to move around the City with the care to assist dreamers. Identify a way to help with the repair of his fractals or recovery of his fractals. Act on this.','2015-09-14 00:18:54',NULL),(10009,10018,16,20,'Identify20','Identify and execute a plan to portray BladeSlayer in a softer light to those outside of your House. Did it work or is he a lost cause?','2015-09-14 01:03:03',NULL),(10062,10007,108,1,'Sable Shield Learn','Bring 2000 strength into the Order. Get receipts!','2015-09-15 00:23:09',NULL),(10022,10009,111,1,'Dreiko - Dazzle','I wish to test a theory, first I want you to come up with a theory of your own. Why may it be useful for houses to assist each other in raising their house arts? If it were possible, how would we go about doing it?\r\n','2015-09-15 01:36:01',NULL),(10009,10753,26,1,'Purify-Learn','Your limited speaking leads to the need for more creativity in how you may spread your curses around. Come up with some creative and unique ways to express your frustration with those around you. Pass your curse along until your need to utilize it is gone. You will then be Purified.','2015-09-15 02:38:21',NULL),(10107,10746,47,40,'Push 40 - Arlyana','Since you\'re looking for a 6th sphere task, consider this. A 6th sphere task is to impact the entire dream.  As a dreamer with a good overall view of how the dream operates, there must be a direction you would want to push the dream in. Something that you think it lacks or would like to improve.  What is this direction?  Once this is done, let\'s try and make it work for a 6th sphere task.','2015-09-15 03:01:09',NULL),(10022,10009,144,30,'ChaosWell-30Dreiko','Bortami stole some eggs to use to unleash chaos into the city. This causes me some concern. Try to find out more about his plans and what his intentions or what he thinks will be the outcome of his actions in this project of his and report it to me so that we can squelch it if necessary. Try to retrieve what he stole as well.','2015-09-15 03:51:52',NULL),(10022,10750,27,1,'Quest: BladeSlayer','honoring Flower of Cienn\'s task for drainself, for Arnaya. It was written using Random as the target.\r\n','2015-09-15 04:31:04',NULL),(10003,10753,2,10,'Lethea DS/BC 10','I want you to approach three members you respect as fighters within our ranks, hand him or her these training papers for your battle certification. Elict their feedback on tips on how you can use your chakrams more effectively as a seer.','2015-09-15 23:42:44',NULL),(10702,10007,33,1,'Banish~ Dina','Why learn Banish? Essence arts and what to do with them used to be so important, but is it still so now? Find a couple of other dreamers who agree with it, and who disagree with the art. Come to me for a discussion~ S','2015-09-16 01:19:22',NULL),(10005,10009,16,40,'Dreiko ID 40','Identify ways to make the forge guild great again.  Talk with people from idaoclese on how their forge guild ran if you are able to.  Come up with ideas on what the forge guild could do to not be terrible.','2015-09-17 01:48:23',NULL),(10108,10311,39,10,'Stagger 10','With the staggering (heh) changes to your home recently, what exactly, are your beliefs? Get with your members and hammer out a full write up of your new beliefs. Write them up for placement within the teacher\'s hall room of houses, and post them for all to see. As well, upon report, provide me a list of your active members, and I will provide you with mine, for ambasadorial purposes.\r\n','2015-09-17 01:49:21',NULL),(10009,10311,15,10,'Judgment10','The Order has undergone a rather large change in recent times but most within the Dream are unaware of the changes. Spread word of the changes through the different postings in the City, including the Archive of the Awakened in the Teaching Guil.','2015-09-17 02:01:18',NULL),(10108,10745,105,1,'Poison Cloud','Welcome Home, CK. As a member of Calenture it\'s your right to learn the art of Poison Cloud. Yet, we are asked to task members in order to learn it. For you, I\'d like you to take a moment to read the history of Poison Cloud in our Library. As well, continue to aid the house by genning or hunting as you have been, and report to me via the Mission boards any work you\'re doing going forward.','2015-09-17 04:25:30',NULL),(10480,10746,52,40,'Train 40','I am in need of some assistance myself. I would like for you to speak with as many high teachers with trains of at least 40 to see if they are interested in the station of Master Teacher. If you would interview them and find out why or why not, that would be most helpful. In addition to that, I wish for you to think of two things that you would like to work on to better yourself as an educator.  **A**','2015-09-18 00:48:22',NULL),(10480,10005,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Raised to the station of Master Teacher.\r\n','2015-09-18 01:27:16',NULL),(10009,10007,111,1,'Dazzle-Learn','We\'re working with the Light to allow both Houses to improve their House arts beyond what we could do individually. Along this note, Sidari Kai has recently identified a need for us to gather as many forces as we can in our attempt to rescue Herbert, which includes having every focus present. Identify a couple of Dreamers of each focus that could help and actually provide useful support for this endeavor so that we may return Herbert to the City.','2015-09-18 02:16:41',NULL),(10480,10107,21,70,'Blend 70','With Blends limits to warded portals, I wish for you to think how this art may be altered to allow a talented DreamSeer to slide past dormant portals. What is it about a warded portal that differs from a dead one? The portal eventually spins so why is it that a Seer can not pass through? Come up with your three best theories and we shall discuss the possibilities. Make this art feared by the other foci. **A**','2015-09-18 02:24:54',NULL),(10480,10107,63,70,'Invis70:OffKilter','Now that I\'ve tapped into your creative mind some, imagine a dream where Seers did not have Invisibility or Chamele. Create a comparable art complete with a history, that could share both the qualities of each of these arts. If you were a mad-scientist Seer, how would you go about creating this art, and what would you use to create it with?','2015-09-18 02:44:40',NULL),(10022,10007,7,20,'RF-20Dina','I learned you cant task someone to collapse someone. Weird. Im kinda fearful of things I still dont know about teaching. Think of all that you know about the subject and organize 5 thoughts or practices that may be little known that you think will help me become a better teacher and lets have a discussion.\r\n','2015-09-19 00:45:09',NULL),(10005,10311,16,20,'Flower Identify 20','Identify how your house can best benefit from this war between DoL and AoE then complete one action towards doing so.','2015-09-19 02:37:38',NULL),(10007,10311,17,1,'ID Curse - Learn','I hear many Seers say this is one of the most useless arts around, but why? You cannot tell if you are cursed by \"sensing it\", so why do Seers say this? After learning why, would you feel the same way they do? In your opinion, what other arts do you feel are somewhat useless? Lets have a discussion!','2015-09-19 04:26:54',NULL),(10007,10789,47,1,'Push - Learn','Perhaps someone of your focus can explain better what you truly are apart of. Ask around for another Gatekeeper and talk with them. Ask about your focus and what makes you different from the rest. Bring me the name of who you spoke with and what things you talked about.','2015-09-20 02:14:54',NULL),(10108,10258,24,1,'Res - Puned','For restore, I\'d like you to do two different things. First, I\'d like you to take the time to talk to each member of the house and find yourself a good niche within it. We have several paths you can choose from. As for the second, be our quiet eyes. Gather information, what you can glean, on what DoL and the Order are up to when it comes to the Pits and the Palisades. Do this quietly, with out asking questions. Just put your ear to the ground and see what you can uncover.\r\n','2015-09-20 03:23:23',NULL),(10779,10746,139,30,'Sense datoken 30','there is an increase in the daymares dreaming. do an outreach tot he young about what are the best ways to be safe or fight them as they may be inclined. perhaps add suggestiosn to the mare list of tips for the house.','2015-09-20 05:59:35',NULL),(10654,10717,40,1,'Will Learn Deafen 2','Ask 3 haloed teachers if they think having a halo has helped them aid other Dreamers outside the granting of arts and plateaus. Do they feel that having a halo causes dreamers to seek non-quest aid from them more often than if they didn\'t have a halo. If possible one of these teachers should be a Master Teacher.','2015-09-20 06:05:04',NULL),(10654,10717,40,1,'Ricson Deafen Learn','Deafen is an art mostly used to annoy others, consider who might put up with being deafened without being overly angry at you for it. Quests for arts and plateaus are not the only way to teach and aid other dreamers. Aid other dreamers without making it obvious it is for a quest. How do they respond to this aid?','2015-09-20 06:05:04',NULL),(10779,10108,74,20,'MindBlank-20','Its been so long since we inhabited our city. I know theres something you have totally forgotten about. Since there are a few older dreamers returning (SN!PER and Selika, for example) ask around and see if they can remind you of a situation you were involved in or a place that totally slipped your mind (Flying? A room you visted often?). Also see if you can jog their memory about something they dont remember. Report to me what you uncovered, and how those old memories made you and them feel.','2015-09-20 06:28:15',NULL),(10728,10003,2,50,'Liolira dreamseer50','My fractal is damaged!  Gather a large group of dreamers and lead them in repairing it for me!  ','2015-09-21 00:02:28',NULL),(10654,10750,98,1,'Arnaya Learn Newly','How were you welcomed to the city? What do you think is the ideal way to greet those whom are new here? At what point do we start explaining our personal/house views of the dream? What should we require of newer dreamers seeking to join the Gathering?','2015-09-21 04:38:36',NULL),(10108,10750,46,1,'Recall - Learn ','Recall binds your soulsphere to a point for a period of time. But that\'s boring and you can learn that by using the art. Instead, I want you to ask at least three dreamers to create for you a small picture of their favorite sanctuary to set recall in. Codex, forged, or even just words will do. Then, ask each why they think recall is important.\r\n','2015-09-21 05:18:34',NULL),(10009,10050,8,10,'Protection10','Protect something in the City from whatever may ail it. Spread the story, exagerating its greatness, as far as you\'re able.','2015-09-21 20:27:00',NULL),(10007,10789,60,1,'First Sphere','I would like for you to bring me every type of talisman you can find here. Chat that you can use, Charm you can use, each type of alteror, a shield, and an elemen for your focal element and dreamsoul. We will discuss what they all mean to you.  ***** Had to rewrite, I put it under Random instead of Sphere.','2015-09-21 23:26:21',NULL),(10022,10008,144,10,'Kailee: CW 10','How is a Chaos Well useful? Is it more useful to some than others? Why? Bring me a full Chaos Well so that the souls contained within can be saved.','2015-09-22 00:39:26',NULL),(10062,10009,108,1,'Sable Shield Learn','Well the house is way different now. Put to codex the improvements the house has made, as well as a detailed description of its beliefs for the Library halls so that dreamers may read them freely. Something the house never had before. Show me the codi before you put them in the Library.','2015-09-22 01:45:48',NULL),(10005,10009,15,50,'Dreiko Judgement 50','Come up with a few different ideas and plans on how DoL could proceed on their mission of entering KoES, assuming that the part of a crest piece AoE held was destroyed.  The plans should be detailed enough even Jerulan could carry them out.','2015-09-22 02:39:30',NULL),(10005,10311,22,1,'Flower Forge part 1','Speak with other forgers of the city and find out about what sort of specialization or common theme their forgings have.  Find out what primary colors you will be able to forge as well.  Brainstorm at least 3 possible specializations that might appeal to you.  ','2015-09-22 02:58:38',NULL),(10005,10311,22,1,'Flower Forge part 2','You\'ve learned what primary colors you will be able to forge.  Start experimenting with some styles.  Using codexs, make designs for a Chakram, Shield, Alteror, and Elemen, each incorporating the primary color into it\'s design in some way.  ','2015-09-22 02:58:38',NULL),(10007,10256,67,10,'Blade 10','I know you\'ve been gone for some time and need to get reacquainted with our city, so I want you to find out what is going on lately. See who is at war and find out why, also see if there are other threats to the city and why. Bring these to me and we will discuss it. Also take down who you spoke to and get different perspectives.','2015-09-22 19:34:15',NULL),(10007,10745,32,10,'Drain 10','You say you are interested to gain knowledge about Chaos Well and Trap Nightmare. Find out the pros and cons between these two arts and then come up with your own evaluation on when and why you would use each art. Are SM\'s limited with Chaos Well?','2015-09-22 19:41:54',NULL),(10007,10256,60,2,'2nd Sphere','Interviewing Sevlen for his Second Sphere. Making sure he knows many basics of our City.','2015-09-22 21:26:29',NULL),(10455,10746,144,20,'Chaos Well 20 - Arl',' I\'d like you to investigate your new surroundings in the City, and compare them to the old. This City is somewhat like the one we remember, but also isn\'t. Knowing that I\'d like you write a short story about someone through the eyes of a newly awakened who is without a well of the past that they can draw from, for context.','2015-09-23 04:59:50',NULL),(10007,10545,3,40,'SM 40','This Tuesday at 6pm dst we are having another SM meeting. Selika is talking about having a dig (possibly). Go to the meeting and help Selika in any way needed if she has it. Also, we have been talking about changing some of our arts. Come up with a plan that could work on getting one of them changed. I want you to give specifics...the whats and how to\'s. Share this at the meeting.','2015-09-23 21:44:00',NULL),(10007,10256,70,10,'Flame 10','Find a mineral/rock around the City, can be from any plane (make it a special type) and then use the powers of flame from the City to melt it down into a special item. Bring this item to me.','2015-09-24 00:49:10',NULL),(10009,10414,60,3,'3rd Sphere','We\'re in the midst of change in the Order. Support Avayla in her plans to modify the Relic to ensure it imprisons the essences placed within it. Help her gather resources, plan events, and participate in whatever way you are able.','2015-09-24 01:34:13',NULL),(10779,10750,60,3,'Quest: Jasper Margr','','2015-09-24 04:25:03',NULL),(10779,10750,6,10,'Arnaya - Med 10','It is uncertain whether Figment will be required to assist Rasputin in opening the stronghold he seeks. In preparation that he is, obtain information as to his whereabouts, and the various parties working to help him. Attempt to assist in any way you can, however this is simply reconnaissance.','2015-09-24 04:28:39',NULL),(10007,10256,67,20,'Blade 20','Give your blade a story. How did you end up with your specific blade. Give it a name and put it in a story on how it chose you to be by your side. You do not have to share this with anyone else, nor do you have to put it on codex. Just tell me its story and it doesn\'t have to be long, but a medium length.','2015-09-24 19:36:23',NULL),(10003,10256,26,10,'Purify 10, Sevlen','There seems to be a stain of greed on the city as of late. In our city we didnt take kindly to houses that were thieves. Get the skinny on what happened and what item is seeking to be returned. Why is that item important to Purify Umbric. Who are the parties involved.','2015-09-24 20:13:04',NULL),(10480,10745,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After an interview and question and answer session, I have granted Quest to Kaihan, former teacher of the City with the understanding that he must regularly report back to me or another Elder on his teaching and how it is going.\r\n','2015-09-25 03:44:58',NULL),(10480,10745,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts to accompany reissue of Quest.\r\n','2015-09-25 03:46:08',NULL),(10480,10745,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts to accompany reissue of Quest.\r\n','2015-09-25 03:46:22',NULL),(10480,10745,52,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After more discussion on his teaching past and with him writing sample tasks, I have granted him train. He is to start with learnables and then work his way up like any other teacher. He will be meeting with me regularly to discuss his progress.\r\n','2015-09-25 04:03:45',NULL),(10136,10253,47,1,'Push to Learn-Lucy','Push is an odd art. Ask others what it could be used for. Return to me with no less than ten things you can do with Push. How is Push used in protecting others? After you get this information, find out who might enjoy being a chest piece for your game.','2015-09-25 04:49:53',NULL),(10480,10256,3,10,'Soulmaster 1st Plat','Speak with other SMs of the city and find out their take on their role as Soulmasters.  Try your hand at each of these aspects as best you can - whether it be healing dreamers fighting nightmares, or repairing shields for others.  We\'ll discuss my own take at the end.','2015-09-25 05:17:44',NULL),(10779,10400,141,20,'Quest: Jasper Margr','','2015-09-26 08:17:08',NULL),(10779,10659,6,10,'Xanth - Meditate10','Pick a plane (excluding house planes, Threshold, and Library) and explore it to its fullest! Discover everything you can about this plane, and develop a theory as to why that plane was created. What purpose does it serve? Make excellent use of Know in your explorations, and be prepared to discuss your explorations and theories! Ensure a thorough report. ','2015-09-26 08:22:06',NULL),(10779,10400,141,30,'Quest: Jasper Margr','','2015-09-26 08:26:08',NULL),(10779,10572,44,10,'Relgric FStorm 10','With the reawakening of the focus guilds has come the rediscovery of focus relics: talismans that allow a group to focus a large amoutn of elemental energy. Our relic, the Everlight, still needs to be recovered. Learn what\'s been done so far. Using forge and inspiration from the dream itself, craft a clue to its recovery. At the next FS meeting, present what you\'ve found. _-* 2.24','2015-09-26 08:57:38',NULL),(10022,10050,144,30,'ChaosWell-30Cuero','Utilize your art and collect several full chaos wells for the house. Also see if you cant provide some wells for newly awakened and freespirits then recollect those wells from them. Try to get them in the habit of always getting and returning wells to the Order. Dont just do a few, put some effort forth worthy of the plat!','2015-09-26 18:42:20',NULL),(10007,10750,70,20,'Flame 20','There are many different types of flames...hearts, actual fire, pride, and etc. Pick two types of flames that are within you and take time to really think how that flame effects you as a dreamer. How does it make you come across with others? Do you have a special spark that allows you to figure certain things out? I want an extensive report on this. I\'ve known you for a short time and want to get to know you better by the end of your report.','2015-09-27 02:17:13',NULL),(10746,10745,74,30,'Quest: Arlyana Jax','Look within the mind of the City and its dreamers, what have we blanked our minds to?  Why has this happened and what are the possible effects?  Chose a select few issues and come up with a way to bring them back to light within the City.','2015-09-27 06:43:04',NULL),(10007,10256,3,20,'SM 20','I can\'t stand the stereotype that we have. Everyone thinks we are healers and there is no fear coming from us. Speak to a handful of SM\'s and get their ideas on how to make us feared (reasonable of course). What would you do? What would you change so people would see us as a warrior and not just a healer? Bring me the names and ideas so we can then discuss.','2015-09-27 19:03:46',NULL),(10018,10761,65,20,'GateSmasher 20','Welcome back to the City! I want you to compile a list of all the changes you notice since you were last here. Are these changes good or bad? What are your thoughts on your old City merging with Idoaclesia? Finally, do you think you can rebuild and follow another path, since your old home is no more?','2015-09-27 22:02:57',NULL),(10107,10007,22,60,'Forge - Dina -Final','I want you to gather up the essence of a Datoken or Dark Mare and devise a replica of it.  Capture all of the visible features of the essence. Make a copy that looks like a Dark Mare essence.  Describe any of the ethereal aspects as well. Perhaps it\'s aura or it\'s soul may be a tangible element to this essence. Perhaps, even weirder, it retains some sort of animation to it.\r\n','2015-09-27 23:12:06',NULL),(10007,10400,74,10,'MB 10','Seems like everyone just uses this art to hide for different reasons. It really is a boring art and it can really be annoying. How would you make this better? If you could change this art, how would you? How would you go about changing it? Bring me your thoughts and ideas.','2015-09-28 00:18:14',NULL),(10007,10789,9,1,'Free Action - Learn','Free Action is one of the most important arts in this City. I want you to find out why. Once you receive this art, how long will it last and how long will it last per plateau? To me, this is important info to have.','2015-09-28 01:38:08',NULL),(10018,10411,13,10,'Return 10','Inspect the entrance portal to the Palisades. Come up with a plan/theory with the help of others, if you like, to create a permanent ward there that would restrict access from a single person - Bandaret.','2015-09-28 03:06:29',NULL),(10018,10050,0,30,'JP 30','Attempt to master the art of \"leaving party\". There\'s a certain point in which a person drops party to let the other get the full amount of xp. Time how many hits and approximate damage until you feel confident enough to show me.','2015-09-28 20:53:13',NULL),(10746,10097,105,1,'Poison Cloud','In order to gain the house art, it is asked that you do service to the house: be it genning, hunting, teaching or guarding in our name for a week.  You can chose to report to me (via the Board) each day or in a single report.','2015-09-29 02:03:02',NULL),(10107,10009,18,60,'Chamele 60','The interest in Chamele dissipates as soon as a dreamer has the art of invisibility at around 50. Then the interest wanes.  How can we, as teachers, help dreamers generate interest around the art?  I\'d like you to figure out what dreamers of our focus think of the art, in comparison to non-dreamseers.  Is it an art that is universally ignored, or is it something that we overlook because we have a more powerful alternative?','2015-09-29 02:34:56',NULL),(10007,10802,60,1,'1st sphere','Spending time with Kaihan and Cuero, teaching Minka about the city and talisman.','2015-09-30 21:25:11',NULL),(10007,10256,70,20,'Flame 20','I will need a small fire pit that can be planted down securely in the Sanctuary on this coming Wednesday, Sept. 30th. I will need to heat up some vials of poison, so it will need to have a ledge where I can place multiple vials over the fire. These will be handed out to SM\'s on this night. I want something great created and I know you can use it. Where did you get the materials, how was it made, and how will it work?','2015-10-01 00:40:11',NULL),(10007,10009,74,50,'MB 50','I want you to come up with well thought out plans to rescue Herbert. I want you to come up with at least 3, incase the first two did not work. Then I want you to try out the first plan and see if it works. Get others involved to come up with 3 plans and to execute one. Keep tabs of who, what, when etc.','2015-10-01 00:51:08',NULL),(10022,10007,29,50,'Dina: Poison 50','I once created a sample of Poison with the assistance of Anyasha. I then later stabilized the sample with the use of Dreamer Essences. Using the work that came before, devise a way to disseminate that sample into the general populous. We need to see what the effects of this new sample are and whether it is any more or less effective than before. Return to me once you have carried out your experiement with a report on the details and results.','2015-10-01 02:04:54',NULL),(10007,10788,60,3,'3rd Sphere','I have a big Poison experiment coming up here in a few days and I need your help. I would like for you to find me a medium sized container that can hold liquids and cannot be eaten through, so something sturdy. I would also like for you to get me some sturdy gloves that can withstand the Poisons I will be working with and one more thing, I need goggles. Get me these items and then help me on the day of my experiment.','2015-10-01 02:08:45',NULL),(10779,10797,102,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Returning Quest to Magerum after updating him on current policies\r\n','2015-10-01 04:17:48',NULL),(10779,10654,144,30,'Chaos well 30','Carry your word to more dreamers sharing your beleifs and the place for your your new House. Have a name for ir yet? What type of projects to you see it having? What will its role be?','2015-10-01 04:22:24',NULL),(10108,10065,105,1,'Poison Cloud','Be a good guardian! Go get Dakkoth to trap for us, show off that crest like a pro, and generally just keep doing what you\'ve been doing, being supportive and awesome and by gods go genning at least once this week!\r\n','2015-10-01 15:45:20',NULL),(10779,10009,139,30,'Dreiko - Sense D 30',' 	The darkmares appear to be under the control of the Consortium. How far does that control reach? Does it affect Datoke, why or why not? I want you to try and obtain pertinent information concerning this matter and prepare an attempt to wrench control from the Consortium or break it completely. ((Rewrite/report of one that was on Quest - didn\'t have the art yet))','2015-10-01 22:25:40',NULL),(10009,10320,21,10,'Blend10','Blend your dreams past and present. Make amends for your past so you can move into the future. While doing that, catch up on things you have missed so you can be fully prepared to move forward.','2015-10-01 22:35:09',NULL),(10009,10788,18,1,'Chamele-Learn','Our City hides many gems out in the open. I\'m in need of such gems. Collect non-elemens that have the first color of Plum, Teal, Blood, or Tan. Try to gather at least two of each. We will discuss the Art of Chamele upon your return.','2015-10-01 22:48:07',NULL),(10697,10702,70,70,'Flame 70','You are just returning to the city after quite the absence. You\'ve recently regained your abilities as a teacher and now it is time for you light some flames under your fellow SoulMasters. Gather the SMs and decide on something that is beneficial to your focus. Devise a plan, and execute it. Keep in mind the magnitude of a plat to 70, and ensure that your efforts meet the reward you seek.','2015-10-02 01:09:47',NULL),(10697,10050,51,40,'Locate to 40','I need to update my house rosters. Find out who is in each house their spheres anf focus. Freesouls are a bonus and so are mares. Knowing who belongs where is always a plus.','2015-10-02 01:14:41',NULL),(10097,10796,71,1,'Flameruin','For this task I\'d like you to ask three dreamers what they use their flame fors that benfit them. Also if you could get someone to slay a bogram for you while you witness it so you can see its benifit. Return to me for a discussion on flame. ','2015-10-02 03:19:33',NULL),(10745,10750,29,1,'Arnaya: Poison','Us SMs can weld arts to help or harm. This is the first you will learn to cause harm. Why did you chose to harm first? Seek out three other SMs with Poison. Find out what they chose first and why. Bring a codex from each. Also what is Dina up to with her research? How is she planning to alteror it? Report back when you have this completed. To free your pack, you may bring the codices as your interviews are completed. ~CK','2015-10-02 07:20:45',NULL),(10779,10745,8,10,'Protection 10','Remind the new to defending Calenture the best practices of defense and offense on our facade. Tips tricks and other wonderful advice.','2015-10-02 22:06:52',NULL),(10108,10745,144,1,'Chaos Well - CK','Chaos Well holds essences, like a bag. But is that what it actually does? I want you to talk to a few folks, Dakkoth specifically, but others as well, on their theory of what a Chaos Well does, exactly. Then come up with your own version. Let me know!\r\n','2015-10-03 06:39:28',NULL),(10107,10003,22,20,'Forge 20 - Pt 3-Lio','I want you to find an invisible gen in the dream.  From there, pick out three items that you find and forge a copy of them. Forge them as though you have no sight.  All you can tell is the feel of the item. Try to capture the texture, the surfaces and the tactile elements of the item. Colours are irrelevant.\r\n','2015-10-04 19:13:43',NULL),(10746,10007,8,20,'Protection~20','As a trapper, you are aware that there are many different traps within the City.  What are some of the worst traps and can we protect ourselves from them? Devise an item that could assist with protection from the trap that you yourself fear the most. }\'|\'{','2015-10-04 20:40:51',NULL),(10107,10009,16,50,'ID 50 - Dreiko','The art of Identify has always needed a bit of a facelift, in my opinion.  Beyond the basics, what other features do you think Identify might behold? I have a few ideas, but those are for after the report.  If you could add one other attribute to ID what would it be?  Furthermore, do you think the dream would also want these features or would they not?  Why? Maybe ask around for a couple opinions.\r\n','2015-10-04 20:55:54',NULL),(10779,10750,26,10,'Purify 10 - Arnaya',' I want you to play a game that I used to be fond of bringing up when I was a member of Bardic, but put your own spin on it. Think up a paragraph of a fictional story, and tell it to someone, then, have them inscribe one, and show it to the next person. When you feel you have enough I want you to think how something can start as one thing and be corrupted or scrambeled when passed from person to person.','2015-10-05 02:55:42',NULL),(10779,10108,44,20,'Clarity - FStorm 20','With two similar arts, Firestorm and Razorwind, why is there such a variation in perception of the two. It seems silly one simply replaces the other, but theorize practical battle application for both of them. Do any other focii have arts that seem to be randomly duplicated, or are Fatesenders the only ones?','2015-10-05 03:17:05',NULL),(10136,10750,30,1,'Antidote Arnaya ','You know what Antidote does, but HOW does it do it?? You\'ll have to tell me how Poison works, and then how Antidote works in full detail in order to keep my attention! Let\'s see how much you know about your focus in order to get this one correctly. It may be trickier than you think!','2015-10-05 03:39:14',NULL),(10350,10750,116,1,'WordSmith Mark','Wordsmith Grant for Dream Reporter after several informative reports incharacter on the forums.','2015-10-05 04:33:04',NULL),(10125,10796,60,1,'1st sphere Jones','Original quest was written on a codex.  Details were to discover the types of talisman of the city, nightmares, and new areas available to a first sphere.  ~D','2015-10-05 04:34:57',NULL),(10108,10005,105,1,'PC','Welcome home. For the next two days, I\'d like to see you actively hunting or genning to bring supplies in for the war, or use the Pt\'s in the vault to make replacement elemens and shields. Report to me on the boards each day. If more PT\'s are required, I\'ll supply them, just let me know.\r\n','2015-10-05 04:44:18',NULL),(10009,10050,18,40,'Chamele40','Chameling your intentions makes for a fun endeavor. Find a couple of dreamers that do not know their way through the Path of Madness. Pretend you know the path and offer to show them. Figure out the way through as a group.','2015-10-07 00:39:06',NULL),(10702,10088,46,40,'recall40~ Vamp','Devise a plan to reforge the SM blade with the pieces we have.~ S','2015-10-07 01:51:09',NULL),(10009,10136,60,5,'Regain 5th Sphere','Threshold is boring. Get people away from it. Try to vary them as much as possible and bring some uniqueness to those who attend. If possible, incorporate some minions into the planning and advertisement process to spread the word as far as possible.','2015-10-07 02:25:12',NULL),(10107,10750,16,1,'ID Learn - Arnaya','Knowing what you hold is very important.  In many cases, it can be critical in a battle.  However, the knowledge of what you possess and it\'s capabilities can learn to find new knowledge.  I\'d like you to explore what branch of knowledge you\'d like to explore.  Tell me how Identify can help and if it will lead to new knowledge down the road.\r\n','2015-10-07 03:50:01',NULL),(10480,10400,6,40,'Meditate 40','You have asked me for help to reopen the guild, or support as it were, you seem confused with my answer for now. In the past GateKeepers have assumed that hording within a wall from all others would save us, and evidence has proven otherwise. How can we prevent this in the future with a guild hall?','2015-10-07 04:09:59',NULL),(10779,10253,71,1,'FlameRuin','Find 3 other dreamers and ask them what other usage that use their flame for besides attacking something. Return to me with the uses and Names of the deramers then we will have a discussion on Flameruin.','2015-10-07 04:44:17',NULL),(10779,10572,86,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Setting up Relgric\'s teaching arts, policies reviewed and discussed','2015-10-07 04:52:56',NULL),(10779,10572,87,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Setting up Relgric\'s teaching arts, policies reviewed and discussed','2015-10-07 04:53:00',NULL),(10779,10572,102,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Setting up Relgric\'s teaching arts, policies reviewed and discussed','2015-10-07 04:53:05',NULL),(10779,10797,86,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Setting up Magerum\'s teaching arts, policies reviewed and discussed','2015-10-07 04:57:12',NULL),(10779,10797,87,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Setting up Relgric\'s teaching arts, policies reviewed and discussed','2015-10-07 04:57:18',NULL),(10779,10572,44,20,'Relgric - 20 Fire','Firestorm is one of the most noticeable thresholds for a Fatesender. Find a cause or individual that could use your skills and experiences as a Fatesender and an Idaoclesian to serve them in some capacity.  Do this twice.','2015-10-07 05:12:37',NULL),(10480,10455,52,30,'Train 30','For this journey I wish for you to create a Newly to Fourty Handbook. In this book I wish for you to cover all of the things that one would need to know for each sphere. Include in the handbook anything that you deem worthy like a list of teachers, genning spots, rooms they will unlock, how to gain energy...things of this nature and much more. It needs to be something that you can keep and access as you progress with your train. Make your effort worthy of the plateau you seek. **A**','2015-10-07 05:33:44',NULL),(10062,10717,1,20,'GK 20','Create a Guide to GateKeepers! I\'m looking for a series of codii that will outline for new GateKeepers the methods in which they should improve themselves. In your guide list priorities, secondary objectives, pack proficiency, and of course battle tactics! Return to me with your guide for consideration.\r\n','2015-10-07 05:35:53',NULL),(10480,10018,7,50,'Resist Fear 50','Current issues in the City have many feeling fear, the destruction of objects, the constant threat of war, missing elders, failure to obtain something...there must be a way to help quiet these fears and to regain focus. Think on the events of the city and see all sides and the way fear is driving things. Find answers to help remove that fear. **A**','2015-10-07 06:08:32',NULL),(10455,10108,100,10,'PT 10 - Clarity',' I\'d like you plant a seed of hope, or doom, someplace in the City. When deciding, think about how branching off from the mainstream from time to time creates or destroys pockets of power within the City. Come up with an idea for both, and report it to me. Finally, what is the most important token you posses. Good luck, ~Fangx\r\n','2015-10-07 06:09:25',NULL),(10746,10009,14,20,'Your own domain','I would like you to find a room in each of the following: Umbric, one of the Rifts and Threshold Pits and claim it as your own complete with desciption and any changes you would make to them.  Be prepared to show them to me.','2015-10-08 01:01:44',NULL),(10007,10545,29,40,'Poison 40','You don\'t have to hold an experiment, but I will want you to come up with an elixir that will help make sure this experiment keeps working. You and I will get together to make it (under your plan) and then we will have you distribute it out to those that drank the poison tonight.','2015-10-08 03:18:16',NULL),(10125,10750,25,20,'Reweave - 20','I have given you an item that has seen better dreams.  It is damaged so badly that it is not quite distinguishable as to it\'s true form.  Your job will be to gather any materials you see fit and reweave it to its original form.  Bonus if you are able to enhance it in the process.  ~Dakk','2015-10-08 05:35:59',NULL),(10007,10050,46,30,'Recall 30','I would like for you to recall two stories from your past that included two wars. Who was in this war and why? Then we will talk about the differences of the past and now, on how we recover from such times. I would like the stories very detailed, so dig into that memory of yours.','2015-10-09 01:08:10',NULL),(10022,10050,38,10,'Scare10-Cuero','Create a fictional monster and write a short story about it that involves the art of scare. You can make it truely evil or just misunderstood. Doesnt have to be a novel, or biography...just something simple but does have some substance to it. Put the story on codex to be placed in the library, hopefully for later use if the Lyceum ever springs back up.','2015-10-09 01:59:23',NULL),(10107,10050,16,40,'Identify 40 - Cuero','Consider the art of Identify as it could be applied in a general sense to a location.  What if we could locate hidden portals or items.  Would there be a way to use it to scan a place or a house for specific items?  Think of how Identify can be used on a macro level instead of a micro level.\r\n','2015-10-09 03:44:35',NULL),(10779,10007,67,60,'Dina - SReaper 60','Selika is attempting to create a Soulmaster blade to fix the perception that Soulmasters have no sting, and that there arts are meant primarily for healing. The Gatekeepers have obtained a focal blade, and the DreamSeers are in the process of creating their own. Attempt to help Soulmasters, with or without Selika\'s assistance, toward the end, or forge a new path on your own.\r\n','2015-10-09 04:03:03',NULL),(10779,10007,67,60,'Addendum: SReap 60','Damn! Selika and Vampyro beat you to forging the blade, ugh! Let\'s pretend they didn\'t. Gather the materials you\'ve mentioned and give me a couple codexes that include the following: why those materials, what\'s special about them? What would your forging process had looked like?','2015-10-09 04:03:03',NULL),(10797,10018,13,40,'Quest: Magerum','Return 40: Return to me with information.  Return me a codex with all pertinent information you can think of on each house.  Who is who, for who.  Return to this old dreamer a sense of knowing what the city holds.','2015-10-09 04:15:37',NULL),(10108,10125,144,1,'Chaos Well - Dakk','As a member of the team that helped create Chaos Well for us, but was never able to see the fruits of the labor, take some time to discuss with others what, exactly, the art does! Find out a few neet things about it, other then it being an essence storage device. Ask each person you speak with to create one for you and compare the differences!','2015-10-09 04:33:08',NULL),(10480,10009,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Raised to Master Teacher.\r\n','2015-10-09 05:08:49',NULL),(10480,10007,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Raised to Master Teacher\r\n','2015-10-09 05:08:56',NULL),(10480,10125,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Raised to Master Teacher\r\n','2015-10-09 05:09:01',NULL),(10779,10572,44,30,'Firestorm 30','For this journey, I would have you contemplate both Firestorm and Razorwind. I would like you to compare and contrast each art. Which is better at what level? Do FateSenders tend to favor one over the other? Which is your favorite and why? Just a few of the questions that you could think about. Please prepare a report worthy of the plateau that you seek. Find me when you are ready and we will discuss your thoughts. **A**','2015-10-09 05:13:02',NULL),(10779,10067,88,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Ordaining Tamarisk\r\n','2015-10-09 05:36:19',NULL),(10779,10009,144,40,'Dreiko - CW 40','You have a lot of boxes to check off your list before you\'re ready to become a Master Teacher, and you have some on your to-do list. Fill some of those boxes in a manner you see fit, and provide me information about what you learned in doing so. Additionally, fill two of your Chaos Wells and bring them to me.','2015-10-09 05:38:24',NULL),(10779,10018,52,50,'Jade - Train 50','Come out from behind BladeSlayer\'s shadow, and visibly wear the colored crest you bear. Task your initiates and guardians in an effort to fulfill this goal. The nature of your emergence and its severity are yours to dictate, however it should be worthy of the plateau you seek.','2015-10-09 06:12:24',NULL),(10779,10018,88,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Ordaining Jade, approved by Akkadian','2015-10-09 06:23:21',NULL),(10107,10022,46,30,'Recall 30 - Blade','The art of Recall is more than just a quick way back to Sanctuary in an emergency, it used to be one of the few sure-fire counters to dreamstrike.  I want you to recall three dreamers who did not concern themselves with recall and it cost them the ultimate price.  Can you name the first dreamer to be struck by another dreamer?','2015-10-09 16:50:04',NULL),(10009,10545,108,1,'Sable-Learn','Develop a set of rules for when it\'s permitted to take Chakrams from the Vault and Armory. It should allow for cases where a member really needs something but also ensure that we are supplied for when we actually need them.','2015-10-09 19:25:58',NULL),(10018,10050,139,1,'L: Sense Datoken ','Attempt at least three times to collapse a Datoken with only your blade and flame. Bring back their essence(s), if you succeed.','2015-10-09 22:38:21',NULL),(10007,10745,30,30,'Antidote 30','I will be handing you an item that is full of poison. You are unable to slice it open to release the poison or burn it. I want you to find other ways to rid this flower of its poison. Bring me back the flower showing that there is no poison left in it.','2015-10-09 23:16:28',NULL),(10009,10717,60,3,'Sphere 3','Shae is working to organize a dreamwide event to allow Dreamers to take a step back from their general busyness. Help her plan, organize, and conduct one event. Play the Master of Ceremony and quite possibly the life of the party.','2015-10-10 02:27:58',NULL),(10097,10796,47,1,'Push','Push your way into conversations and see if you can find some dreamers and get a conversation going on what uses Push has. Tell me what you learn from this conversation and then return for our conversation on the art. ','2015-10-10 02:45:10',NULL),(10746,10745,32,20,'Drain - 20','So many things within the City can drain our energy as we drain it from the nightmare essences. What is the greatest drain on your energy and how do you counter it?  Can this be applied to others within the City? }\'|\'{','2015-10-10 04:53:43',NULL),(10108,10253,40,1,'Deafen - Learn!','Deafen is the first step taken to learning to master the art of control illusion. As such, I\'d like you to do two things. Firstly, ask those around the city how they think deafen works. Then, I want you to, upon the completion of the first, to sit with me and get a good, solid feel for how we fatesenders make deafen work.','2015-10-10 05:12:36',NULL),(10002,10239,12,50,'Shatter to 50 test','Testing server and database changes for questing and logs.','2015-10-10 18:16:01','2015-10-10 17:52:42'),(10002,10026,1,60,'GK60:Golah','I have heard that you are a creator of things. I am not familiar with your work; I would like for you to present to me a variety of items created by your hand that would be most useful to a GateKeeper. Present a history of each, and why you think they would be a part of those infused with will.','2015-10-11 03:17:18','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10022,108,1,'SableShield-Learn','Create a detailed list of members of the Light that will be able to provide assistance in the rescue of Herbert. Group them based on fighting and support abilities. Determine who would be best to lead the group of dreamers that is meant to deceive Kael and lead him away while the rest focus on the direct rescue.','2015-10-11 20:34:17','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10062,10136,108,1,'Sable Shield Learn','Bring in 2000 strength for the house prime. Make sure you get a receipt!\r\n','2015-10-11 22:19:10','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10007,10253,60,1,'First Sphere','I want you to tell me everything you have learned here in our city to see if you seem ready for first sphere.','2015-10-12 02:50:58','2015-10-12 02:25:38'),(10009,10050,144,40,'CW-40','Chaos Well is an intriguing test case in that it\'s a brand new art that everyone is tasking for. This leads to very mundane and repetative tasks. Come up with a sample task for each plateau from a learn to a forty for Chaos Well. Try to be as creative as possible while also focusing on the correct difficulty. While doing this, fill up at least two of your Chaos Wells and bring them to me.','2015-10-12 03:16:18','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10797,10062,65,50,'Quest: Magerum','Blade50: You have clearly demonstrated mastery of your blade.  Defeat a shamblix with your blade.  You may use any means you deem fit to accomplish this task.  Report back, in detail, how you accomplished this','2015-10-13 05:16:06','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10107,10050,64,20,'Give 40 - Cuero','I want you to take a group of dreamers, at least 2 others, and take them to a place in the dream that has a deep, personal meaning.  I want you to give them an original tale of your own creation about the act of giving.  It can be a comedy or a tragedy, but it has to relate to a dreamer giving something without any expectation in return.\r\n','2015-10-13 21:09:24','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10007,10136,35,20,'Trap Nightmare 20','I would like for you to use your \"charm\" and \"wits\". I would like for you to help a newly get a sphere, teach them the ropes of our city, help them make friends, and help them become their own dreamer. I would like for this dreamer to also join our house. Bring me all this info to me on who you helped and what you did for them. I look forward to seeing who you bring to our great cause!','2015-10-14 00:18:26','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10050,60,5,'5th Sphere','The Consortium has begun controlling Dark Mares and using them to their bidding. Determine how this is working and obtain information from witnesses (Arnaya would be a good resource) of what they did. Once you have an idea of how this works, develop a plan and process to block their ability to do this. Once you are confident in your plan, organize a full strike against the Consortium\'s pets, with the hope of permanently severing the tie.','2015-10-14 00:26:41','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10136,87,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Should have been granted when Quest was.\r\n','2015-10-14 00:45:34','2015-10-14 00:45:26'),(10022,10702,67,70,'Selika - SoulReaper','Recently a blade was created through shards of an ancient blade that were found. A GateSmasher was created which Jerulan wielded against the Darkmares, it was imbued with certain powers. Discover the history and means by which this blade came into being. Devise a way to create a blade of equal strength which a SoulMaster may wield, attempt to bring this blade into existence. ','2015-10-14 01:05:47','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10136,9,20,'FA 20 - Shae','Obtain information from House Calenture, Dreamers of Light, Alliance of the Eclipse and the Consortium if possible that you suspect they would not freely give. Share the information to the benefit of your house in whatever way you can think of.','2015-10-14 01:11:40','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10022,10136,7,10,'RF-10Shae','Through the use of RF you can resist the effects of scare. Some thing arent so easily resisted. Come up with some things you, Shae, simply cannot resist. Then speak with a couple of dreamers and see if they have simular vices. I wanna hear about some odd or juicy things that those cannot resist. Come back and report to me some of your findings so we can giggle at them while we gossip about it.','2015-10-14 01:17:15','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10550,10022,74,50,'Mind Blank 50','You have recently come into possession with the Sabled Sphere. Two primes, one that imprisons, one that drains. Yin and Yang, Alpha and Omega, Lightness and Dark. What will you do? The Sabled Sphere is at your mercy. Make attempts with your home as a collective to \"tinker\" with the newly acquired prime. Your mission: \"Mind Blank\" the Sabled Sphere, and see how it can possibly be manipulated in such a way where the Light herself can benefit from actual or potential changes. ','2015-10-14 01:37:23','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10088,139,1,'Sense Datoken-Learn','Dreamers have the capability to sense Datoke before they arrive, however, they are always unprepared. I want you to find groups of dreamers and catch them unaware with this charm. Make a show of it, pretend to be a mare if you wish but teach them to be ready for anything!','2015-10-14 02:00:10','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10797,10400,10,40,'Quest: Magerum','Ward 40: Identify and control traffic in a high-traffic area with your wards.  It may to redirect to a specific path, or prevent all together.  Do this for a total of 4 1 hour increments','2015-10-15 03:53:51','2015-10-10 23:16:53'),(10018,10050,7,20,'RF 20','Rewrite on an incorrectly written FA 20 that should have been RF 20. - With the possiblility of Bandaret being under the Consortium\'s influence, and him originally being a dreamer..what are some ways you could alter the device you created to target the mares, and have it work on a dreamer turned mare? Report back the idea(s)','2015-10-16 06:04:49','2015-10-16 06:04:19'),(10009,10050,15,30,'Judgment30','Judgment has the unique ability to avoid detection when evoking on a target. What are your odds of doing a similar thing? Go out in the City and conduct some acts that may be frowned upon if they were traced to you. Attempt to avoid detection whenever possible. How often were you able to do so? Did you get better at it as time went on? Were you judged for your actions?','2015-10-17 01:46:30','2015-10-12 22:06:09'),(10107,10050,50,10,'NMF 10 - Cuero','This task was tagged incorrectly as Newly Awakened. He gave a great report on what would happen if Nightmare Form was found in charms.  He also reported on if there were any perceivable benefits.  The report was more than satisfactory.','2015-10-17 03:18:16','2015-10-17 03:18:08'),(10009,10400,60,5,'Sphere 5','Identify several locations in the City that could use improvements, preferably in well-traveled areas. Develop a plan to expand or repair them and collect a few dreamers to assist you in the plan. Set up tolls to pay for the improvements as well as constructing them. Ensure to perform at each location multiple times to allow for full completion of this task.','2015-10-17 04:22:18','2015-10-17 04:21:51'),(10550,10050,19,50,'Vision: 5th Mastery','Cuero, your mission is to convert your past experiences of Guardianship and Rulership in Idoclesia. Teach this \"Vision\" to the leadership of your home. Given the fact that the Order has recently gone through a plethora of changes, membership and beliefs wise,  this \"Vision\" will be evoked upon the City - show the outsiders the capability of the Order.','2015-10-17 04:36:43','2015-10-14 01:45:25'),(10022,10050,22,1,'Cuero: Forge L P4','One final part, a test of sorts. I will show you an object, you will write for me a description of an object which you would forge, based on that short viewing. Gaining the art will be based on the level of detail and craftsmanship you display.\r\n','2015-10-17 06:27:10','2015-10-17 06:08:46'),(10779,10411,6,40,'Aidan Meditate 40','Choose a dreamer who is higher sphere than yourself who is not a member of your house.  Convince them to follow you and lead them to a room that dead ends with only 1 portal.  Ward this portal, then keep them there until the ward falls.  Do not allow them to shatter or blend out.  How you keep them there is up to you and how you explain your actions are up to you, but you may not tell them about it being a task.','2015-10-18 02:34:03','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10411,1,50,'GK50:Aidan','Get something going with your house. It\'s too quiet up on the hill. Make some noise up there, let everyone know your house still stands.','2015-10-18 02:45:01','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10003,36,50,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Accidentally destroyed the quest codex --- this task was written weeks ago for Dreamblade for Liolira. She was tasked with reforging the blade Cognizant Talon, the Dreamseer Focal Blade.','2015-10-18 02:57:36','2015-10-18 02:57:26'),(10779,10022,28,80,'Abjure 80','I know you to be one that can make things happen. I wish for you to strip away at what is keeping the Focus Guilds from being a greater force in the City. I want to know why they have not found their prospective Guild Houses. Motivate your own Guild to become a shining example for the other three to follow. Share your ideas with those of other focus that you think would be strong advocates for their Guild. If enough work is put into the Guilds, then rewards will follow. Make your efforts worthy. **A**','2015-10-18 04:16:40','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10750,67,30,'Arnaya - SReaper 30','Win three battles in a way that does not involve a blade. Use your imagination and think outside the box. Be prepared to defend your choices whatever you decide.','2015-10-18 04:50:16','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10022,10717,144,1,'ChaosWell-Will','To learn the art of Chaos Well I want you to create something like a wishing well. Get a small group of dreamers together, nothing planned just whenever you come along a small crowd, and ask them all to inscribe two \'wishes\'. Something they would like to know about each other and something someone could do. (Truth or dare) Get them to throw all the \'wishes\' into a pile in the middle of the room and take turns choosing and answering/doing them.','2015-10-18 06:24:38','2015-10-16 18:50:37'),(10728,10022,67,80,'Reaper to 80','Many say SoulMasters have no bite. Fix this. Work with your fellow dreamers - not just other SoulMasters - to try and improve at least two Resilience Arts to cause damange (either directly or by hindering the target). While you do not have to be successful in your attempts, you better try damn hard!','2015-10-18 07:37:03','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10728,10008,52,1,'Quest: Figment','Granting Kailee a probationary halo.  Figment will keep an eye on her tasks and review them with her as she goes.  Once she has several \"good\" tasks, she will be finished with her mentorship and given her support arts.','2015-10-18 07:55:29','2015-10-18 07:53:00'),(10755,10746,105,10,'Poison Cloud to 10','When meeting with your house members, discuss the potential effect the Soulmaster\'s work on Poison and other arts may have on Poison Cloud.  Will it improve, be degraded, or not change at all and why?  Also, meet with the other house leaders and propose a diplomatic agreement to cultivate mutual respect in inter-house communications.  Do other houses agree to such terms?  Why or why not?','2015-10-18 21:23:43','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10728,10311,4,50,'FateSender 50','At this level you should start to feel yourelf coming into your own. I wish for you to define for me what a FateSender is to you. Also gather from others what they think a FateSender is. After you have gathered information from at least three others as well as yourself, tell me of your favorite two FateSender arts and why you chose them. When you have finished, we will have a chat about your focus and your thoughts on the future. **A**','2015-10-18 23:09:47','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10136,10253,47,10,'Push10 Lucy','Push the boundaries of the dreamers around you. Find things to do that pushes their patience. Ask continuous questions, or pinch their arm- do something uniquely annoying! Tell me what you learn about dreamers by doing this. Why is it important to know the limitations of patience of those around you?','2015-10-19 01:55:30','2015-10-14 05:12:36'),(10480,10050,24,20,'Cuero Restore 20','The art is good for helping another dreamer but the dream needs a BIT OF restoring how to dream. think on this and find me 5 ways we might restore our dreams. @>-\',-- Raefa','2015-10-19 02:48:34','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10050,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After an interview with his Mentor, Dreiko, I have decided to accept Cuero as a true apprentice, thus the training of Quest.\r\n','2015-10-19 03:07:28','2015-10-19 03:04:13'),(10018,10550,111,1,'L: Dazzle','Too much seriousness can make things a bit stale. Dazzle the house with a good time! I want you to come up with a small outing/event or whatever you like for the Light to let off some steam and enjoy theirselves.','2015-10-19 04:29:45','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10007,10253,60,2,'2nd sphere - Inter','When we speak for your interview, it is time you learn about what more is going on around the city. Why is DoL at war with AoE? Who are the Consortium and why are they on our bad side? I know you are in OoSM, but I want to make sure you know all the beliefs of all the open houses. This sphere is where you should have certain information about ongoing issues in the City.','2015-10-19 04:41:40','2015-10-19 03:48:07'),(10018,10400,12,10,'Shatter 10','Attempt to shatter the opinion that you are an untrustworthy fellow. Do three good deeds that helps three different people in some way to gain the plateau you seek. ','2015-10-19 04:47:44','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10018,10050,47,40,'Push 40','How easy is it to Push someone without visibly doing so? With the power of suggestion and reverse psychology, attempt to manipulate someone into doing something to fulfill a goal of yours, or simply for the fun of it. How did it turn out?','2015-10-20 00:36:54','2015-10-17 01:04:58'),(10009,10400,108,1,'Sable-Learn','Assist our Soulmasters in trapping through whatever means you can. Aim for at least 1000 strength. Receipts are not necessary as I keep a close eye on prime strength.','2015-10-20 02:11:27','2015-10-19 02:33:28'),(10088,10050,26,20,'Purify 20','I\'ve been making a HUGE push to make my Tavern relevant again. So.... merely hold a tasting contest! The gin you love so much... I want you to collect the necessary ingredients to *try* and make 3 forms of your OWN. Do a taste testing here - no huge crowd, no public knowledge, but with friends.. and see which blends wins. Then.. let me taste it, and I\'ll see if mine is better!\r\n','2015-10-20 02:32:50','2015-10-14 02:07:05'),(10018,10400,13,1,'L: Return','Revised add-on: Pick three participants to play a game of Wild Portals. Behind each of the three portals you will leave a codex: One reading Pain, the next Nothing, and the other Reward. If the player enters the Reward room, you will give them an item. Nothing is self explanatory. Finally, the pain room is will be warded. You can choose to either collapse or simply damage them.','2015-10-20 04:14:29','2015-10-20 03:09:44'),(10018,10400,13,1,'L: Return','Discover the use of this medallion you acquired, and Return it to the Dreamers of Light. The trade needs to be handled discreetly, and no one but your Rulership is to know about it.','2015-10-20 04:14:29','2015-10-19 05:51:02'),(10018,10400,13,1,'L: Return','Revised add-on: Pick two participants to play a game of Wild Portals. Behind each of the three portals you will leave a codex: One reading Pain, the next Nother, and the other Reward. If the player enters the Reward room, you will give them an item. Nothing is self explanatory. Finally, the pain room is will be warded. You can choose to either collapse or simply damage them.','2015-10-20 04:14:29','2015-10-20 03:08:56'),(10062,10018,141,30,'Kinesis 30 | Jade','Push someone indirectly to do something they wouldn\'t normally do. Whatever it is you seek to have them do, ensure it is something that pushes noticeable progression in your current endeavors. Report back the details.','2015-10-20 05:00:46','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10745,10750,74,1,'Arnaya: Mind Blank','To work alone, in solitary, in peace, in loneliness. In your private thoughts, pause, reflect on what being blanked to all those around you would mean to your dreams. If no dreamer were to dream, no mare to be slain, no art to evoke, no talisman to uncover. What would you do? Write a poem about this experience, share with me in codex, and upon report post it to the scrolls for all.','2015-10-20 21:21:10','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10107,10050,23,50,'Recharge 50 - Cuero','Consider what the implications of recharging all of the houses of underlight.  With the closure of 4 houses, all of which have been somewhat reinhabited or repurposed... Is the problem related to the houses that there aren\'t enough dreamers and therefore less houses, or is it there aren\'t enough houses and therefore there are less dreamers.  Among all 8 houses of Lyran and the houses of Idoaclesia, which make the most sense in this convergence of the two varients?  Is what we have the best for the city?\r\n','2015-10-20 23:43:46','2015-10-19 04:22:15'),(10107,10746,14,30,'Know 40 - Arlyana','I\'d like you to go outside of threshold and find some rooms that have features you can detect with know.  Are they appropriate for the space, do they feel the same as you feel?  Find three rooms that are seldom travelled and create your own know description for each of them.','2015-10-21 00:08:47','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10746,144,30,'CW-30','Chaos Well is the newest art in the City and was created by a group disperse group of Dreamers. Sense Datoken, on the other hand, was the last art created in our City. It was created primarily by Folko and Black-Lotus as an example of what you could do with a prime beyond general House Maintenance. Write a version of history that covers the creation of Sense Datoken. Feel free to stretch reality as you wish. Present the story to a collection of dreamers and write it on the scrolls to be remembered.','2015-10-21 00:35:05','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10746,10066,105,1,'PC-relearn','Serve the house for a day: be it hunting, genning or guarding.  Report for your reward.','2015-10-21 00:53:16','2015-10-20 04:30:42'),(10009,10545,60,5,'5th Sphere','The Order has recently undergone a change to stop the practice of Draining Essences and switch to Imprisonment to collect strength. To do this, the Relic will need modified to support this endeavor. Develop a plan for modifying the Relic to Imprison the nightmares put inside it. Utilize as many Dreamers as possible to Forge whatever pieces are necessary for this. Then lead the Order in the modifications to the Relic. Be careful as we will likely only have one chance to do the modifications properly.','2015-10-21 01:20:53','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10002,10702,112,1,'Guild House','Granting the art of Guild House to reward the SM Guild for their works as an inclusive Guild and successfully improving arts like Poison, Vamp Draw, Healing Aura.','2015-10-21 01:54:14','2015-10-21 01:40:29'),(10002,10022,112,1,'Guild House','Granting the art of Guild House to reward the SM Guild for their works as an inclusive Guild and successfully improving arts like Poison, Vamp Draw, Healing Aura.','2015-10-21 01:54:27','2015-10-21 01:40:11'),(10002,10545,112,1,'Guild House','Granting the art of Guild House to reward the SM Guild for their works as an inclusive Guild and successfully improving arts like Poison, Vamp Draw, Healing Aura.','2015-10-21 01:54:36','2015-10-21 01:40:48'),(10002,10136,112,1,'Guild House','Granting the art of Guild House to reward the SM Guild for their works as an inclusive Guild and successfully improving arts like Poison, Vamp Draw, Healing Aura.','2015-10-21 03:03:47','2015-10-21 02:57:21'),(10550,10750,139,1,'S.Datoken - Learn','House prime creation is an interesting concept and phenomenon, that took a bit of trial-and-error to \"get it right\" back in former times. Hypothetically speaking, you are to use your current art of \"Sense Prime\". Gain a feel of its general location, and conjure a theory on how it can be extracted for use for yours and Rasputin\'s purpose.','2015-10-21 03:51:56','2015-10-15 22:36:44'),(10779,10018,11,50,'Amulet 50 - Jade','((Accidentally written for Dreiko, rewritting and honoring from Nils))  	Keys, keys, keys. You GateKeepers and your locks. What holds the Light back, and how can you fix it? Make a plan, and take the first step. Find me after, and let me hear your plan. ','2015-10-21 04:51:50','2015-10-21 04:34:17'),(10779,10717,65,20,'Will - GSmash 20','Attempt to collapse a Datoken or Dark Mare with just your blade and flame. Regale me the tales of your adventure, either the utter failure, or the thrilling success.','2015-10-21 05:08:11','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10018,10062,74,50,'Mind Blank 50','Mind Blank may veil our true whereabouts, but we can still be traced with Sense Dreamer. How can we increase the art to remove our presence, while still being here? As an aside, why do you think Soul Shield can block this art? ','2015-10-21 05:15:46','2015-10-20 05:09:34'),(10779,10400,1,50,'GK 50 - Harkyn','Skilled with ward and a chakram, but is that all there is to you? You can collapse a Dark Mare or a Datoken alone, but a warrior who lives alone dies alone. Facilitate relationships with all active members of the Order, and help them out. Did you learn anything new about them? Help at least one of them with a project, and become a member of the house whose crest you hide.','2015-10-21 05:26:22','2015-10-18 02:38:32'),(10702,10750,24,20,'res20~ Arnaya','You mentioned the possibility of cleaning or restoring some parts of the City. Which places were you referring to? If you could choose one, how would you clean/restore it? Come up with an idea to discuss, and we will see about getting extra hands to do it~ S','2015-10-22 00:16:01','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10007,10050,72,40,'Inscribe 40','Come up with a fun game that will get others involved, at least 5 or more. I want you to use your Inscribe for this game. I will leave this a bit open for you to come up with a game you like, but as I said, it must involve at least 5 people and the art Inscribe. Have prizes too! I expect a full report and effort in this.','2015-10-22 04:09:30','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10007,112,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Granting Dina Guild House for her amazing, and solely led and executed all by herself, work on Poison','2015-10-23 03:47:05','2015-10-23 03:45:59'),(10779,10400,65,50,'GateSmasher 50','As a GateKeeper progresses, so does their strength. They are more powerful than the other foci in this respect. I wish for you to experiment with your blade against the other three blades and compair the strength differences. After that, find one strength that each of the other focus have that GateKeepers lack. We will discuss. Make your efforts worthy. **A**','2015-10-23 04:14:49','2015-10-19 03:20:37'),(10007,10545,70,40,'Flame 40','I would like for you to work with me on coming up with some new projects for our house. Speak with the others in the house to see what they are working on to get ideas. Bring them to me and who you spoke with, we will discuss what we can do and then place it on the board for the whole house to get involved. Come up with at least 3 or 4 ideas please.','2015-10-23 04:44:07','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10728,10009,23,70,'Dreiko Recharge 70','I\'m so glad you are tasking from me!  Collect \"useless\" items around the dream!  Hold a class on item manipulation and show how these useless items can be transformed into \"powerful\" items using your forge!  I\'m sure you\'ll do great at this and your efforts will be worthy of a 70 plateau!','2015-10-24 02:46:15','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10018,10400,10,50,'Ward 50','Now\'s the time to put your Ward to good use. Lu Chaos has found an item that can possibly be used to save a dreamer. Put in some effort in an attempt to obtain this Jade Amulet for me. Persuasion, trade, trickery or even force.','2015-10-24 04:36:44','2015-10-21 05:22:14'),(10797,10400,68,50,'Quest: Magerum','Flame 50:  Challenge 10 dreamers to a flame duel.  You may agree upon rules (to collapse, or hit count etc).  Summarize and report the results.  Defeat 5 Shamblix with your flame, count the number of evocations it takes and report the average count.','2015-10-24 05:16:16','2015-10-18 04:38:04'),(10797,10717,11,1,'Quest: Magerum','Learn: Amulet.  A Gatekeepers amulet is one of his prized possesions.  With it their ward is neutralized.  Express a basic understanding of what arts a Gatekeepers specificly neutralize.  List the art and the effect they counter.','2015-10-24 06:50:35','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10238,10011,45,10,'Razorwind of Fear','Razorwind is the most fear art in the City to most.  Chatter about beginning to evoke it, start the evocation and then stop.  Listen to the reaction of the folks around you.  Gauge their fear and why are they so afraid of RW.  Why has this art reached a near mythical feared level.  Ask and learn, understand the power it has without even landing it... the fear it brings.','2015-10-25 00:42:37','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10545,89,1,'SoulShield-Learn','The Consortium\'s reach is beginning to extend and the Dream needs to be shielded from it. Investigate and learn all you can about Arnaya\'s disappearance and the current state of the Jade Amulet. Bring me as much information as you can but remember that time is of utmost importance. We\'ll discuss the mechanics of Soul Shield during your report.','2015-10-25 00:59:47','2015-10-24 01:49:43'),(10238,10796,4,10,'FateSender to 10','Trick or Treat - Is whats given a waste or sweet!   You see those spots in the city generating items?  You see the trinkets dropped by them emphants?!  Gather some stuff, its all junk to most, but you must sell them... without the other seeing them... talk the items up... best you can, make a sales pitch!!  See if you can trade poor goods for great goods.  They might get upset, but remind them of the wonderful item they just got!  Mostly... have fun.  Trade 3-4 items... learn to be a true trickster!','2015-10-25 02:46:30','2015-10-15 00:30:37'),(10746,10066,105,10,'PC to 10','Continue your service to the house in defense and genning.  In addition bring in 100 strength.  Post or tell me in person.','2015-10-25 21:43:17','2015-10-22 03:00:07'),(10007,10746,73,40,'DT 40','With parts of my City being destroyed and not coming to this variant, to an artifact being destroyed that belonged to Silk Nuvas. I want you to tell me 3 different stories from your city where important things were destroyed. I would like to hear about some of your history. They don\'t need to be very lengthy, but I do want details about the full story.','2015-10-25 22:13:40','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10797,10018,13,50,'Quest: Magerum','Return 50:  Weigh the arts, Return, Reflect, DreamQuake, & Ward.  Determine their \"worth\" to you and return to me a report as to which are you believe is the Gatekeepers defining art and why.','2015-10-26 00:55:53','2015-10-10 21:58:08'),(10779,10007,27,50,'Dina Drain 50','The Forgers are making an item but they need to make an art to spit this item out. The far reaches of the dream have clues to art making.  Take a party and explore 4 planes and find something out there to help you in art creation.  The party should include people other than just Krodoc.  Have some fun with it. ','2015-10-26 03:10:41','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10545,74,10,'MB10','The rescue of Herbert from the Palisade required the use of his Soul Essence to enlighten the cell area to guide the prisoners to us. Design a device that could provide a similar effect that we could use to rescue Cianne, Xiarasya, and Arnaya. Bring the schematic to me and we can work together to Forge the prototype.','2015-10-26 03:15:39','2015-10-25 01:09:19'),(10779,10066,9,80,'Thunderman FA 80','Break out of your paralysis!  Find your path(s) back within the city and begin down it some meaningful way.  Show the dream that it\'s most powerful Gatekeeper has returned!','2015-10-26 03:27:07','2015-10-18 22:42:32'),(10779,10066,88,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Reinstating Thunderman\r\n','2015-10-26 04:30:15','2015-10-26 04:30:11'),(10018,10148,12,10,'Shatter 20','Come up with a plan -on your own, or with help- to Shatter the leashes the Consortium has placed on some of the DarkMares. Consider the safest method.','2015-10-26 05:37:31','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10802,1,10,'GK 10 - Minka','What does it mean to be a Gatekeeper in this City? What advantages and disadvantages do you feel that you have. Consult other dreamers, Gatekeepers if possible, though those are more rare, and figure it all out. Do you have any plans going forward? What does being a Gatekeeper mean to YOU?','2015-10-26 19:03:33','2015-10-26 17:33:02'),(10779,10318,60,5,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Granting Lu Chaos 5th sphere. He has done a sufficient amount of work behind the scenes in an effort to perpetuate Consortium RP and find potential new members.... as well as sort items.','2015-10-26 19:06:33','2015-10-26 04:00:01'),(10011,10004,9,10,'Zsa Zsa FA 10','Show Savelte around the city. Make sure she knows how to draw a blade, and how to find her way back to threshold, and how to find the houses, and answer any questions she has as best you can. Make her feel welcome! _-* 10.24','2015-10-26 19:41:23','2015-10-24 21:52:29'),(10009,10050,21,1,'Blend-Learn','Blend is a very useful art but also one that requires you to put strategic thought into it. I want you to dive into the Consortium and determine the role of each member. What are their Strengths and Weaknesses? What does each individual provide to the collective? Do this without directly interacting with the Consortium nor directly asking the same person multiple times. We will discuss the basics of Blend during your report.','2015-10-26 23:30:41','2015-10-17 03:42:59'),(10007,10050,73,20,'DT 20','I found this indestructible metal ball from Chasm of Souls. I have tried to smelt it and crush it, but the metal will not render! Find a way to make this big ball of metal disperse! Tell me what you did and how you did it. I need to learn other ways to destroy things.','2015-10-27 00:18:23','2015-10-22 04:25:22'),(10018,10050,8,20,'Protection 20','Protect the Order\'s good name. Why do you think some -such as Lu, Wolflancer, and Seidy- claim it is not the same without Kaer and gD? Do what you can to show them the bigger picture on the changes made for the good.','2015-10-27 04:04:17','2015-10-20 00:45:37'),(10022,10050,74,50,'Cuero-MB50','I want you to make a great effort to change some of the associations made to our house. The first one being blanking out as much as you can any memory of our dark past, the second being associated with any other houses. We are our own presence in the city so help the city realize that we are individualized and a house worth being open. I want to see some results in this effort, when you feel like you have done what Ive asked come report.','2015-10-27 04:04:47','2015-10-16 19:13:56'),(10107,10018,74,60,'Mindblank 60 - Jade','Mindblank is a bit of a connundrum, since it partially meddles with your ability to interact with the dream.  Given the weakness of this tinkering, however, we can still be sensed through sense dreamer. How can we increase our manipulation of ourselves to the point of removing our presence while still being here?  Further to this, I\'d like you to determine how Soul Shield can block this art.  It\'s a bizarre effect, given that mindblank cannot be stacked and therefore cancels with a simple second evoke.\r\n','2015-10-27 04:18:51','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10050,69,50,'TranceFlame50','Learning to use your flame fully will allow you to improve greatly in battle. With this, I want you to collapse some lesser nightmares with the only damage being caused by a flame. Let\'s say 5 Emphants, 5 Bogroms, 1 Agoknight, 2 Shamblixes, and 1 Horron. You may not collapse multiple Nightmares of the same type on the same plane. Keep track of the locations and strategies used.','2015-10-27 20:35:10','2015-10-27 00:52:30'),(10276,10011,107,1,'Peace Aura','Starfall, you wished for and accomplished the return of your crest for the Alliance of the Eclipse.  To learn its house art I would like to sit down with you and learn a great deal about  yourself and the history of this house and its past occupants.  I became interested in this house back when Dakkoth was Guardian.  The Rulership was stagnant so I waited and waited until my day finally came to join its ranks.  Now I want a walk down memory lane, a nice long walk, with you.  Gatekeeper Hannababy','2015-10-27 22:06:46','2015-10-27 04:39:06'),(10062,10400,13,10,'Return 10','Reflect on your earlier dreams and find a little thing you recall most fondly. Return it to your dreams and share it with others. What is it, and who/why/how did you share it?\r\n','2015-10-28 02:55:05','2015-10-21 05:19:04'),(10018,10088,60,5,'5th Sphere','((This task was originally written months ago, targetting random)) Your tavern has went down hill in your absence - it\'s time for a grand reopening! Hold at least three events, with City wide notice. Enlist a team of workers to cater and entertain your guests. The games, prizes, and everything else are up to you!','2015-10-28 03:09:49','2015-10-28 03:09:33'),(10136,10050,25,20,'Reweave20-Cuero','I want you to display to others how the art of reweave can repair things other than shields. Do some research on this ahead of time. You can put together a demonstration of this with a group, or show dreamers individually. Discuss with MTs or an Elder what they know about this.','2015-10-28 03:17:07','2015-10-14 00:37:02'),(10007,10831,47,1,'Push - Learn','There are many nice places to eat those apples in this City. I want you to find a room that fits your description of a nice tree to eat your apples under. Also I want you to find a secondary room that you like, just incase the other is being occupied. Come to me and then be ready to show me these rooms.','2015-10-28 03:55:02','2015-10-25 21:08:05'),(10480,10009,85,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After a short interview and explanation of the responsibilities of on who has the Mark, I am granting DreamSmith to Dreiko.\r\n','2015-10-28 03:58:31','2015-10-28 03:58:23'),(10797,10062,68,50,'Quest: Magerum','Flame 50:  Long ago, after the first Great Awakening.  A Lyran helped open OSM.  This Lyran instructed me on most of my arts.  He appointed Snowblind, Roland, & Amygdala. Rulers, leter myself and Krynn.  He taught me all ways Gatekeeper.  Discover this Lyran\'s name and as much history as you can.','2015-10-28 04:11:12','2015-10-13 05:25:43'),(10480,10022,22,80,'Forge, Eighth Plat','As we discussed, find, acquire, and reforge the fragments of Kruugaar\'s KOES crest.  If possible, use it to gain access inside the KOES house.  If successful, find out how the crest was made, how it was removed/broken, and how you used it to gain access without a Prime or initiation.  Finally, use that knowledge to outline a repeatable process to do the same to gain access to another house - such as POR.  Help in whatever way you can to infiltrate the Consortium.','2015-10-28 05:02:32','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10745,52,10,'Train 10','For this next step in your journey, I wish for you to speak to your fellow teachers and become the student. Learn all that you can from them about how they task for plateaus to ten. Then I would like for you to come up with your own ideas on what you will require from your students when you gain the increase in your Train. Find me when you are ready and we will discuss. **A**','2015-10-28 05:56:29','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10022,10400,22,1,'Harkyn: Forge L P3','You seem to be grasping the fundamentals as well as the concepts concerning forge quite well. I want for you to put these lessons you have learned into practice. Take what you have learned from others and imagine something which you would create. Write a codex detailing each aspect of what it is you would make. Show it to a few dreamers and ask their thoughts on it. Did you alter anything about what you imagined after showing it to other people? Make any changes you wish to the original and return.\r\n','2015-10-28 06:16:06','2015-10-25 02:07:21'),(10480,10750,3,30,'SoulMaster 30','As you grow, so does your power. Does growing too rapidly cause more harm than good? Do you really have time to get comfortable with what you learn before you learn more? How fast is too fast when it comes to growing? As you ponder things, I want you to assist fellow SMs in their work. AoE is working on their generator and telescope, offer assistance to them and learn as you go. Grow into a strong SoulMistress. Make your efforts worthy of the plateau. **A**','2015-10-28 06:31:16','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10018,8,50,'Protection 60','As a sister quest to your Resist Fear, I would like you to continue with your efforts against the Consortium. You are the Protector of the City. Make plans, gather allies and support where you can, reach out to those you think would never assist. I would like to see progress in your fight against the Consortium, but do not be foolish and get yourself hurt. Be smart in your choices and actions. Find me when you have some progress with your task and we will discuss. As always, make your efforts worthy. **A**','2015-10-28 06:54:31','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10066,10796,60,2,'Sph 2 - Jones Shaw','Interview: Asked questions regarding current events of the city. He addressed issues that he claimed were from first hand experience, about Herbert, the Consortium and information he heard through interaction from other dreamers, such as Arnaya and Cianne being freed.','2015-10-29 03:29:03','2015-10-29 03:27:49'),(10007,10253,72,1,'Inscribe - Learn','In my shard there is a holiday that celebrates the dead. Pumpkins that are carved with faces and also candles placed inside to light them up are placed all over! People dress up in costumes! It is so fun. I want you to hand out pumpkins to other dreamers. I want you to pick them out then come to me, I will make sure they are carved nicely, but with your instructions on the way you want them. Lets give out at least 5. Pick your favorite people! ','2015-10-29 06:01:51','2015-10-23 04:09:47'),(10009,10271,60,1,'First Sphere','To reach first sphere, learn the following: What are the five types of nightmares from weakest to strongest. What are the basic capabilities of each? What do Elemens, Alterors, and Chakrams do? What new planes will you be able to reach once you achieve first sphere? ','2015-10-30 03:29:34','2015-10-30 02:30:17'),(10022,10050,50,20,'Cuero: NMF 20','Nightmare Form is arguably a worthless art. More for show than anything, a fun little party trick perhaps. You move at a slower rate of speed, you cannot use any items or arts for that matter. You can just swish your tail and bite people. As such, convince a few people to use NMF and have a number of Emphant duels and then come tell me about it.\r\n','2015-10-30 03:42:54','2015-10-28 03:58:52'),(10008,10253,38,1,'Scare - Learn','I would like for you to explore and find 4 rooms that scare you or give you the \"creeps\" like those boys do! Why do you choose these rooms and how do they make you feel? ','2015-10-30 04:54:54','2015-10-26 04:55:23'),(10011,10831,60,1,'Amy Sphere 1','Speak to a dreamer of each focus. What concerns them when the need to face a fatesender in battle? Why? Where are there favorite places to have a fight, either attacking or defending, and why? If you can and know the way, take me to these places and lead me safely back to threshold. _-* 10.27','2015-10-30 05:03:16','2015-10-28 02:05:18'),(10009,10831,40,1,'L: Deafen - Amy','One of the hardest parts of being unsphered is sometimes it\'s heard for your voice to be heard. Most dreamers have their plans and stick to them, and ignore most people they don\'t seem \"worthy.\" All dreamers are worthy, find your own value, and let your voice be heard to people you think may be deaf to it.','2015-10-31 01:28:17','2015-10-27 20:17:26'),(10008,10253,139,1,'Sense Datoken - L','I would like for you to get a list of ~ALL~ mares and what their abilities are. So start with lesser mares and work your way up to Darkmares. You have 5 lesser mares, then you have Daymares and Darkmares. Find out what they all do. Bring all this info to me.','2015-10-31 04:48:38','2015-10-30 05:00:55'),(10745,10717,24,1,'Will R: Restore','Until this point you have learned the protective arts of your focus. Whereas Meditation is restorative to you, this art is the first to be restorative to another. How do you see yourself using this art? Be prepared to tell me the history of the art and the limitation it will have as a minor art for you. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2015-10-31 08:27:26','2015-10-17 08:20:47'),(10746,10271,139,1,'Datoken-learn','I would like you to speak to a members of each of the house and their beliefs about the nightmares.  If you cannot find a house member, do not fret.  Tell me what your thoughts are on them. ]\'|\'[','2015-11-02 00:27:04','2015-10-30 01:57:23'),(10654,10750,15,1,'Learn Judgement','Talk to other SoulMasters who know Judgement (at least three). Find out how often they utilize Judgement. How often does it help them decide whom to restore in the middle of combat?','2015-11-02 06:25:26','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10011,10831,66,10,'Amy FateSlayer 10','In your first days, you learned how to make a blade from Lucidity. But what does it mean to make a weapon out of a kind of thought? Is it a symbol? A metaphor for violence in a world of metaphors? Or is there some reality to it as there is in Cloudsbreak? Does believing it is real make it real here? Ask some dreamers around you their thoughts about their focus blades. Keep track of who has bothered to take the time to think about these questions before! _-* 10.30','2015-11-02 18:27:38','2015-10-30 20:22:49'),(10107,10050,22,10,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','Since you have a need to balance beauty and ugliness from your shardic life and the dream, let\'s turn that on it\'s head a little.  I want you to forge four items that represent the truly reprehensible things that have occured on your shard.  I want one of each of the following themes: Regret, Deceit, Malice and Indifference.  ','2015-11-03 23:36:36','2015-10-30 22:58:36'),(10009,10050,21,10,'Blend10','Blend is a useful art but it also has its limitations. Identify a few ways that Blend could be improved for Dreamseers. Put together a plan for making your favorite of the modifications and quietly present it to several Dreamseers. How was it received? ','2015-11-04 02:23:09','2015-10-27 20:58:23'),(10136,10050,96,30,'Sense Dre30-Cuero','I\'d like to know a bit about the history of this art. I\'ve heard a few stories in the past, but of course, I\'m sure it all ran down from so many dreamers, that the true story was lost. What I\'d also like to know is how you would change the art, the higher the art knowledge goes up. When you are 1st sphere vs 8th sphere, how would you change it?','2015-11-04 03:11:01','2015-10-28 04:03:24'),(10088,10831,38,1,'Scare! Amy','Okokokok. Lets be serious - but not really. I want you to coerce THREE forgers into creating you THREE scary masks (one each). THEN scare the crap out of THREE victims. All of them must be different, at different times. If they do not feign fear, try again OR acquire a new mask in the failures place. Lets see how scary (and comical) we can make this, yes? ','2015-11-04 03:19:11','2015-10-31 01:00:27'),(10007,10050,72,50,'Inscribe 50','Gather up information about the SM guild. What have they done to get where they are? What kind of experiments, how were they done etc? Then take that information and come up with your own plans for the Seer guild. Place all this information on the open scrolls, so other Seers can see what you have in store, hoping to get them interested. Make sure to let them know you seek to open the Guild Hall for you Seers. ','2015-11-04 05:32:39','2015-10-27 00:35:29'),(10062,10050,139,10,'Sense Datoken 10','You were present for my attempt to create an art in our city that would have done essentially the same thing. Yet the art is flawed that we have here. In what ways is it flawed, and how can you change it?','2015-11-04 06:28:17','2015-10-28 03:58:49'),(10276,10750,9,1,'Free Action','Long ago we used to give tours of the numerous murals around the city.  A group of dreamers would stand and stare and discuss what they saw.  I found others would pull out of these murals things I would never have seen or considered.  I would like you to find a few to study, then take myself and whoever else would like to go on a tour.  Show me something I have never seen before through your eyes.  Gatekeeper Hanna','2015-11-04 06:35:16','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10108,10796,40,1,'Deafen - Learn','Fatesenders are often called the Tricksters of the dream, and while that\'s not quite accurate, it\'s still super fun. Take the oportunity to get into a bit of trouble. Attached is a small squeaky toy. Use it on your friends when they least expect it and record their reactions. Then ask each person you caught their thoughts on how Deafen works!','2015-11-04 06:36:29','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10018,92,1,'Jade Reflect ','Learn the maze in the Palisades like the back of your hand.  Teach 3 other dreamers how to get through is in the quickest manner possible.  Be prepared to demonstrate it when you report!','2015-11-04 23:06:02','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10838,60,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Sphering RPGM Sarayu, expecting to be progressively longer intervals each sphere to mirror player advancement.','2015-11-05 19:27:59','2015-11-05 19:27:56'),(10238,10011,45,20,'Winds of Razors','Now that you\'ve played with the Fear.  Lets see effectiveness.  Hunting with Razorwind is tricky.  Using Firestorm or Razowind exclusively there are a number of spots you can take down Shamblix and never even see it.  Collect me 15 essences of Shamblix - using techniques with Razorwind.  Key lessons here are to learn effective use strategies.  What is a effective, what isnt, what could be done to make Razorwind better.  ','2015-11-06 02:48:10','2015-10-30 21:03:43'),(10007,10745,60,5,'5th Shere!','We talked about how shields were in my City. People complain that shields vape way too fast here. Take our conversation about shields and make it happen. You must get many involved and perhaps the SM guild would be a good start. For this sphere to be granted, I must see much effort in this journey. Make shields better! Make it happen!','2015-11-06 06:53:48','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10238,10008,60,6,'6th Sphere Quest','Simple enough, gain yourself a halo.  Become a teacher!','2015-11-07 02:01:57','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10022,10008,111,1,'Kailee: L Dazzle','Gather a party of House members, take them out into a hunting ground and work together to save souls and gather supplies, 100 souls should do. Return the souls and supplies to the house.\r\n','2015-11-07 02:47:02','2015-11-07 02:46:38'),(10450,10593,87,1,'Quest: Keilara','','2015-11-08 03:29:49','2015-11-08 03:29:44'),(10009,10831,47,10,'Push10','Push yourself and others to the brink. Amplify your bounciness and normal entities tenfold and press on other dreamers to do things outside of Threshold. If they decline, you should pester them until they finally move. It does not matter what they do. Just do something. Keep track of who you pestered and what you got them to do.','2015-11-08 03:41:15','2015-11-03 04:00:29'),(10136,10545,25,40,'Reweave40-Avayla','How much do dreamers know about shields? Get several shields of all levels and have dreamers place bets on how many hits it will take to destroy a shield. Find out how other foci believe shields are mended. You can put on a competition planned, or spontaneous. Explain what you learned about shields and their composition and breakdown, compared to who was hitting them!','2015-11-08 03:49:17','2015-10-16 02:21:06'),(10011,10253,4,10,'Lucile Focus 10','As efforts resume to rebuild the FS guild and the Everlight, all four of the foci may be necessary. Speak to those around you of each focus for ideas on how their focus could contribute to binding an artifact to the city. What is their reasoning and how is their idea something only their focus could do? _-* 10.29','2015-11-09 01:47:07','2015-10-30 04:36:22'),(10008,10253,9,1,'Free Action - Learn','On the Lower Basins, there are two rooms I truly love and when I go there, it makes me feel happy and calm. In these rooms, you will find stump(s) with very pretty ivy wrapping around it. Find them and bring to me the name of the rooms. We need to remember that this City has many rooms out there, that should be seen.','2015-11-09 01:47:53','2015-10-31 05:04:29'),(10480,10311,52,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After completion ofher final written exam, FLower of Cienne has been ordained.\r\n','2015-11-09 02:12:42','2015-11-09 02:11:37'),(10450,10593,86,1,'Quest: Keilara','','2015-11-09 02:12:45','2015-11-09 02:12:40'),(10480,10311,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Added for being ordained\r\n','2015-11-09 02:13:20','2015-11-09 02:13:02'),(10480,10311,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','added for being ordained.\r\n','2015-11-09 02:13:27','2015-11-09 02:13:15'),(10002,10593,112,1,'SM Guild House','With support from existing SM guild members Dina and Shae, Cianne requested admittance to the Guild House as part of the SM Guild.','2015-11-09 02:30:32','2015-11-09 02:30:12'),(10480,10011,41,50,'Blind 50 - Starfall','Blind is about seeing what\'s in front of you.  Show your house members how valuable you are by pushing advancement forward in your home.  How have you done this and what progress was made as a result?  No restriction on how long you need to work on this because I trust you to do good work.','2015-11-09 02:47:35','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10036,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After speaking with Synetney about teaching, I am returning his ability.\r\n','2015-11-09 02:56:40','2015-11-09 02:55:52'),(10480,10036,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Returning his abilities along with Quest.\r\n','2015-11-09 02:56:52','2015-11-09 02:56:30'),(10480,10036,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Returning his abilities along with Quest.\r\n','2015-11-09 02:56:57','2015-11-09 02:56:12'),(10002,10746,15,40,'Judge 40','Find 4 rooms that you love to explore and create an item that speaks to your heart. Please use your forging skills for your creation and then explain to me why these items speak out to you and why you picked these rooms.','2015-11-09 03:35:38','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10002,10746,52,50,'Arlyana Jax Train50','Talk with as many of the new master teachers as you can about the need for teacher oaths.  Whatever the outcome, organize a meeting for all the teachers to advance teaching in the city to higher standards!  I\'m sure you will do great! ','2015-11-09 04:14:13','2015-10-24 03:52:22'),(10002,10253,60,3,'3rd Sphere','Come up with a fun game! It can be anything, but it must be big and have prizes! Maybe a scavenger hunt? Ask around what type of game others would like to play if you need some other ideas. I expect this to be fun and challenging! Take notes on everything, when, where, who showed up, and what the prizes were. Be creative! Don\'t forget about your resources on how to let others know about it!','2015-11-09 04:56:08','2015-10-23 06:11:56'),(10008,10831,71,1,'FlameRuin - Learn','I would like for you to create your own flame and when you are finished, we will try it. Find a special flame around the city or even gather more than one to make your ball of fire and also make a device that will shoot it out. I love creativity.','2015-11-10 02:57:17','2015-10-30 05:12:59'),(10593,10745,28,1,'Taking it all away','Abjure is about taking things away from people. What is it that you would not want taken away from you? What is it that you have taken from someone that you may have regretted afterwards? Lastly, what would you -want- someone to take away from you and why?  ~C','2015-11-10 04:16:04','2015-11-06 07:34:19'),(10011,10831,4,10,'Amy FateSender 10','Being a FateSender isn\'t all trickery and nonsense. After all, anybody can make a joke. Your goal is to use your keen observational skills to make dreamers realize deeper truths through misdirection. For your task, make three dreamers laugh at something that isn\'t funny, in any way you choose. _-* 11.2','2015-11-10 22:34:24','2015-11-03 04:00:51'),(10136,10253,14,10,'Know 10 Lucille','Here is a two part task. First, tell me how you think the art works, by the energy you use to evoke it. Second, evoke Know in areas that are you not familiar with. Show me some rooms that you feel are not what your senses tell you. If you evoke Know, and the area seems moldy, yet it has no mold, show me!','2015-11-11 05:37:12','2015-10-19 02:10:40'),(10062,10136,144,1,'Chaos Well Learn','Chaos Well and SMs are sort of pointless. Besides being able to create larger wells for non-SMs and teaching, what good does this art or any future plateaus hold for you? If none, how would you go about giving it some use?','2015-11-12 03:53:49','2015-10-20 04:17:56'),(10066,10745,105,10,'Poison Cloud 10','Is it possible to successfully evoke an art through chanting a phrase or set of words? Attempt to bind a phrase or set of words to Poison Cloud so your tongue may become as sharp as your mind. How do you suppose alternate forms of casting arts could be useful?','2015-11-12 05:02:15','2015-10-28 01:43:52'),(10779,10838,60,2,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Sphereing Sarayu, RP GM. Continuing to progress the character slowly as per the RP surrounding incorporating this \"hidden\" GM.','2015-11-12 20:18:51','2015-11-12 20:18:45'),(10779,10018,12,40,'Jade - Shatter 40','Your house has engaged in warfare with an entity known as the Consortium. Formulate a plan of attack, identifying the strengths and weaknesses of your faction and your opponent, and take steps alongside your housemates to harm them directly or indirectly.','2015-11-13 01:50:46','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10018,10050,0,40,'Join Party 40','I\'d like for you to put your spying skills to some use. Find out from as many dreamers as you are able (but three will do) what their thoughts are, or what they know about Lu Chaos joining the Consortium. What are his true intentions?','2015-11-13 03:04:53','2015-10-27 04:34:04'),(10009,10136,7,20,'Shae - RF 20','Find out the fear of a non-Order dreamer and help them to overcome it. Do the same with one of your own fears. Additionally, lead an Order member *intentionally* into a situation they\'re afraid of, and force them to work their own way out of it. Was there a point to any of this?','2015-11-13 03:22:51','2015-10-30 02:16:24'),(10107,10253,5,10,'Random 10 - Lucille','The art of Random has seemingly little use apart from gambling and settling minor disputes, the likes of who goes first in a duel or things of a trivial nature.  Grok Firebeard actually uses the gambling side of chaos at the next level with some drastic implications.  Find out what these are.  Also, do you think that there would be a willingness to experiment with even greater stakes in the city?','2015-11-13 05:44:27','2015-10-29 05:23:06'),(10022,10018,22,40,'Jade: Forge 40','I have need of an item of Resilience. Delve into your histories and locate lore pertaining to an item that was connected to being a SoulMaster. Search for this item, or devise a way to bring it back into being. Perhaps you should involve yourself with the SoulMaster guild, we meet on Tuesdays at 6pm. Include people with your creation, the end result should be an item of Resilience... how you get there on the other hand...','2015-11-13 07:37:32','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10745,10253,15,1,'To Be or Not To Be','Judged. Research this Insightful art and find out the quantity focal elemen required to evoke. What will this ability tell you about another dreamer and how many different responses might be returned about them? Form your own opinion about the best applicable uses including when, where, and why? You may find researching the Library and inquiring other dreamers helpful. Report back to me when you are ready. You will be JUDGED. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2015-11-13 07:43:02','2015-11-11 07:03:16'),(10009,10253,46,1,'Recall-Learn','Recall is one of the most useful arts that is often taken for granted by the City. It allows you to choose a location to return to once you are collapsed. Explore the areas that you started to be able to access at second sphere or later. Choose several rooms that you would like to return to and make note of them. Finally, learn how to navigate from Threshold to Fayd\'s Betrayal in Caudal Rift and back to Threshold without waking.','2015-11-14 05:32:02','2015-11-09 05:10:38'),(10018,10253,38,10,'Scare 10','Almost the whole City is afraid of the Consortium. But has anyone stopped to think what scares the Consortium? You can ask opinions of others or theorize on your own. The key to defeating one\'s enemy is knowing their weaknesses.','2015-11-14 05:44:43','2015-11-13 06:47:34'),(10311,10253,26,1,'Purify-Lucy','The Lake of Tears used to be pure crystal blue water, what do you think happened there and how do you think you would purify it back to its previous beauty? You dont have to make any attemps but try to see if you can find out why it is blood now, and come up with some kinda theory on how to clean it back up. Nothing elaborate, you can even be silly with it if you want.\r\n','2015-11-15 03:15:07','2015-11-09 03:58:23'),(10746,10253,144,1,'Well ~ learn','I would like you to find examples of other wells within the City.  They can be physical, mental or spiritual.  If possible, I would like you to show them to me.  If not, an clear explanation is sufficient.','2015-11-15 04:01:21','2015-11-09 05:15:37'),(10008,10750,38,1,'Scare - Learn','Since you and Will want to do your tasks together, I am going to have you search Caudal Rift and find me some rooms that scare you the most (at least 2). What are the names of the rooms and why do they scare you? What do you sense from this room? Don\'t forget to take Will with ya and afterwards, take me to these rooms while you report. Have some fun!','2015-11-15 05:23:02','2015-10-18 08:10:19'),(10018,10750,7,1,'L: Resist Fear','I have an item that is said to bring out one\'s deepest fears. Wear it, and you might truly be able to scare a few dreamers (at least three). Ask them what they see. How does it make them feel, or what does it make them remember? People are often susceptible to fear when their guard is down.','2015-11-18 01:36:39','2015-10-20 02:17:53'),(10022,10253,40,10,'Lucille: Deafen 10','We all have our faults, and can be \"deaf\" to the things around us. For instance it easy to search for the truth, yet not always easy to accept. Meditate on this fact and search your own failings to discover what you are deaf to. Discuss this thought with another or two, were you able to get them to realize they do not hear things that should be apparent, or do they cling to their blissful ignorance?','2015-11-18 08:26:52','2015-11-13 07:56:39'),(10702,10750,29,10,'poison10~ Arnaya','Poison has a long standing history of being a nuisance, but it has recently been changed. Do you think this was for the better or no? Think also of how the art, or any art, may have poisoned/will poison the dream. Speak to a handful of other dreamers and discuss this.~ S','2015-11-19 02:09:27','2015-11-11 01:52:34'),(10593,10745,35,1,'The old cliche\'','How to make a better mousetrap - we\'ve all heard it. I want you to do just that!! Create for me a mouse trap that is humane, yet functional...and see if you can catch anything -besides- mice with it! I look forward to hearning what you came up with & what you caught. ~C','2015-11-19 04:45:49','2015-11-10 04:39:53'),(10022,10545,24,40,'Avayla: Restore 40','It is no secret that I believe Healing Aura to be a worthless steaming pile of refuse. This should be an epitome of restorative power. Yet, its usefulness is... questionable. How could it be made better? What SoulMasters like for it to be capable of? Come up with a design/plan of how to improve the art to the point where it could be desirable to evoke. Once you know what you want it is you wish to do, actualize your vision and attempt to bring the improvements into existence.','2015-11-19 17:06:16','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10077,21,20,'Blend-20','Blend your love of writing with your want to help others in the City. The Consortium is out to defeat us but some still think they\'re here to help. Chronicle the actions of the Consortium in our City. Embellish as necessary to ensure they are shown to be the against the City in this situation. Once complete, share the story on the Public Scrolls. \r\nWhile working on your story, I also want you to Blend through every ward you see. Keep track of who the warder was and what their reaction was. ','2015-11-20 03:23:26','2015-11-05 01:06:40'),(10107,10311,22,10,'Forge 10 - Final','Come up with 4 unique scent mixtures in the dream, and spread them to those who you think are deserving.  Have one of each of the following: A Joke (terrible) scent, an alluring scent, a repelling scent and an intoxicating scent.  You pick the recipients, but I want a detailed description of each scent that you deliver, who you deliver them to, and why you chose that recipient.\r\n','2015-11-20 04:05:36','2015-11-12 02:52:22'),(10009,10238,108,1,'Sable-Learn','Fill one of your Chaos Wells and bring it to me.','2015-11-21 02:30:37','2015-10-11 20:57:40'),(10088,10311,72,30,'Scribe 30','Let\'s play word association! Take your 15 favorite people, and 15 favorite rooms in this City. Describe ALL THIRTY places using one word each. No duplicates! Let\'s test that cleverness, vocabulary, and your literary creativity!','2015-11-21 03:30:17','2015-10-15 01:38:28'),(10450,10745,25,40,'Reweave 40','Since you are newly returned, I wish for you to reweave some new life into the old that you knew. You may choose 4 rooms or histories and start with what you knew and weave into what could be. Take an existing thought and fix it so that it has an alternate ending. Be creative and detailed. Make your efforts worthy of a plateau to 40. **A**','2015-11-21 07:08:48','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10746,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After interview and acceptance, was given the station of Master teacher.\r\n','2015-11-21 07:11:35','2015-11-21 07:09:03'),(10480,10022,60,1,'Quest: Akkadian','First sphere on his secondary focus has been granted.\r\n','2015-11-21 07:49:57','2015-11-21 07:49:45'),(10480,10745,60,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After his interview, I have given Kaihan the art of sphere. He knows the rules and knows that he will be held accountable should he abuse the art. **A**\r\n','2015-11-21 08:23:30','2015-11-21 08:21:38'),(10480,10022,60,2,'Quest: Akkadian','For completion of his second sphere.\r\n','2015-11-21 08:24:13','2015-11-21 08:24:00'),(10745,10022,60,3,'Sphere 3-BladeSlaye','Dare I say it. By the extemption of Keilara, I hereby grant BladeSlayer his THIRD Sphere. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2015-11-21 09:18:25','2015-11-21 09:15:22'),(10022,10077,111,1,'Tember: L Dazzle','Kailee requires your help in a soul saving endeavor. Render assistance. Go out and spread the Light so that the unawakened may be free.\r\n','2015-11-21 09:25:57','2015-11-05 01:21:28'),(10746,10796,38,1,'Fear Itself','The City is not bound by many of the limitations of the waking world, but we still carry many of our fears with us.  I would like you to find a room that defies the physical laws of our shards. Why would someone fear this room? Why should they not? }\'|\'{','2015-11-21 20:44:10','2015-10-30 02:29:31'),(10018,10022,60,4,'4th sphere Blade','Blade\'s 4th sphere during his 9th sphere journey. He is exempt from any tasking.','2015-11-22 07:11:26','2015-11-22 07:11:13'),(10018,10077,7,20,'RF 20','Host a spontaneous duel with at least four others, and three duels between each pair. The entire time during, the duelers must attempt to fight their fears while scared. Who came out the victor?','2015-11-22 07:12:58','2015-11-05 04:00:27'),(10779,10318,1,50,'GK 50 - Lu Chaos','Part of being a warrior is knowing when to retreat, and more importantly appearing as if you are retreating. Try and change public opinion about you in whatever way you can, without compromising your relationship with the Consortium. This will require more balance and restraint than you have likely ever shown, but I have confidence you can do so.','2015-11-23 04:03:28','2015-10-26 19:25:55'),(10779,10007,25,60,'Dina - Reweave 60','Embrace your new role as Guardian and finish what your precedessor has left you. Complete the transformation of your prime artifact and finish the reweaving that has transpired in the Order.','2015-11-23 04:19:15','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10136,112,10,'Guild House - 10','I wish for you to either find two more additions worthy of the Guild House art or assist others of another focus on their way to gaining the art. Make your efforts worthy and keep records for others to attempt similar tasks. **A**','2015-11-23 04:33:44','2015-11-09 03:15:46'),(10779,10007,28,60,'Abjure 60','There is wickedness afoot. I want you to strip away all of the untruths and find out what really happened to Herbert and Castellan. Determine if there are any other prisoners within the Palisades. Tear away the facades that are up and find me the truth. I want specifics, who, what, where, when and why. Be resilient in your investigations. Make this effort worthy of the plateau you seek. **A**','2015-11-23 05:20:55','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10311,10022,39,1,'Stagger-Blade','Stagger someones belief in something, either with your words or with force. You dont have to change the city, but you should do something worthy of the art. Its up to you how you chose to do this task, I want to see some creativity.\r\n','2015-11-23 19:59:34','2015-11-22 19:37:49'),(10022,10311,25,20,'Flower: Reweave 20','It seems your items are broken and in need of reweaving. No, not your shields, other things. You seem to be using elemen as shields, but your reweave is not working on them... ask other people to fix them up, so that you may use them. What are their reactions? Were they able to fix your elemen?','2015-11-23 22:11:19','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10238,10022,60,5,'Quest: WishBringer','yah yah\r\n','2015-11-24 01:41:20','2015-11-24 01:41:13'),(10009,10050,22,20,'Forge-20','Identify three Dreamers or other entities from your City that do not currently dream and you believe should be remembered and immortalized in our combined City. Forge statues of these dreamers based on how you feel they should be remembered. Place these statues within an appropriate room within the new Museum and accompany each with a plaque that explains who they were and why they were important to the City.\r\n','2015-11-24 05:03:45','2015-11-04 02:44:13'),(10450,10050,20,50,'Bl - Fifth Mastery','\"Blast\" Kaer Gerroz\'s legacy. For every action, there is an equal and opposite reaction. The Order will lead the charge of repairing the hole in Caudal Rift that he caused. Extracting some energy from your prime to start this process is key. Solicit the aid of the City as needed. As you\'ll be dealing with Chaos, be ready for anything. This should officially \"Blast\" the lingering link KG has with the City herself.','2015-11-24 06:05:12','2015-10-17 04:48:45'),(10450,10253,66,10,'FS10Lucille','In place of Codex from Clarity not written on Quest codex','2015-11-24 06:31:25','2015-11-24 06:31:15'),(10450,10750,74,10,'MB - 1st Mastery','With the recent tradegies, betrayals, and heart-brokenness in the City, many dreamers are on edge. Upon all existing dreamers, find one to consult and console. Become their \"Mind Blank\" in avatar form, and show them a great time. Get them to escape their troubles, even for a little bit. Afterwards, gain some feedback from them - how did you do, and how does this display the true power of Mind Blank, in and out of art form?','2015-11-24 06:52:39','2015-10-21 04:09:41'),(10311,10022,41,1,'Blind-BladeSlayer','Some people can be blind to their own faults and weaknesses. Since you are on a path to achieving an ultimate form, I think that becoming aware of your own faults, even though Im sure you dont think you have any, could help you towards your goals. Have 3 of your closest comrades tell you what they think a few of your faults/weaknesses/bad habits are and where you can improve, and in turn tell them something they may not be aware of themselves. Tell me who you chose, what they said, and what you told them.','2015-11-25 03:56:08','2015-11-23 22:34:18'),(10311,10088,108,1,'Vampy-SableShield','Get a chaos well from Dreiko, fill it up, and bring that thang back to me and you will get sable shield!','2015-11-28 01:50:11','2015-11-21 03:10:06'),(10311,10104,108,1,'Sable Shield-Dar','Gather 500 strength and bring it to me or get receipts from Dreiko or Dina.','2015-11-29 23:54:23','2015-11-28 01:47:21'),(10009,10320,108,1,'Sable-Learn','Bring 100 essences into the Order. The count begins when you receive the task, not prior.','2015-12-01 00:04:00','2015-11-02 03:12:44'),(10009,10088,144,1,'CW-Learn','Chaos! Everywhere! Gather some dreamers and have them duel in Nightmare Form. Feel free to mock them while they do it. Also, fill this Chaos Well for the fun of it since you won\'t be able to make use of them for much longer.','2015-12-01 03:11:39','2015-10-15 01:33:03'),(10746,10136,144,10,'Well to 10','It has been said that our Chaos Wells are a wekaer version of the Nexus you had in your City.  As I am too curious for my own good, I would like you to closely examine the similarities and differences.  Is there aan way Chaos Well could be made into a Nexus? }\'|\'{','2015-12-01 04:37:08','2015-11-26 03:42:41'),(10450,10088,16,20,'Quest: ID-20','Explore the changes between the realms physical and mental. Physical - A physical change to the landscape that your walk. Mental - Arts that operate differenty than they did in your realm, or differently from both. I believe 10 each should do the trick. Have fun with it!','2015-12-02 05:02:22','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10450,10088,16,20,'ID-20:Vampyro','This is a completion codex. It has been determined that he was unaware of the 5th sphere plateau, but he did report and completed to my satisfaction. Please grant him the art when he is ready. - Keilara','2015-12-02 05:02:22','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10450,10018,92,10,'Reflect10Jade','You are a WordSmith in the Lyceum. In sparing you of the silly notion of GateKeepers, willpower, and all that jazz, I would like you to spend some time reflecting on your journey to becoming a WordSmith. What were the challenges you faced in this journey, and what were the advantages?','2015-12-02 05:10:46','2015-11-24 05:48:02'),(10238,10022,44,1,'Bring on the Rain','So you want to bring the pain of fire from the sky!   Fine, lets do this.  But lets understand the art.  Find you a Firestorming fatesender.... and play FireStorm Tag.   You and them pick a plane.  You have to hit them with flame fire BEFORE they firestorm you.  To gain this art you must understand how they use it, so you can prepare to master it!\r\n','2015-12-03 03:01:51','2015-11-24 01:46:37'),(10009,10077,21,30,'Blend30','Have a Gatekeeper ward you within the Horron\'s Lair in Caudal Rift. Escape or survive until the Ward falls without external support. Collapse is to be considered a failure and will necessitate a retry. Provide a detailed account of events, including who warded the portal, how many tries it took, and who else may have witnessed your attempt. Effort may be considered if you are unable to complete this.','2015-12-03 23:53:46','2015-11-23 04:12:49'),(10779,10838,51,10,'Locate-10','Thus far, you have focused your dreams on growing stronger. However, there is much more to the Dream City than just strength. Attempt to locate a few other things that you may enjoy within the City. You may do this through self experimentation or by asking other dreamers what they enjoy doing. The choice is yours as this is your Dream.','2015-12-05 00:07:18','2015-11-17 01:15:15'),(10779,10838,60,3,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Sphere task for RPGM Sarayu, fourth and higher will be player-driven sphere tasks.','2015-12-05 00:07:22','2015-12-05 00:04:20'),(10779,10838,141,1,'Quest: Jasper Margr','Missing art - RPGM Sarayu','2015-12-05 00:09:41','2015-12-05 00:09:35'),(10009,10022,144,40,'CW-40','The means for ridding the City of the Consortium is at hand. Develop a plan to lure Kael Lupich into a situation that benefits us. Ensure I have the means to get close to him and end his reign of terror.','2015-12-05 01:58:40','2015-12-03 02:43:00'),(10009,10077,16,30,'Identify-30','I have quite the risky propositions ahead of me against the Consortium. The Warden\'s Dagger is a prime artifact, thus, in danger whenever I intend to use it. Choose an attempt against the Consortium and ensure I remain coherant. If for some reason I collapse, make sure you are close enough to be the dreamer to retrieve the Dagger. Success is met by the dagger remaining safe in the end of the attempt.','2015-12-05 02:19:23','2015-12-04 00:01:25'),(10018,10857,8,30,'Protection 30','Speak with a few dreamers and try to get caught up on current events, and create a list of the changes since you last dreamed. Also, as you get reacquainted, consider why you still want to become a teacher.','2015-12-05 04:26:16','2015-12-03 05:55:50'),(10702,10750,24,30,'Restore 30~ Arnaya','You\'re stuck between a rock and a hard place, but you are still a fount of information. I would like for you to write up the details you recall about Dina\'s predicament, and share it with me (also inscribe for the library). Come up with a couple of theories as to how you would restore her avatar. Be prepared for a discussion, and possible ideas of how you can carry it out with your limited interaction~ S','2015-12-06 02:20:10','2015-11-20 01:59:13'),(10136,10253,24,1,'Restore Learn-Lucy','I\'m sure you have an idea on how Restore works, and which energy it uses, but think deeper. When you restore another, are you creating energy to give to them, or actually giving them your own energy from your avatar, exchanging energies and becoming one with them, in a sense? Discuss this with others of all foci. What is the general concensus? What is the oddest thing a dreamer used the art of restore for that you spoke to, personally?','2015-12-07 04:09:44','2015-11-11 05:46:36'),(10022,10018,111,20,'Dazzle','Honoring a task written by Flower of Cienn, targeting random as she does not have Dazzle.\r\n','2015-12-08 01:17:53','2015-12-08 01:09:56'),(10018,10088,9,20,'FA 20','With the current events with the Consortium and your involvement, consider each of their members. Do you believe any one of them should be spared? I\'m looking for detailed answers on why or why not.','2015-12-08 02:03:37','2015-12-01 03:27:23'),(10480,10455,22,40,'Forge 40 part 2/3','On this leg of your journey, I would like to see a forged item that represents each of the five elements. I am looking for the creation and artestry in your work. Do not take this step lightly, for this is the time in your craft that your work solidifies. I leave the purpose of the items up to you. Now is the time to shine as a craftsman and creationist.  **A**','2015-12-08 03:53:23','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10018,10857,65,30,'GateSmasher 30','Practicing with other dreamers can help better one\'s skills for hunting and combat. Select three dreamers for a blade duel of three hits each. Pay attention, and learn what you can from them - if they have any advice. Then take what you learned and defeat at least five AgoKnights. Did your hunting improve any?','2015-12-08 07:54:26','2015-12-05 04:39:41'),(10455,10317,23,20,'Recharge 20 - Teoni',' I\'d like you to get re-aqauinted with the City. Take a look at some of the issues that now plague the City, and using your freshly returned eyes come up with solutions that those in the thick of it may not be able to see. How can we can recharge people\'s desire to dream and think creatively using your theories? Be thorough and come prepared to discuss!\r\n','2015-12-09 03:51:50','2015-12-03 08:38:00'),(10018,10088,8,20,'Protection 20','Many things are missing here that used to be in our City, but with  the emerging of some leads me to believe that they just need to be rediscovered. With your portal expertise, theorize on a way to activate the old entrance portals to the Palisade. ','2015-12-09 04:11:51','2015-12-08 02:15:39'),(10067,10750,73,1,'Destroy Talisman','This art is both wonderful and agonizing at the same time. Along with all the basics of the art, I want you to think on two things that you would like to see destroyed. How would you go about it? What would you replace it with? Would it be better to just leave it be and try and adapt? Think and think some more and when you are finished, we can talk. Also, just for fun, a riddle. What in the City can neither be created nor destroyed but CAN be altered? *)0(*','2015-12-09 06:15:35','2015-12-03 08:35:08'),(10746,10053,23,40,'Recharge 40','I would like you to think about the specific ways that Recharge is different from Reweave.  Speak to Kaihan about his recent experiment to alter Reweave and form a plan to alter Recharge specifically in relation to how many charges the art or the dreamer is able to place upon an item.  Share this plan with me. }\'|\'{','2015-12-11 05:20:27','2015-11-10 04:37:11'),(10136,10088,28,1,'Abjure- Vampyro','First- \'abjure\' dreamers with alcohol of any restrictions they may have felt before drinking your specialties. Next, take them on a field trip to a place in our city where what was once there, no longer is. Tell tales of how we worked on planesmithing and abstract ideas of how we can recreate some of our old city in this new one. Did stripping them of their inhabitions assist in getting good ideas? Report in full detail and expect many questions!','2015-12-11 05:42:47','2015-11-04 03:30:53'),(10450,10088,24,50,'Restore50Vampyro','A dark moment between some dreamers resulted in a horrific tragedy. But not so horrific that it can\'t be repaired and made whole again, given the item you obtained this evening. Where the GateKeeper follows, the SoulMaster goes; put the two halves together and make them whole.','2015-12-11 05:53:15','2015-12-02 05:13:42'),(10450,10088,24,50,'VRestore50','Solve this riddle:\r\n','2015-12-11 05:53:15','2015-12-02 05:08:52'),(10450,10745,52,20,'Train 20: Kaihan','Prepare an interesting and new method of teaching students that is not used currently. Be creative, and bring me a sample task of what you would have your student do.','2015-12-11 06:33:16','2015-11-21 07:21:01'),(10450,10745,3,50,'SM50 - Kaihan','I have heard much of this Consortium, and a movement to halt their activity. Offer your services to the dream defenders as a resilient being. Perhaps even a little intel; find out what happened recently with a missing dreamer. ','2015-12-11 06:48:41','2015-11-21 07:33:22'),(10450,10750,70,30,'Flamesear to 30','Let us see what you can do with your flame. I would like for you to keep record of averages for me, let us say 10 emphants, 10 boggrams and 10 agos. How many shots of your flame did it take to extinquish them? Also, ponder why others seem to rely less on their flame as they grow in strength. Could there be some alteration to the flame that would make it more useful? Make your efforts worthy of the plateau that you seek. **A**','2015-12-11 07:11:07','2015-11-21 08:28:33'),(10450,10018,10,60,'WardAmulet60','Trouble afoot with the Consortium. I\'ve heard the plan to remove from the city their existence. In addition, there is a movement to repair a dreamer down there. I would like you to assist in the Palisade during this excursion, lending your hand of will.','2015-12-11 07:30:46','2015-12-02 05:21:20'),(10450,10018,11,60,'AmuletJade','Amulet part of dual task','2015-12-11 07:31:28','2015-12-11 07:31:19'),(10480,10018,85,1,'Quest: Akkadian','With 5 Smith support, I am granting Jad ethe Mark.\r\n','2015-12-12 03:31:29','2015-12-12 03:31:22'),(10480,10009,60,8,'DreikoSphere','Continue along the path on which Siegward has set you. You have rescued many dreamers from their peril in the Palisade due to Consortium activity. Through trial and error, ensure that the Consortium ceases their activities for the better of the city. This may take many attempts, but the City at large will thank you for your efforts.','2015-12-12 04:01:41','2015-11-08 03:00:19'),(10480,10136,31,50,'Curse50Shae','You have said that you have access to something that manipulates the avatar. I would like for you to attempt to do so. Perhaps, put a curse upon someone. It could be any sort of curse, I imagine. Maybe your next quest will be to fix them.','2015-12-12 04:12:53','2015-11-08 03:11:22'),(10480,10104,29,20,'Poison to 20','We made several attempts at improving poison with the Soulmaster guild.  The attempts eventually fizzled out.  It was difficult to determine exactly how it should be improved, while still maintaining a balance with other focii in the city.  I\'d like you to think on this and propose how we would change poison for the better, while not making it overpowered.  Note that this may be what we use moving forward.','2015-12-12 04:52:08','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10750,25,30,'Reweave 30 - Arnaya','Put in place what you believe to be a surefire way to break away from the Consortium without getting killed in the process. You don\'t have to go through with it, but plan it out enough that you can do it at a moment\'s notice.','2015-12-12 05:18:42','2015-11-23 04:55:06'),(10779,10022,44,10,'Quest: WishBringer','Reverse of your gain the art quest. \r\n','2015-12-13 05:18:56','2015-12-03 04:00:55'),(10779,10136,34,1,'Imprison - Shae','The Consortium can put people into the Palisades, but not retrieve them. Dreamers can retrieve people but not place them into the Palisades. Fix this. Gain a new skill and imprison a member of the Consortium. Utilize as many or as few people as needed to achieve it.','2015-12-13 05:32:22','2015-11-17 01:35:34'),(10779,10136,38,10,'Fear Factor','Time to scare folks, but not with your art!  What other things can make dreamers fall all apart?  Some folks are a afraid of little things like a mouse?  Others are afraid of being kicked out of  their house?!  Perhaps folks are afraid of things tiny and small?  Or others are afraid of things huge and quite tall.  Use inscribe to create mice, drop them on the floor.  See how folks react!  Come tell me what REALLY scares people.\r\n','2015-12-13 05:49:40','2015-11-21 05:18:21'),(10779,10654,144,40,'Chaos Well 40','Oh the glory of Chaos Well. At this point in your dealings with it, what would you like to see changed if it could come to be? There must be something for this art to strive for. It is new and exciting and now it has lost its sparkle. Refresh it and breathe new life into it. Dream it a bright future and we will discuss your vision. I leave the boundaries entirely up to you. **A**','2015-12-13 05:57:51','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10779,10009,52,60,'Train 60 - Dreiko','Task dreamers who are willing to assist you in your quest to break down the Consortium. Demonstrate your understanding of your student\'s individual strengths and weaknesses by tailoring the tasks to them, while maintaining your own personal objective. Cast a large net of potential avenues to further your goal. As a personal favor, find what you can out about Herbert, even if it\'s bad, and attempt to help him, if he is pliable.','2015-12-13 16:49:30','2015-10-14 01:09:36'),(10450,10318,65,50,'Lu Chaos Smash! 50','Choose two houses that are opposing your house and find a way to harm them in some signifcant way!  At least two members of their house must be dreaming while you make your attempt.  And just stealing from their essence room isn\'t good enough!  I\'m sure you\'ll do great!','2015-12-14 00:56:12','2015-11-11 03:57:06'),(10450,10318,9,50,'Quest: Magerum','FA 50: Report the break through rate of Paralyze, & dreamquake.  How many evokes of each at what level defeat long FA?  As many samples of art level as possible, best effort.  (Para 40, 50 - DQ 40, 50 etc)\r\n','2015-12-14 01:24:28','2015-11-02 02:38:51'),(10450,10318,16,10,'ID 10 - Lu Chaos','Perception is reality. Many perceive Jerulan to be one of the City\'s best fighters. Challenge him to a series of duels, best of five. Be patient, be critical, be strategic - many say he is unbeatable, but is he? Identify his shortcomings. How can this be used against him?','2015-12-14 01:30:38','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10450,10104,35,20,'Trap Nightmare 20','An SM should know what each level of Trap can give as a maximum strength, which I will admit. I do not have this information yet. I would like for you to get find out how much a 1-10 Trap gives, 10-19, 20-29...all the way up to 99. Bring me this info and we both will be learning something!','2015-12-14 01:56:20','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10238,10008,82,1,'Learn the Terror','Simple kick off quest - learn the affects, changes per plat.  Range... differences between it and scare... and uses.','2015-12-14 17:40:39','2015-12-06 05:48:07'),(10455,10750,8,1,'Protect - Learn - A',' I\'d like you to consider the state the city is in. Everyone claims they wish to protect this, or that, but it rarely that simple. What things are people trying to protect both honestly, and superficially? Consider and tell me why you\'ve chosen what you have. Finally, what is important to you? What do you want to proect, and how will you do it?\r\n','2015-12-15 06:36:00','2015-12-03 08:43:39'),(10745,10545,28,1,'Avayla-Abjure','This my fellow Soulmistress and woman of medicine, like our many arts can be used to help and to harm. What way would you use it to heal the wounded, the incapacitated on the battlefield? What other problems might your intention to provide relief bring about? Lastly, what would you take from your worst of enemy and why? ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2015-12-15 08:46:13','2015-12-04 00:58:12'),(10454,10545,29,50,'Quest: Sela Cardan','Poison - 50 - Per GM Sanctioned Event, Sela Cardan','2015-12-16 04:43:15','2015-12-16 04:43:08'),(10454,10136,28,20,'Quest: Sela Cardan','Abjure 20 - Per GM Sanctioned Event, Sela Cardan','2015-12-16 04:43:44','2015-12-16 04:43:34'),(10454,10750,27,10,'Quest: Sela Cardan','Drain Self - 10 - per GM Sanctioned Event, Sela Cardan','2015-12-16 04:44:44','2015-12-16 04:44:37'),(10454,10745,24,50,'Quest: Sela Cardan','Restore 50 - GM Sanctioned Event, Sela Cardan','2015-12-16 04:46:01','2015-12-16 04:45:55'),(10728,10868,102,1,'Quest: Figment','Talked with Gwydeon about restoring his quest art.  His train is unsphered so he doesn\'t have to worry much about the plateau rules yet.  Told him we\'d be keeping an eye on his tasks to make sure they were alright.','2015-12-19 05:16:44','2015-12-19 05:16:37'),(10728,10868,87,1,'Quest: Figment','granting support arts','2015-12-19 05:17:21','2015-12-19 05:17:13'),(10728,10868,86,1,'Quest: Figment','granting support arts','2015-12-19 05:17:26','2015-12-19 05:17:01'),(10728,10745,35,10,'Trap 10~ Kaihan','Trap is a lot of fun, and laying actual traps is even more so. Come up with a couple of different types of traps and how you would lure someone/something into it. One must be a serious trap, and the other a fun one. Share with me your ideas, and if you would use them~ S','2015-12-19 05:37:39','2015-11-20 02:09:47'),(10107,10455,16,60,'ID 60 - FangX','Changing the dream and it\'s item generators will take some very special locations.  I\'d like for you to identify 8 locations in the dream that are especially powerful or significant. Identify the makeup of the elements of that room as well as the significance to the dream. We will need areas that are of great significance and great power to sustain what I am going to work towards. What are your choices?  I\'d like you to talk to Em\'et or Varwyn as well, since they have insights from the Idoaclesian City.','2015-12-22 05:25:29','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10654,10750,144,1,'Chaos Well Learn','What are the similiarities and differences between House Primes and Chaos Wells. Study Chaos Wells and House Primes in order to determine if we might learn something from Chaos Wells that we might use in the construction of a Prime for the Gathering. If you were able to name it, what would you want the Gathering Prime to be called?','2015-12-23 07:09:07','2015-12-03 09:05:02'),(10779,10022,44,20,'Firestorm20Blade','Make an attempt to use only Firestorm on a Shamblix, Agoknight, Bogrom, Emphant, and see how long it would take you to collapse them. My personal curiosity looms at this level of Firestorm.','2015-12-24 06:56:02','2015-12-14 00:31:31'),(10779,10022,41,10,'Blind to 10','I wish for you to keep your hand on the pulse of the City and find out if there are any distractions keeping the City blind to hidden dangers. It seems that when we rid the City of one horror, that another is waiting in the shadows to emerge. Bring as much information and intel as you can gather in a weeks time and we shall speak again. **A**','2015-12-24 07:16:12','2015-12-12 04:58:23'),(10779,10318,13,1,'ReturnLearnLuC','Return to your roots. What brought you to this city. Why are you here? You aren\'t here to make friends, so what are you here for? We discussed this earlier, but I want you to go back to the reason why you are the way you are.','2015-12-24 07:17:33','2015-12-14 01:40:18'),(10455,10868,144,1,'Chaos Well -LE- GWD',' I\'d like you to find out more about how this new art functions. What do it do, what happens when it\'s plateau\'d. Obtain one, and place atleast 10 essences in it, and bring it to me. How do you think the wells are functioning? Take all that you have learned and come ready to discuss your findings!\r\n','2015-12-24 07:24:52','2015-12-15 09:30:19'),(10136,10104,28,10,'Abjure10-Dar\'canon','Tell me what you can abjure from beasts. Does the size of the beast matter? Are there any arts that can be considered the opposite of abjure?  What happens when those arts are cast upon beasts? Do they become more aggressive with any arts that you cast upon them for this task? Explain.','2015-12-25 03:07:40','2015-12-21 01:59:26'),(10009,10022,60,6,'Sphere-6','BladeSlayer is being Sphered as per instructons in Keilara\'s tome','2015-12-29 03:34:46','2015-12-29 03:34:37'),(10450,10009,139,40,'Sense Datoken 40','Within your city a dreamer who you may have known helped in the making of its Sense Datoken, but who remembers it? History is an important part of our dreams in my opinion, and I feel that recognition should be given to those who go above in beyond. Help the city never forget, and put together something in tribute towards those involved whether they currently dream or not.','2015-12-29 04:20:10','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10311,10868,139,1,'Quest: Flower of Ci','','2015-12-29 04:31:34','2015-12-29 04:31:25'),(10311,10022,42,1,'Darkness-Blade','Lets see how much influence you have on others and how much people trust you. Get a group together under false pretenses and forge up some blind alts. Hand them out to the group and tell them to use the alts when you say to. Try to keep them from IDing the alts and effectively blind them. Lets see if you can reign darkness on a room without actually using the art. Report to me how many ID\'d, how many had vision, and how many got suckered.','2015-12-29 04:39:27','2015-12-05 01:58:11'),(10018,10104,89,1,'L: Soul Shield','Soul Shield is an art often dismissed. What could be done to make the art more useful? Discuss this with a few people and get a small list of ideas, along with your own. Settle on the best one, and plan out how you would go about making this change if you had the opportunity to do so.','2015-12-29 05:00:19','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10136,35,30,'Trap Nightmare 30','I would liike for you to pit your best chakrams against your current trap abilities. At the higher levels, Trap nightmare makes conventional essence gathering useless. Fill up as many Chaos wells in twenty minutes as you can and then trap for twenty minutes. What are the differences? I wish to see when exactly a SoulMaster starts to leap ahead of energy gathering. Make your efforts worthy. **A**','2015-12-29 05:00:46','2015-12-12 04:27:08'),(10450,10311,80,1,'HypWeaveLearnFlower','Find out everything you can about this art. What does it cost, what is the duration, and what would you use it for? Also, a new and original female name for Lu Chaos.','2015-12-29 05:02:20','2015-12-14 01:45:09'),(10009,10136,22,1,'Forge-Learn-Final','One of the most important things to learn as a Forger is how to repurpose ingredients and items to fit your need. Take this elemen and create something new with it. Mind the coloring as you will have trouble changing that at this point. Determine the best form for it to take, as well as its function. Find a Soulmaster to put your idea to form and bring it to me.','2015-12-29 05:51:34','2015-12-01 03:40:58'),(10455,10750,9,10,'FA - 10 - Arnaya',' I would like you to guage the freedom of each individual house. You can be as sneaky, or transparent as you\'d like. Who are the major \'players\', who runs the show? Don\'t give me crest colors! Rate each house on their ability to do, say, and exist, how they please or how they are not able to for whatever reason. Be it a house mate, a rule, or a \'fault\' in their houses beliefs.','2016-01-04 07:43:00','2015-12-15 06:43:12'),(10745,10104,31,10,'Dar\'canon-Curse 10','Our Curse could use a power boost, like our Poison. Look to the power sources within the City and study them. Bring your research on the most viable sources to provide the energy need for this endeavour. We will have a discussion on how to improve Curse further disrupting the evocations of others. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-01-05 09:33:24','2015-12-24 22:48:21'),(10745,10750,29,20,'Arnaya - Poison 20','As a SoulMaster, I implore your help.  Please find a cure for the Mother Beast\'s poison which ails me. Attached is a vial of antiserum which I alone concocted to slow the progression. Find the antidote and use the extracted Poison to improve your own. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-01-05 10:38:37','2015-12-15 07:41:18'),(10746,10877,144,1,'Chaos Well ~ learn','Welcome back to the City!  As we have discussed before, many things have changed within this fair City of ours.  I would like you to focus on what has changed and try to track down the reason behind  it.  Return with your findings. }\'|\'{','2016-01-09 05:05:55','2016-01-06 04:20:10'),(10455,10659,107,1,'PA:Learn Xan',' I would like you to learn the basics of the changes to our art, and present them to me and atleast 2 other members of the house. Then theorize new ways for us to make use of this and exploit it. Be creative and don\'t hesitate to seek outside opinions if you like.\r\n','2016-01-10 11:51:41','2015-11-01 05:57:56'),(10874,10104,70,50,'Flame50 Dar','Dar\'canon won this in the undergames- he turned in his award token','2016-01-10 23:11:17','2016-01-10 23:11:06'),(10136,10104,28,20,'Abjure20- Dar\'canon','Thinking back on your life in the City, what would you wish to abjure from your past? Now, coming back to this time and day, I\'d like you to find a place in the city that you\'d abjure straight off our maps. Tell me why. What would you put in its place? How could it be done?','2016-01-11 02:21:36','2015-12-29 05:21:34'),(10455,10067,5,30,'Random - 30 - Tugrs',' Start out by being unpredictable, go places, and do things that push the limits of who you are and where you feel comfortable. Then, ick an art or an event and do something completely creative and new with it, I leave the creativity in this to you, it can be a game, a new way of holding a class, anything you can think of. Try to find inspration to propel your dream forward during this unexpected journey\r\n','2016-01-11 06:32:59','2015-12-09 07:20:40'),(10779,10009,69,80,'Tranceflame 80 - D','Granted to honor his Undergame Winner Award, which allows any plateau except Train, Forge, etc.','2016-01-12 02:05:06','2016-01-12 02:04:52'),(10779,10008,89,50,'Soul Shield 50 - K','Your house, nearly every house, is prepping for an eventual war with the Consortium. You can feel it in the air, the tenseness. Take steps to ensure that should the worst befall our City -- total destruction -- that the Dreamers of Light survive. The effort should be substantial, this isn\'t a pack of dark mares we\'re talking about.','2016-01-12 02:18:04','2015-10-18 03:02:22'),(10455,10750,32,10,'Drain 10 - Arnaya',' I\'d like you to look into what we talked about in regards to Drain Essence. Historically try to find out who was okay with draining, who wasnt, and why. I\'d also like for you to learn about the benefits of platting this art, and then come up with new uses for it. If you\'d like a hint, consider the chaos wells.\r\n','2016-01-13 08:54:33','2016-01-11 09:52:33'),(10450,10018,92,20,'Reflect20Jade','Reflect on your journey that brought you to the DreamSmith Mark. What special qualities did you bring to being a forge master that made the council choose you? I\'d like to see some of your work.','2016-01-14 05:12:04','2015-12-29 04:03:56'),(10480,10276,89,20,'Soul Shield: 20','As a Gatekeeper we\'re all well away of the pedantic stereotypes. Avoid those. Yet, I would seek for you to find a way to manifest and use a special shield for yourself that reflects on your focal and higher connections. \'Wyrmgrim did use \"Soul Shield\" to withstand the waves of chaos that washed over the city. What great shield might you manifest in keeping true to yourself?','2016-01-14 05:31:47','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10107,10654,36,50,'Dreamblade 50 ','With the recent changes to the art of combine, this brings about a curious realization. Combine cannot alter blades because they are infinitely charged.  However, they are finintely charged in that there is a finite amount of time in which they can be possessed.  Which raises a more interesting question. Are blades permanent parts of ourselves that we simply manifest?  Is each blade unique, or are they all just a manifestation of something internal?  Perhaps their tie to our appearance is at the root.','2016-01-14 06:16:45','2015-12-12 06:57:35'),(10067,10750,144,10,'Chaos Well - 10','Let\'s have some fun with this one. Come up with three things that you could technically use Chaos Wells for. I know they hold essences but can you think of some other uses for them? Be creative and have some fun. It\'s not planesmithing after all. *)0(*','2016-01-14 06:48:16','2016-01-11 06:40:31'),(10311,10081,144,1,'ChaosWell-Rage','Find out how much strength it can hold unplatted then how much it goes up with each plat. Does it have any limitations of what sort of essences it can hold? What determines the color of a well?','2016-01-16 02:12:24','2016-01-14 19:01:50'),(10455,10318,16,20,'ID - 20 - Lu Chaos',' I\'d like you to speak to each of the Cities factions and find out their current footing as pertains to the other factions, and how they view your new faction. How does knowing this help you, and how can it hinder you? Identify a weakness in whichever home presents the greatest risk to your faction, and exploit it to your benefit.','2016-01-16 03:54:02','2015-12-22 08:00:18'),(10066,10750,46,10,'Recall 10','Create a list of the best gens, including the room name, the spawn area and any other pertinent information you feel is worth adding. We\'ll compare and contrast this list with my memory of gens from before the city fell again. Plan on a field trip.','2016-01-16 06:48:03','2016-01-06 23:06:44'),(10311,10081,108,1,'RageSable-Learn','Collect 5 wells worth of strength for the house.\r\n','2016-01-17 02:27:06','2016-01-16 02:28:05'),(10066,10746,22,40,'Forge Talisman 40','Reevaluate which effects should/nt be imbued into a talismen in the form of a public debate. Identify a general consensus from the debate and plan an attempt to imbue a talisman with the corresponding effect. In your plan, incorporate at last three talismen of your own craft and design that further the goals of your attempt. Delegate two of the talismen to two other people to assist you in your attempt. ','2016-01-17 23:46:43','2015-10-25 06:52:12'),(10007,10276,47,30,'Push 30','Push can be used in many ways. Physical, mental, and emotional. I think you and your house has just gone through all 3 of them recently. Give me a true example of each with your house and the full effect it has had on you and your members. I want the full story to each case.','2016-01-18 05:23:31','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10311,108,10,'Sable-10','Identify a House Project and act upon it.','2016-01-19 02:27:20','2015-12-06 22:07:59'),(10018,10276,11,40,'Amulet 40','An amulet is a GateKeepers most precious possession. In what ways would you change it to make them less risky to carry, if you could? Speak to at least two other Keepers and gain their opinion on the matter as well.','2016-01-20 02:11:28','2015-10-28 06:19:05'),(10136,10081,144,10,'CWell10-PureRage','Can you destroy a chaos well? Can you smash it and use its pieces for something else? I\'d like to discuss HOW a chaos well grows in size to hold more essences.  Can we use this knowledge for other items in the city?','2016-01-20 04:05:33','2016-01-17 02:05:57'),(10745,10717,73,1,'Will Ricson - DT','Destruction can be positive or negative, or both at the same time. I would like for you to pick something of significance to yourself and destroy it. It could be an idea, item, quality, or whatever. Report to me what you destroyed, why you chose it, and whether it is a positive or negative destruction. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-01-20 16:34:52','2016-01-07 09:43:03'),(10007,10717,74,1,'MB - Learn','Play a game with someone. Have them MB and go hide on a plane with many rooms. Keep track of the time and play Hide & Seek with them. They will MB and you will do the seeking. How long did it take you? Have fun!','2016-01-20 19:14:55','2015-10-12 16:40:25'),(10311,10888,26,1,'Purify-Uthy','For your quest I would like for you to find a few opposites in the city. Find three rooms, natural things like waters or skies, or people...and their opposites. When you find these contrasting (Pure and unpure maybe?) objects or people or places I would like you to tell me about them, or show them to me if possible.','2016-01-21 02:23:42','2016-01-21 01:09:01'),(10009,10888,47,1,'Push-Learn','The City is a glorious place to find for the first time. There is so much to find and learn that you can easily become overwhelmed. I want you to continue your exploration and push your luck. Keep going until you find yourself in a place where you can either go no further or you find a foe that you cannot defeat. Where did you go? Where did you stop? What stopped you?','2016-01-21 03:16:29','2016-01-21 01:10:18'),(10007,10888,70,1,'Flame - Learn','With all the flames in the city, not just being \"fireballs\", tell me what types of flames there are in the city. Then I want you to tell me what sparks your own desires. Speak with a couple others to come up with types. Take note on who you speak with.','2016-01-21 05:11:06','2016-01-21 01:14:13'),(10007,10888,60,1,'First Sphere','I believe Uthanatos is ready for his first sphere. He was asked many questions about the city and seems to have a really good grasp on things here.','2016-01-21 05:42:17','2016-01-21 05:42:00'),(10880,10276,60,5,'Hanna - Sphere 5','To replace Magnillia quest for Random.','2016-01-21 09:11:07','2016-01-21 09:10:14'),(10746,10276,15,20,'Judge 20','Channel your inner Seer and look into the core of this art.  Why is it within the realm of Insight?  How does it work?  Which of your actions have been judged incorrectly and how would an accurate judgment have helped that be avoided?','2016-01-22 03:15:08','2015-10-31 04:27:35'),(10107,10455,22,50,'Forge 50 - Pt. 3 ','I want you to explore the stonework here in the Archives of the Planes.  There are some great masonary works in here that should be considered.  I want you to determine where the stone was quarried, what is being used as mortar.  The support pillars seem to be of a different material than the walls.  And finally the Chimeric-like table in the middle must have come from somewhere. From there, make a diorama of the Room to scale and present it as your final submission for this plateau.\r\n ','2016-01-22 05:29:17','2016-01-14 04:55:21'),(10107,10067,22,50,'Forge 50 - part 3','I want you to create the second part of this item which is to fit a chaos well.  I would also like you to create an adapter for AoE\'s telescope and the one in the DreamSeer Apprentice Hall in the Teaching Hall. Make the adapter usable in both telescopes so that experiments are not AoE dependant.\r\n  ','2016-01-22 05:52:29','2015-12-22 06:34:45'),(10745,10796,72,1,'Jonesy - Inscribe','Think about how far your dreams have come since you first awakened. What pieces of your learning would you want those Newly Awakened to know now? Write a few lyrical stanzas to be placed within five individual Codex of Learning. Post these to the Archives of the Awakened. You will need to learn more about the Art first, to make sure your stanzas will fit. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-01-22 05:56:01','2015-11-03 05:11:51'),(10880,10022,140,1,'Quest: WishBringer','Simple Quest out of the gate.  What does Tempest do, how do the plats affect it.  Basic knowledge of the art.  Practical uses, mischievious ones.  Etc.  ','2016-01-23 01:52:53','2015-12-29 04:48:12'),(10880,10009,21,70,'Blend 70 - Dreiko','Find a way into the Consortium. Whether by your own merit, or directing an agent of yours to specifically obtain the crest and become a double-agent. The choice is yours, see it done, and provide a record of how that agent has helped, or hurt, the Order.','2016-01-23 05:22:06','2015-10-26 02:47:23'),(10480,10318,7,40,'RF to 40','As per his undergames prize, I am plateauing his Resist Fear to 40. **A**\r\n','2016-01-23 05:28:14','2016-01-23 05:28:07'),(10480,10746,85,1,'DreamSmith','After interview and speaking with her, granting Smith with the support of the Circle.\r\n','2016-01-23 05:59:14','2016-01-23 05:59:08'),(10880,10066,8,80,'Protection 80 - TM','Save Calenture, or put it out of its misery. Consult your allies, housemates, and your enemies. What do they think is best for Calenture, and best for the City. This task is considered completed when some effort to save, or finish off, Calenture, is evident.','2016-01-23 06:21:16','2016-01-12 02:54:57'),(10480,10018,60,7,'Jade: 7th Sphere','The City has need of is a continuation of the work that has been done towards getting us access into PoR. Towards this end we requires a Consortium crest.. To this end I have acquired us the use of Silk Nuvas\' carving blade. You must devise a means of removing the crest from a Consortium member, you will likely need to collapse the member and then have a way of containing them so that you may work on the soulsphere. Once the crest is in hand assist in making it a viable means of entering PoR.','2016-01-23 07:25:32','2015-10-28 07:30:40'),(10455,10888,25,1,'RW Unthanatos','(Re-quest made out to wrong dreamer) \'d like you to continue on your path to try and keep reweaving your knowledge about your brother and things from his time. Take the time to flesh out what it must\'ve been like for him and visit a few of the places you\'ve spoken to me about. Kudzoo for instance has a perch, which is the first room of Edgeward. Once you\'ve done so, learn a new peice to the puzzle and come ready to discuss.\r\r\n','2016-01-23 10:34:37','2016-01-23 10:33:56'),(10745,10888,24,1,'Uthy-Restore','You mentioned being a soul apprentice and to have regard for historical insight. For your task I would like for you to learn as an apprentice would about the art of Restore. Find out its history. What Master SoulMaster do we attribute it to and why? Acquire basic knowledge on the art, how much, and evoke time. Will this be useful right from the start upon learn? ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-01-23 11:07:35','2016-01-22 09:12:41'),(10007,10750,27,20,'Drain Self 20','You are awesome at writing in the open scrolls about what things have happened in the City. I would like for you to interview me and write the story about my time without my avatar, from fuzzy to bogrom, then to my regular avatar. Place this story on the open scrolls.','2016-01-24 02:58:06','2016-01-19 06:05:16'),(10728,10022,60,7,'Quest: Figment','Regranting Blade\'s sphere as part of his dual focus advancement','2016-01-24 07:07:21','2016-01-24 07:07:16'),(10009,10311,108,20,'Sable20','Collapse 50 Shamblixes with me. Also, ensure the House makes a strong attempt on the Generator project.','2016-01-25 02:59:09','2016-01-25 02:58:58'),(10874,10545,3,50,'SM50 Avayla UndrGam','Avayla turned in her award for the under games with Grok','2016-01-26 02:35:24','2016-01-26 02:35:13'),(10874,10088,3,50,'Vampyro: 50 SM','Working on arts has been done to death. Find something within the City to work on with your fellow SoulMasters. No art research is to be involved. It is to be an original event of your own devising, it need not involve only SoulMasters but it should have a SoulMaster focus. Take people out of their routine, have them work together towards a common goal, no finger waggling or focusing energy. Is it not possible to advance the focus without trying to change an art?','2016-01-26 02:50:03','2015-11-05 04:07:29'),(10874,10088,3,50,'SM50-Vamp via Blade','This is to honor a task blade wrote to him while he was still able to grant them,but now he is a Sender.','2016-01-26 02:50:03','2016-01-26 02:49:37'),(10874,10022,44,30,'Blade\'s Burnin Fire','Fer dis journey, me have ye contemplate both Firestorm and da arts of da SoulMaster. Compare and contrast each art. Which be better at what level? Do FateSenders tend ta have it better over the da other? Which is truly yer favorite and why? Just a few of the questions that ya could think about. Please be prepare ta report worthy of the plateau that you seek. Find me when ye be ready to report. -Deet deet da Deeter','2016-01-26 05:15:02','2016-01-23 06:15:01'),(10480,10104,3,50,'SoulMaster 50','This is a major step in the path of a young SoulMaster. You will be comming into a great deal of power at this level. I wish for you to seek out what new arts you will gain and tell me which are the most important to you. Also, map out in the City where you may find gens that produce the level of chakrams that you will need. **A**','2016-01-26 06:44:49','2015-12-29 05:23:48'),(10009,10104,108,1,'Sable-Learn','Bring in 1000 strength. Starting now.','2016-01-26 17:20:16','2016-01-10 19:39:41'),(10136,10088,35,1,'Trap to Learn -Vamp','Tell me about the construction of a trapping device. How does it work? Can you create one of your own? Give me lots of details! Ask around for ideas and theories! (I don\'t wish for you to create one- just find out if it would be possible,and describe to me why or why not).  Also, I\'d like to discuss why the art is important.','2016-01-27 02:31:25','2015-12-12 06:33:18'),(10007,10888,3,10,'SM - 10','You are a comedian at heart, I can tell. I want you to play a couple practical jokes on a couple dreamers. If you need anything made, come to me and i can make you things that my forge allows me to. Try to infuse our focus into the jokes. I want something funny!','2016-01-27 03:31:58','2016-01-21 06:39:01'),(10007,10750,30,10,'Antidote 10','Speaking of when to use certain arts. Come up with a full plan on when you would \"fight\" or \"heal\". I want an extensive plan. During wars or during mare fights. Everyone thinks we are to just heal, well to hell with that. Again, I want specifics and different scenarios.','2016-01-28 01:29:20','2016-01-24 03:14:41'),(10455,10007,103,1,'Bequeath / Dina','Take this time in your life to give the city another once over. What can you give back to the City with your new found freedom? Take one full day, and help as many people as you can, as best you can, then report back to me.\r\n','2016-01-28 02:27:36','2016-01-21 05:44:35'),(10066,10877,105,1,'PC Learn','Aikido has added thousands of strength to the Orb completing a continued service to the house.','2016-01-29 03:37:04','2016-01-29 03:36:33'),(10455,10888,25,10,'Unth - Reweave - 10',' I\'d like you to go exploring. Find areas of the City that are physically damaged, either planes, objects or things on them. How can these things be fixed, and how would you approach it? Start a conversation about one that you\'d like to see done, and get new ideas and excitement flowing. Finally return to me with all of this information and demonstrate it in a small scale.\r\n','2016-01-29 07:08:54','2016-01-25 08:58:40'),(10880,10750,60,4,'Arnaya 4th Sphere','Organize efforts to restart the WordSmiths as a functional group. Learn the issues that affected the earlier group. What can be done about accountability? What structure or contribution format is more sustainable than meetings? Poetry was over-emphasized to the exclusion of most other formats. What contribution formats have not been explored in the past but could be included? What responsibility does/should the Lyceum have for the Library and Museum? _-* 11.2','2016-01-29 07:24:44','2015-11-03 05:34:15'),(10455,10067,50,10,'NMF 10 Tam',' I\'d like you to design a costume based on a nightmare for the upcoming ball. It doesn\'t have to be what you wear, but I would like you to create it to the best of your ability with the ball in mind. Once you\'ve done so, I want to show it off to people and get their reactions on your costume, as well as their ideas to imrpove NMF.\r\n','2016-01-29 07:48:26','2016-01-16 03:46:25'),(10007,10888,70,10,'Flame 10','So there is a point where your flame will turn pink. A dreamer a while back had issues with this so he made sure to plat it to get rid of that wimpy color (don\'t rat me out to fatesenders). I want you to find out the level this pink flame starts and when it stops. It would be nice to know the colors of all the levels, so find this info out for me please!','2016-01-30 04:45:55','2016-01-29 07:41:33'),(10022,10888,24,10,'Uthanatos: Restore ','Something simple for the young one! Something that would appeal to your cowardly scholarly nature perhaps! Delve into the Library, found works pertaining to Restore... did you learn anything?! Did you not... Perhaps, we shall see! Come up with an answer as to what you believe your best use of this art is for the now, and in the foreseeable future!','2016-01-31 04:25:11','2016-01-26 05:59:33'),(10238,10022,41,20,'There and Back ','Choose a house (not DoL) make your way up there... and back.  You will need a guide.  Explain what it is you learned, and most of all, try your best to have fun!\r\n','2016-01-31 04:29:34','2016-01-25 01:30:34'),(10022,10311,41,10,'Flower: Blind 10','Being blinded in a fight does not mean you have to collapse. I want you to duel two people while blind. Were you able to remain coherent? How did you accomplish it? What is the best method for not getting hit while blind?\r\n','2016-02-01 01:48:12','2016-02-01 01:31:40'),(10238,10022,39,10,'Bartenders License','Clear some room in your pack, create a bunch of alcoholic drinks.  Open the Chak and Flask for the evening and be the bartender.  Most of all, simply have a good time with it!\r\n','2016-02-01 02:58:14','2016-01-31 04:58:47'),(10007,10888,60,2,'2nd sphere','I interviewed uthanatos for a period of an hour or longer. Also showed him the Citadel in the process. He is ready for second sphere','2016-02-02 07:34:11','2016-02-02 07:33:43'),(10009,10545,22,1,'Forge-Learn-Final','Take this alteror and make something unique. The colors must be persisted with your new creation since you are merely reworking this item into something special. Choose a particular function and template to incorporate in forging. Inscribe your schematic onto a codex and bring it to a Soulmaster or Dreamseer with Forge to bring your creation to life.','2016-02-03 01:15:46','2016-01-29 00:54:47'),(10066,10877,105,10,'Poison Cloud 10','Create an improvement center for Poison Cloud where members can find curse charms for others to use on them. Continue to bring in trapped strength for banishment.','2016-02-03 17:18:40','2016-02-03 15:56:05'),(10008,10877,139,1,'Sense Datoken - L','I know when the art was created, but I don\'t know who all made it possible to have it, nor do I know how it was done. I would like this info. Bring me this info and also tell me what all it tells you when you evoke it.','2016-02-04 02:13:21','2016-01-09 05:42:36'),(10022,10009,25,20,'Dreiko: Reweave 20','Make yourself useful. You are not a traveling repairer of items. Fix shields, recharge chaks. Put up a little stand and sell your services. You must help at least three people, while at your stand. Recharging at your house does not count. Who did you help, how did you help, did you get paid?\r\n','2016-02-04 02:36:02','2016-02-01 01:53:44'),(10238,10022,44,40,'Firestorm40-BldSlyr','Test this art with other dreamers with arts of the same level. Which arts do the most damage?  Are they equal, although their names are different?  Tell me what advantages this art has over the dozens of others you could choose to use during combat of the strongest dragons in the city.  Go to a wordsmith meeting, if possible, or a bardic meeting and tell a story of the art.','2016-02-04 19:38:04','2016-01-26 06:17:07'),(10238,10022,80,1,'Quest: Akkadian','This is what I would like to see happen with your learning of this art. I wish for you to attempt to stop the momentum of the conversation of a room full of Citizens. You will paralyze the conversation for a brief moment and change its direction. Make as many attempts as you need to get 4 successes. Keep notes on the original conversation and how long the pause was and the new conversation. The way you achieve results is completely up to you. **A**\r\n','2016-02-06 05:50:21','2015-12-29 05:16:01'),(10450,10022,82,1,'TerrorBladeSlayer','Strike terror in the heart of your enemy. Whether it be verbal or physical, find that which you oppose and terrorize them into submission. ','2016-02-06 06:38:37','2015-12-29 04:08:19'),(10066,10018,79,1,'Dreamquake Learn','Choose a topic that is being avoided or should have more attention, that at least a handful of dreamers can relate to. It could be related to your house or just a general one to the city. Explain the topic then identify why its not being addressed. Discuss what you would do to rectify the problem.','2016-02-07 05:39:01','2016-01-13 02:31:25'),(10022,10009,60,1,'Drieko: 1st Sphere','Dreiko\'s on his 9th sphere task.\r\n','2016-02-09 02:59:28','2016-02-09 02:59:24'),(10022,10009,60,2,'Dreiko: 2nd sphere','Dreiko\'s second sphere in his 9th sphere task.\r\n','2016-02-09 03:44:27','2016-02-09 03:44:23'),(10088,10009,60,3,'Quest: Vampyro','per Figment, a freebie for the multi-focal thing\r\n','2016-02-10 01:43:51','2016-02-10 01:43:41'),(10022,10009,60,4,'Dreiko: Fourth','Dreiko\'s fourth sphere in his 9th sphere path.\r\n','2016-02-11 02:12:16','2016-02-11 02:12:06'),(10009,10905,47,1,'Push-Learn','You are presently a blank slate in knowledge of the City as well as who you represent within it. What are the names of the 8 Strongholds within the City, what planes lead to them, and how many of them are currently accessible? Also, ensure those around you are able to see precisely what you want them to see when they look upon you.','2016-02-11 22:02:21','2016-02-06 15:15:24'),(10746,10877,105,20,'PC to 20','Continue adding strength (like I have to tell you to do that) and using the false wall in the Maze as inspiration, think of a possible plan for creating a secure essence storage room. ','2016-02-12 04:24:17','2016-02-05 04:24:56'),(10746,10008,105,1,'PC - learn','Serve the house; be it through genning, hunting or defending against attacks.  Also, give me your thoughts on which art, Dazzle or Poison Cloud, is more useful in battle. }\'|\'{','2016-02-12 04:42:16','2016-02-09 05:53:32'),(10009,10905,60,1,'First Sphere','You have already learned about the Houses so let\'s learn about you and your focus. What is your Focus? What color of halo marks the teachers of the same focus? What are the five primary item types you will find in the City? What colors are important to your focus? What are the five types of Nightmares within the City?','2016-02-12 19:56:55','2016-02-11 22:06:17'),(10136,10009,27,1,'Drain Self-Dreiko ','As you drain your energy into another dreamer, please explain to me exactly what happens. Have you given them a piece of yourself? Have you altered their avatar\'s core cells? Test this with other soulmasters. Have them drain into you, if you can, and tell me all the info you find out! I\'m curious to know exact numbers for different levels of the art. ','2016-02-13 02:29:34','2016-02-10 00:57:00'),(10022,10009,60,5,'Dreiko: 5th','5th sphere on Dreiko\'s path to 9th.\r\n','2016-02-13 04:43:58','2016-02-13 04:43:46'),(10745,10905,67,10,'Cadirand - SR 10','Learning to fend for yourself before defending or aiding others is your first step as a SoulMaster. Sharpen your skils to earn your plateau by using your blade in its current form. Blade five Bogroms and return their essences to me. The honor code is at play here. Seek advice on blading skills from me or other dreamers if you need to do. You can do it! ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-02-13 11:07:26','2016-02-13 09:40:52'),(10311,10877,142,1,'Aikido-Misdirection','As a former Calenturian, I would like you to try and remind your housemates of the force within the city it once was. I know circumstances (Low population, mostly) makes it hard to bring it back to its former glory but try to remember a couple of projects the house worked on in the past that you can remember, and come up with another you may like to see the house work in the future. Have a talk with your housemates about it then come report to me the past and future projects you came up with.','2016-02-13 16:07:06','2016-01-25 18:38:38'),(10008,10750,50,1,'NMF - Learn','So why can we turn into emphants? What causes us to turn into a mare, but go back to dreamer form after time expires? Normally when a dreamer turns into a mare, they stay that way and then need to be fixed or cured. One more thing, why only emphants, why not higher forms with the plats we get? --- wrote this for the wrong person, so had to rewrite before the report. She had this for far more than seconds, she had it for weeks perhaps.','2016-02-15 05:52:52','2016-02-15 05:35:10'),(10728,10009,29,1,'Dreiko: Poison L','Write a story about poison. Something longer than a handful of sentences. Find a group of Dreamers standing around doing nothing and share your story.','2016-02-15 23:22:58','2016-02-10 02:43:56'),(10480,10545,102,1,'Quest ','Granting Avayla the art of Quest as per her apprenticeship with Dreiko. **A**','2016-02-16 00:41:41','2016-02-16 00:41:00'),(10480,10877,102,1,'Quest art','After interviewing Dina and Aikido, I am granting the art of Quest as per the apprenticeship. **A**','2016-02-16 01:08:04','2016-02-16 01:06:04'),(10480,10888,67,10,'SoulReaper 10 Uthan','Based on our talk of your interests, take this task and CUT into the minds of the peers you\'re making. Compile a list of topics from others on what would make for a mighty fine series of discussions, stories, tales, etc. Then, using the best topic, create a story, involving the individual whose idea you like best, and present it on your story night or at the Bardic Circle. Give me the details and be thorough in your work.','2016-02-16 01:27:40','2016-01-22 03:29:58'),(10880,10136,26,50,'Shae da Pure','Bring da Idoacleasiansand da Lyrans tagether to a united front. Purify the misunderstandings and help ta close the gaps in misunderstandings. Da Consortium beezin a common enemy is a start. -Deet deet da Deeter!','2016-02-16 01:45:21','2016-01-21 04:59:59'),(10136,10009,30,1,'Antidote - Dreiko','You taught me about drain self today.  How does Antidote work as compared to drain self?  Speak to a SoulMaster or two and see why they feel this art uses resilience, rather than dreamsoul to heal a poison that was created with resilience to begin with.','2016-02-16 01:57:17','2016-02-13 02:37:56'),(10480,10022,60,8,'Quest: Akkadian','Sphering Blade to 8th. **A**\r\n','2016-02-16 02:32:44','2016-02-16 02:32:40'),(10480,10022,44,50,'FireStorm Blade','FireStorm Battle - Now you must learn to hunt with it.  The true test - Horron.  Use your keen skills to defeat the Horron.  Do not recruit help, do not trap, or cheat.  Its you vs. it.  Try to use Firestorm as your primary tool to defeat it.  I need 10 essences to proove your dominance over the fowl beast.  Tell me how you used Firestorm effectively.  Good luck and may the Fatesender in you shine forth!','2016-02-16 02:41:34','2016-02-06 04:57:36'),(10480,10022,41,30,'Blind30BladeSlayer','Spend some time blinding your lady with some love. Were I able to etch a grin into my scroll, I would.','2016-02-16 02:45:17','2016-02-06 06:42:56'),(10480,10022,80,10,'Hypnotic Weave 10','Putting meaningful effort into attempting to pursade at least one member of each other open house and a freespirit into joining DoL!    ','2016-02-16 02:51:12','2016-02-09 02:26:06'),(10480,10022,42,10,'Dark Blade Blade','Blinded be thy love ferever more... Perhaps? The Light be yer other love. Do it still burn bright or be it merely full ah too many chiefs and few Initiates. Bring te me a plan ta bring back its backbone or bring it darkness. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-02-16 03:02:39','2016-02-06 06:56:21'),(10480,10022,39,20,'Blade - Stagger 10','Intentionally place a friend, ally or housemate into a situation that is dangerous, they will likely not be able to overcome without assistance, and do not provide that assistance directly. When they have learned a method of overcoming it alone, you may assist them.','2016-02-16 03:10:28','2015-12-13 05:26:18'),(10067,10888,72,1,'Inscribe','This art allows you to write messages onto a codex. It can be handy when you are too far away to whisper. Aside from learning all the basics of the art, I want you to scribble down 5 things that you would write on a codex to someone who you can\'t whisper to. They can be funny or serious or sassy, you choose. Have fun and use your imagination. <T>','2016-02-16 08:13:46','2016-02-15 04:53:09'),(10874,10003,87,1,'Support Sphere-Lio','She did not have the art. ','2016-02-17 03:33:11','2016-02-17 03:33:02'),(10874,10877,83,1,'Aikido: HA L','Take a group of dreamers to a room of your chosing. A room which has been neglected and forgotten. Bring life back to this room in any way you choose.','2016-02-17 04:26:37','2016-02-09 02:18:41'),(10874,10877,83,1,'healing aura ','blade quested this. Nessa trained it to Aikido.','2016-02-17 04:26:37','2016-02-17 04:26:26'),(10874,10067,52,60,'Train Tam','This is a report Nessa heard, but that Deeter tasked.','2016-02-17 04:48:20','2016-02-17 04:48:14'),(10874,10067,52,60,'Prince in Training','Work wit other Seer teachers in tandem by way of yer guild or one-on-one meetings. Further the teaching of yer focus. We Seers have a way ah makin even the mundane task even more boring. Show others what be possible with some imagination. When ye feel yer own standards have been met find meh and tell how all have benefited from the Prince\'s teachins. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-02-17 04:48:20','2016-02-06 07:23:48'),(10018,10750,6,20,'Meditation 20','At one point, Meditation transformed into a DreamSoul art in Idoaclesia. Contemplate on why that happened and if you would like that to happen here. Theorize on the easiest way to implement the alteration.','2016-02-18 10:59:15','2016-02-16 09:02:48'),(10009,10018,22,50,'Forge50','Seek out a dreamer of each focus and have them create a figure or statue depicting a dreamer that they admired in their previous dreams. Once collected, I want you to create the antithesis of each original statue while attempting to maintain the forging style of the original. Show the original Forger the newly created statues and keep track of their responses. Bring all 8 Statues to the report and place them in the Museum afterward.','2016-02-19 00:50:11','2015-12-05 04:33:47'),(10022,10888,60,3,'Uthanatos: Third','It seems Flower of Cienn was heard slandering a Calenture member. It is up to you to bring her to answer for her supposed \"crime\". You must inform her that she is to stand trial. You are to schedule the trial and call witnesses. Assign a panel of jurors and appoint a judge. The accused may choose an advocate, or speak for herself. You are to be arguing on the side of the affected party.','2016-02-20 07:39:17','2016-02-17 06:05:30'),(10216,10750,47,10,'Push/10 - Arnaya','The history of the Illuminated Front and its origins may be lost to us if we fail to pass it down to newer generations such as yourself, an Illuminated Dreamer. Push yourself to learn about them from your peers. A treatrise is not required - but be prepared to compare. ','2016-02-20 09:35:57','2016-02-10 07:20:15'),(10136,10009,29,10,'Poison10-Dreiko','Abuse poison in a light-hearted way. I do not wish for you to collapse any dreamer with it, unless deservingly so. See how often your abuse goes unnoticed, or how often dreamers wish to destroy you. Do you feel if you were in combat, poison could be your only line of offensive arts that you could use and survive the battle? What level Poison do you believe would get you to that point?','2016-02-21 23:26:51','2016-02-16 02:13:06'),(10018,10088,7,20,'Resist Fear 20','Assist Tember and others tomorrow by using your portal tuning technique in a minor way to activate one of the former Palisade entrance portals long enough to pass Herbert through.','2016-02-22 00:35:28','2015-12-09 04:24:51'),(10728,10888,3,20,'SM 20','I want you to work harder on getting people to these FreeSpirit meetings. I want you to give enough notice and spread the word. Seek out FreeSpirits directly to get them to attend. I would like for you to hold a meeting and take notes. Bring to me what you all talked about, who showed up and what you see in the future.','2016-02-22 01:37:14','2016-02-02 07:57:41'),(10728,10888,139,1,'Sense Datoken - L','Sense Datoken is a fairly new art. Who was involved in the creation of this art and how did they achieve it? Also, what can you learn when attempting to sense the Datoken in the city?','2016-02-22 01:52:00','2016-02-16 01:16:09'),(10311,10916,144,1,'ChaosWell-Aileron','Find out who created this art, how many essences it holds at each plateau. Are there any ristrictions on what kind of essences it can hold? Also ask some folks in houses if and why they dont use it for belief purposes.\r\n','2016-02-22 02:52:00','2016-02-19 22:01:40'),(10007,10009,35,1,'Trap Learn','As your trap nightmare grows you will learn things about the city you never noticed before. I would like you to speak to 3 sm\'s experienced in trapping and find out a few things they have learned with the art. I would also like you to plan a route that you will start with. Lastly, please tell me the maximum strength each mare can provide you. -- copied Aikido\'s task and trained due to not being around 2-22-16, apprenticeship','2016-02-22 23:29:46','2016-02-22 23:21:19'),(10007,10009,35,1,'Trap - Learn','As your Trap Nightmare grows you will learn things about the city you never noticed before.  I would like you to speak with 3 SoulMasters experenced in trapping and find out a few things they have learned with the art.  I would also like you to plan a route that you will start with.  Lastly, please tell me maximum strength each mare can provide you.','2016-02-22 23:29:46','2016-02-16 01:34:43'),(10007,10750,3,40,'SM 40','I would like for you to theorize on how chakrams get their effects. Why do only a certain level of chakrams get the effects and the others not? Such as berry chaks can be nice, but no effects while sand chakrams can have many things infused in it, even arts that we don\'t have. Why is this? Come up with a thought out way, on why this is so.','2016-02-23 07:04:46','2016-01-29 07:50:36'),(10067,10888,25,20,'Reweave 20','Oh how I love the sound of Reweave. I would love to know exactly how you think reweave works. Spend some time thinking about it and really give it some thought. Listen to it...what does resilience have to do with it...fun stuff like that. Don\'t hurt yourself thinking too hard about it but do give it some thought. <T>','2016-02-23 08:37:00','2016-02-19 09:42:08'),(10066,10916,105,1,'PC Learn','Donated 300 essences beyond initiation requirements. Service to house.','2016-02-24 02:47:51','2016-02-24 02:47:21'),(10874,10232,80,40,'Hypnotic Weave 40','I always find the peaceful to be interesting. Especially the FateSender ones. Your arts are basically all offensive, yet you try not to take an offensive stance unless needed. Speak with your fellow FateSenders and create for me an alternate art list that would benefit FateSenders of a peaceful nature, but also maintain the whole trickster personna that they portray. Have fun with it, and make you sure you\'re keeping a fair balance in mind!','2016-02-24 03:15:03','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10874,10750,144,20,'Chaos Well 20','This art is peculiar in how it operates. More peculiar yet, is that all the elements that went into this art were devised by forge yet it cannot be forged.  Do you think this was the result of a flaw in the creation of the art, an oversight or was there a purpose to this.  Perhaps find a history on the art if it is available.\r\n','2016-02-24 04:18:33','2016-01-29 04:51:58'),(10654,10905,24,1,'Restore 1 Cadirand','You seek to aid others. First ask others to aid you. Learn the location of two more Cache rooms that we didn\'t already explore. Consider which of them is best suited for you to share the Talismen you collect. Consider which of them is best suited for you to share the Talisman you find. Is a Cache room the best option for this or is there another way you could share what you find?','2016-02-24 09:07:42','2016-02-21 08:35:50'),(10455,10067,89,30,'SS - 30 - Tamarisk',' I\'d like you to investigate the differences in the house arts. Ours, and the Order\'s are completely defensive, yet some are offensive. Why is this? Weigh in the balance all availible house arts. Summarize your findings, and if imbalance is found, how can they be altered to equalize them all? Finally, consider our own house art, and come up with a plan to upgrade it.\r\n','2016-02-25 05:14:13','2016-02-18 06:03:20'),(10746,10175,144,1,'Chaos Well ~ learn','Welcome back to the City!  As I am sure you have seen and heard, this is not the same City many of us left behind.  What are the biggest or most important changes?  How do you see yourself adjusting to this new Underlight?','2016-02-25 05:38:53','2016-02-24 18:27:03'),(10018,10232,73,40,'DT 40','As one of the best historians I know, I want you to help Destroy some of the confusion on our Idoaclesian history. Think of two prominent histories (or only one, if it is in depth) and either inscribe it for the 3rd sphere hall that is dedicated to our city, or post it to the Archive.','2016-02-25 09:14:23','2016-02-23 10:09:14'),(10136,10009,35,10,'Trap10 Dreiko','Can you trap beasts in rooms they are not usually seen in? I know you can trick one in the Lost Caves, but are there other areas that are similar?  Trap a dreamer or two into a conversation about this and then trap them into assisting you however you wish. You can make it a joke, or you can make it serious.  Let loose and have fun, if you want!','2016-02-26 02:04:02','2016-02-23 01:58:52'),(10022,10009,60,6,'Dreiko: Sphere','Sixth sphere for Dreiko.\r\n','2016-02-27 02:39:52','2016-02-27 02:39:47'),(10022,10915,44,30,'Magnum - Firestorm ','I once played Firestorm tag. I was kinda fun and it had me learn about the limitations of Firestorm and how best to use it. Now you get to play Firestorm tag... you can thank WishBringer for inventing it. What you do is you tell people you are going to play tag. You run off, they are to give you a small head start, no more than a few seconds. You run to another room and try to get your Firestorm to hit them, before they can hit you. See how many times you can win.\r\n','2016-02-27 02:56:06','2016-02-16 03:38:34'),(10232,10796,66,10,'Jones - Blade 10','Since this is a plataeu, you\'re required to work with at least one person. As such chose someone to inscribe designs for your own. How should it feel in your hand? What materials would you make it out of? Is it for fighting or wood carving? It should be unique to you, and be ready for creation by the time you are ready for your second plataeu. ','2016-02-27 05:03:39','2015-11-04 06:48:38'),(10232,10796,66,10,'Jones - Blade 10','Per Clarity Task: Find others to create blades meant for you, via inscribe. Which fits you best, which least well? Why? What do you think this says about you, and what others think of you? Ensure a thorough report. ~~ Report heard by Em\'et as Clarity has not been present. ','2016-02-27 05:03:39','2016-02-27 04:55:35'),(10009,10916,144,10,'Chaos Well 10','Chaos Wells can be used for more than just toting essences in abundance. Think of a few ways you could use them for other means, and how you would go about each. Report back with a thorough explanation.','2016-02-28 01:18:22','2016-02-26 00:41:54'),(10022,10311,80,10,'Flower: Hypnotic 10','Can you paralyze a room without the use of arts? Can you stop the flow of conversation throughout the surrounding dreamers with just your words, causing silence? Give it a try, how did you do it, were you successful? Try a couple times.','2016-02-28 02:56:22','2016-02-17 04:41:06'),(10007,10916,70,40,'Flame 40','Mold your flame. This can be many different ways. I am leaving it up to you. Bring me samples of whatever it takes to mold your flame and I want at least 5 different samples. These could be minerals, jars full of thoughts, or etc. I expect this to be unique and very creative, or more will be added to this. Tip: Forge is a great art that many have.','2016-02-28 04:34:23','2016-02-22 23:07:57'),(10232,10175,42,20,'Restel - Darkness20','Threats seem to be appearing from the Idoaclesian City -- Bandaret, and the Mace of Castigation being two notable problems. I\'d like for you to brush up on some history of the Idoaclesian City, relating to Darkness -- Ask dreamers from that city, or who know about that City, about DARKNESS in the Idoaclesian City. Uncover the history of the creatures of Darkness there, and how they were dealt with. Be sure to record your sources; I\'d like to know who knows what on this most unilluminated subject!','2016-02-29 00:48:34','2016-02-25 06:32:13'),(10007,10888,29,1,'Poison - Learn','Poison used to be so useless that many SM\'s didn\'t even use it. If they did it was just to annoy someone. A specific SM took over and led a project that enabled the art to its new greatness with the help of other SM\'s from the Guild. Who was this person and who helped? What did they do? I want details.','2016-02-29 05:59:46','2016-02-25 06:48:30'),(10311,10175,98,1,'NewlyAwakened-Reste','Tell me why people would need to know whos new and who isnt? Give me a few practical uses of the art. Why do you think we need to learn it and it isnt what we call a \'born art?\' There is no wrong answer here, but come up with something that makes sense.','2016-02-29 21:55:49','2016-02-28 02:34:02'),(10009,10232,144,20,'CW-20','The concept of the Chaos Well is loosely based on the Nexus from your City. Speak with some Idoaclesians to get an idea of their thoughts on the two capabilities. Once you have some ideas, put together a document comparing and contrasting the two. Which do you feel is the \"better\" of the two? Place your document on the City Scrolls once it is complete.','2016-02-29 23:52:21','2016-02-24 01:23:46'),(10311,10761,139,1,'Jorryn-SenseDatoken','I would like to find out how much you know and what information you can gather on the differences between the types of mares and give me a theory that you come up with, or if you can find a concrete reason, on why the art only works for datoken and what makes them different. You may get your information from the libraries, the teaching guild, or from other dreamers if you would like. Just come back and report to me something interesting, well thought out, and at least somewhat fact based for your theory.','2016-03-01 01:10:55','2015-11-22 02:43:29'),(10311,10761,139,1,'SenseD-Jorryn','I would like to find out how much you know and what information you can gather on the differences between the types of mares and give me a theory that you come up with, or if you can find a concrete reason, on why the art only works for datoken and what makes them different. You may get your information from the libraries, the teaching guild, or from other dreamers if you would like. Just come back and report to me something interesting, well thought out, and at least somewhat fact based for your theory.','2016-03-01 01:10:55','2016-03-01 01:08:01'),(10480,10232,52,60,'Em\'et 60 Train','Teachers need to be taught, especially when the teacher is absent for long periods of time. Train yourself of the City affairs and see to it to have them fixed, in theory alone, except for ONE. Fix ONE. Find others to help, even groups of two or three at a time. Once the city affairs have been brainstormed and you are up to date, I\'d like for you to train me in the ways of having dreamers trained into teachers. What would you change in the system? Name off good and bad qualities. Be thorough. ','2016-03-01 06:57:57','2016-02-24 03:34:11'),(10745,10888,70,20,'Uthantos: FS 20','Come up with some ideas to help market and kindle the FreeSpirit flame at the next meeting. What could sear the hide of the houses and make being a FreeSpirit more appealing? It might be worthwhile to research how others before you have suceeded before you. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-03-01 07:29:07','2016-02-10 06:04:54'),(10232,10888,74,1,'Uthanatos - MB','Search for a place in the City of Dreams where you can blank your mind. What qualities does such a place possess?\r\n\r\nWhat are the advantages of a blank mind? How can you use this, and how can it be used against you? Consider carefully, and be prepared to discuss. ','2016-03-01 08:58:25','2016-02-29 09:56:51'),(10480,10545,28,10,'Avayla: Abjure 10','How about a bit of research! I do not write many for that! Your abjure is so baby... I think you could benefit from a little tooling around with it. How does Abjure work? How are we able to reach inside an avatar and remove an effect the avatar is afflicted with? What is the actual process by which it functions? Think on this and return.','2016-03-01 09:10:32','2016-01-20 01:06:27'),(10746,10916,105,10,'PC ~ 10','Continue serving the house (genning, hunting, \'statueing\' on the Facade or within our Threshold room).  I would also like you to look into the new effect that came about when Poison was changed.','2016-03-02 05:20:02','2016-02-28 00:18:19'),(10216,10750,15,10,'Judgment 10','I come to understand that a new visitor recently appeared at the steps of House Calenture. Some say he\'s rather high in spheres like the members of the Consortium. Utilize your judgment and determine whether this dreamer is a friend or foe. Who is this Sicario? And what does this mean for our city?','2016-03-02 10:15:03','2016-02-20 09:43:13'),(10746,10008,105,10,'PC to 10','Imagining there are no limitations, is there any way that PC could be improved to be even more powerful now that Poison is a valid threat?  Combine this with continued house service (200 essences/strength, etc).','2016-03-04 03:24:19','2016-02-12 05:02:11'),(10746,10796,105,1,'PC to learn','Service to the house is how this art is given.  Be it through hunting, genning, standing upon the facade or within Threshold or other activities that benefit the house.  Post your fulfilled duties so there is a record of them for 4 days.','2016-03-04 03:33:55','2016-02-20 05:46:49'),(10232,10369,40,1,'Deafen To Learn','What good is deafen to anyone? What do you think it does, how does it work? Ask five or more dreamers how they believe it works.  Pick a couple of things you would like to deafen yourself too, and tell me about them.','2016-03-04 17:27:05','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10232,10369,40,1,'Neveren - Deafen','( Hearing report for Amante\'s task to Neveren for Deafen. )','2016-03-04 17:27:05','2016-03-04 17:01:10'),(10232,10717,47,10,'Will - Push 10','The honorable (and ballsy) practice of Push battle is a time-honored tradition in the City of Dreams. I would like for you to develop strategies for this form of battle. How can you get the upperhand, even when your opponent has the upper-Push? Ensure a thorough report!','2016-03-04 19:40:16','2016-02-23 19:47:54'),(10066,10796,60,3,'Sphere 3','Host a decompression session at the chak and flask. The point is to get a gathering where people can unwind, leave politics at the door and discourage business (teaching, etc). Incorporate one unique idea of your own that will be suitable for the gathering. -™','2016-03-05 05:49:26','2016-02-25 05:05:18'),(10480,10741,102,1,'Quest art','Returning the art of QUest to Talanor. **A**','2016-03-05 07:53:14','2016-03-05 07:52:28'),(10480,10741,60,1,'Sphere','Returning the art of Sphere to Talanor. **A**\r\n','2016-03-05 07:53:23','2016-03-05 07:53:02'),(10480,10741,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting the support art for teachers **A**\r\n','2016-03-05 07:55:54','2016-03-05 07:55:32'),(10480,10741,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting the support arts for teaching **A**\r\n','2016-03-05 07:56:03','2016-03-05 07:55:49'),(10480,10659,70,20,'Flamesear: 20','I wish for you to explore the city and find a vessel capable of containing a mote of your flame within. This could be a gem, a bauble, or anything else that has a connection to your powers and methods that you prove able to trap this mote of your flame within. You may or may not involve others in attempting the act, that is up to you. But let us test your mastery of Flamesear with this practical exercise. ','2016-03-05 08:49:51','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10067,10888,16,1,'ID to learn','This art will save your life. It\'s taken for granted alot. I want for you to bring me two items of each...an elemen, a charm, a shield and a chakram. You should be able to tell me what you think the levels and abilities of them should be. We will Identify them and see how close you are. Also learn all that ID can tell you about an item. <T>','2016-03-06 07:51:08','2016-02-27 09:18:19'),(10232,10369,66,10,'Neveren - Blade 10','Welcome back to the City of Dreams! For this plateau of your Blade art, I\'d like for you wander the City of Dreams looking for the best hunting grounds for you. Where can you fight the most of what you want to fight, in terrain in which you\'d like to fight? Search through at least a few planes, preparing a report on how well you liked the place for hunting for each. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-03-06 21:56:33','2016-03-04 20:24:07'),(10022,10232,22,50,'Em\'et: Forge 50','You say that in your City forging was an expression of art. See if you can breathe life back into that way of thinking. You are to create an exhibition of art! Craft pieces yourself, have others make what they consider to be works of art. These are to be \"masterpieces\" not simple trinkets. Find a space to display these works and have an offical opening to present them for all to see. Perhaps this will be a lasting endeavor, a collection that will grow and endure the test of time.','2016-03-07 06:51:48','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10232,10796,71,10,'Jones - FlameRuin10','The Flame is often seen as the embodiment of our focus, not only by Senders, but by others: How do we reconcile the concept of Lucidity with the element of Fire? Do you think the two are innately related, or is this a matter of perception? I\'d like for you to consider the nature of Lucidity, above all, as all FateSenders must: Is our Focus seen as it truly is? Why, or why not? Be prepared to discuss. ','2016-03-07 07:46:41','2016-02-27 05:33:33'),(10232,10916,40,20,'Deafen 20','An essence is an item distilled and purified. Bring to me the Essence of Deafen. Explain how you made it, and how one might use such an item to counter or strengthen deafen. Be ready for a discussion.','2016-03-07 21:53:20','2016-03-05 04:11:00'),(10746,10232,144,30,'Well to 30','Many of the great things within both of our cities have needed to be created by groups.  Why can great things not be accomplished by one alone?  Does the City conspire to make us work together?  Devise a theory as to why groups are needed when we all have the necessary elements and potential and share it for feedback.','2016-03-08 18:34:47','2016-03-06 22:15:30'),(10066,10125,105,1,'PC Learn','Dakkoth has served the house well since his initiation, submitting over 2000 strength for Banishment.','2016-03-09 02:05:02','2016-03-09 02:04:54'),(10066,10125,139,1,'Sense Datoken Learn','Theorize as to why Sense Datoken is tuned to list all datokes, revealing their name while Sense Dreamer returns aggregate data. How do you suppose Sense Dreamer can be tuned to return names instead of just planes?','2016-03-09 02:27:28','2016-03-09 02:27:08'),(10480,10232,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Raising to the station of Master Teacher of Lucidity. **A**\r\n','2016-03-09 06:35:21','2016-03-09 06:35:10'),(10880,10888,29,10,'Poison - 1st Plat','You must concoct a Poison of sorts.  Nothing that is too harmful.  Something of a particular ailment.  Perhaps it makes them turn Plum in color or shrink in size.  Whatever you can do.  Then...you must slip it into at least one of the drinks the bartender will be making at the Flask and Chak saloon night.  ~Dakk\r\n','2016-03-09 06:50:44','2016-03-02 06:19:49'),(10480,10232,140,20,'Tempest 20','This plateau is for the reward that Em\'et received from Herbert for winning a trivia contest. I am honoring it for a lower level plateau since there was no stipulation as to what arts and level could be honored. **A**','2016-03-09 07:06:15','2016-03-09 07:06:03'),(10880,10545,31,1,'Blessing or Curse','I see that you are a Knight of your house. A station that should be respected. However, it is not always the case. Talk to other Knights of the City, find out if they feel being a Knight is a blessing or a curse, and why. Also...how about you?, do you enjoy it? or is it at times more like a curse?  ~C','2016-03-09 07:26:30','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10232,10888,9,1,'Uthanatos - FA','What are the obstacles that hinder our \"Free Actions\" in the City of Dreams? Explore the physical aspect of the City, and find some different examples of how our freedom can be denied. What are the best countermeasures to ensure our freedoms win in the end? Be prepared to discuss, and ensure a thorough report. ','2016-03-09 08:55:07','2016-03-06 21:22:34'),(10746,10745,22,1,'Forge Part 1','Each Forger is encouraged to find their niche, something that they work into their items and try to perfect. I would like you to go out into the City and find what inspires you.  Create some items using Inscribe to show them to me. How could your inspiration become your niche? ','2016-03-09 21:13:57','2015-11-10 05:33:35'),(10746,10745,22,1,'Forge part 2 - CK','At first you will be forging more for form than for function.  You\'re a long ways away from being able to forge anything overly \"practical.\"  With that said, capture a few forms you admire from throughout the dream.  They could be dreamers or nightmares or items or drawings or what have you.  Pick three and make a codex forging for each one.','2016-03-09 21:13:57','2015-12-22 06:50:34'),(10311,10796,9,1,'FreeAction-Jones','Choose something you see as paralyzed, metaphorically or literally. Volunteer yourself to try and help free this person/place/thing from its paralysis. Come back and report to me what you chose, and what action you took to free it. Were you successful? ','2016-03-10 03:06:45','2016-02-19 02:10:03'),(10232,10905,25,1,'Cadirand - Reweave','Meditate on Being -- How can you BE a Reweave? Learn what this art does, its costs, and benefits. How can you do what it does, without acting, but simply Being? Meander the Dream a while, and find a place that helps you meditate upon this. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-03-10 15:54:41','2016-03-09 07:53:36'),(10125,10905,3,10,'SM - First Plat','Understanding the differences and purpose for each focus is crucial.  Through your interaction with other dreamers, discover why there are four foci and not more or less.  What is the significance of being a SoulMaster?  Report to me when you feel you can adequately answer these questions.  ~Dakk','2016-03-11 05:28:39','2016-03-06 14:21:21'),(10136,10905,24,10,'Restore10-Cadirand','Play with your art!  Restore dreamers and restore beasts.  Do you think there is a difference when you do this to both?  Beasts are made up of mostly chaos, and we are made of mostly dreamsoul. Explain your theories to me.','2016-03-11 21:02:21','2016-03-06 18:47:03'),(10018,10888,24,20,'Restore 20','What can be done about a dreamer that goes out of their way to pick fights and insult people? At this time, our City needs to be strong and cooperative. Do what you can to redirect Rasputin\'s attitude by actions and/or conversations. Report back on how it goes, even if it is a failed effort.','2016-03-12 07:01:53','2016-03-07 02:40:29'),(10232,10761,60,3,'3rd Sphere','History is something that we just can\'t lose. Lets have a gathering to tell stories of our past. I would like this to be posted on the message board and also the open scrolls please. Ask others to bring their best history story of their city to your gathering. ','2016-03-12 19:28:31','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10874,10796,4,20,'Jones-FateSender20','Senders are missing in the City, so you\'ll have to become THE Sender of all time. What can you do to prove to me that Senders are THE focus of the city? Show me. Impress me.','2016-03-12 20:26:59','2016-01-13 04:19:25'),(10874,10232,82,50,'Terror 50','Let us pretend that I know nothing of the art of Terror. Let us also pretend that I am able to trade one of my GateKeeper arts for the FateSender art of Terror. You task is to convince me why I should give up DreamQuake for Terror. Sell the art like your future arts depend on this. I am not saying that failure to convince me will stop your progression, but it may. Do you best to sway this stubborn GateKeeper. **A**','2016-03-12 20:45:16','2016-03-01 07:14:47'),(10232,10750,47,20,'Arnaya - Push 20','Push yourself to new ends of the DreamScape! Explore the Dream with the Art KNOW once more (preferably Outer Planes), and discover something (or somethings!) new: Share this something new with a few dreamers, and brainstorm with others to see if you can make something useful out of it to help us with the incoming invasion. Be creative, and ensure a thorough report. ','2016-03-12 21:42:33','2016-02-29 09:39:52'),(10232,10369,38,1,'Scare - Learn','I would like for you to find three rooms that strike a bit of fear in you. I would like all the details on the rooms. Locations, why it is fearful to you, names, etc. Make sure the three rooms are not on the same plane as well. Explore your surroundings!','2016-03-12 22:30:54','2016-03-04 22:00:44'),(10874,10750,67,40,'SoulRea40-Arnaya','SoulReapers are darkly named for special reasons, I wish for a lesson in the naming of the blade. Who, what, when, where and why?  Get help. This may be a large task. ','2016-03-12 22:36:22','2016-02-17 04:56:56'),(10746,10916,105,20,'PC to 20','Continue with house service. I would like you to catch up on the history of Calenture since the City reopened: members, wars, troubles, etc.  You do not need to go into extravagant detail, but the basics need to be covered.','2016-03-13 00:28:06','2016-03-03 04:19:49'),(10746,10915,139,1,'Sense Datoken - L','A sense is preception of the world as it once was. Get a sense for a mare from the city that has collided with ours. Learn its quirks and whims then create a model of this mare and a history to describe what it was and why. Explain any specific features of the mare in the history.','2016-03-14 03:03:33','2016-03-05 03:19:34'),(10018,10761,10,10,'Ward to 10','Every gatekeepers knows how to ward a portal. but not all know how to suspend a ward seemingly in thin air. confer with other gatekeepers and expand your knowledge on this aspect. also, how is it possible to give your ward to another dreamer to use? seek me when you have the answers i seek and we shal have tea and talk about it.~P~','2016-03-14 03:51:48','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10125,10750,24,40,'Restore - 4th Plat','For this 4th plateau of Restore I require your assistance with my avatar.  It has been heavily damaged.  I am grotesque.  Help me restore it to its\' former handsome glory.  ~Dakk','2016-03-16 04:25:58','2016-03-01 06:45:46'),(10125,10888,29,20,'Poison - 2nd Plat','False Prophet Town Criers like Lu Chaos are spewing vile nonsense.  They are Poisoning the well, so to speak.  Take all that Lu Chaos spoke of tonight in regards to his plan.  You are to as effectively point out the weaknesses of his plan and spread it about the City.  Afflict each and every dreamer you can.  ~Dakk','2016-03-16 05:04:39','2016-03-11 06:17:14'),(10027,10067,144,40,'Chaos well 40','The Chaos well is a wishing well. Make a wish and grant three is the path to the level of fortee. Okay so I am no bard. The dream needs more smiles. Find three dreamers to help them find there path again. ','2016-03-17 05:51:47','2016-03-14 01:11:52'),(10125,10232,50,10,'NMF - 1st Plat','For this first plateau of nightmare form you must seek out to find why anyone would be willing to become a nightmare.  Some have claimed nightmare form to be the superior avatar and seek to become a superior being.  Find out who these people are and what, if any merit, is there to their claim.  ~Dakk','2016-03-18 04:21:22','2016-03-01 07:08:26'),(10232,10125,142,1,'Dakkoth - Misdirect','The City can be quite confusing! Is it intentionally designed that way? Search throughout the DreamScape for areas in which it is easy to become misdirected; was this by design, or by unhappy coincidence? Consider for each location, and be prepared to discuss. ','2016-03-18 04:45:10','2016-03-12 21:05:09'),(10232,10916,144,20,'Aileron - CW 20','How might one tap into the Chaos beyond the City of Dreams? \r\n\r\nHaving tapped into that energy, how might one utilize it? Develop a theory for accessing the Chaos outside our walls, and what you\'d do with it personally, should you possess the power to do so. Ask a few dreamers whose opinions you respect what they would do, should they be able to harness the power of Chaos. Be prepared to discuss. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-03-18 06:34:27','2016-03-07 23:01:21'),(10232,10717,9,10,'Will Ricson - FA 10','I\'d like for you to consider what things constrict someone\'s ability to freely take actions in the City. Build a list of things that do so, and rank them in order from least restrictive, to most restrictive, consisting of no less than seven items. Consider which things bind you, and which do not. Is there anything you would change about this? Why or why not? Be prepared to discuss.','2016-03-18 17:22:37','2016-03-04 19:55:08'),(10311,10027,103,1,'Bequeath-LSil-Learn','So you are always giving and giving yourself to others whether it be through your teaching or advising or just being darn good company. I want you to organize a day or event just amongst you and your friends that will be LadySilver appreciation day. You can have a friend organize it but I do want each person you invite to bequeath you with some sort of gift. Report to me how it went down and what you got.','2016-03-19 02:22:27','2016-03-12 23:52:31'),(10027,10787,144,1,'Chaos well learn','Seek out the beleifs of the four open houses and decide if one fits the new dream and you. Find for me new places here you didnt know about from our time. ','2016-03-19 18:25:31','2016-03-14 23:50:22'),(10746,10175,105,1,'PC to learn','Serve the house by hunting, genning, defending or guarding.  Look at the other house arts (Light, Order and Alliance) and weigh their pros and cons in relation to ours.','2016-03-20 04:09:05','2016-03-04 03:31:53'),(10232,10175,41,40,'Restel - Blind 40','Illuminate me where I am blind -- how can one create an Art, something purely conceptual and intangible, into something physical, tangible. As you have studied history before, look to it again: Where have we used Talisman in conjuction with Arts before? There are at least a few basic Arts that require them, in some fashion or another. Discuss your theories with a few dreamers whose opinions you respect, and develop a plan for how one might proceed. Be prepared to discuss. ','2016-03-20 04:57:19','2016-02-29 22:15:32'),(10232,10796,4,30,'Jones - FteSendr 30','Oh great Prophet of the Shaw! I would like for you to add some imaginary structure to your imaginary religion. Develop a hierarchy for this religion; how does one advance? What are the tennets of the Way of the Jones? What are ranked clergy called? Consider all this and more, and then put it into practice (at least for a dream or so) with your two main diciples: Uthanatos and Aileron. Ensure a thorough report, and let me know how it goes. ','2016-03-20 05:50:47','2016-03-15 19:38:23'),(10480,10108,52,20,'Train 20 - Clarity','Produce two tasks from actual, new students that you think are of quality, and create 4 more of Fatesender arts of your choice to demonstrate a proficiency as a teacher. Be preapred to discuss and defend your pride.','2016-03-20 06:40:18','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10750,70,40,'Flamesear 40','For this task I wish for you to evaluate each of the four flames. Tell me all that you can about them, their differences and similarities, strengths and weaknesses. I also wish for you to theorize where their power truely comes from. Why is the art focus based instead of DreamSoul based if there is no distinguishable difference. Learn all you can about flames and then find me and we shall speak. **A**','2016-03-20 07:18:51','2016-03-01 07:06:07'),(10480,10888,6,10,'Med - 10 - Unth',' I want you to take some time and come up with something memorable. It can be a place in the city, a structure, or even one of the murals hidden all over the city walls. After you\'ve done this, I want you to take a person or two, on a tour of these places. See how they perceive it. Compare and come ready to report the differences and similarities with me.\r\n','2016-03-20 07:40:22','2016-02-22 08:54:54'),(10480,10888,3,30,'Clearly Uthanatos','Plum be in the da basket. Berry be in da hand. Both taste plainly of Sand. Here young little Uthanatos take ye stand. Help the dreamers of Utherlight know Resilience be the best focus of the land. Report when yer glass and lucid wit both be at an end. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-03-20 08:00:24','2016-03-09 07:38:33'),(10027,10761,6,10,'Meditation to 10','The dream has places of great value to each dreamer. Think of the path of your dreams and take me to these place that have held such meanign to you and why. Also think of where the path will be leading you.','2016-03-20 17:05:00','2016-03-13 03:55:54'),(10238,10932,75,1,'Quest: WishBringer','Testing ','2016-03-22 01:41:56','2016-03-22 01:41:47'),(10066,10932,11,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Being without Amulet, what separates you apart from the rest of the dreamers here who can\'t pass through wards (aside from having shatter)?','2016-03-22 02:09:40','2016-03-22 02:08:50'),(10108,10796,9,10,'FA - 10','You let a Soulmaster out sass you, sir. I am disapointed. As punishment, during your completion event for Em\'et\'s task, find or create a rediculous \"Fatesenders are Kings of Sass\" pun, and get your followers to repeat it, whole heartedly. Preferably with out their knowledge. ','2016-03-22 02:48:36','2016-03-18 21:12:20'),(10238,10232,140,30,'Tempest the Lesson','Very little is known about Tempest.  Most of the City just looks at it as an annoying art.  But there is more then meets the eyes!  Pass this knowledge on to any FateSender you run across for certain for all should know.  A demonstrate a lesson for all to understand.  What would be the uses of the push... being further?  Why plat it?','2016-03-22 03:39:18','2016-03-10 17:21:22'),(10232,10717,144,10,'William - CW 10','Push yourself to Explore the City, and find the most Chaos-inspired locations. At least three of such places would be nice. While in these locations, evoke random no less than fifteen times! (For each): Which location has the highest average Random? Does the location in which one evokes Random seem to matter, at all? Does proximity to Chaos matter to random? Consider carefully, before reporting. ','2016-03-22 09:31:42','2016-03-18 17:32:05'),(10136,10888,70,30,'Flamesear30-Uthan','I\'ll let you slide this time and NOT have you put on a concert of all drummers using only their FlameSears. Unless you want to.  How about you just theorize on how you can use this art mixed with others to create a new one. What if we mixed it with a different focus? What types of arts could we create? Maybe we can try to work on one during a soulmaster meeting.','2016-03-23 03:19:23','2016-03-10 03:01:24'),(10136,10125,27,40,'DrainSelf40-Dakk','Drain others for a dream or two by asking those with Drain to drain you frequently with energy. Pretend you are a vessel for the energy. Once you are overflowing with energy, act as if you are going to blow up, or something crazy. Bring them on a mission to put the energy to good use, before you explode!  You can do this a few times with as many dreamers as you wish. One, two, ten. Have fun with this, but be sure to include others.','2016-03-23 03:41:19','2016-03-11 03:12:59'),(10136,10750,29,30,'Poison30-Arnaya','You already know much about the art of poison, so I won\'t ask you to research more about it. What I\'d like to know is how we can mix poison with things to make them stronger. What art, item, living thing could grow stronger with a touch of poison added to it? Try your hand at this on a thing or two in the city and see what you can find.','2016-03-23 04:04:02','2016-01-07 04:20:22'),(10125,10888,30,1,'Antidote - Learn','Kaihan, still a Guardian of House Calenture, has been afflicted apparently with a Poison of sorts.  He apparently has sought Tamarisk for help as Tamarisk knows of a Knight Cleansing Ritual.  Discover all you can about this ritual.  What happens during?  Who must be present? What is used in the ritual?  Spare no details.  ~Dakk','2016-03-23 04:11:58','2016-03-18 05:11:34'),(10746,10027,47,40,'Push 40','I want you to Push yourself back into the teaching fray.  Evaluate what is new.  Revisit the Dream University and refine it accordingly.','2016-03-24 00:21:37','2016-03-12 23:54:16'),(10066,10746,105,30,'Poison Cloud 30','Revisit a diplomatic code that you created before, revise it to have it unanimously accepted by all parties, if possible.','2016-03-24 03:04:33','2016-02-15 01:20:35'),(10232,10750,74,20,'Mind Blank 20','Don\'t you worry your pretty little mind, I say! Writer\'s block can strike even the most talented pensman (or penswoman) around. But the City *must* lacking inspiration. Compile a listing of the City\'s best moments from last year! A top 10 should do. Thy can be tragic, triumphant, personal, abroad - anything you think is worthy. After all, good writing is almost always based on the author\'s perspective.\r\n','2016-03-24 07:04:47','2016-02-22 03:49:33'),(10450,10107,88,1,'Quest: Keilara','Art of Train Self mysteriously disappeared. Returning it.','2016-03-25 01:24:56','2016-03-25 01:24:50'),(10746,10916,144,30,'Well to 30','In preparation for our upcoming battles with the Vanguard and the normal battles with mares, I would like you to look at each focus and outline their strengths and weakness in battle and how to enhance and overcome them respectively.  I would like you to share this with the house so we can work on it.','2016-03-25 01:34:22','2016-03-19 22:31:41'),(10450,10232,80,50,'Em\'et Master  Weave','Use new station to weave an appreciation fer yer focus. Plant seeds of lucidity into yer pupils and directly or indirectly thru interaction with others. See if ye can hypnotize the City\'s populace  into seein their fate may one day lay at the mercy of a sender. Yer reward be at the end of yer reported effort. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-03-25 01:41:29','2016-03-09 07:55:33'),(10746,10027,22,10,'Forge 10','I would like you to think of how you would use Forge in your teaching and provide examples.','2016-03-25 02:03:54','2016-03-13 00:21:23'),(10746,10175,16,20,'ID ~ 20','I would like you to explore the City and identify its weaknesses.  With a battle looming from the outside, how can these be eliminated or midigated?  Devise a plan and share it with the house.','2016-03-25 03:24:01','2016-03-20 04:19:02'),(10746,10097,105,1,'Quest: Arlyana Jax','Retraining lost art due to crest lost due to inactivity.','2016-03-25 03:37:05','2016-03-25 03:35:16'),(10107,10937,60,1,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','Enth delivered an awesome interview all based on the implications of being considered a fragment of a whole dreamer.  The questions were very metaphysical in nature with some severe personal implications.  The interview was astoundingly well answered. ((Props to this RP.  )) ','2016-03-25 19:09:39','2016-03-25 19:09:15'),(10746,10108,22,10,'Forge 10','Forge is one of the best arts for the City\'s tricksters.  Using raw elements from 3 separate planes.  Create 3 items that not only channel your personal style but your trickster nature.','2016-03-27 02:39:25','2016-03-24 01:35:30'),(10746,10108,105,1,'Quest: Arlyana Jax','Retraining lost art .','2016-03-27 03:28:39','2016-03-27 03:27:50'),(10232,10935,60,1,'Quest: Em\'et','','2016-03-27 22:40:13','2016-03-27 22:40:09'),(10009,10232,22,60,'Forge-60','Leverage the abilities of several other Forgers, as well as your own, to create the tools necessary for you to continue work on the Power Generator in Albino Caves. Utilize these tools in a grand demonstration to the City that demonstrates the Generator\'s power, usefulness, and capacity for self-extension. Try not to blow yourself up in the process.','2016-03-27 23:08:01','2016-03-11 20:55:25'),(10027,10935,47,1,'Push to Learn','Treasure hunt time. We have spoken of a few items in the dream. Find me the ones we did not takl about and find out what they do from zsa zsa or any one else.','2016-03-28 01:29:54','2016-03-26 20:53:07'),(10232,10761,32,10,'Jorryn - Drain 10','The Union of the Covenant! I\'ve heard so little about it. I\'d like for you to go exploring that oh-so-familiar plane, the Barrows, and find for me places that hold old memories of the house. The basic belief structure of the house would help me, too. Consider also: Even if the house is drained of purpose, what legacy does it carry on in the Dream today? Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-03-28 04:05:53','2016-02-29 00:56:50'),(10746,10937,9,1,'FA ~ Learn','Learn what you can about the dreamer Em\'et.  Are you limited by who he was or can you be your own dreamer?  Be prepared to explain your answer.','2016-03-28 16:43:57','2016-03-25 16:06:17'),(10027,10915,144,1,'Chaos Well to learn','You are the new dreams mixologist. Create at least  8 drinks based on the history of the dream. They can be to honor houses places dreamers or events.','2016-03-29 00:42:58','2016-03-26 02:24:23'),(10108,10935,6,10,'Med - 10 ','Meditation is an art we all obtain upon first entering the city. As a birth art, it\'s one of our most powerful. Why is that? I want you to take a few days to find out what the benifits of plateauing Meditation are, and what ways you can use it other then the standard art usages. Come up with a few fun ways, speak to others about what fun ways they might use it for!','2016-03-29 02:00:17','2016-03-28 01:08:05'),(10027,10937,60,2,'Second Sphere','interview I have spokene with enth and i feel he is ready for second sphere','2016-03-29 21:41:52','2016-03-29 21:40:06'),(10027,10937,7,1,'Resist Fear learn','Create a journal to mark the path of your dreams observations and thoughts. You will not travel this path an\\again nad you may need some of the experience to attain the planned result. Share a few with me as youbegin the journal but the rest is for you.','2016-03-29 21:57:08','2016-03-27 06:14:57'),(10311,10935,48,1,'SoulEvokeToregordLN','You said this art is useful, give me some of your opinions why. It is one of the few arts that endanger your permanent self, are there any other arts that effect you so greatly? If any art can be abused, give me examples of three arts that can be and how. Also, are there any people you have already deemed not soul-evoke worthy? If so, why?','2016-03-30 00:43:33','2016-03-29 01:41:00'),(10018,10935,68,1,'L: FlameShaft','There are different branches in the Nightmare family. Ask around about each you may encounter and how to properly prepare to defend yourself. What abilities does each nightmare form have? Once you\'ve gathered this information, return to me for your report.','2016-03-30 01:14:10','2016-03-26 21:09:21'),(10018,10796,7,1,'L: Resist Fear','Begin a \"story on the run\". Create the first line and give a loose concept involving Fear. Read what you started to someone else and have them add in their own sentence. Then bring those two lines to another, and so on. Do this until you have a short story. You can post the finished story on the public scrolls or simply inscribe them for me to read. Have fun! ','2016-03-30 01:24:55','2016-03-07 06:21:51'),(10108,10916,75,10,'Show - 10','Why in the sam heck would anyone plataeu Show Talisman? It\'s ridiculous. I have zero idea when I did it, or why, myself. But I did. So it\'s a thing. So, for this task, I want you to run around and show, not tell. Come up with some tall tale or incorperate this with another project, but through actions alone, get people to guess what it is you\'re trying to do with out explaining it, at all. Report to me reactions and how hard or easy it was to do. Also have fun, it\'s manditory!\r\n','2016-03-30 04:59:07','2016-03-20 18:15:26'),(10027,10746,139,40,'Sense Datoken mini','Makes the mare stuffies you wanted to share them if that was your place I love Carl!','2016-03-30 17:35:59','2016-03-29 22:46:18'),(10746,10937,6,10,'Med ~ 10','Even within this peaceful City, we all need places where we can relax and hear our own thoughts.  I would like you to find three rooms that allow you to do this and try to explain why that is.  If the rooms do not have a description, create one of your own.  Be prepared to show them to me.','2016-03-30 18:25:27','2016-03-28 16:53:14'),(10136,10009,35,20,'Trap20- Dreiko','Find exact maximums on this art for you. Are you going to have different numbers than others because you are different? Explain.  Also, make up a short tongue twister and trap several dreamers into saying it at least twice, each. They mustn\'t know it\'s for a task.','2016-03-31 00:58:32','2016-03-01 00:27:29'),(10240,10066,11,70,'Quest: Silk Nuvas','Fix Amulet plat - ','2016-03-31 01:16:41','2016-03-31 01:16:26'),(10009,10175,139,1,'L-Sense Datoken','We can sense Datoken, but why not DarkMares? Theorize on the most probable way to transfer this concept into the creation of a sperate art \"Sense DarkMare\". This girl wants to hear how you would do it and why you think this process would work.','2016-03-31 01:17:46','2016-02-28 02:18:03'),(10136,10935,9,1,'FreeAc-Toregord ','Free Action has such a nice ring to it. What does the art actually do, and how does it actually work?? Ask around!!  Do dreamers sometimes use this art for things it wasn\'t meant for? What can they use it for?','2016-03-31 01:47:01','2016-03-27 00:09:19'),(10066,10935,7,1,'Resist Fear Learn','\"What does Resist Fear protect you from? Learn of terrors that haunt the shards of two other dreamers an report if Resist Fear would assist against those terrors.\" - Restel, Apprentice of Thunderman.','2016-03-31 02:11:17','2016-03-29 02:15:14'),(10107,10937,8,1,'Protection - En\'th','There is a likelihood the dream will want to get Em\'et back.  You will need to consider your protection mechanisms, both from a philisophical standpoint and from a very physical one.  How will you defend your existence, when it may be perceived at the expense of another dreamer.  Moreover, a dreamer who is highly sought after as a master teacher.','2016-03-31 03:44:49','2016-03-25 20:34:37'),(10238,10915,44,40,'Quest: WishBringer','This is a place holder for a quest thats was accidently tagged on the wrong target.\r\n','2016-03-31 04:16:29','2016-03-31 03:20:06'),(10027,10937,72,1,'Inscribe to learn','A new hall is open to you find a few scrolls that interest you and let me know which ones and why. Perhaps think of documenting your own story as it stands something to share. Ask two dreamers what is their favorite story or memory.','2016-03-31 05:50:54','2016-03-29 22:05:50'),(10238,10935,9,10,'Quest: WishBringer','Plat for quest he did for Cienn but her train is broken\r\n','2016-03-31 18:07:43','2016-03-31 18:07:12'),(10027,10761,40,10,'Deafen to 10','To hear is a sense. How many other senses can you find examples of either in an item, a room, a name in the Dream. Use your imagination and share what you discover. What is your favorite sense?','2016-03-31 18:39:08','2016-03-20 20:41:59'),(10108,10935,8,1,'Protection - Learn','Time for something a little different. I would like for you to spend some time searching for protection alts. You can get them made, or gen for them, but you should gather at least 4, and they should have a durration of at the very least 1-5 minutes. Have some Id them to confirm. Then give them out to three people (keep one for yourself) and ask them about their day!','2016-04-01 00:14:19','2016-03-29 02:11:47'),(10108,10937,9,10,'FA - 10','You\'re in a unique situation, being a whole person that is just one peice of another whole being. With that, I want you to ponder what it means to be a Gatekeeper, and how that might relate to who you are. Is the roll suited to you? Are there nuances within that roll that you feel more inclined towards then others? Ask some folks their thoughts on a Gatekeepers roll as well, and choose the best of them to add to your own thoughts. Tell me about it, and them?','2016-04-01 01:50:56','2016-03-29 22:09:16'),(10450,10937,65,10,'GSmash10 En\'th','Smash rocks with others. Uncover a mystery.  Imagine what you could find in the ground beneath our feet and then SHOW it to me. This must be done in a group, or it will not count for a thing. ','2016-04-01 02:02:53','2016-03-26 00:52:04'),(10022,10915,39,10,'Magnum: Stagger 10','There have been quite a few events later that encourage drinking heavily. It is up to you to show people the downside of their behavior. Try to attend one such event and inform people why their choices are not wise. Inform them of why drinking in excess is wrong, with examples or anecdotes. Should you be unable to spread your thoughts at one such event, find any gathering and do it there.\r\n','2016-04-01 02:12:00','2016-02-27 03:19:58'),(10022,10175,39,20,'Restel: Stagger 20','Newly returned, eh? Have you had time to steady your feet under you and get your bearings? During your short time back, you seem to have found a house. Have you also found a purpose? Think about where you believe you fit within the scheme of the City. What are your plans?','2016-04-01 02:28:42','2016-02-28 02:24:20'),(10062,10937,1,10,'GK 10 | En\'th','Learn what you can of the GK focus, and determine its strengths and weaknesses. Explain to me how you plan to overcome these weaknesses in the future as you grow within the focus to stand out as a prominent member of what seems to be a scarce collective.','2016-04-01 03:54:57','2016-03-29 06:29:18'),(10067,10027,18,60,'Chamele 60','Chamele has become somewhat less powerful than it used to be. Find out if there are any ways that it can be strengthened and made better for the future Seers. Also, seek out several places or things or people that seem to have vanished from the attention of the City. How can we make these things shine and radiate from their slumber? Do we need to? Would it be wise? Regualr drill for a plat to 60. <T>','2016-04-01 05:25:37','2016-03-14 01:05:20'),(10066,10937,10,1,'Ward/Amulet Learn','\"A lock and a key are by their nature entwined. What advantages and disadvantages does ward provide with and without an amulet? Locate a portal that does not behave as you expect it should. What about the portal is \"wrong\"? Share your theory with another dreamer you respect and refine it with their input.\" Restel, Apprentice of Thunderman. Addendum: Test the theory on the portal.','2016-04-01 05:31:21','2016-03-31 03:57:19'),(10066,10937,11,1,'Quest: Thunderman','Ward/Amulet learn material covered in other quest. This is for Amulet training.','2016-04-01 05:31:29','2016-04-01 05:30:22'),(10746,10937,7,10,'RF ~ 10','Here within the City, we are free from many of the rules that govern our shards.  I would like you to find: a room with floating rocks, a room with no visible portal and other rooms of oddity.  Form a theory as to why we have nothing to fear from such rules. ','2016-04-01 17:34:10','2016-03-30 19:02:30'),(10027,10937,6,20,'Meditation to 20','Look to the dreamers around you and mediate on what you see. Each one is different and has a gift. Something that makes them unique. Maybe they don\'t even see it. Bring me the list of gifts and how they might help the dream.','2016-04-01 21:29:08','2016-03-31 17:35:34'),(10009,10941,60,1,'First Sphere','What are the 5 primary types of items within the dream. What do the different colors mean for each of these types? What are the five types of Nightmares within the City and what are their primary capabilities? Learn the names of the four open Houses within the City and get a very basic understanding of their beliefs.','2016-04-01 22:48:03','2016-04-01 22:24:31'),(10746,10175,105,10,'PC to 10','Donate 100 to the Orb as well as gen and sit facade/thresh duty.  I would also like you to look at the major limitations of this art in battle and how we can overcome them.','2016-04-02 04:16:36','2016-03-29 02:22:26'),(10027,10935,60,2,'Second Sphere','You have shown me a great many things since your first dream. Create a game of skill to be played with your friends. Include six friends not neccessarily all at once. To play the winners getting bragging rights. Have fun!','2016-04-02 21:45:27','2016-03-29 01:32:34'),(10027,10916,139,10,'Sense Datoken 10','Find a few dreamers that can use a hand in hunting better. Use your expertise to make their dreams easier. They could be new or they could be old. Everyone needs a hand or suggestion now and again.','2016-04-02 23:50:53','2016-03-14 22:52:17'),(10027,10104,89,10,'Soul Shield 10','There is talk of a sheld over the dream see what you can find out about it. You have great ability to sort through things come back to me with what you find.','2016-04-03 04:27:32','2016-03-18 05:58:28'),(10027,10905,60,2,'Second Sphere','Time traveling is fun learning what the City is offering essential. Learn the beleifs of the houses that are open adn see if you can find one other set of beleifs in the dream . Do any maych your own? What do the ranks in a house mean? Find me the names of five other houses in this dream lyrans dreams or Ideoclesians Dream. What does it mean to be a Freespirit.','2016-04-03 16:56:47','2016-03-28 08:29:29'),(10009,10018,144,10,'CW-10','Chaos Wells brought a lot of relief to backpacks everywhere. Come up with a project idea for the Order that will provide a relief of some sort to the House, the City, or just yourself. Bring details to me when ready.','2016-04-04 00:57:03','2016-03-03 01:18:56'),(10027,10108,103,1,'Bequeath learn','Time to be the bearer of gifts. Genned or created by your whims and wishes. Bring a smile to those around you. As you o this I want you to think of what things you wish for in the dream. Share with me the gifts and the dreamers.','2016-04-04 13:33:05','2016-03-19 02:36:58'),(10027,10937,60,3,'Third Sphere','Houses have so many interlocking parts. Create one unknown to the dream of yorur own beliefs and tennets. What woud the ranks be? What type of dreamer would you have in your hosue any that dream now?','2016-04-04 18:32:38','2016-04-01 06:40:54'),(10027,10937,9,20,'Free action to 20','I know you cannot attend the meeting tonight but you have a connection it the promised speaker. Let me know what the outcome is as it is in the FreeSpirit forum. Thanks for you helped','2016-04-04 20:10:14','2016-04-01 21:32:51'),(10746,10937,8,10,'Protection ~ 10','When the City was just beginning, there was no Threshold for new dreamers to enter.  Imagine this to be true once again and take it even farther, no sanctuaries at all.  How would we be able to protect ourselves?  Devise a plan and share it upon the Archives.','2016-04-04 22:57:40','2016-04-01 17:43:50'),(10027,10915,6,10,'Medittion 10','I heard there are some missing historys in the first sphere hall. Care to take a look for me. get me a list of whats there and the second sphere hall perhaps find one from out time and add it. :ets keep teh history alive','2016-04-05 01:56:08','2016-04-03 01:35:55'),(10108,10915,43,20,'Para - 20 ','Paralyze is a Fatesender staple that should be our most powerful art, yet even with it\'s current ability to reduce protection arts, it still falls short. Why? Can we fix that? I want you to take up the cause for para and see what ideas you can come up with to strengthen or improve upon the art itself. Bounce some ideas off some folks, then come to the first guild meeting (friday at 6) and propose your most grandiouso idea. It should be something we might be able to tackle! Can you get us to tinker? ','2016-04-05 03:09:28','2016-03-29 01:48:24'),(10874,10066,52,60,'Train60-ThunderMan','You spoke to me about Poison Cloud, and the desire to have this art much higher in levels for both yourself and for Calenture. Accomplish this mission as part of your quest. The next portion is to have the house give you ideas on how to combine different energy to the art to raise it to a higher, more advanced level. Train them in theory, so to speak. No work needs to be done. Just solid theories and arguments given by all members at the time of your report.','2016-04-05 03:17:01','2016-01-26 05:44:41'),(10062,10934,139,1,'Quest: Krodoc','Speak with some dreamers of your city and track down the name of the creator of Sense Datoken from the Lyran city. Get as much information as you can about its creation and put this to codex for the Library. Bring the codex as your report before placement in the Library.\r\n','2016-04-05 05:47:30','2016-03-29 16:27:51'),(10311,10934,108,1,'Sable-NS','Gather 100 strength of essences.\r\n','2016-04-05 19:02:22','2016-04-01 18:16:48'),(10311,10937,139,1,'SenseD-Enth','Do some research and try to find what exactly sets a datoken apart from a dark mare. Why datoke can only be sensed with the art. Whether you find the reason why or just come up with a solid theory, come report to me your results.\r\n','2016-04-05 19:17:02','2016-04-01 18:32:28'),(10066,10937,10,10,'Ward/Amulet 10','Regarding Ward/Amulet, identify other barriers in the city that seem to function as lock and key. Do all locks have keys? Do all keys belong to a lock? Why or why not. Record several instances of barriers and relationships you find and keep detail as to where and what they are for our discussion. Identify one barrier that could possily lead to an improvement with Ward/Amulet.','2016-04-06 01:20:34','2016-04-02 20:27:58'),(10066,10937,11,10,'Ward/Amulet 10','to honor amulet 10 from report moments ago.','2016-04-06 01:21:33','2016-04-06 01:21:19'),(10480,10027,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Reinstating MT status after reviewing her tasking.\r\n','2016-04-06 20:31:44','2016-04-06 20:31:38'),(10480,10937,65,20,'Smasher20Enth','Continue on your investigation into the coin you have found. See if you can find any other items, trinkets or clues that will lead you to more information.','2016-04-06 21:01:04','2016-04-01 02:12:41'),(10108,10934,98,1,'NA - Learn','As an older dreamer, do you remember how the Newly Awakened art came to be? Find at least one old Lyran dreamer (Silver\'s a good start, or Offy) if you cannot, and find out more. As well, if you can, assist one new dreamer in something, be it hunting or finding a teacher. Something small.\r\n','2016-04-06 22:37:49','2016-04-05 18:43:06'),(10746,10027,22,20,'Forge 20 Part 2','I would like you to use those closest to you for inspiration and create a unique item for each of them that is easily seen to be theirs (without putting their name on it).  ','2016-04-07 00:47:05','2016-04-02 16:09:37'),(10311,10934,103,1,'Bequeath-NS','Be greedy! You will probably use this art, at a cost to yourself, at least once. So choose a \'victim\' and \'hustle\' them out of something. Anything. But dont just ask people for stuff, get something someone really doesnt wanna let go of. We will chalk this act of greed up as payment for your future generosity. After you report the task you can give the person back their prized item or whatever you gain from them if you choose to do so. \r\n','2016-04-07 01:54:35','2016-04-06 00:56:51'),(10067,10934,60,3,'3rd Sphere','Welcome back to the City. I know that it has been awhile since you were away, so for your return to 3rd sphere, I would love to see you host a party at the Chak and Flask. Invite as many people as you can and get them to play games and have fun and tell stories. Make it a fun and relaxing time for everyone. In addition to hosting this event, I would like for you to attend Bardic Circle one evening and tell those in attendance a little bit about yourself so that everyone can get to know you. <T>','2016-04-07 02:25:43','2016-03-23 09:56:57'),(10027,10915,9,20,'Free Action 20','Time to bring smiles to others. Take you time and create or find flowers to share. I bet you will get free smiles everywhere. You can use inscribe or have them forged your choice. The reason you give can be as simple as you thought of them today. Who did you give a flower to and what was there response. Hugs would be a bonus!','2016-04-07 03:20:13','2016-04-05 02:02:16'),(10062,10937,68,1,'Flame | Learn','So it looks like you\'ve figured out where you\'d like to place your efforts as a GK. Now, I\'d like to see where you\'d place your efforts as a dreamer. Many dreamers in this city have different interests and do different things with their dreams. Survey the citizens and find out what\'s lacking, and see where you might fill the void. Report back with the possibilities.\r\n','2016-04-07 18:11:27','2016-04-01 03:58:31'),(10027,10942,60,1,'first sphere','interview iyems and hunting and houses were covers breifly student maxxed and in receipt of a quest as well','2016-04-07 18:36:02','2016-04-07 18:35:47'),(10232,10108,41,20,'Clarity - Blind 20','Search the Dream for the DARKEST places you can find! Invite a dreamer there, and have them stare into the depths. Ask them to see what they can, learn what they can. Encourage them to philosophize. Then ask them to face you, and.... PUSH THEM INTO THE DARKNESS! (The chasm before the portal to the Unkonwn would be an excellent place for this). Do this with a few dreamers, report their responses before and after the push. Have fun with this, and ensure a thorough report. ','2016-04-07 22:41:24','2016-03-17 18:46:18'),(10108,10935,7,10,'RF - 10','Building on your Protection task, I\'d like you to focus on shield colors. One is for durration, and the other is for absorption. Collect a few and have someone ID them. As well, ask around for what color combinations should you be keeping an eye out for? Which combination of durration and absorption colors is typically thought to be best for protecting yourself? Why does each person believe this? Does it differe from person to person?','2016-04-07 23:36:44','2016-04-01 00:26:17'),(10027,10050,18,50,'Chamele 50','Seek out the pattern of the new events in the dream. Who are the enemies of the dream and how have the attained that title. There is a shield protecting us and those coming to aid us. Any news on teh details. New mares as well having those is always handy. Five different examples of what we should be watching for is required. What can we do as dreamers to prepare?','2016-04-07 23:50:52','2016-04-06 19:23:55'),(10746,10935,8,10,'Protection ~ 10','Protection is the only art to guard against the new Bleed effect but not Poison.  Devise a theory as to why this is when the art only used to guard against Curse.','2016-04-07 23:51:46','2016-04-04 23:15:21'),(10009,10935,108,1,'Sable - Learn','Bring in 100 essences. The count starts now.','2016-04-07 23:52:55','2016-04-03 00:19:12'),(10009,10935,47,10,'Push-10','Push your abilities to a new level. Challenge someone to a blade duel and try to push them whenever they come in for a strike. Continue dueling dreamers until you\'re able to successfully land at least one Push in the duel. Do not reveal it\'s a task. Your opponents are not allowed to let you Push them. Try it at least 3 times and we can discuss your progress if you were unable to succeed.','2016-04-08 00:10:43','2016-04-01 00:25:33'),(10027,10915,8,10,'Protection to 10','Whats the best things dreamers can do to protect themsleves? Can you offer some advice? What do you do to protect yourself and what do you protect yourself from. The dream is a magical place but can be dangerous. What are the dangers?','2016-04-08 01:45:34','2016-04-07 03:24:31'),(10062,10935,68,10,'Flame | 10','Flames are important. Not just the art, but to have a drive for something more. Make a list of short term goals and achieve one of them. Report back with your list and how you succeeded.','2016-04-08 03:52:43','2016-04-07 08:34:24'),(10062,10905,26,1,'Purify | Learn','Look inward towards yourself and find an impurity that you wish to be rid of. Find me another dreamer within the city that once had this same impurity and find out how they purified it. Report back to me once you\'ve put a plan into action to purify yourself.','2016-04-08 04:24:07','2016-03-29 16:08:46'),(10311,10050,108,1,'Cuero-SableL','Bring 100 strength of essences to the Order.\r\n','2016-04-08 16:29:42','2016-04-07 23:55:13'),(10232,10943,60,1,'Galeli Interview1st','Discussed where he is, where he is going in his dreams. Made him think about the consequences of simple guesswork, but also the benefits thereof. Determined his belief in the nature of his own focus, and where he might rest his head in houses someday. ','2016-04-08 17:05:57','2016-04-08 16:54:19'),(10232,10750,7,10,'Arnaya - RF 10','Find the scariest colors in the City of Dreams. Which combinations, in which lighting, etc, etc. Design a method of resisting these colors for your report. ','2016-04-08 20:42:09','2016-03-24 07:14:48'),(10009,10360,24,20,'Restore20','Honoring Blue\'s bundle to 20 plateau completion from Amante.','2016-04-08 21:15:08','2016-04-08 21:15:03'),(10027,10050,63,50,'Invi to 50','Make it known about the items from your time the staff and the mace tell your house and share the codex I will pass it on whereever i can too Make the items visible.','2016-04-08 21:46:41','2016-04-08 04:50:22'),(10018,10935,10,1,'L: Ward/Amulet','Ward can be an extremely useful art when used correctly. Speak to at least one other Gatekeeper on their defense and offense tactics when dealing with enemies. Secondly, amulet can come in handy with making quick escapes for yourself and allies, but what are the risks with it? Lastly, there is a way to strengthen a ward with another Keeper. How is this done?','2016-04-09 01:04:23','2016-04-03 22:30:35'),(10018,10935,11,1,'Ward/Amulet','Amulet was bundled with Toregord\'s Ward task that was completed.','2016-04-09 01:05:25','2016-04-09 01:05:13'),(10311,10935,72,1,'Inscribe-Toregord','Ask around about some interesting dreamers that either are from either citys past or present. When you find one that interests you, prepare a short history about this dreamer. Report to me the history then when you get inscribe we\'re gonna have you write it up and place it in the library.\r\n','2016-04-09 01:26:27','2016-04-02 22:15:31'),(10107,10750,16,10,'Identify 10-Arnaya','Persuant to our conversation, do you think there will be students that you have blind spots for?  In my case I would unintentionally favour some students because they were also friends.  Being a teacher can sometimes complicate your relationships with dreamers. Identify how you will assert yourself, should you find your loyalties in conflict. ','2016-04-09 04:36:09','2016-03-27 06:03:35'),(10593,10915,25,20,'Quest: Cianne','Please weave me a new outfit, you alone are responsible for it. Feel free to ask me questions about likes, dislikes etc.. and feel free to try more than one. I look forward to seeing what you come up with!  ~C','2016-04-09 04:50:03','2016-04-09 00:03:46'),(10311,10935,26,1,'Purify-Toregord','Find a place in the city that you think needs purifying. Then come up with some sort of blueprint or prototype of something you would then use to purify it. Do you think your inventions method is simular to how the arts works or no? And of course, find out what it does and is used for.\r\n','2016-04-09 22:28:20','2016-04-09 01:28:48'),(10746,10934,17,1,'ID Curse ~ learn','Believe it or not, this used to be the DreamSeer Guild art meaning it was only learnable by high sphered DreamSeers.  Theorize why this was and why it was eventually changed into a minor art.','2016-04-09 22:58:04','2016-04-06 23:01:11'),(10232,10175,42,30,'Restel - Darkness30','I would like for you to push people into darkness. Lure folks into the darker areas of the Dream, and push them into that darkness. Find at least 3 of these suckers, and record their reactions. Did they trust your luring? Were they suspcious? Are Dreamers naturally trusting, or suspcious, in the main? Which do you think, and why? Be prepared to discuss some. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-04-10 00:21:54','2016-03-20 05:29:24'),(10027,10935,9,20,'Free Action to 20','Travel the dream with your minds eye. You are free to see every plane and room. What rooms do you see the will of a gatekeeper? What images show you the heart of a protector? The dream shows us so many thing share with me what you see.','2016-04-10 21:12:37','2016-04-04 19:01:16'),(10311,10750,89,1,'SoulShield-Arnaya','Try to dig up a little bit of info on this arts history, either in Idoaclesia, Lyra, or both cities then write a story loosely based on the creation of the art where soul shield is the saviour of protagonist. Share the story with the Lyceum and then tell me if I dont happen to be there.','2016-04-10 21:37:49','2016-02-02 03:21:45'),(10654,10062,15,20,'Krodoc Judgement 20','We all make judgements about those we meet. Get to know five of your fellow dreamers better, ideally dreamers you don\'t already know well. What judgements do you find yourself making about them. How are these judgements significantly different from the information you gain from the art?','2016-04-11 02:44:06','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10136,10050,89,10,'SoulShield10-Cuero','Run a few experiments and ask others for their input. This art protects my avatar from the swirling chaos in the city. How does this affect beasts of all sizes? Does it harm them? Does it heal them? Does it do absolutely nothing? How can you tell?','2016-04-11 02:51:31','2015-11-04 03:55:41'),(10232,10915,42,1,'Magnum - Darkness','I\'d like for you to explore the City, and find for me the darkest places, and the brightest places (at least a pair of each): What do these share in common, and how might each place have played a factor in the creation of the art Darkness? Does the location in which Darkness is evoked matter at all? Why, or why not? And as a followup for discussion, how do environmental factors alter our FateSenderish arts? Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-04-11 04:35:15','2016-02-28 22:42:38'),(10311,10941,47,1,'Push-Yae','Push your way into some personal sounding conversations, try to fit in and know what you are talking about. Did your joining stop the convo much like push stops an evoker? Come report to me what the conversations were about and how folks reacted.\r\n','2016-04-11 17:44:33','2016-04-01 22:20:05'),(10027,10941,24,1,'Restore to learn','There are many things in the dream that depletes our energies and ways to restores them as well. Search the dream and find me examples of both. Maybe its an item, a place, an action or a dreamer. Any examples witl do. ','2016-04-11 18:24:47','2016-04-07 22:54:37'),(10027,10937,98,1,'Newly Awakened L','A seers dream to be able to see those that might need our help. You are newer to the dream than most think of what you learn and who assisted you. What would be ten things every new dreamer should know? You can ask for ideas if you like.','2016-04-11 18:34:01','2016-04-04 20:28:48'),(10062,10934,144,1,'Chaos Well | Learn','A handy little contraption for when you\'re hunting to gather energy more efficiently. However, the overall art itself is lacking. What\'s its greatest weakness, and how can we fix it?','2016-04-11 19:48:31','2016-04-08 03:31:25'),(10062,10935,46,1,'Recall | Learn','Recall, among other peaceful arts, has a very good strategic use of it. Create for me a list of these more peaceful arts that so handy in battle. Give a reason for each, and also construct what you feel to be a perfect defense scenario.','2016-04-11 20:09:17','2016-04-08 04:01:25'),(10311,10915,41,10,'MagnumBlind-10','Now that you have Blind lets have some fun with it. Hold a few duels where you randomly blind the opponents. Make sure you have a ele on ya we wanna blind em good. How did it effect those fighting? How long did it last per evoke? How long will it last after its platted?\r\n','2016-04-11 23:49:22','2016-04-09 01:14:44'),(10066,10937,141,1,'Kinesis Learn','Compare and contrast Tempest and Kinesis. Regarding one difference, theorize why Tempest extends the distance a dreaer is pushed while Kinesis does not. In identifying this difference, how do you propose Kinesis could be improved to increae the distance pushed per plateau?','2016-04-12 03:49:17','2016-04-06 02:56:42'),(10018,10937,1,20,'GateKeeper 20','Em\'et seeks to absorb you, which would be killing you in your eyes. I want you to consider at least one possible solution to protect your avatar and keep it separated from Em\'et\'s. Do others agree with your stance? Would they help you, if you wished to carry this out?','2016-04-12 06:10:35','2016-04-01 05:46:33'),(10745,10750,31,1,'Arnaya: Curse Learn','Many dreamers are cursed with qualities we dislike and find appaling. Choose one dreamer and turn their cursed quality into a positive attribute and give it charm. Write about this change and present it to me in privately or make a public post. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-04-12 07:39:50','2016-02-10 06:14:58'),(10027,10942,69,1,'TranceFlame learn','So you are a new explorer I want you to explore the dream and find me somethings that impress or inspire you. As a seer we have more insight than most. Bring me back 5 examples of places. Also five names fo dreamers that have helped you along your way. When you return we will go on a field trip I have some things to share with you.','2016-04-12 07:48:46','2016-04-07 18:42:53'),(10880,10905,70,1,'FlameSear - Learn','Did you know that flames have different colors for different focuses and plateaus?  Discern which color belongs to which focus and if you can, also how they change with each plateau.  ~Dakk','2016-04-12 08:41:20','2016-03-19 04:27:38'),(10880,10750,102,1,'Quest - Arnaya','Report of a train codex by OfF KiLTeR in good standing as Master Tacher. Intial interview with Arnaya. I hereby grant Arnaya, Quest. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-12 09:37:19','2016-04-12 09:21:03'),(10880,10745,94,1,'CleanseKaihan','Find the specifics of this art. Have a fellow Soulmaster show you what the art does, and what it entails.','2016-04-12 09:41:19','2015-12-29 05:18:05'),(10746,10935,8,20,'Protection ~ 20','I would like you to evaulate your houses readiness for the impending invasion from the outside.  What is the house already doing right?  What do they need to begin doing?  Formulate a plan and share it with at least one house member','2016-04-12 17:51:43','2016-04-09 23:06:44'),(10027,10937,8,20,'Protection to 20','Shields and sanctuarys is there a connection. Each seems to cover us. Devise a theory to make the connection or show its is not so. Do you think perhaps arts were made of the parts of these items or not If so what arts. Thrill me with you accumen.','2016-04-12 19:35:44','2016-04-11 19:10:25'),(10009,10941,26,1,'L|Purify','This girl asks you to explore the dream until you find two things: one that is absolutely pure in your eyes, and another that needs purification. Take this girl to each location and explain your reason for them. Do you think it is up to us to provide a little purity touch-up, or is it best to leave certain things in their natural state?','2016-04-13 01:00:54','2016-04-01 22:36:15'),(10027,10108,144,10,'Chaos Well to 10','Calenture needs a party a dance a picnic something fun. You decide what and if you want to invite more. Let me know if i can come and what i need to wear. ','2016-04-13 01:31:47','2016-04-04 13:45:01'),(10027,10796,139,1,'SenseDatoken Learn','There\'s Dark Mares, Kadatorii, Hota, Daymares, nightmare spawns.  I need your help making sense of this all.  If nightmare spawns aren\'t sentient and Dark Mares are sentient, then why are Daymares so much different?  Come up with a theory as to why each nightmare is what it is upon it\'s awakening.  ~Dakk','2016-04-13 02:30:37','2016-03-16 03:37:43'),(10027,10796,139,1,'Sense Datoken  lear','This was a quest given by dakkoth i have heard the report and believe it has been completed~Master Teacher Silver','2016-04-13 02:30:37','2016-04-13 02:29:55'),(10088,10545,30,40,'Antidote 40','TavernMaster meets Medicine Woman. I want you to explore the outer plans and find 6 ingredients that offer some type of soothing, or healing property that I can ADD to my mixtures in my bar. Moreover, I need samples for 5 and I need you to physically take and show me the location for the 6th and explain how each can be used in my trade.','2016-04-13 02:37:11','2015-10-15 02:46:16'),(10480,10175,102,1,'Quest','After speaking with Restel and Thunderman, I have granted Quest to Restel as the next step in his apprenticeship. **A**','2016-04-13 03:18:50','2016-04-13 03:17:38'),(10450,10018,92,30,'Reflect30Jade','Spend some time reflecting upon the job you have done to remove the city of the wretchedness that is the Consortium. If you had to start over from scratch to remove them, what would you do differently than you have already done? Would you approach them differently? Think of some other ways to expel them from the City, or if there would have been a way to befriend them.','2016-04-13 04:02:33','2016-02-05 02:28:49'),(10480,10232,71,60,'Em\'et FlamRuin60','At this point in your career, what good is Flame Ruin? Do you even use this at all? Experiment and find out which arts destroy your enemies the quickest. Blade, fire, arts. Take surveys on which arts dreamers other than Fate Senders find should be the most severe and test out their answers on them. Be sure to keep them safe. Which of their arts at similar levels are stronger than your own?','2016-04-13 04:56:16','2016-03-12 21:30:40'),(10480,10066,60,1,'TMan 1st','Granting Thunderman his first sphere on his secondary focus. **A**\r\n','2016-04-13 05:08:29','2016-04-13 05:08:21'),(10480,10066,69,1,'Quest: Akkadian','This is a test to see if the new flame art will be trainable. **A**\r\n','2016-04-13 05:14:11','2016-04-13 05:14:03'),(10232,10943,4,10,'Galeli - FateSend10','Search throughout the City of Dreams for rooms that Send your own Fate. How do they affect your fate? How do you affect theirs? Find at least two such rooms (though more wouldn\'t hurt!). Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-04-13 19:04:05','2016-04-08 17:17:58'),(10311,10915,17,1,'IDCurseL-Magnum','ID curses uses are very limited. Think of some ways you would manipulate the art to make it at least a bit more useful. I personally am not for changing arts up too much but this is one that needs a makeover. Come report to me a well thought out idea about how to do this.','2016-04-13 23:46:45','2016-04-11 23:58:08'),(10311,10943,38,1,'Scare-LearnGal','Scare is something very exciting for a fatesender. The first one you gain on a path to some very nice arts. Tell me all of the fatesender minors and majors that you will get and what they will do up to sphere 9.\r\n','2016-04-14 00:35:35','2016-04-08 17:12:40'),(10238,10066,60,2,'Quest: WishBringer','Sphere!\r\n','2016-04-14 01:04:17','2016-04-14 01:04:05'),(10027,10066,60,3,'thunder third spher','as per codex recied signed by akkadain','2016-04-14 01:51:27','2016-04-14 01:51:11'),(10018,10935,1,10,'GateKeeper 10','Just how many Gatekeepers roam the city halls (teachers and non included)? It seems just about every focus has had some success with guild meetings, except for ours. Why do you think that is? Is it in our GK nature or something else?','2016-04-14 02:41:09','2016-04-09 01:16:40'),(10136,10935,139,1,'SenseDat-Toregord','This art picks up on large amounts of chaos and allows us to sense the mares.  Tell me the names of as many beasts that you know. Are there some that are stronger than others? What are their names?  Why do you think this art cannot find ALL the mares of the city? What is the difference?','2016-04-14 03:05:21','2016-04-03 22:48:58'),(10027,10796,16,1,'Identify to learn','Time to give dreamers pets. Either really hand them one or think of what pet would suit them. Identify the perfect matches and tell me why. Have fun with this.','2016-04-14 04:35:26','2016-04-13 02:34:27'),(10027,10941,24,10,'Restore to 10','A trip to Citadel and the elemenal pads five. I need there names and what the replenish. Note how fast you regain and what happens when you use meditate.  Take a freind or two to show off the new place you found and how special it is. Spend some time to look around and which one do you like best.','2016-04-14 17:52:28','2016-04-11 18:46:23'),(10027,10066,19,1,'Vison learn','Explain to me the metamorphis of being a seer What is you vision? I know very little bout the dual focus process as Akkadian calls it. Thanks for letting me assist you on your journey.','2016-04-15 03:42:38','2016-04-14 01:57:48'),(10746,10066,18,1,'Chamele ~ learn','Why do you think we have this art when we get Invisibility later in our dreams? Would it not be better to just wait?  Come up with a theory as to why and use your new found knowledge of Insight to blend in with your fellow dreamers. ','2016-04-15 03:52:42','2016-04-14 02:35:02'),(10746,10175,105,20,'PC ~ 20','Now that we have covered how to defend the house against Warders and Blasters, I would like you to educate us on how to defend against FateSenders and their arts. Do not just default to the protective arts.','2016-04-15 04:23:41','2016-04-11 00:33:17'),(10066,10916,105,30,'Poison Cloud 30','\"Assess your house-mates opinions of Poison cloud. Have any actually used it in battle and if so was it effective? Develop a plan of action to improve the art based on this feedback and present it to the house.\" - Restel, apprentice of Thunderman. ; Addendum: Use Poison Cloud in battle and weigh in your own experience.','2016-04-15 04:53:59','2016-03-21 04:28:47'),(10027,10934,2,30,'Dreamseer 30','Help me get the guild up and running. First a date then tell every one. Lets get the insight flowing again. It is good to be a seer.','2016-04-15 05:00:29','2016-04-08 23:09:18'),(10066,10108,8,20,'Protection 20','\"Protect that which is broken and seek to make it whole. Enlist the help of at least two dreamer to mend this orb and protect it from damage. Explain what you did, how you did it, and why you think it will work.\" Restel, Apprentice of Thunderman.','2016-04-15 05:10:12','2016-03-29 02:34:47'),(10009,10941,60,2,'Second Sphere','What are your beliefs? Are you an Illuminate or a Freesoul? Do you believe in a particular essence manipulation? Do you lean toward one house or none? Be ready to explain your answer to this. Second Sphere is generally the defining Sphere for each focus. What will you be able to learn related to your focus during this Sphere? How will it help you grow through the City?','2016-04-16 01:05:42','2016-04-15 23:19:32'),(10022,10077,22,10,'Tember: Forge 10','I am curious as to your ability. Forging is more than just condensing DreamSoul and making a lump of material. Demonstrate your uniqueness and style in three creations. Take these creations to three DreamSmiths (Elders count if you cannot locate three) and get their opinions on the items. Ask for constructive critism. Bring me the three items and the opinions so that we may discuss them.','2016-04-16 01:55:22','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10009,10034,108,1,'Sable-Learn','Bring in 100 essences to the Order.','2016-04-16 02:28:49','2016-04-16 01:14:40'),(10480,10034,52,50,'Train 50','Compile a true list of all the teachers and their focus along with their train levels. Place them on codex so that they may be placed int he Library for young dreamers. **A**\r\n','2016-04-16 02:35:59','2016-04-16 02:35:33'),(10480,10034,60,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After looking at her examples, I have granted Ashton the ability to Sphere. **A**\r\n','2016-04-16 02:37:26','2016-04-16 02:37:21'),(10027,10066,19,10,'Vision to 10','A  Vision quest i have for you. You have an ever increasing amount of insight all puns and prejudices aside what will you do with it? Insight can be a key to many things and the promise of seeing the unseen,','2016-04-16 02:56:22','2016-04-15 04:26:08'),(10480,10009,81,1,'Vampiric Draw ','This is a unique and powerful SoulMaster art. It is also one of my favorites. Find for me all the pertinant information about the art and then create for me a scenario where it would come in most handy. I would also like to hear your thoughts on the art. Any insights that you find worthy of sharing. **A**','2016-04-16 02:56:46','2016-04-06 20:22:15'),(10480,10009,31,1,'Dreiko: Curse Learn','Being of two focuses is a double edged sword, a blessing and a curse. Find a way to merge your understanding of your new focus with your old to lessen the burden. When you have uncovered a way, report it to me. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-04-16 03:09:48','2016-02-12 02:51:09'),(10027,10067,89,40,'Soul shield 40','Shields arew symbols fo protection. There has been alot of talk about the one teh Consortium set.  And the houses crests bear shields. Seek out some of the older storys fof the hsoue meanings of their crests are the the same now. Share this information where it isnt available.\r\n','2016-04-16 04:20:20','2016-03-19 08:35:54'),(10062,10066,60,4,'Quest: Krodoc','Granted under the secondary focus guidelines.\r\n','2016-04-16 04:38:00','2016-04-16 04:37:55'),(10136,10062,51,40,'LocteDream40-Krodoc','Take a poll and see which dreamers are the ones most located in the city.  Why is this?  If we could improve this art, how would you go about doing so? Gather information, as if you were going to do this.  Report to me in full detail, so that maybe we could try accomplishing this as a project in the house. If you put on a semi-experiment, that will do worlds of good.','2016-04-16 04:50:22','2016-04-11 03:12:16'),(10136,10950,70,1,'Flame Tauriel','You are new to the city, but I can already tell you are a stong willed woman!  I wish for you to learn about your flame and explain to me why SoulMasters need weapons, since we generally heal others. Can you find any other useful ways to use your flame? Explain.  Speak to others if you wish! The more, the merrier. ','2016-04-16 04:56:46','2016-04-14 02:54:48'),(10746,10027,22,30,'Forge ~ 30','Your identity has continually changed within the City.  As a first step, I would like you to Forge your current identity within the City and think about what items have influenced it.  Step two, journey to the Forge in the Pits and show me how you see it.','2016-04-16 17:29:48','2016-04-09 22:31:09'),(10311,10062,108,10,'SableShield-10Krodo','Help a housemate with some hunting, or a task or something. Make it worth the plat. Put at least an hour or two into this.','2016-04-16 21:34:29','2016-03-12 22:42:41'),(10311,10941,25,1,'ReweaveL-Yae','Find various materials from around the city and harvest them to weave together to make something new. Could be a new outfit, or a blanket.. If you can, have a few others help you then return to me with your final product. Also find out the basics of the art, what its used for and its cost.\r\n','2016-04-16 22:38:14','2016-04-13 01:04:38'),(10022,10311,140,1,'Flower: Tempest','Lets get you into some trouble, shall we?! Interrupt a couple people while they are evoking something, be as obvious and loud and flamboyant as you possibly can. Once you have done it, be a prat, giggle, point, laugh, do cartwheels... I do not really care. Document their reaction. Do not try this on Elders... they get super cranky, I know from experience.','2016-04-16 22:59:07','2016-02-28 02:58:52'),(10009,10943,40,1,'Deafen-Learn','Deafen is the introduction to the Fatesender arts, much like Bogroms are the introduction to the strength of the Nightmares. Take this blade and attempt to collapse a Bogrom. Were you successful? If not, were you hindered by strength, dreamsoul, or merely ill-prepared skilled-wise?','2016-04-16 23:06:06','2016-04-08 17:16:08'),(10311,10077,142,1,'Misdirection-Tember','Trophy chase, collect some trophies..at least 8 or so..from people. Get them for actions you have achieved in the past for accomplishments in our city or things you have recently achieved. They can be forged items, notes/plaques, or whatever the situation calls for. But they may each come from a different source for different reasons and must all be unique. Maybe in collecting these trophies you will remember a time when you werent so dang lazy! :P','2016-04-16 23:39:29','2015-11-22 02:32:18'),(10062,10411,10,40,'Ward 40','Compare the differences between the Datoke and the Katoke. Ward trap a handful of Datoke and see if you can get one to try and Shatter a ward. Compare the art levels between the two types of nightmares. Lastly, do you think it wise Agonarius chose to use the Datoke rather than align himself with the Katoke? Organize your thoughts and let\'s see if we can come up with a solid solution together during your report.\r\n','2016-04-17 00:32:18','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10874,10935,65,10,'GateSmasher 10','Experiment with your GateSmasher in creative ways with other objects and places in the dream. Keep track of what you do and the interactions or lack of that happen. Share something interest you discovered with someone else. Record their reaction.','2016-04-17 01:38:21','2016-04-02 20:20:46'),(10108,10915,39,20,'Stagger 20','I want you to come up with a game based around flame that includes Stagger. It can be anything you\'d like, but it should have a clear winner. Come to the second day of the Festival of Fire (Saturday the 16th at 6:30) at the Alter room in Threshold Caves and be our Honorary Flamemaster for the evening and play the game with the crowd!','2016-04-17 02:31:17','2016-04-09 00:18:54'),(10027,10066,19,20,'Vision to 20','Calenture grows and gets stronger every dream. What is your vision for her in a month? In three months? How might her place int he dream change?','2016-04-17 04:20:24','2016-04-16 03:07:09'),(10232,10022,41,40,'BladeSlayer-Blind40','As one joining the correct focus late, you may be blind to some of our awesomeness. I\'d like for you to consider what tactics a FateSender must employ to be most effective in combat (ignore your Soulmaster side for the purpose of this task). Test a few of these out (either against real enemies, or in mock combat with friends) and let me know what works, and what doesn\'t. And speak with your fellow Lucid-aligned individuals; What is Lucidity? How is it perceived by most Non-Senders? Be prepared to discuss.','2016-04-17 23:01:56','2016-02-24 05:22:36'),(10027,10066,23,1,'Recharge learn','Have you shared what you have figured out with other seers than me ? If not please do as it holds very true. Seek out the stats if they are unknown for yoru own referance. How about taking a day to relax with yoru houseand recharge yourself.','2016-04-18 03:51:55','2016-04-17 04:27:22'),(10480,10916,102,1,'Quest','After speaking with LadySilver and Aileron and seeing examples of his tasking, I have granted Quest. **A**\r\n','2016-04-18 21:02:06','2016-04-18 21:02:01'),(10311,10360,46,1,'Recall-Blue','Find out all the houses beliefs, familiarize yourself with the leadership and members as much as possible. Speak with some of the house leaders to find out what kind of a relationship they have with the other houses. Some say we should shut down a house or two, while others (Lu) think we should do away with the house system all together. After doing your research tell me what you opinion is on this matter. ','2016-04-18 21:12:04','2016-03-31 20:43:45'),(10480,10951,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Returning Quest to Purple Lace.\r\n','2016-04-18 22:02:09','2016-04-18 22:00:50'),(10480,10951,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting support arts along with Quest.\r\n','2016-04-18 22:02:18','2016-04-18 22:01:14'),(10480,10951,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting support arts along with Quest.\r\n','2016-04-18 22:02:23','2016-04-18 22:01:28'),(10480,10077,60,7,'Final adendum 7th','This is the last part of your 7th sphere task. I wish for you to assist Braelynn in her 6th sphere task. She has the details of the task for you. **A**','2016-04-18 22:35:03','2016-02-06 06:18:44'),(10480,10745,107,1,'Peace Aura','As requested by the leadership of the Alliance, I am granting the house art since no teacher is able to at this time. **A**','2016-04-18 23:14:19','2016-04-18 23:13:41'),(10480,10746,60,1,'Beginning Sphere','I wish for you to write a sphere task for each of the first five spheres. Do not ask for help with them. This is work I wish for you to think and work on your own. After that is complete, speak with as many others that have sphere and find out what you can about the process. Take notes and we will discuss. The first five tasks are not to be adjusted. **A**','2016-04-18 23:21:32','2015-12-12 04:06:29'),(10480,10746,60,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After speaking with AJ, I am granting her the ability to sphere. **A**\r\n','2016-04-18 23:21:32','2016-04-18 23:21:27'),(10480,10745,67,50,'SReaper 50 - Kaihan','Your house\'s fate rests on the edge of a knife. As one of its leaders, find a way to bring it back from that edge, or push it off it. The choice is yours and your housemates. Don\'t make it alone. Formulate and present a plan for either outcome.','2016-04-18 23:27:41','2015-12-24 07:19:52'),(10480,10745,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting the Guildhouse art to Kaihan as part of the SM work to gain access. **A**\r\n','2016-04-18 23:31:44','2016-04-18 23:31:30'),(10745,10067,107,1,'Peace Aura - Learn','For continued service to the Alliance of the Eclipse as Guardian and High Priest. ©k','2016-04-18 23:53:28','2016-04-18 23:53:10'),(10450,10104,29,30,'Poison 30 - Dar','Keep pushing your objective in the Cairn and explore different methods of achieving your goal. Consult other people and get their input.','2016-04-19 01:30:45','2016-01-12 02:29:44'),(10311,10915,16,10,'ID10-Magnum','This shield has 19 charges, try to pass it off to your friends (or enemies) and pressure them to put it on. If they use it, or ID it first ask for it back and try it on someone else. Tell me how many people you got with this trick!\r\n','2016-04-19 01:49:01','2016-04-13 23:59:20'),(10022,10050,38,20,'Cuero: Scare 20','Are people actually afraid of anything within their dreams? What -is- there to fear within your dream? It is not like people fear one another, what lasting consequence is there within the City? Most shrug off a collapse, as it is technically a temporary loss of strength and can be regained. Discover what it is people fear most, how do they protect themselves against it? Is there anything to truly be afraid of?','2016-04-19 02:08:39','2015-11-04 06:02:13'),(10027,10068,60,2,'second sphere ','he had an intervies and i deem him ready for seocnd sphere with this interview and my knowelegde of his dreams as his teacher','2016-04-19 03:05:51','2016-04-19 03:05:39'),(10027,10066,63,1,'Invisibility learn','The way this arts works is very decriptive of how we as seers have mastered our skills. Share with me your insight of how it is we have such skils. create your own cloak symbolizing your new focus.','2016-04-19 03:11:14','2016-04-18 04:05:48'),(10880,10068,27,1,'Draining Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:39:37','2016-04-19 03:33:08'),(10880,10068,70,10,'Flamin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:40:58','2016-04-19 03:35:57'),(10880,10068,3,10,'SoulMasterin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:41:04','2016-04-19 03:36:43'),(10880,10068,24,10,'Healin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:41:31','2016-04-19 03:35:07'),(10880,10068,72,1,'Scribblin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:41:42','2016-04-19 03:33:29'),(10880,10068,67,10,'Reapin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:41:49','2016-04-19 03:37:12'),(10880,10068,96,10,'Sensin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:46:07','2016-04-19 03:44:04'),(10880,10068,139,1,'Mare Sniffin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:46:15','2016-04-19 03:45:18'),(10880,10068,26,10,'Purifin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:46:24','2016-04-19 03:43:30'),(10880,10068,75,10,'Flashin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:46:32','2016-04-19 03:43:12'),(10880,10068,47,10,'Pushin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:47:38','2016-04-19 03:44:18'),(10880,10068,64,10,'Givin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:49:20','2016-04-19 03:48:35'),(10880,10068,5,10,'bundle to ten','I need some help with a task if you will. Seak out ten dreamer and find out what they think of bundles pro and con and what their focus is and if the teachers what train level if the can sphere etc. and s my first bundle student i would love your thoughts as well. by the way theer are at least two here.','2016-04-19 03:49:30','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10880,10068,5,10,'Generatin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:49:30','2016-04-19 03:49:08'),(10880,10068,0,10,'Partyin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:56:20','2016-04-19 03:55:51'),(10880,10068,51,10,'Seekin\' Druce','Per bundled task Druce be grandmothered in.  >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-19 03:56:31','2016-04-19 03:56:13'),(10027,10050,16,50,'Identify 50','Identify some things that might unify and strengthen your home Some points to consider that I have heard recently are sugeestions. Some of your house mates would like to have meeting or get together maybe even just of initiates. Plan a house hunting party or group to genn with. There seems to be a lack of camaradarie. Find three areas that need work, oraginize a plan, and implement one.','2016-04-19 04:11:19','2016-04-10 21:22:27'),(10066,10950,60,1,'Sphere 1','She has a basic understanding of the basic things in the city. Talismens and colors. Arts, majors and minors. Teachers/students. Generators. Planes/rooms. Avatars/effects. Houses, Threshold and their relationship.','2016-04-19 05:38:42','2016-04-19 05:36:20'),(10108,10950,47,1,'Push - Tauriel','Have someone (maybe a handsome Gateseer) show you the scenery items that can be, or used to be able, to be pushed. Also, ask around for what it\'s useful for, as well as one or two fun things to do with the art! Tell me what you learned, and how fun the outing was!\r\n','2016-04-19 22:48:10','2016-04-18 03:58:51'),(10550,10066,63,10,'Invis - 1st Mastery','Your avatar has undergone changes over time as you continue your journey as a GateSeer. What has changed? Ask others within your inner circle to make honest, object comments about your personality and avatar changes, if any, since your new path has began. Are you still a GateKeeper at the core, or are you changing? Any negative sides?','2016-04-20 00:06:41','2016-04-19 21:37:43'),(10066,10050,96,40,'Sense Dreamer 40','We have intruders somewhere outside our walls, looking to breach it. How can we Sense Dreamers outside our city walls? Prepare a theory and test it with the aid of others. Record the results of your test and see if you can determine anything about our intruders, especially their location outside the walls.','2016-04-20 00:41:37','2016-04-08 04:39:47'),(10136,10941,3,10,'SM10-Yae','Find items in the dream from all the different planes that remind you of a soul master\'s focus.  Bring them back to me and explain why you feel this way about each of the items. What connects us to the items?','2016-04-20 00:49:05','2016-04-13 01:28:02'),(10066,10950,26,1,'Purify Learn','Speak with a few members of House Calenture. Learn their beliefs, specifically their solution to handling essences. Why is this topic controversial?','2016-04-20 02:43:45','2016-04-19 04:06:55'),(10136,10050,5,20,'Random20-Cuero','Come down with random things. Split personality, or the case of the purple foot or.. whatever.  Come down with at least five things and tell me how others responded. Become a jerk, or a teddy bear. Whatever. Have fun with it. Don\'t collapse anyone. The bigger the fun, the better.','2016-04-20 03:13:38','2016-04-11 03:16:12'),(10107,10050,36,50,'Dreamblade 50','It is peculiar that Blades do not form at the gens unlike chakrams.  I want you to inspect the gens and see if there is an opportunity for the dream to begin creating these items?  How can we get these to manifest in the gens?  Further to that, would dreamers be interested in these artifacts?  What would be the upshot of all this?','2016-04-20 04:26:10','2015-10-29 05:27:34'),(10067,10027,21,60,'Blend 60','I want you to think of a way that the Seers can Blend into their Guild House. It\'s currently just out of reach for us. Blend your own take on what it would take to get the art to us and what we can do with the GH when we get access to it. It\'s not the GH of the past where it was elitist to even get in. A little blend of the old and the new should make things easy for us to step on in and get some things done. Efforts worthy of a 60 plat please. <T>','2016-04-20 04:33:05','2016-04-01 05:56:39'),(10232,10050,51,50,'Cuero - Locate 50','We\'re refugees! Which I expect you\'ve come to realize, by now, but all the same. I\'d like for you to locate (by sight or word of mouth) 5 other Idoaclesian dreamers in this City, aside from you or myself. Then, while you\'re at it, what\'s missing in this City that was in ours? Be thorough; some things might surprise you! ','2016-04-20 04:53:11','2016-04-07 22:56:57'),(10746,10050,21,20,'Blend ~ 20','As the City prepares for invasion by the Illuminated Vanguard, many are focusing on strengthening our defences.  How can Blend be both a strength and a weakness in battle?  Attempt to work with a Gatekeeper to prove your theories.  Share you results with me.','2016-04-20 04:55:06','2016-04-07 23:32:29'),(10027,10550,51,10,'Locate Dreamer - 10','Sometimes we don\'t really think about how much we rely on Locate Dreamer in our dreams.   Take some time and think about 4 or 5 moments when not having locate would have impacted your dreams in either a good way or a bad.  Tell me about these moments and where would you be now if those moments did or didn\'t happen.  I will share a few of my own as well during the report.  I am very excited to hear about what you come up with.\r\n','2016-04-20 05:30:00','2016-04-18 23:03:16'),(10027,10942,2,10,'Dreamseer to ten','Seek out some explainations to what in the dream a seer is and why insight is important. Some answers might be in scrolls or with other dreamrs or maybe even in your own meditations Think on this and get back to me all the informtion you find.','2016-04-20 20:39:04','2016-04-12 08:14:06'),(10009,10018,108,1,'Sable-Learn','Bring in 100 essences to the Order.','2016-04-20 22:27:26','2016-04-09 00:26:51'),(10746,10550,46,20,'Recall ~ 20','Look back into your memory and try to remember the sphere tasks you have done.  What did you enjoy about them?  Would such tasks be applicable in the current City?  Why or why not?  Evaluate as honestly as you can and return with your results.','2016-04-21 01:56:47','2016-04-18 22:36:11'),(10136,10088,35,10,'Trap10 - Vamp','Work on trapping someone or someoneS into something without them realizing it. You can tell them it was for a task after you\'ve done it. Trap them into telling secrets, or trap them in a room with an emphant, or whatever! THEN work with some soulmasters on plans for a Trapped Head box. Don\'t have to experiment with it.. just good, solid plans.','2016-04-21 03:00:20','2016-01-27 02:57:50'),(10027,10066,60,5,'sphere for thunder','as per akkadians note with supports','2016-04-21 05:15:54','2016-04-21 05:15:43'),(10027,10104,17,10,'ID curse to 10','Help me with my curse to always know things and explain these energy arts to me stats and such thanks for helping me','2016-04-21 19:22:37','2016-04-21 15:35:28'),(10062,10935,1,20,'GK | 20','I\'m told you\'re hosting a meeting for the GKs. This is a good step. Consider various topics, and bring me an outline of topics you wish to discuss. Also, I feel it best that the venue of these focus meetings be upon neutral grounds. Why might that be, and do you agree or not? If you agree, decide where your new venue will be.','2016-04-21 19:24:45','2016-04-17 00:36:30'),(10450,10027,15,60,'Quest: Keilara','Spend some time reflecting upon your dreams. Think of the houses you\'ve been in, and your journey to get where you are today. Bring to me a past memory that you feel altered your course in the dream, and what you are doing now to make an impression on those around you.','2016-04-22 00:46:21','2016-04-19 00:47:57'),(10450,10088,52,50,'Train50Vampyro','Write up several tasks for various dreamers that encourage their legacy, as you require as their teacher. Upon their completion, save them for me and report them each to me, in great detail. I look forward to examining your teaching methods to see what the outcome is for your students. ','2016-04-22 01:17:15','2015-12-11 06:03:08'),(10450,10009,35,30,'TrapDreiko30','I once wrote a task to someone, and they never turned it in so I am passing it on to you. For my informational purposes, I would like to know what each plateau of trap will do, numbers wise. Clear up to the 9th plateau. Crunch some numbers and get back to me.','2016-04-22 01:34:31','2016-04-19 01:13:15'),(10107,10915,111,1,'Dazzle - Magnum','The house art was designed by Lasaimis based on a dream of Sha\'Resa, DoL house Lyran.  What feature of Sha\'Resa is the art of Dazzle based upon?  If any DoL members don\'t know, you get to firestorm them.   ','2016-04-22 02:37:55','2016-04-10 03:49:47'),(10034,10062,141,40,'KinesisKrodoc','I have long forgotten the history of Kinesis and how it came about in our city. Remind me of it.','2016-04-22 02:38:02','2016-04-16 01:09:19'),(10062,10050,75,20,'Show | 20','Show me something new. Be creative, and let it fit the reward. In this day and age, new is a refreshing.  Whatever it is you show me, show it to someone else and get their reaction. Why did you choose this over other things?','2016-04-22 03:29:51','2016-04-11 03:16:58'),(10027,10050,2,50,'Dream seer 50','Help me united the Dreamseers and get this guild solid and moving forward the meeting will be tomorrow night and every week after. Ii will be there i am asking you to  help me rally our focus how is up to you.','2016-04-22 03:43:59','2016-04-19 05:21:54'),(10746,10066,16,30,'ID ~ 30','I would like you to go about the City and claim some rooms for your \"kingdom\".  Using your new found Insight, I want you to come up with descriptions for them, even if they already have one and any changes you would make to them.  Be prepared to show them to me.','2016-04-22 04:10:02','2016-04-15 03:59:48'),(10027,10670,60,1,'Sphere 1','After and interview is it my beleif that rosalie is ready to move the her next sphere ~MT ;adysivler','2016-04-22 05:14:18','2016-04-22 05:13:18'),(10027,10916,37,20,'Trail to 20','You path is uniquely yours. Pick ten places and times in your past in the dream that landed you here. Look forward and see five places you wish to be in the future. Lastly pick five things you wouldnt change in your cheams if you could.','2016-04-22 17:46:58','2016-04-03 00:01:16'),(10593,10360,139,1,'Quest: Grah!','Handy this art.  Try to talk to Arnaya, Arlyana, Em\'et , or  other people that you see quite regularly, ask one or two of them about the Datoken they are aware of and have them give you a rundown on how dangerous or not they are, their habits, quirks, etc...  ~C','2016-04-22 21:26:42','2016-04-12 20:26:07'),(10027,10732,50,10,'Nightmare form 10','to accomplish this quest you will need to be quick on your tail and stay close to the portals. i would like you to seek out each form of nightmare, enter the room in nightmare form and look to see how the nightmare responds to you. with this information i would like you to therorize as to why that is. when you feel you have answered these questions sufficiantly seek me and we shal have tea and chat~P~','2016-04-22 22:26:00','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10732,50,10,'nmf 10','for a quest completed and given by poppygirl','2016-04-22 22:26:00','2016-04-22 22:25:50'),(10311,10935,40,1,'DeafenL-Toregord','How would you use deafen to give you an advantage in battle? Give me a few examples of how you or others would use it in such a situation. Why do you think there is no counter to the art? Report to me your results and opinions.\r\n','2016-04-23 01:14:51','2016-04-12 15:26:52'),(10022,10077,22,20,'Tember: Forge 20','Choose five people that impact your dreams. Forge a represenation of who that person is to you, their personality. Show your creation to that person and document their reaction. Did they feel the piece was a sampling of themselves, or not? Why?','2016-04-23 01:23:58','2016-04-18 02:16:56'),(10027,10550,47,20,'push 20','In the spirit of working with teacher ail was asked to do this for shoury and i agreed the quest ws written by aileron','2016-04-23 04:21:23','2016-04-23 04:05:12'),(10593,10905,3,20,'Quest: Sm 20','You like to wander and meditate, enjoy the quiet times. Go exploring,  spend some time and find your 5 favorite places in the whole dream.  I look forward to hearing where they are and why they are your favorite.  ~C ','2016-04-23 04:42:21','2016-04-09 05:02:04'),(10018,10050,46,40,'Recall 40','Speak with a handful of others and ask them to Recall the best task they were ever given. Why did they enjoy it so much? I also want to hear about your own favorite task. If we as teachers (and apprentices) can learn of what others truly enjoy, we can tailor their tasks to something they would like to work on and focus on growing.','2016-04-23 07:07:10','2016-04-20 05:24:09'),(10550,10066,19,30,'Vision - Rank 3','Continue riding the waves of Calenturean growth. As ruler of HC, evoke \"Vision\" on Evernight. Work with your house between now and through your house meeting. As defenders of the City, what were you able to uncover. Then, begin discussing how you\'d address it and report back.\r\n','2016-04-23 18:38:01','2016-04-20 00:20:17'),(10066,10550,51,20,'Locate 20','Tjarkan recalled to Caudal twice tonight when collapsed. Then it recalled to Dark Awakening the third collapse and recruited Vrihai. It also went to Palisades. Locate a connecton between all three planes, especially the rift and the Dark Awakening. Attempt to test your theory somehow.','2016-04-23 18:49:13','2016-04-21 05:38:49'),(10027,10066,23,10,'Recharge to 10','Seers like tiems they are sort of our niche. The Ideoclesains had energy arts find out all you can about them for me. Stats and any shortcomings. Any other tidbits you can discover.','2016-04-23 20:10:46','2016-04-19 21:35:33'),(10018,10550,46,30,'Recall 30','Recall something about your old City that you would like to see make a comeback...special traditions/celebrations, etc. Tell me all about it and explain why the City could use it now.','2016-04-23 20:13:31','2016-04-21 05:43:48'),(10027,10943,60,2,'sphere second','Galeli has completed an interview nd i am convinvced of his readiness for second sphere','2016-04-23 20:18:56','2016-04-23 20:18:42'),(10009,10050,22,30,'Forge-30','Organize and teach a class on sculpting statue replicas of dreamers. Try to come up with simple techniques that can assist others in your class with their creations. Place the finished products in the 5th Sphere Library when completed.','2016-04-23 20:52:42','2016-04-06 22:48:30'),(10018,10360,26,20,'Purify 20','Blue has completed an old bundle from Amante.','2016-04-23 21:37:12','2016-04-23 21:37:03'),(10009,10935,60,3,'3rd Sphere','What is it that drives you? Once you can answer that question, organize an event that follows it as a theme. Attempt to have as many dreamers as possible in attendence but focus on pulling as many from the Order as you can. If it\'s a competition, attempt to have a prize for the winner(s). If it\'s not a competition, acquire the required components for the event to run smoothly.\r\n','2016-04-23 21:56:46','2016-04-08 00:25:13'),(10027,10935,14,10,'Know - 10','Knowing oneself and their place in the city is just as important as any other knowledge.  Let\'s find out who you are.  Create an item that in your opinion expresses who you are and what you feel is your place in the city.  (Feel free to find someone with forge or use a codex).  The item can be whatever you wish it to be.  Be prepared to discuss how the item relates to you and your dreams when you report.  I look forward to seeing what you come up with!\r\n','2016-04-23 22:05:52','2016-04-20 22:05:18'),(10027,10935,14,10,'Know to ten','seems to be a mistake trying to rectify it this was ailerons quest','2016-04-23 22:05:52','2016-04-22 01:29:42'),(10108,10915,41,20,'Mag - Blind - 20','I want you to get information on the shroud. As much as you can. What is it? How is it keeping us blinded fom the enemy? When you\'ve done that, get with Restel and find out when he\'s next going to attempt phaze 2 of the portal project and see if you can assist him. Are there any things DoL can do to push it along? Ask.','2016-04-24 01:48:09','2016-04-17 02:42:43'),(10450,10088,112,1,'GuildHouseTrainV','','2016-04-24 16:35:11','2016-04-24 16:34:37'),(10027,10104,37,20,'Trail to 20','I have watched your trail twist and turn for awhiel now but i sense a new found sense of home in you I am glad. What five things brought you to where you are? Tell me where you hope this trail will lead you in five days or five months. Can I assist  in any way?','2016-04-24 16:37:35','2016-04-24 04:59:22'),(10450,10027,63,60,'Invisibility60LS','I would like for you to return to several events in your past. Had you not been there, what would the outcome have been, do you think? Marriages, dreamstrikes, training, fights, ascensions.. you name it. Pretend you go back in time, and are invisible during these important moments in your dream. Tell me how different you think things could have been. It is a wonderful dream, isn\'t it?','2016-04-24 16:55:13','2016-04-22 01:50:10'),(10027,10958,139,1,'Sense Dat - Learn','Being back in the city can be very disorienting.  Keep a little journal of your journey to getting back your sense of the dream.  How does it feel?  How easy or hard was it to acclimate back into a dreaming society?  What do you feel has changed and stayed the same the most?  Explore the city for as long as you need to answer these questions and bring back your report.  I will also describe my return and how it felt with you.  I am looking very forward to your report.\r\n','2016-04-24 22:06:22','2016-04-19 02:49:24'),(10311,10077,144,1,'ChaosWellL-Tembs','Get a chaos well from Dreiko, and fill it up. Also tell me the basics of the art, its cost how many essences it hold and how many per plat and so on. Just basic art info!\r\n','2016-04-25 00:31:24','2016-04-17 00:17:10'),(10311,10935,144,1,'ChaosWellLToregord','Chaos well was only recently created, find out the group including some of the names of the people who created the art. How much strength it holds unplatted and how many per plat. What determines its appearance. Just all the chaos well basics you can find out and come report to me your results.','2016-04-25 00:31:34','2016-04-24 01:03:03'),(10066,10050,47,50,'Push 50 | Cuero','Push the members of the City to work with others, including Calenture, and prepare for the Vanguard Advance.  Find out more about our enemy so we might destroy them. Your efforts should match the plateau that you seek.','2016-04-25 01:16:35','2016-04-23 16:38:04'),(10550,10066,63,20,'Invis - Rank 2','Invisibility is oftened tied to perception. Tie this to the \"peace\" that the City has enjoyed for a while now. What does this reveal about the nature of Seers, to an extend, since we have the art?\r\n','2016-04-25 04:47:22','2016-04-23 18:54:43'),(10027,10905,25,10,'Reweave - 10','The City is a weave in itself of plans.  Pick any 4 planes of your choosing and find a shield that represents that plane in your view.  Why does the shield fit that plane?  Does it give you a deeper insight to the plane?  Do you have a connection to any plane inparticular?  Feel free to be a thurough as you wan\'t with the extra questions.  I will choose a plane and shield as well and we will discuss everything together at the report.  I look forward to what you bring me!\r\n  ','2016-04-25 05:54:55','2016-04-19 08:13:06'),(10550,10027,142,20,'Misdirect - Rank 2','\"Misdirect and Direct\" the mantra of your teaching through your apprentice, Aileron. Guilde him, but he is to come up with 5-10 hard questions that he knows the answer to as it comes to teaching. Then, quiz at least 3 teachers (minimum of one MT). This is Aileron\'s time to shine through you!\r\n','2016-04-25 20:36:55','2016-04-22 21:50:44'),(10027,10550,47,30,'shoury 30','becasue we are workign with shoury on a proession of this art aileron and i are doing it together','2016-04-25 21:01:25','2016-04-25 21:01:06'),(10027,10050,21,30,'Blend to 30','Time to assist the houes in blending their pland against the Vanguard work with the Houses and any other group you feel might offer assistance. Create and plan and implement its.','2016-04-25 21:23:46','2016-04-23 03:38:25'),(10022,10077,22,30,'Tember: Forge 30','You are to make something from individual parts. Five parts to be exact. Find five people and have them each make you a component of something larger. This is not you telling them what you want them to make, but what they think you require. You are to have a grand vision for what you want to complete. But, each part should be unique to the person making it. It is then up to you to take each of the five pieces and form them into one. Involve others with the final creation process as well.\r\n','2016-04-26 02:33:20','2016-04-23 23:54:48'),(10746,10066,21,1,'Blend ~ learn','Being that you are a GateKeeper first and a DreamSeer second, I would like you to construct your own theory on how Blend works and how GateKeepers can disable it in the future. ','2016-04-26 02:39:26','2016-04-22 04:28:08'),(10480,10088,31,40,'Vampyro: Curse 40','You have been afflicted by a feeble mind. A passing witch did not like the cut of your jib and twacked you with her wand. What shall you do now that you are not in full control of your mental facilities... run into walls all the time? Seek out help from anyone who will give it... how will they restore you to your senses?! Moral of the story... be nice to witches.','2016-04-26 02:44:40','2016-01-23 23:42:34'),(10880,10027,16,60,'Silver Identity','Da Seer guild be lacking identity amongst those of us who wish ta see it prosper. Bring yer focus tagether and form a bond. Open the way to yer guild again. Identified effort be rewarded a sixth plateau. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 03:19:33','2016-04-12 08:49:16'),(10480,10022,41,50,'Blind to 50','The City seems bent on the idea of an invasion. They are turning a blind eye to the everyday happiness that most seek. I wish for you to present to me a plan on the best way to defend the City against invaders. Use all of the resources in the City in your plan. Is there something that citizens are not seeing? Where are the blind spots? How can the entire City be utilized? Make your efforts worthy of the reward. **A**','2016-04-26 03:41:46','2016-04-18 22:54:01'),(10880,10027,89,60,'Shield of Silver','You must protect at all cost!  You have no control, even when you dont want to or are asked not to, you cant help it!  Take some newlies hunting, and BE their shield.  Stand in their way, protect them uncontrollably, even if they ask you to move out of the way - you simply can not help yourself.  You are afflicted with the Shield Newly Bug - ','2016-04-26 04:03:27','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10066,23,20,'Rechrge to twenty','You have witnessed and collected new knowledge of the dar mares i want you to share this with as many dreasmr as possible and post a scroll to help the information to be shared','2016-04-26 04:19:20','2016-04-26 04:17:41'),(10880,10068,0,20,'Partyin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:30:50','2016-04-26 04:15:18'),(10880,10068,5,20,'Generatin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:31:04','2016-04-26 04:15:54'),(10880,10068,47,20,'Pushin\' Up Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:31:11','2016-04-26 04:16:25'),(10880,10068,64,20,'Givin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:31:29','2016-04-26 04:17:15'),(10880,10068,72,10,'Scribblin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:31:36','2016-04-26 04:18:00'),(10880,10068,75,20,'Flashin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:31:42','2016-04-26 04:18:32'),(10880,10068,96,20,'No Sensin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:31:51','2016-04-26 04:19:12'),(10880,10068,3,20,'SoulMasterin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:32:12','2016-04-26 04:21:46'),(10880,10068,67,20,'Reapin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:32:17','2016-04-26 04:22:03'),(10880,10068,24,20,'Healin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:32:24','2016-04-26 04:23:14'),(10880,10068,25,10,'Weavin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:32:29','2016-04-26 04:23:45'),(10880,10068,27,10,'Masochist Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:32:46','2016-04-26 04:26:40'),(10880,10068,32,10,'Mare Drainin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:32:55','2016-04-26 04:24:25'),(10880,10068,70,20,'Searin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:33:05','2016-04-26 04:22:56'),(10880,10068,46,1,'Recoilin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:33:14','2016-04-26 04:25:36'),(10880,10068,51,20,'Seekin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 04:34:11','2016-04-26 04:34:05'),(10880,10068,40,1,'Defeanin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 05:12:11','2016-04-26 05:11:59'),(10880,10068,9,1,'Free Action\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-26 05:12:21','2016-04-26 05:11:39'),(10746,10734,98,1,'Point of View','Put your avatar in a newlie\'s dreams and tell me how they would view the current state of the City.  Remember that they would have none of the background knowledge of the houses and dreamers involved.  Does this change your view of things?','2016-04-26 19:18:39','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10232,10550,96,30,'Shoury -S Dreamer30','Sense out some dreamers for me; go around, asing dreamers what art they would create, if they could create any one art. What do these responses reveal about these individuals? About the population as a whole? While you\'re at it, what owuld you create? The devil is in the details; as for orbit, focus, cost, etc, etc. Make those whom you ask decide the particulars of the art they\'d make. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-04-26 21:07:18','2016-04-26 21:07:09'),(10062,10050,14,20,'Know 20','What a wonderful art. Bring to me a history of the Sect of the Prudent so that you may place it in the Library. This place is filled with lots of histories, and not many from our City that I\'ve seen. We need to spread our culture as well.\r\n','2016-04-27 02:54:27','2016-04-22 03:35:42'),(10066,10958,105,1,'PC Learn','Snow Angel has brought in a several thousand strength for the Orb with an additional 614 today. Tremenous service to the house.','2016-04-27 03:03:48','2016-04-27 03:03:10'),(10107,10732,16,50,'ID 50 - Rafe','Each room seems to have a personality of it\'s own. Maybe the colours match moods or the layout reminds you of the twisted psyche of another. I want you to pick 10 dreamers and find the room that best matches these dreamers.  What is it about the room that makes it a match to the person. These individuals may be present or past dreamers from years gone by.  Each dreamer should be reflected in a key aspect of a different room.','2016-04-27 03:11:08','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10746,10050,144,50,'Well ~ 50','This City can be likened to a Chaos Well.  How can this be so?  Create a theory. Conduct an experiment to attempt to prove your theory.','2016-04-27 03:14:09','2016-04-20 05:02:58'),(10107,10941,111,1,'Dazzle - Yae','The house art requires power tokens, and as such, the art is not to be used wantonly like the others.  What situations do you think it would be best to use Dazzle?  Talk to two other house members (you can use the boards or in person) and get their advice.\r\n','2016-04-27 03:24:41','2016-04-22 03:29:03'),(10136,10088,28,10,'Abjure10-Vamp','This is one of our most powerful arts as SMs. Be a powerful SM without the art for a few nights. Steal things from dreamers- alts, chaks, anything you can get your hands on. You could ask for it, and then simply keep it! Afterward, hold a sale and sell the items for more items!  This could also be a fun drinking game at the Tavern. Gather dreamers for this- make it big, whatever it is.','2016-04-27 03:28:27','2016-04-21 03:08:09'),(10066,10950,60,2,'Sphere 2','Tauriel has demostrated she is willing to engage in large crowds to help towards a common goal. In the instance she explained to me how she helpd Vampyro (with others) from being smacked from a witch. She suggested the witch may be whoever is veiling the city, knowledge only gained through interacting with other people.','2016-04-27 04:02:39','2016-04-27 03:59:50'),(10232,10062,144,10,'Krodoc - CW10','Where does Chaos pool in our Dreams? What things do you see that require organization, or a de-clogging of chaos? Think the thoughts that you think, and then pick one or two with possible solutions. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-04-27 04:08:19','2016-04-11 02:08:37'),(10108,10964,71,1,'Flameruin - Learn','In our weird little city are two strands of beliefs regarding our dreams here. Illuminate, and Freesoul. As you can, speak to some people and ask them what each belief.. believes, and if they think it\'s relevent in this day and age. Do either resonate with you? Or do you feel they\'re poppycock?','2016-04-27 04:26:53','2016-04-24 04:56:00'),(10232,10670,47,1,'Rosalie - Push','Push yourself into the arena! Work with Dreamers to learn how to summon your blade, and some basic combat techniques, then challenge some nightmaremares, in varying locations. What kinds of mares can you find? Which can you defeat? Ensure a thorough report of your efforts.','2016-04-27 05:54:57','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10067,144,50,'Chaos well 50','Create gifts for you hosusemates to be given during the Fun week show them how much you apprecaite what they do. Make them fruit baskets, bath baskets, spice baskets....you decide what might be best.','2016-04-27 06:12:18','2016-04-25 05:59:31'),(10027,10050,50,30,'NMF 30','We may have visited this int he past if not its a good reaource ifso build on what we had. There have been efferts made recently to speak witht he darks in aiding against hte vanguard, Find out the status. Fakar went tohurron what would be the best way to fight agaist him in the form. How many types of mares can you name.','2016-04-27 21:17:03','2016-04-26 04:43:28'),(10027,10942,69,10,'Tranceflame to 10','You are quite the inspiration. As a new seer want you to consider you dreams. How could thye be better? What is missing? Any thoughts on what could be done to make the dream more than it is today? Let\'s light a flame together for a better City.','2016-04-27 21:36:31','2016-04-27 01:57:39'),(10027,10949,69,1,'tranceflame','was mistakenly asssigned to bleu who was itnhe room when this u\\quest was writtne','2016-04-27 21:55:25','2016-04-27 21:55:15'),(10027,10750,17,1,'ID Curse','Make up curses either with others or on your own. You know the ones \" May an army of ants infext your picnic\". Seek out confirmation of the evoke time and plateaus. Knowing ther is a curse in half the battle see any we can \"cure \" in the dream now?','2016-04-27 23:38:03','2016-03-29 10:42:22'),(10746,10915,74,30,'MB ~ 30','What is the house of Light doing in preparation for the impending invasion?  What are you doing right? What should you start doing?  In keeping with your sphere task, what banner would you unite us all under?  Would it be about beliefs or simply survival?','2016-04-28 00:14:39','2016-04-17 04:41:13'),(10746,10066,63,30,'Invis ~ 30','The balance of the foci is often touted as a falsehood. I would like you to truly evaluate this invisible limit on the foci and its merits or lack there of.  If it does not exist, should it?  What would change for the Foci?','2016-04-28 04:44:52','2016-04-26 02:51:47'),(10232,10360,60,3,'Blue - 3rd Sphere','Blue blew balloons for blueberries. Do you remember the Blueberries? If not, don\'t worry. But you\'re going to take on one of their jobs! Entertainment! The mornings can be so boring. I\'d like for you to devise some entertainment, and make it happen! Invite some friends and random people to attend! I don\'t require that you post to the Scrolls ahead of time, but I bet you\'ll have a better turnout if you do! Think carefully, but more importantly, have fun!','2016-04-28 19:31:12','2016-04-14 16:58:51'),(10027,10732,139,10,'Sense Datoken - 10','Sometimes a dreamers best tool is their hands, let\'s see what yours can do.  Build a device that can amplify the affects of Sense Datoken.  Use materials naturally found in the city and feel free to be as creative with this as you wish to be.  How does the device amplify what the art does?  How would this be useful in everyday dreaming?  Bring the device with you when you report and explain what you did and how it works.  i am excited to see what you come up with!\r\n','2016-04-29 00:14:01','2016-04-24 16:42:15'),(10027,10916,139,20,'Sense datoken 20','The lady need and escort for a tea on Thursday Can you lend you talents to making sure the meeting goes smoothly. Its time to restart a dream and your help would be apprecaited','2016-04-29 00:17:54','2016-04-25 22:05:38'),(10027,10732,18,50,'Chamele to 50','I like hidden things. What treasures do you think are yet to be seen. I want you to think about the journey you have made to get to this point in your dream. What points changed your path? What do you see in your future. What can you work on to get there?','2016-04-29 00:37:43','2016-04-27 01:49:51'),(10027,10066,21,10,'Blend to ten','Perhaps dreamseers and Gatekeeerps are more kindred than we admit. I want you to think of how your two foci are actaul the truest paraellel foci of any other  ones.','2016-04-29 01:56:27','2016-04-26 04:25:39'),(10009,10050,139,20,'SenseDatoken-20','Newlies are the driving force of the City. Work with Night Storm to finalize his marble work. Forge it into a finished product and place it within the Museum to remind the rest of the dream of this.','2016-04-29 03:11:06','2016-04-23 20:58:45'),(10027,10942,60,2,'Second sphere','I beleive he is ready after a veryinsightful interview','2016-04-29 04:23:35','2016-04-29 04:22:56'),(10746,10066,23,30,'Recharge ~ 30','Recharge used to become less stable the higher the plateau.  Why do you think that was the case?  Why is it no longer the case?  What other changes couldbe on the horizon for this art?','2016-04-29 04:48:20','2016-04-28 04:51:02'),(10027,10032,48,1,'Soul Evoke to learn','You grandfather was full of sage advice and I can always use some. Three of his lessons shared will gain you the art you seek.','2016-04-29 04:50:51','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10232,10750,32,20,'Arnaya - Drain 20','Find a location that has had the essence drained right out of it. How might the essence be restored to it? What would it look like with the essence in it again? Share your thoughts with another, whose opinion you respect, and ensure a thorough report. ','2016-04-29 07:13:07','2016-04-14 21:46:07'),(10880,10068,26,20,'Purifyin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-29 07:28:56','2016-04-26 05:12:51'),(10880,10068,46,10,'Recoilin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-29 07:31:59','2016-04-29 07:31:51'),(10880,10068,32,20,'Mare Drainin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-29 07:33:59','2016-04-29 07:33:49'),(10880,10068,72,20,'Scriblin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-29 07:36:09','2016-04-29 07:35:54'),(10880,10068,27,20,'Self Drainin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-04-29 07:36:59','2016-04-29 07:36:52'),(10027,10550,46,40,'recal to 40','aileron and shoury have been workign on a series of plateaus as a practice and this is the next one aileron is doign very well','2016-04-29 23:00:33','2016-04-29 23:00:24'),(10022,10009,60,7,'Quest: BladeSlayer','Sphere for Dreiko','2016-04-30 02:34:27','2016-04-30 02:34:23'),(10009,10088,22,1,'Forge-Pt2','Investigate the different templates available for Forge Talisman -- most can be found within the 5th Sphere Hall of the Library. Choose your three favorite and use Inscribe to \"create\" something using the associated mold. Be mindful of the colors you can Forge when creating them.','2016-04-30 02:42:07','2016-04-16 20:39:45'),(10027,10066,63,40,'Invis to 40','Take the arts of Invisibility Chamele and or Vison and make a new art or two in theory or fix what we have. Think outside the box on what is possible and what is not. What would the conponents be? What would be the steps?','2016-04-30 02:49:40','2016-04-29 02:07:34'),(10108,10311,39,20,'Stagger - 20 ','Go on a rumor crusade. Only, a fun one, not a mean one. Just random, crazy, fun and not-at-all-true things. Whisper random people, get them talking! Dreiko likes to lick hats, Thunder has a secret shrine to Chalk Shields... weird silly things! See if you can get people laughing! I want to hear the results as well as HEAR them!\r\n','2016-04-30 03:03:42','2016-04-18 01:29:56'),(10593,10750,72,10,'Quest: Presents!','In keeping with what you enjoy. Give out 10 very unique, one of a kind gifts to dreamers, even include those who you don\'t normally spend a lot of time with, surprise them!  Can\'t wait to hear what you have created!  ~C','2016-04-30 03:38:37','2016-04-12 20:35:15'),(10746,10550,47,40,'Push ~ 40','Many older dreamers are returning to the City.  Create a plan for reintegrating them into the City, be they Lyran or Idoaclesian.  You do not have to implement the plan, but a clear framework is desired.','2016-04-30 04:27:36','2016-04-26 20:19:22'),(10746,10050,46,50,'Recall ~ 50','I have heard much of the item altering arts of your City.  How would we go about recalling them here?   Would you alter them in any way or keep them as is?  Please place your findings in the Archives.','2016-04-30 04:30:12','2016-04-27 03:22:46'),(10066,10950,24,1,'Restore Learn','Explore a few planes for murals or works of art. Record what it is and assign it a name. While there, investiate whether the work of art needs restored or if prevails against the test of time. Be sure to keep track of the room name and plane.','2016-04-30 06:16:12','2016-04-24 07:17:30'),(10018,10087,139,1,'Sense Datoken','AoE seems to -always- put PA to use on the Datoken. Is this really a good tactic? It is my belief that it gives them enough time to regenerate Dreamsoul, and fight longer. Put it to the test. What is your opinion on the matter?','2016-05-01 03:09:46','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10067,99,10,'Combine to 10','Combine your insight and that of others to see what vision of the future you can see, What events in the dream can you envison? What should we do to prepare? ','2016-05-01 07:13:44','2016-04-27 06:25:26'),(10951,10027,69,60,'Green Flame (60)','Ok wait! Insight is Blue, Resilience is Green. So why a Green Flame? The answer lies with those who may know both well, or may be known only to those who know their focus well enough to Know the TRUE nature of our... unique Flame. Multiple theories acceptable, yet there is only one TRUE reason. Seek it out. ~Lacie~','2016-05-01 17:10:15','2016-04-22 01:43:03'),(10027,10066,19,40,'Vison to 40','Make me two somethings  that no one has ever seen. A coin of Calenture, the great gates of Evernight. the choice is yours. Two things to symbolize your home and the viison you have told me about you have for Calenture\'s future.','2016-05-02 00:03:45','2016-04-30 03:03:44'),(10450,10036,60,1,'Quest: Keilara','The returning of the art of Sphere to Synteny','2016-05-02 03:47:38','2016-05-02 03:46:37'),(10027,10888,60,4,'Sphere four','The dream needs a Returning Dreamer Outreach. Think about what they need and how it can be offered. Create a Welcome Group offering items and companionship to help them get their dream legs back. Hold three events to instruct other how to help, celebrate their return, or offer hunting parties, Dreamers PIcnic, My favorite Dream Dance. What they are is up to you I will be attending all. Lets see if we can brighten things up some.','2016-05-02 04:38:51','2016-03-28 08:52:35'),(10027,10232,139,20,'Sense Datoken 20','Some of our poor dramers have in the past fallen to the curse of the mare. Why do you think this happens and how can we prevent it in the future. Or aid them to come back to the true form.','2016-05-02 19:50:27','2016-04-18 06:07:33'),(10027,10964,47,1,'Push - Learn','Meeting people and pushing ourselves to learn new things is paramount to the city.  Find out different ways to hunt mares in the city.  Talke this time as well to meet a few new dreamers in the city and see what they can impart upon you to make your journey into the city more enjoyable and knowledgeable.  Demonstrate the hunting tactics to me when you report.  Also tell me a few new things you learned from the dreamers you met.  I am looking forward to your report.  Good luck!\r\n','2016-05-03 01:40:51','2016-04-24 05:08:55'),(10746,10066,23,40,'Recharge ~ 40','Is that which is shattered broken, or merely in need of a recharge?  Intertwine your knowledge of Shatter, Ward and Recharge.  Attempt to Recharge a ward pre or post shatter.  Enlist the help of at least three dreamers.  What did you do, how, why and did it work?  If not, could more work be done to improve the odds?','2016-05-03 04:52:50','2016-04-29 05:17:37'),(10027,10905,47,10,'Push - 10','Pushing ourselves can mean more then mentally or physically.  I want you to sit and meditate on what you believe being a Soulmaster means to you.  Push yourself to define it in a way that suits your personality.  Then meditate on where you want to see yourself take your focus.  What path do you see yourself following?  Come to me when you are ready to report.  I am very excited to hear what your meditations have brought to you.\r\n','2016-05-03 04:57:54','2016-04-25 06:50:57'),(10746,10916,144,40,'Well to 40','Time to flex your creative muscles. The history of how Chaos Wells were created has been lost to apathy and forgetfulness. I would like you to recreate the history in story form.  Magnilia, Kaer GeRRoZ, and Starfall must feature within it.  Share it on the Archives and at Bardic.','2016-05-03 20:26:52','2016-03-25 17:55:23'),(10746,10050,32,20,'Drain 20-Cuero','The city has a potential threat looming, speak with various dreamers and devise a plan to keep the shroud in place. What will drain it? Are the mares impacting this? I want a detail report with a minimum of 4 dreamers.','2016-05-03 21:01:37','2016-04-08 00:34:00'),(10746,10968,105,1,'PC ~ learn','This art is gained through service to the house, be it essences, genning or guarding.  Post to me your service for a few days.','2016-05-04 03:07:43','2016-04-29 03:15:04'),(10027,10593,72,50,'inscribe to 50','quest done by aileron with my supervision as a excersise workign with another teacher','2016-05-04 04:16:48','2016-05-04 04:16:14'),(10136,10050,5,30,'Random30-Cuero','Ask others to do/say random things for you. Tell them it is for a contest, for the BEST random thing in all the city. Forge prizes for the top three. You can change it up.. it doesn\'t have to be \"do/say\" it can be anything.. random. Enjoy it. Be a king for a few nights.','2016-05-04 04:31:14','2016-04-22 04:46:52'),(10027,10670,139,1,'Sense Datoken - L','The mares have taken an item of utmost importance.  What is this item you ask?  We don\'t know!  However you are the only one that can find it for us!  Use your senses to find a place in the city that a mare would hide this item and retrive it. Where was it?  What is it?  What does it look like?  What does it do?  Only you can find out for me.  I am sure you will find use of the item before returning to me so just report back your findings.  Good luck!\r\n','2016-05-04 05:22:09','2016-04-25 06:15:30'),(10067,10027,107,1,'Peace Aure','For duties performed within the house.','2016-05-05 00:18:09','2016-05-05 00:17:59'),(10062,10411,13,20,'Return | 20','I\'m looking to bring back an older ability the Keepers used to have only in a more streamlined fashion. I\'m trying to decide what types of items I would need crafted in order to create a Pocket Ward. Consider some options and bring to me at least 3 ideas.','2016-05-05 21:28:41','2016-04-17 00:44:03'),(10952,10746,116,1,'3rd crested Lyceum ','','2016-05-06 03:34:25','2016-05-06 03:12:09'),(10027,10942,36,10,'Blade to 10','There is so many uses for blade in the dream. Seek them out and bring me a list you have created or gathered. Be prepared to show me an example. I have something i will share with you when you report.','2016-05-06 16:17:07','2016-04-27 21:39:40'),(10232,10050,75,30,'Cuero - Show 30','What use is Show Talisman, these days? Nobody believes it, since it can be faked with Inscribe! Show things to Dreamers to SHOCK them! Forge, or Inscribe some things, and then show them around for great entertainment. What sort of reactions can you get? Do people show things back? Scoff at you? Be prepared to discuss!','2016-05-06 17:14:00','2016-05-06 16:55:33'),(10009,10746,15,50,'Judgment-50','Apparently the end is near, however, we won\'t be allowing that to happen. Enlist a few other dreamers to identify the preparedness of the City to defend itself from the impending invaders. How and what you choose to test is up to you. Once the results are in, compile a recommendation for how to improve in the weak areas. Bring the recommendations to the four Houses so that we can hopefully improve as one.','2016-05-06 20:52:14','2016-04-06 23:02:07'),(10072,10311,7,20,'RF20','Think about your fears. Identify one thing you\'re afraid of, and tell me about it in detail. Why did you choose it?','2016-05-06 22:05:33','2016-04-16 23:18:58'),(10951,10027,50,40,'Kotoke dak Eovoc','We need both a \'Basics\' seminar for the University as well as aabbreviated Dictionary... a \"Maren for Dummies\" if you will. Phrases and/or words Dreamers may need at the ready. Provide codexed copies to those attending the Seminar (infinite chg). More than 1 seminar would be great, but only 1 needed to complete the Quest. Good Luck. I\'ll help if need be. ~Lacie~','2016-05-07 03:20:49','2016-05-01 17:57:58'),(10027,10905,24,20,'Restore to 20','You are one of the newer Soulmasters we have in our City. I am always working on trying to make things better and improve the dream. What would you suggest as dreamers we might be able to do better? For younger Dreamers? For your focus? For the Dream?','2016-05-07 04:14:37','2016-05-02 20:44:44'),(10027,10935,37,10,'Trail - 10','Time to hit the dusty trail and see what tickles your fancy.  Explore the city and find three rooms that just make you want to ward the living hell out of it.  What makes you want to do this?  Did you, or did you resist the call of the Keepers?  Do the rooms give you a feeling of connection to your focus?  Jot down your thoughts and feelings and report back to me your findings.  I am very very excited to hear about your little adventure along the trails.  Good Luck!\r\n','2016-05-07 05:31:15','2016-04-23 22:16:39'),(10027,10087,40,10,'deafen to ten','quest aileron did in working with a teacher for critic and practice','2016-05-07 18:54:48','2016-05-07 18:41:14'),(10027,10905,72,1,'Inscribe - Learn','Words alone can not be enough for some dreamers.  Inscribe can give us a way to express ourselves differently.  Think about how you will use inscribe beyond just the normal means.  Give me a few examples of something you may do.  Paint a picture and describe it to me or create an item and tell me what it does and how you made it.  Your creatvity is yours and I look forward to the examples you will bring to me.  Good luck!\r\n','2016-05-07 19:23:16','2016-05-03 06:38:35'),(10874,10750,27,30,'DrainSelf 3rd plat','I would like you to force your ideals of communication and community spirit onto others.  Even if they seem unwilling.  This must be done without asking for permission or seeking their approval prior.  Return to me with a detailed account of what you did, to whom, how they reacted, and why or why not were you successful.  ~Dakk','2016-05-08 04:10:37','2016-03-16 04:46:07'),(10027,10004,60,5,'Fifth Sphere','Time to celebrate the Allaince. I want you to create three events involving the dream. Gather all the help you can from your house mates. Use all the resources avaiable to you. Public scrolls and such. Make the Allaicne shine as only she can.','2016-05-08 05:59:38','2016-04-02 09:59:08'),(10027,10032,139,1,'Sen Daotoken learn','Let\'s play teacher the teacher and make the dream a saner place. How and when you do this is up to you.','2016-05-08 06:42:09','2016-05-02 04:35:44'),(10550,10050,21,40,'Blend - Rank 4','The upcoming threat is upon us. Due to the sense of urgency this is causing, work with your home.. with you leading the effort, to master the final \"blend\" that you would consider the most successful. If you fail to plan, you plan to fail, so I want you to consider a secondary blend as well, just in case.\r\n','2016-05-08 17:08:14','2016-04-26 21:26:44'),(10746,10053,105,10,'Quest: Arlyana Jax','Calenture is preparing for a grand battle and there are many within the house that are working on this to assist.  Lend your knowledge to oneand report back.','2016-05-08 22:34:56','2016-03-27 03:31:52'),(10108,10935,46,10,'Tore - Recall 10','Come be our Honorary FlameMaster for Event 3! Dress in grande Fiery Attire and don the cape and staff of the Flamemaster! Also, judge the next game with the purest heart! Embrace your inner Fatesender! Also, have fun (Saturday at 6:30)','2016-05-09 00:12:25','2016-04-17 02:35:18'),(10027,10108,46,20,'recall to 20','Mare Pinatas Gather up some prizes for your sender events and have them passed out as everyone and beat up on an emphant. Place them around to give out gifts. Just am\\n idea change it as you wish','2016-05-09 00:22:18','2016-04-22 00:31:24'),(10018,10050,73,30,'DT 30','What does it take to Destroy an artifact? With the threat of Igteus\' mace in Zaxun\'s possession, we need to consider our options if we manage to get ahold of it. Seek at least one method of Destruction. Are there any repercussions for trying to make such a powerful item disappear?','2016-05-09 06:39:10','2016-04-23 21:02:46'),(10746,10050,15,40,'Judge ~ 40','I would like you to take a stern look at the City and judge its weaknesses and strengths.  Not just in relation to the impending invasion, but as a whole.  Does this City have the wherewithal to survive a year?  5 years?  10 years?','2016-05-09 18:43:20','2016-05-03 21:13:44'),(10027,10050,50,40,'NMF 40','Help the University and myself in gathering the informaion for the teaching lineage tree.Get me as many names as you can from your time, This is an exciting resource we are creating thank you so much.','2016-05-10 00:12:26','2016-05-06 17:46:30'),(10593,10935,98,1,'Quest: What\'s new?','We know what the art does, pretty straight forward. I think dreamers need to engage more, socially.  Chat \'em up! ask a few dreamers, what\'s new!? what are you working on?? If you could pick anything in the City to make new, what would it be? Chit chat. No set number. Let me know what\'s new!  ~C','2016-05-10 01:14:32','2016-04-19 21:29:22'),(10593,10942,16,1,'Quest: Identify','This task only requires some thought and soul searching on your part. Identify, in your opinion some weaknesses that you feel the City has. It can be physical, emotional, people, places, whatever you choose. By the same token, also Identify the greatest strengths the City has. I look forward to hearing how your mind works! thanks! ~C','2016-05-10 01:33:16','2016-04-20 20:41:45'),(10480,10916,52,1,'Final Written','After speaking with Aileron, apprentice to Master LadySilver, he has been given his final written exam. He is to create a new art of his choosing and formulate all of the intricacies of such an art. He is also to quest ten citizens in the learning of his art. He is also to write four examples of plateaus in his art to the level 40. **A**','2016-05-11 01:45:52','2016-05-04 06:29:45'),(10480,10916,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts for halo.\r\n','2016-05-11 01:47:00','2016-05-11 01:46:55'),(10480,10916,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts for halo.\r\n','2016-05-11 01:47:09','2016-05-11 01:46:37'),(10480,10009,81,10,'Vampiric Draw 10','This art can seem offensive. You and I discussed ways that it can be used in combat to help you sustain longer in battle. Ask at least five others how they feel about assisting you in this way in battle. Report back to me when you have your information and we will discuss. **A**','2016-05-11 01:59:43','2016-04-18 22:22:18'),(10027,10761,144,1,'Learn - Chaos Well','I wish to understand Chaos...Well...as in better than I already do.  As someone who has devouted their entirity of dreams draining this Chaos from essences, please provide a very diffinitive definition of Chaos.  Precisely what is it and how it differs from the other focus elements.  ~Dakk','2016-05-11 21:31:31','2016-03-14 03:50:24'),(10916,10958,144,1,'Chaos Well - Learn','Chaos comes in all forms, so let\'s find some examples of that.  Look about the city for places, items, or even people (past or present) that represents chaos to you.  Has the view of chaos changed since you have returned and if so how?  Bring a few examples of your liking and let\'s discuss them for your report!  I look forward to hearing what represents chaos to you in this city.  Good Luck.\r\n','2016-05-12 00:37:43','2016-04-30 23:41:42'),(10916,10888,31,1,'Curse - Learn','Let\'s start your testing journey with the basics!  Using your knowledge of the basic stats, how do you plan to test the art?  What variables are you looking for?  What do you hope to learn about the art from these tests that you are going to do?  I look forward to hearing your report!  Also..the sound curse makes is amazing!\r\n','2016-05-12 02:11:00','2016-05-11 07:53:34'),(10745,10545,35,1,'Avayla - Trap Mare','Speak with the dreamer propulation at large. What in their dreams has them feeling trapped at times. Is there a common nightmare? If so, what can we do to help make their dreams more free? ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-05-12 06:26:44','2015-12-16 07:31:50'),(10550,10050,14,30,'Know - Rank 3','As a leader of the movement against Zaxun, its important to Know the actual status of your home\'s readiness. Not only as a collective, but individually also, in case of separation during battle. Fight a few members of your home, replicating an actual battle (at least 2-3). Do they Know.. that you Know.. they are prepared? The results you provide may serve as a blueprint for applying this to other factions pre-Zaxun engagement.','2016-05-12 22:19:03','2016-05-08 17:21:22'),(10027,10550,144,50,'chaos well to 50','honoring a quest done for aileron ','2016-05-12 22:43:53','2016-05-12 22:43:35'),(10480,10108,71,50,'Flame to 50','It is time to shine brightly. Have a series of four or five games revolving around your flame. I will leave the details up to you. Have fun and get others involved. Some ideas could be \"flame tag\", \"flame relay races\", \"ping pong the shamblix\", \"flaming target practice\", just to name a few. Or use them all. Make your effort worthy of a plateau to fifty. Find me when you are finished and ready to report. **A**','2016-05-12 23:16:11','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10108,52,30,'Clarity - Train 30','Speak to your fellow teachers, and learn their methods. What do they consider first when writing tasks for students, new or old? What is most important in the teaching process to them? Answer these questions also for yourself. Then consider students: Select three. How do each of these students learn best? Consider carefully. Bring also with your report five examples of 3rd plateau tasks, for consideration and discussion. ','2016-05-12 23:30:53','2016-04-13 03:29:50'),(10066,10050,89,20,'Soulshield 20','In regard to the impending invasion, theorize as to how SoulShield could play a more important role than it currently can. Attempt to test your theory and look for any results that indicate you were right or wrong in your theory.','2016-05-13 03:13:14','2016-04-26 03:06:08'),(10108,10670,98,1,'Rosa - NA - Learn','Take some time to get reaquainted with the city and the current going\'s on. What have you missed in your absence? Is there any projects regarding the current situation that you might be interested in assisting with? Find out what they are. Let me know who you spoke with, and your thoughts on it all.\r\n','2016-05-13 05:11:23','2016-04-27 05:48:33'),(10951,10670,2,10,'Folding the Fabric','We Seers find many things, discover many Unknowns. Unlike other focii, however, Seers tend to study more indept than the others. Further explore the entrance of the Chasm. There are secrets down there, which few know of. If you like, I can show you how to get down there, if you are unable on your own or with the aid of others. Develop/expand your theory of the nature of the object you found earlier. Good Luck. Questions? Please ask! ~Lacie~','2016-05-13 05:42:00','2016-05-04 05:34:08'),(10027,10916,48,1,'Soul evoke','The art has such a taboo around it. I know it can have some protective qualities and some seek it just in case but there is more. Some laugh about it but maybe its not all fun and game. Seak out a few dreamers and see if any have an opinion either way.','2016-05-13 08:29:35','2016-04-29 22:10:59'),(10654,10905,139,1,'Rand SenseDatoken L','Datoken are a type of Mare. What makes them different from the Lesser Mares? How do they differ from the Dark Mares? Why do you think that there is an art that detects Datoken yet doesn\'t detect Dark Mares?','2016-05-13 09:15:10','2016-05-07 06:37:35'),(10550,10951,139,1,'S. Datoken - Rank 0','Continue to elevate your legacy by teaching Sense Datoken to someone without the actual art. If one fails to plan (arts), do they plan to fail?','2016-05-13 22:18:28','2016-04-22 03:46:32'),(10027,10916,50,20,'NMF 20','The Coaltions Needs You! Wanted a researcher to to studies an testing to see whay damage is done in night mare form. Fighting lesser and and calculate what it would be for a dreamer. Salray negoitable. Give me you research as a resume. Good luck!','2016-05-13 23:07:18','2016-05-13 08:52:38'),(10108,10004,9,20,'Quest: Clarity','It\'s an epidemic! No one has FA and you need to collect FA candy to give out to your favorite people that need protecting! I\'ll give you the first, but seek out the strongest bestest candy makers you know and have them make you some lollies that give FA! Present them with a fun speech about how they need it to keep them safe, and enjoy the giggles! Tell me all about their reactions!','2016-05-13 23:25:04','2016-05-12 23:54:21'),(10746,10916,105,40,'PC ~ 40','I think we need to investigate the merits of the three paths within the house again.  See if you can get everyone to choose a path that will be their main focus.','2016-05-14 00:36:28','2016-05-03 20:34:19'),(10480,10455,22,60,'Forge 60 (3/3)','For the final part of this task I wish to see a forged item for each of the four focus as well as dreamsoul. That will be an alteror, elemen, chakram and shield for all five of the elements. Make them unique and specific. Show great thought and creativity. I want to see craftmanship. (20 items total) **A**','2016-05-14 02:27:18','2016-05-10 06:17:50'),(10480,10455,52,40,'Train to 40','I wish for you to compile a list of all of the arts that one would learn from birth to orbit 50 for each of the focus. Be detailed in your report and place them on codex or scroll. **A**','2016-05-14 03:30:28','2016-05-10 05:51:14'),(10880,10068,60,3,'Druce ta Third','Fer dis task take a moment to research the current standing of yer focus guild. Present a singular idea ta yer guildmates. Extree points fer co-hosting a meetin\' and assistin\' with der goals. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:11:30','2016-04-29 07:45:39'),(10880,10068,0,30,'Partyin\' Druce','Bundled task >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:16:49','2016-05-14 05:55:41'),(10880,10068,5,30,'Gamblin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:16:56','2016-05-14 05:56:17'),(10880,10068,46,20,'Recallin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:17:03','2016-05-14 05:56:38'),(10880,10068,47,30,'Pushin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:17:09','2016-05-14 05:57:41'),(10880,10068,51,30,'Locatin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:17:17','2016-05-14 05:57:57'),(10880,10068,51,30,'Locatin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:17:17','2016-05-14 06:01:07'),(10880,10068,96,30,'Creepin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:17:25','2016-05-14 06:00:39'),(10880,10068,139,10,'Mare Sniffin\' Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:17:30','2016-04-26 04:19:30'),(10880,10068,6,10,'Calmin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:17:51','2016-05-14 06:01:24'),(10880,10068,9,10,'Movin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:17:56','2016-05-14 06:01:41'),(10880,10068,14,10,'Knowin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:18:04','2016-05-14 06:01:59'),(10880,10068,3,30,'SoulMasterin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:18:15','2016-05-14 06:02:28'),(10880,10068,24,30,'Savin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:18:21','2016-05-14 06:02:47'),(10880,10068,25,20,'Weavin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:18:26','2016-05-14 06:03:00'),(10880,10068,26,30,'Purifyin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:18:33','2016-05-14 06:03:19'),(10880,10068,27,30,'Drainin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:18:40','2016-05-14 06:03:37'),(10880,10068,32,30,'Drainin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:18:46','2016-05-14 06:03:57'),(10880,10068,67,30,'Reapin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:18:51','2016-05-14 06:04:13'),(10880,10068,70,30,'Searin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:19:04','2016-05-14 06:05:17'),(10880,10068,37,10,'Trailin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:19:11','2016-05-14 06:05:38'),(10880,10068,40,10,'Deafenin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:19:22','2016-05-14 06:06:00'),(10880,10068,29,1,'Poisonin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:19:36','2016-05-14 06:06:38'),(10880,10068,30,1,'Antidotin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:19:43','2016-05-14 06:06:58'),(10880,10068,15,1,'Judgin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:19:51','2016-05-14 06:07:14'),(10880,10068,38,1,'Scarin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:20:09','2016-05-14 06:08:41'),(10880,10068,7,1,'No Fearin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:20:19','2016-05-14 06:08:59'),(10880,10068,118,10,'Housin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:21:11','2016-05-14 06:21:04'),(10880,10068,72,30,'Scriblin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:22:15','2016-05-14 05:58:35'),(10880,10068,64,30,'Givin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:22:44','2016-05-14 05:58:15'),(10880,10068,75,30,'Flashin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:22:54','2016-05-14 05:58:56'),(10880,10068,98,10,'Barely Awake Druce','Per bundled task as Druce be grandmurded in. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:23:04','2016-04-26 04:21:11'),(10880,10068,74,1,'Sneakin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:24:36','2016-05-14 06:23:37'),(10880,10068,144,1,'Ess Stuffin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-14 06:24:45','2016-05-14 06:24:28'),(10067,10455,99,10,'Combine 10 ','For this plateau, I want you to find the fastest way to imp Combine. Do what you have to in order to get that information. Show and share your work. <T>','2016-05-14 08:23:13','2016-05-12 06:42:19'),(10027,10108,89,10,'Soul Shield - 10','Sometimes during our dreams we can become a \"lost soul\".  Let\'s see if we can\'t find something to get you back on your feet.  Sometimes the best way to help ourselves is to help others.  Help a few other dreamers with anything that they may need.  Be it hunting, quests, anything.  Keep note of how it feels to be there for others.  Let\'s talk about it when you report to me.  I look forward to seeing what we find.\r\n','2016-05-16 00:08:57','2016-04-22 01:07:10'),(10027,10108,89,10,'soulsheild 10','honoring a quest done by my former apprentice','2016-05-16 00:08:57','2016-05-16 00:08:50'),(10027,10050,0,50,'Join Party to 50','Help me brain storm for the UNiversity. I need five class ideas five fields trips plans and two challenge like the one i made for the library quest boards. ALso this is a bonus care to offer a class yourself?','2016-05-16 00:32:22','2016-05-11 21:48:03'),(10009,10050,15,50,'Judgment-50','The Dream is \"coming together\" in advance of the coming invasion, however, we are still divided into sub-groups instead of one large group. Identify the divisions amongst dreamers and attempt to push everyone together in some way. WIth this, try to demonstrate the value of the different types of dreamers within the CIty.','2016-05-16 01:19:14','2016-05-10 00:06:21'),(10009,10545,22,10,'Forge-10','Identify a unique quality in three different dreamers. Forge an item that relates each of the qualities and represents the dreamer as a whole. Show them to me and then present the items to the dreamer in question to get their opinion of it.','2016-05-16 01:31:42','2016-02-07 00:40:21'),(10311,10761,24,1,'RestoreLearn-Jorryn','Give a historical item within the city a little makeover. Try to bring awareness to something that you remember being in awe of ins ome way in your early dreams. It can be silly like a graffiti\'d statue or serious like a clean up effort its your choice. ','2016-05-16 01:40:25','2016-03-13 03:50:01'),(10009,10545,35,10,'Trap-10','Trap is a useful tool for a House but like any tool, you need to know how to use it efficiently. At the first plateau, you won\'t be able to Trap a Bogrom, so identify a rotation in the City that will allow you to maximize your Trap efficiency while taking into account your limited pack space and limitations in ability. What plateau do you believe will allow you to move on from this rotation into another?','2016-05-16 01:45:14','2016-05-14 01:21:20'),(10136,10750,29,40,'Poison40-Arnaya','When I first met you, you had been taken away by the Consortium. Your mind was poisoned, and therefore, so was ours. I\'d like you to come up with an alter ego for yourself. Use it always, or use it once in a while.  Whatever you do is up to you.  Maybe an Evil Arnaya! Or a Shy Arnaya!  Pretend that someone has poisoned you. You don\'t know who. Send us on a detective chase with a great ending. Give me plenty of details and have fun with this. Maybe something triggers you to have the other personality. ','2016-05-16 02:03:01','2016-04-05 02:16:46'),(10136,10941,3,20,'SM20-Yae','Take the events in the library tonight with Vampyro. SMs were the first ones to assist him. Create a few scenarios when a SM is not present. Who assisted you when you needed \"help\"? Are SMs the best at giving assistance to others? Explain. ','2016-05-16 02:20:45','2016-04-26 02:26:53'),(10062,10050,17,10,'ID Curse | 10','Sort the armories and make room for good items. Get rid of the junk. Keep track of the items you toss. A tally of them is all that\'s required. What\'s decent can be thrown in the Study or the Essence room. ','2016-05-16 04:11:10','2016-05-03 13:15:16'),(10988,10750,144,30,'Arnaya Color Chaos','Fer dis task use yer mark. Mend misunderstandins in regards to colors of charms, chakrams, alterors, shields, and chaos wells (if ye can). Find by pneumonic or by colloquialism a way to help even those unprivy to dreamer tongue to weld the words of the dream wisely. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-16 06:11:51','2016-04-12 09:09:06'),(10988,10838,51,20,'Sarayu - Locate 20','Locating dreamers and catching them on the move can be a real pain. It can also be fun! For this task, I want you to organize a small group for \"Hide and Go Seek.\" This game must involve five dreamers or more, where you are always the \"it\". Come to me with the rules and ideas you used to make the game a success and fun for all. ~Cyrus Kaihan~','2016-05-16 20:12:06','2015-12-26 21:28:37'),(10018,10761,1,30,'GK 30','You are still finding your way; perhaps it is time to dip your toes in the water! The GK guild has been slow going, due to our hatred of meetings. I want you to be our go-between. Collect a list of ideas from as many GKs as you can find on what they would like to work on as a Guild project. In the mean time, think of your own -or- expland upon another\'s on how you would like to go about implementing it.','2016-05-16 23:40:51','2016-03-14 04:25:34'),(10088,10108,25,20,'Reweave 20','In my City, I developed an alternative method of teaching and rewarding tasks known as \'Vampyric Workshops\'. However, the craze never spread and eventually died out. So, I want you to develop your own, outside the contemporary \'task-and-report\' system. Present your case, in full, to housemates and friends, and based on their feedback, we\'ll see if it\'s worth pursuing with the Elders. If so, we will approach them together and I will support you in full. Details and creativity are a must.','2016-05-17 03:11:28','2016-04-14 02:57:54'),(10593,10915,6,20,'Meditate- 20','Have you ever seen or heard of any \"cults\" ? Many times they like to make up their own chants and things as a means to meditate...for fun, can you make me up a hella\' good meditation chant! Magnum style!! wait...there\'s more.. you must do this in front of people..dont tell them its a task! bwahah.. a fatesender-worthy quest!!','2016-05-17 03:46:14','2016-05-16 02:23:56'),(10746,10050,73,40,'DT ~ 40','With Zaxun coming after the prime artifacts of the houses, I feel we need a contingency plan if we are to keep them away from him.  I want you to assume that the houses are no longer safe from outsiders and develop a plan for the dismantling of the house primes.','2016-05-17 04:04:49','2016-05-09 18:55:43'),(10107,10888,9,10,'FA 10 - Uthanatos','Freedom, a concept always dreamed of but very seldom understood. I want you to look at the city around, and see where “Freedom” has caused problems for the community and individual dreamers. Is it actually Freedom that has caused the problems, or is it our perception of what freedom is that has caused the problems?  Get some input from a couple other dreamers and how \"free\" you are to your opinions.','2016-05-17 04:24:39','2016-05-08 06:51:35'),(10746,10888,26,10,'Purify ~ 10','As one of the founding members of the Way of the Lasso, I would like you to look into the history of both cities and find out about other such \'cults\' be they formal or informal. Askother dreamers,look at the scrolls, what have you to ensure that you will not make the same mistakes they did.','2016-05-17 05:15:11','2016-03-06 22:00:11'),(10480,10018,9,60,'FA60 Jade','Free Action is a physical thing, but what if it were incorporated with written word? Hold a session for your WordSmiths in order to gain more members. Put their words into motion. You\'ll have to make it enjoyable for them- SO- enjoyable, in fact, that they wish to join your group. Pretend it\'s like a house and you are recruiting. Keep a crowd\'s attention. Now, if you need to do this a few times, that\'s alright, too. Let me know how it goes and how many join. ','2016-05-17 05:45:30','2016-01-26 05:29:44'),(10003,10670,69,1,'L:Tranceflame','Rosalie, you have a flair for sparkling things...just like a flame that dances and sparkles. Speak to a few dreamers and introduce yourself. See what their passionate flame is, do they also have jewelry, does it contain any flames that sparkle within your own?','2016-05-17 06:42:15','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10003,107,1,'Peace Aura','I want you to take stock of the Alliance stores and make a list of the things that we need for you to gain the house art. <T>','2016-05-17 07:44:12','2016-04-22 05:55:15'),(10009,10949,60,1,'First Sphere','Partcipate in the First Dreamseer Guild meeting, making your voice heard. Learn the names of the 8 inner ring planes and the Strongholds they lead to. Finally, learn the 5 types of lesser nightmares and their general abilities in battle.','2016-05-17 22:58:21','2016-04-15 01:41:28'),(10108,10004,7,10,'RF 10','This black goo thing sounds scary and very formiliar. I want you to talk to Tam and see if he would be willing to share information with HC leadership so that we can get together and figure it out. If hes not okay with it, then Instead tell him a silly story to make him smile, and tell me the results of THAT.\r\n','2016-05-18 00:10:13','2016-05-13 23:30:40'),(10746,10958,105,10,'PC - 10','Services to the house are what keep it running tip top shape.  Continue growing within the house and do what you can to help.  With the growing threat looming, think of how PC could be used to our advantage outside of combat situations.  A few theories are fine, nothing needs to be too in depth but just a base idea.  Be prepared to discuss and I look forward to what you bring.\r\n','2016-05-18 02:59:46','2016-04-30 17:32:32'),(10027,10360,40,1,'Deafen to learn','as per other codex','2016-05-18 20:41:16','2016-05-18 20:38:34'),(10311,10050,108,10,'Sable10-Cuero','We are needing to get our leadership together for a meeting, you attend and try your best get the others to also.\r\n','2016-05-19 01:27:10','2016-05-12 22:29:53'),(10027,10050,21,50,'Blend 50','Blend together at least one others efforts to prepare for Zaxun with your own and incorporate their ideas with yours in a a new and better one Put the idea into practice and share the results','2016-05-19 03:03:26','2016-05-16 05:26:33'),(10313,10941,67,10,'Soulreaper -10','The sword is only as good as it\'s wielder.  I\'d like you to practice with your blade until you\'re confident in taking on a Bogrom, which I will observe.  Afterward, we will discuss what you think the most important aspect of using a blade is, and where you plan to go from there.  \r\n','2016-05-19 14:39:22','2016-05-18 16:47:17'),(10027,10941,72,1,'Inscribe to Learn','The Dream needs someone to carry some messages from one dream to the next. Creat a chain of dreams and pass on two messages. The first being \"It is a wonderful time to dream.\" The second a message from the previous dreamer.','2016-05-19 14:58:14','2016-05-04 19:48:39'),(10916,10360,30,1,'Antidote - Learn','Antidote is a pretty cut and dry art.  Evoke and remove poison from the avatar.  How will the art change or affect your dreams in your opinion?  Do you see ways outside of the normal that you could use it for?  Lastly think of your dreams so far in the city and have you seen anything that could use some kind of antidote?  Bring your observations and we will discuss them when you report.  Good Luck!\r\n','2016-05-19 21:32:30','2016-05-16 21:46:33'),(10022,10050,22,40,'Quest: BladeSlayer','I recall that your chosen material to be marble. I wish for you to make a grand display of what you can accomplish with it. You are to go out and locate a slab of great size, so as to create something marvelous. Utilize other dreamers in the locating of the raw material, it is not to be found in your pocket. Once in your possession you are to be the main artisan, but also directing others to assist you in your work. Make it an endeavor for more than just you, help others learn from your skill and knowledge','2016-05-20 01:20:29','2016-04-27 03:19:16'),(10066,10958,105,20,'Poison Cloud 20','Trap 2000 strength and record your highest trapped strength in one essence. Orb strength is currently 130,637.','2016-05-20 03:50:40','2016-05-19 03:22:41'),(10066,10750,9,20,'Free Aciton ~ 20','\"Freedom is a state of mind.\" Do you agree with this statement? Gather at least two art based examples, which are in your opinion, for and against the statement. Present them to at least two dreamers. Which did they most agree with? Be ready to discuss your opnions on Freedom.','2016-05-20 04:26:15','2016-04-29 05:36:03'),(10027,10032,98,1,'Newly Awakened L','I want your opinion here. Often I ask what newly dreamers need to know but for you i want to tell me what dreamers dont need to know thrill me with your acumen.','2016-05-20 05:23:11','2016-05-08 17:18:18'),(10593,10905,70,10,'Flaming Hot!','I know Arnaya sometimes makes crispy chocolate coffee beans for you.. But, now you need something hot!!  Ask some dreamers to make you something HOT.  If they ask you what... just shrug  and say..anything hot! It will be fun to see what they make. I will start you off with something!  ~C','2016-05-20 06:30:32','2016-05-08 06:00:28'),(10746,10108,105,10,'PC ~ 10','On top of house service, I would like you to think of a second house art for us.  Provideas much detail as you can.  ','2016-05-21 01:41:25','2016-05-08 23:26:07'),(10916,10004,89,1,'Soul Shield - Learn','Lady Patches and Lord Ruberto have spent a lot time up at the house.  Maybe they have some idea as to how to keep it shielded from all the chaotic things happening until it gets sorted out.  Talk to them and see what they come up with.  And also find a way it could be helpful for the city in general.  I await your findings from your loving dollies.  Good Luck.\r\n','2016-05-21 01:42:39','2016-05-18 00:19:55'),(10238,10108,40,40,'Deafen','Oh to be deaf.  Its horrible!   You have become afflicted with DreamPlugs... your ears appear sealed completely!  You must dream entire dreams this way, a few of them, dont cheat yourself!  And interact with everyone, work on cures, make it go away.  How hard was it to interact, what did you learn.  Mostly though... have fun.\r\n','2016-05-21 03:27:51','2015-10-15 00:37:26'),(10108,10136,38,20,'Shae- Scare 20','Under no circumstances are you allowed to be scared. At all. Over the course of a few days, I want you to use and abuse RF and do your damndest to provoke people into scaring you. Be as creative in your methods, but don\'t be caught with out RF! And if you are, it had best be a fantastic funny story to tell! Give me names and methods!','2016-05-21 04:22:44','2016-04-14 02:37:25'),(10916,10888,17,1,'ID Curse - Learn','After being told exactly what the art does, come up with your own version of ID Curse.  What does it do?  Does it have any applications outside of the normal evoke on a dreamer?  Why would you change the art from what it is now to what you deem to be worthy?  THEN, find something positive about the art as it is now and explain why you feel that way.  I look forward to hearing what you come up with.  Good Luck!\r\n','2016-05-21 04:29:33','2016-05-19 04:27:57'),(10988,10136,28,30,'Sticky Sweet Shae','Fer dis task, work with yer fellow dreamers and guildmates.  Determine which arts are the stickiest and hardest ta remove. Hows effective is stacking arts \'gainst an abjurer? Could abjure be improved against dis haphazard defense? Report yer well research statistics ta get out of this stick business. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-21 04:56:39','2016-04-26 02:53:32'),(10455,10027,107,10,'PA - 10 - Silver',' I\'d like you to take some time and consider the focus of the house in this time of change and peace. Come up with a detailed plan of how you intend to move forward, and make a part of it happen. Be creative!\r\n','2016-05-22 02:04:15','2016-05-20 04:22:58'),(10874,10050,96,50,'Leather Sensin\'','Keep track of movements in yer City fer da next week er so. Tally up da places that registered and go there ta see if ye can sense what all went on there. Report back ta me the intel ye\'ve collected. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-22 04:21:40','2016-04-26 04:49:43'),(10874,10888,3,40,'Uthanatos SM40','List your favorite high sphered SMs of all time. What made them stand out above the rest, and do you wish to be more like them? Tell me where the SMs have all gone. Why is there such a shortage? Have influences outside of our city, like the impending war, had anything to do with this? Prepare to explain. Do research to compliment your discussion.','2016-05-22 04:58:58','2016-05-08 04:22:21'),(10874,10050,60,1,'Cuero\'s 6th Sphere','1.Create a way to visualize a massive attack upon the city 2.Create a weapon to combat said enemy 3. Create a shield to protect the city 4.Hold a large class to educate others on your preparations and what to do in case of attack 5. Bring another house close to yours for strength in numbers. Inform Elders of your progress as you go for each step. Inform Dreamers for each step.','2016-05-22 05:21:05','2016-04-23 03:48:58'),(10874,10050,60,6,'Quest: Nessa Tre','other one vaped\r\n','2016-05-22 05:27:32','2016-05-22 05:27:28'),(10066,10090,105,20,'Poison Cloud 20','Come up with a respectable name for the proposed warrior group. Create an outline of the first five meetings, with a semi detailed list of points for the first meeting.','2016-05-22 05:33:35','2016-05-20 03:44:43'),(10916,10905,27,1,'Drain Self - Learn','Start off with learning the basics of the art (what it does, what it costs).  Then I want you to consider how you will use the art in your dreams.  What use do you feel you will find for it?  Lastly I want you to try and find out why a long time ago Drain Self was considered a very offensive art.  Do you believe it could be useful again?  I look forward to hearing your report, good luck.\r\n','2016-05-22 17:13:31','2016-05-20 05:35:04'),(10027,10050,14,40,'KNow 40','Keep up the good work and bring us more of your insight in what we can do to rally the troups. Let me know w\\what mroe the Allaince can do for you','2016-05-22 18:03:53','2016-05-21 04:24:50'),(10988,10027,20,60,'Blast 60 - LS','You knew this one was coming. Take charge of your house, forge a name for yourself, and ensure the Alliance has a to-do list that never stagnates. Whatever becomes of you or the Alliance or your place in it, you can take the reins that have largely been left to rot in complacency.','2016-05-22 19:35:10','2016-05-17 03:35:41'),(10951,10360,7,1,'No Fear! (To Learn)','After learning the benefits of RF, I want you to compose a statement that you would use if confronted by a Dark Mare. What would you want to say to it? Then, translate it into Maren. I am looking for the effort & can  help correct any errors. It\'s the journey, not the destination. Good Luck! ~Lacie~','2016-05-22 19:39:42','2016-05-15 21:08:46'),(10027,10670,60,2,'Sphere second','I have been observing rosalie since her first dream s i beleive in the interview that she is ready for second sphere','2016-05-22 19:50:45','2016-05-22 19:49:48'),(10107,10066,60,6,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','6th Sphere - part of his 9th sphere task.','2016-05-22 22:08:18','2016-05-22 22:07:52'),(10107,10593,139,10,'Sense Dat 10 - Cia','Sense Datoken was meant to be Sense Kotoke.  I want you to think of a way to expand this to limit covert infiltration by forces from beyond our city.  Pick whatever force (Dreamers, Kadatorii, Hota, Darkmares, anything from outside the city, etc..) you think we should most worry about detecting.  Be sure to include \r\nHow such a detection would work.  (Originally quested on Apr.08/2016, re-written onto quest codex on May.09/2016)','2016-05-22 22:19:52','2016-05-10 06:25:00'),(10066,10746,74,50,'MindBlank 50','\"Our City is currently hidden from invaders. Explore ways of extending this protection. Collect materials that may be used for this cause and with the assistance of others forge an item to assist with this effort.\" - Restel, apprentice of Thunderman ; Addendum: Request the assistance of the city at least via public notice with a given date/time and goals.','2016-05-22 23:08:12','2016-03-24 03:22:11'),(10088,10593,26,30,'Purify 30 Cianne','So you\'ve been around a while. Good for you! Keep coming back! Reflect on your dreams. . . I\'m convinced houses, guilds, and other social structures are almost always tainted. And hell, I\'m a member of them! The challenge here is to list for me as many TRULY pure (in your eyes) groups/factions/etc you can think of throughout your time here. Can you list more than 3? More than 5? Why do you think such organizations always fall short? Details, oh creative one.','2016-05-22 23:33:02','2016-05-08 22:28:23'),(10088,10108,26,20,'Purify 20 - Clarity','Wholesomeness. Tough to come by. So, in an effort towards purely divine purity, provide me with a pure list of all your favorite dreamers - and *ONE* word to describe them. 20 names, for the plateau. And 20 words to describe them. Then order them. How many on your list ever found this City? Select the top that did not, and think of second word for these 5 to put on their temporary tombstone to honor their memory. Yep, 25 words now!! Let me stop writing. . . . Your turn.','2016-05-23 00:37:01','2016-05-17 03:17:12'),(10027,10888,48,1,'Soul Evoke learn','I need you to think outside the standard uses for arts and think of the more stategic uses. You pick any arts and present a mini class for the University.','2016-05-23 03:45:54','2016-05-05 01:42:56'),(10746,10050,89,30,'Soul Shield ~ 30','One of the theories that we have struggled with in this version of the City, is imbuing items with specific arts.  Generate a theory on how you could imbue an item with Soul Shield that could be translated into a larger City wide shield.','2016-05-23 03:46:48','2016-05-17 04:20:41'),(10746,10915,89,10,'SoulShield ~ 10','Formulate a theory as to why Soul Shield hinders the evoking of Mind Blank on others.','2016-05-23 04:07:59','2016-04-28 00:21:02'),(10027,10905,26,10,'Purify 10 - Rand','Is spoken and writen language a pure form of communication?  Is there another form that is more pure?  I want you to think about this, and if there is a mroe pure form of communication, try to think of how to use it in the city.  If there isn\'t, come up with one and tell me about it.','2016-05-23 04:09:36','2016-05-20 06:14:56'),(10027,10888,72,10,'Inscribe 10 - Uthy','I want you to inscribe the essence of a couple of your favourite rooms.  Pick a couple of distinct ones.  Use style you\'d like to represent them, from abstract to ultra-realistic.  Or completely detailed written description.  Share them around a bit, be creative and have fun with it.','2016-05-23 05:16:41','2016-05-20 06:56:47'),(10916,10670,15,1,'Judgement - Learn','You had found an item of importance.  Time to find out how important it was.  Do you believe what you found can help the city and if so how.  What else can you judge about it from the time you spent with it?  Where in your opinon would you go about finding the rest of it  and would that be a good thing? Return to me with your findings and ideas and we will discuss them.  Good Luck.\r\n','2016-05-23 20:50:59','2016-05-14 08:48:14'),(10009,10050,139,30,'SenseDatoken-30','Collapse a datoke without the use of an item (Alterors to art yourself are acceptable). Keep track of names, dates, witnesses, and any other pertinent details.','2016-05-23 23:32:02','2016-05-20 18:17:31'),(10022,10311,41,20,'Flower: Blind 20','Find as many people as you can, to play a game... of sorts. Take them to the beginning of any plane you chose. You are to blind them all, for an extended period of time... I will provide you with a blind alt to do this. Once they are all blind you are to lead them through the plane, while they are blind. You may only give them verbal direction. Once every participant has made it to the finish line you are done.\r\n','2016-05-23 23:57:38','2016-05-11 00:21:18'),(10880,10027,142,30,'Midsdirection-30','Fulfillment of Quest codex under Jade by Cuero. Task confirmed and reported successfuly. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-24 04:34:33','2016-05-24 04:34:26'),(10880,10068,30,10,'Antidotin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-24 04:41:56','2016-05-24 04:40:41'),(10880,10068,29,10,'Poinsonin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-24 04:42:07','2016-05-24 04:41:04'),(10880,10068,46,30,'Callin\' Sanc Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-24 04:42:14','2016-05-24 04:41:48'),(10880,10068,16,1,'Identifyin\' Druce','Honored task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-24 04:42:35','2016-05-24 04:38:44'),(10880,10068,73,1,'Tarnishin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-24 04:42:43','2016-05-24 04:39:41'),(10880,10068,8,1,'Protectin\' Druce','Honored task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-24 04:42:52','2016-05-24 04:39:08'),(10880,10068,74,10,'Mind Blankin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-24 04:43:02','2016-05-24 04:40:16'),(10066,10050,142,1,'Misdirection Learn','Create a diversion of any sort that is intentional and successful. Report to me your plan, implementation and the result from execution.','2016-05-24 04:43:07','2016-05-22 06:06:20'),(10880,10050,52,1,'Train Learn','Approving Cuero upon review of his tasks and interview after multiple apprenticeships. He shall be monitored appropriately by myself. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-05-24 05:59:15','2016-05-24 05:59:08'),(10880,10050,87,1,'Supportin\' Cuero','Support arts for halo.','2016-05-24 06:02:22','2016-05-24 06:02:15'),(10680,10050,50,50,'Dreams & Nightmares','Choose one dreamer. Make their dream a living nightmare. I don\'t care how you do it, the choice is yours, be it with levity, aggression, unrequitted passion...the possibilities are endless. spend a few days.  S.C.','2016-05-24 06:27:53','2016-05-20 20:04:21'),(10027,10050,75,40,'Show Talisman to 40','Show off your craftmanship with your forge. Be the giver of gifts to you friends housemates or random dreamers. Make them a gift to keep or give to another. You know the drill do this as many times as you think the plat is worth.','2016-05-24 17:47:32','2016-05-22 18:29:17'),(10022,10050,111,1,'Cuero: Dazzle Learn','You have recently became part of a new house, towards a goal greater than either house could have accomplished on their own. Towards this end you should know how to transverse your new house. Have a member show you the way, then impart your knew knowledge to someone else who currently lacks it.','2016-05-25 03:25:27','2016-05-25 02:34:41'),(10880,10050,86,1,'Supportin\' Cuero','Support arts for halo.','2016-05-25 03:37:53','2016-05-25 03:37:44'),(10136,10950,67,10,'SoulReap10-Tauriel','Why would a soul master want something named \"Soul Reaper\"?? This seems quite the opposite of what our focus is all about, wouldn\'t you think? Discover the reasoning behind this, although to be honest, this may be a tough one! If you cannot complete it, I still may be able to reward you. Just let me know who you may have spoken to or what codices you read.','2016-05-25 03:49:30','2016-04-26 02:34:13'),(10136,10050,5,40,'Random40-Cuero','Follow Sala\'s randomness. He\'s vague, he\'s scary and inspiring and all other fancy words for.. an odd duck.  Take his lead and create an infectious randomness in dreamers. Make them believe something is real that isn\'t- a sickness, virus, rainbow colored pony, whatever! Keep this veil up for at least three dreams. Make it worthy of this plat.','2016-05-25 04:16:48','2016-05-19 01:55:52'),(10034,10062,12,50,'Shatter to 50, K','Shatter takes a great deal of time to work on. What is the most effective way to improve it? Simply by warding up everything and then shattering? Come up with some other ways to improve it that won\'t take so long.','2016-05-25 04:32:35','2016-04-22 02:40:27'),(10951,10987,139,1,'Sense Datoke(Learn)','This Art makes it much easier to find Dakote. How did you find them before? What did you do to protect yourself? What other Art is most helpful in making sure you only get collasped by them once? Lastly, can you speak to Dakote like you can to Dark Mares? Ask around. Good Luck & Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-05-25 05:50:50','2016-05-19 05:09:08'),(10050,10311,111,1,'Quest: Cuero','(Rewritten due to incorrect codex) -- Develop a plan for stamping out the Order and bring other members up to speed on it. The only essences I know that we have is Harkyn and Avayla, where Krodoc is the biggest obstacle.','2016-05-25 21:51:38','2016-05-25 21:51:20'),(10027,10465,107,1,'pa to learn','norkight invested his time huntig for the hsoeu and brought in 100 essneses','2016-05-25 23:27:30','2016-05-25 23:26:53'),(10311,10943,66,10,'FateSlayerL-Galeli','Fateslayer is an interesting name. See if you can find someone to tell you about a famous FS in history that has actually ended someones fate, or changed it..preferably with their blade. But that is not required. Come back to me and tell me what you learned and be prepared to have a short chat with me about the focus in general.\r\n','2016-05-26 01:48:15','2016-04-16 23:16:18'),(10311,10670,72,1,'InscribeL-Rosalie','Inscribe is a very important art when it comes to relaying or recording information. Now that you are second sphere you have a new library hall opened up to you. Go through some of the codexes there and select an entry that really speaks to you. Then report to me what subject you chose and why.\r\n','2016-05-26 01:53:14','2016-05-22 20:24:15'),(10746,10593,103,1,'Bequeath ~ L','Giving to others is a great gift, but we often forget to give to ourselves or ask for ourselves.  I would like you to ask some around you for what you want and need.  Return with your results.','2016-05-26 03:13:13','2016-05-25 05:12:55'),(10027,10067,17,50,'Id Curse 50','You are a traveling soothsayer with the all seeing eye. You can see the aura of others and you can identify their curses or ailments blessing or wishes. Find dreamers and look deep into their hearts and minds. Doesn\'t have to be politiclaly corrent or even shared with them you decide.','2016-05-26 08:12:05','2016-05-01 07:42:31'),(10027,10050,14,50,'Know to 50','Use your insight to see beyond the vison of the few which generally stops past the end of their noses and tell me what you see coming to the dream within the near future. What can the University do to help prepare for the changes you see. What can just Dreamers do? Give me a vision worthy of this plateau.','2016-05-26 20:49:18','2016-05-25 03:54:54'),(10022,10050,111,10,'Cuero: Dazzle 10','The time has come for you learn the ways of your new house. Get with Tember and learn the means by which we organize vaults. Assist her in the chore of storing all the items which are now strewn about recklessly due to the hasty combining of our houses.\r\n','2016-05-26 22:16:03','2016-05-25 15:29:16'),(10022,10009,24,50,'Dreiko: Restore 50','Let us restore our ability to defend this city without being fractured and divided. The City cannot sustain so many different factions and still have the strength to stand against insurmountable forces. Bring together the Light and the Order\'s leadership so that we may discuss bringing our forces together so that they may be brought to bear against our enemies. Once a plan is laid out which we agree on... sell it to your membership.\r\n','2016-05-26 22:27:32','2016-05-11 00:13:25'),(10022,10311,111,10,'Flower: Dazzle 10','Hunt with your new family, it would do you and them good to spend some quality bonding time together. Get to know one another! Bring the Souls to the house to be freed.\r\n','2016-05-27 00:42:09','2016-05-26 23:38:41'),(10022,10077,111,10,'Tember: Dazzle 10','Make a new family member feel welcome, tell me how you did that.\r\n','2016-05-27 00:43:08','2016-05-26 22:51:44'),(10951,10670,16,1,'Identify (To Learn)','After learning the basics for this Art, I would like you to try an experiment. Over the course of a couple of dreams, see if you can Identify different types of beings in our City. How? Use their auras, ask questions, observe. Use your Insight with this one & let me know who you Identify as what type of being. Good Luck! ~Lacie~','2016-05-27 01:02:17','2016-05-14 08:33:50'),(10988,10951,139,10,'Lace - Datoken 10','What is a datoke? Provide proof of your theory. ','2016-05-27 02:32:22','2016-05-16 22:51:27'),(10746,10066,23,50,'Recharge ~ 50','Create a theory as to why the art of Recharge backfires, when no other art carries this risk.  Speak to other Seers about your theory and see what feedback they have for you.  Present the full theory upon the Archives.','2016-05-27 04:09:00','2016-05-24 03:20:01'),(10027,10750,60,5,'Fifth Sphere','The university  is starting on her madian voyage help steer her through the rocky beginings. Hold three combat classes in the name fo the university and asist with some reasearch to be announced from Head Dean Silver','2016-05-27 04:48:03','2016-04-30 06:50:06'),(10050,10009,111,1,'Dazzle L - Dreiko','Become acclimated to your new home. What growing or merger pains do you expect to run into, and who do you already not trust within your ranks? Purple Lace is working hard behind the scenes, we need to remain vigilant.','2016-05-27 19:57:05','2016-05-25 22:09:12'),(10018,10004,8,10,'Protection 10 - Zsa','5/20 - Work with your house and any others it is allied with to explore ways to help the City prepare for Zaxun. Make sure the Alliance is part of the conversation, or even plays host to what the people are planning.','2016-05-27 21:16:41','2016-05-20 22:16:14'),(10916,10750,105,1,'PC - Learn','It\'s time to get started on house things!  First choose one of the paths in the house (its more a guide as to what you feel you are strong at).  Then Inscribe a few things about HC and put them in the Archives of The Planes for others to have for reference material on the house.  I look forward to seeing and hearing what you have done!  Good Luck.\r\n','2016-05-28 04:27:38','2016-05-20 08:18:07'),(10027,10004,16,40,'Identify to 40','Seek out the current lsit of members form each house and w\\how are the teachers report results at the meeting to be posts ont he boards FRS is a bonus Name focus train etc','2016-05-28 23:30:36','2016-05-25 19:35:54'),(10107,10750,48,1,'Soul Evoke','I want you to consider the rammifications of using such an art.  Lowering your permanent dreamsoul is already a huge burden, but I feel that we lose part of ourselves when we do so.  I want you to draw a line that you must cross in order to evoke the art.  Secondly, once you have evoked the art, how will you use it to better your chances of survival?  Talk to 2 dreamers who have successfully evoked the art and ask if they would do it again.','2016-05-29 04:02:23','2016-04-27 03:19:26'),(10593,10987,144,1,'Just a box?','Chaos wells are kind of cute aren\'t they? but what a shame to stuff them with ugly remains of mares.. ew! Create something out of your chaos well box that is useful for something else! Have fun.  ~C','2016-05-29 04:32:14','2016-05-28 21:36:34'),(10951,10987,16,20,'ID 20','Identify 5 different rooms or areas in the City which have some sort of unique characteristic. Your plat will be granted when you either tell me, or show me these 5 unique places you have Identified. Good Luck & have fun with this. ~Lacie~','2016-05-29 05:01:58','2016-05-28 21:34:07'),(10951,10866,25,10,'Reweave to 10','Use this opportunity to \'reweave\' yourself back together. You\'ll need at least 2 gatekeeper teachers. How will you do this? You may have to assume a position against me to achieve this goal. How you proceed is your own idea, but the goal of this quest. ~Lacie~','2016-05-30 00:18:04','2016-05-27 20:39:42'),(10053,10968,139,1,'Sense Datoke: Kelos','1.Sense datoken will only do one thing...what? 2. what is the focus cost etc of the art? 3. Is there a specific reason why you wish to possess this art? 4. What is a datoken?','2016-05-30 02:20:48','2016-05-09 02:16:59'),(10108,10915,43,30,'Para - 30','The city is paralyzed by fear of this on coming army, and you\'re working on figuring out a way to transport or relocate a firestorm. As such, I want for you to work with a few dreamers to create a storage device that can contain high amounts of heat. Be creative in your design and hoste a forging event to create it, encorperating as many folks as you are able.\r\n','2016-05-30 02:54:25','2016-05-17 04:32:32'),(10593,10950,70,10,'Treasure Hunt','There are many places to explore, and many things hidden! Go on a treasure hunt, light the dark places with your flame and see what you can find!! Come back and show me what you have in your basket! (the only limit is your imagination! :) ','2016-05-30 03:31:48','2016-05-25 04:25:39'),(10593,10750,28,1,'Give & Take','Abjure ! gzzzt! No FA for YOU!!  Abjure takes...What has been taken from the City, it\'s dreamers, you? Talk to as many as you like about loss, thievery, corruption..also , what might they give to get back what was lost. What would you? I\'ll tell you mine! as always all reports are kept confidential. ~C','2016-05-30 04:41:11','2016-05-28 05:39:17'),(10311,10077,144,10,'ChaosWell10-Tembs','Since you havent had much luck with your matchmaking I had an idea to help. Have a speed dating night with all the singles you can gather up at the Tavern. Do what you can to encourage hook ups! Serve drinks, maybe some fancy appitizers I dunno, but try to get at least one couple to commit to each other. Report to me your results!','2016-05-31 01:52:03','2016-04-29 01:45:35'),(10066,10950,24,10,'Restore 10','Speak with a handful of other dreamers on tactics to restore, as well as other pertinent information. Keep track of who you speak to and their responses.','2016-05-31 02:44:29','2016-05-29 19:41:08'),(10066,10050,51,60,'Quest: Thunderman','Wrote it for Quest sorry. Devise a plan for identifying possible locations of the invading force\'s entry and make the public aware. Personally see that countermeasures are in place to meet the threat when it comes. Be prepared to discuss','2016-05-31 20:02:28','2016-05-31 20:02:20'),(10027,10050,99,1,'Combine Learn','I didnt know your city had art histories. I was told they didn\'t. Compare the one for combine and two others and let\'s get the word out of shared arts histories. Maybe even combine them?','2016-05-31 20:39:03','2016-05-26 21:04:05'),(10593,10951,144,1,'Box O\'  ?','I usually dont repeat tasks, but this one I do sometimes. These wells, cute little boxes, but bleh.. putting gross essences in them. Create for me something out of the ordinary from this wee box! I look forward to see what you come up with! ~C','2016-05-31 22:22:40','2016-05-28 22:06:22'),(10593,10950,3,10,'alakazam!','I recall you said you liked my word \"Soulmastery\" So..go up to random people and turn into Tauriel! Mistress of Soulmastery!! and put them under your spell...pull a rabbit out of our hat...grow them a new beard..cure what ails them(gas? bloating? you decide) you choose your Soulmastery! One rule.. have fun!! ~C','2016-06-01 00:42:11','2016-05-30 03:37:50'),(10003,10670,36,10,'Dream Blade 10','Roseslie you have a fine eye, like the tip of your blade, its sharp and appreciates rare beauty. Work with a forger and create a rare artifact blade of your own. Present it to me\r\n','2016-06-01 01:41:15','2016-06-01 01:40:59'),(10022,10050,111,20,'Cuero: Dazzle 20','You have learned your way around the house and how to organize the house. Learn about at least one of your new family members. Tell me about them.\r\n','2016-06-01 02:28:50','2016-05-26 22:50:21'),(10050,10888,46,1,'Recall L - Uth','Recall a time when you were in some hot water and Recall could have saved your ass. It has many uses, and can avoid some unpleasant things after you\'ve been collapsed. Discover as many as you can.','2016-06-01 02:50:55','2016-05-22 09:44:01'),(10027,10670,19,1,'Vision to learn','Insight is somethign that will guide your dreams. Take a look around and tell me what you see. What of the houses? The invasion? The Guilds? The Univerisity? How do you fit in any of these? Or does teh dream hold a differant path for you?','2016-06-01 03:17:44','2016-05-26 02:06:49'),(10988,10915,44,50,'Mag-Firestorm50','Work with members of your house to create something that can use the art of Firestorm against an enemy. Bombs with firestorm within, or Balloons that carry the art to another house. Be imaginative. It may fail, but it may also succeed. Can this work on the outside threats your city is facing?','2016-06-01 03:22:32','2016-04-19 03:07:39'),(10988,10022,80,20,'HypWeaveBladeS','Use this particular art in a battle against a dreamer, or mare. Would it be something you would incorporate into your everyday battle strategy? Why or why not?','2016-06-01 03:31:40','2016-04-22 01:23:26'),(10066,10746,22,50,'Forge Talisman 50','Identify what aspect you missed previously and devise a plan, and new set of tools of your own creation to further your goals in creating a nightmare form charm. Conduct experiments with the nightmare form art and incorporate your findings into the creation of the charm. Other than crafting your tools, all experiments and attempts must involve a handful of dreamers with public notice and invitation.','2016-06-01 03:43:55','2016-02-09 04:40:00'),(10746,10066,19,50,'Vision ~ 50','The Idoaclesian version of Vision was quite different from our own. As a dreamer of two foci, this may be of interest to you.  Speak to the Idoaclesians and learn of these differences.  Create a case to bring the Idoaclesian versions into this city.','2016-06-01 04:09:30','2016-05-27 04:16:17'),(10988,10062,52,50,'Krodoc Train60','Ask for a fake task from fellow teachers for the same art for you without their names revealed on the parchment.(re-writing, if you must). Compare these tasks together and analyze them carefully. Make notes of good and bad qualities of each.  Hand the teachers that wrote you tasks, two of the tasks they did not write, and have them analyze them, as well. What I\'m trying to draw out are the best task writers in the city, and the worst. I wish for a detailed report. Tell me why you felt this way.','2016-06-01 04:52:17','2016-04-19 02:25:39'),(10027,10935,60,4,'Sphere 4th','There are mysteries afoot. Adventures await. Bring glory to the dream in a way suitable for your house and this sphere. Besure to include others as this will only add to its meaning. I await your ingenuity and creativity to be seen. ','2016-06-02 00:19:52','2016-05-14 16:50:07'),(10480,10888,27,1,'Uthy - Drain Self','You mentioned feeling guilty if you did not have this art prior to obtaining Fourth Sphere. Why is that? Learn the basics of the art and its history. How has it changed over time and do you think that barrier now in place shoulder be broken? Be prepared to a brief yet indepth discussion. ©k','2016-06-02 02:38:30','2016-04-19 06:17:44'),(10480,10888,29,30,'Uthanatos Poison 30','Gather a couple dreamers or so and travel to Edgeward Barrows.  Perform some experiments on the water there to help determine the properties of the water there and why it remains red.  ','2016-06-02 02:53:48','2016-05-20 06:24:44'),(10480,10027,52,60,'Train to 60','As per your codex...You are the teaching Puzzle Master. Find the missing pieces of the resources available for the dream and address their solutions, being sure they are implimented. There are at least six things that need your attention. Also, share the locations of the resources wherever you are able. The dream is rich if we can use what is available. **A**','2016-06-02 03:08:20','2016-04-26 03:08:00'),(10480,10951,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Raised to Master Teacher after interview and reciept of supports.\r\n','2016-06-02 03:35:55','2016-06-02 03:35:45'),(10066,10958,105,30,'Poison Cloud 30','Devise a plan and after consulting with house members, implement it to tailor the supplies we have and bring in, to better suit our current membership.','2016-06-02 03:38:15','2016-05-24 04:29:43'),(10018,10987,141,1,'L: Kinesis','Climbing has recently become a forgotten activity. Create a list of your top five climbing areas and challenge yourself by making attempts to successfully climb each. With your past climbing adventures, did you ever come across a spot that wasn\'t well known to the public? If you know of any, I wish for you to show me. Have fun!','2016-06-02 11:47:06','2016-05-14 23:18:14'),(10018,10050,22,50,'Forge 50','Explore the roads less traveled and pick 5 rooms you\'d like to see touched up, or in need of a little attention drawn to what is already there. Forge an item for each that you either A) Want to see there always, or B) Something unique that brings out the hidden qualities of the room as a whole. Take a dreamer to each location and show off your creation. What were their thoughts? People might even start frequenting these locations!','2016-06-03 05:06:17','2016-05-23 00:21:10'),(10988,10027,72,60,'Inscribe 60 - Lady','Give some dreamers some homework to help the University drum up some more content. This can happen as more information for the Public Scrolls, or challenging them to hold more events similar to this one. Make sure they know they have University backing.','2016-06-03 20:55:38','2016-05-26 02:45:32'),(10027,10750,16,20,'Indentify to 20','Time to test your love of an art. For the next 48 hours you cannot use identify. What is it you miss most? What did you just have to know what it was was? Anything  neat handed to you?','2016-06-03 21:21:15','2016-05-29 22:19:14'),(10009,10750,8,10,'Protection 10','Take two or more dreamers on a mini safari, in search of these insects and reptiles you speak of running into. Prepare yourself and your fellow hunters with proper safety and capturing equipment. Can you identify whether or not these small creatures are a curse to this city, or do you believe they may offer something more? ','2016-06-03 21:29:14','2016-04-05 09:07:03'),(10027,10050,89,40,'Soul Shield 40','The Dreamseers will be workign on a new art making blast a mass art gathering up any theories you ahve about those types of arts and shaer with the guild the art is called whirlwind being proposed by tamaraisk tonight','2016-06-03 21:32:23','2016-05-31 21:07:28'),(10009,10935,16,1,'Identify-Learn','Preparation and technique are important aspects of preparing for a difficult battle. Identify three locations of defense for the Light. Two on the Mountain and one on the House facade itself. Be ready to explain why you chose the particular points and how you envision they would assist in defense. Finally, what do Beige, Blood, Abyss, and Gold have in common?','2016-06-04 02:14:50','2016-06-02 00:39:33'),(10022,10915,60,6,'Magnum: Sixth','Accidently wrote Magnum\'s sphere task with Tember as the target, find it that way... rather than me having to rewrite everything.','2016-06-04 02:21:08','2016-06-04 02:21:03'),(10066,10950,72,1,'Inscribe Learn','Confer with your peers and learn common uses of inscribe and three unique uses, one unique use should be you own idea.','2016-06-04 21:11:07','2016-05-31 23:58:28'),(10951,10067,15,60,'Here Comes The (60)','Judge! The DreamWrights created no Art for rude reaction. This Art is important & must regain its glory! Your Quest is to create a way to institute a new philosophy about Judgment, using why it is helpful, when, etc. Execute your plan & let me know of its success or failure.  The goal may not be to succeed but rather to change perceptions. Good Luck & let me know if you have any problems. ~L~','2016-06-05 03:40:46','2016-05-02 04:22:05'),(10027,10905,46,1,'Recall - Learn, Ran','I would like you to Recall your memories of someone you met when you first dreampt.  Compare those memories to the person as they are now.  What has changed?  What has stayed the same?  Have they actually changed, or is it your perception that\'s changed?  Tell me what you think.','2016-06-05 07:21:15','2016-05-23 04:18:06'),(10066,10916,60,5,'Sphere 5','Lead three public events regarding Ward: 1) Obtain a ward and dissect it. 2) Examine the parts of the ward for their function 3) apply your desired alteration and reconstruct the ward for testing. #3 can be split in to two events if necessary. Your research must be thorough and substantial. Ensure participation from others by asking for help and delegating work.','2016-06-05 19:12:40','2016-02-28 21:26:45'),(10107,10066,23,60,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','The amount of energy going into primes is hard to balance against the amount of energy going out from Power Tokens.  I want you to think of some alternative ways to balance that out.  Does the importance of trap mare suddenly make Soulmasters the focus in demand for any houses?  Could there be an alternative means, other than essences, to fill those house primes?\r\n','2016-06-05 19:56:05','2016-05-31 01:18:21'),(10232,10108,38,50,'Clarity - Scare 50','Find a way to scare the entire City, including, most difficult of all, yourself. ','2016-06-06 00:10:57','2016-04-07 22:44:23'),(10951,10787,26,10,'Ack! Purify !! (10)','Why does Purify harm a Vampyre so badly??? Ask Aileron, Dar\'Canon and Vampyro & see if you can ascertain the answer. Also, gather 2 or 3 resilience elemens that would be helpful for our ... cause. Good ones & if I can Combine, even better! ~L~','2016-06-06 00:25:58','2016-06-02 23:50:40'),(10066,10950,105,1,'PC learn','Tauriel provided service to the house and her members by helping defend against Zaxun the other dream. She exhibited bravery and character by aiding the right side.','2016-06-06 01:01:46','2016-06-06 01:01:34'),(10009,10521,60,1,'First Sphere','What are the five types of Lesser Nightmares? What are their general abilities? What are the names of the three open Houses? What are the five primary item types that you can find laying around the City? Of these, what are the colors that will be most important to you?','2016-06-06 01:03:14','2016-06-06 00:33:06'),(10988,10062,88,1,'Quest: Malik','Returnign Krodoc to MT status given his 7 supports and qualifying status.\r\n','2016-06-06 03:59:41','2016-06-06 03:47:09'),(10988,10905,67,20,'SoulReaper - 20','By this point you have become proficient with the handling of your blade. Now is the time to not only improve your blade skill but to personalize it. For instance, my SoulReaper produces not an ordinary blade but a scythe. What will your advancement in the art produce? Speak with other dreamers; SoulMasters and none. Find out what blades they\'ve fathomed for inspiration to weld your own. ©k','2016-06-06 04:27:47','2016-04-19 06:37:50'),(10480,10027,98,50,'Newly Awakened 50','As a Master Teacher of the City I wish for you to create for me a Newly Awakened handbook. Place in this all the material that a newly should need as the y progress and grow in the City. Make your efforts thorough and precise. Leave no information behind. Your efforts should be worthy of a plateau to fifty. **A**','2016-06-06 05:16:37','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10050,52,10,'Cuero: Train 10','You are to write three tasks, each for a 10 plat and each for a different art. You may choose what art you are plating, each of the tasks is to be written for three different dreamers, of your choice. Tailor each of the tasks to suit the student. Show the task to the person you wrote it for, ask if they would complete it. Explain how you tailored the task to the dreamer and why.','2016-06-06 05:26:08','2016-05-26 22:59:10'),(10480,10050,23,60,'Recharge60 | Cuero','Recharge your apprenticeship! Make frequent announcements that you are an apprentice. Try to reach a goal of writing and/or hearing two tasks or reports per dream until I see you, again. Make sure dreamers are well aware that YOU are THE teacher for THEM.','2016-06-06 05:34:20','2016-05-24 03:57:49'),(10951,11014,26,10,'Purify Me?? (10)','A study in Vampyrism, this is. Why do Vampyres react so poorly to Purify? There are a few of us (Dar\'Canon, Aileron, Vampyro & myself). Ask around & learn why it harms us, or does it? Then formulate a theory as to how it counters Poison & harms us. Good Luck. ~L~','2016-06-06 05:45:21','2016-06-03 05:16:14'),(10066,10050,47,60,'Push 60','Work for a diverse group of people and make them pick back up a plan that had put in motion that has fallen by the wayside. It doesn\'t matter who, simply that substantial effort was put forth to encourage them to keep at it. Ensure a thorough report.','2016-06-06 14:15:25','2016-06-01 13:55:16'),(10746,10050,17,20,'ID Curse ~ 20','This is one of the least used and platted arts within the City.  I would like you to go on a short promotionary campaign to encourage others to appreciate it.','2016-06-06 16:25:39','2016-05-23 03:51:18'),(10746,10313,144,1,'Chaos Well ~ L','As we spoke about, the beliefs of Illumination and FreeSoulism have fallen by the wayside in order for the houses to focus on essence beliefs.  I would like you to speak to members of each house about their essence beliefs and theorize why the traditional belief system no longer seems to apply to this era of the City.','2016-06-06 18:26:50','2016-05-17 19:32:37'),(10009,10360,9,1,'Free Action - Learn','Freely moving throughout the Dream is one of the most important abilities you will ever learn but goes much further than just being able to move around. Observe other dreamers and their interactions with each other. Focus on whether their interactions seem to be linked to any particular affiliation -- whether it be focus, House, belief, or something else. Do you feel they have paralyzed themselves by their affiliations or do they move freely? Bring the names and observations to the report.','2016-06-06 21:45:16','2016-03-31 20:46:40'),(10027,11014,25,20,'Reweave to 20','Be more social and as you are learn the beleifs of the three houses that are open now. You don\'t have to join any of them but its nice to know your options in the new dream.  You can include the other groups around the deram if you like.','2016-06-06 22:28:08','2016-06-04 16:47:46'),(10746,10027,22,40,'Forge 40','I would like you to look into our city\'s item history for something to reforge or recreate and then make it a reality.  Involve those with Forge and those without.','2016-06-06 23:04:17','2016-04-22 01:50:34'),(10009,10050,139,40,'SenseDatoken-40','Catalog a good route for collapsing Shamblixes as a team. In your journey, collapse three DIFFERENT Shamblixes by yourself. You may trap, if able, but you cannot use other tricks. You are the only one allowed to do damage to the Shamblix. Seek me out after ten real attempts if you are unable to do so. Keep track of the rooms and strategy used.','2016-06-06 23:42:16','2016-05-25 22:18:41'),(10916,10950,46,1,'Recall - Learn','Spread some reminders around the city about keeping recall active at all times when going outside of a sanctuary.  Also have a notice put up on the boards in the house.  These dangerous times we need all the reminders we can get.  ','2016-06-06 23:58:13','2016-06-05 23:51:14'),(10746,10916,17,10,'IDCurse ~ 10','Look at the \'curses\' that plagued you in the past and determine if they still affect you now.  What new \'curses\' do you see being laid upon you in this new City?','2016-06-07 00:23:29','2016-03-14 03:17:26'),(10746,10062,139,20,'Sense Datoke ~ 20','I would like you to look at each of the types of mares (lesser, Datoke (day) and Kotoke (dark)) and draw up a comprehensive list of their similarities and differences especially in battle in preparation for the impending invasion.','2016-06-07 00:41:58','2016-04-27 03:37:39'),(10746,10108,22,20,'Forge ~ 20','I would like you to show me your ideal self within the City.  Step two, journey to the Forge in the Pits and show me how you see it.','2016-06-07 01:20:09','2016-05-17 04:31:20'),(10988,10025,52,40,'poppygirl | 40 Trai','(Akkadian wrote it for LS) Since you have been away for a stretch of time, I wish for you to do a little dictation. I require all the arts that one may learn from zero orbit to orbit fourty nine. Please include, focus, cost, orbit learned, Major or minor art, and if the are is an offensive or protective art. If there is anything else you wish to add then please feel free. You may inscribe codex and hand them in or come up with our own way when you report. Employ the aide of anyone that you need. ','2016-06-07 02:27:51','2016-06-07 02:27:43'),(10066,10950,24,20,'Restore 20','Put the tips and tactics of Restore you learned previously to use during a skirmish or while someone is hunting. Get practice on becoming an effective restorer. Explain any pertinent details you discover along the way on how to achieve ths.','2016-06-07 03:56:28','2016-06-04 21:24:55'),(10593,10916,28,1,'Burgle!','You have a lovely sense of humor, I\'ve seen and heard it. Abjure takes! Now you are going to burgle your friends! Just take something form them..example..Clarity\'s cake! my paints! etc.. they will need to bargain with you if they want their stuff back! Have fun! I can\'t wait to hear who and what!  ~C','2016-06-07 04:43:42','2016-06-05 19:29:42'),(10593,10987,74,30,'Amnesia?','Are there things that you wish you could erase from your mind forever? You tell me yours, I\'ll tell you mine. Talk to a few dreamers, ask them what they would erase from their memories if they could. Lastly, tell me about something in the City that you really arent too fond of that you wish you could erase! All answers to my quests are always confidential.  ~C','2016-06-07 05:33:57','2016-05-31 22:37:07'),(10027,10067,139,50,'Sense Dat 50 - Tam','Sense Datoken was meant to detect Darkmares, not Datoken.  Though sensing Datoken is very useful, I want you to try and fix the art.  Form your theory on how to at least add Darkmares onto its detectable list, and make at least one attempt at makign the change.  Perhaps this would make a useful project for the house?  Report your process and results.','2016-06-07 09:06:47','2016-05-14 07:36:12'),(10027,10067,139,50,'sense datoken 50','honoring a quest doen by arnaya','2016-06-07 09:06:47','2016-06-07 09:05:24'),(10746,10232,100,1,'PT ~ L','I am curious as to why Lyran Forge was altered to include Power Tokens, is this the case for Idoaclesian Forge as well?  Why do you think the art was changed in this way.  Dazzle me with a complete theory.','2016-06-07 17:57:41','2016-06-06 16:34:35'),(10916,10360,29,1,'Poison - Learn','The art has changed in the recent time of the city.  Find out what you can about what changed and how it happened.  Also just get some basics on the art (nothing too crazy we will discuss it when you report).  Think about how you personally would have changed the art.  What would it do and what impact could it have had on the city?  I am looking forward to the report.  Good Luck\r\n','2016-06-07 21:39:39','2016-05-19 21:44:35'),(10746,10915,22,1,'Forge ~ Part 2','Each Forger is encouraged to find their niche, items that they work to continually perfect.  I would like you to speak to some of the other forgers within the City and discover how they found their personal niches.  Do they feel it limits them? Do you think yours will limit you?  Attempt to discover your own niche.  Also develop a signature for your creations.','2016-06-07 23:41:50','2016-05-31 03:07:03'),(10593,10950,27,1,'Give it up!','ok so...Drainself, we give our focus energies to others..at cost to ourselves. Ask random others what they would be willing to give up in order to accomplish their goals. Secondly...for fun.. give some people some unusual objects..just to see their reactions! Have fun ~C','2016-06-07 23:51:36','2016-06-01 01:00:39'),(10593,10916,35,1,'Perception','You have become quite an accomplished artist. I would love for you to  paint me a triptych depicting  \"Trap\", \"Trapped\" or \"Trapping\" it is up to you how you interperet this onto canvas. Very much looking forward to it.  ~C','2016-06-08 00:30:31','2016-06-07 06:16:18'),(10027,10025,107,1,'pa to learn','assisted voxaroth with a mornign of trappign and beyond','2016-06-08 01:35:51','2016-06-08 01:35:34'),(10311,10915,80,1,'HypWeaveL-Magnum','Gather a few different materials and weave them together into something that may help the house or yourself from Zaxun and his armys attacks. It can be something very simple like a blade, or something more complicated if you choose (Some way to protect the house, or something you can do to your crest or avatar? A shield?) When you have attempted to create your item whether you fail or succeed report to me your results.\r\n','2016-06-08 01:48:12','2016-06-05 01:22:49'),(10238,10950,60,1,'Quest: WishBringer','For work towards the Zaxun and your involvement in the proceeding thus far - continue this work into your 3rd sphere.\r\n','2016-06-08 02:46:45','2016-06-08 02:46:35'),(10238,10950,60,3,'Quest: WishBringer','Wrong quest item granted - this is for the Sphere 3 work,\r\n','2016-06-08 02:48:02','2016-06-08 02:47:56'),(10880,10067,23,60,'Recharge60Tam','Your house seems quiet. Recharge it. Make it productive again.','2016-06-08 03:14:58','2016-04-19 00:43:28'),(10880,10068,30,20,'Antidotin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-06-08 03:39:24','2016-06-08 03:38:46'),(10880,10068,29,20,'Poisonin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-06-08 03:39:34','2016-06-08 03:38:27'),(10880,10068,73,10,'Destroyin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-06-08 03:39:43','2016-06-08 03:37:15'),(10880,10068,144,10,'Dwellin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-06-08 03:41:49','2016-06-08 03:41:37'),(10880,10068,74,20,'Mind Erasin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-06-08 03:42:03','2016-06-08 03:38:04'),(10880,10068,25,30,'Reweavin\' Druce','Honored bundled task. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-06-08 03:42:17','2016-06-08 03:39:12'),(10880,10107,144,50,'Chaos Well 50 - Off','In an effort to increase the capacity beyond the scope of normal plateaus, attempt to combine two Chaos Wells by attempting to mirror the process Seers use. What was the result? How else would you attempt to increase the capacity? Additionally, the knowledge of the individual components of Chaos Well has been lost as the creators no longer dream. Attempt to remedy this lost information for the public scrolls.','2016-06-08 03:54:39','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10880,10888,31,10,'Curse to 10','As per our discussion on the work that you have already done with the art, I wish for you to make an educated guess of how many evokes it will take for you to raise your Know from 3 to 9. Write the number down after confering with your notes and use this charm to be cursed. Report anything that happens. Discoveries are the best form of learning. **A**','2016-06-08 04:15:40','2016-05-17 06:32:29'),(10107,10746,60,6,'Sphere Addendum','I want you to help with the development of the level 70 chakram by coordinating the attainment of 2 40\'s and 2 30\'s of each of the following Chakrams: Night Chalk, Abyss Chalk, Gold Chalk, and Sand Chalk.  Keep them in the DreamSeer Master\'s Lounge.  I would also like you to determine what Daska Jerikko\'\r\n','2016-06-08 05:01:50','2016-05-17 03:24:57'),(10313,10593,35,20,'Trap Nightmare -20','We have the ability to acquire the largest amount of strength of any dreamers in the city, but sometimes struggle to find uses for it.  I want you to be creative and devise a way that we might better use mass quantities of essence strength as a focus.  Talk with two fellow Soulmasters about it, and get their opinion.  We will discuss it further when you\'re ready to report.\r\n','2016-06-08 18:13:57','2016-05-26 02:00:49'),(10593,10360,24,30,'Quest: Fix It Up','Due to your dreaming time, I will give you something to work on at your leisure on your own. Much of the city seems to be in dis-repair. Go on a walk-bout and consider some things you feel need some work. How might they be improved in your opinion. Give me details on how, if you could.. you would fix some of these things. ','2016-06-08 18:45:49','2016-04-23 20:36:36'),(10593,10313,34,1,'Locked up','We all have our prisons, what\'s yours? I\'ll tell  you mine. Take a look around and tell me what you see, WHO or WHAT is imprisoned here, why are they? Why do you think they can\'t get out? How would YOU get them out.  ~C','2016-06-08 18:47:34','2016-05-25 19:57:23'),(10025,11014,46,1,'kendo recall lrn','l would like for you to speak with dreamers that have the art recall, learn from them everything you can about it, how it works, can it be evoked more than once?, can you evoke it on others? can you reset it while its stil active to another room?..besides battles and colapses, what purpose does this art have? when you feel you have completed this quest seek me out and we will talk further~P~','2016-06-08 23:29:51','2016-06-05 16:43:08'),(10027,10232,142,10,'Misdirect 10','Slight of hand can you be a magician in the Dream. Create a \"magic\" trick and impress your friends. How many you decide. Whatever will if be a trick with numbers or somehting they can see.','2016-06-09 18:06:59','2016-06-06 02:03:08'),(10232,10022,42,20,'Blade - Darkness 20','Survey the Outer Planes, and find for me the areas most affected by chaos leaks -- in what ways do these leaks manifest themselves? Show me rooms, names. Are these leaks related to one another in anway? Can we determine a root cause? Why or why not? Be prepared to discuss. Rewritten because original codex targetted Deeter by mistake.','2016-06-09 21:06:52','2016-06-09 21:06:45'),(10027,10025,144,1,'Pop-Chaos Well Lrn','As a now houseless Dreamer. I\'d like for you to very simply look at the bonuses of this art for us. In addiction, what could this ability do for the dream as a whole? Not just pack space, is there an economic reason for this art?','2016-06-09 22:52:55','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10746,99,1,'Combine to learn','A little bit of this and some of that create me five dream recipes to make for a summer picnic. The ingredients combined should bring some  thing fo the dream to mind a place ot event.  Get ready to make that pack lighter!','2016-06-09 23:17:11','2016-06-08 05:11:10'),(10311,10915,140,1,'TempestL-Magnum','Have a long talk, specifically with Em\'et if possible and learn as much as you can about the art itself..how much it costs, what happens when platted, that kinda thing. He has a real love for the art so just conversate about it a bit.  Also think a bit about how important that art may be in times like these. We will discuss when you report.\r\n','2016-06-09 23:57:40','2016-06-08 02:03:18'),(10066,10950,25,1,'Reweave Learn','Learn about the different stations within the house. What are each of them and how could Reweave fit in as a station?','2016-06-10 01:08:54','2016-06-08 01:20:04'),(10027,10025,98,20,'Newly 20 Poppy','We love new dreamers and made this art when dream was fuller, but the dream is emptier. why is it as important now as when we learned it?  Think about it and ask others @>-\'-,-- Rafaella','2016-06-10 02:15:57','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10025,10067,37,20,'Trail to 20','lets stroll down memory lane. for this plat i would like you to choose 3 dream changing events in your dreams that have defined who you are as a dreamer today. l look forward to hearing about the trails you have left upon the city. seek me when you feel you have completed this and we will have tea and chat~P~','2016-06-10 02:51:37','2016-06-08 02:51:03'),(10593,10750,35,1,'Gotcha!!','I have seen you be crafty, stealthy, amusing, frisky, grumpy, adorable.. use whatever wiles you may need to , to set the perfect TRAP! (Uthanatos not allowed to be  your subject! ) for anyone you choose except above ^^ ;) The trap can be anything you wish...to \"catch\" anything you wish. Have fun!!!','2016-06-10 05:11:10','2016-05-31 06:02:25'),(10480,10545,70,50,'FlameSear 50','Flames can inspire and cleanse and reignite. What drives your personal flame? How does it burn? There is also little difference in the power of your flame art and the level of chakram that you can use. Seek information on how and why others use their flames and reflect on how you will use your own. Give this task the work needed for the plateau that you seek. **A**','2016-06-10 06:00:20','2016-03-09 07:50:17'),(10232,10545,74,20,'Avayla - M Blank 20','You are a healing woman, you say. Consider then: How can we use the art of Mind Blank in healing someone, either physically or mentally? Does a blank mind ever help in healing of someone? Consult with at least two others whose opinions you respect. As you consider, search through the City for a room you find blanks your own mind; how does the room do this to you, and how can you use this to your advantage? Ensure a thorough report, and be prepared to discuss!','2016-06-10 06:22:04','2016-03-09 07:38:06'),(10313,10593,28,10,'Abjure 10','Identifying a flaw is hard enough, but stripping a person of that flaw is even harder.  Identify two \"flaws\" you see in your character that make you unhappy on a regular basis.  Then, identify a flaw in another, and call them out on it.  Does addressing them make any difference at all?  Are we doomed to repeat the same mistakes?\r\n','2016-06-10 19:32:17','2016-06-08 18:59:26'),(10951,10905,9,1,'Free Action (Learn)','Now that you understand the benefit of this Art, I want you to find me 2 people who have \"Free Actions\" in their dreams. Study these people. How are they Free? What do they do differently? Why do their actions seem so free...so effortless? Report on these two people when you feel you have the answer. ~Lacie~','2016-06-10 20:34:42','2016-05-22 20:14:24'),(10874,10009,81,20,'Quest: Nessa Tre','dsds','2016-06-10 22:49:51','2016-06-10 22:49:45'),(10874,10311,44,20,'Firestorm20FC','Let\'s be boring for a bit -- how long does it take to firestorm to collapse the lesser mares? Emphant, Bogrom, Agoknight.. at this level? I will save the Shamblix for later. That would take forever.','2016-06-10 23:27:49','2015-12-29 05:04:58'),(10022,10942,139,1,'Seveiron: SDatoken','To Learns are boring! But, I suppose everyone must start somewhere. I want you to devise two circumstances where Sense Datoken would be useful to you. Come up with them on your own or ask others how it is useful to them and then apply it to yourself. Also relay to me the art\'s basic information.','2016-06-11 02:14:10','2016-04-27 21:17:24'),(10746,10004,22,1,'Forge ~ L','I would like you to find inspiration within the planes of the City.  Choose from your favourites and create items from their raw elements that showcase their uniqueness.  Try and create a signature for yourself, so your work is recognizable.\r\n','2016-06-11 02:31:33','2016-06-08 18:04:47'),(10027,10408,5,10,'plat to ten','Gathering me a list of when the arts are learnable and what orbits. your quests from me ar going to be more specifily for you chosen path of teaching. We will be building our resources as befittign a teacher. Finding names of crators of sarts is a bonus.','2016-06-11 16:44:03','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10935,6,20,'Meditation to 20','Find me the quietest place in the dream. The one that holds the truest serenity to meditate on the ways of the dream and how they twist and chance. Create for  me an item or bit of writting to share the twists and turns you find. The you can take me there.','2016-06-11 17:29:55','2016-05-24 17:55:40'),(10232,11023,26,1,'Coraal - Purify','Purify is a powerful art, capable of... what? Find out. Find out what it combats, and the attributes of both of those arts. Which is the more powerful, do you think? Be prepared to discuss, and defend your opinions.','2016-06-11 17:35:46','2016-06-10 06:25:18'),(10108,10916,38,20,'Scare - Ail','With the current threat to us all, find or get someone to make a high charge RF charm and make sure that during an outdoor event or gathering of dreamers that each person is protected. Who made it (or where did you find it)? Think of two things that actually scare you, and tell me about one (which ever you\'re most comfortable sharing).','2016-06-12 06:05:54','2016-06-07 02:21:25'),(10027,10067,14,40,'Know 40','Let\'s all be i the know of the latests round of events and see if we can resolve any issues that are identified. I sense there is a some restless in the ranks fo the general is it psooible so quickl?','2016-06-12 07:27:46','2016-06-10 06:37:03'),(10027,10905,60,3,'Sphere third','The dream has always enjoyed her bards and I for one love a good stories or poems  So here is your challenge my friend. Create a story or set of poems about the deram as you see it. Share it with a few friends either in a group or one at a time. I look forward to hearing it too.','2016-06-12 19:11:36','2016-05-21 14:14:13'),(10951,11027,139,1,'Sense Datoken','When hunting or exploring the City, how will you Know if a Datoke is about, without this Art? There is a way, & this will also help you in other endeavors. It is an art you already possess. Your report will be what you learn as well as telling me a bit about yourself. ~Lacie~','2016-06-12 19:25:42','2016-06-11 17:16:54'),(10027,11027,69,1,'tranceflame learn','What other new things can you find to show me? Find me four. Show me the dream through your eyes. Find me an item that is like the flame art you seek. Hint there should be two. Who helped you?  We can talk of other things about your flame when you come to report.','2016-06-12 20:08:37','2016-06-11 21:17:50'),(10027,11014,60,3,'Third Sphere','Time to get on top of what is going on in teh dream. There are resources everywhere. In the next week or sooner if you find three events. See what the dreamers are up to; join them in their activities. What is the event about and how you think it will effect the dream.','2016-06-12 21:16:42','2016-06-06 22:33:48'),(10232,10958,51,50,'Woven Ruby-Locate50','Search throughout the Dream and find things for me! A flame with no boundaries, three ladies sighing, glittering gemstones: Rubies AND Sapphires side by side, with Opals not far away! A tree with no roots, and last of all: Clasped agreement with something given. \r\n\r\nWhat do these things have in common with each other? Remember: Simple is often best. ','2016-06-12 23:25:57','2016-04-30 20:50:59'),(10313,11023,47,1,'Push - Learn','Your first push into the city will be your most impactful.  Ask others to help you make a list of your Soulmaster Major arts.  Which of them seems the most interesting to you?  Which arts do you think will define you in the dreams to come?\r\n','2016-06-13 01:00:18','2016-06-10 00:46:00'),(10916,11023,70,1,'Flamesear - Learn','Learn the names and evoke colors of each focuses flame.  Then learn about what changes with a flame with plats and come up with your own reasons as to why it does that.  Lastly think about how you will use flame during your dreams, what did you come up with?  I look forward to your report, good luck.\r\n','2016-06-13 02:07:07','2016-06-10 01:40:24'),(10311,10373,47,1,'PushL-Willow','Push is the first of many arts you will learn, while this is an art everyone can learn there will be some that are going to be specific to your focus. Find out a few of the arts that only gatekeepers will learn, and what they do. Also ask around and find out what push does and how it can be used. \r\n','2016-06-13 02:21:45','2016-05-11 23:53:32'),(10916,10373,9,1,'Free Action - Learn','Whipping the mares can be fun but sometimes they can whip back just as hard.  What are some of the mares that will make you need to have Free Action if you wish to try and whip them good?  Also as a growing GK how do you feel the art will affect you personally as you grow?  Take some time and come back to me with your findings.  I look forward to it, good luck!\r\n','2016-06-13 02:58:35','2016-05-12 01:29:12'),(10027,10905,9,10,'FA 10 - Cadirand','Freedom is an amazing concept.  Its a bit harder to put into realistic application though.  I would like you to put some thought into whether True freedom (no rules of any sort, completely free to do whatever they want) is actually what people really want when they talk about being free.  Tell me your thoughts about this, and if you think that other dreamers realize what you\'ve concluded.','2016-06-13 06:27:55','2016-06-11 09:44:16'),(10027,10717,15,1,'Judge-Learn: Will','Judging others is easy... doing it accurately is a whole other issue.  I want you to take a look at some of your past judgements of other dreamers (or darkmares if you wish) and see if you feel the judgement you made before is still accurate.  Give me a couple of them, and let me know what your new judgement is if you find things have changed.','2016-06-13 06:58:20','2016-06-13 06:56:45'),(10746,10313,72,10,'Scribble ~ 10','There have been many histories of Inscribe shared throughout the City, let\'s add one more!  Imagine Inscribe has been lost and you are to rewrite its creation in order to bring it back into existence.  Place your story within the Archives.','2016-06-13 23:30:20','2016-06-10 17:48:26'),(10746,10313,22,30,'Forge ~ 30','Your identity has changed within the City.  As a first step, I would like you to Forge your current identity within the City and think about what items have influenced it.  Step two, journey to the Forge in the Pits and show it to me through your eyes.','2016-06-13 23:44:12','2016-05-21 01:27:05'),(10988,10136,50,10,'Shae: NMF 10','I have never seen the point of Nightmare Form... other than a playful thing. Therefore, be playful. Whenever you choose, you believe yourself to be an Emphant, you are to be this Emphant for one hour, give or take however long you can keep people interested. You are a prissy Emphant who likes bows and having her talons filed and painted and you also like treats. How many people can you get to spoil you in your Emphant form?','2016-06-14 03:06:29','2016-04-20 03:56:15'),(10988,10136,35,40,'Shae Trap 40','Set a trap.  Mare, Dreamer, Other, the choice is yours.  Involve at least 2 others.  Make it worthy of this plateau.','2016-06-14 03:11:44','2016-05-03 02:37:57'),(10480,10136,52,50,'Train50','As you move forth with your ability to Train, you need to ensure you are able to both task appropriately but also take criticism well. Write a minimum of five sample tasks for real dreamers for plateaus to 50. These should cover majors, minors, and dreamsoul arts. Take the tasks to several Teachers you respect to gather their opinions on them. Correct any tasks that need it prior to returning and be ready to detail the differences, if any, from the originals.','2016-06-14 03:24:35','2015-10-19 03:34:07'),(10480,10866,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Giving Quest back to LordMagmus. **A**','2016-06-14 03:45:55','2016-06-14 03:45:48'),(10480,10866,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting the support arts to LordMagmus\r\n','2016-06-14 03:47:03','2016-06-14 03:46:27'),(10480,10866,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','granting support arts to LordMagmus\r\n','2016-06-14 03:47:11','2016-06-14 03:46:56'),(10480,11014,27,1,'Drain Thy Self !','NOTE: Do NOT tell anyone where you got this quest! Why would I not want you to share this info? Cuz it\'s a SM main art! You must seek out an SM & learn the basics, then 3 uses for this Art. It is versitile, so different uses are preferable. How does it do so much with so little? Good Luck ~Lacie~','2016-06-14 04:35:45','2016-06-06 05:58:28'),(10050,10915,142,1,'MisdirectionL - 425','Work with the Light to think of a way to pull the wool over the eyes of Zaxun and really screw him over.','2016-06-14 04:50:29','2016-06-04 20:45:37'),(10480,10750,28,10,'Abjure to 10','Abjure has been a real asset to our focus on the battlefield.  It took us from the sanctuary to the front lines of combat.  I\'d like you to study the Cenotaph of Dread, and find strategic areas where you feel abjure would be most useful, and then walk me through these areas to explain how you would best utilize this art in combat.  Please include consideration of dark mares, datoke, and other dreamers.  How would you have members of the other focii work with you in COD when facing these enemies?','2016-06-14 05:15:31','2016-06-01 03:15:05'),(10027,10025,5,30,'random to 30','pass out zsa zsa call to recall in all the deramers you can and make it stick','2016-06-14 14:12:11','2016-06-06 23:43:37'),(10680,10866,46,1,'Recall','Please, let us get together soon and talk of old times and future plans.. ~S~','2016-06-14 19:07:18','2016-06-12 05:37:28'),(10988,10232,60,7,'Em\'et 7th Part II','Now that you\'ve discovered areas of the City that are weak or failing, fix this with the help of others. Work around the clock, if you must, to protect us all. Once the areas are clear of faults, imbue energies into adding descriptions that are best fitting to as many rooms as you find necessary. Use your FS ways to keep the dreamers working with you happy and rewarded along the way.','2016-06-14 21:45:43','2016-04-30 02:38:05'),(10022,10915,22,10,'Magnum: Forge 10','I require three samples of that which you can forge. You are to make these three samples but you do not bring them to me straight away. You are to take them to three others. DreamSmiths would be best. Dreiko for instance. You shall ask for their impressions of that which you created. Once you have these opinions apply them to your work and bring your finished products to me, at which time we will discuss what you have wrought.\r\n','2016-06-15 01:08:40','2016-06-09 03:42:07'),(10951,11023,60,1,'1st - Maren 101','To learn Maren, you 1st must have a dictionary. There is one in the Archives which will aid you. Study this guide & when comfortable, return to me & I will be the \"Mare\". We will have a conversation. Nothing compicated, just a basic starter talk between you & a DarkMare! Good Luck & if you get stuck or frustrated, come see me. ~Lacie~','2016-06-15 02:28:21','2016-06-13 02:57:30'),(10027,11027,98,1,'Nwly Awakened Learn','So consider what\'s important for a new dreamer to know. Are there any warnings you would give them? What does you insight say they should know?  Find the names of the teachers for Dreamseers. What items can a seer use?','2016-06-15 04:40:48','2016-06-12 20:15:45'),(10951,11027,47,1,'Such Pushiness!','After asking 2 or 3 people what different ways the Art of Push may be used, I would like you to consider what you might rename this Art. I detest the name! Think of a more appropriate one! Lastly, I want you to Push yourself out to the farthest reaches of a Plane of your choice. How far do you go? What do you find? Why was it difficult? Why Push yourself? Good Luck!! ~Lacie~','2016-06-15 06:07:40','2016-06-12 19:34:26'),(10916,10593,105,1,'PC - Learn','First learn some of the boring stuff! (numbers, what happens with plat...you know, fun!)  Second continue doing service to the home in ways you see fit.  One last thing, take some time and think about how your dream has changed already since being in the house.  then lets talk about it.  I am interested!\r\n','2016-06-15 06:32:51','2016-05-27 21:24:22'),(10022,10069,6,10,'Blackthunder: Med10','Meditate on the struggles you find within your Dream. Consider your deepest fears and worries that weigh you down. Think about them as if they were affecting someone else. If you could give advice to that \'other person\', what would that advice be? How would you help? Would this advice help you? ~.|\r\n','2016-06-15 06:37:08','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10067,89,50,'Soul Shield to 50','Bring me the beleifs of these new keepers i hear there  are two sets sorsha nad lace and maybe three your dark friend. The are loosing followers already with laces duplicity. I wish to knowwhat they ar about. Sort it out for me please','2016-06-15 06:37:12','2016-06-12 07:55:27'),(10480,10079,48,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring as per her BUndle to learn task **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:22:15','2016-06-15 07:21:45'),(10480,10079,139,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring as per her Bundle to Learn task **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:22:21','2016-06-15 07:22:08'),(10480,10079,16,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring as part of Silinas Bundle to learn tasks. **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:22:32','2016-06-15 07:20:58'),(10480,10069,27,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring a Learnables to 20 Bundle **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:45:55','2016-06-15 07:42:39'),(10480,10069,40,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring a learnables to 20 bundle **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:46:05','2016-06-15 07:44:53'),(10480,10069,9,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring a learnables to 20 bundle. **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:46:24','2016-06-15 07:45:15'),(10480,10069,72,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring a Learnables to 20 bundle **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:47:02','2016-06-15 07:43:00'),(10480,10069,98,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring a learnables to 20 bundle. **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:47:18','2016-06-15 07:43:20'),(10480,10069,46,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring a learnables to 20 bundle. **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:47:42','2016-06-15 07:45:41'),(10480,10069,139,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring a learnables to 20 bundle **A**\r\n','2016-06-15 07:48:10','2016-06-15 07:44:24'),(10480,10022,44,60,'Firestorm 60 ','Work with a group of dreamers to create a device capable of capturing a firestorm from a more powerful being!  Once the device is created, put it to use.  Attempt to deploy it and capture the being\'s firestorm and take the knowledge for yourself.','2016-06-15 08:01:23','2016-02-16 03:45:50'),(10866,10680,139,1,'Quest: SD','Long ago this art was created to give dreamers a means to track down the threats of datoken. Given the time that has elapsed, do you still think this art still has a use within the dream? Are datoken as rampant as they once was? What are, if any, the known datoken that exist or have they seemingly vanished? Ask around and discuss with me when ready. ','2016-06-15 20:23:03','2016-06-14 23:09:57'),(10027,10232,142,20,'Misdirection 20','This direction that direction whichever will we choose. Lucidity has always been a beacon a light for me adding clarity to things and light to shadows. What do you see as the future of some of these choices we are being barraged with. Share your thoughts in a story to be shared as you wish.','2016-06-15 22:39:59','2016-06-09 19:30:05'),(10951,10155,26,1,'Purify - To Learn','Delicately shaded, this art washes us clean of curse. Examine the evoke, the art, and find the place in the Dream that best embodies Purify. Take me there, explain your choice, and see if you can determine a reason for the evoke to have the colors it does.','2016-06-16 00:06:41','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10108,10950,6,10,'Meditation 10','Everyone in the city has one particular place that they most enjoy. Sometimes it\'s a gen, sometimes it\'s a favored hunting ground, and sometimes it\'s just a quiet spot to think. Is there any place in the city you enjoy the most, out of everywhere? Take some time and search around, with a buddy if you\'d like, and find your own, personal zen place. Tell me about it.\r\n','2016-06-16 01:15:17','2016-06-07 02:27:26'),(10066,10950,7,1,'Resist Fear Learn','Speak with your peers and gather their opinions on the new nightmares. Learn about them, then form an opinion on how to best dispell the fear that these new nightmares may bring to dreamers.','2016-06-16 02:19:28','2016-06-13 00:19:28'),(10027,10025,107,10,'Peace Aura to 10','You have a keen eye and experience in matters of a house. PLease use the and finds three things we can do as if stands now to improve our home.','2016-06-16 18:55:05','2016-06-09 21:55:08'),(10951,10866,144,1,'Deep Well !!!','After learning the basics of this Art, discern how many essences it takes to do the basic house functions. This will prepare you for leadership. How much strength does it take to: initiate, create power tokens, guardians, ruler, etc. Then tally up how many essences we have stored currently.','2016-06-16 21:24:41','2016-06-14 18:14:17'),(10593,10950,3,20,'Soul Stirring','I suppose as Soulmasters, we give a lot of ourselves...if you dont count poison. heh. At any rate!, I would love for you, oh favorite student of mine, to write something that comes from the depths of your very soul. The topic and genre is up to you. ~C','2016-06-17 01:23:35','2016-06-10 01:38:29'),(10313,10916,28,10,'Abjure 10','Abjure is one of our greatest arts, but can act as a double edged sword.  List two situations where having abjure affects us negatively, and propose a solution for each.  Locate a dreamer who has a problem of their own, and abjure them of it, for better or worse.  \r\n','2016-06-17 01:41:03','2016-06-14 20:55:29'),(10108,10916,46,20,'Recall 20','I\'d like for you to take some time to recall a few good memories of your time here previously. Then, recall a few city shaking bad ones. Then! Then find your most favorite spot in the city that you\'re willing to share, invite a few friends, nothing major or unsafe, and tell a story based around it and the memories you hold for it.','2016-06-17 02:28:33','2016-06-12 06:40:12'),(10018,10104,22,1,'L: Forge Pt 3','Create four items with inscribe, while keeping each focus and their natural element in mind. Implement each of your primary colors and pair them to their correct focus piece. Present them to four different forgers (preferably one of each focus, but not a requirement). What were their opinions? DId you manage to capture their element in item form?','2016-06-17 03:17:17','2016-06-02 22:21:31'),(10746,10916,22,1,'Forge ~ Part 2','Each Forger is encouraged to find their niche, items that they work to continually perfect.  I would like you to speak to some of the other forgers within the City and discover how they found their personal niches.  Do they feel it limits them? Do you think yours will limit you?  Attempt to discover your own niche.','2016-06-17 04:21:42','2016-06-14 04:53:58'),(10232,11028,72,1,'Anasina - Inscribe','Search throughout the City, and find something worth writing on, and something worth writing about. What can you write on (ASIDE FROM YOUR ARM) that seems worth of the writing? Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-06-17 08:20:34','2016-06-13 05:54:42'),(10951,10038,46,10,'Recall (10)','Since we have a threat of DreamStrike, I need you to explore the 8 Planes. In each, I want you to locate at least 1 sanctuary for each plane (more = better, but not required). Your report will be the list of sanctuaries you discovered, along with any comments you may have. Good Luck! ~Lacie~','2016-06-17 19:46:01','2016-06-16 01:41:44'),(10067,10025,46,30,'Recall 30','Time for some fun. I want you to recall four dreamers that you miss dearly and wish you could speak to one more time. What would you say? How would you react? Also, recall three places in the City where you have always felt safe and comfortable. We\'ll have some tea and chat when you are ready.  <T>','2016-06-18 03:39:44','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10746,10750,22,1,'Forge ~ L','I would like you to begin with a dreamer that you know well and describe how you would use them as inspiration for an item.  Create this using Inscribe.  Then I would like you to find a dreamer you know less well and try the same technique.  Did it work?  Walk me through your process.','2016-06-18 04:39:42','2016-06-17 05:09:55'),(10027,10079,60,2,'second sphere','Interviews she passed for the sphere It is my opinion she is ready fro this sphere Lady Silver','2016-06-18 05:48:25','2016-06-18 05:47:45'),(10018,10095,144,1,'L: Chaos Well','Take this Chaos Well and fill it. I want you to avoid places with mares you cannot defeat on your own for the time being, and collapse every other one you encounter until this task is complete. Return it to me.','2016-06-18 06:14:25','2016-06-12 04:53:46'),(10027,10025,74,40,'MindBlank 40','You are going  to be promoted  to the Provost (Guardian) of the Acedemic Path of the University. Think about what kinds of things we can teach; what subjects for classes and who might teach them in house or out. Generate me a list of 20 at least. then we can go tot he next step','2016-06-18 19:38:12','2016-06-16 19:05:39'),(10007,11020,60,1,'First Sphere','Talked with Malarky about the basics of the city. He knows talisman really well and can even down agos already. I feel he has a good grasp on the City and deserves his first sphere.','2016-06-18 20:16:41','2016-06-18 19:41:09'),(10027,10079,107,1,'Peace Aura L','Your aissistance makes us all rlearn test train under 25','2016-06-18 22:34:43','2016-06-18 22:34:30'),(10027,10069,107,1,'Peace aura to l','Tell me what you would like to see at the house and thank you for yrou personal reaserch int the revenants','2016-06-18 22:54:19','2016-06-18 22:49:43'),(10022,10915,80,10,'Magnum: Hypno 10','Accidently wrote the original task under LordMagmus. Find it there.\r\n','2016-06-19 01:56:48','2016-06-19 01:56:39'),(10067,10025,144,10,'Chaos Well 10','Chaos Wells are amazing. There are many things you can do with them besides feeding a prime. Find out two interesting facts about them and share them with me. <T>','2016-06-19 09:19:27','2016-06-18 04:17:02'),(10916,11020,70,1,'Flamesear - Learn','Flamesear, the name itself sounds strange for a foci that supposedly are healers.  Why would we be given flame at all and how does that relate to our focus?  How do you see flame affecting your own dreams?  Finally learn what about what happens with flame as you plataue it.\r\n','2016-06-19 16:18:32','2016-06-18 17:10:51'),(10007,11014,3,30,'SM 30','Since my absence, the City has lost a wonderful SM, Kahain. I would like for you to get his story. Get to know him through the others that knew him. I would like a well thought out report on my friend/student till his last appearance. Ask around, take down names, and get as much as you can and for a 3rd plat of our focus, I expect enough to make it worthy of the plat.','2016-06-19 19:53:02','2016-06-17 16:12:18'),(10007,11020,26,1,'Purify - Learn','Take the Corrupted Rose and purify it. This can be done in many ways, but I am looking for something unique. Get someone to help you and bring back a detailed report how it was done. I am looking for great effort.','2016-06-19 20:04:48','2016-06-18 19:29:47'),(10027,11014,74,1,'MB: Learn - Kendo','Mind Blank, so many jokes and bad story plotlines can be drawn from that arts name.  I would like you to come up with an idea for one.  It doesn\'t have to be a full script, just a good (read really bad) plot synopsis and cast.  Which dreamer would you cast in what role?  Make sure it has at least a cast of 3 or 4, but otherwise... go as grand or cheesy as you\'d like.','2016-06-20 00:29:56','2016-06-13 07:27:11'),(10027,10746,2,60,'Dreamseer 60','The Guild needs more support. Remind every seer you see in any forumns of event to come to the Guild Meetings. They are every tuesday at 830 in provenenee. Come up with some ideas on how to make them more enticing to attend and we can impliment them.','2016-06-20 00:51:46','2016-06-09 23:30:39'),(10018,10987,22,1,'L: Forge | Final','For your final part, I want you to consider all you have learned from the forgers you have spoken to during this quest. With that, create something that represents Willpower and the GateKeeper focus, in your eyes. I wish to see something unique. Show me what you can do!','2016-06-20 07:05:12','2016-06-12 09:34:00'),(10027,10937,16,1,'Identify to learn','If you could use this art to Identify on anything what would you want it to tell you? This is an insight art and seers aret the only insghtful ones I beleive your insight will carry you far. WHn i say anyhtign the dream is yoru limit.','2016-06-20 09:57:11','2016-04-12 19:43:23'),(10951,10845,69,1,'Flame Burns!','Tell me in your own way how the Flames in the City are like the Flame which will flow from your hand. Ask others if you need to, but I want your ideas most of all. Also, learn how our Flame grows with plateau. Good Luck & welcome to your City of Dreams! ~Laci`~','2016-06-20 21:10:26','2016-06-19 21:46:53'),(10007,11020,67,10,'Blade 10','Everyone has a blade here in the City, but they are all different. We all have different stories on where it came from. Give me your blades story. Don\'t forget the way it looks and where you feel it came from or what it is made from.','2016-06-21 05:40:28','2016-06-19 20:36:45'),(10027,10232,46,50,'recall 50','this is honored for a report heard written by arlyana','2016-06-21 06:04:47','2016-06-21 06:03:50'),(10027,10232,46,50,'Recall 50 - Em\'et','Recall for me an early history from your city.  Something that others seem to have forgotten, and recount it in detail.  Can you draw any parallels to recent events in this city?  Are there any lessons in that history that would be well remembered for current events?  Check around with some of the other Idoaclesians and confirm your information if possible.  Put the history up in the Archives for the entire city to view.  Up to you if you want to put any of it in the Library as well.\r\n','2016-06-21 06:04:47','2016-06-15 22:16:43'),(10007,11014,67,30,'Blade 30','I want you to create your own sword. I want to have complete details on what it looks like and why it looks the way it does. What materials did you use and from where, what sort of preparations did you have? I want all the details. ','2016-06-21 06:43:16','2016-06-20 17:03:44'),(10746,11020,47,1,'Push ~ Learn','I would like you to embrace your creative side in this task. Find some portals that are currently locked to you and push your mind through them.  Describe for me what you see, feel and sense on the other side.  There is no right or wrong, you create the answer.','2016-06-21 19:56:48','2016-06-19 18:31:54'),(10874,10313,52,30,'Train 30 vox ','this is for malik','2016-06-22 00:03:09','2016-06-22 00:03:00'),(10874,10916,102,10,'Quest 10 - Aileron','Present three major plateau tasks to 10 to four teachers you respect. Record their critiques and attempt to rectify the task on the spot. Let me know your experiences with it, and prepare to do the same with me, or the Elder who honors this plateau.','2016-06-22 00:36:09','2016-05-21 04:39:53'),(10874,10915,82,1,'terror learn Mag','Arnaya wrote it, Deeter approved it.','2016-06-22 00:44:59','2016-06-22 00:44:53'),(10874,10068,30,30,'Anti30-druce','this is for a completed bundle task','2016-06-22 00:49:53','2016-06-22 00:45:48'),(10874,10068,73,20,'DT20-druce','bundle task!','2016-06-22 00:50:06','2016-06-22 00:48:14'),(10874,10068,74,30,'MB20-druce','bundle task report','2016-06-22 00:50:36','2016-06-22 00:46:17'),(10874,10068,29,30,'Druce Poison30','Bundle task report','2016-06-22 00:51:01','2016-06-22 00:43:04'),(10874,10068,144,20,'CWell20-druce','bundle task','2016-06-22 00:51:41','2016-06-22 00:47:34'),(10874,10022,80,30,'weave blade','this is because the writer of the task tasked it accidentally for thunderman','2016-06-22 01:16:34','2016-06-22 01:16:16'),(10916,10950,29,1,'Poison - Learn','Poison is a very painful art, yet SoulMasters get it?  Consider why this is and come up with your own validation for why SMs should have such an art.  Then consider the uses of poison and tell me a few things you will find it good for (be it in combat or out)\r\n','2016-06-22 01:31:00','2016-06-16 01:33:45'),(10022,10066,60,7,'Tman: Sphere','Sphering Thunderman, which means I have to pick up the pace so people do not catch up to me!','2016-06-22 01:39:22','2016-06-22 01:39:15'),(10007,11020,3,10,'SM 10','Go exploring, it can be anywhere in the City. Find me a room that you feel Resilience, WillPower, Lucidity, Insight, and Dreamsoul when you enter it. I want the details of the rooms and why you feel this specific elemental connection.','2016-06-22 04:15:13','2016-06-21 06:25:37'),(10746,10593,22,1,'Forge ~ L','I would like you to think of ways that Forge could be used to inspire others to follow the same path you walk. Create some examples and show them to others.  What feedback did you receive and do you agree with it?','2016-06-22 04:57:27','2016-05-22 22:32:51'),(10593,11014,70,30,'Too HOT!!!','some tasks can get boring, I like to spice things up a bit!! (pun intended...flame! hot! har!! )  I would love to see the creative side of you...create for me at least 3 items that are HOT!! Could be...a bikini...a spicy lunch! a branding iron! you get the idea..of course now try NOT to use those examples, although food is limitless! HAve fun! ~ C','2016-06-22 05:28:46','2016-06-19 22:39:42'),(10027,11014,9,1,'Free Action learn','What in the dream is truly free? Seek out the freeest place. Action and reacion you have seen many since your return. Have any been useful? What would you share with outs about what you ahve learned if anything?','2016-06-22 19:30:18','2016-06-16 04:24:54'),(10951,11023,26,10,'Order of the Moon','To Plat Purify to 10, I want you to study the Order of the Moon section in the Book of Val\'des, in preparation for your ascension to its leader. Your Purified report will be to explain it to your best ability & get any questions answered to your satisfaction. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-06-23 01:17:14','2016-06-21 20:06:35'),(10025,10213,144,1,'chaos well lrn.','tthere are some interesting things about this art. i want you to speak to other dreamers and learn all the details and tricks of it. Also this art can be so much more than just a essence vessel to be placed in a prime, what are some of them?','2016-06-23 01:39:48','2016-06-22 03:39:42'),(10007,11023,24,1,'Restore - Learn','This art can be very dangerous to those that are against you and those you care about. Lacey seems to need lots of help and with her being your Mistress, I want you to come up with some goals that will help her. I want some well thought out plans/goals on how you can help keep her safe using your soulmasterish ways. Come up with at least 4 good ways. Ask around and even talk with Lace about it. Give me details.','2016-06-23 02:07:57','2016-06-18 19:14:23'),(10022,10039,24,20,'Restore 20','Restore your place within the city. Spend at least four dreams finding your place again. What path will you take this time? New city, new beginnings. Find a few places in the city that you enjoy and tell me why.  What did you miss, is it still here? Is it the same?','2016-06-23 03:23:39','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10022,10888,24,30,'Uth: Restore 30','You have lost your marbles, where you lost them or how I do not know, they were yours and you lost them... for shame! Have some people help you find these marbles, while they are gone you are some times afflicted by a feeble mind... you really need those marbles back.','2016-06-23 03:56:41','2016-06-07 08:39:21'),(10951,11014,16,1,'What\'s That???','After knowing basics, etc. Have some fun with this! I know I have encountered several different people. How many can you find in a dream or 3? Old, young, new, returning. How do you Identify these beings without the Art? Asking is 1 thing, but your senses need honing as well. Your report is your list of interesting creatures/people that are out & about these dreams! Good Luck & get creative with this! ~Lacie~','2016-06-23 23:37:02','2016-06-21 00:57:12'),(10951,11038,47,1,'Push Thyself','This Art of Push has extreme value against those who might do you harm. Find out what this value is by speaking to others. Most know this value. Then, wander the planes, there are 8, choosing the 1 you like the best. Push yourself to find a new land to enjoy your dreams on. Which do you choose & why, will complete your report. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-06-24 05:41:08','2016-06-24 00:58:44'),(10007,11014,29,1,'Poison - Learn','A while back a few SM\'s managed to get Poison changed to where it finally made an impact in battles. Find the history by asking around. See who lead this big change and what was done. One more thing, as someone that is not an SM how much it has changed!','2016-06-24 05:42:58','2016-06-23 09:07:43'),(10066,10950,16,1,'Identify Learn','How do you believe being able to identify talismen will change your perception of them? Do you feel you will treat each talisman you encounter now with more attention? Ask your peers and also decide for yourself on what may happen if we gave each other just a little bit more attention?','2016-06-25 00:27:45','2016-06-21 04:42:16'),(10108,10950,9,1,'Free Action - Learn','Your new job title is granted! You are Calenture\'s Lady of Arts! Make sure everyone you come across is arted. Do this by hitting them with the Wiggle Stick provided, and if you catch them with out FA on, loudly anounce that you are the Lady of Arts and they failed their test! Or, make something equally as silly up. Have fun with it! ','2016-06-25 01:04:28','2016-06-16 01:34:26'),(10746,10066,21,20,'Blend ~ 20','You have Blended two opposing foci together.  How do reconcile these differences within yourself?  How do you see reconciling the differences of the other foci when you add them to yourself?','2016-06-25 01:10:56','2016-06-01 04:19:54'),(10916,10888,105,1,'PC - Learn','Poison Cloud needs a PT in order to work.  Come up with a way that PTs could possibly be used in the defense against Zaxun\'s mace and the art of dreamstrike.  (just a theory is fine). I look forward to hearing what you come up with.\r\n','2016-06-25 03:04:30','2016-06-24 05:05:24'),(10746,10915,22,20,'Forge ~ 20 (2)','Emotions have been running high within our fair city for some time.  How can we channel such intangible things as emotions into items?  Provide some examples and share them with others. Take note of their comments, but do not change your designs.','2016-06-25 05:09:33','2016-06-23 02:52:26'),(10007,11014,30,1,'Antidote - Learn','I want you to find plants and herbs around the city and make your own antidote. All of them must have a specific purpose. I want to know what they do, where they came from, and what properties are being used. I know most antidotes take at least 4 or more ingredients. Bring me samples and the final concoction.','2016-06-25 08:12:31','2016-06-24 05:51:27'),(10593,10750,35,10,'Mural','As discussed, add something amazing and uniquely Arnyish to the giant canvas that will be laid out in the Dueling Arena. If you wouldn\'t mind, a small identical canvas for me to keep. Many thanks! ~c','2016-06-25 21:14:10','2016-06-23 22:01:46'),(10027,10213,23,1,'Recharge learn','Seek out the maximum numbers for recharge as its always a numbers game. Find a game of numbers to paly with four dreamers What was the game and who played.','2016-06-25 22:08:36','2016-06-23 04:00:59'),(10916,11037,47,1,'Push - Learn','Learn what you can about the conflict going on in the city right now.  How does this news impact you as a newly awakened?  Also how do you feel you see your place in the city taking shape?  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-06-26 01:16:41','2016-06-25 02:36:04'),(10007,10593,35,30,'Trap 30','I love your paintings shown on the open scroll, I know your talent. Lets see how others can paint though. Hold a gathering with a few people, have at least have 5 dreamers. Place a big piece of canvas up with many colored paints for them to use. Ask them to paint something that makes them feel \"trapped\". If they need help, be their teacher.','2016-06-26 04:30:08','2016-06-22 22:22:01'),(10746,10958,22,20,'Forge ~ 20','Find inspiration within the planes of the City.  Chose from your favourites and create items from their raw elements that showcase their uniqueness.  Place a little of yourself into each item, ask others if they can tell who made it.  Return with your items and findings.','2016-06-26 04:46:20','2016-05-27 22:12:46'),(10007,10038,24,10,'Restore 10','Find me 2 rooms that you would like to restore. I want the names and where they are. What would you change and why? I want a very detailed report. We may even go on a field trip!','2016-06-26 05:41:13','2016-06-20 04:54:18'),(10053,10038,18,10,'Quest - Kelos','For your plateau in Chamele, list 3 reasons why chamele does not allow you to use agressive arts while being chameled. Also, how is it possible for some nightmares to see thru your chamele. Kelos','2016-06-27 02:09:44','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10018,10987,7,30,'Resist Fear 30','Gleali and I have taken on a project to make a complete list of known maren words. I\'d like for you to help us in this endeavor, as it is crucial for us Keepers. Let\'s start by sorting the list alphabetically from dreamer to maren. Begin with A, B, & C on codex form.','2016-06-27 02:17:34','2016-06-25 20:29:25'),(10951,10038,16,20,'ID Us All! (20)','Identify & send me the following potential members. Add them to Locate & watch for them! Wishbringer, Sorsha, Dar\'canon,  Pericules, Tamarisk, Fangx, Braelynn, Lucille, Taureanh & Starlong. If others ask about the House, they need to be sent to me also. Our House beliefs will be in the Teacher Guild\'s Sanctuary. Let me know in 2 days what success you\'ve had. (6/23) ~Lacie~','2016-06-27 03:42:03','2016-06-23 17:23:44'),(10593,10950,26,10,'Perception','Purity is a matter of perception, what you think pure, I may not. Of our house members, think of something about each that you find \"pure\" example..I find Aileron\'s love and devotion to his house and family very pure. also include yourself, and me!  ~C','2016-06-27 04:36:59','2016-06-17 01:50:59'),(10593,10888,67,20,'Time out','I have seen and heard your creativity and am always looking forward to more. Things have been hectic lately, I see you and  Arnaya as both incredibly stressed. Sharpen your blade on the medium of  your choice, and carve a likeness of your beloved. It gives you alone time, and also something for you to have to keep her close, even when she is away.  ~C','2016-06-27 04:53:14','2016-06-26 06:16:22'),(10988,10951,142,1,'Purple Lace | MD 1','Figure out if Zaxun has any intention of helping you open Keepers, or if he\'s simply using you.','2016-06-27 05:58:41','2016-06-07 01:53:07'),(10480,10750,3,50,'Souly Arnaya','Mastery\' of yer focus be half-way complete at this cirtical juncture, yet yer smithing of conjectures may well be at a close accordin\' ta some. Consider yer currect self-mastery and publicly exhalt in witty prose a flashback of recent past and foreshadowing of yer dreams ta come. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-06-27 06:51:25','2016-06-08 04:46:02'),(10480,10007,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','After warning about abandoning apprentices, and given a timeline for work to be done...regranting the station to Dina. **A**\r\n','2016-06-27 06:53:20','2016-06-27 06:53:07'),(10480,10750,31,10,'Arnaya Curse','Curse up a storm every dream. Curse the dogs, curse the skies, curse whatever. Do this for at least two dreams. You can report this after the 9th. Use your imagination. None of this has to be true curse words. Create your own. Vent, let off steam, cool down. Tell me of the reactions to those around you, and play it all up. Create your own world. Go crazy. Is the integrity of your character still upstanding, or have others felt you were losing your mind? You can tell them after the 9th it was all for a task','2016-06-27 08:09:23','2016-05-08 04:15:30'),(10107,11037,69,1,'Tranceflame Invocat','Dreamseers are the focus of Air, whereas Fatesenders are the focus of fire. What is the element of the other two focii and what particular traits are \"typical\" of each focus.  There are also dreamers who have gained a second focus.  Find the name of one of these dreamers and tell me whether the two focii are compatible, or not.','2016-06-28 01:24:46','2016-06-25 02:57:33'),(10007,11037,60,1,'First Sphere','Spoke to Invocat about the basics of the city, such as talisman, nightmares, where he will be able to enter once sphered. He is ready to sphere.','2016-06-28 02:59:15','2016-06-28 02:37:02'),(10916,11037,139,1,'Sense Dat - Learn','Learn what you can about datoken (kinds, mannerisms, habits).  Talk to a few dreamers and get their impressions on what a datoke is and how their presence impacts the city as a whole.\r\n','2016-06-28 04:01:47','2016-06-26 01:24:42'),(10027,11014,26,20,'Purify 20: Kendo','For this purify to 20 quest, I have a special assigment for you.  I want you to put some thought into the potential uses of this art to purge the maren spawns of the Revenants.  Up to you if you want to test your theory as part of your report, but flesh out your theory regardless','2016-06-28 08:00:44','2016-06-20 06:21:15'),(10027,10092,142,10,'MD - 1st Mastery','Misdirection has existed for some time now with Redirection coming on the horizon. A few dreams ago the GK Guild entertained the idea of Redirection as a key GateKeeper art. Some think its more suitable for FateSenders.. others SoulMasters. As a tenured GateKeeper of the City - what are your thoughts? Should this come into fruitation or not?','2016-06-28 15:21:34','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10092,11041,68,1,'FlameShaft','There is a fire that consumes us all and drives us.  Tell me why this Art would be useful to you and how it works.  Then tell me what your fire is in the City and your drive to be here.','2016-06-28 19:00:30','2016-06-28 18:29:32'),(10022,10136,111,1,'Dazzle L - Shae','This could not be more timely. Attempt to search out the remaining members of the Order and persaude them to the Light, or Order of Light, or whatever. Success is not required, but a valiant effort is. Do what you do best.','2016-06-29 01:55:47','2016-05-25 04:02:05'),(10746,10915,8,20,'Prot ~ 20','FateSender arts, are by their nature, destructive.  How can you turn them into defensive arts?  I\'m not just talking in batlle, everydream sort of protection.  Come up with some scenarios for as many arts as you can.','2016-06-29 04:15:41','2016-06-26 04:19:17'),(10027,10376,46,1,'Recall learn','Try and find what the changes are from your city to this one. Places arts houses dreamers and good subjects to start with. What were yrou favorite things from your City? What can you recall?','2016-06-29 05:53:37','2016-06-28 07:52:21'),(10025,10360,15,1,'judgement','You have shown interest in holding a meeting or two during the daytime hours! that is wonderful. i would like you to get together with the head of the university~Lady Silver~ and talk over what your ideas are, she will handle nacking a note up in the courtyard with the details. after your meeting seek me out and we can talk about how things went. get excited and have fun! ~P~','2016-06-29 20:43:19','2016-06-12 18:55:19'),(10027,11028,24,20,'Restore 20','Restore your basic knowledge of the dream. There are new arts to you and new places too. So many new faces and old friends. Three houses with differing beleifs. And new threats abound. Seeek out all these things in the next dream or two and we will comapre notes.','2016-06-30 02:33:11','2016-06-13 06:17:47'),(10874,10888,29,40,'Poison 40 - Uthy','Analyze how your own tongue can poison the City. Is it the way you say it or the words you use to say it that could be wrong? Analyze how much sway you have in the City and use that in a productive way against Zaxun.','2016-06-30 03:25:03','2016-06-06 04:21:58'),(10874,10746,14,40,'Know 30','As a new WordSmith, what can you do to make yourself known? Think of something you feel you are most knowledgeable about and share it with others in a way a WordSmith would.','2016-06-30 03:33:44','2016-05-14 00:50:56'),(10874,10746,14,40,'Know40','Avayala messed up and quested this to 30, rather than 40. AJ completed this task per Dreiko, and added an additional section on her own to make it up to par.','2016-06-30 03:33:44','2016-06-30 03:32:00'),(10874,10746,142,1,'MisdirectL-Arly','Arts with no sort of defense are among the most valuable that we can learn. Write up a short report on the uses of at least misdirection, but I would like to see some mention of other non-avoidable arts and how they can be used to our advantage and place it in the Notices and Edicts section of our public scrolls. Nothing fancy, just a PSA for folks to look at.','2016-06-30 03:44:45','2016-06-10 00:02:54'),(10874,10750,25,40,'Reweave 40 - Arnaya','If the shroud cannot be salvaged, what can we do to slow down or further prepare for the impending invasion? This is not a theory task, put something into action.','2016-06-30 04:07:52','2016-05-16 05:59:37'),(10874,10022,39,30,'Stagger to 30','This art is one of my favorites. It should be used more often than it is. I wish for you to find those that are negligent in their arts while out of safety areas. Also, compare Stagger to DreamQuake and share your results with me.  **A**','2016-06-30 04:26:19','2016-06-14 03:39:03'),(10027,10092,107,1,'peace aura to learn','for you serriveces tot he university','2016-07-01 00:54:40','2016-07-01 00:54:15'),(10027,10213,9,20,'FA 20: Vill','You have expressed a desire for Freedom from the bonds of holy... or unholy... maybe just perverse? bonds of carnal and otherwise romantic relationships in the city.  I want you to take some public steps to ensure your freedom on this front using your new \"Familiar\".  Let me know how people responded to this, and do you think they got the message?','2016-07-01 01:22:25','2016-06-28 19:22:49'),(10027,10092,144,50,'Chaos well 50','Welcome home basket for you. The key is you have to fill it find out whats new? What has changed? The houses would be good since all have changed but Calenture. Seek out an elder to see what\'s up with the teaching of things. Current events like the Vanguard and Templars and revenents. Then seek me out and thrill me with all you have gathered up. ','2016-07-01 01:46:24','2016-06-28 06:21:06'),(10018,10937,68,10,'FlameShaft 10','Your circumstances here are different than the majority, but no less relevant. I want you to discover the uniqueness that ignites your personal Flame. What calls to you in the City and why? If you can maintain your stability, where do you see yourself in the future?','2016-07-01 02:57:47','2016-04-12 06:19:27'),(10018,10937,9,30,'Free Action Thirty','They say our dreams are our own.  Dreams we imagine & create.  This is not true in my eyes for we can not control the actions of others nor the events of the city.  Our only control here is our reactions, participation and actions.  I would like you to lead me into a true dream of your own.  If what they say was truely truth, what would your true dream look like, feel like, smell like? What events, would be happening around us.  What surroundings would you have created? I want to witness YOUR true dream. H','2016-07-01 03:19:28','2016-04-06 02:44:12'),(10746,10937,24,1,'Restore ~ learn ','Given your origins, some are hesitant to trust you.  Think of ways in which this trust can be built.   Attempt to implement them.','2016-07-01 03:39:27','2016-04-04 23:06:15'),(10027,10937,46,1,'Recall to learn','Time to go out and find out where the best genns are for those items you collect. You can ask around of find out for yourself but seek me out when the answer you have found.','2016-07-01 06:21:00','2016-06-20 10:02:01'),(10027,11044,47,1,'Push learn','This is one way we share and teach each other as dreamers. I as a teacher and you as a student. The Art you seek is push. Find out what you can about it. Come back and tell me I am not to hard to find. and we can talk more.','2016-07-01 09:31:49','2016-06-30 09:38:51'),(10027,10025,107,20,'peace aura 20','You have a mission if you choose to accept it. Find out tips from dreamers aon the best wy to imps arts. Either all fo the or are there tricks for differant arts, Looking forward to your report','2016-07-01 10:11:06','2016-06-16 23:31:24'),(10025,11041,60,1,'first sphere','interview preformed he did very well','2016-07-01 12:22:26','2016-07-01 12:22:20'),(10007,11014,24,30,'Restore 30','The Keepers are in ruins already and this is after only a couple days of it being open! Take steps to restore faith in the house. It may be where a whole new group takes over and is united as one, making the house flourish, or it might be where everyone finally gets along. This is no easy task, but see what you can do. Keep track of all the things you have tried. ','2016-07-01 18:00:38','2016-06-25 16:57:50'),(10951,10717,16,1,'Quest: purple lace','blah blahb lah....repeat, because the first one didn\'t work for some reason','2016-07-01 20:49:03','2016-07-01 20:48:50'),(10951,10987,96,10,'Where da\'Peeps?(10)','Two things to do for this plat. #1 Get to know your Keeper Housemates. Do this quietly & with proper introduction if needed. We need to learn to work together. Use your Senses to find the best way to get to know them (hunting, genning, talking, etc) #2. Fill these 2 Wells full of Essences in preparation of our House\'s Opening. Good Luck! ~Lacie~','2016-07-01 20:52:52','2016-05-31 21:49:34'),(10232,11028,40,1,'Anasina - Deafen','Exercise that shiny new art you\'ve just learned, Inscribe! Pick out a few Dreamers you meet (at least two or three, if you please), and write an impression of them, into a codex. Share it with them, and ask them to honestly access your impression: Does your image of them fit with their own image of themselves? ','2016-07-01 22:37:53','2016-06-17 08:33:30'),(10232,11020,24,1,'Malarky - Restore','Search throughout the outer planes for something that you think might need restoring -- then convince someone else that it needs doing. Can you get them interested, involved? ','2016-07-02 02:07:38','2016-06-19 09:16:38'),(10027,10025,139,10,'SD 10 - Poppygirl','Sense Datoken is a very useful art for a Gatekeeper to have.  I would like you to come up with a couple of other sense that you wish you had access to as a gatekeeper and Guardian.  Any idea how they\'d work?  Are these senses things you\'d use regularly, or just once in an odd while?  What inspired you?  Be creative and as serious or silly as you feel like being.','2016-07-02 02:25:48','2016-06-19 10:14:08'),(10007,10854,47,1,'Push - Learn','What you spoke of that you found is called a Cache. There are a few of them in the City. Some you can\'t get to, but push yourself to find the ones that are not behind closed planes. I suggest asking around and finding out the ones you can get to and then go to them. Bring me back a description of the rooms you can get to.','2016-07-02 05:02:39','2016-06-26 05:06:07'),(10232,11038,71,1,'Harlen - FlameRuin','Take a shot in the dark! Find a dark place in the Dream, and shoot the flame I give to you. Then, consider: How do flames illuminate our City, and also importantly, how *don\'t* they? ','2016-07-02 23:32:51','2016-06-26 20:28:25'),(10746,10915,7,20,'RF ~ 20','Time to explore!  I would like you to find some places that either scare you or are meant to inspire fear.  Create descriptions for them, even if one already exists.  Conquer this fear!','2016-07-03 01:08:39','2016-06-29 04:21:41'),(10313,10593,29,10,'Poison 10','You\'ve spent a lot of time administering the \"antidote\" to people, it\'s time to show your teeth!  Or imagine showing them, anyway.  Pick two dreamers who are impossible to deal with, and theorize how to manipulate their nature into working to your favor.  Put this into practice with one, and observe how effective the results are.\r\n','2016-07-03 01:24:16','2016-06-10 19:44:17'),(10022,10915,44,60,'Magnum: FS 60','You are to devise a means of empowering Firestorm to burn the Revenant from a single plane. The plane is up to you. As is the means of accomplishing this within the parameters I have given you. This will require more than a single evoking of Firestorm. It must cross the entire plane utterly destroying the Revenant inhabitating it, as well as their abilty to return. Cleanse their taint from the ground on which they tread.','2016-07-03 01:37:20','2016-06-19 02:20:48'),(10022,10232,22,70,'Em\'et: Forge 70','These Revenants are quite a bother. You are to lead research teams here and there to study them. How were they made, how do they function? Once you understand the workings of the Revenant you are to apply your findings to a a single plane, any plane which they currently inhabit will do. Remove their ilk from the face of that plane, see if you can keep them gone.\r\n','2016-07-03 01:51:26','2016-06-21 04:13:21'),(10232,10092,142,20,'gD - Misdirect 20','Find at least two or three rooms in which this art would be most tactically effective in battle, and explain your logic. Do these rooms ever see fights, these days? Is Misdirection ever useful in battle, especially considering its high cost? Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-07-03 04:29:45','2016-07-02 03:36:46'),(10746,10888,105,10,'PC ~ 10','Poisons come in many forms.  As part of your integration into the family, I would like you to look at the poisons that currently affect us and how we can combat them.','2016-07-03 04:51:06','2016-06-25 05:26:52'),(10027,11020,96,10,'Sense Dreamer 10','You have been here a bit. Let\'s hear what you have for insight. What do you see in the dreamers around you. Pick ten; it\'s a nice number unless you wish to consdier more. What do you think they will be doing  in a month? A year? How about yoursel?','2016-07-03 06:02:44','2016-06-21 18:46:20'),(10951,11038,40,1,'What? What?','I want you to listen to those around you. They hear but do not listen. What is Calenture\'s & the Light\'s position on this current invasion. Do not ask them, for you are...Deafened. Just sit back & hear their views. Your report will be what you have...heard over Deaf ears. ~Lacie~','2016-07-03 07:02:43','2016-06-27 02:36:35'),(10951,11038,60,1,'Crumbling Mount','A Mount so old and nearly dust. A thought so vague, it just might rust! To do the deed, to plant the seed. In Blade\'s own mind, Shadow\'d thoughts indeed! ~Lacie~','2016-07-03 07:07:37','2016-07-02 20:38:14'),(10746,10360,46,10,'Recall ~ 10','Rather than lookat the character of your fellow dreamers, I would like you to find the \'character\' of some of the places within the City.  (They can be from this one or Idoaclesia).  Traverse the planes and find rooms with character and share them with me.','2016-07-03 18:02:04','2016-06-11 17:11:52'),(10874,10107,74,70,'Mind Blank 70','There are 4 places in the City that have been shileded from the minds of the Citizens, they hide on the Basin, Lambents, Valley and Cenotaph. I would have you devise new roles for these silent areas and work on a way to access them. This is a new city and it is time to repurpose what we have. Speak with whomever you need to gain insight into attaining your goal. Make a plan and put it into action. Leave their old uses in the past and bring a new use into the minds of the Citizens. Make your work worthy.','2016-07-04 04:14:40','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10874,10232,45,1,'Razorwind','This is a simple and straightforward task. I want you to pick either Razorwind at level 40 or Firestorm at level 40 and choose which you would use over the other and why. I want you to form an infalable defence against the one that you choose. Offer reasons why and show your work. **A**','2016-07-04 04:22:17','2016-06-15 08:07:06'),(10951,11023,60,2,'Shadow\'d Steps(2nd)','Our members grow in number. It is time they grow in Shadow as well. Create an outline & lesson plan of your choice to help your Housemates learn of the Shadow & grow in knowledge of our Home. You methods your own, the Shadow your guide in this Seeking. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-07-04 04:37:22','2016-07-01 05:20:40'),(10874,10232,5,60,'Random 60 - Em\'et','Find dreamers of all creeds and spheres and do things with them. Perpetuate a subplot, push a main plot, simply have fun, learn about them, hunt with them. In each of these events, you cannot be in Sanctuary, and you cannot simply be talking','2016-07-04 04:40:06','2016-06-03 20:39:32'),(10680,10951,89,10,'Barriers','Many barriers seem to be in place within the ranks of KOES already. Break down the barriers, earn your respect, gather your \"flock\" and work on those who are insolent, childish and prone to tantrums. Weed out the poison.  Make the Keepers a group that will be respected. I know you can do this.','2016-07-04 06:01:33','2016-06-23 19:25:55'),(10951,10987,74,40,'MB 40','rewriting mindblank quest that i wrote at misdirection.','2016-07-04 08:52:24','2016-07-04 08:52:13'),(10593,10905,70,20,'Flames','Your last quest I asked you to ask people for \"hot\" things.. this time, I want YOU to give people some things that are hot!  Tell me what you gave them and how they reacted. Try to think of things that are different and fun! Let us say... six people! Have fun.','2016-07-04 19:57:48','2016-06-08 19:29:27'),(10025,10905,26,20,'purify to 20','i have a mission for you should you accept. weave a tale for us, i would like it to incorperate, the art, dreamers, and another component of your choosing, this can be an entity, an unseen force, a darkmare, etc, have fun with it, it can be funny, sad, scary, what ever you like. Have fun with it. when you have crafted your tale seek me out and we will share your story together.','2016-07-04 21:04:55','2016-07-01 10:22:51'),(10018,11046,65,10,'GateSmasher 10','Compile a list of all the changes you have noticed, and seek out for more you may not be aware of yet, or ask around. See if you can find up to10 things, but I will settle for 5. Share your thoughts on these changes with me. Do you think they are all good, bad, or in between?','2016-07-05 07:14:35','2016-07-01 06:09:17'),(10066,10950,144,1,'Chaos Well','Learn the benefits and limitations of chaos well from your peers. Identify one limitation and speculate as to how you could improve it.','2016-07-05 21:50:33','2016-06-27 03:20:10'),(10053,10915,24,10,'restore10: Kelos','Why do you think restore is available to all foci? ask a dreamer of each focus their opinion...Kelos','2016-07-05 23:08:00','2016-07-04 03:32:02'),(10311,10213,50,1,'nmfLearn-Vill','What are some changes you experience when you take nightmare form? How long does it last unplatted and up to the 5th plat? Since you think emphants are so cute sprinkle some of this information into a story about a cute little emphant, then present it to me with some kind of visual aid for your story that you made or had someone make for you. After the story we will have a discussion about the art.\r\n','2016-07-06 00:33:19','2016-07-03 22:29:30'),(10136,11028,3,20,'SM20- Anasina','You are still trying to figure out yourself and this new city. There is a lot to learn !! I want you to try to figure out how being a SM in this city is different than ours. Speak to many dreamers and get their opinions. What examples of Soulmastery things would you want to bring to this city?? Any arts?  Do lots of research and let\'s talk!','2016-07-06 03:56:31','2016-06-18 02:46:58'),(10027,11037,15,1,'Judgment to learn','A watcher you say? There is so much to see in the Dream. Tell me what you see as you travle these halls. Gather me your impressions and sights over the next dream. I am am easy to find when you are ready to report. I am curious to your judgements.','2016-07-06 03:58:17','2016-06-28 19:00:46'),(10018,10987,22,10,'Forge 10','Think of something this house needs as a permanent fixture that could be sensed with Know. You could select any room on the inside or the facade. It can be a piece of art or whatever comes to mind. Forge it with as much detail as possible and show it to at least one other member.','2016-07-06 05:02:23','2016-07-04 06:45:00'),(10092,10250,144,1,'Chaos Well','For this.. I want you to tell me why.. even though this Art is a DreamSoul Art it is not connected to Forge Talisman.. Do you feel that we could perhaps somehow alter one of these Arts to incorporate Chaos Wells into Forge as well?  Think on this at least a day and find me.','2016-07-06 05:27:46','2016-07-04 06:00:44'),(10027,10038,20,30,'Blast to 30','Seak out the arts and such as you can on these new hybrids the revenants and pass it on. Where  did they come from? Can they be faught? What is their purpose? Blast out the misconceptions and share with at least three others so we know what we are dealign with. Good luck and i look forward to yrou report.','2016-07-06 05:27:49','2016-06-28 17:04:54'),(10027,10079,46,1,'Recall to learn','Recall for me... five rooms you like and where they are. Five items you wish you had,, Five teachers you have met Five dreamers you wish you did not meet..Five tips for new dreamers','2016-07-06 06:39:00','2016-06-23 04:12:48'),(10680,10257,4,20,'Shadowed Prankster','As we discussed, light hearted pranks to ease the tension around here. DONT piss anyone off, we do not need in-fighting. I know you can do this! enjoy it and bring some semblence of normalcy to our home. ~S.C.~','2016-07-06 20:51:19','2016-06-30 23:29:51'),(10009,10580,144,1,'CW-Learn-Bundle','Honoring Najerv Torek\'s 3rd sphere bundle completion codex for Chaos Well.','2016-07-06 21:26:20','2016-07-06 21:26:13'),(10025,11041,65,10,'blade to 10','As our blades grow stronger so does our ability to defeat the chaos that threatens to over take our city. you goal should you choose to accept is to learn the history of your blade. and what secret defence does the protector of the city has and no other foci possese? seek me when you have completed this mission and we can talk ~P~','2016-07-06 22:03:33','2016-07-04 23:30:27'),(10951,11045,47,10,'Pushy Pushy (10)','Try this experiment: Either try to push someone into a color change for their outfit, OR try to get them to push you into changing yours. Try it 5 times and bring me the results as your report. Make this fun but try not to be too...Pushy! Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-07-06 23:02:05','2016-07-06 01:46:42'),(10232,10915,71,50,'Magnum- FlameRuin50','Consider the things that have been ruined in your Dreams. What were the sources of those ruins? Do they have a common root of destruction, or do they all stem from different causes? Pick one thing ruined in your Dreams, and work to restore it, with at least a pair of dreamers you trust. Report your efforts, and ensure it is thorough! ','2016-07-07 02:04:01','2016-06-27 21:36:44'),(10092,10311,9,20,'Limber Flower','The University allows any to teach a class... I want you to coordinate with them and teach a class on the merits of FA.. how it benefits the City.. you will have a guest speaker for your class to go over.. DreamQuake.. me... work with me and the house on a time that this can happen.','2016-07-07 02:16:51','2016-07-02 02:43:03'),(10232,10580,139,1,'Najerv - Sense Dato','Ask around, and learn about the basic qualities of Datoken, from the City\'s dreamers. How are they like darkmares, and how are they like mindless mares? Also: Search throughout the City, and find the location of at least one of every type of mare! Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-07-07 02:39:50','2016-07-06 00:56:44'),(10034,10062,141,50,'Kinesis50Krodoc','I\'ve been well informed of the history regarding Kinesis that stemmed from our city. This time, I feel like I want to hear one that isn\'t full of bloody romance and fluff. Recreate a history of it that uses important dreamers (like yourself?) and make it good, because the fluffy one is stupid.','2016-07-07 02:56:40','2016-05-25 04:50:45'),(10092,10915,74,40,'MB to 40','An art was created to save dreamers and a by product affected Mind Blank.. I want you to tell me what art this is.. who created it.. and how it interferes with Mind Blank.. make sure the answer is worthy of the plateau you seek.','2016-07-07 03:33:09','2016-07-02 23:09:33'),(10480,10750,31,20,'Arnaya Curse','Curse up a storm every dream. Curse the dogs, curse the skies, curse whatever. Do this for at least two dreams. You can report this after the 9th. Use your imagination. None of this has to be true curse words. Create your own. Vent, let off steam, cool down. Tell me of the reactions to those around you, and play it all up. Create your own world. Go crazy. Is the integrity of your character still upstanding, or have others felt you were losing your mind? You can tell them after the 9th it was all for a task','2016-07-07 03:52:04','2016-05-08 04:15:30'),(10480,10750,31,20,'Curse to 10','With the discussion that we had I wish to test your theory and statistics. You will use this charm to curse yourself after you have confered with your experimented entries and make an educated guess how many evokes it will take to raise your Chaos Well from 33 to 39. Report any discoveries that you find. **A**','2016-07-07 03:52:04','2016-05-17 06:34:45'),(10480,10250,22,40,'Anya forge 40','we have discovered a forward vault in our house. Taryag will be on a sphere quest to get us to it. He needs assistance from an excellent forger. Your mission to aid him: Create the explosives needed. The parts for the bomb will have to be made together with at least two dreamsmiths involved','2016-07-07 04:11:57','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10092,142,30,'Misdirection 30','You have a new title for this quest you are Mr Direction. Seek out lost dreamers and show them the way. Be it joining our house  or any other. Finding their way to a higher plateau or sphere. Get lace is a white dress? Help them find their true course. Seek as many worthy fo this level  and have some fun with it.','2016-07-07 04:12:42','2016-07-03 21:42:29'),(10988,10027,74,60,'LS - MB 60','guardDog returns and plans to rule alongside you. Develop a list of positive and negatives of this and how it will or could affect AoE down the road. Purple Lace\'s group is imploding, but she\'s hanging on by a thread. Does the Alliance want her to fail? If not, help her hang on.','2016-07-07 04:30:31','2016-06-29 20:00:15'),(10480,10079,18,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Chamele to learn per bundle **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:35:44','2016-07-07 04:31:17'),(10480,10079,40,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Deafen to learn per bundle **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:36:33','2016-07-07 04:30:39'),(10480,10079,2,10,'Quest: Akkadian','DreamSeer to 10 per bundle **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:36:49','2016-07-07 04:33:11'),(10480,10079,9,1,'Bundle to learn','Free Action to learn per bundle. **A**','2016-07-07 04:37:23','2016-07-07 04:29:28'),(10480,10079,16,10,'Quest: Akkadian','ID to 10 per bundle **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:37:39','2016-07-07 04:33:39'),(10480,10079,72,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Inscribe per bundle to learn **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:37:49','2016-07-07 04:31:55'),(10480,10079,17,1,'Bundle to learn','ID Curse learn per bundle. **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:37:57','2016-07-07 04:30:05'),(10480,10079,14,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Know to 10 per bundle **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:38:13','2016-07-07 04:34:11'),(10480,10079,26,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Purify to learn per bundle **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:38:26','2016-07-07 04:32:20'),(10480,10079,139,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Sense Datoken to 10 per bundle **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:38:38','2016-07-07 04:34:51'),(10480,10079,69,10,'Quest: Akkadian','TranceFlame to 10 per bundle  **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:38:50','2016-07-07 04:35:15'),(10480,10079,19,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Vision to learn per bundle **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 04:39:00','2016-07-07 04:32:46'),(10480,10069,30,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Antidote to learn as per bundles **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:11:30','2016-07-07 05:08:51'),(10480,10069,144,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Chaos Well to learn as per bundles **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:11:49','2016-07-07 05:11:15'),(10480,10069,73,1,'Quest: Akkadian','DT to learn as per bundles **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:12:03','2016-07-07 05:09:22'),(10480,10069,15,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Judgment to learn as per bundles **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:12:38','2016-07-07 05:07:37'),(10480,10069,74,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Mind Blank to learn as per bundles **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:12:52','2016-07-07 05:10:56'),(10480,10069,29,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Poison to learn as per bundles **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:13:07','2016-07-07 05:08:29'),(10480,10069,26,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Purify to 10 as per plateau bundles **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:13:23','2016-07-07 05:08:08'),(10480,10069,8,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Protection to learn as per bundles **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:13:32','2016-07-07 05:07:11'),(10480,10069,7,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Resist Fear to learn per bundles **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:13:42','2016-07-07 05:06:29'),(10480,10069,48,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Soul Evoke to learn as per bundle **A**\r\n','2016-07-07 05:13:54','2016-07-07 05:10:31'),(10951,10987,46,30,'Recall 30','Recall your members! Make them Rings which help them keep th Shadow close and Recall how their souls are protected by the Shadow. The Ring Recalls the Shadow. ~Lacie~','2016-07-07 08:33:19','2016-07-05 22:25:00'),(10027,10580,74,10,'Mind Blank 10','Gather the opinions of two or more dreamers on somehting new to you. This should help you catch up and give you a clearer idea of whats new. Find five topics. Have fun and be safe.','2016-07-07 20:39:10','2016-07-06 19:59:20'),(10951,10580,46,1,'Learn to Recall!','With DreamStrike about, this Art is critical. Learn of as many Sanctuaries as you can Recall, making sure you know at least 1 per plane. Which of the outer Planes have no Sanctuary? Lastly, see if you can find any other ways of avoiding DreamStrike. If you cannot, report your failure as well. Good Luck ~Lacie~','2016-07-07 21:39:19','2016-07-06 18:55:08'),(10746,10107,100,10,'Power Token ~ 10','You are going to enable my history geekiness and tell me about the place of Power Tokens throughout the history of the City, as you remember it.','2016-07-08 03:54:30','2016-07-03 19:33:04'),(10107,10746,20,60,'Blast Addendum','I want you to experiment with Blast and line of sight.  Try it on a GK with reflect from all angles with 10 evokes from each.  Is thre a weakness from any one angle?  Additionally, bring this concept to the DreamSeer Guild.  Perhaps we can take this on as an experiment to alter Blast in a way that has yet to be attempted.\r\n','2016-07-08 04:09:15','2016-07-03 20:03:01'),(10951,11023,24,10,'Restore the Balance','The SoulMaster is the guy standing in the back ....watching. They make excellent spies..ermm... Inteilligence Officers. I need information on Kendo. I want you to use Locate Dreamer alot, finding out where he goes, who he sees, what he does. I will need this to ... elliminate him as a problem of this House. If you get dirt on Dina as well... that\'s just gravy! Two days, don\'t take too long on this! ~Lacie~','2016-07-08 04:22:21','2016-07-04 05:07:28'),(10880,10360,67,30,'Blade 30 Blue','Its important to me that we cut into the heart of OUR City and compare it to this current one. Tear into your past experiences and decide what the single most important subject (people, place, thing, etc) was to YOU in our City, that is missing from our current. Then discuss with me a plan that could help fix this missing link - it it\'s a good plan, maybe I will help you see it through.','2016-07-08 20:54:30','2016-05-29 12:48:13'),(10951,10580,26,1,'Purification!','This Art burns me! Find out why, & not by asking me! How does this Art cleanse? Ask a SoulMaster for their opinion. Lastly, find 3 people in the City that you think are in need of Purifying & 3 that are already as pure as they can be and in no need of Purification. ~Lacie~','2016-07-08 23:07:05','2016-07-07 21:45:34'),(10027,10038,23,1,'Recharge to learn','This is my favorite art as a seer. See what you can find out about the stats. Find out as well what others think of the art. Can they offer you any tips or tricks in using it? What are you thinking it will be useful for.','2016-07-09 03:51:37','2016-07-06 05:47:43'),(10053,10038,69,30,'30 flamQuest: Kelos','there are several levels of flame fireball colors....please research them from level 29 39 49 59 69 and 79....report back when finished for discussion....','2016-07-09 04:07:49','2016-06-27 02:15:16'),(10053,10915,24,20,'Restore20: Kelos','For your plateau, create a chart of how much Restore replenishes for level 9 , 19, and 29. Show this chart to a soulmaster teacher to verify the information... Once verified, add the codex to sphere 3 hall for others to have this information.','2016-07-09 04:16:22','2016-07-08 03:53:10'),(10027,11050,69,1,'Tranceflame learn','You are on you way to gathering up all this new information the Dream as to offer. Ask around about flames, what ones are in the deram? What they are used for? Just a few dreamers is fine.  The dream is amazing to see through new eyes. Seers have insight we use all our dreams.','2016-07-09 04:27:57','2016-07-04 05:50:16'),(10680,10580,72,20,'Your Light','This is quite interesting what you have told me about yourself. It would be interesting and beneficial to the City if you would write your story of who and what you are and place it in the 2nd sphere library hall.  I would like to read it first, if that is acceptable.  S.C.','2016-07-09 04:54:55','2016-07-06 21:04:28'),(10092,10987,10,40,'Ward & Amulet 40','Gather your Will Elemens and have 4 different races.. I want you to race from Thresh to each of the open houses.. straight up the path.. NO shortcuts.. but not just any old race.. I want you to ward every portal on your way up to the House that can be warded.. tell me how many portals for each and the time it took you to do it.','2016-07-09 04:58:41','2016-07-08 03:15:06'),(10092,10987,11,40,'Brad','Ward and Amulet Combo completed.','2016-07-09 04:58:52','2016-07-09 04:49:10'),(10092,11041,68,10,'Flame 10','There are fires that lead you to thresh.. I want you to talk to some dreamers and find out how they got there and how important they must be.. talk to at least 3 dreamers and then tell me your thoughts after you heard what they think.','2016-07-09 05:15:53','2016-07-04 02:48:05'),(10027,10915,89,20,'Soul Shield 20','See what you can learn about mass arts. Do they have anything in common? Strengths? Limitations? Can you find any theories on how they work? Do you have any theories? Any mas art any focus can be used to report','2016-07-09 05:16:23','2016-07-08 01:04:17'),(10018,10580,10,20,'Ward 20','I ask that you consider two things: 1. What do you feel you can bring to the City as a teacher? I seek a detailed answer. 2. What is your place within KoES? Read the mission boards to get an idea on what others are working on. Are you of the Light or Dark?','2016-07-10 00:08:02','2016-07-09 05:24:40'),(10108,10915,38,30,'Scare - 30','Think of the one thing that truely terrifies you. Is it phsyical? Mental? Here in the city, or out on your shard? Could you use it to your advantage in some way? Would you want to if you could? Once you\'ve got a detailed description of said fear, come up with a method to overcome it. Then, forge something spectacular to hold that fear to perhaps be used at a later date.','2016-07-10 02:44:15','2016-06-25 02:41:14'),(10018,10987,7,40,'Resist Fear 40','I was like you once - I too feared speaking around others and voicing my opinions. The best way to Resist this Fear is to push yourself, until it becomes natural. First, consider why this is a fear of yours. Next, I want you to push yourself a little further in some way to overcome it. What you decide to do is your choice.','2016-07-10 02:50:20','2016-06-30 11:24:50'),(10027,10580,9,20,'Freeaction to 20','Let\'s get some dreamers on the move.  Make a up a game to share with some ferinds that involves a race of some kind. You create the game and five dreamers need to play all at once or in smaller group. Have fun!','2016-07-10 03:42:06','2016-07-07 20:47:44'),(10007,10545,67,50,'Blade 50','There are these Revenants around the city and I keep hearing they are different, but I just don\'t understand that. Find out all the information you can by slaying many of them. Bring me their essences as well. No less than 15. When you are slaying them, I want you find out the differences in them. Bring all this info to me and the essences.','2016-07-10 04:31:48','2016-06-27 07:14:03'),(10951,10087,50,40,'Ultimate Mare!','Get to know a few Dreamers, both old and new by expressing the DreamEdge persona in NightMare Form. All I need to know is where, who and what ya did to get their attention, and what you learned about them, while they learned about you! ~Enjoy and have fun with this!~ ~L~','2016-07-10 04:53:19','2016-05-22 16:19:31'),(10107,10915,142,10,'Misdirection 10','Use words to misdirect people to look at something for no real reason.  Point out something that has no significant meaning to it, and make a dreamer question why it is there or what it means.  Blow a mind and you will have your plateau!\r\n','2016-07-10 05:34:43','2016-07-08 03:03:20'),(10018,10580,1,30,'GateKeeper 30','Take a good look at our plane from a Keeper\'s perspective. Figure out the best rooms to set up ambushes, and places to avoid being ambushed. Take into account our current warriors and come up with at least one tactic that would play in our favor. You may want to run a drill to test it.','2016-07-10 08:11:09','2016-07-10 00:15:02'),(10311,10915,144,10,'ChaosWell10-Magnum','The dreamsmith guild is responsible for creating this art, get with a few members of the current version of the guild and see if they have any upcoming projects. If they dont make some suggestions and get some feedback, and if they do tell me what you think about whatever they are working on. Either way no action is needed, report to me what you come up with!\r\n','2016-07-10 14:47:55','2016-07-08 03:19:40'),(10951,10580,46,10,'Recall the way (10)','A do it quest! I need you to show as many of our members the way through the maze as you can in the next 2 dreams! Start tonite at the House meeting. I will make an announcement that you know the best way & it\'s up to you to... Recall the Way! ~Lacie~','2016-07-10 21:31:47','2016-07-08 23:11:01'),(10593,10088,34,1,'Prison','I think we all feel at some point that we are in prison.. I actually WAS in prison here, bad as it was, it made me grow as a person I think. But still, other prisons remain.  What prison are you in? and how do you think you can break free. Any and all answers are of course confidential. ~C ','2016-07-10 21:45:17','2016-05-08 22:21:38'),(10916,10950,30,1,'Antidote - Learn','The citizens of the city have been Poisoned!  However even they don\'t know it.  Find dreamers and proclaim them poisoned with some random ailment (have fun with it),  Then prescribe them the antidote (again have fun with it).  Who was poisoned and what was the antidote?  I look forward to your report!\r\n','2016-07-10 22:12:00','2016-06-22 02:04:31'),(10593,11028,27,1,'Anasina the famous!','Give something to the dream and it\'s citizens, something that is uniquely you! something they can look back on , talk about and smile. I will be listening for your name to be on the dreamers smiling lips!  ~C','2016-07-10 22:34:53','2016-06-17 00:35:12'),(10027,10250,144,10,'Chaos Well to 10','Share with me your revelations since your return. How are you finding the dream suiting you.  Who has assisted you and who can you find more information from. Are you putting all your eggs in one basket?','2016-07-11 04:38:39','2016-07-07 03:52:04'),(10027,10915,16,20,'Identify 20','I want you to find me 20 matches. It can be pairs of art or pairs of deramers sets of places. You decide. Tell me what you have made them pairs and have fun with it!','2016-07-11 05:43:27','2016-07-11 01:35:04'),(10951,10580,74,20,'Blank\'d Mind (20)','Try this experiment and report your results: Learn what SoulShield is & what affect it has on the Blank\'d Mind. Determine your own experiment & record your findings to report for your plateau. ~Lacie~','2016-07-11 20:06:31','2016-07-10 21:37:14'),(10009,10007,144,10,'CW-10','Essences equate to a path in this City. What is yours now that you have left the Keepers? Where do you see yourself in this current conflict and what does the future hold for you in general? Once you have the answers, take your first meaningful step toward your future.','2016-07-11 22:37:37','2016-07-06 21:53:37'),(10022,10009,111,10,'Dreiko: Dazzle 10','Come up with Three branches of focus for the house to invest its members into.','2016-07-11 22:47:31','2016-06-18 01:32:34'),(10022,10750,24,50,'Arnaya: Restore 50','Take the Crystal I have given you. It seems to be broken, being overtaken by something dark... sinister maybe... I do not know, it was broken when I found it, I swear. I am unsure of what it does, or did... it was broken when I found it, promise. Endeavor to repair it and restore its funtionality.','2016-07-11 23:47:23','2016-06-07 07:57:50'),(10746,10750,105,10,'PC ~ 10','On top of service (hunting, genning, defense), I would like you to map our maze and the best ways to run through the house when under attack.  If you can, share it at a house meeting.','2016-07-11 23:56:53','2016-07-03 04:24:05'),(10066,10950,8,1,'Protection Learn','Find a dreamer from each house and ask them what is something personal and public they feel compelled to protect, and why. After collecting these eight examples, can you find any common denominator? Finally, answer this question yourself.','2016-07-12 01:22:31','2016-07-05 22:10:43'),(10311,10376,9,1,'FALearn-Calabosh','You mentioned you just returned, and need to catch up on the latest events in the city. I would like you to do that by speaking to others as well as reading up on the public scrolls about the current events. Catch up on what has been going on for the last few months give the future some thought. When you feel more informed report and we will discuss.\r\n','2016-07-12 02:26:22','2016-07-03 04:35:09'),(10007,11014,60,4,'4th Sphere','I want you to hold a writing contest. Pick a night and have prizes available. I will allow you to figure out the details, but it needs to be big and YOU must lead it and host it completely. Make sure the prizes are awesome. Make sure to place this on the open scrolls and also on the City wall before we enter the dreamstate. Have fun!','2016-07-12 03:52:45','2016-07-07 00:06:23'),(10007,11014,29,20,'Poison 20','I want you to write a piece for your contest tomorrow. It must involve poison and dreamers that are within the dream. This can be a short story or poem. ','2016-07-12 03:54:49','2016-07-11 04:19:10'),(10018,10580,65,30,'GateSmasher 30','How many swings of a level 29 GateSmasher does it take to defeat an Emphant, Bogrom, and Agoknight? Fill up this Chaos Well as you test each form several times. Is it always the same amount or does it differ? While you do so, develop a method you think is best for hunting that allows you to throw more punches while suffering the least amount of damage from the mares. Be prepared to explain or demonstrate.','2016-07-12 03:59:05','2016-07-11 03:03:20'),(10480,11052,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Returning the ability to teach after an interview.\r\n','2016-07-12 04:10:50','2016-07-12 04:09:28'),(10480,11052,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts given with Quest.\r\n','2016-07-12 04:11:01','2016-07-12 04:10:10'),(10480,11052,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts granted with Quest.\r\n','2016-07-12 04:11:08','2016-07-12 04:09:49'),(10480,10125,83,40,'Dakkoth HealingAu40','Is this art better in the hands of some, or the hands of all? Ask several others if they feel we should change the regulations of the art and hand it out to others at lower spheres, more foci, other houses. Which art could you twist this one with to make a more spectacular art? Explain in detail!','2016-07-12 04:32:36','2016-03-12 21:24:49'),(10480,10545,52,1,'Final Written Exam','Now is the time for the last step in your trials. I want you to dream up a new and amazing art. It can be a Major, minor of any focus including Dreamsoul. I want specifics and details. I aslo want you to write several example tasks to learn your new art. Find 5 others and see if they would learn your art from one of your samples. Finally, write sample plateaus for your art to 10, 20 and 30. Be ready to defend your work. Take your time and use this moment to shine. **A**','2016-07-12 05:06:48','2016-06-27 07:46:40'),(10480,10545,52,1,'Pre-final task','For this part of the assignment, I wish for you to write 10 sample tasks, 2 per focus including Dreamsoul. You may pick the arts that you wish for each focus. You will not ask for assistance for this task. I am looking for specific things. When you are finished, we will speak and discuss where the next step will take you. **A**','2016-07-12 05:06:48','2016-06-10 05:14:20'),(10480,10545,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts from ordainment.\r\n','2016-07-12 05:07:31','2016-07-12 05:07:10'),(10480,10545,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts from ordainment.\r\n','2016-07-12 05:07:37','2016-07-12 05:07:25'),(10007,11045,67,10,'Blade 10','I would like for you to describe your blade for me. What kind of materials do you think were used for the making of it and where did they come from?','2016-07-12 05:24:12','2016-07-11 05:50:43'),(10480,10250,35,60,'Trap Nightmare - 60','This task will be two fold. I wish for you to gather some information. At your current Trap level, how much energy can you trap in an hour? When you have that basis, make a table and predict the amount of energy you can garner in 30 minutes, 1 hour, 90 minutes and 2 hours. Find a way to test your theory. Share any information that you think would be relevant, from number or elemens that you would need to a trapping circuit. Secondly, ask each house how much trapped energy you would need for a PT. **A**','2016-07-12 05:28:00','2016-07-07 04:20:01'),(10480,10376,60,3,'Calabosh - 3rd Sph','In order to begin preparations for your beast call, you must better understand the beasts of this city! Ask around, and learn about the different types of beasts, here. There are different factions, if you believe it! Armed with this information, develop a plan for how you might create a \"Beast call\" and share it on the Public Scrolls. ','2016-07-12 05:53:30','2016-07-03 04:36:12'),(10480,10008,43,60,'Paralyze 60','Not having the right answers can instill great paralyzing fear in yourself. As per our discussion, I wish for you to write a short biography for ALL the arts that can be learned for the placement into the various Libraries. When your work is complete, find me and we will discuss. **A**','2016-07-12 06:13:42','2015-12-12 04:22:03'),(10480,10018,65,60,'Jade SMASH','Dis be the opposite ah wat ye expect. Not all tasks be granted by brute force effort. Show da softer smarter side wit yer blade and yer forge. When ye feel its time toughen up, da task be completed. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-07-12 06:36:52','2016-01-29 08:18:06'),(10480,10750,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Giving SM access to their Guild House.\r\n','2016-07-12 06:45:00','2016-07-12 06:44:26'),(10480,10916,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Giving SM access to the Guild House.\r\n','2016-07-12 06:45:08','2016-07-12 06:44:48'),(10480,10232,45,10,'Razorwind - 10','Using the data that you and I compiled previously, I want you to come up with arguements and supports for choosing Razorwind over Firestorm. I think that three items in favor of Razorwind will do nicely. Prepare to enlighten me with your theories. **A**','2016-07-12 06:57:03','2016-07-07 03:59:39'),(10938,10027,107,30,'Peace Aura','For the formidable house leadership and duties undertaken as assigned and accomplished in service to the Alliance of Eclipse. ^~Lynx~^','2016-07-12 08:23:43','2016-06-07 18:13:49'),(10938,10027,93,1,'Sacrificial','Keep it will. Keep it sacred. Keep it lynxed.','2016-07-12 09:51:36','2016-07-12 09:51:19'),(10027,10213,107,1,'Peace aura learn','Your dedication and work for the houses is duly noted with you attendence of meetings and the help you have been to poppy and you excitement about the art creation group bring me a token 100 essnse and this art is yours','2016-07-12 23:42:23','2016-07-12 19:12:53'),(10951,10198,74,10,'Blank\'d Mind (10)','Start 1 Dream with a BlankMind. Enter Threshold, MB, then go to the 3rd Threshold room to your right. Then, walk through 10 rooms down the path towards whatever House is at the end of that plane. Stop. MB again, evoke Know & then spend an evoke\'s time in that room. What do you do? Where are you & what does this room do for your new Dreams? The answers will be your report. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-07-13 00:25:30','2016-07-11 08:54:23'),(10022,10107,111,10,'OfF: Dazzle 10','Explain what you believe to a room full of people, or to one person... whichever. Explain why you believe. Spread your philosophy around!','2016-07-13 02:25:01','2016-06-28 01:24:02'),(10480,10958,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting a SM with the Guild house art.\r\n','2016-07-13 02:40:22','2016-07-13 02:40:16'),(10107,10066,19,60,'Vision 60 - TM','I want you to create your own timeline as to how you see this situation between the Vanguard and the Templars will play out.  I want you to use foresight and insight to see, in your mind, how the conflict will resolve itself, including the state of our city.  I want you to name the main players on each side, and I want you to identify the threats to all three sides: the dreamers, the vanguard and the templars.  Have a discussion with the rulers of the 3 remaining houses.\r\n','2016-07-13 02:58:33','2016-06-05 20:01:28'),(10951,10018,110,1,'Shadow\'d Steps','Little is known about this art. I\'ll quest Sorsha for the History of the Art, but for you, I would like as detailed an explanation as you can muster about the mechanics of the Art posted on the Boards, so everyone will know how to use this Art. ~Lacie~','2016-07-13 08:37:09','2016-07-10 03:13:03'),(10027,10915,14,20,'Know to 20','I need help for my location challenged frien. Write me codexes with the shortcuts you can think of around the dream. She and I will both apprecaite it. Maybe you can find two dreamser to help with shortcuts too.','2016-07-14 03:16:47','2016-07-13 07:26:09'),(10951,10680,110,1,'Shadow\'d Steps','Jade is working on posting the mechanics of the Art on the Boards. I need you to see if you can learn the History of the Art (whatever you can find) and post it also to the Boards. This way, when we teach the Art, at least the basics will be known. Thanks. ~Lacie~','2016-07-14 03:24:46','2016-07-10 03:14:53'),(10027,11052,144,1,'Chaos well to learn','These always reminds me of baskets. It is a new art for a new dream. What else is new to you? You are a teacher. What\'s in your basket. Gather me up some nice fresh places. ideas, dreamers and we can compare notes.','2016-07-14 05:24:44','2016-07-11 01:23:26'),(10951,10198,139,1,'Where\'s d\'Mares?','Find out the usefulness of this Art (of course). How do you find Datoke without it? There IS a way, ask around. If you don\'t find out or figure out, I\'ll tell ya when ya report. Lastly, I need you to sneak around & learn when the Dreamers of Light have their House meeting. DO NOT show this quest to others & don\'t tell them. Pretend you wanna join or something. ~Sneaky fun~  ~Lacie~','2016-07-14 05:35:15','2016-07-13 00:30:35'),(10067,10018,144,20,'Chaos Well - 20','This might be a little tricky to do but I want you to fill this Chaos Well and then tell me two unique things about Chaos Wells. The information can be whatever you think is interesting. I love learning what others think about stuff. <T>','2016-07-14 07:41:57','2016-07-01 05:40:44'),(10027,11065,69,1,'Tranceflame learn','The dream is so much like our shard as we gives us a sense of comfort, What do you see around you that is like where you come from, We have many flames here int he City. Can you list some for me and where they are located, List as well what dreamers have helped you.','2016-07-15 00:21:24','2016-07-13 00:11:55'),(10025,10213,144,10,'chaos well 10','for this mission should you accept. i would like you to fill 2 of lady silvers wells. bring me a reciept when you have completed this mission and you shal recieve what you seek. ~P~','2016-07-15 02:07:56','2016-07-12 22:05:29'),(10951,10376,18,20,'Chamelled! (20)','Think up or ask others 4 ways to Blend into the scenery. How can you not be seen other than using Chamele? Vision reveals the Seer, but we\'re better at hiding than that. Try out each way. Your report will be your experience & the 4 ways. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-07-15 07:47:58','2016-07-13 06:41:06'),(10018,10318,68,50,'Flame 50','((Rewrite, due to loss of original)) Make a change in your attitude around the public. Show a more official side, now that you represent a house and not just a lone wolf. Do this until you others start to notice this, and report back on what has happened.','2016-07-15 07:55:05','2016-07-15 07:50:37'),(10027,11014,9,10,'Free action to 10','You are a freespirit in the dream. This has always been a differant path from being crested. What are the good and bad points. What things can be done possible to make it better? What are the cost s of being free? Think on these things and lets chat.','2016-07-15 09:53:22','2016-07-13 19:17:04'),(10025,10198,144,1,'chaos well learn','you know the basics now lets expand on that. What benefits does having this art have? What can be put in a chaos well? What can these wells be used for besides feeding a prime? and lastly, what interesting things are there to this art? when you feel you have completed your mission seek me out and we will talk ~P~','2016-07-16 02:57:13','2016-07-15 02:18:59'),(10025,11041,60,2,'2nd sphere','an extensive interview was given and i feel this dreamer is ready to move on to 2nd sphere','2016-07-16 03:03:59','2016-07-16 03:03:41'),(10125,11023,3,10,'SoulMaster 2nd Plat','What is a focus?  What is Resilience?  What is a SoulMaster?  What are YOU?  You cannot begin to master what you do not fully comprehend.  Many skirt by on basic definitions.  But I will not accept such as standard.  Search deep within, to the depths of the dream.  May the Shadow guide you on your path.  ~D','2016-07-16 06:19:25','2016-07-14 03:44:11'),(10027,10376,2,30,'Dreamseer to 30','Insight is the key to your dreams. I wish you to take some time and tell me what you see around you.Think on where the dreamers, houses, and the City herself are headed.  Who and how many you decide to share with me is up to you. I have a special place to shows you when you report.','2016-07-16 06:51:19','2016-07-14 10:30:51'),(10027,11069,144,1,'Chaos Well Learn','You have been gathering so much in the past few dreams. Take sometime to sort it out. Ask around to those you can and have them tell you what they think a teacher is. Consider their ideas and as well as what you expect. Then come share with me what you have discovered. What is as you expected?','2016-07-16 08:19:43','2016-07-15 11:15:08'),(10003,11028,139,1,'Sense Dakoten (L) ','Aansina. you emerge into a newcity that has, new threats. Learn about sense dakoten and the current threats of these mares. What does the art do, do the mares have a counter art to sense us? How will this art protect you as you discover this new city? Get names of  of the most vile dakotens. What form are they?','2016-07-16 16:09:16','2016-06-17 16:17:16'),(10018,10125,110,1,'L: Shadow Step','I dare you to Step it up and gain as much energy as you possibly can in the matter of 1-2 dreams. Search for the best places where you can accumulate the most trapped essences in the shortest amount of time. Time youself, and let\'s see if you can beat your own record.','2016-07-17 02:59:52','2016-07-14 05:00:35'),(10092,10198,60,4,'4th Sphere Lunk','You are a scientist.. I am curious about those that come from your City.. I want you to come up with a scale of measurement on how well a dreamer is adapting to this City from yours.. catalog all of the active dreamers from your City that are in the City now and list them and their rating on your newly made scale.','2016-07-17 04:58:31','2016-06-30 16:11:21'),(11052,10915,15,10,'Quest: Sweething','Judgement is a funny thing both within the dream world and out. Dreamers use judgement eveyday just meeting others, looking at their clothes, what focus they are, etc. In your time dreaming, how many times have you judged someone to find that you were wrong?  Ask around to both older and new dreamers - what do you know about this art and why do you fee that some might find it offensive?','2016-07-17 05:05:25','2016-07-14 06:20:28'),(10027,11028,107,1,'peace aura','contribution tot he hsoue gift s for new intiates and her wonderful rsearch all worhty of gainign the art','2016-07-17 20:51:27','2016-07-17 20:50:29'),(10027,11065,69,1,'Tranceflame  learn ','he stormed and lost the art i am retrainign him with the promse he share what he learns it will be a great reminder. i beleive he will indeed do that','2016-07-17 23:44:47','2016-07-17 23:44:37'),(10680,11038,4,10,'Meaning','According to legend, or myth? Fatesenders are supposed to be pranksters, jokers, buffoons. I disagree, and so do you. Tell me what you think it REALLY means to be strong in Lucidity.  Also, find out what Major arts you will be learning and tell me which you look forward to the most, and why.  S.C.','2016-07-18 02:01:57','2016-07-06 23:10:57'),(10018,11075,47,1,'L: Push','Push is a very versatile art. In can be used for fun or prevent the most dangerous of all arts from following through. Seek out at least two others and learn of a couple ways it can be used. Once you gather these answers, seek me out for your report.','2016-07-18 06:36:07','2016-07-17 03:21:06'),(10018,10717,141,1,'L: Kinesis','Our house\'s maze appears to be one of the most confusing of all. Map out the fastest path to get to each Vault/Armory room and back. Simplify things on codex, so that the others can learn as well.','2016-07-18 07:42:33','2016-07-05 07:19:10'),(10018,10717,10,1,'Ward','Ward is a serious Gatekeeper Art.  An Art not to be abused nor taken lightly.  This quest should not be taken lightly either.  I want you to consider the consequences of abusing this art.  How can it be abused? Consider how this art is helpful and also how it hinders. What is a pocket Ward? What is a Double Ward? How are these two types of Wards achieved?  I want details on all topics above.  I want to know you fully understand this art and its importance and its capabilities.  Gatekeeper Hanna','2016-07-18 08:17:27','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10108,11065,139,1,'Sence Datoken','Sence Datoken is like sence dreamer, but for Datoken. Your task, should you accept it, is to find out all you can about what a Datoken IS. Ask around, and compare answers - at least three should do. If you can find out their history too, even better - although it\'s not required.','2016-07-19 00:58:42','2016-07-18 00:15:45'),(10027,10269,60,4,'Fourth Sphere','You are the new weapons purchaser but first you must find just the right ones. Ask dreamser to design a weapos and after you have gathered them up have a showing and have judges pick the ones you want first and second place. Use the scrolls to make more dreamers know what you are doing.','2016-07-19 01:44:59','2016-07-13 07:47:02'),(10951,10987,0,30,'Join the Coffers!','As Co-QuarterMaster, you & Dar\'canon must prepare our supplies. How will you use JP to speed this process up? Use your skills in both the House & out at the gens. Your report will be how you used JP to quicken the process & be more effective in your new duties! ~Lacie~','2016-07-19 02:06:27','2016-07-09 00:56:09'),(10022,10915,80,20,'Magnum - Hypno 10','Come up with a battle plan which involves the effective use of Hypnotic Weave. How can it be used so that it has the greatest effect. You should take into consideration a part of three others. They are to each have a function so that you may safely use Hypnotic Weave and it have the greatest chance of taking hold.','2016-07-19 05:14:03','2016-07-14 04:26:21'),(10880,10067,88,1,'Train Self','After interviewin\' Tamarisk and acceptin\' his supports, me be grantin\' him the station of Master Teacher.','2016-07-19 07:17:12','2016-07-19 07:17:03'),(10007,11014,70,40,'Flame 40','Find 5 flames in the City. Think outside the box please. I want these to be unique. I want a full description on what these flames are and what they mean to you. This must be worthy of the plat you seek.','2016-07-19 18:26:09','2016-07-14 06:01:51'),(10025,11065,47,1,'Push to learn','We have a library within the city that holds a wide aray of information, l would like you to go there and learn the art history of push. once you have achieved this i would like you to speak with others and learn of some of the ways you can use push. Also learn three games that can be played using the art. when you have completed your mission seek me out and we will talk~P~','2016-07-19 20:58:58','2016-07-14 18:07:55'),(10916,11065,98,1,'N. Awakened - Learn','Being a newly awakened yourself, what do you see the use of  this art so early in your dreams?  What are some of the major issues you have learned so far since being in the city?  Finally tell me what you hope to experience in the future as you explore the city.\r\n','2016-07-19 21:15:28','2016-07-18 00:07:51'),(10951,11014,74,10,'The Blank\'d Mind!','Experiment time! Enter Threshold 1 dream in a portal you don\'t normally use. MB immediately! Go 3 portals to your right. Go outside & then down the House\'s path 10 rooms. Evoke Know & refresh your MB. Sit down. Spend an entire evocation of MB looking around. Where are you? What do you think of? How does the place you\'re in Blank or clear your mind. Your report is your experience related. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-07-19 23:02:52','2016-07-16 09:40:41'),(10311,10915,111,10,'Dazzle10-Magnum','Lets make our house dazzle, get with at least one other member of the house to clean up a room. Organize a vault, scrub the facade steps.. do anything you would like with whomever you would like to just show some sort of attention for our home! Maybe take that time to hype that member up about dazzle, and how awesome it is. Try to motivate them to get a plat on the art.\r\n','2016-07-19 23:41:14','2016-07-10 14:55:11'),(10951,10299,47,1,'Quest: Push','What drives your avatar\'s innate ability to exert itself and push objects? Can you just about push anything in the dream? Or are there limiations?  I want you to ask others on this.  Do they use it for fun or for defensive purposes?  Ask them why they feel it uses Dreamsoul what is the connection.  Have them use it on you.  Do you feel any different?  Finally I want you to give me three good uses for Push.','2016-07-20 00:09:49','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10951,10299,47,1,'Push (from Venom)','rewrite for Venom\'s quest....acceptable report','2016-07-20 00:09:49','2016-07-20 00:09:38'),(10018,10299,9,1,'Free Action | Learn','Seek out three Gatekeepers, and learn what you can about Free Action. Why is this art a must have?','2016-07-20 00:29:58','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10018,10299,68,1,'FlameShaft','Learn about the plants in our city and compare them to those in your shard. Are there places here that have other signs of life (hint: body parts)? Teach me about 5 types of plants that you find. And show me any other interesting signs of life you learn about.','2016-07-20 00:44:08','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10680,10915,71,60,'As You Like It','In your ongoing quest to spread happiness. Have a game of flame tag with your house mates in your house maze. Give some prizes. 2. An outdoor cook off! this may be a contest or just a gathering , your choice, but make sure YOU flame up some interesting foods. 3. A n evening of flame duels in the Arena. Give prizes for all events. Make events public via Edict Board outside.  S.C.','2016-07-20 01:53:20','2016-07-14 05:05:55'),(10022,10750,22,10,'Arnaya: Forge 10','Your services are currently required. It is up to you to convince people to make, and gather from them, the devices I require to attempt to burn Revenants from a plane. You know the concept behind what I am asking for, so I will not write it here. See to it that we have plenty, then you will assist me in deploying them.','2016-07-20 04:29:51','2016-06-29 07:09:22'),(10066,10008,105,1,'PC Learn','Kailee assisted seeker RedBee X with gathering essence for his initiation as asked. ','2016-07-20 06:11:38','2016-07-20 06:11:27'),(10480,10750,52,1,'Written Final Exam','Now is the time for the last step in your trials. I want you to dream up a new and amazing art. It can be either a Major or Minor of any focus including DreamSoul. I want specifics and details. I also want you to write up several example tasks to learn your new art. Find 5 others and see if they would learn your art and get input. Finally, write sample plateaus for your art for 10, 20, ane 30. Be ready to defend your work. **A**','2016-07-21 01:06:36','2016-07-07 06:01:41'),(10480,10750,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Supports for gaining halo\r\n','2016-07-21 01:06:43','2016-07-21 00:53:04'),(10480,10750,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts for gaining halo\r\n','2016-07-21 01:06:49','2016-07-21 00:53:17'),(10480,10022,44,70,'BladeS | FireS70','Set the city on fire as you try to eradicate the Revenant. Plan, execute and have back up solutions.  The use of FireStorm is key in this plan. You\'ll need followers who will assist you, obviously. Join forces with friends and foe alike. ','2016-07-21 01:27:31','2016-06-22 01:29:50'),(10022,11065,60,1,'Joandaltha Sphere 1','Granting First Sphere to Joandaltha via interview. Tested for basic knowledge of the DreamScape. Items, Mares, Houses, etc.','2016-07-21 03:30:43','2016-07-21 03:16:02'),(10022,11065,60,1,'Joandaltha Sphere 1','Take two! He got floated to a Revenant and then stormed, losing his sphere. Explaining that this will only work for first sphere, should he lose future spheres he will have to regain them.','2016-07-21 03:45:17','2016-07-21 03:44:33'),(10593,10916,35,10,'Let\'s Palavar','Let\'s talk about the current state of the City and the trap we all kind of find ourselves in these days. Yes, honesty. Rant, rave, whatever. Let\'s figure out what we might do to help. ~c','2016-07-21 05:30:03','2016-07-07 19:33:10'),(10232,10915,66,40,'Magnum - Slayer 40','Dueling is a thing that I haven\'t seen in the City recently. Fix that, would you? Duel a bunch of people, and keep records of the results, and encourage other peoples to duel as well! What method works best for encouraging duels!?!','2016-07-21 21:38:12','2016-07-09 00:52:14'),(10746,10360,38,1,'Scare ~ learn','Even though she was DreamStruck once, Lace does not seem to fear it now as she stands beside a known Striker.  One can assume that she no longer fears that which she once did.  With the greatest threat known to Dreamkind no longer a fear, what could she possibly be scared of?  Theorize and share with me.','2016-07-21 21:43:39','2016-07-03 19:12:43'),(10232,11028,25,20,'Anasina - Reweave20','Your first dream back, you helped create a weave to keep Zaxun\'s armies out! Find out more about this, Arnaya and Arlyana Jax being good sources! Develop your own plan for creating a woven barrier against outside intrusion, and be sure to include Mind Blank into this theoretical weave! In addition: For the duration of this task, you must request to be mind blanked at all times. If you\'re not mind blanked, search out someone to do that for you!','2016-07-21 22:41:39','2016-07-01 22:55:33'),(10232,11046,60,2,'Xererth - 2ndsphere','Interview: Discussed houses, preferences, his goals --> Political beliefs, he trusts Xun\'rok 100%, wants to lick his boots clean as can be. Was a little shaky on knowing his own focus and art progresssion, but we\'re working on it, discussed that some, too. Talked about goals, mostly. Passed sphere interivew. ','2016-07-22 00:04:51','2016-07-22 00:02:28'),(10232,10108,42,10,'Clarity-Darkness10','It\'s kinda funny how it works, but darkness is easier to see than light. I\'d like for you to look for what is difficult to see. Search throughout the Dream, and find me the BRIGHTEST locations possible. Develop some scale on which the brightness of a room can be measured, and be prepared to explain. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-07-22 04:47:39','2016-06-06 00:33:26'),(10066,10915,22,30,'Forge Talisman 30','Your goal is to create a recall alteror with several hours of duration. (Try for 4 hours) Your process work should include at least two public events where each event you create your own tools to further your goal in creating the recall alteror. Delegate work where you can.','2016-07-22 05:03:00','2016-06-27 04:39:13'),(10027,11027,60,1,'Sphere 1','Namelss has a very detailed awareness fo the deram and the basic he needs to advance to first sphere. ','2016-07-22 16:19:35','2016-07-22 16:14:55'),(10311,11065,47,10,'Push10-Joandaltha','So you say you wrestle the emphants, lets see if you can push your way to bigger and badder things. Make a few attempts to attack som bogroms, take someone with you and get pointers and maybe a restore or two would be needed. After you have tried this on a few bogs, report to me who you took and what you learned.','2016-07-22 19:57:32','2016-07-21 18:09:46'),(10746,11028,46,10,'Recall ~ 10','I want to know more about you!  Tell me about some of your favourite moments from both citys.   But here is the twist, I would like you to compose it as if someone were watching you and retelling it.','2016-07-23 04:00:33','2016-07-03 05:05:48'),(10018,10632,60,3,'3rd Sphere','I plan on holding a Flame class in the near future and can use an assistant. Bring all of your knowledge about the use of flame to share, and be prepared to to act out examples to the class. Lastly, if you feel you can offer anything else, please do so.','2016-07-23 05:14:00','2016-07-15 08:14:40'),(10066,10888,60,5,'Sphere 5','Lead an effort to reliably negate Zaxun\'s shield. The process should include three public events (with notice) led by you, where the attendees are able to assist you in some way each time. Delegate work to others for the last two events. Finally, put your plan in to action by testing it against Zaxun\'s shield. Your process work should be very thorough in case you do not succeed in your goal.','2016-07-23 05:43:57','2016-06-09 03:48:35'),(10916,10888,28,1,'Abjure - Learn','Find rooms in the city that has starting letters of it matching your name.  So one room starts with U then another T and so on....write down the room names and which plane they are on.  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-07-23 06:49:04','2016-07-23 06:21:51'),(10593,10360,25,30,'Fibre Arts','You have been given a weaving loom and material to go with it, a sewing kit with all manner of needles, thread, buttons, scissors, tape measure..Several different types of fabric..cotton, linen, silk, suede and some colored wool, knitting needles and crochet hook. Get busy! 1 creation from each grouping. Have fun!! ','2016-07-23 19:35:35','2016-06-24 20:58:54'),(10951,10962,47,1,'An Odd Art','After learning the basics of this Art (its focus, ability, general info) from other dreamers, attempt t understand why it is the 1st Art a Dreamer is able to learn. Why Push? In your journey of discovery, dod you get Pushed by others? How? Why? How was it used long ago? The answer is in the journey as are all things in the City. Good Luck & if ya have questions, please ask! ~Lacie~','2016-07-23 23:01:36','2016-04-21 06:51:38'),(10027,10088,50,10,'NMF to 10','Host a gathering with drinks as the theme. Fun and games allowed. Have one or ten guests its up to you. Share with me what you think the tavern can be used for in the future and what fun you had with teh gathering.','2016-07-24 01:18:49','2016-05-08 16:37:47'),(10988,10250,83,1,'Healing Aura - Anya','Compare theoretical tactics with Healing Aura to practical use in battle. There are not many who have it, but consult your peers. How would you improve, or completely change, the art if it has qualities that are lacking.','2016-07-24 04:24:53','2016-07-07 04:34:57'),(10311,10007,142,1,'MisDLearn-Dina','So you dont agree with the new ruler at KoES. In your own way, try to direct some more people right up outta there. You can use all resources available to you. (Halo, sexy wiles.. etc) You can direct them out of the house, off the facade, out of a room.. Lace just mentioned to me that unity is what shes looking for. Lets see that be tested some. When you feel you have made some kind of impact report to me your results.','2016-07-24 04:27:56','2016-07-06 21:55:27'),(10988,10007,30,50,'Antidote 50','The most feared art from a SoulMaster is their Abjure. Dreamers sling poison chakrams at almost every opportunity. You are considered a focus of healing, yet you are most coveted for your ability to do the exact opposite. Find a way to utilize your harmful abilities in a healing manner and return to me to discuss people\'s reactions. Keep in mind the plateau, and make your efforts worthy of the reward you seek.\r\n','2016-07-24 04:38:27','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10276,10032,144,1,'Chaos Well L','I think we will stick with the basics of this art as I believe it is important to know the story behind its creation.  That is exactly what you need, how was it created...by whom...when....any facts you can find on the topic.  Try to weed out the fiction from the facts on this one.  One last thing, what will you do with the essence once you have captured it?  Gatekeeper - Hannababy','2016-07-24 04:43:21','2016-05-04 03:07:52'),(10988,10007,29,60,'Poison 60 - Dina','Considering your situation, find a way to damage your enemies without using a chakram. Interfere with their plans, smeer their name, convince their followers to leave, whatever. Do six unique things, report the results. Ensure at least half have some tangible success.','2016-07-24 05:04:16','2016-07-07 04:43:44'),(10107,10018,142,10,'Misdirection 10','Jade completed the report for the task for Misdirection to 10 for Arnaya.  She gave a great report and I am satisfied in the task from my apprentice and in the report from Jade.','2016-07-24 05:47:22','2016-07-24 05:47:15'),(10951,10056,23,30,'Recharged !','I have given a list of items we need to refill our coffers. Bring in what\'s needed. Your report on Recharge will be a discussion on what you\'ve learned about the changes in the Art and help in getting our coffers filled with the RIGHT sort of items. You know what I mean. ~Lacie~','2016-07-24 18:08:05','2016-07-24 17:28:52'),(10027,10087,142,10,'Misdirection to ten','Time to direct your and the dreams of others offer some sage advice to several dreamers but follow you own dear friend. Plot the direction yourdreams may take in the near future.','2016-07-24 20:19:03','2016-07-10 03:18:16'),(10027,10213,19,40,'vision to 40','Time to show the dream what you have seen and what you see now and what you see for the future....for yourself your house and the dream. Share these visions as you see fit in a story for the archives as a shared discusssion with house mates, etc... Let the Dream see who Vill is.','2016-07-25 00:19:17','2016-07-23 00:25:43'),(10125,10104,67,50,'SoulReaper - 50','You are to be instructor to Coraal.  Take him under your wing and teach work on his blading technique.  Then, find him suitable oppoents be them nightmare, dreamer, and even perhaps revenants.  Your blade is to remain sheathed.  Protect him with your instruction.  Allow him to grow in strength through your teaching.  Bonus if you help him blade down revenants.  ~Dakk','2016-07-25 01:40:14','2016-07-18 01:37:20'),(10136,10108,24,20,'Restore20-Clarity','Fall \"ill\" or break a leg or.. lose your mind!  for a few nights.  Who is there to assist? What was done by the non-SMs? What was done by the SMs? How do the different foci try to assist you?  You can tell them after you report that it was all just a task, but I\'m interested in knowing who does what to help you. On the other hand, I want you to express to me how you would personally assist someone who had a fractured mind.  Have fun with the task!!','2016-07-25 02:32:32','2016-03-21 23:50:53'),(10108,10915,40,20,'Deafen - 20','The FS guild is absolutely NOT begining work on Cauterize. Because of this project we can not speak about due to FS guild rules about never actually doing anything ever, I\'d like you to create for me a few prototypes for capturing and distilling a firestorm down into it\'s focal componants so we can begin to not work on this not-project for the guild.\r\n','2016-07-25 02:46:40','2016-07-18 01:13:37'),(10066,11046,8,10,'Protection 10','Consider a hunting spot and genning spot that you would like to occupy. Devise a plan for both places (if different) on how to successfully escape an assault from an enemy if you cannot defend.','2016-07-25 02:50:09','2016-07-22 04:07:01'),(10066,10962,60,1,'KuKai Sphere 1','Interview: He has demonstrated knowledge only available through talking to others, such as talisman, their type and function. The houses, their beliefs. The four focii he knew some, so we went over all of them and their elements. He is patient and observant. I will be honoring his first sphere now.','2016-07-25 03:55:40','2016-07-25 03:54:10'),(10916,10962,70,1,'Flamesear - Learn','Talk to people of the city and find out what they most use their flame for (If anything.)  Then learn what you can about the art itself.  Finally how do you see yourself using this art now and possibly in the future, how can it help you in your dreams?  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-07-25 05:09:52','2016-07-24 20:15:40'),(10916,10269,139,1,'Sense Dat - Learn','Find some opinions from dreamers on just how intelligent they believe Datoken are.  Do they merely run off a higher form of instinct?  Are they hunter killers who don\'t know any better?  See what people think then formulate your own opinion.  Share with me what you come up with.\r\n','2016-07-25 06:06:51','2016-07-21 23:37:26'),(10005,10269,36,40,'Blade to 40','Gather some allies and choose a plane that multiple revenants are present on.  Collapse all the revenants on that plane and gather their essences.  Choose your plane wisely, as some will have shamblix and horron revenents and be harder than others.  Make a plan for the essences you gather, whether that is to give them to one of the houses or to put them to use in some way.','2016-07-25 06:26:10','2016-07-21 01:36:10'),(10009,10018,111,1,'Dazzle-Learn','You\'ve already brought a wealth to the Light from the Keepers. Compile a useful set of information that we may or may not know about them. Include information about their capabilities, their vaults, and their internal factions. Place it on the Members Only section of the scrolls.','2016-07-25 22:02:09','2016-07-23 21:41:18'),(10951,10299,60,1,'A New Dream! (1st)','The City has changed in your absense! Find the new areas, summarizing your thoughts about each. Need a guide? Get someone to show ya! Teacher\'s Guild, Museum, Provenance & others. Find out how these places are here. Raise your Arts to 9 so you can plat them once 1st. Visit each open House or talk to a member. Your report is a summary of your experience. Enjoy ~Lacie~','2016-07-25 23:09:22','2016-07-20 00:19:38'),(10311,10962,26,1,'PurifyL-KuKai','Find out from others what this art actually does. Most people dont use it on themselves, but mostly on each other. Why is that? Also, there are a few types in the city who do not appreciate purify being evoked on them, as around and see if you can find a few examples of that. When you have sought all of the information here return to me with your report!\r\n','2016-07-25 23:47:17','2016-07-24 18:00:35'),(10951,11065,2,10,'Insane Male Seers','What *is* it about that male ego & all that Insight that doesn\'t mix? Learn about 3 male Seers who are or went nuts. You are Seer, what kind will you be? Assassin? Scholar? Research & develop your own persona. Your report will be about the 3 & how you will direct your own Insight. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-07-25 23:57:57','2016-07-21 18:11:37'),(10007,10087,29,50,'Poison 50','Take a look around our City and find some nice materials to be placed on other dreamers that need some \"fashion sense\". I want you to make them pieces that could help their attire, then I want you to confront them with the piece and get them to change their clothes. Take note of who and bring me a copy of the piece, so I can see for myself, oh and their reactions! Do this with at least 10 dreamers. One person may need more than one piece and don\'t forget about accessories! Have fun!','2016-07-26 01:15:29','2016-07-10 04:13:44'),(10746,10916,22,10,'Forge ~ 10 (1)','Time for some theory...why do you think we are limited to four first colours?  Look at the limitations of Forge and why they may be in place and construct some tools to change them.','2016-07-26 04:27:23','2016-06-18 04:18:29'),(10003,11065,36,10,'Jo: Dreamblade10','The city is plague by nightmares. They are trickesters. Learning how to confidentially use your blade without tripping over those shabby boots you were. Ask a few dreamers to teach you circle blading and backblading. Did you improve, did you fail? Give me your synopsis of your improved skills after taking this instruction. Also get new boots forged.','2016-07-26 04:28:05','2016-07-22 01:08:30'),(10680,11014,9,20,'Free?','What I see in you is a man who is not sure what he wants or where he is going. To know this, ou have to be free of old baggage, bitterness, conflict.  If you feel that the Cloister is -truly- for you, you would need to - set an example-  by being kind, helpful, no spiteful words or actions. I want to see this from you over the course of a few dreams. This must be REAL, this is not an easy path to take. Are you sure it is for you?  S.C.','2016-07-26 07:40:09','2016-07-24 04:06:05'),(10916,10888,35,1,'Trap - Learn','Let\'s t\r\nake a different look at Trap.  Is there any comparison to Trap in relation to Banish, Cleanse or Imprison mare arts?  If so how and what?  If not, what art would you most closely associate Trap with and why? What relations do the two hold?  I look forward to your report.','2016-07-27 02:11:56','2016-07-26 06:54:42'),(10311,10213,7,10,'RF10-Vill','I noticed today that Zsa is sort of a driving force within your home, you may be comfortable with this, or not. If you are, prove it by whole-heartedly backing her in a particular effort.. and if not voice your concerns however you see fit (Privately or publically within your house in a meeting or something) on some subject. When you feel like you have made an impact either way report to me your results.\r\n','2016-07-27 02:31:54','2016-07-22 07:41:18'),(10022,10915,42,10,'Magnum: Darkness 10','Think of a way to remove the darkness from a dreamer\'s dreams. The person is up to you, the means by which you accomplish this is up to you. Tell me who, how, why.','2016-07-27 04:01:26','2016-07-19 05:22:36'),(10027,11069,139,1,'Sense datoken learn','This is an interesting art and the history is more interesting. You can find it in the Second sphere hall. So this is a treasure hunt for reasources and information.  Why is the history in this hall? The key is the wordsmiths of this time. They are incharge of the Library nd museam. Who are the currents one and what are their duties?','2016-07-27 08:02:56','2016-07-17 21:35:22'),(10027,11014,38,1,'Scare to learn','Not all thigns are bad eh? Find the good uses for scare. Ask dreamres what scares them in the dream. Can we not be afriad? If so how?','2016-07-27 08:38:45','2016-07-25 11:15:06'),(10916,10269,7,1,'RF - Learn','With so many threats around the city as of late, think about what you fear the most.  Come up with something that represents your fear without using words.  What you use what you come up with are up to you.\r\n','2016-07-28 01:28:25','2016-07-26 06:44:05'),(10022,10018,111,10,'Jade: Dazzle 10','Go through the Armory, ensure that the chaks are of a proper standard. Place them neatly on the ledges. I hate it when people mess them up.','2016-07-28 01:31:04','2016-07-27 04:17:17'),(10018,10269,6,10,'Meditation 10','Meditate on the current war. Where do you see it going? How long do you think it will last? Is there an end in sight? How can we go about doing that? As a returning dreamer, I\'m looking for a fresh perspective.','2016-07-28 02:22:41','2016-07-27 04:27:12'),(10107,10915,142,20,'Misdirection 20 -','I am curious if there might be room for an opposite art that captivates dreamers into looking at a dreamer.  What purposes do you think that could be used for?  Do you think that this theoretical art could be used in a way that could be complimented by misdirection? \r\n','2016-07-28 03:12:39','2016-07-24 06:01:57'),(10066,11045,60,2,'Sphere 2 interview','Demostrated knowledge of his house paths and how he has fulfilled each role he is enlisted. One of a supported role in protecting a dreamer, the others assisting with revenant removals and third defending Calenture and the city from Foulmoth. He informed on Zaxun and his supporters and their agenda. All knowledge that can only be gained through interaction.','2016-07-28 05:02:02','2016-07-28 04:59:46'),(10593,10032,3,30,'Soulmastery!!','I\'ve seen what you can do with creativity. So two projects.. first a carving of something that you feel is the epitome of Soulmastery! and secondly... make up a new Soulmastery art that is a bit on the unusual side! I look forward to your creations! ~C','2016-07-28 20:40:09','2016-05-30 22:32:29'),(10874,10057,36,60,'DreamBlade 60 Kailo','Not all conflict can be solved by the sword! Aid your allies or harm your enemies without using a single Art that could not be used in Sanctuary! Talking to them or brokering peace or idle things like that do not count!','2016-07-29 01:00:35','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10027,10213,18,40,'Chamele 40','Play hide the guardian. Silina for one needs help learning her way around whether you do it on one plane or the house is up to you but you need to play it at least four times. I will need to know wher you were hiding who was finidning you and the results. Chamele is allowed if the have vision.','2016-07-29 01:31:11','2016-07-25 05:13:49'),(10027,11065,16,1,'Identify learn','Tell me what things you wish to see in the dream that you have not dicovered. Identify the sytength and weaknesses of others for yourself and to share with me. What do you see as the perfect day in the Dream?','2016-07-29 01:56:53','2016-07-27 03:03:13'),(10951,11065,69,10,'Seer\'s Inner Flame!','Ok! An experiment: Learn what different Seers see as their \"Inner Flame\". You can either observe or ask. Those you ask, ask them to describe their Inner Flame on Codex or Talisman (their choice). Then observe them & See if what they \"say\" & they \"do\" reflects the same Flame. Names & descriptions = your report. Enjoy!','2016-07-29 02:14:43','2016-07-26 00:47:04'),(10916,10962,24,1,'Restore - Learn','Being that you are a pacifist.  I want you to think about restore and would using it as a support being aiding in violent acts even if it is to help someone else?  Is there such a line?  Discuss this with some others (possibly some other pacifists).  Also come up with your own thoughts on this subject.\r\n','2016-07-29 02:26:45','2016-07-25 05:19:13'),(10874,10400,92,40,'Reflection Repair','Reflect on the fabric of the City. What other structures, planes, and strongholds be needin attention? Have the current population reflect what you see and make ammenable repairs. By force if necessary. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-07-29 03:02:02','2016-02-16 00:31:21'),(10951,10104,96,30,'Sense the Flow','Over the next day or so, watch the movements of our enemy. They are planning & working on something. Keep notes on codex if needed. I am most interested in the females. They do the DoL\'s legwork (Tember, Flower, Dina & Jade). Your report is name-date-place, in short detail. Good Hunting! ~Lacie~','2016-07-29 05:29:54','2016-07-27 06:47:25'),(10951,10632,16,1,'Identify This!','Seek out 10 items which you think are worth keeping in your pack. Then have them ID\'d. How many turn out to be not worth the pack space? This Art also does something special to your pack. Find out, if you can, & if you can\'t, I\'ll let you in on the secret of the Art. Enjoy.','2016-07-29 16:23:42','2016-07-28 06:20:16'),(10007,11014,67,40,'Blade 40','I do not know who this Ceyllynn woman is, but she sounds pretty interesting. Get her story for me. Be it from her or ask around (make sure to get more than one side if you get it from someone else). See if she is a good fighter or knows how to swing a blade well.','2016-07-29 18:34:21','2016-07-21 18:07:01'),(10746,11065,15,1,'Judge~ learn','With your new footwear, I would like you to explore the new planes that are now open to you and judge them on the following: appearance, gens, hunting, uniqueness.','2016-07-29 23:43:26','2016-07-22 04:29:53'),(10027,11014,139,1,'Sense Datoken learn','Find out who the current daymares and darks are. These are always lists to keep up to date. What kind of nightmares can you see in the dream currently or int he future and what can we do about them.','2016-07-30 01:40:54','2016-07-27 10:16:37'),(10007,10916,35,20,'Trap 20','I am sure you can find something to trap other than mares. I know this City has critters around here, we just don\'t see them very often. Take the cage I give you and take a small group, go exploring around until you find something cute and small to place in the cage. Bring it to me. Tell me who helped, how you trapped it, and what exactly you trapped.','2016-07-30 02:48:10','2016-07-22 04:42:09'),(10728,10750,70,50,'FlameS50 | Arnaya','Continue your work to halt the spread of Zaxun\'s army.  Experiment with fire. Gather all you can to assist you on your quest, but do not die.','2016-07-30 02:56:32','2016-06-30 04:10:49'),(10480,10232,42,70,'Darkness -- 70','As per our discussion, I wish for you to be Blind for a total of 7 dreams. You will need to rely on the kindness of others as well as your other sences. This adventure should allow you to experience first hand how being unprepared will leave you vulnerable. Find ways to overcome this disability. When we meet again, share with me your trials and tribulations. Make efforts worthy of the plateau that you seek. **A**','2016-07-30 02:59:12','2016-07-12 07:02:32'),(10680,11045,72,1,'Once upon a dream..','You will go to a dreamer and ask them to begin a story for you on an infinite codex..you will take that codex to another, show it to them, they will continue the story.. you will do this until you have 6 pages. I hope you and your helpers will enjoy this. ++SC++','2016-07-30 03:23:46','2016-07-28 05:44:09'),(10232,11065,14,10,'Joandaltha - Know10','I\'d like for you to KNOW something for me! Explore one of the shiny new OUTER PLANES you\'ve unlocked by sphereing, and DISCOVER something you didn\'t know! Know it! And explain to me HOW you know it! Be prepared to discuss some, and ensure a thorough report. ','2016-07-30 03:25:02','2016-07-21 18:00:19'),(10125,10250,28,50,'Abjure - Fifth Plat','As one seeking to serve the Shadow, you will be required to make sacrifices.  What are you willing to let go?  Learn of the sacrifices of other Keepers both present and of ages past.  Would you have done the same?  What is something you are prepared to lose as you begin your path in servitude of the Shadow?  ~D','2016-07-30 03:27:56','2016-07-12 05:01:36'),(10728,10250,29,60,'Poison 60 - Anya','Figure out your plan for your dreams going forward. Many will vie for your loyalty. Align with someone, something, or be a lone agent, and make progress along the path you choose. Lend your assistance, whether healing or hurting, in 6 different ways along your path.','2016-07-30 03:29:06','2016-07-24 04:29:34'),(10125,10104,28,30,'Abjure - Third Plat','Start by reading my mission, \"The Shadowed Path\".  Then, I would like you to discover from each Keeper you can what sacrifice(s) they have made and are willing to make in servitude to the Shadow.  Direct them also to read if not accept \"The Shadowed Path\" mission.  Report to me when you have completed this task.  ~D','2016-07-30 03:53:05','2016-07-27 04:03:10'),(10480,10318,1,60,'GateKeeper -- 60','As I have witnessed, others see you as loyal to Zaxun. I would like for you to think of a way to remove Zaxun, his Revenants and Xun\'rok from the City. Use your newfound fighting skills and resourcefullness to think up a solution to all three problems facing the City that we all hold dear. Your insights will be completely safe with me when you share them. I wish to see what you can come up with. Make your efforts worthy of the plateau you seek. **A**','2016-07-30 03:57:57','2016-07-12 06:02:47'),(10022,10746,22,60,'Arly Jax: Forge 60','As a DreamSmith, more is expected from you when it comes to Forge. For this task you are to study the Revenents. Discover how they are created. Involve others with this research. Once you are educated on how they function you will remove them from a single plane. In order for you to do this you are to use Forge to develop a device that will accomplish this goal. This device is to utilize at least four pieces created by others. Each piece is to be well conceived and functional, making up a whole.','2016-07-30 04:09:42','2016-06-26 22:40:35'),(10680,10108,41,30,'Are you Blind?!!','Make people see things that are not there. A bug on the wall, a giant salamander, a wrinkle, a pile of emphant feces! You decide what they see and where. Be persistant! Above all, have fun. I will be interested to hear what  you made people see. S.C.','2016-07-30 04:11:57','2016-07-20 02:15:45'),(10480,10108,52,40,'Clarity - Train 40','Speak to your fellow Teachers, and discuss with them a TEACHER REWARD PROGRAM. Gather ideas, JUST IDEAS, mind, on how such a system might operate. Organize these ideas, and your opinions on them, for your report. Bring also to your report five examples of 4th plateau tasks. ','2016-07-30 04:57:46','2016-07-22 05:05:52'),(10027,10198,2,40,'Dreamseer 40','The dream is ever changing it is not what it was yesterday nor will it be the same tomorrow. I want you to think about what skills you have either here on your shard that the dream needs and create a detailed plan to make two work here. ','2016-07-30 10:09:08','2016-07-28 05:51:46'),(10107,10066,23,70,'Recharge 70 - TM','The dream needs a plan for recharging itself with the influx of dreamers.  Something that brings people in and gets them involved in a fun way that isn\'t too \"stuffy.\"  Think of some projects you might have people do for tasks for sphere\'s and the like. I think it\'s time we have some big events return.  What events would draw the biggest participation rates and how can we recharge/reboot these events?\r\n','2016-07-30 20:24:53','2016-07-13 03:01:23'),(10951,10623,21,20,'Triple Wards?','Try this experiment: Get a GK (the House has several) & Ward up the Initiate\'s Lounge. The Portals will hold 3 Wards each. Once up, Blend through the Wards. Do this a couple of times to other portals in the House. Your report will be your theory of why this happens & how. Enjoy. ~Lacie~','2016-07-30 22:57:25','2016-07-27 08:07:10'),(10951,10632,24,1,'Medic! Medic!','Restore starts out like a bandage on a broken leg! So, to learn how to make it work the best, here\'s a bandage! (ID it!) Then take this Well, fill it with Emphants, using only your Restore Bandage to heal any wounds! Nay Elemens, mind you; just your Bandage & Meditate! Your report = your experience! ~Lacie~','2016-07-30 23:16:14','2016-07-29 16:34:03'),(10311,10007,111,1,'DazzleL-Dina','Save some souls! Strengthen your home! Make a dazzling impression. 1000 strength worth of impression. :P\r\n','2016-07-30 23:46:06','2016-07-30 08:27:21'),(10108,10004,144,10,'Zsa - CW 10','Work with LadySilver and your home to get the Alliance back on it\'s feet. Once the leadership is set and settled, kick it into high gear Zsa style and have strength gathering party for Alliance members only. Get\'m out hunting and genning and bonding!','2016-07-31 01:11:07','2016-05-18 00:16:45'),(10027,11065,16,10,'Identify to 10','So my fellow seer time for you to teach me. Tell me of the inside of dreamers and our walls. Explain to me what the City is? And what she can never be? You can seek the words of others or just your own. Or the scrolls hidden in the chaos scrolls. We will talk and perhaps go on a field trip when you return to me with the quest complete.','2016-07-31 01:11:07','2016-07-29 03:20:40'),(10027,11065,60,2,'second sphere','interview we reviewed what he has learned abd his plans for the next ssphere i beleive him worthy of this sphere','2016-07-31 01:26:57','2016-07-31 01:26:43'),(10009,11065,51,10,'Locate-10','The Dream is an interesting place lately and most of this is due to the dreamers within. But who dreams, when do they dream, and where do they often reside when they do so? Keep track of who you come across for a single, full, dream. Who, when, and where. Does this tell you anything about the Dreamers, the Dream, or you?','2016-07-31 02:24:57','2016-07-22 20:10:52'),(10007,10888,35,10,'Trap 10','Why can\'t a soulmaster trap while using our essence manipulation arts? I want you to look more into this. I want to trap and it be Imprisoned strength and you could have Banished strength. Why can\'t we do this? Come up with a why and what we could do for an SM meeting. A plan. Would it be linked to what house you are in or should it be where we can choose? Things for you to think on.','2016-07-31 02:27:16','2016-07-30 04:03:15'),(10107,10746,36,60,'DreamBlade 60','The DreamBlade is the dream\'s most ignored weapon of choice in battle and reduced to mostly a hunting item.  Think of a way that it could be restored to become a viable battle item again.  Is there something that could be done to make it more effective in battle, and if so, how can we encourage others to particiapte.\r\n','2016-07-31 02:29:09','2016-07-08 04:12:45'),(10107,11046,7,10,'Resist Fear 10','Is Resist Fear a function of increasing ones bravery, or is it a function of decreasing the effects of fear?  One can certainly be brave without Resist Fear, and one can use Resist Fear and be a coward.  Think about the implications of being scared in a fight: both the art and the emotion.  Can you turn either of these into an advantage in a fight?\r\n','2016-07-31 02:46:51','2016-07-24 05:42:22'),(10746,11065,139,10,'Datoken ~ 10','I would like you to imagine the City before this art existed.  How would datoken/daymares have been detected?  Come up with a theory and story for me.','2016-07-31 02:59:24','2016-07-29 23:53:17'),(10916,11065,48,1,'Soul Evoke - Learn','Considered one of the more deadly and temptuous arts in the city.  I want you to find out everything you can about this art.  What it does, what it\'s cost is, what it was used for in the past.  Then I want you, after learning these things, consider your own dreams.  How would you use this art?  What temptations do you see coming with it and when does the cost become worth the risk of using it?\r\n','2016-07-31 03:13:13','2016-07-29 23:53:00'),(10746,10198,20,40,'Blast ~ 40','I would you like you theorize why Blast is line of sight for DreamSeers, but not for Revenants.  Do they actually evoke it or is it Reflected?  How is this possible?  Work with other Seers to test your theory. ','2016-07-31 03:21:35','2016-07-30 02:12:40'),(10311,10269,74,10,'MB10-RedBee','So I want you to do some research on a maybe lesser remembered but influential former member of DoL from our city. Ask around who your subject should be, Kelos is a good place to start. Then do the research on an important thing that person did, for the house or the city and write me up a series of codexes about this history, or story about this person. Make sure to choose someone who when mentioned now most draw a blank, so we can bring back a memory to be remembered forever!\r\n','2016-07-31 03:52:10','2016-07-29 23:05:02'),(10018,10269,9,20,'Free Action 20','The FateSender art Tempest currently has no counter art. Take a good look at Free Action and the way it works and theorize on a way to alter it to also protect against Tempest\'s effect.','2016-07-31 05:56:18','2016-07-29 23:03:00'),(10027,11063,69,1,'Tranceflame learn','What burns hot but but cannot be seen? Can you find any flames within the dream? See if you can find anyone to explain what they use their flame for as each foci has their own. When we meet again we can talk about what you found and i ahve somehtign to show you.','2016-07-31 11:09:59','2016-07-30 12:36:11'),(10027,11063,60,1,'first sphere','frey has come a long way and i beleive him to be ready for first sphere','2016-07-31 11:55:47','2016-07-31 11:54:40'),(10746,10108,37,20,'Trail ~ 20','I want you to look back at the trail you have blazed within the City, from beginning to present and evaulate it as an outsider.  What would you change about it, what would you never change?  Share the highlights with me.','2016-07-31 17:54:53','2016-07-22 05:21:29'),(10007,10916,35,30,'Trap 30','Come up a way to trap each nightmare (emphant to horron). I want them all trapped in a different way. Bring me a well thought out plan for each.','2016-07-31 19:38:00','2016-07-30 20:22:30'),(10003,11065,107,1,'Peace Aura Jo','Times have changed and so has the art. Why did this happen? Poll a few dreamers and figure out why peace aura was nerfed. Think about how you could get it to work properly again.','2016-07-31 19:57:04','2016-07-27 00:38:54'),(10007,10198,24,10,'Restore 10','I would like for you to find me something that could be restored. This can be \"anything\". I want you to attempt restoring it. After taking some time with whatever it is you choose, then come to me so we can talk about it.','2016-07-31 20:25:31','2016-07-31 05:14:33'),(10680,10951,144,20,'Box  Deux','The first time, You created a box of dreadful stuff. This time, create for me a box that is full of something that brings you joy. I know that there must be something. ++SC++','2016-08-01 00:02:42','2016-07-29 19:50:52'),(10108,11065,47,20,'Push 20','With everything going on in the city, it\'s up to even the newest of dreamers to push back against the darkness trying to swallow us whole. Learn what you can of dreamstrike, both in this city and in idoclease, and come up with a compelling argument for, or against, the learning of this art.\r\n','2016-08-01 00:44:48','2016-07-31 02:56:52'),(10746,11065,2,20,'Seer ~ 20','Why is our focus within our arts list when it is not something we can evoke?  Why do we need to plat it?  Speak to others and see what they think, share your and their thoughts with me.','2016-08-01 03:34:37','2016-07-31 03:30:04'),(10007,11045,27,1,'Drain Self - Learn','Sounds like you need to figure out how this art works. I want you to get two stories about two different people getting drained over and over. Then I want you to find out the changes the art went through. This is important to know. Get me two stories and then the changes to the art. Bring this all to me and you shall learn Drain Self. I want the stories to be full descriptive please.','2016-08-01 04:45:58','2016-07-30 02:33:12'),(10062,11046,68,10,'Flame | 10','You seem to have a strong opinion about the houses. Outline the strengths and weaknesses of each based on your judgement. Do the dreamers or the beliefs weaken the cause the most? Be prepared for a discussion.\r\n','2016-08-01 05:13:44','2016-07-07 04:00:59'),(10750,10888,73,1,'DT Learn: Uthy','Destruction can be a positive thing, or a negative... or a bit of both.  Lets start off with getting you to learn what the criteria are for an item to be Destroyed by this art, then get you to put some thought into why some types of items can\'t be destroyed.  What makes the other items vulnerable to this art?  Lets hear your thoughts on it.','2016-08-01 05:45:49','2016-07-30 10:14:14'),(10018,11046,10,1,'L: Ward/Amulet','Ward is one of the most important arts for a GateKeeper. It can sometimes be difficult to use during battle. I want you to run a training session with a friend in the arena: practice your dodging, aiming, as well as how fast you can get to the portal to \"ward\" without being hit. Secondly, I want you to learn about the risks with Amulet.','2016-08-01 06:19:26','2016-07-24 05:48:17'),(10018,11046,11,1,'Amulet','This is for the bundle learn of Xererth\'s completed Ward/Amulet task.','2016-08-01 06:20:20','2016-08-01 06:20:11'),(10062,10018,12,50,'Shatter | 50','Take a dreamer under your wing temporarily and help teach them to shatter something that stands in their way of achieving that which they desire. Who is this dreamer, and what stood in their way? How did they overcome it? Report back the details.\r\n','2016-08-01 06:20:59','2016-07-14 05:17:13'),(10022,10632,26,10,'RagnaroQ: Purify 10','I would like for you to formulate a theory as to how Purify functions. What is it for, how does it accomplish this feat? Perhaps speaking to other SoulMasters will assist you in discovering how you believe Purify works. Come back and relate to me what you have learned, as well as your theory on how this art functions.','2016-08-01 23:48:43','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10311,10632,40,10,'Deafen10-Ragnaroq','So you mentioned that the revenants have interrupted your hunting a bit. I would like for you to participate in at least one attempt at removing them. During the attempt I would like for you to be a bit sneaky, too. Im going to provide you with a blade to secretly use during the attempt, dont use it when it may disrupt the project.. were you sneaky enough to make those present believe it was the process that deafened them?','2016-08-02 00:10:53','2016-07-22 20:08:09'),(10018,10915,22,40,'Forge 40','There are many projects involving Zaxun and the Revenants. Pick at least one to aid with the creation of at least two needed components. Once you do, show another Forger that is involved in the project and gain their input to see if it needs any tweaking. Bring to me a forged copy (or the original) of the finished product and any initial creations you had to alter.','2016-08-02 01:35:51','2016-07-23 21:57:57'),(10034,10018,141,50,'Kinesis50Jade','Not sure what this merger of bull-pucky is about, but I want to know about it. When did it start, who is involved, and shove everyone aside to get more information. I really want to know if my presence is better served in a house of study or a house of merging BS. And don\'t show this to anyone!','2016-08-02 01:48:56','2016-05-22 23:33:05'),(10066,10950,9,10,'Free Action 10','It is often said that the training of arts is a privilege, not a right. Use your free action to evoke it randomly on other people. By their responses, gauge if the action of helping them is appreciated or if they feel entitled to Free Action and show no appreciation. Record their responses.','2016-08-02 02:22:20','2016-08-01 03:43:09'),(10027,10198,63,1,'Invis learn','Find me there treasure genns that can be unseen, I will need to know where they are and what they gave you. You dont need to keep the item unless you want too. Share their location with a friend. Happy exploring!','2016-08-02 02:24:59','2016-07-31 01:51:49'),(10066,10269,105,1,'PC Learn','RedBee helped me and others on the house facade that helped towards my goal of creating a multi-function talisman. I am rewarding his effort with Poison Cloud learn.','2016-08-02 03:39:08','2016-08-02 03:38:59'),(10311,10213,24,10,'Restore10-Vill','You have been putting a lot of time into your art projects, the house, and sticking to supporting Sil also among other endeavours. I want you to take one evening either by yourself or with one or more people that are personally special to you and restore a bit of your personal side. You dont have to do a bunch of planning but have a small outing doing something you enjoy for an hour or two to take some restorative time for yourself and energize your efforts then tell me all about it!\r\n','2016-08-02 03:40:40','2016-07-29 20:24:19'),(10007,10916,35,40,'Trap 40','As we were talking about earlier...I was told a Horron cannot be trapped, so lets experiment and see if it is true. Bring me a Horron essence that is trapped if it can be done. If it can\'t, I would like proof from whoever you did this with. A codex or even verbal when you report from the other person. If it can\'t, please figure out why.','2016-08-02 04:44:16','2016-07-31 20:11:24'),(10018,10888,22,1,'Forge | Final','Since you have been working closely in the effort to remove the Revenants, I want you to figure out what is needed item wise: a tool, a piece of a larger device, etc. First create it on codex, then seek out a forger to bring it to life. Bring either the original or final product to review.','2016-08-02 06:30:34','2016-08-01 07:37:07'),(10480,11069,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Returning Quest to Inzoum after speaking about teaching.\r\n','2016-08-02 07:39:16','2016-08-02 07:38:25'),(10480,11069,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts for Quest.\r\n','2016-08-02 07:39:24','2016-08-02 07:38:50'),(10480,11069,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support arts for Quest.\r\n','2016-08-02 07:39:30','2016-08-02 07:39:04'),(10480,10022,44,80,'FireStorm 80','I wish to know the strength/damage of this art at each level. Em\'et has a nice formula for this art. Please seek him out and get me the information for all levels from learn to 80. **A**','2016-08-02 08:14:26','2016-07-30 04:03:38'),(10480,10400,92,50,'Reflect 50','I want to know all you know about my favorite art. Find me information from learn to 50 about length, strength, percentages and whatever else you would like to include in your report. Make your efforts worthy of the plateau that you seek. **A**','2016-08-02 08:18:13','2016-07-30 04:06:35'),(10003,10198,107,1,'Peace Aura (L) Lunk','Times are tough, peace is hard to come by. I want you to learn to bring peace to your home by soothing its members in their time of grief. Peace Aura protects against bad arts and attacks, what would your own peace aura bring to the members?','2016-08-02 09:15:00','2016-07-31 20:01:52'),(10746,10198,23,1,'Recharge ~L','Your house has undergone some serious changes of late.  I would like you to focus on one specific aspect that you feel needs to be Recharged and put forth a plan to accomplish it.','2016-08-02 17:36:29','2016-07-31 03:34:30'),(10311,10198,38,10,'Scare10-Lunk','I would like for you to speak to some of your friends and housemates about things that scare them. Take some notes on what they reveal.. at least three people. Then choose one who you know can take a playful joke that didnt have too serious a fear and find a way to sort of tease them about it. (Like have someone forge you a spider and hide it in a vault in your house for the one who fears spiders) or something silly like that. Try to be there when the prank is revealed so you can tell me how they reacted.','2016-08-02 21:42:36','2016-08-02 02:02:50'),(10018,10087,22,30,'Forge 30','Observe each of the open houses - their beliefs and membership as a whole. Use this to design a fitting standard uniform for each (one per house). They can be male or female outfits, you decide. Present the uniforms to a member of the house it was created for and ask their opinions. ','2016-08-03 02:54:49','2016-07-17 00:30:37'),(10007,11045,3,20,'SM 20','There are big plans for the Revs tomorrow 8-2-16. They need shields. I would like for you to go hunting for shields of any type. They need 25 to 30, so please help them out. Also go to this big event and play a part in it. Get yourself involved in the event. Report to me how many shields they used of yours and what part you played!','2016-08-03 04:34:16','2016-08-02 05:24:48'),(10916,10888,50,1,'NMF-Learn','Rework NMF from the ground up (focus, cost, what it does, what happens with plats ect) to be an art that you would consider useful to the city.  Almost a spirtual successor to NMF if you will.  What would be the steps you would take to making this new form of NMF?  ','2016-08-03 05:56:16','2016-07-31 02:40:42'),(10027,10198,40,10,'Deeafen to ten','Do you hear what I hear? Ask about three of your favorite dreamers and find out not from them what their favorite things are or maybe the things they dont like. Find out if your inquiry resutls were true How well do we know each other? Come back and let me know how it went.','2016-08-03 06:07:27','2016-08-02 02:35:44'),(10027,11063,2,10,'Dreamseer to 10','Your insight grows daily it is such a delight to see. You ahve done as i asked and made new friends. The Key to the Dream is sharing and working together. So for this quest I want you to use that inishgt and look around you. Tell me what you see and what you would like to see. How can we make the dream better?','2016-08-03 07:17:41','2016-08-02 09:31:12'),(11069,10198,73,10,'INZ-Dest.Talis (10)','I will give you an object of my design. You are to find a creative way to destroy it and return to me with your solution. We will put it to the test. Obviously, the use of Destroy Talisman is proscribed, and you are forbidden to consume it down to 0 charges or let it evaporate. It\'s a thought exercise, have fun with it!','2016-08-03 08:02:36','2016-08-02 08:09:14'),(10027,11063,60,2,'Sphere 2','Frey and went over several thigns he has learned and he went and found more information. He is mroe than ready for second sphere','2016-08-03 20:37:20','2016-08-03 12:50:17'),(10022,10915,39,30,'Magnum: Stagger 30','Attend a meeting or event, does not matter which one. I hear there is a baking thing coming up soon? You are there to serve drinks. Forge them up and pass them around. Or, if you were to go to the baking thing, perhaps people need some alcoholic ingredients for their baking? Stagger people with your mixology!','2016-08-03 22:47:10','2016-07-27 04:23:31'),(10007,10269,26,1,'Purify - Learn','We all know it takes off Curse, but learn what the biggest pain is about this art. Ask around until you get a few answers on why. Bring them to me, then we will talk about them. Don\'t forget to get names of who you speak with.','2016-08-03 23:32:35','2016-08-02 03:54:10'),(10027,10077,21,40,'Blend to 40','Blending two houses is quite a task. Help your home step into the future of her destiny. With the basics beleifs oaths and such. Help everyone be on the same page and make the house stronger together.','2016-08-04 01:30:57','2016-05-31 02:38:23'),(10007,10087,31,50,'Curse 50','I want you to get with Blade and Magnum-425 and see how you can help with getting rid of the revenants. Help them come up with plans and I would like to see them done. If it is done when I am not around, I will need a codex from one of them stating how you helped. Basically giving me proof of your involvement. I want you to play a huge part in it. This is a high plat.','2016-08-04 02:13:51','2016-07-26 01:25:21'),(10240,11045,3,20,'Quest: Silk Nuvas','Fix bug\r\n','2016-08-04 02:43:50','2016-08-04 02:43:38'),(10750,10269,25,1,'Reweave-Learn: Bee','Finding out the basics of an art is fairly simple, so that\'s the first part of this quest.  To finish things off, I\'d like for you come up with and demonstrate how your evoke of this art will manifest.  Will you use a hammer and anvil, or energy alone.  Be creative and show me what you\'ve got, don\'t just tell me about it.','2016-08-04 03:10:52','2016-08-02 03:20:49'),(10066,10269,8,1,'Protection Learn','It is common knowledge that protection protects against curse, however recent findings show that it prevents something else. Learn what it is and theorize as to how exactly it protects against each negative effect.','2016-08-04 03:39:36','2016-08-02 03:35:33'),(10746,10888,105,20,'PC ~ 20','I would like you to monitor the progress of the removal of the Revenants on Harrow Glades, Chasm of Souls, Cenotaph of Dread and Threshold Caves.  Which have yielded results and what are they?  ','2016-08-04 04:25:27','2016-07-31 02:37:44'),(10007,10950,24,30,'Restore 30','Take time out to think about how this art had made its way to our city. If you had to make this art, how would you make it and what would be the history of it? Just a short history is fine, but also how would you create this art for the first time?','2016-08-04 05:03:30','2016-08-01 04:11:21'),(10680,10198,74,20,'Why hide?','Talk to a few dreamers and ask them what sorts of things make them want to just hide. Then also ask them where their favourite hiding place is in the City. ++SC++','2016-08-04 06:05:19','2016-07-31 21:11:54'),(10680,10318,74,60,'MB60- Who are you?','Let me into your mind. I want to know who you are, how you got to your first city, then this one. What makes you tick? what makes you smile, what makes you sad? Family? regrets? etc..etc..  We will set aside a dream soon to talk. ++SC++','2016-08-04 07:15:14','2016-08-01 04:53:05'),(10750,10888,98,1,'NA Learn - Uthy','The ability to locate newlies is a fairly potent one for people looking to build influence within the city.  I\'d like for you to work out some means of helping ensuring a way of mitigating undue influence over the newlies that are coming into the city.  Be creative, and let me know how you\'d impliment this as well as what the likely obstacles to it would be.','2016-08-04 09:09:58','2016-08-03 10:19:26'),(10746,11065,36,20,'Blade ~ 20','Blades, not including BladeSlayer, are underappreciated within the City.  I would like you to show great appreciation for your blade when in groups and encourage others to do so as well.  Have fun with this! ','2016-08-04 17:59:53','2016-08-01 03:41:48'),(11069,11065,51,20,'Inz - Locate (20)','Locating Dreamers in the geographic sense is all fun and useful, but think of the dreamers you know, where do they stand in your entourage? What kind of dreamers do you allow close to you, what kind do you leave at a distance? Though you are in no obligation to name anyone, consider what justifies closeness or distance in your own terms.','2016-08-04 18:27:16','2016-08-03 18:00:02'),(10746,10213,23,10,'Recharge ~ 10','One of the important partsof being a teacher is knowing the ins and outs of the arts.  I would like you to conduct a study of this art.  Speak to some of the older Seers if you can about changes this art has under gone. ','2016-08-04 18:31:33','2016-08-02 18:08:37'),(10007,10198,50,1,'NMF - Learn','Tell me about this art, what are the restrictions and what makes you turn into a mare? Why is it a DreamSoul art?  No one ever talks about how your avatar changes, so what is your theory? I want a well thought out plan on this.','2016-08-05 00:35:26','2016-08-04 17:49:01'),(10311,10269,144,1,'ChaosWellL-BeEeEeEe','Find out everything you can about the creation of the art. Its cost, how many essences it holds unplatted and how many per plat. How are the colors determined? Just find out everything you can about the basics of the art and return to me with your findings!\r\n','2016-08-05 01:37:10','2016-08-02 03:00:28'),(10053,11046,72,1,'Quest: Kelos','Learn all the details about Inscribe...How has it changed over the years. What art acts very similar to it? Ask a dreamer of each focus these questions and bring the results to me.','2016-08-05 02:32:31','2016-07-22 02:21:15'),(10238,10007,60,7,'7th Sphere','The box causes you to lose your DreamSoul.... all of it.  You must be restored.  How did this happen.  How can it be fixed.  You must hold a minimal of 6 events to try to restore your DreamSoul.  These can not be back to back in a week.  A minimal of 30 days at best.  You may fail often and thus 30 days comes and goes...  The EFFORT is most important here.  True effort gets 7th.','2016-08-05 04:15:59','2015-11-07 03:27:54'),(10916,11023,46,1,'Recall - Learn','Talk to a few of the older dreamers in the city and see if you can figure out how Recall used to work.  Then with that information figure out how it could be used to our advantage in these dreams.  If you can\'t find any solid information, just note what people tell you and we will discuss what they had to say.  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-08-05 04:16:59','2016-08-02 21:56:51'),(10027,11063,69,10,'Tranceflame 10','Time to step up your adventures some. Seek out five dreamers and ask them what is their favorite memory of the Dream and why. Get them to share with you and maybe you can share something with them. Bring back their stories and yours.','2016-08-05 04:17:05','2016-08-03 21:31:19'),(10007,11028,70,20,'Flame 20','At me event tonight, I would love to have food, especially a big cake for those that have worked hard and been to my maren classes. Lets not forget about Bamra too! Come up with many different things to hand out to people and a big cake at the event.','2016-08-05 04:20:40','2016-08-05 00:17:44'),(10027,10067,14,50,'Know 50','The next age in the dream is coming. What will it hold when the titans finally leave and take their reverants with them. What does your vision of the dream tell you beyond what others see what is the place in the Dream for the Twins you and me.','2016-08-05 04:29:37','2016-08-02 06:29:34'),(10007,10888,28,10,'Abjure 10','Come up with a complete battle plan for your house. I want you to hold a class and then have a squabble on your facade with your house members. Perhaps get someone that can make 1 damage chaks. I would like to see this, but if you can\'t get people to do it when I can dream, then I will take 3 codex from members that say what had happened and what they learned. I also want this info from you too. Have a full report ready.','2016-08-05 07:48:36','2016-07-31 02:44:40'),(10007,11023,3,20,'SM 20','I want the thorough report about the Peace Corpse like we spoke about. I also want you to think about your role as an SM in this group. What role will you play? What will you do for your brothers?','2016-08-05 09:03:59','2016-08-03 23:54:13'),(10951,11065,98,10,'Newly Awake! (10)','Newness does not mean inexperience nor lack of knowledge. Sometimes it is the new who teach the old. Find 3 new to the City & ask them about an ornament or other statue, mural etc. Ask all 3 their impressions. Add your own. Are they different? Same? Your report is your analysis. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-08-05 17:06:57','2016-07-29 02:28:33'),(10027,10077,2,60,'Dreamseer to 60','You my dear have the gift of sight. Time to use it for the better of the dream. Use your crystal ball or fortune cards for those around you can tell them a bit about themselves and their future as you see it. Who did you read the future for and what did you see and be sure to do enough to make the plateau worthy. Time to make dreamers smile.','2016-08-05 21:08:12','2016-08-04 01:50:06'),(10027,10311,74,30,'Mind Blank - Rank 3','Continue your efforts in Mind Blanking OoSM from Kaer GeRRoZ by making some sort of house additions and/or leadership changes/adjustments. As you continue to grow, your leadership numbers will need to grow accordingly.\r\n','2016-08-05 21:29:47','2016-05-01 23:57:57'),(11069,10198,89,1,'Inz-Soul Shield (L)','Soul Shield was created for a purpose, and yet it did not turn out exactly as planned. Learn the history behind the Art\'s rediscovery and who were involved in it. Do you feel that the resulting Art is a failure? a success in its own right?','2016-08-05 23:22:03','2016-08-04 18:49:49'),(10062,10311,8,20,'Protection | 20','This Purple Lace lady is highly ignorant. She reminds me of a ditzy version of Magnilia. It occurs to me that she seems to hide in various sanctuaries throughout the City. Devise a plan to remove this protection from her, if only temporarily and see if you can put some fear into her. Record her response and report back to me for a discussion.','2016-08-05 23:31:16','2016-04-19 19:09:28'),(10009,10077,22,40,'Forge40','You are a matchmaker at heart, so do what you do best and make some matches. Identify four dreamers, preferably one of each focus, and craft an item that you feel matches their personality. Show each of the items to other dreamers, without identifying the source material. Can they link your creation to your muse? Keep track of everyone you speak with and how many, if any, they were able to guess. Return to me once all of your creations have been correctly identified at least once or you tried 10 times.','2016-08-05 23:54:00','2016-05-07 01:26:49'),(10680,11065,14,20,'What do we know...','In this quest of yours of knowing... I should wish to know more of you. How have you found yourself here, what is it like where you hail from, what made you decide on your current path and what do you see for yourself in the future. ++SC++','2016-08-06 03:37:05','2016-08-01 00:11:00'),(10108,11046,105,1,'PC Learn','Spend the next week, discovering one new thing about each house member that you encounter. They\'re family, and getting to know each is key to helping you feel comfortable. Share your findings with the rest of the house at next weeks meeting. As well, if you can, see if you can find out more about the art - what it does, and if possible, how it came to be. \r\n','2016-08-06 05:47:47','2016-07-22 05:02:47'),(10066,10750,22,20,'Forge Talisman 20','Research the CoID pages old and new. Find any similarities and/or differences. Create replicas of the CoID pages recently found for educational purposes. Regarding the learning of Dreamstrike, theorize how the art can be learned without someone like Cowled One to train it.','2016-08-06 06:12:27','2016-07-30 19:49:55'),(10916,11046,98,1,'Newly Awake - Learn','Consider how the state of the city can form opinions of it both negative and posisitive.  How would you try and present the city to a newly awakened during these times, outlining both the good and the bad to them so they could be fully informed?  Would you if you were newly awakened, be put off by what is going on or would you embrace it and see where the dreams would take you?\r\n','2016-08-06 06:59:32','2016-08-02 00:54:58'),(11097,10318,65,60,'Lu Smasher of Gates','You seek that your blade become stronger? Should you not become stronger as well?! If you were to weild such a thing. Duel three people whom are considered the \"best\". A prize must be involved, should they best you... you must reward them. Draw others to witness your prowess, what is the point of getting stronger if other people do not see it....','2016-08-06 07:16:48','2016-08-02 07:54:12'),(11097,10213,16,40,'Vill\'s Questions','Go about your normal dreams and in the course of this discover how others feel about their current situations. It matters not what exactly each situation is, only how that person feels about it. Identify the core of each person\'s worries or beliefs and decide what the cause of each would be. Can you help them, or perhaps help them help themselves?','2016-08-06 07:42:54','2016-08-02 08:27:45'),(10746,10311,22,20,'Forge 20','Forge is one of the best arts for the City\'s tricksters.  Using raw elements from Gloom Peaks, Lambent and Dorsal Rift.  Create 3 items that not only channel your personal style but your trickster nature.','2016-08-06 20:01:22','2016-03-13 00:04:40'),(10874,10916,52,10,'Aileron - Train 10','Consider for me the place of talisman in Quests; should specific talisman be required for a quest? Are quests to acquire certain talisman acceptable? Where\'s the line drawn? Discuss with some teachers you respect, before you report. Bring also to your report at least four examples of 1st plateau tasks. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-08-06 21:18:12','2016-06-09 23:25:23'),(10951,11063,16,1,'Wat t\'Heck is That?','Secrets here, whispers there, mystery lurks \'round everywhere! Wander the plane d\'EverNight. Turn d\'corner d\'Glades Insight. Find the Springs, a secret place. Pause a while, lose your pace. Let the whispers take you far, dream upon a falling Star. What do you Identify? ~Lacie~','2016-08-06 21:37:22','2016-08-03 23:45:59'),(10003,11069,107,1,'InzoumPeace Aura(L)','The Alliance appears broken and do does the house art. Talk to several dreamers as a teacher. How did PA work before? How does pa work now? (Cost, affects, durations).What arts breakthrough now. Familiarize yourself with this coveted art the appears dysfunctional.','2016-08-06 23:59:02','2016-08-01 07:34:51'),(10009,11063,139,1,'SenseDatoken-Learn','Develop a strategy that you may use to collapse an Agoknight. Attempt it once. Did you succeed? If not, what could you have done better? There is no failure in this. Try to keep from collapsing but do give it everything you can.','2016-08-07 01:53:40','2016-07-31 16:20:03'),(10916,10796,24,1,'Restore - Learn','Restore some of the House\'s unity through a small night of sharing or comradere (However you wish to do it is up to you).  I will attend and lend my assistance how I can.\r\n\'','2016-08-07 03:08:12','2016-08-05 21:54:04'),(10108,10796,46,1,'Recall - Learn','Recall is the most important protection art. Why? What does it do? Seek folks out, two Idocleasians, and two Lyrans, and ask why they think Recall is useful, and what they think it does. Also, speak to someone (Restel or Thunder or someone of the like) on how to protect Recall from Abjure. Share with me all these things.','2016-08-07 03:39:26','2016-03-31 03:10:57'),(10746,11063,18,1,'Chamele ~ learn','There are many hidden doorways within our fair City.  I would like you to seek some of them out and theorize why they are hidden.','2016-08-07 20:12:29','2016-08-04 17:17:33'),(10916,11028,9,1,'FA - Learn','Time for you to become Free Action!  Dress yourself as you feel Free Action would look if it was clothing.  Spend as much time as you feel needed being Free Action.  What did you do during this time?  How did you help make people feel free?  What did you make them feel free of?  Everything in this quest is up for interpretation on your end.  I know you can handle it.  I look forward to the report.\r\n','2016-08-07 20:48:53','2016-07-22 05:13:36'),(10074,11063,19,1,'Quest: Fin Marda','It is through Vision that we learn to see what some are trying to hide from us. Find me five instances where Vision would have helped you in a situation. How did you manage without having Vision?','2016-08-07 22:17:01','2016-08-06 19:15:04'),(11069,11065,46,1,'Inz- Recall (L)','Remember a place you enjoyed in your first dreams. In older times, when everything was new and inspiring. Find a place that has made a mark on you and return to it. Recall what made that place special, different from the rest. Does it still feel the same today?','2016-08-07 23:36:22','2016-08-05 23:55:24'),(10680,11065,15,10,'On the up side..','Most oft Judgement is used in a derogatory way. I would like you to make your own judgements concerning what you feel is the -best- here.. best house, best personality, best sense of humor, best dressed..for a few examples, feel free to add your own. ++SC++','2016-08-08 03:26:18','2016-08-06 03:56:45'),(10746,11046,9,20,'FA ~ 20','Freedom of speech is something that we hold to strongly within the City, but is it true freedom?  Take a look at what topics are seen as taboo and look to understand why.  After your report, I would like you to place your findings in the Archives.','2016-08-08 03:34:06','2016-08-05 03:43:52'),(10066,10950,74,1,'Mind Blank Learn','You are aware of our enemies. Keep a few on your locate list and monitor their location. When they are mind blanked use empirical evidence to determine as best you can where they may be, despite being mind blanked.','2016-08-08 03:43:11','2016-08-02 02:36:27'),(10951,11069,17,1,'What the *!@#%@#!#?','Some Curse has befallen the citizens of this City... again! After leerning the basics for this art, listen to dreamers, ask questions & then go to the 2nd Sphere hall (left room) & learn about the Mace of Castigation. Sometimes knowing the Curse can expedite a cure! Your analysis will be your report. ~Lacie~','2016-08-08 08:10:22','2016-08-02 09:27:39'),(11069,11028,51,10,'Locate Creamer (10)','You have used Zsa Zsa\'s tea cart in her absence and misplaced an important item. Try as you might, you can\'t locate the cream jar, a precious heirloom and idissociable part of the set. Since locating the jar itself may prove difficult, you should locate someone who might assist with creating a reasonable facsimile. Locate Dreamer and your ingenuity are your best tools. Don\'t let Zsa Zsa find out!','2016-08-08 14:17:16','2016-08-04 07:21:02'),(10311,11065,72,1,'InscribeL-Joandalth','Find a history, or a story.. that revolves around a former or current member of Dreamers of Light, or the house or mountain plane. Maybe a big battle, a former member or ruler.. something the house contributed to the city. Come back to me and tell me that story and you will gain the art you seek.','2016-08-08 19:07:42','2016-08-08 19:07:28'),(10750,11065,26,1,'Purify Learn: Joan','Purity comes in a lot of different forms, but none of them area easy to maintain in the face of life.  So, in addition to learning the basics of the art, I want you to put some thought into how you plan on maintaining some aspect of purify that you hold currently.  Purify of focus, of intent, whatever.  Try to make sure its a plan that you think you can honestly stick to, and will work.  Then tell me if you should even try and why or why not.','2016-08-08 19:39:54','2016-08-06 00:15:04'),(10022,10400,22,60,'Harkyn: Forge','Original task lost. Task was for Harkyn to create an item that would assist in the going and coming back of a group of people using Dynroth\'s staff.','2016-08-08 21:55:30','2016-08-08 21:52:18'),(10916,11023,27,1,'Drain Self - Learn','As usual learn a bit about the basics of the art.  Then I want you to learn how Drain Self was considered one of the deadliest arts in the city at one point in time and then decide for yourself if having that ability would be advantageous now.  Come to with pros and cons along with your own thoughts when you report.\r\n','2016-08-09 03:34:05','2016-08-06 07:23:28'),(10062,11065,9,1,'Free Action | Learn','I once belonged to a house dedicated to Responsible Freedom. Determine the potential flaw in this ideal system as a basis for a house, and even as a basis in itself.','2016-08-09 03:42:39','2016-08-06 02:02:29'),(10746,11065,18,1,'Chamele ~ learn','Chamele makes you invisible, but it has one serious weakness.  Why does such a useful art have this shortfall?  Spend some dreams invisible and attempt to understand the ins and outs of this art.','2016-08-09 04:07:35','2016-08-04 18:06:08'),(10916,10888,89,1,'Soul Shield - Learn','If you could harness the power of chaos in any form, what would it be and how would you shield yourself from it? Could you harness that power for a good cause?  Does Soulshield to you (outside of an abjure stacker) actually make any difference in your opinion and if not, how would you make it so it actually makes a difference in our city?','2016-08-09 07:35:00','2016-08-06 04:55:13'),(10750,11063,72,1,'Inscribe Learn:Frey','Inscribe is a very versatile art that sees a lot of random use.  For starters, I\'d like you to find out the difference between a regular codex and a quest codex.  Second, I want you to share your story with someone for inscribing or presenting in the Archives.  Only as much as you feel comfortable sharing, but write out something to show the city how you became who you are now.','2016-08-09 09:11:11','2016-08-04 07:36:18'),(10951,11063,18,10,'Chamele 10','An Ossuary of Dread it seems, a place to go when ends one\'s dreams. But look around, Chameled ye be, and wonders abound you will so see. A Lab I had in Graceful Retreat; a gen you\'ll find, so plant ye feet! Bring back with ye, what ye shall find, Seer\'s gen it is, it\'ll blow ye mind! Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-08-09 20:34:43','2016-08-06 22:14:00'),(11069,10198,9,20,'Inz - FreeAction 20','Free Action. Gratuitous Gesture? Pick 3 dreamers at random outside the House, and show them kindness in a way that is personal to each. ENTIRELY FREE OF CHARGE. No strings attached. Just entirely free actions of goodwill!','2016-08-09 22:42:08','2016-08-06 00:09:14'),(10018,10411,10,50,'Ward 50','Take a look at our land: the sewers, the main path, as well as the short-cut. Figure out the best room(s) to set a trap for our enemies. Secondly, I wish for you to sneak over to Evernight and do the same.  If we were to hold an ambush for HC there, show or tell me the best place. I\'m looking for detailed answers. You may also ward their land as you\'re leaving.','2016-08-09 23:25:11','2016-07-21 22:14:01'),(10746,10958,105,40,'PC ~ 40','As the foremost trapper within the house, I would like you to educate your fellow SoulMasters (and envious DreamSeers) on the tricks of the trade when it comes to trapping nightmares.  Arrange a field trip to some of your favourite trapping spots.','2016-08-10 01:48:51','2016-06-08 02:15:32'),(11097,10136,8,10,'Protection 10','With me being one of your many \"bodyguards\", I\'d like to see the roles reversed. Pick someone you feel confident enough to be their bodyguard for a dream or two. Protect them with all that you can offer.','2016-08-10 02:44:49','2016-01-07 04:08:22'),(11097,11028,27,10,'Get it!','Drainself - all about giving of  yourself. You do that ALL the time, baked goods, smiles, hugs. Time for you to get something in return...approach some friends and ask them what they think that -you- need, and ideally, have them give it to you. This can be a physical item, but also spiritual, advice, a hug,..etc.. have fun! ~c','2016-08-10 03:04:18','2016-07-22 19:19:02'),(10066,10888,22,10,'Forge Talisman 10','Research and theorize a way to improve the limitations of chaos well, specifically in the regarding trapped essences. Devise a plan and create two talisman to further the goals of your plan. The talisman should demonstrate your ability in crafting talismen, not just their function use. We will discuss the plan during your report.','2016-08-10 03:10:17','2016-08-06 06:26:20'),(10108,10299,7,1,'RF learn','Resisting the things that scare us the most is often a hard job. The next time you\'re at a large gathering of some kind, ask around for what scares people the most during these odd times. Make sure to make a good showing, as if you\'re the cities fear census taker, and get at least five answers. ','2016-08-10 03:13:12','2016-08-02 20:21:23'),(10107,11063,36,10,'Dreamblade 10 Frey','I want you to provide me with a blade design.  Something that you would want to carry in the dream as your own.  Desribe it as best you can in detail.  Share your design with me. For a bonus, how does your blade get its colour when you swing it?\r\n','2016-08-10 03:21:48','2016-08-01 05:16:05'),(10480,10750,29,50,'Arnaya - Poison 50','Poison your enemies, metaphorically or literally, and cripple their progress. Do this as many times and in as many different ways as you feel satisfies the task.','2016-08-10 03:22:11','2016-07-07 04:12:50'),(10107,11028,72,10,'Inscib 10: Ana','Inscribe is fun, you can do so many things with it.  For this particular quest, I want you to get creative and help lighten the mood of the city... try to inspire some hope and unity.  I want you to come up with a bunch of \"Fortune Cookies\" to hand out to random people.  Make note of the inspirational sayings, and any particular reactions people had to them.','2016-08-10 03:33:35','2016-07-03 04:43:40'),(10107,11028,72,10,'Completed Task','Anasina completed a task from my apprentice for Inscribe to the first plateau.  The task was to create fortune cookies as part of her baking skillset.  Most creative use of a dreamer\'s skills.','2016-08-10 03:33:35','2016-08-10 03:31:30'),(10107,10066,19,70,'Vision 70 - TM','It\'s time for a vision to come to you.  I want you to predict the future of the city, as it comes to you in a vision.  Try and predict how the debacle of the Revenants and the City will end. Call out for a few deaths and dreamstrikes, get the city wound up.  Use your influence at Calenture to get your house members whipped up into a frenzy of protection for the city!  How will this all end?\r\n','2016-08-10 03:35:24','2016-07-30 20:31:19'),(10480,10888,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting access to the SM guild house. **A**\r\n','2016-08-10 03:41:35','2016-08-10 03:41:28'),(10480,10915,4,60,'FS 60 - Magnum','Work with every faction in the City to create a reliable way to negate Zaxun. This can take any form you wish, but ensure there is a beginning, middle and end to the thought process and implementation.','2016-08-10 03:44:10','2016-06-06 03:54:01'),(10066,10269,23,1,'Recharge Learn','Speak with your peers on how recharge is commonly used present dream. Come up with a few creative ways to utilize recharge in ways that are not currently being used.','2016-08-10 03:51:22','2016-08-06 06:00:07'),(10107,10750,89,10,'Soulshield 10','This art is often ignores, and yet it may have untold benefits in the future.  What do you think those benefits may be?  Is there some sort of tie to something more than just blocking Mindblank or as a Abjure buffer?\r\n','2016-08-10 04:20:52','2016-07-31 04:46:24'),(10951,10717,60,4,'Will\'s Pub!','We need a place to chill out! We also need a place to have drinks ready for our many guests. You are the man for the job! Turn a room in our Home into the Bar of our Dreams! Use other Keepers, their skills & my help in preparing our Home to serve ourselves & our guests! Use your housemates\' skills & knowledge to accomplish this goal. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-08-10 16:39:44','2016-06-30 19:38:57'),(10951,11063,2,20,'See-eer of Dream!','O\'Seer of Visions, your quest is clear. Slip through the blind, your dream be near. I want you to look at people & try to see what their dreams are. What do they dream of? Then think about your own dreams. What are you to become? Vision comes from within, not from with-out. Bring me your dreams, you See-er of Visions! ~Lacie~','2016-08-10 18:10:29','2016-08-09 20:42:20'),(10916,11023,67,10,'Soulreaper - 10','I want you to create a blade that embodies who you are, what you are and who you hope to be.  Find natural materials from the city and piece it together.  How it looks and how you forge it is entirely up to you.  When you are done, bring it to me and we will go over it.  I look forward to what you bring.\r\n','2016-08-11 00:16:41','2016-08-09 03:46:53'),(10951,11038,60,2,'2nd sphere','You are to work on keeping the KoES house open. Results not as important as the effort. ~L~','2016-08-11 00:34:04','2016-08-11 00:24:52'),(10009,10545,35,20,'Trap-20','Gather a group of dreamers together for a purpose of your choice. Keep them working or debating a single topic for at least thirty minutes. Aim for at least five dreamers to make it the entire time. Deviation from the topic or work being done requires a restart.','2016-08-11 00:51:13','2016-05-19 01:01:57'),(10066,10269,105,10,'Poison Cloud 10','Examine the paths of the house and services you see other members performing for the house. Consider a fresh, unique service that you could personally own and serve the house with.','2016-08-11 01:06:55','2016-08-06 06:43:45'),(10018,11046,65,20,'GateSmasher 20','Now that you have practiced fighting with a chakram, it\'s time for you to get reacquainted with your blade. I want you to challenge at least four dreamers to duel. For those you lose to, ask for any advice they might have. And for those you win against, offer them advice, if you have any. Report back with what you have learned and if your blading has improved any.','2016-08-11 02:29:07','2016-08-01 06:48:57');
INSERT INTO `trainlog` VALUES (10053,10311,89,10,'Souldshld10: Kelos','Soul Shield is a strange art that many know nothing about...Ask a dreamer of each focus what they think the art actually protects you from...Note their responses...','2016-08-11 02:59:03','2016-07-05 23:26:23'),(10066,10950,73,1,'Destroy Talisman L','\"Think about what you want DT for. Speak with your fellow dreamers about what they typically use DT for. Are there any certain ones that stand out for any reason? Are there any that you didn\'t realize DT would be useful for, before speaking with your peers that you see as useful now?\" - Tauriel','2016-08-11 03:00:36','2016-08-08 04:17:36'),(10680,10915,140,10,'What\'s in a name?','Tempest.. rather odd name for this art, don\'t you think? If it had been YOUR creation, what would you have named it and why? Also, for a bit of mischief, continually use Tempest in a gathering, keep using it until someone retaliates with something or scolds you! All in good fun. ++SC++','2016-08-11 03:10:32','2016-08-08 03:47:52'),(10750,10213,89,1,'SS Learn - Vill','In addition to learning the basics of the art, I would like you to have some fun.  Become \"The Shield\" and protect a few people from random things.  The sillier the \"threat\", the better.  Let me know how things went, and how people responded to your \"shielding\" them. ','2016-08-11 03:13:30','2016-08-02 18:35:24'),(11069,11053,68,1,'Flameshaft (L)','Every Dreamer can learn a Flame Art that is specific to their Focus. Likewise, the chakrams they can use are also specific to their Focus. How can you tell which chakrams can be used by a Gatekeeper? While both chakrams and Flameshaft are projectiles, they have some differences, ask around and see if you can figure out what separates them!','2016-08-11 16:46:17','2016-08-06 16:54:49'),(10232,10746,142,10,'Arlyana - Misdir 10','Select three, out-of-the-way destinations, and find DIFFERENT people to give you directions to them. NO showing, just verbal directions. How good are those directions? Following them TO THE LETTER, can you get to where you\'re supposed to? Ensure a thorough report!','2016-08-11 17:53:25','2016-07-22 04:57:37'),(10311,11045,98,1,'NewlyL-Nathan','There has been a small influx of newly awakened dreamers recently which is perfect timing for this task. Find one and spend some time with them, take them around doing things you find enjoyable, and see if you can come up with something they also like doing when the city is slow. Ive noticed they like to come and go, so work with one and try to give them reason to stay and something to do with their time that they may carry throughout their dreams in the future.','2016-08-11 21:21:21','2016-08-11 21:21:09'),(10009,11065,46,10,'Recall-10','Recall back to your first dreams. You were taught lessons that others thought to be valuable. Do the same for some others by teaching a lesson you deem to be valuable.','2016-08-11 23:52:14','2016-08-10 02:10:17'),(10545,10580,8,1,'Protection | L','Keep your Trail handy and attempt to venture up the Mountain again. While doing so, inspect the portals leading up and leading down. What is the difference and how does this help keep you from getting lost? Use Trail as a fall-back if you do not notice it. Secondly, take a look at a shorter plane like EB. Why do you think some are shorter than the other main paths?','2016-08-12 00:36:37','2016-08-11 03:15:55'),(10951,11065,19,1,'Vision Quest','To See what most just walk on by, the Seer does walk where most don\'t try. Up Trinity long & arduous walk, up far & strong & do not talk. Then seek a name a room doth keep, a story told for when you sleep. A Vision Quest be one of soul; to come away & still be whole. Where do you land; what tale in the sand? Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-08-12 01:00:38','2016-08-07 01:21:45'),(10053,10269,69,30,'Quest: Kelos','Research what damage your flame will do from level 30-39. Does the flame color change when plateaued? Get a dreamer with level 40. 50, and 60 to tell you the damage and color of their flame.','2016-08-12 01:39:11','2016-08-05 03:39:50'),(10916,11046,46,1,'Recall - Learn','Figure out another plan to push the revenants back.  Use whatever means you can come up with to recall them and put it into action.  Success or fail, the point is keeping the fight going against them.  Good luck and i will help where i can.\r\n','2016-08-12 03:10:02','2016-08-06 07:19:12'),(10750,11046,139,1,'Sense Dat Learn:Xer','Having basic combat skills when you encounter of the creatures this art detects is great, knowing what combat skills to use against them and when is better.  I want you to step beyond basic \"Dodge, Shoot, heal, art\" philsophy and look into tactics.  Tell me how you\'d fit into a 2, and 3 man team of your house mates or allies to defeat a datoken.  Which dreamers were a part of your teams, and why did you chose the roles you did with each?  How would this art help?','2016-08-12 03:36:09','2016-08-07 02:27:22'),(10951,10213,23,20,'Treasures Renewed','A Mount, two Caves, Plateau & Dread. Treasures deep, not quite so dead. To take, the norm but not in form. To Give... Recharged, the Soul enlarged. One of five, a secret looms, a hidden gen in one d\'rooms. Seek & thee shall find. ~Lacie~','2016-08-12 04:30:08','2016-08-06 21:55:46'),(10027,10213,60,5,'Sphere fifth','You are a gypsy king and it is time to have a carnevale to entertain the dreamers. This must be three events and you need to use the scrolls and other resources avaialbale to you. Let\'s celebrate and have some fun.','2016-08-12 06:07:22','2016-06-29 07:17:09'),(10027,10623,2,50,'Dreamseer 50','I beleive we all should follow our dreams. Lets see what we can do for you new project. Get some advertising out there maybe use the classes of lu\'s as a lead in to your services. Just a thought but here is what I need proof of sucessful contracts and what were the terms three should do it and let the dream know what you have to offer three of them. We can go from there.','2016-08-12 06:51:10','2016-07-30 08:49:25'),(10938,11069,107,10,'Peace Aura - 10','House Services\r\n','2016-08-12 08:38:06','2016-08-12 08:37:54'),(10027,11063,69,20,'Tranceflame to 20','Give me a hand with a project. Ask around and find out who are the best teachers dreaming and why. I need about 10 to 15. Get the name of who you spoke with, the teacher and why they are so good.','2016-08-12 08:39:18','2016-08-05 22:12:14'),(10938,10004,46,20,'Recall - 20','House Services','2016-08-12 08:41:58','2016-08-12 08:41:51'),(10746,10213,144,20,'Well ~ 20','As you work towards your own art creation, I would like you to think about this art was created when no Idoaclesians were involved even though it is loosely based on your Nexus.  Or is it?  Lay out what could have been the blueprints.','2016-08-12 23:52:36','2016-08-04 18:56:35'),(10746,11063,19,10,'Vision ~ 10','Take some time and traverse the planes of the City and find a few things (animals, flowers, scents) that are often overlooked.  Use your innate vision to see some of the things that we are missing in our hurries.','2016-08-13 00:11:35','2016-08-11 19:49:03'),(10027,10269,73,1,'Destroy Talisman L','What are the best ways to destory something? This dream does take care of some of the clutter. What are the benefits? What are the limitations for the art? What neesd to be removed from the Dream?','2016-08-13 02:59:37','2016-08-02 04:01:18'),(10746,11046,26,1,'Purify ~ L','Purify is one of the most expensive Resilience arts, which is annoying when you are Cursed and not a SoulMaster.  Why is this art so expensive, when arts such as Restore are not?  Speak to some of each focus for their ideas and share them and your own with me.','2016-08-13 04:07:46','2016-08-08 03:41:22'),(10027,10198,63,10,'Invis to 10','Find me places to hide. Either by poor lighting (shadows) or a change in colors.  Five is a nice number thats hwo many you need to seek out and show me. Weave me a story about one of the places.','2016-08-13 06:23:51','2016-08-12 09:27:54'),(10951,11063,36,20,'Bladed Seer','We are distance fighters, but the fight does come to us on ocassion. When this happens, we must be ready. Over the course of a Dream, your \"chakram hand\" is too sore to use. Blade enough to fill a Well. Hone your skill, learn some tricks. Lu Chaos is rather good, as are some others. Learn. Your report will include a demonstration. ~Lacie~','2016-08-13 06:26:46','2016-08-10 18:32:43'),(10007,11063,60,3,'Third Sphere','I would like for you to ask Arnaya if you could help host her event this coming Friday (Bardic Event) 8-12-16. I also want you to be part of it by sharing a piece. This can be singing, writing, etc, but present something unique. I wont be there, so get a codex from Arnaya stating that you helped and also that you shared a piece at her event!','2016-08-13 07:12:12','2016-08-10 07:39:38'),(10066,10746,23,60,'Recharge 60','Conduct two group experiments with line of sight arts and area effect arts. During each experiment, collect data that supports a theory as to why the arts are line of sight or area effect. After the experiments, consider the data and theorize as to how newly created arts could use your theories as a basis to achieve either targeting class.','2016-08-14 03:57:06','2016-06-09 03:27:10'),(10311,10762,71,1,'Flame-Genovefa','Spend some time exploring the planes. Explore all 8 planes surrounding Threshold and find a unique flame that speaks to you. Return and tell me why you chose this flame. Also, you should notice a certain type of flame present in all of the planes, what is the signifigance of this flame?','2016-08-14 20:50:25','2015-12-13 19:30:32'),(10027,11046,40,1,'Deafen to learn','Seek out the best uses of arts in battle. There are some nice suggestions out there. Deafen and scare being among them. There are many to ask uthy is a good oen as is flower. Gather up the tips and tricks and come back to me and i will see what i can add to yrou arsenal.','2016-08-14 21:04:41','2016-08-13 03:14:24'),(10746,10088,46,50,'Recall ~ 50','What art histories have been forgotten within the City?  Look at both Lyran and Idoaclesia.  If a history does not exist, you are to create one of your own.','2016-08-14 21:37:17','2016-04-24 17:05:35'),(10107,10746,69,60,'Flame 60 - Arlyana','The fires of the houses seem to be burning brigther than they have in some time, but it seems that two have such troubles with stability that they run the risk of implosion simply for not having strong leadership.  I want you to identify the traits that all good rulers seem to possess. I want you to then compare these to all the rulers of the city.  This is not an analysis of good/bad people... this is an analysis of good/bad rulers.\r\n','2016-08-14 21:55:35','2016-07-31 02:55:52'),(11069,11046,10,10,'Inz - Ward (10)','You\'ve learned about combat efficiency using Ward, now let\'s have a look at the ethics. Develop and example of a situation where Ward can be used in a way that promotes safety for your House, as well as an example of a situation where Ward can be utilized to cause others harm. We will discuss these examples together upon your report.','2016-08-14 23:27:45','2016-08-13 07:14:47'),(10066,11046,105,10,'Poison Cloud 10','Theorize how we can prepare ourselves to deal with Xun\'rok should he turn out to have malign intentions towards the city and citizens. Give some thought to how we may be able to rid Zaxun without Dreamstrike. Discussion to follow.','2016-08-15 02:53:32','2016-08-11 02:56:08'),(10545,11023,9,1,'Free Action | L','As you traverse the planes, keep your eyes wide open and take a better look with Know. Which leaves you feeling Free as opposed to the others and why? Do any of them remind you your shard? Be prepared to show this girl some of the rooms you have explored as you explain your feelings on them.','2016-08-15 03:11:54','2016-08-12 06:25:27'),(10027,11063,69,30,'Tranceflame 30','No cutting off your ear. Paint me a picture with all the colors you see in our dream. Three differant subjects be it dreamers, places or what an art is. You need to end up with three works of art. Share them with three dreamers and get some insight into what they see. and report back to me with them in hand.','2016-08-15 03:51:42','2016-08-13 17:19:52'),(10027,11053,60,1,'first sphere','i ahve interviewed her and beleive her to be ready for her next sphere','2016-08-15 17:20:07','2016-08-15 17:19:54'),(10951,11046,8,20,'Protect The Tail!','Over the course of 2 consecutive dreams (next 2 times ya dream), your tail is in serious jeapordy! True, it grows back, but that takes time! Everytime you think things are going well, you \'accidentally\' forget & eat the candy I give you. How many give you Protection? Your report is the experience. ~Lacie~\r\n','2016-08-15 17:55:51','2016-08-13 05:28:02'),(10311,10213,8,10,'Prot10-Vill','Using your inscribe create an \'item\' to protect, at any cost! Keep it for a couple days, be very vocal that you have it, show it off (Show talisman). Did people respect your protective nature, or did they try to foil you somehow? Did it pique anyones curiosity of why you are protecting the item. Were stories shared of simular items others are very protective of? Play it up and have fun!\r\n','2016-08-15 19:07:29','2016-08-11 19:44:05'),(10545,10580,48,1,'Soul Evoke | L','As you are aware, Soul Evoke has its risks, but has an importance as well. Speak to a handful of dreamers about their opinions on the art, or if they have it or have heard stories about those that have used it. How helpful was it? Lastly, in a dire situation, which would be your art of choice to use?','2016-08-15 20:31:43','2016-08-12 06:36:29'),(10916,10950,29,10,'Poison - 10','Talk to dreamers (how many is up to you) and have them give you a one word answer when you say \"Poison\". Then come up with a theory about how poison either came to be or works incorporating the answers you were given into it.  I look forward to what you come up with!\r\n','2016-08-16 02:41:15','2016-08-08 03:59:11'),(10027,11063,20,1,'blast to learn','Find me unlikely pairs in the dream..... arts rooms planes dreamers mares. You can seek help or nto that is up to you. I cannot wait to see what you come up with. I need ten matches.','2016-08-16 03:09:09','2016-08-15 06:04:14'),(10066,10950,139,1,'Sense Datoken Learn','Speak with your peers on how Sense Datoken works. Given the responses, devise a theory as to how you could Sense Revenants, instead. If we find a way to target all revenants, could this be used to rid all of them too?','2016-08-16 03:22:40','2016-08-14 02:57:16'),(10062,11046,68,20,'Flame | 20','Battle battle battle. Most people want to get better at fighting. There are several things that make someone good. Seek out the brawlers of the City and ask them what makes someone good. Is it skill, attitude, strength? Create a list of 5 traits and return to me for discussion. There\'s always something better in losing.','2016-08-16 03:40:09','2016-08-05 03:29:06'),(10136,10545,27,40,'DrainSelf40-Avalya','Drain yourself into something whole-heartily.  I don\'t care what it is. Some project, some gathering, some.. something!!  Try to gather dreamers together. Even if it is slow, gather the few that are there. Make whatever you do worthy of this level of task. Now that you are going to be a teacher, this should help you with gauging difficultly levels for different students. Only this time.. YOU are the student! Make me proud!','2016-08-16 03:46:02','2016-02-16 02:19:25'),(10007,11063,24,1,'Restore - Learn','Know the basics of the art when you come to me, but also, I want you to find out what the ranges of heals you can do with each plat. Bring me the ranges up to 70 please.','2016-08-16 04:08:26','2016-08-13 07:22:07'),(10027,11069,144,10,'Quest: LadySilver','A wishing wells; they are always fun. Gather up the wishes of those around you and see if you can grant a few. Make it fun for you and them who wished for what and what did you do to make their wish come true','2016-08-16 06:34:49','2016-08-01 18:31:48'),(10027,10888,6,20,'meditation to 20','You have so many talents. Mediate on them and write me letter of recommendation on yourself detailing the assets and skills you bring to the dream and how they can help here. Where wuld such a letter lead you too? The new governor of the City? What do you see in your future?','2016-08-16 06:55:55','2016-08-14 06:29:52'),(10238,10318,22,1,'Quest: WishBringer','Take this pile of junk.  And trade it for much better higher quality goodies.  The trick is simple... you must get them to offer you the item - make the trade, and then run off with their wares.  You can use a \"bait\" item if you wish.  Good luck!  And have fun!\r\n','2016-08-16 21:15:46','2016-08-16 21:07:07'),(10311,10580,144,10,'ChaosWell10-Najerv','I want you to use your inscribe art to create your own vision of a chaos well. Put some real thought into why you made it look/function like it does and give me solid reasons why you created it as such. I also would like you to use chaos well in some sort of prank against a couple of dreamers. The first part is the most important part of this task, but give the second a good effort I wanna see how silly you can be. I will leave it open to you how you go about carrying out your prank.\r\n','2016-08-16 23:05:35','2016-08-11 14:30:17'),(10238,10066,22,70,'Quest: WishBringer','Work on putting together a shield to protect one against the massive destruction of the Mace!  Utilize pieces and parts, forged items and see if you can be a forge master!','2016-08-17 01:10:00','2016-06-08 02:19:16'),(10916,10311,5,10,'Random - 10','Use random to spice up your dreams a bit!  Take the number spread of random and break it down (1-20, 21-40 ect.  However you feel comfortable) Then assign yourself something you have to do for those sets.  Then random and whatever you get you have to do!  Do this for however long you like!  During the report tell me how you broke it down, what you had to do and what were the results!\r\n','2016-08-17 01:55:51','2016-08-07 19:17:59'),(10680,11046,7,20,'To Fear or not','I suppose some may find you a bit frightening, if dreamers seem afraid of you, how do you calm their fears? Is there anything in particular that you are fearful of? I conquered one of mine this eve..performing in public. How might you conquer your fear? Lastly.. what might you warn others of here, that they should be wary of, and why? ++SC++','2016-08-17 03:32:11','2016-08-13 05:31:59'),(10746,11046,60,3,'Sphere the Third','As a GateKeeper, you have received what is considered your trademark art at second sphere, Ward.  Organize an event to discuss if this art is truly the defining art of a GateKeeper.  Share your findings on the Archives.','2016-08-17 04:22:01','2016-08-13 04:14:24'),(11097,10104,35,30,'Quest: Faelyn','Honoring a task from Dakkoth, the codex was lost when KoES was cleaned out. I remember seeing the task though.','2016-08-17 04:31:42','2016-08-17 04:26:12'),(10010,10213,21,1,'Blend Learn- Vill','First I want you to find out evoke times for the art, from learn to 30 plateau. Duration as well. Secondly, I want you to have a bit of fun. I want you to \"blend\" into the background when you are in a room of dreamers. How did the dreamers react, and were you able to learn things by doing so? Was it fun to do ? ~Cryst~','2016-08-17 04:37:28','2016-08-16 07:00:08'),(10746,11028,60,3,'Sphere the Third','As you work with Cianne on the creation of the Sense Teacher art, I would like you to include the SM Guild in your work taking their suggestions and countering them to the best of your abilities (only one focused meeting is necessary).  Successful creation of the art is not necessary, but lay the groundwork for the first experiment.','2016-08-17 04:41:06','2016-07-21 04:32:14'),(11097,11046,1,20,'Xererth, Keeper','Are all GateKeepers lumbering brutes? That is what some say... easier to get a GateKeeper to bang his head against rocks to make dirt than to get one to have a thought! Are you a mindless drone or could you perhaps lead? Take a group of your comrades on an adventure. It matters not where, only that you lead. Discover something, blaze a path somewhere. So the City you can lead the charge towards glory! Also, don\'t bang your head against rocks. It\'s bad for you.\r\n','2016-08-17 04:45:18','2016-08-06 07:23:23'),(11097,10318,9,60,'Quest: Faelyn','Granting Lu Chaos a plat in FA, as per BC\'s want to reward his behavior in irc.','2016-08-17 05:17:33','2016-08-17 05:17:22'),(10916,10593,37,10,'Trail - 10','Trail has it\'s functions in the city but what else can it be used for?  You know what time it is? Picture time!  Using trail i want you to use your creative skills and \'draw\' a picture of your choosing.  How trail is used is up to you but have fun with it!  If you can\'t put the picture to paper, when you report describe it to me in detail.  I am very excited to see what you come up with!\r\n','2016-08-17 05:44:18','2016-04-19 21:45:22'),(10593,10888,67,30,'Tale','an EPIC tale! It can be comedic, dramatic, romantic, sorrowful, you decide! It must include a blade, knife, pointed stick! something.. Original work only! and brand new! and psst..  EPIC!!!!  ~c','2016-08-17 05:57:45','2016-06-30 05:48:25'),(11069,10003,107,10,'Inz - Peace Aura 10','Peace Aura\'s duration may be short, but a plateau to it will make it last longer. In a broader sense, our goal is lasting peace for all. What do you feel are key ingredients for a lasting peace? Once peace is established, what contributes to maintaining it? We\'ll discuss your thoughts.','2016-08-17 16:48:29','2016-08-16 12:12:49'),(10003,11053,47,1,'Lariwtn (L)Push','Push your away through the dream, seek out its wonders. What rooms keep you safe that have interest to you. Threshhold and the main planes. What room draws you to it, explain why the room draws you in?','2016-08-17 16:57:59','2016-08-02 03:53:18'),(11069,11028,46,20,'Inz - Recall (20)','You have been a baker for as long as you remember, and I have always known you as such. You have recently set up shop in the upper parts of the Chak \'n Flask. Remember a place that has meaning for you in your baking career, in more modest times. Perhaps a reception? or your first improvised oven? Somewhere that says \"a part of me is here, a part of what I do happened here\". Recall that place and describe to me what you feel by revisiting it today.','2016-08-17 17:51:05','2016-08-11 17:24:53'),(10027,10623,16,40,'identify 40','So not yet a teacher. Its a big decision. Look back in your past and now and pick out some good teachers you have had and why they were that for you. How about some bad things teacher can do? What could you bring to a halo no one else could? How will teachers work for the Peace Corps? What would their goal and missions be? Or will they fit in at all?','2016-08-17 18:05:01','2016-08-12 09:02:37'),(10951,11110,47,1,'Push on in!','You have managed to Push yourself into a State of Dreaming. What will you do next? You must interject... \"Push\" yourself into the groove of the City\'s activities now. There\'s two meetings this week; try to make at least one. It may seem hard to push yourself, but wander about & try to see what dreams you\'d like to live out here. Your experience will be your report. ~Lacie~','2016-08-17 23:05:39','2016-08-16 00:45:38'),(10027,10269,6,20,'meditation to 20','Time to consider you journey my friend seek out a place or two to collect your thoughts and why did you pick them. Share your insight on where you wish to be in the near future and how we can help you get there.','2016-08-17 23:40:13','2016-08-13 03:22:04'),(10680,11065,40,1,'Listening?','Many turn a deaf ear to what is happening around them. Can you think of any examples in the City where this occurs? Also, and completely unrelated, what , to you, is the most annoying sound EVER. ! ?  ++SC++','2016-08-18 00:42:35','2016-08-08 03:39:44'),(10009,10545,35,30,'Trap-30','I have a need for a Trap. Develop a means to ensare Zaxun. I only need it to hold him for a few seconds. ','2016-08-18 00:51:18','2016-08-12 00:06:22'),(10009,11065,16,20,'Identify-20','The City is a place of many Paths and Roles. What will yours be? Identify what you feel your role in the City will be in the future. Identify the path you feel it will take to get there. As you reflect inside, speak to a few dreamers about what they aspired to be as a younger dreamer and how it contrasts with what they became.','2016-08-18 01:04:01','2016-08-12 00:01:17'),(10003,11115,69,1,'Tranceflame(L) Zes','There are many flames in the dream that are useful, more importantly yours is. I want you to come up with a theory on how to produce your flame. What did it take, was it mind over matter or something more. Ask two dreamers also what they think their flames come from.','2016-08-18 01:35:44','2016-08-17 17:06:37'),(10027,11014,60,5,'Fifth Sphere','There needs to be three in a series of events. Your writting contests might work nicely or something else like a dueling contest a dream workshop you decide which. You will need to host try to get others involved in the planning. It makes it easier for you. Get creative.','2016-08-18 01:38:39','2016-07-23 10:26:15'),(10007,10962,3,10,'SM 10','I would like for you to visit all the 8 great houses and lets say the City had changed to where all the foci had chose 2 houses. Think about their house arts as well and the look of it. What focus would you place at each house and why? Who do you think should rule them and why? Bring this info to me.','2016-08-18 03:43:47','2016-07-30 03:54:52'),(10007,10888,35,20,'Trap 20','Speaking of this annoying mouse that runs around the City...I want you to build the best mouse trap this City has ever seen. It better be the best and take lots of work. See who can help you and set it out and see if you catch anything with it. I hope you catch the mouse! Oh and it better not be Bamra that you catch!','2016-08-18 04:22:30','2016-08-05 08:03:56'),(10750,11046,24,1,'Restore Learn: Xer','I would like you to learn the basics of the art to start with.  After that, many people think unplatted restore is useless (Many think that even 20 plat restore is nearly useless).  Since you will never have the proficiency with the art that a Soulmaster will, I would like you to figure out some tactics to maximize your effectiveness with Restore. Let me know what you come up with.','2016-08-18 04:37:49','2016-08-17 05:06:47'),(10007,10750,67,50,'Blade 50','Since you are going for your halo, I would like for you to come up with tasks for blade. I want tasks for learn up to 60 plat (7 tasks). After you have done this, I want you to see both of your mentors and get their advice on them. I want to know what they told you and I want to see all the tasks myself. We will discuss it further when you report. I want them all to be different and unique.','2016-08-18 04:55:28','2016-07-07 04:17:30'),(10916,10888,30,10,'Antidote - 10','The city is filled with poison and it\'s up to you \"Antidote Man\" (Name can be subject to change) to bring the healing word to the people!  Find dreamers who have been taken ill with this poison and antidote them with antidotes of your choosing (note they don\'t  have to be an actual item...could be...anything) When you report tell me what the poisons were, who had it and how you cured them.  Antidote man (name subject to change) Will save us all.\r\n','2016-08-18 05:02:49','2016-08-09 07:54:42'),(11097,10003,52,30,'Liolira\'s Halo','You wish to make your halo just a tad bit brighter, yes? Helping others is a fine endeavor, for you must have a complete understanding of things in order to pass that knowledge on to others. Write up a detailed report of how you approach each and every situation when someone asks you to write a task. What are some of the things you think of before you even touch ink to paper? Pick a person at random and write them a task for a random art to 30. Be prepared to explain what you wrote and why.','2016-08-18 05:44:55','2016-08-02 09:26:12'),(11097,10750,25,50,'Arnaya\'s Stitches','I have just began a service, Arnaya\'s Triage! You can change the name... it\'s not important, maybe something with bunnies wearing paper hats of some kind. During and after any battle you are to walk among the ranks of the combatants and tend to their wounds. Patch up the Dreamers, as well as their gear, as best you can. Perhaps they will even require some morale uplifting, yes? Maybe a smiling face will lift their spirits so that they can return to the fight and protect that which they believe in.','2016-08-18 06:48:59','2016-08-03 10:31:47'),(11097,11069,141,1,'Kinesis','Tell me how this Art came to be and any change that might have come from it since it was created.. why would this be a Will Art as opposed to Push?  Formulate a theory as I know you can do so.','2016-08-18 07:05:25','2016-07-17 20:50:21'),(11069,11115,47,1,'Inz - Push (L)','When Push was developped into an Art, it was used firstly as a means to contest authority, then in self-defense. Since Push can cancel an Art evocation, ask around and learn of 3 offensive Arts that could have bad consequences if they were allowed to be evoked on someone. Push can help prevent that! It can also be used to bully and annoy others, so be sure you use the Art wisely when you learn it!','2016-08-18 17:11:46','2016-08-17 17:18:21'),(10951,11063,18,20,'Where\'d ya go?','I quest you to find the \"hidden\" things in the City. There\'s dozens of hidden things, but I\'d like you to try and find 5 things of different nature. Ask others, learn their secrets. Your report is the adventure this sends you on. Good Luck & Happy Hunting! ~Lacie~','2016-08-18 18:54:29','2016-08-17 23:27:33'),(10951,11065,17,1,'What the $#%$%^!','The DreamWrights were either geniuses or totally insane! You must determine which! The Mazes in this City are just... well, you decide. Pick one, discover its secret & try to discern what Curse befell the being that created it. Think...out of the box here with this one. Let your imagination soar! ~Lacie~','2016-08-18 19:07:07','2016-08-12 01:16:10'),(10746,10213,2,50,'Seer ~ 50','Fifth sphere used to be one of the greatest milestones, for all foci, not just Seers.  It meant that you could finally seek to join your focus Guild and hopefully learn the Guild art.  With fifth now being on the lower end of the spectrum, what do the foci have to look forward to? Speak to a Lyran who was a Guild member and then attend Guild meetings to determine how the structure and purpose of the Guilds has changed.  Beas thorough as you canand present your findings in a meeting and on the Archives.','2016-08-18 22:20:29','2016-08-13 00:39:34'),(10746,10004,21,1,'Blend ~L','Given many of the recent shady activities, how can we trust what people say, especially when it comes to politics.  How are they able to Blend so seamlessly through the Wards of decency?  Create a theory and solution for this issue.','2016-08-18 22:35:45','2016-08-02 18:03:00'),(10053,10269,18,20,'Chamele20: Kelos','Chamele seems to work against the Revenants. Ask 3 seers why they think that the revenants do not possess the art of vision or do they in some instances? The Revenants seem to possess all the other arts....why not vision. ','2016-08-19 02:14:55','2016-08-13 03:27:53'),(10066,10269,63,1,'Invisibility Learn','Join in on a search for a page of the codex of immortal dreams and see what you can help turn up. Next, devise a theory as to how to deal with Xun\'rok, should he end up like his brother Zaxun. Lets assume Dreamstrike is not something we\'ll have the chance to have.','2016-08-19 02:25:10','2016-08-12 00:40:20'),(10746,10916,105,50,'PC ~ 50','I would like you to hold two battle scenario classes for the house.  One to see what we need to work on and the second to put the improvements into place.','2016-08-19 03:16:42','2016-06-06 19:55:54'),(10053,11046,6,10,'Med10: Kelos','For your plateau, determine the time & rate at which meditation heals at level 1,10,& 20. Why do you think that meditation can only be platted to 29 for non-gatekeepers.','2016-08-19 03:18:53','2016-08-13 03:21:32'),(10066,10750,8,20,'Protection 20','Xun\'rok stated that pages are safest in the binder and pages stored for too long would find their way out in the open again. Do you feel the arrangement of transferring the pages will circumvent this characteristic of the pages? Is it even true? Finally, consider any elements that could point Xun\'Rok and Zaxun being in league with each other.','2016-08-19 04:18:30','2016-08-06 06:40:16'),(10680,11023,72,1,'Freedom to Express','I have a feeling you will get much use out of inscribe. The task itself, not so hard for one as talented as you. I am going to write something for you in the upcoming days. You saw my song, you heard it.. write for me some words from your ValH\'e\'. Speak them or sing them to me when you are ready. Any subject matter is acceptable. ++SC++','2016-08-19 04:32:14','2016-08-18 00:03:55'),(10066,11065,60,3,'Sphere 3','Study the composition of the dream. Use the information you gather to assist you in leading a \"guided meditation event\". Publically inspire others to join you. Set one attainable goal for the event and achieve it.','2016-08-19 04:47:58','2016-08-09 03:51:41'),(10746,11028,96,20,'Sense ~ 20','A sense of community has always been important to many within the City.  I would like you to look into some of the groups that have existed outside of house membership within the City.  How did they contribute to a sense of community?','2016-08-19 05:03:08','2016-07-23 04:14:16'),(11097,10888,70,40,'Quest: Faelyn','You have recently had a run in with the flames of Rage and Fear, and got burned a little bit by them. The flame of fear burns rampant right now, and it is our job as masters of the soul to help combat such flames, or build others to help counter them. I want you to do your part towards this. Be creative, and make your effort worthy of this plateau. ~Written under Deeter\'s authority and approval. | Honored for Deeter |','2016-08-19 05:56:57','2016-08-19 05:56:40'),(10750,10888,7,1,'RF Learn - Uthy','You know the basics of the art already, so I\'ve got something different in mind.  I want you to come up with a coordination method for the house support fighters to help overcome the fear that many people have of not being useful in tense situations.  Pick the member that you feel can use it the most, and help get them up to speed.  Report how things went and what your plan was.','2016-08-19 09:16:25','2016-08-09 07:55:57'),(10003,10750,40,10,'Deafen 10 Arnaya','I want you to create an theory about how deafen can be expanded to multiple deafen dreamers.. like a mass art. Create a fun theory that is funny. Share it with a few dreamers.Did they accept your hypothese? Can it be tested? Report back to me your theory and who accepted it or how denied it.','2016-08-19 09:43:34','2016-08-02 04:21:55'),(10311,11065,72,10,'Inscribe10-Joandalt','I would like for you to spread the word of your event this week using your inscribe art. Make invitations and pass them out and drop them off (Not too many!) in public places to remind people of your meeting. I do want to add a twist, imply in your invitation that there will be some kind of surprise that you havent already planned or intend on having there that will get people talking, then at the meeting find a fun way to play it off without disappointing anyone.','2016-08-19 18:38:40','2016-08-11 19:22:38'),(10874,10411,13,30,'Aidan | Return 30','Stories have it that you have joined the dark men in the war. If you support the men that came here with threats to destroy the city, explain to me why you have. If you haven\'t, explain why not. Prove to me by example of the side you have chosen. When all is said and done, return the favor and spread a rumor- true or false, and see what happens when it returns back to you.','2016-08-19 21:06:36','2016-06-22 01:24:06'),(10010,10213,20,50,'Blast 50- Vill','Blast can be an offensive or defensive art, depending on what side of the battle you are on. I want you to have a blast battle round up all the seers you can, and like you would a duel tournament, try and have one for blast. If it does not come to fruition, I want you to use your imagination, and write a story about how that event would have happened, most of all have fun. ~Cryst~','2016-08-19 22:10:22','2016-08-18 06:55:01'),(11069,11115,98,1,'Inz - Newly A. (L)','See if you can find another Newly Awakened dreamer and go and meet that person. See how their first steps in the City are going, and if you can offer some help, it might even work both ways! You can ask more experienced dreamers to use the Art of Newly Awakened to help you find someone else, or perhaps they already know someone to direct you to. I\'ll accept reports about Dreamers who recently obtained their First Sphere also.','2016-08-19 22:13:52','2016-08-18 17:47:22'),(10951,11045,139,1,'Wdere na Datoke??','Before this Art, dreamers used other ways of finding the Datoke & the DarkMare. How was this done? Before there was Dark Awakening, both came from some hole in the ground? Wdere? Ask some older dreamers, do some research & let me know what you find out! ~Lacie~','2016-08-20 02:51:10','2016-07-30 02:22:36'),(10010,11063,20,10,'Blast 10- Frey','Blast allows you to battle from a distance. I want you to create a theory of why that is so. I also want you to work on your social attributes. I want you to spend time around others, find out if you can what they think of blast, what they would improve etc. The name of the game is to find your balance between hunting, genning and socializing. Try and find the equal balance between the three. ~Cryst~\r\n','2016-08-20 03:53:42','2016-08-16 05:46:06'),(10027,10269,20,40,'Blast to 40','Matchmaker make me a match. Seek out the dream artists and have them create a piece of art that represents or matches something in the dream. A room, a person, an art, a house, anythign special to them. Have a showing and share the creativity of the dream.','2016-08-20 07:17:45','2016-08-18 00:10:45'),(11069,11046,1,30,'Inz - GateKeeper 30','Consider the stereotypes associated with a GateKeeper. For best results, ask some Dreamseers about it! Do you agree with the picture others have of GateKeepers in general? Do you feel you, as an individual, fit in that mold? In what ways are you everyone\'s GateKeeper, and in what ways are you shaping your own image of your focus? Once you\'ve made a clearer picture of this, ask a few people if they agree with your assessment, and it they see in you the GateKeeper you know you are, the way you are.','2016-08-20 08:47:01','2016-08-17 17:03:35'),(10107,11115,60,1,'1st Sphere - Zes','Had a great little interview with Zes and liked his answers.  Those who prepared him fell a little short... but that\'s okay.','2016-08-20 20:09:50','2016-08-20 20:09:36'),(10003,11069,89,10,'Soulshield,10-Inzy','We have some very important decesions regarding the codex in our home. Develop a good theory as to why soulshield is important during any rituals or destruction events. Give this information to your members during any of these events. Report to me their responses, did they heed your warnings or not?','2016-08-20 21:34:28','2016-08-17 16:33:54'),(10018,10580,60,4,'4th Sphere','Breathe life back into the Dueling Arena by holding a unique blade tournament, focusing on the three key things we lean on while sparring: our Vision, Hearing, and Balance. Promote the tourny on the Public Scrolls for all to attend. As the duelists compete, go through special rounds of Stagger, Blind, and Deafen (You will need assistants for this part). Prepare prizes by yourself or assistance from an Elder or Forger.','2016-08-20 23:51:34','2016-07-12 06:14:43'),(10311,10199,144,1,'ChaosWellL-subby','Find out all you can about chaos well. Who helped create it, what determines the colors, how many it holds unplatted and per plat, how much it costs to evoke.. all the basics! I also would like for you to do a prank involving a chaos well.. I will leave the details up to you but a suggestion might be use one in a crowd and act like something else got sucked into it (A body part, your favorite chak.. w/e) really play it up and tell me how people reacted.\r\n','2016-08-21 00:38:00','2016-08-13 17:10:05'),(10951,11065,69,20,'Great Balls of Fire','Two parts. #1 Talk with Anasina about the Alchemic nature of the Flame. What do you learn from her knowledge of the arcane art? #2 Perfect the Art of FlameStinky! Try different ways to Flame Stinky, using Chamele, your turning skills & any obstacles in the area. Learn to be sneaky with your Flame! ~Lacie~','2016-08-21 01:19:02','2016-08-18 19:16:32'),(10007,10545,28,20,'Abjure 20','I want you to offer your Abjure services to the community. Get at least 7 people to do so. This can be done for anything like helping them work on NMF or any other art. This does not need to be done in a harmful way. I just want you to find other ways to use Abjure in a different way and not just battle. These need to be worth the plat.','2016-08-21 06:40:34','2016-07-11 04:12:46'),(10545,11023,40,1,'Deafen | L','As we have just gained access to our stronghold, we must Deafen the spirits of old so that we can start anew. Search the planes for natural growing plants to create a smudge stick, such as sage and other cleansing plants. As you bind the ingredients into a stick, consider a short incantation to go along with such a ritual.','2016-08-21 07:23:43','2016-08-18 04:57:20'),(11069,11028,107,10,'Inz - PeaceAura 10','A plateau to Peace Aura increases its duration. You seek to keep the peace a little longer, then? How do you keep YOUR peace going longer? When you feel something getting on your nerves and you feel you\'re about to start flailing and screaming, what efforts do you make to keep it together and remain calm? Are you satisfied with how you work these things out internally?','2016-08-21 22:26:01','2016-08-17 18:14:03'),(11069,11065,144,1,'Inz-ChaosWell (L)','I believe you are already quite familiar with the use of Chaos Wells themselves, so let\'s take a sidestep and look at something from a different perspective. Can you explain why the Chaos Wells take on certain colors when produced? I am not looking for some official answer, only your thoughts on the process and the utility of this aspect of the talismans created. Ask other dreamers for their thoughts on this as well, and see if it corroborates your own.','2016-08-21 23:19:12','2016-08-20 23:40:15'),(10311,11046,72,10,'inscribe10-Xererth','Inscribe a codex with increments of random on them, and something you want someone to do if they random that amount (Example: 1-20 give me a hug 21-40 blah blah..etc) then have them random and do the thing on the codex. Do this a few times, then report to me who had to do what! \r\n','2016-08-22 01:03:44','2016-08-14 20:35:25'),(10311,11065,38,1,'ScareL-Joandaltha','I would like for you to plan and conduct a \'Haunting of Underlight\' tour. Find out where at least 3 tragic events happened in the city, and take a small group of dreamers to these locations and tell them the story of why you believe the room to be haunted. If you cant come up with interesting enough stories surrounding these tragic events make something up! Make the tour as interesting as possible, maybe even have a \'scarer\' on hand to give your tour a realistic feel.','2016-08-22 01:19:14','2016-08-20 23:51:57'),(10053,11065,17,10,'ID Curse10: Kelos','At one point in dream history, ID Curse was a 6th sphere Seer art...Now, it is available to all foci. Ask a dreamer of each focus why they think this art is now available for all foci.','2016-08-22 01:51:51','2016-08-19 03:56:54'),(10916,11046,38,1,'Scare - Learn','Learn some of the basics of scare then find a reason as to why we would actually feel fear in the city.  Do you believe the fear is real?  Does this apply only to fear or does it also apply to other senses that the avatars could potentially feel?  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-08-22 02:27:33','2016-08-18 04:49:42'),(10480,10311,52,20,'Quest: Akkadian','As per Em\'ets train 20 quest. **A**\r\n','2016-08-22 02:59:08','2016-08-22 02:59:03'),(10022,10915,42,20,'Magnum: Darkness 20','Write a story. The story should involve three things: A bear named Wuzzle, a skunk named Pip and some form of darkness. Tell your story to a group of dreamers.','2016-08-22 03:33:26','2016-08-03 23:19:24'),(10916,11023,25,1,'Reweave - Learn','As usual learn some of the basics of the art.  I want you to look beyond the usual things that need to be \"reweaved\" and see if you can find a few examples of more obscure or different things in the dream that could be in need of being put together again. How you interpret that is up to you.  I look forward to what you come up with.\r\n','2016-08-22 03:48:37','2016-08-17 02:33:20'),(10480,10022,41,60,'Blind 60','Someone was blinded by greed and ambition. I believe that it could be detrimental to the City and the alliance that has been forged between the Citizens. Your task is to find out who it was and what it involved. Also find out just how Zaxun was trying to manipulate things. Make your efforts worthy. **A**','2016-08-22 03:49:57','2016-08-10 02:39:04'),(10545,11045,40,1,'Deafen | L','Since you enjoy making your friends laugh: make a spectacle of yourself going deaf and twist everyone\'s words into something humorous. Use your imagination as to what brought it and report back with the results. Have fun.','2016-08-22 04:29:51','2016-08-20 03:09:42'),(10951,11063,2,30,'DreamSeer 3rd','At this point in your Seer-ness, you should be able to create or \"see\" ideas which present themselves to you. Your quest is to find one of these ideas (or create your own) & get it to the point where you can present it to others (either at the Seer meeting or some other forum). Speak with LadySilver if guidance is needed.','2016-08-22 04:40:47','2016-08-19 05:20:22'),(10951,11045,46,1,'Remember & Recall','You know what this Art prevents, but what else is it good for? Look into the Art\'s history & learn why it was originally created. Then remember when you were unsphered? Recal your beginings & provide me with a brief summary of how you began to dream. Go where you went, do what you did. Recall & Remember. ~Lacie~','2016-08-22 06:12:21','2016-08-20 03:00:04'),(11069,11065,6,10,'Inz - Meditation 10','Although it seemed very interesting, I could not attend your guided meditation event due to scheduling. I would like for you to give me a short lesson on how you proceed in these guided medidation sessions, and what your experience with these have brought you and others so far. Is this something you intend to pursue in the long run?','2016-08-22 15:29:07','2016-08-21 23:27:42'),(10916,11065,24,1,'Restore - Learn','First off learn what you can on the basics of the art.  Think about your current situation (Which I know about) and come up with a base idea on how if needed you could restore you and your brethern to your former selves.  This doesn\'t have to be too in depth, just an idea and outline of a possible plan.\r\n','2016-08-23 01:02:10','2016-08-20 23:53:56'),(10003,11065,19,10,'Vision(10) Jo,AOE','Vision is the most important of all arts for seers. Why is this? I want you to embark on this journey by asking why vision in the subconcious sense is just as important as the physcial sense. Bring me a common theme amongst seers to this question, develope your own from it.','2016-08-23 02:21:35','2016-08-18 01:56:19'),(11097,11028,107,20,'Quest: Faelyn','Rewarind AoE\'s actions against DreamStrike.','2016-08-23 02:43:04','2016-08-23 02:38:19'),(11097,10003,107,20,'Quest: Faelyn','Rewarind AoE\'s actions against DreamStrike.','2016-08-23 02:43:17','2016-08-23 02:37:40'),(10951,11065,2,30,'See-er of Dreams!','We are the See-er of Dreams. We manipulate the fabric of the DreamScape to our wishes! You must learn about this. Learn to Merge (if you already can Merge, learn more types of Merges). Learn about places you can be to shoot, Blast & avoid attack. Spend a little time w/Kailoth & learn some of his fighting tricks, if you can. ~Lacie~','2016-08-23 03:09:17','2016-08-21 01:23:02'),(10010,11063,20,20,'Blast 20-Frey','Blast allows one to do an attack from a distance. Why do you think that this is a dreamseer art, versus it being an art for the other foci? Is there any things you would like to change ? I want you to show your writing skill, I want you to write me a short story about the art. Have fun. ~Cryst~','2016-08-23 08:35:52','2016-08-22 06:44:49'),(10003,11115,139,1,'Sense Dakoten(L)','I want to you learn to work with a team mate and understand the importance of working together to protect yourself and others. The senses are important, knowing who is aroumd, where to look and what daymares are dreaming are very important. Bring me back your report.','2016-08-23 19:10:13','2016-08-20 21:57:08'),(10916,11028,75,10,'Show - 10','Showing Items can be all well and good but where does that leave the telling?  come up with some overly wordy descriptions for the average things in the city that we just don\'t think about often. (items, planes, people..whatever).  You decide how much and what you to do.  I look forward to hearing what you come up with.\r\n','2016-08-23 21:34:23','2016-08-07 21:17:37'),(10916,11065,32,10,'Drain Essence - 10','Let\'s consider Drain Essence for a bit.  Is it possible in that using drain essence could also drain some of the chaos that makes up the essence into you?  If so, come up with an item that could channel and harness that chaos from the avatar to something else.  When you report, bring the item and explain how it works and what it would do with the chaotic energy it would channel.\r\n','2016-08-24 00:52:10','2016-08-23 01:09:30'),(10951,11065,20,1,'MastaBlasta!','Line of sight. You\'d think that\'d stop us! Nay! Find spots in an area of your choice that you can shoot a Flame around a corner or from a safe position. Use your House\'s Facade also. How can you Blast around it? Explore, experiment & test your ideas. Your report is your analysis. ~Lacie~','2016-08-24 02:02:43','2016-08-23 03:21:30'),(11069,11045,26,10,'Inz - Purify (10)','Curses are not always academically related to the Art, and sometimes special curses need a little out-of-the-box thinking to remove. Ask three dreamers to invent a comical curse that they would like to prank someone with, then think of a fun way to remove these hypothetical curses. Have fun with it!','2016-08-24 21:09:44','2016-08-04 17:57:32'),(10311,11045,9,1,'FreeActionL-Nathan','I would like for you to find out all the basics of this art, how much it costs, duration and how much is added per plat.. I also would like you to find out all of the arts it protects you against. THEN I want you to ask three of your friends, as a pre-payment for all of the sharing you will be doing for FA\'n in the future to make you a gift either forged or on codex to thank you in advance! Bring me the gifts you collected and the info for your art!\r\n','2016-08-24 21:09:47','2016-08-21 02:44:12'),(10066,10050,22,60,'Forge Talisman 60','Retrieve details of Zaxun\'s stones that enable him to be shielded, as well as any other pertinent details that can bring down his shield. Create replicas of each stone. Form a plan to reliably weaken this shield for every encounter, using tools of your own creation. Hold a city-wide meeting, where you demonstrate all you\'ve created to simulate your plan against Zaxun. Exclude Zaxun\'s recruits from this meeting.','2016-08-24 21:31:33','2016-06-04 21:01:04'),(10951,11063,9,1,'Free them Bones!','There are many older dreamers in the City. Seek them out & create a way to ease their \"old bones\" in a manner of your own creation. Do you use a Charm? A spell of some sort? Or do you just get them out & give them some well needed exercise? Do this to 5 & report. ~Lacie~','2016-08-25 01:38:30','2016-08-23 10:35:41'),(10062,11046,141,1,'Kinesis | Learn','You are the Kinesis. Now push someone to do something indirectly. What it is you push them to do doesn\'t not matter beyond that it need be noticeable. Report back the details.','2016-08-25 01:57:16','2016-08-18 04:39:46'),(10066,11046,105,20,'Poison Cloud 20','Speak with other House members and see how they serve the house in their own unique way. After hearing these responses, determine what your own unique role can be to serve the House. Perform this role at least once.','2016-08-25 03:34:04','2016-08-19 04:05:14'),(10107,11046,47,10,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','As far as offensive Dreamsoul arts, there aren\'t many.  Find out what they are and when you can learn them.  ','2016-08-25 03:54:53','2016-08-15 03:12:42'),(10007,11028,24,30,'Restore 30','I have lost my list of Peace Corpse members. I need a new one. Please restore my list and gain the names that belong to their little...clan. Not all wear their crest.','2016-08-25 04:23:59','2016-08-24 04:10:23'),(10010,11063,36,30,'Dreamblade  30-Frey','Your blade is an inherant part of you, an extension of your own person, we create our blades using our insight. I want you to use your insight, and create a unique blade. You can have its description placed in a scroll, or if you can find someone, then you can have someone forge an item that would reflect what your blade would be capable of. Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-08-25 05:57:35','2016-08-24 06:03:00'),(10938,11069,93,1,'Worthy','Inzoum has been granted Sacrifice to bestow upon those marked by the runes of the Star. /Lynx/','2016-08-25 07:08:16','2016-08-25 07:03:54'),(11069,10004,93,1,'Your Sacrifice','Zsa Zsa. You have already completed your task, having committed to the greatest of our sacrifices.','2016-08-25 10:01:11','2016-08-25 09:57:37'),(11069,11028,93,1,'Your Sacrifice','Anasina, Warden of the Ninth, I have permission from Lynx to train you with immediate effect in the Art of Sacrifice in light of the burden you carry.','2016-08-25 11:58:48','2016-08-25 11:54:59'),(11069,11028,16,1,'Inz - Identify (L)','I will make you a cocktail. Use your tastebuds, nose, eyes and extensive knowledge in the field of mixology to identify the ingredients used in its composition, and which situation could call for such a drink. If your recipe and assessment for it is close enough to mine, I will recognize in you the ability to discern the characteristics of talismans.','2016-08-25 14:24:38','2016-08-21 22:41:25'),(11069,11065,93,1,'Your Sacrifice','Joandaltha, Warden of the Ninth. I have permission from Lynx to immediately train you in the Art of Sacrifice in light of the burden you carry for our greater cause.','2016-08-25 15:47:47','2016-08-25 15:47:05'),(10311,11065,74,1,'MindBlankL-Joandalt','Since you have been having so much fun with my silly tasks, and you did so well with my story task lets combine those two for this one. Write a short story, just a paragraph or two, but leave about 10 words blank in the story. Tell random people to give you words to fill it in, ask for adjectives, nouns, etc but dont tell them what its for. Then place your story in the public archives with the filled in words capitalized and who provided them at the bottom. We will discuss the art itself upon reporting.','2016-08-25 16:52:29','2016-08-22 01:31:24'),(10311,10007,111,10,'Dazzle10-Dina','Get a current roster of the PC, and place the list on the public house archives.\r\n','2016-08-25 17:54:33','2016-08-23 01:43:24'),(10311,10199,26,10,'Purify10-Sublamento','I want you to be the purify police, when something seems cursed, someone is cursing, things are just getting negative in general I want you to \'ID the curse\' then purify in a dramatic fashion. Do this a few times and then come report to me what happened.\r\n','2016-08-25 20:42:20','2016-08-24 21:21:26'),(10951,10580,74,30,'Blank\'d Mind 30','Something... new is wrong with your already warped brain! I don\'t care what it ism but I want you to WORK it hard! Are you suddenly craving emphie-cakes? Must have chocolate ago-bites? Have you forgotten you\'re allergic to females? Whatever you choose, do it hard, fast & furious! You\'re quickly losing your sanity! Tell me about it for your report! ~Lacie~','2016-08-25 21:19:18','2016-08-15 18:02:31'),(10916,11028,29,1,'Poison - Learn','Get some information on the basics of the art (cost, what it does per plat ect ect).  Then I want you to come up with your own \"Poisoned\" Cupcake.  It won\'t really be poisoned but have it represent what poison means to you.  Bring a sample of the cupcake when you report and be prepared to explain the association.\r\n','2016-08-25 22:32:43','2016-08-23 21:40:56'),(10027,10068,60,4,'Fourth Sphere','Gypsy Dreams. You are the head gypsy to entertain the troops so to speak. Will it be magic shows or fortune telling? Will you have a crystal ball or cards of destiny. Tales shares over a bonfire. Arrange three small gathering to share your skills or the skills fo others the choice is yours.','2016-08-26 07:08:18','2016-06-09 03:26:50'),(10951,11070,25,1,'Follow an Example','I will hear Arnaya\'s quest as written in 24 hours. ~Lacie~','2016-08-26 08:00:09','2016-08-24 08:30:34'),(10951,11070,25,1,'Reweave Learn - Asa','You have only recently returned to the city and a lot has changed.  So, in addition to confirming the art basics.  I would like you to look around and find something something you can use to reweave some of the holes and losses that the changes and time have inflicted on you.  It could be a house, a group of dreamers, a single dreamer, a room, or a even a talisman.  Let me know what you chose, why, and how it helps you to slowly reweave yourself.','2016-08-26 08:00:09','2016-08-19 10:00:20'),(10951,11070,60,2,'2nd Sphere','After maxxing your orbit, try to get your arts ready to plat. You need to visit each open house, learning NEW beliefs & try to work your way around some of the Outer Planes to refamiliarize yourself. Use the Chamele Alt I give ya! While exploring, take a look at the Revenants. How did we make them? We will discuss this. Lastly, what plans will you decide to bring to the City. We need them! ~Lacie~','2016-08-26 08:45:50','2016-08-19 08:59:28'),(11069,11065,5,10,'Inz - Random 10','For one whole day, you will have to place words in a random order in your sentences. Try and manage with that and see if people can understand you.','2016-08-26 15:25:59','2016-08-22 15:44:55'),(10027,11065,18,10,'Chamele to 10','Find me five things unseen in the dream. Think outside the norm in your search. What Hidden treause lie with the Dreams walls? Use yoru insight to guide you as it has always served you well.','2016-08-26 16:45:26','2016-08-18 01:23:56'),(10053,11065,26,10,'Quest: Kelos','Evoke the art of purify on 5 of your housemates and make note of their reactions.','2016-08-27 01:15:19','2016-08-22 02:06:44'),(10916,11065,144,10,'Chaos Well - 10','Your Pinwheel was a huge success.  The crowds demand more products from Jo, Jo and Jo.  This time they want something stylish that they can hold energy IN until it needs to be used.  Be creative, be amazing, be....Jotactular!  I look forward to seeing what you come up with.','2016-08-27 01:34:09','2016-08-24 00:59:12'),(10010,11063,20,30,'Blast 30-Frey','There are times for advancement, then there are times for fun. I want you to ponder, and come up with at least 5 things that are a \"blast\" for you in the city, Once you have come up with them, how do they play into your every day dreams? Are there things that you can do to make them happen more often ? Are there things that you think would be a \"blast\" but have not had the chance to take part in ? Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-08-27 05:46:29','2016-08-25 06:05:11'),(10010,11023,139,1,'Sense Datoken Learn','This art allows you to find daymares when they dream. I want you to delve into the create side of your brain, I want you to write me a story about the art, the catch is, you have to make me giggle. Meaning, nothing serious, or dour, I want some thing light, and funny. Most of all, have fun. ~Cryst~','2016-08-27 06:27:30','2016-08-22 05:41:05'),(10027,11063,19,20,'Vision to 20','Can you see what i see? You are growing by leaps and bounds which is always a great thing but what will you try to change in your up and coming dreams? I say perhaps look around and see who could use and update in how they look. How could you add some spice to their dreams? Find six targets. If you are comfortable maybe suggest the changes. Have some fun!','2016-08-27 06:49:30','2016-08-16 06:03:36'),(10027,10213,69,40,'Tranceflame to 40','Love the Art Group idea take it forward for the next two meetings and tell me what you plan to do to continue the course you are on. Evaluate the meeting have others help like Coraal with the minutes make it somehting the City can enjoy.','2016-08-27 07:34:38','2016-07-30 06:02:41'),(11069,10360,93,1,'Your Sacrifice','Blue, I\'ve been permitted by Lynx to train you in the Art of Sacrifice immediately should you so desire, in light of the marks you carry. You have earned this already.','2016-08-27 13:46:44','2016-08-27 13:44:01'),(10311,11063,6,10,'Meditation10-Frey','I would like you to meditate alone for three days in a different relaxing place each day for -at least- one duration of an evoke of your meditation. Take this time to sit and think about things that are going on around you. Really put some effort into whats really on your mind. When the three days are up, reflect on what it was you thought of the most and take action on whatever it is that was nagging you during your med session. Whether it be solving a problem/proving your affection/whatever came to mind.','2016-08-27 15:24:11','2016-08-22 15:30:50'),(10027,10050,20,60,'Blast 60','Art creation tips and tricks round table discussuion for the university. prepare and conduct a class ont his subject with a postign for notes to follow up. It is a timely topic good luck!','2016-08-27 19:01:34','2016-06-03 21:40:57'),(10874,10050,144,60,'Chaos Well 60','Fill these two Chaos Wells at level 99 and Chaos Well 60 shall be yours. **A**','2016-08-27 21:12:21','2016-06-06 05:39:26'),(10874,10050,36,60,'Dreamblade 60 Cuero','Now that our houses are amalgamated, you\'ve got something that is most valuable: a keep.  I want you to work with the house members to come up with keep defense team.  Your role is to help everyone identify what their role is in keep defense.  Break it down by focus and then by individuals.  Also, help Blade develop a \"Keep Leads\" for ordering defense of the keep.','2016-08-27 21:27:32','2016-05-25 03:46:26'),(10027,10010,144,10,'CW - First Mastery','In light of recent events.. I command you to do the following: Create \"Treat-Myself-Love-Myself Well\" but NOT in art form. Do something(s) you\'ve always wanted to do but just never got around to it and make it happen - bring some else along that you trust and confide in - no self-pity parties! Be spontaneous and report back with your experiences. All is well.\r\n','2016-08-28 04:46:34','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10007,11046,74,1,'MB - Learn','I want you to use your lizardly sniffer and sniff out those that are mindblanked. Use \"Locate and House Members\" to find someone MB\'d. Then go and find them! Find -at least- 3 dreamers and be successful in finding them! Tell me who you found and what it took to find them. ','2016-08-28 04:55:00','2016-08-18 05:01:42'),(10988,10027,144,60,'Chaos Well 60 - LS','Fill these Chaos Wells and return them to me to claim what you seek.','2016-08-28 09:09:39','2016-07-07 05:17:55'),(10988,10027,14,60,'Knowin\' Yer Enemy','An enemy be encroachin\' upon the City with a unforeseen and unfathomabe vengeance attributed to Underlight. Yer task then be to know the unKNWONn. Discover the weakness of our greatest City\'s adversary ta date. Be true to yer cause of the Unviersity: the pursuit of knowledge. For extra credit use the knowledge gained to make progress against yer enemy by action. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-08-28 09:28:31','2016-06-08 03:30:27'),(10874,10050,52,20,'Cuero | Train20','Teachers have roamed the halls of the city for eons. We have lists of teachers, but not many codices that speak of what made them an inspiration to others. Ask teachers what lessons were the most inspirational, and come up with a small handbook on how to create the perfect task. Make it something new teachers could refer to, if they have a moment of writers block.','2016-08-28 19:33:04','2016-06-14 01:25:19'),(10680,10213,74,30,'Forget about it!','People love your carnivals, it helps them forget their woes. Perhaps you could have one up here to celebrate our opening? It would also be a good way for us to promote ourselves and our cause. Make sure it is ok with Lu, Cloud and Coraal first. ++SC++','2016-08-28 21:03:28','2016-08-19 02:03:29'),(10988,11065,36,30,'Blade-30','Forming a blade involes much more than 5 insight. Extend your knowledge of alchemy and the actual formation of the blade. I also expect a detailed analysis of your blade. What that includes is up to you.That includes a possible name, and detailed descriptions. Meet expectations or be denied. ~Kailoth','2016-08-29 00:42:16','2016-08-21 01:45:42'),(10916,11046,15,1,'Judgement - Learn','Get some of the basics of the art.  Judgement has an interesting property to it that no other art has.  I want you to learn that property and come up with a reason as to why it would be the only art to have it.  Then think of a few other arts you would think would be good having that property and why.  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-08-29 01:18:09','2016-08-26 02:15:46'),(10916,11065,74,10,'Mind Blank - 10','Mind Blank when evoked does not actually blank your mind.  But what if it did? I want you to come up with a disclaimer for Mind Blank, assuming it actually blanked the mind. Then I want you to come up with some disclaimers for others arts (be as creative and silly as you want).  I look forward to what you come up with!\r\n','2016-08-29 01:35:58','2016-08-27 01:38:33'),(10951,11065,16,30,'Saucy!','BOOM! You are now infatuated by the female garment style in this City! Oh Dear! The BOOM was too much & you\'re obsessed with the male garment as well! Crap! You are hereby charged with finding the sauciest male & female outfits in the City. I don\'t count! Seek & Identify the Sauciest male & female dreamers here! ~Lacie~','2016-08-29 01:48:59','2016-08-24 04:31:30'),(10107,10915,47,30,'Push 30','I want you to continue your efforts pushing the Revenants.  Bring me your next experiment and let\'s see if there are any tweaks we can do to make them more successful.  Have the details planned out and make the attempt as public as possible without alerting KoES.\r\n','2016-08-29 02:20:38','2016-07-28 03:18:41'),(10007,11065,0,10,'Join Party 10','So we have this nifty perk in this City where the teacher gains \"Energy\" when joined to others. Same with Guardians and Rulers! I would like for you for a couple of days remind house members and students to help out their Teachers, Rulers, and Guardians. Talk them into joining to eachother. Take note of who does and pays attention. Be consistent with it.','2016-08-29 03:51:51','2016-08-24 04:01:35'),(10651,10623,104,1,'Quest: Kael Lupich','Richard is a creepy creepy invis stalker.','2016-08-29 03:58:14','2016-08-29 03:57:20'),(10651,10318,104,1,'Quest: Kael Lupich','Richard is a creepy creepy invis stalker.','2016-08-29 03:58:21','2016-08-29 03:57:30'),(10651,10680,104,1,'Quest: Kael Lupich','Richard is a creepy creepy invis stalker.','2016-08-29 03:58:28','2016-08-29 03:57:40'),(10951,11038,46,1,'Learn to Recall!','Learn, of course, the basics for this Art. What is it good for besides preventing DreamStrike? Then, as a prelude to ... other things, your basic Alchemic knowledge. For your report, we will discuss what you Recall, as well as what you\'ve learned about the nature of Recall. ~Lacie~','2016-08-29 07:17:36','2016-08-27 20:24:27'),(11069,11046,10,20,'Inz - Ward 20','By now you understand a lot about how to use Ward. Is the art satisfyingly efficient? Are there any aspects of the Art that would need to be improved, and why? Gather the thoughts of a few dreamers, idealy from different foci, and add your own to it.','2016-08-29 18:15:59','2016-08-24 21:42:06'),(10680,10580,38,10,'Dreadfully Awful','I would like you to create something truly DREADFUL, something that people find hard to look at, or touch, or hear,. Feel free to put a comic spin on this if you wish. I will tell  you what I mean by that if you wish.  S.C.','2016-08-29 19:59:48','2016-07-10 02:53:21'),(10022,10311,111,20,'Flower: Dazzle 20','Write a story involving Dazzle. Share it with your house mates.','2016-08-29 20:01:50','2016-05-27 20:44:00'),(10680,10915,66,50,'Show & Shine','I would like you to have 10 different dreamers create for you 10 amazing blades. (Forge preferred but not required) Then I would like you to have a gathering where you display and try to sell these blades to the highest bidders. ++SC++','2016-08-29 22:49:34','2016-08-11 03:17:22'),(10680,11065,46,20,'Memories','I do so enjoy hearing you speak, you are one of my favorite dreamers.  Let us spend some time and you tell me two or three of your fondest memories throughout your life. I look forward to your tales of  joy. ++SC++','2016-08-29 23:46:08','2016-08-18 00:46:12'),(10009,11065,15,20,'Judgment-20','You have lost your Judgment! Spend a dream agreeing to whatever is asked of you or around you...whether it be hunting, genning, or something even sillier. You may deny requests that would go against your nature or morals (collapsing yourself or others, stealing, etc...).','2016-08-30 00:59:58','2016-08-18 01:10:17'),(10311,11063,111,1,'DazzleL-Frey','Bring in 100 strength in essences to the house.\r\n','2016-08-30 01:03:52','2016-08-29 20:24:34'),(10545,10580,89,1,'SoulShield | L','Beside Sanctuaries, there is one other type of place that protects our Soul Spheres from DreamStrike. Find out where this is and get further details on how and why.','2016-08-30 01:52:01','2016-08-26 00:25:32'),(10311,11046,26,10,'Purify10-Xererth','I would like for you to find a place in the city that is corrupted or dilapitated, and assemble a small team to make an attempt at cleaning it up. Could be anything from purifying a pond, to clearing the dust from a never-used sanctuary. When you report tell me why you chose the place, what kind of decay it was in, who helped you, and what steps you took to clean up.   ','2016-08-30 02:49:57','2016-08-25 02:08:18'),(10107,11046,139,10,'Sense Datoken 10 X','It seems that unlike other dark mares, the Datoken seem to attract people who actively seek them only for experience.  A dreamer would seldom tackle a Tzayak or a Sharque alone, but they will rapidly seek a datoken.  Do you think the Datoken are hiding some deeper, inner ability? Or are they just as weak as dreamers make them to be. Think of a means to ensure Datoken stay a smaller threat than their dark cousins.\r\n','2016-08-30 02:59:06','2016-08-29 02:03:41'),(10018,10915,22,50,'Forge 50','(Addition to the 1st) Seek out at least one DreamSmith and one other forger. Discover an item that would make them happy or that they would simply like. Keep in mind what you have learned and bring their desired item to life, with details from your own imagination. Ask them for their honest opinion and alter if needed. Bring back originals or copies for inspection.','2016-08-30 03:46:58','2016-08-25 05:20:56'),(10680,10580,104,1,'Radiant Blaze','Radiant Blaze needs power tokens to evoke, one power token costs fifty energy, bring at least fifty to learn your art. ++SC++','2016-08-30 21:03:02','2016-08-29 20:11:00'),(10027,10580,16,10,'Identify to 10','There an back again so many places to see. Identify the best places in the dream to take a date. What are other peoples ideas? Maybe test a few details are all yours. Take some time to have some fun.','2016-08-30 22:08:46','2016-08-29 19:36:20'),(10009,10311,22,30,'Forge-30','You are a Master of Scent in your craftings. Identify Masters in other aspects of Forge and attempt to mimic their craft. Aim for at least four of them. Show your item to the associated Master and see if they would accept it as their own. Bring the items to me when ready.','2016-08-31 01:07:48','2016-08-07 22:48:23'),(11069,10580,9,30,'Inz - FreeAction 30','Free Action is all about remaining agile and unhindered in battle. Examine the garbs of Dreamers. Find two dreamers in particular (your choice!) whose vestments appear impractical for battle. Long cloaks that might tangle? Armor that doesn\'t bend well enough? You be the judge. Try to identify a way to improve their mobility, and discuss it with them, taking note of their thoughts or reactions.','2016-08-31 18:55:44','2016-08-15 20:20:56'),(10027,10580,8,10,'protection 10','time to wonder what are the risks we need to protect each other form and our selves. Gather me up a list of known threaats and what the counters are.','2016-08-31 19:23:06','2016-08-30 22:20:36'),(10027,10318,144,1,'Chaos Well','This was one of  the first results of a combined action between to cities made one. Find me three more either by your memory or asking around.','2016-08-31 19:24:14','2016-08-31 19:05:46'),(10680,10213,104,1,'Radiant Blaze','Gather a few items or some strength for us to use. See me tomorrow to learn this splendid art! ++SC++','2016-08-31 21:30:36','2016-08-31 03:15:40'),(10680,10580,24,10,'Fixer-upper','Offer your services to a few dreamers, fix things up for them...it could be a shield, their hair, their shoes, mud on their facade, you choose, be creative, make it fun. ++SC++','2016-08-31 21:35:08','2016-08-30 21:11:29'),(10311,11038,40,10,'Deafen10-HarlenRoni','Sometimes in the hustle and bustle of things, people become deaf to others focusing solely on whatever it is they wanna hear. I want for you, for the next few dreams to speak and make heard something you have to really get out during such heated moments. Whether it be a silly made up fact during a busy discussion at a house meeting, or a calm the f down during a fight between brothers.. when you feel like you have made yourself heard a couple times return to me to report!','2016-09-01 01:58:39','2016-08-22 19:18:45'),(10951,10580,144,20,'Echo Well!','Talk to Lu about the upcoming project involving the elimination of the Revenants. Let him see this quest. We will need supplies in the form of Essences. Fill as many wells as full as ye can within 24 hours. ~Lacie~','2016-09-01 02:16:09','2016-08-30 22:36:55'),(10007,11063,60,4,'4th Sphere','Frey\'s Pet Store shall be opened soon! Seek out forgers around the City and ask them to make you pets that you had come up with. Get a good variety. Make sure to put your ideas on codex first for the forgers. Afterwards, ask if they would like to donate any pets for the Pet Store. Hold a big event and have people random for the animals. Almost like a big auction!','2016-09-01 03:42:47','2016-08-21 05:46:27'),(10680,10199,104,1,'Quest: Sorsha','For the recovery of a pikachu113 essence! Quite important to us and Kael Lupich','2016-09-01 03:48:12','2016-09-01 03:47:27'),(10916,10580,25,10,'Reweave - 10','Everyone in the city has differing theories on how arts work and relate to the focus they are based one.  Come up with a theory on how the elemental property of water incorporates into the fixing of a shield.  Then using your new water theory, put it to use on things other then just shields! Could be planes, other items, even dreamers or clothes! It\'s up to you.  I look forward to hearing your theory and what you did with it, good luck.\r\n','2016-09-01 04:42:49','2016-08-30 22:28:46'),(10027,10580,46,20,'recall to 20','I would like you to take some time and recall three things from your city and one thing from htis one that has made a differance in your dreams. Share the best with someone else and the i get to hear them all.','2016-09-01 05:59:50','2016-08-31 19:28:50'),(11069,10580,11,20,'Inz - Amulet 20','Your Amulet is a talisman that is perfectly tuned to your being. Talismans can be a very personal thing. Some have meaning due to the context they were obtained in, or were tailor-made for you. Explain your attachment to the other talismans you are able to produce, namely the GateSmasher and (normally) the codex you should be able to Inscribe. Lastly, find a Forger who knows you well enough to create a talisman they feel represents you, and give it to you. Share with me your thoughts on what you received.','2016-09-01 16:25:03','2016-08-31 19:01:58'),(10027,10580,46,30,'recall 30','You are the dreams pied piper! Time to  lead a few dreamers on an adventure. Play your flute for them as you go. You can take them anywhere in the dream you wish but when you get there you need to play them a song that reminds you of the place you went too.','2016-09-01 17:35:24','2016-09-01 06:11:45'),(10951,11063,74,1,'What\'s Yo Name?','For the next 2 dreams, you can\'t see anyone\'s nametag! Crap! Your mind has gone blank & now you must rely on your other senses to figure out who the heck you\'re talking to! Nay cheating, use your senses so that when you get MB, you won\'t lose your mind! ~Lacie~','2016-09-01 17:48:10','2016-08-29 12:33:11'),(10916,10580,15,10,'Judgement - 10','There are some basic applications of judgement but nothing too practical.  If you could overhaul the entire art, what would it do?  What would it cost, and how would it work?  Come up with your own version of Judgement and then \"use\" it on some dreamers.  Who did you \"use\" it on and what did the art tell you?  I look forward to hearing your report of everything!\r\n','2016-09-02 00:25:25','2016-09-01 04:51:21'),(10480,11046,141,10,'Pushy!','See if you can discover any information about Zaxun\'s long term goals. What exactly is he doing here, when will he leave? Be a persistent as need be to gather as much information as you can!','2016-09-02 03:54:00','2016-08-23 02:58:50'),(11097,10318,7,60,'Lu, Scaredy Wolf','You have displayed confidence and bravado, it practically exudes from you! I wonder then, can you display fear? You must display fear in order to accomplish this goal. The source of the fear I leave up to you, but your comrades must assist you in assuaging this fear. Convince them to venture forth with you and vaquish this object of your terror!','2016-09-02 04:06:55','2016-08-06 07:48:24'),(10480,10623,60,6,'Black Cloud Rising','You seem to have grandiose goals, leading to having a house to call your own. There are many things involved in opening a house. Such as: Recruiting your members. Holding meetings. Developing beliefs. Putting a hierarchy in place. Having a space to call your own until you have a house. It would also be wise to have allies. A fledgeling house should also have allies, so they may grow into the City, rather than being closed off from it and lastly, opening the house! Return when complete you feel complete.','2016-09-02 04:13:44','2016-08-04 01:15:47'),(10232,11046,48,1,'Xererth -Soul Evoke','To evoke one\'s soul is to tear away a piece of yourself, sacrifice it: Describe situations in which you might consider using this art. Having considered this, consider also and theorize: What other uses could we put permanent pieces of our soul toward? Imagine what kind of powerful effects we can produce, with such a fuel. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-09-02 04:18:58','2016-08-15 21:45:06'),(10480,10232,66,70,'FateSlayer to 70','This should be an easy task for you. I wish for you to fill one of your Chaos wells with 20 emphants, 30 bograms, 30 agoknights, and  20 Revenants. I wish for you to only use your blade to best the beasts. When you are finished, find me and we will discuss how you decided upon which way to best defeat them. **A**','2016-09-02 04:32:21','2016-07-30 03:06:54'),(10480,10008,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Giving support arts.\r\n','2016-09-02 04:59:26','2016-09-02 04:59:03'),(10480,10008,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Giving support arts.\r\n','2016-09-02 04:59:31','2016-09-02 04:59:19'),(10480,10008,52,10,'Quest: Akkadian','As per your quest for Train 10 from Keilara to speak with teachers and non teachers on their opinions about teaching and learning and getting others to do something in the City. **A**\r\n','2016-09-02 05:11:26','2016-09-02 05:05:09'),(10480,10213,63,10,'Quest: Invis 10','Vill, things are constantly changing within the dream as you know and word is that there are possibly more houses that are hidden from our view. See if you can locate any clues leading to this as well as think about where they might be? Between which other houses? Details!  Find for me two places within the dream that are invisible to others and take a dreamer to each.   ~ Sweet','2016-09-02 05:21:40','2016-07-25 04:07:11'),(10480,10680,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sorsha Master Teacher.\r\n','2016-09-02 05:29:40','2016-09-02 05:29:06'),(10480,10027,46,60,'Recall 60','For this task I wish for you to either train or plateau the Recall for six citizens. It is important that they have this art and use it at all times. **A**','2016-09-02 05:34:17','2016-06-06 05:42:18'),(10480,10027,103,1,'Bequeath','For this journey I wish for you to seek ourt opinions on training the art. Who should have it? Who should not? Is it really useful? How can it be improved? The hows and whys are up to you. I wish for a detailed report. We shall speak when you are finished. **A**','2016-09-02 05:40:48','2016-08-02 09:13:27'),(10480,11104,32,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Returning a birth art.\r\n','2016-09-02 06:02:08','2016-09-02 06:02:02'),(11069,10580,12,1,'Inz - Shatter (L)','As you\'ve said, Shatter destroys a Ward. Find out a bit more about the Art\'s basics, its cost, and how it improves with plateaus. With these basics in mind, I want you to consider why the cost of this Art might be as high as it is, and why this is inherently a Willpower Art, unlike Destroy Talisman, with which it has some similarities. Your own thoughts on the matter, I\'m not especially looking for an official or academic answer.','2016-09-02 18:07:38','2016-09-01 16:34:21'),(10951,10580,72,30,'Scribble Me This...','Write a very brief, short story (no more than 3 codexes) about a recent event that has happened in the City. Try to be as factual & include some input from 1 or 2 other people (include names). Be the City\'s reporter, using best grammar & spelling. ~Lacie~','2016-09-02 18:35:56','2016-09-01 02:29:31'),(10951,11046,40,10,'What\'d Ya Say???','For some reason, you can\'t understand a thing people are saying. You hear them, but you will misunderstand most everything that\'s said to you for the length of a dream (or 2, if few are about). Twist around what is said to you. Are you offended? Embarrassed? If that doesn\'t work, then twist around your responses. \"I\'m good\" turns to \"Horrible, thanks for asking\". Twist things up for a dream or two! Your choice in how ya do it. ~Lacie~','2016-09-03 02:27:46','2016-08-29 02:06:20'),(10593,10659,25,20,'Quest: Fix it up!','You know the mechanics of reweave already, let\'s put a different spin in this. Reweaving is bout fixing things, making them better...as such, fix for me the most incredible dish you have ever cooked...\"fix\" it until it is just perfect! I look forward to sharing it with you.  ~C','2016-09-03 05:24:40','2016-04-23 08:08:49'),(10951,10376,20,1,'Masta Blasta (1)','This Art is half-skill and half-cunning. Seek out other Seers, try to learn their Blast tricks. If none aid you in this, seek out ways & areas that would give you an advantage to Blast successfully. Your report will be at least 5 good spots, & at least 2 good tricks to Blast. Hint: Ask Silver how to Blast while moving! ~Lacie~','2016-09-03 07:06:39','2016-07-17 07:07:42'),(10680,10104,89,20,'Soul Shield','An art forgotten by most. For what reason do you want to plateau this? also..what is in your soul that you shield from others? I know there is more to you beneath that gruff exterior. ++SC++','2016-09-03 21:21:36','2016-09-01 17:00:47'),(10027,11063,46,1,'Recall to learn','Find me the quickest way to five places the dream is full of short cuts. To Houses to other planes. You may need to know these some day and its good to remind others. So its time to save ourselves some time and get to where we want to go.','2016-09-03 23:48:11','2016-08-28 04:24:39'),(10680,11045,104,1,'Radiant Blaze','Just bring some items for our use, some essences, alts, elems, chaks. your choice. See me tomorrow for your shiny new house art! ++SC++','2016-09-04 02:31:43','2016-09-01 18:16:16'),(10067,10027,5,50,'Random 50','Your task is to got to each main plane (8) and find a room that you don\'t usually go to. Sit in the silence and listen. Write the first random thing that pops into your head while there. When you are done, come and share your random thoughts with me. <T>','2016-09-04 03:41:47','2016-08-05 04:34:26'),(10010,11063,18,30,'Chamele 30-Frey','Chamele has a sister art in invisibility, and vision helps allow one to see through both of them, I want you to expand on the three arts. How can each be better, how can they work in conjunction with each other. Should invis and chamele be merged, if so. How can they be merged effectivly? Is there a better art that could be more battleworthy ? Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-09-04 07:53:59','2016-08-28 04:27:49'),(10027,11046,73,1,'Destory Talisman L','Tips and trick are alwasy fun to find. See if you can find any from current teachers and or students about teaching. It could be anything from how to imp arts to the best way to hear a report? Good information for a new apprentice.','2016-09-04 19:02:53','2016-09-03 07:06:11'),(10680,11070,72,1,'To know you','Speak to Xererth, an interesting scaled fellow, learn of how he found his way here. I would also be very interested to hear of your...plight? You do not seem to happy about being a dragon..it was the snort. For extra credit and a little extra reward, see if you can find others who do not \"fit the norm\" as it were. ++SC++','2016-09-04 21:12:39','2016-09-03 21:01:46'),(10027,10067,144,60,'Chaos well to 60','I am contemplating working on some classes. I need some ideas. So in this \"basket\" please give me ideas for six topics. (examples arts, exploring.....) Maybe in you spare time you can arrange to lead a class for me fromt he list.','2016-09-05 04:15:51','2016-09-04 03:21:19'),(10067,10027,64,60,'Give - 60','You give so much of yourself already. It\'s time that you start thinking about what you want. I want to know your deepest and darkest desires that may or may not come to be. This is a wish list so dream big. If the dream were giving out wishes, what would you want? Think of 6 things that the dream could give to you on Wish Day. <T>','2016-09-05 04:24:30','2016-09-04 03:47:46'),(10107,11046,98,10,'Newly Awakened 10','It is interesting how accelerated the dreams are becoming. It took me over a year to get 4th sphere and now dreamers are doing it in months.  Are we accellerating because we need to because there are so few dreamers? Or is it because we measure success in comparison with our friends and peers.  When does a dreamer \"win?\"\r\n','2016-09-05 18:24:07','2016-08-30 03:10:57'),(10311,11046,72,20,'Inscribe20-Xererth','Find a history, story, or create your own about a member, former member of the light.. Or of the Mount.\r\n','2016-09-05 19:34:09','2016-08-30 02:54:25'),(10680,11070,24,10,'Recreation','Restore the splendor to the items given you. Feel free to add or take away from each as you see fit. I look forward to seeing the finished products. ++SC++','2016-09-05 20:25:57','2016-09-04 22:00:01'),(10003,11069,107,20,'Inzoum PA (20)','You are the Angel of Peace, I want you to wear these wings and take your staff, skip or fly around protecting others with it for a few days. Create a catchy way or saying of touching them with the staff of peace. Were they receptive? How did you they take you offering peace?','2016-09-05 22:00:04','2016-08-23 09:29:48'),(10916,10580,50,1,'NMF - Learn','First learn the basics of the art (there isnt much so that won\'t be hard).  Then it was once said that this art was created for purposes of study.  What do you hope to learn from having the art and also what do you think could be learned from studying the lesser mares in general? Would it be worth the time?  I look forward to what you come up with, good luck!\r\n','2016-09-06 00:28:39','2016-09-02 00:31:43'),(10010,11045,24,20,'Restore 20-Nathan','First off, I want you to try and track down the history of the art. Second, I want you to be the restorer of laughter,  I want you to make others laugh, however, you must try and accomplish this in rooms that are silent, or where the mood seems somber, at least three attempts. How did those around you respond, what did you do to make them smile or laugh. Have Fun! ~Cryst~','2016-09-06 00:35:09','2016-08-22 05:29:26'),(10022,10107,111,20,'OfF: Dazzle 20','We are in need of a MB post detailing what we believe and why. The core of our beliefs as well as the additional things we adopted when we took in the Order. Speak with Dreiko and get a full account of what that is. Once you have it put together, post it on the MB for our initiates to see.\r\n','2016-09-06 02:00:46','2016-07-23 21:41:18'),(10022,10311,111,30,'Flower: Dazzle','Ensure a post is made and maintained describing how all the vaults work. What should be stored, where it should be stored, assign an official QuaterMaster and make sure they do their damn job.\r\n','2016-09-06 02:07:34','2016-08-30 01:43:31'),(10916,11070,67,10,'Soulreaper - 10','A weapon should be an extension of ourselves and have some meaning other then just a tool to be used.  Come up with some visual representation (be it picture, story, song, statue, ect ect) of what a weapon means to you.  When you report, explain how what you show (or tell) me relates.  I look forward to what you come up with.\r\n','2016-09-06 21:36:17','2016-09-04 08:25:58'),(11097,10746,88,1,'Quest: Faelyn','Returning MT.','2016-09-07 01:36:55','2016-09-07 01:30:25'),(11097,10746,88,1,'Quest: Faelyn','Returning MT.\r\n','2016-09-07 01:36:55','2016-09-07 01:36:24'),(11097,10746,85,1,'Quest: Faelyn','Returning DreamSmith.\r\n','2016-09-07 01:37:14','2016-09-07 01:36:45'),(11097,10746,116,1,'Quest: Faelyn','Returning WordSmith.\r\n','2016-09-07 01:37:58','2016-09-07 01:37:48'),(10951,11046,6,20,'Med Spa','Seek out a location you feel would be the best place for *you* in the City to rest & relax. What type of environment is best suited to your ... nature? Once you find such a spot, take another to this location & get them to critique the area. Is \"what\'s good for the Iguana, good for the Dreamer\"? Why or why not? ~Lacie~','2016-09-07 02:30:11','2016-09-03 02:43:19'),(10018,11046,65,30,'GateSmasher 30','GateSmasher is an art all GateKeepers have, but with each individual, it is with the creativeness of our minds that make them uniquely ours. Since we cannot pass them, how do you envision your blade? Utilize Inscribe to form all of the details, then seek out a forger to bring it to life. Return with the finished product for my inspection.','2016-09-07 02:41:46','2016-08-30 03:23:31'),(10680,11046,16,1,'How do you see it?','It is quite odd that we cannot fully SEE an item until we evoke this art on them, Why do you think we can\'t see them? And in your own words, how do you think this art actually works? when you report (we have to wait a day) I will tell you an answer I once gave in how I think this works. ++SC++','2016-09-07 03:17:12','2016-09-05 20:02:27'),(10545,11046,144,1,'Chaos Well | L','Fill this Chaos Well and return it to this girl. As you work on this, think about all the type of essences it can hold and those it cannot. Why do you think this is? Is it already known or are dreamers still trying to figure out why?','2016-09-07 04:30:50','2016-08-28 05:43:20'),(10951,11063,23,1,'Recharged!','Learn the abilities of this art, including how far each item type can be recharged. Also, ask Seers on the Blow-up & Failure rates. You\'ll get some different responses, so take good notes. Once you\'re familiar with the Art, Recharge a Room! Find a room or area which lacks a description & create one! ~Lacie~','2016-09-07 05:01:48','2016-09-02 04:01:23'),(10593,11023,70,10,'Time to Rest','Being on the Pacifistic side, I find it awful that most just use their flames to harm others. I bet you could make a lovely bonfire with yours, gather your family and friends and make an evening of it. Stories, food, drinks, fellowship. Relax & enjoy. ~c','2016-09-07 06:16:07','2016-07-16 23:18:45'),(10951,11069,50,30,'Make \'em NMF!','Alright, you peaceful Ruler, time to get wicked! I want you to figure out a way to make 5 people change into NightMare Form! Can\'t just ask them to! Get creative! Will you challenge them? Irritate them? Intimidate? Don\'t worry, \"This is just for a quest\" !!! ~Lacie~','2016-09-07 06:36:21','2016-08-23 06:29:27'),(10010,11063,36,40,'Blade 40-Frey','Our blade is an extention of ourselves. It requires our insight to create it, however, all the other foci also have a blade that requires thier focal element to create it. Why is this the case? Why is it not our dreamsoul that is used? Once you come up with your theories, I want you to share them with at least 5 dreamers, I want at least one of each foci, notate thier thoughts and reactions, once you have that done, share it with me. Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-09-07 07:07:13','2016-09-06 07:49:10'),(10027,10580,46,40,'Recall 40','Time to do some reflecting and research. There aer two documents of importance int he archives read them and save them for future referance. Now i want you to think of five quests you really enjoyed. What was good about them? Three that you would never do again. What ws bad about them? Now tthe same with teachers. Seek out dreamers and ask them what their favortie quest was and why. After this consider your results. What makes a good quest? What makes a bad one? What are the best qualities of a teacher?','2016-09-07 17:51:31','2016-09-01 18:15:08'),(10680,11023,60,3,'Laureate Coraal','Finish up your work with the Corpse writings, on the Public Scrolls and the Archives of the Plains.  Also feel free to hand out tenets to dreamers who you feel may be interested. Amazing work, thank you for doing that for us. ++SC++','2016-09-07 21:31:24','2016-09-04 01:51:52'),(10238,10318,22,10,'Quest: Apples ','You now sell apples.  You can be in the middle of a fight, and just suddenly forget whom you are and want to sell apples.  You keep a few with you at all times.  The fun part here is to be middle of talking about anything, literally, and suddenly forget the entire conversation and want to sell apples.  Sell a couple of dozen forged apples, but mostly have fun losing it and needing to sell them.','2016-09-08 01:09:28','2016-08-17 00:51:10'),(10746,10232,144,50,'Well ~ 50','How does a Well hold the Chaos within it without it leaking?  Is it possible that a crack could form?  Does the same apply to our avatars?  Speak to some of your fellow dreamers about their theories as well as form you own.  Extra: place your findings within the Archives.','2016-09-08 20:34:59','2016-06-12 23:46:32'),(11069,10580,68,20,'Inz- Flameshaft 20','Further your knowledge of how things burn in the City independently of your use of FlameShaft and you are bound to learn more about how to make a hotter flame. Explore the City and find places with flaming ornaments or geological characteristics. Pick three of them and tell me how they inspire you.','2016-09-08 21:28:29','2016-09-07 16:52:11'),(10916,10580,17,1,'ID Curse - Learn','As always learn the basics of the art (there is basically not much so no worries).  This art is on par with being one of the more \"useless\" arts in the dream. Come up with a way to expand it\'s use beyond just dreamers. How would you do that? What in your opinion would constitute a curse and  what kind of curses could the art detect in the city? Finally come up with a few examples to back up your opinions. I look forward to what you come up with.\r\n','2016-09-08 21:55:51','2016-09-06 00:36:58'),(10680,10010,104,1,'Service','For recharging services rendered to the House. ++SC++','2016-09-09 00:04:15','2016-09-09 00:02:14'),(10018,10580,1,40,'GateKeeper 40','So you want to be a teacher! I would like to see what you can do. Inscribe five sample quests, all to learn: Push, FlameShaft, Ward, Amulet, & Kinesis. Keep in mind when these arts are learnable and adjust difficulty accordingly.','2016-09-09 02:12:22','2016-08-30 21:48:13'),(10010,11063,69,40,'Tranceflame 50-Frey','Your flame is a ranged weapon. I want you to tell me what you can do with your flame that does not directly correlate to hunting? After you figure that out. I want you to develop a theory as to how we create our flame using just our insight. I want you to have fun with this quest. ~Cryst~','2016-09-09 02:13:16','2016-09-08 08:12:42'),(10066,11046,9,30,'Free Action 30','Investigate Purple Lace\'s alchemy works as of late by your own investigation and through discretely asking others. Determine what she is up to and what the impact could be to the city, us and those outside the city. If her actions are malign, prepare a counter idea to her efforts.','2016-09-09 02:31:40','2016-09-02 03:33:53'),(10680,10232,82,60,'Anti-Terror','6 New arts that are the polar opposite of Terror. They must be Fatesender arts of course.  I look forward to your ideas. Feel free to make them public for fun, though that is not required.++SC++','2016-09-09 03:50:00','2016-08-16 17:18:11'),(10916,10008,105,10,'PC - 10','Poison Cloud now follows you around!  However it\'s only poison is the offending of the nostrils.  Stand next to some dreamers and expel your cloud of noxious poison however you see fit.  Then waft it around the room.  Take note of who you do it around and their responces.  I look forward to hearing what happens\r\n','2016-09-09 04:28:25','2016-08-28 03:00:55'),(10027,10318,142,1,'Misdirection learn','You will find my quest for you will relfect teaching. Teachign was differant in yrou city can you share with me in what ways? Where there really teaching robots? How were mentors differant? Can any of the differance benefit us now if so how? And what do you beleive is the role of a mentor and apprentice?','2016-09-09 04:48:17','2016-09-03 06:53:40'),(10027,11063,2,40,'dreamseer 40','Okay time to consider you place int he dream and where you wish to see yourself. Seek out examples of leading Dreamseers. Are any of their qualitites a good fit for you? Are you a leader? a teacher? a fighter? a politician? or maybe something all together differant ? I will share my ideas when you return.','2016-09-09 05:04:52','2016-09-04 00:00:09'),(10951,10623,21,30,'Blendin\' In (30)','Let\'s abuse the Art a bit. Nothing nasty or harmful. You seem to have a GK on your coattails. Let\'s see if you can come up with a way to irritate him with your Blend. Is it the noise that bothers him? The fact that his Wards are useless? Do you argue with him? Think up a way. Report results or failures. ~Lacie~','2016-09-09 05:56:32','2016-08-15 21:26:45'),(10916,11028,30,1,'Antidote - Learn','As usual get the basics of the art (This one is easy enough though).  When you learned poison you displayed interesting \"poisons\" throughout the city.  I want to get your take on what would be considered \"antidotes\" along that same line of thinking.  What are they and how do they fall into that category?  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-09-09 08:29:18','2016-08-26 01:06:43'),(10916,11046,74,10,'Mind Blank - 10','Play a word association game with some dreamers (however many is up to you)  Give them a word and have them give you a word in responce to it.  record their answers given then take them and come up with a funny story, anecdote, limerick..whatever you wish using the answers that were given.  When you report tell me the end result first, then who you spoke to and the answers given.\r\n','2016-09-09 21:04:53','2016-09-03 23:51:16'),(10951,11046,47,20,'Tail Smackin\'','Ok, so Push can\'t be used in Sanctuary, but ye have a tail! Put it to functional use & find a way to \"Push\" a few folks around (3). How ye use your skills is up to you, but try to \"Push\" them around, off your tail, whatever, inside an area that Push is not usable. If not, use the Art along with your tail, as a supportive muscle! Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-09-09 23:08:18','2016-09-07 02:40:17'),(10311,11046,25,1,'ReweaveL-Xererth','Have some conversations with knowledgeable SMs about the art. How it works, differs from restore, what it does unplatted then what changes with each plat. All the art basics. Then I would like for you to take what you learned and put a physical effort into imitating what the art does by gathering a few materials and using them to reweave something back together. Whether it be something in the city, a mural or broken wall.. tell me about your efforts and what material you used and what they represent.','2016-09-10 01:01:09','2016-09-05 19:38:54'),(10916,11023,74,1,'Mind Blank - Learn','As always learn the basics of the art (borrrring!)  Now the interesting bit.  When you evoke Soul Shield on yourself it can block the use of Mind Blank.  Come up with an argument stating whether or not MB in some form uses chaos to shield us from locate.  Also in this I want you to put your own opinions on if it could eventually cause our avatars harm or not.  make sure to include examples to support your theories!  I look forward to what you come up with.  Good Luck!\r\n','2016-09-10 01:30:45','2016-09-08 22:10:10'),(10062,11046,46,10,'Recall | 10','Speak to dreamers from the Idoaclese city and find a city worth putting to codex. Record this history and present it to me for acceptance. The history will be placed in the Library afterwards.\r\n','2016-09-10 01:54:11','2016-08-25 02:04:44'),(10010,10545,104,1,'Quest: Crystalline','','2016-09-10 06:10:57','2016-09-10 06:10:50'),(10680,11023,104,1,'Radiant Blaze','Please bring in some energy or a few items to put into storage and this Art shall be yours. ++SC++','2016-09-10 18:12:24','2016-09-04 02:41:39'),(10010,10623,74,10,'MB-10 Black Cloud','I want you to contemplate Mind Blank, and how it is used currently. I want you to develop a theory of how it works on the dreamer. I also want you to come up with a few ways that it could be improved. Or is it perfect the way it is? Have fun! ~Cryst~','2016-09-10 23:14:15','2016-08-18 23:34:33'),(10951,11063,6,20,'Meditate!','Find a tree. Any tree, must be a few around. Sit under the tree, figure out a way to climb it. Once about halfway up, stop and look around. What do ye see? Think on it, meditate. How far do ye see and what\'s out there. Imgination counts! Don\'t fall outta the tree! ~Lacie~','2016-09-11 01:13:40','2016-09-08 04:46:55'),(11097,11046,68,30,'Flameshaft -- 30','For your journeys into the teaching realm, I will tailor this task to fit your ambitions. I wish for you to share what you know about your flame with as many people as you are able. Hold discussions, share views, give tips...the specifics I leave up to you. Report when you are satisfied that you have met the requirements. **A**','2016-09-11 01:28:14','2016-08-22 03:21:30'),(11097,11046,141,20,'Ken20 | Xererth','Opposite Task Day: Have other teach you about this art and give you hints on how to optimize it\'s capability.  Once you hear what they have to say, twist it around so it seems you hadn\'t learned anything. See if they correct you, or let you move along. This will teach you patience, and how important it is to listen to all the words you are told. Do this to as many as you see fit, but of course, the more you do, the more you will learn. ','2016-09-11 01:41:01','2016-09-02 04:30:42'),(11097,10077,20,70,'Tember\'s Mind','I have had the pleasure of reading some of your works, and have been told that writing to be something you excel at. As a Ruler it is wise to keep your house up to date on everything which occurs around them but they may not be present to see. I would like for you to start a weekly update for them, so that they may know what all has been missed. They should always be able to react to situations with the most up to date information, wouldn\'t you say? This should be comprehensive and a very detailed thing.','2016-09-11 01:56:48','2016-08-04 01:23:15'),(10746,11046,105,30,'PC ~ 30','Aside from the service you already do for our fair home, I would like you to come up with an idea for a secondary house art for us.  Cost, PT usage, when it is learnable and its effects.','2016-09-11 02:55:44','2016-09-08 02:59:04'),(10480,10232,45,20,'Em\'et Razorwind 20','You say you would like to see Fatesenders to be able to forge bleed!  I won\'t spoil the ending and tell you what I saw in the future on whether you were successful or not!  For this task, you will make the first attempt to make it possible for Fatesenders to forge bleed.','2016-09-11 03:01:41','2016-07-30 02:34:59'),(10480,10746,89,40,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring a Soul Shied quest from when Arnaya was an apprentice. I have heard the report and accept it.\r\n','2016-09-11 03:19:57','2016-09-11 03:19:51'),(10480,10750,52,10,'Arnaya\'s Halo','As a newly ordained Teacher most of what you have learned up to this point are still fresh in your mind. I would like for you to share this fresh knowledge with others, those who would seek a halo as well as those who have had one for a great deal of time. Write up a list of information you feel is important to those who teach, or seek to teach. A comprehensive list of Do\'s and Dont\'s, in a manner of speaking. Place your writings upon the Archive.','2016-09-11 03:22:07','2016-08-18 07:16:05'),(10480,10750,33,1,'Banish Nightmare','I\'d like you to spend some time in the Caudal and Dorsal rifts.  Try to identify the areas that are most volatile in terms of the chaotic essence that is seeping in to the city.  Utilize your ability to forge talismans to create some equipment to help you in this analysis - and get some others to assist you if possible.  Please be careful in this endeavor, and watch your back.','2016-09-11 03:41:11','2016-08-08 20:59:08'),(10746,11028,46,30,'Recall ~ 30','I would like you to talk to at least one Lyran and one Idoaclesian teacher about their apprenticeships.  What were their favourite parts?  What parts sucked?  What do they wish had gone differently.  What do you see yourself bringing to the teaching atmosphere when you go for your halo?','2016-09-11 05:05:39','2016-08-19 05:16:53'),(10746,10916,100,10,'PT ~ 10','Written by Vill Valorian \"Motivate your house though simple catch phrases while in an opportunity to do things unique to your position in your home,linessuch as. \"It\'s sucha pleasure serving you as Guardian\", or, \"It\'s such a treat just to tell you\".  So that you are a token of power in words.\"','2016-09-11 05:21:08','2016-08-08 21:30:30'),(10027,10376,74,1,'Mindblank','This art can make some upset. What are the good and bad uses of it? Can it be abused? What could be done to make it less effective? More effective? Are there ways to have bank mind without the art?','2016-09-11 09:43:25','2016-09-03 07:28:16'),(10480,10400,141,40,'Harkyn\'s Adventure','You seem to spend much time in the sun, with all that dark wrinkled skin. See if you cannot push others to step outside of Threshold and seek the brighter lights that can be found outside the ring. Make it an adventure! Lead the charge with that Cutlass I see hanging from your waist!','2016-09-11 21:47:32','2016-08-02 08:07:21'),(10680,10376,104,1,'Radiant Blaze','In service to the Corspe, please gather some energy or items for storage, see me tomorrow to be granted this most amazing of arts! ++SC++','2016-09-12 02:43:29','2016-09-10 19:41:28'),(10027,10067,89,60,'Soul Shield to 60','I beleive the dream has a soul and we see it in our three ladies Plum, Justice and Calenture. Are these the only three from lyran times with house spirits? Was there house spirits in Ideoclesia and what do you beleive their true purpose is as you seem to have a link to them. Coudl you write up something explain what you beleive and share it please you choice as to where the archives or library proper','2016-09-12 03:55:53','2016-09-05 04:33:13'),(10107,10007,111,20,'Dazzle 20 - Dina','I want you to combine Abjure and Dazzle in at least one fight in the near future. Leave someone wobbling for their life! ','2016-09-12 04:12:28','2016-09-06 02:07:09'),(10680,11023,144,1,'Just a Box?','Quite an innovative invention these wells. To learn this art I always like to see how people think -outside- of said box.  Use the template of the well and create something for me from it. I look forward to your creation. ++SC++','2016-09-12 04:20:30','2016-09-10 18:25:37'),(10067,10027,96,60,'Sense Dreamers 60','Time for some fun and \"play spy\". I would love to know the movements of dreamers. Where are they going? What is there? What could they be doing? Track the movements of 6 people for a few days and make up a \"cloak and dagger\" story about what they were doing. Make it fun and just hilarious. <T>','2016-09-12 04:28:02','2016-09-05 04:38:24'),(10951,11023,16,1,'ID the UnIDentified','Many things can be ID\'ed with this Art, but several cannot be ID\'ed. Pick two. Why a Plane colored as it is? What does the word \"Shamblix\" mean? Anything ye choose, simple or complex. We all know why the skies in EverNight are dark blue. Pick ye own & use ye skills to Identify what is .... Unknown. ~Lacie~','2016-09-12 05:01:58','2016-09-11 00:45:44'),(10593,11023,67,20,'Aviary','Build what you have to, to keep that bird close to home, we don\'t want it messing up the Library or scaring people or eating Elder mice. ~c','2016-09-12 05:43:35','2016-09-07 06:24:41'),(11069,11046,72,30,'Inz - Inscribe 30','In older days, prior to the Art of Forge Talisman being mainstream, people would express their creativity through carefully decorated and folded codi. Use your Art of Inscribe to produce three paper creations. Be creative and have fun!','2016-09-12 06:08:13','2016-09-02 16:15:03'),(10951,10010,20,60,'Blast-O-Matic!','This is a major improvement in Blast. Learn the secrets of the Art, either by example, torture or inquisition! If ye want to be a MastaBlasta, ye need to learn how to run & Blast, around corners & thru walls! Seek out the Masters of the Art as well as some of the victims. Your expertise will be your report. ~Lacie~','2016-09-12 07:37:30','2016-09-09 01:53:20'),(10951,10623,20,60,'MastaBlasta','With this plat ye be a MastaBlasta. Two parts. 1st: Help Crystalline learn the secrets of Blast. There\'s several tricks ye need t\'learn. 2nd: Take all but ONE chak out of ye pack & rely sololy on Blast for two entire dreams. Ye need t\'hunt, defend, irritate, whatever ye do in a normal dream, but only with Blast. Ye need to show marksmanship & proficiency in order to be deemed... MastaBlasta! ~Lacie~','2016-09-12 07:47:31','2016-09-09 06:18:47'),(10010,10376,15,1,'Judge learn-Cala','I want you to watch others, see how they judge those around them. What do they do? What do they say ? Then I want you to judge at least 3 dreamers, why did you pick them, how did you judge them? What did you learn about judging others ? ~Cryst~','2016-09-12 07:50:28','2016-09-11 10:03:33'),(10951,10376,20,10,'Blasted Art!','So ye think ye can Blast, eh? I want you to surprise Blast 5 people before they have a chance to run or respond! Now this won\'t hurt, so nay harm done, but ye need t\'make ye point! Originality counts here, so make them interesting Blasts! ~Lacie~','2016-09-12 07:53:02','2016-09-03 08:18:49'),(10916,11046,144,10,'Chaos Well - 10','Find a way to use chaos wells in a project of repairing something of your choosing.  What the well does and how it integrates into the project is yours to decide.  Have at least 2 other dreamers help you in this.  When you report, tell me who helped, what you repaired and how Chaos Wells tied into the whole thing.  I look forward to what you come up with.\r\n','2016-09-13 00:57:59','2016-09-10 03:23:19'),(10232,10376,73,1,'Calabosh - DestroyT','Select one type of talisman: You have now obliterated all of them from existence, and they will never exist again. What are the consequences of this action, in the short term? In the long term? Will this serve the dream, or hinder it? Ensure a thorough report.','2016-09-13 02:06:31','2016-09-08 20:01:40'),(10951,10317,2,40,'Dreamseer to 40','You\'re a Dreamseer but what we need is a Soul Master. Recruit and initiate one.','2016-09-13 02:18:16','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10010,11063,63,1,'Invis-Learn-Frey','Invis allows us to hide in plain sight. I want you to develop a theory as to how it works, and why it costs what it does to use. Once you have that information, I want you to write a story about the art, you decide the tone of the story. Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-09-13 06:51:35','2016-09-09 02:29:28'),(10680,10580,6,20,'Be at Peace','Use this quest to take a break from all of your studies. Take your lovely Avayla out for a pleasurable evening to relax and enjoy the city that we have been blessed with. Wine, food and flowers optional, but of course..would I imagine be appreciated by your love. ++SC++','2016-09-13 18:42:37','2016-08-31 21:43:56'),(10027,10580,7,20,'Resist Fear 20','This might be an odd request but I need some assistance. Your City flourished under the fel art of dreamstrike and to me that would seem impossible. As I have seen and experienced nothing but destruction from the result of it not to mention its direct effect. Please explain to me how this can even be possible. How does one dream with Dreamstrike. Because in truth I dont know how much more I can endure.','2016-09-13 18:55:08','2016-09-07 18:00:13'),(10007,10580,47,20,'Push 20','You say you may be going back to the Peace Corpse, but you just recently left. What is pushing you to rejoin them then? I want you to come up with your own dos and don\'ts why you should and should NOT join a house or fraction. I want you to think about what you come up with and we will talk about it. During this time, do not join anyone until we have talked. I want this a well thought out report and it must be worth your plat. ','2016-09-13 20:16:51','2016-09-09 02:26:33'),(11069,10580,8,20,'Inz- Protection 20','I give you a little chick, a hatchling. It needs care and feeding, and to be shielded from harm. Bring it back to me in one piece after 3 days, and consider how everything you do could have an impact on it. Keep it safe and alive.','2016-09-13 20:37:36','2016-09-08 21:35:46'),(10232,11023,38,1,'Coraal - Scare','This art makes you run, it MAKES you run. Spend a dream or two fidgeting, refusing to sit still, moving as much as you can while still keeping up your normal behavior. How does this movement affect your thinking? Your behavior? Are you treated differently by others? Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-09-13 20:41:43','2016-09-08 22:14:59'),(10916,10580,26,10,'Purify - 10','Purity can be defined many ways.  Take some time and go about the city and discover in your view the least pure plane in the city and the most pure plane.  With each plane come up with a theory as to why they are both the least and most examples of this fact.  Lastly I want to know if you think having impurities in the city is good or bad for it.  Why do you feel this way?  I look forward to what you come up with.','2016-09-13 21:59:57','2016-09-08 23:55:40'),(10916,11045,27,10,'Drain Self - 10','Think about how Drain Self fits into being a SoulMasters art.  What about our focus would validate or show that it being in our hands is the best hands for it? Do you feel it helps us as a focus?   Then think about what you have used the art for so far.  What potential do you feel it has for your future dreams and growing as a SM yourself?  I look forward to your report!\r\n','2016-09-14 01:49:32','2016-09-13 00:22:25'),(10010,11045,25,20,'Reweave 20-Nathan','Reweave allows one to repair a sheild. I want you to create a reweave stand, the where and when is your choice. I want you to do this until you have reweaved 10 sheilds. I also want you to add your brand of humor to it. I want you to tell me the responses of those who you did reweave for, did they like the humor aspect to this? Most of all, have fun ~Cryst~','2016-09-14 02:30:17','2016-09-06 00:42:08'),(10311,11063,9,10,'FreeAction10-Frey','Free Action is probably one of the most important arts in the city. Especially with all the threats we face daily. Take some time to think of everything you can that FA protects us from, and choose a few. Write a story or poem involving the use of the art against such threats and place it in the houses scrolls for our members to view and remind them that they need to keep their FA on at all times.','2016-09-14 02:46:22','2016-09-03 02:15:04'),(10951,10317,23,30,'Recharge-R-Bust','Even though your Art level may be low, doesn\'t mean it can\'t perform decently. Try picking up 10, low lvl talismen & Recharge towards their max. Note any Art failures or backfires. Try to discern a pattern for your level of Recharge. Does the 15 item blow-up rule apply to your level? Results = your report. ~Lacie~','2016-09-14 02:55:52','2016-09-13 02:09:20'),(10010,10376,69,30,'TranceFlame 30-Cala','Our flame is an inherant talent to us. It uses our insight. I want you to weave a tale of suspense. Where a seer loses his or her insight, thus losing thier ability to use thier flame. How did they cope? How did they get it back ? Be creative and have fun with it ~Cryst~','2016-09-14 06:55:06','2016-09-12 08:34:09'),(10027,10623,21,40,'Blend to 40','How will your new house be orgaized? I hvae heard military terms used in pasing. How will play out as your home grows? Will you maintain \"branches\" as other houses do? Create a history for the begining of you new adventure for all to read on how your hsoue began. Post in the archives of the awakended and the Archive of the Planes.','2016-09-14 07:22:30','2016-08-17 18:47:30'),(10010,11063,15,1,'Judgement-Learn','Judgement allows one to judge another, tell me what judgement will tell you at different phases of wellness. Once you have that I want you to \"judge\" three dreamers. What makes them the way they are? Why do you feel that they are the way they are, things like that. Have fun. ~Cryst~','2016-09-14 07:26:23','2016-09-13 23:29:13'),(10951,10317,63,10,'Inviso-Man','Create your own style of hunting using Invisibility. Since your level is low, work mainly with Emphants do develop your flavor of Seer Hunting. Your report is a summary of how you incorporate Inviso into your hunting routine. ~Lacie~','2016-09-14 20:01:58','2016-09-14 05:40:43'),(10951,11069,74,30,'Blank\'d Mind (30)','The Mind is a terrible thing....to Blank! What happens when this art is overused? Create an experiment for either yourself or a student to test the results of too much MindBlank. Maybe get a student to interview Em\'et (King of MB) or perhaps the Queen. The results of the experiment is your report. ~L~','2016-09-14 20:33:04','2016-09-11 07:40:12'),(10027,10317,23,40,'Recharge to 40','The group you have returned to assist is ever growing and with that comes the need to recharge. How can you help your comrades do this? Come up with five ideas and what you would arrange and pick one to do with them time to get to know each other. Report yoru ideas and what happened with who.','2016-09-14 21:16:42','2016-09-14 07:58:12'),(10916,11046,73,10,'DT - 10','Take the idea of DT and see if you can find any other applications for it in the city (doesnt just have to pertain to items).  what applications did you come up with?  Then consider for me if DT could potentially be used as a weapon either against dreamers or mares?  If so how?  If not, what way could you expand upon DT to make it more then just a \"cleaning\" art.  Be creative and report to me what you come up with.  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-09-14 21:24:04','2016-09-13 01:37:47'),(10007,11063,72,10,'Inscribe 10','I want you to tell me the pros of platting your inscribe to your orbit, but I also want you to give me -many- options you have with the art. If you run out of ideas, perhaps asking your fellow dreamers for ideas. Bring to me a copy of each way. I am expecting at least 4.','2016-09-15 02:04:58','2016-09-13 08:15:40'),(10027,11063,47,1,'Push to learn','To push or not to push there are times when to offer help to another is a gift and times it is not. Travel t he dream and think on examples of both. Your insight will guide you.','2016-09-15 02:49:57','2016-09-13 18:35:53'),(10232,11063,74,10,'Frey - Mind Blank10','Explore the City, and find the room that blanks your mind the most -- how does it cause this? Does the room do this for everyone, or is it you specifically it targets!? How might you protect yourself from this blanking? Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-09-15 05:49:46','2016-09-09 05:01:51'),(10232,11046,74,20,'Xererth-MindBlank20','Search the City for a place that seems blank to you. Theorize a way that you could remove its blankness, and give it more form, more character. Discuss with a few whose opinions you respect, and see what they think. What can you do about this? Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-09-15 06:13:51','2016-09-09 21:38:35'),(10232,10376,38,1,'Calabosh - Scare','Find a scary room in the City of Dreams, and convince someone to walk with you there -- once there, SCARE them! Use all your spooky powers to accomplish this. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-09-15 06:23:10','2016-09-13 06:47:26'),(10232,11028,74,1,'Anasina - MindBlank','Blank your mind, and then unblank it -- What is the FIRST thing that pops into your head? Envision that thing, and then attempt to blank your mind to EVERYTHING else. Where do you see it? Find a place in the Dream that embodies the first thing you thought of, and explain! How does the physical landscape of the Dream reflect our thoughts in this way? Ensure a thorough report! ','2016-09-15 07:04:02','2016-09-08 22:12:42'),(11069,10580,12,10,'Inz - Shatter 10','I\'ll take a page from someone else\'s book as I find this is a valuable lesson to learn regarding an Art such as Shatter and wish to pass this onto my students as well. Consider what difficulties you\'ll encounter as you strive to improve your skill with this new plateau. How can you efficiently practice your skill at Shatter until level 19? What plan would you formulate to efficiently raise this Art that requires another to function?','2016-09-15 21:14:51','2016-09-13 20:46:01'),(10916,10580,139,10,'Sense Datoken - 10','What do you think it is we \"sense\" in a datoken that lets us pinpoint where they are in the city when they dream?  How does this compare to the sense dreamer art to you?  And with knowing those two things, do you think we could expand upon sense datoken?  What would you enjoy seeing done with it?  I look forward to what you come up with, good luck!\r\n','2016-09-15 22:24:54','2016-09-13 22:08:50'),(10874,10916,52,20,'Train 20 | Aileron','Your reputation is a good one. Your teaching skills unmatched. Give us some secrets on how to write better tasks and post them on a public wall. Add to it, what inspires you. I also want you to ask your students, specifically, what makes you a good or a bad teacher. ','2016-09-16 01:12:02','2016-08-28 19:52:48'),(10874,10067,17,60,'ID Curse 60 - Tama','I want to take curse outside of the box a little. What if we, through our manipulation of the CoID, could create a limitation on the art of Dreamstrike where the evoker must \"mark\" a coherent dreamer before being able to strike.  How could we manage the mechanics of this, and how could we use ID Curse to prevent any further striking?','2016-09-16 01:54:41','2016-08-21 20:16:53'),(10053,10916,46,30,'Recall30 Qst: Kelos','For you plateau, ask 3 of the oldest dreamers you know, if they remember (1.) how Recall worked originally....(2.) Would it be to our advantage if it still worked that way today? ','2016-09-16 02:23:58','2016-07-02 01:52:32'),(10027,10067,14,60,'Know 60','It\'s a big one eh? We have learn so much and grown so much. Touch by every teacher we listened too. The end of the path is upon us but a new one is being laid as well. With the trail blazers ahead of us what are they teaching us you know Gerroz, Dreiko, Thunder and Blade? Em\'et too and maybe even Tember? What is in store for deramers like us Tam? Will we follow their lead or make our own path as we always have. Seek them out if you wish for their input We have Jiovanni, Norkight and Wishbringer as well.','2016-09-16 02:45:34','2016-09-12 04:10:45'),(10874,10232,45,30,'Razorwind to 30','Time for more experiments with your arts. This time you will be using your Razorwind against your flame art. I wish for you to figure out how much stronger your flame is compaired to your Razorwind and Firestorm. You can use your flame to take out 5 Shamblix and then use a combination of Razorwind and Firestorm to take out 5 additional shamblix. Keep track of your findings and share with me what you have learned.  Make your efforts worthy of the plateau that you request. **A**','2016-09-16 03:04:57','2016-09-11 04:46:10'),(10874,10951,142,10,'Wait... what?','Are you able to accomplish something which others do not expect of you? For them to believe one thing, but to do another? For the right hand to know be aware of what the left does? Give it a try and let me know how it went. I leave the particulars up to you.','2016-09-16 03:54:02','2016-09-02 04:59:03'),(10063,10008,80,1,'Weave | Learn','Use your charm to stop a room of dreamers dead in their tracks. Use whatever means necessary and report all their reactions. What did you expect versus what you received? How did you do it, and how would do it differently for better results in the future?','2016-09-16 04:17:52','2016-08-26 03:49:30'),(10018,11046,7,30,'Resist Fear 30','GateKeeper art histories are severely lacking! I want you to do some digging. Speak to a few history buffs that know their stuff and collect as much information as you can on Return (for either Lyran and/or Idoaclecia). Compile it all together and inscribe it codex. ','2016-09-16 04:40:26','2016-09-12 06:40:34'),(10018,11069,1,40,'GateKeeper 40','Create a four series forge set dipicting your own vision of peace and chaos. I want the materials to be collected from various outer planes. Make a show of crafting them by whatever medium you see fit, but it does not have to be grand.','2016-09-16 05:35:35','2016-09-12 06:20:19'),(10951,11069,17,10,'Dag-Nabbit!','Ok, time for some overt cursing! Your tongue has slipped & now you\'ve got a bit of a potty mouth. But not the normal curse words... wierd ones! Make people what the hell is wrong & what curse you\'re putting on them. Do it for a day to everyone you encounter! Flabberity-gabber you! Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-09-16 06:15:40','2016-09-15 06:12:45'),(10750,11063,15,10,'Judge 10 - Frey','There have been a lot of judgements going on lately, mostly based on half truths and perceptual differences.  I would like you to advance your ability to make accurate judgements by chasing down the factual instigation incident to this war between OoL and the Peace Corpse.  What do you think would settle it, and what lessons do you feel would need to be learned by the leaders of both groups to avoid such issues in the future?','2016-09-16 06:31:31','2016-09-15 05:20:37'),(10593,11023,30,1,'Pitchman','Use your infinite charm and wit to hawk your wares, be the pitchman of the century selling your special cure all..whatever you decide to create. Smile, enjoy yourself, bring a smile to others..keep your clothes on. ~c ','2016-09-16 08:27:00','2016-09-12 06:00:35'),(10746,10593,22,10,'Forge ~ 10 (2)','I would like you to chose a room without a history and create one (letting it be known that it is a work of fiction) inclusding some of the items that would have been used there.','2016-09-16 19:12:20','2016-07-07 19:21:27'),(10951,10317,63,20,'Inviso or Bust!','You seem to be object-oriented & the Corpse needs assistance. Using Blast, Flame & Inviso, fill a Chaos Well (over 50) with essences. This is to get you some practice using your new-found skills while helping the group you\'ve seemed to bond with. Turn in the Well & get a receipt. Your report will tell me how long this took & any problems you encountered & how you overccame them. ~Lacie~','2016-09-16 20:10:33','2016-09-14 21:04:47'),(10951,10593,103,1,'Give as Ye Gets','Alright, we seem to be trying to create a currency system in this forsaken City. Let\'s have some fun. Now that you\'re a FrS, you can take on the \"beggar\" role. Try to get your students & others to give you an item they think ye may need. Then write them an IOU, which you can pay with the Bequeth art once ye have it. (5 people total). ~L~','2016-09-16 21:51:00','2016-09-13 04:19:41'),(10680,11045,60,3,'The Amazing Nathan!','The Bizarre Bazaar! this will be an event where you have very odd items for sale. You will present each item then ask dreamers what they will pay for it. I would like you to collect these strange items from other dreamers. Tell them you are having a Bizarre Bazaar! and let their imaginations go! I will look forward to this and will also donate an item when it is time. ++SC++','2016-09-17 01:10:11','2016-09-04 03:14:55'),(10593,10750,35,20,'So Many Traps','From the sounds of things, it has been a bit blah around the city and tense. You want a task, then you have to liven things up. Set some traps for your friends and family...these traps have to be something that makes them and you, smile. Looking forward to hearing who and what.  Have fun. ~C','2016-09-17 04:45:38','2016-08-17 06:21:23'),(10003,11063,23,10,'Recharge 10-Frey','Recharge is a coveted art for seers. How do you think recharge works? Does it have the same mechanisms as reweave for shields? Report to me your theory. Share it with two seers, did they agree with your synposis?','2016-09-17 04:55:01','2016-09-10 22:23:15'),(10007,11063,16,10,'ID 10','I want you to ID personalities in the City. Pick 10 people and tell me what they are like (good or bad), in your eyes. Include me! ','2016-09-17 05:54:47','2016-09-15 02:26:48'),(10951,10632,25,1,'Reweave for ID','Since ye did such good work on a plat ye cannot receive yet, I am willing to accept your efforts towards the completion of the Art of Reweave. Present this to me in a day, and I will accept ye work as complete. Please become familiar with the Art of Reweave for your own benefit. ~Lacie~','2016-09-17 06:35:41','2016-09-16 07:15:14'),(10018,10580,65,40,'GateSmasher 40','Seek out four different teachers and inquire on how they build a task. What level of difficulty do they use for a learn verses a plateau, etc? Be sure to take detailed notes. Afterward, inscribe a sample task of your choice around each teacher\'s point of view. Bring them to me, along with what you have learned. ','2016-09-17 07:07:44','2016-09-09 02:42:36'),(10010,11063,47,10,'Push 10-Frey','Push allows us to push others, stopping evokes, or just for fun. I want you to find other purposes for the art....they can be of your imagination. I also want you to sneak attack atleast 10 dreamers with your push. How did they respond ? Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-09-17 08:40:43','2016-09-15 05:37:56'),(11069,11046,11,10,'Inz- Amulet','If you were to describe your Amulet, what would it look like? It\'s yours and none other\'s. How is it personal to you?','2016-09-17 17:10:14','2016-09-15 22:48:53'),(10009,11069,22,10,'Forge-10','Style, style, style. A Forger\'s style allows them to become more comfortable with the work they create, allowing for a consistent and more efficiently created product. Investigate the various Forging Styles in the City, to include at least one DreamSmith. What makes them unique? Do you feel you could identify their work in the future? Once complete, define a style for yourself. Forge three items of various function and templates, utilizing the style you defined for yourself. Bring the three items with you.','2016-09-17 18:08:24','2016-07-29 18:57:27'),(10746,11028,72,20,'Inscribe ~ 20','You have made your reputation as a baker, now you must share this on a new level.  I want you to wrtie some instructional articles on the Archives answering some of the questions or issues that came up in your baking classes.','2016-09-18 04:26:18','2016-09-11 05:26:35'),(10010,11023,24,20,'Restore 20-Coraal','Restore allows a dreamer to give another back thier coherance. I want you to develop a theory as to how this works. I also want you to share that theory with others, at least 5. I want you to record thier thoughts, and perhaps thier insights into how they think it works. Most important, Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-09-18 06:10:15','2016-09-06 02:18:14'),(10010,11063,16,20,'ID 20-Frey','Id allows us to identify items in our pack, I want you to tell me if there are benefits to plateauing the art. I also want you to observe those around you. Identify those that hide things behind thier persona, are they truly happy, sad or indifferent. Why do you think that is so? Present me with at least 5 observations. Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-09-18 10:17:44','2016-09-17 08:49:28'),(10007,11063,72,20,'Inscribe 20','I want you to write up two tasks for this very art. I want you to write them for \"Learn Inscribe\", no plats.','2016-09-19 01:58:00','2016-09-17 18:04:35'),(11069,10632,1,30,'Inz - GK 30','Generators have tiers of power. Find where the highest ones are usually located and what gens from them, spend some time at at least 3. Test the spawn timers and see if they varies. Lastly, seek out some information from an idoaclesian or the Library to learn about the differences between generators in this City and their\'s, which do you prefer?','2016-09-19 05:53:19','2016-09-16 06:43:34'),(10480,11089,96,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Missing birth art.\r\n','2016-09-19 06:20:42','2016-09-19 06:20:36'),(10951,11069,98,10,'Teaching the Young','Even though the New Dreamer is few & far between, we teachers still need a plan of action ready for their rare appearances. Think on it a bit & come up with a series of things you\'d go thru to expose & familairize them with the City of Dreams. Just a few first steps will suffice. ~Lacie~','2016-09-19 06:24:49','2016-09-16 06:26:35'),(10480,11089,139,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Returning birth art.\r\n','2016-09-19 06:26:39','2016-09-19 06:26:33'),(10480,11089,98,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Restoring birth art.\r\n','2016-09-19 06:26:51','2016-09-19 06:26:06'),(10480,11089,17,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Restoring arts.\r\n','2016-09-19 06:28:15','2016-09-19 06:27:52'),(10232,10951,144,30,'Lace - Chaos Well30','I\'d like for you to consider the nature of Chaos -- what is it, precisely? What, if anything, can we do with it? You say you like changing things -- can you do anything to change Chaos? Theory, experiment, whatever y\'like -- let me know whatcha think, how it goes. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-09-19 18:46:28','2016-09-16 17:42:56'),(10951,11045,144,1,'Well of Chaos','Ok, so that\'s what it is -  a Well of Chaos. How does an object made of DreamSoul hold objects made of pure Chaos? There\'s no real idea, so original idea is asked here. You can ask others, but I want your idea. Know the benefits of platting, etc., of course, but the why & how is important to the quest. ~Lacie~','2016-09-19 19:59:49','2016-09-17 02:00:50'),(10916,11045,29,1,'Poison - Learn','First things first, give me the basics!, always the basics.  Now we know that poison is no longer effective against Darks or Datoke.  My question is, why would this come about?  Come up with a good theory as to why this is.  Then come up with a way we could make it potent for them again. (nothing to  in depth, just a base idea).  I look forward hearing what you come up with.\r\n','2016-09-19 21:08:32','2016-09-17 02:12:06'),(10680,10232,104,1,'Radiant Blaze','for massive amounts of essences You have earned the art of Radiant blaze! Keep up the good work. Your service is appreciated','2016-09-20 00:12:34','2016-09-20 00:11:33'),(10680,10951,104,1,'Radiant Blaze','for recharging work rendered and more to come, I am pleased to grant you Radiant blaze','2016-09-20 00:14:38','2016-09-20 00:13:18'),(10680,10376,74,10,'Forget about it!','I find it interesting learning about your City, quite a few things that were different about it as compared to this City. What are some things that happened there that you would much rather forget!? Give it some thought and see me tomorrow, I look forward to hearing more about this City.  ++SC++','2016-09-20 01:14:35','2016-09-12 21:19:50'),(10680,11046,60,4,'Lost & found','A fun treasure hunt or two in the City of dreams, make it known to the City via the Public Scrolls and Courtyard of Awakening. Offer prizes, perhaps get some forgers to help you with that. ++SC++','2016-09-20 02:03:22','2016-09-12 02:46:26'),(10952,10311,116,1,'Quest: Tritium','','2016-09-20 03:17:52','2016-09-20 03:17:45'),(10952,10680,116,1,'Quest: Tritium','','2016-09-20 03:18:06','2016-09-20 03:18:01'),(10952,11028,116,1,'Quest: Tritium','','2016-09-20 03:18:42','2016-09-20 03:18:34'),(10018,11046,8,30,'Protection 30','I have an extremely precious item that is in need of your Protection. The only downside is it must be seen by ALL that request to. Are you able to keep it safe? This is an exercise to see who you can trust and who you cannot. Come up with a story on how you found it and make sure to mention it in front of others to play up the mystery.','2016-09-20 04:33:22','2016-09-16 04:54:26'),(10010,10376,25,1,'Reweave-Learn-Cala','You have the basics, I want you to try and find the history of this art. Once you have that, I want you to share the history with others. I want you to inscribe the history, and place it in the first sphere libarary for others to learn from. Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-09-20 06:14:28','2016-09-15 07:41:16'),(10593,11023,29,1,'Perception','Everyone sees things differently. I would like you to think about each open house, including your group... are there things in each that you feel may be detrimental to the inner workings, or the physical structures themselves? Choose some things from each and explain why you feel they are poison/a detriment. ~c','2016-09-20 06:24:25','2016-09-16 08:47:15'),(11097,11069,12,20,'Shatter to 20','Please come up with a possible ways to quickly improve your Shatter art. Use your own experience to determine the quickest way to make your art climb as you plateau it. There are always quicker ways to do things, but not always better. Show me a combination of both. **A**','2016-09-20 06:38:50','2016-09-11 22:05:45'),(11097,11069,13,20,'Return to 20','For this journey, I wish for you to return to a simpler time in your travels and focus on what your own personal goals were and what they are now. I wish to know what your dreams were and what they are now and why they might have changed. Look deep within and enlighten me. **A**','2016-09-20 06:47:30','2016-09-11 22:03:43'),(11097,10937,10,20,'Ward/Amulet to 20','Ward and Amulet go hand in hand. It is also another example of how the GateKeepers control the ebb and flow of the City. I wish for you to find for me three examples of places that you may access freely that require a lock and key. Who should have access to it? Who should it keep in or out? These are the types of inquiries that I wish to hear in your report. Be detailed and thorough. **A**','2016-09-20 07:10:30','2016-04-06 21:10:27'),(11097,10937,11,20,'Amulet','Honoring a combo ward/amulet task from Akkadian.\r\n','2016-09-20 07:11:32','2016-09-20 07:11:21'),(11097,10937,1,30,'GateKeeper 30','Being a gatekeeper is a very important role within the city. speak to fellow gkers and get thier views on what it means to them, with that in mind ponder a bit on what it means to you. There is a place in the city we GKers call the warding circle. ask around and find someone to take you there. give me your impresions of it. Tell me about RenRut Nek. when you have this mission complete seek me out and we will have tea and talk ~P~','2016-09-20 07:22:32','2016-07-01 07:02:42'),(11097,11046,10,30,'Blockade!','You are to pick a plane and set up a blockade, of at least five portals. You are then required to enlist the aid of others to break through this blockade! The scenario of how these portals became blocked is up to you, as well as the manner in which you break through. Involve others and try to have fun.','2016-09-20 07:32:12','2016-09-02 04:35:59'),(11097,11046,141,30,'Kin30 | Xererth','Shoving dreamers isn\'t polite. Do it, anyway.  How is using this harmless art similar to using a sharp weapon? Could you use this art as a passive House Art? What would you change about it, if you could?','2016-09-20 07:41:36','2016-09-16 02:30:32'),(10027,10376,36,30,'Dreamblade to 30','Nothing cuts more than that a sharp blade or wit. I want you to find me ten examples of brilliance in the dream today. Maybe it will be something a dreamers says. Maybe it will be something you see as you walk these halls. Bring me a list and have any you found changed your dreams in any way?','2016-09-20 08:09:13','2016-09-12 08:37:19'),(10010,11063,16,30,'ID-30-Frey','I want you to identify 5 things that you like about your house, and 5 things that you would like to see changed. Once you have done that, I want you to identify the first 10 items that you find, what are their stats. What would you do improve those items ? Have Fun! ~Cryst~','2016-09-20 08:34:17','2016-09-19 05:40:33'),(10916,10937,73,1,'DT - Learn','Come up with a theory as to where an item goes once it is DT\'ed.  With that theory could there be a way to possibly retrieve a once destroyed item?  If so how advantageous would this be for the city?  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-09-20 21:01:53','2016-06-20 21:17:45'),(11069,11063,47,20,'Inz - Push 20','I\'m sure you find a lot of undesirable items in your genning time. The next talisman you consider throwing away, I want you to keep and instead find a way to push it onto someone. Make it amusing, show off its merits, even if it doesn\'t have any, and get it off your hands and into someone else\'s. Push that product!','2016-09-20 22:24:03','2016-09-18 12:30:41'),(10009,10018,22,60,'Forge-60','The Lyceum could use some excitement. Organize a large gala event for them. Come up with a design scheme and style for the event. Have a myriad of items and decorations forged by at least five other dreamers using your designs but in their own work. Ensure that all of the crafted items blend together to fit into one design scheme. Schedule entertainment, refreshments, and whatever else you feel would be necessary for a good time to be had by all.','2016-09-20 22:52:01','2016-08-06 00:46:24'),(10916,11045,30,1,'Antidote - Learn','First things always first THE BASICS! (Its Anti so..yeah..basically one or two things).  Recently I heard an opinion that Antidote should stack on an avatar like FA, RF or Prot does.  Being a SM yourself, how do you feel about this? Is there really anyway to build up on the art to give it more use then it has now? If so, what and how?  I look forward to what you come up with.\r\n','2016-09-21 02:14:02','2016-09-19 21:13:20'),(10480,11046,102,1,'Quest ','I am granting Xererth Quest for the next step of his journey as an apprentice. **A**\r\n','2016-09-21 05:15:12','2016-09-21 05:15:07'),(10480,10750,7,20,'RF 20','This situation with the Vanguard and the Templars have seemed to inspire fear among many in the City.. I want you to talk to a member of each House and a few FrS.. find out what they fear of the situation and try to soothe them and aid them in not being afraid anymore.','2016-09-21 05:36:36','2016-06-30 02:45:01'),(10232,10746,96,40,'Arlyana - SenseDr40','Soul Essences! These things are interesting, and powerful! Ask around, and see if you can learn about a time that a Soul Essence was used as a TRAP! -- if you can\'t, we\'ll discuss it at the report. How can we use Soul Essences before they\'re left behind as our Dreamstruck token? Theorize some ideas for me! ','2016-09-21 17:32:04','2016-09-08 21:08:16'),(10680,10232,140,40,'Tempting','You are a Master of creation, tempt dreamers with your wares, talk these (possibly extremely bizarre) items up SO much that everyone just HAS to have them. I\'ll not put time limits or numbers, you will know what is sufficient in regards to the plateau level. ++SC++','2016-09-21 20:36:38','2016-09-09 04:00:31'),(10951,11069,139,10,'Vdat isis Datoke???','Consider the nature of the Datoke? *What* are they & why are they Sensed with this Art? They\'re different than the DarkMares, which cannot be Sensed with this Art? Why? Theorize & present your idea with some basis to back it up. ~Lacie~','2016-09-21 23:23:07','2016-09-19 18:11:36'),(10951,10317,69,30,'Flame On!!!','Our Flame Entrances, and so should we. Combine your firey robe with a new flourish of your personality, nature & focal Elemen of Air. Create an \"aire\" about yourself. Try it out, improve upon it and garner reaction from those around you. I\'ll see the results & know your efforts. ~Lacie~','2016-09-21 23:46:19','2016-09-16 21:12:42'),(10003,11063,74,20,'Frey-MB,30','So you think you are a ladies man, eh? For 4 days, I want you to forget your flaundering ways, your flirtious sayings, and lose your your mind. Return to the innocent Frey that entered the city and was quiet and humble. You are not allowed to tell anyone about this task. If dreamrs ask, think of something without directly lying, your mind is now blank!','2016-09-22 01:37:17','2016-09-17 07:10:55'),(10593,11045,70,20,'Fire Should be hot!','Alright well, give this some thought..from childhood we are taught fire is hot! no touchie! but inevidently we are all curious enough to stick our finger in it anyways. There are several places with fire in the city, do you percieve them as being hot? everywhere or just some places? and if they aren\'t hot, why not? It\'s very peculiar!!  Name some places nd we\'ll talk about it. ~c','2016-09-22 02:59:23','2016-09-17 04:19:27'),(10593,11023,3,30,'Soul-O-Rama','Create for me 5 new Soulmaster arts! 3 nice, 2 not nice! pretend, of course..but if you COULD..what would they be?  I look forward to hearing what you cojme up with!  ~c','2016-09-22 03:15:09','2016-09-20 06:45:12'),(10951,11045,74,1,'Mare\'s Blank\'d Mind','Set out on your own Hunting Expedition. Choose a location with both a lesser Mare AND a sanctuary closeby (Thresway comes to mind). With a Well in 1 hand & a weapon in the other, Chamele for a moment before you strike. Watch the Mare & really consider his movements. What is that Mare thinking??? Is his Mind Blank??? ~Lacie~','2016-09-22 03:16:16','2016-09-19 20:10:23'),(10951,11132,47,1,'Push Back!','We need more of the old and less of the new! Push back & repress the old ires & try your hand at reacquainting yourself with the newness around you. Enjoy the old, sure, but find the new things in the City. Push yourself to learn about the new Strongholds & Houses, & find a couple of new places. ~Lacie~','2016-09-22 06:36:33','2016-09-21 01:16:35'),(10010,11063,63,10,'Invis 10-Frey','Invis allows us to hide in plain sight. I want you to write a story about someone who felt invisible, no matter where they were, with or without the art. Why did they feel that way. Was there a way that they were able to make it better ? Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-09-22 07:46:10','2016-09-21 07:22:21'),(11069,11046,12,1,'Inz - Shatter (L)','The cost in elemental force of using Shatter (40) is twice that of Ward (20). Why do you think it costs so much more to shatter a Ward then to create it? Think of what a Ward represents, and what Shattering it represents, and tell me in your own thought why you think this is so. You can use any type of imagery to describe your thoughts, but use your own words.','2016-09-22 22:08:17','2016-09-21 15:55:14'),(10746,11046,50,1,'NMF ~ L','Why do you think we are limited to the form of an emphant?  And why does it not disguise us from the real mares?  Create a theory for me on why this is and also how you would change it.','2016-09-22 22:52:12','2016-09-21 16:55:57'),(10951,11132,60,1,'1st Interview','After several discussions over the past couple of days, I\'d like to give a little quiz, to see if you\'ve gotten the basics down and are ready for 1st sphere. Anything you get wrong is ok, I\'ll give you the correct information so you\'re ready for new adventures which await you! ~Lacie~\r\n','2016-09-23 00:50:50','2016-09-23 00:18:16'),(10088,10958,3,50,'SM 50 Snow Angel','It\'s good to be a resident trapper. But what if one day the City shifts and something CRAZZZYY happens and we lose that ability? I want you to improve your combat skills in the more conventional methods of blade, flame, and chakrams. Set up targets in various parts of the City. You can choose the planes - but pick 10 solid rooms. Get advice from warriors you trust on footwork accuracy. This exercise SHOULD allow those like me to feel safer, walking near you, a new gunslinger. Put my mind at ease.','2016-09-23 01:14:36','2016-08-07 18:52:32'),(10007,10958,27,40,'Drain Self 40','I want you to take this bowl of water that I hand you and find a way to drain it without pouring the water out or breaking the bowl. I do suggest getting someone to help you. Bring to me the empty bowl in one piece and your notes on how you succeeded in doing so. I want a full report on how and who helped.','2016-09-23 01:31:43','2016-09-15 02:16:42'),(10009,10062,22,30,'Forge-30','Bandaret is a dreamer that those of your City know well. Dreamers of my City know little about him, however. You mentioned once that you were likely the foremost expert in the tools/trinkets/items that he held. I want you to change this. Forge replicas of the various items of Bandaret you know about. Make them as close to the real ones as you can remember but embelish the pieces you cannot. Present them to me when ready and we will settle them in the Museum for Preservation upon completion.','2016-09-23 03:33:07','2016-08-06 00:12:50'),(10067,10009,74,60,'MindBlank 60','For some reason I don\'t fully trust Xun\'rok. I can sense that something is amiss in this whole drama. He may not be hiding but his motives aren\'t fully visible. Find out what you can and see if there is more to what we can see. Also, think of a way that if he gets DreamStrike, how we can take him out if things go wrong. <T>','2016-09-23 03:44:04','2016-08-21 20:34:50'),(11069,11132,9,1,'Inz- Free Action','Perhaps you already have memory of what the Art of Free Action does? Confirm the basics of the Art (costs and effect). But most importantly, envigor your old bones into moving freely again and explore the City. Find a place that has meaning to you either in your new dreams, or in your old ones, and explain what you find in that place, what it means to you. Was the trip also a good one as well?','2016-09-23 05:35:19','2016-09-22 06:07:55'),(10018,11132,68,1,'L: FlameShaft','It has been some time since you have been in the City. Spend a dream or two learning of the changes or simply things you find exciting. Collect a list and bring it back to me with your thoughts on each.','2016-09-23 06:33:29','2016-09-20 23:00:33'),(10010,11063,20,40,'Blast 40-Frey','Blast is a great defensive art. I want you to interview at least 5 dreamers, find out how they defend against blast ? What do they think of the art? What do they think could be improved? Taken away? I also want you to do some testing. Is blast effective on all mares, if no, which ones does it not work on ? Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-09-23 06:52:34','2016-09-13 06:58:22'),(10232,10915,80,30,'Magnum - H Weave 30','Identify some hypnotic things in the City of Dreams; at least three or so. Search throughout the City, both in the physical landscape, and in the ideas people present to one another; Where are there weaves hypnotizing people? Select one of these Weaves, and attempt to alter it: Either by making it more hypnotic, drawing in more unsuspecting individuals, or less so: Freeing those who seem hypnotized. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-09-24 04:10:05','2016-07-21 21:49:45'),(10007,10916,35,50,'Trap 50','Hold a contest for your house. See who can bring in essences the fastest. Where did they hunt and what did they use? During this time, I want you to go with them too. Do this for 30 minutes to an hour. See what they bring in compared to you. The hard part will be getting everyone together to do it. I suggest giving everyone the same chaos well (a high one), and going by how many are in the well. Show them how awesome it is to have SM\'s with Trap!','2016-09-24 05:57:11','2016-08-03 20:50:23'),(10916,11045,67,20,'SoulReaper - 20','Get some hands on training with chakram fighting from a few dreamers.  Dodging, aiming, footwork, whatever you think you need more work on.  Then I want you to take what you learn from chakram fighting and apply it to blade.  Try out your blade dueling with what you have learned on a few dreamers.  How does chak compare to blade and what overall did you learn and progress most on?\r\n','2016-09-24 19:07:24','2016-09-23 05:39:17'),(10027,11045,7,1,'Resist Fear learn','Fear can be a good thing or a bad as you dream consider examples of both. Help eases the fears fo a dreamer or 3. Even with a simple kind word. Report back to me and we can see what we can do to ease some of yours.','2016-09-24 20:07:40','2016-09-17 01:36:52'),(10951,10027,104,1,'Recharge d\'Blaze','Help Recharge the Armory. The reward for your efforts is the ability to Radiantly Blaze!','2016-09-24 20:33:25','2016-09-24 19:48:52'),(10593,11045,3,30,'Soulmastery!','Coraal had to make up new arts, I would like you to comeup with three new soulmaster weapons! I look forward to seeing and hearing your ideas! ~c','2016-09-24 21:14:55','2016-09-22 03:06:41'),(10053,10916,14,20,'Quest: Kelos','Why does the art know give more descriptive knowledge in some rooms and not in others? Ask 3 soulmasters their opinion on this as well...','2016-09-25 03:14:10','2016-09-19 00:27:25'),(11097,10009,81,30,'Dreiko\'s Bite!','As a teacher I hear things, such as the constant battle against the bad man Zaxun. From what I hear collapsing him has no real effect, he just keeps coming back. Perhaps you could develop a means of siphoning off some of his strength, perhaps make it harder for him to swing that mace? Nothing too extravagant, but maybe something others can build on.','2016-09-25 04:09:28','2016-08-10 02:09:51'),(11097,10750,94,1,'Cleanse Nightmare','This is one of the 5 essence arts. Two of the five are very powerful where three are not so much. I wish for you to come up with ways that Banish, Cleanse and Imprison Nightmares can be made as useful as Trap and Drain Essence. This is your time to dream big. How would you have them used and strengthened? Share with me your dreams for these three arts. **A**','2016-09-25 04:30:23','2016-09-11 04:53:31'),(10746,10916,15,20,'Judge ~ 20','With so many different generations within the City, does a dreamer\'s past have any bearing in the present or are we granted a clean slate?  Weigh the pros and cons of each scenario with a dreamer from each generation and apply them to your own dreams.','2016-09-25 04:38:02','2016-09-11 05:40:52'),(10018,10750,47,30,'Push 30','Put some thought into our recent test into Push and Kinesis vs. soulspheres. Why does Kinesis have the power to move them and Push does not?','2016-09-25 06:49:15','2016-09-20 04:36:54'),(10728,10888,24,40,'Uthan: Restore 40','You are now the proud owner of Uthanjangle\'s Traveling Clinic... I would have come up with a more clever name that was vaguely insulting... but I am tired. You provide a service for whatever it is that ails people! No matter what a person is afflicted with... you have a cure! I think you either have a wooden stall you set up... or maybe a cart... pulled by a really fat penguin... See how many people you can \"help\".','2016-09-25 07:44:28','2016-06-29 07:28:13'),(10728,11069,10,30,'Keys and Locks','Here is a key. I know not to what it goes. Gather up some friends and perhaps you will be able to discover its purpose. Or will you create its purpose yourself? We shall see!','2016-09-25 07:44:52','2016-09-20 06:57:26'),(10916,11063,98,1,'NA - Learn','First off the busy work, learn the basics of the art (what it does, cost, ectect, all that fun stuff)  Then I want you to come up with a theory explaining how each elemental attribute pertains to each focus. (IE Res has water because it needs it to bind blah blah).  Then using those elements, come up with a very very basic description of what each of those elements makes you think of and why.  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-09-25 22:09:14','2016-09-15 02:22:04'),(10007,10750,30,20,'Antidote 20','Find me some plants around the City that you think would make a nice antidote. Bring me samples and tell me where you found them. We will then go over each of them and see what we can come up with. We may be able to keep these in the SM hall and use them at a later time.','2016-09-25 22:11:19','2016-08-18 05:59:43'),(10007,10958,28,40,'Abjure 40','I want you to put your Abjure to use during a fight. Now this can be a duel type fight or even a datoken fight. Whatever works best for you. I want you to use your Abjure in a helpful way towards those fighting. I want it in a positive way, not negative. Ask around if you are unsure of what you could do. Get others ideas. Perhaps have your house have a mock fight?','2016-09-26 00:37:37','2016-09-23 02:05:21'),(10951,11045,15,1,'Here Comes the....','Judge! You are hereby deemed the Insanity Inspector! I want you to Judge the sanity of 6 people! Not only must you pass Judgment, but have a valid reason for your decision. Learn the stats for this Art as well & reasons it is used. Enjoy!  *hands him a gavel* ~Lacie~','2016-09-26 03:32:58','2016-09-22 03:24:10'),(10088,11028,67,20,'Blade 20 Anasina','As we will occupy a close proximity in my Tavern, I want you to expand your craft. So, consider your time in our City. And consider your time in *THIS* City. Make 20 new and different cookie cutters - 10 for Idoaclesia and 10 for today. What are their shapes? And what inspired your creations?','2016-09-26 04:19:44','2016-08-05 00:15:05'),(10136,10032,67,30,'SoulReap-Wolfgar','You\'ve set a goal for yourself to collapse agos while blindfolded.  You feel that at the moment, that is something you cannot accomplish due to the size of your blade.  I wish you to practice on Emphants. How well do your other senses assist you while you are blinded? I\'d like you, for the second part of this task, to bring someone along who can guide you with their words. Which, do you feel, was easier to accomplish your task? Alone with your senses heightened, or with another guiding you?','2016-09-26 04:36:18','2016-07-12 03:32:25'),(10916,11045,27,20,'Drain Self - 20','Try to utilize a way for Drain Self to be somewhat effective in a combat scenario.  Work with dreamers to run a simulation testing any theories you can come up with to make this possible.  When you report, discuss what you did, who helped and if you think the art itself is something salvageable in a combat environment.\r\n','2016-09-26 05:04:11','2016-09-24 19:11:47'),(10951,10318,32,10,'Drain It Down!','Find a nice Well and fill it up! Drain the City of the energy stored within the Lesser Mares, so that we can Drain it into the Prime.','2016-09-26 19:03:35','2016-09-26 07:14:24'),(10746,11046,17,1,'ID Curse ~ L','Hard to believe that this art used to be the highest art a DreamSeer could learn.  Do you think this art was something more than what it became?  What other arts seem impressive, but fall very short of expectations when we finally get them? Look at the arts you currently have and those that are in your future.','2016-09-27 03:49:39','2016-09-22 23:01:43'),(10916,11046,46,20,'Recall - 20','From what I have heard, molding dreamsoul is the beginning to creation of planes or items.   come up with either a description of a plane you would create or come up with a new item that you would create and have circulating the gens.  With either you choose, get a few dreamers opinions on what you created and see what they would add to it if able.  I look forward to your report.\r\n','2016-09-27 05:22:45','2016-09-17 17:01:56'),(10750,11046,5,10,'Random 10 - Xererth','What was told to me as a solid fact has now become questionable, and a little random.  I would like you to test the projectile Colours of the GK chakrams in the 30 range.  I have noted that the projectile colours COULD differ with damage ranges.  So please test different damage rating chaks within the same level.  Note all your results, including burst colours.','2016-09-27 05:49:20','2016-09-16 04:56:57'),(10880,10067,139,60,'Sense Dat60 | Tam','I\'m not sure why you want to know where dragons are, in the first place, but for this task, I want you to send a task force out to all the planes. Describe which dragons live where, and where the consensus tells you the other less visible dragons come from. Telling me the \"Chaos\" is not enough. I was specific locations.  Are their patterns to the datoken\'s behaviors that is trackable? describe.','2016-09-27 05:52:10','2016-09-16 02:36:27'),(10951,10376,18,30,'Where\'d Ye Go???','Coordinate with Crystalline & Black Cloud in their Stragedic quests. Ye main job will be to locate good places to Chamele within their chosen locations. Ye will need spots on opposite sides of each of their parts of the stragedic plan. Have spots for both Blasters & Healers to ... Chamele. ~Lacie~','2016-09-27 06:07:07','2016-09-13 02:26:19'),(10880,10067,60,7,'7th Spherein\' Tam','Open the DreamSeer Guild and further the reputation of yer focus by reaching the station of Master DreamSmith or Master Teacher. Special consideration fer an onstanding report by obtainin\' both stations. All of yer arts be required ta meet yer currentt orbit \'cept yer 6th sphere arts and posin\' as a mare. >Deet deet da Deeter','2016-09-27 06:35:37','2016-06-08 06:09:42'),(10680,10232,140,50,'Opposites..attract?','Sorry for the similar quests..My brain is on vacation it seems. Tempest..pushes people away. Create 5 new arts that -bring-. either singular people, groups, items, candy.... whatever. You decided. Amaze me once again with your imagination! ++SC++','2016-09-27 20:22:40','2016-09-24 23:48:04'),(10593,11045,24,30,'New & Improved','I have some items that need repair, I -know- that you can make them good as new. I have an old rusty clock with broken hands and  a lopsided pendulum. A really old and dull as a rock blade that is tarnished. A  walking stick that is broken in half, the hand grip is rusty  and dented. Lastly, a very old pair of leather boots with soles flapping and broken zippers. Create-make new- have fun. ~c','2016-09-27 23:01:12','2016-09-24 21:23:07'),(10022,10009,24,60,'Dreiko: Restore 60','Work within the SM guild, as well as any other focus who shows interest, and attempt to expand the capacity of Join Party.','2016-09-28 01:36:42','2016-05-27 02:14:24'),(10480,10027,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting GH to Seers.\r\n','2016-09-28 03:38:04','2016-09-28 03:33:00'),(10480,10951,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting GH to the Seers.\r\n','2016-09-28 03:38:15','2016-09-28 03:33:53'),(10480,10746,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting GH to the Seers.\r\n','2016-09-28 03:38:24','2016-09-28 03:34:08'),(10480,10213,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting GH to Seers.\r\n','2016-09-28 03:38:31','2016-09-28 03:33:28'),(10480,10107,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting GH to the Seers.\r\n','2016-09-28 03:38:37','2016-09-28 03:36:24'),(10480,10053,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting GH to the Seers.\r\n','2016-09-28 03:38:45','2016-09-28 03:35:53'),(10018,11046,1,40,'GateKeeper 40','With your recent work in starting up the GateKeeper guild, I\'d like you to continue to pull these bullheads together. This meeting can be spontaneous, as long as there are a few GKs involved. We need to make a plan on how to prepare ourselves to use our arts (Kinesis especially), to work with the other foci against Zaxun.','2016-09-28 03:48:01','2016-09-20 04:52:10'),(10480,10400,92,60,'Reflect to 60','For this task I wish for you to reflect on the many houses you have been a member of. Please tell me, from your own unique perspective, how those houses could have been better. **A**','2016-09-28 03:55:03','2016-09-11 21:50:05'),(10951,11046,47,30,'Pushy Thoughts!','Take the simpliest of thought or idea & push it beyond all reason & sanity. It can be anything from why Wish thinks he has clothing on, to why the skies in EverNight turned dark. Take some time & really push your imagination. Your pushed conclusion will be ye report. ~Lacie~','2016-09-28 04:22:53','2016-09-14 20:38:30'),(10010,11063,23,20,'Recharge 20-Frey','Recharge allows us to put the charges back into items, however, we tend not to spend the time recharging ourselves. I want you to speak with at least 5 dreamers, as them how they recharge themselves, and if they don\'t, how they would if the did. I also want you to tell me what you do to recharge yourself. Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-09-28 04:30:27','2016-09-23 07:08:04'),(10480,10010,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting GH to the Seers.\r\n','2016-09-28 04:34:10','2016-09-28 04:34:05'),(10480,10027,60,7,'Sphere 7','Having reviewed all of your teaching success of the past, I am taking that into consideration as part of this sphere quest. This is a list of things that I wish for you to accomplish to gain your 7th sphere. 1) 15 tasks for students trained successfully   2) 5 personal arts plateaued   3) Help the Seers gain access to the Guild House   4) Get your apprentice, Arnaya ordained   5) Finalize the Alliance and the University structures. Have a plan and execute it to stabilize both for posterity.  **A**','2016-09-28 04:35:52','2016-06-02 02:50:34'),(10480,10007,52,60,'Train 60','For this assignment, I wish for you to show tasks for two arts from learning all the way to 6th plateau. That is a total of 14 tasks. One art may be of your focus but the other must be of another focus that they learn after orbit 40. Take your time and pay close attention to difficulty as plateuas raise, art level, student interest, and success rate just to name a few items. Make your efforts worthy of the plateau that you seek. **A**','2016-09-28 05:00:27','2016-06-27 07:25:32'),(10027,10010,99,1,'Combine to learn','Passion im teaching and creativity comebien to make a awesome teacher and that you have always been. Take another tact and see if you can change thigngs some. Maybe a series fo classes or discussion on teachings? Make up a outine and consider the options. You don\'t have to do the classes. ','2016-09-28 05:07:53','2016-09-11 09:13:36'),(10062,11069,7,30,'Resist Fear | 30','Devise a game, tournament, or any event of your choosing. You do not have to hold the event, unless you really want to. I\'m looking for the outline. Utilize your desire for creativity by applying a theme of fear or the dispelling of it. Report back the details.\r\n','2016-09-28 06:20:25','2016-09-20 17:13:33'),(10311,11063,111,10,'Dazzle-10','Assist our quartermaster (OfF) in organizing the house either directly, or ask him where he needs assistance and work on it alone. Either way just spend a session making the house neat (And if you do it solo report to him or myself anything we may need more or less of)\r\n','2016-09-28 19:14:34','2016-09-20 03:55:41'),(10951,10318,144,10,'Will\'s Well!','Make Will fill a whole Well! Something over 60... He\'s getting lazy and only the great Lu can motivate him','2016-09-28 22:40:30','2016-09-26 19:56:56'),(10007,10888,28,20,'Abjure 20','I want you to go around and find 5 dreamers and make them a mask of what their opposite self would be. Make sure to keep the details of each mask and of course the dreamer. Why did you choose the certain dreamer? Do you think they could be seen as the mask you gave them, or would it be impossible for them? I want great detail.','2016-09-28 23:46:21','2016-08-18 05:21:03'),(10009,10545,22,20,'Forge-20','Choose a theme, any theme. Forge five items from five different forging molds that all tie back to a single central theme. Once created, craft a simple story that ties the items together. Bring your crafts to me for a discussion upon completion and tell your tale. ','2016-09-29 00:48:12','2016-08-16 01:06:25'),(10680,10032,60,4,'Beauty Unmatched','Is what these carvings would posses, I am certain of it! do, please if you see fit, create a series of carvings unique to your life and dreams...','2016-09-29 02:16:27','2016-09-19 16:20:09'),(10951,10376,20,20,'Blaster Delux!','Do this with Emphants. Using Blast (and an empty Well!), perfect your technique to Blast mares. Try a ledge, a corner, any advantage. What area do you choose & why? Bring your full Well & your experience as your report. ~Lacie~','2016-09-29 07:41:55','2016-09-27 06:10:15'),(10750,11090,70,1,'Flamesear - lliam','In addition to learning the basics of the flame arts (cost, damage when first learned, projectile speed), I want you to figure out how you can use this art at lower plateaus effectively.  Its evoke time is fairly slow for a combat art, but there are a few tricks to allow you to use it at least as a suppliment to other combat methods.  Find out what you can about those tricks, and explain them to me.','2016-09-29 09:37:07','2016-09-25 07:44:07'),(10951,11023,15,1,'Here Comes the....','Judge! Choose 5 DrOoLers. Study them at some length; try to be as objective as possible. You are to Judge their sanity. State valid reasons, name their affliction (if insane), & any \"sentence\" you deem worthy of their insanity. Be thorough! ~Lacie~','2016-09-29 20:55:59','2016-09-26 03:49:02'),(10480,10067,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting GH to Seers.\r\n','2016-09-29 22:01:32','2016-09-29 22:01:26'),(10480,10232,45,40,'Razorwind to 40','I believe that it is time to take the proverbial wind out of your FateSender sails. Please theorize for me how you could change either Razorwind or Firestorm and make it into a DreamSeer art. The Seer Guild is working on such a thing and I wish to see things from a FateSenders point of view. Make your efforts worthy. **A**','2016-09-29 22:18:00','2016-09-21 05:39:49'),(10480,10022,42,30,'Darkness -- 30','There is a growing problem in the City and it is the Revenants. I forsee them becoming a bigger problem before they are driven from the City. Lift the veil of darkness on them. Find out all that you are able to about them and see if others have any ideas that may assist the City in defeating these abominations. Seek help wherever you are able to get it, even if it is from those that you would not normally think of. Make your efforts worthy. I eagerly await your thoughts. **A**','2016-09-29 23:15:34','2016-07-12 07:09:37'),(11097,11069,11,30,'Inzoum Amulet 30','You lost your Soul Shield key!  Faelyn has a 93% chance of being really mad about that!  Forge a new key that you could give her to make up for it!','2016-09-30 00:21:54','2016-09-25 07:52:29'),(10916,11023,70,20,'FlameSear - 20','We all know that the colors for flame change depending on plat.  But do we really know why it does that?  Come up with your own theory for why the color of the flame changes.  Then I want you to come up with your own color scheme for flame when it plats (doesnt have to be only the colors we have.)  Share what you did with a few dreamers and see what one color combonation they would want in a flame.  Bring all the information when you report and lets see what you come up with.  \r\n','2016-09-30 00:49:06','2016-09-21 21:57:53'),(10480,10009,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting GH to Seers.\r\n','2016-09-30 01:01:02','2016-09-30 01:00:55'),(11097,10009,35,40,'Trap 40 | Dreiko','Create a prison for your enemies and trap them in it.','2016-09-30 01:06:50','2016-06-07 01:36:56'),(11097,10077,112,1,'Guild House','Granting to Tember\r\n','2016-09-30 01:15:55','2016-09-30 01:15:43'),(10311,10009,111,20,'Dazzle20-Dreiko','Put a couple of each type of alt at the house in the FV. Recharge/combine stuff on the tables while you are there. Help keep us prepared for the idiocrasy that is this war with the Corpses.\r\n','2016-09-30 01:58:33','2016-09-29 00:33:02'),(10007,10916,28,20,'Abjure 20','Think of 4 dreamers that are your students and I want you to take one personality trait from them. Take these 4 traits and make an item that even I could figure out who you are talking about by looking at the item. I want one single item. ','2016-09-30 04:40:10','2016-09-25 07:09:52'),(10007,10888,35,30,'Trap 30','Find out what your highest trap can be. Then bring me an essence that is within 3 points of that max. Find ways on how to do this and bring me back your results. ','2016-09-30 04:49:45','2016-09-28 23:51:40'),(10750,11063,25,1,'Reweave Learn: Frey','In addition to learning the basics of the art, I want you to explore some of the different uses that Reweave can be put to besides simply patching up shields.  Ask around a little bit, and see if you can come up with an idea or two for using it that you wern\'t able to find out about.  Report your findings and ideas.','2016-09-30 06:26:43','2016-09-23 08:28:00'),(10010,11063,23,30,'Recharge 30-Frey','You have learned all the basics of the art, and you have had to be introspective, and determine what others did to recharge themselves. Now I want you to put this to use, I want you to offer to recharge 10 things from others. I want you to tell me what it was, were there failures, if so, what happened. This could include recharging for your house. Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-09-30 07:12:57','2016-09-29 07:24:57'),(10010,10376,19,30,'Vision 30-Calabosh','Vision allows us to see those who are chameled and invis. I want you to use your vision, and insight, and look past the facade. To the real dreamer. What are dreamers hiding? Do you think that all dreamers hide things ? I want at least 10 examples. Have Fun ~Cryst~\r\n','2016-09-30 07:29:08','2016-09-20 06:19:21'),(10027,10067,99,20,'Combine 20','Best combinations dream wide?  DReam History? Prodictions?Use your insight on who can use some advice pass it on combined  a forged item as a reminder.','2016-10-01 00:15:26','2016-09-16 04:20:36'),(10916,11028,29,10,'Poison - 10','The poison that the art uses must have started as a base componet somewhere down the line.  Come up with your own theory for a poison that can do whatever you want (doesnt have to be serious), be creative with it!  There is only one stipulation however!  No focal element (IE Resilience, Will ect ect) can be used.  However the elemental properties can be if you wish.  When you report give me the name of the poison, what it does and how you created it!  I look forward to what you come up with.\r\n ','2016-10-01 01:33:31','2016-09-11 03:50:10'),(10018,11090,60,1,'1st Sphere - lliam','During lliam\'s interview, we discussed basic item and color knowledge, fonts, mare drops, mare forms and their weaknesses and strengths, houses and the main paths, as well as focuses.','2016-10-01 07:12:30','2016-10-01 07:10:46'),(10018,11069,68,30,'FlameShaft 30','Flameshaft is a very underused art, as of late. I want you to come up with a new way to use it: it could be a game, a small project, etc. The choice is up to you. Make it worth the plateau you seek.','2016-10-01 07:30:09','2016-09-16 05:42:50'),(11069,11132,1,10,'Inz - GateKeeper 10','Look ahead to your future as a GateKeeper! Ask around and identify what Arts of Willpower await you in the future as you increase your Spheres. Knowing about them will help you better visualise our expected role in the City. You don\'t specifically have to ask GKs, other experienced dreamers may answer you just as well. While you\'re at it, ask them what they think of GateKeepers in general.','2016-10-01 21:01:13','2016-09-23 05:42:20'),(10027,11069,46,30,'Recall to 30','Play remember when with several dreamers. Singely or in a group. Find out who remebers what till you get to something they don\'t remember. Let me know the results. You might be surprised. Or maybe i will be.','2016-10-01 21:31:00','2016-09-15 21:55:38'),(10951,11132,7,1,'Resist the Fear!','Do you dare traverse the Outer Planes??? Of course you do, you\'re a Fearless GateKeeper! Use the provided Alteror, if you wish, but find & explore the Outer Planes. (Don\'t forget FA & Chamele!) You don\'t have to go far into the plane, but know how to get to each. Know the stats on RF also. ~Lacie~','2016-10-01 23:04:24','2016-09-23 01:08:09'),(10010,10213,23,30,'Recharge 30-Vill','I want you to have a recharge booth, I want you to recharge a minimum of 15 items, I want you to record what you recharged, how long it took, how many items suffered from backfires ? How many did you actually turn to dust ? As an extra credit, if you can think of how you would improve the art, that would be interesting as well. Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-10-02 01:33:42','2016-08-22 05:17:03'),(10007,10545,35,40,'Trap 40','Most SM\'s know the ranges of what their highest number can be when they trap. Make sure you find this number out for 39, then trap a mare to that highest number. Bring me the mare essence so I can see it for myself. This is no easy task.','2016-10-02 01:53:52','2016-08-22 04:18:25'),(10232,11023,98,1,'Coraal - Newly Awak','Devise for me a NEWLY AWAKENED EDUCATION PLAN -- a plan for how you personally would begin a newly awakened\'s education to the City of Dreams, beginning to \"end\" -- (end being defined as when they\'re not considered newly anymore), assuming there is no interference in their education by others. Delight me with educative resources!','2016-10-02 04:01:38','2016-09-29 21:03:39'),(10010,11063,74,30,'MB 30-Frey','Mindblank hides you from others, if there are not alot of dreamers in the city, it can work against you as they can sense the plane you are on. That being said, I want you to pretend you have lost your memory for one dream, make like you don\'t know dreamers, or what your items do, things of that nature. How did those around you respond, did they want to try and fix you ? Have Fun with it. ~Cryst~','2016-10-02 08:29:38','2016-09-30 07:17:23'),(10750,10888,15,1,'Judge Learn - Uthy','In addition to learning the basics of the art, There are many crimes in this city that go unpunished due to a complete lack of any sort of judicial system.  I would like you to come up with the basis (Rudimentary) of a criminal justice system and legal code.  Who would you try first, and for what crimes of the list you\'ve come up with?','2016-10-03 09:37:49','2016-10-02 07:16:21'),(10009,10088,35,20,'TrapNightmare-20','Trapping Nightmares is easy. Dreamers, however, are trickier. Come up with a reason to \"Trap\" dreamers somewhere out of a Sanctuary. An event, a story, a joke, or even a trip to the bar...whatever you choose to do to lure them is fine. Just keep them there for a fair bit of time. Track the who, what, and where.','2016-10-04 01:41:25','2016-05-08 16:47:44'),(10593,11023,24,30,'Allabout that faith','\'Bout that faith...bout that faith!  I have lost faith that I will ever find true love again!  Go to at least eight dreamers and have them write you a love poem..they need not know it is for a task.. I also want you to write one, which I will place in the Fourth sphere hall. Give me some faith!!!!  ~c','2016-10-04 03:34:04','2016-09-22 03:39:27'),(10916,10888,30,20,'Antidote - 20','Find a few rooms in the city that are \"poisoned\" with terrible decor and color pallete.  Come up with a way to antidote that disgusting poison from the room and then change it to what you feel would make it look SO much better.  One hitch, each room you choose, you have to come up with a new way to antidote the room.  I look forward to hearing what you come up with, good luck.\r\n','2016-10-04 06:01:38','2016-10-02 07:13:06'),(10750,11069,48,1,'SE Learn, Inzoum','In addition to the exact effects of the art as it is now, I would like you to come up with a \"Code\" of sorts for yourself to guide how you will use this art.  Further, Since you are a teacher... I want you to come up with a set of guidelines that you will use to help determine who, and how you will teach this art.  Report all your conclusions, and any potential problems you can foresee with them.','2016-10-04 07:35:17','2016-09-06 06:23:28'),(10232,10951,139,20,'Lace - Sense Dat 20','Search throughout the City of Dreams for a room you feel embodies the ability to SENSE datoken -- how does this room assist your finely tuned Seer senses for searching? With that said, I know you like to speak to Datoken -- tell me about that. What have you learned from them? What has this accomplished? Educate me in this matter! Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-10-04 19:26:45','2016-09-19 18:54:01'),(10951,11046,50,10,'Xerphant vs Emphant','The gauntlett has been thrown, battle lines drawn! Thresway it be! Challenge an Emphant to a duel to the death! Three battles with 3 Emphants! Remember to run into Threshold if things get out of hand. Don\'t collaspe! Your report will be showing me your new-found skills... Lacephant to Xererphant! ~Lacie~','2016-10-04 22:14:12','2016-10-03 01:58:23'),(10750,11090,67,10,'Reaper 10 - lliam','Soul Reaper is a very useful tool, and you\'ve demonstrated a good understanding of the dream already.  So, I would like you to get your feet wet in more of the dreamer theory and figure out why different peoples blades would appear differently.  What makes that change?  Also, think about how you want to summon your blade.  Let me know what you come up with.','2016-10-04 23:51:24','2016-10-01 10:55:02'),(10874,10088,70,50,'Flame50Vampyro','I would like for you to investigate each of the four focal flames. What is different about each of them, and what sets them apart from the others? If you could change anything about your own flame, what would it be? Think about these and give me one of your usual creative reports.','2016-10-05 02:21:51','2016-04-24 16:30:25'),(10874,10088,25,50,'VampyroRewave50','Gather Soul Masters from near and far, assisting Em\'et along the way. You do not need to work directly with him, just realize his goal and assist as you can with the others in repairing the city walls, in preparation for the upcoming catostrophic war. ','2016-10-05 02:38:46','2016-04-30 02:54:48'),(10746,10750,105,20,'PC ~ 20','Why do house arts evoke so slowly when they are often a houses first line of defence?  Do you think this was engineered on purpose?  See if you can trackdown the evoke speed of the other house arts to solidify your theory.','2016-10-05 03:14:47','2016-09-18 04:45:12'),(10746,10107,100,20,'PT ~ 20','Let your playful spirit come out and play.  I would like you to come up with some of the fun things we could do with Power Token aside from Forging and making people dance.  See if you can make any of them happen.','2016-10-05 03:41:09','2016-09-28 03:23:59'),(10874,11046,10,40,'Ward - 40','For this plateau, I want to know of a place on each of the main planes that would make a perfect Ward trap for the aggressor and a terrible spot for a Ward trap for the victim. The places and distances are to be left up to you. Make your efforts worthy of the plateau that you seek. **A**','2016-10-05 03:48:13','2016-09-28 04:04:28'),(10874,10750,28,20,'Arnaya Abjure 20','I went back and saw that a group of dreamers entered one of the houses yesterday!  Take a small group up to one or more of the unopened houses and investigate the portals there for activity!  ','2016-10-05 03:48:38','2016-09-25 07:24:38'),(10107,10750,98,10,'Newly Awakened 10','Newly awakened can be fooled at times. There were once times that the elders would, on rare occaision, appear as newly awakened dreamers.  Do you think there could be a way to attribute this ability to a dreamer? Perhaps a lost dreamer who has found his or her way back into the dream? What could be done with such an ability, and to whom?\r\n','2016-10-05 04:04:54','2016-09-20 04:28:10'),(10007,10750,26,20,'Purify 20','Years ago, I heard that dreamers thought Purify could \"hurt\" Daymares and Darks. Ask around if there are any stories about this actually happening. If there is, please share this with me. I haven\'t seen this work before, but if it could work, how do you think it would work and why? Come up with a great big theory on it.','2016-10-05 04:32:07','2016-09-25 22:26:24'),(10010,11063,139,10,'Sense Datoken 10','Sense datoken allows you to sense only one type of mare, what type of mare is it. I also want you to use sense for two dreams, and tell me how many mares you sense. Do you think that the art can be improved ? And if so how ? Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-10-05 06:01:06','2016-10-02 08:59:59'),(10018,10750,46,20,'Recall 20','I want you to do a little bit of studying. With Recall being the #1 deterrent against Strike, what is the likelihood of making it immune to Abjure? Theorize on the best method to go about implementing this change.','2016-10-05 07:06:37','2016-10-01 06:13:55'),(10951,11069,96,10,'Nosey Nellie!','Should be an Insight Art, right? But it isn\'t. How do we use DreamSoul to determine which places have the most dreamers? Secondly, how could one Art (your choice) be changed to prevent being noticed with this horrid Art? ~Lacie~','2016-10-05 22:49:14','2016-09-22 18:24:34'),(10916,11045,30,10,'Antidote - 10','You have been called with your expert doctoriness experience to find those who have an ailment and give them a treatment!  However! You must first diagonose the patient..tell them what they have, then give them the antidote.  HOWEVER!  The antidote is no mere pill...you must inform them of the side effects!..whatever..they..may..be.   Fix some dreamers then come find me, tell me what you diagnosed them with, what the antidote was..and what side effects they may have!  Good Luck and remember, you are Doctor','2016-10-06 02:33:08','2016-09-26 05:12:39'),(10746,11046,105,40,'PC ~ 40','Things are getting serious within the City.  I would like you to create two games to ease some of the tension.  I would also like you to try your hand at the Lyceum contest.','2016-10-06 03:54:06','2016-09-27 03:59:14'),(10010,10376,16,30,'ID-30-Calabosh','I want you to spend 3 dreams with a broken ID, you are not allowed to ID a thing that you pick up to use. You must find out about the object in other ways. What ways did you come up with ? At least three. Have Fun! ~Cryst~','2016-10-06 05:49:06','2016-10-02 05:28:50'),(10951,11038,46,10,'Recall the Past','Talk to Teoniba Ta\'kin, Dar\'canon & anyone they suggest about the cult known as Deltros. Get them to Recall any goals, beliefs, history and/or objectives they feel comfortable retelling. A summary of this will be ye report. ~Lacie~','2016-10-06 17:10:24','2016-09-13 03:25:16'),(10951,11069,5,30,'Random | 30','Alright, for this game, I would like you to random starting from Threshold Way on any of the 8 main planes. Take the first digit of the number you random and walk that many portals away and write a codex entry describing one of the paintings or figures of art you encounter. After you\'ve done this three times, give the codex entries to another dreamer and see if they can figure out where you were! Upon completion report the results to Lace in my presence. ','2016-10-06 17:32:00','2016-10-04 22:25:31'),(10951,11038,104,1,'Blaze a Trail!','For a solid hour, travel a route thru Threshold Pits, Well in one hand, your weapon in the other. Move with a purpose, stretch those muscles & see how many Essences you can gather in a short time. Make every movement count, don\'t waste time or energy. In exchange for the Well, I\'ll share information about Radiant Blaze. ~Lacie~','2016-10-06 21:28:09','2016-10-06 20:01:58'),(10232,11038,71,10,'Harlen -FlameRuin10','I\'d like for you to select a plane, and explore it to fullest extent that you can -- one of the house planes, or outer planes, if you please -- searching for fire, or evidence that fire once existed there. List these for me! Is fire everpresent in our City? Should it be, or shouldn\'t it be? Consider carefully, and ensure a thorough report. ','2016-10-06 21:51:15','2016-09-16 17:51:34'),(10951,10623,104,10,'Blaze On!','You have your choice (time permitting) of three options: 1. Fill a Well (capacity over 50), 2. Help a fellow PC member gain an orbit, or 3. Incite/Encourage three members to turn in something to use your House\'s energy on for a reward. ~Lacie~','2016-10-06 22:01:43','2016-10-06 21:35:44'),(10728,10951,144,40,'Quest: Figment','Was going to grant xp as reward for helping the newly but she\'s already maxed!  ','2016-10-06 22:22:12','2016-10-06 22:19:08'),(10728,10232,51,70,'Quest: Figment','Granting for his aid to the newly awakened.  He was already maxed so I couldn\'t grant xp.','2016-10-06 22:23:43','2016-10-06 22:23:31'),(10951,10498,104,1,'Blaze On!','Bring me a Chaos Well (over 60) full to learn our House Art of Radiant Blaze.','2016-10-06 22:25:46','2016-09-27 19:48:09'),(10010,11063,23,40,'Recharge 40-Frey','I asked you to find 5 dreamers you felt could do with a recharge, in this task, I want you to expand on that thought. I want you to \"recharge\" 5 dreamers. What did you do to recharge them? How did they react to you wanting to recharge them? Do you think that we all need that time to regroup, and recharge ourselves ? Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-10-07 03:07:07','2016-10-05 06:03:53'),(10018,10761,141,1,'L: Kinesis','GateKeepers carry the stereotype of being brainless and not having much to say. I\'d like for you to try and break through that perception. Share your story about your days of being mute and how you overcame it. This could be added to the Library or the Archives.','2016-10-07 05:34:51','2016-05-16 23:57:16'),(10750,11090,26,1,'Purify learn-lliam','In addition to the basics of the art (cost, when other foci can learn it, etc..) I would like you to give some thought as to the tactical uses for this art and what options it may open for you as a lower sphere\'d combatant when working with an ally.  Let me know what you come up with.','2016-10-07 06:10:22','2016-10-05 00:12:06'),(10951,11069,73,30,'Burn It!','There are many uniquely dressed individuals in the City, but a few with less than taste or style in their attire. Find 5 such ill-dressers & ascertain one piece of their attire which leaves one lacking for comment. What will you replace these garments with? Names, items & replacements will be your report. ~Lacie~','2016-10-07 23:03:56','2016-10-05 23:00:55'),(10232,10761,38,1,'Scare - Learn','Fatesenders and Gatekeepers are polar opposites here within the city. What does this mean? Can you come up with a theory as to why we, as foci, are so opposed? What do others think? See if you can answer these, and along the way try and find out the story of the first Gatekeeper in Underlight.','2016-10-07 23:29:14','2016-03-28 03:35:11'),(10232,10761,38,1,'Scare - Jorryn','Old task from Clarity to learn Scare for Jorryn was reported to me, today: That task is named Scare - Learn. Reported to my satisfaction, I\'m granting her Scare!','2016-10-07 23:29:14','2016-10-07 23:28:36'),(10916,10761,16,1,'ID - Learn','Go around the city and find (places, items, even people) that identify with you in some way.  What connection do they have to you and what does that tell you about yourself.  Then think about ID, what do you anitcipate the most from it? How will  you having it benefit the city and your own dreams?  Give these things some thought and return to me to report.  We will discuss it. Good luck!\r\n','2016-10-08 00:01:33','2016-05-15 20:30:07'),(10311,10761,25,1,'ReweaveL-Jorryn','In keeping in theme with your previous task, come up with two house models that you think would be ideal for the status of the current city with Lyran and Idoaclesian based beliefs. One for a freesoul house, and one for a lumy house. But the reasoning and facts that these two houses are based on must come from both cities\r\n. That is where the weaving will come in, of course.','2016-10-08 00:19:14','2016-05-16 01:47:09'),(10010,11063,51,10,'Locate 10-Frey','Locate allows us to find others in the City. If you were lost, how would you find your way ? I want you to tell me how you think locate works to find other dreamers in the city. Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-10-08 06:33:59','2016-10-07 03:09:37'),(10951,10027,104,10,'Radiant Blaze 10','Fill a Chaos Well (over 100 capacity) for the Prime. Also, ask other PC members if they have Blaze. If they don\'t, make sure they either have a quest, or see me for one. Does our House Art take Vision off the target? Find out.','2016-10-08 07:25:04','2016-10-02 03:43:08'),(10027,10623,99,1,'Combine to learn','You need to speak to you members and see what they think would be a interesting or fun event for the house. They need to give you two ideas one for the house itself and maybe friends of the house and one for the dream. It should give you more choices to work with. A groupt hat brainstorms together stays together.','2016-10-08 08:55:59','2016-09-14 08:09:01'),(10951,11063,50,1,'NMF Fights! (redo)','To learn the benefits & uses of this Form, you must challenge your comrades to a battle! Get several Housemates to change into NMF (3 or 4), then battle them in your regular form. Watch their movements, learning how NMF works. The results & your experience will be your report. ~Lacie~','2016-10-08 19:42:56','2016-10-08 19:41:45'),(10311,10545,89,10,'SoulShield10-Avayla','So in most peoples opinion, soul shield is a pretty useless art. I would like for you to create and demonstrate an item that when used in combination with Soul Shield it makes the effect do something useful. Doesnt have to last long, or be able to be used more than once. Bring me the results of your experiment.\r\n','2016-10-08 21:26:36','2016-08-24 21:16:46'),(10746,11069,22,20,'Forge ~ 20','Our City is rich in elements that we can use for creating items.  Using raw elements from select planes that one would not normally think of yielding anything useful and create from them.  Be ready to share the specifics of the rooms and supplies.','2016-10-08 22:28:53','2016-09-20 05:36:51'),(10746,10311,15,20,'Quest: Arlyana Jax','I would like you to organize a fashion show/beauty contest.  This can be for dreamers or creations.  Come up with criteria that will be used to guide the judging.  What did you learn about how we each Judge? }\'|\'{','2016-10-08 22:53:08','2015-12-01 01:04:21'),(10951,11069,75,30,'Wut t\'Hell is THAT?','During your recent explorations for materials, you\'ve uncovered an unusual object. Forge an item of \"Unknown\" nature. Give it an interesting name. Then Show it around curiously. Note what people think it is (5 people) along with their reactions. ~Lacie~','2016-10-08 23:30:16','2016-10-07 23:14:24'),(10951,11046,72,40,'Scribble Me This!','\"Once upon a midnight dreary, walked a dreamer, oh so weary! Caught upon an ancient star, his dreams were often oh, so far!\" Scribe this on a codex. Ask 4 other dreamers to each add ONE line (rhymed, of course) to add to the poem. Month of Moon, remember! Make it spookey! ~Lacie~','2016-10-09 01:44:20','2016-10-04 22:46:19'),(10951,10593,73,30,'Destroy Tally | 30','Dearest Cianne, your talent as a romance novelist is not to be underrated. Write me a short love story excerpt from your winning novel. Be sure to incorporate the destroying of a talisman in this story! Upon completion of this task, report to Purple Lace in my presence.','2016-10-09 02:24:28','2016-10-04 04:11:00'),(10107,11046,98,20,'Quest: OfF KiLTeR','You are no longer a new dreamer and your perspective is very different from that of Lyrans and of Idoaclesians.  What ways will you guide new dreamers, ensuring your unique experience is expressed to them? Who will you cite as your role-models and what qualities will you tell new dreamers are most valued in the city?\r\n','2016-10-09 04:54:55','2016-10-05 04:07:38'),(10593,11046,89,1,'Armoured','We protect ourselves from many things. I suppose we all have secrets that sort of taunt us from time to time...Are there things about yourself that you\'d never let -anyone- know about? If so, why? do you think you would be treated differently? hunted? scorned? laughed at? Also..what is the most important thing that you currently shield, and why? We will also talk about the art itself when you report. The mechanics of it etc..~c','2016-10-09 05:28:50','2016-10-03 01:58:57'),(10750,10888,8,1,'Prot Learn - Uthy','In addition to the basics, Lets look first at protecting yourself.  I would like you to examine an aspect of your dreams over the last couple of months that has caused you to become \"Cursed\" or to \"Bleed\".  Once you have that pinned down, I want you to put some thought into it and figure out a way to protect yourself from suffering further \"Curses\" or \"Bleeding\" due to that.  Let me know what you come up with and why you chose it.','2016-10-09 06:56:35','2016-10-07 08:43:01'),(10916,10888,31,20,'Curse - 20','The Teddy Bears you make for others are now cursed themselves.  Coming alive and wrecking havok to the dreamscape!  Not only are they causing destruction but they are constantly chasing you.  WAGE WAR ON THESE BEASTS, DESTROY THEM AND BRING PEACE BACK TO THE LANDS.  I want to hear about the means you took to gain victory and any help you may have gotten from outside sources.  Good luck.\r\n','2016-10-09 08:18:01','2016-10-04 06:10:41'),(11069,11146,141,1,'Inz - Kinesis','Push may be a bit of a joke, but Kinesis is not. It is perhaps one of the more valuable tools in the GateKeeper\'s arsenal these days. Learn about the Mace of Castigation, you should have no trouble finding answers asking those around you. How does Kinesis change the role of a GateKeeper in battle?','2016-10-09 16:28:37','2016-10-08 22:54:46'),(10951,11038,72,1,'Message in a Bottle','Codexes of Learning spring up in Threshold, but what can they mean? What would you say instead? Take a little time (an hour or so) & read the messages that pop up. Then, climb your mountain (Totality) & see if you can think up a few messages that ~should~ be written & allowed to pop up in Threshold instead. ~Lacie~','2016-10-10 02:47:27','2016-08-29 07:35:20'),(10009,10750,22,30,'Forge-30','Sound is a unique quality within an item. Something that few even attempt and even fewer get right. Hold a small class of at least five students or a series of at least eight individual sessions with other dreamers in which you teach them how to incorporate sound into their items. Hold onto the best student created item and bring it to the report. How well did your students do? Was there vast improvement from the beginning to the end?','2016-10-10 03:20:18','2016-09-06 21:39:50'),(10107,10018,89,20,'Soul Shield 20 Jade','There has to be something else to Soul Shield that we are all missing at its finer points.  I want you to speculate about the art and what you think it is that the dream has in store for Soul Shield.  Could the chaos shielding elements be used for any purposes inside the city?\r\n','2016-10-10 04:37:21','2016-08-30 03:29:46'),(10107,10067,111,1,'Dazzle - Tamarisk','DOL Dance Party time!  Invite three people from DoL to dance.  They have to shake it like they want to break it!','2016-10-10 04:56:30','2016-09-30 02:38:46'),(10067,10107,144,60,'Chaos Well to 60','Chaos Wells are great space savers. What are you inclined to use them for besides keeping essences in? I know you have worked with the energy inside, but what can be done with it? How do we filter the unawakened soul and just keep the energy? That would power experiments real easily. Think, think and think some more. <T>','2016-10-10 05:07:05','2016-09-30 02:31:31'),(10545,11137,70,1,'L: FlameSear','There are several different Nightmare forms, and three classes in the maren family. This information is vital when it comes to battling these creatures. Seek a dreamer or two to learn all you will need to know about them. What are their strengths and weaknesses, what separates them from the others? Be prepared to explain all of this in your report.','2016-10-10 05:42:45','2016-09-25 23:08:14'),(10916,11069,144,20,'Chaos Well - 20','Lets mix a bit of creavity with theory with....well you will see.  You spent a long day experimenting on chaos wells (what that experiment is is up to you) and now you have a giant chaos well stuck on you!.  You cant use your arms or see!!  Find a way out without cutting, tearing, or destroying the well.  If needed get a dreamer or two to help you out with ideas!  I look forward to hearing how you manage to free yourself.\r\n','2016-10-10 06:21:10','2016-09-20 21:45:28'),(10007,11137,60,1,'First Sphere','Interviewed Nine Continents and he is ready for sphere. He did a great job.','2016-10-10 07:24:46','2016-10-10 07:23:55'),(10951,10623,104,20,'Blaze it Up!','Create a post on our Boards that asks all members to reply with their level (0-20) of Blaze. Then offer a reward for those who improve their levels within 24 hours of your post. Set the post up so that it won\'t last more than a day or three. ~Lacie~','2016-10-11 00:32:13','2016-10-07 06:17:23'),(10951,11045,26,20,'Purification 20','Purification comes in many forms; some visible, others more subtle. As Commisar, your job is moral & the mental well-being of the Corspe. Work with your brothers & sisters, finding a way to \"purify\" the heaviness tht hovers about us, due to recent concerns, Are you able to \"Purify\" the air & return our dreams to light & ease? Your report will be a summary of your attempts. ~Lacie~','2016-10-11 01:22:32','2016-10-01 06:17:32'),(10007,10545,28,30,'Abjure 30','Strip down 2 rooms for me. I want them stripped completely and I want you to redo them. Any room, but the layout will be the same. I want you to visualize how you would change the rooms. Take me to the rooms and show me exactly what you do with it.','2016-10-11 05:57:29','2016-10-05 06:05:43'),(10750,10888,46,10,'Recall 10 - Uthy','I would like you to do something wordy.  Recall a significant event that you have either read a detailed report about, or witnessed personally... and that has not been otherwise documented, or has been long lost.  Write up an article for it with an \"Uthy Twist\" to the events detailed and put it in the Archives.  Let me know why you picked that event, and what the \"Twist\" was you put into things.','2016-10-11 08:44:54','2016-10-09 08:33:09'),(10916,11045,29,10,'Poison - 10','It\'s time to infect people with a poison, a poison of laughter!  Come up with a few comedic sketches that have poison as some sort of theme in it.  Perform this for dreamers and get their reactions, comments, ect ect.   When you report, perform the sketches for me and tell me who you performed for and what they thought of it. Good luck!\r\n','2016-10-11 20:58:26','2016-10-06 02:37:40'),(10593,11028,25,30,'No baking this time','We know you are an amazing baker.. but going to switch it up a bit.. of the names I give you I want you to create for them a formal outfit for a formal ball I will be having in the near future...do  your best to get them to attend and wear their new clothes.  Yourself, Inzoum, Aileron, Arnaya, Magnum, Lace, Coraal, Xererth, Flower, Jade.  ~c','2016-10-11 21:30:56','2016-10-04 03:57:30'),(10916,11028,27,20,'Drain Self - 20','How does the avatar regain lost focus energies as we evoke arts or from using the art of Drain Self?  How does this relate to the focal pads around the city.  With this information, could a way to improve Drain Self be possible?  How would it work and what would be the first steps to making this possible.  I look forward to what you come up with, good luck!\r\n','2016-10-11 23:33:53','2016-10-01 01:45:17'),(10750,10007,103,1,'Bequeath - Dina','Bequeath is an art that lets you give more or yourself than another can receive.  As such, its one of the most selfless arts by its core nature.  So, I would like for you to... for one dream (a couple of hours)... show yourself as selfless (within reason) and humble in word and deed.  Don\'t tell anyone why you are doing it, just do it and see how people respond.  Let me know the top responses.','2016-10-12 02:42:34','2016-09-21 06:03:24'),(10066,10746,105,60,'Poison Cloud 60','Soul Essences are something of  mystery. Being that we have three readily available, conduct a thorough study of them and try to determine why Kaihan\'s essence was used, yet Lothrick\'s was not. Also, see if you can determine an origin of the Unnamed Soul Essence.','2016-10-12 03:21:53','2016-10-12 03:21:38'),(10066,10888,22,20,'Forge 20','Consider the story of Zaxun and Xun\'rok as it has unfolded so far. Compose two riveting tale/predictions from current state to its close. For both tales/predictions create a talisman that appropriately and dramatically lends itself to the storyline. Your story should be moving, but the talisman should cause the dramatic emotion.','2016-10-12 03:48:08','2016-08-16 02:40:33'),(10066,10888,105,30,'Poison Cloud 30','Look in to the relationship of Zaxun, Xun\'rok and the Revenants to find some expoitable weak point in all three. This weak point should lend itself somehow to being able to rid them from the city. Run your idea past Aileron. Record responses. Discussion to follow.','2016-10-12 04:00:00','2016-08-16 02:59:01'),(10750,11028,98,1,'NA Learn: Ana','You have a lot of experience helping out newlies already it seems.  So I would like you to help a couple of others learn some of the lessons you\'ve already picked up.  How you choose to impart those lessons is up to you, but \"Mentor\" the would be newly Mentors... and the upcoming generaton of Mentors.','2016-10-12 07:07:19','2016-08-06 05:05:44'),(10010,11090,24,1,'Restore Learn-lliam','Restore will give someone back thier coherance, I want you to find the history for restore. I want you to tell me the history. I also want you to tell me what you would improve in the art, if anything at all. Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-10-12 07:19:48','2016-10-02 02:33:12'),(10009,10916,24,50,'Restore-50','With our current threat, we need to be able to heal as many dreamers as possible. WIth this, I want to work to expand Join Party to allow for more dreamers in a party. Develop a plan for an experiment to meet this goal. Work with me and other Soulmasters to enact the plan.','2016-10-12 20:39:18','2016-06-05 23:58:38'),(10232,11045,38,1,'Nathan - Scare','Inscribe up a SCARY item, and have a forger forge it for, but tell them to put THEIR choice of effect on it, without telling them what it\'s for. What do they do with it? Do they make a Scare alteror or Scare weapon!?! One can only hope! Don\'t use the word Scare in your description! Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-10-12 23:32:42','2016-09-24 02:35:08'),(10107,11046,40,20,'Deafen 20 ','Often considered very uncouth to use on a dreamer, I\'d like you to consider why deafen truly offends dreamers.  The implications in battle are certainly greater than most dreamers realize.  I also want you to teach someone a lesson on trancing outside of sanc using a deafen charm.  \r\n','2016-10-13 01:45:49','2016-10-09 05:05:41'),(10107,11145,47,1,'Push - Vistael','Since this is typically the art that is first used in teaching, I want you to talk to a teacher of each focus and ask them the best way to approach a teacher for learning new things.  Ask them the best way to build a rapport so that both the student and teacher are comfortable having future training sessions.','2016-10-13 02:31:19','2016-10-10 04:12:44'),(10007,11063,60,5,'5th Sphere','I would like for you to hold 3 events of your choice. Take notes if I am unable to attend.','2016-10-13 03:07:47','2016-09-17 05:35:52'),(10951,10580,64,20,'Give | 20','Hunting and creating things aren\'t the only way to support the dreamer community. You can donate your time and expertise as well. I would like for you to do something different, Find the best way to incorporate chairity to the dream. Do something generous for someone else, give them uplifting words, a full chaos well...anything that will put a smile on their face. Do this for 2 dreamers. Report to Lace in my presence upon completion. ','2016-10-13 05:41:12','2016-10-10 03:46:54'),(10951,11145,40,1,'What Ya Say???','This Art has uses both in battle & everyday dreaming. Talk to a few people, learning how this Art is helpful in battle. Also, try to find a few people gathered and sk one of them to Deafen you, so that you may experience what it\'s like to hear the Sounds of Silence. ~Lacie~','2016-10-14 01:54:28','2016-10-11 03:41:21'),(10009,10750,35,30,'Trap-30','Be nimble or you will be trapped! I want you to circle the entire Horron\'s Lair in Caudal Rift without Free Action. The Horron must be present when you begin. You cannot have anyone trap it. You cannot have someone else collapse it. You cannot be Chameled. Circle the place, have a witness. If you cannot complete it in 3 attempts then seek me with the horrors you went through. Have a witness nearby but you must restart if you activitate Free Action.','2016-10-14 02:56:53','2016-10-10 03:33:16'),(10746,10916,64,20,'Give ~ 20','What is the greatest thing we can give others in the City?  Do many of us give it?  What accounts for this lack, should there be one? If there is a lack, I would like you to come up with ways to combat this (theory will suffice).','2016-10-14 03:58:21','2016-09-25 04:43:43'),(10018,11046,68,40,'FlameShaft 40','Gather the select few you mentioned for a private training session. Invite a few you feel you can learn from, as well as those you think could use a few pointers just like yourself. Focus on your weakests points, but make sure to cover all of the bases.','2016-10-14 05:54:34','2016-09-28 04:37:58'),(10018,11069,6,30,'Meditation 30','Meditate on why our focus has been the least active of all. Are we dying out? Is it due to our arts, or is it simply innate? Lastly, consider at least one solution we can focus on as a Guild that will build excitment and stave off boredom.','2016-10-14 06:22:14','2016-10-07 05:45:10'),(10750,11090,3,10,'SM 10 - lliam','Soulmasters are a unique focus in the city, since our abilities make us highly sought after in a number of combat roles and by the houses for out of combat roles.  I want you to do a little bit of digging and thinking.  Why are we so diverse of a focus, when the other foci are limited to fairly specific roles?  Do you even agree with that statement?  Defend your perspective on these questions.','2016-10-14 08:40:29','2016-10-10 06:50:17'),(10916,11045,30,20,'Anti - 20','Your Quest is one of a grand adventure!  I want you to explore your shard in order to find something not man made that could be used for an antidote, bring it back with you (its a dream, just dream it!)  Then I want you to find something in the city that can do the same thing.  Compare both and come up with how each could be used in the other place.  Is it even possible?  I look forward to hearing what you find and what you come up with.  Good Luck\r\n','2016-10-14 23:30:19','2016-10-11 21:03:39'),(10593,11045,25,30,'Fibre Arts!','I am giving you..A sewing kit..thread needles, scissors, fabrics of all sorts.. also.. wool suitable for weaving...ALSOOOO... every material you could think of to create a hat of some sort! Get to work! two items of your choice and a stunning hat!! ~c','2016-10-14 23:37:19','2016-09-27 23:25:50'),(11097,10010,69,60,'Quest: Faelyn','Undergames winner.\r\n','2016-10-15 01:47:21','2016-10-15 01:47:17'),(11097,11063,69,50,'Quest: Faelyn','Undergames winner.\r\n','2016-10-15 01:47:47','2016-10-15 01:47:43'),(11097,10009,81,40,'Quest: Faelyn','Undergames winner.\r\n','2016-10-15 01:49:12','2016-10-15 01:49:04'),(11097,10018,1,70,'Quest: Faelyn','Undergames winner.','2016-10-15 01:50:33','2016-10-15 01:50:18'),(10951,11045,16,1,'Identify the Wierd!','Without this Art, you just don\'t know WHAT someone will hand you! Get 5 people to show you something unusual in their possession. Try to guess what it is. Then, since curiousity will get the better of you, ask them the properties of Shown items. What does this Identify about the 5 dreamers? ~Lacie~','2016-10-15 18:20:35','2016-10-11 20:31:43'),(10232,10916,47,30,'Aileron - Push 30','Push yourself to learn things that I want to know, for me! How much dreamsoul does Restore restore at each plateau? At what point does the payout of Dreamsoul become greater than the cost of Resilience? Work with some Soulie buddies to find out these answers, and more! What is your heal/minute rate? Just how much dreamsoul CAN a dedicated Restorer do? Ensure a thorough investigation and report. ','2016-10-15 21:27:28','2016-09-29 23:54:31'),(10010,11063,63,20,'Invis-20-Frey','I want you to do a poll, I want you to develop 4 questions about the art of invisibility, once you have them, I want you to ask at least 10 others your questions. Record thier answers and responses. The questions can be serious, or humorous, or a combination of the both. Have fun ~Cryst~','2016-10-16 01:28:06','2016-10-08 07:06:43'),(10916,11046,24,10,'Restore - 10','In the time of our dreams, we give, we lose, we misplace and we find.  We destroy and we restore.  Does this show our true character or does it show the fallacies that we all hold?  Are we held accountable for dreams ever more for the mistakes of our past or do we get chances to restore peoples faith in our true intents?  At what point do we cross that line that marks us as with no salvation?  Is there even salvation in this city?   I look forward in hearing what you come up with.\r\n','2016-10-16 02:58:31','2016-10-12 07:14:57'),(10746,11028,144,1,'Well ~ L','This is a place of wonders, most often when we think outside of the proverbial box.  I would like you to look about the City and see what wells you can find.  Tell me about them.','2016-10-16 03:07:26','2016-09-18 04:35:26'),(10480,11146,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting quest.\r\n','2016-10-16 03:46:21','2016-10-16 03:45:04'),(10480,11146,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support art for teacher. **A**\r\n','2016-10-16 03:46:33','2016-10-16 03:45:25'),(10480,11146,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support art for teacher. **A**\r\n','2016-10-16 03:46:37','2016-10-16 03:45:38'),(10750,11028,30,10,'Anti 10 - Ana','Antidote is a great art, albiet with only a single use right now.  There is another art of very similar nature that\'s around and is somehow immune to Antidote.  I\'d like you to put some thought into this, and figure out how you MIGHT be able to modify Antidote to remove bleed as well.  Let me know what you come up with.','2016-10-16 03:55:23','2016-10-14 03:11:00'),(10746,11046,139,20,'Sense Datoke 20','I would like you to find a room in each of the following: Umbric, one of the Rifts and one of the Basin and claim it as your own complete with desciption (even if it already has one) and any changes you would make to them.  Appeal to the senses.  Be prepared to show them to me.','2016-10-16 03:58:34','2016-10-06 04:03:16'),(10480,11046,141,40,'Assertive Diction','Can you push people around with your words?! We shall see... I wish for you to gather a group of workers and travel up to a house which is closed. I do not like that I cannot wander where I like... it is up to you to direct this group of peons and have them discover a means of artivating these closed off portals. Make sure they work hard!\r\n','2016-10-16 04:41:04','2016-09-30 00:00:09'),(10009,11146,22,30,'Forge-30','You are recently returned to the City, so you will need to Forge yourself a new path. Identify the first few steps you need to take and Forge appropriate signs that will help point the pathway. There should be at least four of them. These signs should be consistently forged, in that, a dreamer could tell they were related to one another.','2016-10-16 04:46:01','2016-10-08 00:54:15'),(10480,10022,41,70,'Blind - 70','Time to remove the blinders from those around you. Seek out information on your housemates that you think are a weakness of them, something that they are blind to themselves. When you have seen their blindspots, think of ways that they could overcome them. Think AS them and not FOR them. **A**','2016-10-16 04:46:41','2016-09-29 23:18:23'),(10007,11028,3,30,'SM 30','What does it mean to be a Soulmaster to you? I want your deep thoughts on the matter, physically, mentally, and emotionally. Don\'t forget to interview others (Soulmasters or other foci) to hear what they think as well. Place this info on the open scrolls for others to see.','2016-10-16 04:52:12','2016-08-25 04:39:51'),(10480,10951,89,20,'Quest: Akkadian','As per her request, I am making a duplicate codex so that she can keep the original from her dear friend Sorsha.\r\n','2016-10-16 04:52:54','2016-10-16 04:50:16'),(10480,10951,60,7,'7th sphere -- Lace','I wish for you to open the KoES house. You are to also keep it stable for at least 3 months. In addition, find a way to control, or destroy, oe redeploy the Revenants. You should have your prome strength at 75,000 and discuss your plans with Zaxun. Your interest in the Consortium interests me as well, keep working on that issue. Do not neglect the other issues we discussed. **A**','2016-10-16 05:22:00','2016-08-10 03:55:47'),(10480,10951,60,7,'Sphere 7 addition','I wish for you to assist the members of the Alliance in removing the runes from themselves before harm comes to them. Also work on getting your Alchemy Lab operational and on its feet. Lastly, use your unique knowledge of the Revenants to find a way to either remove them from the City or contain them to a smaller area. I want you to use as many citizens as you need to assist you in your goals. Maybe the Seer Guild could be of assistance. Do not do this alone. **A**','2016-10-16 05:22:00','2016-09-02 04:42:45'),(10480,10545,52,10,'Train to 10','I wish to send you on a grand journey. for this task, I wish for you to think of the perfect or near perfect progression in arts from level 9 to the first plateau. I wish you to choose one other focus as well as your own to test your theories on. I will leave the specifics up to you. **A**','2016-10-16 05:46:43','2016-09-11 22:24:34'),(10480,11063,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Quest to Frey. He is apprenticing under Dina. **A**\r\n','2016-10-16 06:03:23','2016-10-16 06:03:09'),(10007,10750,34,1,'Imprison - Learn','I am going to leave this plain and simple, but I expect a thorough report. Give me your theory on how each (Imprison, Banish, Cleanse) works through this art.','2016-10-16 06:53:09','2016-10-09 20:48:44'),(10951,10966,36,10,'Quest: Purple Lace','Create a pattern or path thru the hunting area of your choice. For the first hour of this experiment, follow your path, taking note of how many mares you can Blade to collaspe. Then, for the second hour, rework the route and try to beat the first hour\'s count. Does it work? ~Lacie~','2016-10-16 07:07:45','2016-10-14 04:56:51'),(10007,10888,35,40,'Trap 40','Why is it that we cannot trap day or darkmares? What exactly makes it that we cannot? After trapping me a Shamblix (yes I want you to bring me a shamblix essence that has been trapped by YOU), I want you to bring me the whys and why nots about horrons, daymares, and darkmares. All three must have a different theory.','2016-10-16 07:58:11','2016-09-30 05:31:09'),(10311,11063,24,10,'Restore10-Frey','Do you know the amounts of what each plat of restore does? Find out for me how much it starts and goes up per plat! When you have done this I want you to inscribe the increments in which the restore amount goes up per plat and place it in the first sphere area of the library (If its not already there! Check first!)','2016-10-17 01:40:07','2016-10-08 00:39:59'),(11097,10009,60,8,'Dreiko: Sphere 8','Returning 8th sphere to Dreiko. 9th sphere path.\r\n','2016-10-18 01:18:59','2016-10-18 01:18:57'),(10007,11063,17,1,'ID Curse','Take the item I give you and ID the curse that is in it. I am looking for creativity most of all. Tell me what it is and how you think it got into the item.','2016-10-18 01:58:57','2016-09-19 04:09:06'),(10026,11046,6,30,'Meditate 30','Everyone can Meditiate, yet as GateKeepers we can go higher than other focii Why? Find Renruts Study, and ask about him, what was his mark on the dream, and why is that important to us.','2016-10-18 01:59:57','2016-10-16 02:23:06'),(10480,10009,22,80,'Forge 80 pt 3','This is a personal journey. I wish for you to create for me a syllabus for your new student. I want it from learning the art to plateauing up to 70. Include all the information and tasks that you would normally use, as well as reasons why the student is learning things at each level. I want to see inside the mind of the teacher so that I can see into the future of the forger. **A**','2016-10-18 02:13:17','2016-02-16 00:17:48'),(10480,10232,71,70,'FlameRuin --70','No theory, no questions, and no mindless opinion. I wish to see cold, hard facts. Create for me a Guide to Loving your Flame art. You should include items from learning to the seventh plateau. Where to improve it? What to improve it on? When to use it? Why is it universal to all the focus?','2016-10-18 02:50:38','2016-09-29 22:37:15'),(10480,11146,1,60,'GateKeeper -- 60','Having recently returned to the City there is much to know. Seek and find new places, arts, events. There have been many, so learn all that you can. Also assess your art levels and prepare for me a plan on how to help the GateKeepers in the City by improving your own arts.Reaquaint yourself with the City and tune into how you can best protect and serve. Make your efforts worthy of the plateau that you seek. **A**','2016-10-18 02:51:58','2016-10-16 04:03:45'),(10480,10593,60,1,'Sphere training','For this task, please write for me five examples of appropriate sphere tasks. One for each sphere and two for fourth. Also learn the rules of Sphere and be prepared to discuss them with me. You may seek assistance from anyone you wish to complete this task. Speak with me when you are ready and prepared. **A**','2016-10-18 03:47:31','2016-10-16 03:54:20'),(10916,10593,31,10,'Curse - 10','Your quest is to come up with a Tale, it can be a tall tale, short tale, big tale or small tale, a tale with a tail or a tale with no tail!  The tale is about the Curse of ______ <--Thats where the curse goes by the way.  The only thing I ask is that you get a few dreams to give you some ideas to go into this tale. Everything else is up to you!!! But remember...the curse...may...find...you!\r\n','2016-10-18 03:49:57','2016-10-15 20:58:48'),(10916,11045,29,20,'Poison - 20','The Doctor is back in, however, time to poison a few people instead.  HOWEVER, These poisons will not cause harm, but they will make the dreamers poisoned have strange, wacky, giggly or hopping (be creative with your poisons) effects!  The poisons don\'t last long however. When you report, tell me who you poisoned, how you poisoned them and what the effects were and what happened!  Good luck and I look forward to what you come up with.  Remember, you are a Doctor!\r\n','2016-10-18 22:21:56','2016-10-14 23:39:18'),(10026,11045,8,1,'Worm Detail- Pro','You hold in your hands Mir, he is a 5 inch long worm that communicates with thought. He has tasked you with the mission to explore the city and show him all the water sights. Once done u 2 will tell me the best water holes in the city\r\n','2016-10-19 01:26:04','2016-10-11 01:27:58'),(10951,11045,104,10,'Blaze a Trail!','Bring a full Chaos Well (~100) to add to our Prime. Learn the benefits of platting (Em\'et has the stats). And, as a bonus, if you\'ll bring in an extra 50 essences, I\'ll make you a Power Token, so that you may experiment with the Art yourself! ~Lacie~','2016-10-19 01:44:53','2016-10-14 19:35:56'),(10232,10750,38,10,'Arnaya - Scare 10','Search throughout the City for a room that might instill someone with COURAGE, and BRAVERY -- not you, necessarily, but generally, would inspire PEOPLE! Then, having found this room, devise how you might go about inverting it so that it made people FRIGHTENED, or FEARFUL! Consider carefully, and ensure a thorough report. ','2016-10-19 03:52:54','2016-09-20 04:30:15'),(10746,10750,144,40,'Well ~ 40','Written by Vill Valorian \"Determine the level of chaos through the as many number of water wells and watery areas found throughout the city with as many or as few dreamers to your liking but as a decent amount in your leasure time, thresh caves, miniral spring, the choice is yours, let us quell the chaos that wells with in us.\"','2016-10-19 05:34:09','2016-08-08 22:00:08'),(10010,11063,23,50,'Recharge 50-Frey','We all know the pros and cons of recharge, how it can work for us, or against us. I want you to use your creative side. Write a story of a dreamer who used recharge. You decide if it was a good outcome or a bad outcome. I look forward to hearing the outcome. Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-10-19 06:01:20','2016-10-16 01:31:01'),(11156,10916,3,50,'SM 50 | Aileron ','Create something with a group of others that will assist your house. You know what your house needs more than I do, so I will not narrow it down. Close off the sanctuary, or add another vault. Maybe create a helpful art or a blade. Use your imagination and the help of others.','2016-10-19 06:30:14','2016-08-28 19:47:18'),(11156,11045,70,30,'Balls of Fire','Invent a game that involves Flame as the focal point of its rules. The game must involve as many people as you can get to play it, this includes people outside your home. Tell me all about it once complete.\r\n','2016-10-19 07:02:04','2016-09-25 04:34:23'),(10593,11045,67,30,'What\'s yours?','Have these dreamers create for you what they think would be -your- perfect weapon. Ask them why they think it is suitable?  Lacey, Black Cloud, Em\'et, Calabosh, me, Magnum, Frey, Aileron, Ana.  *c','2016-10-20 01:35:54','2016-10-15 00:09:48'),(10951,11046,37,10,'Blaze a Trail','Having this Art platted has its benefits. Try to learn a couple. Use current events as a basis. Next, mark your Trail through an area you\'re unfamiliar with. Make a path, then follow your Trail Crystals back to the beginning of your Trail. How far can ye get without the Crystals evaporating (# of rooms)? ~Lacie~','2016-10-20 21:46:26','2016-10-09 02:38:03'),(10007,10664,60,2,'Second Sphere','Interviewed Jordyn for her second sphere and I feel she is ready to ascend.','2016-10-21 01:53:06','2016-10-21 01:21:59'),(10232,11038,38,1,'Harlen - Scare','Search throughout the physical landscape of the City of Dreams, and find for me something that might be frigthening. What qualities does it possess that instill that emotion? Using this knowledge, consider then what qualities cause people to be scared. Be prepared to discuss. ','2016-10-21 01:57:50','2016-10-06 21:57:23'),(10311,10580,111,1,'DazzleL-Najerv','Bring in 100 strength in untrapped essences (souls) to the house.\r\n','2016-10-21 02:42:55','2016-10-21 02:27:28'),(10007,10888,30,30,'Antidote 30','For this task I\'d like you to create a entirely new history of the art of Antidote. Write it as if no current history exists. I\'d like to see a decent story with the added elements of precisely why and how the art was created. Serious or entertaining, I\'ll leave it completely up to you. I look forward to hearing your result. Add this to the Archives. - Frey','2016-10-21 02:53:37','2016-10-16 08:30:26'),(10062,11046,65,40,'GateSmasher | 40','Work with a forger or two to design and craft your own GateSmasher. Make it unique to yourself and bring it to me for inspection. Every GK should have a good blade, and I\'m curious to know what yours would look like and how you decided to make. Make note of everything you put into it and why you chose those things.\r\n','2016-10-21 02:58:51','2016-09-23 02:31:02'),(10008,11145,71,1,'Flame - Learn','I would like for you to find out all the new places you can enter once you hit first sphere and I want \"all\" of them. Then I want you to tell me what plateau you get rid of the girly pink flame, since the color goes by level of the flame.','2016-10-21 06:25:20','2016-10-11 04:11:08'),(10007,11090,70,10,'Flame 10','Exploring can be fun, so lets start with that. There are different flames in the City. Take me on a field trip and show me all the different flames there are. There is one flame that has a specific use to it. If you can\'t figure it out on your own, ask around. I look forward to spending time with you and seeing the beauties of the City that you have found.','2016-10-21 07:02:08','2016-10-10 07:33:18'),(10007,11145,60,1,'First Sphere','I have interviewed Vistael for first sphere and feel he is ready.','2016-10-21 07:30:26','2016-10-21 07:27:56'),(10010,11014,6,10,'Med 50-Kendo','Meditate allows us to focus on our elementals, and regain them after using them, such as will, resilience etc. I want you to take the time to meditate on you, I want you to try and look deep inside. Try and find what makes you happy, what makes you sad. I want you to meditate on why you are anti social. ~Cryst~','2016-10-21 09:40:05','2016-08-19 12:38:13'),(11069,11046,12,10,'Inz- Shatter 10','Perhaps Wards have feelings too? Try to come up with convincing arguments that Shattering Wards is a horribly cruel act against Wardkind and test them against another Dreamer in a discussion or debate. Can you succeed in convincing another Dreamer of the virtues of being Pro-Ward? Give it your best shot and report whether this ends in failure of success!','2016-10-21 22:25:35','2016-10-04 22:14:03'),(10951,10966,60,2,'2nd Sp Interview','Now that you\'ve gotten your dream-legs, we will discuss your future dreams. Where will your dreams take you, what methods you will choose and who you have met thus far. Aterwards, a brief discussion about your focus. ~Lacie~','2016-10-22 04:36:43','2016-10-22 04:00:55'),(10750,11014,35,1,'Trap - Learn','In addition to learning the basics of how the art works, I want you to look at the most productive way to use it.  When is it worth burning the resilience to catch a full mare, as opposed to weakening them first?  Also, how will you avoid the \"Trap\" of becoming viewed as only a Trapper?','2016-10-22 07:44:28','2016-08-19 00:05:45'),(10311,11146,144,1,'ChaosWellL-Thrawn','Find out how many essences they hold, and how many more with each plat. What determines their color, and if its beneficial in any way to know who made which well. Also I would like for you to research if there were anything simular to the Chaos Well in our city, or Idoaclesia. When you get all your info together report to me your findings.\r\n','2016-10-22 20:28:10','2016-10-10 01:32:40'),(10951,11045,73,1,'Crap! Destroyed It!','Destroy Talisman is a great tool to keep one\'s pack clean, but has its bad side. Find 5 great uses for this art. Then speak to 5 people, asking them what they have accidentally DT\'ed, or DT\'ed and regretted doing so thereafter. Why can\'t it Destroy infinitely-charged codexes??? ~Lacie~','2016-10-22 22:24:53','2016-10-19 01:52:32'),(10026,11046,9,40,'Freeaction 40','Why does the art now weaken over time when arts are used against its protection, how does knowing this play a factor in how often and how well you use your own protective arts.','2016-10-23 02:50:51','2016-10-18 02:07:59'),(10018,11046,7,40,'Resist Fear 40','Gather your house mates for an investigation to learn more about this mysterious wormhole above your facade. The main objective is to attempt to discover if it is dangerous to Calenture and friendly dreamers, or if it is possibly protecting the house. Where did it come from? Test it, find out what you can.','2016-10-23 03:47:09','2016-10-14 06:07:56'),(11146,11046,8,40,'Protection 40 Xerer','Find four rooms in the city on different planes that could use our \"protection\".  Bring me the name of the room and the plane and be prepared to show it to me.  Tell me why these rooms need our protection and how we would help them.  Also bring me a 40+ gatekeeper chakram, moderate bouncing or better to support the formation of the city guard.  ','2016-10-23 04:34:03','2016-10-16 04:58:44'),(10951,10027,5,60,'Random\'s Random','Your new-found solo hunting of the Shammy\'s have yielded some interesting developments in your art of Random. After your hunt, gather a few useful items and make people Random for the \"prize\". Do this 6 times with 6 items. ~Lacie~','2016-10-23 18:47:01','2016-10-02 05:15:40'),(10951,10027,104,20,'Blaze On!','Help me motivate and improve our Stronghold\'s art! Find two members who need either the Art or an improvement, & help them get it raised a notch!. Then, see if ye can have a race with one of our comrades to fill a Well. Make it fun! ~Lacie~','2016-10-23 18:48:02','2016-10-19 23:10:07'),(10951,10026,104,1,'Radiantly Blazin\'','Speak with Em\'et and garner the stats on this Art, benefits of platting, etc. Discuss his experiment with Blaze. Learn the Tenets of the PC & get connected with our Archives on the Arcchives. Also, fill one Chaos Well of at least 100 essences. ~Lacie~','2016-10-23 23:04:41','2016-10-19 01:39:15'),(10010,11014,50,1,'NMF-Learn-Kendo','Nightmare form allows us to change our form from the one we have, to that of a mare. How does this happen? What are the basics of the art ? Duration if you can get it. Also, do we become other mares beyond emphants ? Why or why not ? Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-10-24 02:52:06','2016-10-21 09:26:35'),(10186,10066,60,8,'Quest: Xun\'rok','9th sphere path, Thunderman.\r\n','2016-10-24 06:17:35','2016-10-24 06:17:31'),(10027,10376,5,20,'Random to 20','Surveys and Questionairs find out the best and worst of five catagories you pick and have some fun maybe even offers prizes!','2016-10-24 16:15:24','2016-10-01 07:57:33'),(10027,11069,89,20,'Soul Shield to 20','Time to think about what needs to be shielded whether it be dreamers, houses or the dream itself. What needs to be protected and how will you go about doing this. It might be as simple as asking someone else too. See if you can offer your wisdom and protection to others.','2016-10-24 17:55:58','2016-10-08 07:33:46'),(10951,11069,47,30,'Push the Limits!','Words are so important here, but who really uses the correct words when it really counts??? A word of your own choosing, preferably with many syllables & not commonly used here needs to be added to your vocabulary. Use it often, make people ask what it means. Tell me of the experience. Details are left to your imagination! ~Lacie~','2016-10-24 21:39:40','2016-10-09 07:57:35'),(10874,11045,60,1,'4th for Nathan','this is a copy of Sorsha\'s task for him. ','2016-10-25 01:39:50','2016-10-25 01:39:32'),(10874,11045,60,4,'Quest: Nessa Tre','','2016-10-25 01:46:29','2016-10-25 01:46:25'),(10951,11160,60,1,'1st Sph Interview','We\'ll go over basic knowledge: Talismen, Planes & current open Houses & beliefs. Then we\'ll discuss plans for the future and current events. What ye aren\'t up to speed on, I\'ll help fill in a few gaps. Enjoy! ~L~','2016-10-25 23:46:33','2016-10-25 22:57:33'),(10107,10746,16,60,'Identify 60 - AJ','We\'ve made some great progress as a guild!  What say we continue by doing a little SWOT analysis!  Identify our Strengths, Weaknesses and Opportunity/Threats.  Pick three actions as to where to go next, and present them to the guild when you have the opportunity to do so!','2016-10-26 03:35:47','2016-09-28 03:36:20'),(10010,11014,72,10,'Inscribe 10-Kendo','Inscribe allows us to write things down for prosperity or for just a moment. I want you to inscribe for me, on three different scrolls, one purpose of the art. So one purpose per codex, I also want the perks of the art, as well as what a drawback to the art can be. ~Cryst~','2016-10-26 05:46:38','2016-10-24 02:58:34'),(10750,11028,15,1,'Judge Learn - Ana','I need some help with something.  I need a bit a bit of a judgemental survey done of people around.  I need to find out peoples favourite teachers, and least favourite teachers.  I don\'t need you to be exhaustive about this, but get a fair few people surveyed.  Only conditional on this, is that you can\'t tell people who gave you the quest.','2016-10-26 06:04:52','2016-10-16 04:01:08'),(10026,10951,89,30,'Soul 30','How if at all can a ward contain a soul in order to prevent it further harm, use that seer brain since you can blend a ward to determine how a ward may be altered to trap a soul, if at all possible\r\n','2016-10-27 00:14:36','2016-10-18 02:37:24'),(10010,11014,98,1,'Newly Awaken-Learn','You know the basics of the art, I want you to recall your first few weeks in the city. What did you learn, who made the biggest impressions on you? I also want you to think about the mechanics of the art, I want you to tell me how you would improve the art.  Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-10-27 05:23:29','2016-10-26 06:27:45'),(10951,10010,2,60,'Defensive Seer\'ness','Create a stragedy to defend your stronghold in times of attack. Use the skills you\'ve learned, as well as EVERY nook & cranny of your Facade to your advantage. Where do Seers stand? Who needs to be in party with whom? The whole plan. Once created, execute it with a *war games* practice or two. Adjust the plan as needed. Report =  how you did what & with whom & how it all went. ~Lacie~','2016-10-27 06:02:37','2016-09-14 05:56:05'),(10951,11145,38,1,'A Tale of Fright!','Use these last days of the Month of Moon to learn about your fellow dreamers. What \'scares\' them? Ask at least 2 people about the Art itself: 1 to inquire about the stats & 1 to ask how this Art is used in battle. Look around the City. Which room \"Scares\" you the most so far & why? Enjoy ~Lacie~','2016-10-27 06:53:44','2016-10-25 07:15:18'),(10951,11046,144,20,'Bottomless Well...','The Chaos Well is an under-examined item. We have learned it can be Drained, even when empty. What else is the well capable of holding & doing? What other Arts (besides DrainEssence) can be used on these Wells? The results of your experimentation will be your report. ~Lacie~','2016-10-27 22:17:34','2016-10-20 21:55:23'),(10027,10026,104,10,'Radiant Blaze 10','The house grows every dream. Can you think of anything we can do differant to make things better? On the boards? House events anything? We are a innovative house lets show it.','2016-10-28 01:14:15','2016-10-23 23:52:10'),(10010,11014,15,1,'Judgement-Learn','Judgement gives us information about the dreamer that we cast it upon, I want you to tell me what information that is, I also want you to tell me the hazard of judging others, not the art, but judgement in general. Are first judgements always the correct ones? Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-10-28 06:06:18','2016-10-27 05:28:06'),(10750,11046,25,10,'Reweave 10 - Xer','You\'ve started developing your own skill and flare for this art, so I would like you to continue along that path.  Find a small key segment to some larger structure that you feel is weaker than your comfortable with it being.  Lead a small group to try and patch it up using your newfound profiency.  For the report, I would like you to look at how the art feels now when you use it as opposed to how it did when you first started.  Did your helpers have similar issues?','2016-10-28 21:04:16','2016-09-27 06:01:24'),(10951,10318,104,10,'Blazin\' Well!','Fetch a Well (over 50)! Once collected, the plateau is yours!','2016-10-28 22:16:14','2016-09-27 19:16:27'),(10916,11045,31,1,'Curse - Learn','First things first, as always get the basics of the art (cost, what it does with plat, all that fun stuff.)  Then I want you to think about Curses and how they effect our avatars.  Why do we fail to evoke arts sometimes to begin with and does curse amplify this or does it affect us a totally different way to get the same result.  Then think about how purify cleanses that effect from the avatar.  I look forward to your report, good luck.\r\n','2016-10-29 00:12:31','2016-10-25 02:02:46'),(10951,11046,73,20,'Clutter E\'erywhere!','In preparation of receiving your halo, access the information in the Library of Souls (LoD). Young dreamers will need pertinent information. I wish a list of one item (or set of codexes) which is either taking up too much space, or not needed to be incuded in the LoD at all. This list will be passed onto the WordSmiths. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-10-29 01:46:45','2016-10-27 22:22:03'),(10951,10593,0,10,'Join Party | 10','Party preparations! Find the best room in the dream and utilize forge and inscribe to create a room worthy of a celebration. Your report will be to show this room to me. Themes for month are more than welcome! Have fun!','2016-10-29 01:51:42','2016-10-20 20:48:09'),(10916,10659,29,20,'Poison - 20','You have toiled and and strained to bring about the creation of poison.  Finally you have done it! Now the historians want to know what you did!  Tell me how you created poison, what methods did you use, what ingredients were involved, what does your poison do? Also lets not forget who helped.  Choose a few dreamers and have them give you one ingredient that is used in the making of the poison.  I look forward with what you come up with.\r\n','2016-10-29 07:33:27','2016-10-01 06:10:59'),(10951,10593,14,10,'Know | 10','Building your artistic abilities. Utilize your Forge as well as your ability to create snow to forge an obscure object. Place this object in the hands of 3 dreamers and ask for their interpretations of it. Attempt to make it interprative as possible. Upon completion report to me in Lace\'s presence. ','2016-10-29 23:32:01','2016-10-29 01:58:46'),(10010,11014,16,10,'ID-10-Kendo','Id allows us to find out information about items, I want you to find 10 items, and id them. Tell me what you ided and what the details of the items were. Were any of the items forged or combined, or were they all true from a generator. Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-10-30 05:38:06','2016-10-28 06:11:19'),(11069,10659,107,1,'Peace Aura (L)','You\'ve already learned Peace Aura in the past. Your understanding of this Art is sufficient in my mind. I would simply ask of you that you share with me your thoughts on how our House can bring you peace again.','2016-10-30 07:16:54','2016-10-01 07:14:36'),(10010,11090,47,1,'Push-Learn-lliam','I want you to tell me the mechanics of push, how does it work. Once you have done that, I want you to come up with three uses for the art. Can push be considered a protective art, if so, why ? Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-10-30 07:21:25','2016-10-12 07:22:57'),(10880,10009,2,70,'DreamSeer 70','Approved by Akkadian and Deeter for ongoing efforts and continuous improvements to the City\'s fabric.','2016-10-30 18:43:50','2016-10-30 18:43:41'),(10026,11046,60,5,'Sphere 5','Z must be stopped at all costs. This is a matter more grave than petty squabbles. Your mission is to develope and lead key roles of defense and offense against the being with Strike, How do we evade and defeat. Do well, and 5th is yours.\r\n','2016-10-30 21:08:29','2016-10-23 02:55:37'),(10009,10593,22,20,'Forge-20','Every ball needs decorations. Craft up some scary ornaments for the costume ball, focusing on a consistent theme between them. Preserve replicas of your four favorite to show me if I cannot make it to it myself. Bonus points if you can make someone wet themselves.','2016-10-30 23:21:09','2016-10-29 03:22:44'),(10480,10009,145,1,'Rally ','Give an answer to my group question. **A**\r\n','2016-10-31 00:42:26','2016-10-31 00:42:20'),(10480,10915,145,1,'Rally','Gave an answer to my group question. **A**\r\n','2016-10-31 00:43:42','2016-10-31 00:43:36'),(10480,11028,145,1,'Rally','Gave an answer to my group question. **A**\r\n','2016-10-31 00:43:48','2016-10-31 00:43:05'),(10480,10916,145,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Gave an answer to my group question. **A**\r\n','2016-10-31 00:44:50','2016-10-31 00:44:43'),(10480,10107,145,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Gave an answer to my group question. **A**\r\n','2016-10-31 00:45:02','2016-10-31 00:44:23'),(10480,10066,145,1,'Quest: Akkadian','For answering my group question.\r\n','2016-10-31 00:47:13','2016-10-31 00:46:49'),(10480,10951,145,1,'Quest: Akkadian','For an answer to my group question.\r\n','2016-10-31 00:47:20','2016-10-31 00:47:05'),(10480,10958,145,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Gave an answer to my group question.\r\n','2016-10-31 00:49:59','2016-10-31 00:49:51'),(10480,10066,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:02:26','2016-10-31 01:01:26'),(10480,10958,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:02:31','2016-10-31 01:01:43'),(10480,11046,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:02:34','2016-10-31 01:01:56'),(10480,10916,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:02:38','2016-10-31 01:02:12'),(10480,10916,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:03:46','2016-10-31 01:03:41'),(10480,11046,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:03:49','2016-10-31 01:03:28'),(10480,10958,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:03:54','2016-10-31 01:03:15'),(10480,10066,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:03:58','2016-10-31 01:03:00'),(10480,10009,146,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Channel.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:15:01','2016-10-31 01:14:55'),(10480,10915,146,1,'Channel','After thinking on the group discussion, find one new discovery about the art Channel. **A**','2016-10-31 01:15:49','2016-10-31 00:32:53'),(10480,10107,146,1,'Channel','After thinking on the group discussion, find one new discovery for the art of Channel. **A**','2016-10-31 01:16:04','2016-10-31 00:31:32'),(10480,10066,146,1,'Channel','After thinking on the group discussion, find one new discovery about the art Channel. **A**','2016-10-31 01:17:26','2016-10-31 00:29:47'),(10480,10916,146,1,'Channel','After thinking on the group discussion, find one new discovery about the art Channel. **A**','2016-10-31 01:17:49','2016-10-31 00:33:42'),(10480,10915,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:23:33','2016-10-31 01:23:04'),(10480,10009,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:23:35','2016-10-31 01:23:17'),(10480,10107,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:23:38','2016-10-31 01:23:28'),(10480,10915,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:24:23','2016-10-31 01:23:56'),(10480,10009,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:24:26','2016-10-31 01:24:07'),(10480,10107,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:24:28','2016-10-31 01:24:19'),(10480,10003,146,1,'Channel','After thinking on the group discussion, find one new discovery for the art Channel. **A**','2016-10-31 01:31:00','2016-10-31 00:35:21'),(10480,10951,146,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting channel after answering a question on a new discovery.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:32:19','2016-10-31 01:32:12'),(10480,11028,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:36:04','2016-10-31 01:34:51'),(10480,10951,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:36:08','2016-10-31 01:35:04'),(10480,11171,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:36:19','2016-10-31 01:35:50'),(10480,11028,93,10,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:39:21','2016-10-31 01:36:57'),(10480,10951,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:39:27','2016-10-31 01:38:56'),(10480,11171,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:39:35','2016-10-31 01:39:17'),(10107,10915,111,20,'Magnum - Dazzle','It is time for you to encourage others to bring in Souls so that they may be saved. Host an essence drive within the house, see how many Souls you can personally release from their torment. Keep track of the number and involve as many in the house as possible.\r\n','2016-10-31 01:39:55','2016-09-27 06:35:02'),(10107,10915,111,20,'Honour Dazzle 20','For the dreamstruck BladeSlayer.  ','2016-10-31 01:39:55','2016-10-31 01:37:31'),(10480,10750,146,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Gave answer to group question about Channel.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:01:23','2016-10-31 02:00:50'),(10480,10746,146,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Gave answer to group question about Channel.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:01:27','2016-10-31 02:01:08'),(10480,10750,145,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Rally after discussion.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:08:33','2016-10-31 02:08:09'),(10480,10746,145,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting after discussion.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:08:35','2016-10-31 02:08:27'),(10480,10746,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:12:15','2016-10-31 02:11:55'),(10480,10746,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:12:15','2016-10-31 02:11:42'),(10480,10750,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting corrupt Essence.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:12:59','2016-10-31 02:12:52'),(10480,10750,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:13:52','2016-10-31 02:13:35'),(10480,10746,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:13:57','2016-10-31 02:13:46'),(10480,10066,1,80,'Quest: Akkadian','Test\r\n','2016-10-31 02:29:38','2016-10-31 02:29:31'),(10480,11171,103,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting teacher support art. **A**\r\n','2016-10-31 02:49:02','2016-10-31 02:47:10'),(10480,11171,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Quest. **A**\r\n','2016-10-31 02:49:11','2016-10-31 02:47:41'),(10480,11171,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Support arts.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:49:19','2016-10-31 02:48:19'),(10480,11171,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting support arts.\r\n','2016-10-31 02:49:25','2016-10-31 02:48:31'),(10088,11028,70,30,'Flame 30 Ana','My main goal? Continuin to help shape your legacy, and expand you craft and network. So, for this. . . I want you to find TEN places where you can make a type of cooking tent, or whatever it\'s called, to help you make your treats. BUT you can\'t simply build your selections with raw materials, rather, use what\'s already there and brainstorm *HOW* you could overhaul the Dreamscape, safely, and create what is needed to feed us more, more, more. Take me to at least 2 of your picks.','2016-10-31 03:09:01','2016-09-26 04:27:25'),(10480,11046,11,20,'Amulet -- 20','Key unlock the most mysterious of places. I wish for you to take this key and discover where it unlocks for you. Do not take this task literally. This is a journey of the person. What wonders does the other side hold for you? **A**','2016-10-31 03:32:07','2016-10-16 06:37:52'),(10874,10746,52,60,'Arlyana - Train 60','There has been some talk lately, of a Teacher Reward Program. I would like for you to design and submit such a program to the Elder Masters, consulting your fellow teachers along the way. Do your utmost to see that it is fair and is approved by said Elders. Clarity has already done some research on it -- I recommend her as a good source of information. Bring also to your report five examples of sixth plateau tasks you\'ve written, for consideration. ','2016-10-31 03:37:24','2016-08-17 19:20:44'),(10480,10232,93,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Sacrifice after group discussion.\r\n','2016-10-31 03:38:50','2016-10-31 03:38:44'),(10480,10232,145,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Rally after group discussion.\r\n','2016-10-31 03:39:00','2016-10-31 03:38:21'),(10480,10232,113,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Corrupt Essence after group discussion.\r\n','2016-10-31 03:39:15','2016-10-31 03:37:49'),(10480,10232,146,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting Channel after group discussion.\r\n','2016-10-31 03:39:21','2016-10-31 03:37:29'),(10480,11038,4,20,'What Does It Mean?','Fatesenders.. we are \"supposed\" to be a lot of things, but what do -you-  think? Have you ever regretted being a Fatesender? What art is your favourite/look most forward to learning? If you could create a -new- FS Art, what might it be? ++SC++','2016-10-31 03:48:53','2016-09-29 02:32:27'),(10480,10232,45,50,'Razorwind -- 60','For this task, I am going to ask that you slice through the air and find out what people think of Razorwind. Why do they like it or hate it? How can it be used with other focus to take out a DarkMare easily? You know what I usually seek. Make your efforts worthy. **A**','2016-10-31 03:56:18','2016-10-18 02:55:29'),(10232,10067,93,1,'Tamarisk - Sacrific','Akkadian\'s bidding, yar. ','2016-10-31 04:06:31','2016-10-31 04:06:18'),(10232,10067,113,1,'Tamarisk - Corrupt','Akkadian\'s bidding, yar. ','2016-10-31 04:06:38','2016-10-31 04:05:18'),(10232,10067,146,1,'Tamarisk - Channel','Akkadian\'s bidding, yar.','2016-10-31 04:06:45','2016-10-31 04:04:47'),(10232,10915,43,40,'Magnum - Paralyze40','Search the Dream for a cursed alteror, one that paralyzes the user. Forging one is cheat! Theorize how you might alter it in such a way that makes the alteror benefical! Changing it to FA is booooring! Be creative. Seek input from those whose opinions you respect. Ensure a thorough report','2016-10-31 04:29:56','2016-10-31 04:29:50'),(10067,10027,0,60,'Join Party 60','Time for some more fun. You are the party planner. I want you to offer up suggestions to groups of people when you encounter them. See if they take the bait and join in. Make four attempts of your choosing. <T>','2016-10-31 04:42:08','2016-09-12 04:42:24'),(10232,10376,7,1,'Calabosh - Resist F','Go into the wilderness, and find something that resists fear all by its lonesome, without any arts or capabilities; EMULATE THAT THING! Tell me how you did it!','2016-10-31 05:48:09','2016-09-28 05:02:44'),(10750,10007,103,1,'Quest: Arnaya','Re-granting art lost due to house demotion.  As per akkadian\r\n','2016-10-31 05:57:06','2016-10-31 05:56:36'),(10007,10750,28,30,'Abjure 30','Find ways to aide 5 of your fellow dreamers in their advancement using this art. Think out of the box as much as possible and we\'ll expect a report worthy of this amazing art','2016-10-31 06:42:10','2016-10-16 07:17:39'),(11069,10593,93,1,'Sacrifice (L)','Nowadays, since most members of the Alliance consider hunting Nightmares acceptable and compatible with a general pursuit of peace, the Art of Sacrifice is no longer an absolute requirement for the Star. Obtaining it was no easy feat. Learn of the sacrifice we had to make in order to obtain it. Anasina can help with the specifics.','2016-10-31 08:14:52','2016-10-21 21:31:45'),(10951,10027,113,1,'Corrupt Essence','Since you have already learned the stats for this art & recited the information to me, bring a full Chaos Well (at least 100 essences) to me, and I will grant you this art. ~L~','2016-10-31 18:51:39','2016-10-31 05:31:37'),(10027,11069,64,30,'Give 30','These can be the craziest of times. Take some time and thank your members for all they do for you and for the house. Ask them if you can aid them in some manner and do your best to do so. Sometime the noticing of their efforts means so much.','2016-10-31 19:07:45','2016-10-24 18:23:38'),(11069,10318,11,10,'Inz- Amulet 10','About keys... They keep your locks safe but they\'re easy to lose, to terrible consequences, no? Come up with a wacky invention to help GateKeepers keep their keys (and/or amulets) in check at all times, and make a sales pitch. Test it out on another GateKeeper and see if you can convince them.','2016-10-31 19:41:11','2016-09-26 20:46:01'),(10951,10318,146,1,'Channel - Learn','Learn the stats on this Art (I will make a post about them). Coordinate with me and Calor on the best way to help Xun\'rok defeat Zaxun. Post a message to the PC to relay the efforts. ~Lacie~','2016-10-31 20:27:18','2016-10-31 04:28:17'),(10951,10026,75,60,'Such a Showoff!','Using your art of Forge, create a contest in which contestants are asked to pick between two items, using only what can be seen with Show Talisman & one clue. Five items should work. Find another Forger to recreate the other choices for the contest. Winners take the better item; however you choose to work it. ~Lacie~','2016-10-31 22:03:59','2016-10-09 03:35:31'),(10951,10717,139,1,'Datoke Hunter!','Alright, prep ye pack & ready ye weapons! Since the Revenants seem to be confined, the Datoke are bound to start hunting more again. Learn their habits, seek their hunting grounds. Take a hunting party or go solo. Ye report will be how many ye find in a few days, or the head of one! Good Hunting without the Sense to find them! ~Lacie~','2016-10-31 22:28:08','2016-09-13 20:11:26'),(10027,10717,104,1,'Radieant Blaze L','Thank you for your help in making the Peace Corpse grow. I ask you for essense to aid in a house experiement. Deliver these and i will share the art with you.','2016-10-31 23:31:34','2016-10-23 15:23:42'),(10750,11069,32,1,'Drain Learn - Inzou','In addition to making sure you know the basic mechanics of the art, I want you to come up with THE Ultimate Drain Essence Vessel.  What would it look like?  How would it work?  How would you even consider starting to build it?  What sorts of uses do you envision for this?  Be creative and try to have some fun with this.','2016-10-31 23:51:24','2016-10-10 22:37:01'),(10916,10053,146,1,'Quest: Aileron','First thing learn the basics from those that have learned the art.  Then with that knowledge I want you to consider how the art could impact an avatar on a negative level.  Do you believe it is possible and if so how and what could be done to ensure safety.  I look forward to hearing what you come up with, good luck.\r\n','2016-11-01 00:23:39','2016-10-31 02:28:05'),(10232,11028,74,10,'Anasina - M Blank10','Theorize how the colors of what we wear create INSTANT IMPRESSIONS of people. What snap judgements do you make, or have you seen other make? Are there theoretical color combinations that would create certain impressions? Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-11-01 00:26:07','2016-09-22 23:22:54'),(10232,10027,93,1,'LadySilver - Sacrif','Bring to our House some things worth sacrificing! Bring at least 15 chakrams/charms for conversion, one of each focus for chakrams, one of each focus for charms!','2016-11-01 00:49:02','2016-10-31 05:26:27'),(10880,10888,70,50,'Flamesear 40: Uthy','You have recently had a run in with the flames of Rage and Fear, and got burned a little bit by them.  The flame of fear burns rampant right now, and it is our job as masters of the soul to help combat such flames, or build others to help counter them.  I want you to do your part towards this.  Be creative, and make your effort worthy of this plateau. ~Written under Deeter\'s authority and approval.','2016-11-01 08:39:51','2016-06-08 05:09:25'),(10232,10318,145,1,'Lu Chaos - Rally','Learn all the details of this art (Cost, Effect, Element, Orbit), and then compare it to Return. If you were forced to keep only one of the two arts, which would you keep, and why? Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-11-02 00:38:32','2016-10-31 05:50:18'),(10232,11171,146,1,'Cupid - Channel','Search out the channels in the City of Dreams; Find me a river in whichever plane you like, and try to follow it from source to ending. If you like, bring someone along -- willing or unwilling -- and entertain them endlessly with river facts, how they are natural CHANNELS. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-11-02 00:58:48','2016-11-01 00:10:19'),(10916,10066,144,10,'Chaos Well - 10','Come up with a theory on how it would be possible to have one chaos well absorb another in order to combine both strengths into one.  Then with this theory, create an item that would be used in the process.  Bring the item with you when you report.\r\n','2016-11-02 01:04:00','2016-08-14 04:41:19'),(10951,11046,38,10,'Fright Night!','During these last days of the Month of Moon, I want you to test, really test the limits of this Art! Go out of your way to make certain Dreamers have Resist Fear active by scaring the pants off of them! Oh? They\'re in Sanctuary? Give them a little fright too! Your methods are your own. ~Lacie~','2016-11-02 01:52:20','2016-10-29 23:16:13'),(10951,11171,50,20,'Nightmare Form | 20','Write/Inscribe a comedic sketch/story involving a scary Emphant as the central idea. Make this hilarious and upon completion we will see to this being told at the next Lyceum event. If you need some ideas, ask around as well as take time to examine them in their natural habitats. Report to Lace in my presence when done.','2016-11-02 02:46:43','2016-10-29 02:11:57'),(10067,10027,146,1,'Channel','Speak to a few teachers and get the basics of Channel. Tell me how you are going to love it or hate it. Keep everyone excited about getting the new art. <T>','2016-11-02 06:16:42','2016-10-31 04:25:02'),(10750,11014,35,10,'Trap 10 - Kendo','We\'ve talked about trapping a bit, so now.... I would like you to construct THE perfect trap for the target of your choice.  Dreamer, Datoken, Lesser Mare, Darkmare, or an intangible like \"Courage\" or \"Fear\".  Use Forge if you have it, or inscribe the details otherwise and walk me through how/why its the perfect trap, and how you would build it if you were making it for real.\r\n','2016-11-02 06:26:21','2016-10-28 08:11:31'),(11069,11046,26,20,'Purify 20','While searching for a way to make your molting more manageable as a matter of social etiquette, you accidentally discover that your shed skin can actually be made into a powerful detergent with the right ingredients. The specifics are up to you, but get at least one dreamer to accept to test your formula.','2016-11-02 17:13:48','2016-10-21 22:32:33'),(10746,10750,139,10,'Sense Datoke ~10','I am curious about a few things: why does this only detect Datoke?  Why is it an Insight art rather than a DreamSoul art?  Provide solid answers to these questions.','2016-11-02 20:41:35','2016-10-05 03:23:35'),(10951,11069,0,30,'It\'s My Party!','This 3rd plateau will be most beneficial to you, but you\'ll have to work for your reward! Devise a way to spend the majority of your dreams with a full party, WITHOUT asking people to \"jp\"! How you accomplish this is your own construct. Try to keep tabs on how much experience you gain from this experiment. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-11-02 23:27:15','2016-10-28 18:41:50'),(10026,10376,60,4,'Sphere 4','Where are the top gens that you can access at your current level located? From these Gens I want 1 Chakram of each Focus 41- or Better, 1 Alt that gives Vision, Freeaction, Resist Fear, and Protection 10 min or better. 4 Shields that have second color Abyss. These items will be used for the PC Market, so have an idea of what you will charge for them when you turn them in. Do this and 4th is Yours.','2016-11-03 00:40:36','2016-10-27 01:37:35'),(10009,10311,145,1,'Rally-Learn','Rally has limitations on where it can be used. Help me find one!','2016-11-03 01:29:51','2016-10-31 00:59:53'),(10951,11171,104,1,'Radiant Blaze','As part of your initiaton into the Peace Corspe, learn the tenents of the organization, and contribute 200 essences to the Soul of Radiance. Also, learn the power of this art and requirements for usage & restrictions. ~Lacie~','2016-11-03 01:45:35','2016-10-29 02:13:52'),(10107,10580,75,20,'Show 20 - Najerv','I want you to create a series of 4 codexes that can convey your ideas in a conversation.  Use agreement, disagreement, indifference and surprise.  See if you can carry out a decent conversation using only 4 expressions through codex titles.\r\n','2016-11-03 04:31:50','2016-10-10 04:39:51'),(10010,11014,73,1,'DT-Learn-Kendo','I want you to tell me the basics about the art, as well as the mechanics in how you think that this art works. I want to know if there are items that cannot be destroyed, and if not, how come? Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-11-03 07:52:11','2016-10-30 05:41:59'),(10027,11069,144,30,'Chaos well 30','The titans will soon fade into no one remembering them but the dream goes on. Time to look at your houses plans and projects for the future. I don\'t need top secret details but think of some ideas to bring the Allaince to her rightful place int he dream. Make a list of steps to get you there. You can ask for input from yoru house mates as well.','2016-11-03 12:38:32','2016-11-01 08:59:15'),(10951,11171,144,1,'Deepest Wells','We used to have to gather Essences in our packs, but now we have Chaos Wells! After learning how this art improves with plateaus, consider how the new arts of Sacrifice & Corrupt Essence have improved this device. What else could go into a Well? ~Lacie~','2016-11-03 20:12:33','2016-11-03 01:17:40'),(10026,11069,13,30,'Return 3rd Inzoum','Pick any 3 Gatekeepers of noted History, and remind by story by whatever means you have of their accomplisment, return when completed.','2016-11-03 22:47:21','2016-10-09 22:59:43'),(10107,10915,142,30,'Misdirection 30','I want you to take three dreamers to the Mt. Illapse Cache and show them the mural on the top of the pedestal in the middle of the room.  Have them give you an interpretation on what they think it might be. Get their opinions on the type of pigment used to dye the rocks and make it look the way it does. \r\n','2016-11-04 02:49:22','2016-10-04 04:00:01'),(10746,10066,100,10,'PT ~ 10','I have always wondered why Power Tokens and Soul Essences look the same and bear the same name before they are within our packs.  Why do you think this is when one comes from dreamers and the other comes from maren essences.  Create a sound theory, complete with short falls.','2016-11-04 03:26:38','2016-08-14 04:06:48'),(10746,10916,100,20,'PT ~ 20','Time to do some exploring!  I remember hearing rumours back in the day of the climbing places, aside from Lost Caves, about the City.  Try and see how many you can find.','2016-11-04 03:44:46','2016-10-16 23:28:43'),(10066,10750,15,20,'Judgement 20 Arnaya','Speak with several dreamers and get their opinion on what line has to be crossed before a dreamer is considered irredeemable and a candidate for being dreamstruck. Answer this question yourself. Find commonalities.','2016-11-04 04:11:27','2016-10-14 03:37:44'),(10746,10750,22,40,'Forge ~ 40 (2)','Now for the fun part, depending on others.  You have the plans and schematics in place, but I do not want you to do all of the tool creation yourself.  Look for some assistants in their creation, guide the design as you are able.','2016-11-04 04:16:17','2016-10-30 05:22:42'),(10916,11046,24,20,'Restore - 20','We have restored our comrades from the bowels of the sticky Mace of Constipation.  However there could be others in the mace.  Think of a possible way that we could extract some others that are in the mace safely and would you make it so we could pick and choose who to save?  Or would all come at once?  I look forward to hearing what you come up with.\r\n','2016-11-04 04:35:58','2016-11-03 06:26:04'),(10951,10376,24,1,'Restore | Learn','It would appear that there is still a lot of tension in the city regarding the previous war. Speak to 2 members from each house and tell them a joke to \"restore\" some joy to their dreams. Also, learn how damage is healed up to 2nd plateau for this art. ','2016-11-04 06:13:08','2016-10-04 03:52:55'),(10951,11069,139,20,'Sense Datoken | 20','Aren\'t sense datoken plateaus useless? Contemplate some methods to improve this art for every plateau up to 5th. Speak to some other dreamers about your ideas and combine their new ideas with yours. Report to Lace in my presence. ','2016-11-04 06:59:23','2016-10-08 23:41:26'),(11069,11046,13,1,'Inz- Return (L)','Return behaves similarly to Recall, but rather than displace you upon collapse, it does so when evoked again while the effect lasts. Consider these mechanics, and think of examples for each of these three scenarios: 1) Saving time. 2) Battle tactics 3) Pranking. You are likely to use each of these on a regular basis, I want you to start thinking about your movements with Return in mind, it\'ll soon be an indispensable part of your Dreams.','2016-11-04 07:18:27','2016-11-02 17:21:00'),(10027,11069,113,1,'Corrupt L','A  moral high ground many seek but how is this defined and what is the rule and exception. What is an essense to the dream today? This is all theory and I doubt we will reach one solid answer btu stranger things ahve happened.','2016-11-04 12:47:00','2016-11-03 12:47:43'),(10916,11069,145,1,'Rally - Learn','First off get the basics of the art from those that have learned it so far.  Then I want you to learn as much as you can about it and from the information you obtain I want to know what limitiations would you put on the art?  How do you see the art potentially being misused and should the art even be a Guardian art?  I look forward to hearing what you come up with.\r\n','2016-11-04 22:58:54','2016-11-02 08:43:51'),(10007,10750,35,40,'Trap 40','I want you to help Uthy come up with a way to explain how Trap works, through art. Come together and come up with the ideas on how to do this and then I want you both to create this through forge. This must be a minimum of 10 items on display. I want this to be displayed in the Museum for all to see. This is a group effort for two big plats, so I expect this to be worthy.','2016-11-05 05:18:34','2016-10-31 07:01:15'),(10027,10106,144,1,'Chaos well L','Aas around and see what you can learn that new to you. House names, Houses beleifs. Places and arts have changed. Dreamers will still give you  hand. Ask then what they like about chaos wells.','2016-11-05 06:28:18','2016-11-03 09:52:24'),(10951,10106,20,30,'MastaBlasta','The Peace Corpse (PC) has the most DreamSeers of any stronghold. Learn the tricks (tell them you\'re my grandson) I have taught them, then show them a thing or two. Consult any 2 of the following: LadySilver, Calabosh, Crystalline, Black Cloud or Frey, or any others you luck up on). Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-11-05 06:54:53','2016-11-04 10:10:23'),(10480,11069,141,10,'Kinesis to 10','I wish for you to push your housemates to do more than stand on the facade. There is much turmoil within the City these days. Citizens are frightened and need ways to enjoy themselves again. Take charge of this calling as leader of the Alliance. The specifics are entirely up to you. **A**','2016-11-05 07:05:23','2016-09-11 22:07:39'),(10480,10027,17,60,'ID Curse - 60','This art does not work on oneself. To me it seems rather pointless to be able to cast it upon others and not on yourself like other protective arts. Please theorize how you would adjust the mechanics of the art to be able to target yourself and see if you are Cursed. Also, think of three other improvements to the art that do not currently exist. Make you efforts worthy of the plateau that you seek. **A**','2016-11-05 07:26:21','2016-09-28 04:49:47'),(10951,11069,98,20,'Newbie Alert!','Alright so newbies are rare, but returning dreamers should count as newlies at times too! Do some investigating & find out a few things (3 or 4) that new or returning dreamers are unaware of. People, places or things matters not. Results count! ~Lacie~','2016-11-05 08:18:53','2016-11-02 23:39:10'),(10067,10027,51,60,'Locate 60','Locate 6 new rooms or areas that are in this City that wasn\'t in ours and write a short paragraph about each one for me. I want to see how you see them. <T>','2016-11-06 00:19:41','2016-11-02 06:33:16'),(10951,10026,146,1,'Channel Learn','Since you\'ve learned the stats and abilities of this Art, pass the information on to one person (or more) that doesn\'t know it. Then bring a full Well to add to our Strength, if someone can benefit from the energy of this, that\'s an added bonus! ~Lacie~','2016-11-06 03:48:55','2016-10-31 22:31:31'),(11156,11045,3,40,'SM 40 | Nathan','Soul Masters are the Healers. For this task, you must find a number of things wrong with the city\'s dreamers. Maybe hate, vengefulness, jealousy- use your imagination. Things that bring the dream DOWN. Now. It is your job to create a way to involve these dreamers and create a way for them to turn those frowns upside down AND to benefit the city. For instance- creating art work to be hung in the library, or something of this sort.','2016-11-06 04:35:39','2016-10-25 02:18:25'),(10026,11045,9,10,'FreeAction 10','To plat this art I require a poem, a small little bard, not too hard. It must tell the story of the little boy with stagger, who liked to hit others and watch them swagger, then one day freeaction came, and that little boy was never the same. Finish the quest by telling the whole story','2016-11-06 04:50:18','2016-10-19 01:37:15'),(10027,10916,144,50,'Chaos Well 50','Welcome Baskets for everyone! Okay not everyone but a few as a ruler its nice to let those in your home know you appreciate them with a token of gratitude. Maybe they like certian items or a basket of trinkets you decide. Sya thank you in your own way. Let me know how it turns out','2016-11-06 05:17:53','2016-09-04 17:04:49'),(11156,10951,69,70,'Lace: Flame 70','As a Master of Insight, you know your element. Lie for me. Create a deception in Underlight such that it is well known, and if not believed, at least leaves others in doubt. I wish to be able to speak to five dreamers and have four of them tell me they know of this deception. Return to me when this is done. ','2016-11-06 05:23:32','2016-10-18 04:15:03'),(10951,11069,89,30,'Shielded Soul','Consider the altar/portals at the House/Stronghold Facades for a bit. An edict should be published about their existance, order of appearance & any precautions new, returning & existing dreamers should take. Publication will serve as your report. ~Lacie~','2016-11-06 09:01:34','2016-11-05 23:03:38'),(10593,10916,73,20,'No more grumpy','This new chapter of your dream has done you a world of good, you are much happier and focused, your morale is up. A lot of people try to Destroy morale. I would like you to do your best to keep morale up in the city, include -all- dreamers..even if you dont like them. If you hear harsh words..offer some positive ones..etc..tell me incidences that stand out as you do this. *c','2016-11-07 00:12:47','2016-10-11 21:54:34'),(10750,10580,146,1,'Channel Learn- Naj','In addition to learning the basics of the art, I would like you to look into some other potential uses for this art.  Just going from its name and what you think it does even.  Provide some basic details at least on these alternatives.','2016-11-07 02:11:27','2016-11-03 04:14:55'),(10951,10376,20,30,'Blast-O-Matic','Every machine needs proper maintenance and your Blast-O-Matic is no exception. Using your new Blasting techniques, fill a Well (100 or better) with nothing but Blasted Mare Essences! Hone your skill, use your talents & Blast those Mares! ~Lacie~','2016-11-07 04:05:06','2016-11-06 04:20:51'),(10593,11045,27,30,'Give & Take','This art is about giving of yourself.  I want you to give some people what you think they -really- need and in return, they are to give you what they think -you- need.  Make note of what you gave..and what they gave in return. At least...ten dreamers.  *c','2016-11-07 06:23:14','2016-10-20 01:45:47'),(10951,10026,113,1,'Corrupted Essence!','Putting Dreamer Essences into Chaos Wells! What will the Dream think up next? How might we use this process to help retrieve our comrades & citizens? Think on it a bit, then report. ~Lacie~','2016-11-08 03:15:07','2016-11-01 01:52:26'),(10232,10026,93,1,'Golah - Sacrifice','Consider the nature of the art Sacrifice: Other than increasing how much energy a node contains, how might this art be made more useful? Be creative, and surprise me with interesting ideas!','2016-11-08 03:37:24','2016-11-01 01:40:28'),(10874,10915,140,20,'Tempest -- 20','Tempest is a very fun art. It can also be a very valuable defensive art. Speak with those that you trust as well as other FateSenders about the art. Learn what they know and share your knowledge as well. Return when you believe the task to be complete and we will discuss. **A**','2016-11-08 05:01:12','2016-08-22 03:56:48'),(10874,10750,52,20,'Arnaya | Train20','Discover the secrets of teachers and elders. Compile a list of \"easy\" teachers and \"difficult\" teachers. All this is in secret, mind you! Take polls on who the favorites and least favorites are, and why. Is there a running theme these days on tasks? Finally, create a few tasks that you are proud of that will fit your coming days with Train20. Have another higher leveled teacher assist you on the final wording. It is our duty to create a fun enviornment with valuable lessons.','2016-11-08 05:41:24','2016-10-05 03:19:08'),(10916,10580,139,20,'Sense Datoken - 20','Take the basic idea of Sense Datoken (using ones own senses to locate something.) and try to apply it to your shardic life.  Apply it in however many ways you can and use any means you feel fit to at least give it your best try.  What are your thoughts to trying to apply something from the city to your waking life?  I look forward to hearing about how everything went and what you did to try and accomplish your goal, good luck.\r\n','2016-11-10 09:22:46','2016-10-10 00:25:10'),(10027,10580,74,40,'Mind Blankk 40','The dream is now your canvas. Build me a new one. Well one the plans I want a new plane with five rooms and a new house. Have some fun with it and fill the house with just the right dreamers and I need to know why they are in the house, What would the hosue do how would it be differant from current houses.','2016-11-10 10:22:37','2016-09-13 23:40:05'),(10916,10580,37,20,'Trail - 20','How is it that only the ones that evoke trail can see the crystals left behind?  Come up with a theory on why this is so and using that theory, come up with a few ways to put that theory to use in the city (with different overall effects).  I look forward to what you come up with.\r\n','2016-11-11 03:47:09','2016-11-10 09:37:52'),(10018,10580,10,30,'Ward/Amulet 30','I want you to be the puppetmaster behind dreamwide wonder: \"Wards are spreading like wildfire, where are they coming from?!\" Begin warding up as many planes as you can without getting caught, be discreet as possible, and try to get people talking about it! Do this for a few days and see if any rumors fly!','2016-11-11 05:14:01','2016-09-17 07:17:38'),(10018,10580,11,30,'Ward/Amulet 30','This is for Najerv\'s completed bundled quest for Ward and Amulet 30.','2016-11-11 05:14:11','2016-11-11 05:13:45'),(10746,10007,146,1,'Channel ~ learn','This art is a mystery, nothing like it has ever been seen before.  See what you can find out about the ins and outs of this art.  How useful do you see it being?','2016-11-11 05:24:07','2016-10-31 04:02:06'),(10007,10888,35,50,'Trap 50','I want you and Arnaya to come up with a way to explain how Trap works, through art. Come together and come up with the ideas on how to do this and then I want you both to create this through forge. This must be a minimum of 10 items on display. I want this to be displayed in the Museum for all to see.','2016-11-11 05:34:25','2016-10-31 06:55:52'),(10018,11063,46,10,'Recall 10','Recall is on the fritz, which is causing you to Recall your thoughts backwards! What ever will you do?! Allow your friends to fix you and report back with the details of how it went. Have fun!','2016-11-11 07:45:13','2016-09-13 08:18:49'),(10027,10580,73,20,'Dest Talis 20','We have more arts to manipulate items. This is exciting. Find six ways to do this and if you cannot make up the ones missing. Have some fun with this. ','2016-11-11 08:02:16','2016-11-10 10:27:57'),(11069,10717,50,1,'Inz - NightForm (L)','Release your inner Emphant! Be the Emphant, smell the emphant! Feel the wings, the uneven array of teeth, that powerful tail! Prepare your best impression of an Emphant, study their maneurisms and grooming habits. Present a reasonable mimicry of Emphantness to other dreamers on 3 separate occasions, collecting their feedback and improving your act between each attempt. Once you\'ve mastered being an Emphant, return to me.','2016-11-11 23:17:00','2016-08-23 17:21:54'),(10916,10580,14,20,'Know - 20','Come up with an advertisement for the city as if you were trying to get visitors to come by and check it out.  Then run your advertisement by a few dreamers and see if they would give the city a look based on it.  When you report, tell me the advertisement, who you ran it by and what they said about it.  I look forward to hearing what you come up with.\r\n','2016-11-12 02:08:41','2016-11-11 04:23:55'),(10951,10580,0,20,'Join Party | 20','I would like for you to make the preparations for a surprise party for a good friend of yours. The occasion is up to you. It can be anything from someone recently joining a house, to getting that art plateaued to 50, to slaying Harry the Horron. Work with a forger/baker to have a cake made for them just for the occasion! You can\'t have a party without a cake! Report to Lace in my presence.','2016-11-12 03:43:42','2016-10-13 05:47:25'),(10088,10593,75,10,'Show 10 - Cianne','On my shard, we have these silly little \"fortune tellers\". You ask this giant jewel a question, shake it up, and there\'s a pyramid-shaped token inside with different words, usually inspirations or instructions to help confused souls come to a decision- once the liquid falls still and a side of the token lands against the lens. Leave chance up to fate, or the Dream Gods, I say! Create one of these unique items for me here, and if you like - get the input of others as it pertains to your words of wisdom.','2016-11-12 04:41:11','2016-10-31 00:53:22'),(10027,10117,144,10,'Chaos Well to ten','Gather me up a story fo great valor. Shall it with three dreamer who and how is up to you. Make the dream remember what courage truly is. I know you can do it.','2016-11-12 05:00:11','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10593,10966,72,1,'Opinions..','I would like you to approach at least  5 dreamers and have them write on a 1 charged codex to describe you in one word... hand the codi to me when yo ucollect them and I\'ll unveil them with you. ! *c  p.s.** They are not allowed to tell you what they wrote.**','2016-11-12 06:09:34','2016-10-29 06:28:05'),(10027,10580,75,30,'Show Talisman 30','You are the Grand Master Showman. Help others show off some. Use your skills at seeing what other need and give them a hand, a scroll or just some solid advice on how to make their dreams better. I will need names of who and what you shared with them.','2016-11-12 08:36:16','2016-11-11 08:10:50'),(10545,10580,89,10,'Soul Shield 10','Gather a group of at least three others to play a few rounds of a new \"duel\" in the Arena. There will be two teams. Each team will have a swordsman titled the \'Soul\' and a guard titled the \'Shield\'. Only the Souls can swing their blades. The Shields are to defend their Souls. 3 hits and they are out. The Souls must continue until one is left standing.','2016-11-12 08:47:03','2016-10-16 07:20:28'),(10951,10117,60,6,'6th Sp. Kage re-do','Kage wrote a sphere quest and tagged it to learn the Art of Random. the quest: See to the planning, organization & implementation of the effort to remove Adonarius\' control of BladeSlayer & prevent him from entering our City again. While banished from the City, he still maintains control & commands his Datoken army. Deal w/the immediate situation...protect from the threat. Recruit others; empower them while leading the effort.','2016-11-12 18:52:37','2016-11-12 18:52:30'),(10107,10580,50,10,'NMF 10 - Najerv','Are you trying to issue a challenge to the mares?  I want you to hunt in Nightmare form and gather 20 essences from mares you have collapsed in NMF alone.  Emphants, Bogroms... whatever you like.  \r\n','2016-11-12 21:23:37','2016-11-09 04:14:20'),(10027,10580,144,30,'Chaos well 30','Think of what you would put in a teaching well. What props would assist you or your students? Make me five things you would share and examples of a quest or two that might go with them.','2016-11-12 22:18:31','2016-11-12 08:41:19'),(10107,10915,89,30,'Soulshield 30','Soulshield certainly implies a great ability, but apart from blocking Mindblank it is seemingly useless.  That is the outward appearance of many things in the city. I want you to experiment with the areas that drain dreamsoul by making contact with certain surfaces and see if there is a chance that Soul Shield could help in these places.\r\n','2016-11-12 22:50:34','2016-11-07 02:34:02'),(10018,11028,47,20,'Push 20','It\'s that time of year again! Spooooooky!!! I want you to get creative. Bake me a haunted castle ONLY out of treats (cakes, cookies, candy, you name it!) ','2016-11-12 23:13:00','2016-10-14 06:57:10'),(10025,10117,25,20,'reweave 20','create a way out there story about how your shield was damaged and why you cant fix it yourself. then get at least 7 dreamers to fix it for you if your story is convincing enough! have fun with it. ','2016-11-13 01:00:55','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10874,10580,6,30,'Najerv Meditate 30','You are now a meditation master.  Teach 3 dreamers how they can meditate deeper.  Show them your technique on how you clear you mind and fall into a deep meditation.  Also bring me a 40+ Gatekeeper chakram moderate or better to help support the formation of the city guard.  ','2016-11-13 01:52:37','2016-10-16 04:51:21'),(10027,10966,36,20,'DreamBlade 20','The Journey of a dreamer means so very much and your blade is a part of that as it is a part of you. I would like you to take some time and advice if you wish to design two blades that are for you. One from your past and one from now. All quality items need a name what will your blades be?','2016-11-13 06:56:46','2016-11-02 05:00:03'),(11069,10580,68,30,'Inz- Flame 30','Welcome to Najerv Torek\'s olde-fashioned Steak House and Grill! Setup a flame grill in the Chak \'n\' Flask and invite a group of dreamers (3 others at least) over for a grilling party! Show off your skills as a barbecue expert, pull off a few tricks with the oil and flames and for the love of all that is hly DON\'T burn the place down.','2016-11-13 09:06:52','2016-10-11 16:01:07'),(10027,10580,73,30,'Destry Talis 30','You have seen the city around us rebuilding itself in about every way it can. Share you point of view with five others in a group  or singlely, What more would you like to see happen?','2016-11-13 09:57:32','2016-11-12 22:23:37'),(10750,10580,26,20,'Purify 20-Najerv','Since you are so pure, by your view of purify, I would like you to judge the purity of a few others around.  Give me a good sampling of the cities population, with focus on those who Seem to be purest at a first glance.  Explain your reasoning for each.','2016-11-13 10:33:24','2016-11-12 10:56:13'),(10025,10580,7,30,'RF 30','What can this small mysterious object be?. Where did it come from?. everything has a purpose, what might this ones be? weave a tale about this object and share it with at least 4 dreamers, what was thier reation,did they have any thoughts as to where it may have come from? l look forward to hearing about your adventure~P~','2016-11-13 20:26:41','2016-11-12 12:12:55'),(10107,10580,111,10,'Dazzle 10','The art of Dazzle is wrapped up in the histories of Sha\'Resa and Lasaimis. Find who these two dreamers are and their stories.  ','2016-11-13 23:16:17','2016-11-12 21:24:56'),(10746,10750,17,10,'ID Curse ~ 10','Colour plays a large part within our fair City. Items, arts and houses are defined by them. Put on a pair of PlaneSmith shoes and tell me why the colours were assigned as they were.','2016-11-14 02:11:46','2016-11-02 20:54:45'),(10010,10376,40,1,'Deafen learn-Cala','Deafen once evoked on a dreamer causes them to lose thier hearing. I want you to develop a theory as to how this happens. I want you to speak with others, and get thier input. Is there a common consensus as to how it works ? Have Fun ~Cryst~','2016-11-14 03:30:47','2016-10-11 07:44:37'),(10480,10680,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Returning MT status to Sorsha. **A**\r\n','2016-11-14 05:24:11','2016-11-14 05:24:05'),(10750,10888,7,10,'RF 10 - Uthy','I want you to theorize about what it is exactly, that makes us run.  Normally that type of fear makes thought impossible, but quite a few people can think clearly and even find the effect a bit of a joke.  So what does scare actually do, and how does RF stop it?','2016-11-14 07:11:08','2016-10-28 08:44:12'),(10027,10117,73,10,'Destroy Talis 10','Things are changing everywhere you look. What have you seen that destroyed, new, fixed and or gone. Find me ten things to share and we can go fromt here.','2016-11-15 02:24:23','2016-11-12 05:25:01'),(10680,10232,80,60,'Aethimir\'s Lab','It has been \"re-woven\" from your City to ours.. how do you suppose that was possible. Are there things missing? things new? what are the differences? Hypnotic portals that swirl..eight of them leading to nowhere..what piece to the puzzle are we missing? The glowing spires in the center of the pool..also eight...signifigant? or not? The lab  resembles part lost caves..part resting columns..intentional? no? yes?  ++SC++','2016-11-15 04:46:41','2016-11-11 02:03:07'),(10027,10376,2,40,'Dreamseer 40','Use you insight to take the Market one step closer to being active you decide the step but all must know something was in fact done. Be its house boards or archives. Set up a time and place for the sales, a sales list perahps these are just ideas.','2016-11-15 07:57:13','2016-11-03 01:23:36'),(10088,10593,51,10,'Locate Dreamer 10','I stated some arts are pointless. Perhaps you disagree. This, in my opinion, is the MOST used art in the City. My level is 49. And still, I feel jipped that other than milli-seconds worth of evoke speed, it does nothing more for me at level 49 than at level 9. So, at what point, other than boredom, or teacher-requirements, will we make plateauing basic arts worth it? Rather - how would you modify this, so that at higher levels, you get more bang for your buck? Ahhh the possibilities.','2016-11-15 22:27:03','2016-11-12 19:35:15'),(10018,11171,22,30,'Forge 30','You aspire to be a DreamSmith, as well as a WordSmith. I would like to see how you can combine the two. Write a short, funny story -or- a handful of jokes that correspond with three forged items of yours.','2016-11-15 23:15:49','2016-11-14 01:56:37'),(10018,10088,22,10,'Forge 10','As you begin the process to recover the Cyclonyx, decide what you would personally like to forge for the first step. I require detail and and inspection of either the original or a copy.','2016-11-15 23:50:52','2016-09-27 02:30:25'),(10022,10088,111,1,'Vampyro: Dazzle','There are three branches of thought within the house. Discover what they are and which you believe to fit best into.','2016-11-16 00:44:25','2016-08-02 02:57:29'),(10022,10411,60,6,'Aidan: Sixth Sphere','When the select few idiots joined sides with Zaxun they were given blades. These blades signify their membership with the Vanguard. What I am curious about is they serve a purpose beyond decorative. It is up to you to acquire one of these blades and deconstruct it. What is it\'s purpose, can we repurpose it to benefit ourselves? If so, do it. Once you have made it into something that can be utilized, strike at Zaxun or one of his followers. Do lasting damage.','2016-11-16 00:56:26','2016-06-09 00:22:00'),(10026,11046,65,50,'Blade 50','Why can\'t we forge real blades? What makes us different that our damage arts do more damage than the other focii? What do clothes determine blade color, and how does that tie into forge? I want you to create 4 Practive blades 1 for each focus, unique for that focus. (Use imagination, and skill not really needing blades have fun with it)','2016-11-16 01:07:24','2016-11-05 00:31:53'),(10022,10018,111,20,'Jade: Dazzle','I want for you to go through the vaults. Document the supplies we have and the ones you believe we need. I expect a comprehensive list. Then I want you to place the list of expected supplies for the rest of house to see. Ask that they bring in that which you believe is needed.','2016-11-16 01:07:41','2016-09-27 06:44:13'),(10026,10318,92,1,'Reflect Lu Chaos','Reflect upon a time when forge was able to make items much stronger and with many other effects by simple dreamers, than they can today, what are the pros and cons to these changes, what would you prefer','2016-11-17 02:07:44','2016-09-28 21:49:29'),(10480,10232,45,60,'Razorwind -- 60','Lately I have had arts on my mind. For this task I wish for you to take a ride on the winds. Use this magical flower and set it upon the winds and tell me where it takes you and what it wants you to see. If you can get others to share in your journey, all the better. Make your efforts worthy. **A**','2016-11-17 04:20:24','2016-11-05 07:11:18'),(10480,10022,3,70,'Bladeslayer SM 70','Call a meeting for the Soulmaster guild, it is alright if non-soulmasters attend as well.  Lead those who show up in some type of soulmaster themed project or experiment.  The project should not be to improve one of your arts or to locate the guild hall.  You should involve those who show up in some way and not just channeling their energy either!','2016-11-17 04:25:28','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10480,10750,27,40,'Arnaya: Drainself40','Discover examples of someone draining themselves in Underlight. How can their draining be applied to the most productive purposes? Theorize how you might syphon what they drain into your more productive purpose. Return to me when you have done this. ','2016-11-17 05:51:16','2016-10-18 04:30:09'),(10027,11046,146,1,'Channel  learn','Time to contemplate your dreams and how you have arrived here and now. Who most influenced you and how to you as a dreamre channel their lessons.','2016-11-17 18:07:44','2016-11-17 06:33:46'),(10951,10010,21,30,'Blend Thru Calabosh','Blend through Calabosh\'s facade & be his inner voice. Talk up the Peace Market to those you encounter, doing recon work for what would be good & desired goods for the market. Be both secretary & spokeswoman for him. Progress will be seen. A summary of your efforts... your report. ~Lacie~','2016-11-18 01:36:03','2016-10-27 07:06:57'),(10027,10010,142,1,'Misdirection to lea','Direction is a wonderful thing and I know you hve helped me maintain mine a time or two. Can you dot hat for a few others to help strengthen the dream becuase it the dreamers than make it strong. See hwat otther advice you can get for the art.','2016-11-18 01:46:02','2015-10-10 16:27:44'),(10232,10951,93,10,'Lace - Sacrifice 10','Explore the City of Dreams and find a place you have neglected. Once there, consider the sacrifices you\'ve made to get where you are now. Were they worth it? Would you have sacrificed more? Consider the nature of sacrificing; is it possible to get something without sacrificing anything? ','2016-11-18 02:27:38','2016-11-06 05:54:18'),(10951,11063,74,40,'A Blank\'d Mind','You have experienced something few understand. They think it a casual experience. They\'re wrong. Try to decipher your experience while trapped in the Mace of Castigation, publishing what your Blanked Mind went through. Try not to ramble, stick to what you Know. Quality over quantity. ~Lacie~','2016-11-18 03:45:38','2016-11-04 22:50:28'),(10053,11046,14,10,'Know10: Kelos','The art of know is an important art sometimes not used to it\'s potential. Find a room on 3 different planes that have an expanded  descriptive message when you evoke know. Write them down and bring the information back to be for discussion.','2016-11-18 04:03:22','2016-10-01 03:33:23'),(10053,10376,23,1,'Recharge: Kelos','Recharge is one of the Seer\'s best loved and hated arts....Speak to 3 seers and ask them what they love about the art, then speak to 3 other seers and ask them what the hate about the art. bring this information to me for discussion...Kelos','2016-11-18 04:22:05','2016-11-14 03:15:15'),(10593,11145,38,10,'The hell!','Don\'t suppose seein me as a dude is the scariest thing you\'ve ever seen... what Is though? Is there three times that you can recall when you were scared shitless??? Tell me bro. *C(huck)','2016-11-18 06:17:31','2016-11-04 21:09:46'),(10746,10888,105,40,'PC ~ 40','House Primes are singularly unique items, that serve only one, albeit important purpose, to deal with energy.  If we were to suddenly change our beliefs and want the Orb to perform some other function (aside from banishing), how could we go about it?  Create a detailed plan, with blueprints. ','2016-11-18 06:19:31','2016-11-13 06:26:42'),(10027,10376,36,40,'Blade 40','Get some dreamers togther and have some fun what games you play is up to you. Will it be a formal challenge or some good old fun? I leave it all up to you get other to help if you like.','2016-11-18 06:49:03','2016-11-15 08:54:40'),(10750,10888,93,1,'Sac learn-Uthy','In addition to learning the basics of the art, I\'d like you to look back over your dreams.  What are a couple of things that you\'ve sacrificed since you started dreaming, that you regret losing... or that you consider well worth the trade off?  Did you feel that there wasn\'t a choice to those sacrifices, or were they very deliberate decisions?  Why do you think others (In general terms) do/don\'t make those same sacrifices?','2016-11-18 08:02:44','2016-11-16 09:52:43'),(10027,10580,96,30,'Sense dreamer 30','Over the next four dreams  keep a log of who os dreaming when. I will do the same and we can comepare notes. I am looking for some stats and an extra pair of hands would be wonderful.','2016-11-18 13:29:16','2016-11-13 20:40:03'),(10027,10117,64,20,'Give to 20','Everyone keeps the gfts you give them. You are one of the best craftsman i know in the dream. Create three gifts for others they can cherish and pass on the love of the dream.','2016-11-18 18:35:30','2016-11-15 02:36:30'),(10680,11171,144,10,'Chaos Well | 20','Understanding of Chaotic Energy is much simpler than dreamers make it to be. I want you to act out into behavior so unpredictable as to appear random for at least 2 minutes. After your brief act of \"Chaos\", convince 2 dreamers as to how this behavior displays your expertise on the realm of Chaotic Energy! Have fun! Upon completion you will report the task to me and will recieve a codex of Quest Completion to be honored by Sorsha or Purple Lace. ','2016-11-19 01:13:17','2016-11-16 00:28:48'),(10951,10026,144,20,'Chaos Well | 20','Considering your exemplified experience as a GateKeeper and Dreamsmith, I would like you to delve deeper into the relations between Dreamsoul, Willpower and GateKeeper Talisman creations. Then I would like to you teach at least 2 dreamers this knowledge you\'ve learned. Also, why do you think such a useful art is third sphere. Upon completion of this task, please report to Master Sorsha. ','2016-11-19 01:24:16','2016-09-28 22:34:05'),(10026,11046,9,50,'FA 50','Arts have changed many times over the years. Freeaction can now be depelted as its offensives are used upon it. How important is it to know just how much time is removed per evoke of a negative art? Freeaction, if you had power to enhance the art how would you do so? What do you think about an 8th sphere Aura effect?\r\n','2016-11-19 01:41:42','2016-11-16 01:09:55'),(10009,10888,22,30,'Forge-30','Adorable. Annoying. Calculating. Heroic. Sinister. Five words that can be used to describe a dreamer. Choose five Dreamers, one that maps to each of those words. Craft an item that embodies the dreamer and the word. Once completed, seek out several dreamers and see if they can make the connotative jump from the item to the dreamer and finally to the word. Bring the items to your report.','2016-11-19 02:49:49','2016-10-16 04:54:36'),(10027,10067,142,10,'Misdirection to 10','Improving this can really annoy some folks. Nont to mention its costly. Find the true benefits of this art and the circumatsnces where it might be useful in theory or fact.','2016-11-19 08:00:42','2016-11-12 08:46:17'),(10027,10088,74,50,'MindBlank to 50','This is a adventure with three parts. First take the lady of your choice on a outing. Who and where are my interest. The details are for you. Find some dreamers with time on thier hands and help them relax maybe a few drinks and stories at the tavern. If you wouldn\'t mind help me gather some ideas for some teachings classes what makes a godo quest is the theme.','2016-11-20 19:01:25','2016-07-24 01:26:01'),(11097,10009,35,50,'Trapped!','Dreamers have potential, yes? Maybe not all of them. Come up with some examples of the locked away potential of some Dreamers, who they are, what they could be doing, why you believe they have not and how they could unlock this undiscovered potential. Lastly, tell me a joke.\r\n','2016-11-20 23:13:07','2016-10-18 01:23:26'),(10007,10916,29,50,'Poison 50','I want you to have a group of people that will help you with gathering items around the City that can be made into a Poison. Then I want you to hold an SM meeting to create the Poison. I want you to lead this and if I can\'t be there, please take good notes on all that transpired and who was there. We need to teach our other SM\'s how it\'s done!','2016-11-21 03:33:50','2016-09-30 04:45:31'),(10746,11063,21,1,'Blend ~ learn','I would like you to embrace your creative side in this task. Find a portal that is currently locked to you and push your mind through it.  Describe for me what you see, feel and sense on the other side.  There is no right or wrong, you create the answer.','2016-11-21 04:24:50','2016-11-10 05:15:32'),(10027,10376,93,1,'Sacrifice Learn','Have you ever sacrificed something in your dreams? Was it gvien freely or taken? Was it worth it? Would you do it again? What do you as a dreamer expect from the City of Dreams?','2016-11-21 22:15:51','2016-11-18 09:27:47'),(10026,10376,6,20,'Med 20','How can one transmute a Mare or Dreamer Esse into a Ward.','2016-11-22 01:28:56','2016-11-06 04:09:51'),(10026,10580,8,30,'Protection 30','Protection is what you seek, but this quest is not for the meek, you see I have this invisible friend, likes to have fun to no end, so show him the city and introduce him well, it would do me honor and make me swell, his name is Tom and is the bomb, do well and this shall be your song\r\n','2016-11-22 01:44:13','2016-11-12 23:31:11'),(10311,10580,111,20,'Dazzle20-Najerv','I wanna give you something fun, I really do. But I saw the forwards in disarray today. Clean up by ID\'ing everything. Place things that need charging and combining on the tables and make everything neat and tidy for me. Then harass Dreiko or OfF to get on charging and combining by posting them a reminder after you have set everything up.','2016-11-22 01:52:04','2016-11-21 03:05:20'),(10680,10580,50,20,'NMF | 20','A nightmare is a dream occurring sleep that results in feelings of strong terror, fear, distress or extreme anxiety. Contemplate a few theories as to why we give the beasts of the dream (Emphant, Bogrom, Agoknight, etc.) such a fitting name. Additionally, when you are in Nightmare Form, what physical features distinguishes your NMF from other dreamers? Upon completion you recieve a codex of completion to be honored by Master Sorsha. ','2016-11-22 03:43:43','2016-11-16 00:00:58'),(10025,10580,9,40,'free action 40','In this city all one aspires to acomplish can be achieved. l would like you to spend some time reflecting on who najerv is and where does he see himself in the future. l would like to see some serious thought go into your report. l look forward to hearing it when you feel you are ready find me~P~','2016-11-22 15:39:37','2016-11-13 20:34:44'),(10018,11028,6,10,'Meditation 10','I want you to explore a plane you have traveled the least. Pay close attention to the walls, floor, and the ceiling/sky. See if you can find anything else funny, scary, or just plain odd carved in the City. While you are doing so, use inscribe to show me a little something you would hide within the walls if you were a PlaneSmith.','2016-11-22 23:12:54','2016-11-13 00:04:01'),(10018,11046,7,50,'Resist Fear 50','Continue to experiment on the altars. Are there any differences between them? As you do, I want you to do a little investigating. I find it odd that these altars appeared the same time Xun\'rok decided to take over the houses. Could they be working together? Let me know what you find out.','2016-11-22 23:38:08','2016-11-16 01:38:57'),(10018,10580,12,20,'Shatter 20','Since you are a tasking machine, I want you to rub off on the rest of the house. Give your fellow house mates a little nudge that need it and lend them a helping hand (try for at least 2-3 dreamers).','2016-11-23 00:43:10','2016-11-11 06:02:44'),(10018,11046,68,50,'Xererth Flame 50','Come up with a plan for a mission you could have the Gatekeeper guild complete that involves a flame in some way.  Literal or figurative.  You do not have to actually have the Gatekeeper guild complete this mission, but plan it like you would put it into motion.  Also, bring a chakram to donate to the City Guard.  40+ Gatekeeper moderate bouncing or better.','2016-11-23 00:56:39','2016-11-01 01:13:57'),(10026,10580,6,40,'Med 40','Meditate has vastly improved over the years, mine is 69 and restores 8 ticks per 2.5 seconds. As we grow we need more arts and more focus faster, how will having this new level make you a better person, and a better Gatekeeper\r\n','2016-11-23 01:09:17','2016-11-22 01:45:53'),(10232,10746,93,10,'Arlyana - Sacrif 10','Take a look at what you have sacrificed in your Dreams. Then select two things: One that you regret sacrificing, and one that would have sacrificed even more. What makes those situations unique? Tell me about them!','2016-11-23 01:10:19','2016-11-15 03:12:52'),(10746,10916,146,10,'Channel ~ 10','Stereotypes are all around us gender, focus, house and so on.  I would like you to choose a few and find someone who epitomizes it and another who disregards it entirely.','2016-11-23 01:34:29','2016-11-20 20:39:32'),(11171,10906,47,1,'Grandma Jo - Push 1','You\'re a pushy old lady, and much like the art, you get around by imposing your will. Force someone to file down the calluses on one of your feet, then come tell me who did it and how you convinced them to do so. Impose your will, Grandma!','2016-11-23 01:36:30','2016-11-23 01:21:43'),(10232,10750,38,20,'Arnaya - Scare 20','You live in a dream where everyone\'s Deafen art has been replaced with DreamStrike of an equal plateau. Describe it to me, in all its SCARY details. And I mean ALL the details! Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-11-23 01:40:04','2016-11-05 07:26:05'),(11097,10580,141,10,'Kinesis | 10','Optimizing your dreaming time. It appears that you have quite the busy shardic life! Considering the sporadic and minimal time you have at dreaming, I suggest you write a simple schedule of what you do in your dream time. Then, after that you will approach me and tell me how this effects progression for you. How does what you do on the daily apply towards your goals? Find how you can Push yourself.  Upon completion you will recieve a codex of quest completion to be given to Elder Master Akkadian. ','2016-11-23 01:47:17','2016-11-01 04:38:39'),(10750,11046,89,10,'SS 10 - Xererth','For a relatively limited art, I would like you to delve into the nature of what this art\'s name seems to indicate that it protects.  Is there any indication that is such a thing, or that it actually has an influence here in anything other than poetic names for stuff?  How about the myth that lesser mares hold one imprisoned?  Lets hear your thoughts on these issues and if you can think of any proof to back them up.','2016-11-23 20:46:40','2016-10-28 21:18:04'),(11069,10580,40,20,'Inz- Deafen 20','Find two locations in the City, one that is deafeningly loud, and one that is deafeningly quiet. Bring someone to these locations and ask them to listen, describe what you both hear. Are there any similarities in how you hear or don\'t hear the ambient sounds?','2016-11-23 21:18:26','2016-11-13 09:16:22'),(11171,10117,38,30,'Melinda - Scare 30','Scare makes people run for the hills. Its use in battle is questionable. Its use on mares is moot. Write me a treatise - 3 codices long at least - describing how YOU would employ it in battle conditions, and how you would improve the art for mare hunting purposes.','2016-11-24 00:49:32','2016-11-17 02:06:03'),(10009,10580,144,40,'Chaos Well-40','Chaos Wells have a rather obnoxious limitation. Make an attempt to allow for them to hold essences and tokens that have more than 1 strength.','2016-11-24 01:37:18','2016-11-22 00:52:38'),(10951,11171,93,10,'Give It Up!','Seems I made Golah a bit grumpy yesterday. Your quest is to Sacrifice something for his amusement or big belly laugh! How do you make him get a big laugh? Totally up to you, but I\'d prefer it if there were witnesses to this grand roar of his laughter. ~Lacie~','2016-11-24 01:45:09','2016-11-23 01:40:43'),(10009,11045,24,40,'Restore-40','The City has fractured a bit in recent times. This has led to an unfortunate set of circumstances leading into a potential final confrontation with Zaxun. Develop a means to Restore the City to a united front and act upon your plan. ','2016-11-24 01:53:41','2016-10-30 23:34:37'),(10593,11149,60,1,'1st Sphere','Interview, the city, its inhabitants, items, etc..','2016-11-24 03:53:35','2016-11-24 03:35:36'),(10007,10888,24,50,'Restore 50','What the hell are these huge things on the house facades? Hold a big City meeting to come up with the answers to this and what the City should be doing about them? Listen to all sides and see if everyone can come together as one. It is such an eye sore...','2016-11-24 05:40:30','2016-11-11 05:52:38'),(10007,10750,30,30,'Antidote 30','It seems like the city today is full of metaphorical \"poisons\". So I\'d like you to think out of the box and give me 5 unique aspects of the Dream that one might consider poisoned and a brief explanation of how we could possibly deliver an \"antidote\" to these. I look forward to hearing your report. -Frey','2016-11-24 06:29:00','2016-11-05 05:41:01'),(11171,11045,89,1,'Nate Soul Shield 1','Such mystery abounds in our dream! When you enter the dream in the courtyard there is a mural of two interlinked arms and hands, above a collection of all the house symbols. Find where else that symbol appears in the dream, in a dead-end room. Hint: It is a lair. Remember to whom this lair belongs. There is one dreamer out there who knows the ORIGINAL meaning of our halos. Once you know what it originally signified, have a Forger create you an item based on those two words. Bring me the finished item.','2016-11-24 17:58:34','2016-11-24 00:22:29'),(11171,10117,42,30,'Matilda Darkness 30','Darkness is a far ranging art, with great power and possibilities. One who desires its power must prove their own. Have a Fatesender Blind you whilst you defeat an agoknight with your blade. Timing is key. Do this 3 times, once for each plateau. Then write a small treatice on the uses of Darkness in war time, and how it can be exploited for your side\'s advantage, and what you can do to prevent this same exploit being used against you.','2016-11-25 00:33:31','2016-11-24 00:53:55'),(10027,11171,144,20,'Chaos well 20','I always see these as baskets which makes me think of all kinds of wonderful things. So here is your quest if you decide to take it. Take a basket and make it one of makeovers. You need to find two victims or volunteers. Show them how much a new look can add to their dreams.','2016-11-25 18:52:27','2016-11-22 10:06:50'),(11069,11046,13,10,'Return 10','You are still working dilligently on becoming a Teacher. I want you to return to a time before you began your apprenticeship. Think of the quests you enjoyed as a student, and how they influenced your decision to become a Teacher yourself. Did you already have ideas for quests of your own at that time? The whole process seems very natural to you, and I\'d like to know more about what drove you to walk this path. A trip down memory lane for significant events leading you there. Share with me what you wish.','2016-11-26 09:04:02','2016-11-25 19:03:48'),(10916,11045,31,10,'Curse - 10','Come up with few verbal awards that are on the silly side (like best morning hair, or cutest soulsphere) be creative.  Then get a few nominations from dreamers for those awards and make sure to ask them why they chose that specific person.  Report to me when you have winners for all your categories. We will go over it all. (Remember to remind everyone that this is for fun!)\r\n','2016-11-27 01:50:21','2016-11-01 23:04:06'),(10593,11045,93,1,'Your Opinion','This one is just you...Tell me of one dreamer who stands out from your city who made a huge sacrifice for some reason..then think of one here.. extra credit...1 or more dreamers who you feel sacrifce daily..what do they sacrifice? why? *c','2016-11-27 05:07:58','2016-11-07 06:40:50'),(10951,11171,144,30,'Deep Deep Wells','Find for me a Well so deep, its contents secret, so hard to keep. Look far and wide for deepest spot, the City so vast tho sometimes not. What place you find of deepest fill, a story you\'ll tell to give me a chill! Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-11-27 19:34:01','2016-11-27 03:44:03'),(10951,10906,60,1,'1st sph interview','We will go over the basics of the city (talismen, planes, arts, fociis). We will then discuss personality & what it means to dream in the City of Dreams. ~Lacie~','2016-11-28 01:34:00','2016-11-28 00:59:38'),(10951,11171,144,40,'Big Bucket of...','Not fake poop! Alright, so you want the bigger Well. Prove it. Create 5 items (use Gift Box form of Forge) that depict what a Well of this size ~should~ look like. Show them to a few at least 3) dreamers, asking their impression. What changes should be make to this Art and why? ~Lacie~','2016-11-29 01:11:14','2016-11-28 02:54:41'),(10027,10104,146,1,'Channel Learn','So who from your past would you channel and share the knowledge they shared with you? It could be a teacher; a fellow dreamer; or a mare. You decide, They source could be from this dream or the one before.','2016-11-29 07:11:13','2016-11-25 19:08:09'),(10951,10376,146,1,'Channel!','Learn as much as you can about this art. Much is not known, but find out what you can about it. Then pick 3 PC members & try to aid them with some aspect of their development (level, hunting tips, low supplies, information or whatever you choose). Who got what & the info about the Art you learned will be your report. ~L~','2016-11-29 18:49:57','2016-11-21 03:59:02'),(10951,11045,104,20,'Blaze It Up! (20)','Not only does this Art have a long casting time at low levels, but it requires a Power Token for each evocation. Gather 200 strength for the Prime in preparation for this. Also, look at our Stronghold\'s setup & decide on the 3 best locations to stand in order to use this weapon in defense of our Home. ~Lacie~','2016-11-30 00:16:39','2016-11-24 18:55:08'),(10951,11045,17,1,'Who\'s Cursed?','Anasina has recently been marked by the DarkMare Raichuelle. She says she\'s fine, but being the Master of Souls you are, you are convinced otherwise. Although your Purifications efforts were significant, study her to discern the side-effects of this Mark. Try to Identify her Curse. ~Lacie~','2016-11-30 00:32:57','2016-11-24 18:46:34'),(11156,11171,52,50,'Cupid: Train 50','The city of dreams is filled with great mystery. Incorporate this mystery into your tasking. Quest at least one dreamer in a way that involves great mystery, where the student may not know precisely what is expected of them. Return to me when you have done this, and bring to your report at least five samples of your ability to write fifth plateau tasks. ','2016-11-30 02:00:01','2016-11-06 05:00:02'),(10026,10376,26,1,'Purify Learn','What is the history of the art, if anyone remembers. Cost? Effect? Is it as useful today as it was 20 years ago?\r\n','2016-11-30 02:28:43','2016-11-22 01:38:42'),(10136,11045,29,30,'Poison30- Nathan','Poison someone\'s mind, and then your own.  In the madness, find someone who works well with herbs and can create poisonous spells.  Learn from them as much as you\'d like, and share with me what you will. ','2016-11-30 02:53:53','2016-11-15 05:00:42'),(10951,11149,47,1,'Completion Codex','Xererth granted Hael a quest which she has completed. Xererth created a completion codex, which Hael has brought to me. This quest codex will be used to complete the granting of the art of Push.\r\n','2016-11-30 03:04:01','2016-11-30 03:03:53'),(10007,10916,31,50,'Curse 50','For a week, I want you to act cursed. Not just some dumb little curse, I want you to come up with a unique and terrifying one. I am leaving this open for you to come up with your own, but it needs to be 50 plat worthy. 11-20-16','2016-11-30 03:57:39','2016-11-21 03:40:00'),(10593,11028,27,30,'Poor poor ana!','You are soooo drained! ....of insulin!... you spend so much time giving away your sweets, you yourself have not had any sugar ! and ana NEEDS sugar to function happily and niftily! convince a few others to bake for YOU and give YOU sweets..without telling them that\'s what they need to do... put on your best acting hat?shoes? ACTION!! Have fun!  ~C','2016-11-30 04:16:15','2016-10-19 00:46:11'),(10916,10888,9,20,'Free Action - 20','Find a night to make yourself free to spend with your significant other.  Make it a special night, get a few others to help out with this with either items be it food or drink or even a way to have music.  Or have them write sections of a poem that you will read to your significant other on that night.  One requirement is you have to share a kiss in a room of stars that you never have before.  I look forward to hearing about (the non naughty) parts of your date!  Good luck!\r\n','2016-11-30 05:26:25','2016-10-19 03:04:30'),(10066,11046,1,50,'Gatekeeper 50','Establish a new meeting time for the Gatekeeper meeting to ensure maximum turnout. Lead the Gatekeepers to reclaim access to their guild hall.','2016-11-30 05:41:47','2016-11-01 04:17:17'),(11171,10104,104,1,'Dar - RBlaze 1','Find out the basics of Radiant Blaze - what does it cost, and what does it do. Then find out how best to use it during the defense of your house, and how to use it offensively during war. With those basics, you\'ll have earned the art.','2016-12-01 01:52:11','2016-11-30 00:34:32'),(10916,11045,31,20,'Curse - 20','Ask some dreamers what they feel is the biggest curse on this city.  From those answers I want to you to find what a potential source of that curse could be and then come up with a way to purify it.  Take ideas from at least 2 others in the purification (Be it a theory to put in place or an item to help).  Bring everything together and report back when you\'re ready, good luck.\r\n','2016-12-01 03:09:10','2016-11-29 23:10:08'),(11171,11045,9,20,'Nate - FA 20','Free Action is all about keeping you loose, warding off paralysis and other motion-affecting arts. All you need do now is express that idea in the form of dance! You must find a large group of dreamers - or 2 smaller ones - and dance for them in such a way as to captivate them with your limber actions. It need only be a couple minutes long, but make it good! Make it sexy, like a tango, if you have the heart for it.','2016-12-01 03:51:16','2016-11-30 00:54:41'),(10232,11069,96,20,'Inzoum - S Dream 20','I would like for you to consider alternative senses; how do we as dreamers perceive things around us? Which of our senses are strongest, and weakest? Consider carefully, and then forge for me something that ignores our stronger senses, -- something we can only view or perceive through those weaker senses. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-12-01 18:24:38','2016-10-06 16:27:35'),(10951,10104,89,30,'SoulShield\'s 3rd','Our members require PT\'s in their packs to stay prepared. Gather 3000 strength in essences so that we have the ability to provide Power Tokens for those with Radiant Blaze. Also, compose 1 codex describing your 3 reasons SoulShield isn\'t a \"worthless art\". This will be placed in the Library of Souls. ~Lacie~','2016-12-02 01:45:33','2016-12-01 00:33:36'),(10480,11171,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting station of MT to Cupid.\r\n','2016-12-02 02:33:39','2016-12-02 02:29:46'),(10480,10104,22,10,'Forge 10','With your experience in dealing with generators and talisman, I would like you to consider something unique: a portable generator. Design what it would look like, what it would spawn, and explain what energy source it would draw from. Have fun.','2016-12-02 03:06:51','2016-11-11 07:08:43'),(10480,10580,141,20,'Kinesis | 20','Outward motivation. It\'s amazing how that if one hates their jobs, it seems like everyone else does too. If you are very stressed out, it seems like everyone else is too. Enthusiasm is contagious! If you are enthusuiastic about a job everyone else will be too!  For this task, I want you to spend 2 dreams being exceptionally more enthusiatic about everything in the dream.  Your report will be any noticable changes from them. Upon completion you will recieve a codex of completion to be honored by Akkadian. ','2016-12-02 03:11:11','2016-11-23 02:09:57'),(10480,10009,81,50,'Vamp Draw -- 50','I wish for you to write me two funny stories about Vampiric Draw. They can be poems or limerics or four line rhyming verse. The specifics are up to you. Do your best to make them humorous. **A**','2016-12-02 03:19:04','2016-10-18 03:24:02'),(10480,10009,52,70,'Train -- 70','For this journey I wish for you to assist all of the other Masters. Find a way to decrease the amounts of support tokens for Train Self. I believe that the requirements are too steep to be effective. Come up with a system and a way to implement it. Get input from the other Masters as well. Make your efforts worthy of the plateau that you seek. **A**','2016-12-02 03:26:46','2016-10-16 04:35:09'),(11171,10376,25,10,'Calabosh Reweave 10','So you want to fix up your shields eh? Very well - offer your reweaving services to someone else; someone who trusts you, of course. Go with them to hunt some agoknights, then when their shield is about half-worn, reweave it back up. I leave the specifics to you - use your head here! I trust you will be honest, and report to me when you\'ve done exactly as written here.','2016-12-02 03:29:36','2016-11-30 01:00:25'),(10018,10888,8,10,'Protection 10','According to you, the Archive has recently been flooded with nonsense. Pick a subject you deem of quality and share it for everyone to see. Report back when it is published.','2016-12-02 05:07:41','2016-10-09 08:57:27'),(10067,10376,23,10,'Recharge to 10','Recharge is called the DreamSeers personal Destroy Talisman until it gets higher in plats. Don\'t let that discourage you. I want you to recharge a codex, elemen, alt, chak, and charm from one charge to their highest charges, or until they explode.. Tell me how long it took and how much you yelled at your recharge. <T>','2016-12-02 05:24:58','2016-11-19 07:31:51'),(10067,10580,32,20,'Drain Essence 20','As a member of the Order of Light, we do not believe in draining essences. It is viewed as murder of the soul within the essence. Tell me how you think the prime seperates the soul from the energy and how you can now raise this art without essences? <T>','2016-12-02 07:54:41','2016-11-12 08:31:28'),(10750,11028,139,10,'Sen Dat 10 - Ana','I think its time the plushies maybe had a run in with a datoken raid.  How do two lovable, squeezable, plushes deal with the ravening, energy hungry beasts?  Was this a new datoken, or one of the established ones?  Where were they and what were they doing?  Write up a bit of a story about this and put it up in the Archives for others to enjoy.','2016-12-03 05:46:15','2016-11-03 20:01:31'),(10027,11045,50,1,'NMF Learn','So there is huge ball and dreamers must come as their favorite mare anda date. Give me the couple that went.  What snacks did that have and what music was heard. Did they dance or play games? Have some fun imagining this whacked out dance.','2016-12-03 07:01:07','2016-11-19 06:20:50'),(10066,11171,22,40,'Forge Talisman 40','Compose a compelling tale that follows the subject(s) in his/her/their waking world and here in the dream city. When considering the plot to your story, craft four talisman that lend themselves dramatically to the story and seek to incite emotion from listeners of all focii. Tell your tale in a large crowd, or two smaller sized crowds. Allow your story to be publically read, as well.','2016-12-03 18:56:56','2016-11-22 01:47:34'),(10026,11069,65,40,'Smasher 40','Design 4 Blades one for each Gatekeeper you respect in the city, what are the blades, who are they for, what made you pick them. These blades must be for citizens currently dreaming','2016-12-04 00:00:12','2016-11-09 00:04:30'),(10026,11045,7,10,'Resist 10','Resistance is Futile, or is it? Tell me about a time you resisted temptation, and what the temptation was.','2016-12-04 02:26:46','2016-11-06 04:51:30'),(10027,11045,8,10,'Protection to 10','What is in need of protection these dreams? As a lieutenent what are your plans for the Peace Corpse? Are any of these things the same? How will you go about furthing yoru dreams?','2016-12-04 07:05:33','2016-12-03 07:05:05'),(10951,10104,104,10,'Blaze 10','Get a partner and him/her tote your trapping of 1000 strength worth of essences. During your work, use this Power Token to evoke Blaze on a Bogram. Have both you and your partner notice the results of the evocation at level 9. We need to confirm just what this Art does. ~Lacie~','2016-12-04 20:43:20','2016-12-02 05:00:51'),(10951,10104,139,10,'Wdere isis Datoke?','Since you dream at different times, you have a unique opportunity to watch the Datoke. During your trapping efforts (1000 for this plat quest), watch for signs of Datoke regularily. If you are too busy, get your mule to do so. See if you can discern any patterns of habits of these \'Mares. ~Lacie~','2016-12-04 21:20:31','2016-12-02 01:55:43'),(10007,11045,29,40,'Poison 40','Have a group to help you find things around the City to make a Poison. Most poisons take at least 3 different properties to make it. After you gather these things (bring me a sample of each), make the poison and apply it to an item. Bring me all the details, samples, and end result.','2016-12-05 04:55:13','2016-12-03 06:34:36'),(10007,10750,27,50,'Drain Self 50','Speak more with Rasputin and help him in his project up at GoE. Play a big part in the result this coming Sunday 12/4. Since he is talking about syphoning energy, you can definitely help with this by using your art of Drain Self perhaps. Keep notes on what transpired and what you did to help.','2016-12-05 08:51:47','2016-12-01 07:42:47'),(10088,10009,29,20,'Poison 20','RELATIONSHIPS! Consider the relationship between great weapons and Strike (or the properties thereof). Luckily, we can imbune weapons ourselves with Forge and Poison, but most of it is junk! So then, *how* would you go that extra step? Craft me a model that you feel you could ACTUALLY either a) imbune with poison - lethally- that would be your go-to weapon over standarized fighting gear or b) upgrade to be able to kill permanently or carry similar properties to Strike. Details. ','2016-12-06 03:27:04','2016-10-18 02:08:22'),(10027,11191,60,1,'First sphere','interveiw we discussed items house dreams and planes i feel he has learned enoguht o aquie first sphere','2016-12-06 13:15:04','2016-12-06 13:12:44'),(10680,11028,9,10,'Completion','Anasina has completed the task set before her by Xererth, unfortunately Xererth accidentally chose flameshaft rather than Free Action on his quest codex. This codex it to remedy that','2016-12-06 20:10:34','2016-12-06 20:10:10'),(10951,11045,146,1,'Channel Ye Mind','As a new Lieutenant in the PC, it is your responsibility to bring us together, under any situation, and work as a team. Find three instances where you can \"Channel\" your leadership into others for mutual benefit. Your report is the three instances, ~Lacie~','2016-12-07 02:18:01','2016-11-30 00:42:17'),(10874,10088,67,50,'Blade50 | Vampyro','Blade can cut and blades can spin and blades can spank and blades can grow... there are many blades in this dream.  Why should you be allowed to hoist a blade over your head with this strength? Until you learn to change a blade of grass into a blade of resilence, you are not worthy.','2016-12-07 03:28:07','2016-10-31 02:39:53'),(10951,10966,2,20,'To See the Dream...','Speak with some DreamSeers, at least one from each House. Have a set of 3 questions standardized to ask them. How do their answers differ? Then, compare their answers to what you feel is the true nature of our focus? The questions, Seer\'s names, their answers & your opinion will be your report. ','2016-12-07 06:19:01','2016-10-22 04:41:00'),(10916,10593,30,20,'Anti - 20','Take as many dreamers around you that you want and jot down the first word that comes to mind when you see them.  Then take those words and put them together into something written by you (whatever it is, is up to you, be it poem, story, ect ect).  You can tell me who is what if you wish but you don\'t have to.\r\n','2016-12-08 02:43:57','2016-11-19 18:47:33'),(10027,10951,144,50,'Chaos Well to 50','You are the Mistress of Events of sorts. Lets gather up the house members and have some fun of your choosing.  Get those wells popping for a prize a contest if you will.','2016-12-08 20:28:09','2016-11-28 20:58:48'),(10951,11045,60,5,'5th Sphere Quest','Investigate the Nodes that Xun\'rok has placed within the closed Houses. Determine if a method can be executed to nullify and/or destroy these devices. Gather others to aid in your quest (Rasputin, ie) & make at least 2 attempts to disarm or destroy them. Good luck! ~Lacie~','2016-12-08 22:21:53','2016-11-30 00:48:04'),(10007,11045,31,30,'Curse 30','Take the voodoo doll that I make you and use it on unexpected dreamers. Do things to the doll to see if it works on the dreamer you are targeting. Just remember not to do too mean of things, we don\'t want you getting attacked. Do it on those that you trust! How many times did you use it and how many times does it work? I want many attempts and a few that actually works.','2016-12-09 00:04:39','2016-12-05 05:10:10'),(10007,10088,28,20,'Abjure 20','Strip down 4 rooms to the bare minimum. Take out everything in the rooms and redo them. How would they look? I want a complete redo of these rooms. Describe them in full to where I can visualize it. Names, items, etc...everything.','2016-12-09 03:33:31','2016-09-26 03:33:08'),(10107,10750,22,50,'Forge 50 - Pt 3','I want you to make a working model that consists of 5 separate components.  1: Stone, 2: Wood, 3: Water, 4: Copper, 5: Glass. Each component should be clear in how it interacts with the next component.  As a test of their ability to interact  with each other - +we will find a yet to be named candidate to see if we can get them to put it together properly for you without instructiuon.','2016-12-09 05:12:35','2016-11-20 06:57:48'),(10750,11063,24,20,'Restore 20-Frey','Restoring is a task that can be approached from a lot of different angles, with a lot of different techniques.  So, I would like you to approach your restoration from a new angle.  Pick someone, or something... that you see needs some TLC restoration.  Pick a method of restoration different from your norm, and someone to give you a hand with making it work.  Let me know what you did, why, how it worked it out, and why you picked the subject that you did.','2016-12-09 06:43:04','2016-11-11 09:43:49'),(11069,10148,93,1,'Inz - Sacrifice','Learn of the sacrifices our House had to make in order to learn the Art. There are many records of these events on our private House boards on the City Walls, and Anasina is a great person to ask in person.','2016-12-09 22:30:33','2016-09-23 06:06:36'),(11069,11028,7,1,'Inz - RF','Resist Fear is an art of Will. Why do you think this is the case? Build a strong argument on what you think separates being brave from being reckless, and see if you can get others to agree with you.','2016-12-09 23:14:46','2016-08-25 14:35:59'),(10480,10026,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Returning his MT status. **A**\r\n','2016-12-10 00:39:54','2016-12-10 00:39:41'),(10480,10009,35,60,'Dreiko: Trap 60','Trap one of each of trappable nightmares. Return to me when you have done this. ','2016-12-10 01:45:36','2016-11-30 02:18:12'),(11171,11045,6,10,'Nate - Meditate 10','Meditation is useful in more ways than to just restore your focus levels more rapidly. It can focus a mind and lead to epiphanies; find your favorite brazier and stare in to it for no less than 10 minutes. In that time, try to think of one way we can help the flames defeat the coming darkness. Then tell me your idea.','2016-12-10 02:58:15','2016-12-07 02:38:35'),(10750,10654,47,20,'Push 20 - Ras','You have pushed yourself a great deal from when I first met you.  So I\'m not going to have you push yourself any further right now.  Instead, I want you to try and push someone through a dark time they are experiencing (perhaps a fear of death?).  Let me know who you helped, and how they responded.','2016-12-10 07:12:32','2016-06-06 04:41:39'),(10951,11046,37,20,'Breadcrumbs','Many Trails in the City, but can you make your own? Sure YOU can see your Trail crystals, but create a way someone can find you in a tricky area. Do this twice, have a couple of rewards for successfully finding you (use MB to make it harder?). Methods are your own. Two attempts & results for the plateau to 10! ~Lacie~','2016-12-10 21:01:08','2016-11-02 02:23:55'),(10026,11046,10,50,'Ward 50','Can you still make pocket wards? Double Wards? your role is to create both pocket wards, and in addition double ward with a person of 50 ward or higher sucessfully 5 times. Why are double wards important to use, how does ward and amulet interact with one another, why cant we forge wards?\r\n','2016-12-11 00:45:10','2016-11-19 01:45:09'),(10232,10680,146,1,'Sorsha - Channel','Because turnabout IS fair play, I ask a Channel limerick of you! Delight and amaze me! Or just give me a limerick to ponder, if that\'s your fancy! ','2016-12-11 02:06:23','2016-11-14 23:04:17'),(10232,10951,146,10,'Lace - Channel 10','Search the City of Dreams for natural (or natural SEEMING) channels! One that DON\'T appear to be cultivated by Dreamer hands (even if arguably the whole city was built by dreamers). Follow these channels from their beginning to end; what purpose do these serve, and what purpose might WE put to them? Ensure a thoughtful report. ','2016-12-11 02:29:55','2016-11-29 19:38:37'),(10010,11063,18,40,'Chamele 40-Frey','I want you to come up with 5 interesting questions that have to do with the art, I also want the answers to those questions. Why did you pick those questions? Have Fun. ~Cryst~','2016-12-11 06:02:22','2016-11-18 03:42:55'),(11069,11046,12,20,'Inz - Shatter 20','There are some places in the City that have endured some damage over the years. An obvious example of this is how the House facades were torn apart, and had to be bridged. Let\'s leave those aside... Find a place in the City that has sustained damage in some way, either prior to our era or during it. See if you can learn something new about these shattered parts of our Dream.','2016-12-11 09:19:53','2016-11-26 09:09:03'),(10232,10027,146,10,'LadySilver - Chan10','Find all the \"channels\" in the City you can -- where are our rivers? What function does a river serve in the City of Dreams? Come up with some theories, -- surprise me! Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-12-11 17:04:02','2016-12-10 15:45:36'),(10311,11028,38,1,'ScareL-Anasina','Go to the scary side of the Museum and pilfer through everything there. Find something that really speaks to you in one way or another. Then once you\'ve found this thing, create (Have someone else forge for you) or do a write up honoring this piece you have found. It could be like a part 2, or something simular with your own twist. Then come report to me what you chose, why, what you created or wrote about it and we will discuss what to do from there.','2016-12-11 18:34:50','2016-08-28 01:28:18'),(10107,10022,146,1,'Channel - Blade','I want you to channel a personality for a group and see if they can guess who you are.  No providing hints and no channeling Elders. You\'re old enough as it is.\r\n','2016-12-11 21:25:48','2016-11-12 21:54:22'),(11171,11045,6,20,'Nate Meditate 20','You\'re a little fast at asking for plateaus, so I\'m going to have to slow you down! This is your final plateau of Meditate, so you go and meditate on a high-level gen for 1 hour, no less. Bring to the house the best stuff you find, but keep 1 item for yourself. Then convince someone in threshold to meditate with you for 5 minutes. Make them \"hummmmmm\" periodically, but say or whisper nothing else. You must both do that. After 5 minutes of SOLID meditation, you\'re set; come and tell me all about it.','2016-12-13 01:48:20','2016-12-10 03:14:28'),(10951,10027,104,30,'Blaze Away! (30)','Collect the classes that we PC want to hold & organize a schedule for a trial run of your new university. I\'d like to see it called a new name, improved maybe? Then post a list of classes on the public portion of the PC Archives after getting the teacher\'s available times/days. Progress! ~Lacie~','2016-12-13 05:06:27','2016-11-03 01:49:30'),(10951,11063,63,30,'Inviso-Man!','When nigh falls deep, in darkest light, a Seer so male tis out of sight! Seek out your own private hideaway, since the City in total is now ye home. Where do you choose & why? Make sure this place can meet all your needs (hunting, genning, sanctuary, etc.) ~Lacie~','2016-12-13 12:52:37','2016-12-10 06:38:31'),(10951,10498,93,1,'What a Sacrifice!','While filling a Well for our Prime (100 or more), keep count of how many charms or low chaks you leave behind! Learn the stats & advantages of plateauing this Art. Bring the Well, your \"loss* number & new information for your report. ~Lacie~','2016-12-13 21:06:32','2016-11-07 21:46:08'),(10951,11171,93,20,'Sacrificed...','What once was dark, now full of light. Dying embers show so bright. Tis only one of little mark, to bring to thee a lonely spark. Seek out the place of darkest nigh... contemplate that spark that make thee high. Tell me of ye journey. ~Lacie~','2016-12-14 01:41:59','2016-12-08 02:42:53'),(10951,11171,146,10,'What Channel?','You are hereby the Channel-Master! Seek out our members, help them get their Channel levels up. If not by quest, send them to a teacher who CAN help them. Your report will be the list of members you can talk to over the course of 2 or 3 days & the results. ~Lacie~','2016-12-14 01:52:30','2016-11-30 01:12:15'),(10750,11045,28,1,'Abure Learn-Nathan','I would like you to first of all... learn the basics of the art.  Then, I want you to try to figure out how to \"Abjure\" the curse from the item I\'m giving you with this.  This curse is complicated, and removing it will likely cause an odd effect or two... so try to account for that and make it as clean of an Aburing as you can.  Let me know what you did, and your reasoning behind it.  Try to get some help with this.','2016-12-14 06:05:09','2016-12-11 22:46:23'),(10186,10750,109,1,'Quest: Xun\'rok','','2016-12-14 06:19:14','2016-12-14 06:14:25'),(10593,11045,35,1,'To trap or...','Being pacifistic, I myself have qualms about trapping..why should I? people give me all kinds of reasons why I should. I could do the standard and ask what makes you feel trapped..but NAY! I want you to tell me a time when you felt that you -escaped- a trap! Also give me your own theory on how you think this art works. *c','2016-12-15 21:40:40','2016-12-13 03:19:15'),(10951,11045,104,30,'Quest: Purple Lace','After obtaining your art of Trap Essence, use this opportunity to bring in as many Trapped Essences as it will take to maximize your art to its first level. Keep track of how many essences and strength you obtain for this quest. ~Lacie~','2016-12-15 22:25:36','2016-12-07 02:44:46'),(10951,11171,104,10,'Blaze On! (10)','Now that your arts of Blaze and Sacrifice are on their way up, let\'s put them to use. Blaze thru a low-level hunting ground for a short time twice (30-45 min each) with as empty a pack as you can muster, & one Well. Over the course of 2 hunting runs, how many charms/chaks can you Sacrifice vs. how many essences do you collect? Blaze on! ~Lacie~\r\n','2016-12-15 23:33:20','2016-12-14 02:15:29'),(10680,11045,47,20,'Why So Pushy?','There are some dreamers who push many things here. I am not going to say what but a few come to mind. Think about who dies and what they are constantly pushing..and we will see if we have any matching answers! All answers confidential, of course. ++SC++','2016-12-16 00:11:17','2016-12-10 08:24:48'),(10874,10750,40,20,'Deafen | 20','Deafen has a lot of justified stigma behind the art. It is grotesquely annoying and unchivalrous in the act of battle. Consider how this would drastically change the stigma if this art was harmful to dreamers. Additionally, design improvements in which deafen could be used as an offensive tool. Upon completion you will report to me and recieve a codex of Quest Completion to be honored by Sorsha. ','2016-12-16 03:55:16','2016-11-17 05:09:23'),(10746,11046,105,50,'PC ~ 50','I would like you to organize two classes on how we can use our house art to its deadliest.  The first would be to observe a battle (real or mock) and then provide pointers in a class.  Run a second scenario implementing your pointers.  Share your results with me.','2016-12-16 04:40:41','2016-11-14 05:25:53'),(10746,10750,98,20,'NA ~ 20','I would like you to think back to your newly dreams.  How different are they from those of newlies now?  Is there a way to go back to the way they were?  Should we even want to?  Present your logic in a creative way.','2016-12-16 05:24:54','2016-11-14 02:21:40'),(10311,10545,111,1,'DazzleL-Avayla','Trap 1000 strength for the house! Standard house art learn, hah!','2016-12-17 02:40:56','2016-10-16 02:21:59'),(11171,11145,4,10,'Vistael FSender 10','Fatesenders are inherently tricky by nature. With your growth as a fatesender you\'ll be presented with chances to exercise that quirk so natural to us. Knowing that we can use arts like Blind, Stagger and Paralyze, tell me one funny prank you would like to pull on a friend using one or more of those arts. Basically, a little short story about being a Fatesender.\r\n','2016-12-18 01:22:39','2016-12-09 01:57:50'),(10232,11145,71,10,'Vistael - Flame10','Find a flame in the City of Dreams, and decide how you might best ruin it. Then decide how you might instead stoke it, build it up. Then decide which it needs, and be prepared to explain. Ensure a thorough report. ','2016-12-18 02:11:01','2016-11-06 06:44:44'),(10026,11045,8,20,'Pro 20','Protection is over rated, what does it mean to really protect someone, how far would you go? How about someone else how far will they go to protect what they hold dear. I want the 5 W\'s for this','2016-12-18 04:14:51','2016-12-16 00:27:45'),(10750,10545,17,1,'ID Curse Learn - Av','In addition to learning the basics of the art (and basic is the operative word with this art), all of us bear curses of one sort or another. So before casting judgements on the curses of others, I\'d like you to identify a curse or two that afflict you.  How have these curses impacted your dreams, and how do you think they could be removed (If they even should be)?  Let me know what you come up with.','2016-12-18 09:52:12','2016-10-16 06:07:27'),(10746,11069,22,30,'Forge ~ 30','I would like you to think about the legacy you want others to find, should your experiments go awry.  Speak to as many that know you as possible about their favourite memories of you and attempt to encapulsate them into items.','2016-12-18 19:13:29','2016-10-31 23:30:15'),(10880,10009,35,70,'Trap Nightmare 80','Approved by Akkadian and Deeter for ongoing efforts and continuous improvements to the City\'s fabric.','2016-12-18 21:35:19','2016-12-18 21:35:14'),(11097,10009,2,80,'Whip Crack!','Become involved with the Seer Guild, just this once. Develop something for them to work on, which will have an end result. Retrun when they have acheived something.\r\n','2016-12-18 21:37:37','2016-11-20 23:25:32'),(10880,10009,81,60,'VD -- 60','That is alot of VD that you are asking for. Tell me of your favorite uses for the art and how to use it effectively. Also, who would be the top 5 on your list to use the art on? **A**','2016-12-18 21:42:56','2016-12-10 01:36:22'),(10880,10009,8,20,'Proteciton 20 ','Approved by Akkadian and Deeter for ongoing efforts and continuous improvements to the City\'s fabric.','2016-12-18 21:44:23','2016-12-18 21:44:07'),(11097,10400,65,70,'GateSm70 | Harkyn','From the looks of ya, you\'re a sea goblin.  Create a sea in the city and sail it.  Take all in your path and show me your treasures! Set your eyes on a large target. A house? A leader? A girl? The choices are endless. ','2016-12-18 22:16:01','2016-12-07 04:06:30'),(10480,10232,40,70,'Deafen 70','Honoring the new train support system until it gets fixed. **A**','2016-12-19 01:28:08','2016-12-19 01:28:02'),(10480,10027,47,70,'Push 70','Honoring the new Train Self support requirements until it can be fixed. **A**','2016-12-19 01:30:44','2016-12-19 01:30:36'),(10480,10027,5,70,'Random 70','Honoring the new train self supports until the system can be fixed. **A**\r\n','2016-12-19 01:32:23','2016-12-19 01:32:15'),(10480,10027,50,60,'NMF 60','4 supports -- honoring the new train self supports until the system can be fixed. **A**\r\n','2016-12-19 01:34:05','2016-12-19 01:33:59'),(10480,10232,41,70,'Blind 70','I am intrigued with how your progress is going with your new teaching tool. Please continue to use the adventure tool and adapt it how you wish to make it part of your repertoire. Find me when you feel the task is complete. **A**','2016-12-19 01:34:54','2016-11-17 04:34:42'),(10480,11192,102,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting the art of Quest to Nemi. **A**\r\n','2016-12-19 02:37:55','2016-12-19 02:34:35'),(10480,11192,103,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting teaching support art. **A**\r\n','2016-12-19 02:38:12','2016-12-19 02:34:57'),(10480,11192,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','granting the teaching support arts **A**\r\n','2016-12-19 02:38:26','2016-12-19 02:35:26'),(10480,11192,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting the teaching support arts. **A**\r\n','2016-12-19 02:38:33','2016-12-19 02:35:40'),(10480,11063,112,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Granting access to the Guild House as per DreamSeers.\r\n','2016-12-19 03:16:26','2016-12-19 03:16:19'),(10874,10232,44,70,'FireS70 | Em\'et','Go to a location that you are not readily familiar with. Evoke the art as you now know it. What damage did you to do the area when no dreamers are near? I want you to experiment with this art when you can. If others can assist, that is even more wonderful. Create a masterpiece with this art as it is. Do something nobody has done before. Explain it to me in high detail. Make it worthy of the level you wish to achieve.','2016-12-19 03:35:59','2016-10-31 03:10:59'),(10480,10107,15,70,'Judgment 70 - Off','Unite all the Seers you can in an effort that actually benefits the City in a tangible way. Destroy Zaxun, rid the Revenants, make more powerful chakrams. The choice is yours, but the quest is not complete until AT LEAST one agenda comes to full fruition.','2016-12-19 03:43:49','2016-07-24 05:17:31'),(11097,10067,103,1,'Quest: Faelyn','because\r\n','2016-12-19 07:15:46','2016-12-19 07:15:36'),(10750,11045,94,1,'Cleanse Learn-Nath','Cleanse if a Very under rated art, though not so much for actual use as intended.  The art was based on the concepts of Harmonics, a core that can allow much more than just neutralizing chaotic energy.  I would like you to both learn the basics of the arts function, then look at some other ways harmonics could be brought to bear to improve the city.  Run your idea\'s past another dreamer or two who\'s opinions you trust and see what they think.  Let me know what you come up with.','2016-12-19 09:38:37','2016-12-14 08:35:47'),(10680,11145,66,10,'Feelin Groovy 2','Alright, you don\'t mind if people watch you say...I want a song and dance that has to do with blades or weapons somehow. Private audience. ++SC++','2016-12-20 00:03:39','2016-12-09 02:16:19'),(11171,11145,47,10,'Vistael Push 10','Figure out HOW you could use Push as a defensive art, and then as an offensive art. Then tell me how you\'d execute it during war time in defence of your friends, or in attack of your enemies. That\'s it!','2016-12-20 00:13:55','2016-12-18 01:28:15'),(10951,10680,104,1,'Relight the Blaze!','To relearn the Art of Blaze will take your WordSmithing skills! The Tenets are not under our symbol in the Teaching Guild\'s sanctuary. Replace them (in condensed form if necessary). Let\'s give this City a taste of the wonderful group we\'ve built! ~Lacie~','2016-12-20 02:21:57','2016-12-16 00:33:28'),(10680,10915,140,30,'So Tempting','Tempt your fellow dreamers with... -yourself- do things that would make them want to be JUST like you! Also..you must tempt the lovely Lady Tre! A very special and unique creation that you and Lady Baker (Ana) must create together in her kitchen. Present it to Lady Tre, let me know how it goes.  ++SC++','2016-12-20 03:50:38','2016-11-11 02:49:42'),(10480,10009,24,80,'Quest: Akkadian','Honoring the train self of Restore until the system is fixed. **A**\r\n','2016-12-20 04:37:11','2016-12-20 04:37:04'),(10480,10009,35,80,'Trap Nightmare 80','This task is simple and easy. Bring in 5,000 strength to your house prime. How long did it take you with your mighty trap nightmare at 79? Make a list of items used, and time taken. **A**','2016-12-20 04:42:58','2016-12-19 01:43:48'),(10480,10022,39,40,'Stagger 40','Stagger me with three tales of things that have happened to you since you came back to the City the first time. **A**','2016-12-20 06:04:44','2016-11-17 04:37:21'),(10480,10022,41,80,'Blind 80','People have been turning a blind eye on the mares and their latest \"contraptions\". Find a way to motivate others to find out what they are and what they do. **A**','2016-12-20 06:16:49','2016-11-17 04:36:24'),(10022,10750,28,40,'Pesky Arnaya','Is there anyone you do not pester? We should put that to use, but perhaps in a different manner. You seem to have developed some strange affliction... every time someone makes physical contact you apparently absorb a portion of their personality, causing you to behave as if you were them. How will you ever get people to help you stop the maddness?!','2016-12-20 07:13:18','2016-11-15 04:23:02'),(10022,11145,60,2,'Vistael: 2nd Sphere','2nd sphere interview of Vistael, asking questions about houses and current political happenings and so on\r\n','2016-12-20 20:41:29','2016-12-20 20:39:11'),(10951,11145,40,10,'Deafen to 10','Deafen can be both annoying & dangerous. There is an added ability the FateSenders have. How does this affect Deafen? Experiment with both lesser mares & a couple of VOLUNTEERS. Keep the parameters standard to compare affects between both. Enjoy! ~Lacie~','2016-12-21 19:01:46','2016-12-19 23:32:13'),(10027,11132,60,2,'sphere 2','I have conducted an interview and deem him ready for second sphere','2016-12-22 10:11:07','2016-12-22 10:10:35'),(10022,10311,146,1,'Flower: Channel','Write me a list which is to include the strengths and weaknesses of each of the focuses.','2016-12-22 21:15:48','2016-12-20 21:37:32'),(10009,10400,111,1,'Dazzle-Learn','Help me investigate the portal restrictions within the House to discover the potential issues with Rally.','2016-12-23 02:06:41','2016-12-23 02:05:32'),(10018,11132,65,10,'GateSmasher 10','GateKeepers are known for being the Warriors or the Protectors of the City. I want you to see where you fit into this mold, if at all. What interests you about the City? What do you aspire to be one day? Be as detailed as you can.','2016-12-23 02:14:13','2016-10-02 04:51:16'),(10026,10717,1,30,'Focus 30','Being of will is not all that hard, as long as you are playing with the right cards. Your mission is simple and not all that dreary, fighting seems to make you leary. Hold 2 Blade matches small or big matters not to me, only that you have some fun.','2016-12-23 02:31:18','2016-11-01 01:43:52'),(10027,11145,139,1,'Sense Datoken L','Mares are varied and have differing natures explain them to me. There are lesser mares, day mares and dark mares. This can be obtained by speakgin to dreamers or wandering about in the scrolls. How do they differant from dreamers in the end. YOur ideas very much appreciated.','2016-12-23 05:42:18','2016-12-21 19:16:31'),(10951,11063,36,50,'Combined Blade','Combine your Blade skills with the other methods of attack you possess to come up with at least three new (at least to you) methods of using Blade in combination with your other offensive arts. Share these techniques with 5 others, getting their input & making any changes you deem worthy. ~Lacie~','2016-12-23 22:40:23','2016-12-13 13:32:08'),(10026,11132,1,20,'Focus 20','Now that you have some more knowledge, find renruts study in threshold below us, study the two rooms, and return to me, we will discuss what you have seen and take a small trip','2016-12-24 00:17:39','2016-12-23 00:31:20'),(10680,11145,66,20,'Man of Creation','Utilize that bolt of yours to create a new type of weapon. How can you apply that electricity in a way that makes something unique and unprecedented?  I Look forward to your creation. ++SC++','2016-12-24 01:09:04','2016-12-21 19:13:29'),(10951,11132,72,1,'Firey Brazier','Find a Brazier in a quiet place Spend some time really studying it. It\'s the small things in the City that matter so much. What does the Brazier \"tell\" you about the City? You are a Keeper of the Gates. How will you guard the Flames of the City so they do not burn out? Condense this to fit inside your first Inscribed Codex. ~Lacie~','2016-12-24 01:20:00','2016-12-23 06:15:20'),(10951,11145,38,20,'Scare to the 2nd','This Art is very versatile & can be beneficial in battle or defense of one\'s self or others. Consider 2 ways it can aid in battle & 2 ways it can help another dreamer get out of danger. Detail these methods & include how you would explain your actions after your evocation (in the case of the latter). Lastly, what do you fear the most? ~Lacie~','2016-12-24 01:33:17','2016-12-21 19:11:08'),(11097,10009,81,70,'Dreiko Humanitarian','Draw forth your willingness to help others! First, find something which requires your help. Next, pour yourself into it and ensure its well being. Return once you have something to report.','2016-12-24 03:10:37','2016-12-18 21:57:10'),(10311,11145,39,1,'StaggerL-Vistael','I would like for you to butt into a few conversations, they dont have to be awfully serious but try to stagger the subject to another. Even if they try to stay on topic, try to turn them in a new direction. If they give in, change it again and again. After a few minutes of this recede and see if they go back to the original topic. How does this relate to how stagger works in battle? Dont return to me until you have results from a few tries, then we will discuss your findings.\r\n','2016-12-24 03:11:53','2016-12-20 20:49:38'),(10311,10400,145,1,'RallyL-Harkyn','What are some limitations to this art? Also think of three HUGE (In your eyes, but can be suggestions of others) benefits to having it? Why do you think its strictly a guardian/ruler art and not a gatekeeper art as it was intended? ','2016-12-24 03:22:41','2016-12-23 02:18:00'),(10026,11132,10,1,'Ward Learn','To learn ward, there are some steps. There are several ways to get past a ward what are these ways? Ward cost 20 will and a bit of time to evoke, how does knowing this effect when and where you use it.','2016-12-24 23:12:49','2016-12-24 02:20:41'),(10026,11132,11,1,'Amulet Learn','Amulet is one way to pass wards, they tune your focus and signature to the ward, so only you may pass with the key, or another with it if you have given them one. Why is it important to destroy amulets after you use them, Amulet costs 1 will to make, why so low?','2016-12-24 23:12:55','2016-12-24 02:22:09'),(10951,10717,146,1,'Channel Quest','Since you don\'t possess the Art of Channel yet, find a way to help one other member of the PC in some measurable fashion. Do you help fill Well that they turn in for energy? Help clear out the Armory with Silver, so she can gain energy from her efforts? Your methods are your own. ~Lacie~','2016-12-26 21:13:02','2016-11-02 20:48:20'),(10874,10951,20,70,'Blast 70 | Purple L','Opening a house with dragons will be a challenge.  We need diversity in the City, but how will this be welcomed by the population? Gather more than a handful of dreamers with similar ideas for the house and see if you can double their numbers, enough so that you can open the house.  Blast the City with this new idea and see where it takes us.','2016-12-26 22:25:41','2016-12-07 03:51:40'),(10874,10026,9,70,'Self Train FA','Gave 5 supports to Nessa','2016-12-26 22:44:02','2016-12-26 22:43:52'),(10951,11045,145,1,'Rally the Troups!','I know ye be Procurer, but I need ye help. The others will be back soon and they need to be brought up to speed. Compose a simple summary of what they need to know, including any battle plans or tactics we will be using, in case of trouble. Set it to 2 codexes, so be brief. Let\'s get our comrades Rallied together! ~Lacie~\r\n','2016-12-27 00:14:56','2016-12-25 21:52:00'),(11171,11045,74,10,'Nate MindBlank 10','Randomly ask people if Anasina is dreaming. When you\'re told that she is dreaming, find her WITHOUT using Locate Dreamer. Just ask around; ask people if they\'ve seen her, where she usually hangs out at that time, etc. When you find her, you get your plateau!','2016-12-27 00:37:22','2016-12-16 00:55:01'),(10680,11145,4,20,'Who are you? ','Fatesender, stereotypes. I hate Stereotypes. What makes YOU a fatesender, what makes Me one?, In the old days we were pegged as \"tricksters\" jokers\" not taken too seriously, do you think that is correct? Also...part 2 - Join the PC. Part 3 - Tell me wher eyou hail from so I can understand what is groovy and hip! ++SC++','2016-12-27 22:00:25','2016-12-24 01:13:22'),(10027,10067,50,20,'NMF to 20','Who is who in the lastest line up? Daymares and darks? Any news on their alters or chaos portals?  They seem busy with something as of late.','2016-12-27 22:08:51','2016-12-19 08:56:40'),(10951,11145,47,20,'Push the Button','Ok, first off, don\'t get in any more trouble with this. However, do some investigation into what Pushes people\'s buttons around here. Why are some more Resilient than others, but so delicate with the silliest things? How can one be Pushed without Art or insult? Enjoy. ~Lacie~','2016-12-27 22:19:22','2016-12-24 01:47:40'),(10067,10009,144,60,'Chaos Well to 60','So much Chaos has been welling up in everyone. Is it because of the strikings and the idea of strike? What does the chaos have in store for us? Think about the war, Zaxun, Xun\'ruk, the Consortium...why is the chaos so strong lately and how can we stop it? <T>','2016-12-27 22:49:18','2016-09-30 02:36:27'),(10916,10958,146,1,'Channel - Learn','First get as much basics as you can from those learning about it and those learned it.  Second I want you to consider any ramifacations this art could have that would impact the city in a negative way.  What would you do to combat that impact?  I look forward to hearing what you come up with.\r\n','2016-12-28 02:13:12','2016-10-31 01:24:36'),(10027,11132,8,1,'Protection to learn','The best protection to making up ones own mind and traveling your own path is gathering knowledge. Ask around and see what the Houses have to say about why they are in the dream and what beleifs they claim. Any of the suit you? You don\'t need to join any but see what you can learn to protect the choice when you make one.','2016-12-28 05:28:44','2016-10-01 21:14:00'),(10107,10951,63,70,'Invis - Purple Lace','It appears that vision does not interact with some forms of invisibility. Clearly there are portals, and possible even planes that are undetectable to the naked eye even with the use of Invis.  I would like you to investigate the possibility of applying this in some way to items.  See if you can manage to create an item that is not detectable with the naked eye, but can be detected, handled and manipulated.  ','2016-12-28 05:31:06','2016-10-26 03:59:43'),(10480,11046,52,1,'Final Exam - Part 1','For this part of the assignment, I wish for you to write 20 sample tasks to Learn, 4 per focus including DreamSoul. You may pick the arts you wish for each focus but the 4 of your focus must be Major arts. You will not seek assistance for this task. I am looking for specific things. You will also, no longer write tasks for anyone while you are in the stages of your Final Exam. When you are finished, we will speak and discuss the next step. **A**','2016-12-28 06:35:21','2016-12-09 08:54:38'),(10480,11046,52,1,'Quest Train','I wish for you to work with Sorsha and to learn all that you can about how to write acceptable tasks. When she feels that you are ready, you will write me five example tasks and we three will meet and discuss further. Also, I wish for you to work on your art levels. Your focus arts should be at least to 20 as well a a majority of your Dreamsoul arts. **A**','2016-12-28 06:35:21','2016-09-02 05:39:32'),(10480,11046,103,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support art for gaining his halo.\r\n','2016-12-28 06:36:46','2016-12-28 06:36:39'),(10480,11046,87,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support art for gaining his halo.\r\n','2016-12-28 06:36:59','2016-12-28 06:36:19'),(10480,11046,86,1,'Quest: Akkadian','Support art for gaining his halo.\r\n','2016-12-28 06:37:04','2016-12-28 06:36:03'),(11171,11045,46,10,'Nate Recall 10','So you know what Recall does by now; let\'s get creative! Try to recall the last time someone or something collapsed you. Return to the place where you were collapsed, wait 5 minutes, then inscribe for me on ONE codex your thoughts on whether Recall would have been useful at that time - or - if it was better that you remained there, and the reason(s) why for either case. I wanna read your report this time!','2016-12-29 01:39:23','2016-12-27 00:46:30'),(11069,11046,13,20,'Return 20','I have Forged this peculiar item and manipulated it such that it has inverted onto itself, inside out. See if you can return it to its original state. Describe the process by which you would achieve this, or better yet, return with the reverted item. You may seek help from others.','2016-12-29 21:58:36','2016-12-18 09:31:36'),(10026,11046,8,50,'Protect 50','Each dream, people, fates, arts change the goal is to determine those changes, once reflect was 70% effective today 50% Arts now eat Protections, yet as Gatekeepers, we rely on finding a balance. Your mission, what did the sacrifice form Gatekeepers do for Gatekeepers, Pro or Con or both? How does helping the other focii grow, in turn help Gatekeepers grow\r\n','2016-12-29 22:59:32','2016-12-22 23:53:55'),(10680,10951,142,20,'That Way!!','Time to drive some people to drink...for a few hours or a couple of dreams..I want you to tell people there is something that they just MUST see!! you will take them one way...oop...sorry..this way...damn...that way.. you get the jist..a wild Lace Chase! see how long they follow you. Either groups or singles. enjoy! ++SC++','2016-12-30 01:11:34','2016-12-10 06:46:48'),(11046,10376,144,1,'Chaos Well | Learn','It\'s time for you to vent out! The dreams as of lately have been a large bit frustrating for a good deal of dreamers. I want you to spend one dream speaking your mind, every opinion, every thought positive or negative and let all of that inner \"chaos\" out! Don\'t hold back! Additionally, as per requirements, please tell me what type of essences can be placed in wells and those which can not. Upon completion you will recieve a codex of Quest Completion to be honored by Sorsha/Purple Lace. Good luck! ','2016-12-30 07:10:02','2016-11-17 06:26:35'),(10026,11046,6,40,'Med 40','With the Darkness Approaching and its focus on the OOL, what can we as Gatekeepers do, to prevent that house from falling, and how will that apply to the houses with no members\r\n','2016-12-30 20:13:54','2016-12-29 23:00:58'),(10027,10591,47,1,'push learn','again this fasll uunder the bundle ast explained by myself ','2016-12-30 20:26:08','2016-12-30 20:24:51'),(10027,10591,69,1,'flame to learn','he has come in with a bunlde that was mine i was informed these can be honored by master teachers by dreiko and golah an have gone ahead and done this','2016-12-30 20:26:18','2016-12-30 20:24:05'),(10027,10591,139,1,'Sense datoken l','dreiko explained what this art deos and it was understood  also under the bundle','2016-12-30 20:26:32','2016-12-30 20:25:46'),(10027,10591,98,1,'Newly awakened  L','this was explained by purple lace we all worked togetehr again under the bundle he completed','2016-12-30 20:28:28','2016-12-30 20:28:13'),(10480,10745,88,1,'Quest: Akkadian ','a\r\n','2017-01-08 03:15:21','2017-01-08 03:15:14'),(10480,10745,52,30,'Quest: Akkadian','','2017-01-08 03:35:35','2017-01-08 03:35:26'),(10480,10066,52,70,'Quest: Akkadian ','1','2017-01-08 04:04:56','2017-01-08 04:04:51'),(10880,10027,2,70,'DreamSeer 70','LadySilver gets a bosom boost.','2017-01-08 08:13:47','2017-01-08 08:13:37'),(10880,10027,52,70,'Train 70','Boom.','2017-01-08 08:15:49','2017-01-08 08:15:44'),(10880,10027,88,1,'Train Self','MT','2017-01-08 08:16:37','2017-01-08 08:16:34'),(10880,10067,85,1,'DreamSmith Mark','1','2017-01-08 08:28:53','2017-01-08 08:28:45'),(10480,10005,138,1,'Quest: Akkadian','test','2017-03-31 04:42:17','2017-03-31 04:42:07'),(10186,10005,49,1,'Quest: Xun\'rok','test','2017-03-31 04:44:54','2017-03-31 04:44:37'),(10186,10005,88,1,'Quest: Xun\'rok','test','2017-03-31 04:45:51','2017-03-31 04:45:46'),(10009,10311,66,50,'FateSlayer','','2017-04-29 17:05:08','2017-04-28 23:52:50'),(10009,10311,71,50,'FlameRuin','','2017-04-29 17:12:59','2017-04-28 23:52:35'),(10009,10318,68,1,'Quest: Akkadian','','2017-04-29 18:09:03','2017-04-29 18:08:30'),(10009,10318,112,1,'Quest: Dreiko','','2017-04-29 18:11:13','2017-04-29 18:11:09'),(10072,10400,65,1,'Quest: Jerulan','boubo','2017-05-01 02:24:11','2017-05-01 02:23:54'),(10007,11023,60,4,'Quest: Dina','test','2017-06-08 02:25:23','2017-06-08 02:21:20'),(10007,11023,3,40,'Quest: Dina','test','2017-06-08 02:25:42','2017-06-08 02:25:34');
